return
{
    ["\n\nMVPDes_30212\n\n"]="The Sin Archbishops of the Witch Cult, representing sloth. He turned extremely paranoid due to the Witch Factor he carries.\nWith powerful and strange abilities, he's the main antagonist hunting down Emilia and her group.",
    ["\n\nMVPDes_30213\n\n"]="An enormous whale-like Mabeast summoned from another world by the Witch Cult, with a horn on its head and eerie glowing red eyes.\nIt's got a giant pink halo above its head, and its body is covered in white fur and has countless blowholes.\nIt's said to have been created by a powerful figure for special purposes.",
    ["2025AnniversaryTips_001"]="Current Round: %s",
    ["2025AnniversaryTips_002"]="Current Round Countdown: %s",
    ["2025AnniversaryTips_003"]="<size=16>Opens daily from 20:00 to 21:00 and 22:00 to 23:00</size>",
    ["2025AnniversaryTips_004"]="Preview Time: %s",
    ["2025AnniversaryTips_005"]="From June 11, 08:30 to June 18, 05:00.\n<color=#3c4d4d>By defeating wilderness monsters, the chance of dropping MVP/MINI rare items is increased by 100%, and the amount of Base EXP, Job EXP, and Zeny obtained is increased by 100%.</color>",
    ["2025AnniversaryTips_006"]="From June 18, 05:00 to June 25, 05:00.\n<color=#3c4d4d>The crit rate of fishing, mining, gardening, and smelting is 15% (with extra items available to obtain); the gardening speed under special weather is increased by 20%.</color>",
    ["2025AnniversaryTips_007"]="From June 11, 08:30 to June 25, 05:00.\n<color=#3c4d4d>Complete Advanced Guild Orders to earn double rewards!</color>",
    ["2025AnniversaryTips_008"]="Remaining drops across all servers: %s",
    ["2025AnniversaryTips_009"]="Next Wave: %s",
    ["2025AnniversaryTips_010"]="Broadcast: Early access to exclusive effects on the new serve—can't wait to journey with you!\n1. World Level progression speed increased by at least 200%.\n2. Base EXP, Job EXP, and Zeny obtained from AFK using Odin's Blessings are increased by at least 1,200% (up to 2,000 Odin's Blessings daily)!\n3. EXP obtained from Life Skills is increased by at least 200% (up to 2,000 Stamina daily).",
    ["2025AnniversaryTips_011"]="Rules:\n1. The event takes place every night at 20:00-21:00, 22:00-23:00.\n2. Each session lasts 1 hour, with 6 rounds (10 minutes each) in total. Enter via the designated NPC in the main city.\n3. At the start of each round, a Deviling shows up in the main city and hands out Mysterious Candy (usable in the instance) for 1 minute. After that, the boss will spawn in the main city, and rewards are distributed based on part damage rankings. Only the top 200 parties get rewards.\n4. Candy gives you a huge combat boost, and it can even deal massive damage to the boss directly!\n5. A server-wide reward will be up for grabs during the event. Only one is available per day; resets at 05:00 daily.\n6. When the event ends, you will be teleported back to the main city automatically.",
