    ["3rdAnniversaryTips_001"]="Current Split Eligibility: <size=20>%s</size> Server-wide Split: <color=#64B1D9><size=20>%s</size></color>",
    ["3rdAnniversaryTips_002"]="Obtain Cards:\n 1. Consume Odin's Blessings and defeat monsters for a chance of getting a Common Card Box.\n 2. Open the Carnival Chest every day to get a guaranteed Common Card Box.\n 3. On the exchange interface, spend wild cards and crystals for various card boxes.",
    ["3rdAnniversaryTips_003"]="Rules:\n1. Cards are divided into common cards (J, Q, K, A), wild cards, and Joker.\n2. During the event, consume Odin's Blessings and defeat monsters for a chance of getting a common card box (up to 3 per day). Open the Carnival Chest every day to get a guaranteed common card box.\n3. Consume 1 set of common cards (J, Q, K, A) to get 1 entry for the diamond split reward. A single Adventurer can earn multiple entries.\n4. When the event is settled, the diamond pool will be equally split based on the total split entries from all Adventurers (more entries yield more rewards, and each entry gets the same amount of diamonds).\n5. Open different card boxes to have a chance to get the Joker. Each Joker card grants one reward, which can be claimed directly.\n6. When the event is settled, a Joker Lucky Draw will take place with 10 grand prizes (more Joker cards, higher odds. Each Joker card has the same winning chance.)",
    ["3rdAnniversaryTips_004"]="%s-%s Odin Auto-Battle Base Reward Doubled",
