    ["3rdAnniversaryTips_008"]="Collaboration Invasion Rules:\n1. Tap the title below to claim the quest.\n2. A new quest will unlock daily; you can complete unlocked quests at any time.\n3. After finishing the quest, you can claim your rewards on this screen.",
    ["3rdAnniversaryTips_009"]="From June 11, 08:30 to June 18, 05:00, <color=#3c4d4d>by defeating wilderness monsters, the chance of dropping MVP/MINI rare items is increased by 100%, and the amount of Base EXP, Job EXP, and Zeny obtained is increased by 100%.</color>\n \n From June 18, 08:30 to June 25, 05:00, <color=#3c4d4d>the crit rate of fishing, mining, gardening, and smelting is 15% (with extra items available to obtain); the gardening speed under special weather is increased by 20%.</color>\n \n \n From June 11, 08:30 to June 25, 05:00, <color=#3c4d4d>complete Guild Orders to earn double rewards!</color>",
    ["3rdAnniversaryTips_010"]="From June 11, 08:30 to June 18, 05:00, <color=#3c4d4d>by defeating wilderness monsters, the chance of dropping MVP/MINI rare items is increased by 100%, and the amount of Base EXP, Job EXP, and Zeny obtained is increased by 100%.</color>\n \n From June 18, 08:30 to June 25, 05:00, <color=#3c4d4d>the crit rate of fishing, mining, gardening, and smelting is 15% (with extra items available to obtain); the gardening speed under special weather is increased by 20%.</color>\n \n \n From June 11, 08:30 to June 25, 05:00, <color=#3c4d4d>complete Guild Orders to earn double rewards!</color>",
