    ["AchievementGet"]="Achievement: %s!",
    ["AchievementGroupName_1"]="Dungeon",
    ["AchievementGroupName_2"]="Cooperate",
    ["AchievementGroupName_3"]="Contest",
    ["AchievementGroupName_4"]="MVP",
    ["AchievementMainMenu_1"]="Character",
    ["AchievementMainMenu_2"]="Battles",
    ["AchievementMainMenu_3"]="Adventures",
    ["AchievementMainMenu_4"]="Equipment",
    ["AchievementMainMenu_5"]="Life",
    ["AchievementMainMenu_6"]="Quests",
    ["AchievementMainMenu_7"]="Couple",
    ["AchievementMainMenu_8"]="Red Envelope",
    ["AchievementSecContent_1"]="The beauty of life lies in adventures.\n— Criatura Academy Chronicles",
    ["AchievementSecContent_10"]="It's not always a blessing to have every wish fulfilled.\n— Thief Instructor Moxie",
    ["AchievementSecContent_11"]="Don't cry over spilled milk.\n— Kafra Corporation W",
    ["AchievementSecContent_12"]="Hand me the reins of a good steed, and I shall ride it across the darkness.\nIt can ward against evil spirits and enchantments, and leap across blazing flames.",
    ["AchievementSecContent_13"]="Goshawks hover in the sky in hopes of catching fish at the top of the mountain.",
    ["AchievementSecContent_14"]="Engrave the wonders of the world.",
    ["AchievementSecContent_15"]="Jade needs to be cut before it is of value.\n— proverb from Dragon Kingdom",
    ["AchievementSecContent_16"]="Lady Luck is smiling.",
    ["AchievementSecContent_17"]="Before the moon rises, the mountains are cold, and the honks of geese ring out into the blue clouds.",
    ["AchievementSecContent_18"]="Seek the shepherd if you need bait. How do you not know something so simple.",
    ["AchievementSecContent_19"]="It is not the endless mines that wear people out, but a single grain of sand within the mines.",
    ["AchievementSecContent_2"]="Adventurers, let us become legends and inspire future generations!",
    ["AchievementSecContent_20"]="To drink with one hand, and brawl with another.\n— Siegfried's Song",
    ["AchievementSecContent_21"]="The things we love show us who we really are.",
    ["AchievementSecContent_22"]="Life is like an anvil, the more you beat it, the more sparks you get.\n— Hollgrehenn",
    ["AchievementSecContent_23"]="Be sure to use this cauldron to make the secret brew.\n— Siegfried's Song",
    ["AchievementSecContent_24"]="One who chases shadows is a shadow himself.",
    ["AchievementSecContent_25"]="Drunk where the sky reflects upon the sea, a boat full of dreams across the galaxy.\n— Luoyang Nursery Rhymes",
    ["AchievementSecContent_26"]="The big dusty tree is evergreen all year round, sheltering the Holy Spring of Destiny.",
    ["AchievementSecContent_27"]="Someone owes money for the weapon. I'm here to collect on that debt.",
    ["AchievementSecContent_28"]="Whenever I need you, you're always there.",
    ["AchievementSecContent_29"]="I'd travel thousands of miles to be by your side.",
    ["AchievementSecContent_3"]="Three hundred monsters a day, all in a day's work for someone from Payon.",
    ["AchievementSecContent_30"]="Like flames that engulf and consume me.",
    ["AchievementSecContent_31"]="For you, I'd pluck the brightest star from the sky.",
    ["AchievementSecContent_32"]="Till death do us part.",
    ["AchievementSecContent_33"]="You are my day, my night, my everything.",
    ["AchievementSecContent_34"]=" The most beautiful sound in the world?\n Why, it's the jingling of Zeny and Diamonds, of course.",
    ["AchievementSecContent_35"]="Money is but a worldly possession, though it is priceless when shared with others.",
    ["AchievementSecContent_36"]="The scent of money... It's simply irresistible!\n —Crystal Merchant Sinclair",
    ["AchievementSecContent_37"]=" Perhaps these hands have been blessed by the Goddess...\n These palms constantly shine with a golden luster.",
    ["AchievementSecContent_38"]="Never forget, a penny saved is a penny earned.",
    ["AchievementSecContent_39"]="Monsters from another dimension... They should all be eradicated without mercy.",
    ["AchievementSecContent_4"]="In the past before the world was destroyed, storms and wolves ran rampant.",
    ["AchievementSecContent_40"]="Move on with faith, and never give up... \nFrom this, respect is born.",
    ["AchievementSecContent_41"]="Give and you shall receive in turn.",
    ["AchievementSecContent_5"]="A sharp blade flows, while the cumbersome swords sings.",
    ["AchievementSecContent_6"]="You may have heard of this, or you might know something else.\n— Unclear text on the Heart Pedestal",
    ["AchievementSecContent_7"]="Remind the sparrows to quiet down, as the skies are still miles higher.",
    ["AchievementSecContent_8"]="Years pass, and the hills grow apart.",
    ["AchievementSecContent_9"]="I scaled the mountains, only to find that I'm alone.",
