    ["ActivityEndingTips"]="Event has ended.",
    ["ActivityFindBack_Tips001"]="Welcome back to Midgard! You have unclaimed rewards, do you want to retrieve them?",
    ["ActivityFindBack_Tips002"]="Spend <color=#CA2E0AFF>%s</color> Crystals to retrieve all remaining rewards at a ratio of <color=#CA2E0AFF>%s</color>?",
    ["ActivityFindBack_Tips003"]="Spend <color=#CA2E0AFF>%s</color> Crystals to retrieve %s rewards at a ratio of <color=#CA2E0AFF>%s</color>?",
    ["ActivityFindBack_Tips004"]="Retrieve %s rewards at a ratio of <color=#CA2E0AFF>%s</color> for <color=#CA2E0AFF>free</color>?",
    ["ActivityFindBack_Tips005"]="<color=#97BCF8FF>Rules:</color>\n1. Rewards can be retrieved for incomplete gameplay up to 5 previous days.\n2. The Base Level used for obtaining daily rewards will be Adventurer's Base Level at 5 AM on the same day, and the rewards are collected based on the Base level.\n3. Non-Kafra VIP Adventurers get 1 free retrieval per week, which will be refreshed every Monday.\n4. Non-Kafra VIP Adventurers only get a 50% retrieval ratio.\n\n<color=#97BCF8FF>Kafra Plus:</color>\n1. Kafra Plus Adventurers get 3 extra free retrievals per week.\n2. Kafra Plus Adventurers get a 90% retrieval ratio.",
    ["ActivityFindBack_Tips006"]="%s Times",
    ["ActivityFindBack_Tips007"]="<color=#97BCF8FF>Rules:</color>\n1. Rewards can be provided for up to 5 of the previous days\n2. Retrieved rewards are collected based on the players Base Lv at 5AM that day\n3. There are 28 free retrieval chances in the first week\n4. The retrieval ratio for the first week is 50%\n",
