    ["Activity_DemonSlayer"]="Obtained from the Demon Slayer: Kimetsu no Yaiba collaboration event",
    ["Activity_Season_lock"]="No ongoing season at this moment",
    ["Activity_desc_100001"]="Monsters are invading the continent. Help the citizens of Rune Kingdom. Complete issued quests and drive away the monsters!",
    ["Activity_desc_100002"]="The Carousel is a new business at the Prontera South Gate, set up by the Eden Group. It has become a hot spot for ladies to take photos.",
    ["Activity_desc_100003"]="There are bountiful rewards for guild members forming groups to go on expeditions to defeat monsters!",
    ["Activity_desc_100004"]="A test of the adventurer's wisdom! Step on the O or X on the ground to select your answer. Rewards await!",
    ["Activity_desc_100005"]="Form a party and challenge the eerie instances! Invite your friends and defeat the mighty bosses together to get equipment, rare materials, and more.",
    ["Activity_desc_100006"]="Completing missions from the Chamber of Commerce will grant you large amounts of experience and you can even redeem rewards of your choice!",
    ["Activity_desc_100007"]="Odin's Blessing will help brave adventurers grow faster and more easily. It has never been easier to earn tons of experience!",
    ["Activity_desc_100008"]="empty",
    ["Activity_desc_100009"]="A successful guild is built upon every adventurer's dedication. Complete your guild quests each day and build up your guild family!",
    ["Activity_desc_100010"]="The bards sing of the Endless Tower, of how it awaits the brave to unveil it.",
    ["Activity_desc_100011"]="empty",
    ["Activity_desc_100012"]="empty",
    ["Activity_desc_100013"]="I am the dazzling warrior that combs through the continent, tracking down heroes and defeating them!",
    ["Activity_desc_100014"]="Enter the explosive 5v5 arena, where swords and magic clash, a battle of courage and wisdom!",
    ["Activity_desc_100015"]="Use the treasure map to find the ruins of the Rune-Midgarts Kingdom and uncover endless treasures!",
    ["Activity_desc_100016"]="Form a party with your fellow guild members and enter the tournament, and bring honor to your guild.",
    ["Activity_desc_100017"]="The smoke from GvG battles has spread across the entire continent. Position, command, coordinate, and protect your territory! For glory!",
    ["Activity_desc_100018"]="Assemble 15 trusted teammates, tackle the tough Trial Illusion, and experience an epic instance storyline!",
    ["Activity_desc_100019"]="It's a matter of life and death, but also a matter of superiority! The ultimate battle to decide the most powerful fighter in all Prontera!",
    ["Activity_desc_100021"]="Tavern Owner: \"This isn't just a place for drinking—there's also games with great rewards!\"",
    ["Activity_desc_100025"]="Xavier, the master of fishing, has some magical bait. Go find him to learn more about it and experience the ultimate thrill of fishing!",
    ["Activity_desc_100026"]="As Halloween descends upon Midgard, Jakk has invaded Prontera with a legion of evil monsters! Unite to resist the terrors of the night!",
    ["Activity_desc_100029"]="Between life and death, between the strong and the weak! Here all will be revealed! Come on! The bravest of the Midgard, display your prowess!",
    ["Activity_desc_100030"]="Form a team to challenge a magical illusion left behind by those before you. Experience a magnificent prehistoric battle for generous rewards.",
    ["Activity_desc_100031"]="Cast your vote, and choose the costume you want most! Remember claim your reward after the vote.",
    ["Activity_desc_100032"]="It's a contest of survival. It's a contest of strength. Face your rivals head-to-head, and fight to become the winner! Free Arena or Infinite Showdown, it's your call.",
    ["Activity_desc_100035"]="Imprisoned offerings, seeking to awaken the Demon Lord within the forbidden realm...\nThe chance of making it out alone is slim; have faith in your allies and overcome the darkness together!",
    ["Activity_desc_500001"]="Complete weekly quests to increase your season level. Let's fight to get into the end-of-year competition together!",
