    ["AnniCeremonyTips_001"]="(Obtained after submission)",
    ["AnniCeremonyTips_002"]="(Obtained)",
    ["AnniCeremonyTips_003"]="You have not entered a blessing yet.",
    ["AnniversaryAchievement_tips_001"]="Warrior Cultivation",
    ["AnniversaryAchievement_tips_002"]="Heroic Song",
    ["AnniversaryAchievement_tips_003"]="All-embracing Collection",
    ["AnniversaryAchievement_tips_004"]="Joyful Life",
    ["AnniversaryAchievement_tips_005"]="Kingdom Tycoon",
    ["AnniversaryDataDes_001"]="<color=#CA2E0AFF>%s</color>, you arrived in Rune-Midgarts Kingdom. (The statistics are collected until 10/13/2021.)",
    ["AnniversaryDataDes_002"]="<color=#CA2E0AFF>%s</color>, you possess the status of Kafra's VIP.",
    ["AnniversaryDataDes_003"]="<color=#CA2E0AFF>%s</color>, you have decided your path forward.",
    ["AnniversaryDataDes_003_1"]="You have maintained your Novice class. We hope that you will be able to decide on your class advancement in the near future.",
    ["AnniversaryDataDes_004"]="Among numerous choices, you chose to become a <color=#CA2E0AFF>%s</color>.",
    ["AnniversaryDataDes_005"]="During your adventure, <color=#CA2E0AFF>%s</color> monster(s) have filled your handbook.",
    ["AnniversaryDataDes_006"]="To date, you have defeated <color=#CA2E0AFF>%s</color> monster(s).",
    ["AnniversaryDataDes_007"]="You have fought and bested enemies <color=#CA2E0AFF>%s</color> time(s).",
    ["AnniversaryDataDes_008"]="Throughout your journey, you have collected <color=#CA2E0AFF>%s</color> decoration(s). They are still waiting for you to pick them.",
    ["AnniversaryDataDes_008_1"]="Your Wardrobe is still empty. I wonder what the first lucky addition will be.",
    ["AnniversaryDataDes_009"]="As you set off again, you now have <color=#CA2E0AFF>%s</color> mount(s) accompanying you.",
    ["AnniversaryDataDes_010"]="Friendship is a diamond, sparkling throughout your adventure. To date, you have become friends with <color=#CA2E0AFF>%s</color> other adventurer(s).",
    ["AnniversaryDataDes_010_1"]="In your heart, you seem to have found your own haven. You can find peace regardless of the liveliness or solitude around you.",
    ["AnniversaryDataDes_011"]="Among them, <color=#CA2E0AFF>%s</color> is your closest companion.",
    ["AnniversaryDataDes_012"]="You have also formed unbreakable bonds with <color=#CA2E0AFF>%s</color> NPC(s).",
    ["AnniversaryDataDes_013"]="You are well versed in money-making. At the Exchange Center, you have already sold <color=#CA2E0AFF>%s</color> order(s).",
    ["AnniversaryDataDes_013_1"]="You have not unlocked your business talents yet. Hurry over to the Exchange Center to make your first transaction!",
    ["AnniversaryDataDes_014"]="In this process, you earned <color=#CA2E0AFF>%s</color> Crystal(s).",
    ["AnniversaryDataDes_015"]="You have also spent <color=#CA2E0AFF>%s</color> Crystal(s) to become stronger.",
    ["AnniversaryDataDes_016"]="In order to search for rare treasures, you have generously spent <color=#CA2E0AFF>%s</color> Diamond(s).",
    ["AnniversaryDataDes_017"]="You're a natural card collector. You have obtained <color=#CA2E0AFF>%s</color> card(s).",
    ["AnniversaryDataDes_017_1"]="Unfortunately, you have not collected any cards yet. Cards can grant you strong bonuses in battle. Go collect some!",
    ["AnniversaryDataDes_018"]="Among them, <color=#CA2E0AFF>%s</color> card(s) turned out to be your precious loot from nearly half a year of fighting monsters.",
    ["AnniversaryDataDes_019"]="In your adventures, you have unlocked <color=#CA2E0AFF>%s</color> type(s) of card encyclopedias in your Academy Handbook.",
    ["AnniversaryHint_2"]="HAPPY 4TH ANNIVERSARY",
    ["AnniversaryHint_3"]="Successfully claimed.",
    ["AnniversaryMessageTips_002"]="Too few characters you have entered. Unable to leave a message.",
    ["AnniversaryMessageTips_003"]="You have entered too many characters.",
    ["AnniversaryMessageTips_004"]="Every %s Star Wish Coins spent, Floor-To-Ceiling Screen Messager x%s will be gifted to you. (%s/%s)",
    ["AnniversaryMessageTips_005"]="Crystal Received: %s (Rewards will be issued via mail)",
    ["AnniversaryMessageTips_006"]="1. Different screen types consume different tokens to leave a message.\n2. After leaving a message on the Jumbotron, the message will be displayed on the largest screen in Prontera. Meanwhile, a notice will be announced throughout the entire server, and the message will be pinned to the world channel.\n3. After leaving a message on the Floor-To-Ceiling Screen, the message will be displayed on the mid-size screen in Prontera, and a pop-up bulletin will appear when the Adventurer arrives at the Poring location.\n4. After leaving a message on the Small Screen, the message will be displayed on the small screen in Prontera, and a pop-up bulletin will appear when the Adventurer arrives at the Poring location.\n5. The duration of the message on the screen increases as the number of messages left increases.\n6. The Messager will be consumed first when leaving a message.\n7. When leaving multiple messages on the same type of screen, the newer message can only be left when the previous one finishes display. When multiple people are leaving messages on the same type of screen, the messages will be displayed one after another based on the chronological order in which the message is left.",
    ["AnniversaryMessageTips_007"]="Successfully left a message",
    ["AnniversaryMessageTips_008"]="Star Wish Coins Owned: %s",
    ["AnniversaryMessageTips_009"]="Obtained through gift packs and Make a Wish quests.",
    ["AnniversaryMessageTips_010"]="1. During the wishing period, select a wish and input Star Wish Coins to make a wish.\n2. During the prize announcement period, a lucky draw will be carried out based on the number of Star Wish Coins inputted in the wish. The more the Star Wish Coins are inputted, the higher the winning chance.\n3. The three wishes can be selected more than once.\n4. The number of Crystals to be awarded is based on the total Star Wish Coins inputted across all three wishes.",
    ["AnniversaryMessageTips_011"]="Messages exist on the current type of screen. Queuing/displaying...",
    ["AnniversaryMessageTips_012"]="Inputted: %s",
    ["AnniversaryMessageTips_013"]="Your chance of winning is higher than %s% of the players.",
    ["AnniversaryMessageTips_014"]="Current Round: In progress. Ends in %s.",
    ["AnniversaryMessageTips_015"]="The next round starts in %s.",
    ["AnniversaryMessageTips_016"]="Event Time: %s to %s",
    ["AnniversaryMessageTips_017"]="Successfully made a wish.",
    ["AnniversaryMessageTips_018"]="Starts at %s.",
    ["AnniversaryMessageTips_019"]="TIME:%s~%s",
    ["AnniversaryMessageTips_020"]="Event Time: %s to %s",
    ["AnniversaryMessageTips_051"]="Adventurer, do you want to become the center of attention? Come to me and leave a message!",
    ["AnniversaryMessageTips_052"]="The message will show up on the %s. There are %s Adventurers ahead of you. Last %s.",
    ["AnniversaryMessageTips_053"]="The message is expected to show up on the %s. There are %s Adventurers ahead of you. Last %s.",
    ["AnniversaryMessageTips_054"]="Displaying message. Last %s minute(s).",
