    ["AnniversaryTips_001"]="Warrior Level %s",
    ["AnniversaryTips_002"]="Wish for <color=#CA2E0AFF>%s</color>? You <color=#CA2E0AFF>can't change your mind</color> later.",
    ["AnniversaryTips_003"]="No wishes unlocked.",
    ["AnniversaryTips_004"]="This wish has not been unlocked yet.",
    ["AnniversaryTips_005"]="Rules:\n·The event is divided into the event phase and reward claim phase.\n\n·The event ends at 5:00 on October 24. During the event, completed Bass Echo and Note Challenge quests (quest chains) will be counted.\n\n·The reward claim phase ends at 5:00 on October 28. Before the deadline, you can always receive quests and claim Warrior's Reward rewards. At the Celebration Shop, items can be exchanged and Anniversary Wishes can be made.\n\n·For the Bass Echo event, the player's account data since its creation and new data accumulated during the event will be counted.\n\n·Complete various Bass Echo quests to upgrade the Warrior Level and claim corresponding Warrior's Rewards.\n\n·For Note Challenge, only player's data accumulated during the event will be counted.\n\n·Complete various quests in Note Challenge to get Celebration Points, which can be exchanged for items in the Celebration Shop.\n\n·Various Anniversary Wishes will be unlocked as your Warrior Level increases. You can only choose 1 out of 3 wishes. The selected gift pack items will be obtained in the 2022 Anniversary Celebration.",
    ["AnniversaryTips_006"]="Event time: %s–%s",
    ["AnniversaryTips_007"]="Rules:\nFor the Highlighted Planning event, the Adventurer's account data since its creation and new data accumulated during the event will be counted.\n\nQuests will still be counted during the Highlighted Planning event.\n\nComplete various Highlighted Planning quests to upgrade the anniversary celebration exclusive Warrior Level (gain 1 level for every 100 EXP). Increase your Warrior Level to claim corresponding Warrior's Rewards.\n\nAdventurer's historical Crystal transactions before tax will be tallied in the 5-Star Seller and Royal Buyer quest series, excluding buying and selling Diamonds and bidding on rare items.",
    ["AnniversaryTips_008"]="Unlocked Warrior Level %s. Go to Bass Echo and complete quests to keep increasing your Warrior Level.",
    ["AnniversaryTips_009"]="You've already made a wish. You can't change it again.",
    ["AnniversaryTips_010"]="Rules:\n·Complete Bass Echo quests and increase your Warrior Level to unlock and make a 2nd Anniversary Celebration wish on the Wish screen, which will come true during the anniversary celebration.\n\n You can only <color=#CA2E0AFF>pick 1 out of 3</color> wishes, and your wish cannot be changed afterwards.\n\n·Please refer to the 2022 Anniversary Celebration announcement for the items that will be released in each wish pack.",
    ["AnniversaryTips_011"]="Rules:\n· For Note Challenge, only player's data accumulated during the event will be counted.\n\n· For Trading Champion branch quests, players' pre-tax Crystal turnover at the Exchange Center during the event will be counted, but the sale and purchase of Diamonds and auction of rare items will not be counted.\n\n· Complete various quests in Note Challenge to get Celebration Points, which can be exchanged for items in the Celebration Shop.",
    ["AnniversaryTips_012"]="Reward Expiration: %s",
    ["AnnouncemenChildrens_1"]="<color=#ec8a5a>The Golden Queen</color> has appeared with rare gifts at <color=#ec8a5a>Eden Group [Channel 1]</color>.",
    ["AnnouncemenChildrens_2"]="<color=#ec8a5a>%s</color> hit like a pro! They struck the <color=#ec8a5a>Golden Queen</color> and obtained the surprise gift <color=#ec8a5a>%s</color>!",
    ["AnnouncemenChildrens_3"]="<color=#ec8a5a>%s</color> obtained the gift exchange material <color=#ec8a5a>%s</color>.",
    ["AnnouncemenChristmas_1"]="<color=#ec8a5a>A Gold Angeling Balloon</color> has appeared in <color=#ec8a5a>Geffen</color> with rare Christmas gifts!",
    ["AnnouncemenChristmas_2"]="<color=#ec8a5a>%s</color> hit their target like a pro, popping a <color=#ec8a5a>%s</color> to get the mysterious <color=#ec8a5a>%s</color> Christmas gift!",
    ["AnnouncemenChristmas_3"]="<color=#ec8a5a>%s</color> popped a <color=#ec8a5a>%s</color> to get <color=#ec8a5a>%s</color>, which can be exchanged for gifts!",
    ["AnnouncemenHalloween_1"]="The <color=#d6006c>Twilight Banquet Illusion</color> will begin in <color=#ec8a5a>5 minutes</color>! Adventurers, head to <color=#ec8a5a>Odin's Statue in Prontera</color> and prepare to enter the illusion!",
    ["AnnouncemenHalloween_2"]="The <color=#d6006c>Twilight Banquet Illusion</color> has begun! Adventurers, head to <color=#ec8a5a>Odin's Statue in Prontera</color> to enter the illusion!",
    ["AnnouncemenHalloween_3"]="<color=#ec8a5a>%s</color> defeated <color=#ec8a5a>%s</color> in <color=#d6006c>Twilight Banquet Illusion</color> and received a rare item, <color=#ec8a5a>%s</color>.",
    ["AnnouncemenHalloween_4"]="The <color=#d6006c>Dream Terror</color> will begin in <color=#ec8a5a>5 minutes</color>! Adventurers, head to <color=#ec8a5a>Central Fountain in Prontera</color> and prepare to enter!",
    ["AnnouncemenHalloween_5"]="The <color=#d6006c>Dream Terror</color> has begun! Adventurers, head to <color=#ec8a5a>Central Fountain in Prontera</color> to enter!",
    ["AnnouncemenLantern_1"]="<color=#ec8a5a>%s</color> and <color=#ec8a5a>%s</color> successfully united to earn the Jade Rabbit's Blessing!",
    ["AnnouncemenLantern_2"]="<color=#ec8a5a>%s</color> and <color=#ec8a5a>%s</color> successfully united to earn the Blessing of the Lantern! Kafra VIP <color=#ec8a5a>%s</color> will obtain a Lantern Festival Gift Box!",
    ["AnnouncemenWhiteDay_1"]="<color=#ec8a5a>%s</color> and <color=#ec8a5a>%s</color> made some cookies and received Cupid's blessing!",
    ["AnnouncemenWhiteDay_2"]="Close Friends <color=#ec8a5a>%s</color> and <color=#ec8a5a>%s</color> made some cookies and obtained Cupid's blessing, as well as some Pink Paper Cranes, as a reward!",
    ["AnnouncementBearRealDrop"]="Congratulations to <color=#ec8a5a>%s</color> for achieving outstanding damage taken in the Nian Invasion, earning the rare <color=#ec8a5a>%s</color>!",
    ["AnnouncementBloodyBranch"]="<color=#ec8a5a>%s</color> used a Bloody Branch in your guild territory, summoning <color=#ec8a5a>%s</color>! Hurry up and join the expedition!",
    ["AnnouncementFatTiger_1"]="Amazing Luck! <color=#ff5d5d>%s</color> claimed <color=#ff5d5d>%s Diamonds</color> from the Wheel Prize Pool!",
    ["AnnouncementGashaponTally1"]="Congratulations to <color=#FF6F76>%s</color> for winning <color=#FF6F76>%s</color> x<color=#FF6F76>%s</color> in this round of the Cool Event Corporation Points Lottery!",
    ["AnnouncementGashaponTally2"]="The next round of the Cool Event Corporation Points Lottery is about to begin! If you haven't participated yet, head to the Prontera Vending Machine to join in!",
    ["AnnouncementGashaponTally3"]="Congratulations to <color=#FF6F76>%s</color> for winning <color=#FF6F76>%s</color> x<color=#FF6F76>%s</color> in this round of the Kafra Corporation Points Lottery!",
    ["AnnouncementGashaponTally4"]="The next round of the Kafra Corporation Points Lottery is about to begin! If you haven't participated yet, head to the Prontera Vending Machine to join in!",
    ["AnnouncementGashaponTally5"]="Congratulations to <color=#FF6F76>%s</color> for winning <color=#FF6F76>%s</color> x<color=#FF6F76>%s</color> in this round of the Cat Hand Services Points Lottery!",
    ["AnnouncementGashaponTally6"]="The next round of the Cat Hand Services Points Lottery is about to begin! If you haven't participated yet, head to the Prontera Vending Machine to join in!",
    ["AnnouncementGashaponTally7"]="Double-tap the blank area to open all gachas. Tap SKIP to skip the reward display.",
    ["AnnouncementGifts_1"]="<color=#ec8a5a>{0}</color> gifted <color=#ec8a5a>{1}</color> <color=#5d98e7>{2}</color> x<color=#5d98e7>%s</color>. The bond between them has deepened!",
    ["AnnouncementGkvm_1"]="Guild KVM will begin in 5 minutes. Invite your friends to take part in the battle together!",
    ["AnnouncementGkvm_2"]="The current Guild KVM season has ended. Congratulations to Guild %s for coming in first!",
    ["AnnouncementGve_1"]="The Otherworld Gate will open in 5 minutes. Our guild members may enter the battle area via the Valkyrie in our territory.",
    ["AnnouncementGve_2"]="The Otherworld Gate will open in 3 minutes. Our guild members may enter the battle area via the Valkyrie in our territory.",
    ["AnnouncementGve_3"]="The Otherworld Gate will open in 1 minute. Our guild members may enter the battle area via the Valkyrie in our territory.",
    ["AnnouncementGve_4"]="The Otherworld Gate is open! Please head to our guild territory to take part in the battle.",
    ["AnnouncementHealRealDrop"]="Congratulations to <color=#ec8a5a>%s</color> for achieving outstanding healing in the Nian Invasion, earning the rare <color=#ec8a5a>%s</color>!",
    ["AnnouncementHighTest"]="Hi %s! I am a Public Announcement Test. Your level is %s.",
    ["AnnouncementIceFishing_1"]="The Fishing Showdown begins now! Everyone, please get ready at the designated spot in Lutie.",
    ["AnnouncementIceFishing_2"]="The Fishing Showdown is ending in 5 minutes. %s is currently leading the game with a fish %scm long!",
    ["AnnouncementIceFishing_3"]="%s fishes up a fish %scm long and breaks today's record!",
    ["AnnouncementIceFishing_4"]="Fish are gathering. You now have a much bigger chance of catching a big fish!",
    ["AnnouncementInvadeRefresh"]="<color=#FF6F76>%s</color> has been affected by the Haze weather. There will be Otherworld gaps appearing on <color=#FF6F76> [Route 1]</color>.",
    ["AnnouncementMuMa"]="Congratulations to <color=#FF6F76>%s</color> for being visitor number <color=#FF6F76>%s</color> of the Carousel. Your reward will be valuable <color=#FF6F76>Eden Group gold coins</color>.",
    ["AnnouncementMvpRefresh"]="%s will be spawning on %s [Route 1]. Warriors, charge!",
    ["AnnouncementNormalTest"]="HI %s! I am a Public Announcement Test. Your level is %s.",
    ["AnnouncementOX_1"]="Since a large portion of the audience got the right answer, we will increase the answering time for the next question!",
    ["AnnouncementOX_2"]="Rewards galore! OX Quiz starts in 5 minutes. Don't miss out!",
    ["AnnouncementOX_3"]="OX Quiz has begun! Get ready to answer! Adventurers who are not taking part, give it a shot next time!",
    ["AnnouncementPKtrade_1"]="The item <color=#ec8a5a>%s</color> has entered the Bidding Wars segment! The final showdown will start in 60 seconds. Go spectate!",
    ["AnnouncementPKtrade_2"]="The item <color=#ec8a5a>%s</color> was ultimately obtained by the bidder <color=#e7bb22>%s%s</color> for <color=#ec8a5a>%s Diamond(s)</color>!",
    ["AnnouncementRamadan_1"]="Congratulations! <color=#ec8a5a>%s</color> killed <color=#ec8a5a>%s</color>. The clone will appear in 10 minutes at <color=#ec8a5a>%s</color>. Warriors, charge!",
    ["AnnouncementRamadan_2"]="<color=#ec8a5a>%s</color> clone(s) will appear in 5 minutes at <color=#ec8a5a>%s</color>. Warriors, charge!",
    ["AnnouncementRamadan_3"]="<color=#ec8a5a>%s</color> clone(s) will appear in 1 minute at <color=#ec8a5a>%s</color>. Warriors, charge!",
    ["AnnouncementRamadan_4"]="<color=#ec8a5a>%s</color> clone(s) have appeared at <color=#ec8a5a>%s</color>. Warriors, charge!",
    ["AnnouncementRefineTips"]="Congratulations, Adventurer <color=#32abea>%s</color> succeeded to achieve refinement<color=#f47261> +%s%s</color>!",
    ["AnnouncementSeasonWeather"]="It's only <color=#FF6F76>%s</color> minute(s) until <color=#FF6F76>%s</color>'s weather turns: <color=#FF6F76>%s</color>! Some monsters have thereupon mutated! Hurry there and eliminate them, warriors!",
    ["AnnouncementSeasonWeather_2"]="The %s map is currently under the Whirlsand weather, with a swarm of Calamity Boxes rampaging in the vicinity! Warriors, proceed and eliminate them as soon as possible!",
    ["AnnouncementSpringFestival"]="Nian Siege! Phantom Nian has appeared in the vicinity of <color=#ec8a5a>%s</color>! Go there and defeat them now!",
    ["AnnouncementTradeAdvert_1"]="Adventurer <color=#ec8a5a>%s %s</color> is selling <color=#ec8a5a>%s</color> in the Diamond Auction House! If you want to get your hands on some rare goods, now's your chance!",
    ["AnnouncementUltraman"]="<color=#ec8a5a>%s</color>, congratulations on getting the SP reward <color=#ec8a5a>%s</color> in the Reward of Light Special Assault mode!",
    ["AnnouncementWeatherAberrance"]="Due to the <color=#FF6F76>%s</color> weather, the <color=#FF6F76>%s</color> has mutated! Hurry there and eliminate it!",
    ["AnnouncementWorldTask_1"]="The world event - <color=#ec8a5a>Surprise Delivery</color> has started in Lutie! Complete the gift delivery quest for the <color=#ec8a5a>Gingerbread Reindeer</color> to progress the quest and claim rewards!",
    ["AnnouncementWorldTask_2"]="The world event - <color=#ec8a5a>Eve of Celebration</color> has started in Toy Factory! Defeat the <color=#ec8a5a>Cookie Bandit</color> and <color=#ec8a5a>Myst Case Bandit</color> who stole the fireworks, and submit the <color=#ec8a5a>Lost Firework</color> to the <color=#ec8a5a>Christmas Cookie Foreman</color> to progress the quest and claim rewards!",
    ["AnnouncementWorldTask_3"]="The world event - <color=#ec8a5a>Celebration Commencement</color> has started in Lutie! Set off the <color=#ec8a5a>Scattered Firework Boxes</color> to progress the quest and claim rewards!",
    ["AnnouncementWorldTask_4"]="The world event - <color=#ec8a5a>Nightmare Cruiser</color> has started in Toy Factory! Defeat the crazy <color=#ec8a5a>Nightmare Cruiser</color> to progress the quest and claim rewards!",
    ["AnnouncementWorldTask_5"]="The world event - <color=#ec8a5a>Energy Armament</color> has started in Lutie! Gather the <color=#ec8a5a>Energy Crystals</color> and submit the <color=#ec8a5a>Energy Fragments</color> to the <color=#ec8a5a>Gingerbread Factory Manager</color> to progress the quest and claim rewards!",
    ["AnnouncementWorldTask_6"]="The world event - <color=#ec8a5a>Warg Tracking</color> has started in Toy Factory! Submit the <color=#ec8a5a>Warg Breath</color> you obtained from the previous event to <color=#ec8a5a>Evelyn</color> to progress the quest and claim rewards!",
    ["AnnouncementWorldTask_7"]="The world event - <color=#ec8a5a>Challenge Garm</color> has started in Lutie! Adventurers, let's party up and safeguard Lutie's peace!",
    ["AnnouncementXmas_1"]="The Clown has found a new hiding place! Go to Lutie and find him!",
    ["AnnouncementXmas_2"]="Garm obtained the power of <color=#5A7D29>Cookie</color>! Prepare yourself with the Cookie Transmog and battle against it!",
    ["AnnouncementXmas_3"]="Garm obtained the power of <color=#ff3300>Christmas Cookie</color>! Prepare yourself with the Christmas Cookie Transmog and battle against it!",
    ["AnnouncementXmas_4"]="Garm obtained the power of <color=#FFFF00>Myst Case</color>! Prepare yourself with the Myst Case Transmog and battle against it!",
    ["AnnouncementXmas_5"]="Garm obtained the power of <color=#0033ff>Cruiser</color>! Prepare yourself with the Cruiser Transmog and battle against it!",
    ["AnnouncementXmas_6"]="Garm retreats for now and tries to regain the power for the next attack. Get yourself prepared and end it once and for all this time!",
    ["AnnouncementZoneGvg_1"]="<color=#ec8a5a>%s</color> has captured <color=#ec8a5a>%s</color> and obtained <color=#ec8a5a>%s</color> Crystal energy",
    ["Announcementhunterking_1"]="The <color=#ec8a5a>Ultimate Showdown</color> qualifiers have come to an end! All those who qualified, please enter the final battle arena! The finals will officially start in 2 minutes!",
    ["Announcementhunterking_2"]="Registration for the <color=#ec8a5a>Ultimate Showdown</color> has begun! Registration will be open for <color=#ec8a5a>3</color> minutes. Please go to <color=#ec8a5a>Tony Chir</color> in the tavern to register!",
    ["Announcementhunterking_3"]="The <color=#ec8a5a>Ultimate Showdown</color> registration period has come to an end! The qualifiers will begin in <color=#ec8a5a>2 minutes</color>. Please be sure to enter the competition as soon as possible!",
    ["Announcementhunterking_4"]="A winner has been crowned! <color=#ec8a5a>%s</color> defeated all other competitors in the Ultimate Showdown and has earned the title of <color=#ec8a5a>Ultimate Fighter</color>!",
    ["Announcementhunterking_5"]="The Battlefield Administrator has placed a <color=#ec8a5a>Supply Box</color> on the battlefield. Check it out now, Adventurers!",
