    ["ApexGVGLeague_RewardTips09"]="Apex GVG League Season %s",
    ["ApexGVGLeague_RewardTips10"]="Not Qualified",
    ["ApexGVGLeague_Tips001"]="League Overview",
    ["ApexGVGLeague_Tips002"]="Preliminaries",
    ["ApexGVGLeague_Tips003"]="League Phases",
    ["ApexGVGLeague_Tips004"]="Hall of Glory",
    ["ApexGVGLeague_Tips005"]="Matching...",
    ["ApexGVGLeague_Tips007"]="League Progression:",
    ["ApexGVGLeague_Tips008"]="- Step 1: Qualifier Phase: Compete in the Main Server KVM rankings to earn your spot.",
    ["ApexGVGLeague_Tips009"]="- Step 2: Group Phase: After confirming the qualifying guilds, the system automatically allocates groups and tiers (reset after each round).",
    ["ApexGVGLeague_Tips010"]="- Step 3: League Phase: The league lasts 4 weeks, with 3 matches per party each week.",
    ["ApexGVGLeague_Tips011"]="- Step 4: Hall of Glory: Announce the final rankings.",
    ["ApexGVGLeague_Tips012"]="Rules:",
    ["ApexGVGLeague_Tips013"]="1. Apex GVG League is a Cross-Server Contest.\nGuilds are grouped based on their Point Rankings of the Main Server KVM.\nThere will be 4 match zones, each containing 8 tiers where winners fight their way up. (Match zones displayed below are not listed in any particular order. After each round, guilds are reshuffled into new zones according to their latest tiers.)\n<color=#dbbd82>- Match Zones: Prontera, Izlude Island, Morroc, and Payon.</color>\n<color=#dbbd82>- Tiers (high to low): Apex King, Legendary Star, Exalted Diamond, Glorious Platinum, Tempered Gold, Frosted Silver, Rising Bronze, Dauntless Steel.</color>\nNote:\nLet our glory shine on the world stage! Fighting Side by Side—the Hall of Glory ranking rewards now offer double <color=#FF0000>Apex GVG Exchange Medal</color>!\n<color=#FF0000>New Year Break: No matches will be held from December 29, 2025 to January 4, 2026.</color>",
    ["ApexGVGLeague_Tips014"]="2. Apex GVG League runs for 4 rounds, each lasting 1 week. Every week, guilds must join 3 matches.\n<color=#dbbd82>- Match 1: Every Wednesday 21:30:00 - 21:55:00 (UTC+7)</color>\n<color=#dbbd82>- Match 2: Every Saturday 21:30:00 - 21:55:00 (UTC+7)</color>\n<color=#dbbd82>- Match 3: Every Saturday 22:00:00 - 22:25:00 (UTC+7)</color>\n- At the end of each round, guilds are reassigned based on their current tier, with all guilds of the same tier reassigned randomly across groups.",
    ["ApexGVGLeague_Tips015"]="3. Participation Rules:\n1) Servers open for less than 180 days are not eligible.\n2) A maximum of 60 members from the guild may participate. Guild titles cannot be adjusted from 5 minutes before the match starts until the end.\n- Guild Leader: <color=#dbbd82>1</color>\n- Deputy Guild Leader: <color=#dbbd82>3</color>\n- First-Tier Member: <color=#dbbd82>6</color>\n- Second-Tier Member: <color=#dbbd82>50</color>",
    ["ApexGVGLeague_Tips016"]="4. Reward Details:\n① After each match, rewards are calculated based on tier and result. All participating guild members will receive them via mail.\n② After each round, points are settled according to ranking and tier, and tiers are reassigned. (Higher tiers earn more points.)\n③ At the end of the season, final settlements are based on accumulated points, with trophies and leaderboard rewards delivered via mail to all guild members.\nNote: All rewards are issued through in-game mail. Adventurers are advised to collect them before withdrawing from their guild.",
    ["ApexGVGLeague_Tips017"]="5. Trophy Details:\n- Acquisition: Granted as final ranking rewards in the Apex GVG League.\n- Types of Trophies: <color=#dbbd82>1st Place: </color>Gold Cup; <color=#dbbd82>2nd Place: </color>Silver Cup; <color=#dbbd82>3rd Place: </color>Bronze Cup; <color=#dbbd82>4th-20th</color>: Iron Cup\n- Trophies are proof of guild honor. Members can view all past trophies earned on the Results screen.",
    ["ApexGVGLeague_Tips018"]="Unable to enter the battlefield due to your current guild title.",
    ["ApexGVGLeague_Tips019"]="Preliminaries",
    ["ApexGVGLeague_Tips020"]="Group Phase",
    ["ApexGVGLeague_Tips021"]="Battle Phase",
    ["ApexGVGLeague_Tips022"]="Tier Up/Down",
    ["ApexGVGLeague_Tips023"]="Hall of Glory",
    ["ApexGVGLeague_Tips024"]="League Phases (4 Rounds)",
    ["ApexGVGLeague_Tips025"]="Tips: Current round progress",
    ["ApexGVGLeague_Tips026"]="Match Progress",
    ["ApexGVGLeague_Tips027_1"]="Current Qualifier",
    ["ApexGVGLeague_Tips027_2"]="Current Semifinal",
    ["ApexGVGLeague_Tips027_3"]="Current Final",
    ["ApexGVGLeague_Tips028_1"]="Not Started",
    ["ApexGVGLeague_Tips028_2"]="In Progress",
    ["ApexGVGLeague_Tips028_3"]="Ended",
    ["ApexGVGLeague_Tips029"]="6. Ranking Rules:\n- Single round rankings are based on win/loss within the tier (not related to total points).\n- Honor Leaderboard is determined by:\n1) Guilds are ranked by points first.\n2) In the event of a tie, results are determined based on:\nTotal number of enemy base destructions → total battle time in winning matches (shorter durations rank higher) → total kills achieved in winning matches (higher counts rank higher)",
    ["ApexGVGLeague_Tips033_1"]="Qualifier/Semifinal",
    ["ApexGVGLeague_Tips033_2"]="Final",
    ["ApexGVGLeague_Tips033_3"]="Current Ranking",
    ["ApexGVGLeague_Tips034"]="Round 1",
    ["ApexGVGLeague_Tips035"]="Round 2",
    ["ApexGVGLeague_Tips036"]="Round 3",
    ["ApexGVGLeague_Tips037"]="Round 4",
    ["ApexGVGLeague_Tips038"]="Not Started",
    ["ApexGVGLeague_Tips039"]="1. The map is split into <color=#ffcd55>Red and Blue</color> zones.",
    ["ApexGVGLeague_Tips040"]="2. There are two lanes, top and bottom, with towers along the paths and a <color=#ffcd55>boss area</color> in the center.",
    ["ApexGVGLeague_Tips041"]="1. Each side has a <color=#ffcd55>base</color>. If destroyed, that side is defeated.\n2. Bases attack enemy units and possess unique <color=#ffcd55>structural armor</color> that modifies damage received.",
    ["ApexGVGLeague_Tips042"]="1. <color=#ffcd55>Towers</color> will attack enemies and are equipped with unique structural armor.\n2. When <color=#ffcd55>outer towers</color> remain intact, inner towers and the base receive <color=#ffcd55>significantly reduced damage</color>.",
    ["ApexGVGLeague_Tips043"]="1. From time to time, <color=#ffcd55>a faction boss will spawn</color>.\n2. If <color=#ffcd55>allied boss</color> defeats the enemy boss, your boss will <color=#ffcd55>assist in pushing towers</color>.",
    ["ApexGVGLeague_Tips044"]="1. <color=#ffcd55>Defeating neutral monsters</color> grants your faction resource points.\n2. <color=#ffcd55>Commanders</color> can spend strategy points to activate <color=#ffcd55>battle tactics</color> that help their guild win.",
    ["ApexGVGLeague_Tips045"]="My Guild",
    ["ApexGVGLeague_Tips046"]="<color=#dbbd82>Tier</color>\nRanking",
