    ["ApexGVGLeague_Tips062"]="When the league begins, tap the chat and select Apex GVG League to enter!!!",
    ["ApexGVGLeague_Tips063"]="The battle is over.",
    ["ApexGVGLeague_Tips064"]="Time:",
