    ["ApexGVGLeague_Tips067"]="%s (UTC+7)",
    ["ApexGVGLevelTips002"]="Both bosses have spawned! Hurry to the central area and help your boss defeat the enemy boss!!",
    ["ApexGVGLevelTips003"]="<color=#d25f62>Morroc</color>, with help from <color=#d25f62>Red Faction</color> heroes, won this round! In 10 seconds, it will move to a side lane to help <color=#d25f62>Red Faction</color> push towers!",
    ["ApexGVGLevelTips004"]="<color=#8a98f8>Thanatos</color>, with help from <color=#8a98f8>Blue Faction</color> heroes, won this round! In 10 seconds, it will move to a side lane to help <color=#8a98f8>Blue Faction</color> push towers!",
    ["ApexGVGLevelTips005"]="<color=#ffcd55>Charge forth, heroes! For the glory of the guild!!</color>",
