    ["BadgeDes10902001"]="A badge given to adventurers who participate in the MVP Academic Seminar, symbolizing knowledge, courage, luck, and supreme strength.",
    ["BadgeDes10902004"]="This badge symbolizes an adventurer's status as a fishing master of Midgard, second only to Xavier.",
    ["BadgeDes10902005"]="After 186 protests over claims that badges made of plants will eventually rot, the Horticultural Society finally began making badges out of ordinary materials.",
    ["BadgeDes10902006"]="\"Anyone can become a master, even if you only fight against Porings for 300 years.\" These were the words of encouragement Dean Mainz shared with his students at the badge-issuing ceremony.",
    ["BadgeDes10902007"]="If I wear this badge, will I get the item of my dreams on my next draw?",
    ["BadgeDes10902008"]="They say this badge was made exceptionally sturdy to prevent mining masters from digging out the rare ore embedded in it.",
    ["BadgeDes10902009"]="A badge certified and issued by Criatura Academy, it symbolizes the official beginning of every adventurer's career, and holds a deep significance to those who receive it.",
    ["BadgeDes10902016"]="Only the most fashionable headgear in your wardrobe can match this glittering badge.",
    ["BadgeDes10902018"]="You can never guess what kinds of mounts adventurers wearing Mount Master Badges might have under their command.",
    ["BadgeDes10902020"]="The Chamber of Commerce presents this badge only to adventurers who frequently help complete their requests, and always welcome their presence.",
    ["BadgeName1"]="MVP Commemorative Badge",
