    ["Barrage_001"]="Midgard, I'm here!",
    ["Barrage_002"]="High energy ahead!",
    ["Barrage_003"]="Awww, so cute!",
    ["Barrage_004"]="2333333",
    ["Barrage_005"]="This barrage is mine!",
    ["Barrage_006"]="Um...",
    ["Barrage_007"]="Knowledge will bring you wealth and wisdom!",
    ["Barrage_008"]="No looping",
    ["Barrage_009"]="What is this? Lark?",
    ["Barrage_010"]="Classy!",
    ["Barrage_011"]="Nice jump! Poring!",
    ["Barrage_012"]="So cute!!! Hahaha!",
    ["Barrage_013"]="Keep Running!!!",
    ["Barrage_014"]="Poring the Environment Contaminator LOL",
    ["Barrage_015"]="This glance back kills me!",
    ["Barrage_016"]="How does this old Poring pick up the staff without having hands?",
    ["Barrage_017"]="The handsome me is here!",
    ["Barrage_018"]="Am I supposed to die from a star strike?",
    ["Barrage_019"]="King Poring is so mad! Hahaha!",
    ["Barrage_020"]="I know nothing!",
    ["Barrage_021"]="Turns out I'm the thief XD",
    ["Barrage_022"]="Oh, shoot! I miss!",
    ["Barrage_023"]="Nice catch! Crow!",
    ["Barrage_024"]="There is a long way to go...",
    ["Barrage_025"]="It's gonna be a pain in the butt to climb for real",
    ["Barrage_026"]="This special effect is kinda fire",
    ["Barrage_027"]="Aaaaahhhhh! My eyes are bleeding!!!",
    ["Barrage_028"]="Wow! This is one giant Poring glasses",
    ["Barrage_029"]="Don't pat my shoulder!",
    ["Barrage_030"]="This is a weird-looking captain",
    ["Barrage_031"]="Yea, that's the captain rofl",
    ["Barrage_032"]="Wow... kinda spectacular...",
    ["Barrage_033"]="Ygnizem FOREVER!!!",
    ["Barrage_034"]="This transition is amazing!",
    ["Barrage_035"]="The best seagull's-eye view",
    ["Barrage_036"]="The captain again!",
    ["Barrage_037"]="Super Summon Magic!!!",
    ["Barrage_038"]="This is cool hahaha",
    ["Barrage_039"]="Finally done with all those nonsense...",
    ["Barrage_040"]="I definitely miss it...",
    ["Barrage_041"]="What do you mean by suitable? I'm a professional!",
    ["Barrage_042"]="So much green hair hahaha",
    ["Barrage_043"]="Veteran players: Git Gud!!!",
    ["Barrage_044"]="Assembling seven dragonballs",
    ["Barrage_045"]="Adventure! Battle! Then get killed!",
    ["Barrage_046"]="Prontera! Here I come!",
    ["Barrage_047"]="The ace skydiver is reporting for duty!",
    ["Barrage_048"]="Five go down, and one goes up",
    ["Barrage_049"]="You jump! I jump!",
    ["Barrage_050"]="Taking off! Weeee!",
    ["Barrage_051"]="A buttery landing. I'm proud of myself.",
    ["Barrage_052"]="Hahahaha! Don't fly too far out",
    ["Barrage_053"]="These two look shady",
    ["Barrage_054"]="What are you whispering? Fill me in",
    ["Barrage_055"]="Attaboy! Big Beard!",
    ["Barrage_056"]="My heroic entrance once again",
    ["Barrage_057"]="So it was you who lured the Willow to the village",
    ["Barrage_058"]="This story teaches you don't start a random casting",
    ["Barrage_059"]="Odin might not save you, but I will",
    ["Barrage_060"]="How come the protagonist has a big enough hand to cover up his upper body",
    ["Barrage_061"]="The true protagonist halo...",
    ["Barrage_062"]="Right, keep running like it's gonna matter",
    ["Barrage_063"]="Is the Golden Thief Bug made of gold? Can I sell it?",
    ["Barrage_064"]="Is there a dog in a hotdog?",
    ["Barrage_065"]="Is there anyone playing this game who is still single? No way! Unreal!",
    ["Barrage_066"]="???",
    ["Barrage_067"]="This is some arrogant laughter",
    ["Barrage_068"]="Right, that's me. You're welcome",
    ["Barrage_069"]="I give up on become Golden Thief Bug!!!",
    ["Barrage_070"]="This is unreal! It doesn't make sense!",
    ["Barrage_071"]="Ymir's Heart didn't fail. You failed",
    ["Barrage_072"]="Greenish stinky gas, Paul",
    ["Barrage_073"]="Navy, Marine, and Airforce of the Royal Chivalry, haha",
    ["Barrage_074"]="Did someone photoshop the head of this captain?",
    ["Barrage_075"]="A good-looking boy with animate eyes",
    ["Barrage_076"]="Nice! Burn it to the ground!",
    ["Barrage_077"]="This is way too hot!",
    ["Barrage_078"]="Everyone knows it, it's flame against the skull",
    ["Barrage_079"]="The duck captain. Quack quack quack",
    ["Barrage_080"]="How the hell does a skeleton smoke without lungs?",
    ["Barrage_081"]="Time stone?",
    ["Barrage_082"]="He got a big ship, we should take a look",
    ["Barrage_083"]="Aaaaahhhhhh! My Ygnizem is possessed",
    ["Barrage_084"]="Kept the same facial expression since forever",
    ["Barrage_085"]="Isn't Ygnizem a swordman?",
    ["Barrage_086"]="Evelyn? It turns out Ygnizem is possessed by a widow, haha",
    ["Barrage_087"]="This Evelyn got something in her",
    ["Barrage_088"]="A tsundere witch, hahaha",
    ["Barrage_089"]="We actually have battle over the sea here?",
    ["Barrage_090"]="You're over thinking, it's not possible",
    ["Barrage_091"]="Such a gigantic octopus!!!",
    ["Barrage_092"]="There is the dinner! Octopus it is!",
    ["Barrage_093"]="Gimme my ship TAT",
    ["Barrage_094"]="I'm gonna cry",
    ["Barrage_095"]="This First Mate is cute!!!",
    ["Barrage_096"]="Twisted octopus",
    ["Barrage_097"]="My awesome moves, HAHAHA",
    ["Barrage_098"]="I found this Whisper somewhat adorable",
    ["Barrage_099"]="I can't take it anymore TAT",
    ["Barrage_100"]="Reanimation Jutsu!",
    ["Barrage_101"]="Urgh... I don't know what to say",
    ["Barrage_102"]="Boohoo... Finally being together",
    ["Barrage_103"]="Yep, you're going away",
    ["Barrage_104"]="Eh? That's it?",
    ["Barrage_105"]="I thought the captain would try to resist a bit longer...",
    ["Barrage_106"]="These midgets are so funny, hahaha",
    ["Barrage_107"]="Smoke while asleep...",
    ["Barrage_108"]="Yo! This wine jar is so big and so white",
    ["Barrage_109"]="Haha! Found 'em! Hahahaha!",
    ["Barrage_110"]="Dwarf: Don't you touch me, moron!",
    ["Barrage_111"]="Why is it offensive to restore you?",
    ["Barrage_112"]="Nvm, I'll return the shards",
    ["Barrage_113"]="She's your wife!!!",
    ["Barrage_114"]="Help! Someone's murdering his wife! There's a murderer!",
    ["Barrage_115"]="The classic whoop your ass to wake you up",
    ["Barrage_116"]="Is your husband not listening? Slap him on the face",
    ["Barrage_117"]="Osiris is a major simp",
    ["Barrage_118"]="Because she's blind",
    ["Barrage_119"]="Then you... you are blind",
    ["Barrage_120"]="Why is it that I'm walking and she's swimming? /doge",
    ["Barrage_121"]="Aaaargh!!! It's so sweet!!!",
    ["Barrage_122"]="Wish the two of you stay together forever",
    ["Barrage_123"]="Are you sure this is not some god of thunder?",
    ["Barrage_124"]="Wow, let the thunder do the talking.",
    ["Barrage_125"]="Every Alchemist has a pair of glasses, hahaha",
    ["Barrage_126"]="It's time to take a pill",
    ["Barrage_127"]="It's Paul! Hahaha! No wonder why they look alike",
    ["Barrage_128"]="The previous chapter: Wife Murderer. This chapter: Daughter Murderer.",
    ["Barrage_129"]="Is it an unspoken rule for every boss to be retarded?",
    ["Barrage_130"]="Father! Wake up!",
    ["Barrage_131"]="Ugh? What happened?",
    ["Barrage_132"]="Nothing sweet is gonna happen in this chapter?",
    ["Barrage_133"]="Dang it! It's something sour instead!!!",
    ["Barrage_134"]="Gimme my Lucia!!!",
    ["Barrage_135"]="Paul: I'm outta here",
    ["Barrage_136"]="Frankly, these monsters are kinda cute",
    ["Barrage_137"]="Monsters are jamming up the place!",
    ["Barrage_138"]="Oh, we're jamming up the place too. Then it's fine.",
    ["Barrage_139"]="Paul, the trouble maker",
    ["Barrage_140"]="Stop it, Miss! Stop it, General!",
    ["Barrage_141"]="Qi Euin! Kill him right now!",
    ["Barrage_142"]="I want my Miss T-T",
    ["Barrage_143"]="Baroshev is disgusting...",
    ["Barrage_144"]="Haha! Failed again. Paul will be back.",
    ["Barrage_145"]="Blow his face off! I'm sick of seeing his face.",
    ["Barrage_146"]="Somehow Paul can escape just like that every time...",
    ["Barrage_147"]="The General inhaled unknown gas/funny",
    ["Barrage_148"]="A hilarious face, HAHA",
    ["Barrage_149"]="Who are you, cutie?",
    ["Barrage_150"]="Revenge? Watch me blast his head off, doge",
    ["Barrage_151"]="Is this blue blood a noble orc?",
    ["Barrage_152"]="Justice will prevail!",
    ["Barrage_153"]="The Orc Hero declared the war, but why do I have to be here/crying-laughing",
    ["Barrage_154"]="If there is black smoke, it must be followed by an unfortunate event",
    ["Barrage_155"]="The stories are so dark in every single chapter...",
    ["Barrage_156"]="Argh... family separation",
