    ["BattlePass_7"]="Level %s",
    ["BattlePass_8"]="Activate the Glory Pass.\nAt maximum level, the whole party can obtain a Cooking Pack after clearing an instance.",
    ["BattlePass_9"]="Activate the Glory Pass and instantly\nlevel up your pass by 25 levels.",
    ["BattlePlan_1"]="Spend %d Crystals to create a new load-out?\n(Creating a new load-out will reset your Stat Points, Skill Points, Equipment, and Battle Achievement Medals)",
    ["BattlePlan_10"]="Fully activated!",
    ["BattlePlan_11"]="Partially activated!",
    ["BattlePlan_12"]="No cards are available for activation.",
    ["BattlePlan_13"]="Activate <color=#FF0000>unbound</color> cards to equipment?",
    ["BattlePlan_14"]="Switch to this setup first.",
    ["BattlePlan_16"]="Switching load-outs on another class is not allowed at this time.",
    ["BattlePlan_2"]="Unable to switch load-outs during battle.",
    ["BattlePlan_3"]="Unable to create new load-outs during battle.",
    ["BattlePlan_4"]="Unable to switch load-outs while on a vehicle.",
    ["BattlePlan_5"]="Unable to create new load-outs while on a vehicle.",
    ["BattlePlan_6"]="Unable to switch Load-outs in your current state.",
    ["BattlePlan_7"]="Card Rules:\n1. Activation Button: Tap to sync the card setup to your equipment.\n2. Save Button: Tap to sync the currently equipped cards to your setup.\n3. Active Status: The card setup will show as active when it matches your cards.\n4. Switching setups will auto-load the card information from the saved setup.\n5. The card status in the setup will change with real-time equipment updates.\n6. The socket status in the load-out will change along with the weapon type.",
    ["BattlePlan_8"]="System Rules:\n1. Save Button: Tap to save your cards to load-outs.\n2. The interface allows you to socket, insert, or remove cards.\n3. Tap the card to view its details.\n4. The card status will change as your equipment updates in real time.",
    ["BattlePlan_9"]="No equipment with available card slots.",
