    ["BattleTips302161071"]="Don't let the puppet catch you!",
    ["BattleTips302161091"]="Hurry! Move your party member who turned into a keychain into the <color=#e14558>Light of Revival</color>!",
    ["BattleTips302161092"]="Congratulations on obtaining the buff.",
    ["BattleTips302161101"]="Pick up the balls that match the <color=#e14558>basket's color</color> and put them inside.",
    ["BattleTips302161102"]="Color Bomb",
    ["BattleTips302161103"]="It's an ocean of colorful balls! Your ball changes color each time you touch something.",
    ["BattleTips302161111"]="Stand together on a card to select it.",
    ["BattleTips302161112"]="Please find a <color=#e14558>higher</color> card than the Piedmon's, and <color=#e14558>have 4 people stand on it</color>.",
    ["BattleTips302161114"]="Memory Time",
    ["BattleTips30217107"]="Break that gear quickly! Devimon gains a buff when he's nearby.",
    ["BattleTips_3003910101"]="Shadow Chaser Gertie is planting Shadow Bombs on the marked Adventurer. Move the bomb away from the Abyss Square.",
    ["BattleTips_3003910201"]="Shadow Chaser Gertie is absorbing abyssal power. Leave the blast zone before the Omega Abyss Strike lands.",
    ["BattleTips_3004010101"]="Genetic Flamel is commanding the Automated Cannon to fire. Lure the bombardment near the Homunculus to damage it.",
    ["BattleTips_3012"]="Pick up attribute orbs to change weapon attribute",
    ["BattleTips_3021210801"]="If possessed, move away from the crowd quickly.",
    ["BattleTips_30212110"]="Break the shield and defeat the Witch Cult Leader, preventing Sloth's regeneration!",
    ["BattleTips_3021211001"]="Switch to fire shield! Trigger and defeat the Witch Cult Leader!",
    ["BattleTips_3021211101"]="The fallen souls are collected by Sloth, triggering Authority - Unseen Hand after reaching a certain number.",
    ["BattleTips_3021310401"]="Guide the tornado toward the mist to disperse it.",
    ["BattleTips_3021310901"]="Pick up the Purging Stone!",
    ["BattleTips_30213112"]="Launch the Purging Stone to activate the shield!",
    ["BattleTips_3021311201"]="Launch the Purging Stone to activate the shield!",
    ["BattleTips_30213117"]="Hurry and defeat the White Whale's Clone!",
    ["BattleTips_3021311701"]="Take down the White Whale's Clone quickly! Otherwise, your party will be wiped out!",
    ["BattleTips_30218107"]="The Power of Light has appeared!",
    ["BattleTips_30218110"]="Approach the Dark Cage to rescue party members.",
    ["BattleTips_302181111"]="Pick up the Sonic Blaster energy orb and use your skills to shatter the barrier.",
    ["BattleTips_302181112"]="Barrier Explosion",
    ["BattleTips_3102310101"]="Sorcerer Celia is about to summon Elemental Spirit. Stop the Elemental Spirit from reaching the Elemental Field.",
    ["BattleTips_3102410101"]="Ranger Cecil has targeted Adventurers carrying Wind Sign. Protect those Adventurers from the arrow.",
    ["BeKickedFromTeam"]="You have been removed from the party!",
    ["BeautyAnniversaryTips_001"]="Happy 1st Anniversary! Remember to revisit the Carousel you were riding with your friends back on the server-launching day for many more years to come!",
    ["BeautyAnniversaryTips_002"]="Your thought cannot exceed 64 characters.",
    ["BeautyAnniversaryTips_003"]="You have not entered a thought yet.",
    ["BeautyContestAward001"]="No. %s",
    ["BeautyContestAward002"]="Participation Reward",
    ["BeautyContestNo"]="No. %s",
    ["BeautyContestPet001"]="Show",
    ["BeautyContestPet002"]="Cancel Show",
    ["BeautyContestRank"]="RANK: %s",
    ["BeautyContestRule"]="\n\nEvent Guide:\n\nRegistration Phase:\nApril 8, 5:00 to April 11, 5:00\nEvent Rules:\n1. After reading the event rules, upload a photo on the event page and tap Register to register.\n2. All photos must be verified before being displayed on the personal page during the competition. During the registration phase, you may change your photo. You may only upload 20 photos per day.\n3. Please do not upload obscene, violent, or any other prohibited pictures that go against the User Agreement, and do not upload other's photos without permission.\n4. You will receive rewards for participation if you have successfully signed up for the event. Rewards will be issued after the end of the support phase.\n5. The sound recording function can be unlocked after successful registration. The maximum length of recording is 1 minute, and you need to wait 10 minutes after saving the recording before you can re-record.\n\nSupport Phase:\nApril 11, 5:00 to April 22, 5:00\nEvent Rules:\n1. During the competition, Adventures can support their favorite contestants by sending them gifts.\n2. The Top 100 Adventurers from across all the servers will be displayed in the Overall Rankings.\n3. There may be delays in sending gifts and refreshing the leaderboard rankings.\n4. You can add an Entry Declaration on your Personal Home Page and share it with the chat channel to ask for more support.\n5. You cannot send gifts to yourself.\n\nDisplay Phase:\nApril 22, 5:00 to April 26, 5:00\nEvent Rules:\n1. The top 3 Adventurers of the support phase will be displayed as winners.\n2. The gifting and following functions will be closed, and the overall rankings will be for display only without further updates.\n3. Rewards will be sent by mail at this stage, please remember to claim them.\n\nSpecial Note:\nThe purpose of this event is to encourage you to play with your friends. Therefore, this platform does not support participation through unfair tricks or other improper means.\nOnce discovered, we reserve the right to take measures such as revoking event qualifications, withholding rewards, resetting account balances, and applying restrictions, among other actions. We also reserve the right to reclaim any received event rewards or recover an equivalent amount and reserve the right to pursue legal action. No compensation will be made for your losses in this case.\n\n",
    ["BeautyContestSing001"]="Start recording after %s seconds",
    ["BeautyContestSing002"]="Saved successfully!",
    ["BeautyContestSing003"]="Hold down to record",
    ["BeautyContestSing004"]="Release to cancel recording",
    ["BeautyContestSlogan001"]="I've joined the Miracle Celebration event! Support me now!",
    ["BeautyContestSlogan002"]="%s\n[a href=%s]<color=#648DAC>Support him/her![/a]</color>\"",
    ["BeautyContestTips001"]="You've turned to the last page~",
    ["BeautyContestTips002"]="You've turned to the first page~",
    ["BeautyContestTips003"]="The player cannot be found",
    ["BeautyContestTips004"]="Please enter the entry no. you want to search for",
    ["BeautyContestTips005"]="Support Successful",
