    ["BlackgoldMechaUnlock"]="Use The Blackgold to unlock.",
    ["BlazeValue"]="1. Shine Points can be added to equipped and saved costumes.\n2. The following stats will be activated when Shine Points meet the requirements.",
    ["Body"]="Size",
    ["Body_0"]="Large",
    ["Body_1"]="Medium",
    ["Body_2"]="Small",
    ["Body_3"]="Giant",
    ["BpHeroRating_001"]="Activated at Pass Lv.<color=#f4ce4e>60</color>: <color=#e22228>Consecutive Normal Punches</color>",
    ["BpHeroRating_002"]="Activated at Pass Lv.<color=#f4ce4e>40</color>: <color=#453e84>Infinite Flee</color>",
    ["BpHeroRating_003"]="Activated at Pass Lv.<color=#f4ce4e>20</color>: <color=#37937f>Ghost Power Zone</color>",
    ["BpHeroRating_004"]="Activated skill: <color=#006aa9>Rocket Dash</color>",
    ["BtnName_fuhuo"]="Remaining Attempts: %s",
    ["Btn_DfsIn"]="Enter Training Course",
    ["BubbleUnlock"]="Please unlock using the Bubble.",
    ["BuffDes_10001"]="Colossal Titan",
    ["BuffDes_10002"]="Armored Titan",
    ["BuffDes_10003"]="Beast Titan",
    ["BuffDes_10003031"]="When <color=#7ACEFF>playing dead</color>, the target will not be able to cast any skills, attack, or move, but they will not be attacked by monsters.",
    ["BuffDes_10003032"]="When <color=#7ACEFF>playing dead</color>, the target will not be able to cast any skills, attack, or move, but they will not be attacked by monsters.",
    ["BuffDes_1001"]="When <color=#7ACEFF>stunned</color>, the target will not be able to cast any skills, attack, or move, and they will not naturally recover HP and SP.",
    ["BuffDes_1002"]="When <color=#7ACEFF>frozen</color>, the target's Armor attribute will become <color=#7ACEFF>Water</color>, M.DEF will be reduced by <color=#44afee>20%%</color>, and they will not naturally recover HP and SP.",
    ["BuffDes_1003"]="When <color=#7ACEFF>Slowed</color>, the target's Movement Speed will be reduced by <color=#7ACEFF>40%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_10030301"]="Increases Strength by 50",
    ["BuffDes_10030302"]="Increases Agility by 50",
    ["BuffDes_10030303"]="Increases Vitality by 50",
    ["BuffDes_10030304"]="Increases Intelligence by 50",
    ["BuffDes_10030305"]="Increases Dexterity by 50",
    ["BuffDes_10030306"]="Increases Luck by 50",
    ["BuffDes_10030307"]="Increases Crit Damage by 20%",
    ["BuffDes_10030308"]="Increases Final Crit by 10%",
    ["BuffDes_10030309"]="Increases Final Magic Defense Penetration by 10%",
    ["BuffDes_10030310"]="Increases Final Physical Defense Penetration by 10%",
    ["BuffDes_1006"]="When <color=#7ACEFF>silenced</color>, the target will not be able to cast any skills.",
    ["BuffDes_1007"]="When <color=#7ACEFF>immobilized</color>, the target will not be able to move.",
    ["BuffDes_1008"]="When <color=#7ACEFF>immune to crowd control</color>, the target will be immune to all <color=#7ACEFF>crowd control</color> and <color=#7ACEFF>Slow</color> negative effects.",
    ["BuffDes_1009"]="When <color=#7ACEFF>poisoned</color>, the target will take <color=#7ACEFF>Poison</color> physical Damage equal to <color=#7ACEFF>20%%</color> of the caster's ATK every second, their DEF will be decreased by <color=#7ACEFF>25%%</color>, and they will not naturally recover HP and SP for the duration of the effect. The damage effect can stack up to <color=#7ACEFF>5</color> times. When the target's HP is less than <color=#7ACEFF>25%%</color>, they will stop taking damage, but the other debuffs will still be in effect.",
    ["BuffDes_1010"]="While under the effect of <color=#7ACEFF>Bleed</color>, receive neutral attribute P.DMG equal to <color=#7ACEFF>20%%</color> of the caster's P.ATK every second, P.ATK and ASPD decreased by <color=#7ACEFF>25%%</color>, and unable to naturally recover HP or SP for the duration of the effect.",
    ["BuffDes_10102014"]="DEF +80",
    ["BuffDes_10103011"]="Damage increased by 10%",
    ["BuffDes_10104010"]="Will not die when taking fatal damage.",
    ["BuffDes_10105005"]="Damage taken is reduced by 50%.",
    ["BuffDes_10105014"]="Damage is increased by 20%.",
    ["BuffDes_101050891"]="Increases P.ATK percentage by 15%%.",
    ["BuffDes_101050901"]="Increases M.ATK percentage by 15%%.",
    ["BuffDes_101051041"]="Deals <color=#44afee>50%%</color> less damage to the caster and reduces your MSPD by <color=#44afee>20%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_101051051"]="Increases your damage dealt to Angel, Insect, Demi-Human, and Brute monsters by 16%%.",
    ["BuffDes_10106016"]="While having the <color=#7ACEFF>Card Skill</color> effect, equipping the <color=#7ACEFF>Greatest General Card</color> will increase damage dealt by <color=#7ACEFF>10%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_10106026"]="Damage is reduced by 80%.",
    ["BuffDes_101060261"]="While under the effect of <color=#7ACEFF>Osiris's Curse</color>, will not automatically resurrect ",
    ["BuffDes_10107020"]="In <color=#44afee>Summon Orc Disaster</color> status, when receiving lethal damage, it doesn't die and recovers <color=#44afee>30%</color> Max HP at once, then recovers <color=#44afee> 2%</color> Max HP every second for the next <color=#44afee>10</color> seconds. Effective once every <color=#44afee>60</color> seconds.",
    ["BuffDes_10107021"]="In the <color=#44afee>Regeneration</color> state, while active, recovers <color=#44afee>2%</color> Max HP every second.",
    ["BuffDes_10107023"]="In status <color=#44afee>Summon Storm Dragon</color>. When in battle, for every <color=#44afee>30</color> seconds, you will summon <color=#44afee>6</color> tornadoes around your body. Tornado will run outwards, lasting 6 seconds. Enemies hit by tornado will receive True Damage equal to <color=#44afee>1%</color> Max HP. (Not effective against BOSS, Mini and MVP.)",
    ["BuffDes_10107026"]="Stimulate the power of the Armored Titan to increase your Final Physical Defense by <color=#44afee>60%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_10107027"]="Stimulate the power of the Colossal Titan to gain a shield that is equal to <color=#44afee>20%%</color> of your Max HP.",
    ["BuffDes_10107029"]="Stimulate the Armored Titan Power to increase your Final P.DEF by <color=#44afee>72%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_10107030"]="Stimulate the Colossal Titan Power to gain a shield that is equal to <color=#44afee>24%%</color> of your Max HP.",
    ["BuffDes_10107032"]="Deals an additional 20%% damage to all MVPs, Minis, and Bosses.",
    ["BuffDes_10107033"]="Deals an additional 20%% damage to all normal monsters.",
    ["BuffDes_10107036"]="Under Observation's Gaze. Becomes immune to damage and gains an Endure effect.",
    ["BuffDes_10107039"]="Your armor is converted into Holy attribute, increasing your Holy/Neutral Attribute Enhancement by <color=#44afee>2%%</color> and Holy/Neutral Damage Reduction by <color=#44afee>2%%</color> per stack.",
    ["BuffDes_10107040"]="Reduce your damage taken by <color=#44afee>20%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_101070402"]="Your Final DMG Reduction is increased by <color=#44afee>45%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_101070412"]="Your Final DMG Bonus is reduced by <color=#44afee>30%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_101090171"]="Reduces Max HP by <color=#9ACEFF>%s%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_101090191"]="While active, the armor attribute changes to <color=#9ACEFF>Holy</color>, making each of your normal attacks and skills to deal an additional Adaptive Holy DMG equal to <color=#9ACEFF>100%%</color> and <color=#9ACEFF>300%%</color> of Adaptive ATK, respectively.",
    ["BuffDes_101090192"]="While active, the armor attribute changes to <color=#9ACEFF>Shadow</color>, making each of your normal attacks and skills to deal an additional Adaptive Shadow DMG equal to <color=#9ACEFF>100%%</color> and <color=#9ACEFF>300%%</color> of Adaptive ATK, respectively.",
    ["BuffDes_101090201"]="Reduces MSPD by <color=#9ACEFF>50%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_101090202"]="Deals Adaptive Water DMG equal to <color=#9ACEFF>180%%</color> of Adaptive ATK to enemies within a <color=#9ACEFF>6</color>-meter radius every <color=#9ACEFF>0.5</color> seconds and applies the </color>Slow<color=#9ACEFF> effect.",
    ["BuffDes_101090214"]="Unable to trigger Death Return during the effective period.",
    ["BuffDes_101090221"]="Increases your Final P.DMG Bonus and Final M.DMG Bonus by <color=#FFA500>60%%</color>. While active, your armor attribute changes to <color=#FFA500>Undead</color>, granting immunity to debuffs (excluding effects from MVP, MINI, and Boss units).",
    ["BuffDes_101090232"]="Cannot move and attack while frozen.",
    ["BuffDes_101090241"]="Weakness is exposed. The next damage taken will include an additional Adaptive DMG equal to <color=#FFA500>1,500%%</color> of the attacker's Adaptive ATK.",
    ["BuffDes_101090251"]="Each stack increases the caster's Crit DMG Bonus by <color=#44afee>8%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_101090261"]="Your HP is locked at <color=#44afee>80%%</color> or above your Max HP under the Fat Dragon's protection. This protection ends early after <color=#44afee>20</color> hits or if damage exceeds <color=#44afee>35%%</color> of your Max HP.",
    ["BuffDes_101090262"]="A full-bellied Fat Dragon ascends into the sky. Your HP is locked at <color=#44afee>80%%</color> or above your Max HP under the Fat Dragon's protection.",
    ["BuffDes_101090271"]="Takes Fire attribute M.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of the caster's M.ATK every second.",
    ["BuffDes_101090281"]="Each stack reduces your PVP Final P.DMG RED and PVP Final M.DMG RED by 1%%.",
    ["BuffDes_101090291"]="Consumes 1 stack to immune the effect when getting hit by Freeze, Petrify, Immobilize, or Stun.",
    ["BuffDes_101090303"]="While active, your PVP Final P.DMG RED is reduced by <color=#44afee>13%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_101090304"]="While active, your P.ATK is increased by <color=#44afee>40%%</color> and Final P.DMG Bonus is increased by <color=#44afee>35%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_101090313"]="While active, your PVP Final M.DMG RED is reduced by <color=#44afee>13%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_101090314"]="While active, your M.ATK is increased by <color=#44afee>40%%</color> and Final M.DMG Bonus is increased by <color=#44afee>35%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_101090343"]="While active, reduces your PVP Final P.DMG RED by <color=#44afee>13%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_101090344"]="While active, increases your Crit DMG Bonus by <color=#44afee>80%%</color> and Final P.DMG Bonus by <color=#44afee>30%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_101090353"]="While active, reduces your Fire Resistance by <color=#44afee>75%%</color> and Ghost Resistance by <color=#44afee>75%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_101090354"]="While active, increases your Crit DMG Bonus by <color=#44afee>80%%</color> and P.ATK by <color=#44afee>35%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_101090363"]="While active, reduces your Wind Resistance by <color=#44afee>75%%</color> and Water Resistance by <color=#44afee>75%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_101090364"]="While active, increases your Final M.PEN by <color=#44afee>40%%</color> and M.ATK by <color=#44afee>35%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_101090371"]="While active, increases Poison/Ghost P.DMG by an extra 30%%, or 17%% if the target is an Adventurer.",
    ["BuffDes_101090381"]="While active, increases Fire/Earth P.DMG by an extra 30%%, or 17%% if the target is an Adventurer.",
    ["BuffDes_101090391"]="While active, increases Shadow/Holy P.DMG by an extra 30%%, or 17%% if the target is an Adventurer.",
    ["BuffDes_101090401"]="While active, increases Neutral/Wind P.DMG by an extra 30%%, or 17%% if the target is an Adventurer.",
    ["BuffDes_101090411"]="While active, each stack of <color=#44afee>Grudge</color> reduces your Final DMG by <color=#44afee>1%%</color>, stacking up to <color=#44afee>20</color> times.",
    ["BuffDes_101090412"]="While active, each stack of <color=#44afee>Conviction</color> increases your PVP Final P.DMG Bonus by <color=#44afee>8%%</color>, stacking up to <color=#44afee>5</color> times.",
    ["BuffDes_101090421"]="While active, each stack of <color=#44afee>Courage</color> increases your PVP Final M.DMG Bonus by <color=#44afee>8%%</color>, stacking up to <color=#44afee>5</color> times.",
    ["BuffDes_101092112"]="Increases P.ATK by <color=#44afee>50%%</color> and Final P.PEN by <color=#44afee>25%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_101092122"]="Increases P.ATK by <color=#44afee>50%%</color> and Crit DMG Bonus by <color=#44afee>50%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_101092132"]="Increases M.ATK by <color=#44afee>50%%</color> and Final M.PEN by <color=#44afee>25%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_101092142"]="Increases the damage against MVP and MINI by <color=#44afee>20%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_101092431"]="While active, increases your Final P.DMG Bonus and Final M.DMG Bonus by <color=#44afee>80%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_101092432"]="While active, increases your Final P.DMG Bonus and Final M.DMG Bonus by <color=#44afee>40%</color>, Final P.DMG Reduction and Final M.DMG Reduction by <color=#44afee>20%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_1011"]="While <color=#7ACEFF>invisible</color>, the caster will hide in the shadows, maintaining invisibility. Upon taking or dealing damage, they will lose their Invisibility effect.",
    ["BuffDes_10112121"]="While under the effect of <color=#7ACEFF>Hiding</color>, become undetectable to enemies. Actively attacking, taking damage, or being affected by anti-stealth will cancel the Hiding effect.",
    ["BuffDes_1012"]="While <color=#7ACEFF>burning</color>, the target will receive Fire magic damage equal to <color=#7ACEFF>20%%</color> of the caster's M.ATK.",
    ["BuffDes_1013"]="While <color=#7ACEFF>quicken</color>, Movement Speed will be increased by <color=#7ACEFF>20%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_10142012"]="While active, increases your normal attack damage.",
    ["BuffDes_10142081"]="While active, Fire Resistance is reduced by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_10142091"]="While active, Wind Resistance is reduced by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_10142101"]="While active, Freeze Resistance is reduced by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_10142111"]="While active, Petrify Resistance is reduced by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_10142121"]="While active, MSPD, Final ASPD, and Final Haste are reduced by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>, <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>, and <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>, respectively.",
    ["BuffDes_1016"]="While <color=#7ACEFF>petrified</color>, the target will not be able to move.",
    ["BuffDes_1018"]="While having the <color=#7ACEFF>Endure</color> effect, the caster will not be interrupted or knocked back when attacked.",
    ["BuffDes_1019"]="While <color=#7ACEFF>poisoned</color>, the target will receive <color=#7ACEFF>Poison</color> magic damage equal to <color=#7ACEFF>50%%</color> of the caster's M.ATK every <color=#7ACEFF>0.5</color> seconds. Damage effect can stack up to <color=#7ACEFF>5</color> times.",
    ["BuffDes_10201028"]="Damage received from Fire attribute monsters decreases by 15%",
    ["BuffDes_10201029"]="Damage received from Water attribute monsters decreases by 15%",
    ["BuffDes_10201030"]="Damage received from Wind attribute monsters decreases by 15%",
    ["BuffDes_10201031"]="Damage received from Earth attribute monsters decreases by 15%",
    ["BuffDes_10202029"]="Weapon attribute changes to Fire Attribute.",
    ["BuffDes_10202030"]="Weapon attribute changes to Water Attribute.",
    ["BuffDes_10202031"]="Weapon attribute changes to Wind Attribute.",
    ["BuffDes_10202032"]="Weapon attribute changes to Earth Attribute.",
    ["BuffDes_10202056"]="Ate Spring Festival Dumplings. Happy Spring Festival!\nSTR +10, VIT +10, and DEX +10.",
    ["BuffDes_10202057"]="Ate Spring Festival Rice Cakes. Happy Spring Festival!\nAGI +10, INT +10, and LUK +10.",
    ["BuffDes_10202085"]="Star Grape consumed. All stats +5.",
    ["BuffDes_10202094"]="Salt-baked Crab Pot I consumed. Holy Attribute Enhancement +10%.",
    ["BuffDes_10202095"]="Sea Bream Skewer I consumed. Ghost Attribute Enhancement +10%.",
    ["BuffDes_10202114"]="Ate Adventurer's Salad. All Stats +3.",
    ["BuffDes_10202115"]="Ate Birthday Cake!\nHP +5%, P.ATK +5%, M.ATK +5%, Final DEF +5%, and Final M.DEF +5%",
    ["BuffDes_10202116"]="Grass Jelly with Taro Balls consumed.\nPVP Debuff Duration Reduction +10\nPVP Debuff Resistance +10",
    ["BuffDes_10202117"]="Chilled Watermelon Juice consumed.\nP.ATK +10%\nM.ATK +10%",
    ["BuffDes_10202118"]="Mango Frappe consumed.\nPVP Final P.DMG Bonus +10%\nPVP Final M.DMG Bonus +10%",
    ["BuffDes_10202122"]="Dried Fruit Platter I consumed, Neutral Attribute Enhancement +10%",
    ["BuffDes_10202123"]="Snowy Milk Cake I consumed. Fire Attribute Enhancement +10%, Earth Attribute Enhancement +10%.",
    ["BuffDes_10202124"]="Crispy Chili Herb I consumed. Wind Attribute Enhancement +10%, Water Attribute Enhancement +10%.",
    ["BuffDes_10202125"]="Witchy Fish Fillet I consumed. Poison Attribute Enhancement +10%.",
    ["BuffDes_10202165"]="Doritos - Nacho Cheese flavored chips consumed. Mining time is reduced by 10% for 20 minutes.",
    ["BuffDes_10202166"]="Doritos - BBQ flavored chips consumed. The success chance of catching a pet is increased by 5% for 20 minutes.",
    ["BuffDes_10202167"]="Doritos - Original flavored chips consumed. The non-battle MSPD is increased by 1 for 20 minutes.",
    ["BuffDes_10202182"]="Engineer 003's Midnight Snack consumed. Max HP, P.ATK, M.ATK, Final P.DEF, and Final M.DEF are increased by 3%.",
    ["BuffDes_10202188"]="Increase the DMG dealt to and reduce DMG taken from Fire attribute monsters by 8%.",
    ["BuffDes_10202189"]="Increase the DMG dealt to and reduce DMG taken from Water attribute monsters by 8%.",
    ["BuffDes_10202190"]="Increase the DMG dealt to and reduce DMG taken from Wind attribute monsters by 8%.",
    ["BuffDes_10202191"]="Increase the DMG dealt to and reduce DMG taken from Earth attribute monsters by 8%.",
    ["BuffDes_10202192"]="Increase the DMG dealt to and reduce DMG taken from Poison Attribute Monsters by 8%.",
    ["BuffDes_10202193"]="Increase the DMG dealt to and reduce DMG taken from Undead Attribute Monsters by 8%.",
    ["BuffDes_10202196"]="Imbibe in Roller Coaster Cheese Chips and obtain +2.5% PvP Final Physical Damage Bonus, +2.5% PvP Final Magic Damage Bonus, +50% Final Attack Speed, +5% Final Haste, +5% Final Physical Damage Bonus, and +5% Final Magic Damage Bonus.",
    ["BuffDes_10202203"]="\"You Know Nothing\" consumed. The non-battle MSPD is increased by 1.",
    ["BuffDes_10202204"]="\"Have a Cookie\" consumed. Mining time is reduced by 10%.",
    ["BuffDes_10202205"]="\"My Candy Is Big\" consumed. The success chance of catching a pet is increased by 5%.",
    ["BuffDes_10202208"]="Eating Pineapple Pastry grants Freeze Resistance +30 and Curse Resistance +30%.",
    ["BuffDes_10202209"]="Eating Golden Pillow Durian grants PVP Final Physical Damage +10% and PVP Final Magic Damage Bonus +10%.",
    ["BuffDes_10202218"]="Bonus Damage Dealt to Undead +12.5%\nReduced Damage Received from Undead +12.5%",
    ["BuffDes_10202219"]="Bonus Damage Dealt to Demons +12.5%\nReduced Damage Received from Demons +12.5%",
    ["BuffDes_10202247"]="If you die while the scroll takes effect, you will be resurrected on the spot and recover full HP and SP.",
    ["BuffDes_10202276"]="Disguised as Cookie! Stay still! Otherwise, you will expose yourself!",
    ["BuffDes_10202277"]="Disguised as Christmas Cookie! Stay still! Otherwise, you will expose yourself!",
    ["BuffDes_10202278"]="Disguised as a Myst Case! Stay still! Otherwise, you will expose yourself!",
    ["BuffDes_10202279"]="Disguised as Cruiser! Stay still! Otherwise, you will expose yourself!",
    ["BuffDes_10202282"]="Activate Odin's Blessing to increase the dropping chance of Napa Cabbage, Rice Cake, or Tofu when killing monsters.",
    ["BuffDes_10202283"]="Activate Odin's Blessing to increase the dropping chance of Beef, Lamb, or Chicken when killing monsters.",
    ["BuffDes_10202284"]="Activate Odin's Blessing to increase the dropping chance of Squid or Prawn when killing monsters.",
    ["BuffDes_10202295"]="Increase the DMG dealt to and reduce the DMG taken from Ghost attribute monsters by 8%.",
    ["BuffDes_10202296"]="Increase the DMG dealt to and reduce the DMG taken from Angel monsters by 8%.",
    ["BuffDes_10202297"]="Increase the DMG dealt to and reduce the DMG taken from Formless monsters by 8%.",
    ["BuffDes_10202298"]="Increase the DMG dealt to and reduce the DMG taken from Holy attribute monsters by 8%.",
    ["BuffDes_10202299"]="Increase the DMG dealt to and reduce the DMG taken from Shadow attribute monsters by 8%.",
    ["BuffDes_10202300"]="Increase the DMG dealt to and reduce the DMG taken from Neutral attribute monsters by 8%.",
    ["BuffDes_10202328"]="Temporarily adds 2 levels to your life skills in <color=#ff5d5d>fishing/mining/gardening</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_10202329"]="Temporarily adds +2 levels to your life skills in <color=#ff5d5d>smelting</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_10202331"]="You ate Shion's Delicacies. Even though they seem hard to swallow, they taste surprisingly good.\nSTR +25, AGI +25, DEX +25, VIT +25, LUK + 25, INT +25\nMSPD +1\nReduce your body size by 30%.",
    ["BuffDes_10202332"]="Weapon attribute changes to Holy Attribute.",
    ["BuffDes_10202333"]="Weapon attribute changes to Shadow Attribute.",
    ["BuffDes_10202334"]="Weapon attribute changes to Undead Attribute.",
    ["BuffDes_10202335"]="When fighting against monsters up to 3 levels above your level, you'll get a 30%% Physical Lifesteal and Magic Lifesteal, and a 200%% Final P.DMG Bonus and Final M.DMG Bonus. Blocks damage every second, up to 20% of your Max HP (ineffective against MVP, MINI, or Boss units). Duration: 30 days.",
    ["BuffDes_102023451"]="The monster modification went wrong; all main stats dropped by 20.",
    ["BuffDes_102023452"]="With the Villain Power, your size is increased by 50%, and all primary stats are increased by 40.",
    ["BuffDes_10202346"]="Increase the DMG dealt to Undead monsters and reduce DMG taken from Undead monsters by 8%.",
    ["BuffDes_10202347"]="Increase the DMG dealt to Dragon monsters and reduce DMG taken from Dragon monsters by 8%.",
    ["BuffDes_10202348"]="Increase the DMG dealt to Plant monters and reduce DMG taken from Plant monsters by 8%.",
    ["BuffDes_10202349"]="Increase the DMG dealt to Insect monsters and reduce DMG taken from Insect monsters by 8%.",
    ["BuffDes_10202350"]="Increase the DMG dealt to Fish monsters and reduce DMG taken from Fish monsters by 8%.",
    ["BuffDes_10202351"]="Increase the DMG dealt to Demi-Human monsters and reduce the DMG taken from Demi-Human monsters by 8%.",
    ["BuffDes_10202392"]="The Hyper Fire increases all attributes of the Adventurer by <color=#44afee>20</color> points. Satiety: 0.\nUpgrade costs 10% less Zeny.\nExpires at the end of the Hyper Event.",
    ["BuffDes_102023921"]="Personal Protection: When consuming Odin's Blessings, each normal attack/skill deals extra True DMG equal to <color=#44afee>20%%/60%%</color> of the monster's Max HP to them (ineffective against MVP, MINI, and Boss). If the target requires more Odin's Blessings than what you currently have, then the damage effect will not take effect.\nGains corresponding Life EXP and extra rewards when conducting life-related activities.\nParty Member Protection: After joining the party, party members who are not Hyper Players but within the same scene will have their damage against all monsters increased by <color=#44afee>25%%</color> for <color=#44afee>6</color> hours; when out of combat, their MSPD is increased by <color=#44afee>10%%</color>.\nNote: Party Member Protection is not self-obtainable. After having this buff for <color=#44afee>6</color> hours in total, it cannot be received again for the next <color=#44afee>10</color> days. The protection becomes ineffective when the Hyper Player leaves the party or the buff carrier enters a PVP scene.",
    ["BuffDes_102023922"]="Inspired by the Hyper Player, the damage against all monsters is increased by <color=#44afee>15%%</color>; when out of combat, MSPD is increased by <color=#44afee>10%%</color>.\nNote: The protection becomes ineffective when the Hyper Player leaves the party, the buff carrier enters a PVP scene, or the Hyper Return event is over.",
    ["BuffDes_102023925"]="<color=#44afee>%s</color> minutes left for the Party Member Protection. Expires at the end of the Hyper Event.",
    ["BuffDes_102023927"]="Unable to receive another <color=#44afee>Party Member Protection</color> effect within <color=#44afee>10</color> days. Expires at the end of the Hyper Event.",
    ["BuffDes_10202393"]="Weapon attribute changes to Ghost Attribute.",
    ["BuffDes_102023930"]="An exclusive icon for active players. Party up with Hyper Players and complete the corresponding gameplay to receive \"A Travel Companion Pack.\"",
    ["BuffDes_10202402"]="Eating Richer and Richer grants damage dealt to Nian-series monsters +10%.",
