    ["BuffDes_10202512"]="Grants a <color=#7ACEFF>100%%</color> chance to get an additional yield from fishing, mining, or gathering for 2 hours. (Not affected by other buffs.)",
    ["BuffDes_10202513"]="Every smelting has a <color=#7ACEFF>100%%</color> chance to not consume Stamina for 2 hours.",
