    ["BuffDes_10202527"]="After use, there's a 100% chance of receiving an extra gathering reward while gathering.",
    ["BuffDes_10202528"]="After use, there's a 100% chance of receiving an extra mining reward while mining.",
    ["BuffDes_10202529"]="After use, there's a 100% chance of receiving an extra fishing reward while fishing.",
    ["BuffDes_10202530"]="After use, there's a 100% chance of costing zero stamina while smelting.",
    ["BuffDes_10202531"]="After use, there's a 15% chance of refunding the enhancement cost while enchanting in Prontera.",
    ["BuffDes_10202532"]="After use, there's a 15% chance of refunding the enhancement cost while enchanting in Morroc.",
    ["BuffDes_10202533"]="After use, there's a 15% chance of refunding the enhancement cost while enchanting in Einbroch.",
