    ["BuffDes_10202535"]="After use, there's a 15% chance of refunding the enhancement cost while enchanting in Alberta.",
    ["BuffDes_10202536"]="After use, there's a 20% chance of refunding the enhancement cost while enchanting in Payon.",
    ["BuffDes_10202537"]="After use, there's a 20% chance of refunding the enhancement cost while enchanting in Geffen.",
    ["BuffDes_10202538"]="After use, there's a 20% chance of refunding the enhancement cost while enchanting in Glast Heim.",
    ["BuffDes_10202539"]="After use, there's a 25% chance of refunding the enhancement cost while enchanting in Comodo.",
    ["BuffDes_10202540"]="After use, there's a 25% chance of refunding the enhancement cost while enchanting in Umbala.",
    ["BuffDes_10202541"]="After use, there's a 25% chance of refunding the enhancement cost while enchanting in Juno.",
    ["BuffDes_10202542"]="After use, there is a chance of refunding the refinement costs (including Refinement Vouchers). The specific chances are listed below:\n(Lv.0-8: 10%), (Lv.9-12: 15%), (Lv.13-15: 20%)",
    ["BuffDes_10202543"]="After use, there is a chance of refunding the upgrade costs. The specific chances are listed below:\nWeapon (Lv.0-220: 10%), (Lv.221-260: 15%), (Lv.261-300: 20%)\nArmor (Lv.0-110: 10%), (Lv.111-130: 15%), (Lv.131-150: 20%)\nAccessory (Lv.0-55: 10%), (Lv.56-65: 15%), (Lv.66-75: 20%)",
    ["BuffDes_10202544"]="After use, there's a 20% chance of refunding the ascension cost while ascending.",
    ["BuffDes_10202545"]="After use, there's a 20% chance of refunding the purchase cost while purchasing items in the Crystal Shop.",
    ["BuffDes_10202546"]="After use, there's a 20% chance of refunding the purchase cost while purchasing items in the Pet Store.",
    ["BuffDes_10202547"]="After use, there's a 20% chance of refunding the purchase cost while purchasing items in the Guild Store.",
    ["BuffDes_10202548"]="After use, there's a 20% chance of refunding the transfer cost while transferring.",
    ["BuffDes_1021"]="While <color=#7ACEFF>blinded</color>, Final Hit Rate is reduced by <color=#7ACEFF>30%%</color> and Final Dodge Rate is reduced by <color=#7ACEFF>30%%</color> (Final Dodge Rate cannot go below 0%).",
    ["BuffDes_10229552"]="Weight Limit +500 for 7 days (unstackable, timer continues even when offline)",
    ["BuffDes_1023"]="While <color=#7ACEFF>ASPD is reduced</color>, Final ASPD is reduced by <color=#7ACEFF>40%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_1024"]="While under the effect of <color=#7ACEFF>HP</color> Regen Potion, recover a fixed amount of HP every second. Recovered amount will increase based on the grade of the potion.",
    ["BuffDes_1025"]="While under the effect of <color=#7ACEFF>SP</color> Regen Potion, recover a fixed amount of SP every second. Recovered amount will increase based on the grade of the potion.",
    ["BuffDes_1026"]="While under the effect of <color=#7ACEFF>Petrify</color>, the armor's attribute will become <color=#44afee>Earth</color>, P.DEF increased by <color=#44afee>25%%</color>, M.DEF reduced by <color=#44afee>25%%</color>, and unable to naturally recover HP or SP. Every <color=#44afee>1</color> second, lose <color=#44afee>0.33%%</color> Max HP. When Petrify expires or gets dispelled, the Earth Armor effect will persist for another <color=#44afee>3</color> seconds.",
    ["BuffDes_1027"]="While under the effect, the target's Max HP is reduced by <color=#7ACEFF>15%</color>, with the healing received and recovery effect reduced by <color=#7ACEFF>50%</color> (ineffective against MVP, MINI, and Boss).",
    ["BuffDes_1028"]="While <color=#7ACEFF>sleeping</color>, the target will not be able to cast any skills, attack, or move, and they will not naturally recover HP and SP. Normal attacks received during this time are guaranteed hits and Crits, and taking damage will remove the Sleep effect.",
    ["BuffDes_1033"]="While <color=#7ACEFF>invulnerable</color>, all damage and negative effects are prevented.",
    ["BuffDes_1034"]="While under the effect of <color=#7ACEFF>Neutral Armor</color>, the armor's attribute will become <color=#9ACEFF>Neutral</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_1035"]="While <color=#7ACEFF>Poison Resistance is reduced</color>, <color=#7ACEFF>Poison</color> damage received is increased by <color=#7ACEFF>30%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_1036"]="While <color=#7ACEFF>overpowered</color>, rapidly slash and deal Neutral physical damage multiple times.",
    ["BuffDes_1037"]="While under the effect, the target's attack bonus effects are removed, and any weapon attribute changes applied to the target or their allies are rendered ineffective (ineffective against MVP, MINI, and Boss).",
    ["BuffDes_1038"]="While under the effect, the target's defense bonus effects are removed, and any armor attribute changes applied to the target or their allies are rendered ineffective (ineffective against MVP, MINI, and Boss).",
    ["BuffDes_1040"]="Cannot control the direction of your own movement and you will move uncontrollably.",
