    ["BuffDes_10406613"]="After consuming <color=#7ACEFF>Herbs in Grape Juice</color>, Final Hit Rate is increased by <color=#7ACEFF>10%</color> for <color=#7ACEFF>20</color> minutes. Hic! (Effects from the same food cannot stack.)",
    ["BuffDes_10406614"]="After consuming <color=#7ACEFF>Scaly Meat Stew</color>, Bonus Physical Damage is increased by <color=#7ACEFF>10%</color> for <color=#7ACEFF>20</color> minutes. Hic! (Effects from the same food cannot stack.)",
    ["BuffDes_10406615"]="After consuming <color=#7ACEFF>Squid Ink Soup</color>, Bonus Magic Damage is increased by <color=#7ACEFF>10%</color> for <color=#7ACEFF>20</color> minutes. Hic! (Effects from the same food cannot stack.)",
    ["BuffDes_10406616"]="After consuming <color=#7ACEFF>Mixed Tea</color>, Final Dodge Rate is increased by <color=#7ACEFF>10%</color> for <color=#7ACEFF>20</color> minutes. Hic! (Effects from the same food cannot stack.)",
    ["BuffDes_10406617"]="After consuming <color=#7ACEFF>Herbal Honey Tea</color>, Final Crit Rate is increased by <color=#7ACEFF>10%</color> for <color=#7ACEFF>20</color> minutes. Hic! (Effects from the same food cannot stack.)",
    ["BuffDes_10406618"]="After consuming <color=#7ACEFF>Steamed Pumpkin</color>, Cooldown Reduction is increased by <color=#7ACEFF>10%</color> for <color=#7ACEFF>20</color> minutes. Hic! (Effects from the same food cannot stack.)",
    ["BuffDes_10406619"]="After consuming <color=#7ACEFF>Steamed Crab Chela</color>, Damage Reduction is increased by <color=#7ACEFF>10%</color> for <color=#7ACEFF>20</color> minutes. Hic! (Effects from the same food cannot stack.)",
