    ["BuffDes_1049"]="While under the effect of <color=#7ACEFF>Holy Armor</color>, the armor's attribute will become <color=#9ACEFF>Holy</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_1057"]="If you suffer up to <color=#44afee>%s</color> <color=#44afee>Soak</color>, you will become trapped in a water bubble.",
    ["BuffDes_1058"]="Will be unable to move or attack while trapped in a <color=#44afee>Water Bubble</color>. Will be eliminated after being trapped by a water bubble for more than <color=#44afee>%s</color> seconds cumulatively. Duration does not accumulate while being rescued.",
    ["BuffDes_1061"]="While under the effect of <color=#7ACEFF>Undead Resistance Reduced</color>, each stack of <color=#7ACEFF>Undead</color> damage taken is increased by <color=#7ACEFF>10%%</color>. Can be stacked.",
    ["BuffDes_1062"]="While under the effect of <color=#7ACEFF>Fire Resistance Reduced</color>, each stack of <color=#7ACEFF>Fire</color> damage taken is increased by <color=#7ACEFF>10%%</color>. Can be stacked.",
    ["BuffDes_1063"]="While under the effect of <color=#7ACEFF>Water Resistance Reduced</color>, each stack of <color=#7ACEFF>Water</color> damage taken is increased by <color=#7ACEFF>10%%</color>. Can be stacked.",
    ["BuffDes_1064"]="While under the effect of <color=#7ACEFF>Shadow Resistance Reduced</color>, each stack of <color=#7ACEFF>Shadow</color> damage taken is increased by <color=#7ACEFF>10%%</color>. Can be stacked.",
    ["BuffDes_1065"]="While under the effect of <color=#7ACEFF>Ghost Resistance Reduced</color>, each stack of <color=#7ACEFF>Ghost</color> damage taken is increased by <color=#7ACEFF>10%%</color>. Can be stacked.",
    ["BuffDes_1066"]="While under the effect of <color=#7ACEFF>Holy Resistance Reduced</color>, each stack of <color=#7ACEFF>Holy</color> damage taken is increased by <color=#7ACEFF>10%%</color>. Can be stacked.",
    ["BuffDes_1067"]="While under the effect of <color=#7ACEFF>Wind Resistance Reduced</color>, each stack of <color=#7ACEFF>Wind</color> damage taken is increased by <color=#7ACEFF>10%%</color>. Can be stacked.",
    ["BuffDes_1068"]="While under the effect of <color=#7ACEFF>Earth Resistance Reduced</color>, each stack of <color=#7ACEFF>Earth</color> damage taken is increased by <color=#7ACEFF>10%%</color>. Can be stacked.",
    ["BuffDes_1069"]="While under the effect of <color=#7ACEFF>Poison Resistance Reduced</color>, each stack of <color=#7ACEFF>Poison</color> damage taken is increased by <color=#7ACEFF>10%%</color>. Can be stacked.",
    ["BuffDes_1079"]="Increase Odin's Blessings EXP multiplier by 130% during nighttime.",
    ["BuffDes_1080"]="Current Class & Playstyle: Swordman - Spear Knight",
    ["BuffDes_1081"]="Current Class & Playstyle: Swordman - AGI Swordsman",
    ["BuffDes_1082"]="Current Class & Playstyle: Swordman - VIT Knight",
    ["BuffDes_1083"]="Current Class & Playstyle: Swordman - Martyr",
    ["BuffDes_1084"]="Current Class & Playstyle: Swordman - Judex",
    ["BuffDes_1085"]="Current Class & Playstyle: Swordman - Shield Charge",
    ["BuffDes_1086"]="Current Class & Playstyle: Magician - Earth/Fire",
    ["BuffDes_1087"]="Current Class & Playstyle: Magician - Ice/Lightning",
    ["BuffDes_1088"]="Current Class & Playstyle: Merchant - Mecha",
    ["BuffDes_1089"]="Current Class & Playstyle: Merchant - Zeny",
    ["BuffDes_1090"]="Current Class & Playstyle: Merchant - Cart",
    ["BuffDes_1091"]="Current Class & Playstyle: Acolyte - Crit Priest",
    ["BuffDes_1092"]="Current Class & Playstyle: Acolyte - Exorcism",
    ["BuffDes_1093"]="Current Class & Playstyle: Acolyte - Praise",
    ["BuffDes_1094"]="Current Class & Playstyle: Acolyte - Guillotine Fist",
    ["BuffDes_1095"]="Current Class & Playstyle: Acolyte - Gate of Hell",
    ["BuffDes_1096"]="Current Class & Playstyle: Acolyte - Finger Offensive",
    ["BuffDes_1097"]="Current Class & Playstyle: Acolyte - Finger Offensive",
    ["BuffDes_1098"]="Current Class & Playstyle: Archer - Crit Hunter",
    ["BuffDes_1099"]="Current Class & Playstyle: Archer - Longbow Falconer",
    ["BuffDes_1100"]="Current Class & Playstyle: Archer - Marksman Hunter",
    ["BuffDes_11003221"]="While under the effect of <color=#7ACEFF>Magnum Break</color>, turns the weapon attribute into the <color=#7ACEFF>Fire Attribute</color>, and increases the damage of normal attacks by <color=#7ACEFF>%s%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_11003231"]="While having the <color=#7ACEFF>Endure</color> effect, you will not be interrupted or knocked back when being attacked within 30 meters of the caster, and both DEF and M.DEF will be increased by <color=#7ACEFF>%s</color>. The Endure effect will be removed after being attacked <color=#7ACEFF>%s</color> times.",
    ["BuffDes_11003241"]="While being <color=#7ACEFF>Provoked</color>, the unit's DEF will be reduced by <color=#7ACEFF>%s%%</color>, ATK will be increased by <color=#7ACEFF>%s%%</color>, and they will be forced to attack the caster.",
    ["BuffDes_11003261"]="While having the <color=#7ACEFF>Increase HP Recovery</color> effect, recover <color=#7ACEFF>4%%</color> of Max HP every second.",
    ["BuffDes_11003271"]="While under the effect of <color=#7ACEFF>Battle Will</color>, each normal attack that hits will increase Physical Damage Bonus by <color=#44afee>%s</color>, up to a maximum of <color=#7ACEFF>8</color> stacks.",
    ["BuffDes_11003281"]="While having the <color=#7ACEFF>Fatal Blow</color> effect, DEF is reduced by <color=#7ACEFF>%s</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_1101"]="Current Class & Playstyle: Archer - Shortbow Falconer",
    ["BuffDes_1102"]="Current Class & Playstyle: Thief - Crit Assassin",
    ["BuffDes_1103"]="Current Class & Playstyle: Thief - Stealth Assassin",
    ["BuffDes_1104"]="Current Class: Novice",
    ["BuffDes_1106"]="Armor Lv.0",
    ["BuffDes_1107"]="Armor Lv.1",
    ["BuffDes_1108"]="Armor Lv.2",
    ["BuffDes_1109"]="Armor Lv.3",
    ["BuffDes_1110"]="Armor Lv.4",
    ["BuffDes_11102351"]="While having the <color=#7ACEFF>Double Blow</color> effect, normal attacks have a <color=#7ACEFF>30%%</color> chance to deal <color=#7ACEFF>%s%%</color> Neutral damage that ignores DEF and Penetration.",
    ["BuffDes_11103211"]="While under the effect of <color=#7ACEFF>Auto Counter</color>, become immune to damage equal to <color=#7ACEFF>%s%%</color> of Max HP.",
    ["BuffDes_11103271"]="While having the <color=#7ACEFF>Sword Speed Boost</color> effect, Final ASPD is increased by <color=#7ACEFF>%s%%</color>. This effect will be removed when sword is unequipped.",
    ["BuffDes_11103291"]="While under the effect of <color=#7ACEFF>Courage</color>, MSPD is increased by <color=#7ACEFF>%s%%</color> and P.DEF <color=#7ACEFF>%s%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_11103301"]="While having the <color=#7ACEFF>Brandish Spear</color> effect, reduce ASPD and MSPD by <color=#7ACEFF>%s%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_11103341"]="While having the <color=#7ACEFF>Steel Heart</color> effect, damage received is reduced by <color=#7ACEFF>%s%%</color>, and will not stagger for the next <color=#7ACEFF>%s</color> hits. Loses this effect when the hit limit is reached.",
    ["BuffDes_1111"]="Armor Lv.5",
    ["BuffDes_11113211"]="While having the <color=#7ACEFF>Head Crush</color> effect, ATK is increased by <color=#7ACEFF>%s%%</color> and Crit Damage is increased by <color=#7ACEFF>50%%</color>. Normal attacks also have a <color=#7ACEFF>%s%%</color> chance to inflict hit targets with Bleed.",
    ["BuffDes_11113241"]="While under the effect of <color=#7ACEFF>Aura Blade</color>, Final Crit Rate is increased by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> and Crit Damage Bonus is increased by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_11113251"]="While under the effect of <color=#7ACEFF>Berserk</color>, Max HP is increased by <color=#7ACEFF>%s%%</color>, ATK is increased by <color=#7ACEFF>%s%%</color>, Movement Speed is increased by <color=#7ACEFF>30%%</color>, Endure is maintained, and DEF and M.DEF are decreased by <color=#7ACEFF>50%%</color>. While Berserk is in effect, you cannot actively use skills or healing items, healing effects are decreased by <color=#44afee>100%%</color>, and HP and SP will not recover naturally. This effect is removed when HP falls below <color=#7ACEFF>5%%</color>.\n",
    ["BuffDes_11113253"]="While <color=#7ACEFF>Recuperative Power is restricted</color>, you will be unable to naturally recover HP and SP.",
    ["BuffDes_11113261"]="While under the effect of <color=#7ACEFF>Concentration</color>, damage received from the caster will be increased by <color=#7ACEFF>%s%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_11113271"]="While under the effect of <color=#7ACEFF>Weapon Blocking</color>, there is a <color=#7ACEFF>%s%%</color> chance to weapon block enemy attacks when taking P.DMG from front enemies. Successful blocks negate the <color=#7ACEFF>physical damage</color> taken this time, and deal weapon attribute P.DMG equal to <color=#7ACEFF>%s%%</color> P.ATK to the target (can trigger crit). When equipped with Two-Handed Sword, increases the damage coefficient by <color=#7ACEFF>100%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_11113311"]="While under the effect of <color=#7ACEFF>Self-Ignite</color>, you will lose <color=#7ACEFF>1%%</color> of your Max HP every second while also dealing (<color=#7ACEFF>%s%%</color> of Max HP + <color=#7ACEFF>%s</color>) Neutral <color=#7ACEFF>Holy physical</color> damage to nearby enemies. This effect will be removed when your HP falls below <color=#7ACEFF>10%%</color>. You will be unable to naturally recover HP and SP while under the effect of Self-Ignite, and will be unable to trigger Increase HP Recovery's HP regen effect in PVP.",
    ["BuffDes_11113331"]="While having the <color=#7ACEFF>Lord's Aura</color> effect, ATK of all party members within 30 meters of the caster is increased by <color=#7ACEFF>%s%%</color>. Loses its effect when the caster is more than 30 meters away.",
    ["BuffDes_1112"]="Armor Lv.6",
    ["BuffDes_11122021"]="Targets suffering from <color=#44afee>Burn</color> lose <color=#44afee>2%%</color> Max HP/sec for the duration of the effect.",
    ["BuffDes_11122051"]="When <color=#44afee>Death Bound</color> is in effect, <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of lost HP from attacks is converted to Regular Physical Damage and dealt to the bound target. Effect is lifted when the distance between you and the target is greater than 12 meters.",
    ["BuffDes_11122052"]="When <color=#44afee>Death Bound</color> is in effect, <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of lost HP from the caster is counted towards Regular Physical Damage. Effect is lifted when the distance between you and the target is greater than 12 meters.",
    ["BuffDes_11122071"]="Increases <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> Final Physical DEF and Final Magic DEF while <color=#44afee>Unbreakable</color> is in effect. Can be stacked up to <color=#44afee>5</color> times, after which a Rune Shield is granted.",
    ["BuffDes_11122072"]="Grants damage resistance equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> Max HP while <color=#44afee>Rune Shield</color> is in effect.",
    ["BuffDes_11122082"]="All damage taken increased by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_11122101"]="Increases Crit Damage Bonus by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> while <color=#44afee>Wind Cutter</color> is in effect. Can be stacked up to <color=#44afee>6</color> times, after which additional Weapon-based Physical Damage equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> Physical Attack is dealt to the target.",
    ["BuffDes_11122121"]="While in the <color=#44afee>Dark Flame Sword</color> state, each normal attack that hits a target grants the party members within <color=#44afee>30</color> meters a stack of the <color=#44afee>Dark Flame</color> effect. Each stack of <color=#44afee>Dark Flame</color> increases the Final Hit by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> and the Final Crit by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>, up to <color=#44afee>12</color> stacks.",
    ["BuffDes_11122122"]="While in the <color=#44afee>Dark Flame</color> state, each stack increases the Final Hit by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> and the Final Crit by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_11122131"]="Each stack reduces MSPD by <color=#44afee>25%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_11131011"]="Grants a <color=#44afee>5%%</color> increase to Final Physical Damage Bonus, Final Magic Damage Bonus, PvP Final Physical Damage Bonus and PvP Final Magic Damage Bonus from each party member with <color=#44afee>Nosiege Rune Blessing</color> while the blessing is in effect. Can be stacked up to <color=#44afee>5</color> times.",
    ["BuffDes_11131021"]="Grants a <color=#44afee>5%%</color> increase to Final Physical Damage Reduction, Final Magic Damage Reduction, PvP Final Physical Damage Reduction and PvP Final Magic Damage Reduction from each party member with <color=#44afee>Raido Rune Blessing</color> while the blessing is in effect. Can be stacked up to <color=#44afee>5</color> times.",
    ["BuffDes_11131031"]="Grants a shield equal to <color=#44afee>10%%</color>Max HP from every party member with <color=#44afee>Berkana Rune Blessing</color> every 30 sec while the buff is in effect, lasting for <color=#44afee>15</color>sec.",
    ["BuffDes_11131041"]="Restores <color=#44afee>1%%</color>Max HP to all party members with <color=#44afee>Isia Rune Blessing</color> when casting an active skill.",
    ["BuffDes_11131051"]="Restores <color=#44afee>0.15%%</color>Max HP to all party members with <color=#44afee>Othila Runestone’s Blessing</color> when triggering a crit.",
    ["BuffDes_11131061"]="While under the effect of <color=#44afee>Urj Runestone Blessing</color>, damage taken is decreased by <color=#44afee>3%%</color>*the number of party members also under the effect. The remaining damage will also be shared among all party members who are under the same effect. Stacks up to <color=#44afee>5</color> times.",
    ["BuffDes_11131071"]="Increases Movement Speed by <color=#44afee>0.5</color> per party member with <color=#44afee>Thurisaz Rune Blessing</color> while the buff is in effect. Can be stacked up to <color=#44afee>5</color> times.",
    ["BuffDes_11131081"]="While under the effect of <color=#44afee>Pertz Runestone Blessing</color>, for each party member carrying this blessing when inflicting debuffs on enemies ignores <color=#44afee>5%%</color> resistance buffs and ignores <color=#44afee>5</color> Debuff Resistance and PVP Debuff Resistance. Stacks up to <color=#44afee>5</color> times.",
    ["BuffDes_11131091"]="Grants a <color=#44afee>5%%</color> chance per party member of inflicting Stun on enemies within <color=#44afee>2</color> meters for <color=#44afee>1</color> sec for every <color=#44afee>10%%</color> HP lost, based on the number of party members with <color=#44afee>Hagalaz Rune Blessing</color>. Can be stacked up to <color=#44afee>5</color> times.",
    ["BuffDes_11132011"]="During normal attacks, there is a <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> chance to consume <color=#44afee>1</color> energy sword, dealing damage to all enemies within <color=#44afee>4</color> meters of the target. The damage dealt by the energy sword can trigger critical hits.",
    ["BuffDes_11132021"]="Each time the marked target is attacked by a member of the caster's party, <color=#44afee>1</color> stack is added. Once the mark reaches <color=#44afee>%s</color> stacks, <color=#44afee>1</color> <color=#44afee>Ultimate Servant Weapon</color> will drop.",
    ["BuffDes_11132051"]="When <color=#44afee>Storm Force</color> reaches <color=#44afee>%s</color> stacks, it triggers Storm Slash, hitting the target <color=#44afee>5</color> times.",
    ["BuffDes_11132061"]="Puts you under the Awakened Dragon Soul state.",
    ["BuffDes_11132071"]="When <color=#44afee>Charge</color> reaches <color=#44afee>12</color> stacks, you can activate the <color=#44afee>Pierce</color> effect.",
    ["BuffDes_11132072"]="Using <color=#44afee>Pierce</color>, <color=#44afee>Spear Stab</color>, <color=#44afee>Spear Boomerang</color>, <color=#44afee>Spiral Stab</color>, <color=#44afee>Phantom Strike</color>, <color=#44afee>Hundred Spears</color>, or <color=#44afee>Madness Crusher</color> with a spear deals extra damage.",
    ["BuffDes_11132091"]="While under the effect of <color=#7ACEFF>Slow</color>, MSPD is decreased by <color=#7ACEFF>33%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_11132101"]="While under the effect of <color=#44afee>Vigor</color>, you gain <color=#44afee>%s</color> skill boosts, making your skill attacks to carry extra damage from Dragon Knight.",
    ["BuffDes_11132111"]="When <color=#44afee>taunted</color>, you are forced to attack the source of the buff.",
    ["BuffDes_11132112"]="Charges up to enter a defensive stance, gaining <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> Final P.DMG RED and Final M.DMG RED, and reducing your MSPD by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_1115"]="Hunter Transformation",
    ["BuffDes_1116"]="Blacksmith Transformation",
    ["BuffDes_1117"]="Knight Transformation",
    ["BuffDes_1118"]="Assassin Transformation",
    ["BuffDes_1119"]="Wizard Transformation",
    ["BuffDes_1120"]="Priest Transformation",
    ["BuffDes_11202051"]="While under the effect of <color=#ffd700>Sacred Force</color>, your P.ATK is increased by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> and MSPD is increased by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> within the duration for each stack.",
    ["BuffDes_11202101"]="When in the <color=#7ACEFF>Weapon Speed</color> state, and while the effect is active, your attack speed is increased by <color=#7ACEFF>%s</color> points, and Crit by <color=#7ACEFF>%s</color> points.",
    ["BuffDes_11202111"]="When in the <color=#7ACEFF>Sacrifice</color> state, and while the effect is active, the next <color=#7ACEFF>%s</color> normal attacks have an additional <color=#7ACEFF>%s%%</color> weapon attribute Physical Damage (can Crit) of your Max HP, and recovers HP that is (<color=#7ACEFF>0.8%%</color>*Crit times) of your Max HP.",
    ["BuffDes_1121"]="Crusader Transformation",
    ["BuffDes_11212021"]="While under the effect of <color=#7ACEFF>Prestige</color>, the armor's attribute will become Holy, increasing your Anti-Crit by <color=#7ACEFF>%s%%</color> and Crit DMG Reduction by <color=#7ACEFF>%s%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_11212031"]="When in the <color=#7ACEFF>Gospel</color> state, and while the effect is active, your damage dealt is increased by <color=#7ACEFF>%s%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_11212051"]="When in the <color=#7ACEFF>Moon Slasher</color> state, and while the effect is active, the damage dealt to you by enemy units in the formation is reduced by <color=#7ACEFF>%s%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_11212061"]="When in the <color=#44afee>Pressure</color> state, and while the effect is active, every stack increases the damage you take from the caster's party members by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>. When Pressure ends, depending on the stacks of <color=#daa520>Sacred Force</color> consumed, deals Holy Attribute Physical Damage to the buff target that is equal to P.ATK x (<color=#44afee>313%%|713%%|1213%%</color> x stacks).",
    ["BuffDes_11212081"]="When in the <color=#7ACEFF>Defending Aura</color> state, and while the effect is active, the damage taken is reduced by <color=#7ACEFF>%s%%</color>. If you are attacked, the attacker's movement speed is reduced by <color=#7ACEFF>%s%%</color> for 5s.",
    ["BuffDes_11212082"]="When in the <color=#7ACEFF>Defending Aura</color> state, and while the effect is active, your movement speed is reduced by <color=#7ACEFF>%s%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_11212091"]="When in the <color=#7ACEFF>Armor Damage</color> state, and while the effect is active, damage taken is increased by <color=#7ACEFF>%s%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_11212101"]="When in the <color=#7ACEFF>Battle Intent</color> state, and while the effect is active, every stack of Battle Intent increases your Final Crit by <color=#7ACEFF>%s%%</color> and Crit DMG Bonus by <color=#7ACEFF>%s%%</color>. Whenever you take a single damage that exceeds <color=#7ACEFF>35%%</color> of your Max HP, <color=#7ACEFF>%s%%</color> × (remaining stacks) of the damage is reduced (up to 20 stacks).",
    ["BuffDes_1122"]="Monk Transformation",
    ["BuffDes_11222031"]="When in the <color=#7ACEFF>King's Grace</color> state, and while the effect is active, you receive a shield equal to <color=#7ACEFF>%s%%</color> of your Max HP. When the shield is removed, you deal <color=#7ACEFF>%s%%</color> of your shield value in weapon attribute Physical Damage to all enemy units within 3 meters.",
    ["BuffDes_11222041"]="While under the effect of <color=#7ACEFF>Bleed</color>, lose HP equal to <color=#7ACEFF>%s%%</color> of the caster's P.ATK every second, P.ATK and ASPD decreased by <color=#7ACEFF>25%%</color>, and unable to naturally recover HP or SP for the duration of the effect.",
    ["BuffDes_11222051"]="While under the effect of <color=#44afee>Judgement of Genesis</color>, Holy damage received from the caster will be increased by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_11222053"]="While under the effect of <color=#44afee>Dispersal of Genesis</color>, removes buffs once every <color=#44afee>2</color> seconds.",
    ["BuffDes_11222081"]="When in the <color=#7ACEFF>Devotion</color> state, and while the effect is active, your Max HP is increases by <color=#7ACEFF>%s%%</color> while your Physical Attack is reduced by <color=#7ACEFF>50%%</color>. <color=#7ACEFF>50%%</color> of damage taken by party members is taken.",
    ["BuffDes_11222082"]="When in the <color=#7ACEFF>Sacrifice Guard</color> state, and while the effect is active, <color=#7ACEFF>50%%</color> of the damage dealt to you is taken by the source of the Buff.",
    ["BuffDes_11222092"]="When in the <color=#7ACEFF>Overpower</color> state, and while the effect is active, your attack and movement speed are reduced by <color=#7ACEFF>%s%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_11222101"]="When in the <color=#7ACEFF>Oath Blade</color> state, and while the effect is active, you gain a shield that is equal to <color=#7ACEFF>%s%%</color> of your Max HP, and Physical Lifesteal is increased based on HP lost.",
    ["BuffDes_11222111"]="When in the <color=#7ACEFF>Life Vow</color> state, and while the effect is active, when you use Sacrifice, Fearless Charge, or Life Vow to deduct your own HP, the target of the established contract will also take weapon Physical Damage equal to <color=#7ACEFF>%s%%</color>, for a max of <color=#7ACEFF>30%%</color> of your Max HP.",
    ["BuffDes_11222112"]="When in the <color=#7ACEFF>Life Vow</color> state, and while the effect is active, if the caster uses Sacrifice, Fearless Charge, or Life Vow, and deducts their HP, you also take weapon Physical Damage that is equal to <color=#7ACEFF>%s%%</color> of the damage deducted.",
    ["BuffDes_11222121"]="When in the <color=#7ACEFF>Inspiration</color> state, and while the effect is active, your normal attacks are turned into Holy Spirit Radiance that shoots at the target. Holy Spirit Radiance deals Holy Attribute Physical Damage (can Crit) to the target and enemy units within <color=#7ACEFF>3</color> meters that is <color=#7ACEFF>%s%%</color> of the caster's Max HP. If there is no other target in range, the target takes an additional Holy Attribute Physical Damage (can Crit) that is <color=#7ACEFF>%s%%</color> of the caster's Max HP. <color=#7ACEFF>%s%%</color> of damage taken will be stored and deducted in the form of Bleed for <color=#7ACEFF>3</color>s. For every <color=#7ACEFF>30</color> Crits , you activate Cleanse and remove Bleed from all stored damage.",
    ["BuffDes_1123"]="Sage Transformation",
    ["BuffDes_11232011"]="In Offensive Stance.",
    ["BuffDes_11232013"]="While active, using <color=#44afee>Shield Charge</color>, <color=#44afee>Shield Boomerang</color>, or <color=#44afee>Earth Drive</color> grants you a certain chance to increase the skill coefficient by an additional <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_11232021"]="In Defensive Stance.",
    ["BuffDes_11232041"]="Each stack increases your Final Crit by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> and Crit DMG Bonus by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_11232051"]="Upon activation, the next attack deals additional corresponding element damage equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of the attacker's Adaptive ATK.",
    ["BuffDes_11232052"]="While active, the next attack deals additional corresponding element damage equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of the attacker's Adaptive ATK.",
    ["BuffDes_11232093"]="Increases the damage against Dragon monsters, Undead monsters, and Formless monsters by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>, <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>, and <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>, respectively.",
    ["BuffDes_11232094"]="Increases the Final P.DEF by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> and Final M.DEF by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_11232121"]="Increases the damage dealt to MVP and MINI units by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_1124"]="Bard Transformation",
    ["BuffDes_1125"]="Dancer Transformation",
    ["BuffDes_1127"]="Disarmed. Unable to attack or cast skills.",
    ["BuffDes_1145"]="While the buff is active, reduce all received healing and recovery effects by 30%.",
    ["BuffDes_12003251"]="While under the effect of <color=#7ACEFF>Signum Crucis</color>, P.DEF and M.DEF are reduced by <color=#44afee>%s</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_12003261"]="While having the <color=#7ACEFF>Blessing</color> effect and within 30 meters of the caster, STR, DEX, and INT are all increased by <color=#7ACEFF>%s</color>. Loses its effect when the caster is more than 30 meters away.",
    ["BuffDes_12003271"]="While having the <color=#7ACEFF>Ruwach</color> effect, holy spirits will help you find <color=#7ACEFF>Hiding</color> enemy units nearby.",
    ["BuffDes_12003281"]="While having the <color=#7ACEFF>Increase Agility</color> effect and within 30 meters of the caster, AGI is increased by <color=#7ACEFF>%s%%</color>, and Movement Speed is increased by <color=#7ACEFF>%s</color>. Loses its effect when the caster is more than 30 meters away.",
    ["BuffDes_12003282"]="While under the effect of <color=#7ACEFF>Increase Agility</color>, ASPD is increased by <color=#7ACEFF>%s</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_12003301"]="While under the effect of <color=#7ACEFF>Light Blessing</color>, party members within 30 meters of the caster recover (<color=#7ACEFF>%s%%</color> of caster's M.ATK +<color=#7ACEFF>%s</color>) HP. Loses its effect when the caster is more than 30 meters away.",
    ["BuffDes_12102321"]="While under the effect of <color=#7ACEFF>Pneuma</color>, <color=#7ACEFF>become immune to ranged physical damage</color>. The barrier can take up to <color=#7ACEFF>%s</color> hits. The damage negated cannot exceed 50%% of the buff holder's Max HP.",
    ["BuffDes_12103241"]="While under the effect of <color=#7ACEFF>Lex Aeterna</color>, the next active skill's damage is increased by <color=#7ACEFF>%s%%</color>. Loses its effect when the caster is more than 30 meters away.",
    ["BuffDes_12103271"]="While having the <color=#7ACEFF>Aspersio</color> effect, the weapon will be converted to a <color=#7ACEFF>Holy attribute</color> weapon. Loses its effect when the caster is more than 30 meters away.",
    ["BuffDes_12103281"]="While under the effect of <color=#7ACEFF>Impositio Manus</color>, increases P.DMG (normal attack) by an additional <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>. While active, skills that deal P.DMG will also inflict additional Holy attribute P.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of the caster's P.ATK and ignore defense. The additional damage triggers once every <color=#44afee>2</color> seconds. Damage from periodic debuffs won't trigger this effect. Loses its effect when being 30 meters away from the caster.",
    ["BuffDes_12103291"]="While under the effect of <color=#7ACEFF>Angelus</color> and within 30 meters of the caster, DEF is increased by <color=#7ACEFF>%s%%</color>. Loses its effect when the caster is more than 30 meters away.",
    ["BuffDes_12103301"]="While under the effect of <color=#7ACEFF>Magnificat</color>, SP Regen is increased by <color=#7ACEFF>%s%%</color> and Magic Damage Bonus is increased by <color=#7ACEFF>%s</color>. Loses its effect when the caster is more than 30 meters away.",
    ["BuffDes_12103331"]="While having the <color=#7ACEFF>Kyrie Eleison</color> effect, block damage with a Physical Shield. The Physical Shield can block at most <color=#7ACEFF>%s</color> times of damage or up to <color=#7ACEFF>%s%%</color> of HP, losing its effect when either limit exceeds. Loses its effect when the caster is more than 30 meters away.",
    ["BuffDes_12103371"]="While under the effect of <color=#7ACEFF>Decrease Agility</color>, MSPD is decreased by <color=#7ACEFF>%s%%</color>, Final ASPD is decreased by <color=#7ACEFF>%s%%</color>, and Final Haste is decreased by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_12112291"]="While under the effect of <color=#7ACEFF>Safety Wall</color>, <color=#7ACEFF>become immune to melee physical damage</color>. The barrier can take up to <color=#7ACEFF>%s</color> hits.",
    ["BuffDes_12113221"]="While under the effect of <color=#7ACEFF>Sacred Blessing</color>, immediately recover HP equal to <color=#7ACEFF>%s%%</color> of Max HP upon taking lethal damage (amount healed is also affected by Healing Effect). Loses effect when the caster is more than 30 meters away.",
    ["BuffDes_12113251"]="While having the <color=#7ACEFF>Suffragium</color> effect and within 30 meters of the caster, Final haste is increased by <color=#7ACEFF>%s%%</color>. Loses its effect when the caster is more than 30 meters away.",
    ["BuffDes_12113261"]="While having the <color=#7ACEFF>Assumptio</color> effect and within 30 meters of the caster, M.DEF is increased by <color=#7ACEFF>%s%%</color>. Loses its effect when the caster is more than 30 meters away.",
    ["BuffDes_12113271"]="While having the <color=#7ACEFF>Gloria</color> effect and within 30 meters of the caster, LUK is increased by <color=#7ACEFF>%s</color>. Loses its effect when the caster is more than 30 meters away.",
    ["BuffDes_12113272"]="While under the effect of <color=#7ACEFF>Gloria</color>, Crit is increased by <color=#7ACEFF>%s%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_12113361"]="While under the effect of <color=#7ACEFF>Holy Strike</color>, normal attacks dealt with a Mace will deal an additional <color=#8ACEFF>%s%%</color> of your ATK as Holy sacred physical damage that ignores DEF.",
    ["BuffDes_12113362"]="While having the <color=#7ACEFF>Holy Mark</color> effect, every normal attack received from a player with the <color=#9ACEFF>Holy Strike</color> effect will increase one additional mark, up to a maximum of <color=#9ACEFF>20</color> stacks.",
    ["BuffDes_12122011"]="While under the effect of <color=#44afee>Sigil of the Life Tree</color>, recover <color=#44afee>6%%</color> of HP and SP per second, and Final DMG Reduction is increased by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_12122021"]="Increases Bonus Heal and Debuff Immunity by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> while <color=#44afee>Oper Auditorium</color> is in effect.",
    ["BuffDes_12122022"]="While under the effect of <color=#44afee>Oper Auditorium</color>, gain immunity to debuffs. (This does not include debuffs inflicted by Boss monsters.)",
    ["BuffDes_12122031"]="While under the effect of <color=#44afee>Praefatio</color>, gain a shield that blocks incoming damage. This shield can block damage up to <color=#7ACEFF>%s</color> times, or damage equal to <color=#7ACEFF>%s%%</color> of Max HP, disappearing when either limit exceeds. Loses effect if more than 30 meters from the caster.",
    ["BuffDes_12122051"]="While under the effect of <color=#44afee>Sacrament</color>, decreases Fixed Cast Time by <color=#44afee>%s</color> seconds and Fixed Cooldown Duration by <color=#44afee>%s</color> seconds.",
    ["BuffDes_12122061"]="While under the effect of <color=#44afee>Heal Block</color>, all healing received has no effect and <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of the healing received will be converted into Neutral magic damage. This has no effect on bosses.",
    ["BuffDes_12122071"]="When the effect of <color=#44afee>Light Brand</color> ends, deals Holy magic damage equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of M.ATK to units in an 8-meter range inflicted with a <color=#44afee>Bind</color> mark, and immobilizes them for <color=#44afee>%s</color> seconds.",
    ["BuffDes_12122072"]="While under the effect of <color=#44afee>Bind</color>, MSPD is decreased by <color=#44afee>50%%</color>. If within Light Brand's detonation range, takes Holy magic damage when Light Brand detonates.",
    ["BuffDes_12122081"]="While under the effect of <color=#44afee>Oratio</color>, Holy damage dealt is increased by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_12122091"]="While under the effect of <color=#44afee>Exhort</color>, your P.ATK and M.ATK are decreased by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> each.",
    ["BuffDes_12122101"]="While under the effect of <color=#44afee>Duple Light</color>, you deal <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> Holy damage of a type that matches your own each second to enemies within a 3-meter range. Each time you deal damage to the same target, this damage increases by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_12122111"]="While under the effect of <color=#44afee>Holy Spirit Protection</color>, each time you take damage, <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of this damage is converted into healing, restoring your HP instead.",
    ["BuffDes_12122121"]="While under the effect of <color=#44afee>Ascalon</color>, the first normal attack will mark the target with an Ascalon mark.",
    ["BuffDes_12122122"]="When the effect of <color=#44afee>Ascalon Mark</color> ends, take a percentage of the total amount of damage taken from the caster's normal attacks while the effect was active.",
    ["BuffDes_12122131"]="While under the effect of <color=#44afee>Holy Hammer</color>, Crit DMG Bonus and is increased by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> and Final P.PEN is increased by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>. Can be stacked up to <color=#44afee>%s</color> times. At full stacks, every critical hit will reduce the cooldown of Sacred Hammer and Holy Strike by <color=#44afee>0.25</color> seconds.",
    ["BuffDes_12132011"]="Restores <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> Max HP every second.",
    ["BuffDes_12132031"]="Each stack increases your Max HP by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_12132041"]="While under the effect of <color=#7ACEFF>Argutus Vita</color>, increases M.DMG (normal attack) by an additional <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>. While active, skills that deal M.DMG will also inflict additional Holy attribute M.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of the caster's M.ATK and ignore defense. The additional damage triggers once every <color=#44afee>2</color> seconds. Damage from periodic debuffs won't trigger this effect. Loses its effect when being 30 meters away from the caster.",
    ["BuffDes_12132061"]="Reduces Final Anti-Crit by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> and Crit DMG Reduction by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_12132062"]="Reduces Final P.DEF by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_12132063"]="Unable to move or release skill while being trapped.",
    ["BuffDes_12132071"]="Each normal attack has a <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> chance to summon Holy Ligh to deal Holy attribute P.DMG that ignores defense to the target.",
    ["BuffDes_12132081"]="Each Petitio triggered will deal Holy attribute P.DMG that ignores defense to all enemies near the target, with the damage split among the targets within range.",
    ["BuffDes_12132091"]="Each stack increases <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of your Debuff Resistance and Debuff Duration Reduction.",
    ["BuffDes_12132092"]="While the buff is active, increases your PVP Debuff Resistance and PVP Debuff Duration Reduction by <color=#44afee>%s</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_12132101"]="Loses <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> Max SP per second. During this time, there's a <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> chance you will be stunned for 0.5 seconds each time you receive Holy attribute damage.",
    ["BuffDes_12132111"]="Interrupts <color=#44afee>Solo</color>, <color=#44afee>Ensemble</color>, <color=#44afee>Chant</color>, and <color=#44afee>Chorus</color> skills. During this time, <color=#44afee>Solo</color>, <color=#44afee>Ensemble</color>, <color=#44afee>Chant</color>, and <color=#44afee>Chorus</color> skills cannot be released.",
    ["BuffDes_12202021"]="When in the Spirit Sphere state, every Spirit Sphere increases the caster's Physical Attack by (Agility*<color=#44afee>%s%%</color>) points.",
    ["BuffDes_12202041"]="When in the Zen state, every Spirit Sphere increases the caster's Physical Attack by an additional (Agility*<color=#44afee>%s%%</color>) points.",
    ["BuffDes_12202051"]="When in the Critical Explosion state, every stack increases Physical Attack by an additional <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_12212011"]="When in the Spirits Recovery state, (<color=#44afee>%s%%</color>*recovery times) of Max SP is recovered every 0.5s, and if you are attacked by normal attacks or skills while in Spirits Recovery, it will end early.",
    ["BuffDes_12212071"]="When in the Crush state, damage you take from the caster is increased by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_12212101"]="When in the Inner Strength state, every time the target takes damage from the caster, it triggers Inner Strength, and take additional (<color=#44afee>%s%%</color>*caster's Physical Attack) in weapon attribute Physical Damage.",
    ["BuffDes_12222011"]="When in the Extraordinary state, gain immunity to all debuffs.",
    ["BuffDes_12222021"]="When in the Rising Dragon state, <color=#44afee>%s</color> stacks of Critical Explosion is added to you, and the number of Spirit Sphere you carry increases by <color=#44afee>%s</color>, while the time taken for Call Spirits is reduced by <color=#44afee>%s</color>s. The Critical Explosion state added to Rising Dragon will not be removed from use of the skill.",
    ["BuffDes_12222031"]="When in the Cursed state, you are restricted for <color=#44afee>%s</color>s if you attack in this period.",
    ["BuffDes_12222041"]="While under the effect of Steel Body, increases DMG Immunity by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> and MSPD by <color=#44afee>%s</color> for 3 seconds.",
    ["BuffDes_12222091"]="While in the Knuckle Power state, every stack of Knuckle Power increases your Final Crit by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> and Crit DMG Bonus by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_12222111"]="When in the Seismic state, every stack of Seismic reduces your movement speed by <color=#44afee>30%%</color>, up to a max of <color=#44afee>3</color> stacks. When you reach the max number of stacks, you are stunned for <color=#44afee>3</color>s.",
    ["BuffDes_12222121"]="When in the Dazzle state, every stacks increases damage from the caster by <color=#44afee>5%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_12232021"]="Max HP +<color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_12232022"]="Reduces damage received from MVP, MINI, and Boss units by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_12232023"]="Receives an additional <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of Base EXP and Job EXP when killing monsters.",
    ["BuffDes_12232031"]="While active, casting certain skills grants an additional damage boost.",
    ["BuffDes_12232041"]="While active, casting certain skills has a chance to trigger the <color=#44afee>Zen</color> effect.",
    ["BuffDes_12232051"]="When taking damage from the Brand caster, each stack increases <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> damage.",
    ["BuffDes_12232061"]="While active, each stack increases your PVP Final P.DMG RED and PVP Final M.DMG RED by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_12232062"]="While active, for <color=#44afee>each</color> stack of Brand applied to the target, you gain <color=#44afee>1</color> stack of Faith.",
    ["BuffDes_12232072"]="While active, for <color=#44afee>each</color> stack of Brand applied to the target, you deal an additional attack.",
    ["BuffDes_12232081"]="While active, attacking a target afflicted with Brand has a (<color=#44afee>%s%%</color> x Brand stacks) chance of triggering an additional attack. Triggers <color=#44afee>once</color> every <color=#44afee>2</color> seconds.",
    ["BuffDes_12232121"]="While active, casting certain skills does not consume Spirit Spheres.",
    ["BuffDes_13001221"]="While under the effect of <color=#44afee>Habitual Casting</color>, reduces the fixed cast time of the next Lightning Bolt.",
    ["BuffDes_13001281"]="While under the effect of <color=#44afee>Habitual Casting</color>, reduces the fixed cast time of the next Fire Bolt.",
    ["BuffDes_13001301"]="While under the effect of <color=#44afee>Habitual Casting</color>, reduces the fixed cast time of the next Cold Bolt.",
    ["BuffDes_13003211"]="While having <color=#7ACEFF>Water Armor Extension</color> effect, the armor's attribute will become <color=#9ACEFF>Water</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_13003241"]="While having the <color=#7ACEFF>Sight</color> effect, fireballs can be summoned to find <color=#7ACEFF>Hiding</color> enemy units.",
    ["BuffDes_13003261"]="While under the effect of <color=#7ACEFF>Energy Coat</color>, P.DMG and M.DMG taken are reduced.",
    ["BuffDes_13101311"]="While under the effect of <color=#44afee>Habitual Casting</color>, reduces the fixed cast time of the next Heaven's Drive.",
    ["BuffDes_13103211"]="While under the effect of <color=#7ACEFF>Storm Gust Slow</color>, Movement Speed is reduced by <color=#7ACEFF>%s%%</color>. At <color=#7ACEFF>3</color> stacks, the <color=#7ACEFF>freeze</color> effect will be triggered.",
    ["BuffDes_13103221"]="While having the <color=#7ACEFF>Storm Gust Freeze</color> effect, the armor's attribute will become <color=#7ACEFF>Water</color>, M.DEF is reduced by <color=#44afee>20%%</color>, and will not naturally recover HP and SP.",
    ["BuffDes_13103231"]="While under the effect of <color=#44afee>Shadow Equipment: Jupitel Thunder</color>, Blind Resistance is reduced by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_13103341"]="While under the effect of <color=#7ACEFF>Abyssal Swamp</color>, Final Attack Speed is reduced by <color=#7ACEFF>%s%%</color>, and Final Haste is reduced by <color=#7ACEFF>%s%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_13103342"]="While under the effect of <color=#7ACEFF>Abyssal Swamp</color>, Movement Speed is decreased by <color=#7ACEFF>%s%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_13113211"]="While under the effect of <color=#44afee>Meteor Storm II</color>, Stun Resistance is reduced by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>. Stacks up to 6 times.",
    ["BuffDes_13113221"]="While under the effect of <color=#44afee>Shadow Equipment: Lord of Vermilion</color>, Blind Resistance is reduced by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_13113231"]="While under the effect of <color=#44afee>Shadow Equipment: Frost Nova</color>, Freeze Resistance is reduced by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_13113241"]="While under the effect of <color=#44afee>Gravitational Field II</color>, Stun Resistance is reduced by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>. Stacks up to 6 times.",
    ["BuffDes_13113251"]="While under the effect of <color=#7ACEFF>Amplify Magic Power</color> and within 30 meters of the caster, Final M.DMG Bonus is increased by <color=#7ACEFF>%s%%</color>. Loses its effect when the caster is more than 30 meters away.",
    ["BuffDes_13113321"]="While under the effect of <color=#7ACEFF>Kindle</color>, receive Fire damage equal to <color=#7ACEFF>%s%%</color> of the caster's M.ATK every second, and take <color=#7ACEFF>%s%%</color> more Fire damage from the caster.",
    ["BuffDes_13113341"]="While under the effect of <color=#7ACEFF>Intense Telekinesis</color>, each stack reduces the fixed cast time by <color=#44afee>0.2</color> seconds and increases Ghost Attribute Enhancement by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_13122011"]="While under the effect of <color=#44afee>White Imprison</color>, Ghost damage taken from the caster in increased by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_13122031"]="While under the effect of <color=#44afee>White Barrier</color>, turns your armor attribute into <color=#44afee>Ghost</color> and makes you immune to damage in all attributes (except damage from MVP, MINI, and Boss) other than Ghost damage.",
    ["BuffDes_13122061"]="While under the effect of <color=#44afee>Wind Enhancement</color>, Wind enhancement is increased by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>. Stacks up to <color=#44afee>4</color> times.",
    ["BuffDes_13122062"]="While under the effect of <color=#44afee>Earth Enhancement</color>, Earth enhancement is increased by <color=#44afee>%</color>. Stacks up to <color=#44afee>4</color> times.",
    ["BuffDes_13122063"]="While under the effect of <color=#44afee>Water Enhancement</color>, Water enhancement is increased by <color=#44afee>%</color>. Stacks up to <color=#44afee>4</color> times.",
    ["BuffDes_13122064"]="While under the effect of <color=#44afee>Fire Enhancement</color>, Fire enhancement is increased by <color=#44afee>%</color>. Stacks up to <color=#44afee>4</color> times.",
    ["BuffDes_13122071"]="While under the effect of <color=#44afee>Burn</color>, lose <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of Max HP per second.",
    ["BuffDes_13122076"]="While under the effect of <color=#44afee>Tetra Vortex: Blind</color>, Blind Resistance is reduced by <color=#44afee>50%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_13122077"]="While under the effect of <color=#44afee>Tetra Vortex: Petrify</color>, Petrify Resistance is reduced by <color=#44afee>50%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_13122078"]="While under the effect of <color=#44afee>Tetra Vortex: Frost Diver</color>, Freeze Resistance is reduced by <color=#44afee>50%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_13122091"]="While under the effect of <color=#44afee>Electrify</color>, take Wind magic damage when within <color=#44afee>4</color> meters of another unit inflicted with Electrify.",
    ["BuffDes_13122101"]="Deals Wind Magic Damage and inflicts <color=#44afee>Confusion</color>every <color=#44afee>0.5</color> sec while <color=#44afee>Confusion Storm</color> is in effect.",
    ["BuffDes_13122111"]="While under the effect of <color=#44afee>Frosty Misty</color>, MSPD is decreased by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>, and you have a <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> chance to be frozen for <color=#44afee>3</color> seconds when attacked.",
    ["BuffDes_13122131"]="Reduces MSPD by <color=#44afee>50%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_13122141"]="While under the effect of <color=#44afee>Flame Guard</color>, gain a shield equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of MaxHp",
    ["BuffDes_13122151"]="While under the effect of <color=#44afee>Sienna Execrate</color>, Max HP is reduced by <color=#44afee>15%%</color> and healing received is reduced by <color=#44afee>50%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_13132011"]="While under the effect of <color=#44afee>Climax - Fire</color>, it increases your Fire Enhancement by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>, Debuff Penetration by <color=#44afee>%s</color>, and Debuff Enhancement by <color=#44afee>%s</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_13132012"]="While under the effect of <color=#44afee>Climax - Wind</color>, it increases your Wind Enhancement by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>, Debuff Penetration by <color=#44afee>%s</color>, and Debuff Enhancement by <color=#44afee>%s</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_13132013"]="While under the effect of <color=#44afee>Climax - Water</color>, it increases your Water Enhancement by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>, Debuff Penetration by <color=#44afee>%s</color>, and Debuff Enhancement by <color=#44afee>%s</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_13132014"]="While under the effect of <color=#44afee>Climax - Earth</color>, it increases your Earth Enhancement by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>, Debuff Penetration by <color=#44afee>%s</color>, and Debuff Enhancement by <color=#44afee>%s</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_13202011"]="While under the effect of <color=#44afee>Free Cast</color>, you can <color=#44afee>move</color> while casting magic, and your INT is increased by <color=#44afee>%s</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_13202021"]="While under the protection of an ally's <color=#44afee>Magic Rod</color>, each stack of this effect can block 1 hit of M.DMG dealt by a skill.",
    ["BuffDes_13202022"]="While under the effect of <color=#44afee>Magic Rod</color>, each stack of this effect can increase your fixed cooldown by <color=#44afee>0.5</color> seconds.",
    ["BuffDes_13202023"]="While under the effect of <color=#44afee>Magic Rewards</color>, each stack of this effect can increase your Final M.DMG Bonus by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_13202031"]="While under the effect of <color=#44afee>Spell Breaker</color>, the skills you cast, chant, or channel will be interrupted, and you will be silenced.",
    ["BuffDes_13202041"]="While under the effect of <color=#44afee>Dispell</color>, reduces M.DEF by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_13202051"]="While under the effect of <color=#44afee>Advanced Book</color>, increases your ASPD by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> and M.ATK by <color=#44afee>%s</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_13202061"]="While under the effect of <color=#44afee>Auto Spell</color>, normal attacks have a <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> chance of triggering the Elemental Arrow of the corresponding attribute.",
    ["BuffDes_13202071"]="While under the effect of <color=#44afee>Elemental Mark</color>, takes an additional <color=#44afee>%s</color> damage of the corresponding attribute.",
    ["BuffDes_13202081"]="While under the effect of <color=#44afee>Element Bonus</color>, enhances the attribute corresponding to the consumed medium by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>, and additionally increases your Final M.PEN by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> and M.ATK by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_13202082"]="While under the effect of <color=#44afee>Element Bonus</color>, enhances the fire attribute effects by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>, and increases your Final M.PEN by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> and M.ATK by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_13202083"]="While under the effect of <color=#44afee>Element Bonus</color>, enhances the water attribute effects by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>, and increases your Final M.PEN by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> and M.ATK by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_13202084"]="While under the effect of <color=#44afee>Element Bonus</color>, enhances the wind attribute effects by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>, and increases your Final M.PEN by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> and M.ATK by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_13202091"]="While under the effect of <color=#44afee>Habitual Casting</color>, when casting the same Elemental Arrow again, reduces the fixed cast time by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_13202101"]="While under the effect of <color=#44afee>Radius</color>, increases the cast range of Heaven's Drive, Fire Bolt, Cold Bolt, and Lightning Bolt by <color=#44afee>%s</color>m.",
    ["BuffDes_13202111"]="While under the effect of <color=#44afee>Enhanced Heaven's Drive</color>, increases the range of Heaven's Drive to a radius of <color=#44afee>3</color>m.",
    ["BuffDes_13202112"]="While under the effect of <color=#44afee>Enhanced Fire Bolt</color>, increases the range of Fire Bolt to a radius of <color=#44afee>3</color>m.",
    ["BuffDes_13202113"]="While under the effect of <color=#44afee>Enhanced Cold Bolt</color>, increases the range of Cold Bolt to a radius of <color=#44afee>3</color>m.",
    ["BuffDes_13202114"]="While under the effect of <color=#44afee>Enhanced Lightning Bolt</color>, increases the range of Lightning Bolt to a radius of <color=#44afee>3</color>m.",
    ["BuffDes_13202121"]="While under the effect of <color=#44afee>Land Protector</color>, deals Earth magic damage to enemies in the field by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>, and reduces all party members' Earth damage taken by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_13202122"]="While under the effect of <color=#44afee>Volcano</color>, deals Fire magic damage to enemies in the field by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>, and reduces all party members' Fire damage taken by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_13202123"]="While under the effect of <color=#44afee>Deluge</color>, deals Water magic damage to enemies in the field by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>, and reduces all party members' Water damage taken by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_13202124"]="While under the effect of <color=#44afee>Violent Gale</color>, deals Wind magic damage to enemies in the field by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>, and reduces all party members' Wind damage taken by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_13212022"]="While under the effect of <color=#44afee>Deplete</color>, all methods of recovering SP are ineffective and deduct 10%% Max SP per second.",
    ["BuffDes_13212041"]="While under the effect of <color=#44afee>Mental Breakdown</color>, reduces M.ATK by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> and M.DEF by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_13212051"]="While under the effect of <color=#44afee>Spider Web</color>, you cannot move.",
    ["BuffDes_13212052"]="While under the effect of <color=#44afee>Spider Web</color>, increases damage taken from Fire attribute attacks by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_13212061"]="While under the effect of <color=#44afee>Spell Fist</color>, increases the Final Hit by an additional <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>, and each <color=#44afee>50</color> INT increases the Final Hit by an additional <color=#44afee>1%%</color>. Normal attacks become earth attribute attacks and have a chance to deal earth attribute M.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> for <color=#44afee>6</color> times.",
    ["BuffDes_13212062"]="While under the effect of <color=#44afee>Spell Fist</color>, increases the Final Hit by an additional <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>, and each <color=#44afee>50</color> INT increases the Final Hit by an additional <color=#44afee>1%%</color>. Normal attacks become fire attribute attacks and have a chance to deal fire attribute M.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> for <color=#44afee>6</color> times.",
    ["BuffDes_13212063"]="While under the effect of <color=#44afee>Spell Fist</color>, increases the Final Hit by an additional <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>, and each <color=#44afee>50</color> INT increases the Final Hit by an additional <color=#44afee>1%%</color>. Normal attacks become water attribute attacks and have a chance to deal water attribute M.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> for <color=#44afee>6</color> times.",
    ["BuffDes_13212064"]="While under the effect of <color=#44afee>Spell Fist</color>, increases the Final Hit by an additional <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>, and each <color=#44afee>50</color> INT increases the Final Hit by an additional <color=#44afee>1%%</color>. Normal attacks become wind attribute attacks and have a chance to deal wind attribute M.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> for <color=#44afee>6</color> times.",
    ["BuffDes_13212071"]="While under the effect of <color=#44afee>Striking</color>, increases the damage dealt to the target by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> for every 1% Max HP the target loses.",
    ["BuffDes_13212072"]="While under the effect of <color=#44afee>Armor Damage</color>, increases the damage taken by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> for every 1% Max HP lost.",
    ["BuffDes_13212091"]="While under the effect of <color=#44afee>Memorize</color>, the next Fire Bolt, Cold Bolt, Lightning Bolt, and Heaven's Drive can be cast instantly.",
    ["BuffDes_13222011"]="While under the effect of <color=#44afee>Warmer</color>, you are immune to Freeze and Slow.",
    ["BuffDes_13222021"]="Reduces MSPD by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> while <color=#44afee>Slow</color> is in effect.",
    ["BuffDes_13222022"]="While under the effect of <color=#7ACEFF>Slow</color>, MSPD is decreased by <color=#7ACEFF>60%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_13222051"]="Summon Tera",
    ["BuffDes_13222052"]="Summon Agni",
    ["BuffDes_13222053"]="Summon Aqua",
    ["BuffDes_13222054"]="Summon Ventus",
    ["BuffDes_13222071"]="While under the effect of <color=#44afee>Elemental Shield</color>, absorbs melee and ranged physical damage <color=#44afee>%s</color> times.",
    ["BuffDes_13222081"]="While under the effect of <color=#44afee>Spirit Sympathy</color>, the corresponding elemental attribute enhancement is increased by [<color=#44afee>%s%%</color>], and MSPD is increased by [<color=#44afee>%s%%</color>].",
    ["BuffDes_13222082"]="While under the effect of <color=#44afee>Earth Spirit Sympathy</color>, each stack of this effect increases the Sage's Earth Enhancement by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_13222083"]="While under the effect of <color=#44afee>Fire Spirit Sympathy</color>, each stack of this effect increases the Sage's Fire Enhancement by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_13222084"]="While under the effect of <color=#44afee>Water Spirit Sympathy</color>, each stack of this effect increases the Sage's Water Enhancement by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_13222085"]="While under the effect of <color=#44afee>Wind Spirit Sympathy</color>, each stack of this effect increases the Sage's Wind Enhancement by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_13222087"]="While under the effect of <color=#44afee>Poison Spirit Sympathy</color>, each stack increases Sage's Poison Enhancement by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_13222091"]="Under the effect of <color=#44afee>Earth Insignia</color>. Restores (M.ATK x <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>) HP to Earth attribute party members within 4m every second and deals <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> M.DMG to Wind attribute enemies every second.",
    ["BuffDes_13222092"]="Under the effect of <color=#44afee>Fire Insignia</color>. Restores (M.ATK x <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>) HP to Fire attribute party members within 4m every second and deals <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> M.DMG to Earth attribute enemies every second.",
    ["BuffDes_13222093"]="Under the effect of <color=#44afee>Water Insignia</color>. Restores (M.ATK x <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>) HP to Water attribute party members within 4m every second and deals <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> M.DMG to Fire attribute enemies every second.",
    ["BuffDes_13222094"]="Under the effect of <color=#44afee>Wind Insignia</color>. Restores (M.ATK x <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>) HP to Wind attribute party members within 4m every second and deals <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> M.DMG to Water attribute enemies every second.",
    ["BuffDes_13222095"]="Under the effect of <color=#44afee>Poison Insignia</color>. Restores (M.ATK x <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>) HP to party members wearing Poison armor within 4 meters every second and deals <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> M.DMG to Earth/Fire/Wind attribute enemies every second.",
    ["BuffDes_13222111 "]="While under the effect of <color=#44afee>Tera Possession</color>, changes the Sorcerer's armor and weapon attribute to Earth and reduces damage taken by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>. Successful normal attacks made with the book have a 50%% chance to reduce the ASPD and MSPD of enemies within 2×4m in front of you by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> and <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>, respectively.",
    ["BuffDes_13222111"]="While under the effect of <color=#44afee>Tera Possession</color>, changes the armor and weapon attribute to Earth and reduces damage taken by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>. Successful normal attacks made with the book have a 50%% chance to reduce the Final ASPD and MSPD of enemies within 2×4m in front of you by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> and <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>, respectively.",
    ["BuffDes_13222112"]="While under the effect of <color=#44afee>Agni Possession</color>, changes the Sorcerer's armor and weapon attribute to Fire and increases MSPD by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>. Expands the range of melee attacks to a 4m fan-shaped area with a 180 degree angle.",
    ["BuffDes_13222113"]="While under the effect of <color=#44afee>Aqua Possession</color>, changes the Sorcerer's armor and weapon attribute to Water and summons crashing waves within 4m of the Sorcerer, dealing M.ATK ×<color=#44afee>%s%%</color> Water magic damage to enemies within range every 1 second. Meanwhile, enemies within range are knocked back 4m and their MSPD is reduced by 40%% for 2 seconds.",
    ["BuffDes_13222114"]="Reduces MSPD by <color=#44afee>40%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_13222115"]="While under the effect of <color=#44afee>Ventus Possession</color>, changes the Sorcerer's armor and weapon attribute to Wind. When taking damage, there is a <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> chance to attack the attacker with a chain lightning, dealing M.ATK ×<color=#44afee>%s%%</color> Wind magic damage to them and blinding them for 2 seconds. This effect can be triggered once every 0.2 seconds.",
    ["BuffDes_13222116"]="Reduces Final ASPD by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> and MSPD by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_13222118"]="While under the <color=#44afee>Poison Spirit Possession</color>, changes the armor and weapon attribute to Poison and ignores <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of the target's M.DEF when dealing Poison attribute M.DMG.",
    ["BuffDes_13222122"]="While under the effect of <color=#44afee>Spirit Control</color>, <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of the Sorcerer's HP Regen is converted to the spirit's HP. Meanwhile the Sorcerer takes <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of the damage the spirit takes.",
    ["BuffDes_13232011"]="While under the effect of <color=#44afee>Crystallize</color>, becomes incapable of movement or attacking, and the armor attribute changes to Earth. Receiving damage will not cancel the Crystallize effect.",
    ["BuffDes_13232021"]="While under the effect of <color=#44afee>Firestorm</color>, receives Fire attribute M.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of the caster's M.ATK every <color=#44afee>2</color> seconds.",
    ["BuffDes_13232031"]="While under the effect of <color=#44afee>Instant Freeze</color>, becomes incapable of movement or attacking, and the armor attribute changes to Water. Receiving damage will not cancel the Instant Freeze effect.",
    ["BuffDes_13232041"]="While under the effect of <color=#44afee>Conductive</color>, receives Wind attribute M.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of the caster's M.ATK every <color=#44afee>2</color> seconds.",
    ["BuffDes_13232051"]="While under the effect of <color=#44afee>Lethal Venom</color>, generates a <color=#44afee>4</color>-meter poison cloud every <color=#44afee>3</color> seconds, applying <color=#44afee>1</color> stack of Poison that lasts for <color=#44afee>6</color> seconds to targets in the area.",
    ["BuffDes_13232052"]="While under the effect of <color=#44afee>Venom Swamp - Poison</color>, the Poison carrier receives Poison attribute M.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of the caster's M.ATK every second for each stack they carry.",
    ["BuffDes_13232071"]="While under the effect of <color=#44afee>Increasing Activity - Earth</color>, the attribute of the highest Elemental Enhancement becomes Earth Enhancement.",
    ["BuffDes_13232072"]="While under the effect of <color=#44afee>Increasing Activity - Fire</color>, the attribute of the highest Elemental Enhancement becomes Fire Enhancement.",
    ["BuffDes_13232073"]="While under the effect of <color=#44afee>Increasing Activity - Water</color>, the attribute of the highest Elemental Enhancement becomes Water Enhancement.",
    ["BuffDes_13232074"]="While under the effect of <color=#44afee>Increasing Activity - Wind</color>, the attribute of the highest Elemental Enhancement becomes Wind Enhancement.",
    ["BuffDes_13232075"]="While under the effect of <color=#44afee>Increasing Activity - Poison</color>, the attribute of the highest Elemental Enhancement becomes Poison Enhancement.",
    ["BuffDes_13232081"]="Summon Poison Spirit",
    ["BuffDes_13232091"]="While under the effect of <color=#44afee>Spell Enchanting - Earth</color>, Earth Enhancement and Earth Resistance are increased by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_13232092"]="While under the effect of <color=#44afee>Spell Enchanting - Fire</color>, Fire Enhancement and Fire Resistance are increased by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_13232093"]="While under the effect of <color=#44afee>Spell Enchanting - Water</color>, Water Enhancement and Water Resistance are increased by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_13232094"]="While under the effect of <color=#44afee>Spell Enchanting - Wind</color>, Wind Enhancement and Wind Resistance are increased by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_13232095"]="While under the effect of <color=#44afee>Spell Enchanting - Poison</color>, Poison Enhancement and Poison Resistance are increased by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_13232101"]="While under the effect of <color=#44afee>Elemental Buster</color>, Earth/Fire/Water/Wind Resistance is reduced by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>/<color=#44afee>%s%%</color>/<color=#44afee>%s%%</color>/<color=#44afee>%s%%</color>, respectively. When the effect ends, receives the corresponding attribute M.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of the caster's M.ATK.",
    ["BuffDes_14003221"]="While under the effect of <color=#7ACEFF>Improve Dodge</color>, P.ATK is increased by <color=#7ACEFF>%s%%</color> and Final ASPD is increased by <color=#7ACEFF>%s%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_14003251"]="While under the effect of <color=#7ACEFF>Hiding</color>, become undetectable by enemies. Actively attacking, taking damage, or being affected by anti-stealth will cancel Hiding. For <color=#7ACEFF>Thief-branch Classes</color>, taking damage will not cancel Hiding after learning Covert Disguise.",
    ["BuffDes_14003252"]="While under the effect of <color=#7ACEFF>Assassination</color>, damage received from the caster will be increased by <color=#7ACEFF>%s%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_14003253"]="Upon your next attack, applies an Assassination mark to the first target you deal damage to.",
    ["BuffDes_14003331"]="While having the <color=#7ACEFF>Immunity to Poison</color> effect and within 30 meters of the caster, become immune to <color=#8ACEFF>Poison</color>. Loses its effect when the caster is more than 30 meters away.",
    ["BuffDes_14021311"]="Increases the damage of the Back Stab by an additional <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_14103281"]="While having the <color=#7ACEFF>Enchant Poison</color> effect, normal attacks will deal an additional <color=#7ACEFF>%s%%</color> Poison physical damage and have a <color=#7ACEFF>%s%%</color> chance on hit to poison the target.",
    ["BuffDes_14103331"]="While under the effect of <color=#7ACEFF>Roll Away</color>, Dodge is increased by <color=#7ACEFF>%s</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_14103332"]="While under the effect of <color=#44afee>High DMG Red</color>, the next damage taken over <color=#44afee>25%%</color> of Max HP will be reduced by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_14103341"]="While having the <color=#7ACEFF>Twin Blade Piercing</color> effect, DEF is reduced by <color=#7ACEFF>%s</color> points.",
    ["BuffDes_14103351"]="While having the <color=#7ACEFF>Enhanced Hiding</color> effect, the usual Hiding effects of being Upgraded and the usable skills are still the same, and damage received will be reduced by <color=#7ACEFF>%s%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_14103361"]="While under the effect of <color=#7ACEFF>Enhanced Enchant Poison</color>, the weapon that dealt Enchant Poison will deal additional Poison physical damage equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of ATK.",
    ["BuffDes_14103371"]="While under the effect of <color=#7ACEFF>Shadow Blade</color>, ASPD is increased by <color=#7ACEFF>%s</color> times.",
    ["BuffDes_14113251"]="While having the <color=#7ACEFF>Enchant Deadly Poison</color> effect, the weapon's attribute will become <color=#7ACEFF>Poison</color>, and any Poison damage dealt will be increased by <color=#7ACEFF>%s%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_14113311"]="While under the effect of <color=#7ACEFF>Assassination Halo</color>, Final Crit is increased by <color=#7ACEFF>%s%%</color>. Loses its effect when the caster is more than 30 meters away.",
    ["BuffDes_14113313"]="Increases Final Flee by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> and Final ASPD by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_14113321"]="While under the effect of <color=#7ACEFF>Slash</color>, have the ability to use Slash again.",
    ["BuffDes_14113333"]="While under the effect of <color=#44afee>Mirror Image</color>, gains immunity to knockback and debuffs (except for the debuffs of some BOSS-level monsters and those which evade clearance or immunity as noted in the game).",
    ["BuffDes_14122062"]="Immune to all debuffs (debuffs from MVP, MINI, and Boss cannot be removed or negated by this immunity effect), and increases MSPD by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>",
    ["BuffDes_14122071"]="First attack deals additional Heavy Damage for <color=#44afee>5</color> sec while <color=#44afee>Hallucination Walk</color> is in effect. Targets that suffer Heavy Damage will experience <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> less Healing Effectiveness.",
    ["BuffDes_14122072"]="Targets suffering from <color=#44afee>Heavy Damage</color> will experience a <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> decrease in Healing Effectiveness and additional Weapon-based Physical Damage equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>Max HP from the caster’s attacks. Can be triggered once every <color=#44afee>1</color> sec, up to a maximum of <color=#44afee>%s</color> time(s).",
    ["BuffDes_14122081"]="While under the effect of <color=#44afee>Blade Guard</color>, the blades have a <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> chance of blocking incoming P.DMG. For each successful block, the energy generated will charge one of the blades, reducing the fixed cooldown by <color=#44afee>1.5</color> seconds for each successful charge.",
    ["BuffDes_14122082"]="Triggers Blade Strike the first time you deal damage to an enemy while <color=#44afee>Blade Counter</color> is in effect. Each charged blade will fly at the target, dealing Weapon-based Physical Damage equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> Physical Attack.",
    ["BuffDes_14122091"]="Indicates the current amount of total spins while <color=#44afee>Spin Points</color> is in effect.",
    ["BuffDes_14122111"]="Increases normal attack damage inflicted by the caster by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> and reduces final HP by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> while <color=#44afee>Blackened Wounds</color> is in effect. Can be stacked up to <color=#44afee>6</color> times.",
    ["BuffDes_14132011"]="Reduces Final P.DEF by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_14132012"]="Reduces Crit DMG Reduction by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_14132111"]="Each <color=#44afee>1</color> stack of Shadow Scar increases the damage taken from the phantom by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_14202011"]="Each stack of <color=#44afee>Dip</color> increases your Poison Attribute Enhancement by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_14202031"]="Increases your Penetration by <color=#44afee>%s</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_14202032"]="Increases your Crit by <color=#44afee>%s</color> and Crit DMG Bonus by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_14202123"]="While under the <color=#44afee>Close Confine</color> state, you will not be able to move or use normal attacks. You may use the following skills to release you from the <color=#44afee>Close Confine</color> state: <color=#44afee>Hiding</color>, <color=#44afee>Charge Attack</color>, <color=#44afee>Sonic Wave</color>, <color=#44afee>Trample</color>, <color=#44afee>Shield Press</color>, <color=#44afee>Body Relocation</color>, <color=#44afee>Flame Shock</color>, <color=#44afee>Roll Away</color>, <color=#44afee>Warg Strike</color>, <color=#44afee>Marionette Control</color>, <color=#44afee>Front Side Slide</color>, and <color=#44afee>Suicidal Destruction</color>. Any other skills, except those mentioned above, cannot be cast during the Close Confine period.",
    ["BuffDes_14212032"]="Increases P.ATK by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>. There is a <color=#44afee>20%%</color> chance to slow the enemies by <color=#44afee>50%%</color> when dealing damage.",
    ["BuffDes_14212033"]="Reduces MSPD by <color=#44afee>50%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_14212041"]="Ring (Left) is stripped.",
    ["BuffDes_14212042"]="Ring (Right) is stripped.",
    ["BuffDes_14212043"]="Talisman is stripped.",
    ["BuffDes_14212061"]="Reduces MSPD by <color=#44afee>50%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_14212071"]="Cannot be selected, move, cast skills, or launch normal attacks.",
    ["BuffDes_14212072"]="Immune to the Man Hole traps.",
    ["BuffDes_14212091"]="Overpowered. Cannot move, cast skills, or launch normal attacks.",
    ["BuffDes_14212101"]="Armor is stripped.",
    ["BuffDes_14212102"]="Muffler is stripped.",
    ["BuffDes_14212103"]="Shoes are stripped.",
    ["BuffDes_14212121"]="When taking melee P.DMG, reflects <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of the damage to the attacker.",
    ["BuffDes_14222011"]="Possessed by the shadow. Take <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> DMG for the Rogue, and share <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of your healing effect with the Rogue.",
    ["BuffDes_14222012"]="Transfer <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of your DMG Taken to the target, and enjoy <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of the target's healing effect.",
    ["BuffDes_14222042"]="Each stack increases your <color=#44afee>P.ATK</color> by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>, DEX by <color=#44afee>%s</color>, and MSPD by <color=#44afee>20</color>. Stacks up to <color=#44afee>5</color> times.",
    ["BuffDes_14222051"]="Return to the location of <color=#44afee>Dimension Door</color> in <color=#44afee>3</color> seconds.",
    ["BuffDes_14222061"]="When launching <color=#44afee>Normal Attack</color>, <color=#44afee>Double Strafe</color>, <color=#44afee>Repeated Shot</color>, or <color=#44afee>Triangle Slot</color> on a target, deals <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of the original skill's weapon attribute P.DMG to nearby enemies within a <color=#44afee>4</color>m radius. Has a chance of Crit. Lasts for <color=#44afee>6</color> seconds.",
    ["BuffDes_14222071"]="Changes weapon attribute into <color=#44afee>Ghost</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_14222081"]="Reduces DMG Taken by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_14222091"]="Strips the weapon.",
    ["BuffDes_14222101"]="<color=#44afee>%s</color> STR points get stripped away.",
    ["BuffDes_142221010"]="Snatch <color=#47afee>%s</color> INT points.",
    ["BuffDes_142221011"]="Snatch <color=#48afee>%s</color> DEX points.",
    ["BuffDes_142221012"]="Snatch <color=#49afee>%s</color> LUK points.",
    ["BuffDes_14222102"]="<color=#45afee>%s</color> AGI points get stripped away.",
    ["BuffDes_14222103"]="<color=#46afee>%s</color> VIT points get stripped away.",
    ["BuffDes_14222104"]="<color=#47afee>%s</color> INT points get stripped away.",
    ["BuffDes_14222105"]="<color=#48afee>%s</color> DEX points get stripped away.",
    ["BuffDes_14222106"]="<color=#49afee>%s</color> LUK points get stripped away.",
    ["BuffDes_14222107"]="Snatch <color=#44afee>%s</color> STR points.",
    ["BuffDes_14222108"]="Snatch <color=#45afee>%s</color> AGI points.",
    ["BuffDes_14222109"]="Snatch <color=#46afee>%s</color> VIT points.",
    ["BuffDes_14222111"]="Decreases <color=#44afee>Final DEF</color> by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> in Shadow Cage.",
    ["BuffDes_14222112"]="While under the effect of <color=#7ACEFF>Slow</color>, MSPD is decreased by <color=#7ACEFF>75%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_14222121"]="Receive weapon attribute P.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> every second for each stack, lasting <color=#44afee>10</color> seconds. HP, P.ATK, and ASPD are reduced by <color=#7ACEFF>25%%</color>, and unable to naturally recover HP or SP.",
    ["BuffDes_14232011"]="Each stack increases your PVP Debuff Resistance and PVP Debuff Duration Reduction by <color=#44afee>%s</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_14232021"]="Strips away the Shadow Equipment.",
    ["BuffDes_14232071"]="Unable to move or release skill while being trapped.",
    ["BuffDes_14232101"]="While active, each stack increases your DEX by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_14232111"]="While under the effect, the target's Max HP is reduced by <color=#7ACEFF>%s%%</color>, with the healing received and recovery effect reduced by<color=#7ACEFF>%s%%</color> (ineffective against MVP, MINI, and Boss).",
    ["BuffDes_15003242"]="While under the effect of <color=#44afee>Time to Shine</color>, Final Damage Bonus is increased by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_15003243"]="In the <color=#44afee>Behind Bars</color> state, Final Damage Bonus is reduced by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> while the effect is active.",
    ["BuffDes_15003251"]="While having the <color=#7ACEFF>Improve Concentration</color> effect, AGI will be increased by <color=#7ACEFF>%s</color> points and DEX will be increased by <color=#7ACEFF>%s</color> points.",
    ["BuffDes_1501"]="While under the <color=#44afee>Solo</color> status, you cannot use other solo or ensemble skills.",
    ["BuffDes_1502"]="While under the <color=#44afee>Ensemble</color> status, you cannot move, launch normal attacks, or use skills other than the skill to end the ensemble.",
    ["BuffDes_1503"]="While under the <color=#44afee>Ensemble - Longing for Freedom</color> status, you cannot use other solo or ensemble skills and take <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> less damage.",
    ["BuffDes_15103231"]="While having the <color=#7ACEFF>Blitz Beat</color> effect, ASPD will be increased by <color=#7ACEFF>%s</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_15103251"]="While having the <color=#7ACEFF>Freezing Trap Slow</color> effect, Movement Speed will be reduced by <color=#7ACEFF>%s%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_15103301"]="While having the <color=#7ACEFF>Falcon's Mark</color> effect, damage received from the caster will be increased by <color=#7ACEFF>%s%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_15103331"]="While under the effect of <color=#7ACEFF>Focused Shot's Mark</color>, receive <color=#7ACEFF>8%%</color> additional damage from the target for each Mark inflicted on you.",
    ["BuffDes_15113241"]="While having the <color=#44afee>True Sight</color> effects, all 6 basic stats will be increased by <color=#44afee>10</color> points, P.ATK by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>, Crit DMG Bonus by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>, and Final Physical Penetration by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_15113261"]="When <color=#7ACEFF>immobilize</color>, become unable to move and damage received from traps will be increased by <color=#7ACEFF>%s%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_15113301"]="When <color=#7ACEFF>Slowed</color>, MSPD will be reduced by <color=#8ACEFF>30%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_15113331"]="While having the <color=#7ACEFF>Ace Tamer</color> effect, each stack increases ATK by <color=#7ACEFF>%s%%</color>, up to a maximum of <color=#7ACEFF>3</color> stacks.",
    ["BuffDes_15113351"]="While under the effect of <color=#7ACEFF>Intimidation</color>, become stunned and take <color=#7ACEFF>%s%%</color> more damage from the caster.",
    ["BuffDes_15122021"]="Reduces Movement Speed by <color=#44afee>%s</color> while <color=#44afee>SPD Down</color> is in effect.",
    ["BuffDes_15122031"]="While under the effect of <color=#44afee>Tearing Bite</color>, lose HP equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of the Max HP every second, P.ATK and ASPD decreased by <color=#7ACEFF>25%%</color>, and unable to naturally recover HP or SP for the duration of the effect.",
    ["BuffDes_15122071"]="Increases Crit Damage Bonus by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> while <color=#44afee>Fear Breeze</color> is in effect. Can be stacked up to <color=#44afee>4</color> times.",
    ["BuffDes_15122091"]="Reduces Final Attack Speed by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> while <color=#44afee>Ace Shot</color> is in effect.",
    ["BuffDes_15122101"]="While under the effect of <color=#44afee>Wounded</color>, the healing received is decreased by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> (including the Lifesteal effect).",
    ["BuffDes_15122102"]="While under the effect of <color=#44afee>Wounded</color>, the healing received is decreased by <color=#44afee>50%%</color> (including the Lifesteal effect).",
    ["BuffDes_15132051"]="Increases MSPD by <color=#44afee>%s</color>. Cannot attack and is immune to all ongoing ground effects from enemies.",
    ["BuffDes_15132053"]="Increases damage against enemies with less than <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> HP by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_15132061"]="Cannot enter <color=#44afee>Hiding</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_15132111"]="Takes <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> extra Neutral DMG from the caster's party member within the arrow array.",
    ["BuffDes_15132112"]="Takes <color=#45afee>%s%%</color> extra Water DMG from the caster's party member within the arrow array.",
    ["BuffDes_15132113"]="Takes <color=#46afee>%s%%</color> extra Fire DMG from the caster's party member within the arrow array.",
    ["BuffDes_15132114"]="Takes <color=#47afee>%s%%</color> extra Holy DMG from the caster's party member within the arrow array.",
    ["BuffDes_15132115"]="Takes <color=#48afee>%s%%</color> extra Wind DMG from the caster's party member within the arrow array.",
    ["BuffDes_15132116"]="Takes <color=#49afee>%s%%</color> extra Earth DMG from the caster's party member within the arrow array.",
    ["BuffDes_15202052"]="While under the <color=#44afee>Assassin Cross of Sunset</color> status, increases your Final ASPD by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>. Additionally increases Final ASPD bonus by <color=#44afee>1%%</color> for every <color=#44afee>%s</color> INT of the caster.",
    ["BuffDes_15202062"]="While under the <color=#44afee>The Apple of Idun</color> status, increases your Max HP by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>. Additionally increases Max HP bonus by<color=#44afee>1%%</color> for every <color=#44afee>%s</color> VIT of the caster.",
    ["BuffDes_15202101"]="Increases your Final P.DMG Reduction by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>. Ensemble skills cannot be used in this state.",
    ["BuffDes_15202102"]="Increases your Final P.DMG Reduction by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>. Ensemble skills cannot be used when you are too far away from your ensemble partner.",
    ["BuffDes_15202111"]="While under the <color=#44afee>A Drum on the Battlefield</color> status, increases your adaptive damage by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_15202121"]="While under the <color=#44afee>Mr. Kim A Rich Man</color> status, increases your Base EXP and Job EXP gained by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_15212032"]="While under the <color=#44afee>A Poem of Bragi</color> status, reduces your variable casting time by <color=#44afee>%s</color> seconds, and your casting cannot be interrupted.",
    ["BuffDes_15212061"]="While under the <color=#44afee>Polymeric Note</color> status, each stack increases your P.ATK by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_15212081"]="While under the <color=#44afee>Eternal Chaos</color> status, increases your Final P.DMG Bonus by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> and Final M.DMG Bonus by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_15212091"]="While under the effect of <color=#44afee>Invulnerable Siegfried</color>, reduces the Wind, Earth, Water, and Fire damage you take by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> and increases your Debuff Resistance by <color=#44afee>%s</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_15212111"]="While under the <color=#44afee>Salvation</color> status, reduces the damage taken by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>. Restores <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of lost HP for every <color=#44afee>4</color> attacks received (triggers once every <color=#44afee>4</color> seconds). Every Bard or Dancer in the party additionally reduces your damage taken by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> and additionally increases the restoration of your lost HP by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_15222031"]="Each stack of <color=#44afee>Echo</color> increases the damage of <color=#44afee>Dominion Impulse</color> by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_15222042"]="Grants HP Regen equal to <color=#44afee>2%%</color> Max HP for every 1 point (restores HP 1 time every 5 seconds).",
    ["BuffDes_15222043"]="Grants <color=#44afee>4%%</color> M.ATK for every 1 point.",
    ["BuffDes_15222044"]="Grants <color=#44afee>4%%</color> P.ATK for every 1 point.",
    ["BuffDes_15222045"]="Grants <color=#44afee>4%%</color> Final DMG Reduction for every 1 point.",
    ["BuffDes_15222072"]="Restores <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of your Max HP every <color=#44afee>3</color> seconds.",
    ["BuffDes_15222091"]="Unable to move or attack. Final P.DMG Reduction and M.DMG Reduction are reduced by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>. One stack of Sleep is removed each time the target takes damage from a normal attack or skill.",
    ["BuffDes_15222092"]="You cannot be afflicted with <color=#44afee>Sleep</color> again while this buff is in effect.",
    ["BuffDes_15222111"]="Dances wildly (unable to move or attack under this status).",
    ["BuffDes_15222112"]="Loses <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of both Max HP and Max SP every second with healing effect reduced by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_15232011"]="While active, damage received from the caster and their ensemble partner increases by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> per stack.",
    ["BuffDes_15232021"]="While active, gains one random music note every <color=#44afee>5</color> seconds.",
    ["BuffDes_15232022"]="While active, increases the damage of Rhythm Shooting.",
    ["BuffDes_15232023"]="While active, increases the damage of Rhythm Shooting.",
    ["BuffDes_15232024"]="While active, increases the damage of Rhythm Shooting.",
    ["BuffDes_15232025"]="While active, increases the damage of Rhythm Shooting.",
    ["BuffDes_15232026"]="While active, increases the damage of Rhythm Shooting.",
    ["BuffDes_15232027"]="While active, increases the damage of Rhythm Shooting.",
    ["BuffDes_15232028"]="While active, increases the damage of Rhythm Shooting.",
    ["BuffDes_15232052"]="While active, all party members within range gain a <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> damage boost against Demon monsters.",
    ["BuffDes_15232062"]="While active, all party members within range gain <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> Final M.PEN and <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> Final M.DMG Bonus.",
    ["BuffDes_15232071"]="While active, all party members within range gain a <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> increase in their highest main attribute (excluding VIT).",
    ["BuffDes_15232072"]="Increases STR by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_15232073"]="Increases AGI by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_15232074"]="Increases VIT by <color=#45afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_15232075"]="Increases INT by <color=#46afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_15232076"]="Increases DEX by <color=#47afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_15232077"]="Increases LUK by <color=#48afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_15232081"]="While active, the existing ensemble effect will not disappear.",
    ["BuffDes_15232091"]="Failing to return to the ensemble range in time will interrupt the ensemble.",
    ["BuffDes_15232112"]="While active, reduces DMG taken by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_15232122"]="Gaining Remorse extends the duration of active debuffs by <color=#44afee>1</color> second. When Remorse ends, any debuffs it caused will disappear.",
    ["BuffDes_15302052"]="While under the <color=#44afee>Humming</color> status, increases your Final P.PEN by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> and P.DMG Bonus by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_15302062"]="While under the <color=#44afee>Moonlit Serenade</color> status, increases your Earth, Fire, Water, Wind, and Holy damage bonus by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_15312011"]="While under the <color=#44afee>Charm</color> status, enemies move towards you at the MSPD of <color=#44afee>2</color> and can't attack or use skills.",
    ["BuffDes_15312022"]="While under the <color=#44afee>Fortune's Kiss</color> status, increases your Crit DMG Bonus by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_15312032"]="While under the <color=#44afee>Please Don't Forget Me</color> status, reduces your Final Haste by (<color=#44afee>%s</color> + caster's AGI/<color=#44afee>500</color>)%%.",
    ["BuffDes_15332052"]="While active, all party members within range gain a <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> damage boost against Angel monsters.",
    ["BuffDes_15332062"]="While active, party members within a 6-meter radius can ignore <color=#44afee>%s</color> of Debuff Resistance and Debuff Duration Reduction when applying debuffs to monsters they have already damaged.",
    ["BuffDes_16001061"]="While under the effect of <color=#7ACEFF>Crazy Uproar</color>, the STR of all party members is increased by <color=#7ACEFF>%s</color>. Loses its effect when the caster is more than 30 meters away.",
    ["BuffDes_16001071"]="While under the effect of <color=#7ACEFF>Battle Will</color>, each normal attack that hits will increase Physical Damage Bonus by <color=#44afee>%s</color>, up to a maximum of <color=#7ACEFF>8</color> stacks.",
    ["BuffDes_16002081"]="While having the <color=#7ACEFF>Bounty</color> effect, kill any monsters with the Bounty effect to receive additional <color=#7ACEFF>%s%%</color> Zeny.",
    ["BuffDes_16101031"]="While having the <color=#7ACEFF>Over Thrust</color> effect, caster's ATK is increased by <color=#7ACEFF>%s%%</color>, and ATK of all party members within 30 meters of the caster is increased by <color=#7ACEFF>%s%%</color>. Loses its effect when the caster is more than 30 meters away.",
    ["BuffDes_16101041"]="While having the <color=#7ACEFF>Adrenaline Rush</color> effect and within 30 meters of the caster, Final ASPD is increased by <color=#7ACEFF>%s%%</color>. Loses its effect when the caster is more than 30 meters away.",
    ["BuffDes_16101042"]="While under the effect of <color=#44afee>Adrenaline Rush I</color>, Final Hit is increased by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_16101051"]="While having the <color=#7ACEFF>Weapon Perfection</color> effect and within 30 meters of the caster, base weapon modifier is increased by <color=#7ACEFF>%s%%</color>, up to <color=#7ACEFF>100%</color>. Loses its effect when the caster is more than 30 meters away.",
    ["BuffDes_16101061"]="While under the effect of <color=#7ACEFF>Cart Blitz</color>, Movement Speed is increased by <color=#7ACEFF>%s</color>. During the charge, you gain the Endure effect and Control Immunity, and damage received is decreased by <color=#7ACEFF>%s%%</color>. After Cart Blitz kills <color=#44afee>8</color> targets or deals <color=#44afee>32</color> hits, the charge will end prematurely.",
    ["BuffDes_16111011"]="While having the <color=#7ACEFF>Cart Boost</color> effect, Movement Speed is increased by <color=#7ACEFF>%s%%</color> and Dodge by <color=#7ACEFF>%s%%</color>. Movement Speed boost will not be dispelled by Quagmire and does not stack with other Movement Speed increase effects.",
    ["BuffDes_16111041"]="While under the effect of <color=#7ACEFF>Maximum Over Thrust</color>, normal attack damage is increased by <color=#7ACEFF>%s%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_16111071"]="While having the <color=#7ACEFF>Zeny Storm</color> effect, become slowed by <color=#7ACEFF>50%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_16111101"]="While having the <color=#7ACEFF>Savagery</color> effect, each stack of Savagery grants <color=#7ACEFF>%s%%</color> Lifesteal. Stacks up to 5 times.",
    ["BuffDes_16112031"]="While under the effect of <color=#7ACEFF>Armor Break</color>, DEF is decreased by <color=#7ACEFF>%s%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_16122012"]="While under the effect of <color=#44afee>Slow</color>, MSPD is reduced by <color=#44afee>50%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_16122023"]="While <color=#44afee>Energy Shield</color> is in effect, stored energy is converted into a damage-resistant shield.",
    ["BuffDes_16122062"]="MSPD reduced by <color=#44afee>50%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_16122081"]="Increases Physical Attack by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> and Final Attack Speed by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> while <color=#44afee>Savage Fury</color> is in effect. Can be stacked up to <color=#44afee>6</color> times, after which Blood Thirst will be granted.",
    ["BuffDes_16122082"]="Grants <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> Physical Lifesteal while <color=#44afee>Blood Thirst</color> is in effect.",
    ["BuffDes_16122111"]="Reduces Movement Speed by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> while <color=#44afee>Power Swing</color> is in effect.",
    ["BuffDes_16122131"]="Reduces Final Physical Defense by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>, and Movement Speed by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> while <color=#44afee>Lure</color> is in effect. Can be stacked up to <color=#44afee>6</color> times.",
    ["BuffDes_16122132"]="While under the effect of <color=#44afee>Gainful Lure - DEF Reduction</color>, Final Physical Defense is decreased by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>. Stacks up to <color=#44afee>6</color> times.",
    ["BuffDes_16132021"]="Blocks damage coming from outside the defensive field.",
    ["BuffDes_16132051"]="<color=#44afee>ABR - Battle Warrior</color> and <color=#44afee>ABR - Dual Cannon</color> can repeatedly cast <color=#44afee>Strike</color> and <color=#44afee>Arm Cannon</color>. The attack frequency of the drone attack system is also increased.",
    ["BuffDes_16132121"]="While under the effect of <color=#44afee>Emergency Armor</color>, MSPD is increased by <color=#44afee>4</color> but <color=#44afee>Suicidal Destruction</color> is disabled.",
    ["BuffDes_16202071"]="During the <color=#44afee>Armor Protection</color> period, you are protected from <color=#44afee>Armor Break</color>, and the chance of <color=#44afee>Strip Armor</color> taking effect on you is reduced by <color=#44afee>25%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_16202081"]="During the Weapon Protection period, you are protected from <color=#44afee>Weapon Break</color>, and the chance of <color=#44afee>Strip Weapon</color> taking effect on you is reduced by <color=#44afee>25%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_16202121"]="While under the effect of <color=#44afee>Bleed</color>, receive weapon attribute P.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s</color> every <color=#44afee>0.5</color> seconds. HP, P.ATK, and ASPD are reduced by <color=#7ACEFF>25%%</color>, and unable to naturally recover HP or SP.",
    ["BuffDes_16212031"]="Increases the Lifesteal effect by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_16212032"]="When implanted with Blood Sucker, <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of the healing received will be transferred to the caster.",
    ["BuffDes_16212041"]="The Howling of Mandragora increases the <color=#44afee>fixed cooldown</color> of your active skills by <color=#44afee>%s</color> second(s) and the <color=#44afee>fixed cast time</color> by <color=#44afee>%s</color> second(s).",
    ["BuffDes_16212051"]="While in the <color=#44afee>Demonic</color> state, increases MSPD by <color=#44afee>%s</color>, Crit DMG Bonus by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>, Final P.PEN by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>, and P.ATK by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_16212111"]="The target implanted <color=#44afee>Spore Explosion</color> and their allies within <color=#44afee>3</color> meters take weapon attribute P.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of the caster's P.ATK + INT x <color=#44afee>%s</color> after <color=#44afee>3</color> seconds.",
    ["BuffDes_16212131"]="During the <color=#44afee>Accessory Protection</color> period, the chance of <color=#44afee>Strip Accessory</color> taking effect on you is reduced by <color=#44afee>25%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_16222011"]="While in the <color=#44afee>Cart Boost</color> state, increases your MSPD by <color=#44afee>%s</color> and P.ATK by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_16222061"]="Increases Max HP by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> and healing effectiveness by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_16222062"]="Increases Max HP by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> and P.DEF and M.DEF by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_16222063"]="Increases P.ATK by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> and P.PEN by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_16222064"]="Increases P.ATK by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>, Final Crit by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>, and Crit DMG Bonus by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_16222071"]="When in an <color=#44afee>Illusion</color>, vision becomes blurry, and each stack reduces Final Hit by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> and MSPD by <color=#44afee>%s</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_16222081"]="While in the <color=#44afee>Trap</color> state, receives <color=#44afee>%s</color> weapon attribute P.DMG every second from the caster. The trapped enemies will get out of the <color=#44afee>Trap</color> state early if they receive Fire DMG.",
    ["BuffDes_16222112"]="The current Heavy Cannon loading capacity.",
    ["BuffDes_16222162"]="Increases Final Dodge by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_16222163"]="Reduces Final Hit by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_16232021"]="Each stack increases your Final P.DMG Bonus by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_16232081"]="While active, the Shadow Equipment Disarm success rate of removing the Shadow Equipment's Pioneer and Inscription effects is reduced by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_16232101"]="While active, your attacks ignore size decay effects, and you take <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> less M.DMG.",
    ["BuffDes_16232111"]="Reduces STR by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>, Debuff Resistance and Debuff Duration Reduction by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_16232112"]="Reduces AGI by <color=#45afee>%s%%</color>, Debuff Resistance and Debuff Duration Reduction by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_16232113"]="Reduces VIT by <color=#46afee>%s%%</color>, Debuff Resistance and Debuff Duration Reduction by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_16232114"]="Reduces INT by <color=#47afee>%s%%</color>, Debuff Resistance and Debuff Duration Reduction by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_16232115"]="Reduces DEX by <color=#48afee>%s%%</color>, Debuff Resistance and Debuff Duration Reduction by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_16232116"]="Reduces LUK by <color=#49afee>%s%%</color>, Debuff Resistance and Debuff Duration Reduction by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_16232121"]="While active, gains a shield equal to (INT x <color=#44afee>%s</color>).",
    ["BuffDes_17002041"]="Each stack increases ASPD by <color=#44afee>%s</color> and P.ATK by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_17002061"]="Take Neutral attribute P.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of P.ATK every second.",
    ["BuffDes_17002071"]="Each stack of Focus increases your Final DMG Bonus by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>, reduces your melee damage taken by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> and ranged damage taken by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>. Stacks up to <color=#44afee>3</color> times and lasts for <color=#44afee>60</color> seconds. Leaving the realm will cause the realm to expire.",
    ["BuffDes_17002091"]="Under the Magical Bullet effect. The weapon's attribute becomes Ghost, and Ghost attribute is increased by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>. Last for <color=#44afee>300</color> seconds.",
    ["BuffDes_17003071"]="Exclusive to the scene. All attacks cost no bullets.",
    ["BuffDes_17102011"]="Increases your MSPD by <color=#44afee>20%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_17102031"]="Increase MSPD by <color=#44afee>%s</color> for 1 second.",
    ["BuffDes_17102041"]="Increase your Final Flee by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> for 5 seconds.",
    ["BuffDes_17102051"]="<color=#44afee>Bleeding</color>. Take Neutral attribute P.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of P.ATK every second for <color=#44afee>6</color> seconds.",
    ["BuffDes_17102061"]="Cannot enter Stealth while under the Crimson Marker effect.",
    ["BuffDes_17112051"]="Inflict a Blinding Flash effect on all units (both friendly and enemy units) within <color=#44afee>3</color> meters for <color=#44afee>%s</color> second(s). Enemies under this effect will receive extra Holy attribute P.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of P.ATK. Extra damage can be triggered up to <color=#44afee>%s</color> time(s).",
    ["BuffDes_17112052"]="When taking damage, receive an additional Holy attribute P.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of P.ATK. Can only be triggered up to <color=#44afee>30</color> times.",
    ["BuffDes_17112071"]="Take Neutral attribute P.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of P.ATK every second.",
    ["BuffDes_17112091"]="Increase your normal attack damage by an additional <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> but reduce your Final Hit by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>. Last for <color=#44afee>20</color> seconds.",
    ["BuffDes_17112101"]="Reduce the ranged P.DMG you receive by <color=#44afee>99%%</color> and increase your damage reduction against Undead monsters by <color=#44afee>50%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_17112102"]="MSPD reduced by <color=#44afee>50%%</color>, Final Hit reduced by <color=#44afee>50%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_17112111"]="Every time you reload, receive one stack of Heat for <color=#44afee>30</color> seconds. Each stack of Heat increases your ASPD by <color=#44afee>%s</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_17112112"]="While under the effect of Overloaded, normal attacks deal an additional <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> True DMG. Every additional <color=#44afee>20</color> LUK increases the damage coefficient by <color=#44afee>1%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_17122021"]="All damage taken during the casting period increased by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_17122031"]="MSPD reduced by <color=#44afee>50%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_17122071"]="Under the Duel state. The winner receives the Decider effect, whereas the loser dies.",
    ["BuffDes_17122072"]="Under the Duel state. The winner receives the Decider effect, whereas the loser dies.",
    ["BuffDes_17122073"]="Upon getting the Decider effect, recover your HP & SP by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> and increase your damage by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> for <color=#44afee>12</color> seconds.",
    ["BuffDes_17122081"]="Each stack increases your MSPD by <color=#44afee>0.5</color> and Predator's damage by <color=#44afee>1%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_17122082"]="Take Neutral attribute P.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of P.ATK every second.",
    ["BuffDes_17122101"]="Inflict the target with the Kindle effect for <color=#44afee>3</color> seconds, dealing Fire attribute P.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of P.ATK every second.",
    ["BuffDes_17122111"]="Reduce your damage taken by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> during Fire Dance's casting period.",
    ["BuffDes_17122112"]="Increase the damage of your next normal attack.",
    ["BuffDes_17122121"]="Forcefully knock the target airborne for <color=#44afee>1</color> second, allowing Fire Dance to deal an additional <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> damage to the Airborne target and refresh the Airborne effect on successful hits.",
    ["BuffDes_17132021"]="While active, increases your Debuff Penetration and Debuff Enhancement by <color=#44afee>%s</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_17132022"]="While active, reduces your PVP Final P.DMG RED and PVP Final M.DMG RED by <color=#44afee>%s</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_17132041"]="While active, increases your Final Hit by an additional <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>. Leaving the <color=#44afee>Concentration Realm</color> cancels the effect.",
    ["BuffDes_17132061"]="While active, increases your PVP Debuff Resistance and PVP Debuff Duration Reduction by <color=#44afee>%s</color> while taking <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> less damage. Triggers up to <color=#44afee>15</color> times.",
    ["BuffDes_17132091"]="While the buff is active, take weapon attribute P.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of the buff caster's P.ATK.",
    ["BuffDes_17132121"]="While active, the target suffers intermittently <color=#44afee>Stun</color> and <color=#44afee>Blurry Vision</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_18002041"]="While under the effect of <color=#44afee>Hiding</color>, become undetectable to enemies. Actively attacking, taking damage, or being affected by anti-stealth will cancel the Hiding effect.",
    ["BuffDes_18002091"]="Reduces your MSPD and ASPD by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_18002101"]="Each stack reduced your MSPD by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_18102021"]="Increases your Final DMG Reduction by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_18102031"]="While under the <color=#44afee>Illusion</color> state, you are unable to perform normal attacks. The skill now randomly deals damage to 1 target and converts <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of all received healing effects into True DMG.",
    ["BuffDes_18102052"]="Each stack increases your P.ATK and P.PEN by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_18102071"]="A Trauma effect cast by a male Ninja. Each stack increases your damage taken by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> from the attack dealt by the buff caster's party members.",
    ["BuffDes_18102072"]="A Trauma effect cast by a female Ninja. Each stack increases your damage taken by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> from the attack dealt by the buff caster's party members.",
    ["BuffDes_18102073"]="Increases your damage taken by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> from the attack dealt by the buff caster's party members.",
    ["BuffDes_18102081"]="A jade filled with the power of the Water Escape Technique.",
    ["BuffDes_18102082"]="A jade filled with the power of the Fire Escape Technique.",
    ["BuffDes_18102083"]="A jade filled with the power of the Wind Escape Technique.",
    ["BuffDes_18102111"]="The shadow is suppressed by a Ninja. If under the Hiding state, the Hiding state will be immediately dispelled, leading to a <color=#44afee>5</color>-second Immobilization effect.",
    ["BuffDes_18102112"]="The teamwork among Ninjas leads to a decrease in ASPD and Haste by <color=#44afee>%s</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_18112022"]="While active, remain unaffected by the effects of <color=#44afee>Illusion - Imprison</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_18112041"]="Meikyo Shisui is interrupted, getting stunned.\n",
    ["BuffDes_18112051"]="Leaves a shadow area on the ground for every <color=#44afee>5</color> meters moved for <color=#44afee>5</color> seconds, up to <color=#44afee>3</color> can exist at the same time.",
    ["BuffDes_18112091"]="Reduces the fixed cast time by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>, increases M.PEN by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>, and synchronizes the enhancement value of Fire, Water, and Wind attributes to the highest of the three.",
    ["BuffDes_18122012"]="While under the <color=#44afee>Illusion - Jyusatsu</color> state, each stack reduces your Max HP by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> (effects of the same type can reduce up to <color=#44afee>50%%</color> in total). When <color=#44afee>Illusion - Jyusatsu</color> reaches <color=#44afee>7</color> stacks, you will die instantly.",
    ["BuffDes_18122041"]="Increases your damage by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_18122061"]="Increases your Physical Lifesteal by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> and healing effect received by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_18122101"]="Each stack increases your Fire, Water, and Wind attribute by <color=#44afee>2%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_18122131"]="While inside the water area created by <color=#44afee>Suijinton - Mitsuha</color>, your MSPD is reduced by <color=#44afee>%s</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_18132011"]="While the buff is active, you can use Enton: Thunder Fire. After learning <color=#44afee>Silent Night</color>, if you are not in the <color=#44afee>Izayoi</color> state, it will sync the Wind Enhancement and Fire Enhancement.",
    ["BuffDes_18132012"]="While the buff is active, you can use Muton: Misty Slash. After learning <color=#44afee>Silent Night</color>, if you are not in the <color=#44afee>Izayoi</color> state, it will sync the Fire Enhancement and Water Enhancement.",
    ["BuffDes_18132013"]="While the buff is active, you can use Ranton: Lightning Torrent. After learning <color=#44afee>Silent Night</color>, if you are not in the <color=#44afee>Izayoi</color> state, it will sync the Wind Enhancement and Water Enhancement.",
    ["BuffDes_18132061"]="While the buff is active, your Fire Resistance is reduced by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_18132062"]="While the buff is active, your Water Resistance is reduced by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_18132063"]="While the buff is active, your Wind Resistance is reduced by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_18132064"]="While the buff is active, your Fire Resistance and Water Resistance are reduced by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_18132065"]="While the buff is active, your Water Resistance and Wind Resistance are reduced by <color=#45afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_18132066"]="While the buff is active, your Fire Resistance and Wind Resistance are reduced by <color=#46afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_18132067"]="While the buff is active, your Fire Resistance, Water Resistance, and Wind Resistance are reduced by <color=#47afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_18132071"]="While the buff is active, each stack of buff increases your Shadow Enhancement by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>. After learning <color=#44afee>Shadow - Dance</color>, your damage taken is reduced by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>. If <color=#44afee>Cast-off Ciceda Shell</color> is on cooldown and you are in <color=#44afee>Meditation</color> state, taking a fatal blow will consume all stacks to block the fatal damage <color=#44afee>once</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_18132081"]="While the buff is active, each stack of <color=#44afee>Nightmare</color> reduces your P.DMG Reflection and Regen effect by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>. Each time a <color=#44afee>Nightmare</color> stack is added, one random debuff (<color=#44afee>Fear</color>, <color=#44afee>Slow</color>, or <color=#44afee>Blind</color>) is applied to you for <color=#44afee>1.5</color> seconds.",
    ["BuffDes_18202111"]="Shrouded in moonlight, the P.DEF and M.DEF are reduced by <color=#44afee>%s</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_18202112"]="Cast moonlight around you, revealing invisible enemies.",
    ["BuffDes_19002051"]="Each stack reduces P.DEF by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_19002071"]="Each stack increases MSPD by <color=#44afee>%s</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_19002081"]="Each stack increases P.ATK/M.ATK by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_19002082"]="Each stack increases P.ATK/M.ATK by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_19002091"]="Increases Final DMG Reduction by <color=#44afee>1%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_19102012"]="Each stack grants <color=#44afee>1</color> star.",
    ["BuffDes_19102021"]="Increases P.ATK by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> during Union of the Stars and grants Endure.",
    ["BuffDes_19102031"]="Enveloped by the warmth of the stars, damage taken from a single attack is reduced by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> when it exceeds <color=#44afee>5%%</color> of Max HP.",
    ["BuffDes_19102041"]="Reduces Final DMG Bonus by <color=#44afee>40%%</color> and increases base MSPD by <color=#44afee>%s</color> during Anger of the Stars.",
    ["BuffDes_19102043"]="MSPD reduced by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_19102051"]="Inflicts a <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> Slow effect.",
    ["BuffDes_19102071"]="Each stack reduces P.DEF by <color=#44afee>5%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_19112011"]="While under the sun's light, increases P.DEF and M.DEF percentages by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>, and increases P.DMG dealt to targets within the realm by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_19112021"]="Every 10 stacks are converted to a Stun effect during Anger of the Sun.",
    ["BuffDes_19112041"]="Blessing of the Sun reduces damage taken.",
    ["BuffDes_19112044"]="Blessing of the Sun reduces damage taken.",
    ["BuffDes_19112071"]="Increases Final Flee by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_19122011"]="While under the moon's light, increases MSPD by <color=#44afee>%s</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_19122031"]="Each stack reduces enemy P.DEF and M.DEF by <color=#44afee>%s</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_19122032"]="Each stack increases P.ATK and M.ATK by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_19122041"]="Each stack can negate physical damage once.",
    ["BuffDes_19122043"]="Blessing of the Moon increases Final Flee by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_19122052"]="While <color=#7ACEFF>Recuperative Power is restricted</color>, unable to recover HP.",
    ["BuffDes_19122071"]="Grants a shield equal to [A] Max HP, which removes all debuffs and grants immunity to debuffs while the shield is active.",
    ["BuffDes_19122072"]="Grants a shield equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> Max HP, which removes all debuffs and grants immunity to debuffs while the shield is active.",
    ["BuffDes_19132021"]="While the buff is active, at <color=#44afee>1/2/3</color> <color=#44afee>stars</color>, the sun phase changes to <color=#44afee>Sunrise</color>, <color=#44afee>Noon</color>, <color=#44afee>Sunset</color>, respectively.",
    ["BuffDes_19132031"]="While the buff is active, at <color=#44afee>1/2/3</color> <color=#44afee>stars</color>, the moon phase changes to <color=#44afee>Moonrise</color>, <color=#44afee>Midnight</color>, <color=#44afee>Moonset</color>, respectively.",
    ["BuffDes_19132032"]="While the buff is active, gains a shield equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of Max HP.",
    ["BuffDes_19132041"]="While the buff is active, dealing damage with skills has a chance to grant energy.",
    ["BuffDes_19132081"]="While the buff is active, getting hit by the caster's Fire attribute DMG also triggers an extra Fire attribute P.DMG.",
    ["BuffDes_19132091"]="While the buff is active, you ignore part of the target's P.DMG Reflection.",
    ["BuffDes_19132102"]="While the buff is active, you ignore part of the target's PVP Final P.DMG RED.",
    ["BuffDes_19132111"]="While the buff is active, you recover a certain amount of HP based on your Max HP per second.",
