    ["BuffDes_19132121"]="While the buff is active, you gain both effects from the sun realm (<color=#44afee>kicking skill</color> damage) and the moon realm (<color=#44afee>ultimate</color> cast time reduction).",
    ["BuffDes_19202011"]="Consume Soul Essences to unleash powerful skills!",
