    ["BuffDes_19202091"]="While the buff is active, reduces your Final DMG Taken by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_19202092"]="While the buff is active, increases your M.ATK by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_19202093"]="While the buff is active, reduces all your talisman skills' SP consumption by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_19202094"]="While the buff is active, increases your MSPD by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_192022011"]="While the buff is active, increases your MSPD by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_192022051"]="While the buff is active, increases your MSPD by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_192022061"]="While the buff is active, increases damage against units with less than <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> HP by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_19212021"]="While the buff is active, auto-attacks the nearest enemy within <color=#44afee>8</color> meters.",
    ["BuffDes_19212031"]="While active, increases the damage of Soul Explosion, Soul Harvest, and Curse Explosion by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_19212041"]="While the buff is active, you become untargetable, unable to use normal attacks and cannot cast skills.",
    ["BuffDes_19212053"]="While the buff is active, your location is exposed, and your Final DMG taken is increased by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_19212061"]="While the buff is active, reduces your Final DMG dealt by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_19212081"]="While the buff is active, your MSPD is slowed by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> and your MSPD buffs are disabled.",
    ["BuffDes_19212091"]="While the buff is active, the target takes a certain amount of Neutral M.DMG per second from the caster. The elemental attribute can be changed by Warm Wind.",
    ["BuffDes_19212101"]="While the buff is active, reduces healing received and recovery by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_19212111"]="While the buff is active, increases damage reduction against small, medium, and large monsters by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> and nullifies any defense-reduction debuffs.",
    ["BuffDes_19212121"]="While the buff is active, increases damage boost against small monsters by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> and nullifies any attack-reduction debuffs.",
    ["BuffDes_19222081"]="While the buff is active, increases damage boost against medium monsters by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> and nullifies any critical-type debuffs.",
    ["BuffDes_19222091"]="While the buff is active, increases damage boost against large monsters by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> and temporarily nullifies casting-type debuffs.",
    ["BuffDes_19222103"]="While active, each stack increases your PVP Debuff Resistance and PVP Debuff Duration Reduction by <color=#44afee>%s</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_19222111"]="While the buff is active, you take <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> less damage, and a certain percentage of the damage is converted into healing.",
    ["BuffDes_19222121"]="While the buff is active, your damage dealt to <color=#44afee>Neutral</color>, <color=#44afee>Earth</color>, <color=#44afee>Fire</color>, <color=#44afee>Water</color>, and <color=#44afee>Wind</color> armor enemies is increased by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_19232011"]="While the buff is active, your attacks inflict <color=#44afee>Wounded</color> on the target for <color=#44afee>5</color> seconds.",
    ["BuffDes_19232021"]="While the buff is active, slows the target by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> every time you take damage from them.",
    ["BuffDes_19232031"]="While the buff is active, reduces your DMG Taken by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_19232041"]="While the buff is active, reduces your DMG Taken by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_19232051"]="While the buff is active, <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of your damage taken are stored.",
    ["BuffDes_19232061"]="While the buff is active, reduces your Max HP by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> and healing received and recovery effect by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_19232071"]="While the buff is active, each stack of <color=#44afee>Divine Resonance</color> reduces your Final DMG taken by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> and fixed cast time by <color=#44afee>0.1</color> seconds.",
    ["BuffDes_19232081"]="While the buff is active, the target cannot gain buffs, loses <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> Max SP per second, and loses <color=#44afee>1</color> buff <color=#44afee>each</color> second.",
    ["BuffDes_19232091"]="While the buff is active, applies an effect that doubles the next damage every <color=#44afee>2</color> seconds. Lasts <color=#44afee>6</color> seconds or when the buff ends.",
    ["BuffDes_19232101"]="While the buff is active, skills can be used instantly without casting. Lasts <color=#44afee>10</color> seconds or when the buff ends.",
    ["BuffDes_19232111"]="While the buff is active, you are unable to use normal attacks or skills.",
    ["BuffDes_1991"]="While under the effect of <color=#7ACEFF>Encumbrance Penalty</color>, HP and SP cannot be naturally recovered, Final ASPD is decreased by <color=#7ACEFF>75%%</color>, Channel Duration is increased by <color=#7ACEFF>100%%</color>, Cooldown Duration is increased by <color=#7ACEFF>100%%</color>, Movement Speed is decreased by <color=#7ACEFF>50%%</color>, and Max HP and Max SP are decreased by <color=#7ACEFF>50%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_1992"]="While under the effect of <color=#7ACEFF>Encumbrance Penalty</color>, HP and SP cannot be naturally recovered, Final ASPD is decreased by <color=#7ACEFF>75%%</color>, Channel Duration is increased by <color=#7ACEFF>100%%</color>, and Cooldown Duration is increased by <color=#7ACEFF>100%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_1993"]="While having the <color=#7ACEFF>Encumbrance Penalty</color> effect, HP and SP cannot be naturally recovered.",
    ["BuffDes_1994"]="While having the <color=#7ACEFF>Arielle's Blessing</color> effect, recover <color=#7ACEFF>10%%</color> of your Max HP every second.",
    ["BuffDes_1996"]="While having the <color=#7ACEFF>Meditate</color> effect, recover <color=#7ACEFF>20%%</color> of your Max HP and <color=#7ACEFF>20%</color> of your Max SP every <color=#7ACEFF>5</color> seconds.",
    ["BuffDes_1998"]="You feel happy after riding the Carousel. While having this effect, your ATK and M.ATK are both increased by <color=#7ACEFF>1%%</color>, and your Movement Speed is increased by <color=#7ACEFF>10%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_2000"]="You have used up today's Wilderness AFK time. You will <color=#7ACEFF>no longer gain anything</color> while AFK. Refreshes the following day at 05:00.",
    ["BuffDes_2001"]="Sandstorm",
    ["BuffDes_20012"]="While under the effect of <color=#44afee>Damage Reduction</color>, increases Final Damage Reduction by <color=#44afee>30%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_2002"]="Hot",
    ["BuffDes_2003"]="Storm",
    ["BuffDes_2003601"]="Resists the next upcoming attack from water gun or water balloon while <color=#44afee>Lifebuoy</color> is active. Can take effect <color=#44afee>%s</color> time(s).",
    ["BuffDes_2003901"]="Decreases cooldown for water bombs by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> for the duration while <color=#44afee>Pressure Boost Valve</color> is active.",
    ["BuffDes_2004"]="Drizzle",
    ["BuffDes_2004001"]="Increases Movement Speed by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> and reduces Soak by <color=#44afee>%s</color> point(s) per second while <color=#44afee>Energy Drink</color> is active.",
    ["BuffDes_2004101"]="While <color=#44afee>Under Rescue</color> is active, if Rescue Progress reaches <color=#44afee>%s</color> you will be freed from the water bubble.",
    ["BuffDes_2005"]="Meteor",
    ["BuffDes_2006"]="Haze",
    ["BuffDes_2007"]="While under the effect of <color=#7ACEFF>HP Regeneration</color>, recover a fixed amount of HP every second.",
    ["BuffDes_2008"]="While under the effect of <color=#7ACEFF>SP Regeneration</color>, recover a fixed amount of SP every second.",
    ["BuffDes_20313302"]="Received Purified Seedling's blessing, increase <color=#4169E1>Final DMG by 30%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_20313303"]="Received Purified Seedling's blessing, increase <color=#4169E1>MSPD by 1</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_20313304"]="Received Purified Seedling's blessing, recover <color=#4169E1>20% lost HP and 10% Max SP</color> every 2 seconds. This effect won't be affected by Fatality.",
    ["BuffDes_21002301"]="Cursed. Healing effects are weakened, and you cannot use healing potions.",
    ["BuffDes_21030"]="Restrained! <color=#FF4500>Rapidly shake the joystick</color> to escape sooner!",
    ["BuffDes_21034"]="You are marked! Missiles are coming towards you!",
    ["BuffDes_21052"]="Movement Speed will be increased while <color=#7ACEFF>Quickened</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_2108"]="PVP Final M.DMG Bonus +150%, PVP Final P.DMG Bonus +150%, Final Haste +50%, Final ASPD +500%, Debuff Resistance +150, Stun, Blind, Freeze, and Slow Resistance +100%.",
    ["BuffDes_21099301"]="When transporting this Mysterious Cargo from the Abyssal Arcade, your speed will decrease, and you can't conceal yourself. Submit it to the commander at the entrance to receive a bounty.",
    ["BuffDes_21099302"]="Occupy the altar to obtain the Blessing of Tyr, which offers an one-off shield effect and deals additional True Damage equal to 1% of the target's Max HP. The effect can be triggered up to 1 time per second (only effective to players).",
    ["BuffDes_21099303"]="Become the Lord of Beast Spirits when dealing the final blow to the MVP, which grants friendly units within 15m of you a periodic shield. Your Final Damage Reduction and Final Damage dealt are also increased. If you are defeated while this effect is active, the effects of Lord of Beast Spirits will be transferred to the enemy.",
    ["BuffDes_21099304"]="The blessing effect brought by the Lord of Beast Spirits. Grants a periodic shield for the duration of the effect, and increases the Final Damage Reduction and the Final Damage Bonus by 15%.",
    ["BuffDes_21099305"]="When transporting Abyssal Treasures that are dropped by MVPs in the Abyssal Arcade, your speed will decrease, and you can't conceal yourself. Submit it to the commander at the entrance to receive a great bounty.",
    ["BuffDes_212221"]="While under the effect of <color=#7ACEFF>Confuse</color>, your character will move in the opposite direction.",
    ["BuffDes_212671"]="Increases the damage against all normal monsters, MVPs, MINIs, Bosses by <color=#44afee>84%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_212681"]="Increases Physical/Magic Lifesteal by <color=#44afee>84%%</color> and ATK percentage by <color=#44afee>84%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_212682"]="Increases ATK percentage by <color=#44afee>42%%</color> and Physical/Magic Lifesteal by <color=#44afee>42%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_212691"]="Increases P.ATK and M.ATK percentage by <color=#44afee>120%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_212711"]="Deals <color=#44afee>1,680%%</color> weapon attribute Adaptive DMG that ignores defense to enemy units within 4 meters.",
    ["BuffDes_212761"]="Grants immunity to all debuffs during the duration.",
    ["BuffDes_212771"]="Increases your Final DMG Bonus by <color=#44afee>84%%</color> during the duration.",
    ["BuffDes_212773"]="Increases your Final DMG Bonus by <color=#44afee>28%%</color> during the duration.",
    ["BuffDes_30000323"]="While under the effect of <color=#7ACEFF>Severe Damage</color>, each stack reduces Final Max HP by 10%, stacking up to 5 times.",
    ["BuffDes_30003302"]="While under the effect of color=#7ACEFF>Slow</color>, MSPD is decreased by color=#",
    ["BuffDes_30004304"]="When <color=#7ACEFF>drowning</color>, you will be unable to move, and you will continuously take heavy damage until a party member rescues you.",
    ["BuffDes_30005302"]="While having the <color=#7ACEFF>Frost</color> effect, Frost will stack. Once you have 5 stacks of Frost, you will become <color=#7ACEFF>frostbitten</color>, and once you reach 10 stacks, you will become <color=#7ACEFF>frozen</color>. Being hit by Wind attacks will reduce <color=#7ACEFF>Frost</color> stacks.",
    ["BuffDes_30005304"]="While <color=#7ACEFF>frostbitten</color>, you will take damage every second, and your ASPD and MSPD will be reduced by 20%.",
    ["BuffDes_30005305"]="While <color=#7ACEFF>Frozen</color>, the target will be unable to move. Damage received will be increased and remove the <color=#7ACEFF>Freeze</color> effect. Wind attribute attacks will deal a lot of extra damage and fully remove the <color=#7ACEFF>Frost</color> effect.",
    ["BuffDes_30011301"]="While under the effect of the <color=#7ACEFF>Biteback Spell</color>, casting skills will cost <color=#7ACEFF>twice as much SP</color> and inflict magic damage on the caster at the same time.",
    ["BuffDes_30011303"]="While under the effect of <color=#7ACEFF>Luna's Blessing</color>, capabilities are greatly enhanced and you become immune to damage from meteors.",
    ["BuffDes_30011304"]="While under the effect of the <color=#7ACEFF>Bell of Chaos</color>, movements are inverted. If no one around you is under the same effect when it ends, you will receive magic damage of a random attribute.",
    ["BuffDes_30011310"]="While under the effect of Reduced M.DEF, M.DEF is reduced by 100%.",
    ["BuffDes_30012301"]="While under the effect of <color=#7ACEFF>Armor Break</color>, damage received is increased by <color=#7ACEFF>20%</color> for each stack of the effect. Can stack up to 10 times.",
    ["BuffDes_30013302"]="While <color=#7ACEFF>Slowed</color>, Attack Speed and Movement Speed will be reduced by <color=#7ACEFF>60%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_30013303"]="While <color=#7ACEFF>Poisoned</color>, receive <color=#7ACEFF>5% * the number of stacks</color> of <color=#00EE00>poison</color> magic damage from Osiris every second. Damage received is increased and damage dealt is decreased. The effect can stack up to <color=#7ACEFF>5</color> times.",
    ["BuffDes_30013306"]="While under the effect of <color=#7ACEFF>Everlasting Energy</color> and <color=#7ACEFF>blocking the black line</color>, receive <color=#7ACEFF>5%</color> of your Max HP in true damage every second. If the black line touches Osiris, he will gain <color=#7ACEFF>80%</color> damage reduction and <color=#7ACEFF>recover HP over time</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_30014301"]="While under the effect of <color=#7ACEFF>Trauma</color>, take Neutral physical damage equal to <color=#7ACEFF>10%%</color> of the caster's P.ATK per Trauma stack each second, damage taken is increased by 15%, and healing received is decreased by 15%. In addition, HP and SP won't recover naturally for the duration of this effect. At 10 stacks of Trauma, you will die instantly (ignores death immunity).",
    ["BuffDes_30014305"]="While under the effect of <color=#7ACEFF>Slow</color>, MSPD will be decreased by <color=#7ACEFF>30%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_30014306"]="While under the effect of <color=#7ACEFF>Slow</color>, MSPD will be decreased by <color=#7ACEFF>60%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_30014307"]="While under the effect of <color=#7ACEFF>Stop</color>, you will be unable to move.",
    ["BuffDes_30016302"]="While under the effect of <color=#7ACEFF>Weak</color>, damage taken is increased by 10%, and healing received is decreased by 10% for each stack. This effect can be stacked.",
    ["BuffDes_30016306"]="While under the effect of <color=#7ACEFF>Slow</color>, MSPD is reduced by <color=#7ACEFF>60%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_30017301"]="While <color=#7ACEFF>Exhausted</color> and the <color=#7ACEFF>red line</color> is in effect, your Max HP is reduced, and the Pharaoh receives healing. Get away from the Pharaoh and break free of the line to remove the <color=#7ACEFF>Exhausted</color> effect.",
    ["BuffDes_30017303"]="While under the effect of <color=#7ACEFF>Black Death</color>, receive the Pharaoh's vilest curse, which drastically reduces all attributes. <color=#7ACEFF>Stay away from others</color> to avoid infecting them with <color=#7ACEFF>Black Death</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_30019301"]="Morroc inflicts the Demon King's Curse onto weaker creatures. Each stack of the curse deals <color=#FFFFF0>True</color> DMG equal to 1% of Max HP. At 10 stacks, targets will be inflicted with the <color=#ff00ff>Curse of Enslavement</color> debuff.",
    ["BuffDes_30019302"]="While enslaved by Morroc, all damage dealt to Morroc becomes healing while reflecting 100% of the damage to yourself.",
    ["BuffDes_30019303"]="Each stack increases Shadow damage taken by 10%.",
    ["BuffDes_30019308"]="You have been bound by the Demon King's Hand! <color=#ff0000>Keep shaking the joystick to break free!</color>",
    ["BuffDes_30022301"]="You are gradually approaching the terrifying truth... Each stack reduces Final DMG Bonus by <color=#FF4500>10%</color>, and there's a chance to trigger Confuse. Converts to Shattered Vitality at 5 stacks.",
    ["BuffDes_30022302"]="All hope is cut off here. You can neither refuse nor resist. While active, HP recovery is disabled, and the Final DMG Bonus is gradually reduced, continually causing damage to surrounding units.",
    ["BuffDes_30022303"]="You are overwhelmed by some power strong enough to make your soul wither. Split this loneliness-caused damage with your allies!",
    ["BuffDes_30022304"]="You are infected with mad knowledge...",
    ["BuffDes_30022307"]="You are in a frenzied state and lose your sense of direction.",
    ["BuffDes_30024304"]="Every stack decreases ATK, ASPD, DEF, Healing, and Lifesteal by <color=#FF4500>10%</color>. When <color=#FF4500>defeated</color> while carrying the Buff, generates a random Megalith Trap that lasts for <color=#FF4500>10 seconds</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_30024305"]="The number above means the stacks of the mark, ranging from <color=#FF4500>1</color> to <color=#FF4500>5</color>. For every unmarked player within a 5-meter radius, 1 stack is shared, dealing True DMG equal to <color=#FF4500>stack number x 50 Max HP</color> after <color=#FF4500>10 seconds</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_30024306"]="The number above indicates the stacks of the mark, which is not greater than <color=#FF4500>1</color>. Players staying within a 5-meter radius of the marked player share 1 stack of the mark, taking no damage.",
    ["BuffDes_30024308"]="You are being marked by Tao Gunka! Tao Gunka keeps shooting at the marked target, dealing damage of <color=#FF4500>10% Max HP</color> within a 10-meter radius, and draws the nearby targets by <color=#FF4500>2 meters</color>. For targets within 3 meters of the central point, Tao Gunka deals additional True DMG of <color=#FF4500>80% Max HP</color> and inflicts <color=#FF4500>3 stacks of Soul Destruction</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_30025306"]="You are Intimidated! Characters with Intimidate take <color=#FF4500>additional damage</color> from the Boss. <color=#FF4500>Shake the remote quickly</color> to decrease the duration of Intimidate!",
    ["BuffDes_30025308"]="When <color=#7ACEFF>Immobilized</color>, the target will not be able to move.",
    ["BuffDes_30025314"]="Increases SP consumption by <color=#FF4500>300%</color> after each skill activation, and takes <color=#FF4500>100%</color> Magic Damage from the Boss.",
    ["BuffDes_30026301"]="You are punished by past crimes. Recovery and Attack are reduced by <color=#FF4500>10%</color>, and you will take massive true DMG when your sin is dispelled or detonated.",
    ["BuffDes_30026302"]="You have been hit by a Soul Spike, which will explode after a short time and deal magic damage to the surroundings.",
    ["BuffDes_30026304"]="You have been judged as a good spirit and will soon be released from all suffering. Quickly enter the land of evil to balance out good and evil.",
    ["BuffDes_30026305"]="You have been condemned as a sinner and will soon be punished. Quickly enter the land of good to balance out good and evil.",
    ["BuffDes_30027301"]="While under the effect of <color=#7ACEFF>Shadow/Fire</color>, healing received will be converted into an equal amount of Shadow magic damage.",
    ["BuffDes_30027302"]="Water DMG taken greatly increased. Can be removed by touching a Fire Attribute Orb.",
    ["BuffDes_30027303"]="Fire DMG taken greatly increased. Can be removed by touching a Water Attribute Orb.",
    ["BuffDes_30027304"]="Holy DMG taken greatly increased. Can be removed by touching a Shadow Attribute Orb.",
    ["BuffDes_30027305"]="Shadow DMG taken greatly increased. Can be removed by touching a Holy Attribute Orb.",
    ["BuffDes_30028311"]="Increases damage taken by 1,000%.",
    ["BuffDes_30028317"]="Becomes smaller in size. Decreases Max HP by 30%.",
    ["BuffDes_30029301"]="You are <color=#ff5252>Burnt</color>! Attack Speed and Healing are decreased, and cooldown is increased. The fire heats the whole battlefield, so beware of <color=#ff5252>lava</color> explosion!",
    ["BuffDes_30029320"]="You are <color=#528fff>Frozen</color>! The hard ice keeps you safe from Mutant Dragonoid's crash!",
    ["BuffDes_30030301"]="The Filth spawned from the dead. Upon dying, the carrier will randomly generate a <color=#006400>Plague Soul</color> at the place based on their <color=#4169E1>attributes</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_30030303"]="Shrouded by Fatality, which makes the wounds unable to recover and decay gradually, the carrier is <color=#800080>prevented</color> from <color=#00FF7F>recovering HP</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_30030320"]="The Holy Light, tainted by Beelzebub, cannot heal the living anymore but becomes the accomplice of the Undead Legion. Deals <color=#FFD700>Holy DMG equal to (5% Max HP x Fatality stacks)/10</color> per second and lasts for <color=#800080>10 seconds</color> while <color=#00FF7F>recovering 5% Max HP</color> to Plague Soul and Giant Plague Soul every second for <color=#800080>10 seconds</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_30031301"]="Decreases Attack Speed by 20% and Movement Speed by 20%.",
    ["BuffDes_30031302"]="Decreases healing received and healing by 20%.",
    ["BuffDes_30031311"]="Your life is about to fade. You can only stop this by altering time.",
    ["BuffDes_30031312"]="Increases the damage taken from Time Fixing Fluid by 100%.",
    ["BuffDes_30031316"]="Becomes larger in size. Increases damage dealt by 30%.",
    ["BuffDes_30032301"]="Your body starts emitting holy light... Healing is reduced by 20% and you become vulnerable to Holy Attribute. Enter the Realm of Holy Light to neutralize it!",
    ["BuffDes_30032304"]="Your body starts to wither, losing a great amount of Max HP.",
    ["BuffDes_30033301"]="The electric current you carry diffuses outward uncontrollably, causing area damage with each layer of Inductive Charge.",
    ["BuffDes_30033302"]="You are currently bearing the anode, Max HP decreased by <color=#7ACEFF>30%</color>. Please remain connected with the cathode to avoid triggering an explosion!",
    ["BuffDes_30033303"]="You are currently bearing the cathode, Max HP decreased by <color=#7ACEFF>30%</color>. Please remain connected with the anode to avoid triggering an explosion!",
    ["BuffDes_30033304"]="The electric current is surging within your body, reducing your Wind Resistance.",
    ["BuffDes_30033305"]="The electric current has overcharged your body! You will be immobilized periodically.",
    ["BuffDes_30033306"]="You are now immune to the impact of electric shocks.",
    ["BuffDes_30034301"]="You've picked up RSX-0806's repair scraps. Your Max HP reduces by <color=#7ACEFF>50%</color>, but your and your party members' Final DMG increases by <color=#7ACEFF>20%</color>!",
    ["BuffDes_30039304"]="While <color=#7ACEFF>poisoned</color>, receives True DMG equal to 5% of (Max HP x stacks) every second during the effect duration, stacking up to 5 times.",
    ["BuffDes_30039314"]="While active, reduces Max HP and healing received by 50%, Lifesteal and recovery effects by 95%.",
    ["BuffDes_30091302"]="When affected by <color=#00ffcc>Storm Seed</color>, generates a powerful storm for several seconds. Keep moving to avoid it!",
    ["BuffDes_30099301"]="Under the effect of <color=#7ACEFF>Red Lotus</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_30099302"]="Under the effect of <color=#7ACEFF>Holy Fire</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_30099325"]="In tune with the joyful rhythm, your body feels increasingly agile, increasing your Final DMG Reduction by <color=#44afee>3%</color>, Final DMG by <color=#44afee>3%</color>, and MSPD by <color=#44afee>5%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_30110302"]="Final DMG +20%.",
    ["BuffDes_3012301"]="While the buff is active, each stack reduces your Final P.DMG Bonus and Final M.DMG Bonus by <color=#7ACEFF>1%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_3012302"]="While the buff is active, each stack decreases your Crit DMG Bonus by <color=#7ACEFF>2%</color> and reduces both Final P.PEN and Final M.PEN by <color=#7ACEFF>1%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_3012303"]="While the buff is active, suffers <color=#7ACEFF>Unhealable</color> and is unable to recover HP.",
    ["BuffDes_30181301"]="Evil Frost has invaded your body, decreasing your healing effectiveness and increasing your damage. Turns into Bone Destroyer upon reaching 5 stacks.",
    ["BuffDes_30181302"]="Those subzero temperatures have made their way into your bones! You now lose HP over time!",
    ["BuffDes_30181307"]="Your existence has become an obstacle of your own in this fairy tale world. You now deal only 1 damage regardless. Only the Fairy Tale Healing Fountain can dispel magic like this.",
    ["BuffDes_30181308"]="Due to magic, all your attacks have turned into gifts, and all your damage has turned into 1. Only the Fairy Tale Healing Fountain can dispel magic like this.",
    ["BuffDes_30181309"]="Your existence is being wiped, and you lose HP over time! Only the Fairy Tale Healing Fountain can dispel magic like this.",
    ["BuffDes_30181310"]="Your wound is beyond repair, and nothing can heal you now. Only the Fairy Tale Healing Fountain can dispel magic like this.",
    ["BuffDes_30181311"]="In the same fairy tale world as Garm, you ignore its defense.",
    ["BuffDes_30184303"]="Your body becomes feeble, reducing your Final DMG Bonus by <color=#44afee>5%</color> on each stack.",
    ["BuffDes_30184304"]="Your body is infected by undead energy, reducing your Max HP by <color=#44afee>50%</color> on the first stack. Upon reaching the second stack, you will die instantly, triggering an area explosion at your position.",
    ["BuffDes_30205301"]="Each stack increases your P.ATK and M.ATK by <color=#44afee>10%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_30208301"]="While under the <color=#44afee>Hiding</color> state, your MSPD is increased by <color=#44afee>2</color> and Final Flee is increased by <color=#44afee>50%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_30209303"]="A slave mark inflicted by Yuda. Dealing damage to Yuda each time during this period will cause a certain amount of True DMG on you, which could be fatal.",
    ["BuffDes_30210301"]="The additional effect comes with Raoh's attack. You will be inflicted with the Lethal Point effect when it reaches 10 stacks, and you will die after 5 seconds. (Adventurers with the Legacy of Hokuto Shinken can save you by touching.)",
    ["BuffDes_30210303"]="Acquired the Legacy of Hokuto Shinken. Immune to point-sealing effects and can reset lethal points on party members by touching them. Acquired the Heart of Compassion. Drops upon death.",
    ["BuffDes_30212301"]="While under the effect of <color=#7ACEFF>Mental Contamination</color>, you suffer <color=#7ACEFF>Confuse</color> and lose 20% of Max HP each second.",
    ["BuffDes_30212307"]="While under the effect of <color=#7ACEFF>Possession</color>, you become part of Sloth's side for the effect's duration.",
    ["BuffDes_30213301"]="During the effect, you remain <color=#7ACEFF>stunned and become unhealable</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_30213302"]="While under the effect of <color=#7ACEFF>Slow</color>, MSPD is reduced by <color=#7ACEFF>20%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_30213307"]="<color=#7ACEFF>P.DEF is reduced</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_30213308"]="<color=#7ACEFF>M.DEF is reduced</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_30213310"]="While under the effect of <color=#7ACEFF>Bleed</color>, healing received is reduced by <color=#7ACEFF>5% of Max HP</color> each second.",
    ["BuffDes_30216301"]="While under the effect of Blind, you lose 20% of Max HP every second, and you cannot move or attack.",
    ["BuffDes_30216302"]="Terror increases each second within the fire rings. Reaching 10 stacks of Terror puts you into the Blind state!",
    ["BuffDes_30216304"]="You cannot move or attack while in the Puppet state, and you will receive a fatal blow after 10 seconds. Get into the Light of Revival to remove this effect.",
    ["BuffDes_30216318"]="Each time you touch another colored ball, it changes color! Place the matching-color balls into the basket for buff; otherwise, you will take fatal damage.",
    ["BuffDes_30216320"]="While active, your P.ATK and M.ATK increase by 20%.",
    ["BuffDes_30216324"]="While under the effect of Burn, you lose HP every second.",
    ["BuffDes_30217302"]="While under the effect of <color=#7ACEFF>Bleed</color>, healing received is reduced by <color=#7ACEFF>15% of Max HP</color> each second.",
    ["BuffDes_30218303"]="Continuously drains HP while the buff is active. Can be dispelled.",
    ["BuffDes_30218304"]="Dies instantly at 20 stacks. Can be cleansed by the Power of Light.",
    ["BuffDes_3080302"]="Cannot obtain buff items from the Serpent Guardian gameplay during the effective period.",
    ["BuffDes_31006301"]="Obtained the upgraded Power of Carrot effect, which increases the movement speed and deals fatal damage to the wolves upon touching them.",
    ["BuffDes_31009301"]="While having the <color=#7ACEFF>Deep Sea Bomb</color> mark effect, after <color=#7ACEFF>5</color> seconds, you and all others within 10 meters of you take a large amount of water magic damage. <color=#7ACEFF>Stay away from other people!</color>",
    ["BuffDes_31010303"]="Take Poison magic damage equal to 500% of M.ATK + 15% of own MAX HP from the caster every second.",
    ["BuffDes_31011301"]="Movement Speed is decreased by 50% and damage is taken according to distance traveled.",
    ["BuffDes_31012301"]="Each stack decreases Attack Speed and Healing by <color=#FF4500>10%</color>, and decreases HP by <color=#FF4500>5%</color> per second. <color=#FF4500>Move</color> quickly to alleviate the effect.",
    ["BuffDes_31012302"]="You are marked! <color=#FF4500>Spikes</color> will keep spawning around you.",
    ["BuffDes_31012303"]="You are targeted by <color=#FF4500>Infinite Midair Slash</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_31014301"]="You are infected with <color=#FF4500>virus</color>. Each stack decreases Attack Speed, Movement Speed and Healing by <color=#FF4500>30%</color>. It might give you antibodies, or turn you into a Munak.",
    ["BuffDes_31014302"]="You just mutated! Movement Speed is decreased by <color=#FF4500>90%</color>, and you are now a <color=#FF4500>Munak</color>!",
    ["BuffDes_31014303"]="You have gained antibodies, which grants <color=#FF4500>Immunity</color> to the virus for a short while.",
    ["BuffDes_31014304"]="You are protected from the consumption of Blind Magic.",
    ["BuffDes_31014305"]="You are exposed to Blind Magic, you are gradually being consumed.",
    ["BuffDes_31015301"]="Your body is gradually turning into bones... ASPD and recovery effects are reduced by <color=#FF4500>20%</color>, and you will turn into a pile of bones on death.",
    ["BuffDes_31015302"]="You feel your life slipping away, losing <color=#FF4500>15%</color> of total HP every second.",
    ["BuffDes_31015303"]="You are nailed to a cage of hell, MSPD reduced by <color=#FF4500>80%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_31016301"]="You are burned by Blazing Flames, losing <color=#FF4500>15%</color> of HP every second!",
    ["BuffDes_31016302"]="You are burned by Death Flames, damage taken greatly increased.",
    ["BuffDes_31016303"]="While under the effect of <color=#7ACEFF>Slow</color>, MSPD is reduced by <color=#7ACEFF>70%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_31016304"]="You are condemned by hell and about to deal massive damage to the surrounding area. Stay spread out!",
    ["BuffDes_31017301"]="Your soul is shaken, rendering the next Wrath Suffering effect applied to you to be doubled.",
    ["BuffDes_31017302"]="Your actions are being suppressed, MSPD reduced by <color=#7ACEFF>40%</color> and Max HP reduced by <color=#7ACEFF>50%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_31017303"]="You are under the trial of modesty, continuously losing HP until other players intercept the effect.",
    ["BuffDes_31017304"]="You are being touched by heaven, continuously losing HP until the strange hand disappears.",
    ["BuffDes_31017306"]="You are being watched. Do not break the rules!",
    ["BuffDes_31017311"]="You broke the rules and are now suffering God's mighty wrath!",
    ["BuffDes_31018301"]="MSPD reduced by <color=#7ACEFF>20%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_31018303"]="A massive amount of energy is rushing into your body! Loses <color=#7ACEFF>10%</color> HP every second.",
    ["BuffDes_31018304"]="Your armor has been corroded by acid clouds, reducing the Final DMG Reduction and Final DMG Bonus by <color=#7ACEFF>5%</color> for each stack you received.",
    ["BuffDes_31018305"]="You are hit by the energy current, MSPD reduced by <color=#7ACEFF>80%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_31019302"]="You are engulfed by a barrage of sand, making your backpack increasingly heavy and reducing your maximum carry limit by <color=#7ACEFF>1,000</color>. You may get <color=#44afee>petrified</color> if there is too much sand.",
    ["BuffDes_31021305"]="While under the effect of Frostbind, you need to keep moving, or you will get frozen for 10 seconds.",
    ["BuffDes_31023305"]="When Elemental Mark reaches 20 stacks, the count stops increasing and the holder enters the corresponding Elemental Corrosion state. When the Elemental Corrosion ends, all related Elemental Marks are cleared.",
    ["BuffDes_31023323"]="Affected by Elemental Corrosion, the effect grows stronger as stacks increase. Upon reaching 4 stacks, the target dies instantly.",
    ["BuffDes_31024301"]="While under the effect, each stack of Vulnerable increases damage taken by 15%. Upon reaching the maximum of 5 stacks, the target suffers Armor Break.",
    ["BuffDes_31024302"]="While under the effect, the target's attack and defense bonus effects are removed, and any weapon or armor attribute changes applied to the target or their allies are rendered ineffective.",
    ["BuffDes_31024304"]="While under the effect, reduces Lifesteal, HP Regen, and healing received by 50%.",
    ["BuffDes_31024305"]="While under the effect, being hit by Ranger Cecil's Crescive Bolt results in instant death.",
    ["BuffDes_33034301"]="When the bound gargoyle takes damage, receive the same percentage of damage.",
    ["BuffDes_33066301"]="While under the effect of <color=#7ACEFF>DEF Reduction</color>, P.DEF and M.DEF are reduced by <color=#44afee>20%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_33068301"]="While under the effect of <color=#7ACEFF>Restricted Vision</color>, Final Hit is reduced by <color=#7ACEFF>30%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_33068302"]="While under the effect of <color=#7ACEFF>Restricted Vision</color>, Final Hit is reduced by <color=#7ACEFF>25%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_33068303"]="While under the effect of <color=#7ACEFF>Restricted Vision</color>, Final Hit is reduced by <color=#7ACEFF>20%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_35011302"]="While under the effect of <color=#7ACEFF>Biteback Spell</color>, consumes <color=#7ACEFF>double SP</color> every time a spell is being cast, and 10% of SP will be deducted every second. The caster dies when SP is lower than 5%. After the effect wears off, remaining SP will be converted into HP at a certain ratio.",
    ["BuffDes_35016302"]="While under the effect of <color=#7ACEFF>Weak</color>, damage taken is increased by 20%, and healing received is decreased by 100% for each stack.",
    ["BuffDes_36000301"]="Final DMG +20%.",
    ["BuffDes_4000"]="HP when on GvG battlefields is increased 4 times.",
    ["BuffDes_4001"]="Cannot resurrect.",
    ["BuffDes_4001101"]="While in the <color=#44afee>Lumina Shield</color> state, damage received is offset by the shield value for the duration of the effect.",
    ["BuffDes_4002"]="Battlefield Mark",
    ["BuffDes_4003"]="When you die again while this is in effect, you will be weakened, and your stats will be decreased when you get resurrected. Only takes effect in PVP modes.",
    ["BuffDes_4004"]="Reduces Final Attack Damage dealt, Bonus Heal received, and Lifesteal by 20%, and increases Final Damage taken by 20%.",
    ["BuffDes_4004353"]="Train with Saitama and feel yourself becoming stronger. STR +52",
    ["BuffDes_4004354"]="Train with Saitama and feel yourself becoming stronger. DEX +52",
    ["BuffDes_4004355"]="Train with Saitama and feel yourself becoming stronger. VIT +52",
    ["BuffDes_4005"]="Reduces Final Attack Damage dealt, Bonus Heal received, and Lifesteal by 30%, and increases Final Damage taken by 30%.",
    ["BuffDes_4006"]="Reduces Final Attack Damage dealt, Bonus Heal received, and Lifesteal by 50%, and increases Final Damage taken by 50%.",
    ["BuffDes_4007"]="Reduces Final Attack Damage dealt, Bonus Heal received, and Lifesteal by 70%, and increases Final Damage taken by 70%.",
    ["BuffDes_4008"]="Safety protection. Cannot take damage while this buff is active.",
    ["BuffDes_4009"]="Gain 1 second of invulnerability after resurrecting.",
    ["BuffDes_4010"]="Challenger's Protection",
    ["BuffDes_4011"]="Preparation phase, unable to use skills",
    ["BuffDes_4017"]="Using normal attacks and skills is prohibited.",
    ["BuffDes_4020"]="Players who don't leave the Safe Zone within 40 seconds will be kicked",
    ["BuffDes_4031"]="With Maids' support, you receive the correct answer in advance.",
    ["BuffDes_4032"]="Complete the advanced guild order during the event period to increase its rewards by <color=#44afee>100%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_4101101"]="While in the <color=#44afee>Thunder Shield</color> state, damage received is offset by the shield value for the duration of the effect.",
    ["BuffDes_4101301"]="Every 2 seconds, this unit gains a stack of effect, with each stack increasing damage by <color=#44afee>2%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_4101304"]="Deals extra True DMG equal to <color=#44afee>3%% of Max HP</color> of the target each time. This effect is stackable.",
    ["BuffDes_4101326"]="Once the countdown ends, Adventurers remaining in the safe zone will no longer benefit from its effects.",
    ["BuffDes_4101327"]="The safe zone effects are disabled during this effect.",
    ["BuffDes_4101328"]="Final DMG Bonus -50%, Final DMG Reduction -50%, MSPD -50%",
    ["BuffDes_4101332"]="Attacking characters with over 300M HP will deal extra damage, with each hit adding extra True DMG equal to (target's HP - 300M)/75.",
    ["BuffDes_4101335"]="The safe zone has expired! Please leave the safe zone!",
    ["BuffDes_4110303"]="When you have more party members than the other side in the resource point, you will receive a damage bonus.",
    ["BuffDes_4150306"]="Removes all debuffs on you and boosts your damage by 30% for 10 seconds.",
    ["BuffDes_4150307"]="Removes all debuffs on you and reduces your damage taken (including True DMG) by 30% for 10 seconds.",
    ["BuffDes_4150308"]="Removes all debuffs on you and recovers 20% of your Max HP and Max SP every second for 10 seconds.",
    ["BuffDes_4500"]="During the event, the amount of Base EXP, Job EXP, and Zeny obtained by defeating wilderness monsters is increased by %s%%.",
    ["BuffDes_4501"]="During the event, the chance of dropping MVP/Mini rare items by defeating wilderness monsters is increased by %s%%.",
    ["BuffDes_4502"]="During the event, Base EXP, Job EXP, and Zeny obtained from defeating wilderness monsters, as well as the drop rate of rare items from killing MVPs/Minis, are all increased by %s%.",
    ["BuffDes_4510"]="During the event, the chance of dropping rare items by defeating wilderness MVP is increased by %s%%.",
    ["BuffDes_4511"]="During the event, the chance of dropping rare items by defeating wilderness MINI is increased by %s%%.",
    ["BuffDes_4512"]="During the event, the chance of dropping cards by defeating wilderness monsters is increased by %s%%.",
    ["BuffDes_4513"]="During the event, the chance of dropping Poring Gold Coins in instances and Endless Tower is increased by %s%%.",
    ["BuffDes_4514"]="During the event, the chance of dropping cards and costumes in instances is increased by %s%%.",
    ["BuffDes_4515"]="During the event, the chance of dropping cards and costumes in raids is increased by %s%%.",
    ["BuffDes_4516"]="During the event, there is a %s%% chance of triggering crits in fishing and mining, allowing you to receive extra items.",
    ["BuffDes_4517"]="During the event, there is a %s%% chance of triggering crits in gardening and smelting, allowing you to receive extra items. Gardening's gathering speed is increased by %s%% under special weather.",
    ["BuffDes_4518"]="During the event, the Daily Mission Board will provide %s extra mission reward(s).",
    ["BuffDes_4519"]="During the event, receive extra EXP from the following life skills: fishing/mining/gardening/smelting.",
    ["BuffDes_4521"]="While under the <color=#44afee>Unbridled Frenzy</color> state, your STR, INT, AGI, VIT, DEX, and LUK are increased by <color=#46afee> your Base Level x 150%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_4522"]="While under the <color=#44afee>Unbridled Frenzy</color> state, your STR, INT, AGI, VIT, DEX, and LUK are increased by <color=#46afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_4534"]="During the event, the amount of Job EXP obtained by defeating wilderness monsters is increased by %s%%.",
    ["BuffDes_4535"]="During the event, the respawn intervals for regular MVP/MINI units in the wild are reduced significantly.",
    ["BuffDes_4550"]="During the event, the chance of taming S/A-quality pets is increased by 50%.\nThe success rate of evolving pets to S/A quality is increased by 50%.",
    ["BuffDes_50003111"]="The pet and its owner's STR increases by 20 for 60 seconds.",
    ["BuffDes_50003121"]="The pet and its owner's AGI increases by 20 for 60 seconds.",
    ["BuffDes_50003131"]="The pet and its owner's VIT increases by 20 for 60 seconds.",
    ["BuffDes_50003141"]="The pet and its owner's INT increases by 20 for 60 seconds.",
    ["BuffDes_50003151"]="The pet and its owner's DEX increases by 20 for 60 seconds.",
    ["BuffDes_50003161"]="The pet and its owner's LUK increases by 20 for 60 seconds.",
    ["BuffDes_50003211"]="Heals all party members for 100% of M.ATK per second for 5 seconds.",
    ["BuffDes_50003281"]="Reflects 50% of melee physical damage for 5 seconds.",
    ["BuffDes_50005011"]="Grants 20% Earth Attribute Enhancement to the pet and its owner for 60 seconds.",
    ["BuffDes_50005021"]="The pet and its owner deal 20% more damage to Earth attribute targets and receive 20% less Earth damage for 60 seconds.",
    ["BuffDes_50006011"]="Grants 20% Fire Attribute Enhancement to the pet and its owner for 60 seconds.",
    ["BuffDes_50006021"]="The pet and its owner deal 20% more damage to Fire attribute targets and receive 20% less Fire damage for 60 seconds.",
    ["BuffDes_50007011"]="Grants 20% Water Attribute Enhancement to the pet and its owner for 60 seconds.",
    ["BuffDes_50007021"]="The pet and its owner deal 20% more damage to Water attribute targets and receive 20% less Water damage for 60 seconds.",
    ["BuffDes_50008011"]="Grants 20% Wind Attribute Enhancement to the pet and its owner for 60 seconds.",
    ["BuffDes_50008021"]="The pet and its owner deal 20% more damage to Wind attribute targets and receive 20% less Wind damage for 60 seconds.",
    ["BuffDes_50009011"]="Grants 20% Shadow Attribute Enhancement to the pet and its owner for 60 seconds.",
    ["BuffDes_50009021"]="The pet and its owner deal 20% more damage to Shadow attribute targets and receive 20% less Shadow damage for 60 seconds.",
    ["BuffDes_50010011"]="Grants 20% Ghost Attribute Enhancement to the pet and its owner for 60 seconds.",
    ["BuffDes_50010021"]="The pet and its owner deal 20% more damage to Ghost attribute targets and receive 20% less Ghost damage for 60 seconds.",
    ["BuffDes_50011011"]="Grants 20% Poison Attribute Enhancement to the pet and its owner for 60 seconds.",
    ["BuffDes_50011021"]="The pet and its owner deal 20% more damage to Poison attribute targets and receive 20% less Poison damage for 60 seconds.",
    ["BuffDes_50012011"]="Grants 20% Undead Attribute Enhancement to the pet and its owner for 60 seconds.",
    ["BuffDes_50012021"]="The pet and its owner deal 20% more damage to Undead attribute targets and receive 20% less Undead damage for 60 seconds.",
    ["BuffDes_50013011"]="Grants 20% Neutral Attribute Enhancement to the pet and its owner for 60 seconds.",
    ["BuffDes_50013021"]="The pet and its owner deal 20% more damage to Neutral attribute targets and receive 20% less Neutral damage for 60 seconds.",
