    ["BuffDes_55003131"]="While under the effect of <color=#44afee>Divine: Earth Armor</color>, the Earth Attribute is added to your Armor, reducing damage from Earth Attribute Monsters by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_55003141"]="While under the effect of <color=#44afee>Divine: Fire Armor</color>, the Fire Attribute is added to your Armor, reducing damage from Fire Attribute Monsters by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
