    ["BuffDes_55003581"]="While under the effect of <color=#44afee>Divine: Magic Resistance</color>, Final Magic Defense and Final Magic Damage Reduction are increased by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_55003591"]="While under the effect of <color=#44afee>Divine: Attack Resistance</color>, Final Dodge and Final Anti-Crit are increased by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_55003601"]="While under the effect of <color=#44afee>Divine: Healing Up</color>, Healing done and received is increased by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_55003611"]="While under the effect of <color=#44afee>Divine: Pneuma</color>, <color=#44afee>become immune to physical damage</color>. The barrier can withstand up to <color=#44afee>%s</color> attacks.",
    ["BuffDes_55003621"]="While under the effect of <color=#44afee>Divine: Safety Wall</color>, <color=#44afee>become immune to magic damage</color>. The barrier can withstand up to <color=#44afee>%s</color> attacks.",
    ["BuffDes_55003631"]="While under the <color=#44afee>Pets: Increase HP Recovery</color> effect, recover <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of Max HP every second.",
    ["BuffDes_55003641"]="While under the <color=#44afee>Pets: Kyrie Eleison</color> effect, block damage with a Physical Shield. The Physical Shield can block up to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of Max HP.",
    ["BuffDes_55003651"]="While under the effect of <color=#44afee>Pets: Sacred Blessing</color>, you’ll be saved from death on taking fatal damage, and immediately recover <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> HP.",
    ["BuffDes_55003711"]="While under the effect of <color=#44afee>Divine: Edge Break</color>, Final Hit and Final Crit are reduced by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>. Stacks up to <color=#44afee>4</color> times.",
    ["BuffDes_55003721"]="While under the effect of <color=#44afee>Divine: Tenacity Break</color>, Final Dodge and Final Anti-Crit are reduced by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>. Stacks up to <color=#44afee>4</color> times.",
    ["BuffDes_55003731"]="While under the effect of <color=#44afee>Divine: Defense Break</color>, Final DEF and Final M.DEF are reduced by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>. Stacks up to <color=#44afee>4</color> times.",
    ["BuffDes_55003741"]="While under the effect of <color=#44afee>Divine: Penetration Break</color>, Final P.PEN and Final M.Pen are reduced by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>. Stacks up to <color=#44afee>4</color> times.",
    ["BuffDes_55003751"]="While under the effect of <color=#44afee>Divine: Buff Break</color>, Final P.DMG Bonus and Final M.DMG Bonus are reduced by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>. Stacks up to <color=#44afee>4</color> times.",
    ["BuffDes_55003761"]="While under the effect of <color=#44afee>Divine: Reduction Break</color>, Final P.DMG Reduction and Final M.DMG Reduction are reduced by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>. Stacks up to <color=#44afee>4</color> times.",
    ["BuffDes_55003771"]="While under the effect of <color=#44afee>Mystic Skill: Attack Break</color>, P.ATK and M.ATK are reduced by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>. Stacks up to <color=#44afee>4</color> times.",
    ["BuffDes_55003781"]="While under the effect of <color=#44afee>Mystic Skill: Crit Break</color>, Crit Damage Bonus and Crit DMG Reduction are reduced by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>. Stacks up to <color=#44afee>4</color> times.",
    ["BuffDes_55003791"]="While under the effect of <color=#44afee>Mystic Skill: Healing Break</color>, received and done healing are reduced by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>. Stacks up to <color=#44afee>4</color> times.",
    ["BuffDes_55003801"]="While under the effect of <color=#44afee>Mystic Skill: State Break</color>, Debuff Resistance and Debuff Duration Reduction are reduced by <color=#44afee>%s</color>. Stacks up to <color=#44afee>4</color> times.",
    ["BuffDes_55003811"]="While under the effect of <color=#44afee>Ultmate Skill: Final Break</color>, Final Damage Bonus and Final DMG Reduction are reduced by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>. Stacks up to <color=#44afee>4</color> times.",
    ["BuffDes_55003821"]="While under the effect of <color=#44afee>Ultimate Skill: Buff Break</color>, Final PVP Physical Damage Bonus and Final PVP Magic Damage Bonus are decreased by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> each. Stacks up to <color=#44afee>4</color> times.",
    ["BuffDes_55003831"]="While under the effect of <color=#44afee>Ultimate Skill: Reduction Break</color>, Final PVP Physical Damage Reduction and Final PVP Magic Damage Reduction are decreased by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> each. Stacks up to <color=#44afee>4</color> times.",
    ["BuffDes_55003841"]="While under the effect of <color=#44afee>Ultimate Skill: State Break</color>, PVP Debuff Duration Reduction and PVP Debuff Resistance are reduced by <color=#44afee>%s</color>. Stacks up to <color=#44afee>4</color> times.",
    ["BuffDes_55003911"]="While under the effect of <color=#44afee>Mystic Skill: Attack Speed Restriction</color>, Final Attack Speed is decreased by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_55003921"]="While under the effect of <color=#44afee>Mystic Skill: Haste Restriction</color>, Final Haste is decreased by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_55003931"]="While under the effect of <color=#44afee>Mystic Skill: HP Restriction</color>, HP Regen, HP Regen per 5 seconds, HP restored by potions, and Heal Effectiveness are decreased by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> each.",
    ["BuffDes_55003941"]="While under the effect of <color=#44afee>Mystic Skill: SP Restriction</color>, SP Regen, SP Regen per 5 seconds, and SP restored by potions are decreased by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> each.",
    ["BuffDes_55004071"]="While under the effect of <color=#44afee>Wolf Cry</color>, Final Physical Damage Reduction and Final Magic Damage Reduction are decreased by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> each.",
    ["BuffDes_55004081"]="While under the effect of <color=#44afee>Wolf Howl</color>, PVP Final Physical Damage Reduction and PVP Final Magic Damage Reduction are decreased by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> each.",
    ["BuffDes_55004091"]="While under the effect of <color=#44afee>Blood Thirst</color>, Physical Lifesteal and Magic Lifesteal are increased by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> each.",
    ["BuffDes_55004101"]="While under the effect of <color=#44afee>Haematophagy</color>, recover <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> HP every second. (This is not effected by Bonus Heal Received attributes.)",
    ["BuffDes_55004155"]="In <color=#44afee>Immune</color> status, while active, immune to debuff effects (does not apply to debuffs from BOSS level monsters).",
    ["BuffDes_55004181"]="While under the effect of <color=#44afee>Moon's Aura</color>, Final Damage Bonus and Final Damage Reduction is increased by <color=#FFA500>%s%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_55004211"]="While in the <color=#7ACEFF>Carnage</color> state, your size increases by <color=#7ACEFF>30%%</color>, and your Final P.DEF and Final M.DEF are increased by <color=#7ACEFF>30%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_55004224"]="While under the effect of <color=#7ACEFF>Slow</color>, MSPD is reduced by <color=#7ACEFF>75%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_55004231"]="Each stack grants <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> bonus damage against large monsters and <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> Water Attribute Enhancement.",
    ["BuffDes_55004261"]="While under the effect of Defense Awakening, grants a shield equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of your Max HP during the duration.",
    ["BuffDes_55004276"]="While under the effect of <color=#7ACEFF>Drowsiness</color>, the target will not be able to cast any skills, attack, or move, and they will not naturally recover HP and SP. The Drowsiness state ends after taking damage equal to <color=#7ACEFF>30%%</color> of their Max HP in total.",
    ["BuffDes_55004278"]="The target enters <color=#7ACEFF>Drowsiness</color> state when the countdown ends. While active, the target will not be able to cast any skills, attack, or move, and they will not naturally recover HP and SP. The Drowsiness state ends after taking damage equal to <color=#7ACEFF>30%%</color> of their Max HP in total.",
    ["BuffDes_55004281"]="Increases Debuff Resistance by <color=#E79741>%s</color> and MSPD by <color=#E79741>2</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_55004282"]="Grants a shield equal to <color=#E79741>%s%%</color> of your Max HP.",
    ["BuffDes_55004332"]="Increases your Ghost and Neutral attributes by <color=#FFA500>%s%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_55004342"]="Each stack increases damage dealt to MVP and MINI units by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_55004351"]="While active, each stack reduces your Final DMG Reduction by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> when taking damage from the caster, stacking up to <color=#44afee>3</color> times.",
    ["BuffDes_55004361"]="While active, each stack increases your shield value by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of P.ATK, up to <color=#44afee>30%%</color> of your Max HP, stacking up to <color=#44afee>3</color> times.",
    ["BuffDes_55004371"]="While active, damage received from the caster and their party members increases by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_55004391"]="While active, reduces your Final M.DMG RED by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> when taking damage from the caster.",
    ["BuffDes_55004421"]="While the buff is active, reduces <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of Final Flee and <color=#44afee>%s</color> of Debuff Resistance.",
    ["BuffDes_55004601"]="While active, having 1 stack reduces Final Anti-Crit by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>; having 2 stacks additionally reduces PVP Final P.DMG RED by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_55004604"]="While active, increases your shield value equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of the caster's P.ATK, up to <color=#44afee>30%%</color> of your Max HP, and removes 1 random control-type debuff every <color=#44afee>2</color> seconds.",
    ["BuffDes_55004632"]="While active, any cooldown increase effects (both variable and fixed) received by you are temporarily disabled.",
    ["BuffDes_55004642"]="While active, each stack reduces the highest primary stat by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_55004662"]="While active, each stack increases your Neutral Enhancement by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> and Final DMG Bonus by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_55004663"]="While active, each stack increases your Shadow Enhancement by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> and Final DMG Bonus by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_55004681"]="While active, inflicts Fortune Corrosion on the attacker when being attacked.",
    ["BuffDes_55004691"]="While active, reduces your MSPD by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> and Final DMG dealt by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_550060101"]="Affected by <color=#7ACEFF>Gravitational Storm</color>. Skills' SP costs are increased by <color=#7ACEFF>%s%%</color> within the effect's duration.",
    ["BuffDes_550060301"]="Affected by <color=#7ACEFF>Weakening Touch</color>. Max HP is decreased by <color=#7ACEFF>60%%</color> within the effect's duration.",
    ["BuffDes_550060601"]="Protected by <color=#7ACEFF>Barbed Armor</color>. Armor attribute is changed to <color=#7ACEFF>Fire</color>. Within the effect's duration, your armor reflects damage to the attacker each time you take damage.",
    ["BuffDes_550061201"]="Under <color=#7ACEFF>Guard</color> stance. Immune to <color=#7ACEFF>%s</color> ranged attacks within the effect's duration. Each time the immunity is triggered, the attacker will have their Final DMG Bonus decreased by <color=#7ACEFF>%s%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_550061202"]="Your Final DMG Bonus is reduced by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_550061401"]="Under <color=#7ACEFF>Auto Counter</color> state. Final DMG Reduction is increased by <color=#7ACEFF>%s%%</color> within the effect's duration.",
    ["BuffDes_550061701"]="Prepared to launch <color=#7ACEFF>Defense-Ignoring Attack</color>. All attacks ignore <color=#7ACEFF>%s%%</color> of the target's defense within the effect's duration.",
    ["BuffDes_550061901"]="Under <color=#7ACEFF>Anubis' Trial</color>. Body size increases by <color=#7ACEFF>20%%</color>. Within the effect's duration, your MSPD is increased, and each melee normal attack deals additional Undead Damage.",
    ["BuffDes_550062201"]="Affected by <color=#7ACEFF>Adrenaline Rush</color>. Final ASPD is increased by <color=#7ACEFF>%s%%</color> and Crit DMG Bonus increased by <color=#7ACEFF>%s%%</color> within the effect's duration.",
    ["BuffDes_550062301"]="Affected by <color=#7ACEFF>Demonic Curse</color>. Skill cooldowns are increased by <color=#7ACEFF>%s</color> seconds and cast time is increased by <color=#7ACEFF>%s</color> seconds within the effect's duration.",
    ["BuffDes_550062401"]="While under the effect of <color=#7ACEFF>Foxic Charm</color>, reduces Final DMG Bonus by <color=#7ACEFF>%s%%</color> and increases <color=#7ACEFF>%s%%</color> damage taken from the caster of this debuff.",
    ["BuffDes_550062501"]="Haunted by <color=#7ACEFF>Psychosis</color>. Suffer Ghost Damage equal to <color=#7ACEFF>%s%%</color> of your Max HP each time you use a skill.",
    ["BuffDes_55006262"]="Exposed to <color=#7ACEFF>Moonlight</color>. P.DEF and M.DEF are reduced by <color=#7ACEFF>%s%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_5501301"]="\"Let's fly! Brave Samurais who exorcise the specters!\" — Shadow Organization",
    ["BuffDes_5501302"]="\"A battle of wills! Brave Samurais who exorcise the specters!\" — Shadow Organization",
    ["BuffDes_55102011"]="Increases Poison attribute enhancement by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> while <color=#44afee>Divine: Poison Enhancement</color> is active.",
    ["BuffDes_55102021"]="Reduces Poison attribute Magic Damage taken by <color=#45afee>%s%%</color> while <color=#44afee>Divine: Poison Attribute Resistance</color> is active.",
    ["BuffDes_55102031"]="Changes weapon’s attribute to Poison and increases Poison attribute enhancement by <color=#46afee>%s%%</color> while <color=#44afee>Divine: Poison Attack</color> is active.",
    ["BuffDes_55102041"]="Changes armor’s attribute to Poison and reduces Poison attribute Magic Damage taken by <color=#47afee>%s%%</color> while <color=#44afee>Divine: Poison Attribute Armor</color> is active.",
    ["BuffDes_55102051"]="Grants immunity to Poison while <color=#44afee>Divine: Detoxify</color> is active.",
    ["BuffDes_55102151"]="Increases Ghost attribute enhancement by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> while <color=#44afee>Divine: Ghost Enhancement</color> is active.",
    ["BuffDes_55102152"]="While under the effect of <color=#44afee>Divine: Neutral Enhancement</color>, Neutral Enhancement is increased by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_55102161"]="Reduces Ghost attribute Magic Damage taken by <color=#45afee>%s%%</color> while <color=#44afee>Divine: Ghost Resistance</color> is active.",
    ["BuffDes_55102171"]="Changes weapon’s attribute to Ghost and increases Ghost attribute enhancement by <color=#46afee>%s%%</color> while <color=#44afee>Divine: Ghost Attack</color> is active.",
    ["BuffDes_55102181"]="Changes armor’s attribute to Ghost and reduces Ghost attribute Magic Damage taken by <color=#47afee>%s%%</color> while <color=#44afee>Divine: Ghost Attribute Armor</color> is active.",
    ["BuffDes_55102191"]="Reduces all damage taken by <color=#47afee>%s%%</color> (excluding Ghost attribute damage) while <color=#44afee>Divine: White Barrier</color> is active.",
    ["BuffDes_55102251"]="Increases all damage dealt by the pet and its master by <color=#47afee>%s%%</color> (excluding Ghost attribute damage) while <color=#44afee>Arcane: White Imprison</color> is active.",
    ["BuffDes_55102281"]="Reduces HP Regen, HP Regen/5s, HP potion effects, and healing received by <color=#47afee>%s%%</color> while <color=#44afee>Arcane: Napalm Beat</color> is active.",
    ["BuffDes_55102321"]="Inflicts attackers with 1 stack of Poison while <color=#44afee>Poison Skin </color> is active.",
    ["BuffDes_55102331"]="Increases Final Dodge and Final Anti-Crit by <color=#FFA500>%s%%</color> while <color=#44afee>Phantom Flash</color> is active.",
    ["BuffDes_55102361"]="Reduces HP Regen, HP Regen/5s, HP potion effects, and healing received by <color=#47afee>%s%%</color> while <color=#44afee> Fatal Wound</color> is active.",
    ["BuffDes_55102391"]="Grants immunity to all debuffs while <color=#44afee>Moonlight Prayer</color> is active (does not apply to certain Boss monster debuffs and debuffs that cannot be cleansed or are not affected by immunity), and recovers <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> Max HP per second.",
    ["BuffDes_55102411"]="Inflicts 1 stack of Frost on attackers while <color=#44afee>Ice Shield</color> is active. Each stack reduces the target’s Final Attack Speed by <color=#FFA500>%s%%</color> and Final Haste by <color=#FFA500>%s%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_55102412"]="Reduces Final Attack Speed by <color=#FFA500>%s%%</color> and Final Haste by <color=#FFA500>%s%%</color> while <color=#44afee>Frost</color> is active.",
    ["BuffDes_55102421"]="Increases PvP Final Physical Damage Reduction and PvP Final Magic Damage Reduction by <color=#FFA500>%s%%</color> while <color=#44afee>Elephant Skin</color> is active.",
    ["BuffDes_55118301"]="While under the effect of <color=#7ACEFF>Weak</color>, damage taken is increased by 10% and healing received is decreased by 10% for each stack. This effect can stack up to 20 times.",
    ["BuffDes_55118302"]="Ignited by the Devil's Flame. Take damage equal to 10% of Max HP every second. The Devil's Flame can transmit to other teammates within 4 meters.",
    ["BuffDes_55130305"]="Your power is continuously being drained by Thanatos.",
    ["BuffDes_55130306"]="A kind of poison gas that erodes your mind. When reaching 20 stacks, it triggers an instant kill.",
    ["BuffDes_551600101"]="While under the effect of <color=#44afee>Divine: Holy Enhancement</color>, Holy Enhancement is increased by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_551600201"]="While under the effect of <color=#44afee>Divine: Holy Resistance</color>, damage from Holy attribute monsters is reduced by <color=#47afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_551600301"]="While under the effect of <color=#44afee>Divine: Holy Attack</color>, the Holy Attribute will be added to your weapon, increasing Holy Enhancement by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_551600401"]="While under the effect of <color=#44afee>Divine: Holy Armor</color>, the Holy Attribute is added to your Armor, reducing damage from Holy attribute monsters by <color=#47afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_551600501"]="While under the effect of <color=#44afee>Divine: Demon Bane</color>, the damage dealt to Demon and Undead monsters is increased by <color=#47afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_551600601"]="While under the effect of <color=#44afee>Divine: Blessing Spell</color>, grants immunity to all debuffs.",
    ["BuffDes_55177301"]="Energy usable only by robots. Can be used to cast skills after transforming into a robot, stacking up to 3 times.",
    ["BuffDes_55230306"]="Precious yet risky Essence Energy! You have 30 seconds to destroy Vesper's Shield or a huge explosion will occur!",
    ["BuffDes_55230311"]="Imprisoned in the crystal (unable to move, use skills or items, or recover HP and SP), suffering True DMG equal to 5% of Max HP per second.",
    ["BuffDes_55230314"]="Receives True DMG equal to 1% of Max HP per second, stackable. Every 5 stacks grants 1 extra layer of Armor Corrosion for 20 seconds.",
    ["BuffDes_55230316"]="Reduces P.DEF & M.DEF by 20%, stackable.",
    ["BuffDes_55245305"]="When the effect ends, the target takes 4 rounds of True DMG equal to 30%/30%/30%/150% of Max HP.",
    ["BuffDes_55245308"]="Disable movements, normal attacks, and HP/SP regeneration. Can be removed by dispelling skills.",
    ["BuffDes_55245309"]="Final ASPD -30%, Final Haste -3%, Fixed Cooldown +0.5s, Final DMG Reduction -25%. Stacks up to 10 times.",
    ["BuffDes_55245311"]="Imprisoned in the ice crystal (unable to move, use skills or items, or recover HP and SP). Someone break me out!",
    ["BuffDes_55245312"]="Disable Movement, Normal Attack, Skill, HP Regeneration, SP regeneration",
    ["BuffDes_55248302"]="Receives the Frostbite effect, changes ATK, and loses HP every second. One Stack: Lose HP every second—Normal: 0.4%, Hard: 0.8%, Nightmare, and Master: 2%. Two Stacks: Reduces ATK by 20%; loses 10% HP every second. Three Stacks: Reduces ATK by 30%; loses 40% HP every second. Four Stacks: Reduces ATK by 50%; loses 50% HP every second. Five Stacks: Reduces ATK by 10%; loses 60% HP every second. Six Stacks: Reduces ATK by 20%; loses 90% HP every second.",
    ["BuffDes_55249303"]="Receives the Pure Spirit effect, reduces ATK, and loses HP every second. One Stack: Reduces ATK by 5%; loses 5% HP every second. Two Stacks: Reduces ATK by 10%; loses 10% HP every second. Three Stacks: Reduces ATK by 15%; loses 15% HP every second. Four Stacks: Reduces ATK by 20%; loses 20% HP every second. Five Stacks: Disables attacks; loses 30% HP every second.",
    ["BuffDes_55249305"]="Gains the Pure Spirit effect, preventing nearby party members from being affected by the Lustful Beam effect.",
    ["BuffDes_552600301"]="While under the effect of <color=#44afee>Mystic Skill: Duple Light</color>, deals <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> Adaptive Holy DMG every second to enemies within a 3-meter range.",
    ["BuffDes_55278303"]="P.ATK +100% and M.ATK +100% for 30 minutes. Non-stackable, will not disappear upon death, and will be cleared when switching scenes.",
    ["BuffDes_55278304"]="Final P.DMG Bonus +100% and Final M.DMG Bonus +100% for 30 minutes. Non-stackable, will not disappear upon death, and will be cleared when switching scenes.",
    ["BuffDes_55278305"]="Final P.PEN +200%, Final M.PEN +200%, Crit DMG Bonus +400%, and Final Crit +100% for 30 minutes. Non-stackable, will not disappear upon death, and will be cleared when switching scenes.",
    ["BuffDes_55278306"]="Physical Lifesteal +30%, Magic Lifesteal +30%, Final P.DMG RED +100%, and Final M.DMG RED +100% for 30 minutes. Non-stackable, will not disappear upon death, and will be cleared when switching scenes.",
    ["BuffDes_553600201"]="While under the effect of <color=#44afee>Ultimate Skill: Signum Crucis</color>, increases Debuff Resistance by <color=#44afee>%s</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_553600301"]="While under the effect of <color=#44afee>Ultimate Skill: Duple Light</color>, deals <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> Adaptive Holy DMG every second to enemies within a 3-meter range. The damage dealt to the same enemy increases by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> each time.",
    ["BuffDes_553600401"]="While under the effect of <color=#44afee>Ultimate Skill: Magnus Exorcismus</color>, Debuff Resistance is reduced by <color=#44afee>%s</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_55406302"]="Receive blessings from citizens who are scattering beans. Physical Defense is increased by 20%.",
    ["BuffDes_55406303"]="Receive blessings from citizens who are scattering beans. Magic Defense is increased by 20%.",
    ["BuffDes_55406304"]="Receive blessings from citizens who are scattering beans. Physical Attack is increased by 20%.",
    ["BuffDes_55406305"]="Receive blessings from citizens who are scattering beans. Magic Attack is increased by 20%.",
    ["BuffDes_55481301"]="Increases Final DMG against enemy Adventurers by 30%. Unstackable.",
    ["BuffDes_55481302"]="Increases Final DMG against monsters by 30%. Unstackable.",
    ["BuffDes_55481303"]="Increases Final DMG against buildings by 30%. Unstackable.",
    ["BuffDes_55481305"]="While the buff is active, grants immunity to damage (excluding from MVP, MINI, Boss, or other execution mechanics). If a buff is applied by the 1-Star <color=#44afee>Sanctuary Spiral - Bella</color>, restores <color=#44afee>10%%</color> of Max HP per second.",
    ["BuffDes_55481306"]="Increases MSPD by 5, unstackable.",
    ["BuffDes_55481307"]="Increase Final DMG taken by 40% when under the enemy towers.",
    ["BuffDes_56144305"]="Attacking targets with over 300M HP (including shields) will deal extra damage. The higher the target's Max HP, the greater the damage dealt!",
    ["BuffDes_58030301"]="Decreases healing received by 50%.",
    ["BuffDes_58030302"]="Take Fire magic damage equal to 20% of M.ATK from the caster every second. Healing received also decreases by 50%.",
    ["BuffDes_60000032"]="Increases Final Damage Reduction by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>. Takes effect when couples form a party and are within line of sight in the same location and dimension.",
    ["BuffDes_60000042"]="Increases EXP obtained from killing monsters by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>. Takes effect when couples form a party and are within line of sight in the same location and dimension.",
    ["BuffDes_60000052"]="Increases Zeny obtained from killing monsters by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>. Takes effect when couples form a party and are within line of sight in the same location and dimension.",
    ["BuffDes_6001"]="Strength Blessing: Grants 5% Bonus Physical Damage. This buff only works in Endless Tower. Buff effects can be stacked.",
    ["BuffDes_6002"]="Magic Blessing: Grants 5% Bonus Magic Damage. This buff only works in Endless Tower. Buff effects can be stacked.",
    ["BuffDes_6003"]="Speed Blessing: Grants 5% Movement Speed. This buff only works in Endless Tower. Buff effects can be stacked.",
    ["BuffDes_6004"]="Angel Blessing: Grants resistance against the Deviling's Curse and +5% HP and SP Regen. This buff only works in Endless Tower. Buff effects can be stacked.",
    ["BuffDes_6005"]="Gain 1 stack of Angeling's Blessing for every 1 level that the average party level is higher than the level of the monsters of this floor. Bonus Damage is increased by 2% for every stack of Angeling's Blessing.",
    ["BuffDes_6006"]="Gain 1 stack of Deviling's Curse for every 1 level that the average party level is lower than the level of the monsters of this floor. Bonus Damage and Damage Reduction are decreased by 2% for every stack of Deviling's Curse.",
    ["BuffDes_6007"]="The Endless Tower is cursed by Deviling. Your HP Regen is reduced by 100%, and Potions cannot be used.\nWhen a party's average level is lower than a floor's monster level, the party will receive a stronger Curse effect and reduced regen.",
    ["BuffDes_6008"]="The Endless Tower is burned by Baphomet's flames. Your HP Regen is reduced by 100%, and potions cannot be used. When a party's average level is lower than a floor's monster level, the party will receive a stronger curse effect and reduced regen.",
    ["BuffDes_60103061"]="Reduce your Final P.DEF by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_60103101"]="Increase your damage received from the buff caster's party members by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_60103121"]="Reduce your Final P.DEF by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_60103161"]="Each stack of <color=#44afee>Judge</color> increases your damage of <color=#44afee>Grand Cross</color> by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>. Upon reaching <color=#44afee>6</color> stacks, Grand Cross has a <color=#44afee>50%%</color> chance of dealing an additional holy attribute P.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of P.ATK.",
    ["BuffDes_60105081"]="Increase the damage received from the buff caster by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_60105101"]="Increase your Final M.DMG Reduction by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_60105121"]="Each stack increases the damage of <color=#44afee>Lord of Vermilion</color> by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_60105171"]="Increase your MSPD by <color=#44afee>%s</color> and immune to <color=#44afee>Slow</color> and <color=#44afee>Immobilize</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_60105181"]="Each stack increases your Adaptive Attack by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_60106011"]="Increase your Crit DMG Bonus by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_60106021"]="Increase your Final Crit by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_60106031"]="Increase your Final Crit by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> and Crit DMG Bonus by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_60106061"]="Every 50 AGI of the caster increases their P.DMG Bonus by an additional <color=#44afee>%s</color> and their Final Crit by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_60106071"]="Increase your Crit DMG Bonus by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> and Final Hit by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_60106091"]="Increase your Final Hit by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> and P.DMG Bonus by <color=#44afee>%s</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_60106101"]="Increase your normal attack damage by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>. Consume 1 stack every time a normal attack deals damage.",
    ["BuffDes_60107041"]="Increase your Final P.PEN by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_60107091"]="Increase your P.DMG Bonus by <color=#44afee>%s</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_60107101"]="Increase your P.DMG Bonus by <color=#44afee>%s</color> and Final Hit by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_60107131"]="Increase your Final DMG Reduction by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> and MSPD by <color=#44afee>2</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_60107141"]="Increase your P.ATK by an additional <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_60107161"]="Each stack of Critical Explosion increases your Final P.PEN by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_6011"]="Every level of the blessing increases Max HP and Damage Reduction by 3%.",
    ["BuffDes_6012"]="Every level of the blessing increases the number of Tower Stones obtained by 20%.",
    ["BuffDes_6013"]="Every level of the blessing increases the chance that your next blessing will be of a higher quality by 10%.",
    ["BuffDes_6014"]="Every level of Blessing increases the chance of triggering the immortality effect by 2%. Immune to death for 3s, with a minimum of 1 HP. 100% Movement Speed increase, and 100% Lifesteal.",
    ["BuffDes_60991051"]="While the buff is active, reduces your PVP Final P.DMG RED and PVP Final M.DMG RED by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_61031010"]="Increased chance to level up Lil' Kitty's enchantment for a limited time.",
    ["BuffDes_6104"]="In the <color=#44afee>Praefatio</color> state, the shield can block damage for a max of <color=#7ACEFF>2</color> times, or <color=#7ACEFF>10%</color> of Max HP while the effect is active, and the shield is removed if either are exceeded.",
    ["BuffDes_6106"]="In the <color=#44afee>Blood Thirst</color> state, you gain <color=#44afee>100%</color> Lifesteal and <color=#44afee>100%</color> Movement Speed while the effect is active.",
    ["BuffDes_6110103"]="While under the effect of <color=#44afee>Bash II</color>'s DEF reduction, Final Physical Defense is decreased by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>. Stacks up to <color=#44afee>4</color> times.",
    ["BuffDes_6110105"]="While under the effect of <color=#44afee>Endure I</color>, Physical Reflect Damage is increased by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> and Magic Reflect Damage is increased by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>. This effect disappears when Endure is removed.",
    ["BuffDes_6110107"]="While under the effect of <color=#44afee>Endure II</color>, Physical Reflect Damage is increased by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> and Magic Reflect Damage is increased by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>. This effect disappears when Endure is removed. In addition, PVP Final Physical Damage Reduction is increased by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> and PVP Final Magic Damage Reduction is increased by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>. This effect disappears when Endure is removed.",
    ["BuffDes_6110109"]="While under the effect of <color=#44afee>Berserk I</color>, Bonus Heal Received is increased by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_6110110"]="While under the effect of <color=#44afee>Self-Ignite I</color>, Max HP is increased by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_6110111"]="While under the effect of <color=#44afee>Berserk II</color>, Bonus Heal Received is increased by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> and Physical Lifesteal is increased by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_6110112"]="While under the effect of <color=#44afee>Self-Ignite II</color>, Max HP is increased by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>, PVP Debuff Duration Reduction is increased by <color=#44afee>%s</color>, and PVP Debuff Resistance is increased by <color=#44afee>%s</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_61103161"]="While under the effect of <color=#44afee>Shadow Equipment - Rune Shield</color>, increases your Final PVP Physical Damage Reduction and Final PVP Magic Damage Reduction by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> each.",
    ["BuffDes_61103541"]="When under the effect of <color=#FFA500>Shield Charge II</color>, your Stun Resistance is reduced by <color=#FFA500>%s%%</color> and PVP Debuff Resistance is reduced by <color=#FFA500>%s</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_61103571"]="While under the effect of <color=#FFA500>Shield Reflect II</color>, your PVP Debuff Duration Reduction is reduced by <color=#FFA500>%s</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_61103591"]="When in the <color=#FFA500>Defending Aura I</color> state, your ranged Physical Damage taken is reduced by <color=#FFA500>%s%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_61103601"]="When in the <color=#FFA500>Earth Drive I</color> state, your Final Physical Damage Bonus is increased by <color=#FFA500>%s%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_61103611"]="When in the <color=#FFA500>Defending Aura II</color> state, your ranged Physical Damage taken is reduced by <color=#FFA500>%s%%</color>, and <color=#FFA500>%s%%</color> of the damage taken is converted to dealing the caster.",
    ["BuffDes_61103621"]="While in the <color=#FFA500>Earth Drive II</color> state, your PVP Final Physical Damage Bonus is increased by <color=#FFA500>%s%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_61103651"]="When in the <color=#FFA500>Devotion</color> state, your Final Damage Reduction is increased by <color=#FFA500>%s%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_61103661"]="When in the <color=#FFA500>King's Grace</color> state, your PVP Final Physical Damage Reduction is increased by <color=#FFA500>%s%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_6111"]="Lose 3% Max HP and gain 1% Bonus Damage for every level of the blessing.",
    ["BuffDes_6112"]="Every level of the blessing grants a 1% chance to inflict a target that has dealt damage to you with 1 stack of Poison for 5 seconds.",
    ["BuffDes_6113"]="Every level of the blessing increases basic resistance to abnormal statuses by 3%.",
    ["BuffDes_6114"]="Every level of Blessing increases the chance to cast Safety Wall by when using normal attacks by 1%. All members within the area are immune to melee Physical Damage for 5s, and are immune for a max of 3 times.",
    ["BuffDes_6121"]="Lose 3% Max HP and gain 2% Bonus Damage.",
    ["BuffDes_6122"]="Every level of the blessing grants a 3% chance to inflict a target that has dealt damage to you with 2 stacks of Poison for 5 seconds.",
    ["BuffDes_6123"]="Every level of the blessing increases basic resistance to abnormal statuses by 5%.",
    ["BuffDes_6124"]="Every level of Blessing increases the chance to cast Safety Wall by when using normal attacks by 1.2%. All members within the area are immune to melee Physical Damage for 5s, and are immune for a max of 3 times.",
    ["BuffDes_6130101"]="While under the effect of <color=#44afee>Battle Will I</color>, Final Physical Damage Bonus is increased by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>. Stacks up to <color=#44afee>4</color> times.",
    ["BuffDes_6130102"]="While under the effect of <color=#44afee>Sword Speed Boost I</color>, Final ASPD is increased by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_6130103"]="While under the effect of <color=#44afee>Battle Will II</color>, PVP Final Physical Damage Bonus is increased by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>. Stacks up to <color=#44afee>4</color> times.",
    ["BuffDes_6130104"]="While under the effect of <color=#44afee>Sword Speed Boost II</color>, Physical Lifesteal is increased by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>, and PVP Debuff Resistance is increased by <color=#44afee>%s</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_6130105"]="While under the effect of <color=#44afee>Aura Blade I</color>, Final Crit is increased by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> and Final Hit is increased by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_6130107"]="While under the effect of <color=#44afee>Aura Blade II</color>, Crit Damage Bonus is increased by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> and Final Hit is increased by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_6130110"]="While under the effect of <color=#44afee>Head Crush I</color>, Final Physical Damage Bonus is increased by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_6130112"]="While under the effect of <color=#44afee>Head Crush II</color>, increase the PVP Final P.DMG Bonus and PVP Final P.DEF Reduction by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> and PVP Debuff Reduction by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_6130302"]="While under the effect of <color=#44afee>Pierce I</color>'s DEF reduction, Final Physical Damage Reduction is decreased by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_6130303"]="While under the Heal Slowdown effect of <color=#44afee>Spear Stab II</color>, the healing received is decreased by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> (including the Lifesteal effect).",
    ["BuffDes_6130304"]="While under the effect of <color=#44afee>Pierce II</color>'s DEF reduction, PVP Final Physical Damage Reduction is decreased by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_6130306"]="While under the effect of <color=#44afee>Spiral Pierce I</color>, Final Physical Damage Bonus is increased by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>. Stacks up to <color=#44afee>4</color> times.",
    ["BuffDes_6130307"]="While under the effect of <color=#44afee>Spear Boomerang II</color>'s DEF reduction, Final Physical Defense is decreased by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_6130308"]="While under the effect of <color=#44afee>Spiral Pierce II</color>, PVP Final Physical Damage Bonus is increased by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>. Stacks up to <color=#44afee>4</color> times.",
    ["BuffDes_61303161"]="While in the <color=#44afee>Dark Flame</color> state, each stack increases the Final Hit by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>, the Final Crit by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>, and PVP Final P.DMG Bonus by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_61303162"]="While in the <color=#44afee>Dark Flame Sword</color> state, each normal attack that hits a target grants the party members within <color=#44afee>30</color> meters a stack of the <color=#44afee>Dark Flame</color> effect. Each stack of <color=#44afee>Dark Flame</color> increases the Final Hit by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>, the Final Crit by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>, and the PVP Final P.DMG Bonus by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>, up to <color=#44afee>12</color> stacks.",
