    ["BuffDes_66106961"]="While under the effect of <color=#44afee>Bleed</color>, receive caster's weapon attribute P.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s</color> every second for each stack. P.ATK and ASPD are reduced by <color=#7ACEFF>25%%</color>, and unable to naturally recover HP or SP.",
    ["BuffDes_66203301"]="Suspend the actions.",
    ["BuffDes_66203302"]="Transform! Ultraman Taro! Go disarm the Absolute Shield on the Golden Fortress! Disarming the shield earns you a ton of points!",
