    ["BuffDes_66304631"]="While in the <color=#44afee>Fire Upgrade</color> state, each stack of Fire Upgrade increases your Fire Attribute Enhancement by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_66304641"]="While under the effect of <color=#44afee>Corrosion</color>, your healing received during this time is reduced by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>, and you take <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> more damage from the caster's party.",
    ["BuffDes_66304651"]="Take Fire P.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of the caster's P.ATK + INT x <color=#44afee>%s</color> every second.",
    ["BuffDes_66304661"]="Deals weapon attribute P.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of P.ATK every second to enemies within <color=#44afee>5</color> meters.",
    ["BuffDes_66991031"]="While the buff is active, reduces Final ASPD, Final Haste, and MSPD by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>, <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>, and <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>, respectively.",
    ["BuffDes_6699901"]="While under the effect of <color=#44afee>Crazy Uproar</color>, Final Damage Bonus is additionally increased by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> and Final Damage Reduction is additionally increased by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_66999511"]="While marked with <color=#44afee>Coordinated Combat</color>, when you are attacked by the caster of the mark, you will additionally take weapon attribute P.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of the caster's P.ATK.",
    ["BuffDes_66999521"]="Increases MSPD by <color=#44afee>%s</color> and P.ATK by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
