    ["BuffDes_67111131"]="Each stack makes targets hit by the Gatling take an additional <color=#44afee>0.5%</color> damage from the shooter and their party members.",
    ["BuffDes_67111151"]="Reduces your P.DEF by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> but increases your P.DMG by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_67991021"]="While the buff is active, increases damage dealt to monsters by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
