    ["BuffDes_67991061"]="While the buff is active, increases your MSPD by <color=#44afee>%s</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_68001011"]="Grants a shield equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of your Max HP.",
    ["BuffDes_68314011"]="Gains a shield worth <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of your Max HP x the level of <color=#44afee>Suiton - Wave</color>. You now carry a Water attribute armor during the shielded period.",
    ["BuffDes_68314021"]="Reduce the M.DEF percentage of all targets within the <color=#44afee>vortex</color> by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>. Stacks up to <color=#44afee>3</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_68314031"]="Gains a shield worth <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of your Max HP x the level of <color=#44afee>Suiton - Wave</color> and <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> Freeze Resistance. You now carry a Water attribute armor during the shielded period.",
    ["BuffDes_68314041"]="Reduce the M.DEF percentage of all targets within the <color=#44afee>vortex</color> by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>. Stacks up to <color=#44afee>3</color>. After reaching <color=#44afee>3</color> stacks, the target will be frozen.",
    ["BuffDes_68314051"]="Each stack increases your M.DMG Reflection by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_68314061"]="The explosion effect also ignites up to <color=#44afee>5</color> other targets within range, dealing Fire attribute M.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of the M.ATK every second to the target and surrounding targets within <color=#44afee>4</color> meters.",
    ["BuffDes_68314071"]="Each time an enemy deals damage to you, the enemy receives Fire attribute M.DMG equal to (<color=#44afee>%s%%</color> x the stacks of <color=#44afee>Backfire</color>) of the M.ATK.",
    ["BuffDes_68314081"]="The explosion effect also ignites up to <color=#44afee>5</color> other targets within range, dealing Fire attribute M.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of the M.ATK every second to the target and surrounding targets within <color=#44afee>4</color> meters. If there's only <color=#44afee>1</color> target within range, the target receives extra Fire attribute M.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of the M.ATK.",
    ["BuffDes_68314101"]="Reduces Final Haste by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_68314121"]="Increases all skills' fixed cooldown by <color=#44afee>%s</color> second(s).",
    ["BuffDes_68314131"]="Provoke the wrath of the fire god! The enhanced version of the Kajinton - Kagutsuchi can be used directly.",
    ["BuffDes_68314141"]="Reduces Slow Resistance by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_68315011"]="Increase your Final P.DMG Bonus by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>. Stacks up to <color=#44afee>3</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_68315031"]="Deals Neutral DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of P.ATK every second. Stacks up to <color=#44afee>3</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_68315042"]="Increases your MSPD by <color=#44afee>%s</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_68315051"]="Hitting a target increases your Shadow and Neutral attributes by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>. Stacks up to <color=#44afee>5</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_68315061"]="Each stack blocks off P.DMG <color=#44afee>once</color>. Stacks up to 20 times.",
    ["BuffDes_68315081"]="If your skills or normal attacks deal Neutral attribute P.DMG, they now carry an additional Weapon attribute P.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of P.ATK that ignores the target's defense. This damage is increased by <color=#44afee>100%%</color> to targets in the Bleed state.",
    ["BuffDes_68315111"]="Each stack increases your Physical Lifesteal by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>. Stacks up to 20 times.",
    ["BuffDes_68315131"]="Each stack reduces your Max HP by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>. Stacks up to 10 times.",
    ["BuffDes_68315141"]="Reduces the fixed cooldown by <color=#44afee>%s</color> second(s).",
    ["BuffDes_68315151"]="Restores <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of your Max HP every second.",
    ["BuffDes_6900"]="Greatly increases Size, Max HP, P.ATK, and M.ATK.\nSlightly decreases ASPD and MSPD.\nThis effect can stack up to 5 times. The effect of Chunky Poring Candy and the effect of Deviruchi Candy cannot be stacked.",
    ["BuffDes_69001031"]="Each stack increases your PVP Final M.DMG Bonus by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>. Stacks up to 10.",
    ["BuffDes_69001061"]="Each stack increases your PVP Final P.DMG Bonus by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>. Stacks up to 10.",
    ["BuffDes_6901"]="Decreases Size and greatly increases Flee.\nSlightly increases ASPD and MSPD.\nThis effect can stack up to 5 times. The effect of Deviruchi Candy and the effect of Chunky Poring Candy cannot be stacked.",
    ["BuffDes_6902"]="Enter the Hiding state. Crit Rate is greatly increased for the duration of the effect.",
    ["BuffDes_6903"]="Enter Fervor state. Deals bonus damage to large monsters while taking extra damage for the duration of the effect.",
    ["BuffDes_6904"]="Ate Golden Rabbit Sweet Dumplings. Happy Lantern Festival!\nYou will develop a bond with someone who has eaten Silver Rabbit Sweet Dumplings when you are near them.\nStrength, Agility, Vitality, Intelligence, Dexterity and Luck +5 respectively.",
    ["BuffDes_6905"]="Ate Silver Rabbit Sweet Dumplings. Happy Lantern Festival!\nYou will develop a bond with someone who has eaten Golden Rabbit Sweet Dumplings when you are near them.\nStrength, Agility, Vitality, Intelligence, Dexterity and Luck +5 respectively.",
    ["BuffDes_6906"]="Successfully obtained Jade Rabbit's Blessing!\nStrength, Agility, Vitality, Intelligence, Dexterity and Luck +20 respectively.",
    ["BuffDes_69105031"]="While active, reduces your Earth Resistance by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_69105032"]="While active, reduces your Fire Resistance by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_69105033"]="While active, reduces your Water Resistance by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
