    ["BuffDes_69105101"]="While active, reduces your PVP Final P.DMG RED by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> and PVP Final M.DMG RED by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_69105111"]="While active, increases your Final P.DMG Bonus by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> and Final M.DMG Bonus by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_69105112"]="While active, increases your Final P.DMG RED by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> and Final M.DMG RED by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_69105121"]="While active, increases your PVP Final P.DMG Bonus by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> and PVP Final M.DMG Bonus by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_69105122"]="While active, increases your PVP Final P.DMG RED by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> and PVP Final M.DMG RED by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_69105171"]="While active, increases your Earth Resistance by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_69105172"]="While active, increases your Fire Resistance by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_69105173"]="While active, increases your Water Resistance by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_69105174"]="While active, increases your Wind Resistance by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_69105191"]="While active, you gain a part of the <color=#44afee>Heavenly Spirits</color> effect.",
    ["BuffDes_69105231"]="While active, increases HP by <color=#44afee>%s</color>, Final P.DEF / Final M.DEF by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>, and Final P.DMG RED / Final M.DMG RED by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_6911"]="Ate Golden Jar Cookies. Happy White Valentine’s Day!\nYou will develop a bond with someone who has eaten Silver Jar Cookies when you are near them.\nStrength, Agility, and Vitality +20 respectively.",
    ["BuffDes_6912"]="Ate Silver Jar Cookies. Happy White Valentine’s Day!\nYou will develop a bond with someone who has eaten Golden Jar Cookies when you are near them.\nIntelligence, Dexterity, and Luck +20 respectively.",
    ["BuffDes_6913"]="Successfully obtained Cupid's Blessing!\nFinal P.DMG Bonus and Final M.DMG Bonus +2%%, respectively, which can be stacked up to 10 times.",
    ["BuffDes_6920"]="While in the Drunk state, you feel lightheaded, and your vision gets blurry. Everything you see is disoriented.",
    ["BuffDes_69308101"]="While active, increases your MSPD by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_69308151"]="While active, increases your MSPD by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_69308201"]="While active, reduces your damage by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_69316011"]="Each stack increases Final P.DMG Bonus by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_69316041"]="Permanently blinded, Final Hit Rate is reduced by <color=#7ACEFF>30%%</color>, and Final Flee is reduced by <color=#7ACEFF>30%%</color> (Final Dodge Rate cannot go below 0%).\nFinal DMG Bonus is increased by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_69316051"]="Each stack increases PVP Final P.DMG Bonus by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_69316091"]="Reduces Stun Resistance by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_69316131"]="Increases Fire Enhancement and Resistance by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_69316141"]="Take Fire attribute P.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of P.ATK.",
    ["BuffDes_69316151"]="Increases Neutral Enhancement by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_69316152"]="Increases Fire Enhancement by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_69316153"]="Increases Water Enhancement by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_69316154"]="Increases Wind Enhancement by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_69316155"]="Increases Earth Enhancement by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_69316156"]="Increases Holy Enhancement by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_69316157"]="Increases Shadow Enhancement by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_69316158"]="Increases Ghost Enhancement by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_69316159"]="Increases Undead Enhancement by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_69316161"]="While under the effect of <color=#7ACEFF>Hiding</color>, become undetectable to enemies. Actively attacking, taking damage, or being affected by anti-stealth 7 times will cancel the Hiding effect.",
    ["BuffDes_69316162"]="Increases the damage of Ultimate Kick by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_70001011"]="Each stack increases Final P.DMG Bonus by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_70001021"]="Grants a shield equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of P.ATK.",
    ["BuffDes_70001031"]="Increases Final DMG Bonus by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_7001"]="Healing skills cannot be used on yourself",
    ["BuffDes_7002"]="The next time you kill an MVP or MINI, the total damage dealt by your party is doubled.",
    ["BuffDes_7003"]="In Arena Mode, the effects of some skills will be weakened.",
    ["BuffDes_7004"]="In Arena Mode, the effects of some skills will be weakened.",
    ["BuffDes_71011310"]="While under the effect of <color=#7ACEFF>Healing Ban</color>, the healing, HP recovery, and Lifesteal effects are reduced. And take a certain amount of Poison attribute True DMG every second.",
    ["BuffDes_71011311"]="Unable to look into distance due to restricted vision.",
    ["BuffDes_71011313"]="Takes a certain amount of Fire attribute True DMG every second, stacking up to 5 times.",
    ["BuffDes_71011314"]="Reduces MSPD/ASPD by <color=#7ACEFF>10%%</color>, stacking up to 5 times. Upon reaching 5 stacks, an extra 5-second Freeze effect is triggered (suspending movement, normal attacks, and skill usage).",
    ["BuffDes_71011315"]="Reduces Final DMG by <color=#7ACEFF>5%%</color>, stacking up to 5 times. Upon reaching 5 stacks, an extra 5-second Prohibition effect is triggered (suspending normal attacks and skill usage).",
    ["BuffDes_71011324"]="Unable to move, use normal attacks or skills, and immune to Chill.",
    ["BuffDes_71011325"]="Unable to use normal attacks or skills.",
    ["BuffDes_71011334"]="Reduces MSPD/ASPD by <color=#7ACEFF>8.5%%</color>, stacking up to 6 times.",
    ["BuffDes_71011344"]="Reduces MSPD/ASPD by <color=#7ACEFF>7%%</color>, stacking up to 7 times.",
    ["BuffDes_71011381"]="Immune to Attachable debuffs.",
    ["BuffDes_71012310"]="Inflicts interruption and immobilization effects continuously.",
    ["BuffDes_71012312"]="Take a certain amount of Shadow attribute True DMG every second until time runs out or the connection is broken.",
    ["BuffDes_71012314"]="Unable to resist monsters' magic, forced to move towards it, and unable to use normal attacks or skills.",
    ["BuffDes_71012380"]="HP won't fall below 1.",
    ["BuffDes_71013303"]="While under the effect of <color=#7ACEFF>Slow</color>, MSPD is decreased by <color=#7ACEFF>50%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_71013318"]="Quickly approach the negative charge to break the connection; otherwise, you will take a large amount of True DMG when the connection ends!",
    ["BuffDes_71013319"]="Quickly approach the positive charge to break the connection; otherwise, you will take a large amount of True DMG when the connection ends!",
    ["BuffDes_71013325"]="<color=#7ACEFF>P.DEF is reduced</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_71013326"]="<color=#7ACEFF>M.DEF is reduced</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_71015306"]="While under the effect of <color=#7ACEFF>Healing Ban</color>, the healing, HP recovery, and Lifesteal effects are reduced.",
    ["BuffDes_71015331"]="While under the effect of <color=#7ACEFF>Slow</color>, MSPD is reduced by <color=#7ACEFF>20%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_71096301"]="Command Flag - Increases damage dealt by 10%.",
    ["BuffDes_71096302"]="Command Flag - Decreases damage taken by 10%.",
    ["BuffDes_71096303"]="Command Flag - Increases healing received by 10%.",
    ["BuffDes_74012300"]="Reduces MSPD by <color=#44afee>50%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_74012312"]="Restores HP equal to <color=#44afee>97%%</color> of the caster's P.ATK + caster's INT x <color=#44afee>45</color> every second.",
    ["BuffDes_74013301"]="Increases P.DEF and M.DEF by <color=#44afee>50%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_74013311"]="The shield generated from <color=#44afee>DEF</color> can block damage equal to <color=#44afee>40%%</color> of the caster's Max HP.",
    ["BuffDes_74015301"]="While <color=#44afee>marked</color> by Filir, take additional damage according to your lost HP when attacked by Filir. The damage taken is increased by <color=#44afee>4%%</color> for every <color=#44afee>1%%</color> HP lost.",
    ["BuffDes_74015302"]="While in the <color=#44afee>Fleet Move</color> state, each stack increases Final ASPD by <color=#44afee>10%%</color> and ATK by <color=#44afee>2%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_8001"]="A blessing has been received from <color=#7ACEFF>Lil' Kitty</color>. There is a chance that enchantment items will not be consumed when enchanting or refining. (Can only be used with <color=#7ACEFF>Lil' Kitty</color>. Disappears after taking effect <color=#7ACEFF>%s</color> times.)",
