    ["BuffDes_8141"]="Received blessing from <color=#7ACEFF>Magic Furnace</color>. There is a chance that refinement items will not be consumed when refining Purple and Orange Off-hand Weapons. (Disappears after taking effect <color=#7ACEFF>%s</color> times)",
