    ["BuffDes_8143"]="Received blessing from <color=#7ACEFF>Magic Furnace</color>. There is a chance that refinement items will not be consumed when refining Purple and Orange Daggers. (Disappears after taking effect <color=#7ACEFF>%s</color> times)",
    ["BuffDes_8144"]="Received blessing from <color=#7ACEFF>Magic Furnace</color>, slightly increasing the success rate when refining Purple and Orange Daggers. (Disappears after <color=#7ACEFF>%s</color> refinements.)",
    ["BuffDes_8145"]="Received blessing from <color=#7ACEFF>Magic Furnace</color>. There is a chance that refinement items will not be consumed when refining Purple and Orange Armors. (Disappears after taking effect <color=#7ACEFF>%s</color> times)",
    ["BuffDes_8146"]="Received blessing from <color=#7ACEFF>Magic Furnace</color>, slightly increasing the success rate when refining Purple and Orange Armors. (Disappears after <color=#7ACEFF>%s</color> refinements.)",
    ["BuffDes_8147"]="Received blessing from <color=#7ACEFF>Magic Furnace</color>. There is a chance that refinement items will not be consumed when refining Purple and Orange Cloaks. (Disappears after taking effect <color=#7ACEFF>%s</color> times)",
    ["BuffDes_8148"]="Received blessing from <color=#7ACEFF>Magic Furnace</color>, slightly increasing the success rate when refining Purple and Orange Cloaks. (Disappears after <color=#7ACEFF>%s</color> refinements.)",
    ["BuffDes_8149"]="Received blessing from <color=#7ACEFF>Magic Furnace</color>. There is a chance that refinement items will not be consumed when refining Purple and Orange Shoes. (Disappears after taking effect <color=#7ACEFF>%s</color> times)",
    ["BuffDes_8150"]="Received blessing from <color=#7ACEFF>Magic Furnace</color>, slightly increasing the success rate when refining Purple and Orange Shoes. (Disappears after <color=#7ACEFF>%s</color> refinements.)",
    ["BuffDes_81500101"]="Each stack increases the P.DMG received from the buff caster by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_81500203"]="Each stack increases your Fire Enhancement by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_81500301"]="Each stack increases the M.DMG received from the buff caster by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> while reducing M.DMG dealt to them by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_81500701"]="Each stack increases damage dealt by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> while reducing damage taken by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_81500902"]="Your damage dealt is increased by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>, your Hiding duration lasts <color=#44afee>%s</color> second(s) longer, and you can spot hidden targets.",
    ["BuffDes_81501103"]="Each stack increases your Neutral Enhancement by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_81501203"]="Each stack increases your Fire Enhancement by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_81501601"]="Gains a shield equal to M.ATK x <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> (scales with HP percentage); while the shield is active, casting a skill also deals weapon attribute M.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of M.ATK.",
    ["BuffDes_81501701"]="Each stack increases your Fire Enhancement by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_81501801"]="Every <color=#44afee>40</color> normal attacks, your next move (skill or normal attack) within 5 seconds deals extra weapon attribute DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of P.ATK and stuns the target for 2 seconds. Triggers once every 6 seconds.",
    ["BuffDes_81502002"]="All skill damage is increased by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> for 10 seconds or until reloading.",
    ["BuffDes_81502301"]="Increases Final DMG Bonus by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> and MSPD by <color=#44afee>3%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_81502502"]="Your damage dealt is increased by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>, your Hiding duration lasts <color=#44afee>%s</color> second(s) longer, and you can spot hidden targets.",
    ["BuffDes_81502801"]="Each stack increases your Earth Resistance by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_81502802"]="Each stack increases your Water Resistance by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_81502803"]="Each stack increases your Fire Resistance by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_81502804"]="Each stack increases your Wind Resistance by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_81502901"]="Blocks damage equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of Max HP.",
    ["BuffDes_81503001"]="Increases your Final DMG Bonus by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_81503102"]="Each time a skill is cast, deals an additional Neutral attribute P.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of P.ATK to the target within 12 meters.",
    ["BuffDes_81503201"]="While having the <color=#7ACEFF>Kyrie Eleison</color> effect, block damage with a Physical Shield. The Physical Shield can block at most <color=#7ACEFF>10</color> times of damage or up to <color=#7ACEFF>30%%</color> of HP. Increases the Final M.DMG Bonus by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_81503301"]="Each stack increases your Final DMG Bonus by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_81503501"]="While having the <color=#7ACEFF>Kyrie Eleison</color> effect, block damage with a Physical Shield. The Physical Shield can block at most <color=#7ACEFF>10</color> times of damage or up to <color=#7ACEFF>30%%</color> of HP. Increases the Final P.DMG Bonus by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_815036005"]="Reduces P.DMG Reflection and M.DMG Reflection by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_815036006"]="Increases Physical Lifesteal and Magic Lifesteal by <color=#45afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_815036007"]="Increases the highest main attribute by <color=#46afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_815036008"]="Reduces HP Regen/5s by <color=#47afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_8151"]="Received blessing from <color=#7ACEFF>Magic Furnace</color>. There is a chance that refinement items will not be consumed when refining Purple and Orange Accessories. (Disappears after taking effect <color=#7ACEFF>%s</color> times)",
    ["BuffDes_8152"]="Received blessing from <color=#7ACEFF>Magic Furnace</color>, slightly increasing the success rate when refining Purple and Orange Accessories. (Disappears after <color=#7ACEFF>%s</color> refinements.)",
    ["BuffDes_8153"]="Received blessing from <color=#7ACEFF>Magic Furnace</color>. There is a chance that refinement items will not be consumed when refining Purple and Orange Talismans. (Disappears after taking effect <color=#7ACEFF>%s</color> times)",
    ["BuffDes_8154"]="Received blessing from <color=#7ACEFF>Magic Furnace</color>, slightly increasing the success rate when refining Purple and Orange Talismans. (Disappears after <color=#7ACEFF>%s</color> refinements.)",
    ["BuffDes_81602101"]="While the buff is active, each stack increases your Neutral Enhancement by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_81602102"]="While the buff is active, each stack increases your Fire Enhancement by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_81602103"]="While the buff is active, each stack increases your Final P.DMG Bonus by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_81602104"]="While the buff is active, each stack increases your Final M.DMG Bonus by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_81602105"]="While the buff is active, increases your DMG Bonus by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_81602106"]="While the buff is active, increases your DMG Bonus by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> and Debuff Penetration by <color=#44afee>%s</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_81602107"]="While the buff is active, each stack increases your Poison Enhancement by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_81602108"]="While the buff is active, each stack increases your Poison Enhancement by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_81602109"]="While the buff is active, each stack increases your Ghost Enhancement by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_81602110"]="While the buff is active, each stack increases your Wind Enhancement by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
