    ["BuffDes_81602112"]="While the buff is active, each stack increases your Final P.DMG Bonus by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_81602113"]="While the buff is active, each stack increases your Final P.DMG Bonus by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_81602114"]="While the buff is active, increases your DMG Bonus by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_81602115"]="While the buff is active, increases your DMG Bonus by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> and Debuff Penetration by <color=#44afee>%s</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_81602116"]="While the buff is active, increases your DMG Bonus by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_81602117"]="While the buff is active, increases your DMG Bonus by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> and Debuff Penetration by <color=#44afee>%s</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_81602118"]="While the buff is active, your Final DMG is reduced by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> and Final DMG Bonus is increased by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_81602119"]="While the buff is active, each stack increases your Fire Enhancement by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_81602120"]="While the buff is active, each stack increases your Holy Enhancement by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_81602121"]="While the buff is active, each stack increases your Final M.DMG Bonus by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_81602122"]="While the buff is active, each stack increases your Final P.DMG Bonus by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_81602123"]="While the buff is active, each stack increases your Final P.DMG Bonus by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_81602124"]="While the buff is active, each stack increases your Ghost Enhancement by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_81602125"]="While the buff is active, each stack increases your Final P.DMG Bonus by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_81602126"]="While the buff is active, each stack increases your Final P.DMG Bonus by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_81602127"]="While the buff is active, each stack increases your Final P.DMG Bonus by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_81602153"]="While the buff is active, your Final DMG is reduced by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> and Final DMG Bonus is increased by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_8201"]="While having Arielle's Blessing, your Max HP increases by <color=#7ACEFF>5%</color>. (Max 5,000 HP.)",
    ["BuffDes_8202"]="While having Arielle's Blessing, your haste increases by <color=#7ACEFF>2%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_8203"]="While having Arielle's Blessing, your ASPD increases by <color=#7ACEFF>5%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_8204"]="While having Arielle's Blessing, your M.ATK and ATK increase by <color=#7ACEFF>1%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_8205"]="While having Arielle's Blessing, your DEF and M.DEF increase by <color=#7ACEFF>2%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_8206"]="While having Arielle's Blessing, your STR increases by <color=#7ACEFF>5%</color>. (Max 50 STR.)",
    ["BuffDes_82060000"]="While under the effect of <color=#7ACEFF>Vulnerable</color>, damage received from the caster is increased by <color=#7ACEFF>%s%%</color>. Can be stacked up to <color=#7ACEFF>5</color> times.",
    ["BuffDes_8207"]="While having Arielle's Blessing, your AGI increases by <color=#7ACEFF>5%</color>. (Max 50 AGI.)",
    ["BuffDes_82070000"]="While under the effect of <color=#44afee>Dark Invasion</color>, Final PVP Physical Damage Bonus and Final PVP Magic Damage Bonus are increased by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> each. Stacks up to <color=#44afee>%s</color> times.",
    ["BuffDes_8208"]="While having Arielle's Blessing, your VIT increases by <color=#7ACEFF>5%</color>. (Max 50 VIT.)",
    ["BuffDes_82082004"]="While under the effect of <color=#44afee>JJJ</color>, Final Damage Bonus is increased by <color=#FFA500>%s%%</color>. Can be stacked.",
    ["BuffDes_82082005"]="While under the effect of <color=#44afee>QQQ</color>, Final Damage Reduction is increased by <color=#FFA500>%s%%</color>. Can be stacked.",
    ["BuffDes_82082006"]="While under the effect of <color=#44afee>KKK</color>, Debuff Duration Reduction and Debuff Resistance are increased by <color=#FFA500>%s</color>. Can be stacked.",
    ["BuffDes_82082007"]="Grants Damage Resistance equal to <color=#FFA500>%s%%</color> Max HP while under the effect of <color=#44afee>JQK</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_8209"]="While having Arielle's Blessing, your INT increases by <color=#7ACEFF>5%</color>. (Max 50 INT.)",
    ["BuffDes_820902001"]="While under the effect of <color=#44afee>Sharp</color>, Final Damage Bonus and Bonus Heal are increased by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>. Stacks up to 3 times.",
    ["BuffDes_820902002"]="While under the effect of <color=#44afee>Tough Resilience</color>, damage or healing produced by the next active attack is increased by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_8210"]="While having Arielle's Blessing, your DEX increases by <color=#7ACEFF>5%</color>. (Max 50 DEX.)",
    ["BuffDes_82102001"]="While under the effect of Haze of the Underworld, each stack of Haze of the Underworld increases normal attack damage by <color=#7ACEFF>%s%%</color> and Final Hit by <color=#7ACEFF>%s%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_82102003"]="While active, each stack increases your PVP Final P.DMG Bonus and PVP Final M.DMG Bonus by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_8211"]="While having Arielle's Blessing, your LUK increases by <color=#7ACEFF>5%</color>. (Max 50 LUK.)",
    ["BuffDes_82273"]="While active, increases your MSPD by <color=#44afee>20%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_83020000"]="While under the effect of <color=#7ACEFF>Ancient Terror</color>, you lose <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of Max HP every second.",
    ["BuffDes_85020000"]="In status <color=#7ACEFF>Moonlight Gift</color>, cannot be debuffed, and regen <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> MAX HP every second. (In addition to some debuffs from BOSS and debuffs or resistances that can't be removed)",
    ["BuffDes_86000000"]="While <color=#7ACEFF>Quickened</color>, Movement Speed will be increased by <color=#7ACEFF>%s%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_86003000"]="While under the effect of <color=#44afee>CRIT DMG Bonus</color>, CRIT DMG Bonus is increased by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_86004001"]="Enter the state of <color=#44afee>Final Damage Bonus</color>, and for the duration of this state, increase Final Damage Bonus by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>, up to <color=#44afee>6</color> stacks.",
    ["BuffDes_86005000"]="While under the effect of <color=#44afee>Shield</color>, gain a shield that can block damage equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of Max HP.",
    ["BuffDes_88001000"]="Enter the state of <color=#44afee>Marks</color>, and for the duration of this state, casting skills constantly can grant marks. Once you have <color=#44afee>5</color> marks, damage of your active skills increase by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> for <color=#44afee>4</color>s.",
    ["BuffDes_88001001"]="Enter the state of <color=#44afee>Damage Increase</color>, and for the duration of this state, damage of your active skills increase by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_88004000"]="While under the effect of <color=#44afee>Final DMG Reduction</color>, Final DMG Reduction is increased by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_89003000"]="While <color=#44afee>PVP Damage Reduction Down is decreased</color>, Final PVP Physical Damage Reduction is decreased by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>. Stacks up to <color=#44afee>12</color> times.",
    ["BuffDes_89004001"]="While under the effect of <color=#44afee>Debuff Immunity</color>, during the effect's duration, cannot be inflicted with debuff statuses. (This does not include debuffs inflicted by Boss monsters.) Also increases PVP Final Physical Damage Reduction and PVP Final Magic Damage Reduction by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> each.",
    ["BuffDes_89005000"]="While under the effect of <color=#44afee>PVP Added Damage Up</color>, Final PVP Physical Damage Bonus and Final PVP Magic Damage Bonus are increased by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> each. Stacks up to <color=#44afee>4</color> times.",
    ["BuffDes_9601201"]="Increases MSPD by <color=#44afee>12</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_9601202"]="Grants immunity to ground-based DoT while continuously building up <color=#44afee>Starpower</color> stacks.",
    ["BuffDes_9601203"]="Your next attack consumes all your <color=#44afee>Starpower</color> stacks to deal True DMG equal to <color=#44afee>2%%</color> x <color=#44afee>Starpower</color> stacks.",
    ["BuffDes_9601205"]="Unable to cast <color=#44afee>Dragon Nova - Assault</color> during the effective period.",
    ["BuffDes_9602201"]="Reduces your Final ASPD by <color=#44afee>500%%</color> and increases the fixed cooldown of class skills by <color=#44afee>3</color> seconds.",
    ["BuffDes_9602202"]="Unable to cast <color=#44afee>Soulbound Nightfall - Elegy</color> during the effective period.",
    ["BuffDes_9602204"]="Increases damage dealt to monster by <color=#44afee>40%%</color> during the effective period.",
    ["BuffDes_9603201"]="Increases damage received by <color=#44afee>25%%</color> during the effective period.",
    ["BuffDes_9603202"]="Unable to cast <color=#44afee>Flashbeak - Starpiercer</color> during the effective period.",
    ["BuffDes_9604201"]="Gains Endure during the effective period, converting <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of damage received into a shield.",
    ["BuffDes_9604202"]="Blocks damage during the effective period.",
    ["BuffDes_9605201"]="While the buff is active, MSPD bonus is temporarily unavailable. Every <color=#44afee>5</color> hits causes the spore to absorb energy and grow even larger (excluding <color=#44afee>Fungal Adhesive</color>'s periodic damage). After growing <color=#44afee>4</color> times, <color=#44afee>Fungal Adhesive</color> is removed and replaced with <color=#44afee>Suffocating Cocoon</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_9605202"]="While the buff is active, moving and using normal attacks or skills are prevented. If you die while having the buff, all members in the enemy party gain <color=#44afee>Withered Bloom</color> for <color=#44afee>45</color> seconds.",
    ["BuffDes_9605207"]="While the buff is active, <color=#44afee>Fungal Adhesive - Cocoon</color> cannot be cast.",
    ["BuffDes_9606201"]="While the buff is active, if any party member takes a hit that the final damage exceeds their Max HP by <color=#44afee>10%</color>, the damage received gets split evenly among other party members who have at least <color=#44afee>40%</color> HP and are under the <color=#44afee>Heartlink Shield</color> effect.",
    ["BuffDes_9606202"]="While the buff is active, the Adventurer gains a certain amount of shield.",
    ["BuffDes_9606205"]="While the buff is active, reduces the damage dealt to the Arrow of Fate caster by <color=#44afee>30%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_9606206"]="While the buff is active, increases the damage received from the Arrow of Fate caster by <color=#44afee>15%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_9606207"]="While the buff is active, Heartlink Shield - Punish becomes unavailable.",
    ["BuffDes_9607202"]="While the buff is active, there's a certain chance to deal extra damage to the target when releasing normal attacks or skills.",
    ["BuffDes_9607203"]="Whenever a party member uses <color=#44afee>Dual Blades - Cleaver</color>, one stack of <color=#44afee>Crystal Edge</color> is consumed, granting the <color=#44afee>Cleaver</color> effect.",
    ["BuffDes_9607205"]="While the buff is active, gains <color=#44afee>20%%</color> Final DMG Bonus. When a 5-Star Companion uses a skill, gains an additional <color=#44afee>20%%</color> Final DMG Bonus.",
    ["BuffDes_9608201"]="While the buff is active, the Adventurer takes Neutral attribute True DMG equal to <color=#44afee>6%%</color> of their Max HP every <color=#44afee>0.5</color>. If a buff is applied by the 5-Star <color=#44afee>Misty Soul Snare - Nimbus</color>, reduces PVP Final P.DMG RED and PVP Final M.DMG RED by an additional <color=#44afee>120%%</color> and <color=#44afee>120%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_9608202"]="While the buff is active, <color=#44afee>Strangling Mask</color> becomes unavailable.",
    ["BuffDes_9609201"]="While the buff is active, grants immunity to damage (excluding from MVP, MINI, Boss, or other execution mechanics). If a buff is applied by the 3-Star <color=#44afee>Sanctuary Spiral - Bella</color>, restores <color=#44afee>10%%</color> of Max HP per second.",
    ["BuffDes_9609202"]="While the buff is active, increases Final P.DMG RED and Final M.DMG RED by <color=#44afee>120%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_9610201"]="While active, there's a <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> miss chance on normal attacks and a <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> chance for AoE skills to deviate from the targeted location.",
    ["BuffDes_9610202"]="While active, Blossom Mirage - Mistbind becomes unavailable.",
    ["BuffDes_9611202"]="While active, you take True DMG equal to <color=#44afee>4%%</color> Max HP per second.",
    ["BuffDes_9611203"]="While active, <color=#44afee>Whispering Corridor - Heart Erosion</color> becomes unavailable.",
    ["BuffDes_9611204"]="While active, reduces your MSPD by <color=#44afee>35%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_9611205"]="While active, increases your PVP MSPD by <color=#44afee>2</color> and PVP Final P.DMG RED / Final M.DMG RED by <color=#44afee>60%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDesc_12212021"]="Increases MSPD by <color=#44afee>20%%</color> + stack count ×<color=#44afee>10%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDesc_30036302"]="While under the effect of Sightrasher, MSPD is reduced by 40%, and you continuously take damage.",
    ["BuffDesc_30037302"]="While marked by Retribution, each stack reduces HP Regen and healing received by 50%. At 3 stacks, the Adventure instantly dies.",
    ["BuffDesc_30037303"]="Confined by the shadow, unable to move.",
    ["BuffDesc_30092301"]="Self-aware Titans all have <color=#800080>100 stacks</color> of Harden, which can be reduced by a turret attack. When the Harden stack goes to <color=#800080>0</color>, the Self-aware Titans enters the <color=#FF0000>Fallen State</color>.",
    ["BuffDesc_30092303"]="The Self-aware Titan kneels on one knee and cannot move or use skills. Players can <color=#FF0000>kill the Titan</color> by approaching and using the Execute. Self-aware Titan's Fallen State lasts for <color=#FF0000>30 seconds</color>.",
    ["BuffDesc_30095301"]="After human players' Terror reaches <color=#800080>100 stacks</color>, they enter <color=#0000FF>Terrorized state</color>, during which Terror is automatically reduced by <color=#800080>1 stack</color> every second.",
    ["BuffDesc_30095303"]="Humans cannot move or use skills while in the Terrorized state. The Terrorized state will be removed when the Terror stack goes to <color=#800080>0</color>. When humans are in the Terrorized state, Self-aware Titans can approach humans to <color=#FF0000>execute them</color>.",
    ["BuffDesc_30095304"]="When humans are in the Fallen state, they can move slowly but cannot use skills. The rest of the players can perform <color=#32CD32>Rescue</color> on them.",
    ["BuffDesc_30095305"]="Gain a temporary <color=#800080>1x</color> movement speed bonus after being attacked.",
    ["BuffDesc_30095306"]="Self-aware Titans and Unsullied Titans <color=#0000CD>cannot detect</color> the target in stealth, but the attack of Self-aware Titans will affect the target in stealth, so pay attention to avoiding Self-aware Titans.",
    ["BuffDesc_31021302"]="Weapon attribute changes to Wind Attribute.",
    ["BuffDesc_31021304"]="Deals 50% more damage to Ktullanux.",
    ["BuffDesc_31022304"]="Gains a Holy Blessing, changing the armor attribute to Holy attribute.",
    ["BuffDesc_31022305"]="Gains a Shadow Blessing, changing the armor attribute to Shadow attribute.",
    ["BuffDesc_62313581"]="Attacking targets hit by Power Velocity gives a <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> chance of generating <color=#44afee>2</color> Spirit Spheres.",
    ["BuffDesc_62313641"]="Each stack increases Final Physical Penetration by an additional <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDesc_62313651"]="Every time you are hit, there is a <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> chance to increase Spirit Sphere and Spirit Sphere limit by one stack.",
    ["BuffDesc_62313652"]="Skill damage dealt is increased by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDesc_62314511"]="Every stack increases the Final Attack Speed by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDesc_62314531"]="Increases <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> Crit Damage Bonus percentage and <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> Final Hit for every stack.",
    ["BuffDesc_62314561"]="Increases your Crit Damage Bonus percentage by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDesc_62314571"]="Increases your Final Physical Damage Bonus by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDesc_62314581"]="Increases your PVP Final Physical Damage Bonus by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDesc_62314631"]="Reduces your PVP Debuff Resistance by <color=#44afee>%s</color> and Immobilization Resistance by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDesc_62314641"]="Every stack increases your Final Crit and Final Hit by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDesc_62314651"]="Every time you are hit, there is a <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> chance of increasing Spirit Sphere and Spirit Sphere limit by one stack.",
    ["BuffDesc_62314652"]="The next normal attack or first attack of a damage skill is increased by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>, and using this skill does not use up SP.",
    ["BuffDesc_62314661"]="Each stack increases the damage of Gate of Hell by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDesc_63001511"]="Your Final Damage Bonus is reduced by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDesc_6710804"]="Increases your Final P.DMG Bonus by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDesc_67999011"]="Grants a shield equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of your Max HP.",
    ["BuffDesc_67999031"]="Increases your PVP Final P.DMG Bonus by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDesc_71013309"]="While <color=#7ACEFF>quicken</color> , MSPD is increased by <color=#7ACEFF>2</color>.",
    ["BuffDesc_71013310"]="While <color=#7ACEFF>quicken</color> , MSPD is increased by <color=#7ACEFF>1</color>.",
    ["BuffMismatch"]="Must have the <color=#44afee>{0}</color> effect.",
