    ["BusinessTask_Info_1"]="To honor our most distinguished guests, we have prepared some Headgear Gacha Coins for your enjoyment! ",
    ["BusinessTask_Info_10"]="The Wigner Chamber of Commerce is always generous with their remuneration, including Pet Coins!",
    ["BusinessTask_Info_11"]="Wigner",
    ["BusinessTask_Info_2"]="If you want to earn some lucky equipment Gacha Coins, don't miss your chance to take on our missions!",
    ["BusinessTask_Info_3"]="If you want to expand your card collection from another world, come and help us expand our business opportunities, meow!",
    ["BusinessTask_Info_4"]="Aid",
    ["BusinessTask_Info_5"]="I need some pros to help me with a COC Mission!",
