    ["BusinessTask_Info_9"]="Welcome to %s.",
    ["BusinessTask_Tips_01"]="Obtained by completing orders.\nThe higher the Favor, the more points earned.\n<color=#e7bb22>(Reward bonus: %s%%)</color>",
    ["BusinessTask_Tips_02"]="The mission reward will be lost if the quest is abandoned,\nbut a COC quest attempt will still be used up.\nAbandon the quest?",
    ["BusinessTask_Tips_03"]="Complete this order to get:",
