    ["BusinessTask_Tips_08"]="Remaining aid attempts: %d",
    ["ByteDanceBattlePassTips"]="Level Up the Closed Beta Pass for Open Beta Gifts and Bonuses\n\nGlory Pass rewards: Adventurers who level up the Glory Pass to Lv.80 will also be able to claim limited pass rewards!",
    ["ByteDanceNinetales1001"]="Loading failed.",
    ["ByteDanceNinetales1002"]="Loading failed.",
    ["ByteDanceNinetales1003"]="System not supported.",
    ["ByteDanceNinetales1004"]="Loading failed.",
    ["ByteDanceNinetales2001"]="System error.",
    ["ByteDanceNinetales3001"]="The event has already ended",
    ["ByteDanceNinetales9999"]="System error.",
    ["ByteDanceRechargeTips"]="<color=#e7bb22>Top up in Closed Beta for Bonus Cashback in Open Beta</color>\n\nTop up between 12:00 PM on 4/23 to 15:00 PM on 5/8 to receive the following rewards when the open beta starts.\n\n- 100% cashback on all purchased Diamonds \n- 10x Crystal cashback for all Diamonds purchased (Max. 1M Crystal)\n\nCashback will be issued in stages over the 7 days of the Total Login Cashback event. Diamond rewards can be claimed on the first log-in during the open beta. \n\nExample: If you top up 200,000 Diamonds during the closed beta, you will receive 200,000 Diamonds and 1,000,000 Crystals over the 7 days of the Total Login Cashback event during the open beta. \n\nCashback stages:\nDay 1: 100% of purchased Diamonds and\nDay 2: x10 Crystals for 10% of Diamonds purchased\nDay 3: x10 Crystals for 10% of Diamonds purchased\nDay 4: x10 Crystals for 15% of Diamonds purchased\nDay 5: x10 Crystals for 15% of Diamonds purchased\nDay 6: x10 Crystals for 20% of Diamonds purchased\nDay 7: x10 Crystals for 30% of Diamonds purchased\n\nNotes:\n1. The scope of the cashback is all Diamond top up activity during the closed beta, and the totals for all characters under the same account will be combined.\n2. All Diamonds purchased during the closed beta will be returned to any character under the same account during the open beta. Players can choose which character will receive it (please check the upcoming event announcements for details).\n3. Costumes earned during CBT will be returned during OBT.",
