    ["CardUpgradeTips_001"]="Success Rate: <color=#ffeb9d>%s</color>",
    ["CardUpgradeTips_002"]="Star Upgrade successful!",
    ["CardUpgradeTips_003"]="Star Upgrade failed. Please try again!",
    ["CardUpgradeTips_004"]="There is no card with a higher star level in your backpack.",
    ["CardUpgrade_rule_01"]="◆Star Card Upgrade Rules\n1. Upgrading the card's star level can significantly increase its stats. The upgrade requires cards of the <color=#ff8c00>same version </color>and a certain number of Cat Hand Services Coins.\n2. A successful upgrade is not guaranteed; using cards of the same name can increase the success rate, stackable; <color=#ff8c00>card items will not be consumed if the upgrade fails</color>, but the Cat Hand Services Coins will still be consumed.\n3. The card becomes a bound item once it's upgraded.",
    ["CardUpgrade_rule_02"]="◆Card Reset Rules\n\n1. Resetting the card consumes a certain number of Crystals, and the cost depends on the quantity and the quality of the card.\n2. Resetting the card will return to you all card items spent in the Star Upgrade except for the Cat Hand Services Coins.\n3. The card becomes a bound item once it's reset.",
    ["CardUpgrade_rule_03"]="◆Card Bond Rules\n\n1. Each card has a different bond than the others. When depositing a card, its stat bonus and collection progress will be unlocked. When the points of a bond type reach a specified number, this bond type will gain collection stats.\n2. The bond bonus of Common cards and Star Cards are independent and will not affect each other.\n3. Star Cards can be deposited in the Star Card Bond. Different collection progress will be acquired based on their star levels, and in this way, different collection stats will be unlocked.",
    ["Card_1"]="Embedding successful.",
    ["Cardshop_tips_01"]="Do you want to go to the store to make a purchase?",
