    ["ChildrenActivities_Tips_49"]="You're out of tickets. Do you want to continue with the \"Dashing Sweetheart\"? (Only your score will be recorded, and there will be no ranking rewards.)",
    ["ChildrenActivities_Tips_5"]="Current Ranking",
    ["ChildrenActivities_Tips_50"]="Your highest ranking: %s. Do you want to use the Smart Boost-Run to claim the rewards for your current ranking?",
    ["ChildrenActivities_Tips_51"]="Rules:\nDuring the event period, participate in Dashing Sweetheart and Candy Factory to earn exchange materials. You can use them in the Exchange Shop for mounts, costumes, and backpacks.\nDuring the event period, defeat monsters with Odin's Blessings to earn exchange materials.\nItems\nRainbow Bean: Small 2% Medium 4% Large 6% (Up to 120 per day)\nCandy Delight Box: Small 0.5% Medium 1% Large 1.5% (Up to 30 per day)\nDuring the event period, participate in defeating MVP/MINI to earn the following exchange materials: Rainbow Bean x12 or Candy Delight Box x6. Drops up to 3 times per day.",
    ["ChildrenActivities_Tips_6"]="Best Result:",
    ["ChildrenActivities_Tips_7"]="Competition Time:",
    ["ChildrenActivities_Tips_8"]="Log in for the first time every day %s/1 time",
