    ["ChristmasActivityTips001"]="Visit Santa Claus in Lutie to complete the daily sign-in and claim your holiday rewards!",
    ["ChristmasActivityTips002"]="After messing with Santa Claus' candies, Garm Baby sneaked into Toy Factory. Apparently, you gotta have those sweet <color=#cf234b>Crystal Candy Balls</color> to catch it...\n<color=#cf234b>You must reach Base Lv. 50 and unlock the Pet system before taming it.</color>",
