    ["CombinationSkillIsEmpty"]="No component skills have been set. Please use this after setting some.",
    ["CombineTips_1"]="If bound items are used for synthesis, the synthesized item will become bound. Synthesize?",
    ["ComeBackContent_1"]="Base level is expected to increase to level <color=#fdca53>%s</color> after completing today’s quests.\nBase level is expected to increase to level <color=#fdca53>%s</color> after completing 7-day quests.\nActivating Kafra's VIP card will increase the quest reward by <color=#fdca53>%s</color>%%(%s).",
    ["ComeBackContent_2"]="<color=#aaf883>Activated</color>",
    ["ComeBackContent_3"]="<color=#b8525c>Not Activated</color>",
    ["ComeBackContent_4"]="Novice Coin owned: <color=#fdca53>%s</color>",
    ["ComeBackContent_5"]="Long time no see, %s,\nIt's been %s days since you left Midgard, and you missed %s season pass(es)...\nBut luckily, you were never truly far away! We've prepared a warm welcome-back gift just for you.\nThe rewards you missed have been added to the 7-Day Return Pack,\nand we've prepared generous return gifts and celebration events to greet your comeback.\nWe hope these help you re-experience the magic of this land together with your friends.",
