    ["ComeBackTips_4"]="Not yet the Gift Pack Opening Time",
    ["ComeBacktips_001"]="Today's Limit: %s/%s",
    ["ComeBacktips_002"]="You are currently a Hyper Player, and your master will receive extra rewards when you complete quests.",
    ["ComeBacktips_003"]="Daily Guild Limit for Obtaining Hyper Exclusive Rewards: %s/%s",
    ["ComeBacktips_004"]="The Hyper Event lasts 30 days. Returns triggered during the event period are all considered as Hyper Returns.\nDuring the Hyper Event, the event status is based on the character's status at their first login.\nAdventurers who have previously triggered a return must wait a longer period before it can be triggered again.\nOn servers hosting the Hyper Return event, characters meeting any of the following conditions will trigger it.\n1. Returning Adventurer\nThe character's base level must be ≥25.\nThe character must stay offline for a period of time.\n2. 30 levels lower than the World Level.\nThe specific Hyper Return trigger time is calculated separately for each Adventurer.\nWhen the Hyper Event begins, Adventurers in the middle of a return will have their return process forcibly terminated, and a new Hyper Return will be triggered instead. The paid status of the Return Pass will be carried over to the new Hyper Return.\nDuring the Hyper Event\n1. Hyper Players will receive Hyper Power buff, with the buff duration calculated based on each Adventurer's return time.\nWhen partying up with a Hyper Player, non-Hyper Players can receive a Hyper Morale buff. Lasts for 6 hours with a 10-day cooldown.\n2. Hyper Player Sign-In lasts 10 days (up to 7 days can be signed in); Hyper Quests lasts 30 days; Hyper Pass lasts 30 days. Complete them to receive gold equipment, costumes, and pet rewards.\n3. Non-Hyper Player will receive exclusive quests. Party up with Hyper Players to complete GVG, KVM, and tower-climbing to receive exclusive rewards.\n4. When a Hyper Player becomes an apprentice and completes the master/apprentice daily quest, the master will receive exclusive rewards.",
    ["ComeBacktips_005"]="Hyper Player Exclusive Identifier\n1. Enjoy exclusive EXP bonuses of the Hyper Return.\n2. Receive Hyper Items as rewards after completing event quests.\n3. Become more powerful with the blessing of the Hyper Power.\n4. Grant Party Member Protection to all party members, increasing their damage against MVP/MINI.\n5. Receive exclusive rewards after completing GVG, KVM, or tower-climbing with a Hyper Player.",
    ["ComeBacktips_006"]="Today's A Travel Companion Pack Obtain Limit: %s/%s",
    ["ComeBacktips_007"]="Returning Adventurer Exclusive Identifier\n1. Activate the exclusive Return Pass to get exclusive rewards.\n2. Receive exclusive items as rewards after completing return quests.\n3. Sign in daily to claim loads of rewards.",
    ["ComeBacktips_008"]="Sign-in Deadline: %s",
    ["ComeBacktips_010"]="Hyper Player gains additional <color=#5AB6F1>Fishing EXP x%s</color>.",
    ["ComeBacktips_011"]="Hyper Player gains additional <color=#5AB6F1>Mining EXP x%s</color>.",
    ["ComeBacktips_012"]="Hyper Player gains additional <color=#5AB6F1><color=#5AB6F1>Gardening x%s</color>.",
    ["ComeBacktips_013"]="Hyper Player gains additional <color=#5AB6F1>Smelting EXP x%s</color>.",
    ["ComeBacktips_014"]="Hyper Player gains additional <color=#5AB6F1>Crafting EXP x%s</color>.",
    ["ComeBacktips_015"]="Hyper Player gains additional <color=#5AB6F1>Cooking EXP x%s</color>.",
    ["ComeBacktips_016"]="Hyper Player gains additional <color=#5AB6F1>Rune EXP x%s</color>.",
    ["ComeBacktips_017"]="Hyper Player gains additional <color=#5AB6F1>Pet Taming EXP x%s</color>.",
    ["ComeBacktips_018"]="1. Non-Hyper Players can go to the shop to exchange for the Hyper Power buff to gain Life EXP and extra rewards when conducting life-related activities. Enjoy a 10%% discount on Zeny for upgrades (<color=#b584ea>Today's Life EXP limit: %s</color>; <color=#b584ea>Today's Life extra drop limit: %s</color>)\n2. Party up with Hyper Players to get Guide Quest rewards.\n3. Party up with Adventurers (at least 30 levels lower than the World Level) and help them to complete the corresponding gameplay to obtain the <color=#b584ea>\"A Travel Companion Pack.\"</color> Limited to 10 per day.\nConsume 500 Odin's Blessings\nConsume 1 Instance Chance\nConsume 1 MVP Reward Chance",
    ["ComeBacktips_019"]="Today's Life Reward Chances: %s/%s",
    ["ComeBacktips_020"]="Extra rewards and EXP for life-related activities during the Hyper Event.",
    ["ComeBacktips_021"]="Completed Sessions of Cumulative Refinement Quests",
    ["ComeBacktips_022"]="Completed Sessions of Cumulative Quests requiring obtaining diamonds",
