    ["CoupleLevelTips001"]="Level Privilege - Lv.%s",
    ["CoupleLevelTips002"]="1. Increase Couple Level to unlock more privileges.\n2. You can accept up to 3 Couple Quests from the Mission Board every day.\n3. Couple Quests belongs to the individual who accepted it. EXP from completing the quest will also only be given to that individual.\n4. Couple Quests can be completed by both parties. Helping your partner out will advance their quest progress.\n5. Giving gifts to your partner will increase Couple EXP.\n6. The Monthly Challenge is a tough challenge for each couple.\n7. Complete the Monthly Challenge to obtain great rewards.\n8. Couple EXP will be deducted as a punishment for failing the Monthly Challenge.\n9. EXP will not be deducted if you fail the Monthly Challenge during your Honeymoon Period.\n10. The deduction in EXP will only be from your current level. Couple Level will not decrease.",
    ["CoupleLevelTips003"]="Honeymoon Period: %s",
    ["CoupleLevelTips004"]="Obtain a total of %s/%s EXP this month to claim.",
    ["CoupleNotOnline"]="Insufficient HP/SP. Cannot use skill.",
    ["CoupleResetSkillTips001"]="Spend %s Crystals to reset Couple Skills?",
    ["CoupleSkillCannotUse"]="You cannot use Couple Skills in the current state.",
    ["CoupleSkillNotTargetPoint"]="You can't teleport when your partner is offline or when you are not in a normal location.",
    ["CoupleSkillStateError"]="You can't teleport while in battle or in the current location.",
    ["CoupleStatusNotEnough"]="Your partner is offline and is unable accept your call. Hurry, get them to come online!",
    ["CoupleTeleportRefuse"]="Your partner does not want to accept your call. You should reflect on yourself.",
    ["CoupleTeleportTips001"]="Couple Call",
    ["CoupleTeleportTips002"]="<color=#E8833C>%s</color> is calling for you to go to them.",
