    ["DemonSlayerBP_daily_title"]="Daily Supply",
    ["DemonSlayerBP_desc"]="The goal in this Trial is getting Trial EXP, which determines the Trial outcome",
    ["DemonSlayerBP_exp"]="Trial Collection",
    ["DemonSlayerBP_expDrop"]="Trial Objective",
    ["DemonSlayerBP_exp_1"]="Kill MVP and Mini units for chances to get Trial EXP Packs",
    ["DemonSlayerBP_exp_2"]="Kill monsters with Odin for a chance to get Trial EXP",
    ["DemonSlayerBP_exp_btn"]="View MVP",
    ["DemonSlayerBP_exp_droptext"]="Obtained %s x%s",
    ["DemonSlayerBP_exp_limit"]="Daily Limit: <color=#5f8e2d>%s/%s</color>",
    ["DemonSlayerBP_exp_title"]="EXP Gained",
    ["DemonSlayerBP_help"]="Trial Instructions:\n\n1. When the collaboration event is available, Trial is <color=#CA2E0AFF>automatically unlocked</color>\n\n2. Gather <color=#CA2E0AFF>Trial EXP</color> to obtain Trial Rewards\n\n3. Sign up for Trials to unlock Trial Supply <color=#CA2E0AFF>once per day</color>, which is unlocked once a day during the event\n\n4. Obtain <color=#CA2E0AFF>Trial EXP</color> by killing monsters\n\n5. When killing monsters and challenging an MVP or Mini, there is a chance to gain <color=#CA2E0AFF>Trial EXP Pack</color> containing <color=#CA2E0AFF>Trial EXP</color>\n\n6. Unclaimed Trial rewards will expire when the event ends, so please claim your rewards in time",
    ["DemonSlayerBP_normal"]="Daily Supply",
    ["DemonSlayerBP_normal_desc"]="Purchase to claim <color=#CA2E0AFF>Daily Supply</color>.\n Grants <color=#CA2E0AFF>5,000</color> EXP at most during the event",
    ["DemonSlayerBingo_btn_research"]="Start Investigation %s/1",
    ["DemonSlayerBingo_btn_reward"]="Claim Rewards",
    ["DemonSlayerBingo_btn_text"]="Investigation Progress: %s/%s",
    ["DemonSlayerBingo_help"]="Chessboard Instructions:\n\n1. Use <color=#CA2E0AFF>Investigation Attempts</color> to light up a random square on the Chessboard\n\n2. When the Chessboard is lit<color=#CA2E0AFF>horizontally</color>, <color=#CA2E0AFF>vertically</color>, or <color=#CA2E0AFF>diagonally</color>, corresponding rewards can be claimed\n\n3. When the whole Chessboard is lit up, the investigation phase is finished and phase rewards can be claimed\n\n4. Claim all the rewards granted by the Chessboard to enter the next phase; there are <color=#CA2E0AFF>12 phases</color>\n in total\n5. Unclaimed Chessboard rewards will expire when the event ends, so please claim your rewards in time",
    ["DemonSlayerBingo_research1"]="Investigation Phase 1",
