    ["DemonSlayerTask_help"]="Quest Instructions:\n\n1. Complete the quests to increase number of <color=#CA2E0AFF>Chessboard</color> investigation attempts available\n\n2. Daily Quests refresh every day; other quests can be completed only once",
    ["DemonSlayerTask_rewardText"]="Chessboard Investigation +%s",
    ["DemonSlayerTreasure_desc"]="Receive <color=#ffb260>1 random</color> reward from the following by purchasing Treasures. There is a limited supply.",
    ["DemonSlayerTreasure_help"]="Treasures Event Info:\n\n1. There are a fixed number of treasures. The corresponding items will be removed after each purchase.\n\n2. Open all the treasures to obtain all rewards displayed.\n\n3. While stock lasts.",
    ["DemonSlayerTreasure_limit"]="Quantity: %s/%s",
