    ["DialogueBubble610803001"]="●●-●",
    ["DialogueBubble610803002"]="●-",
    ["DialogueBubble610803003"]="●-●",
    ["DialogueBubble610803004"]="●●●-",
    ["DialogueBubble610803005"]="●",
    ["DialogueBubble610803006"]="●-●●",
    ["DialogueBubble610903101"]="My Sundries Store has everything, but there's no candy for the kids. I can't stand troublemakers!",
    ["DialogueBubble610963101"]="Don't miss out on our limited-time Halloween dishes!",
    ["DialogueBubble611383101"]="The Spiked Mask is a big hit this Halloween!",
    ["DialogueBubble611722101"]="As long as you believe in the infinite possibilities of the future, good things will come your way every day.",
    ["DialogueBubble611722201"]="It is a blessing to be loved. Our meeting is also a kind of miracle.",
    ["DialogueBubble611722301"]="Do not let a temporary setback stop you from moving forward.",
    ["DialogueBubble611722401"]="Every stage of life is worth celebrating. Even if no one applauds you, you have to remember to applaud yourself.",
    ["DialogueBubble611722501"]="Happy events should be shared with everyone.",
    ["DialogueBubble611722601"]="Although I have many fans, it's the first time I've seen one as bold as you.",
    ["DialogueBubble611722701"]="You have to be happy today, too!",
    ["DialogueBubble630710101"]="It's dangerous up ahead! No one is allowed to enter!",
    ["DialogueBubble6310701"]="\"Fluffy, cute, and a bit of a dummy, it doesn't fear bees and loves eating honey.\"",
    ["DialogueBubble6310702"]="Can you guess what animal it is?",
    ["DialogueBubble6311001"]="\"With a long tail and flowing mane, it gallops and pull carts down the lane.\"",
    ["DialogueBubble6311002"]="Can you guess what animal it is?",
    ["DialogueBubble6311101"]="\"Its snout is long and its tail is curly, it's last in the zodiac because it stopped to eat early.\"",
    ["DialogueBubble6311102"]="Can you guess what animal it is?",
    ["DialogueBubble640012101"]="Welcome to Criatura Academy!",
    ["DialogueBubble640052101"]="Look at the vigor of these young adventurers!",
    ["DialogueBubble640062101"]="Silence in the library!",
    ["DialogueBubble640382101"]="Hee-hee-hee! Yes, I'm a food merchant, but I don't have anything to sell right now...",
    ["DialogueBubble640382201"]="Looking forward to my cooking? Thanks! Hahaha! Well, at least I can make chicken nuggets!",
    ["DialogueBubble640392101"]="Huh? You want some equipment? Go find Hollgrehenn... Ah... What is even the point of us being here?",
    ["DialogueBubble640392201"]="Me being here has made the town more lively? I'm not sure what you're talking about, but thanks for the compliment!",
    ["DialogueBubble640402101"]="If you need any equipment, please contact Blacksmith Hollgrehenn in the city. What are we doing here? I'm really not sure...",
    ["DialogueBubble640402201"]="I'll actually be useful one day? Hahaha! Thank you for your encouragement!",
    ["DialogueBubble6601411"]="Hey! Check out my perfected slingshot skills!",
    ["DialogueBubble6601611"]="As, as long as it's Captain Altyna's order, I'm willing to follow it...",
