    ["DialogueBubble662491210"]="I'm going to play the code now. Please listen carefully!",
    ["DialogueBubble670002101"]="What kind of story would you like to hear?",
    ["DialogueBubble670012101"]="Alright! I'll use this fishing spot as the first step to gaining master's approval!",
    ["DialogueBubble670062101"]="Danger lurks ahead—please act with caution!",
    ["DialogueBubble670072101"]="Wow!",
    ["DialogueBubble670082101"]="Can I request a song?",
    ["DialogueBubble670092101"]="Morts!",
    ["DialogueBubble670422101"]="*Sigh* I want to go to Criatura Academy and become an adventurer, too!",
    ["DialogueBubble670432101"]="Don't worry about it—there's always next year. I'll be waiting for you here!",
    ["DialogueBubble670442101"]="I hear that the mentors in our academy are very strict...",
    ["DialogueBubble670452101"]="Don't worry—as long as you study hard, your mentors are sure to love you!",
    ["DialogueBubble670462101"]="Oh! Have you heard? We've got a very handsome guy this time!",
    ["DialogueBubble670462201"]="Thank you. I like Aronst the most!",
    ["DialogueBubble670472101"]="Oh, you mean Aronst? He seems very familiar...",
    ["DialogueBubble670472201"]="Thank you. You are a good person.",
    ["DialogueBubble670482101"]="Hey! Have you seen any good-looking students among the freshmen?",
    ["DialogueBubble670482201"]="Whoa! Were you eavesdropping on us just now?",
    ["DialogueBubble670492101"]="Huh? No, not at all. I'm not interested in this sort of stuff...",
    ["DialogueBubble670492201"]="Ea-Eavesdropping is a nasty habit! You'd better listen to your elders!",
    ["DialogueBubble670502101"]="Would you also like to become an adventurer here in the future, too?",
    ["DialogueBubble670512101"]="Yeah! I want to be a great adventurer and save the world!",
    ["DialogueBubble670522101"]="Every year I see this same scene. It reminds me of my time as a student. This is where I met you, my dear.",
    ["DialogueBubble670522201"]="Hahaha! Serendipity is a wonderful thing, don't you agree?",
    ["DialogueBubble670532101"]="Indeed. Our life together is all thanks to the academy.",
    ["DialogueBubble670532201"]="Ah, destiny... I'm starting to feel like a kid again...",
    ["DialogueBubble670542101"]="Mother... Can I go to school here in the future?",
    ["DialogueBubble670552101"]="Well, of course! Only the best for our baby!",
    ["DialogueBubble670562101"]="I want to eat chicken nuggets...",
    ["DialogueBubble670572101"]="You need to eat healthily! If you promise to eat your vegetables, I'll get you anything you want!",
    ["DialogueBubble670582101"]="Life on Izlude Island is so convenient! You can buy all the life skill materials you need in the Central Square!",
    ["DialogueBubble670582201"]="Haha! Everyone who lives here has a smile like yours!",
    ["DialogueBubble670592101"]="You just looked in that cat spirit's direction again! Huh?",
    ["DialogueBubble670602101"]="All you need to do is dress up a little and you'll be a true beauty! Why don't you give it a try?",
    ["DialogueBubble670612101"]="*Sigh* Having so many people jealous of my beauty really is a bother...",
    ["DialogueBubble670612201"]="Haha! Thank you for your love, but I can't just like anyone, you know?",
    ["DialogueBubble670622101"]="Weapon and armor merchants don't sell equipment, and food merchants don't sell food...? This island really is interesting...",
    ["DialogueBubble670622201"]="Whoa, I was just being honest! Don't be like that!",
    ["DialogueBubble670632101"]="Will term be starting at Criatura Academy soon? Ah, youth really is a beautiful thing!",
    ["DialogueBubble670642101"]="Welcome to the Training Course! Swordsman training is a tradition of Izlude Island. I hope you enjoy it!",
    ["DialogueBubble670652101"]="You may have been the elites of the academy, but here, you're all rookies! Now, give it your all!",
    ["DialogueBubble670652201"]="Huh? You're a rookie too? You look pretty tough! I'll make an exception and let you train together!",
    ["DialogueBubble670662101"]="Yaaaah! Hah!",
    ["DialogueBubble670672101"]="Goodness gracious me... The Monster Instructor really hasn't changed one bit!",
    ["DialogueBubble670672201"]="Do you feel sorry for them, too?",
    ["DialogueBubble670682101"]="Hahaha! Don't look at him like that! You don't know how many lives he's saved on the battlefield...",
    ["DialogueBubble670682201"]="It's not that I don't understand how you feel... After all, in the eyes of outsiders...",
    ["DialogueBubble670692101"]="I-I-I just can't stand that coach anymore!",
    ["DialogueBubble670702101"]="Don't be silly! If you want to be strong, listening to him is the fastest way, and you want to give up!?",
    ["DialogueBubble670712101"]="Whew... Resting after a class with the Monster Instructor feels like being in paradise!",
    ["DialogueBubble670722101"]="Are we... really getting stronger...?",
    ["DialogueBubble670732101"]="Please line up in order to register for training!",
    ["DialogueBubble670732201"]="Even like this... Do you have to wait in line, too?",
    ["DialogueBubble670742101"]="Huh? Cut the queue and you're going straight to the back! Don't disturb my work!",
    ["DialogueBubble670742201"]="Do it again and I'll tell everyone here to beat you!",
    ["DialogueBubble670752101"]="Umm... There are so many people here...",
    ["DialogueBubble670762101"]="After all, the Swordsman Guild of Izlude Island is very famous.",
    ["DialogueBubble670772101"]="I really want to get stronger... As long as its not with the Monster Instructor, I'll do anything.",
    ["DialogueBubble670792101"]="This world... Is it real? Was it really not just created by someone?",
    ["DialogueBubble670812101"]="This is the Royal Palace, very important place. If you don't have any business here, leave now!",
    ["DialogueBubble670822101"]="They say that couples who sit on the carousel outside the South Gate together will be together forever.",
    ["DialogueBubble670832101"]="Wow! Really!? Let's go for a ride!",
    ["DialogueBubble670842101"]="Originally, they wanted to tear this place down and build a giant carousel. Fortunately, they placed it outside of the city in the end, otherwise, we'd have no peace here!",
    ["DialogueBubble670852101"]="Want to go play on the <color=#CA2E0AFF>Carousel</color>, but can't find where to buy a ticket? Look in the upper right corner of the <color=#CA2E0AFF>Chamber of Commerce</color> to buy <color=#CA2E0AFF>Carousel Tickets</color>!",
    ["DialogueBubble670862101"]="What a pity...",
    ["DialogueBubble670872101"]="I want to take a photo on the carousel!",
    ["DialogueBubble670882101"]="They were apparently planning to put a carousel here before... Why did they end up putting it outside the city?",
    ["DialogueBubble670892101"]="Right! Riding the carousel in Prontera would be so romantic!",
    ["DialogueBubble670902101"]="Hey, calm down. Don't you think the amusement park outside the South Gate is kind of neat?",
    ["DialogueBubble670912101"]="Pork! Chicken! Beef! I've got all the best meat! Freshly slaughtered just this morning!",
    ["DialogueBubble670912201"]="Oh? Please help yourself if you want to take a look!",
    ["DialogueBubble670922101"]="High quality honey tea! Pure and natural, with no additives! Buy one, get one free! Come and have a taste!",
    ["DialogueBubble670922201"]="I can see how much you want it... Want to buy a couple of cups? You'll get one for free!",
    ["DialogueBubble670932101"]="Freshly picked from Prontera! No pesticides—totally organic!",
    ["DialogueBubble670942101"]="All of our fruits have been purified with magic—you can eat them right away!",
    ["DialogueBubble670952101"]="Look at the meat I bought today... It looks delicious, right? What do you think? Want to take some home?",
    ["DialogueBubble670962101"]="Really? Thank you so much. Give these grapes to your kids. They really big and juicy!",
    ["DialogueBubble670972101"]="Can we go up...? I wonder what's up there?",
    ["DialogueBubble670982101"]="No... Father says we're not allowed to go up there.",
    ["DialogueBubble671002101"]="The sewers are up ahead, but you're not allowed to enter right now. If you don't have any business here, please leave.",
    ["DialogueBubble671012101"]="Hi... Would you like a drink?",
    ["DialogueBubble671012201"]="Huh? Can't take your eyes off me, huh? Come to the tavern and you can look all you want.",
    ["DialogueBubble671022101"]="I, I'm not drunk...! Hic! See, I... I'm rowing! Rowing!",
    ["DialogueBubble671032101"]="Prontera's Catwomen really live up to their reputation.",
    ["DialogueBubble671032201"]="You think they're awesome, too... right?",
    ["DialogueBubble671042101"]="If you want to chat with them, just come here for a drink!",
    ["DialogueBubble671042201"]="Did you just come out from inside there? They're gorgeous, aren't they?",
    ["DialogueBubble671052101"]="Dad, why is that girl dressed like a cat?",
    ["DialogueBubble671052201"]="Catwoman...? What in heaven's name is that?",
    ["DialogueBubble671062101"]="Uh... It's because they're so adorable, right? But you are too young... Maybe you should try to learn something from them.",
    ["DialogueBubble671062201"]="Hey, you! Don't you try leading my daughter astray!",
    ["DialogueBubble671072101"]="Wow! Is this Prontera? Where should we go first?",
    ["DialogueBubble671082101"]="I know! I'll go shopping in the Central Square first!",
    ["DialogueBubble671092101"]="I want to go to the Royal Palace Plaza!",
    ["DialogueBubble671102101"]="What are you talking about? How can you visit Prontera and not go to the Rose Red Tavern!?",
    ["DialogueBubble671112101"]="The graveyard is just up ahead. Please don't make too much noise.",
    ["DialogueBubble671122101"]="One day, this place will also become a graveyard...",
    ["DialogueBubble671132101"]="May the dead rest in peace...",
    ["DialogueBubble671142101"]="Waaaah... Rupee... I miss you so much...",
    ["DialogueBubble671142201"]="Thank... Thank you for easing my pain.",
    ["DialogueBubble671152101"]="For the young soul who sleeps beneath the earth, I must live well...",
    ["DialogueBubble671152201"]="Thank you, young hero. I am used to life without my child...",
    ["DialogueBubble671162101"]="This is our great sanctuary... A tranquil place for the pious.",
    ["DialogueBubble671192101"]="Welcome to the base of the imperial knights! If you're looking for the person in charge of missions here, step right this way!",
    ["DialogueBubble671202101"]="Don't worry—everything you need is here!",
    ["DialogueBubble671202201"]="What? You're not a member of the Knights' Order, are you? You can't take the food here...",
    ["DialogueBubble671212101"]="I want some garlic bread!",
    ["DialogueBubble671222101"]="Could you please add another rasher of bacon? Thanks!",
    ["DialogueBubble671232101"]="Got any apples?",
    ["DialogueBubble671242101"]="Wow! I didn't expect the knights to have such amazing food!",
    ["DialogueBubble671252101"]="Of course. Knights put their lives on the line for the people—they're the greatest in the land.",
    ["DialogueBubble671262101"]="Especially the chefs of the Knights' Order. They're beyond compare!",
    ["DialogueBubble671272101"]="*Burp* I'm stuffed, but it's shame there's no booze...",
    ["DialogueBubble671282101"]="Idiot! How can you fight drunk!?",
    ["DialogueBubble671292101"]="I feel like taking a nap...",
    ["DialogueBubble671302101"]="Welcome to Prontera! Please be sure to abide by the laws of this land as you take a look around.",
    ["DialogueBubble671312101"]="Don't run around here like that! You're going to start annoying people!",
    ["DialogueBubble671312201"]="S-Sorry for any bother my children may have caused you!",
    ["DialogueBubble671342101"]="The giant telescope up there was designed by yours truly! It's awesome, isn't it?",
    ["DialogueBubble671352101"]="Well, this is the twentieth time you've spoken to an adventurer today...",
    ["DialogueBubble671352201"]="Hehehe... It's like that old man has reverted into a little boy. All he does these days is show off his telescope.",
    ["DialogueBubble671362101"]="Mom, does a real princess live in that big castle?",
    ["DialogueBubble671372101"]="Of course, and a handsome prince lives there, too.",
    ["DialogueBubble671382101"]="It doesn't matter when you see Prontera, it's always so majestic...",
    ["DialogueBubble672722101"]="Let us celebrate the fact that we're about to become adventurers! Cheers!",
    ["DialogueBubble672732101"]="Unfortunately, we're not old enough to drink just yet. Cheers!",
    ["DialogueBubble672742101"]="Orange juice isn't a bad choice, either! Cheers!",
    ["DialogueBubble672752101"]="Today is registration day at the academy! It's half price on orange juice!",
    ["DialogueBubble672762101"]="The area up ahead has been privately reserved. No one is allowed to enter without an invitation!",
    ["DialogueBubble672772101"]="What can I get you? Our special orange juice is highly recommended!",
    ["DialogueBubble672782101"]="Every time I hear music playing in the tavern, I feel like I could fly!",
    ["DialogueBubble672792101"]="Right! Are you going to pick a song from the jukebox?",
    ["DialogueBubble672802101"]="*Munch, munch* Mmm... So tasty!",
    ["DialogueBubble673292101"]="You two, stop running around!",
    ["DialogueBubble673302101"]="Look over here!",
    ["DialogueBubble673312101"]="Wow!",
    ["DialogueBubble673322101"]="Slacking—slacking off—",
    ["DialogueBubble673342101"]="Hey! Don't chew on the gift box!",
    ["DialogueBubble673352101"]="Boop—",
    ["DialogueBubble673362101"]="Nice!",
    ["DialogueBubble673372101"]="I've been watching all day...",
    ["DialogueBubble673382101"]="Is that a snack pouch on your head?",
    ["DialogueBubble673392101"]="That's a hat, meow! A captain's hat!",
    ["DialogueBubble673412101"]="What's it trying to say?",
    ["DialogueBubble673422101"]="I don't understand...",
    ["DialogueBubble673462101"]="(I kind of... want to touch it...)",
    ["DialogueBubble673472101"]="Y-You can see me?!",
    ["DialogueBubble673482101"]="This place is pretty fun!",
    ["DialogueBubble673492101"]="There's something sweet in the air...",
    ["DialogueBubble673502101"]="Why are we standing together?",
    ["DialogueBubble673512101"]="Because we didn't want to be mushroomly... lonely...",
    ["DialogueBubble673542101"]="Shh... look at the guy up ahead!",
    ["DialogueBubble673612101"]="Where'd that guy run off to...?",
    ["DialogueBubble673642101"]="Sister... I want to...",
    ["DialogueBubble673652101"]="Nope, you don't want to.",
    ["DialogueBubble673672101"]="Wanna go ice fishing?",
    ["DialogueBubble673682101"]="Don't fall into the water again.",
    ["DialogueBubble673692101"]="Lots of bait, lots of fish!",
    ["DialogueBubble673752101"]="Let's go fishing later...",
    ["DialogueBubble673832101"]="Have fun!",
    ["DialogueBubble673842101"]="It's... It's kinda cold...",
    ["DialogueBubble673852101"]="Put on my jacket first.",
    ["DialogueBubble674002101"]="I wanna eat this ice cream!",
    ["DialogueBubble674012101"]="You'll get a stomachache...",
    ["DialogueBubble674022101"]="Want some candy?",
    ["DialogueBubble674042101"]="Enjoy without worries!",
    ["DialogueBubble674082101"]="Let's see who can guess what this treasure is!",
    ["DialogueBubble674192101"]="Watch your step—don't slip.",
    ["DialogueBubble691001101"]="Left? Right? Whether you can get the treasure chest or not depends entirely on your choice, adventurer!",
    ["DialogueInMagic1"]="Fire",
    ["DialogueInMagic2"]="Water",
    ["DialogueInMagic3"]="Wind",
    ["DialogueInMagic4"]="Earth",
    ["DialogueInMagic5"]="That was a mistake. Remember what I said just now—which elements need to be added right now?",
    ["DialogueOPtion30129011"]="I've decided!",
    ["DialogueOPtion30129021"]="(Drink)",
    ["DialogueOPtion30129031"]="Begin!",
    ["DialogueOPtion30130011"]="Chanting Beads?",
    ["DialogueOPtion30130021"]="Alright...",
    ["DialogueOPtion30133011"]="I'm ready!",
    ["DialogueOPtion30134011"]="You know me?",
    ["DialogueOPtion30134021"]="Miraculous...",
    ["DialogueOPtion30134031"]="Begin!",
    ["DialogueOPtion30135011"]="Purification Elixir?",
    ["DialogueOPtion30138011"]="The Lotus Seeds...",
    ["DialogueOPtion30138021"]="Noble, of course!",
    ["DialogueOPtion30138031"]="Huh...",
    ["DialogueOPtion30138041"]="I will be good and noble!",
    ["DialogueOPtion30138071"]="...",
    ["DialogueOPtion30138072"]="Yes!",
    ["DialogueOption10001011"]="Criatura Academy?",
    ["DialogueOption10001021"]="So, you're...?",
    ["DialogueOption10002011"]="I got in?",
    ["DialogueOption10002012"]="Who's checking me out?",
    ["DialogueOption10002021"]="Student Handbook?",
    ["DialogueOption10002031"]="Student Handbook?",
    ["DialogueOption10004011"]="You like it?",
    ["DialogueOption10004021"]="(Take out camera)",
    ["DialogueOption10005021"]="Jarod is...?",
    ["DialogueOption10005031"]="I'll bring him back!",
    ["DialogueOption10006011"]="Kiki's looking for...",
    ["DialogueOption10007011"]="......",
    ["DialogueOption10008011"]="Socializing may be an issue...",
    ["DialogueOption10008012"]="You suck...",
    ["DialogueOption10008021"]="And what if I did?",
    ["DialogueOption10008031"]="And what if I did?",
    ["DialogueOption10008041"]="Great!",
    ["DialogueOption10009011"]="I made a friend!",
    ["DialogueOption10009021"]="Keep your word.",
    ["DialogueOption10009022"]="Maybe it's just you...",
    ["DialogueOption10010021"]="What is it?",
    ["DialogueOption10010031"]="I'm not sure...",
    ["DialogueOption10013011"]="(Greet)",
    ["DialogueOption10013021"]="What happened just now...",
    ["DialogueOption10013041"]="I can report...",
    ["DialogueOption10013051"]="I'll help you, then!",
    ["DialogueOption10014011"]="I've decided!",
    ["DialogueOption10015011"]="But?",
    ["DialogueOption10015031"]="Leave it to me!",
    ["DialogueOption10016011"]="No...",
    ["DialogueOption10017021"]="......?",
    ["DialogueOption10017041"]="Enough tuition?",
    ["DialogueOption10017042"]="A noble temperament?",
    ["DialogueOption10017043"]="Irresistible charm?",
    ["DialogueOption10018011"]="Academy Hat...",
    ["DialogueOption10018021"]="This is... bad?",
    ["DialogueOption10018031"]="<size=24>What—!?</size>",
    ["DialogueOption10018041"]="What materials?",
    ["DialogueOption10021011"]="Ready.",
    ["DialogueOption10021012"]="Wait a second.",
    ["DialogueOption10024011"]="Adventurer!",
    ["DialogueOption10024021"]="Make my dreams come true!",
    ["DialogueOption10024031"]="Eh...",
    ["DialogueOption10024041"]="Alright!",
    ["DialogueOption10035011"]="A divine aura...",
    ["DialogueOption10035021"]="A destructible shadow?",
    ["DialogueOption10038011"]="Yes.",
    ["DialogueOption10038012"]="(Nods) But...",
    ["DialogueOption10038021"]="What is this Kingdom Defense Force...?",
    ["DialogueOption10038031"]="I'll give it a shot!",
    ["DialogueOption10040011"]="What happened?",
    ["DialogueOption10040021"]="Can it be fixed?",
    ["DialogueOption10040031"]="Leave it to me!",
    ["DialogueOption10041011"]="Mission Board...",
    ["DialogueOption10041021"]="Mission Board...",
    ["DialogueOption10041031"]="Mission Board...",
    ["DialogueOption10042011"]="Gladly!",
    ["DialogueOption10043011"]="Eh...",
    ["DialogueOption10044011"]="But...?",
    ["DialogueOption10044021"]="Think no more of it...",
    ["DialogueOption10044031"]="All...!?",
    ["DialogueOption10046011"]="What's the gift?",
    ["DialogueOption10101011"]="Yes.",
    ["DialogueOption10103021"]="......",
    ["DialogueOption10103031"]="Yes, Captain!",
    ["DialogueOption10103051"]="Yes, Captain!",
    ["DialogueOption10104011"]="(Convey Fitz's instructions)",
    ["DialogueOption10104031"]="(Convey Fitz's instructions)",
    ["DialogueOption10104051"]="Yes.",
    ["DialogueOption10104052"]="Wait a second.",
    ["DialogueOption10105011"]="It's not coming down...",
    ["DialogueOption10106051"]="Ah!",
    ["DialogueOption10109021"]="Yes, Captain!",
    ["DialogueOption10110011"]="(Inquire...)",
    ["DialogueOption10110021"]="I'll go.",
    ["DialogueOption10111011"]="(Tell the whole story)",
    ["DialogueOption10111021"]="I'll help, too!",
    ["DialogueOption10111031"]="Yes, Captain!",
    ["DialogueOption10112011"]="What happened?",
    ["DialogueOption10113011"]="(Inquire...)",
    ["DialogueOption10117011"]="What is it?",
    ["DialogueOption10118011"]="Ymir's Heart...",
    ["DialogueOption10121011"]="What happened?",
    ["DialogueOption10122011"]="What happened?",
    ["DialogueOption10123011"]="(Take out the letter)",
    ["DialogueOption10125011"]="(Greet)",
    ["DialogueOption10126011"]="Eh...",
    ["DialogueOption10126031"]="...!!",
    ["DialogueOption10126041"]="What is it?",
    ["DialogueOption10127021"]="I want to answer the question.",
    ["DialogueOption10127031"]="Come on!",
    ["DialogueOption10127061"]="Mainz Gaebolg",
    ["DialogueOption10127062"]="Aronst Gaebolg",
    ["DialogueOption10127081"]="Fred Barr Venter",
    ["DialogueOption10127082"]="Kroneika Heines",
    ["DialogueOption10127101"]="Bohr Richard",
    ["DialogueOption10127102"]="Chino Richard",
    ["DialogueOption10129011"]="(Exchange pleasantries...)",
    ["DialogueOption10129021"]="(Inquire...)",
    ["DialogueOption10131011"]="(Inquire...)",
    ["DialogueOption10131021"]="It's very dangerous...",
    ["DialogueOption10131022"]="Hand it over, now!",
    ["DialogueOption10133011"]="What happened?",
    ["DialogueOption10133031"]="Okay!",
    ["DialogueOption10134011"]="(Tell the story so far)",
    ["DialogueOption10134031"]="!!",
    ["DialogueOption10135011"]="Okay, here's the thing...",
    ["DialogueOption10135012"]="...Hmm. You're even busier than me.",
    ["DialogueOption10138011"]="(State the situation)",
    ["DialogueOption10139011"]="Flora Salad",
    ["DialogueOption10139012"]="Egg Fried Fabre",
    ["DialogueOption10139013"]="Braised Poisonous Mushroom",
    ["DialogueOption10139014"]="Steamed Pecopeco",
    ["DialogueOption10140011"]="(Inquire...)",
    ["DialogueOption10140021"]="Zudd and Iverson?",
    ["DialogueOption10141011"]="(Explain why you came)",
    ["DialogueOption10141021"]="Let's go and help him!",
    ["DialogueOption10141041"]="Then I'll go alone!",
    ["DialogueOption10142011"]="(Explain why you came)",
    ["DialogueOption10143031"]="The stolen shard!",
    ["DialogueOption10143041"]="(Explain the situation)",
    ["DialogueOption10144011"]="The sewers...",
    ["DialogueOption10144031"]="Sorry...",
    ["DialogueOption10146011"]="Blueprints...",
    ["DialogueOption10146021"]="Blueprints...",
    ["DialogueOption10146031"]="Blueprints...",
    ["DialogueOption10148011"]="What happened?",
    ["DialogueOption10148021"]="A change?",
    ["DialogueOption10148031"]="I'll go check it out now!",
    ["DialogueOption10149011"]="What happened?",
    ["DialogueOption10149021"]="I'll help, too!",
    ["DialogueOption10150011"]="I'll join in, too!",
    ["DialogueOption10151011"]="Actually...",
    ["DialogueOption10152011"]="(Inquire...)",
    ["DialogueOption10152021"]="Tell me more...",
    ["DialogueOption10153011"]="What are we going to do?",
    ["DialogueOption10154011"]="(Request...)",
    ["DialogueOption10156011"]="(Explain the situation)",
    ["DialogueOption10157011"]="You're hurt!",
    ["DialogueOption10157021"]="(Persuade...)",
    ["DialogueOption10158011"]="(Tell the whole story)",
    ["DialogueOption10159011"]="A Fragment of Ymir's Heart!",
    ["DialogueOption10159041"]="No...",
    ["DialogueOption10160011"]="Alright.",
    ["DialogueOption10160012"]="Not yet.",
    ["DialogueOption10161011"]="This shard...",
    ["DialogueOption10161021"]="!!",
    ["DialogueOption10162011"]="A Fragment of Ymir's Heart!",
    ["DialogueOption10162021"]="And next...",
    ["DialogueOption10163011"]="You are a goddess?",
    ["DialogueOption10164011"]="How did you know...?",
    ["DialogueOption10201011"]="Unrest?",
    ["DialogueOption10201021"]="Fog...",
    ["DialogueOption10202011"]="What problem?",
    ["DialogueOption10202021"]="What's strange?",
    ["DialogueOption10202031"]="I can help.",
    ["DialogueOption10203011"]="What is it?",
    ["DialogueOption10203021"]="...Haze?",
    ["DialogueOption10204011"]="...What is this haze?",
    ["DialogueOption10204031"]="We must put an end to this!",
    ["DialogueOption10205011"]="I'm okay, but...",
    ["DialogueOption10205021"]="Another mentor...?",
    ["DialogueOption10205031"]="Leave it to me!",
    ["DialogueOption10206031"]="...The situation around here?",
