    ["DialogueOption20602031"]="...?",
    ["DialogueOption20602041"]="It gets bigger?",
    ["DialogueOption20602051"]="How did you know?",
    ["DialogueOption20602061"]="So it's a coincidence?",
    ["DialogueOption20602071"]="(Thinking) Devil’s thorn and snake blood...",
    ["DialogueOption20602081"]="(Raises eyebrows) For example?",
    ["DialogueOption20602091"]="Of course!",
    ["DialogueOption20603011"]="Those people in the mission...",
    ["DialogueOption20603021"]="Could they have...",
    ["DialogueOption20603031"]="(Covers his mouth!)",
    ["DialogueOption20603041"]="I have my reasons.",
    ["DialogueOption20603051"]="(Surprised) You’re…",
    ["DialogueOption20603061"]="... Thank you.",
    ["DialogueOption20603071"]="I'll go find them now!",
    ["DialogueOption20604011"]="Are you Shah?",
    ["DialogueOption20604021"]="Neste said...",
    ["DialogueOption20604041"]="I can help you!",
    ["DialogueOption20606011"]="!!",
    ["DialogueOption20606021"]="Hold on! Wait for me!",
    ["DialogueOption20607011"]="I'm here to see you.",
    ["DialogueOption20607021"]="(Provide details)",
    ["DialogueOption20608021"]="(Go up and greet them)",
    ["DialogueOption20608031"]="(Provide details)",
    ["DialogueOption20608041"]="Is the guy you're looking for called Cesar?",
    ["DialogueOption20608051"]="If I can help...",
    ["DialogueOption20611011"]="Those notes were you...",
    ["DialogueOption20611021"]="... Who are you?",
    ["DialogueOption20612011"]="...... (Hesitates)",
    ["DialogueOption20612021"]="Sorry... I...",
    ["DialogueOption20612031"]="I’m from the Church Mission...",
    ["DialogueOption20612041"]="(Pleading) This is important!",
    ["DialogueOption20612051"]="???",
    ["DialogueOption20613011"]="But it was in the daytime.",
    ["DialogueOption20613021"]="... What are you trying to say?",
    ["DialogueOption20614021"]="(Contradicting him)",
    ["DialogueOption20614031"]="... That Church Mission?",
    ["DialogueOption20615011"]="You said...",
    ["DialogueOption20615021"]="Lord Commander!",
    ["DialogueOption20615041"]="Honorable and strong.",
    ["DialogueOption20615042"]="Courageous and wise.",
    ["DialogueOption20615061"]="?!",
    ["DialogueOption20615071"]="You are...?!",
    ["DialogueOption20616011"]="... The Church Mission?!",
    ["DialogueOption20616031"]="(Gritting teeth) The dreamland...",
    ["DialogueOption20616041"]="Can we still catch up with the mission?",
    ["DialogueOption20616051"]="I'm <color=#CA2E0AFF>going back to Prontera</color> right away.",
    ["DialogueOption20617011"]="(Apologetic) I’m sorry...",
    ["DialogueOption20617021"]="(Tell the truth)",
    ["DialogueOption20617031"]="It looks like he gave me something.",
    ["DialogueOption20617032"]="(Fumbles with pockets)",
    ["DialogueOption20618011"]="I think that night I dreamt that...",
    ["DialogueOption20618012"]="A young lad became the king...",
    ["DialogueOption20618021"]="?!",
    ["DialogueOption20618031"]="But...",
    ["DialogueOption20618041"]="(Puzzled) But Your Majesty...",
    ["DialogueOption20618051"]="The King's Mandate...",
    ["DialogueOption20618061"]="What should we do now?",
    ["DialogueOption20618091"]="... It's my duty to help a friend.",
    ["DialogueOption20701051"]="What happened?",
    ["DialogueOption20701052"]="You guys are fighting?",
    ["DialogueOption20702011"]="You want me to help Speeka?",
    ["DialogueOption20702031"]="Why don't you...",
    ["DialogueOption20702051"]="Alright.",
    ["DialogueOption20703011"]="It's Cecilia...",
    ["DialogueOption20703021"]="No! Absolutely not!",
    ["DialogueOption20703022"]="It's to be a witness to your mighty courage!",
    ["DialogueOption20704021"]="But there are still a number of monsters...",
    ["DialogueOption20705011"]="Who's that?",
    ["DialogueOption20705031"]="Return now",
    ["DialogueOption20705032"]="Give me a moment.",
    ["DialogueOption20706031"]="(Enquire)",
    ["DialogueOption20708011"]="(Agree)",
    ["DialogueOption20708012"]="(Give advice)",
    ["DialogueOption20708041"]="Worth a shot, I guess?",
    ["DialogueOption20708051"]="(Surprised) You don't mean...",
    ["DialogueOption20708071"]="You seem very aware of these things.",
    ["DialogueOption20709011"]="A glass of your finest, please.",
    ["DialogueOption20709012"]="The kind good for tempting Galapagos, please.",
    ["DialogueOption20709021"]="(Deflect)",
    ["DialogueOption20709022"]="(Make a joke)",
    ["DialogueOption20709041"]="But previously you...",
    ["DialogueOption20709051"]="...",
    ["DialogueOption20709061"]="But, the thing is, you once...",
    ["DialogueOption20709081"]="Definitely!",
    ["DialogueOption20710011"]="(Brandish weapon)",
    ["DialogueOption20710021"]="(Take the photo out with the left hand)",
    ["DialogueOption20710031"]="(Take the beer with the right hand)",
    ["DialogueOption20710041"]="(Make a hand switch)",
    ["DialogueOption20711011"]="Careful!",
    ["DialogueOption20711021"]="(Take out the handkerchief)",
    ["DialogueOption20711031"]="?!?!",
    ["DialogueOption20714011"]="Does this mean that Barbara...",
    ["DialogueOption20715021"]="So...?",
    ["DialogueOption20716031"]="We could help!",
    ["DialogueOption20717031"]="No, we... Ouch!",
    ["DialogueOption20717051"]="Doreen was... Ouch!",
    ["DialogueOption20717111"]="(Lost in thought)",
    ["DialogueOption20718011"]="Hello, we were just...",
    ["DialogueOption20718031"]="Actually, could we just...",
    ["DialogueOption20718041"]="(Point at the forest)",
    ["DialogueOption20718042"]="(Point at the ground)",
    ["DialogueOption20719011"]="(Return poems)",
    ["DialogueOption20719012"]="(Enquire)",
    ["DialogueOption20719051"]="(Nods)",
    ["DialogueOption20719061"]="\"Soulless\"...?",
    ["DialogueOption20720011"]="And Drying Square is?",
    ["DialogueOption20720031"]="It'll be alright.",
    ["DialogueOption20720032"]="We'll go look for him.",
    ["DialogueOption20721041"]="?!!!",
    ["DialogueOption20722021"]="So should we just...?",
    ["DialogueOption20722031"]="Huh...?",
    ["DialogueOption20723011"]="Callahan's testimony",
    ["DialogueOption20723012"]="Fellow students' assessments",
    ["DialogueOption20723021"]="The \"Dance of all Dances\"",
    ["DialogueOption20723022"]="Her relationship to Vendra",
    ["DialogueOption20723031"]="The monsters' attitudes",
    ["DialogueOption20723032"]="Signatures on the handkerchief and sword",
    ["DialogueOption20723051"]="Self-defense?",
    ["DialogueOption20723071"]="What do you mean?",
    ["DialogueOption20725041"]="(Surprised) You don't mean...",
    ["DialogueOption20725061"]="...!",
    ["DialogueOption20726121"]="(Surprised) So you...",
    ["DialogueOption20729021"]="(Angrily) You...",
    ["DialogueOption20730011"]="Is that it?",
    ["DialogueOption20730021"]="And the book...?",
    ["DialogueOption20730041"]="What a shame...",
    ["DialogueOption20730042"]="It's not the Sword of Valiant",
    ["DialogueOption20730081"]="In that case...",
    ["DialogueOption20730082"]="I'm still going to be your witness!",
    ["DialogueOption20801011"]="(Patting) Fulkyn!",
    ["DialogueOption20801021"]="What things are escaping?",
    ["DialogueOption20801031"]="A little translation, please?",
    ["DialogueOption20801041"]="Just say you took some PHOTOS!",
    ["DialogueOption20802011"]="Explode?!",
    ["DialogueOption20802021"]="What can we do then?",
    ["DialogueOption20802041"]="Understood.",
    ["DialogueOption20803011"]="Are you alright?",
    ["DialogueOption20803021"]="L-Let me put it back for you?",
    ["DialogueOption20803031"]="...Robot?",
    ["DialogueOption20803041"]="I'm not... not going to let it get away! Oh yes, I am the master!",
    ["DialogueOption20804011"]="Excuse me...",
    ["DialogueOption20804061"]="!!!",
    ["DialogueOption20805011"]="...?",
    ["DialogueOption20806021"]="??!!",
    ["DialogueOption20806041"]="This is not a dog at all!",
    ["DialogueOption20806051"]="I... Eh?",
    ["DialogueOption20806061"]="That's weird...?",
    ["DialogueOption20806062"]="Feels a little... Soft?",
    ["DialogueOption20806101"]="(Shocked) What's going on?",
    ["DialogueOption20807031"]="That...",
    ["DialogueOption20807041"]="It's fine.",
    ["DialogueOption20807051"]="Have you ever seen...?",
    ["DialogueOption20807061"]="Thank you!",
    ["DialogueOption20808051"]="(SHOCKED)!!!",
    ["DialogueOption20808091"]="Whew... Seems we are okay?",
    ["DialogueOption20809011"]="I'm just running an errand...",
    ["DialogueOption20809021"]="I am going after it now...",
    ["DialogueOption20809031"]="This is...?",
    ["DialogueOption20809061"]="(Grateful) Thank you.",
    ["DialogueOption20810011"]="...?",
    ["DialogueOption20810031"]="Hard to believe someone fooled you.",
    ["DialogueOption20810041"]="...You know him?",
    ["DialogueOption20811011"]="From Juno University...",
    ["DialogueOption20811021"]="Huh?",
    ["DialogueOption20813011"]="SPEAK IN SIMPLE WORDS!!!",
    ["DialogueOption20813031"]="...9?",
    ["DialogueOption20813041"]="The culprit's...",
    ["DialogueOption20813042"]="Next target?",
    ["DialogueOption20815011"]="Why did this culprit...?",
    ["DialogueOption20816051"]="The Mysterious Device?",
    ["DialogueOption20816161"]="!!!",
    ["DialogueOption20816181"]="What are you doing?",
    ["DialogueOption20817011"]="(Consoling him)",
    ["DialogueOption20817021"]="But you said...",
    ["DialogueOption20817031"]="(Pondering) Just now...",
    ["DialogueOption20817041"]="What is that?",
    ["DialogueOption20817051"]="What is the dimensional rift...?",
    ["DialogueOption20817061"]="(Headache) Right...",
    ["DialogueOption20817062"]="Just stop it...",
    ["DialogueOption20817071"]="You mean...?",
    ["DialogueOption20817081"]="9!",
    ["DialogueOption20830011"]="What are you doing?",
    ["DialogueOption20830041"]="You... admire him a lot?",
    ["DialogueOption20830051"]="So, what should we do now?",
    ["DialogueOption20830091"]="Are you thinking...",
    ["DialogueOption20830101"]="To time travel?",
    ["DialogueOption20830111"]="I will!",
    ["DialogueOption20830121"]="Why don't you go by yourself?",
    ["DialogueOption20830131"]="I see.",
    ["DialogueOption20830132"]="... It better be.",
    ["DialogueOption20831011"]="Yes, but...",
    ["DialogueOption20831012"]="No.",
    ["DialogueOption20831041"]="W-What?",
    ["DialogueOption20832011"]="The correct timeline?",
    ["DialogueOption20834011"]="(Explain what happened)",
    ["DialogueOption20834021"]="About Gamow...",
    ["DialogueOption20834031"]="Describe what Gamow looks like.",
    ["DialogueOption20834041"]="It's... this year?",
    ["DialogueOption20834051"]="Describe what's unusual about Gamow.",
    ["DialogueOption20834071"]="Advise Thanatos to give up.",
    ["DialogueOption20834072"]="Hunt down Morroc.",
    ["DialogueOption20836011"]="You're calm.",
    ["DialogueOption20836021"]="Would you regret it?",
    ["DialogueOption20837011"]="Are you alright?",
    ["DialogueOption20837042"]="Where to next?",
    ["DialogueOption20841011"]="Are you mad?",
    ["DialogueOption20841031"]="Lush's here too?",
    ["DialogueOption20841041"]="What exactly happened?",
    ["DialogueOption20843011"]="You know everything?",
    ["DialogueOption20843021"]="What do you need?",
    ["DialogueOption20844011"]="<color=#CA2E0AFF>\"Be brave and speak the truth.\"</color>",
    ["DialogueOption20844021"]="Could it be that he has a feeling for Lush?",
    ["DialogueOption20844031"]="You know...?",
    ["DialogueOption20844061"]="Let me try.",
    ["DialogueOption20860011"]="What are you trying to do?",
    ["DialogueOption20860031"]="That's so cruel!",
    ["DialogueOption20860041"]="I'm leaving?",
    ["DialogueOption20860042"]="There's nothing else to do?",
    ["DialogueOption20860071"]="Shh, keep it down...",
    ["DialogueOption20860091"]="But...",
    ["DialogueOption20861011"]="Have you seen Zenlur?",
    ["DialogueOption20861031"]="You don't want him to come back?",
    ["DialogueOption20861041"]="... Can I do anything to help?",
    ["DialogueOption20863011"]="Toss it!!!",
    ["DialogueOption20863012"]="And wash your hands!!!",
    ["DialogueOption20863031"]="Where's Zenlur?",
    ["DialogueOption20863041"]="So...?",
    ["DialogueOption20863051"]="Sounds awesome.",
    ["DialogueOption20863052"]="Sounds awful.",
    ["DialogueOption20864011"]="Where's Zenlur?",
    ["DialogueOption20864031"]="(Threatening) You better start talking now.",
    ["DialogueOption20864032"]="(Giving in) Please...",
    ["DialogueOption20865011"]="Now can you tell me...",
    ["DialogueOption20865021"]="...",
    ["DialogueOption20866011"]="(Battle stance) Hey!",
    ["DialogueOption20866021"]="Artificial bodies?",
    ["DialogueOption20866041"]="You!!!",
    ["DialogueOption20867021"]="I'm here to take Zenlur back.",
    ["DialogueOption20867031"]="So, you're only,",
    ["DialogueOption20867032"]="doing surgery for him?",
    ["DialogueOption20867071"]="What referred him?",
    ["DialogueOption20867081"]="... I see.",
    ["DialogueOption20868011"]="(Look at Ivy)",
    ["DialogueOption20868021"]="???",
    ["DialogueOption20868051"]="Hold on for a second...",
    ["DialogueOption20868071"]="Allow me!",
    ["DialogueOption20869021"]="What did you use to make it?",
    ["DialogueOption20869031"]="...",
    ["DialogueOption20869101"]="!?",
    ["DialogueOption20870011"]="Wow!",
    ["DialogueOption20870031"]="But...",
    ["DialogueOption20870032"]="The people trapped in Lighthalzen...",
    ["DialogueOption20871041"]="How did you know...",
    ["DialogueOption20873021"]="Ahem! Ahem, ahem!",
    ["DialogueOption20873031"]="I was there back in Juno...",
    ["DialogueOption20873041"]="...?",
    ["DialogueOption20873051"]="Where are the surveys?",
    ["DialogueOption20873071"]="Understood.",
    ["DialogueOption20874011"]="Stop!",
    ["DialogueOption20874021"]="(Explain your intent)",
    ["DialogueOption20874031"]="You need to complete the survey.",
    ["DialogueOption20875011"]="I also want to know...",
    ["DialogueOption20875021"]="Those workers...",
    ["DialogueOption20875041"]="I think...",
    ["DialogueOption20875042"]="This isn't right...",
    ["DialogueOption20876011"]="How did you know?",
    ["DialogueOption20876021"]="About Rekenber...",
    ["DialogueOption20876031"]="Did you not...",
    ["DialogueOption20876041"]="Name your price.",
    ["DialogueOption20876051"]="What do you need them for?",
    ["DialogueOption20877011"]="And your return?",
    ["DialogueOption20877021"]="?",
    ["DialogueOption20877041"]="...",
    ["DialogueOption20877071"]="(Lost in thought)",
    ["DialogueOption20877081"]="!?",
    ["DialogueOption20877082"]="Give me back my dragon hearts!!!",
    ["DialogueOption20878011"]="Actually...",
    ["DialogueOption20878021"]="(Share information)",
    ["DialogueOption20878031"]="If...",
    ["DialogueOption20879011"]="Ahh!",
    ["DialogueOption20879021"]="Were you stalking me?",
    ["DialogueOption20879022"]="What's wrong?",
    ["DialogueOption20879051"]="I'm here for...",
    ["DialogueOption20879071"]="I'll ask around for you.",
    ["DialogueOption20890011"]="Many...",
    ["DialogueOption20890051"]="Leave it to me.",
    ["DialogueOption20891011"]="What about your story?",
    ["DialogueOption20892011"]="What is it?",
    ["DialogueOption20892021"]="What cargo?",
    ["DialogueOption20892041"]="(Mention the survey)",
    ["DialogueOption20892051"]="I'll come with you!",
    ["DialogueOption20893081"]="How much do you want?",
    ["DialogueOption20894011"]="Three R&D Dept Sectors?",
    ["DialogueOption20895011"]="(Reveal identity)",
    ["DialogueOption20896011"]="Wait, you too?",
    ["DialogueOption20896021"]="I can request permission for you.",
    ["DialogueOption20896022"]="Once we're back in Prontera.",
    ["DialogueOption20896031"]="...",
    ["DialogueOption20896041"]="What do you mean?",
    ["DialogueOption20896051"]="(Doubtful)",
    ["DialogueOption20896061"]="My help in Geffen.",
    ["DialogueOption20896062"]="That is what you are looking for, right?",
    ["DialogueOption20896081"]="Deal!",
    ["DialogueOption20897031"]="(Explain...)",
    ["DialogueOption20897071"]="???",
    ["DialogueOption20898011"]="Are you alright?",
    ["DialogueOption20898021"]="What's the difference?",
    ["DialogueOption20898041"]="I just realized.",
    ["DialogueOption20898042"]="You didn't need my help back there.",
    ["DialogueOption20900011"]="Why?",
    ["DialogueOption20900021"]="Do you want me to <color=#CA2E0AFF>follow</color> them?",
    ["DialogueOption20901011"]="I'll carry you!",
    ["DialogueOption20901012"]="I'll track them alone!",
    ["DialogueOption20901051"]="Stop",
    ["DialogueOption20902011"]="Should we split up?",
    ["DialogueOption20902031"]="You set it, right?",
    ["DialogueOption20903011"]="(Explain what happened)",
    ["DialogueOption20903021"]="(Point out all locations)",
    ["DialogueOption20903031"]="Huh?",
    ["DialogueOption20904011"]="What happened?",
    ["DialogueOption20904021"]="What about Morroc?",
    ["DialogueOption20904041"]="(Look at the dark circle on his face.)",
    ["DialogueOption20904061"]="(Pass on Sun Euin's message.)",
    ["DialogueOption20906051"]="What?!",
    ["DialogueOption20907011"]="Excuse me...",
    ["DialogueOption20908021"]="They've arrived in Rachel?",
    ["DialogueOption20908031"]="What?!!",
    ["DialogueOption20908051"]="Of all places... why the mines...",
    ["DialogueOption20908061"]="Okay.",
    ["DialogueOption20908062"]="Nope.",
    ["DialogueOption20908091"]="What is it?",
    ["DialogueOption20908101"]="Where should I start looking?",
    ["DialogueOption20909011"]="I would like to ask you about...",
    ["DialogueOption20909012"]="Pope St. Isumia.",
    ["DialogueOption20909021"]="Do you know her?",
    ["DialogueOption20909051"]="What happened to them?",
    ["DialogueOption20909071"]="Two completely different...",
    ["DialogueOption20909072"]="History...",
    ["DialogueOption20911011"]="Tell me...",
    ["DialogueOption20911012"]="Why weren't they here?",
    ["DialogueOption20911031"]="?!!",
    ["DialogueOption20911041"]="A letter?",
    ["DialogueOption20912021"]="You're not familiar with this place...",
    ["DialogueOption20912022"]="I'll handle the investigation.",
    ["DialogueOption20912031"]="My current identity is...",
    ["DialogueOption20912041"]="Understood.",
    ["DialogueOption20913011"]="I'll take it.",
    ["DialogueOption20913021"]="One of each.",
    ["DialogueOption20913031"]="Got a few names I need info on.",
    ["DialogueOption20914011"]="(Describe the team's appearance in detail)",
    ["DialogueOption20914021"]="They're my companions.",
    ["DialogueOption20914022"]="I have a score to settle with them.",
    ["DialogueOption20914081"]="Who's the guide?",
    ["DialogueOption20914091"]="Take me to the kid.",
    ["DialogueOption20914101"]="(Pay)",
    ["DialogueOption20915031"]="Where did they go?",
    ["DialogueOption20915051"]="Why wouldn't I?",
    ["DialogueOption20915061"]="!!!",
    ["DialogueOption20915071"]="Take me there.",
    ["DialogueOption20915081"]="(Pay)",
    ["DialogueOption20915091"]="(Pay)",
    ["DialogueOption20915101"]="(Pay)",
    ["DialogueOption20916011"]="I'm here to sign up.",
    ["DialogueOption20916021"]="(Inquire)",
    ["DialogueOption20917011"]="Where did you get this?",
    ["DialogueOption20917021"]="(Step down hard on his hand)",
    ["DialogueOption20917031"]="Be specific!",
    ["DialogueOption20917041"]="Where do they end up?",
    ["DialogueOption20917051"]="Where's your boss?",
    ["DialogueOption20917061"]="(Keep stepping down) About today...",
    ["DialogueOption20918011"]="What is it?",
    ["DialogueOption20918031"]="!!!",
    ["DialogueOption20918041"]="Where did he go after checking out?",
    ["DialogueOption20919011"]="(Share information)",
    ["DialogueOption20919031"]="Are you saying...?",
    ["DialogueOption20920011"]="Have you ever seen...?",
    ["DialogueOption20920021"]="Did you let her go?",
    ["DialogueOption20921021"]="...",
    ["DialogueOption20921031"]="(I can't blow my cover...)",
    ["DialogueOption20921041"]="(Goldie was here...)",
    ["DialogueOption20921042"]="(If I were in her place...)",
    ["DialogueOption20921051"]="(There must be a trace...)",
    ["DialogueOption20921052"]="(Search, hurry!)",
    ["DialogueOption20921061"]="(Wait, that is...?)",
    ["DialogueOption20921062"]="(Goldie's dagger and...)",
    ["DialogueOption20921071"]="(That's a distress marker...)",
    ["DialogueOption20921072"]="Step back.",
    ["DialogueOption20922011"]="(Tell him what you saw)",
    ["DialogueOption20922041"]="What do you mean?",
    ["DialogueOption20922042"]="Shouldn't we rescue them now?",
    ["DialogueOption20922071"]="(Accept)",
    ["DialogueOption20922072"]="(Refuse)",
    ["DialogueOption20922101"]="Of course.",
    ["DialogueOption20930021"]="No, no, no, I'm not...",
    ["DialogueOption20930031"]="Let go!",
    ["DialogueOption20931011"]="I don't even know you!",
    ["DialogueOption20931012"]="Captain Alquein?",
    ["DialogueOption20932021"]="But her armor...",
    ["DialogueOption20932041"]="Glast Heim?",
    ["DialogueOption20933041"]="She's the founder of Arunafeltz.",
    ["DialogueOption20933071"]="You mean...?",
    ["DialogueOption20934031"]="You said...",
    ["DialogueOption20934051"]="We need to drink it too?",
    ["DialogueOption20934091"]="Curtis...",
    ["DialogueOption20935011"]="Are you the one summoning us?",
    ["DialogueOption20935031"]="Yes.",
    ["DialogueOption20935041"]="(Explain the situation)",
    ["DialogueOption20935051"]="What?",
    ["DialogueOption20936011"]="No...",
    ["DialogueOption20936021"]="!!!",
    ["DialogueOption20936031"]="So, how do I ask?",
    ["DialogueOption20936071"]="He's fading away!",
    ["DialogueOption20937011"]="(Explain)",
    ["DialogueOption20937061"]="Uh...",
    ["DialogueOption20938161"]="(Tell him the truth)",
    ["DialogueOption20938162"]="(Remain silent)",
    ["DialogueOption20939011"]="(Explain)",
    ["DialogueOption20939031"]="???",
    ["DialogueOption20941021"]="Hello?",
    ["DialogueOption20941031"]="Are you here for...",
    ["DialogueOption20941032"]="Reporting the Dawn Moon Festival?",
    ["DialogueOption20942021"]="(Agree)",
    ["DialogueOption20942022"]="(Unconvinced)",
    ["DialogueOption20942051"]="But I heard that...",
    ["DialogueOption20942052"]="Priest Yus Amar won't be attending...",
    ["DialogueOption20942061"]="Malam",
    ["DialogueOption20942071"]="Yes.",
    ["DialogueOption20942101"]="???",
    ["DialogueOption20942111"]="???",
    ["DialogueOption20942131"]="Me?",
    ["DialogueOption20943011"]="What about the others?",
    ["DialogueOption20943021"]="Is it still the same mining site?",
    ["DialogueOption20944011"]="About Iron-Blooded Priest...",
    ["DialogueOption20944012"]="(Stay silent)",
    ["DialogueOption20945011"]="I came from Grey Wolf Village...",
    ["DialogueOption20945021"]="Speaking of nomads, people here...",
    ["DialogueOption20945031"]="(Bring up the old interview)",
    ["DialogueOption20945041"]="!!!",
    ["DialogueOption20945071"]="Alright.",
    ["DialogueOption20946011"]="(Take out the camera)",
    ["DialogueOption20948011"]="What's your next move?",
    ["DialogueOption20948021"]="Transportation... logistics?",
    ["DialogueOption20948031"]="I'll scout out some info for him.",
    ["DialogueOption20949021"]="I saw their guards.",
    ["DialogueOption20951021"]="Is there an issue with the material?",
    ["DialogueOption20951031"]="Actually...",
    ["DialogueOption20951051"]="Do we need to gather materials again?",
    ["DialogueOption20951061"]="???",
    ["DialogueOption20951071"]="You mean...",
    ["DialogueOption20951081"]="That's a pretty risky assumption.",
    ["DialogueOption20951082"]="The ones who benefit from this...",
    ["DialogueOption20952011"]="I was just passing by.",
    ["DialogueOption20952012"]="I didn't take your commission.",
    ["DialogueOption20952031"]="It doesn't sound that hard, but I'll take it.",
    ["DialogueOption20952032"]="I'm leaving. Bye.",
    ["DialogueOption20954011"]="Look at its leaves...",
    ["DialogueOption20954021"]="Its stems...",
    ["DialogueOption20954031"]="Its roots...",
    ["DialogueOption20954061"]="Professor Viola?",
    ["DialogueOption20954071"]="Moderately patient?",
    ["DialogueOption20954091"]="???",
    ["DialogueOption20955011"]="(Explain your intent)",
    ["DialogueOption20955021"]="She's in Rachel.",
    ["DialogueOption20955041"]="Please, calm down!",
    ["DialogueOption20955051"]="That's what it sounds like.",
    ["DialogueOption20956011"]="Is it unusable?",
    ["DialogueOption20957011"]="What's wrong?",
    ["DialogueOption20959021"]="Viola suggests...",
    ["DialogueOption20959022"]="A new essay topic.",
    ["DialogueOption20960021"]="... Huh?",
    ["DialogueOption20961021"]="What's wrong?",
    ["DialogueOption20961031"]="Then I'll speak with the village chief.",
    ["DialogueOption20961041"]="!!!",
    ["DialogueOption20961051"]="Sorry to hear that...",
    ["DialogueOption20961091"]="Shh—",
    ["DialogueOption20961111"]="What can I do to help?",
    ["DialogueOption20961121"]="Since you're not scared.",
    ["DialogueOption20961122"]="Why should I be?",
    ["DialogueOption20962011"]="(Explain your intent)",
    ["DialogueOption20962081"]="This time—",
    ["DialogueOption20962082"]="We will fulfill the chief's final wish.",
    ["DialogueOption20963031"]="What are you talking about?",
    ["DialogueOption20963041"]="...",
    ["DialogueOption20963051"]="Of course!",
    ["DialogueOption20963071"]="(Explain the funeral procedure)",
    ["DialogueOption20963091"]="I'll give it a try...",
    ["DialogueOption20965011"]="But Grey Wolf Village...",
    ["DialogueOption20965041"]="Let me think...",
    ["DialogueOption20967041"]="Then...",
    ["DialogueOption20967042"]="Why did you choose to attend the funeral?",
    ["DialogueOption20969021"]="Could this be Shikoti's slab?",
    ["DialogueOption20970011"]="What must I do?",
    ["DialogueOption20971031"]="Who are they?",
    ["DialogueOption20972011"]="(Explain your intent)",
    ["DialogueOption20972021"]="Yes.",
    ["DialogueOption20972061"]="Leave it to me.",
    ["DialogueOption20974011"]="You...",
    ["DialogueOption20975011"]="What about it?",
    ["DialogueOption20975021"]="I'll go to Glast Heim right away.",
    ["DialogueOption20976021"]="Yet, I stand in the present.",
    ["DialogueOption20976022"]="I have a reason to gain my power right now.",
    ["DialogueOption20976031"]="The future is not mine alone.",
    ["DialogueOption20976032"]="It belongs to countless others.",
    ["DialogueOption20976071"]="Understood!",
    ["DialogueOption20977011"]="What should I do?",
    ["DialogueOption20977021"]="It's <color=#CA2E0AFF>Criatura Academy</color>...",
    ["DialogueOption20977031"]="<color=#CA2E0AFF>The mentor of first-class</color>...",
    ["DialogueOption20978021"]="(Explain your intent)",
    ["DialogueOption20978031"]="What is it?",
    ["DialogueOption20978061"]="...I understand.",
    ["DialogueOption20979011"]="(Explain your intent)",
    ["DialogueOption20979021"]="It is my treasured companion.",
    ["DialogueOption20981021"]="Will you attend as well?",
    ["DialogueOption20983021"]="Countless souls?",
    ["DialogueOption20987011"]="(Share your insights.)",
    ["DialogueOption20988031"]="What's wrong?",
    ["DialogueOption20988041"]="Can I have it?",
    ["DialogueOption20989011"]="(Explain the situation)",
    ["DialogueOption20989031"]="Noble kids...",
    ["DialogueOption20989032"]="The Pope?",
    ["DialogueOption20989041"]="Hey-Hey-Hey!",
    ["DialogueOption20991021"]="(Show the fairy tale book)",
    ["DialogueOption20993011"]="Who are you?",
    ["DialogueOption20993031"]="What's going on?",
    ["DialogueOption20993051"]="(The setting may be different...)",
    ["DialogueOption20993052"]="(It's still part of the story...)",
    ["DialogueOption20993081"]="We will go together!",
    ["DialogueOption20994051"]="Of course!",
    ["DialogueOption20996011"]="(Recount the journey through the dream)",
    ["DialogueOption20996031"]="Why don't we...",
    ["DialogueOption20996032"]="Uncover the ending together?",
    ["DialogueOption20997011"]="Fairy tales...",
    ["DialogueOption20997012"]="They always find their perfect ending.",
    ["DialogueOption20998031"]="Who are you?",
    ["DialogueOption20999021"]="???",
    ["DialogueOption20999041"]="You...",
    ["DialogueOption21000011"]="You were eavesdropping?!",
    ["DialogueOption21000021"]="...",
    ["DialogueOption21000031"]="Do you know...",
    ["DialogueOption21000032"]="What was their relationship?",
    ["DialogueOption21000041"]="???",
    ["DialogueOption21001031"]="Hmm...",
    ["DialogueOption21002111"]="What?",
    ["DialogueOption21004051"]="(Greet)",
    ["DialogueOption21005021"]="Boggs told me!",
    ["DialogueOption21006011"]="(Explain what happened)",
    ["DialogueOption21006051"]="And now... what comes next for you?",
    ["DialogueOption21006061"]="Do you want me to help you...",
    ["DialogueOption21006062"]="Look for houses around the Temple?",
    ["DialogueOption21007011"]="Even a knowledgeable professor like you...",
    ["DialogueOption21007012"]="Needs to study?",
    ["DialogueOption21007021"]="You mean Barr Venter?",
    ["DialogueOption21008031"]="You mean...",
    ["DialogueOption21009011"]="Hello?",
    ["DialogueOption21009021"]="What?!",
    ["DialogueOption21009031"]="(The time travel malfunctioned...)",
    ["DialogueOption21009041"]="Wait—no! Don't capture my image!",
    ["DialogueOption21010011"]="I...",
    ["DialogueOption21010091"]="Are you saying...",
    ["DialogueOption21010092"]="Your name is Barr Venter?",
    ["DialogueOption21010101"]="You are Barr Venter!",
    ["DialogueOption21010121"]="Barr Venter, you need to...",
    ["DialogueOption21011041"]="What are you trying to say?",
    ["DialogueOption21011071"]="Where?",
    ["DialogueOption21011091"]="So...",
    ["DialogueOption21011092"]="Is this... a leftover command?",
    ["DialogueOption21012011"]="Yes.",
    ["DialogueOption21012021"]="Did they not get along?",
    ["DialogueOption21015021"]="(Try to convince)",
    ["DialogueOption21015081"]="She just wanted you to...",
    ["DialogueOption21015082"]="Let go of the past.",
    ["DialogueOption21015111"]="But Tamaureen said...",
    ["DialogueOption21015112"]="You used to love machines.",
    ["DialogueOption21017041"]="You can do it.",
    ["DialogueOption21017051"]="Rekensheim suits you well.",
    ["DialogueOption21017061"]="Do you want to repair Tamaureen?",
    ["DialogueOption21017101"]="Join Rekensheim.",
    ["DialogueOption21017102"]="You will get what you want.",
    ["DialogueOption21019011"]="I'm not...",
    ["DialogueOption21019021"]="Mercenary uprising?",
    ["DialogueOption21019022"]="What year is it now?",
    ["DialogueOption21019031"]="I'm a mercenary too!",
    ["DialogueOption21019032"]="I'm here to find a relative!",
    ["DialogueOption21020011"]="Barr Venter?",
    ["DialogueOption21020031"]="Is he leaving?",
    ["DialogueOption21020041"]="Any idea...",
    ["DialogueOption21020042"]="Why does he seem upset?",
    ["DialogueOption21021031"]="Why did he refuse?",
    ["DialogueOption21021091"]="What?!!",
    ["DialogueOption21021111"]="Bye!",
    ["DialogueOption21022021"]="I...",
    ["DialogueOption21022031"]="...",
    ["DialogueOption21022051"]="I'm traveling through time...",
    ["DialogueOption21022052"]="And ran into Barr Venter.",
    ["DialogueOption21022061"]="Barr Venter is going to try to rewrite history...",
    ["DialogueOption21022062"]="For you.",
    ["DialogueOption21022071"]="(Tell the truth)",
    ["DialogueOption21022081"]="Yes.",
    ["DialogueOption21022101"]="It's not like that.",
    ["DialogueOption21023021"]="What are you talking about?!",
    ["DialogueOption21023091"]="I merely followed...",
    ["DialogueOption21023092"]="The path that history had written.",
    ["DialogueOption21023101"]="!!!",
    ["DialogueOption21023111"]="...",
    ["DialogueOption21023161"]="!!!",
    ["DialogueOption21024011"]="I...",
    ["DialogueOption21024021"]="What should we do now?",
    ["DialogueOption21025011"]="A threat from another world?",
    ["DialogueOption21025041"]="Got it!",
    ["DialogueOption21026011"]="This is...",
    ["DialogueOption21026021"]="This is a world different from yours.",
    ["DialogueOption21026031"]="(Repeat what the goddess told you.)",
    ["DialogueOption21026041"]="(Shake your head.)",
    ["DialogueOption21026051"]="Let me help.",
    ["DialogueOption21026061"]="It's what the goddess told me to do.",
    ["DialogueOption21027011"]="I'm good today!",
    ["DialogueOption21027021"]="What is it?",
    ["DialogueOption21027022"]="Of course!",
    ["DialogueOption21027041"]="I'm not sure...",
    ["DialogueOption21027042"]="However...",
    ["DialogueOption21027051"]="I can get their work for you.",
    ["DialogueOption21027061"]="I'm happy to help.",
    ["DialogueOption21028011"]="I'm looking for...",
    ["DialogueOption21028021"]="Great?",
    ["DialogueOption21028031"]="Okay!",
    ["DialogueOption21028041"]="What is it?",
    ["DialogueOption21028051"]="Alright...",
    ["DialogueOption21029011"]="Snap out of it...",
    ["DialogueOption21029021"]="I'm here for...",
    ["DialogueOption21029031"]="Clenches fist",
    ["DialogueOption21029041"]="I don't want immortality...",
    ["DialogueOption21029042"]="I just want the poetry collection...",
    ["DialogueOption21030011"]="I want...",
    ["DialogueOption21030021"]="This is what happened...",
    ["DialogueOption21030031"]="I'll take care of it!",
    ["DialogueOption21030041"]="Leave it to me!",
    ["DialogueOption21030101"]="Strange... How did anyone find their way here?",
    ["DialogueOption21030201"]="Right, not bad.",
    ["DialogueOption21030301"]="Right, not bad.",
    ["DialogueOption21030401"]="Very good, very good!",
    ["DialogueOption21030501"]="My head... I'm so dizzy... I don't feel so good...",
    ["DialogueOption21030601"]="It's done. Ladle the medicine out while it's still hot!",
    ["DialogueOption21031011"]="I'll pass!",
    ["DialogueOption21031101"]="Waaaaaaaa! I've been found!",
    ["DialogueOption21031201"]="Oh! My bride has returned!",
    ["DialogueOption21031301"]="Ew, these things are absolutely disgusting... By Odin, the stench...",
    ["DialogueOption21031401"]="All in the name of love... Urgh... I'm about to suffocate...",
    ["DialogueOption21031501"]="I hope Heflee will like them... Bleurgh!",
    ["DialogueOption21031601"]="Who's there? How dare you insult Osiris' honor!",
    ["DialogueOption21031701"]="Oh no, this is bad. It's covered in Matyr saliva.",
    ["DialogueOption21031801"]="Oh, thanks! Look, the finger is still moving slightly!",
    ["DialogueOption21031901"]="A red, beating heart! It belongs to Osiris!",
    ["DialogueOption21032001"]="The shape of your forehead is so elegant!",
    ["DialogueOption21032011"]="The poetry collection...",
    ["DialogueOption21032101"]="Well then, it's time for us to return to our eternal slumber. Adventurer, goodbye and I hope to never see you again.",
    ["DialogueOption21032201"]="Come—stir it clockwise, and the potion will bubble.",
    ["DialogueOption21032301"]="Keep going—stir it anticlockwise and watch a mystery become a masterpiece.",
    ["DialogueOption21033011"]="That's right, and it's about...",
    ["DialogueOption21034011"]="What is it?",
    ["DialogueOption21034021"]="Lesser spirit?",
    ["DialogueOption21034022"]="What are they?",
    ["DialogueOption21034041"]="The city of magic...",
    ["DialogueOption21034051"]="Leave it to me!",
    ["DialogueOption21035011"]="(Explain why you came.)",
    ["DialogueOption21035031"]="Please!",
    ["DialogueOption21035032"]="Just this once! Make an exception!",
    ["DialogueOption21035051"]="I'll go see what I can do!",
    ["DialogueOption21036011"]="Explain what happened.",
    ["DialogueOption21036021"]="Unless?",
    ["DialogueOption21036022"]="Is there a workaround?",
    ["DialogueOption21036031"]="She's...",
    ["DialogueOption21036032"]="The one from the goddess' prophecy...",
    ["DialogueOption21037011"]="Thank you for the compliment!",
    ["DialogueOption21037021"]="Thank you!",
    ["DialogueOption21038011"]="Actually...",
    ["DialogueOption21038031"]="Don't mention it...",
    ["DialogueOption21039011"]="I'm here for...",
    ["DialogueOption21039021"]="Give me one second!",
    ["DialogueOption21039022"]="They're out of dried fish!",
    ["DialogueOption21039041"]="Okay.",
    ["DialogueOption21040021"]="Excuse me...",
    ["DialogueOption21040031"]="(Explain why you came.)",
    ["DialogueOption21040041"]="A fish?",
    ["DialogueOption21040051"]="I see.",
    ["DialogueOption21041011"]="Explain what happened.",
    ["DialogueOption21041021"]="Not exactly...",
    ["DialogueOption21041022"]="He just wants to buy a fish...",
    ["DialogueOption21041041"]="Time to show you my skills!",
    ["DialogueOption21042021"]="You're welcome.",
    ["DialogueOption21042031"]="I'll handle it!",
    ["DialogueOption21042032"]="Leave it to me!",
    ["DialogueOption21050301"]="Oh! That's right! That's it!",
    ["DialogueOption21050401"]="My old friend, it's time for us to fight side by side again.",
    ["DialogueOption23010101"]="Too slow... Too slow!",
    ["DialogueOption23010201"]="(Surprised emoticon bubble)",
    ["DialogueOption23010301"]="Wow! Thank you so much!",
    ["DialogueOption23010401"]="By Odin, why are these rabbits going crazy?",
    ["DialogueOption23010501"]="Wow! Thank you so much!",
    ["DialogueOption23020101"]="Ah... Ouch, ouch, ouch, ouch, ouch!",
    ["DialogueOption23020201"]="Oh! Can these herbs heal my wounds?",
    ["DialogueOption23020301"]="Remember, Hornets are very sensitive monsters!",
    ["DialogueOption23020401"]="(Love emoticon bubble)",
    ["DialogueOption23020501"]="(Surprised emoticon bubble)",
    ["DialogueOption23020601"]="Thor's hammer struck the earth, the mountain he split was named Mjolnir~♪",
    ["DialogueOption23020602"]="The forest enveloped in temporal magic, who broke its seal of a thousand years~♪",
    ["DialogueOption23020603"]="The condensed magic eventually spread, making intelligent insects mutate~♪",
    ["DialogueOption23020604"]="The new king who leads the way, appears beneath the god's cruel gaze~♪",
    ["DialogueOption23020701"]="What... Is this for real?",
    ["DialogueOption23020702"]="Ah! I can't believe it's true!",
    ["DialogueOption23020801"]="It looks like... it's about to crack!?",
    ["DialogueOption23020802"]="Wait! Inside... That's no ordinary Hornet!",
    ["DialogueOption23030101"]="Adventurer, can I speak with you?",
    ["DialogueOption23030201"]="This... How is this possible!?",
    ["DialogueOption23030301"]="(Surprised emoticon bubble)",
    ["DialogueOption23030401"]="I will never allow it... You will not devour my people again!",
    ["DialogueOption23030501"]="*Whistle* Phwee! Phwee, phwee, phwee!!!",
    ["DialogueOption23030601"]="From today on, I will lead the Egyptian empire to prosperity!",
    ["DialogueOption23030602"]="Together with my queen—Eassis!",
    ["DialogueOption23030701"]="Osiris...",
    ["DialogueOption23030801"]="May Anubis bless the Pharaoh and the Queen!",
    ["DialogueOption23030901"]="(Drooling emoticon bubble)",
    ["DialogueOption23031001"]="Open your eyes, lost Pharaoh.",
    ["DialogueOption23031002"]="The body has returned to dust, but the soul will never die!",
    ["DialogueOption23031101"]="You are...",
    ["DialogueOption23031102"]="Lord Anubis...",
    ["DialogueOption23040101"]="This is all my fault... Who can help me...?",
    ["DialogueOption23040201"]="Ah, this clay tablet is buried so deep!",
    ["DialogueOption23040301"]="What... What is this?",
    ["DialogueOption23040401"]="(Scared emoticon bubble)",
    ["DialogueOption23040501"]="Look... It's happy!",
    ["DialogueOption23040601"]="(Happy emoticon bubble)",
    ["DialogueOption23040701"]="So, what's the matter with you?",
    ["DialogueOption23040702"]="Ah!",
    ["DialogueOption23040801"]="(Angry emoticon bubble)",
    ["DialogueOption23040901"]="Rosie... This is all my fault...",
    ["DialogueOption23040902"]="If... If I could go back and do it all again...",
    ["DialogueOption23041001"]="Why... Why does it have to be like this!?",
    ["DialogueOption23041002"]="Phillas! Help me!",
    ["DialogueOption23041003"]="No... Phillas... Help...",
    ["DialogueOption23041101"]="(Angry emoticon bubble)",
    ["DialogueOption23041201"]="......",
    ["DialogueOption28030101"]="I'm depending on you!",
    ["DialogueOption28030201"]="(Uncertain emoticon bubble)",
    ["DialogueOption28040101"]="Now, we will offer up this girl's blood...",
    ["DialogueOption28040201"]="For the great Lord of Chaos—Morroc!",
    ["DialogueOption28040301"]="*Crying* Brother...",
    ["DialogueOption28060101"]="(Happy emoticon bubble)",
    ["DialogueOption30005061"]="An old friend?",
    ["DialogueOption30005071"]="What is it?",
    ["DialogueOption30005081"]="Humph!",
    ["DialogueOption30006041"]="No one can turn down Zeny!",
    ["DialogueOption30006042"]="I don't like Zeny...",
    ["DialogueOption30014011"]="Why do you love Brutes so much?",
    ["DialogueOption30014021"]="Who's there?",
    ["DialogueOption30014031"]="You're so excited...",
    ["DialogueOption30014041"]="What should I do?",
    ["DialogueOption30015021"]="Where can I get it?",
    ["DialogueOption30016011"]="What should I do?",
    ["DialogueOption30016021"]="Huh? But...",
    ["DialogueOption30017011"]="The hunter's mission?",
    ["DialogueOption30017021"]="Hmm...",
    ["DialogueOption30018021"]="Why?",
    ["DialogueOption30019021"]="Hammer?",
    ["DialogueOption30019031"]="So... What shall we do?",
