    ["DialogueOption32905031"]="Who's the agent?",
    ["DialogueOption32906011"]="You must be...",
    ["DialogueOption32906012"]="So Lugenburg...",
    ["DialogueOption32906021"]="Your master is Wul...",
    ["DialogueOption32907011"]="No... but why did you...",
    ["DialogueOption32907021"]="Both...",
    ["DialogueOption32907041"]="Why didn't he just...",
    ["DialogueOption32907061"]="How did you...?!",
    ["DialogueOption32907071"]="McGille...",
    ["DialogueOption32907072"]="Really gonna die...?",
    ["DialogueOption33002011"]="Alchemy Potion?",
    ["DialogueOption33003011"]="The souls...",
    ["DialogueOption33003021"]="Leader Nicolas...",
    ["DialogueOption33004011"]="The thing besides you is...",
    ["DialogueOption33005011"]="Pour in the Strong Alcohol...",
    ["DialogueOption33102011"]="I'm ready!",
    ["DialogueOption33201021"]="Yes.",
    ["DialogueOption33202031"]="A powerful monster?",
    ["DialogueOption33203021"]="(Panic) You're gonna...",
    ["DialogueOption33203041"]="What are you up to?",
    ["DialogueOption33205011"]="Anubis? The God of the Underworld?",
    ["DialogueOption33205051"]="Well, if that's the case...",
    ["DialogueOption33207031"]="I will abide!",
    ["DialogueOption33302011"]="Ready!",
    ["DialogueOption33401021"]="Yes.",
    ["DialogueOption33403021"]="Master Hamid said...",
    ["DialogueOption33403031"]="Using myself...?",
    ["DialogueOption33403041"]="But...?",
    ["DialogueOption33405011"]="What is it?",
    ["DialogueOption33405021"]="But...",
    ["DialogueOption33405031"]="Equivalent Exchange.",
    ["DialogueOption33405041"]="That should be...",
    ["DialogueOption33502011"]="准备好了！",
    ["DialogueOption33602011"]="Ready!",
    ["DialogueOption33603021"]="Yes.",
    ["DialogueOption33604011"]="(Explain your intent)",
    ["DialogueOption33604061"]="Of course!",
    ["DialogueOption33605011"]="???",
    ["DialogueOption33605021"]="The Scroll of Destined Fate?",
    ["DialogueOption33605031"]="Are you the guardian?",
    ["DialogueOption33605041"]="What did you do?",
    ["DialogueOption33605071"]="It's sacrificing the scroll?",
    ["DialogueOption33605091"]="Why didn't you seek help?",
    ["DialogueOption33605151"]="Uh...",
    ["DialogueOption33606011"]="Can you...",
    ["DialogueOption33606021"]="I would...",
    ["DialogueOption33606041"]="I will only follow...",
    ["DialogueOption33606042"]="The decision from the heart.",
    ["DialogueOption33606071"]="I will!",
    ["DialogueOption33701011"]="...?",
    ["DialogueOption33701021"]="Have you ever seen...",
    ["DialogueOption33701022"]="A little girl and a robot?",
    ["DialogueOption33701041"]="Thank you!",
    ["DialogueOption33704011"]="This voice... Logan?",
    ["DialogueOption33705011"]="(Sigh) I'm not going to hit you.",
    ["DialogueOption33705012"]="Only if you tell me...",
    ["DialogueOption33705021"]="...Lookout?",
    ["DialogueOption33705031"]="Where would she go?",
    ["DialogueOption33705041"]="The stuff that attracts monsters...",
    ["DialogueOption33705061"]="...<color=#CA2E0AFF>West</color>?",
    ["DialogueOption33706011"]="Martistine?",
    ["DialogueOption33706021"]="Is this your robot?",
    ["DialogueOption33706031"]="Where are you?",
    ["DialogueOption33706041"]="Are you hungry?",
    ["DialogueOption33706051"]="Today is your birthday?",
    ["DialogueOption33706061"]="...Hang on for a moment.",
    ["DialogueOption33707011"]="I know.",
    ["DialogueOption33707021"]="Not at all. Thank you for your concern.",
    ["DialogueOption33707031"]="Certainly.",
    ["DialogueOption33708011"]="(Nods) And...",
    ["DialogueOption33708041"]="Absolutely. Thank you.",
    ["DialogueOption33709011"]="Yes. You want it?",
    ["DialogueOption33709021"]="Then come out now.",
    ["DialogueOption33709031"]="(Sigh) Martistine.",
    ["DialogueOption33709032"]="Don't be a bad kid.",
    ["DialogueOption33709051"]="...I offered you a chance.",
    ["DialogueOption33711021"]="...???",
    ["DialogueOption33711031"]="(Hesitating) You are...",
    ["DialogueOption33711061"]="You have multiple personalities?",
    ["DialogueOption33711071"]="...Pffft",
    ["DialogueOption33711072"]="You are a kid, after all.",
    ["DialogueOption33711081"]="...Hold still.",
    ["DialogueOption33712051"]="You have someone now.",
    ["DialogueOption33712052"]="I'll be your company. Play, talk, everything.",
    ["DialogueOption33712061"]="...Rekenber Corp?",
    ["DialogueOption33712071"]="(Extend a hand) Pinky swear.",
    ["DialogueOption33712081"]="Screw him!",
    ["DialogueOption33713011"]="I applied for...",
    ["DialogueOption33713021"]="From now on, it's your home, too.",
    ["DialogueOption33713031"]="Encounters and farewells...",
    ["DialogueOption33713032"]="Are both parts of growing up.",
    ["DialogueOption33713051"]="The real family...",
    ["DialogueOption33713052"]="Won't just take orders from you.",
    ["DialogueOption33713071"]="(Pats her head)",
    ["DialogueOption33713091"]="<color=#CA2E0AFF>We'll have plenty of time</color>.",
    ["DialogueOption33802021"]="Understood.",
    ["DialogueOption33802031"]="Un-der-stood!",
    ["DialogueOption33802061"]="Un-der-stood!",
    ["DialogueOption33901011"]="Dean, I...",
    ["DialogueOption34001031"]="So, this abbey...",
    ["DialogueOption34003011"]="(The putrid stench invades the nostrils, yet Instructor Miller's expression holds firm. He gestures for you to observe the rusted iron gate ahead.)\nLike those warriors 700 years ago, we're also at a pivotal moment in our mission - <color=#CA2E0AFF>a door not marked on any map.</color>",
    ["DialogueOption34004011"]="Yes",
    ["DialogueOption34004031"]="Could they be... the Sageworms?",
    ["DialogueOption34004061"]="!!!",
    ["DialogueOption34005011"]="What about the story?",
    ["DialogueOption34102011"]="Ready!",
    ["DialogueOption34201021"]="Yes",
    ["DialogueOption34202011"]="Who's \"she\"?",
    ["DialogueOption34202031"]="Alright.",
    ["DialogueOption34203011"]="I am...",
    ["DialogueOption34203021"]="They are dead?",
    ["DialogueOption34203031"]="But...",
    ["DialogueOption34203041"]="You know King Schmidt?",
    ["DialogueOption34203061"]="I shall stand firm in upholding justice.",
    ["DialogueOption34203062"]="But I also need formidable strength.",
    ["DialogueOption34203091"]="My teacher once said...",
    ["DialogueOption34203101"]="What?",
    ["DialogueOption34402011"]="What?",
    ["DialogueOption34402021"]="You...!",
    ["DialogueOption34501011"]="Confront?",
    ["DialogueOption34501041"]="I...",
    ["DialogueOption34601081"]="Hold her hands",
    ["DialogueOption34601082"]="Nods",
    ["DialogueOption34601111"]="Forgotten Lake?",
    ["DialogueOption34602011"]="Don't you wanna win?",
    ["DialogueOption34602061"]="Why the Stone Formation?",
    ["DialogueOption34602071"]="What if I don't agree?",
    ["DialogueOption34602081"]="... I agree.",
    ["DialogueOption34603011"]="Are you alright?",
    ["DialogueOption34604011"]="Where does it lead to?",
    ["DialogueOption34604021"]="You!",
    ["DialogueOption34604031"]="I...",
    ["DialogueOption34604041"]="I...",
    ["DialogueOption34605021"]="I want to know.",
    ["DialogueOption34605022"]="Everything I should know about...",
    ["DialogueOption34605031"]="These Skeletons...",
    ["DialogueOption34605041"]="I don't understand...",
    ["DialogueOption34605051"]="You think so?",
    ["DialogueOption34605061"]="Where are you going?",
    ["DialogueOption34701021"]="Yes.",
    ["DialogueOption34702011"]="Are you alright?",
    ["DialogueOption34702031"]="They were trying...",
    ["DialogueOption34702061"]="I don't...",
    ["DialogueOption34702062"]="Winning like this...",
    ["DialogueOption34705011"]="They didn't have to die!",
    ["DialogueOption34705021"]="What exactly are you trying to do?",
    ["DialogueOption34705031"]="I'm your student too!",
    ["DialogueOption34705061"]="I don't understand...",
    ["DialogueOption34902011"]="About training...",
    ["DialogueOption35101011"]="(Fist bump)",
    ["DialogueOption35102021"]="Heavy...",
    ["DialogueOption35103011"]="(Nod)",
    ["DialogueOption35301021"]="Yes.",
    ["DialogueOption35302011"]="I do!",
    ["DialogueOption35303011"]="Can't this be changed?",
    ["DialogueOption35303031"]="What if I lose?",
    ["DialogueOption35304021"]="That Orc...",
    ["DialogueOption35401011"]="What should I do?",
    ["DialogueOption35401021"]="It's <color=#CA2E0AFF>Criatura Academy</color>...",
    ["DialogueOption35401031"]="<color=#CA2E0AFF>The mentor of first-class</color>...",
    ["DialogueOption35402011"]="This is???",
    ["DialogueOption35402021"]="???",
    ["DialogueOption35402061"]="I'm going!",
    ["DialogueOption35403011"]="This is...",
    ["DialogueOption35403031"]="The wandering tome spirit...?",
    ["DialogueOption35403051"]="Of course!",
    ["DialogueOption35502011"]="New class advancement...",
    ["DialogueOption35502031"]="A more powerful core?",
    ["DialogueOption35502051"]="Why ten?",
    ["DialogueOption35503011"]="No.",
    ["DialogueOption35503012"]="Yes!",
    ["DialogueOption35602011"]="I want to...",
    ["DialogueOption35602021"]="Can you help me?",
    ["DialogueOption35702021"]="!!!",
    ["DialogueOption35702041"]="Huh???",
    ["DialogueOption35703011"]="(Explain what happened)",
    ["DialogueOption35703021"]="(Show weapon)",
    ["DialogueOption35802021"]="(Explain why you came.)",
    ["DialogueOption35802031"]="Then...?",
    ["DialogueOption35803011"]="(Proudly) Well, I am...",
    ["DialogueOption35803021"]="(Embarrassed, scratching your head)",
    ["DialogueOption35803022"]="(Stand with your hands on the hips, full of pride)",
    ["DialogueOption35803051"]="Of course! I...",
    ["DialogueOption35804011"]="So...?",
    ["DialogueOption35901021"]="So...?",
    ["DialogueOption35902011"]="No, I still...",
    ["DialogueOption35902021"]="Could it be...?",
    ["DialogueOption35902041"]="So you want me to...?",
    ["DialogueOption35902051"]="How do I find the spirit?",
    ["DialogueOption35902052"]="How do I unseal the spirit?",
    ["DialogueOption35902071"]="Creator?",
    ["DialogueOption35902072"]="Protector?",
    ["DialogueOption35902073"]="Destroyer?",
    ["DialogueOption35902091"]="(Nod) Got it.",
    ["DialogueOption35903011"]="Hello?",
    ["DialogueOption35903021"]="... What do you mean?",
    ["DialogueOption35903041"]="(Pick it up) This is...?",
    ["DialogueOption36002011"]="... What?",
    ["DialogueOption36002021"]="... Stop messing around.",
    ["DialogueOption36002031"]="I want to become...",
    ["DialogueOption36002041"]="A real death...?",
    ["DialogueOption36002042"]="A fake death...?",
    ["DialogueOption36003021"]="Rogue's determination!",
    ["DialogueOption36003031"]="Probably??",
    ["DialogueOption36004011"]="Are you... Zorser?",
    ["DialogueOption36004021"]="What do you want?",
    ["DialogueOption36005011"]="???",
    ["DialogueOption36005021"]="... Not interested.",
    ["DialogueOption36102011"]="You are so dramatic...",
    ["DialogueOption36102031"]="(Whack him with the harp)",
    ["DialogueOption36102032"]="(Lash him with the whip)",
    ["DialogueOption3610301"]="It's been a while, Adventurer. I can tell your skill has improved a lot.",
    ["DialogueOption36103031"]="A bard must first tell their own tale...?",
    ["DialogueOption36103032"]="A dancer must find joy in themselves...?",
    ["DialogueOption36103081"]="You mean...?",
    ["DialogueOption36103091"]="(Lost in thought)",
    ["DialogueOption36103101"]="... I'll give it a try.",
    ["DialogueOption36107031"]="... Blank page?",
    ["DialogueOption36107032"]="(Realizing something) I got it!",
    ["DialogueOption36107041"]="Thank you, Kiki!",
    ["DialogueOption36108011"]="I want to be...",
    ["DialogueOption36108012"]="A blank page, always.",
    ["DialogueOption36108021"]="Because...",
    ["DialogueOption36108071"]="(Eagerly) So I...?",
    ["DialogueOption36202011"]="Hi there!",
    ["DialogueOption36202021"]="???",
    ["DialogueOption36202041"]="... Not interested.",
    ["DialogueOption36203011"]="(Nod)",
    ["DialogueOption36203021"]="Evolution Potion?",
    ["DialogueOption36203041"]="... Why?",
    ["DialogueOption36203051"]="What's the second rule?",
    ["DialogueOption36203071"]="Of course!",
    ["DialogueOption36205031"]="(Nod)",
    ["DialogueOption36205032"]="(Shake head)",
    ["DialogueOption36205051"]="What about the class advancement...?",
    ["DialogueOption36205071"]="!!!",
    ["DialogueOption36205081"]="Thank you!",
    ["DialogueOption36302021"]="(Proudly) I've already...",
    ["DialogueOption36302041"]="I'm going now!",
    ["DialogueOption36303021"]="So...?",
    ["DialogueOption36303031"]="Bring it on!",
    ["DialogueOption36304011"]="... Meaning those Buddha statues?",
    ["DialogueOption36304021"]="And then?",
    ["DialogueOption36305011"]="(Show the Flame of Exorcism.)",
    ["DialogueOption36305021"]="Who exactly are they...?",
    ["DialogueOption36305031"]="!!!",
    ["DialogueOption36305051"]="I will!",
    ["DialogueOption36401031"]="Dean Mainz...",
    ["DialogueOption36402011"]="Dean, I...",
    ["DialogueOption36403011"]="What is it?",
    ["DialogueOption36403012"]="Where's Tanders?",
    ["DialogueOption36403041"]="Why are you—?",
    ["DialogueOption36403071"]="(Something's not right...)",
    ["DialogueOption36404011"]="Those other footprints...",
    ["DialogueOption36404021"]="Let's go!",
    ["DialogueOption36405011"]="!?",
    ["DialogueOption36405021"]="What's going on here?",
    ["DialogueOption36405041"]="Then why she...?",
    ["DialogueOption36405061"]="Protecting others",
    ["DialogueOption36405062"]="Fighting with courage",
    ["DialogueOption36405063"]="Exploring the unknown",
    ["DialogueOption36405131"]="Me too!",
    ["DialogueOption36406031"]="If you ever feel lost...",
    ["DialogueOption36406032"]="Why not just ask your heart?",
    ["DialogueOption36406071"]="... Huh?",
    ["DialogueOption36406081"]="So you all...",
    ["DialogueOption36502031"]="Perhaps...",
    ["DialogueOption36503011"]="I...",
    ["DialogueOption36503021"]="Why must it...?",
    ["DialogueOption36503041"]="Then what you told me before...",
    ["DialogueOption36503061"]="!?",
    ["DialogueOption36504011"]="Wait... is this place...",
    ["DialogueOption36504041"]="How is this possible?!",
    ["DialogueOption36504042"]="I thought...",
    ["DialogueOption36504061"]="This is all pointless...",
    ["DialogueOption36504071"]="Then I'll just have to...",
    ["DialogueOption36504072"]="(Raise your weapon)",
    ["DialogueOption36504091"]="Ohka!?",
    ["DialogueOption36504092"]="Souzo!?",
    ["DialogueOption36505011"]="You...",
    ["DialogueOption36505031"]="(Quickly pull back)",
    ["DialogueOption36505032"]="(Knock the weapon down)",
    ["DialogueOption36505041"]="But you saved them!",
    ["DialogueOption36505051"]="It's the only way...",
    ["DialogueOption36505052"]="To stop them from becoming monsters...",
    ["DialogueOption36505071"]="(Shake head) No, I...",
    ["DialogueOption36505091"]="Come on, the floor's cold.",
    ["DialogueOption36505111"]="Thought I was weak, huh?",
    ["DialogueOption36505121"]="...???",
    ["DialogueOption36505131"]="(Stand with your hands on the hips, full of pride.) Hmph!",
    ["DialogueOption36603021"]="What happened?",
    ["DialogueOption36603041"]="So, today's trial...?",
    ["DialogueOption36604011"]="Huh? Wait, so...",
    ["DialogueOption36605011"]="I can feel it...",
    ["DialogueOption36606011"]="Um... hello?",
    ["DialogueOption36606041"]="???",
    ["DialogueOption36607011"]="It's... the Way of Flow?",
    ["DialogueOption36607041"]="Not now!",
    ["DialogueOption36702011"]="Dean, about the fourth class...",
    ["DialogueOption36702031"]="The price of class advancement...?",
    ["DialogueOption36702041"]="Alright!",
    ["DialogueOption36703021"]="I'm ready!",
    ["DialogueOption36703031"]="What kind of trial is it?",
    ["DialogueOption36703051"]="...!",
    ["DialogueOption36704021"]="(Hesitating) Sir...",
    ["DialogueOption36704022"]="About the girl in the black dress...",
    ["DialogueOption36704051"]="(Nod)",
    ["DialogueOption36705011"]="What...?",
    ["DialogueOption36705061"]="No. You lost.",
    ["DialogueOption36705062"]="The corrupt kingdom you speak of has long since collapsed.",
    ["DialogueOption36705081"]="You're the only one still stuck in...",
    ["DialogueOption36705082"]="A nightmare from seven hundred years ago...",
    ["DialogueOption36706011"]="Do you still remember...",
    ["DialogueOption36706012"]="Your name?",
    ["DialogueOption36706031"]="You're... not the goddess.",
    ["DialogueOption36706032"]="You're just what's left of her hatred.",
    ["DialogueOption36707011"]="... How did you know?",
    ["DialogueOption36707021"]="\"We\"...?",
    ["DialogueOption36707031"]="This trial...",
    ["DialogueOption36707032"]="You saw it coming too?",
    ["DialogueOption36901011"]="Huh? You're...",
    ["DialogueOption36902011"]="That sound just now...",
    ["DialogueOption36902031"]="The locals...",
    ["DialogueOption36904011"]="My breath... it's resonating with something...",
    ["DialogueOption36905011"]="Mentor, have you...",
    ["DialogueOption36905021"]="Yeah... it feels weird to me...",
    ["DialogueOption37102011"]="There's something I wanted to ask...",
    ["DialogueOption37102031"]="I've completely memorized it.",
    ["DialogueOption37103011"]="Where did you come from?!",
    ["DialogueOption37103031"]="That sound just now...?",
    ["DialogueOption37103071"]="Evil spirit...",
    ["DialogueOption37104031"]="That was way too close...",
    ["DialogueOption37104081"]="Do you really think there's a next life?",
    ["DialogueOption37104091"]="I see. Also...",
    ["DialogueOption37203011"]="... Mentor?",
    ["DialogueOption37203021"]="I did not!",
    ["DialogueOption37203022"]="Something feels off about this place...",
    ["DialogueOption37203041"]="... Huh?",
    ["DialogueOption37203071"]="I think...",
    ["DialogueOption37204051"]="Leafshade?",
    ["DialogueOption37204061"]="... Wait, that was you?",
    ["DialogueOption37204081"]="So you...?",
    ["DialogueOption37205011"]="Could it be...?!",
    ["DialogueOption37205051"]="What do you mean?",
    ["DialogueOption37205071"]="(Stop him) Mentor...",
    ["DialogueOption37205072"]="This is my trial.",
    ["DialogueOption37206131"]="Good night, Frostveil.",
    ["DialogueOption37206141"]="You want to see them again?",
    ["DialogueOption37206171"]="(Sigh)",
    ["DialogueOption37206172"]="Mentor Moonstrider!",
    ["DialogueOption38001010"]="... What are you doing?",
    ["DialogueOption38001020"]="Have you known each other for a long time?",
    ["DialogueOption38001040"]="What makes you say that?",
    ["DialogueOption38001060"]="About...",
    ["DialogueOption38002030"]="You should take a break...",
    ["DialogueOption38002040"]="Take your time.",
    ["DialogueOption38006010"]="Parni? Margaret?",
    ["DialogueOption38006020"]="Actually, I'm...",
    ["DialogueOption38006040"]="I overheard...",
    ["DialogueOption38006070"]="It's not really like that...",
    ["DialogueOption38006071"]="That's right! It's me!",
    ["DialogueOption38007010"]="I wouldn't call that serving justice...",
    ["DialogueOption38008010"]="You and Seyren...",
    ["DialogueOption38008030"]="No... it isn't foolishness. It's kindness, pure and true.",
    ["DialogueOption38009080"]="(Whisper) What is it?",
    ["DialogueOption38009120"]="Why aren't you going?",
    ["DialogueOption38010010"]="Just a passing Adventurer.",
    ["DialogueOption38010011"]="Margaret asked me to tell you...",
    ["DialogueOption38010040"]="You haven't changed a bit...",
    ["DialogueOption38010050"]="I'm kinda curious...",
    ["DialogueOption38010070"]="(Squint) How many quests are there?",
    ["DialogueOption38010080"]="I'll give you a new quest instead.",
    ["DialogueOption38011010"]="What are you doing?",
    ["DialogueOption38011020"]="You're good at this...",
    ["DialogueOption38013010"]="(Thumbs-up)",
    ["DialogueOption38013120"]="Er...",
    ["DialogueOption38014010"]="Don't worry... I think...",
    ["DialogueOption38014030"]="Of course, but you...",
    ["DialogueOption38015010"]="They must...",
    ["DialogueOption38801011"]="Welfare Center?",
    ["DialogueOption38801021"]="What happened?",
    ["DialogueOption38801031"]="No problem.",
    ["DialogueOption38801051"]="(Nods)",
    ["DialogueOption38801061"]="OK. Thank you.",
    ["DialogueOption38802011"]="(Puzzled) You are...?",
    ["DialogueOption38802021"]="(Nods) Right.",
    ["DialogueOption38802031"]="Here you are.",
    ["DialogueOption38803011"]="Well, I heard...?",
    ["DialogueOption38803021"]="...How long has she been missing?",
    ["DialogueOption38804011"]="W-What's the matter?",
    ["DialogueOption38804021"]="I'm not...",
    ["DialogueOption38804031"]="Please hear me out...",
    ["DialogueOption38804041"]="If you need anything.",
    ["DialogueOption38804042"]="I'm willing to help.",
    ["DialogueOption38804061"]="(Nods) Yes.",
    ["DialogueOption38804071"]="Are these things edible?",
    ["DialogueOption38805011"]="(Hesitating) These are...",
    ["DialogueOption38805031"]="Do you know where she is?",
    ["DialogueOption38805051"]="Petra is...?",
    ["DialogueOption38806011"]="May I join you?",
    ["DialogueOption38806031"]="(Smiles) Okay!",
    ["DialogueOption38807021"]="(Smiles) Thank you.",
    ["DialogueOption38807041"]="Don't eat it!",
    ["DialogueOption38807061"]="I got something nice and sweet.",
    ["DialogueOption38808021"]="I want to be your friend too!",
    ["DialogueOption38808022"]="So...",
    ["DialogueOption38808041"]="...You guys hate her a lot?",
    ["DialogueOption38808061"]="So she's now...?",
    ["DialogueOption38809011"]="Why are you bullying others?",
    ["DialogueOption38809021"]="Are you smart?",
    ["DialogueOption38809031"]="Martistine said that...?",
    ["DialogueOption38809041"]="(Probing) You...",
    ["DialogueOption38809051"]="...(Lift up your fist.)",
    ["DialogueOption38810011"]="If you ever dare...",
    ["DialogueOption38810021"]="And you will share the rocking chair with others.",
    ["DialogueOption38810031"]="No more bullying!",
    ["DialogueOption38810041"]="...Who said it?",
    ["DialogueOption38810051"]="(Let go)",
    ["DialogueOption38810052"]="He's wrong.",
    ["DialogueOption38810061"]="Read more books, and you will understand.",
    ["DialogueOption38810071"]="Do you know where she is?",
    ["DialogueOption38810081"]="...?",
    ["DialogueOption38811011"]="(Explain your intent)",
    ["DialogueOption38811021"]="...?",
    ["DialogueOption38811051"]="And then she was gone?",
    ["DialogueOption38811081"]="(Sigh) I will try.",
    ["DialogueOption38901091"]="(Pulling Andre back)",
    ["DialogueOption38901111"]="This...",
    ["DialogueOption38902011"]="The words from Lyra...",
    ["DialogueOption38902031"]="But you were...",
    ["DialogueOption38902041"]="?",
    ["DialogueOption38902061"]="You read?",
    ["DialogueOption38902062"]="What's the conclusion?",
    ["DialogueOption38903021"]="(Explain your intent)",
    ["DialogueOption38903041"]="What?",
    ["DialogueOption38903051"]="Leave it to me!",
    ["DialogueOption38904011"]="Untraceable?",
    ["DialogueOption38904031"]="(Lost in thought)",
    ["DialogueOption38904041"]="I still have questions.",
    ["DialogueOption38904042"]="About the meaning of these runes...",
    ["DialogueOption38904061"]="I have one more question...",
