    ["Digimon_tips_01"]="The entrance to the Darkness Purge instance has appeared at the Prontera West Gate. Please get there as soon as possible. Devimon arrives in 5 minutes!",
    ["Digimon_tips_02"]="Congratulations to <color=#ec8a5a>%s</color> on receiving the <color=#ec8a5a>%s</color> from Digimon Vault!",
    ["Diolague31001"]="Actually, it's nothing important, I just miss you a little. You look so energetic!",
    ["Disguised"]="This load-out has been transmogrified.",
    ["DismantleFirst"]="The Enchantment Stone must be removed before socketing can be carried out.",
    ["DisplayCase_EffectEmpty"]="Please add a Costume skin",
    ["DisplayCase_EffectTypeTips"]="The Showcase has set to<color=#CA2E0AFF>%s</color>effect, please remove the costumes within to set another effect.",
    ["DisplayCase_Empty"]="You have not obtained any Costume skins yet. Go collect them now!",
    ["DisplayCase_EmptyTips"]="Please select a Costume skin",
    ["DisplayCase_FullTips"]="Only<color=#CA2E0AFF>3</color>costumes can be displayed in the Showcase.",
    ["DisplayCase_Help01_01"]="Showcase Rules:\n1. Costumes with the Display Effect can be added to the Showcase.\n2. The effect of the Costume in the first slot of the Showcase can be activated.\n3. When there are 3 Costumes in the Showcase, the Display Effect of the lowest level Costume will be activated.\n4. When the Showcase effect needs to be changed, all Costumes in the Showcase have to be taken out.\n5. The Showcase effect is automatically activated",
    ["DisplayCase_Name"]="Showcase",
    ["DivorceTips001"]="Your partner, <color=#338dc3>%s</color>, filed for an uncontested divorce. Do you agree to end your marriage with your current partner? This will remove all couple privileges and end your relationship.",
    ["DivorceTips002"]="Agree",
    ["DivorceTips003"]="Decline",
    ["DivorceTips004"]="You and your partner, <color=#338dc3>%s</color>, have been married <color=#338dc3>%s</color> days. You will have to pay <color=#338dc3>%s</color> Crystals to unilaterally end this relationship. This is calculated based on the length of time, the degree of loyalty, distance between you and the status of the one who breaks the vow. As the initiator, do you agree to pay this price to end this relationship?",
    ["DivorceTips005"]="Pay the price",
    ["DivorceTips006"]="Think on it",
    ["DivorceTips007"]="Unilateral",
    ["DivorceTips008"]="Uncontested",
    ["DivorceTips009"]="Both parties are required to cancel a contract. Team up and come back",
    ["DivorceTips010"]="Your partner is not in your team",
    ["DivorceTips011"]="Your partner is offline. Cancel vow agreement failed",
    ["DivorceTips012"]="Action too frequent",
    ["DivorceTips013"]="%s is no longer your partner",
    ["DivorceTips014"]="Both parties must agree to cancel the contract",
    ["DivorceTips015"]="Unilateral divorce successful. Go enjoy your freedom",
    ["DownloadDonePushMessageBody"]="The App has been downloaded",
    ["DownloadDonePushMessageSubTitle"]="Download the Game",
    ["DownloadDonePushMessageTitle"]="Download",
    ["Downshift_1"]="Downshift to Confirm",
    ["Downshift_2"]="Slow game speed. Temporarily reduce graphics quality?",
    ["Downshift_3"]="Graphics temporarily reduced to %s",
    ["Downshift_4"]="Restored to %s graphics",
    ["DragonBoatFesDesc_001"]="Event Rules:\n1. Event Time: \n<b>·</b>Play the Dragon Boat Festival board game and kill monsters above level 21 with Odin's Blessing while the draw is available to get randomly dropped exchange materials\n<b>·</b>During the exchange period, players can exchange items at the Dragon Boat Exchange Shop in Prontera\n\n2. Board game draw cost:\n<b>·</b>It costs 1 Dragon Boat Ticket per dice roll\n<b>·</b>It costs <color=#CA2E0AFF>3,600</color> Crystals per roll when you don't have any Dragon Boat Tickets. Kafra's VIP Card users can enjoy a <color=#CA2E0AFF>20% discount</color>\n\n3. Obtaining Draw Coupons: New Carnival event activity rewards have been added for the duration of the draw event\n\n4. Board game rewards:\n<b>·</b>When Poring lands on a tile with an item icon, the item marked on that tile will be obtained\n<b>·</b>An additional lap-passing reward will be obtained when passing the starting tile each time\n<b> </b>·Accumulate a certain number of laps around the board to get corresponding milestone rewards    ",
    ["DragonBoatFesDesc_002"]="Event Time: %s \n(Exchange Before: %s)",
    ["DragonBoatFesDesc_003"]="Number of dice rolls today: %s",
    ["DragonBoatFesHint_001"]="Are you sure you want to use <color=#CA2E0AFF>%s</color> Crystals to roll the dice?",
    ["DragonBoatFesHint_002"]="Are you sure you want to use <color=#CA2E0AFF>%s</color> Crystals to roll the dice?\nThere is a <color=#CA2E0AFF>20%%</color> discount for Kafra's VIP Card holders!",
    ["DragonBoatFesHint_003"]="Initializing the board. Please wait before rolling the dice.",
    ["DragonBoatFesHint_004"]="Capoo is moving. Can't roll the dice now.",
    ["DragonBoatFesHint_005"]="You're too late to get any rewards - the dice can't be used anymore",
    ["DragonBoatFesHint_006"]="The event hasn't started yet, please wait",
    ["DragonMechaUnlock"]="Use Auspicious Dragon's Blessing to unlock.",
