    ["Drunk_text1"]="I'm fine... I'm okay! I'm... per... perrr... perfectly fine!",
    ["Drunk_text2"]="Look... I... I-I am... flying H-High in the sky!",
    ["Drunk_text3"]="I... I can... drink many... more! Cheers! Burp!",
    ["Drunk_text4"]="%$#&...?!%&##!",
    ["Drunk_text5"]="E-Everyone... here... is... HEHE...",
    ["Drunken_Reminder_01"]="Matchmaking is not possible upon reaching 100 stacks of the drunk debuff.",
