    ["EnchantCity"]="From %s",
    ["EnchantRateUp"]="Upgrade Probability Increased!",
    ["EnchantTips_01"]="Weapon Overall Rating",
    ["EnchantTips_02"]="Enchantment Cost Reduced",
    ["EnchantTips_03"]="Enchantments under Lv.15 are unavailable",
    ["EnchantTips_04"]="Armor Overall Rating",
    ["EnchantTips_05"]="Accessory Overall Rating",
    ["EnchantTips_06"]="Enchantment costs are reduced when refining selected attributes",
    ["EnchantTips_07"]="Attributes exceeding Lv.15 after conversion cannot be applied",
    ["EnchantTips_08"]="Weapon Enchantment Overall Rating",
    ["EnchantTips_09"]="Accessory Enchantment Overall Rating",
    ["EnchantTips_10"]="Armor Enchantment Overall Rating",
    ["EnchantTips_11"]="The current attribute rating is lower than the overall rating. Conversion cost has been reduced.",
    ["EnchantTransformationRule1"]="Enchantment Conversion randomly grants an Enchantment Stat based on where the process is conducted. The converted Stat and level are also related to the location. For more information, please see:",
    ["EnchantTransformationRule2"]="Location of previous enchantment - Location of current enchantment",
    ["EnchantTransformationRule3"]="Enchantment Level unchanged, Enchantment Level-1",
    ["EnchantTransformationTips1"]="Lv. 5 is required for Enchantment Conversion. The costs for Enchantment Conversion are based on the level of the Enchantment Stat to convert. The higher the Enchantment Level, the higher the cost.",
    ["EnchantTransformationTips2"]="Enchantment Conversion costs are different for weapons/armor/accessories.",
    ["EnchantTransformationTips3"]="Enchantment Conversion costs and the value of stat(s) converted directly correspond to each other. The costs for Daggers/One-Handed Weapons/Two-Handed Weapons are 1.5/2/3 times that of Shields, respectively.",
    ["EnchantTransformationTips4"]="When converting enhancements between different regions, the higher the target region's Enchantment Level, the more the Enchantment Level will decrease after conversion, vice versa. (Izlude Island and Alberta are regions with the same Enhancement Level. Morroc and Einbroch are also regions with the same Enchantment Level.)",
    ["EnchantTransformationTips5"]="Costs for an Enchantment Conversion at the same Enchantment Level are directly related to the previous and current enchantment location.",
    ["EnchantTransformationTips6"]="If a Favor Breakthrough occurs after conversion, the Favor of the NPC at the destination must meet the Level Breakthrough conditions.",
    ["EnchantTransformation_SystemTips1"]="No equipment available to Enchant.",
    ["EnchantTransformation_SystemTips2"]="Unable to convert. Reach Stat Level %s first.",
    ["EnchantTransformation_SystemTips3"]="Please select a stat to convert from the left panel.",
    ["EnchantTransformation_SystemTips4"]="Location of current enchantment not selected.",
    ["EnchantTransformation_SystemTips5"]="Random Attribute",
    ["EnchantTransformation_SystemTips6"]="Start Enchantment Conversion?",
    ["EnchantTransformation_SystemTips7"]="Insufficient materials. Cannot perform enchantment conversion.",
    ["EnchantTransformation_SystemTips8"]="Redeemed!",
    ["EnchantTransformation_SystemTips9"]="After conversion, an Enchantment Stat will be randomly selected from the %s stat pool.",
    ["EnchantmentClear"]="Enchantment Refinement",
    ["EnchantmentClearExplainTips1"]="When refining an enchantment, the stats will first be checked to see if they belong to the current enchantment stat list.",
    ["EnchantmentClearExplainTips2"]="Stats that belong to the current enchantment stat list (including unsaved stats) will be randomized within a range according to the level of the enchantment.",
    ["EnchantmentClearExplainTips3"]="Stats that do not belong to the current enchantment stat list will be regarded as Lv.0 and randomized within a range on that basis.",
    ["EnchantmentClearExplainTips4"]="During the refinement process, the level of the enchantment will change within a range. Remember to save the stat when a random high-level stat appears.",
    ["EnchantmentClearExplainTips5"]="Lv. 5 Enchantment Level is required for Enchantment Conversion. To quickly obtain stats from another enchantment pool with a similar Enchantment Level, proceed to Al De Baran to perform an Enchantment Conversion.",
    ["EnchantmentConsumption"]="Enchantment Cost",
    ["EnchantmentConsumptionExplainTips1"]="The cost of the enchantment is related to the NPC providing the enchantment service.",
    ["EnchantmentInherit"]="Enchantment Transfer",
    ["EnchantmentInheritExplainTips1"]="Pieces of equipment of the same type can transfer their enchantment stat bonuses interchangeably.",
    ["EnchantmentLock"]="Enchantment Attribute Locked",
    ["EnchantmentLockExplainTips1"]="Lock stones can be used to lock the attributes saved on the selected enchantment slot of your equipment.",
    ["EnchantmentLockExplainTips2"]="Using a lock stone not only locks an attribute but also slightly increases the enchantment success rate.",
    ["EnchantmentLockExplainTips3"]="If no attributes are saved in the current equipment enchantment slot or if the saved attributes have reached the maximum level in this version, lock stones cannot be used.",
    ["EnchantmentLockExplainTips4"]="Lock stones cannot be used when the attributes saved in the equipment enchantment slot do not belong to the current main city.",
    ["EnchantmentLockHint1"]="Lock stones are not available at the current enchantment level.",
    ["EnchantmentLockHint2"]="The attributes of the equipment do not match the current main city.",
    ["EnchantmentNPCDes"]="%s Favor Quest Unlocked: %s",
    ["EnchantmentRate"]="Upgrade Probability: %s\nMaintain Probability: %s\nDowngrade Probability: %s",
    ["EnchantmentRateDetail"]="Upgrade Probability Slightly Increased (From %s)",
    ["EnchantmentRating"]="Enchantment Rating",
    ["EnchantmentRatingExplainTips1"]="Overall enchantment ratings are assigned separately to weapons, armor, and accessories according to their respective enchantment cultivation progress.",
    ["EnchantmentRatingExplainTips2"]="During evaluation, the system selects the highest-rated enchantment attributes from each equipment slot, simulating a fully filled set of enchantments to determine the strongest possible overall rating.\nThe enchantment ratings for weapons, armor, and accessories are determined by the lowest-rated piece within the strongest overall set. Equipment stored in the backpack is also included in the calculation.\nOnce rated, a rating will not go down regardless of whether the original attribute exists; it will continue to increase if the source attributes improve.\nWhen refining enchantments lower than the overall rating, the refinement cost will be reduced.",
    ["EnchantmentRatingExplainTips3"]="Single Attribute Rating = (City Rating -1) + Enhancement Attribute Level\nThe range of attribute ratings for each city and their corresponding City Ratings are as follows:\nProntera, City Rating Level 1, Attribute (Lv.1 to Lv.15) Rating Range: Lv.1 to Lv.15\nMorroc, City Rating Level 2, Attribute (Lv.1 to Lv.15) Rating Range: Lv.2 to Lv.16\nEinbroch, City Rating Level 2, Attribute (Lv.1 to Lv.15) Rating Range: Lv.2 to Lv.16\nIzlude Island, City Rating Level 3, Attribute (Lv.1 to Lv.15) Rating Range: Lv.3 to Lv.17\nAlberta, City Rating Level 3, Attribute (Lv.1 to Lv.15) Rating Range: Lv.3 to Lv.17\nPayon, City Rating Level 4, Attribute (Lv.1 to Lv.15) Rating Range: Lv.4 to Lv.18\nGeffen, City Rating Level 5, Attribute (Lv.1 to Lv.15) Rating Range: Lv.5 to Lv.19\nGlast Heim, City Rating Level 6, Attribute (Lv.1 to Lv.15) Rating Range: Lv.6 to Lv.20\nComodo, City Rating Level 7, Attribute (Lv.1 to Lv.15) Rating Range: Lv.7 to Lv.21\nUmbala, City Rating Level 8, Attribute (Lv.1 to Lv.15) Rating Range: Lv.8 to Lv.22\nJuno, City Rating Level 9, Attribute (Lv.1 to Lv.15) Rating Range: Lv.9 to Lv.23",
    ["EnchantmentTips_01"]="Enchantment Level capped. Please increase NPC Favor to lift it. Enchantment can only change attributes now.",
    ["EnergyID"]="Stamina",
    ["EnhancePropPercent"]="The basic stats of the equipment at the current upgrading level increased by an extra %s%%",
    ["EnoughMaterial"]="You have enough ingredients for the blueprint.",
    ["EnterFuBenTips"]="You have been summoned to enter an instance. Enter now?",
    ["EntertainmentSkill_001"]="Entertaining Skill: %s is now available",
    ["EntertainmentSkill_002"]="Entertaining Skills: Water Gun Shock is now available",
    ["Equip"]="Weapon",
    ["EquipAddCardTips"]="Insert %s into the %s slot?",
    ["EquipAddCardTips_1"]="Are you sure you want to put %s into slot %s?\nThis card is <color=#ff0000>unbound</color>. Once inserted, the card will be <color=#ff0000>bound</color>.",
    ["EquipAddCardTips_2"]="Insert %s into the additional slot %s?",
    ["EquipAddCardTips_3"]="Insert %s into the additional slot %s? (This card is <color=#ff0000>not bound</color> currently and will be <color=#ff0000>bound</color> after being inserted.)",
    ["EquipCanNotDecompose"]="The equipment could not be dismantled.",
    ["EquipDecomposeSuccess"]="Successfully dismantled the equipment!",
    ["EquipDes_4101360"]="A wobbling ramen pot—careful, it's hot!",
    ["EquipDesc_1000996"]="Songkran Festival Water Guns",
    ["EquipDesc_1100001"]="A dagger issued to all members of the Eden Group. It is provided especially for use by novice adventurers.",
    ["EquipDesc_1101001"]="A basic longsword that is very versatile.",
    ["EquipDesc_1101002"]="A sword with a thick, flat blade.",
    ["EquipDesc_1101003"]="A sword with an elegant blade and cross guard.",
    ["EquipDesc_1101004"]="A terrifyingly sharp sword with devastating cutting power.",
    ["EquipDesc_1101005"]="A sword adorned with an engraving of the sun, symbolizing battle spirit and haste.",
    ["EquipDesc_1101006"]="A sword crafted by a mysterious island nation in the Far East. It is used to cultivate one's moral character as well as combat.",
    ["EquipDesc_1101007"]="A sword used by orcs. It is precious as it symbolizes noble status among the orcs.",
    ["EquipDesc_1101008"]="A one-handed sword used by cavalry. However, it is mainly used for ceremonial purposes.",
    ["EquipDesc_1101011"]="A spectacular sword with a blade forged from meteorite that shines with starlight during the night.",
    ["EquipDesc_1101012"]="A sword often used by sailors.",
    ["EquipDesc_1101013"]="A sword that is embedded in a stone. It chooses its owner and possesses divine power.",
    ["EquipDesc_1101014"]="Legend has it that this is the weapon that killed the god of light.",
    ["EquipDesc_1101015"]="The sharp and strong sword. It is as if you can hear the sound when it pierces the armor.",
    ["EquipDesc_1101016"]="A divine sword that metes out the punishment of the gods.",
    ["EquipDesc_1101017"]="A sword with beautiful wave patterns on its blade. It is deceptively lethal.",
    ["EquipDesc_1101018"]="A knife with a round hilt.",
    ["EquipDesc_1101030"]="A one-handed sword made with beginners in mind.",
    ["EquipDesc_1101031"]="A one-handed sword favored by those who love to adventure. It offers just enough attack power to deal with basic monsters.",
    ["EquipDesc_1101032"]="A sword that can only be used by masters of the highest proficiency. Extremely deadly in the right hands.",
    ["EquipDesc_1101033"]="A sword that can only be used by warriors who have won glory. Those who carry it will feel great honor.",
    ["EquipDesc_1101034"]="A sword imbued with telekinetic energy that can disturb an enemy's mental state.",
    ["EquipDesc_1101035"]="A sword that is widely supplied to ordinary citizens.",
    ["EquipDesc_1101036"]="A sword conferred to warriors by the royal family. Those who carry it will feel the highest honor.",
    ["EquipDesc_1101037"]="A sword made of a stone hilt and iron blade. It packs immense force.",
    ["EquipDesc_1101038"]="A sword used by the Imperial Guard.",
    ["EquipDesc_1101039"]="A sword used by the lord of a kingdom.",
    ["EquipDesc_1101042"]="A sword passed down from generation to generation by the viscount of a kingdom.",
    ["EquipDesc_1101043"]="A sword said to house a Wraith that feeds on hatred. It will grow more powerful as its wielder's vengeful heart swells.",
    ["EquipDesc_1101045"]="A weapon that emits an ominous aura. Even touching it just slightly seems to absorb a person's soul.",
    ["EquipDesc_1101060"]="Made from the frozen rock in the cave of Comodo, the blade always emits the vague radiance of magic. Look closer, and you could even see streamline patterns resembling aurora...",
    ["EquipDesc_1101061"]="A sword passed down from generation to generation by the duke of a kingdom.",
    ["EquipDesc_1101062"]="With the handguard shaped like butterfly wings, the blade attacks like dancing butterflies.",
    ["EquipDesc_1101075"]="A sword with the power of an otherworldly ancient god. It's yours, if you're willing to give up your soul for it.",
    ["EquipDesc_1101076"]="The blade is covered with jagged barbs. Once merged into the enemy's body, it is hard to pull it out.",
    ["EquipDesc_1101077"]="Does he pursue the wanton life or the peaceful sleep after death?",
    ["EquipDesc_1101092"]="A longsword crafted with ancient jade, giving out a ghostly verdant glow in the darkness. It was once wielded by a knight of great integrity.",
    ["EquipDesc_1101093"]="With this sword in hand, together do we live.",
    ["EquipDesc_1101094"]="A gift from the Lord's Mansion in Schwarzwald Republic to Juno College Students, a one-handed sword crafted with the most cutting-edge Republican technology.",
    ["EquipDesc_1101501"]="A sword created with magical guidance technology at its core, achieving the perfect fusion of magic and machinery. A true milestone creation of the Schwarzwald Republic.",
    ["EquipDesc_1101502"]="Inlaid with gems and inscribed with runes that amplify its power, this blade could only be born from the of Arunafeltz, the kingdom known for its unmatchable alchemy.",
    ["EquipDesc_1101701"]="As the sword slides out of the sheath, it's covered in red flames.",
    ["EquipDesc_1101708"]="A weapon forged by a girl for her beloved, glowing with a hazy crimson light—just like her hidden, burning love.",
    ["EquipDesc_1101716"]="They say this sword was once stuck in a rock in a western kingdom—it chooses its own master and holds divine power.",
    ["EquipDesc_1102001"]="A common axe that is easy for anyone to use.",
    ["EquipDesc_1102004"]="An axe used by orcs.",
    ["EquipDesc_1102006"]="An axe with unprecedented speed.",
    ["EquipDesc_1102007"]="A heavy, broad-bladed hatchet used by butchers.",
    ["EquipDesc_1102008"]="A sharp axe made specially for war.",
    ["EquipDesc_1102009"]="An axe shaped like an octopus leg topped with a decorative octopus. It is extremely strong and sharp.",
    ["EquipDesc_1102010"]="A bloodthirsty axe that has aided many warriors in battle.",
    ["EquipDesc_1102013"]="A luxurious axe decorated in red. It creates wind with a unique sound when you wave it.",
    ["EquipDesc_1102019"]="The standard weapon that symbolizes the Marquis identity. Not only does it represent the noble bloodline of the user, but also signifies the user’s heroic character.",
    ["EquipDesc_1102020"]="A huge axe designed to deal with heavy armor, with a barb that can not only kill someone, but also pry open the armor.",
    ["EquipDesc_1102021"]="A weapon made of the entire horn of the beast. Its weird and wild appearance will scare off cowardly opponents.",
    ["EquipDesc_1102030"]="A one-handed axe made with beginners in mind.",
    ["EquipDesc_1102031"]="A one-handed axe favored by those who love to adventure. It offers just enough attack power to deal with basic monsters.",
    ["EquipDesc_1102032"]="An axe crafted with metalworking processes given to mankind by the ancient god of blacksmithing. Those who have a great understanding of metals are able to maximize the power of this axe.",
    ["EquipDesc_1102033"]="An axe that can only be used by warriors who have won glory. Those who carry it will feel great honor.",
    ["EquipDesc_1102034"]="An axe conferred to warriors by the royal family. Those who carry it will feel the highest honor.",
    ["EquipDesc_1102035"]="An axe that is lighter than ordinary axes, making it ideal for sneak attacks.",
    ["EquipDesc_1102036"]="An axe used by the Imperial Guard.",
    ["EquipDesc_1102037"]="An axe used by the lord of a kingdom.",
    ["EquipDesc_1102040"]="An axe passed down from generation to generation by the viscount of a kingdom.",
    ["EquipDesc_1102041"]="The gleam of this axe as it slashes through the air makes it look like a shooting star falling from the sky.",
    ["EquipDesc_1102043"]="The blade of the axe has a special serrated edge, which is said to be able to cleave open the boundary between life and death.",
    ["EquipDesc_1102060"]="A specially shaped axe with a curved blade, which grants the function of a sickle, and additional lightness. In Zenhai Marsh riddled with thorns, islanders often keep one with them.",
    ["EquipDesc_1102061"]="An axe passed down from generation to generation by the duke of a kingdom.",
    ["EquipDesc_1102062"]="In the dazzling crystal, there stays magic. Though seems heavy, it is actually light as feather. Even a child could easily lift the axe.",
    ["EquipDesc_1102075"]="An axe with the power of an otherworldly ancient god. It's yours, if you're willing to give up your soul for it.",
    ["EquipDesc_1102076"]="Unique ores from the Umbala rainforest were used when forging it, which grants higher elemental adaptability and can even make it a medium for casting some small magic.",
    ["EquipDesc_1102077"]="The wailing and howling from those of the same kind will become a cry for the dead.",
    ["EquipDesc_1102092"]="A weapon that pierces through souls. The more you struggle, the more you suffer.",
    ["EquipDesc_1102093"]="A blessed weapon that once belonged to an emissary of Arunafeltz. It has laid countless heretics to rest.",
    ["EquipDesc_1102094"]="A gift from the Lord's Mansion in Schwarzwald Republic to Juno College Students, a battleaxe crafted with the most cutting-edge Republican technology.",
    ["EquipDesc_1102501"]="An axe created with magical guidance technology at its core, achieving the perfect fusion of magic and machinery. A true milestone creation of the Schwarzwald Republic.",
    ["EquipDesc_1102502"]="Inlaid with gems and inscribed with runes that amplify its power, this axe could only be born from the of Arunafeltz, the kingdom known for its unmatchable alchemy.",
    ["EquipDesc_1102701"]="Fragments fell off from an automated robot after it broke down and got destroyed. They're all bent out of shape because of some magic interference device installed by the Illusionists.",
    ["EquipDesc_1102708"]="In his presence, hunters remember what it's like to be hunted.",
    ["EquipDesc_1102716"]="A battle axe reborn through a purification ritual, now embodying faith in truth.",
    ["EquipDesc_1103002"]="A rough-hewn wand that's effective enough for the casting of magic spells.",
    ["EquipDesc_1103003"]="A weapon that is more powerful than ordinary rods.",
    ["EquipDesc_1103004"]="An ornate, elegantly crafted wand that grants powerful magical energy.",
    ["EquipDesc_1103005"]="Made of crystal, it is especially beautiful when it refracts light.",
    ["EquipDesc_1103006"]="A rare staff that can convert psychic energy into destructive power.",
    ["EquipDesc_1103007"]="A rod used by shamanic priests.",
    ["EquipDesc_1103010"]="A staff jointly developed by the Wizard Guild and Prontera Church.",
    ["EquipDesc_1103011"]="A staff jointly developed by the Wizard Guild and Prontera Church. It is even more powerful than the Survivor's Rod.",
    ["EquipDesc_1103012"]="A staff with a hypnotizing effect that can make even a novice feel like a great mage.",
    ["EquipDesc_1103013"]="A staff made from a branch of Yggdrasil. It is engraved with the words \"health and longevity\" in an ancient language.",
    ["EquipDesc_1103016"]="A rod made from a rune of Odin, used exclusively for exorcism rituals.",
    ["EquipDesc_1103017"]="A short, lightweight rod.",
    ["EquipDesc_1103018"]="The special staff for the owl guard. Its holder will master the magic and birds and beasts.",
    ["EquipDesc_1103019"]="A staff that conducts pressure, and in its magical flood, all things will be silenced.",
    ["EquipDesc_1103030"]="A one-handed rod made with beginners in mind.",
    ["EquipDesc_1103031"]="A one-handed rod favored by those who love to adventure. It offers just enough attack power to deal with basic monsters.",
    ["EquipDesc_1103032"]="A rod that can only be used by masters of the highest proficiency. Extremely deadly in the right hands.",
    ["EquipDesc_1103033"]="A rod that can only be used by warriors who have won glory. Those who carry it will feel great honor.",
    ["EquipDesc_1103034"]="A rod conferred to warriors by the royal family. Those who carry it will feel the highest honor.",
    ["EquipDesc_1103035"]="A wooden rod inlaid with agate containing limitless potential.",
    ["EquipDesc_1103036"]="A rod used by the Imperial Guard.",
    ["EquipDesc_1103037"]="A rod used by the lord of a kingdom.",
    ["EquipDesc_1103040"]="A staff passed down from generation to generation by the viscount of a kingdom.",
    ["EquipDesc_1103041"]="That pair of empty eyes always lights up in the dark, making it look like a gaze from the abyss.",
    ["EquipDesc_1103043"]="The beautiful stone at the top of the staff is not just for decoration. It also grants the caster unlimited power.",
    ["EquipDesc_1103058"]="Words into poems, signals into songs. For thousands of years, Euphonic Symphony has shaped the unique language of Comodo in this way. Instead of a battle weapon, the staff is more of an emblem passed down through generations.",
    ["EquipDesc_1103059"]="A staff passed down from generation to generation by the duke of a kingdom.",
    ["EquipDesc_1103060"]="Flowers born from withering, meaning birth from devastation.",
    ["EquipDesc_1103073"]="A staff with the power of an otherworldly ancient god. It's yours, if you're willing to give up your soul for it.",
    ["EquipDesc_1103074"]="The gemstone wrapped around the cane's head emits a flickering light like a thumping heart in the dark.",
    ["EquipDesc_1103075"]="A staff that looks like a demon's claw. Its features are also like its appearance, which can infinitely magnify the desires in the user's heart.",
    ["EquipDesc_1103090"]="A staff that vanished from the world for many centuries. It was once used by a renowned magician.",
    ["EquipDesc_1103091"]="A sumptuously adorned scepter that used to be the centerpiece of ceremonies, bearing the principles bestowed by the Great Sage of ancient times.",
    ["EquipDesc_1103092"]="A gift from the Lord's Mansion in Schwarzwald Republic to Juno College Students, a rod crafted with the most cutting-edge Republican technology.",
    ["EquipDesc_1103501"]="A hammer created with magical guidance technology at its core, achieving the perfect fusion of magic and machinery. A true milestone creation of the Schwarzwald Republic.",
    ["EquipDesc_1103502"]="Inlaid with gems and inscribed with runes that amplify its power, this staff could only be born from the of Arunafeltz, the kingdom known for its unmatchable alchemy.",
    ["EquipDesc_1103701"]="The souls of nobles converge upon a single will, becoming a dazzlingly magic staff.",
    ["EquipDesc_1103708"]="A magic staff that turns the power of elements into supernatural energy.",
    ["EquipDesc_1103716"]="A staff made from metal of another world, said to be a masterpiece of a great warlock. It seems to resonate with the boots of ancient heroes.",
    ["EquipDesc_1104000"]="A wooden mace that is very versatile.",
    ["EquipDesc_1104001"]="An iron mace that is effective for simple smashing.",
    ["EquipDesc_1104002"]="A deadly mace topped with three extremely sharp blades.",
    ["EquipDesc_1104003"]="A metal club topped with a solid steel ball covered in spikes.",
    ["EquipDesc_1104004"]="A heavy, powerful mace with a rounded top.",
    ["EquipDesc_1104005"]="A huge club that can knock enemies unconscious.",
    ["EquipDesc_1104006"]="A mace that stuns any opponent it hits.",
    ["EquipDesc_1104007"]="A club entirely covered in spikes, that swings wildly and haphazardly in battle.",
    ["EquipDesc_1104008"]="A large silver mace used for exorcisms.",
    ["EquipDesc_1104013"]="A mace in the shape of a blood-red cross. It is enough to send shivers down your spine.",
    ["EquipDesc_1104015"]="A simple flail that consists of an iron chain attached to a thin mace.",
    ["EquipDesc_1104016"]="With a spiked metal ball that freely swings from a chain, a flail is a very intimidating weapon.",
    ["EquipDesc_1104017"]="The standard weapon that symbolizes the Marquis identity. Not only does it represent the noble bloodline of the user, but also signifies the user’s resolute heart.",
    ["EquipDesc_1104018"]="A heavy hammer made of complete ore that emits a faint light in the dark. When the purple crystals on it collide, it will also erupt with magic fluctuations.",
    ["EquipDesc_1104019"]="The weapon is like the head of a fierce owl, but instead of attacking with its sharp beak, it uses its own weight to crush the enemy.",
    ["EquipDesc_1104030"]="A mace made with beginners in mind.",
    ["EquipDesc_1104031"]="A mace favored by those who love to adventure. It offers just enough attack power to deal with basic monsters.",
    ["EquipDesc_1104032"]="A mace that can only be used by masters of the highest proficiency. Extremely deadly in the right hands.",
    ["EquipDesc_1104033"]="A mace that can only be used by warriors who have won glory. Those who carry it will feel great honor.",
    ["EquipDesc_1104034"]="A mace conferred to warriors by the royal family. Those who carry it will feel the highest honor.",
    ["EquipDesc_1104035"]="The power of language knows no bounds.",
    ["EquipDesc_1104036"]="A mace used by the Imperial Guard.",
    ["EquipDesc_1104037"]="A mace used by the lord of a kingdom.",
    ["EquipDesc_1104040"]="A hammer passed down from generation to generation by the viscount of a kingdom.",
    ["EquipDesc_1104041"]="Non-traditional smelting methods have made this hammer sturdier than standard weapons.",
    ["EquipDesc_1104043"]="It's said that the best way to deal with insomnia is to be knocked out by a hammer—or at least, that's what the creator of the magic hammer Requiem says.",
    ["EquipDesc_1104058"]="The demon severed a part of itself, in order to break free. Occasionally, the remaining body parts were found by a passing craftsman. Do be careful with it, as the demon is indeed revengeful...",
    ["EquipDesc_1104059"]="A hammer passed down from generation to generation by the duke of a kingdom.",
    ["EquipDesc_1104060"]="\"The earth shakes and moans, bursting flowers of flame from underground. He picked the flowers, turned them into a weapon, with which he faced the abyss.\"",
    ["EquipDesc_1104073"]="A hammer with the power of an otherworldly ancient god. It's yours, if you're willing to give up your soul for it.",
    ["EquipDesc_1104074"]="Dreams are gifts from the Creator, and fantasies give human wings. If you are willing to trade your life for freedom, I wish your dream would never end.",
    ["EquipDesc_1104075"]="A heavy and sturdy warhammer. It is said that no one has been able to lift it since the very day it was cast. The hammer is still stored in the arsenal of the Glast Heim Chivalry. So... will you be its destined owner?",
    ["EquipDesc_1104090"]="A weapon that looks heavy but surprisingly light in hand. The gem atop harbors the residual power from the last era.",
    ["EquipDesc_1104091"]="Debris of a fallen star, made into a warhammer by a skillful craftsman. It is infused with the force of the cosmos.",
    ["EquipDesc_1104092"]="A gift from the Lord's Mansion in Schwarzwald Republic to Juno College Students, a mace crafted with the most cutting-edge Republican technology.",
    ["EquipDesc_1104501"]="A wand created with magical guidance technology at its core, achieving the perfect fusion of magic and machinery. A true milestone creation of the Schwarzwald Republic.",
    ["EquipDesc_1104502"]="Inlaid with gems and inscribed with runes that amplify its power, this hammer could only be born from the of Arunafeltz, the kingdom known for its unmatchable alchemy.",
    ["EquipDesc_1104701"]="A mace carrying the force of the earth. It's said that it can reach its true strength by restoring the powers of \"heaven and earth.\"",
    ["EquipDesc_1104708"]="A weapon powered by feline energy, rumored to give two-legged creatures a special attack bonus.",
    ["EquipDesc_1104716"]="Originally designed for surveying the Einbech tunnels, this hammer's unique construction also makes it effective as a weapon.",
    ["EquipDesc_1105001"]="A double-edged dagger made for practical purposes.",
    ["EquipDesc_1105002"]="A knife used for cutting enemies.",
    ["EquipDesc_1105003"]="A magnificent dagger. People of noble status often wear it during special occasions.",
    ["EquipDesc_1105004"]="A thrusting dagger used by the highlanders of a certain Western country in ancient times.",
    ["EquipDesc_1105005"]="A dagger with a blade that is curved at just the right angle.",
    ["EquipDesc_1105006"]="A dagger made of special steel characterized by wavelike patterns along the blade.",
    ["EquipDesc_1105007"]="A dagger that brings luck to its user.",
    ["EquipDesc_1105008"]="A dagger designed to destroy enemy weapons, although the chance of this happening is low.",
    ["EquipDesc_1105009"]="The sawtooth blade of this dagger is coated with poison.",
    ["EquipDesc_1105010"]="A very useful dagger for clearing obstacles in the jungle.",
    ["EquipDesc_1105011"]="One of a pair of daggers made by the Assassins Guild.",
    ["EquipDesc_1105014"]="One of a pair of daggers made by the Assassins Guild.",
    ["EquipDesc_1105015"]="The dagger worn by the pilgrims is both an important ritual tool and a sharp thorn to pierce the heart of the animal sacrifice.",
    ["EquipDesc_1105016"]="A sawtooth dagger crafted by the Rogue Guild. It has awesome destructive power.",
    ["EquipDesc_1105017"]="The thornlike serrations are intended to inflict great pain on the enemy.",
    ["EquipDesc_1105018"]="Crafted from a dragon's fang, this dagger can even pierce shells of monsters.",
    ["EquipDesc_1105019"]="A short blade as thin as a worm's wing. It is used by a senior spy who never misses, and can stab enemies almost undetected.",
    ["EquipDesc_1105030"]="A dagger designed to be easily used by anyone.",
    ["EquipDesc_1105031"]="A dagger favored by those who love to adventure. It offers just enough attack power to deal with basic monsters.",
    ["EquipDesc_1105032"]="A dagger that can only be used by masters of the highest proficiency. Extremely deadly in the right hands.",
    ["EquipDesc_1105033"]="A dagger that can only be used by warriors who have won glory. Those who carry it will feel great honor.",
    ["EquipDesc_1105034"]="A dagger conferred to warriors by the royal family. Those who carry it will feel the highest honor.",
    ["EquipDesc_1105035"]="A dagger provided to seasoned adventurers. It looks quite durable.",
    ["EquipDesc_1105036"]="A dagger used by the Imperial Guard.",
    ["EquipDesc_1105037"]="A dagger used by the lord of a kingdom.",
    ["EquipDesc_1105040"]="A dagger passed down from generation to generation by the viscount of a kingdom.",
    ["EquipDesc_1105041"]="This dagger is small and delicate, but if you underestimate it and get careless, your blood will become its food.",
    ["EquipDesc_1105043"]="This dagger is used in aristocratic coming-of-age ceremonies and is quite gorgeous and exquisite.",
    ["EquipDesc_1105058"]="A delicate dagger made with different craftsmanship from Comodo's tradition, thus presumably a foreign item. People in cloaks are seen wandering near Hermit's Village. Did they lose this?",
    ["EquipDesc_1105059"]="A dagger passed down from generation to generation by the duke of a kingdom.",
    ["EquipDesc_1105060"]="Wounds from the curved blade are difficult to heal. When used with poison, it can quickly deprive enemies of their ability to fight.",
    ["EquipDesc_1105073"]="A dagger with the power of an otherworldly ancient god. It's yours, if you're willing to give up your soul for it.",
    ["EquipDesc_1105074"]="The flamboyant and gorgeous dagger is reminiscent of the vast desert at sunset. The flaming red clouds and the sand and gravel in the sky are integrated into one. The lone bird flutters high, and even the white feather that is slowly falling looks red against the sky.",
    ["EquipDesc_1105075"]="The dazzling jewelry is so enchanting that it gives you the perfect time to take lives.",
    ["EquipDesc_1105090"]="\"Who can turn down a cool-looking dagger that can be used in felling trees, fishing, and opening cans?\" Said Irumina.",
    ["EquipDesc_1105091"]="This lightsome, gold-adorned short blade is the dream weapon of every assassin.",
    ["EquipDesc_1105092"]="A gift from the Lord's Mansion in Schwarzwald Republic to Juno College Students, a dagger crafted with the most cutting-edge Republican technology.",
    ["EquipDesc_1105501"]="A dagger created with magical guidance technology at its core, achieving the perfect fusion of magic and machinery. A true milestone creation of the Schwarzwald Republic.",
    ["EquipDesc_1105502"]="Inlaid with gems and inscribed with runes that amplify its power, this dagger could only be born from the of Arunafeltz, the kingdom known for its unmatchable alchemy.",
    ["EquipDesc_1105701"]="One of a pair of daggers made by the Assassins Guild.",
    ["EquipDesc_1105708"]="A dagger crafted from solid mammoth ivory—so hard it's a pain to craft, but its tip is razor-sharp for stabbing.",
    ["EquipDesc_1105716"]="A dagger with a jet-black blade that warns of danger with its color.",
    ["EquipDesc_1107001"]="A common book that is quite powerful when used as a weapon.",
    ["EquipDesc_1107002"]="A book containing holy words. Its considerable weight can deal heavy damage to enemies.",
    ["EquipDesc_1107003"]="A notebook used by the god of death. They sometimes end up in human hands when the god of death drops them. Some of the many names on its pages are familiar.",
    ["EquipDesc_1107005"]="A spell book used by a mage. It is big and thick.",
    ["EquipDesc_1107007"]="A book that contains the origin and history of all dragons. It is said to have been passed down through the generations of the dragon race.",
    ["EquipDesc_1107008"]="A book of a great sage, that records all his knowledge in the form of a diary.",
    ["EquipDesc_1107010"]="A book to help students acquire all the knowledge necessary to become a mage.",
    ["EquipDesc_1107011"]="An encyclopedia published by a Prontera publisher that is well-known for the hard edges of its books.",
    ["EquipDesc_1107012"]="A thick book that all priests must read. According to legend, the method for killing a monster in seconds is recorded in this book.",
    ["EquipDesc_1107014"]="This book has an impressive tagline: \"There is more than one path to learning.\" Practice makes perfect. If you keep trying, you'll be an expert before you know it.",
    ["EquipDesc_1107015"]="The standard weapon that symbolizes the Marquis identity. Not only does it represent the noble bloodline of the user, but also signifies the user’s infinite intelligence.",
    ["EquipDesc_1107016"]="A tome written in icy cold. Just touching its cover, you can feel the deep cold for one thousand year.",
    ["EquipDesc_1107017"]="The book with the horrible and filthy incantation. The person who reads the incantation can make everything around him wither away.",
    ["EquipDesc_1107030"]="A spell book made with beginners in mind.",
    ["EquipDesc_1107031"]="A spell book favored by those who love to adventure. It offers just enough attack power to deal with basic monsters.",
    ["EquipDesc_1107032"]="A book that can only be used by masters of the highest proficiency. Extremely deadly in the right hands.",
    ["EquipDesc_1107033"]="A book that can only be used by warriors who have won glory. Those who carry it will feel great honor.",
    ["EquipDesc_1107034"]="A tome owned by Abysmal Knights.",
    ["EquipDesc_1107035"]="A book conferred to warriors by the royal family. Those who carry it will feel the highest honor.",
    ["EquipDesc_1107036"]="A cursed tome.",
    ["EquipDesc_1107037"]="It is said to record many stories of heroism. Over time, it has gained some magic power.",
    ["EquipDesc_1107038"]="A spell book used by the Imperial Guard.",
    ["EquipDesc_1107039"]="A spell book used by the lord of a kingdom.",
    ["EquipDesc_1107042"]="A book passed down from generation to generation by the viscount of a kingdom.",
    ["EquipDesc_1107043"]="You want to try talking with the person in the book? Be careful—those are the whispers of a demon.",
    ["EquipDesc_1107045"]="A forbidden book said to have the source of all calamities sealed within. Because of this, you absolutely cannot open the heavy lock on the book.",
    ["EquipDesc_1107060"]="The cover comprises complex mechanisms, which only unlock after strict rituals, so no one but truly loyal believers are qualified to grab a glimpse into it. Why does Tao Gunka hold something like this? No one knows. It can't read, after all.",
    ["EquipDesc_1107061"]="A book passed down from generation to generation by the duke of a kingdom.",
    ["EquipDesc_1107062"]="Are epics stories, or prophecies? ",
    ["EquipDesc_1107075"]="A book with the power of an otherworldly ancient god. It's yours, if you're willing to give up your soul for it.",
    ["EquipDesc_1107076"]="A record is kept on the names of every soul that crosses the Styx.",
    ["EquipDesc_1107077"]="It accepts only the purest desires.",
    ["EquipDesc_1107092"]="In the ancient times when Ymir lived, sands and seas didn't exist. Nor were there surging waves, vast lands, or boundless skies, only the bottomless, desolate abyss. — Prologue of The Book of Sybil",
    ["EquipDesc_1107093"]="Knowledge points the direction for people to move forward.",
    ["EquipDesc_1107094"]="A gift from the Lord's Mansion in Schwarzwald Republic to Juno College Students, a book containing the most cutting-edge Republican technology.",
    ["EquipDesc_1107501"]="A spell book created with magical guidance technology at its core, achieving the perfect fusion of magic and machinery. A true milestone creation of the Schwarzwald Republic.",
    ["EquipDesc_1107502"]="Inlaid with gems and recorded runes that amplify its power, this book could only be born from the of Arunafeltz, the kingdom known for its unmatchable alchemy.",
    ["EquipDesc_1107701"]="Technical books are stored in the Barmeal. They're all bent out of shape because of some magic interference device installed by the Illusionists.",
    ["EquipDesc_1107708"]="A sacred book of exorcism, said to have belonged to an ancient priest.\nIt seems to resonate with the boots of ancient heroes.",
    ["EquipDesc_1107716"]="A manual of industrial safety and disaster prevention. Just holding it makes you feel safer.",
    ["EquipDesc_1108001"]="A compact firearm fitted with an extended barrel that increases the shooting range and HIT. Seems handier than a Revolver.",
    ["EquipDesc_1108002"]="Named after a storm, this rifle lives up to its reputation for exceptional range and outstanding firepower.",
    ["EquipDesc_1108003"]="The firepower of the previous rifle has been dramatically enhanced. Now, as its name implies, the enemy should embrace their \"Dusk of Life.\"",
    ["EquipDesc_1108004"]="A highly-accurate rifle benefited from its extended barrel.",
    ["EquipDesc_1108005"]="Shorter than usual rifles, this one adopted pragmatic designs for serious indoor combats.",
    ["EquipDesc_1108006"]="A masterpiece that maximizes a rifle's performance to its fullest. The exquisite design instantly captivates many Gunslingers' hearts, and its deadly shot can pierce through the enemy's heart in the blink of an eye. The only drawback, if there is any, is that it utilizes a lever-action reload mechanism, which slows the reloading speed.",
    ["EquipDesc_1108007"]="A Branch Rifle designed especially for sniping humanoid enemies in mid to long-range.",
    ["EquipDesc_1108008"]="A rifle crafted in honor of a glorious warrior.",
    ["EquipDesc_1108009"]="A rifle made for Rebellions, as they are just getting used to firearms.",
    ["EquipDesc_1108010"]="A medium-sized assault rifle with astonishing damage.",
    ["EquipDesc_1108011"]="A rifle favored by thieves, which is lighter in weight compared to their alternative choices.",
    ["EquipDesc_1108012"]="A large-sized assault rifle used in combat.",
    ["EquipDesc_1108013"]="An automatic rifle favored by those who love to adventure. It offers just enough attack power to deal with basic monsters.",
    ["EquipDesc_1108014"]="An automatic rifle that can only be used by masters of the highest proficiency. Extremely deadly in the right hands.",
    ["EquipDesc_1108015"]="An automatic rifle that can only be used by warriors who have won glory. Those who carry it will feel great honor.",
    ["EquipDesc_1108016"]="An automatic rifle used by the Imperial Guard.",
    ["EquipDesc_1108017"]="An automatic rifle conferred to warriors by the royal family. Those who carry it will feel the highest honor.",
    ["EquipDesc_1108018"]="An automatic rifle used by the lord of a kingdom.",
    ["EquipDesc_1108019"]="An automatic rifle passed down from generation to generation by the viscount of a kingdom.",
    ["EquipDesc_1108020"]="The standard weapon that symbolizes the Marquis identity. Not only does it represent the noble bloodline of the user, but also signifies its raging rain of bullets.",
    ["EquipDesc_1108021"]="An automatic rifle passed down from generation to generation by the duke of a kingdom.",
    ["EquipDesc_1108022"]="Osiris's Rifle.",
    ["EquipDesc_1108023"]="A gift from the Lord's Mansion in Schwarzwald Republic to Juno College Students, an automatic rifle crafted with the most cutting-edge Republican technology.",
    ["EquipDesc_1108024"]="One of the winning prizes from the 115th Midgard Continent Amateur Shooting Championship. All champions in history have autographed this gun, making it a priceless souvenir. But don't hold your breath on its performance in actual combat.",
    ["EquipDesc_1108025"]="This one was allegedly made by a short-haired female mage. She infused the weapon's firing system with a potion of stimulating odor, and surprisingly, it worked pretty well in terms of firepower...",
    ["EquipDesc_1108026"]="A rifle with a complicated structure. It used to be popular at the time but was eventually phased out due to the advancement of gun-making technology. Nevertheless, it is a rare find for those scholars studying firearm history.",
    ["EquipDesc_1108027"]="Equipped with the automated aiming system developed by Rekenber Corp. Even beginners can hit the bullseye every time.",
    ["EquipDesc_1108028"]="Vibrant graffiti blooms like fireworks, covering every inch of the firearm. After pulling the trigger, even the gunpowder smell becomes a fruity fragrance with a touch of sweetness. It's truly a weapon filled with tropical vibes.",
    ["EquipDesc_1108029"]="Annihilation might not be the end; it could be a rebirth.",
    ["EquipDesc_1108030"]="A rifle with a stunningly elegant appearance, more like an art piece than a weapon. It's said that the prototype was unearthed from an altar in the deep of the Juperos Ruins, and is now being stored in the Juno University Museum, with no access to the public.",
    ["EquipDesc_1108501"]="A rifle created with magical guidance technology at its core, achieving the perfect fusion of magic and machinery. A true milestone creation of the Schwarzwald Republic.",
    ["EquipDesc_1108502"]="Inlaid with gems and inscribed with runes that amplify its power, this shotgun could only be born from the of Arunafeltz, the kingdom known for its unmatchable alchemy.",
    ["EquipDesc_1108721"]="A rifle with precision modifications using clock tower components. It operates quite differently from existing guns.",
    ["EquipDesc_1108735"]="A prototype weapon tossed aside due to its uncontrollable firepower. The gunstock still has Rekensheim Institute's logo.",
    ["EquipDesc_1108751"]="Made by a modest master craftsman. When the trigger is pulled, it can pierce even dimensions.",
    ["EquipDesc_1109001"]="A compact firearm fitted with an extended barrel that increases the shooting range and HIT. Seems handier than a Revolver.",
    ["EquipDesc_1109002"]="Named after a storm, this rifle lives up to its reputation for exceptional range and outstanding firepower.",
    ["EquipDesc_1109003"]="The firepower of the previous rifle has been dramatically enhanced. Now, as its name implies, the enemy should embrace their \"Dusk of Life.\"",
    ["EquipDesc_1109004"]="A highly-accurate rifle benefited from its extended barrel.",
    ["EquipDesc_1109005"]="Shorter than usual rifles, this one adopted pragmatic designs for serious indoor combats.",
    ["EquipDesc_1109006"]="A masterpiece that maximizes a rifle's performance to its fullest. The exquisite design instantly captivates many Gunslingers' hearts, and its deadly shot can pierce through the enemy's heart in the blink of an eye. The only drawback, if there is any, is that it utilizes a lever-action reload mechanism, which slows the reloading speed.",
    ["EquipDesc_1109007"]="A Branch Rifle designed especially for sniping humanoid enemies in mid to long-range.",
    ["EquipDesc_1109008"]="A rifle crafted in honor of a glorious warrior.",
    ["EquipDesc_1109009"]="A rifle made for Rebellions, as they are just getting used to firearms.",
    ["EquipDesc_1109010"]="A medium-sized assault rifle with astonishing damage.",
    ["EquipDesc_1109011"]="A rifle favored by thieves, which is lighter in weight compared to their alternative choices.",
    ["EquipDesc_1109012"]="A large-sized sniper rifle used in combat.",
    ["EquipDesc_1109013"]="A sniper rifle favored by those who love to adventure. It offers just enough attack power to deal with basic monsters.",
    ["EquipDesc_1109014"]="A sniper rifle that can only be used by masters of the highest proficiency. Extremely deadly in the right hands.",
    ["EquipDesc_1109015"]="A sniper rifle that can only be used by warriors who have won glory. Those who carry it will feel great honor.",
    ["EquipDesc_1109016"]="A sniper rifle used by the Imperial Guard.",
    ["EquipDesc_1109017"]="A sniper rifle conferred to warriors by the royal family. Those who carry it will feel the highest honor.",
    ["EquipDesc_1109018"]="A sniper rifle used by the lord of a kingdom.",
    ["EquipDesc_1109019"]="A sniper rifle passed down from generation to generation by the viscount of a kingdom.",
    ["EquipDesc_1109020"]="The standard weapon that symbolizes the Marquis identity. Not only does it represent the noble bloodline of the user, but also signifies its devastating strike.",
    ["EquipDesc_1109021"]="A sniper rifle passed down from generation to generation by the duke of a kingdom.",
    ["EquipDesc_1109022"]="Osiris's Sniper Rifle.",
    ["EquipDesc_1109023"]="A gift from the Lord's Mansion in Schwarzwald Republic to Juno College Students, a sniper rifle crafted with the most cutting-edge Republican technology.",
    ["EquipDesc_1109024"]="A sniper rifle crafted with high-density materials, whose light weight provides exceptional stability. However, prolonged use may result in burdening the shooter's body.",
    ["EquipDesc_1109025"]="When facing the awe-inspiring Minorous, some chose to trap it in the labyrinth. But you, my friend, can choose another option—grant it a permanent and peaceful rest.",
    ["EquipDesc_1109026"]="\"Naming the work after its creator is not a privilege exclusive to artists.\" — Scrooge, the genius craftsman",
    ["EquipDesc_1109027"]="The colossal creature resides in the poisonous glacier of Hvergelmir and only feeds on the most delicious souls.",
    ["EquipDesc_1109028"]="Harming others for self-gain. That is the essence of conflict. Therefore, victory is nothing but a fig leaf for egoists.",
    ["EquipDesc_1109029"]="Crafted in the Wraith Forge in the Realm of the Dead, this weapon uses the energy of its wielder as ammunition, piercing every soul with each bullet.",
    ["EquipDesc_1109030"]="A sniper rifle with an unbelievably effective range, people refer to it as the sniper rifle that shocks heaven.",
    ["EquipDesc_1109501"]="A sniper rifle created with magical guidance technology at its core, achieving the perfect fusion of magic and machinery. A true milestone creation of the Schwarzwald Republic.",
    ["EquipDesc_1109502"]="Inlaid with gems and inscribed with runes that amplify its power, this sniper rifle could only be born from the of Arunafeltz, the kingdom known for its unmatchable alchemy.",
    ["EquipDesc_1109721"]="A weapon of utmost etiquette, incredibly lavish.",
    ["EquipDesc_1109735"]="Every gem on this gun is a gift from the stars.",
    ["EquipDesc_1109751"]="A firearm forged from the bones of a giant beast found in ancient ruins. It silently vows that no bullet it fires shall ever stray.",
    ["EquipDesc_1201001"]="A solid, well-built shield.",
    ["EquipDesc_1201002"]="A round shield that is commonplace because it is simple to make and easy to use.",
    ["EquipDesc_1201003"]="A shield that is highly effective at blocking enemy attacks.",
    ["EquipDesc_1201004"]="A shield with a mirrored surface capable of reflecting harmful magic.",
    ["EquipDesc_1201005"]="A strong shield made out of Bradium.",
    ["EquipDesc_1201006"]="A holy shield that symbolizes the gods.",
    ["EquipDesc_1201008"]="The shield used by Gna, messenger of Frigg, when she served as a valkyrie.",
    ["EquipDesc_1201009"]="An angel's shield containing a holy power that eliminates evil.",
    ["EquipDesc_1201010"]="A large steel plate used for serving food. It has been polished to a mirror finish.",
    ["EquipDesc_1201011"]="A magnificent platinum shield that is rumored to be capable of reflecting harmful magic.",
    ["EquipDesc_1201012"]="A rough shield covered in spikes.",
    ["EquipDesc_1201013"]="A hefty cross-shaped shield.",
    ["EquipDesc_1201014"]="An exquisite yet tough shield made from Naga scales, each of which is razor-sharp.",
    ["EquipDesc_1201015"]="A thin shield made of silver and iron. It looks spectacular when it reflects light.",
    ["EquipDesc_1201016"]="A shield with a notch for a lance, very efficient for staying safe while you attack.",
    ["EquipDesc_1201017"]="A strengthened round shield.",
    ["EquipDesc_1201018"]="A strengthened shield.",
    ["EquipDesc_1201019"]="A hard shield.",
    ["EquipDesc_1201020"]="A shield with a mysterious aura.",
    ["EquipDesc_1201021"]="A massive shield that can withstand any attack without being pushed back.",
    ["EquipDesc_1201022"]="A spell book used by mages, large and heavy enough to serve as a shield.",
    ["EquipDesc_1201023"]="A stone shield that Thor obtained after slaying Hrungnir, the king of giants. It contains the power of the giants, which rivals the might of the gods.",
    ["EquipDesc_1201024"]="A thick book that all priests must read.",
    ["EquipDesc_1201030"]="A shield favored by those who love to adventure. It offers just enough defense power to deal with basic monsters.",
    ["EquipDesc_1201031"]="A buckler favored by those who love to adventure. It offers just enough defense power to deal with basic monsters.",
    ["EquipDesc_1201032"]="A shield favored by veterans. It provides enough defense power to deal with some intermediate monsters.",
    ["EquipDesc_1201033"]="A buckler favored by veterans. It provides enough defense power to deal with some intermediate monsters.",
    ["EquipDesc_1201034"]="A shield that can only be used by warriors who have won glory. It provides enough defense power to deal with most intermediate monsters.",
    ["EquipDesc_1201035"]="A buckler that can only be used by warriors who have won glory. It provides enough defense power to deal with most intermediate monsters.",
    ["EquipDesc_1201036"]="A shield conferred to warriors by the royal family. It provides enough defense power to deal with some advanced monsters.",
    ["EquipDesc_1201037"]="A buckler conferred to warriors by the royal family. It provides enough defense power to deal with some advanced monsters.",
    ["EquipDesc_1201038"]="A small black shield that can be equipped on the arm.",
    ["EquipDesc_1201039"]="A shield that contains the will of the gods and was bestowed by the gods.",
    ["EquipDesc_1201040"]="A shield that Goibne made for a bet against his rival, Dulb.",
    ["EquipDesc_1201041"]="A shield used by the most basic of guards.",
    ["EquipDesc_1201042"]="A shield provided to acolytes for their use.",
    ["EquipDesc_1201043"]="A steel shield used by the Imperial Guard.",
    ["EquipDesc_1201044"]="A buckler used by the Imperial Guard.",
    ["EquipDesc_1201045"]="A shield used by the lord of a kingdom.",
    ["EquipDesc_1201046"]="A buckler used by the lord of a kingdom.",
    ["EquipDesc_1201051"]="A square shield passed down from generation to generation by the viscount of a kingdom.",
    ["EquipDesc_1201052"]="A kite shield passed down from generation to generation by the viscount of a kingdom.",
    ["EquipDesc_1201053"]="A mysterious image is engraved on the shield's surface. It is said to symbolize triumphant returns.",
    ["EquipDesc_1201054"]="On the surface, this looks like nothing more than an ordinary copper shield, but it's said that the materials used to forge it were from thousands of years ago...",
    ["EquipDesc_1201057"]="The meticulous craftsmanship of the creator of this shield is entirely condensed in this blossoming rose.",
    ["EquipDesc_1201058"]="A very durable shield made of special materials. It's standard issue for the city guard.",
    ["EquipDesc_1201087"]="A kite shield favored by those who love to adventure. It offers just enough defense power to deal with basic monsters.",
    ["EquipDesc_1201088"]="A square shield favored by those who love to adventure. It offers just enough defense power to deal with basic monsters.",
    ["EquipDesc_1201089"]="A kite shield favored by veterans. It provides enough defense power to deal with some intermediate monsters.",
    ["EquipDesc_1201090"]="A square shield favored by veterans. It provides enough defense power to deal with some intermediate monsters.",
    ["EquipDesc_1201091"]="A kite shield that can only be used by warriors who have won glory. It provides enough defense power to deal with most intermediate monsters.",
    ["EquipDesc_1201092"]="A square shield that can only be used by warriors who have won glory. It provides enough defense power to deal with most intermediate monsters.",
    ["EquipDesc_1201093"]="A kite shield used by the Imperial Guard.",
    ["EquipDesc_1201094"]="A square shield used by the Imperial Guard.",
    ["EquipDesc_1201095"]="A kite shield conferred to warriors by the royal family. It provides enough defense power to deal with some advanced monsters.",
    ["EquipDesc_1201096"]="A square shield conferred to warriors by the royal family. It provides enough defense power to deal with some advanced monsters.",
    ["EquipDesc_1201097"]="A kite shield used by the lord of a kingdom.",
    ["EquipDesc_1201098"]="A buckler used by the lord of a kingdom.",
    ["EquipDesc_1201099"]="A shield made from a special processed metal. It looks like a blooming rose.",
    ["EquipDesc_1201100"]="A standard shield used by military guards. It is enchanted with a divine power.",
    ["EquipDesc_1201105"]="Legend tells that this shield is the masterpiece of a great blacksmith, and was once used by an ancient guardian giant.",
    ["EquipDesc_1201106"]="A lightweight yet durable shield that has magical powers.",
    ["EquipDesc_1201107"]="A kite-shaped shield.",
    ["EquipDesc_1201108"]="A square shield.",
    ["EquipDesc_1201115"]="The armor that symbolizes the Marquis identity, with stars and feathers lighting up the bearer's path.",
    ["EquipDesc_1201116"]="The armor that symbolizes the Marquis identity. Its bearer seems to have starlight enchantment.",
    ["EquipDesc_1201117"]="The armor that symbolizes the Marquis identity, decorated ornately but also highly protective.",
    ["EquipDesc_1201118"]="The armor that symbolizes the Marquis identity, the bearer of which will be the protector of friends.",
    ["EquipDesc_1201119"]="A solid shield distributed by the kingdom's army, luxurious and practical.",
    ["EquipDesc_1201120"]="It is said that someone had faced the otherworld rift head-on and ripped out a mass of energy from it, which kept changing and became a shield by itself. The attack blocked by it went to another world as if it had disappeared.",
    ["EquipDesc_1201121"]="A kite shield that seals the echo of the Clock Tower. Whenever it fends off an attack, a bell echoes that does not match its size.",
    ["EquipDesc_1201122"]="A buckler inlaid with demon’s eyes. The ancient demon has long since died, and only the long-ago roar still echoes from its vacant eyes.",
    ["EquipDesc_1201147"]="With the power, here comes the price. Screams from the abyss will haunt your soul, depriving you of peaceful sleep every night.",
    ["EquipDesc_1201148"]="With the power, here comes the price. Undead spirits from the eternal darkness will devour every sound, leaving you in endless silence.",
    ["EquipDesc_1201149"]="A shield passed down from generation to generation by the duke of a kingdom.",
    ["EquipDesc_1201150"]="A buckler passed down from generation to generation by the duke of a kingdom.",
    ["EquipDesc_1201151"]="A kite shield passed down from generation to generation by the duke of a kingdom.",
    ["EquipDesc_1201152"]="A square shield passed down from generation to generation by the duke of a kingdom.",
    ["EquipDesc_1201153"]="Carved from a whole piece of unmelting polar ice, it is bigger than normal shields. Carry it, and you are determined to be the fortress for your allies.",
    ["EquipDesc_1201154"]="Riddled with sharp barbs imitating dragon scales, the shield provides protection against attacks, while breaking enemies' weapons cleverly.",
    ["EquipDesc_1201183"]="A shield with the power of an otherworldly ancient god. It's yours, if you're willing to give up your soul for it.",
    ["EquipDesc_1201184"]="A buckler with the power of an otherworldly ancient god. It's yours, if you're willing to give up your soul for it.",
    ["EquipDesc_1201185"]="A kite shield with the power of an otherworldly ancient god. It's yours, if you're willing to give up your soul for it.",
    ["EquipDesc_1201186"]="A square shield with the power of an otherworldly ancient god. It's yours, if you're willing to give up your soul for it.",
    ["EquipDesc_1201187"]="Standard weapons used by the undead soldiers. Engraved with the Nifflheim emblem on the shield, they are said to have been designed by Hera, Queen of the Underworld.",
    ["EquipDesc_1201188"]="The door-sized giant shield is scripted with the traditional Utan characters. It's more like a symbol of faith rather than a weapon.",
    ["EquipDesc_1201189"]="Weapons are not good or evil, but they do catch the wielder's color. Why did the shield made to protect eventually turn into tools for hurting others?",
    ["EquipDesc_1201190"]="The life of the Holy Fire Knight was brief but brilliant. All his beliefs were gathered in a shield named \"Summum Bonum.\" No matter how long it has been, history will remember all this.",
    ["EquipDesc_1201223"]="A mysterious weapon with an unknown history. Some have sought its origin but found nothing. It's said to be actually a key. But who knows?",
    ["EquipDesc_1201224"]="Forged hundreds of times by skilled craftsmen.",
    ["EquipDesc_1201225"]="If the darkness falls, I shall rise before the multitude. — Heimdall, Guardian of Gods.",
    ["EquipDesc_1201226"]="Believed to originate from Svartalfheim, this shield was crafted by the most skillful blacksmith in the Realm of Dwarves.",
    ["EquipDesc_1201227"]="A gift from the Lord's Mansion in Schwarzwald Republic to Juno College Students, a shield crafted with the most cutting-edge Republican technology.",
    ["EquipDesc_1201228"]="A gift from the Lord's Mansion in Schwarzwald Republic to Juno College Students, a buckler crafted with the most cutting-edge Republican technology.",
    ["EquipDesc_1201229"]="A gift from the Lord's Mansion in Schwarzwald Republic to Juno College Students, a kite shield crafted with the most cutting-edge Republican technology.",
    ["EquipDesc_1201230"]="A gift from the Lord's Mansion in Schwarzwald Republic to Juno College Students, a square shield crafted with the most cutting-edge Republican technology.",
    ["EquipDesc_1201501"]="A shield created with magical guidance technology at its core, achieving the perfect fusion of magic and machinery. A true milestone creation of the Schwarzwald Republic.",
    ["EquipDesc_1201502"]="A buckler created with magical guidance technology at its core, achieving the perfect fusion of magic and machinery. A true milestone creation of the Schwarzwald Republic.",
    ["EquipDesc_1201503"]="A kite shield created with magical guidance technology at its core, achieving the perfect fusion of magic and machinery. A true milestone creation of the Schwarzwald Republic.",
    ["EquipDesc_1201504"]="A square shield created with magical guidance technology at its core, achieving the perfect fusion of magic and machinery. A true milestone creation of the Schwarzwald Republic.",
    ["EquipDesc_1201505"]="Inlaid with gems and inscribed with runes that amplify its power, this shield could only be born from the of Arunafeltz, the kingdom known for its unmatchable alchemy.",
    ["EquipDesc_1201506"]="Inlaid with gems and inscribed with runes that amplify its power, this buckler could only be born from the of Arunafeltz, the kingdom known for its unmatchable alchemy.",
    ["EquipDesc_1201507"]="Inlaid with gems and inscribed with runes that amplify its power, this kite shield could only be born from the of Arunafeltz, the kingdom known for its unmatchable alchemy.",
    ["EquipDesc_1201508"]="Inlaid with gems and inscribed with runes that amplify its power, this square shield could only be born from the of Arunafeltz, the kingdom known for its unmatchable alchemy.",
    ["EquipDesc_1201701"]="The cursed knight's shield has become even more bloodied due to a failed purification ritual. It's impossible to cleanse it further.",
    ["EquipDesc_1201702"]="Enhanced by powerful magic to become extremely light. Though its abilities have been boosted, it can't be used for direct attacks.",
    ["EquipDesc_1201715"]="Looks totally bent out of shape, but this square shield can still take a hit like a champ.",
    ["EquipDesc_1201716"]="The go-to shield for elf warriors, packed with their magic.",
    ["EquipDesc_1201731"]="A shield infused with the power of wind. Its effects vary depending on the user.",
    ["EquipDesc_1201732"]="A divine weapon forged by the legendary blacksmiths of Olympus, tempered and refined over thousands of years.",
    ["EquipDesc_1202001"]="A basic Revolver with a capacity of 6 rounds. User-friendly to any Gunslingers.",
    ["EquipDesc_1202002"]="Compared to the practical aspects, this shiny golden revolver focuses more on its decoration. It surely allows you to become the center of attention when carrying it.",
    ["EquipDesc_1202003"]="Its simple mechanism and handy maneuverability quickly earn the favor of soldiers from different countries.",
    ["EquipDesc_1202004"]="A crimson gun that makes you think of blood and gore. It's said that this revolver is cursed.",
    ["EquipDesc_1202005"]="An order-made, slightly rare revolver. It's said that the genuine piece has the crafter's name engraved on it.",
    ["EquipDesc_1202006"]="Possessing signature characteristics of a revolver: sustained firepower and proud hit rate, this masterpiece was crafted in honor of a nameless Gunslinger who had overcome every challenge in the wilderness.",
    ["EquipDesc_1202007"]="This revolver is designed especially for close or mid-ranged combat. It can penetrate bulletproof vests and deal some decent damage.",
    ["EquipDesc_1202008"]="A revolver that emits a red glow.",
    ["EquipDesc_1202009"]="A weapon that has a subtle power. It feels like some of its abilities have been sealed.",
    ["EquipDesc_1202010"]="A revolver made from an alloy composed of both Oridecon and gold in a golden ratio.",
    ["EquipDesc_1202011"]="A revolver that emphasizes its decorative aspect instead of practical use. Carrying it surely makes you the center of attention.",
    ["EquipDesc_1202012"]="Dual revolvers featuring lightweight white bodies and heavy red barrels.",
    ["EquipDesc_1202013"]="A revolver favored by those who love to adventure. It offers just enough attack power to deal with basic monsters.",
    ["EquipDesc_1202014"]="A revolver that can only be used by masters of the highest proficiency. Extremely deadly in the right hands.",
    ["EquipDesc_1202015"]="A revolver that can only be used by warriors who have won glory. Those who carry it will feel great honor.",
    ["EquipDesc_1202016"]="A revolver used by the Imperial Guard.",
    ["EquipDesc_1202017"]="A revolver conferred to warriors by the royal family. Those who carry it will feel the highest honor.",
    ["EquipDesc_1202018"]="A revolver used by the lord of a kingdom.",
    ["EquipDesc_1202019"]="A revolver passed down from generation to generation by the viscount of a kingdom.",
    ["EquipDesc_1202020"]="The standard weapon that symbolizes the Marquis identity. Not only does it represent the noble bloodline of the user, but also signifies the user's excellent marksmanship.",
    ["EquipDesc_1202021"]="A revolver passed down from generation to generation by the duke of a kingdom.",
    ["EquipDesc_1202022"]="Osiris's Revolver.",
    ["EquipDesc_1202023"]="A gift from the Lord's Mansion in Schwarzwald Republic to Juno College Students, a revolver crafted with the most cutting-edge Republican technology.",
    ["EquipDesc_1202024"]="This revolver tells you how to perfectly fuse ice and fire together.",
    ["EquipDesc_1202025"]="\"Katrina has three principles on weapon-crafting: flashy outlook, catchy name, and trashy ability... What? You ask me why she dug into firearm crafting as a professional mage? Like I said, she's obsessed with useless stuff.\" — Bairde ranted.",
    ["EquipDesc_1202026"]="Eden Group always discovers things that don't belong to the current era from Glast Heim. This is one of them.",
    ["EquipDesc_1202027"]="The Schwarzwald Republic used to list it as a standard-issue weapon for their guards, but they soon revoked this decision due to several incidents that had caused civilian casualties. The reason was quite simple — it's too powerful as a revolver.",
    ["EquipDesc_1202028"]="If you can't win head-on, outspeeding your opponent can be a good choice.",
    ["EquipDesc_1202029"]="A weapon beyond sensible explanation. The black roses adorning the barrel bloom only after absorbing the enemy's blood, making it a cursed revolver of misfortune.",
    ["EquipDesc_1202030"]="Of course, Tyr never used a gun, but the weapon named after the god of war will surely bring you a triumphant victory.",
    ["EquipDesc_1202501"]="A revolver created with magical guidance technology at its core, achieving the perfect fusion of magic and machinery. A true milestone creation of the Schwarzwald Republic.",
    ["EquipDesc_1202504"]="Inlaid with gems and inscribed with runes that amplify its power, this revolver could only be born from the of Arunafeltz, the kingdom known for its unmatchable alchemy.",
    ["EquipDesc_1202721"]="According to legend, a ruthless queen is imprisoned inside.",
    ["EquipDesc_1202735"]="The ultimate hunter only has one target—your heart.",
    ["EquipDesc_1202751"]="Among certain nobles, carrying a decorated revolver is a symbol of prestige; some even chose to load them.",
    ["EquipDesc_1203001"]="Got its name from the stone-rolling sound it makes when being fired. Please use it with caution since it's heavy and rough.",
    ["EquipDesc_1203002"]="A modified shotgun; sleek and black. The capability of firing shots from two barrels enhances its firepower.",
    ["EquipDesc_1203003"]="Though it's officially called Gate Keeper, people actually prefer the name \"Absolute Defender\" since it has the highest attack power among all shotguns on the market.",
    ["EquipDesc_1203004"]="A short-barreled shotgun made from Oridecon. Possessing solid durability and reliability, it can even block incoming bullets.",
    ["EquipDesc_1203005"]="Its excellent durability and reliability can even bounce off incoming bullets.",
    ["EquipDesc_1203006"]="A hunting shotgun with a sawed-off barrel.",
    ["EquipDesc_1203007"]="A shotgun designed for close-quarter combat, boasting formidable power against human targets. However, its actual damage effect may vary significantly.",
    ["EquipDesc_1203008"]="A shotgun made for Rebellions, as they are just getting used to firearms.",
    ["EquipDesc_1203009"]="A shotgun made for Rebellions, as they are just getting used to firearms.",
    ["EquipDesc_1203010"]="A soul-infused shotgun used by the King of Firearm, who excels in every type of firearm.",
    ["EquipDesc_1203011"]="A spin-off of Rolling Stone. The special mechanism installed enables it to fire lightning shots.",
    ["EquipDesc_1203012"]="An automatic shotgun that is capable of sustained firing but has weaker damage when compared to other shotguns.",
    ["EquipDesc_1203013"]="A shotgun favored by those who love to adventure. It offers just enough attack power to deal with basic monsters.",
    ["EquipDesc_1203014"]="A shotgun that can only be used by masters of the highest proficiency. Extremely deadly in the right hands.",
    ["EquipDesc_1203015"]="A shotgun that can only be used by warriors who have won glory. Those who carry it will feel great honor.",
    ["EquipDesc_1203016"]="A shotgun used by the Imperial Guard.",
    ["EquipDesc_1203017"]="A shotgun conferred to warriors by the royal family. Those who carry it will feel the highest honor.",
    ["EquipDesc_1203018"]="A shotgun used by the lord of a kingdom.",
    ["EquipDesc_1203019"]="A shotgun passed down from generation to generation by the viscount of a kingdom.",
    ["EquipDesc_1203020"]="The standard weapon that symbolizes the Marquis identity. Not only does it represent the noble bloodline of the user, but also signifies its strong firepower.",
    ["EquipDesc_1203021"]="A shotgun passed down from generation to generation by the duke of a kingdom.",
    ["EquipDesc_1203022"]="Osiris's Shotgun.",
    ["EquipDesc_1203023"]="A gift from the Lord's Mansion in Schwarzwald Republic to Juno College Students, a shotgun crafted with the most cutting-edge Republican technology.",
    ["EquipDesc_1203024"]="Embedded with a concealed blade in the grip, thin and unnoticeable, this weapon allows the user to counterattack when the enemy least expects it.",
    ["EquipDesc_1203025"]="Compared to the firearm itself, the bullets embracing seven different elements are way more valuable. It's said that one can only use this gun to its fullest extent by flexibly switching bullet according to the situation.",
    ["EquipDesc_1203026"]="Infused with the holy power of light, this weapon can purge all sinful intentions in the world.",
    ["EquipDesc_1203027"]="\"He pulled the trigger and buried the bullet into her heart. This time, they will never separate again.\"",
    ["EquipDesc_1203028"]="Crafted by a mysterious gunsmith who secluded himself on the Comodo. Legend has it that the gun was crafted with extremely rare dragon scales, making it a priceless masterpiece.",
    ["EquipDesc_1203029"]="You need to make up your mind when choosing this one as your weapon. This weapon brings not only death but total destruction.",
    ["EquipDesc_1203030"]="Even a tiny spark can set the entire prairie on fire.",
    ["EquipDesc_1203501"]="A shotgun created with magical guidance technology at its core, achieving the perfect fusion of magic and machinery. A true milestone creation of the Schwarzwald Republic.",
    ["EquipDesc_1203510"]="Inlaid with gems and inscribed with runes that amplify its power, this shotgun could only be born from the of Arunafeltz, the kingdom known for its unmatchable alchemy.",
    ["EquipDesc_1203721"]="A shotgun crafted from the limbs of deep-sea monsters. It seems to be brewing a conspiracy?",
    ["EquipDesc_1203735"]="Is it a call to glory or the sound of doom? You won't know until you pull the trigger.",
    ["EquipDesc_1203751"]="Its spring, stock, and other parts were modified with special materials, giving it incredible accuracy and power.",
    ["EquipDesc_1204015"]="The gloves of a Dark Knight. They are said to make their wearer more agile.",
    ["EquipDesc_1301001"]="A sword that can only be used by masters of the highest sword proficiency. Extremely deadly in the right hands.",
    ["EquipDesc_1301003"]="A two-handed sword that is great for both slashing and stabbing.",
    ["EquipDesc_1301004"]="A huge two-handed sword that dispatches the enemy with its weight and swing speed.",
    ["EquipDesc_1301006"]="A very large multi-purpose two-handed sword with a thick blade that is good for both attack and defense.",
    ["EquipDesc_1301007"]="A sword made mainly out of dragon teeth. It can easily pierce the hard, sharp scales of dragons.",
    ["EquipDesc_1301008"]="A huge sword with a cross hilt.",
    ["EquipDesc_1301009"]="Known as a demonic sword due to its evil aura, but its power cannot be underestimated.",
    ["EquipDesc_1301011"]="A horrifying two-handed sword used to behead many who have been sentenced to death.",
    ["EquipDesc_1301012"]="A powerful sword that looks like a giant cross. The grip is decorated red for the highest class of knights.",
    ["EquipDesc_1301014"]="A simple yet exquisitely crafted sword.",
    ["EquipDesc_1301015"]="The standard weapon that symbolizes the Marquis identity. Not only does it represent the noble bloodline of the user, but also reveals his or her invigorating power.",
    ["EquipDesc_1301016"]="The sword's curved body and unorthodox design reveal its owner's past as an exile from the normal world.",
    ["EquipDesc_1301017"]="The huge sword that marks the identity of the winner, its wide and heavy blade indicates the strength of its holder.",
    ["EquipDesc_1301030"]="A two-handed sword made specially for beginners.",
    ["EquipDesc_1301031"]="A two-handed sword favored by those who love to adventure. It offers just enough attack power to deal with basic monsters.",
    ["EquipDesc_1301032"]="A heavy sword that can only be used by masters of the highest proficiency. Extremely deadly in the right hands.",
    ["EquipDesc_1301033"]="A heavy sword that can only be used by warriors who have won glory. Those who carry it will feel great honor.",
    ["EquipDesc_1301034"]="An exquisite example of Eastern swordsmithing. It is both beautiful and powerful.",
    ["EquipDesc_1301035"]="A heavy sword conferred to warriors by the royal family. Those who carry it will feel the highest honor.",
    ["EquipDesc_1301036"]="A giant two-handed sword used by the hero Sigurd.",
    ["EquipDesc_1301037"]="A spectacular sword with a blade forged from meteorite that shines with starlight during the night.",
    ["EquipDesc_1301038"]="A sword issued to cavalry.",
    ["EquipDesc_1301039"]="A heavy sword used by the Imperial Guard.",
    ["EquipDesc_1301040"]="A heavy sword used by the lord of a kingdom.",
    ["EquipDesc_1301043"]="A heavy sword passed down from generation to generation by the viscount of a kingdom.",
    ["EquipDesc_1301044"]="It's said that the inscriptions on this sword are always glowing, and that its wielder will get strange power from them.",
    ["EquipDesc_1301046"]="No one knows just how many people's blood this dark sword's blade has drank.",
    ["EquipDesc_1301061"]="Made with animal skeletons ground smooth and sharp, the blade keeps the teeth as they were. An intimidating and wild weapon.",
    ["EquipDesc_1301062"]="A heavy sword passed down from generation to generation by the duke of a kingdom.",
    ["EquipDesc_1301063"]="The sharp edge is divided into two, just like the palate of insects.",
    ["EquipDesc_1301076"]="A heavy sword with the power of an otherworldly ancient god. It's yours, if you're willing to give up your soul for it.",
    ["EquipDesc_1301077"]="The sword forged by a master craftsman was named after the radiance on the blade that looks like a sunrise.",
    ["EquipDesc_1301078"]="The sword most regularly used by the Holy Fire Knight was customized by the most prestigious weapon craftsman of the time. The sword is wide and heavy, perfect for the hero's combat style.",
    ["EquipDesc_1301093"]="A test subject from the lab. Can be used to store the user's power. Warning: extremely unstable.",
    ["EquipDesc_1301094"]="A magical blade that once lifted a beggar to the throne. It was lost later in the chaos of the fallen kingdom.",
    ["EquipDesc_1301095"]="A gift from the Lord's Mansion in Schwarzwald Republic to Juno College Students, a heavy sword crafted with the most cutting-edge Republican technology.",
    ["EquipDesc_1301501"]="A heavy sword created with magical guidance technology at its core, achieving the perfect fusion of magic and machinery. A true milestone creation of the Schwarzwald Republic.",
    ["EquipDesc_1301502"]="Inlaid with gems and inscribed with runes that amplify its power, this heavy sword could only be born from the of Arunafeltz, the kingdom known for its unmatchable alchemy.",
    ["EquipDesc_1301701"]="It's said to be a weapon made by workers during the great revolution as a means to resist exploitation.",
    ["EquipDesc_1301708"]="Many have tried to master this blood-forged blade, but in the end, they became part of it.",
    ["EquipDesc_1301716"]="A greatsword once wielded by a dragonslayer. After regaining its honor, its power has returned.",
    ["EquipDesc_1302002"]="A two-handed axe designed for fighting multiple opponents at once.",
    ["EquipDesc_1302003"]="An extremely powerful hammer.",
    ["EquipDesc_1302006"]="A two-handed axe with a fairly large blade that inspires fear in the enemy.",
    ["EquipDesc_1302007"]="A multi-bladed axe that looks terrifying.",
    ["EquipDesc_1302008"]="A huge two-handed axe imbued with the power of a hurricane.",
    ["EquipDesc_1302009"]="An axe made from Arctic ore. It gives off a bitterly cold wind.",
    ["EquipDesc_1302012"]="A long-bladed axe with a reinforced head and a thick handle, making it effective in melee combat.",
    ["EquipDesc_1302015"]="An extremely powerful axe that lives up to its name.",
    ["EquipDesc_1302016"]="An axe that can help souls who linger in the underworld rest in peace.",
    ["EquipDesc_1302017"]="An axe that has a divine power. It is often used in ceremonies.",
    ["EquipDesc_1302018"]="The standard weapon that symbolizes the Marquis identity. Not only does it represent the noble bloodline of the user, but also reveals his or her strength and determination like a giant axe.",
    ["EquipDesc_1302019"]="The axe, as tough as weathered stone, is said to be able to not only break down cliffs, but also feed on the stone to strengthen itself.",
    ["EquipDesc_1302020"]="The huge axe that hosts the power of the devil. The fires of hell are spat out again by the hands of others.",
    ["EquipDesc_1302030"]="A two-handed axe made with beginners in mind.",
    ["EquipDesc_1302031"]="A two-handed axe favored by those who love to adventure. It offers just enough attack power to deal with basic monsters.",
    ["EquipDesc_1302032"]="An axe that can only be used by masters of the highest proficiency. Extremely deadly in the right hands.",
    ["EquipDesc_1302033"]="An axe that can only be used by warriors who have won glory. Those who carry it will feel great honor.",
    ["EquipDesc_1302034"]="An axe conferred to warriors by the royal family. Those who carry it will feel the highest honor.",
    ["EquipDesc_1302035"]="A weapon with a subtle power that can sense abilities deep inside the body.",
    ["EquipDesc_1302036"]="A cold, heavy axe that gives people a feeling of oppression.",
    ["EquipDesc_1302037"]="A two-handed axe used by the Imperial Guard.",
    ["EquipDesc_1302038"]="A two-handed axe used by the lord of a kingdom.",
    ["EquipDesc_1302041"]="It pursues the ultimate might and destructive power, but only superbly strong warriors can wield this battle axe as they like.",
    ["EquipDesc_1302042"]="The handle of this weapon has been modified in order to adapt to combative environment, making it surprisingly comfortable to wield.",
    ["EquipDesc_1302059"]="Chicks only fly after being thrown off the cliff, and true warriors only grow fearless after witnessing life and death. The colorful eagle feathers are not only decorations, but also sincere expectations for the warriors.",
    ["EquipDesc_1302060"]="A two-handed axe passed down from generation to generation by the duke of a kingdom.",
    ["EquipDesc_1302061"]="With colorful metal embedded in the blade, it reflects rainbow-like light to disturb enemies' sight, thus disguising the actual traces of attack.",
    ["EquipDesc_1302074"]="A two-handed axe with the power of an otherworldly ancient god. It's yours, if you're willing to give up your soul for it.",
    ["EquipDesc_1302075"]="The blade of the semicircular axe looks like folding arms, which symbolizes being surrounded by the blessing of Yggdrasil.",
    ["EquipDesc_1302076"]="The ghosts coiled on the roofs of the houses spy on the humans, unleashing fear. The craftsmen would carve images of the ghosts on the edges of blades as a deterrent to the enemies.",
    ["EquipDesc_1302091"]="Instead of complaining about the hardship of marching forward, how about powering through it with a sharp axe in your hand?",
    ["EquipDesc_1302092"]="Just as Odin sought the truth of the world through Vedrfolnir, the wielder of this axe can easily find the weakest spots of their enemies.",
    ["EquipDesc_1302093"]="A gift from the Lord's Mansion in Schwarzwald Republic to Juno College Students, a two-handed axe crafted with the most cutting-edge Republican technology.",
    ["EquipDesc_1302501"]="A two-handed axe created with magical guidance technology at its core, achieving the perfect fusion of magic and machinery. A true milestone creation of the Schwarzwald Republic.",
    ["EquipDesc_1302502"]="Inlaid with gems and inscribed with runes that amplify its power, this two-handed axe could only be born from the of Arunafeltz, the kingdom known for its unmatchable alchemy.",
    ["EquipDesc_1302701"]="Components removed from sophisticated combat weapons, equipped with an independent launch module, ready to be used in battle.",
    ["EquipDesc_1302708"]="Don't forget to treat Octa to some juicy crabs—or your axe might just go on strike!",
    ["EquipDesc_1302716"]="A master blacksmith forged this two-handed axe to avenge his family. It seems to resonate with the boots of ancient heroes.",
    ["EquipDesc_1303001"]="A spear commonly used by knights.",
    ["EquipDesc_1303003"]="A spear with a curved blade.",
    ["EquipDesc_1303004"]="A spear with two sharp protrusions on the sides of its head.",
    ["EquipDesc_1303005"]="An auger-shaped two-handed spear designed for striking the gaps in armor.",
    ["EquipDesc_1303006"]="A three-pronged spear that can also be used or fishing.",
    ["EquipDesc_1303007"]="A two-handed spear with an axe blade topped with a spike, enabling both slashing and thrusting.",
    ["EquipDesc_1303008"]="A spear with multiple prongs that automatically shoot out at the enemy.",
    ["EquipDesc_1303010"]="A spear with a blade shaped like a lightning bolt.",
    ["EquipDesc_1303012"]="A spear with a large sword-like head.",
    ["EquipDesc_1303014"]="A magical spear forged from loess fragments to fight against Sakray, the cursed swordsman. Its physical strength and magical power are equally formidable.",
    ["EquipDesc_1303015"]="The standard weapon that symbolizes the Marquis identity. Not only does it represent the noble bloodline of the user, the lance also signifies superior martial arts.",
    ["EquipDesc_1303016"]="A two-handed three-pronged fork. It is light and practical.",
    ["EquipDesc_1303017"]="A spear made from the corpse of a giant sea monster. The sawtooth blade inflicts deep wounds.",
    ["EquipDesc_1303018"]="The creator of this formidable two-handed spear sacrificed his own life to make it. The spear has its own will and tries to dominate the user's consciousness.",
    ["EquipDesc_1303019"]="A spear that reveals demonic appearance due to the power of a  curse. It is said that the former owner pierced his chest with this spear out of unconcealed remorse.",
    ["EquipDesc_1303030"]="A two-handed spear made with beginners in mind.",
    ["EquipDesc_1303031"]="A two-handed spear favored by those who love to adventure. It offers just enough attack power to deal with basic monsters.",
    ["EquipDesc_1303032"]="A spear that can only be used by masters of the highest proficiency. Extremely deadly in the right hands.",
    ["EquipDesc_1303033"]="A spear that can only be used by warriors who have won glory. Those who carry it will feel great honor.",
    ["EquipDesc_1303034"]="A spear conferred to warriors by the royal family. Those who carry it will feel the highest honor.",
    ["EquipDesc_1303035"]="A cursed legendary spear owned by the tragic soldier, Longinus.",
    ["EquipDesc_1303036"]="An extremely sharp spear made of a pure, snow-white steel.",
    ["EquipDesc_1303037"]="A spear used by the Imperial Guard.",
    ["EquipDesc_1303038"]="A spear used by the lord of a kingdom.",
    ["EquipDesc_1303041"]="A spear passed down from generation to generation by the viscount of a kingdom.",
    ["EquipDesc_1303042"]="A spear with a peculiar design with a tip has been shaped into an axe blade. It grants destructive power at the expense of dexterity.",
    ["EquipDesc_1303044"]="A halberd forged into the shape of a flying dragon. A faint flash of thunder appears when it's wielded.",
    ["EquipDesc_1303059"]="Humans poke the snake pupils out of dragons, as a decoration of spears. Again, equipped with the weapon embedded with dragons' eyes, they hunt the dragon clan.",
    ["EquipDesc_1303060"]="A spear passed down from generation to generation by the duke of a kingdom.",
    ["EquipDesc_1303061"]="The name of calamity does not necessarily indicate disaster. Blessings come with misfortune, and light is always accompanied by shadows. Similarly, weapons bring death, as well as redemption.",
    ["EquipDesc_1303074"]="A spear with the power of an otherworldly ancient god. It's yours, if you're willing to give up your soul for it.",
    ["EquipDesc_1303075"]="A powerful spell is applied to the spear, which grants more power upon absorbing blood.",
    ["EquipDesc_1303076"]="The tip of the long spear used as a ritual item is divided into two, which is modeled on the feathers of the goddess Freya. Sacrifice your blood, and you will have a brief window to communicate with the goddess.",
    ["EquipDesc_1303091"]="A spear that grows fiery red with magical power. It can set enemies' blood ablaze.",
    ["EquipDesc_1303092"]="Life is but a wild dream. And how many roads must one go down?",
    ["EquipDesc_1303093"]="A gift from the Lord's Mansion in Schwarzwald Republic to Juno College Students, a spear crafted with the most cutting-edge Republican technology.",
    ["EquipDesc_1303501"]="A spear created with magical guidance technology at its core, achieving the perfect fusion of magic and machinery. A true milestone creation of the Schwarzwald Republic.",
    ["EquipDesc_1303502"]="Inlaid with gems and inscribed with runes that amplify its power, this spear could only be born from the of Arunafeltz, the kingdom known for its unmatchable alchemy.",
    ["EquipDesc_1303701"]="By attaching a weapon similar to a scythe to its extended body, this spear can be used in multiple attack modes, making it highly versatile.",
    ["EquipDesc_1303708"]="This two-handed spear was made in a final act of revenge against monsters—its creator's will still lingers, trying to control whoever picks it up.",
    ["EquipDesc_1303716"]="A dying Obeaune gave her lover an ice crystal from the deep sea. He then forged it into a spear of frost and raised it in rebellion.",
    ["EquipDesc_1304003"]="A specially made katar with multiple blades for fearsome offensive power.",
    ["EquipDesc_1304004"]="A cold katar made from a sharp icicle.",
    ["EquipDesc_1304006"]="A katar made from sharp thorns.",
    ["EquipDesc_1304009"]="A katar made from the bone of a skeleton king. It radiates an aura of death.",
    ["EquipDesc_1304011"]="A katar decorated with black light that might be difficult to swing.",
    ["EquipDesc_1304012"]="A katar used by a certain guillotine cross to assassinate a traitor of the guild a long time ago.",
    ["EquipDesc_1304013"]="A katar with a rare design that symbolizes reincarnation.",
    ["EquipDesc_1304014"]="A katar with an increased number of sockets. It is very difficult to use, so you may end up hurting yourself.",
    ["EquipDesc_1304015"]="A dual-bladed katar designed to kill enemies slowly by leaving wounds that cannot be sutured.",
    ["EquipDesc_1304018"]="The standard weapon that symbolizes the Marquis identity. It represents not only the noble bloodline of the user, but also his or her agility.",
    ["EquipDesc_1304019"]="Katar, which has been passed down from some ancient elemental beliefs, strikes the enemy with every punch like a thunderstorm.",
    ["EquipDesc_1304020"]="The Katar made of the spine of evil demons. No matter how it is made, its shape is always like the unfurled bat wings.",
    ["EquipDesc_1304030"]="A katar designed for ease of movement.",
    ["EquipDesc_1304031"]="A katar favored by those who love to adventure. It offers just enough attack power to deal with basic monsters.",
    ["EquipDesc_1304032"]="A katar that can only be used by masters of the highest proficiency. Extremely deadly in the right hands.",
    ["EquipDesc_1304033"]="A katar that can only be used by warriors who have won glory. Those who carry it will feel great honor.",
    ["EquipDesc_1304034"]="A katar conferred to warriors by the royal family. Those who carry it will feel the highest honor.",
    ["EquipDesc_1304035"]="A katar made from a dragon's scale. Its appearance strikes fear into the heart of the enemy.",
    ["EquipDesc_1304036"]="A katar loved by fighters because it provides so much bang for their buck.",
    ["EquipDesc_1304037"]="A katar used by the Imperial Guard.",
    ["EquipDesc_1304038"]="A katar used by the lord of a kingdom.",
    ["EquipDesc_1304041"]="A katar made in the shape of thorns. It leaves behind wounds that are not easily healed.",
    ["EquipDesc_1304042"]="An ice blade that does not melt, made of ice and snow from Ginnungagap.",
    ["EquipDesc_1304059"]="As believed by the desert residents, Golden Beetles are the emblem of eternal circulation, thus used as decorations on various daily items. After being shipped to Comodo, these goods sent off another trend for Golden Beetles.",
    ["EquipDesc_1304060"]="A katar passed down from generation to generation by the duke of a kingdom.",
    ["EquipDesc_1304061"]="With delicate carvings on the handle, the weapon looks like a dragon spreading its wings on your fingertips.",
    ["EquipDesc_1304074"]="A katar with the power of an otherworldly ancient god. It's yours, if you're willing to give up your soul for it.",
    ["EquipDesc_1304075"]="Originated from the far east, the Katar incorporates a peculiar concept of cultivation in the design. It is said that the five blades represent form, sensations, perceptions, mental activities, and consciousness, respectively. When the five aggregates of clinging are extinguished, it is the highest level of cultivation.",
    ["EquipDesc_1304076"]="Lightweight and sharp, the Katar has virtually no drawbacks as a weapon. But when night falls, there seems to be a pair of eyes in the gloomy gemstone that peeks into the world...",
    ["EquipDesc_1304091"]="Wonder if the owner of this katar yells, \"Wings of light, spread!\" while wielding it.",
    ["EquipDesc_1304092"]="Blessed by the gods, these warriors can harness unparalleled force.",
    ["EquipDesc_1304093"]="A gift from the Lord's Mansion in Schwarzwald Republic to Juno College Students, a katar crafted with the most cutting-edge Republican technology.",
    ["EquipDesc_1304501"]="A katar created with magical guidance technology at its core, achieving the perfect fusion of magic and machinery. A true milestone creation of the Schwarzwald Republic.",
    ["EquipDesc_1304502"]="Inlaid with gems and inscribed with runes that amplify its power, this katar could only be born from the of Arunafeltz, the kingdom known for its unmatchable alchemy.",
    ["EquipDesc_1304701"]="A skull-shaped Katar, similar to the scythe of the Grim Reaper and the claws of an evil dragon.",
    ["EquipDesc_1304708"]="A katar shaped like a spike—hits hard, cuts wide, and leaves behind some nasty marks.",
    ["EquipDesc_1304716"]="A finely crafted katar. Though the craftsman's name is long forgotten, the weapon's brilliance endures in the hands of every warrior.",
    ["EquipDesc_1305002"]="A bow made of a mixture of materials that deals heavy damage.",
    ["EquipDesc_1305003"]="A giant bow that looks difficult to use.",
    ["EquipDesc_1305004"]="A slim, smooth bow specially designed for inflicting double attacks.",
    ["EquipDesc_1305005"]="According to legend, this bow was cursed for killing the hero of a small Eastern kingdom. Anyone who uses it will suffer bad luck.",
    ["EquipDesc_1305008"]="A bow that does not deal very much damage but is easy to use.",
    ["EquipDesc_1305009"]="A bow imbued with divine power that increases its damage, allowing the user to unleash their full potential.",
    ["EquipDesc_1305012"]="A bow made from moonstone and has a blade that allows its user to block and counter enemy attacks. Unfortunately it is quite heavy.",
    ["EquipDesc_1305015"]="A bow made from dragon bones and shaped like dragon wings. It can deal lethal damage to dragons.",
    ["EquipDesc_1305016"]="An elegant red bow reminiscent of a hawk in flight.",
    ["EquipDesc_1305017"]="A cross-shaped bow with a special mechanism that rapidly shoots powerful bolts.",
    ["EquipDesc_1305018"]="The standard weapon that symbolizes the Marquis identity. It represents not only the noble bloodline of the user, but also his or her mastery of archery.",
    ["EquipDesc_1305019"]="A longbow enchanted with the magic power of the abyssal poisonous spider. The arrow shot by it is like a jet of spider silk, which will cling to the prey.",
    ["EquipDesc_1305020"]="Contains the power of Payon Forest. The bow has vine leaves growing out of its body and is known for its rapid shots.",
    ["EquipDesc_1305030"]="A mighty bow that is much loved for its precision and power.",
    ["EquipDesc_1305031"]="A bow favored by those who love to adventure. It offers just enough attack power to deal with basic monsters.",
    ["EquipDesc_1305032"]="A bow that can only be used by masters of the highest proficiency. Extremely deadly in the right hands.",
    ["EquipDesc_1305033"]="A bow that can only be used by warriors who have won glory. Those who carry it will feel great honor.",
    ["EquipDesc_1305034"]="A bow conferred to warriors by the royal family. Those who carry it will feel the highest honor.",
    ["EquipDesc_1305035"]="A longbow used by imperial sergeants.",
    ["EquipDesc_1305036"]="A longbow used by the Imperial Guard.",
    ["EquipDesc_1305037"]="A longbow used by the lord of a kingdom.",
    ["EquipDesc_1305040"]="A bow passed down from generation to generation by the viscount of a kingdom.",
    ["EquipDesc_1305041"]="A bow protected with special runes. If one can use it properly, even shooting a willow leaf from a hundred paces is possible.",
    ["EquipDesc_1305043"]="The bow is decorated with eagle feathers to display the glory of a sniper.",
    ["EquipDesc_1305058"]="Carved somewhere insignificant on the bow are these words: \"Waves are the letters home from a faraway land. Off we sailed with the wind, and back we will come with the tides.\"",
    ["EquipDesc_1305059"]="A longbow passed down from generation to generation by the duke of a kingdom.",
    ["EquipDesc_1305060"]="An elegant longbow. The feathers decorating the sides are actually there for magic amplification, which empower the arrows shot.",
    ["EquipDesc_1305073"]="A longbow with the power of an otherworldly ancient god. It's yours, if you're willing to give up your soul for it.",
    ["EquipDesc_1305074"]="The flame is an arrow shot in the air, burning out all the evil in the world.",
    ["EquipDesc_1305075"]="The path ahead is long and winding, but the faith of the seeker will never be worn out by it.",
    ["EquipDesc_1305090"]="This compound longbow is crafted with pulleys and layered bowstrings. It might appear bulky, but it excels in shooting range and power.",
    ["EquipDesc_1305091"]="This magical longbow can sense the will of its owner and directs each arrow with deadly precision.",
    ["EquipDesc_1305092"]="A gift from the Lord's Mansion in Schwarzwald Republic to Juno College Students, a longbow crafted with the most cutting-edge Republican technology.",
    ["EquipDesc_1305501"]="A longbow created with magical guidance technology at its core, achieving the perfect fusion of magic and machinery. A true milestone creation of the Schwarzwald Republic.",
    ["EquipDesc_1305502"]="Inlaid with gems and inscribed with runes that amplify its power, this longbow could only be born from the of Arunafeltz, the kingdom known for its unmatchable alchemy.",
    ["EquipDesc_1305701"]="A longbow that has a subtle power. It feels like some of its abilities have been sealed.",
    ["EquipDesc_1305708"]="Blessed by Goddess Freyja, this legendary longbow is locked away in the Pope's vault—rarely, if ever, seen.",
    ["EquipDesc_1305716"]="An ancient hero's longbow, passed down by a now-forgotten royal lineage. Awakened by the magic of old, it now reveals its true power.",
    ["EquipDesc_1306001"]="A two-handed staff that emits a red glow.",
    ["EquipDesc_1306002"]="A metal wand that has been reinforced with steel to enhance its abilities.",
    ["EquipDesc_1306003"]="A two-handed staff that amplifies magic power.",
    ["EquipDesc_1306004"]="Covered in thick dust, this powerful staff appears not to have been used for many years. It is engraved with the royal seal and the words: \"Bestowed upon Archmage Heines, the Guardian of Geffen Tower.\"",
    ["EquipDesc_1306005"]="A two-handed rod that can destroy anything. As it grows stronger, its user loses more of their spiritual power.",
    ["EquipDesc_1306006"]="A rod that consists of two separate parts that are held in each hand. When the two parts are crossed, they will endow their user with divine power.",
    ["EquipDesc_1306008"]="A long staff adorned with the image of goddess.",
    ["EquipDesc_1306009"]="A wand that can focus the awesome power of wind.",
    ["EquipDesc_1306010"]="Adorned with a gold dragon that controls space-time and a crystal ball containing powerful magic, this staff looks spectacular but is also extremely heavy.",
    ["EquipDesc_1306011"]="A weapon that has a subtle power. It feels like some of its abilities have been sealed.",
    ["EquipDesc_1306018"]="The standard weapon that symbolizes the Marquis identity. Not only does it represent the noble bloodline of the user, but also reveals the richness of his or her magic power.",
    ["EquipDesc_1306019"]="The staff that people who are skilled in the use of trickery like to use. the holder shakes the charm, enough to make people fall into a dazzling illusion.",
    ["EquipDesc_1306020"]="The staff that controls the clouds and rain. The power of the staff changes depending on the state of mind of the wielder.",
    ["EquipDesc_1306030"]="A two-handed rod made with beginners in mind.",
    ["EquipDesc_1306031"]="A two-handed rod favored by those who love to adventure. It offers just enough attack power to deal with basic monsters.",
    ["EquipDesc_1306032"]="A rod that can only be used by masters of the highest proficiency. Extremely deadly in the right hands.",
    ["EquipDesc_1306033"]="A rod that can only be used by warriors who have won glory. Those who carry it will feel great honor.",
    ["EquipDesc_1306034"]="A rod conferred to warriors by the royal family. Those who carry it will feel the highest honor.",
    ["EquipDesc_1306035"]="If you listen carefully, you can hear the murmur of the ghosts sealed within the rod.",
    ["EquipDesc_1306036"]="A two-handed rod used by the Imperial Guard.",
    ["EquipDesc_1306037"]="A two-handed rod used by the lord of a kingdom.",
    ["EquipDesc_1306040"]="A two-handed rod passed down from generation to generation by the viscount of a kingdom.",
    ["EquipDesc_1306041"]="You can feel energy overflowing from this staff, but it might not be energy from this world...",
    ["EquipDesc_1306043"]="It's quite different from traditional staves, so it's regarded as blasphemous.",
    ["EquipDesc_1306059"]="When the withered great tree sprout again, deceased things burst into life. Its mere existence is the totem of life.",
    ["EquipDesc_1306060"]="A two-handed rod passed down from generation to generation by the duke of a kingdom.",
    ["EquipDesc_1306061"]="The stars never change, and humans record their traces in astrolabes, trying to seize control of their fates.",
    ["EquipDesc_1306074"]="A two-handed rod with the power of an otherworldly ancient god. It's yours, if you're willing to give up your soul for it.",
    ["EquipDesc_1306075"]="The gods give equal blessings to all. Living or the dead, saint or the villain, they will all sleep under the brilliance of the sceptre.",
    ["EquipDesc_1306076"]="Waving a flag of war is not the privilege of a vanguard. As long as courage remains, glory will last forever.",
    ["EquipDesc_1306091"]="A wand that contains a slight power from Verthandi, the Goddess of Fate. It enables the user to manipulate time through the veil of destiny.",
    ["EquipDesc_1306092"]="Having instigated a reign of blood and chaos, the Philosopher's Stone was eventually crafted into a staff by someone using enigmatic power.",
    ["EquipDesc_1306093"]="A gift from the Lord's Mansion in Schwarzwald Republic to Juno College Students, a two-handed rod crafted with the most cutting-edge Republican technology.",
    ["EquipDesc_1306501"]="A two-handed rod created with magical guidance technology at its core, achieving the perfect fusion of magic and machinery. A true milestone creation of the Schwarzwald Republic.",
    ["EquipDesc_1306502"]="Inlaid with gems and inscribed with runes that amplify its power, this two-handed rod could only be born from the of Arunafeltz, the kingdom known for its unmatchable alchemy.",
    ["EquipDesc_1306701"]="Originally used to search for unique metals in the Einbroch mines, this wand, now amplified with magic power, is often used in various other locations.",
    ["EquipDesc_1306708"]="Once wielded by the Archmage Roxina, this staff radiates magic so pure that prevents flowers from withering.",
    ["EquipDesc_1306716"]="Enhanced by the magic of Ether, this weapon starts exhibiting never-before-seen abilities.",
    ["EquipDesc_1307020"]="The standard weapon that symbolizes the Marquis identity. Not only does it represent the noble bloodline of the user, but also indicates that the user has never abandoned his or her exquisite fighting skills.",
    ["EquipDesc_1307021"]="A shortbow enchanted with the magic power of the abyssal poisonous spider. Its attack speed is like a swarm of spiders pouncing on its prey in the darkness.",
    ["EquipDesc_1307022"]="Contains the power of Payon Forest. The bow has vine leaves growing out of its body and is known for its accurate shooting.",
    ["EquipDesc_1307058"]="Carved somewhere insignificant on the bow are these words: \"Waves are the letters home from a faraway land. Off we sailed with the wind, and back we will come with the tides.\"",
    ["EquipDesc_1307059"]="A shortbow passed down from generation to generation by the duke of a kingdom.",
    ["EquipDesc_1307060"]="An elegant shortbow. The feathers decorating the sides are actually there for magic amplification, which empower the arrows shot.",
    ["EquipDesc_1307073"]="A shortbow with the power of an otherworldly ancient god. It's yours, if you're willing to give up your soul for it.",
    ["EquipDesc_1307074"]="The flame is an arrow shot in the air, burning out all the evil in the world.",
    ["EquipDesc_1307075"]="The path ahead is long and winding, but the faith of the seeker will never be worn out by it.",
    ["EquipDesc_1307090"]="This compound shortbow is crafted with pulleys and layered bowstrings. It might have a shorter shooting range, but it stands out with its agility and lightness.",
    ["EquipDesc_1307091"]="This magical shortbow can sense the will of its owner and directs each arrow with deadly precision.",
    ["EquipDesc_1307092"]="A gift from the Lord's Mansion in Schwarzwald Republic to Juno College Students, a shortbow crafted with the most cutting-edge Republican technology.",
    ["EquipDesc_1307501"]="A shortbow created with magical guidance technology at its core, achieving the perfect fusion of magic and machinery. A true milestone creation of the Schwarzwald Republic.",
    ["EquipDesc_1307502"]="Inlaid with gems and inscribed with runes that amplify its power, this shortbow could only be born from the of Arunafeltz, the kingdom known for its unmatchable alchemy.",
    ["EquipDesc_1307701"]="A shortbow that has a subtle power. It feels like some of its abilities have been sealed.",
    ["EquipDesc_1307708"]="Blessed by Goddess Freyja, this legendary shortbow is locked away in the Pope's vault—rarely, if ever, seen.",
    ["EquipDesc_1307716"]="An ancient hero's shortbow, passed down by a now-forgotten royal lineage. Awakened by the magic of old, it now reveals its true power.",
    ["EquipDesc_1308001"]="A Light Knuckle made with beginners in mind.",
    ["EquipDesc_1308004"]="This light knuckle made from precious methril and the armor on the back of the hand can serve as a protection for joints and deliver a punch onto your enemy.",
    ["EquipDesc_1308005"]="Only with molten lave and rune-imbued cast can this unique light knuckle be made. User may burn himself if not careful.",
    ["EquipDesc_1308007"]="Light Knuckle made from beast bones, exhibiting predator’s strength and aura of wild nature.",
    ["EquipDesc_1308009"]="A light knuckle rumored from far east that carved with complicated totem. People believe it represents the highest power.",
    ["EquipDesc_1308010"]="A light knuckle with retractable blades installed on the bat wing shaped section that deal a heavy blow against your enemy.",
    ["EquipDesc_1308011"]="A light knuckle blessed by Odin that regarded as symbol of faith. It serve as a key ceremonial item and see little battle.",
    ["EquipDesc_1308012"]="This light knuckle once believed as a tool of execution, now it is developed into a dedicated melee weapon.",
    ["EquipDesc_1308014"]="A light knuckle favored by those who love to adventure. It offers just enough attack power to deal with basic monsters.",
    ["EquipDesc_1308015"]="A light knuckle that can only be used by masters of the highest proficiency. Extremely deadly in the right hands.",
    ["EquipDesc_1308016"]="A light knuckle that can only be used by warriors who have won glory. Those who carry it will feel great honor.",
    ["EquipDesc_1308017"]="A light knuckle used by the Imperial Guard knight.",
    ["EquipDesc_1308018"]="A light knuckle conferred to warriors by the royal family. Those who carry it will feel the highest honor.",
    ["EquipDesc_1308019"]="A light knuckle used by the lord of a kingdom.",
    ["EquipDesc_1308020"]="A heirloom light knuckle for the viscount of a kingdom.",
    ["EquipDesc_1308070"]="A heirloom light knuckle for the duke of a kingdom.",
    ["EquipDesc_1308071"]="A light knuckle with luxurious appearance that believed made from study turtle shell. It is highly durable and regarded as a symbol of invincibility.",
    ["EquipDesc_1308072"]="A light knuckle with the power of an otherworldly ancient god. It's yours, if you're willing to give up your soul for it.",
    ["EquipDesc_1308073"]="The lingering fog of Nifflheim was somehow condensed and made into a knuckle.",
    ["EquipDesc_1308074"]="The knuckle that incorporates special spells when forged. The stronger the wielder's will, the more powerful it will become.",
    ["EquipDesc_1308089"]="The latest creation of the Steel Capital Institute. A model that focuses more on its portability and swiftness. The built-in energy reactor allows even the weakest user to exert astounding power.",
    ["EquipDesc_1308090"]="A pair of lightweight knuckles engraved with ancient runes.",
    ["EquipDesc_1308091"]="A gift from the Lord's Mansion in Schwarzwald Republic to Juno College Students, a pair of light knuckles crafted with the most cutting-edge Republican technology.",
    ["EquipDesc_1308501"]="A light knuckle created with magical guidance technology at its core, achieving the perfect fusion of magic and machinery. A true milestone creation of the Schwarzwald Republic.",
    ["EquipDesc_1308502"]="Inlaid with gems and inscribed with runes that amplify its power, this light knuckle could only be born from the of Arunafeltz, the kingdom known for its unmatchable alchemy.",
    ["EquipDesc_1308701"]="Blessing spells on these light knuckles amp up their attacks, matching the strong will of devout monks.",
    ["EquipDesc_1308708"]="Fists are power. When marked by the fierce tiger, only a true conqueror can wield them.",
    ["EquipDesc_1308716"]="Real or not—it doesn't matter. Even the lightest punch makes a hero.",
    ["EquipDesc_1309001"]="A Heavy Knuckle made with beginners in mind.",
    ["EquipDesc_1309002"]="This knuckle is made from raw metal and not designed for extended period of use, but offer great protection.",
    ["EquipDesc_1309003"]="This knuckle imitates the shape of eagle claw and allow experienced fighters further refine their combat skills.",
    ["EquipDesc_1309004"]="This heavy knuckle made from precious methril and the armor on the back of the hand can serve as a protection for joints and deliver a punch onto your enemy.",
    ["EquipDesc_1309005"]="Only with molten lave and rune-imbued cast can this unique heavy knuckle be made. User may burn himself if not careful.",
    ["EquipDesc_1309006"]="Standard-issue weapon designed by Shufazad Republic and capable of adjust output efficiency based on user’s physique.",
    ["EquipDesc_1309007"]="Heavy Knuckle made from beast bones, exhibiting predator’s strength and aura of wild nature.",
    ["EquipDesc_1309008"]="Expensive jewelry couldn’t penetrate the grimness shrouding this weapon. Through the eye socket of the bird bone, you sense some one is staring back at you...",
    ["EquipDesc_1309009"]="A heavy knuckle rumored from far east that carved with complicated totem. People believe it represents the highest power.",
    ["EquipDesc_1309010"]="A heavy knuckle with retractable blades installed on the bat wing shaped section that deal a heavy blow against your enemy.",
    ["EquipDesc_1309011"]="A heavy knuckle blessed by Odin that regarded as symbol of faith. It serve as a key ceremonial item and see little battle.",
    ["EquipDesc_1309012"]="This heavy knuckle once believed as a tool of execution, now it is developed into a dedicated melee weapon.",
    ["EquipDesc_1309013"]="The most-profound complexity expressed in great simplicity, the loudest sound is the full silence, the greatest form is the formless and the smartest seems like the most simple mind. When you reach the top tier of the martial art, the weapon in your hand won’t impede your move.",
    ["EquipDesc_1309014"]="A heavy knuckle favored by those who love to adventure. It offers just enough attack power to deal with basic monsters.",
    ["EquipDesc_1309015"]="A heavy knuckle that can only be used by masters of the highest proficiency. Extremely deadly in the right hands.",
    ["EquipDesc_1309016"]="A heavy knuckle that can only be used by warriors who have won glory. Those who carry it will feel great honor.",
    ["EquipDesc_1309017"]="A heavy knuckle used by the Imperial Guard knight.",
    ["EquipDesc_1309018"]="A heavy knuckle conferred to warriors by the royal family. Those who carry it will feel the highest honor.",
    ["EquipDesc_1309019"]="A heavy knuckle used by the lord of a kingdom.",
    ["EquipDesc_1309020"]="A heirloom heavy knuckle for the viscount of a kingdom.",
    ["EquipDesc_1309021"]="The standard weapon that symbolizes the Marquis identity. Not only does it represent the noble bloodline of the user, but also reveals his or her fierce combat skills.",
    ["EquipDesc_1309069"]="The corrupting dragon fire seems reside within the knuckle, user may reduced to ashes if fail to master the power.",
    ["EquipDesc_1309070"]="A heirloom heavy knuckle for the duke of a kingdom.",
    ["EquipDesc_1309071"]="A heavy knuckle with luxurious appearance that believed made from study turtle shell. It is highly durable and regarded as a symbol of invincibility.",
    ["EquipDesc_1309072"]="A heavy knuckle with the power of an otherworldly ancient god. It's yours, if you're willing to give up your soul for it.",
    ["EquipDesc_1309073"]="The lingering fog of Nifflheim was somehow condensed and made into a knuckle.",
    ["EquipDesc_1309074"]="The knuckle that incorporates special spells when forged. The stronger the wielder's will, the more powerful it will become.",
    ["EquipDesc_1309089"]="The latest creation of the Steel Capital Institute. A model that focuses more on its power and destructive force. The built-in energy reactor allows even the weakest user to exert astounding power.",
    ["EquipDesc_1309090"]="A set of thick and heavy knuckles engraved with the ancient runes.",
    ["EquipDesc_1309091"]="A gift from the Lord's Mansion in Schwarzwald Republic to Juno College Students, a pair of heavy knuckles crafted with the most cutting-edge Republican technology.",
    ["EquipDesc_1309501"]="A heavy knuckle created with magical guidance technology at its core, achieving the perfect fusion of magic and machinery. A true milestone creation of the Schwarzwald Republic.",
    ["EquipDesc_1309502"]="Inlaid with gems and inscribed with runes that amplify its power, this heavy knuckle could only be born from the of Arunafeltz, the kingdom known for its unmatchable alchemy.",
    ["EquipDesc_1309701"]="Blessing spells on these heavy knuckles amp up their attacks, matching the strong will of devout monks.",
    ["EquipDesc_1309708"]="Fists are power. When marked by the mighty dragon, only a true conqueror can wield them.",
    ["EquipDesc_1309716"]="Real or not—it doesn't matter. The one who throws the strongest punch is the hero.",
    ["EquipDesc_1310001"]=" A string instrument played by plucking its strings with fingers.",
    ["EquipDesc_1310002"]="A guitar of a bard who lived a lonely life. It plays a very somber tune.",
    ["EquipDesc_1310003"]="A guitar that suddenly makes you want to go on a journey just because of a gust of wind that blows out of nowhere amid its tune.",
    ["EquipDesc_1310004"]=" It may look like a guitar, but it's equipped with an amplifier that converts its magnetically induced vibrations into electronic vibrations.",
    ["EquipDesc_1310005"]="A legendary guitar that pulls the performer out of themself until the end of performance.",
    ["EquipDesc_1310006"]=" An instrument made for playing bass, it feels steady and deep.",
    ["EquipDesc_1310007"]="A guitar made of solid platinum. Just a touch is enough to feel its charm.",
    ["EquipDesc_1310008"]="It is said that the owner of this guitar can talk to rocks, but don't actually try it, because you'll just make a fool out of yourself.",
    ["EquipDesc_1310009"]=" A ukulele used by Newoz. Its color matches his clothes.",
    ["EquipDesc_1310010"]="A guitar with free will. It looks old and outdated, but it can still be used.",
    ["EquipDesc_1310011"]="A guitar made of solid platinum. Just a touch is enough to feel its charm.",
    ["EquipDesc_1310012"]="A guitar once used by the king of evernight. It is said that eternal night will descend once more when it's played.",
    ["EquipDesc_1310013"]="A wealthy man used a hill of gold to make this guitar. It's a symbol of humanity's endless greed.",
    ["EquipDesc_1310014"]="A guitar favored by those who love to adventure. Its music is just enough to drive away basic monsters.",
    ["EquipDesc_1310015"]="A guitar that can only be used by masters of the highest proficiency. Extremely deadly in the right hands.",
    ["EquipDesc_1310016"]="A guitar that can only be used by warriors who have won glory. Those who carry it will feel great honor.",
    ["EquipDesc_1310017"]="A guitar used by the Imperial Guard.",
    ["EquipDesc_1310018"]="A guitar conferred to warriors by the royal family. Those who carry it will feel the highest honor.",
    ["EquipDesc_1310019"]="A guitar used by the lord of a kingdom.",
    ["EquipDesc_1310020"]="A guitar passed down from generation to generation by the viscount of a kingdom.",
    ["EquipDesc_1310021"]="A guitar passed down from generation to generation by the marquis of a kingdom.",
    ["EquipDesc_1310022"]="A guitar with the power of an otherworldly ancient god. It's yours, if you're willing to give up your soul for it.",
    ["EquipDesc_1310023"]="A guitar passed down from generation to generation by the duke of a kingdom.",
    ["EquipDesc_1310024"]="The demon's song is poison. Once contaminated, you will be doomed.",
    ["EquipDesc_1310025"]="The body of the guitar is covered with elegant wave ripple patterns. It is one of the most unique guitars from Comodo.",
    ["EquipDesc_1310026"]="Can a girl that has lost her voice use music to express her feelings?",
    ["EquipDesc_1310027"]="A rather elegant guitar, with green branches leaping between the strings. It seems to lighten up the mood of the player.",
    ["EquipDesc_1310090"]="Who among us can play the decadent melodies of a lost kingdom?",
    ["EquipDesc_1310091"]="The gentle music flows at the fingertips, becoming the wings that embrace the world.",
    ["EquipDesc_1310092"]="A gift from the Lord's Mansion in Schwarzwald Republic to Juno College Students, a guitar crafted with the most cutting-edge Republican technology.",
    ["EquipDesc_1310501"]="A guitar created with magical guidance technology at its core, achieving the perfect fusion of magic and machinery. A true milestone creation of the Schwarzwald Republic.",
    ["EquipDesc_1310502"]="Inlaid with gems and inscribed with runes that amplify its power, this guitar could only be born from the of Arunafeltz, the kingdom known for its unmatchable alchemy.",
    ["EquipDesc_1310701"]="This black electric guitar produces sharp and fierce tunes, like roars echoing from the depths of hell.",
    ["EquipDesc_1310708"]="A legendary guitar that pulls the performer out of themself until the end of the performance.",
    ["EquipDesc_1310716"]="It looks like a guitar, but uses steel strings and a magnet-based amplifier that converts vibration into electric sound.",
    ["EquipDesc_1311001"]="A rope. But it's a lethal weapon when used as a weapon.",
    ["EquipDesc_1311002"]=" A thin and fairly strong whip.",
    ["EquipDesc_1311003"]=" A whip made of iron.",
    ["EquipDesc_1311004"]="A whip with a small iron ball at the end.",
    ["EquipDesc_1311005"]="A whip used by the church to punish sinners. The cross on it can teach sinners how to repent better.",
    ["EquipDesc_1311006"]=" A whip made from a fresh carrot.",
    ["EquipDesc_1311007"]="A whip made from the strong stem of a nepenthes.",
    ["EquipDesc_1311008"]=" Broken blades tied together with a rope in the shape of a whip. Swinging it is like swinging a sword, absolutely enjoyable!",
    ["EquipDesc_1311009"]="A whip that takes pride in its high attack. Please don't indulge in any dangerous thoughts.",
    ["EquipDesc_1311010"]="A jumping rope with wooden handles. Tears will definitely roll if it hits someone by accident.",
    ["EquipDesc_1311011"]="A whip with electricity coursing through it. Don't shock yourself by accident!",
    ["EquipDesc_1311012"]=" A whip made from a creature that emits powerful electricity. Its slipperiness makes it feel very weird.",
    ["EquipDesc_1311013"]=" A whip made from the feet of the siren renowned in the west. It is said to hold the power to steal souls. Be careful if you encounter another siren.",
    ["EquipDesc_1311014"]="A whip favored by those who love to adventure. It's just enough to deal with basic monsters.",
    ["EquipDesc_1311015"]="A whip that can only be used by masters of the highest proficiency. Extremely deadly in the right hands.",
    ["EquipDesc_1311016"]="A whip that can only be used by warriors who have won glory. Those who carry it will feel great honor.",
    ["EquipDesc_1311017"]="A whip used by the Imperial Guard.",
    ["EquipDesc_1311018"]="A whip conferred to warriors by the royal family. Those who carry it will feel the highest honor.",
    ["EquipDesc_1311019"]="A whip used by the lord of a kingdom. The barbs on it are stained with the blood of slaves.",
    ["EquipDesc_1311020"]="A whip passed down from generation to generation by the viscount of a kingdom.",
    ["EquipDesc_1311021"]="A whip passed down from generation to generation by the marquis of a kingdom.",
    ["EquipDesc_1311022"]="A rope with the power of an otherworldly ancient god. It's yours, if you're willing to give up your soul for it.",
    ["EquipDesc_1311023"]="A rope passed down from generation to generation by the duke of a kingdom.",
    ["EquipDesc_1311024"]="\"The weapon's designer has proven to be an avid fan of Medusa.\"",
    ["EquipDesc_1311025"]="Embellished with a number of precious gems, the weapon lets out dazzling light when wielded. A true luxury.",
    ["EquipDesc_1311026"]="A secret treasure refined from the Wraith smelting furnace. It can transcend physical beings and cause damage to spirits.",
    ["EquipDesc_1311027"]="A whip made of soft vines that can exert its due power, depending on the skill of the user.",
    ["EquipDesc_1311090"]="This controversial weapon has received strong criticism from the Scorpion Conservation Association ever since it came into being.",
    ["EquipDesc_1311091"]="The mortal who stole the power of deities crafted it into a long whip.",
    ["EquipDesc_1311092"]="A gift from the Lord's Mansion in Schwarzwald Republic to Juno College Students, a whip crafted with the most cutting-edge Republican technology.",
    ["EquipDesc_1311501"]="A whip created with magical guidance technology at its core, achieving the perfect fusion of magic and machinery. A true milestone creation of the Schwarzwald Republic.",
    ["EquipDesc_1311502"]="Inlaid with gems and inscribed with runes that amplify its power, this whip could only be born from the of Arunafeltz, the kingdom known for its unmatchable alchemy.",
    ["EquipDesc_1311701"]="An evil iron whip.",
    ["EquipDesc_1311708"]="An item gymnasts use to add flair and rhythm to their movements.",
    ["EquipDesc_1311716"]="A whip made from a creature that emits strong electric currents, though it feels a bit too slippery.",
    ["EquipDesc_1312001"]="Got its name for looking like bird wings. It's a popular weapon among the Huuma.",
    ["EquipDesc_1312002"]="It's like a giant wheel with wings, really heavy but super powerful. Has a chance to make enemies bleed when dealing physical attacks at close range.",
    ["EquipDesc_1312003"]="Refreshes the mind and reinforces faith, which is super helpful when the user is in the thick of a battle.",
    ["EquipDesc_1312004"]="A Huuma Shuriken used by Ninjas in Helosilia.",
    ["EquipDesc_1312005"]="A handy little saw blade from Einbech mine. It is easy to carry around and really good at cutting, so it ends up being used for more than just mining.",
    ["EquipDesc_1312006"]="A Huuma Shuriken was made to help out Adventurers.",
    ["EquipDesc_1312007"]="Smuggled into Glast Heim, this Huuma Shuriken doesn't look special, but it's full of magic, thanks to Himmelmez.",
    ["EquipDesc_1312008"]="This Huuma Shuriken is all about false trust.",
    ["EquipDesc_1312009"]="This Cross Huuma Shuriken is all about false trust.",
    ["EquipDesc_1312010"]="A Huuma Shuriken was made of an alloy composed of both Oridecon and gold in a golden ratio.",
    ["EquipDesc_1312011"]="A huge chunk of metal fell in a corner of the Barmeal. It's all bent out of shape because of some magic interference device installed by the Illusionists.",
    ["EquipDesc_1312012"]="An ice-cold Huuma Shuriken made from ice collected from the Isengard Glacier. Rumor has it that it's even stronger if you apply it with the special Snowflake Magic Stone.",
    ["EquipDesc_1312501"]="A Huuma Shuriken favored by those who love to adventure. It offers just enough attack power to deal with basic monsters.",
    ["EquipDesc_1312502"]="A Huuma Shuriken that can only be used by masters of the highest proficiency. Extremely deadly in the right hands.",
    ["EquipDesc_1312503"]="A Huuma Shuriken that can only be used by warriors who have won glory. Those who carry it will feel great honor.",
    ["EquipDesc_1312504"]="A Huuma Shuriken used by the Imperial Guard.",
    ["EquipDesc_1312505"]="A Huuma Shuriken conferred to warriors by the royal family. Those who carry it will feel the highest honor.",
    ["EquipDesc_1312506"]="A Huuma Shuriken used by the lord of a kingdom.",
    ["EquipDesc_1312507"]="A Huuma Shuriken passed down from generation to generation by the viscount of a kingdom.",
    ["EquipDesc_1312508"]="The standard weapon that symbolizes the Marquis identity. Not only does it represent the noble bloodline of the user, but also signifies the user's excellent Ninjutsu.",
    ["EquipDesc_1312509"]="A Huuma Shuriken passed down from generation to generation by the duke of a kingdom.",
    ["EquipDesc_1312510"]="Osiris's Huuma Shuriken.",
    ["EquipDesc_1312511"]="A gift from the Lord's Mansion in Schwarzwald Republic to Juno College Students, a Huuma Shuriken crafted with the most cutting-edge Republican technology.",
    ["EquipDesc_1312512"]="A Huuma shuriken created with magical guidance technology at its core, achieving the perfect fusion of magic and machinery. A true milestone creation of the Schwarzwald Republic.",
    ["EquipDesc_1312513"]="Inlaid with gems and inscribed with runes that amplify its power, this Huuma shuriken could only be born from the of Arunafeltz, the kingdom known for its unmatchable alchemy.",
    ["EquipDesc_1312701"]="A Huuma Shuriken, referred to as \"Falling Petals,\" creates the sensation of being encircled by endless snowflakes when in use.",
    ["EquipDesc_1312702"]="The art of conquering the sea lies in riding with the waves, not in battling against the tide. The same applies to weapons.",
    ["EquipDesc_1312703"]="With its cute and whimsical Plesiosaur appearance, this item serves as a weapon and a perfect water toy, making it an ideal partner for summer.",
    ["EquipDesc_1312704"]="Journeying through time and space with Morroc, this weapon is able to break down or rebuild matter, totally beyond modern technological capabilities.",
    ["EquipDesc_1312705"]="The valiant gouged out the demon's eye and adorned the weapon with it. This stands as a glorious medal.",
    ["EquipDesc_1312706"]="Enhanced by the energy of Mjolnir, the Grindstone Huuma Kunai drains magic as intensely as the formidable power it contains.",
    ["EquipDesc_1312707"]="When it spins, it resembles a galaxy amassing countless stars.",
    ["EquipDesc_1312708"]="It almost feels alive.",
    ["EquipDesc_1312755"]="A razor-sharp Huuma Shuriken that is as weightless as morning mist but deadly enough to take a head off in an instant.",
    ["EquipDesc_1312771"]="When snow and blossoms descend, so too do the enemies of Huuma Shuriken, blooming one last time beneath the petals.",
    ["EquipDesc_1313001"]="The Ninja Guild is currently working on this dagger. It's still a prototype, so hold your breath for it to hit the shelves.",
    ["EquipDesc_1313002"]="It's a sword of legend, capable of slicing through water, so sharp that it's believed to create streams if it cuts through the sky.",
    ["EquipDesc_1313003"]="The Ninja Guild's latest invention, a crimson dagger, with a color so striking it sends chills down the spine.",
    ["EquipDesc_1313004"]="This short dagger, with its blade mirroring the curve of the crescent moon, has absorbed the lunar essence for formidable power.",
    ["EquipDesc_1313005"]="A club with an outward hook for disarming opponents, offering lower damage but is user-friendly.",
    ["EquipDesc_1313006"]="Petite and delicate, yet it is a lethal blade.",
    ["EquipDesc_1313007"]="A blade of radiant white, crafted from bone, more effective for stabbing than slashing.",
    ["EquipDesc_1313008"]="The dagger features a dark edge adorned with white pearls.",
    ["EquipDesc_1313009"]="Empowered by the magic of Aether, this weapon exhibits never-seen-before abilities.",
    ["EquipDesc_1313010"]="For seasoned ninjas, this powerful dagger is a preferred choice among them.",
    ["EquipDesc_1313011"]="It is a common dagger that has been heavily bent due to the impact of the magic interference device installed by Illusionists.",
    ["EquipDesc_1313012"]="This purple knife was used by Ninjas who were hired to mine gold in the past.",
    ["EquipDesc_1313501"]="A Ninja Sword favored by those who love to adventure. It offers just enough attack power to deal with basic monsters.",
    ["EquipDesc_1313502"]="A Ninja Sword that can only be used by masters of the highest proficiency. Extremely deadly in the right hands.",
    ["EquipDesc_1313503"]="A Ninja Sword that can only be used by warriors who have won glory. Those who carry it will feel great honor.",
    ["EquipDesc_1313504"]="A Ninja Sword used by the Imperial Guard.",
    ["EquipDesc_1313505"]="A Ninja Sword conferred to warriors by the royal family. Those who carry it will feel the highest honor.",
    ["EquipDesc_1313506"]="A Ninja Sword used by the lord of a kingdom.",
    ["EquipDesc_1313507"]="A Ninja Sword passed down from generation to generation by the viscount of a kingdom.",
    ["EquipDesc_1313508"]="The standard weapon that symbolizes the Marquis identity. Not only does it represent the noble bloodline of the user, but also signifies the user's dexterity.",
    ["EquipDesc_1313509"]="A Ninja Sword passed down from generation to generation by the duke of a kingdom.",
    ["EquipDesc_1313510"]="Osiris's Ninja Sword.",
    ["EquipDesc_1313511"]="A gift from the Lord's Mansion in Schwarzwald Republic to Juno College Students, a Ninja Sword crafted with the most cutting-edge Republican technology.",
    ["EquipDesc_1313512"]="A ninja sword created with magical guidance technology at its core, achieving the perfect fusion of magic and machinery. A true milestone creation of the Schwarzwald Republic.",
    ["EquipDesc_1313513"]="Inlaid with gems and inscribed with runes that amplify its power, this ninja sword could only be born from the of Arunafeltz, the kingdom known for its unmatchable alchemy.",
    ["EquipDesc_1313701"]="Crafted from a trophy commemorating past victories in the octagon cage.",
    ["EquipDesc_1313702"]="One of the swords used by Ninjas who mastered the Eight Gates technique.",
    ["EquipDesc_1313703"]="It is a legendary weapon; nothing can describe the sharpness of its edge due to the vacuum effect.",
    ["EquipDesc_1313704"]="The blade's edge is crafted to draw in the power of raging flames.",
    ["EquipDesc_1313705"]="A fusion of sacred and evil relics in a dagger, dominated by its sacred side.",
    ["EquipDesc_1313706"]="In the life of a Holy Fire Knight, there are numerous accomplishments, with dragon-slaying being just a tiny, almost insignificant part. But this weapon, made from the remains of a wicked dragon, has become a symbol upholding beliefs and legends.",
    ["EquipDesc_1313707"]="In memory of King Glossa's glory, a hundred craftsmen took a thousand days to forge this unparalleled sword.",
    ["EquipDesc_1313708"]="Cyber City's favorite, neon that lights up the dark.",
    ["EquipDesc_1313755"]="A weapon that severs the line between life and death, meant to save the lost—not to take lives.",
    ["EquipDesc_1313771"]="When the mountain wind whispers through the forest, the ninja sword answers—silent, merciful, and inevitable as the drizzles.",
    ["EquipDesc_1314001"]="A common tome that is quite powerful when fully comprehended.",
    ["EquipDesc_1314002"]="A very thick and seemingly heavy book. Getting hit by its corner should hurt quite a bit.",
    ["EquipDesc_1314003"]="A book with the power to control spiritual energy.",
    ["EquipDesc_1314004"]="A tome made from an alloy composed of both Oridecon and gold in a golden ratio.",
    ["EquipDesc_1314005"]="A book written in an unknown language whose secrets still haven't been fully cracked to this day. The scarce diagrams within are the few clues to its contents. But even then, the profundities of its moves are enough to fascinate any warrior...",
    ["EquipDesc_1314006"]="No flashy techniques, just punches honed for the sake of survival. A survival guide for those who live on the edge.",
    ["EquipDesc_1314007"]="A strategy book written with the sweat and blood of a great military strategist from China. Many in the military still study this book, even to this day.",
    ["EquipDesc_1314008"]="\"There are no shortcuts on the path of a warrior, but it's simple enough. It only requires... the dedication to protect others.\" - Epigraph",
    ["EquipDesc_1314009"]="The diary of a wrongly imprisoned prisoner. It has traces of records written in secret and away from the warden's eyes.",
    ["EquipDesc_1314010"]="Bellum Encyclopedia published by a Prontera publisher that is well-known for the hard edges of its books.",
    ["EquipDesc_1314011"]="A manual written by Eden.",
    ["EquipDesc_1314501"]="A tome favored by those who love to adventure. The moves it contains are just enough to deal with basic monsters.",
    ["EquipDesc_1314502"]="A tome that can only be used by masters of the highest proficiency. Extremely deadly in the right hands.",
    ["EquipDesc_1314503"]="A tome that can only be used by warriors who have won glory. Those who use its moves will feel great honor.",
    ["EquipDesc_1314504"]="A tome used by the Imperial Guard.",
    ["EquipDesc_1314505"]="A tome conferred to warriors by the royal family. Those who use its moves will feel the highest honor.",
    ["EquipDesc_1314506"]="A tome used by the lord of a kingdom.",
    ["EquipDesc_1314507"]="A tome passed down from generation to generation by the viscount of a kingdom.",
    ["EquipDesc_1314508"]="A tome passed down from generation to generation by the marquis of a kingdom.",
    ["EquipDesc_1314509"]="A tome passed down from generation to generation by the duke of a kingdom.",
    ["EquipDesc_1314510"]="A tome with the power of an otherworldly ancient god. It's yours, if you're willing to give up your soul for it.",
    ["EquipDesc_1314511"]="A gift from the Lord's Mansion in Schwarzwald Republic to Juno College Students. It has brought together the most cutting-edge Republican technology to teach combat skills.",
    ["EquipDesc_1314512"]="A tome created with magical guidance technology at its core, and magic and machinery integrated into its combat skills. A true milestone creation of the Schwarzwald Republic.",
    ["EquipDesc_1314513"]="Inlaid with gems and recorded runes that amplify its power, this tome could only be born from the of Arunafeltz, the kingdom known for its unmatchable alchemy.",
    ["EquipDesc_1314701"]="A book overflowing with the power of Yin and Yang. It holds the truth of the world.",
    ["EquipDesc_1314702"]="A circuit board of unknown origin. Its hardness makes it a perfect weapon.",
    ["EquipDesc_1314703"]="A notebook used by the god of death. They sometimes end up in human hands when the god of death drops them. Some of the many names on its pages seem familiar.",
    ["EquipDesc_1314704"]="A full moon book that has been reborn with true faith in a cleansing ceremony.",
    ["EquipDesc_1314705"]="A book that has been reinforced and encased with Phracon to enhance its abilities.",
    ["EquipDesc_1314706"]="An ancient book titled \"The Only Sun in the Sky.\" Although its author and time of writing are unknown, it contains knowledge of astronomy. It seems to resonate with the boots of ancient heroes.",
    ["EquipDesc_1314707"]="The essence of Taiji encompasses the world and all things within it. The user decides if it's from man to divine or vice versa.",
    ["EquipDesc_1314708"]="A book that contains the origin and history of all dragons. It is said to have been passed down through the generations of the dragon race.",
    ["EquipDesc_1314761"]="There's no end to martial arts—keep striving, and you'll go beyond your limit.",
    ["EquipDesc_1314777"]="A shattered tome, a piece of lost memory. The true art of combat persists, a dormant skill waiting to bloom.",
    ["EquipDesc_1999996"]="The limited exclusive Children's Day equipment item Candy Slingshot will remind you of this unforgettable season all year round!\nYou can use Toffee Projectiles and Cotton Candy Projectiles to deal damage to Honeybees in the air after entering the ranged attack view in Eden Group! The higher the quality of the projectile you use, the more damage you'll deal to the balloons! \n<color=#FF0000>(You can only enter ranged attack view at Prontera South Gate.)</color>",
    ["EquipDesc_1999997"]="The limited exclusive Christmas equipment item Elk Slingshot will remind you of this unforgettable season all year round!\nYou can use Starshot, Meteor Pellets, and Icicle Ammo after entering the ranged attack view in Geffen to shoot down Monster Balloons! The higher the quality of the ammo you use, the more damage you'll deal to the balloons! \n<color=#FF0000>(You can only enter ranged attack view in Geffen.)</color>",
    ["EquipDesc_1999998"]="The Animal Protection Association is committed to the study of monster taming. The Pet Slingshot is a great invention created while studying how to precisely control the pet's HP during a taming process. (Every attack deals damage equal to 30% HP of the target pet. Ineffective against Mini, MVP, and Bosses.)",
    ["EquipDesc_2001001"]="A comfortable shirt made of cotton.",
    ["EquipDesc_2001002"]="A uniform that is only provided to members of the Eden Group. It comes in various sizes.",
    ["EquipDesc_2002001"]="A manteau that is only provided to members of the Eden Group.",
    ["EquipDesc_2003001"]="Boots that are only provided to members of the Eden Group.",
    ["EquipDesc_2101001"]="A coat that provides basic protection.",
    ["EquipDesc_2101002"]="A robe that is convenient to put on but does not offer much defense.",
    ["EquipDesc_2101003"]="A coat favored by those who love to adventure. It offers just enough defense power to deal with basic monsters.",
    ["EquipDesc_2101004"]="A robe favored by those who love to adventure. It offers just enough defense power to deal with basic monsters.",
    ["EquipDesc_2101005"]="Clothes made specially for adventurers.",
    ["EquipDesc_2101006"]="An inexpensive leather jacket. Wear it for long enough and it will develop its own unique look.",
    ["EquipDesc_2101007"]="A coat made of soft animal fur.",
    ["EquipDesc_2101008"]="Skintight clothing that allows for easy movement.",
    ["EquipDesc_2101009"]="A coat that is simple and elegant.",
    ["EquipDesc_2101010"]="A knee-length coat that provides excellent protection against the cold.",
    ["EquipDesc_2101011"]="A coat favored by veterans. It provides enough defensive power to deal with some intermediate monsters.",
    ["EquipDesc_2101012"]="A robe favored by veterans. It provides enough defensive power to deal with some intermediate monsters.",
    ["EquipDesc_2101013"]="Solid armor made of durable steel plates.",
    ["EquipDesc_2101014"]="Formal clothing that displays the wearer's refined taste and elegance.",
    ["EquipDesc_2101015"]="Very light clothing.",
    ["EquipDesc_2101016"]="Clothes made of an improved material that is even more tight-fitting. It is the latest product of the Rekenber Company.",
    ["EquipDesc_2101017"]="An outer garment that clerics wear over their shoulders.",
    ["EquipDesc_2101018"]="A robe made using valuable silver thread.",
    ["EquipDesc_2101019"]="The basic armor of the Hermode set. Trigger the set bonus to summon its hidden power.",
    ["EquipDesc_2101020"]="Armor consisting of metal links that form a mesh.",
    ["EquipDesc_2101021"]="Said to originate from an island nation in the east. It enables its wearer to move quickly and stealthily.",
    ["EquipDesc_2101022"]="These clothes feature a device that stimulates the muscles used to shoot arrows, shortening the time between attacks and inflicting fatal damage.",
    ["EquipDesc_2101023"]="A robe that reduces spell casting time.",
    ["EquipDesc_2101024"]="A holy robe that has been blessed by a goddess.",
    ["EquipDesc_2101025"]="A coat that can only be used by warriors who have won glory. It provides enough defensive power to deal with most intermediate monsters.",
    ["EquipDesc_2101026"]="A robe that can only be used by warriors who have won glory. It provides enough defensive power to deal with most intermediate monsters.",
    ["EquipDesc_2101027"]="Armor made of a metal that does not exist in this world. A mysterious power is hidden within.",
    ["EquipDesc_2101028"]="According to legend, a goddess made this sacred armor to heal a wounded warrior. It boosts the recovery speed of whoever wears it.",
    ["EquipDesc_2101029"]="Dazzlingly spectacular armor made from Naga scales, each of which is razor-sharp.",
    ["EquipDesc_2101030"]="Mysterious armor that changes its abilities based on its wearer.",
    ["EquipDesc_2101031"]="Clothes passed down by ancient mages. Increases the wearer's mental power.",
    ["EquipDesc_2101032"]="Blessed holy clothing that provides powerful defense against evil.",
    ["EquipDesc_2101033"]="A coat conferred to warriors by the royal family. It provides enough defensive power to deal with some advanced monsters.",
    ["EquipDesc_2101034"]="A robe conferred to warriors by the royal family. It provides enough defensive power to deal with some advanced monsters.",
    ["EquipDesc_2101035"]="Armor made by Boitata.",
    ["EquipDesc_2101036"]="An adventuring outfit that maximizes defense and comfort.",
    ["EquipDesc_2101037"]="Protects riders against the wind, as well as injury in the event of an accident.",
    ["EquipDesc_2101038"]="Strengthened armor made from a mysterious meteorite.",
    ["EquipDesc_2101039"]="Purportedly a relic of the Icarus Guild, home to many a famed archer.",
    ["EquipDesc_2101040"]="A robe worn by the super novice guardian angel. The feeling when it covers the body is heavenly!",
    ["EquipDesc_2101041"]="Armor worn by valkyries. It glows with a white light when worn.",
    ["EquipDesc_2101042"]="Armor that gained special powers when the craftsman, Murphy, accidentally spilled ale of eternal life on it.",
    ["EquipDesc_2101043"]="The basic armor of the Hermode set.",
    ["EquipDesc_2101044"]="A robe dedicated to the bravest fighters.",
    ["EquipDesc_2101045"]="Made of lightweight calf leather, it is both strong and durable.",
    ["EquipDesc_2101046"]="Makes the wearer feel very wise.",
    ["EquipDesc_2101047"]="Looks luxurious and is of course made of the finest materials.",
    ["EquipDesc_2101048"]="A lightweight windbreaker that makes the wearer stealthier.",
    ["EquipDesc_2101049"]="A robe that has absorbed the essence of the sun and the moon.",
    ["EquipDesc_2101050"]="A coat of protection used by the Imperial Guard.",
    ["EquipDesc_2101051"]="A robe used by the Imperial Guard.",
    ["EquipDesc_2101052"]="A coat of protection used by the lord of a kingdom.",
    ["EquipDesc_2101053"]="A robe used by the lord of a kingdom.",
    ["EquipDesc_2101075"]="The clothing that only a marquis can wear is distinguished by its excellent protection.",
    ["EquipDesc_2101076"]="The clothing that only a marquis can wear ensures that the wearer can move in the most agile way.",
    ["EquipDesc_2101077"]="The clothing that only a marquis can wear. The magic power flowing between its threads can be felt vaguely.",
    ["EquipDesc_2101081"]="Armor that can pierce sharp spikes. Repel steel with steel, and force back the weak with prestige.",
    ["EquipDesc_2101082"]="The body armor with scales on it. While strengthening protection, it also ensures that the wearer can move freely like the wind without being tied up.",
    ["EquipDesc_2101083"]="Legend has it that there was once an old mage who traveled in a black robe seeking mysteries and eventually brought about great disaster. Since then, all black-clad mages are regarded as suspicious people.",
    ["EquipDesc_2101114"]="A magic coat favored by those who love to adventure. It offers just enough defense power to deal with basic monsters.",
    ["EquipDesc_2101115"]="A coat favored by veterans. It provides enough defensive power to deal with some intermediate monsters.",
    ["EquipDesc_2101116"]="A magic coat that can only be used by warriors who have won glory. It provides enough defensive power to deal with most intermediate monsters.",
    ["EquipDesc_2101117"]="A magic coat used by the Imperial Guard.",
    ["EquipDesc_2101118"]="A coat conferred to warriors by the royal family. It provides enough defensive power to deal with some advanced monsters.",
    ["EquipDesc_2101119"]="A magic coat used by the lord of a kingdom.",
    ["EquipDesc_2101120"]="A gorgeous, light leather armor used by valkyries.",
    ["EquipDesc_2101121"]="A gorgeous, light robe used by valkyries.",
    ["EquipDesc_2101122"]="Light armor that has a hidden Murphy's seal. It is said that an ancient spell is recorded on it.",
    ["EquipDesc_2101123"]="A robe that has a hidden Murphy's seal. It is said that an ancient spell is recorded on it.",
    ["EquipDesc_2101124"]="A piece of equipment brimming with Odin's divine majesty that puts people under an invisible pressure.",
    ["EquipDesc_2101125"]="A piece of equipment brimming with Odin's glory that makes people unable to look away from it.",
    ["EquipDesc_2101165"]="A coat made from fabric infused with magic.",
    ["EquipDesc_2101175"]="A coat of protection passed down from generation to generation by the duke of a kingdom.",
    ["EquipDesc_2101176"]="A robe passed down from generation to generation by the duke of a kingdom.",
    ["EquipDesc_2101177"]="A magic coat passed down from generation to generation by the duke of a kingdom.",
    ["EquipDesc_2101178"]="Taking after the armor once worn by Margaret Nerius, both in terms of appearance and crafting, it obtains the name of dragonslayer. As for the original copy, it has long been buried with the fallen hero.",
    ["EquipDesc_2101179"]="A traditional garment of Comodo, the frequent choice for important ceremonies.",
    ["EquipDesc_2101180"]="Look at the embroidery of roses made with gold and silver threads. Such a dress at dinner parties is bound to turn heads.",
    ["EquipDesc_2101211"]="A coat of protection with the power of an otherworldly ancient god. It's yours, if you're willing to give up your soul for it.",
    ["EquipDesc_2101212"]="A robe with the power of an otherworldly ancient god. It's yours, if you're willing to give up your soul for it.",
    ["EquipDesc_2101213"]="A magic coat with the power of an otherworldly ancient god. It's yours, if you're willing to give up your soul for it.",
    ["EquipDesc_2101214"]="Armor made to the highest specifications and used only at coronation ceremonies. Dearly expensive but offers no special effect. Its elegance is what the ruling class is after.",
    ["EquipDesc_2101215"]="The most beloved dress of Hera, Queen of the Underworld. If you look closely, you will find that there is a line of small letters that appear and disappear on the dress, which seems to be condensed with magic power—\"For my most adorable daughter Hera.\"",
    ["EquipDesc_2101216"]="A special uniform for high priests from Arunafeltz, embroidered with exorcism spells with a special craft. Because of its unique style, it has gradually become popular in other regions too...",
    ["EquipDesc_2101250"]="Some say fashion is a cycle!",
    ["EquipDesc_2101251"]="A lightweight and well-fitted uniform. It is durable and will not pose any restrictions to the movement. The go-to choice of the Capital Defense Guards.",
    ["EquipDesc_2101252"]="Designed by a hardcore fan of Lunatic, this one was a trendsetter in the past.",
    ["EquipDesc_2101253"]="A gift from the Lord's Mansion in Schwarzwald Republic to Juno College Students, a coat of protection crafted with the most cutting-edge Republican technology.",
    ["EquipDesc_2101254"]="A gift from the Lord's Mansion in Schwarzwald Republic to Juno College Students, a manteau crafted with the most cutting-edge Republican technology.",
    ["EquipDesc_2101255"]="A gift from the Lord's Mansion in Schwarzwald Republic to Juno College Students, a pair of boots crafted with the most cutting-edge Republican technology.",
    ["EquipDesc_2101292"]="With magical energy coursing through, this Demon Swordsman's armor looks spine-chilling.",
    ["EquipDesc_2101293"]="With magical energy coursing through, this Demon Swordsman's leather armor looks spine-chilling.",
    ["EquipDesc_2101294"]="With magical energy coursing through, this Demon Swordsman's robe looks spine-chilling.",
    ["EquipDesc_2101304"]="A coat of protection created with magical guidance technology at its core, achieving the perfect fusion of magic and machinery. A true milestone creation of the Schwarzwald Republic.",
    ["EquipDesc_2101305"]="A manteau created with magical guidance technology at its core, achieving the perfect fusion of magic and machinery. A true milestone creation of the Schwarzwald Republic.",
    ["EquipDesc_2101306"]="A pair of boots created with magical guidance technology at its core, achieving the perfect fusion of magic and machinery. A true milestone creation of the Schwarzwald Republic.",
    ["EquipDesc_2101367"]="Adorned with precious gems and inscribed with runes that amplify its defense, this coat of protection could only be born from the of Arunafeltz, the kingdom known for its unmatchable alchemy.",
    ["EquipDesc_2101368"]="Adorned with precious gems and inscribed with runes that amplify its defense, this magic coat could only be born from the of Arunafeltz, the kingdom known for its unmatchable alchemy.",
    ["EquipDesc_2101369"]="Adorned with precious gems and inscribed with runes that amplify its defense, this robe could only be born from the of Arunafeltz, the kingdom known for its unmatchable alchemy.",
    ["EquipDesc_2101370"]="A blessed warrior's robe that makes them stronger the longer they fight.",
    ["EquipDesc_2101500"]="The armor of the experimental subject YSF01 from the Werner Research Institute. Powerful magic stirs wildly inside. Feels like if you wear it wrong, the magic might eat you alive.",
    ["EquipDesc_2101634"]="The component of Vesper's full-body armor system. When charged up, it provides a huge defense boost for a short while.",
    ["EquipDesc_2101635"]="The component of Vesper's full-body armor system. It's great at tracking down enemies.",
    ["EquipDesc_2101636"]="The component of Vesper's full-body armor system. It's a detachable signal amplifier that can connect to the main body and be used as a melee weapon in emergencies.",
    ["EquipDesc_2101676"]="Bijou's beloved armor—within it lingers a fragment of her soul. Rumor has it that during the dead of night, you can hear her sweet whispers if you're wearing it...",
    ["EquipDesc_2101677"]="Bijou's beloved cloak—within it lingers a fragment of her soul. Rumor has it that during the dead of night, you can hear her sweet whispers if you're wearing it...",
    ["EquipDesc_2101678"]="Bijou's beloved boots—within it lingers a fragment of her soul. Rumor has it that during the dead of night, you can hear her sweet whispers if you're wearing it...",
    ["EquipDesc_2102001"]="A muffler that protects the head and shoulders.",
    ["EquipDesc_2102002"]="A manteau made of a sturdy fabric that protects the neck, shoulders, and back.",
    ["EquipDesc_2102003"]="A muffler favored by those who love to adventure. It offers just enough defense power to deal with basic monsters.",
    ["EquipDesc_2102004"]="A manteau favored by those who love to adventure. It offers just enough defense power to deal with basic monsters.",
    ["EquipDesc_2102005"]="Shoulder armor that provides considerable protection in battle.",
    ["EquipDesc_2102006"]="A manteau made of spun yarn that protects the neck, shoulders, and back.",
    ["EquipDesc_2102007"]="A muffler favored by veterans. It provides enough defensive power to deal with some intermediate monsters.",
    ["EquipDesc_2102008"]="A manteau favored by veterans. It provides enough defensive power to deal with some intermediate monsters.",
    ["EquipDesc_2102009"]="A manteau that makes people think the wearer is feeling murderous.",
    ["EquipDesc_2102010"]="The skin of a demon king that has been cursed in the language of the demons. It can be worn as a cape.",
    ["EquipDesc_2102011"]="A manteau made of scales that protects the neck, shoulders, and back.",
    ["EquipDesc_2102012"]="A manteau that makes people think the wearer is feeling murderous.",
    ["EquipDesc_2102013"]="A muffler that can only be used by warriors who have won glory. It provides enough defensive power to deal with most intermediate monsters.",
    ["EquipDesc_2102014"]="A manteau that can only be used by warriors who have won glory. It provides enough defensive power to deal with most intermediate monsters.",
    ["EquipDesc_2102015"]="A mysterious manteau with a protective spell that can convert the wearer's magic defense to physical defense.",
    ["EquipDesc_2102016"]="A mysterious manteau with a protective spell that can convert the wearer's physical defense to magic defense.",
    ["EquipDesc_2102017"]="A scarf that a dragon has breathed onto. It has inevitably become warm and sticky.",
    ["EquipDesc_2102018"]="A muffler conferred to warriors by the royal family. It provides enough defensive power to deal with some advanced monsters.",
    ["EquipDesc_2102019"]="A manteau conferred to warriors by the royal family. It provides enough defensive power to deal with some advanced monsters.",
    ["EquipDesc_2102020"]="A relic used by a high priest to fight demons during an ancient war.",
    ["EquipDesc_2102022"]="A gorgeous, lightweight cloak used by valkyries.",
    ["EquipDesc_2102028"]="A manteau filled with dark shadows. It can only be worn by a person who has conquered the darkness.",
    ["EquipDesc_2102030"]="The first piece of armor that Murphy ever made. He is particularly proud of the shoulders.",
    ["EquipDesc_2102031"]="A manteau once worn by Vali, the son sired by Odin to avenge Baldr by killing Hodr.",
    ["EquipDesc_2102032"]="A muffler that Freyja, daughter of Njord, often lent to Loki. It makes its wearer as nimble as a falcon in flight.",
    ["EquipDesc_2102033"]="A muffler made of wool.",
    ["EquipDesc_2102034"]="A manteau that protects its wearer from the wind and is also great for showing off.",
    ["EquipDesc_2102035"]="A muffler used by the Imperial Guard.",
    ["EquipDesc_2102036"]="A manteau used by the Imperial Guard.",
    ["EquipDesc_2102037"]="A muffler used by the lord of a kingdom.",
    ["EquipDesc_2102038"]="A manteau used by the lord of a kingdom.",
    ["EquipDesc_2102043"]="A manteau passed down from generation to generation by the viscount of a kingdom.",
    ["EquipDesc_2102044"]="A muffler passed down from generation to generation by the viscount of a kingdom.",
    ["EquipDesc_2102045"]="A collar passed down from generation to generation by the viscount of a kingdom.",
    ["EquipDesc_2102046"]="This ugly scarf looks a bit old at first glance, but it is very comfortable to wear.",
    ["EquipDesc_2102049"]="This cloak has a badge embroidered with gold thread on it, which serves as a medal of honor awarded to the strongest of soldiers.",
    ["EquipDesc_2102050"]="This manteau looks to be quite ordinary, but as soon as they put it on, the wearer will realize why it is so special.",
    ["EquipDesc_2102065"]="A shawl with a hood.",
    ["EquipDesc_2102071"]="A silk scarf that feels smooth to the touch.",
    ["EquipDesc_2102076"]="A cape lined with thick heavy scales on top like a giant crocodile. Looks very agressive.",
    ["EquipDesc_2102080"]="The mysterious power of the sea hidden within makes its wearer feel currents.",
    ["EquipDesc_2102083"]="A manteau worn by warriors in duels. It symbolizes equality and honor.",
    ["EquipDesc_2102085"]="A cloak that looks like angel wings. Although soft, it offers great protection.",
    ["EquipDesc_2102086"]="A collar favored by those who love to adventure. It offers just enough defense power to deal with basic monsters.",
    ["EquipDesc_2102087"]="A collar favored by veterans. It provides enough defensive power to deal with some intermediate monsters.",
    ["EquipDesc_2102088"]="A collar that can only be used by warriors who have won glory. It provides enough defensive power to deal with most intermediate monsters.",
    ["EquipDesc_2102089"]="A collar used by the Imperial Guard.",
    ["EquipDesc_2102090"]="A collar conferred to warriors by the royal family. It provides enough defensive power to deal with some advanced monsters.",
    ["EquipDesc_2102091"]="A collar used by the lord of a kingdom.",
    ["EquipDesc_2102092"]="A gorgeous, light muffler used by valkyries.",
    ["EquipDesc_2102093"]="A gorgeous, light manteau used by valkyries.",
    ["EquipDesc_2102094"]="A manteau that has a hidden Murphy's seal. It is said that an ancient spell is recorded on it.",
    ["EquipDesc_2102095"]="A shawl that has a hidden Murphy's seal. It is said that an ancient spell is recorded on it.",
    ["EquipDesc_2102096"]="A relic left behind by a saint who saved people in an ancient war.",
    ["EquipDesc_2102125"]="A collar which can provide some warmth.",
    ["EquipDesc_2102139"]="The clothing can only be worn by a marquis, and it is very luxurious.",
    ["EquipDesc_2102140"]="The clothing can only be worn by a marquis, and it is very luxurious.",
    ["EquipDesc_2102141"]="The clothing can only be worn by a marquis, and it is very luxurious.",
    ["EquipDesc_2102142"]="With two clear, mirror-like crystals set on either sides, this advanced pauldrons can not only absorb and reflect magic, but can also blind enemies by refracting light.",
    ["EquipDesc_2102143"]="A thick and dull-colored cloak. It is rumored that someone who loves pets so much stripped the fur of his crazy pet to make this cloak.",
    ["EquipDesc_2102144"]="The cloak, decorated with gray fur, is strong enough to block the inner magic from escaping to the outside.",
    ["EquipDesc_2102175"]="A manteau passed down from generation to generation by the duke of a kingdom.",
    ["EquipDesc_2102176"]="A muffler passed down from generation to generation by the duke of a kingdom.",
    ["EquipDesc_2102177"]="A collar passed down from generation to generation by the duke of a kingdom.",
    ["EquipDesc_2102178"]="The crimson color might be indicating all the warfare the cape has seen.",
    ["EquipDesc_2102179"]="With plenty of Romantic Leaf-shaped decorations, the cape helps to hide traces when running through the forest.",
    ["EquipDesc_2102180"]="Made with the softest wool, the muffler is said to feel like a cloud.",
    ["EquipDesc_2102211"]="A manteau with the power of an otherworldly ancient god. It's yours, if you're willing to give up your soul for it.",
    ["EquipDesc_2102212"]="A muffler with the power of an otherworldly ancient god. It's yours, if you're willing to give up your soul for it.",
    ["EquipDesc_2102213"]="A collar with the power of an otherworldly ancient god. It's yours, if you're willing to give up your soul for it.",
    ["EquipDesc_2102214"]="A cape made to the highest specifications and used only at coronation ceremonies. Dearly expensive but offers no special effect. Its elegance is what the ruling class is after.",
    ["EquipDesc_2102215"]="The most beloved collar of Hera, Queen of the Underworld. If you look closely, you will find that there is a line of small characters that appear and disappear on the fringe, which seems to be condensed with magic power—\"For my most adorable sister Hera.\"",
    ["EquipDesc_2102216"]="A special muffler for high priests from Arunafeltz, embroidered with exorcism spells with a special craft. Because of its unique style, it has gradually become popular in other regions too...",
    ["EquipDesc_2102250"]="Some say fashion is a cycle!",
    ["EquipDesc_2102251"]="A lightweight and well-fitted uniform. It is durable and will not pose any restrictions to the movement. The go-to choice of the Capital Defense Guards.",
    ["EquipDesc_2102252"]="Designed by a hardcore fan of Lunatic, this one was a trendsetter in the past.",
    ["EquipDesc_2102253"]="A gift from the Lord's Mansion in Schwarzwald Republic to Juno College Students, robes crafted with the most cutting-edge Republican technology.",
    ["EquipDesc_2102254"]="A gift from the Lord's Mansion in Schwarzwald Republic to Juno College Students, a muffler crafted with the most cutting-edge Republican technology.",
    ["EquipDesc_2102255"]="A gift from the Lord's Mansion in Schwarzwald Republic to Juno College Students, a pair of shoes crafted with the most cutting-edge Republican technology.",
    ["EquipDesc_2102292"]="With magical energy coursing through, this Demon Swordsman's cloak looks spine-chilling.",
    ["EquipDesc_2102293"]="With magical energy coursing through, this Demon Swordsman's muffler looks spine-chilling.",
    ["EquipDesc_2102294"]="With magical energy coursing through, this Demon Swordsman's manteau looks spine-chilling.",
    ["EquipDesc_2102304"]="A magic coat created with magical guidance technology at its core, achieving the perfect fusion of magic and machinery. A true milestone creation of the Schwarzwald Republic.",
    ["EquipDesc_2102305"]="A collar created with magical guidance technology at its core, achieving the perfect fusion of magic and machinery. A true milestone creation of the Schwarzwald Republic.",
    ["EquipDesc_2102306"]="A pair of leather boots created with magical guidance technology at its core, achieving the perfect fusion of magic and machinery. A true milestone creation of the Schwarzwald Republic.",
    ["EquipDesc_2102367"]="Adorned with precious gems and inscribed with runes that amplify its defense, this muffler could only be born from the of Arunafeltz, the kingdom known for its unmatchable alchemy.",
    ["EquipDesc_2102368"]="Adorned with precious gems and inscribed with runes that amplify its defense, this collar could only be born from the of Arunafeltz, the kingdom known for its unmatchable alchemy.",
    ["EquipDesc_2102369"]="Adorned with precious gems and inscribed with runes that amplify its defense, this manteau could only be born from the of Arunafeltz, the kingdom known for its unmatchable alchemy.",
    ["EquipDesc_2102370"]="A rune-etched cloak that lightens the warrior's load.",
    ["EquipDesc_2102500"]="The manteau of the experimental subject YSF01 from the Werner Research Institute. Powerful magic stirs wildly inside. Feels like if you wear it wrong, the magic might eat you alive.",
    ["EquipDesc_2102634"]="The component of Vesper's sensor system on its shoulder and neck. There are a lot of hidden wires and routes beneath its heavy armor, which is Vesper's real \"weak spot.\"",
    ["EquipDesc_2102635"]="The component of Vesper's sensor system on its shoulder and neck. It's equipped with the latest optical camouflage, making it hard for any radar to detect.",
    ["EquipDesc_2102636"]="The component of Vesper's sensor system on its shoulder and neck. It has the highest level of access to auto-capture any comm signals nearby.",
    ["EquipDesc_2102676"]="Bijou's beloved mail—within it lingers a fragment of her soul. Rumor has it that during the dead of night, you can hear her sweet whispers if you're wearing it...",
    ["EquipDesc_2102677"]="Bijou's beloved muffler—within it lingers a fragment of her soul. Rumor has it that during the dead of night, you can hear her sweet whispers if you're wearing it...",
    ["EquipDesc_2102678"]="Bijou's beloved shoes—within it lingers a fragment of her soul. Rumor has it that during the dead of night, you can hear her sweet whispers if you're wearing it...",
    ["EquipDesc_2103001"]="A pair of boots that protect the ankles during battle.",
    ["EquipDesc_2103002"]="A pair of ordinary shoes.",
    ["EquipDesc_2103003"]="Boots favored by those who love to adventure. They offer just enough defense power to deal with basic monsters.",
    ["EquipDesc_2103004"]="Shoes favored by those who love to adventure. They offer just enough defense power to deal with basic monsters.",
    ["EquipDesc_2103005"]="Lightweight boots that are ideal for running.",
    ["EquipDesc_2103006"]="Strong but extremely heavy boots.",
    ["EquipDesc_2103007"]="Boots favored by veterans. They provide enough defensive power to deal with some intermediate monsters.",
    ["EquipDesc_2103008"]="Shoes favored by veterans. They provide enough defensive power to deal with some intermediate monsters.",
    ["EquipDesc_2103009"]="Premium sandals decorated with gold thread and gemstones. Designed to slip on and off with ease.",
    ["EquipDesc_2103010"]="Leather boots that can protect the wearer's feet in any situation.",
    ["EquipDesc_2103011"]="Light and elegant boots that bards love to wear.",
    ["EquipDesc_2103012"]="Metal boots made purely for defense without any regard for usability or comfort.",
    ["EquipDesc_2103013"]="Boots that can only be used by warriors who have won glory. They provide enough defensive power to deal with most intermediate monsters.",
    ["EquipDesc_2103014"]="Shoes that can only be used by warriors who have won glory. They provide enough defensive power to deal with most intermediate monsters.",
    ["EquipDesc_2103015"]="Boots with a very special design. It is clear that the creator wanted to challenge the gods but fell short.",
    ["EquipDesc_2103016"]="Shoes woven out of branches from the tree of vitality. They feel comfortable and full of vitality.",
    ["EquipDesc_2103017"]="Boots conferred to warriors by the royal family. They provide enough defensive power to deal with some advanced monsters.",
    ["EquipDesc_2103018"]="Shoes conferred to warriors by the royal family. They provide enough defensive power to deal with some advanced monsters.",
    ["EquipDesc_2103019"]="Greaves that are best suited for combat.",
    ["EquipDesc_2103020"]="Boots imbued with darkness to help the wearer effortlessly blend into darkness.",
    ["EquipDesc_2103022"]="Valkyrie boots that greatly boost the wearer's abilities.",
    ["EquipDesc_2103027"]="Mysterious boots that automatically adjust to fit the wearer perfectly, as if they were alive.",
    ["EquipDesc_2103030"]="Boots that Murphy made for a bet against his rival.",
    ["EquipDesc_2103031"]="Vidar, son of Odin, wore these boots when he slew Fenrir. They represent the great physical and mental strength he displayed in that epic battle.",
    ["EquipDesc_2103032"]="A pair of boots with blessings of the earth from Freyr, son of Njord.",
    ["EquipDesc_2103033"]="Boots made of goat hair. They are very warm.",
    ["EquipDesc_2103034"]="Very popular shoes with a thicker sole than most shoes.",
    ["EquipDesc_2103035"]="Boots used by the Imperial Guard.",
    ["EquipDesc_2103036"]="Shoes used by the Imperial Guard.",
    ["EquipDesc_2103037"]="Boots used by the lord of a kingdom.",
    ["EquipDesc_2103038"]="Shoes used by the lord of a kingdom.",
    ["EquipDesc_2103043"]="A pair of boots passed down from generation to generation by the viscount of a kingdom.",
    ["EquipDesc_2103044"]="A pair of shoes passed down from generation to generation by the viscount of a kingdom.",
    ["EquipDesc_2103045"]="A pair of leather boots passed down from generation to generation by the viscount of a kingdom.",
    ["EquipDesc_2103046"]="Valuable boots made using precious gold.",
    ["EquipDesc_2103049"]="The patterns on the shoes seem to be words, but nobody knows what they mean.",
    ["EquipDesc_2103050"]="Leather boots made using special materials. They let the wearer move silently in the night.",
    ["EquipDesc_2103065"]="Lace-up boots that feel really solid on your feet once the laces are tied.",
    ["EquipDesc_2103071"]="Tough boots made of light leather that make the wearer feel like going for a run.",
    ["EquipDesc_2103076"]="Light and comfortable boots that are suitable for fast walking.",
    ["EquipDesc_2103080"]="Guardians of Time are always on time. Could these boots be why?",
    ["EquipDesc_2103083"]="These lightweight boots seem to make the wearer move much faster.",
    ["EquipDesc_2103085"]="Rumor has it that these leather boots were worn by a well-known dancer. They make the wearer feel happy when dancing in them.",
    ["EquipDesc_2103086"]="Leather boots favored by those who love to adventure. They offer just enough defense power to deal with basic monsters.",
    ["EquipDesc_2103087"]="Leather boots favored by veterans. They provide enough defensive power to deal with some intermediate monsters.",
    ["EquipDesc_2103088"]="Leather boots that can only be used by warriors who have won glory. They provide enough defensive power to deal with most intermediate monsters.",
    ["EquipDesc_2103089"]="Leather boots used by the Imperial Guard.",
    ["EquipDesc_2103090"]="Leather boots conferred to warriors by the royal family. They provide enough defensive power to deal with some advanced monsters.",
    ["EquipDesc_2103091"]="Leather boots used by the lord of a kingdom.",
    ["EquipDesc_2103092"]="Gorgeous, light leather boots used by valkyries.",
    ["EquipDesc_2103093"]="Gorgeous, light cloth boots used by valkyries.",
    ["EquipDesc_2103094"]="A pair of light boots that have a hidden Murphy's seal. It is said that an ancient spell is recorded on them.",
    ["EquipDesc_2103095"]="A pair of boots that have a hidden Murphy's seal. It is said that an ancient spell is recorded on them.",
    ["EquipDesc_2103096"]="A pair of impressive boots that are rumored to be blessed with divine protection.",
    ["EquipDesc_2103125"]="Boots made from leather, sturdy and durable.",
    ["EquipDesc_2103139"]="The clothing can only be worn by a marquis, and it is very luxurious.",
    ["EquipDesc_2103140"]="The clothing can only be worn by a marquis, and it is very luxurious.",
    ["EquipDesc_2103141"]="The clothing can only be worn by a marquis, and it is very luxurious.",
    ["EquipDesc_2103142"]="The boots, which have been handed down from the classical era and exude a sacred aura, have been passed down from generation to generation as the legacy of the High Divine Guard.",
    ["EquipDesc_2103143"]="Lightweight and gorgeous boots worn only by members of the noble court. However, they have blades hidden in the toe of the shoe, which can kill people without being noticed.",
    ["EquipDesc_2103144"]="Leather boots worn by mages on important occasions. Not only do they shine with the flow of magic, but they also show the elegance and wisdom of the wearer.",
    ["EquipDesc_2103175"]="A pair of boots passed down from generation to generation by the duke of a kingdom.",
    ["EquipDesc_2103176"]="A pair of shoes passed down from generation to generation by the duke of a kingdom.",
    ["EquipDesc_2103177"]="A pair of leather boots passed down from generation to generation by the duke of a kingdom.",
    ["EquipDesc_2103178"]="Boots with advanced fire resistance, which provide a surprising bonus in battles against dragons.",
    ["EquipDesc_2103179"]="Shoes specially made for a great time on the beach. Will you get sunburnt marks? That's the only thing to worry about.",
    ["EquipDesc_2103180"]="Delicate sheepskin boots gaining popularity among noble ladies with poring-shaped decorations. Hmm, looking nifty and cute.",
    ["EquipDesc_2103211"]="A pair of boots with the power of an otherworldly ancient god. It's yours, if you're willing to give up your soul for it.",
    ["EquipDesc_2103212"]="A pair of shoes with the power of an otherworldly ancient god. It's yours, if you're willing to give up your soul for it.",
    ["EquipDesc_2103213"]="A pair of leather boots with the power of an otherworldly ancient god. It's yours, if you're willing to give up your soul for it.",
    ["EquipDesc_2103214"]="Boots made to the highest specifications and used only at coronation ceremonies. Dearly expensive but offer no special effect. Their elegance is what the ruling class is after.",
    ["EquipDesc_2103215"]="The most beloved boots of Hera, Queen of the Underworld. If you look closely, you will find that there is a line of small letters that appear and disappear on the heels, which seems to be condensed with magic power—\"For my most adorable sister Hera.\"",
    ["EquipDesc_2103216"]="Special shoes for high priests from Arunafeltz, embroidered with exorcism spells with a special craft. Because of their unique style, they have gradually become popular in other regions too...",
    ["EquipDesc_2103250"]="Some say fashion is a cycle!",
    ["EquipDesc_2103251"]="A lightweight and well-fitted uniform. It is durable and will not pose any restrictions to the movement. The go-to choice of the Capital Defense Guards.",
    ["EquipDesc_2103252"]="Designed by a hardcore fan of Lunatic, this one was a trendsetter in the past.",
    ["EquipDesc_2103253"]="A gift from the Lord's Mansion in Schwarzwald Republic to Juno College Students, a magic coat crafted with the most cutting-edge Republican technology.",
    ["EquipDesc_2103254"]="A gift from the Lord's Mansion in Schwarzwald Republic to Juno College Students, a collar crafted with the most cutting-edge Republican technology.",
    ["EquipDesc_2103255"]="A gift from the Lord's Mansion in Schwarzwald Republic to Juno College Students, a pair of leather boots crafted with the most cutting-edge Republican technology.",
    ["EquipDesc_2103292"]="With magical energy coursing through, these Demon Swordsman's boots look spine-chilling.",
    ["EquipDesc_2103293"]="With magical energy coursing through, these Demon Swordsman's leather boots look spine-chilling.",
    ["EquipDesc_2103294"]="With magical energy coursing through, these Demon Swordsman's cloth boots look spine-chilling.",
    ["EquipDesc_2103304"]="A robe created with magical guidance technology at its core, achieving the perfect fusion of magic and machinery. A true milestone creation of the Schwarzwald Republic.",
    ["EquipDesc_2103305"]="A muffler created with magical guidance technology at its core, achieving the perfect fusion of magic and machinery. A true milestone creation of the Schwarzwald Republic.",
    ["EquipDesc_2103306"]="A pair of shoes created with magical guidance technology at its core, achieving the perfect fusion of magic and machinery. A true milestone creation of the Schwarzwald Republic.",
    ["EquipDesc_2103367"]="Adorned with precious gems and inscribed with runes that amplify its defense, this pair of boots could only be born from the of Arunafeltz, the kingdom known for its unmatchable alchemy.",
    ["EquipDesc_2103368"]="Adorned with precious gems and inscribed with runes that amplify its defense, this pair of leather boots could only be born from the of Arunafeltz, the kingdom known for its unmatchable alchemy.",
    ["EquipDesc_2103369"]="Adorned with precious gems and inscribed with runes that amplify its defense, this pair of shoes could only be born from the of Arunafeltz, the kingdom known for its unmatchable alchemy.",
    ["EquipDesc_2103370"]="Heavy boots with a stable magic circle, making the warrior stand firm in battle.",
    ["EquipDesc_2103500"]="The greaves of the experimental subject YSF01 from the Werner Research Institute. Powerful magic stirs wildly inside. Feels like if you wear it wrong, the magic might eat you alive.",
    ["EquipDesc_2103634"]="The component of Vesper's power system on its legs. It's equipped with multi-core engines to compensate for its mobility issue due to its heavy weight.",
    ["EquipDesc_2103635"]="The component of Vesper's power system on its ankles. It has the latest positioning technology developed by Khayr Consortium to minimize errors while moving and landing.",
    ["EquipDesc_2103636"]="The component of Vesper's power system on its feet. It supplies energy to the engines, serving as an essential part of the machinery.",
    ["EquipDesc_2103676"]="Bijou's beloved robe—within it lingers a fragment of her soul. Rumor has it that during the dead of night, you can hear her sweet whispers if you're wearing it...",
    ["EquipDesc_2103677"]="Bijou's beloved manteau—within it lingers a fragment of her soul. Rumor has it that during the dead of night, you can hear her sweet whispers if you're wearing it...",
    ["EquipDesc_2103678"]="Bijou's beloved cloth boots—within it lingers a fragment of her soul. Rumor has it that during the dead of night, you can hear her sweet whispers if you're wearing it...",
    ["EquipDesc_2109999"]="Default equipment of Ultimate Showdown. Automatically switched after switching classes.",
    ["EquipDesc_2201006"]="Armor made from Bakonawa scales. It glows with a mysterious light.",
    ["EquipDesc_2201008"]="Armor that can be worn when sprinting at full speed. It feels a like a running shirt, but has the effectiveness of armor.",
    ["EquipDesc_2201010"]="Purportedly a relic of a famed dual-wielding assassin.",
    ["EquipDesc_2201011"]="Purportedly a relic of the Icarus Guild, home to many a famed archer.",
    ["EquipDesc_2201012"]="Protects riders against the wind, as well as injury in the event of an accident.",
    ["EquipDesc_2201013"]="Armor created specially to protect high-ranking officials from ninja assassins. When the wearer is attacked, the armor creates a mirror image to confuse the assailant.",
    ["EquipDesc_2201014"]="A coat worn by members of a patrol team that used to fight criminals.",
    ["EquipDesc_2202001"]="A muffler that protects the shoulders.",
    ["EquipDesc_2202003"]="A robe made of a transparent cloth with beautiful patterns that is worn by fairies as they fly through the air.",
    ["EquipDesc_2202004"]="A cloak fashioned from the hide of a Buwaya. It feels like the soul of the Buwaya is still present.",
    ["EquipDesc_2202006"]="The skin of a demon king that has been cursed in the language of the demons. It can be worn as a cape.",
    ["EquipDesc_2202008"]="A symbol worn by runners that just makes you want to sprint when you wear it.",
    ["EquipDesc_2202010"]="Purportedly a relic of a famed dual-wielding assassin.",
    ["EquipDesc_2202011"]="Purportedly a relic of the Icarus Guild, home to many a famed archer.",
    ["EquipDesc_2202012"]="A muffler that Freyja, daughter of Njord, often lent to Loki. It makes its wearer as nimble as a falcon in flight.",
    ["EquipDesc_2202013"]="A feathery mantle once worn by a master swordsman of an Eastern nation.",
    ["EquipDesc_2202014"]="A striking manteau adorned with a saber-toothed tiger pattern.",
    ["EquipDesc_2202024"]="A manteau made out of the mane of a brutal dragon.",
    ["EquipDesc_2203001"]="Boots made of an extremely durable but lightweight leather.",
    ["EquipDesc_2203002"]="Boots with a waterproof coating that prevents slippage on wet surfaces.",
    ["EquipDesc_2203003"]="Sandals fashioned from hardwood. It might not be a good idea to wear them for long.",
    ["EquipDesc_2203004"]="Ominous boots that harbor a deep-seated grudge against humans.",
    ["EquipDesc_2203005"]="Hiking shoes created by a lifelong mountaineer, based on years of experience.",
    ["EquipDesc_2203007"]="Comfortable boots that can be worn when sprinting at full speed.",
    ["EquipDesc_2203008"]="Shoes that make their wearer feel more refreshed.",
    ["EquipDesc_2203009"]="Purportedly a relic of a famed dual-wielding assassin.",
    ["EquipDesc_2203010"]="Purportedly a relic of the Icarus Guild, home to many a famed archer.",
    ["EquipDesc_2203012"]="Boots filled with the power of darkness, supposedly able to improve the wearer's concentration.",
    ["EquipDesc_2203013"]="Boots that can change shape, making them impeccable in terms of versatility and comfort.",
    ["EquipDesc_2301001"]="Clothes made from a premium fabric that offers excellent magic defense.",
    ["EquipDesc_2301004"]="A robe made to commemorate those who have stood guard for many years. It keeps out the wind and is very warm.",
    ["EquipDesc_2301006"]="A green robe that has been baptized with saintly power.",
    ["EquipDesc_2301010"]="A magnificent golden robe imbued with the power of the wind.",
    ["EquipDesc_2301011"]="A relic left behind by a high priest who saved people in an ancient war.",
    ["EquipDesc_2301013"]="Developed in Geffen after years of research, this robe effectively protects its wearer against potent magic.",
    ["EquipDesc_2301029"]="A robe embroidered with unknown symbols. Anyone who wears it will feel as if they are learning a new language.",
    ["EquipDesc_2302003"]="A manteau that provides excellent defense against magic.",
    ["EquipDesc_2302005"]="A manteau that greatly increases the wearer's ability to survive in any situation.",
    ["EquipDesc_2302006"]="A manteau made to commemorate those who have stood guard for many years. It keeps out the wind and is very warm.",
    ["EquipDesc_2302007"]="A manteau that contributes greatly when escaping from the threat of death from Odin.",
    ["EquipDesc_2302010"]="A magnificent golden muffler imbued with the power of the wind.",
    ["EquipDesc_2302011"]="Armor obtained from infinite space that emanates a faint aura.",
    ["EquipDesc_2302012"]="A relic left behind by a high priest who saved people in an ancient war.",
    ["EquipDesc_2302013"]="A shawl with magic embroidery that enhances concentration.",
    ["EquipDesc_2302014"]="Special clothing developed to protect priests who carry out exorcisms in Prontera Cathedral.",
    ["EquipDesc_2303002"]="Shoes that are convenient to put on but do not offer much defense.",
    ["EquipDesc_2303004"]="Shoes that provide excellent defense against magic.",
    ["EquipDesc_2303006"]="Boots imbued with magic power.",
    ["EquipDesc_2303007"]="Boots made specially for guardians of time and suitable for use in all conditions.",
    ["EquipDesc_2303009"]="Magnificent golden boots imbued with the power of the wind.",
    ["EquipDesc_2303010"]="A relic left behind by a high priest who saved people in an ancient war.",
    ["EquipDesc_2303011"]="Boots imbued with darkness to help the wearer effortlessly blend into darkness.",
    ["EquipDesc_2303012"]="Purportedly a relic of the Icarus Guild, home to many a famed archer.",
    ["EquipDesc_2303013"]="Shoes woven out of branches from the tree of vitality. They feel comfortable and full of vitality.",
    ["EquipDesc_2405001"]="The costume of the Campus Festival set.",
    ["EquipDesc_2405002"]="Fluffy Cat Outfit",
    ["EquipDesc_2405003"]="Campus Festival Costume (Red)",
    ["EquipDesc_2405004"]="Campus Festival Costume (Blue)",
    ["EquipDesc_2405005"]="Campus Festival Costume (Green)",
    ["EquipDesc_2405006"]="Campus Festival Costume (White)",
    ["EquipDesc_2405007"]="An exercise shirt that is popular in the summer due to its thin, breathable material.",
    ["EquipDesc_2405008"]="Cool, comfortable clothes, ideal for a trip to the beach.",
    ["EquipDesc_2405009"]="Special protective clothing of the Rekenber Institute. Ideally suited for combat, it was designed specifically with the needs of adventurers in mind.",
    ["EquipDesc_2405010"]="Peculiar and unsophisticated clothes that are rumored to be the costume of a mysterious hero.",
    ["EquipDesc_2405011"]="An outfit that is worn by Daytime Magicians. This light-colored outfit is elegant and conspicuous, and serves the purpose of the magicians' creed of presenting a glamorous appearance to the audience.",
    ["EquipDesc_2405012"]="An outfit that is worn by Night Magicians. This dark outfit is simple and low-key, and serves the purpose of the magicians' creed of attracting the audience to their magic instead of the magician.",
    ["EquipDesc_2405013"]="An elegant outfit exclusive to the VIPs of the Purchase Shop.",
    ["EquipDesc_2405014"]="An elegant and gorgeous bard's outfit.",
    ["EquipDesc_2405015"]="Exaggerated and high-profile looking clothing worn by trendsetters.",
    ["EquipDesc_2405016"]="A husky-shaped doll costume.",
    ["EquipDesc_2405017"]="A baggy jumpsuit worn by clowns.",
    ["EquipDesc_2405018"]="An outfit worn by witches who hide among the people. It is said that these witches only appear in front of others during a special festival and speak and act as they please.",
    ["EquipDesc_2405019"]="A peculiar outfit of the dead that is worn by those who want to dress up as a resurrected dead person for a night march during a special festival.",
    ["EquipDesc_2405022"]="An outfit named after the Stars' Blessings. It is a prize that the Heines Family prepared for the Christmas event. The red and white color combination is always timeless.",
    ["EquipDesc_2405023"]="An outfit made for winter. It is made out of a thick fabric that keeps the wearer warm and comfortable without sacrificing any elegance.",
    ["EquipDesc_2405024"]="A uniquely designed white suit that carries the promise between two lovers.\nFor males only.",
    ["EquipDesc_2405025"]="A uniquely designed white wedding gown that carries the promise between two lovers.\nFor females only.",
    ["EquipDesc_2405026"]="Outfit worn by the witness. Conveys the most wonderful blessings to the newlyweds.",
    ["EquipDesc_2405027"]="An elegant eastern-styled outfit. People will wear it on special occasions to welcome a new change.",
    ["EquipDesc_2405031"]="An outfit designed to look like Nian.",
    ["EquipDesc_2405032"]="A regal cavalry style uniform. Charismatic and dignified, it symbolizes the honor of the royal family.",
    ["EquipDesc_2405033"]="Uniform worn by the royal family during formal events. Beautifully dignified.",
    ["EquipDesc_2405035"]="Archaeologists wear this outfit. Ruins on this continent are full of risks, and depending on the wits alone is not going to work for an explorer.",
    ["EquipDesc_2405036"]="The outfit of the Steam Expedition, very durable and functional.",
    ["EquipDesc_2405037"]="An outfit that's suited for students. It's youthful and sweet.",
    ["EquipDesc_2405038"]="Uniform worn by hot blooded youths - although the style is retro, it still looks great today.",
    ["EquipDesc_2405039"]="Bee style clothing. Produce sticky sweetness through hard work.",
    ["EquipDesc_2405040"]="After reading the fairy tale book, Vera got new inspiration and made this outfit based on the image of the protagonist in the story.",
    ["EquipDesc_2405041"]="Part of the Rabbit Attendant Set. Attendants who are constantly moving between cups in the background naturally count as part of the scenery. Abandon your timid shame and boldly show your most charming self!",
    ["EquipDesc_2405043"]="The style of this outfit and the techniques used are fresh and original. The bamboo embroidery at the hem is hand-stitched at great cost.",
    ["EquipDesc_2405044"]="Admired by many fashion experts for it's unique style. It is said to be created by a visitor from a different world.\n",
    ["EquipDesc_2405045"]="You can almost feel the sea breeze when you put on a cool summer dress.",
    ["EquipDesc_2405046"]="Prontera’s famous designer tried their best to create an outfit that integrates the Schwarzwald Republic industrial style. It’s both majestic and cool.",
    ["EquipDesc_2405047"]="Close fitting and lightweight, specially made for hunters who need to respond instantly to changes in the battlefield. It can not only protect the hunters from the sharp teeth and claws, but also hide their figures in the lightless abyss.",
    ["EquipDesc_2405049"]="Clothing designed in Japanese style due to the influence of samurai culture in the past.",
    ["EquipDesc_2405051"]="A diving suit made from the most technologically advanced materials that keeps you warm in the water.",
    ["EquipDesc_2405052"]="Seemingly exotic clothing brought by traders from abroad. Its sleek design and high level of comfort made it immediately popular among the public.",
    ["EquipDesc_2405053"]="In winter, beds are like monsters that eat people, and your warm pajamas are like the bed's claws... Please don't open the door or windows...",
    ["EquipDesc_2405054"]="Put on your sailor suit and swab the deck, matey! There are new adventures ahead!",
    ["EquipDesc_2405055"]="A baseball game outfit that arms you to the teeth. Show them what you are made of!",
    ["EquipDesc_2405059"]="You can almost feel the sea breeze when you put on this cool summer dress.",
    ["EquipDesc_2405060"]="The well-tailored uniform exudes the calm and elegance of the last century. It will available after will be available to female characters after the update in 06.09.2022.",
    ["EquipDesc_2405061"]="Simple but elegant ancient outfit. The jade ring above is as bright as the moon in the sky, expressing one’s feeling of missing.",
    ["EquipDesc_2405062"]="Full of respect and adoration for Rimuru. It's the perfect combination of absolute loyalty and great individual strength.",
    ["EquipDesc_2405063"]="\"As one of the best aerospace engineers, I think space suits should be designed to be practical rather than to contain lots of roses and chocolates!\" – Engineer Singer Doug",
    ["EquipDesc_2405064"]="Bright and breezy, it's a great spring day for an outing. Fresh bento is in the Chickling Backpack. Share it with your pals.",
    ["EquipDesc_2405065"]="A powerful monster's proof of being recognized by the world. It's a symbol of a demon evolving to their peak.",
    ["EquipDesc_2405066"]="Clothing designed in Japanese style due to the influence of samurai culture in the past.",
    ["EquipDesc_2405067"]="Full of respect and adoration for Rimuru. It's the perfect combination of absolute loyalty and great individual strength.",
    ["EquipDesc_2405068"]="A powerful monster's proof of being recognized by the world. It's a symbol of a demon evolving to their peak.",
    ["EquipDesc_2405069"]="A set of costume employed laser-reflective materials, ideal for light show. You will be the shining star in a well-lit night",
    ["EquipDesc_2405070"]="This is the outfit urban legend clowns wear when they invade a house at night. During the day, they look ordinary and blend in with others, and nightfall transforms their faces into expressions of horror.",
    ["EquipDesc_2405074"]="Wow! Who just enter the floor with that dazzling gesture? And who is stealing all the attentions in the club?",
    ["EquipDesc_2405075"]="Designed by professionals to keep you warm all the way in the coldest weather. It is becoming a must-have for anyone who wants to climb the snow mountains.",
    ["EquipDesc_2405076"]="Injustices abound in the vast and sparsely populated wilderness, but vigilantes will not tolerate criminals! Get your equipment on, we're going after those felons!",
    ["EquipDesc_2405080"]="A flower parade must have an orchestra that plays sonorous music and is neat... Naturally, only well-trained members are allowed to wear the uniform!",
    ["EquipDesc_2405081"]="Legend has it that the saint, who is busy all night on the holy night to make children's wishes come true, has a group of loyal companions who sort out all the gifts, prepare his vehicle, and... cook dinner for him.",
    ["EquipDesc_2405082"]="Take up a sword, bend a bow, mount a horse, until you're brave enough, so that I may repay Odin.",
    ["EquipDesc_2405083"]="It is not all about the traditional bright red design. It corresponds to the atmosphere of the New Year, and is also very suitable for other important occasions to dress up. The tiger starts the year and sends the news of spring by stepping on the clouds.",
    ["EquipDesc_2405084"]="Crisscrossing on the verdant greenfield. Let's join the game of the brave!",
    ["EquipDesc_2405085"]="Besides handling different ingredients, a master chef can also make cooking an aesthetic experience. The outfit you wear for work is also the outfit you wear for the performance. Captivate your customers' eyes and taste buds!",
    ["EquipDesc_2405086"]="In the days when the gods walked the earth, this uniform symbolized peace and hope. Until the gods fell and monsters rampaged, it never changed.",
    ["EquipDesc_2405088"]="The high quality outfit from the ancient East to Midgard are decorated with accessories and motifs inspired by the “Kylin”, an auspicious beast that wards off misfortune and brings good luck to its owner.",
    ["EquipDesc_2405089"]="Flowers seldom encounter the snow. Your fancy dress touches the falling cherry blossom, facilitating the most fantastic reunion of flowers and snow.",
    ["EquipDesc_2405090"]="Code the wings with 0/1 and embed the chip in the heart. In the infinite torrent of data, the last player suddenly heard the buzz.",
    ["EquipDesc_2405091"]="The set for the king of fish market. Don’t interrupt the one in that set unless you want some exotic fish like blue fin tuna, leopard coral trout, or Chinese bahaba gutted and cleaned.",
    ["EquipDesc_2405092"]="Skateboard? Graffiti? Parkour? Put it on, you are the coolest artist on the street!",
    ["EquipDesc_2405093"]="After a full meal, the Fluffy Lion King rubbed his small stomach, \"Huh? Where’d my muscles go? Mmm... but this feels really nice~",
    ["EquipDesc_2405094"]="A holy armor that was blessed by Valkyrie. Only the one who possesses a pure soul can wear it.",
    ["EquipDesc_2405095"]="Suitable for various combat styles, this monk's attire is simple and practical.",
    ["EquipDesc_2405096"]="Recruit uniform of the Training Corp, with the emblem of sword and shield displayed on the left chest pocket, shoulders and back.",
    ["EquipDesc_2405097"]="Uniform of the Survey Corps，with the emblem of dual-color wings displayed on the left chest pocket, shoulders and back.",
    ["EquipDesc_2405098"]="Pristine cleaning outfit, suggesting the owner’s determination to sweep all the dust.",
    ["EquipDesc_2405099"]="Sturdy and durable camping gear that provides the best protection for campers.",
    ["EquipDesc_2405101"]="Forged from the Asgardian Oridecon, the dwarven craftmanship used has been lost since the twilight of the gods.",
    ["EquipDesc_2405102"]="Maid costume in black and white, butterflies on the hemline resemble to the red strawberry on the cream chocolate cake. Available for male characters after update in 09.06.2022.",
    ["EquipDesc_2405103"]="Kotaro Higashi's daily outfit.",
    ["EquipDesc_2405104"]="Princess Maya's outfit.",
    ["EquipDesc_2405105"]="What looks like the official uniform of some dimensional authority, which symbolizes protection and order.",
    ["EquipDesc_2405106"]="I do my best in dating and performing! This is the shining me!",
    ["EquipDesc_2405108"]="Trim the clouds to make clothes. Carve the moon into accessories. It's as light as smoke and as soft as organdie.",
    ["EquipDesc_2405115"]="The splendid horizon greeted me as I left the imperial palace. I'd rather carry my sword and wine just to be the Heavenly Protector.",
    ["EquipDesc_2405116"]="The splendid horizon greeted me as I left the imperial palace. I'd rather carry my sword and wine just to be the Heavenly Protector.",
    ["EquipDesc_2405117"]="The splendid horizon greeted me as I left the imperial palace. I'd rather carry my sword and wine just to be the Heavenly Protector.",
    ["EquipDesc_2405118"]="The splendid horizon greeted me as I left the imperial palace. I'd rather carry my sword and wine just to be the Heavenly Protector.",
    ["EquipDesc_2405119"]="The splendid horizon greeted me as I left the imperial palace. I'd rather carry my sword and wine just to be the Heavenly Protector.",
    ["EquipDesc_2405120"]="An outfit for an ancient profession. It is said that they are the emissaries from the spirits in the secret legend.",
    ["EquipDesc_2405121"]="A robe made from the hide of a man-eating serpent monster that harbors great resentment. It must be embedded with gold and decorated with beautiful gemstones and have its soul suppressed with the flames of the searing lotus.",
    ["EquipDesc_2405122"]="The Tanjiro Kamado Set.\nIt is not possible to wear the costumes of other <color=#CA2E0AFF>Demon Slayer: Kimetsu no Yaiba characters</color> while wearing this.",
    ["EquipDesc_2405123"]="The Nezuko Kamado Set.\nIt is not possible to wear the costumes of other <color=#CA2E0AFF>Demon Slayer: Kimetsu no Yaiba characters</color> while wearing this.",
    ["EquipDesc_2405124"]="The Zenitsu Agatsuma Set.\nIt is not possible to wear the costumes of other <color=#CA2E0AFF>Demon Slayer: Kimetsu no Yaiba characters</color> while wearing this.",
    ["EquipDesc_2405125"]="The Inosuke Hashibira Set.\nIt is not possible to wear the costumes of other <color=#CA2E0AFF>Demon Slayer: Kimetsu no Yaiba characters</color> while wearing this.",
    ["EquipDesc_2405126"]="An armor once belonged to Loki. It was recast by his followers after the Ragnarok to commemorate the fallen gods.",
    ["EquipDesc_2405127"]="Made by the tailor in the ancient castle. As if it were the master's youth, this outfit never fades.",
    ["EquipDesc_2405128"]="This outfit is designed specifically for street soccer players. Wear it and go wild on the field!",
    ["EquipDesc_2405129"]="A puppet who came to life on Christmas Eve so he could attend the Christmas celebration.",
    ["EquipDesc_2405130"]="A complicated and gorgeous outfit that the Royal tailor designs. Dressing in this for the celebration is only permitted for the pure royal bloodlines.",
    ["EquipDesc_2405131"]="Take a deep breath and get on the stage. Be the undefined X!",
    ["EquipDesc_2405134"]="The trendy outfit of the Celestial Rabbit series is straight out of the Twelve Zodiac fashion show, and it is the signature design of the new designer, Celestial Rabbit.",
    ["EquipDesc_2405135"]="The frog element in this raincoat set makes it stand out. Wear it on a rainy day in early spring!",
    ["EquipDesc_2405137"]="The robe bestowed to the kind Adventurer by Angeling. Its style, reputedly, is the one that Deviling hates the most... Designer: 冷遇の月",
    ["EquipDesc_2405138"]="The sequence of the stars contains hidden messages from afar, which you can use to predict how people’s destinies tie together and where they are heading.",
    ["EquipDesc_2405139"]="A standard aviation uniform. People call it the \"Orange Meteor\" due to its eye-catching flame patterns.",
    ["EquipDesc_2405140"]="A piece of armor named after Thanatos. Its owner may acquire unparalleled strength or walk into a dead end of losing everything.",
    ["EquipDesc_2405141"]="It was made of pure and sacred linen and cleansed with the water of the Nile. With the blessing from Pharaoh and gods painted in the slave's blood, it traveled seven thousand years to meet you finally.",
    ["EquipDesc_2405144"]="A lightweight and trendy diving suit that protects you from water pressure and cold temperature.​",
    ["EquipDesc_2405145"]="A tribe hunting outfit made from beast hide. The primary materials of this outfit are usually the loot that hunters take pride in.",
    ["EquipDesc_2405146"]="An evening dress that contrasts musical notes with the starry sky. When the music sounds, it's hard to tell whether the flowing melody comes from the stars or the notes.",
    ["EquipDesc_2405148"]="Soon, the most powerful music will take the world by storm. The sound of phantoms can't be defined or categorized!",
    ["EquipDesc_2405149"]="An outfit with a white cloak for young female adventurers. Shizue Izawa's daily outfit.",
    ["EquipDesc_2405150"]="The outfit Souei wears when going on missions.",
    ["EquipDesc_2405151"]="Sacred armor for a Holy Knight. Hinata Sakaguchi's daily combat suit.",
    ["EquipDesc_2405152"]="The outfit Souka wears when going on missions.",
    ["EquipDesc_2405154"]="A tight leather jacket wrapping a rebellious soul, who contradicts all the obsolete conventions of the world, only to proclaim the slogan of love and freedom.​",
    ["EquipDesc_2405155"]="The warrior granted this armor will go to The Underworld and serve Hel forever.",
    ["EquipDesc_2405156"]="Put on this lemon-themed vacation outfit and chill out in the cool sea breeze under sunny skies!",
    ["EquipDesc_2405157"]="This uniform was worn by the legendary mentor-student duo when they dominated the school.",
    ["EquipDesc_2405158"]="He and she, hand in hand, go through no-go areas and blockade lines, celebrating their wedding in unique salutes, with sirens and alarms replacing the 99 guns.",
    ["EquipDesc_2405159"]="<color=#FF0000>(Unisex)</color> The armor of the \"Dominator of the Universe,\" Boros.",
    ["EquipDesc_2405160"]="<color=#FF0000>(Male)</color> The outfit of the \"Hero Hunter,\" Garou.",
    ["EquipDesc_2405161"]="<color=#FF0000>(Female)</color> The dress of the S-Class Hero, \"Terrible Tornado.\"",
    ["EquipDesc_2405162"]="<color=#FF0000>(Female)</color> The dress of the B-Class Hero, \"Hellish Blizzard.\"",
    ["EquipDesc_2405163"]="<color=#FF0000>(Male)</color> Speed-o'-Sound Sonic's outfit.",
    ["EquipDesc_2405164"]="<color=#FF0000>(Male)</color> Saitama's hero suit.",
    ["EquipDesc_2405165"]="<color=#FF0000>(Male)</color> Genos' outfit.",
    ["EquipDesc_2405166"]="A heavy metal rocker's suit. Wearing it brings a storm that tears the stage apart.",
    ["EquipDesc_2405167"]="Defying traditions and questioning conventions, they step on the narrow line between genius and madness, exploring the forbidden secrets.",
    ["EquipDesc_2405168"]="With its thick fur and nutshell lamp, it keeps a hunter warm when looking for the biggest prey in the snowstorm.",
    ["EquipDesc_2405169"]="Trapped in the Fairy Tale Forest, the girl and the werewolf would eventually become the darkest beings when night falls.\n<color=#FF0000>Note: This set has different forms for day and night. Refrain from peeking at its true appearance during the dark hours!</color>",
    ["EquipDesc_2405170"]="An azure autumn attire with white velvety edge piping. It's said to be a present the Moon Rabbit brought from the moon.",
    ["EquipDesc_2405171"]="This combat suit, designed solely for hot war, utilizes soft bullet-proof composites, achieving light weight and efficient protection at the same time.",
    ["EquipDesc_2405172"]="Supernatural beings that hunt down evil across the four-dimensional space. They call themselves predators. [Designer: ♡+憨吉皇后+♡]",
    ["EquipDesc_2405174"]="Trapped in the Fairy Tale Forest, the girl and the werewolf would eventually become the darkest beings when night falls.\n<color=#FF0000>Note: This set has different forms for day and night. Refrain from peeking at its true appearance during the dark hours!</color>",
    ["EquipDesc_2405175"]="Your good friend Garm and the faithful mount Garm are exclusive to Dreamscape.",
    ["EquipDesc_2405176"]="The attire worn by Heimdall when he was appointed as a god. Some say it's carrying the nine blessings from his nine mothers.",
    ["EquipDesc_2405177"]="The chronicles of the realm of gods never mention the name of the King of Niflheim, only that He is as everlasting as primordial ice and snow and as splendid as the god of all gods.",
    ["EquipDesc_2405178"]="Armor crafted from merits, bloodshed, and heroic souls. Refrained from calling the real name of its master, enemies refer to it only as the \"Ice Conqueror.\"",
    ["EquipDesc_2405180"]="Ride the Garm Baby and keep the adventure rolling even in the dreams.\nSnowman Dyestuffs can be used in the wardrobe to unlock other colors.",
    ["EquipDesc_2405185"]="An outfit inspired by the elegance of cranes. Perfect for wearing during the melting of snow, drawing the attention of birds returning in spring.",
    ["EquipDesc_2405186"]="Essential equipment for fire rescue operations, ensuring the safety of firefighters in the blazing fire.",
    ["EquipDesc_2405187"]="Light and sleek gear for adventure. The less you carry, the more you bring on the way back!",
    ["EquipDesc_2405188"]="A suit for working in hazardous conditions, where the bright orange symbolizes both danger and hope.",
    ["EquipDesc_2405189"]="A hero crafted from cardboard boxes. When you have a dream, it doesn't matter if it's made of cardboard or tape.",
    ["EquipDesc_2405190"]="Catching and breeding insects and witnessing the magic of their transformations during their fleeting lives.",
    ["EquipDesc_2405191"]="Frosted sweetness cools the summer heat, soothing and capturing summer memories.",
    ["EquipDesc_2405192"]="As starlight meets the sunrise and the desert finds the oasis, the nomadic artist's show goes on and on.",
    ["EquipDesc_2405193"]="Soft on one side, tough on the other—total cuteness and power!",
    ["EquipDesc_2405194"]="The most knowledgeable owl scholar, who's seen as much of the world as the books they've read.",
    ["EquipDesc_2405195"]="Decorated with coral and pearls, this outfit is perfect for a tide-spinning performance for the deep sea.",
    ["EquipDesc_2405199"]="The Larva costume with yellow stripes might just give you the power to spread joy!",
    ["EquipDesc_2405200"]="The Larva costume with red stripes might just give you the power to spread joy!",
    ["EquipDesc_2405201"]="This fancy gold-threaded robe screams luxury from miles away, almost like a dragon popping into the world.",
    ["EquipDesc_2405202"]="A sturdy yet lightweight professional ice hockey suit featuring protective armor for crucial body parts to maximize safety.",
    ["EquipDesc_2405203"]="Holding up a desire darker than the night beneath layers of raven feathers, weaving an unbreakable web of sin and love.",
    ["EquipDesc_2405204"]="The precious sincerity confined in a swan's body, still pulsating with love, ready to surrender everything.",
    ["EquipDesc_2405207"]="Dragon prints, check! Dragon balls, check! Dragon claws, check! Time to dress up as mighty dragons and greet the New Year!",
    ["EquipDesc_2405208"]="Recast from the remains of Vesper. It continues to stir the fear of life and death under Vesper's rule.",
    ["EquipDesc_2405209"]="An outfit of ocean blue adorned with starlit pearls, made by a designer who once crossed paths with merfolk in their youth.",
    ["EquipDesc_2405210"]="Polish those rainbow dreams and revisit childhood moments, rewinding back to the age of innocence.",
    ["EquipDesc_2405211"]="Following the impact of thunderous authority, the armor given by otherworldly deities has fallen into a sinister shade of black.",
    ["EquipDesc_2405212"]="Kenshiro's tight leather jacket he wore while traversing the post-nuclear world. <color=#FF0000>(Torn-away effect will be triggered when releasing normal attacks and skills.)</color>",
    ["EquipDesc_2405213"]="Bursting muscles shred the top apart, revealing scars in the shape of the North Star.",
    ["EquipDesc_2405214"]="The elegant attire Yuria wore when she became The Last Nanto General.",
    ["EquipDesc_2405216"]="Raoh's imposing armor. It showcases the legendary Ken-Oh's might and power.",
    ["EquipDesc_2405217"]="Raoh's ultimate physique is unveiled during intense battles.",
    ["EquipDesc_2405218"]="Mamiya's outfit. It's designed with maximum mobility in mind. <color=#FF0000>(Torn-away effect will be triggered when releasing normal attacks and skills.)</color>",
    ["EquipDesc_2405219"]="The armor of the Holy Emperor Thouzer. It conceals secrets beneath its surface.",
    ["EquipDesc_2405220"]="Rocking the MVP custom outfit to steal the stage! It's showtime!",
    ["EquipDesc_2405221"]="Neon lights, champagne, flowers, and beauties——It was the best of times, it was the worst of times.",
    ["EquipDesc_2405222"]="Use your textbook as a skateboard to discover the world!",
    ["EquipDesc_2405227"]="An outfit without any defense makes offense the best defense.",
    ["EquipDesc_2405228"]="Zeus was swayed by the golden belt and stopped aiding Troy; the blood-stained golden apple found its way into the goddess' hand.",
    ["EquipDesc_2405229"]="Jade branches as ornaments; moon and clouds as robes—tonight, the full moon shines forever.",
    ["EquipDesc_2405230"]="The maid outfit Rem wears at Roswaal Mansion proves she can handle any household task.",
    ["EquipDesc_2405231"]="The maid outfit Ram wears at Roswaal Mansion reflects her pride in being the big sister.",
    ["EquipDesc_2405232"]="Emilia's purple and white outfit showcases her lovely charm perfectly.",
    ["EquipDesc_2405233"]="This fancy dress really brings out her petite yet classy style.",
    ["EquipDesc_2405234"]="The outfit worn by Subaru Natsuki when arriving in another world. It's practical and perfect for actions.",
    ["EquipDesc_2405235"]="The outfit Subaru Natsuki wears as a servant showcases the neat cuts and details.",
    ["EquipDesc_2405236"]="Roswaal's outfit and his distinctive makeup really give him a striking appearance.",
    ["EquipDesc_2405237"]="Garfiel's outfit is considered his partner through battles in the past.",
    ["EquipDesc_2405238"]="Frederica's maid outfit at Roswaal Mansion. It's slightly longer compared to other maid outfits.",
    ["EquipDesc_2405239"]="The golden ratio of nitric acid and potassium carbonate—add just a bit of heat—BOOM!",
    ["EquipDesc_2405240"]="Armed with holy water and silver arrows, the vampire hunters are ready for action. Who's the outsider among us?\n<color=#FF0000>Note: This outfit has different forms for day and night. Refrain from peeking at its true appearance during the dark hours!</color>",
    ["EquipDesc_2405241"]="Armed with holy water and silver arrows, the vampire hunters are ready for action. Who's the outsider among us?\n<color=#FF0000>Note: This outfit has different forms for day and night. Refrain from peeking at its true appearance during the dark hours!</color>",
    ["EquipDesc_2405242"]="Day and night, the messenger of the underworld guides souls ceaselessly, praising death as though exalting rebirth.\n<color=#FF0000>(Note: When night falls, this costume receives Hade's blessing, appearing in a completely different look.)</color>",
    ["EquipDesc_2405243"]="Day and night, the messenger of the underworld guides souls ceaselessly, praising death as though exalting rebirth.\n<color=#FF0000>(Note: When night falls, this costume receives Hade's blessing, appearing in a completely different look.)</color>",
    ["EquipDesc_2405244"]="Cozy up in fuzz, and you'll survive winter without sleeping it away!",
    ["EquipDesc_2405245"]="Scales that grow and shed remind us of change and courage—may this costume inspire you to move against the tide.",
    ["EquipDesc_2405247"]="A testament to the artisan's unmatched skill. The garment sways with the wind like a celestial weaver, with brilliance cascading from every fold.",
    ["EquipDesc_2405248"]="Her song weaves through the void of night—poor traveler, your steps now falter toward the abyss...",
    ["EquipDesc_2405249"]="Spin and sway—at the end of the ball, we'll both find the warmest hearts.",
    ["EquipDesc_2405250"]="Thunder in its weave, wind in its breath—this armor awakens unshakable conviction.",
    ["EquipDesc_2405251"]="It's a sleepless, starlit night. The Phantom has already declared tonight's target. Now, the bit players are just on edge, waiting for that fleeting glimpse of movement.",
    ["EquipDesc_2405252"]="Staying graceful is a must for a great servant. Even in chaos, not a drop of blood or dust dares touch that uniform.",
    ["EquipDesc_2405253"]="A young captain aiming to conquer the seas, who seems to have gained the ocean's gift after that fateful storm...",
    ["EquipDesc_2405254"]="In the heart of flowering boughs stands a secret spring tended by a mysterious keeper. Countless travelers converge and depart, yet the shimmering mist never fades...",
    ["EquipDesc_2405255"]="A tribute to the fearless, to those who fought their way here. Your path leads to the stars and beyond.",
    ["EquipDesc_2405256"]="You don't need to glow to stand out—you'll always shine.",
    ["EquipDesc_2405257"]="The imposing Alexander—perfect as a guardian spirit for your home!",
    ["EquipDesc_2405259"]="The imposing Baoku Lee—perfect as a guardian spirit for your home!",
    ["EquipDesc_2405262"]="There's always one star at the party—whether it's on stage or on the streets.",
    ["EquipDesc_2405263"]="The sun may be veiled by momentary darkness, but it shall never fade.",
    ["EquipDesc_2405264"]="After a whole winter of training, Capoo's got the muscles it always wanted!",
    ["EquipDesc_2405265"]="Fix your cream lace shirt and throw on that candy wrapper coat. Don't sleep yet—it's candy time tonight!",
    ["EquipDesc_2405268"]="Welcome to the Wonder Circus, dear guest. Have fun tonight—here, laughter and fantasy come free of charge.",
    ["EquipDesc_2405269"]="Taichi's daily outfit—comfy and great for moving around, perfect for a soccer-loving kid.",
    ["EquipDesc_2405270"]="Mimi's daily outfit—cute and simple; every girl dreams of being a princess, right?",
    ["EquipDesc_2405271"]="Above the sacred altar of an ancient temple, armor hangs aloft in priestly song—patient, silent, yearning to offer its master one more glorious triumph.",
    ["EquipDesc_240527102"]="Above the sacred altar of an ancient temple, armor hangs aloft in priestly song—patient, silent, yearning to offer its master one more glorious triumph.",
    ["EquipDesc_2405272"]="No more waiting in this vibrant paradise! Take off your headphones, hand over the doll, and learn from the fairy of love, holding on to a midsummer dream.",
    ["EquipDesc_2405275"]="Put on the unicorn's gift—soft and warm, just like the winters shared with everyone.",
    ["EquipDesc_2405276"]="Creatures on land always try to read the sea's shifting emotions to survive in its grasp. Yet who among them truly understands its joy and fury?\n(A special effect triggers upon entering battle!)",
    ["EquipDesc_240527602"]="Creatures on land always try to read the sea's shifting emotions to survive in its grasp. Yet who among them truly understands its joy and fury?\n(A special effect triggers upon entering battle!)",
    ["EquipDesc_2405277"]="Wataru Ikusabe's combat attire—whenever people see it, they know the savior of Mt. Soukai has arrived.",
    ["EquipDesc_2405279"]="\"For the peace of our city! For the sake of every rumbling belly! Destroyer of hunger—the celestial Gourmet Rider takes the stage!\"",
    ["EquipDesc_2405281"]="The bitter wind blows on, ushering winter into spring. In its wake comes warmth, melting mountain snows and awakening blossoms across the wild.",
    ["EquipDesc_2406001"]="A suit that belongs to the mysterious Alien Bemular. There is a light indicator on the chest for energy indication.\nCan be dismantled to get <color=#da696f>Seals of Light</color>, which can be used to exchange rare items in the Store of Light. <color=#da696f>Seals of Light</color> will be recycled when the ULTRAMAN event is over.",
    ["EquipDesc_2406002"]="A suit that belongs to Ultraman. You may see his complete figure in the Giants of Light Memorial.\nCan be dismantled to get <color=#da696f>Seals of Light</color>, which can be used to exchange rare items in the Store of Light. <color=#da696f>Seals of Light</color> will be recycled when the ULTRAMAN event is over.",
    ["EquipDesc_2406003"]="A suit that belongs to Seiji Hokuto. The armor symbolizes the meaning of Ace.\nCan be dismantled to get <color=#da696f>Seals of Light</color>, which can be used to exchange rare items in the Store of Light. <color=#da696f>Seals of Light</color> will be recycled when the ULTRAMAN event is over.",
    ["EquipDesc_2406004"]="A suit that belongs to Dan Moroboshi. It has excellent single-target damage-dealing ability and defensive ability.\nCan be dismantled to get <color=#da696f>Seals of Light</color>, which can be used to exchange rare items in the Store of Light. <color=#da696f>Seals of Light</color> will be recycled when the ULTRAMAN event is over.",
    ["EquipDesc_2406005"]="A suit that belongs to Shin Hayata. The armor and the weapon system are all upgraded.\nCan be dismantled to get <color=#da696f>Seals of Light</color>, which can be used to exchange rare items in the Store of Light. <color=#da696f>Seals of Light</color> will be recycled when the ULTRAMAN event is over.",
    ["EquipDesc_2406006"]="A suit that belongs to Jack. Built on the technology of the Yapool.\nCan be dismantled to get <color=#da696f>Seals of Light</color>, which can be used to exchange rare items in the Store of Light. <color=#da696f>Seals of Light</color> will be recycled when the ULTRAMAN event is over.",
    ["EquipDesc_2406007"]="Kotaro Higashi's suit that can effectively keep his abnormal power under control.",
    ["EquipDesc_2406008"]="A suit in the Ultra Dynamite mode. Every crack in the plate is bursting with blazing flames.",
    ["EquipDesc_2406009"]="A suit that belongs to Alien Adacic. The clamp on the arm can shoot out an electrical beam.\nCan be dismantled to get <color=#da696f>Seals of Light</color>, which can be used to exchange rare items in the Store of Light. <color=#da696f>Seals of Light</color> will be recycled when the ULTRAMAN event is over.",
    ["EquipDesc_2406010"]="It's said that a kidult can wear this to enter a forest of fantasy, which only exists in fairy tales.",
    ["EquipDesc_2406011"]="<color=#FF0000>(Unisex)</color> A white color doggie costume based on the appearance of the Watchdog Man",
    ["EquipDesc_3000001"]="A bracelet that is only provided to members of the Eden Group.",
    ["EquipDesc_3101001"]="A brooch that can endow its wearer with certain abilities.",
    ["EquipDesc_3101002"]="Magical earrings that boost the wearer's mental capacity.",
    ["EquipDesc_3101003"]="A ring with a mysterious magic power that increases its wearer's strength.",
    ["EquipDesc_3101004"]="An accessory used to decorate clothing and fabric.",
    ["EquipDesc_3101005"]="A magical necklace that makes its wearer feel full of vitality.",
    ["EquipDesc_3101006"]="A beautiful cross-shaped bracelet with divine blessing.",
    ["EquipDesc_3101007"]="A brooch favored by those who love to adventure. It provides a small Dexterity boost.",
    ["EquipDesc_3101008"]="Earrings favored by those who love to adventure. They provide a small Intelligence boost.",
    ["EquipDesc_3101009"]="A ring favored by those who love to adventure. It provides a small Strength boost.",
    ["EquipDesc_3101010"]="A pin favored by those who love to adventure. It provides a small Agility boost.",
    ["EquipDesc_3101011"]="A necklace favored by those who love to adventure. It provides a small Vitality boost.",
    ["EquipDesc_3101012"]="A bracelet favored by those who love to adventure. It provides a small Luck boost.",
    ["EquipDesc_3101013"]="A brooch favored by veterans. It provides a considerable Dexterity boost.",
    ["EquipDesc_3101014"]="Earrings favored by veterans. They provide a considerable Intelligence boost.",
    ["EquipDesc_3101015"]="A ring favored by veterans. It provides a considerable Strength boost.",
    ["EquipDesc_3101016"]="A pin favored by veterans. It provides a considerable Agility boost.",
    ["EquipDesc_3101017"]="A necklace favored by veterans. It provides a considerable Vitality boost.",
    ["EquipDesc_3101018"]="A bracelet favored by veterans. It provides a considerable Luck boost.",
    ["EquipDesc_3101019"]="A pretty ring made of flowers.",
    ["EquipDesc_3101020"]="A cursed ring covered with thorns.",
    ["EquipDesc_3101021"]="Designed to look like a four-leaf clover, the green represents a verdant spring.",
    ["EquipDesc_3101022"]="A ring representing the strong will and determination required to follow the path of priesthood. It contains the power to repel the forces of evil.",
    ["EquipDesc_3101023"]="A ring inlaid with a giant gemstone.",
    ["EquipDesc_3101024"]="A gold ring worn by warriors.",
    ["EquipDesc_3101025"]="A small brooch featuring a wooly mammoth design.",
    ["EquipDesc_3101026"]="A necklace once worn by the goddess Freyja. This holy item grants its wearer beauty and powerful abilities.",
    ["EquipDesc_3101027"]="A brooch that can only be used by warriors who have won glory. It provides a considerable Dexterity boost.",
    ["EquipDesc_3101028"]="Earrings that can only be used by warriors who have won glory. They provide a considerable Intelligence boost.",
    ["EquipDesc_3101029"]="A ring that can only be used by warriors who have won glory. It provides a considerable Strength boost.",
    ["EquipDesc_3101030"]="A pin that can only be used by warriors who have won glory. It provides a considerable Agility boost.",
    ["EquipDesc_3101031"]="A necklace that can only be used by warriors who have won glory. It provides a considerable Vitality boost.",
    ["EquipDesc_3101032"]="A bracelet that can only be used by warriors who have won glory. It provides a considerable Luck boost.",
    ["EquipDesc_3101033"]="An item that makes people shout out, improving their mood when they are down. It seems to be able to inspire people.",
    ["EquipDesc_3101034"]="A ring that has different special abilities depending on its form.",
    ["EquipDesc_3101035"]="A bracelet that has patterns similar to those of the master of time.",
    ["EquipDesc_3101036"]="A ring symbolizing allegiance to the Rune-Midgarts Kingdom",
    ["EquipDesc_3101037"]="A pendant designed specially for guardians of time so that they can change the time at will.",
    ["EquipDesc_3101038"]="A bracelet sealed by Hellion gems that can purify evil power.",
    ["EquipDesc_3101039"]="A relic left behind by a high priest who saved people in an ancient war.",
    ["EquipDesc_3101040"]="A magic ring developed by Geffen. It increases one's abilities.",
    ["EquipDesc_3101041"]="A ring representing the strong will and determination required to follow the path of priesthood. It contains the power to repel the forces of evil.",
    ["EquipDesc_3101042"]="A ring that makes its wearer run faster but also generates a considerable degree of repulsion.",
    ["EquipDesc_3101043"]="A seal created by purifying a Peuz runestone.",
    ["EquipDesc_3101044"]="A badge made of magic wisteria that is said to help its wearer achieve a high level of focus.",
    ["EquipDesc_3101045"]="A magnificent golden ring imbued with the power of the wind.",
    ["EquipDesc_3101046"]="A beautiful cross-shaped necklace with divine blessing.",
    ["EquipDesc_3101047"]="The ring of Aegir, god of the sea. It grants its wearer the power of the ocean.",
    ["EquipDesc_3101048"]="Purportedly a relic of a famed dual-wielding assassin.",
    ["EquipDesc_3101049"]="The accessory symbolizing the Marquis identity will enhance its wearer’s Dexterity, making him or her as dexterous as a clear stream or river.",
    ["EquipDesc_3101050"]="One of the items given to members of the Morroc delegation.",
    ["EquipDesc_3101051"]="A ring with a divine might that senses and enhances certain abilities.",
    ["EquipDesc_3101052"]="A pin made from the tears of a water spirit.",
    ["EquipDesc_3101053"]="A brooch conferred to warriors by the royal family. It provides a major Dexterity boost.",
    ["EquipDesc_3101054"]="Earrings conferred to warriors by the royal family. They provide a major Intelligence boost.",
    ["EquipDesc_3101055"]="A ring conferred to warriors by the royal family. It provides a major Strength boost.",
    ["EquipDesc_3101056"]="A pin conferred to warriors by the royal family. It provides a major Agility boost.",
    ["EquipDesc_3101057"]="A necklace conferred to warriors by the royal family. It provides a major Vitality boost.",
    ["EquipDesc_3101058"]="A bracelet conferred to warriors by the royal family. It provides a major Luck boost.",
    ["EquipDesc_3101059"]="A replica of the legendary ring of an ancient wise king who used to communicate with animals. Whoever wears it will learn the languages of other worlds.",
    ["EquipDesc_3101060"]="The accessory symbolizing the Marquis identity will enhance its wearer’s Intelligence so that he or she can have the wisdom of a sage.",
    ["EquipDesc_3101061"]="A shining ring with a mysterious power. The owner is said to be a religious leader.",
    ["EquipDesc_3101062"]="Purportedly a relic of the Icarus Guild, home to many a famed archer.",
    ["EquipDesc_3101063"]="It is said that Reicht made this necklace by gathering the resentment of the dead.",
    ["EquipDesc_3101064"]="A ring that makes its wearer realize their potential.",
    ["EquipDesc_3101065"]="Reputedly once belonged to a famed assassin in ancient times",
    ["EquipDesc_3101066"]="A man who was born under a cursed star made this necklace to protect himself. It has been enchanted with many spells to seal the power of curses.",
    ["EquipDesc_3101067"]="The only item that can cure Dullahan's poison.",
    ["EquipDesc_3101068"]="A crescent-shaped pin that shines with a golden light.",
    ["EquipDesc_3101069"]="An accessory used to summon the goddess of prayers.",
    ["EquipDesc_3101070"]="The ring of an ancient king.",
    ["EquipDesc_3101071"]="Purportedly a relic of a famed dual-wielding assassin.",
    ["EquipDesc_3101072"]="Wings that bless the faithful.",
    ["EquipDesc_3101073"]="A very ancient necklace.",
    ["EquipDesc_3101074"]="An accessory made out of moonlight essence.",
    ["EquipDesc_3101075"]="A chain fastened around the necks of Matyrs. It is said to be related to their speed.",
    ["EquipDesc_3101076"]="A necklace that Goibne made for a bet against his rival, Dulb.",
    ["EquipDesc_3101077"]="A ring that Goibne made for a bet against his rival, Dulb.",
    ["EquipDesc_3101078"]="A brooch made of bright silver.",
    ["EquipDesc_3101079"]="Earrings made of small bells that chime.",
    ["EquipDesc_3101080"]="A brooch that seems to be tangled up like a knot.",
    ["EquipDesc_3101081"]="A brooch made out of white dove feathers.",
    ["EquipDesc_3101082"]="A brooch used by the Imperial Guard. It provides a major Dexterity boost.",
    ["EquipDesc_3101083"]="Earrings used by the Imperial Guard. They provide a major Intelligence boost.",
    ["EquipDesc_3101084"]="A ring used by the Imperial Guard. It provides a major Strength boost.",
    ["EquipDesc_3101085"]="A pin used by the Imperial Guard. It provides a major Agility boost.",
    ["EquipDesc_3101086"]="A necklace used by the Imperial Guard. It provides a major Vitality boost.",
    ["EquipDesc_3101087"]="A bracelet used by the Imperial Guard. It provides a major Luck boost.",
    ["EquipDesc_3101088"]="A brooch used by the lord of a kingdom. It provides a major Dexterity boost.",
    ["EquipDesc_3101089"]="Earrings used by the lord of a kingdom. They provide a major Intelligence boost.",
    ["EquipDesc_3101090"]="A ring used by the lord of a kingdom. It provides a major Strength boost.",
    ["EquipDesc_3101091"]="A pin used by the lord of a kingdom. It provides a major Agility boost.",
    ["EquipDesc_3101092"]="A necklace used by the lord of a kingdom. It provides a major Vitality boost.",
    ["EquipDesc_3101093"]="A bracelet used by the lord of a kingdom. It provides a major Luck boost.",
    ["EquipDesc_3101102"]="A ring passed down from generation to generation by the viscount of a kingdom. It provides a major Strength boost.",
    ["EquipDesc_3101103"]="A pin passed down from generation to generation by the viscount of a kingdom. It provides a major Agility boost.",
    ["EquipDesc_3101104"]="A necklace passed down from generation to generation by the viscount of a kingdom. It provides a major Vitality boost.",
    ["EquipDesc_3101105"]="A bracelet passed down from generation to generation by the viscount of a kingdom. It provides a major Luck boost.",
    ["EquipDesc_3101106"]="A neck ring made from a monster's spine. It has no superfluous decorations, and even the original structure of the bone can be seen from it.",
    ["EquipDesc_3101107"]="An armband carved with white feathers of spread wings. You can feel an unbelievable power housed within.",
    ["EquipDesc_3101108"]="No one understands the murderous intentions hidden within this exquisite necklace.",
    ["EquipDesc_3101109"]="An ancient relic with a storied history. It's said that the gemstone inlaid on the ring was an item used by the royal family, though later on, it was given to a certain family who was loyal to the crown...",
    ["EquipDesc_3101114"]="A necklace corrupted by darkness. It once symbolized the most pious faith.",
    ["EquipDesc_3101115"]="Though it was originally used as a torture device, for some reason it gradually became the most popular style of jewelry...",
    ["EquipDesc_3101116"]="The accessory symbolizing the Marquis identity will provide its wearer with the power of a giant bear and enhance their strength.",
    ["EquipDesc_3101117"]="The accessory symbolizing the Marquis identity will enhance its wearer’s Agility, making them all move like the wind.",
    ["EquipDesc_3101191"]="A necklace owned by the Chosen One. Represents the highest power.",
    ["EquipDesc_3101192"]="A thumb ring passed from generation to generation in the royal family, bestowing its owner with power and duty.",
    ["EquipDesc_3101193"]="A necklace covered in dust, but its value can still be perceived.",
    ["EquipDesc_3101194"]="A ring owned by the wielder of power, a symbol of the royal family.",
    ["EquipDesc_3101195"]="A silent and noiseless neck ring. It makes no sound even if it is dropped to the floor. Wearing it makes one feel their footsteps have become quieter.",
    ["EquipDesc_3101196"]="A brooch made from glass. Becomes incredibly clear and transparent after careful cleaning, as though it does not exist.",
    ["EquipDesc_3101209"]="A pure white bow tie. Light, comfortable, and looks dreamy.",
    ["EquipDesc_3101210"]="A ring with a spiritual aura. Legend has it that it is a goddess's treasure.",
    ["EquipDesc_3101211"]="A brooch in the design of green wheat.",
    ["EquipDesc_3101212"]="A ring in the design of a white dragon with its head attached to its tail. It seems to hide a special meaning.",
    ["EquipDesc_3101213"]="A neck ring with thorns and possessing unclean powers.",
    ["EquipDesc_3101214"]="A cursed brooch. After putting it on, the wearer will feel intense negative emotions.",
    ["EquipDesc_3101215"]="Legend has it that this is a sacred relic of the Eclipse clan. A gemmed necklace made of magical blue crystals.",
    ["EquipDesc_3101216"]="A sapphire brooch in the shape of a sky-blue Lunatic silhouette.",
    ["EquipDesc_3101217"]="Earrings made from Eclipse fur. These lovely plush earrings have a faint blue luster.",
    ["EquipDesc_3101218"]="A silver Eclipse-shaped ring that exudes an air of cuteness.",
    ["EquipDesc_3101219"]="A silver bracelet decorated with rabbit ears, and is engraved with mysterious patterns that seem to form some kind of ancient incantation.",
    ["EquipDesc_3101220"]="A necklace made of blue Lunatic fur. It seems to be a token of love belonging to some noble.",
    ["EquipDesc_3101221"]="An old ring with a colorful luster and engraved with patterns of Dragon Flies.",
    ["EquipDesc_3101222"]="A bracelet made of a special material as light as a Dragon Fly's wings.",
    ["EquipDesc_3101223"]="Earrings made of dark metal and inlaid with rubies as bright as the sun.",
    ["EquipDesc_3101224"]="A silvery gray bracelet that exudes a dark aura and is engraved with a Ghostring. Legend has it that this accessory once belonged to a killer.",
    ["EquipDesc_3101225"]="A ring with no owner, exuding a murderous aura. It seems to be possessed by countless ghosts.",
    ["EquipDesc_3101226"]="A brooch flowing with energy. It looks like a King Poring crown.",
    ["EquipDesc_3101227"]="A golden ring containing infinite hidden power that perhaps originates from the forefathers of the Poring Kingdom.",
    ["EquipDesc_3101228"]="A necklace worn by the apostles of King Poring, containing the pure power of faith.",
    ["EquipDesc_3101257"]="A gorgeous gold bracelet inlaid with a Toad-shaped pendant.",
    ["EquipDesc_3101258"]="Glistening and translucent crystal earrings that look like two frog legs carved from ice and snow.",
    ["EquipDesc_3101259"]="Shaped like a pair of lobster nippers. Shines with red and white lights when shaken.",
    ["EquipDesc_3101260"]="A ring made from lobster shell. It is covered with lethal blades, which seem to be used for both decoration as well as some other purpose.",
    ["EquipDesc_3101261"]="A brooch shaped like an adorable Deviruchi, and emitting a faint purple light.",
    ["EquipDesc_3101262"]="A black metal ring that appears to be engraved with a Deviling's curse.",
    ["EquipDesc_3101263"]="A silver ring which has been kissed by an angel. Contains sacred power.",
    ["EquipDesc_3101264"]="A brooch which emits a golden aura of light, and possesses an inexplicable sense of holiness.",
    ["EquipDesc_3101361"]="The accessory symbolizing the Marquis identity will enhance its wearer’s Vitality, making them more indestructible as it is protected by the breath of life.",
    ["EquipDesc_3101362"]="The accessory symbolizing the Marquis identity will enhance its wearer’s Luck, making them blessed by the gods.",
    ["EquipDesc_3101363"]="Gold ornaments decorated with the hand of the goddess, wrapped around the neck of the wearer, is a gentle touch, or choke the throat.",
    ["EquipDesc_3101364"]="Someone once embodied evil thoughts, and compressed into a gem sealed on the ring, hoping to borrow its power to fuel the magic, now the ring has fallen, but the maker of the ring is nowhere to be found.",
    ["EquipDesc_3101365"]="The earrings are stored with a thick fog, and the wearer's face is draped by the fog just like wearing a light veil.",
    ["EquipDesc_3101366"]="A necklace that is imbued with the power of life and grows leaves naturally on its chain. Should those who seek the original life also seek to give life to dead things?",
    ["EquipDesc_3101367"]="An ornament that exists in a subtle way and can change shape easily, but is mostly shown in the most space-saving form.",
    ["EquipDesc_3101368"]="An accessory that displays the wearer's justice and balance. However, if there is nothing to measure, the scale will naturally tilt toward the heavier side.",
    ["EquipDesc_3101413"]="A decoration blessed with runes. With an appearance similar to the sword of Tyr, the God of War, it carries heartfelt wishes for victory.",
    ["EquipDesc_3101414"]="A creepy ring. Gaze into the gem on it, and you will hear eerie whispers...",
    ["EquipDesc_3101415"]="Look at the blue moonlight butterfly, it looks so real that it might fly away at any second.",
    ["EquipDesc_3101416"]="On the tiny whistle hanged by a somehow aged silver chain, someone carved \"L&K\" with clumsy hands. A token of affection left by lovers, maybe?",
    ["EquipDesc_3101417"]="A brooch passed down from generation to generation by the duke of a kingdom. It provides a major Dexterity boost.",
    ["EquipDesc_3101418"]="An earring passed down from generation to generation by the duke of a kingdom. It provides a major Intelligence boost.",
    ["EquipDesc_3101419"]="A ring passed down from generation to generation by the duke of a kingdom. It provides a major Strength boost.",
    ["EquipDesc_3101420"]="A pin passed down from generation to generation by the duke of a kingdom. It provides a major Agility boost.",
    ["EquipDesc_3101421"]="A necklace passed down from generation to generation by the duke of a kingdom. It provides a major Vitality boost.",
    ["EquipDesc_3101422"]="A bracelet passed down from generation to generation by the duke of a kingdom. It provides a major Luck boost.",
    ["EquipDesc_3101423"]="With the ring twisted, is the promise back then broken, too?",
    ["EquipDesc_3101424"]="Treasure recovered from a sunken ship, supposedly. It seems to have some ages behind, but is undoubtedly made from gold, and worth a fortune.",
    ["EquipDesc_3101475"]="A brooch with the power of an otherworldly ancient god. It provides a major Dexterity boost.",
    ["EquipDesc_3101476"]="An earring with the power of an otherworldly ancient god. It provides a major Intelligence boost.",
    ["EquipDesc_3101477"]="A ring with the power of an otherworldly ancient god. It provides a major Strength boost.",
    ["EquipDesc_3101478"]="A pin with the power of an otherworldly ancient god. It provides a major Agility boost.",
    ["EquipDesc_3101479"]="A necklace with the power of an otherworldly ancient god. It provides a major Vitality boost.",
    ["EquipDesc_3101480"]="A bracelet with the power of an otherworldly ancient god. It provides a major Luck boost.",
    ["EquipDesc_3101481"]="The traditional mask of the Utan tribe. Made of branches and buds of Yggdrasil. Like an amulet, it is an important object that cannot be separated from its owner.",
    ["EquipDesc_3101482"]="A necklace made of animal skeletons, handed down from generation to generation by the wizards of the Utan tribe. It is also the last barrier for guarding the Utan tribe's Sacred Relic.",
    ["EquipDesc_3101483"]="The spine of the coelacanth, I don't know which genius first came up with the idea to comb hair with it.",
    ["EquipDesc_3101484"]="Have you ever seen a fish that eats cats?",
    ["EquipDesc_3101485"]="Shellfish that inhabit deep under the Styx occasionally fall as inadvertent prey to coelacanths. Their gorgeous appearance makes them popular among collectors, and jewelries made from them can be quite unique.",
    ["EquipDesc_3101486"]="Eyeballs are the most precious part of the coelacanth, and bracelets made of fish eye beads are even more valuable.",
    ["EquipDesc_3101543"]="I must admit, only this communication device has realized the true definition of mobility. I'm thinking of developing a handheld communication device. Perhaps I will call it... mobile phone? — Irumina",
    ["EquipDesc_3101544"]="Are you tired of teary eyes when facing the sandy winds? Do you want to travel across the Sograt Desert without getting bothered by the sand? Get your hands on these windproof goggles now!",
    ["EquipDesc_3101545"]="Strangely enough, humans always find that all non-humanoid creatures are adorable.",
    ["EquipDesc_3101546"]="After fine carving and polishing, precious gems shimmer radiantly under the sunlight.",
    ["EquipDesc_3101547"]="Even Odin traded his right eye for wisdom. What price are you willing to pay?",
    ["EquipDesc_3101548"]="The armlet of the Observation possesses captivating magic power.",
    ["EquipDesc_3101549"]="A gift from the Lord's Mansion in Schwarzwald Republic to Juno College Students, a ring crafted with the most cutting-edge Republican technology. Increases its wearer's STR.",
    ["EquipDesc_3101550"]="A gift from the Lord's Mansion in Schwarzwald Republic to Juno College Students, a brooch crafted with the most cutting-edge Republican technology. Increases its wearer's DEX.",
    ["EquipDesc_3101551"]="A gift from the Lord's Mansion in Schwarzwald Republic to Juno College Students, an earring crafted with the most cutting-edge Republican technology. Increases its wearer's INT.",
    ["EquipDesc_3101552"]="A gift from the Lord's Mansion in Schwarzwald Republic to Juno College Students, a necklace crafted with the most cutting-edge Republican technology. Increases its wearer's VIT.",
    ["EquipDesc_3101553"]="A gift from the Lord's Mansion in Schwarzwald Republic to Juno College Students, a bracelet crafted with the most cutting-edge Republican technology. Increases its wearer's LUK.",
    ["EquipDesc_3101554"]="A gift from the Lord's Mansion in Schwarzwald Republic to Juno College Students, a pin crafted with the most cutting-edge Republican technology. Increases its wearer's AGI.",
    ["EquipDesc_3101637"]="A brooch created with magical guidance technology at its core that significantly increases the wearer's DEX.",
    ["EquipDesc_3101638"]="An earring created with magical guidance technology at its core that significantly increases the wearer's INT.",
    ["EquipDesc_3101639"]="A ring created with magical guidance technology at its core that significantly increases the wearer's STR.",
    ["EquipDesc_3101640"]="A pin created with magical guidance technology at its core that significantly increases the wearer's AGI.",
    ["EquipDesc_3101641"]="A necklace created with magical guidance technology at its core that significantly increases the wearer's VIT.",
    ["EquipDesc_3101642"]="A bracelet created with magical guidance technology at its core that significantly increases the wearer's LUK.",
    ["EquipDesc_3101701"]="Ultra-light gloves made with the newest materials.",
    ["EquipDesc_3101702"]="A small bouquet with the pattern of a pinguicula.",
    ["EquipDesc_3101703"]="A precious pendant bestowed on the safety managers of Einbroch mine, but only a few have been issued.",
    ["EquipDesc_3101704"]="A precious epaulet bestowed on the safety managers of Einbroch mine, but only a few have been issued.",
    ["EquipDesc_3101729"]="The component of Vesper's central system in its chest armor. This is the first processor out of the four.",
    ["EquipDesc_3101730"]="The component of Vesper's central system in its chest armor. This is the second processor out of the four.",
    ["EquipDesc_3101731"]="The component of Vesper's central system in its chest armor. This is the third processor out of the four.",
    ["EquipDesc_3101732"]="The component of Vesper's central system in its chest armor. This is the fourth processor out of the four.",
    ["EquipDesc_3101789"]="A brooch inscribed with alchemical runes that significantly increases the wearer's DEX.",
    ["EquipDesc_3101790"]="An earring inscribed with alchemical runes that significantly increases the wearer's INT.",
    ["EquipDesc_3101791"]="A ring inscribed with alchemical runes that significantly increases the wearer's STR.",
    ["EquipDesc_3101792"]="A pin inscribed with alchemical runes that significantly increases the wearer's AGI.",
    ["EquipDesc_3101793"]="A necklace inscribed with alchemical runes that significantly increases the wearer's VIT.",
    ["EquipDesc_3101794"]="A bracelet inscribed with alchemical runes that significantly increases the wearer's LUK.",
    ["EquipDesc_3101811"]="Blended from various metals and ores, a rare treasure that could only be born from Arunafeltz, the kingdom known for its unmatchable alchemy.",
    ["EquipDesc_3101891"]="From the humblest tree grows a fruit that radiates the immense vitality of heaven and earth, living through countless changing seasons.",
    ["EquipDesc_3101892"]="A ring made from the sprout of Yggdrasil, giving off a mysterious aura.",
    ["EquipDesc_3101893"]="Gloves infused with dark power, their threads like serpents of magic, binding the will of lifeless dolls to the puppeteer's heart.",
    ["EquipDesc_3101894"]="A beautiful ring engraved with a cross, said to have belonged to a leader with a special mission.",
    ["EquipDesc_3102011"]="Purportedly a relic of the Icarus Guild, home to many a famed archer.",
    ["EquipDesc_3102012"]="A silver pocket watch with a chain.",
    ["EquipDesc_3102013"]="Gloves that librarians love to use.",
    ["EquipDesc_3102014"]="The belt worn by a famous ninja. The ornate patterns glow with a mysterious light that makes it look enchanted.",
    ["EquipDesc_3102015"]="Red silk imbued with a saint's strong desire to seal the forces of evil.",
    ["EquipDesc_3102016"]="A ring inscribed with mysterious words. Its beauty is bewitching.",
    ["EquipDesc_3102017"]="A ring that enables its wearer to sprint at full speed but also generates a considerable degree of reaction force.",
    ["EquipDesc_3102018"]="Made from the horns of a captured ox, it gives its wearer a feeling of untamed animal strength.",
    ["EquipDesc_3102019"]="Gloves used by the top palace chef. They give the wearer a small taste of the dexterity that earned him such fame.",
    ["EquipDesc_3102020"]="A brooch that can endow its wearer with a certain abilities.",
    ["EquipDesc_3102021"]="A blue ring engraved with mysterious runes, which glow and give off a mysterious energy.",
    ["EquipDesc_3102022"]="Blue earrings engraved with mysterious runes, which glow and give off a mysterious energy.",
    ["EquipDesc_3102023"]="A pin made out of processed Bradium.",
    ["EquipDesc_3102024"]="A brooch that can endow its wearer with certain abilities.",
    ["EquipDesc_3102025"]="A gold ring.",
    ["EquipDesc_3102026"]="A silver ring.",
    ["EquipDesc_3201001"]="A beginner's manual containing basic knowledge about methods to increase Strength and Vitality.",
    ["EquipDesc_3201002"]="A beginner's manual containing basic knowledge about methods to increase Strength and Luck.",
    ["EquipDesc_3201003"]="A beginner's manual containing basic knowledge about methods to increase Dexterity and Intelligence.",
    ["EquipDesc_3201004"]="A beginner's manual containing basic knowledge about methods to increase Vitality and Intelligence.",
    ["EquipDesc_3201005"]="A beginner's manual containing basic knowledge about methods to increase Luck and Agility.",
    ["EquipDesc_3201006"]="A beginner's manual containing basic knowledge about methods to increase Dexterity and Agility.",
    ["EquipDesc_3201007"]="A manual carried by those who love to adventure. It is particularly useful for enhancing Strength and Vitality.",
    ["EquipDesc_3201008"]="A manual carried by those who love to adventure. It is particularly useful for enhancing Strength and Luck.",
    ["EquipDesc_3201009"]="A manual carried by those who love to adventure. It is particularly useful for enhancing Dexterity and Intelligence.",
    ["EquipDesc_3201010"]="A manual carried by those who love to adventure. It is particularly useful for enhancing Vitality and Intelligence.",
    ["EquipDesc_3201011"]="A manual carried by those who love to adventure. It is particularly useful for enhancing Luck and Agility.",
    ["EquipDesc_3201012"]="A manual carried by those who love to adventure. It is particularly useful for enhancing Dexterity and Agility.",
    ["EquipDesc_3201013"]="A manual commonly used by veterans. It is particularly useful for enhancing Strength and Vitality.",
    ["EquipDesc_3201014"]="A manual commonly used by veterans. It is particularly useful for enhancing Strength and Luck.",
    ["EquipDesc_3201015"]="A manual commonly used by veterans. It is particularly useful for enhancing Dexterity and Intelligence.",
    ["EquipDesc_3201016"]="A manual commonly used by veterans. It is particularly useful for enhancing Vitality and Intelligence.",
    ["EquipDesc_3201017"]="A manual commonly used by veterans. It is particularly useful for enhancing Luck and Agility.",
    ["EquipDesc_3201018"]="A manual commonly used by veterans. It is particularly useful for enhancing Dexterity and Agility.",
    ["EquipDesc_3201019"]="A black-winged pendant that has a mysterious power.",
    ["EquipDesc_3201020"]="A seemingly long-forgotten bookmark. The leaves are very dry, so take care in case it crumbles.",
    ["EquipDesc_3201021"]="Sacred incense that grants good luck.",
    ["EquipDesc_3201022"]="A figure that shows the marquis identity will enhance Strength and Vitality. Knights of Sword and Shield represent steadfastness and glory.",
    ["EquipDesc_3201023"]="A record of the canyon mission. Automatically disappears when the time is up.",
    ["EquipDesc_3201024"]="Automatically disappears when you get the certificate proving that the quest has been completed.",
    ["EquipDesc_3201025"]="Seems to be part of the vesper bell that is purportedly able to stimulate magic.",
    ["EquipDesc_3201026"]="A figure that shows the marquis identity will enhance Strength and Luck. Hammer Knights represent supreme power.",
    ["EquipDesc_3201027"]="A warrior's medal of honor that greatly boosts Strength and Vitality.",
    ["EquipDesc_3201028"]="A warrior's medal of honor that greatly boosts Strength and Luck.",
    ["EquipDesc_3201029"]="A warrior's medal of honor that greatly boosts Dexterity and Intelligence.",
    ["EquipDesc_3201030"]="A warrior's medal of honor that greatly boosts Vitality and Intelligence.",
    ["EquipDesc_3201031"]="A warrior's medal of honor that greatly boosts Luck and Agility.",
    ["EquipDesc_3201032"]="A warrior's medal of honor that greatly boosts Dexterity and Agility.",
    ["EquipDesc_3201033"]="A figure that shows the marquis identity will enhance Dexterity and Intelligence. Staff-wielding sages represent the surge of magic.",
    ["EquipDesc_3201034"]="A pendant that promotes harmony.",
    ["EquipDesc_3201035"]="A figure that shows the marquis identity will enhance Vitality and Intelligence. Chanting men represent the wisdom of omniscience.",
    ["EquipDesc_3201036"]="An accessory that instantly makes a beast look more majestic when hung from its neck.",
    ["EquipDesc_3201037"]="A figure that shows the marquis identity will enhance Luck and Agility. Hidden Rangers represent dexterity and tact.",
    ["EquipDesc_3201038"]="An orb filled with liquid of unknown powers.",
    ["EquipDesc_3201039"]="A bracelet sealed by Hellion gems that can purify evil power.",
    ["EquipDesc_3201040"]="The ring rumored to have been worn by a famed bard. It is adorned with an exquisite wing motif.",
    ["EquipDesc_3201041"]="A red crystal ball that preserves the power of fire within it.",
    ["EquipDesc_3201042"]="A worn gold ring that is said to have once been owned by a saint.",
    ["EquipDesc_3201043"]="A figure that shows the marquis identity will enhance Dexterity and Agility. Crossbow wielders represent precision and ease.",
    ["EquipDesc_3201044"]="A purple gemstone ring that is given to priests in training.",
    ["EquipDesc_3201045"]="A necklace with the blessing of Luna.",
    ["EquipDesc_3201046"]="A brooch made of feathers rich in magic. People with limited ability will see the feathers come to life and twitch if they wear it.",
    ["EquipDesc_3201047"]="A doll made in the likeness of owls, which can be hang everywhere you want, as long as they don't get in the way.",
    ["EquipDesc_3201048"]="Set with kite shaped gemstones, the small shield likewise becomes a spiritual tool for protecting its master.",
    ["EquipDesc_3201049"]="A figure conferred to warriors by the royal family. It greatly boosts Strength and Vitality.",
    ["EquipDesc_3201050"]="A figure conferred to warriors by the royal family. It greatly boosts Strength and Luck.",
    ["EquipDesc_3201051"]="A figure conferred to warriors by the royal family. It greatly boosts Dexterity and Intelligence.",
    ["EquipDesc_3201052"]="A figure conferred to warriors by the royal family. It greatly boosts Vitality and Intelligence.",
    ["EquipDesc_3201053"]="A figure conferred to warriors by the royal family. It greatly boosts Luck and Agility.",
    ["EquipDesc_3201054"]="A figure conferred to warriors by the royal family. It greatly boosts Dexterity and Agility.",
    ["EquipDesc_3201055"]="Fate is unknown when the coin is tossed, Fate is decided when the coin lands on the ground.",
    ["EquipDesc_3201056"]="A bow tie made of the pure white feathers of the thirteen extinct and feathered beasts. The wearer will feel the fierce wind pass through his heart.",
    ["EquipDesc_3201057"]="A special nameplate handed out by the Mercenary Association, indicating recognition of the bearer.",
    ["EquipDesc_3201058"]="A pendant that looks like a maelstrom.",
    ["EquipDesc_3201061"]="A badge based on the shape of a guardian fairy's wings.",
    ["EquipDesc_3201062"]="A crystal ball that awakens the potential of the wise.",
    ["EquipDesc_3201063"]="A statue that has mysterious power.",
    ["EquipDesc_3201064"]="An accessory symbolizing the supreme power of a leader.",
    ["EquipDesc_3201065"]="This black pocket watch looks very sophisticated.",
    ["EquipDesc_3201066"]="Something that is crucial to assassins. There are many rumors about the bloodstain at the tip of the blade.",
    ["EquipDesc_3201067"]="Jade that can only be controlled by a powerful will.",
    ["EquipDesc_3201068"]="A talisman that Goibne made for a bet against his rival, Dulb.",
    ["EquipDesc_3201069"]="A figure passed down from generation to generation by the viscount of a kingdom. It greatly boosts Strength and Luck.",
    ["EquipDesc_3201070"]="A figure passed down from generation to generation by the viscount of a kingdom. It greatly boosts Dexterity and Intelligence.",
    ["EquipDesc_3201071"]="A manual carried by the Imperial Guard. It is particularly useful for enhancing Strength and Vitality.",
    ["EquipDesc_3201072"]="A manual carried by the Imperial Guard. It is particularly useful for enhancing Strength and Luck.",
    ["EquipDesc_3201073"]="A manual carried by the Imperial Guard. It is particularly useful for enhancing Dexterity and Intelligence.",
