    ["EquipDesc_3201078"]="A figure carried by the lord of a kingdom. It greatly boosts Strength and Luck.",
    ["EquipDesc_3201079"]="A figure carried by the lord of a kingdom. It greatly boosts Dexterity and Intelligence.",
    ["EquipDesc_3201080"]="A figure carried by the lord of a kingdom. It greatly boosts Vitality and Intelligence.",
