    ["EquipDesc_3201087"]="A figure passed down from generation to generation by the viscount of a kingdom. It greatly boosts Vitality and Intelligence.",
    ["EquipDesc_3201088"]="A figure passed down from generation to generation by the viscount of a kingdom. It greatly boosts Luck and Agility.",
    ["EquipDesc_3201089"]="A figure passed down from generation to generation by the viscount of a kingdom. It greatly boosts Dexterity and Agility.",
    ["EquipDesc_3201090"]="It's clearly a feather dropped from a Valkyrie's wings, so why is it stained with such a deep color?",
    ["EquipDesc_3201093"]="A statue with a strange shape. At first glance, it looks like a bird flapping its wings, but upon closer inspection, it looks like an Obeaune diving into the water. If you look at it too long, you'll gradually forget the passage of time...",
    ["EquipDesc_3201094"]="The wolf totem is one of the oldest beliefs. It is both power and slaughter.",
    ["EquipDesc_3201130"]="A dark, round pearl revealing the faint pattern of Dragon Fly wings.",
    ["EquipDesc_3201131"]="A Dragon Fly pendant made of jade and faintly marked with fine blood marks.",
    ["EquipDesc_3201132"]="A beautiful necklace made of rubies. They say that spirits who lurk in the darkness of the night cannot help but be drawn to it.",
    ["EquipDesc_3201133"]="A pearl which emits a faint green light. It seems to house a mysterious phantom.",
    ["EquipDesc_3201134"]="A bracelet made of pure gold, and engraved with the brilliant history of the Poring race.",
    ["EquipDesc_3201135"]="A statue of an angry King Poring, containing boundless energy. The King Poring's rage is a force not all can withstand.",
    ["EquipDesc_3201190"]="A pendant in the shape of a Toad in twilight. It emits a faint green light when night falls.",
    ["EquipDesc_3201191"]="The statue of a Toad, reborn from the ashes. It is made from a special material which can resist erosion for a long time.",
    ["EquipDesc_3201192"]="A bright red statue with a special shape similar to that of a wild lobster.",
    ["EquipDesc_3201193"]="A crystal base shaped like a nipper. It shines with a brilliant light.",
    ["EquipDesc_3201194"]="A metal statue of a whispering demon. When you approach it, you can sometimes hear it chattering.",
    ["EquipDesc_3201195"]="Legend has it that this mysterious pendant is made of demon horns, and contains a mysterious power.",
    ["EquipDesc_3201196"]="A white statue of an omniscient angel. Its open wings seem to convey the power of wisdom to the world.",
    ["EquipDesc_3201197"]="A pendant made of pure white angel feathers. It appears to contain the power of sacred brilliance.",
    ["EquipDesc_3201198"]="A thick and sturdy badge. Just wearing it puts your mind at ease.",
    ["EquipDesc_3201199"]="The faint fireflies in the lanterns will never burn out. Listen—that's the sound of a soul burning.",
    ["EquipDesc_3201200"]="Something that cannot be worn by those who violate the oracle.",
    ["EquipDesc_3201231"]="According to the mysterious magic from somewhere, dropping blood on the puppet secures a pact. After that, the puppet protects its owner from a fatal attack before being destroyed.",
    ["EquipDesc_3201232"]="A demon made this by copying itself. Everyone ever wearing it is seduced into a loyal follower of the demon.",
    ["EquipDesc_3201233"]="Carved on the back of the mirror are suspicious incantations. Someone once said that reading the spells would grant you any wish. Do you trust him?",
    ["EquipDesc_3201234"]="Stars fall from the sky, gifting brightness for the last time to humans.",
    ["EquipDesc_3201235"]="A figure passed down from generation to generation by the duke of a kingdom. It greatly boosts Strength and Vitality.",
    ["EquipDesc_3201236"]="A figure passed down from generation to generation by the duke of a kingdom. It greatly boosts Strength and Luck.",
    ["EquipDesc_3201237"]="A figure passed down from generation to generation by the duke of a kingdom. It greatly boosts Dexterity and Intelligence.",
    ["EquipDesc_3201238"]="A figure passed down from generation to generation by the duke of a kingdom. It greatly boosts Vitality and Intelligence.",
    ["EquipDesc_3201239"]="A figure passed down from generation to generation by the duke of a kingdom. It greatly boosts Luck and Agility.",
    ["EquipDesc_3201240"]="A figure passed down from generation to generation by the duke of a kingdom. It greatly boosts Dexterity and Agility.",
    ["EquipDesc_3201241"]="Move your ear near, and enjoy the songs from the deep sea.",
    ["EquipDesc_3201242"]="A necessity for new dancers. The sounds made when shaking helps in following the rhythm.",
    ["EquipDesc_3201281"]="A figure with the power of an otherworldly ancient god. It greatly boosts Strength and Vitality.",
    ["EquipDesc_3201282"]="A figure with the power of an otherworldly ancient god. It greatly boosts Strength and Luck.",
    ["EquipDesc_3201283"]="A figure with the power of an otherworldly ancient god. It greatly boosts Dexterity and Intelligence.",
    ["EquipDesc_3201284"]="A figure with the power of an otherworldly ancient god. It greatly boosts Vitality and Intelligence.",
    ["EquipDesc_3201285"]="A figure with the power of an otherworldly ancient god. It greatly boosts Luck and Agility.",
    ["EquipDesc_3201286"]="A figure with the power of an otherworldly ancient god. It greatly boosts Dexterity and Agility.",
    ["EquipDesc_3201287"]="Those who have made a contract with the ancient gods must wear this ring to show loyalty.",
    ["EquipDesc_3201288"]="Sprout, grow, bloom, and wither. You see, even Yggdrasil knows its origin and end.",
    ["EquipDesc_3201289"]="The knight's medallion is covered in rust. The name on it is already blurred. Perhaps it is for the sentimental values that the medallion has not been abandoned yet.",
    ["EquipDesc_3201290"]="A container that can permanently preserve the human soul. Once a private collection of Hera, it has now become an ornament of Naght Sieger at some price. But whose soul is in it?",
    ["EquipDesc_3201291"]="Hera personally gave Naght Sieger the seal of the executioner. It is both a symbol of rights and the eyes of the watcher.",
    ["EquipDesc_3201292"]="A rope woven from coarse hemp is adorned with a gold bell. In some areas, this object is often used as an amulet and given to loved ones who will be sent to war.",
    ["EquipDesc_3201701"]="A badge presented for excellent achievement at academy graduation.",
    ["EquipDesc_3201702"]="A magical pendant that allows dolls to move around freely, made from all sorts of magical materials.",
    ["EquipDesc_3201703"]="A ring that has different special abilities depending on its form.",
    ["EquipDesc_3201704"]="The pattern in this ring can put you in a bad mood.",
    ["EquipDesc_3201729"]="The component of Vesper's central system in its chest armor. This is the bridge connecting four processors.",
    ["EquipDesc_3201809"]="Inlaid with a cosmic amethyst said to have fallen from the heavens. Within its depths slumber the wills of countless warriors who reached the end of their path.",
    ["EquipDesc_3201810"]="A black lucky bead necklace with strong magical power, crafted from rare black ore found in the Mjolnir mines.",
    ["EquipDesc_3201811"]="A spider-shaped brooch set with a gem. A sleeping demon inside slowly drains the wearer's life.",
    ["EquipDesc_3201812"]="A necklace shaped like an hourglass. Its power lasts only until the final grain of sand falls.",
    ["EquipDesc_3201901"]="A manual given to novices.",
    ["EquipDesc_3201902"]="A manual given to swordsmen.",
    ["EquipDesc_3201903"]="A manual given to mages.",
    ["EquipDesc_3201904"]="A manual given to acolytes.",
    ["EquipDesc_3201905"]="A manual given to archers.",
    ["EquipDesc_3201906"]="A manual given to thieves.",
    ["EquipDesc_3201907"]="A manual given to merchants.",
    ["EquipDesc_3201908"]="A manual given to knights.",
    ["EquipDesc_3201909"]="A manual given to wizards.",
    ["EquipDesc_3201910"]="A manual given to priests.",
    ["EquipDesc_3201911"]="A manual given to hunters.",
    ["EquipDesc_3201912"]="A manual given to assassins.",
    ["EquipDesc_3201913"]="A manual given to blacksmiths.",
    ["EquipDesc_3201914"]="A manual given to lord knights.",
    ["EquipDesc_3201915"]="A manual given to high wizards.",
    ["EquipDesc_3201916"]="A manual given to high priests.",
    ["EquipDesc_3201917"]="A manual given to snipers.",
    ["EquipDesc_3201918"]="A manual given to assassin crosses.",
    ["EquipDesc_3201919"]="A manual given to whitesmiths.",
    ["EquipDesc_3201920"]="A dust-covered ornament that still shines with infinite power.",
    ["EquipDesc_3201921"]="A pure and immaculate statue that inspires reverence.",
    ["EquipDesc_3201992"]="An unsuccessful experiment from a scientist, where the virtual data network was interwoven into a physical egg. What on earth hides within?",
    ["EquipDesc_3201993"]="Technology changes our daily life!",
    ["EquipDesc_3201994"]="The core that provides energy to Skeggiold. Due to its unique aesthetic and industrial outlines, people have compressed it into a decoration.",
    ["EquipDesc_3201995"]="So long as we look up to the starry sky, the fire of hope will never die.",
    ["EquipDesc_3201996"]="During ancient rituals, the priests would inscribe badges to invocate guidance from the gods.",
    ["EquipDesc_3201997"]="Inscribed with the last prophecy from the oracle.",
    ["EquipDesc_3201998"]="Crafted with the most cutting-edge Republican technology, this attack figure can enhance the STR and VIT of the user.",
    ["EquipDesc_3201999"]="Crafted with the most cutting-edge Republican technology, this assault figure can enhance the STR and LUK of the user.",
    ["EquipDesc_3202000"]="Crafted with the most cutting-edge Republican technology, this chant figure can enhance the DEX and INT of the user.",
    ["EquipDesc_3202001"]="Crafted with the most cutting-edge Republican technology, this balance figure can enhance the VIT and INT of the user.",
    ["EquipDesc_3202002"]="Crafted with the most cutting-edge Republican technology, this analysis figure can enhance the AGI and LUK of the user.",
    ["EquipDesc_3202003"]="Crafted with the most cutting-edge Republican technology, this swift figure can enhance the DEX and AGI of the user.",
    ["EquipDesc_3202074"]="An attack figure created with magical guidance technology at its core. It greatly boosts STR and VIT.",
    ["EquipDesc_3202075"]="An attack figure created with magical guidance technology at its core. It greatly boosts STR and LUK.",
    ["EquipDesc_3202076"]="An attack figure created with magical guidance technology at its core. It greatly boosts DEX and INT.",
    ["EquipDesc_3202077"]="An attack figure created with magical guidance technology at its core. It greatly boosts VIT and INT.",
    ["EquipDesc_3202078"]="An attack figure created with magical guidance technology at its core. It greatly boosts LUK and AGI.",
    ["EquipDesc_3202079"]="An attack figure created with magical guidance technology at its core. It greatly boosts DEX and AGI.",
    ["EquipDesc_3202080"]="A figure inscribed with alchemical runes. It greatly boosts STR and VIT.",
    ["EquipDesc_3202081"]="A figure inscribed with alchemical runes. It greatly boosts STR and LUK.",
    ["EquipDesc_3202082"]="A figure inscribed with alchemical runes. It greatly boosts DEX and INT.",
    ["EquipDesc_3202083"]="A figure inscribed with alchemical runes. It greatly boosts VIT and INT.",
    ["EquipDesc_3202084"]="A figure inscribed with alchemical runes. It greatly boosts LUK and AGI.",
    ["EquipDesc_3202085"]="A figure inscribed with alchemical runes. It greatly boosts DEX and AGI.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101001"]="A crown containing magic that gives the wearer wisdom and clarity of thought.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101002"]="A delicate plant that is still in the early stages of growth.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101003"]="A headband with alluring bunny ears. Sexiness +100%.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101004"]="A colorful hat made from an egg shell. One size fits all.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101005"]="A headband made to look like black cat ears. It is a copy of the one owned by Whikebine in Morroc.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101006"]="Upper body armor made of gold. Despite the main material, it provides good protection.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101007"]="A helmet worn only by true orc heroes. It proves that the wearer is one of the greatest warriors.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101008"]="A hat inspired by Moonlight Flower. It is made of 30% cotton and 70% Nine Tail fur. Hand wash only.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101009"]="A hair bow made of purple fabric.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101010"]="Be careful not to get struck by the lightning.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101011"]="A hat worn by Drake the pirate king. It is a symbol of power and authority.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101012"]="A headband that looks like kitten ears.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101013"]="A headband that looks like bunny ears.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101014"]="A beautiful hat with strange patterns that makes its wearer feel smarter.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101015"]="A hat symbolizing the priesthood that makes its wearer feel more authoritative.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101016"]="A headband inspired by the appearance of demon wings.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101017"]="A big bow that adds a cute touch to any look.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101018"]="A headband made of angel feathers.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101019"]="A loose-fitting hat that blocks out the sun.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101020"]="A fashionable hat that is worn by gentlemen and looks most dignified.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101021"]="A rustically stylish cowboy hat.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101022"]="A functional headband with a decorative ribbon on top.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101023"]="A headband that makes its wearer feel like they can travel through the sky.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101024"]="A traditional Japanese headpiece associated with a certain Eastern country.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101025"]="Headgear inspired by the appearance of a griffin.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101026"]="A helmet designed to resemble the jackal head of Anubis, god of the underworld. It imbues the wearer with incredible power.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101027"]="A bird singing happily on a branch.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101028"]="A white horn that is smooth to the touch and has a sharp tip.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101029"]="Green insect feelers to make you look like a giant Rocker.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101030"]="A helmet inspired by the appearance of Vanargand, the monstrous wolf of legend.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101031"]="Headgear made of a dragon skull. It is extremely tough.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101032"]="A helmet made of tough metal.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101033"]="A hat coveted by all talented mages. Despite its rough appearance, it will really put a spring in your step.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101034"]="According to legend, this is the apple that an expert marksman shot off someone's head in the distant past.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101035"]="A conical hat woven from reeds. It is mainly used to provide protection from the sun and rain.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101036"]="A bandana with a skull design that grants strength to its wearer.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101037"]="A black hat worn by students.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101038"]="A hat made to look like an onigiri. It almost looks good enough to eat.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101039"]="A headband worn by many of Kafra's female employees at work.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101040"]="A cute headband that looks like a pair of adorable puppy ears.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101041"]="A jeweled tiara that promotes clarity of mind when casting spells.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101042"]="A signboard with the word STOP written on it.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101043"]="Best not worn in polite company.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101044"]="This hat is highly recommended for anyone who wants to know what it feels like to be a Spore.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101045"]="A hat inspired by the appearance of a Deviruchi. It is guaranteed to cheer up anyone who sees it.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101046"]="A hat designed to look like a cute Sea Otter. It has a mysterious power of unknown origin.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101047"]="A hat worn to protect the wearer's eyes from the sun.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101048"]="A stage prop that makes it look like wearer has a knife sticking out of their head.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101049"]="A nest of hatchlings. Be sure to keep them safe from harm.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101050"]="A cute little hat that sits on the side of the head. Ideal for a picnic on a summer day.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101051"]="A green beret that represents courage and honor.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101052"]="A fragrance filled with blessings.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101053"]="He may look like a frog, but he is actually a handsome prince waiting for the girl who will lift his curse.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101054"]="A hat designed to look like the ever popular Poring.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101055"]="A hat with a valuable feather sticking out. Good taste never goes out of style.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101056"]="A hat worn by nurses.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101057"]="A rather dashing hat of the type worn by toy soldiers.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101058"]="A flower to add a dash of color to one's head.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101059"]="A helmet with a gemstone in the center.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101060"]="A dapper hat that looks good on any occasion.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101061"]="A hood that looks like a wolf's head. Just don't use it to scare sheep.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101062"]="Hugely popular! A hat with a doll designed to look like Kafra's Telling. Full of energy and always on the go, she is one of the most respected individuals in the whole company.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101063"]="A hat made to look like Wild Rose.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101064"]="A hat given to novice adventurers. It is guaranteed to bring a smile to your face.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101067"]="You never know what might be hidden in a magician's hat.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101069"]="This majestic crown consists of a velvet cap, gold frame, and stunning gemstones.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101070"]="An elegant circlet that has long been a symbol of leadership.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101073"]="In the face of horrific beasts, Demon Hunters not only should not only have excellent hunting skills, but also learn to terrorize them from the outfit. The helmet in the shape of a huge horn was created for this purpose.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101074"]="A bandana with a checkered pattern. It keeps the hair firmly in place.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101075"]="A simple bandana that instantly makes you look like an action hero.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101076"]="A cute blue hairband.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101077"]="A hairband with red and white stripes.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101078"]="An ornate circlet.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101079"]="A tribal headband adorned with large white feathers. It makes the wearer feel at one with nature and the ancestral spirits.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101080"]="According to legend, this headdress was worn by a famed craftsman of the east. An aura of a great power still fills it.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101083"]="A simple red comb.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101084"]="Wear this star-shaped hairclip, and you will always shine brightly.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101085"]="A hairpin that looks like a cherry blossom.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101086"]="A cute heart-shaped hairpin.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101087"]="A hairpin that looks like a cat's paw.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101088"]="A hairpin that looks like a crescent moon.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101089"]="A normal hairband that works surprisingly well with long hair.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101090"]="A cute green ribbon for your hair. A timeless classic.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101091"]="A cute red ribbon for your hair. A timeless classic.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101092"]="A cute blue ribbon for your hair. A timeless classic.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101093"]="A headband with soft edges that is reminiscent of delicate flowers.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101094"]="This feels stronger than usual. Its power originates from love.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101095"]="Looks like what would happen if you left your head in a dark, damp place for a long time.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101096"]="A hat with three Porings stacked on top of each other, an Angeling on the bottom, a Mastering in the middle, and a Poring on the top.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101097"]="A hairband designed to look like antlers.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101098"]="The perfect accessory for a Journey to the West.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101099"]="A simple hat that is practical and versatile.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101100"]="A hat worn for protection during construction work. Remember, safety first!",
    ["EquipDesc_4101101"]="An orc helmet. It is rather primitive in design and construction.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101102"]="Wearing it makes you feel smarter.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101103"]="Wearing it makes you feel like the spells you cast are stronger.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101104"]="A hat with eyes symbolizing those of a dark mage. It is said that the eyes can see.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101105"]="A hat made specially for carnivals.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101106"]="Ever wanted to look like a Smokie? Then this hat is for you.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101107"]="A cute hat that looks like a teddy bear's face. It would make a great gift.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101108"]="A hat that looks like a sheep's head. It is so adorable that the enemy might think twice about attacking.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101109"]="A hat designed to look like an Angeling, the mother of all Porings.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101110"]="A hat designed to look like a little Deviling.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101111"]="A winged helmet that symbolizes the valkyries who serve Odin.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101113"]="A lazy-looking gray cat. Listen closely and maybe you will hear it purr occasionally.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101114"]="A lazy-looking brown cat. Listen closely and maybe you will hear it purr occasionally.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101115"]="A lazy-looking pink cat. Listen closely and maybe you will hear it purr occasionally.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101116"]="A lazy-looking blue cat. Listen closely and maybe you will hear it purr occasionally.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101117"]="A lazy-looking yellow cat. Listen closely and maybe you will hear it purr occasionally.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101118"]="A lazy-looking cat. Listen closely and maybe you will hear it purr occasionally.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101119"]="Hugely popular! A hat with a doll designed to look like Kafra's Bennit. Even though she's a bit tomboyish, she actually likes knitting and reading romance novels. She's popular with men who really like short skirts.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101120"]="A hat with a doll designed to look like Kafra's W. <color=#CA2E0AFF>Can be used to teleport you to any location you've ever been to before. (Initial cooldown time is 60 minutes.</color> Cooldown will decrease as Favor Level increases.)",
    ["EquipDesc_4101121"]="Hugely popular! A hat with a doll designed to look like Kafra's Defolty. Many of her numerous admirers open the Warehouse upwards of 20 times a day just to see her smile.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101122"]="Hugely popular! A hat with a doll designed to look like Kafra's Lilia. It is popular with many of her diehard fans.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101123"]="Hugely popular! A hat with a doll designed to look like Kafra' Dorothy. It is popular with many of her diehard fans.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101124"]="Hugely popular! A hat with a doll designed to look like Kafra's Clarice. It is popular with many of her diehard fans.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101125"]="Hugely popular! A hat with a doll designed to look like Kafra's Shuling. It is popular with many of her diehard fans.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101126"]="A doll designed to look like Tangami. Look at how cute she is.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101127"]="It looks so soft, just like a real rabbit that can be placed on the head.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101128"]="A hat designed to look like the god of frogs. It just so happens that the god of frogs looks just like any other frog.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101129"]="This tortoise may look cute, but it is incredibly lazy.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101131"]="A hat with a Smokie that looks too lazy to even move.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101132"]="A hat designed to look like a Nine Tail. All its tails make it very warm.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101133"]="Who wouldn't want to wear an adorable brown puppy on their head?",
    ["EquipDesc_4101134"]="A quart style doll that looks sad.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101135"]="A mischievous little dragon.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101136"]="Designed to look like a Lif. It looks sleepy, but also looks like it is tenderly watching over its wearer.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101137"]="Made to look like an adorable bunny rabbit.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101138"]="A little angel with two lovely wings and the ability to use a number of frosty spells.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101139"]="A red-hot imp with a fiery temper.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101140"]="A long strip of green cloth tied into a beautiful bow.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101141"]="A long strip of pink cloth tied into a beautiful bow.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101142"]="A long strip of red cloth tied into a beautiful bow.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101143"]="A long strip of white cloth tied into a beautiful bow.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101144"]="A long strip of yellow cloth tied into a beautiful bow.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101145"]="An angel's halo that makes the person wearing it more conspicuous at night.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101146"]="A crown made of fresh flowers, representing the feelings of a young lady.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101148"]="It is said that a Smokie can transform after putting this on its head. I wonder if humans can do the same.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101149"]="It looks very meaty. Can you smell fish, or is it just your imagination?",
    ["EquipDesc_4101150"]="A nice sunflower for the top of your head.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101151"]="A candle that looks like it will never burn out.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101152"]="Worn by a great female fighter in ancient times. Her powerful kicks fascinated everyone at the time.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101153"]="Horns that resemble those of a succubus. They seem to grant the wearer a mysterious power.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101154"]="Horns that resemble those of an incubus. They seem to grant the wearer a mysterious power.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101155"]="A pair off demon-like wings. Just don't expect to be able to fly.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101156"]="A helmet filled with the power of darkness that is said to improve the wearer's concentration.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101157"]="A diadem decorated with the jewel of love. It is said that those who wear it will find true love.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101158"]="Headwear based on the bells Sohees wear in their hair. The huge size emphasizes their cuteness.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101159"]="An iron mask that covers the face. It is able to withstand deadly attacks.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101160"]="A hat worn by Munaks. There is a mysterious talisman on it.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101161"]="A tough hat worn by Bonguns. It doesn't block too much of the wearer's vision because half of the talisman has been ripped off.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101162"]="A crown that represents the power of darkness. There are rumors that those who wear it will hear devil’s whispers.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101171"]="A mouthwatering plate of lobsters... Oh my, they're still moving!",
    ["EquipDesc_4101172"]="Wear this and you will look inkredible.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101173"]="The hat of the Campus Festival set.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101174"]="Fluffy Cat Ears",
    ["EquipDesc_4101175"]="Campus Festival Hat (Red)",
    ["EquipDesc_4101176"]="Campus Festival Hat (Blue)",
    ["EquipDesc_4101177"]="Campus Festival Hat (Green)",
    ["EquipDesc_4101178"]="Campus Festival Hat (White)",
    ["EquipDesc_4101180"]="A pair of fashionable shades to cut down the glare of the summer sun.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101181"]="A hat to protect against harsh UV rays while at the beach.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101182"]="A special protective mask developed by the Rekenber Institute. It provides protection against bacteria and viruses.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101183"]="A peculiar and unsophisticated hat that is rumored to be the costume of a mysterious hero.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101184"]="An empowering fishing hat said to be the ultimate attire of a master of fishing.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101185"]="The handbook given to new students of Criatura Academy. It records every detail of each new generation's unique journey.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101186"]="A hair accessory worn by Daytime Magicians. This light-colored accessory looks like a pair of wings sitting on their ears.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101187"]="A hat worn by Night Magicians. This dark hat is decorated with flowers and stars.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101188"]="A piggy bank made of pure gold that gains the ability to dance when magic power is injected into it.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101189"]="A bard's hat that has a feather on it.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101190"]="A wig worn by trendsetters that looks out of the ordinary.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101191"]="A husky-shaped headgear.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101192"]="A fluffy and bright wig worn by clowns.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101193"]="The Campus Festival Hat is exclusive to the Open Beta. The pure white color of the hat symbolizes the clouds that drift freely in the sky and a new era of dreams and adventures.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101194"]="A hat worn by witches who hide among the people. It is said that these witches only appear in front of others during a special festival and speak and act as they please.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101195"]="A peculiar pumpkin headgear that is worn by those who want to dress up as a resurrected dead person for a night march during a special festival.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101198"]="A hat named after the Stars' Blessings. It is a prize that the Heines Family prepared for the Christmas event. The small reindeer antlers tie in to the joyous atmosphere of Christmas.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101199"]="A circlet made for winter. It keeps the wearer warm and leads the fashion trend in the cold winter.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101200"]="A uniquely designed white dress hat that carries the promise between two lovers.\nFor males only.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101201"]="A uniquely designed white veil that carries the promise between two lovers.\nFor females only.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101202"]="Garland worn by the witness. Conveys the most wonderful blessings to the newlyweds.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101203"]="An elegant eastern-styled headgear. People will wear it on special occasions to welcome a new change.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101208"]="A headgear designed to look like Nian.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101209"]="A headgear worn by lion dancers. It gives off a clear ringing when put on.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101210"]="A small veil. Makes one think of a wedding.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101211"]="A bowl of glutinous rice balls. Whether it tastes delicious nobody knows, but legend says it signifies reunion.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101212"]="Archaeologists wear this hat. Ruins on this continent are full of risks, and depending on the wits alone is not going to work for an explorer.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101213"]="A headgear that's suited for students. It's youthful and sweet.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101214"]="Bee style headgear. Produce sticky sweetness through hard work.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101215"]="What should I use to adorn my love? Gems, pearls, and the softest red velvet. I now present you my love with a touch of gentleness.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101216"]="The exquisitely crafted Steam Detector, which helps one determine the condition of the instrument’s parts more precisely.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101217"]="This is a sacred crown, and on the top of the crown is a carving of the divine bird flapping its wings and flying into the air.\n",
    ["EquipDesc_4101218"]="A crystal clear tiara, noble and elegant.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101219"]="A regal cavalry style hat. Charismatic and dignified, it symbolizes the honor of the royal family.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101220"]="A regal cavalry style feather hat. Charismatic and dignified, it symbolizes the honor of the royal family.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101221"]="Anything is possible in a fairytale world, such as rabbit ears suddenly growing on your head.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101222"]="Headgear worn by hot blooded youths - although the style is retro, it still looks great today.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101223"]="A gorgeous classic ancient Egyptian-styled headgear.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101224"]="A hair band with a sharp edge. Has the air of a prankster about it.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101225"]="A decorative item worn by a priest. Holds dark magic.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101226"]="A dark halo that symbolizes depravity and evil.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101227"]="Headdress worn by the royal family during formal events. Beautifully dignified.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101228"]="Headgear worn by hot blooded youths - although the style is retro, it still looks great today.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101229"]="Part of the Rabbit Attendant Set, these ultra-realistic rabbit ears bounce whenever the wearer moves. It is said that the color of the Poring accessory on it indicates the attendant's grade.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101230"]="Kitty is a cute cat that brings good luck. I was inspired the experience where I was sticking eyes stickers to his butt when he was sleeping!—Designer Artemis",
    ["EquipDesc_4101231"]="This cake hat exudes the sweet scent of strawberries. It might even attract Porings who like a jolly time if distributed at a birthday party!—Designer Laurel",
    ["EquipDesc_4101232"]="\"Let's Go on an Adventure in This Fantasy World With Mama & Baby Lunatic!\" -- Designer Yi Jiuyun",
    ["EquipDesc_4101233"]="Inspired by Artemis, the winner of the Ragnarok X: Next Generation Original Headgear Design Competition. A woolly hat in the design of a winged cat descending into the secular world.The eyes on its back convey feelings of longing and blessings, bringing happiness to those they watch.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101234"]="Inspired by Laurel, the winner of the Ragnarok X: Next Generation Headgear Design Contest. This cake hat exudes the sweet scent of strawberries. It might even attract Porings who like a jolly time if distributed at a birthday party!",
    ["EquipDesc_4101235"]="The best way to fight against strong winds. You deserve it.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101236"]="Used to shade yourself from the sun. May be a little too small sometimes, but seeing it is like witnessing a fiery victory!\n",
    ["EquipDesc_4101237"]="A small portion of the Mysteltainn’s power remains in it, which is a symbol of adventurer’s strength.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101238"]="A trendy retro peaked cap, a best seller of the season. The designer suggests matching it with the outfit of the same series for the ultimate style.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101239"]="Meow——Meow!",
    ["EquipDesc_4101240"]="Protect your eyes from seawater so you can play in the sea!",
    ["EquipDesc_4101241"]="These wide sunglasses are so hot right now. They'll keep the sun out of your eyes.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101242"]="This delicate hairpin wrapped in gold threads emits a subtle mugwort fragrance when you get close.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101244"]="Earphones with cat ears for decoration, cute but with a high-tech feeling",
    ["EquipDesc_4101245"]="Jet-black horns with short red hair.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101246"]="Light peach-colored long hair with two white, porcelain-like horns.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101249"]="A slime that can wear a scholar hat and be put on the head. It's Chloe's most favorite way to play.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101250"]="A slime that can wear an Anti-Magic Mask and be put on the head. It's Shion's most favorite way to play.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101251"]="Long light purple hair with an obsidian-like horn. It reflects a sense of competence.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101253"]="The flowers are simple but elegant, representing hope and new life.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101254"]="There will always be some people who envy hibernating creatures, and there are good reasons for this. When sleepiness and the cold strike together, the cotton ball on the nightcap becomes so heavy that people can't help but rest their heads on a pillow... Be careful.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101255"]="One day, humans will possibly gain the ability to hibernate through evolution. Can we lie down in a warm bed while we're waiting for that to happen? Be very careful though, because sleepwalking in winter can be fatal...",
    ["EquipDesc_4101256"]="Sailors have a tendency of throwing their hats into the air when they see the coastline.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101257"]="Shaped like a small boat. It's a look that's distinct to sailors.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101258"]="Provides some protection to the player. The brim of the helmet can be used to block out the sunlight, allowing better performance.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101265"]="Proof that you have become an adventurer who can face challenges alone.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101268"]="This simple crescent-shaped hair band can be manually tightened on the head to secure the hair.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101269"]="A handsome and dashing hairstyle. People wearing this will feel as if they are standing on the Magpie Bridge when their hair are blowing in the wind.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101270"]="This seemingly ordinary black hair with highlights exudes the oppressiveness of the superior demon clan.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101271"]="A samurai bun filled with the aura of a samurai. It is pale in color, but it exudes a feeling of strength.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101272"]="Lively long blonde hair that gives a sense of positivity.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101273"]="Long, flowing, silvery-blue hair.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101274"]="\"I'll sign his helmet with a permanent marker. When Mr. Hurt leaves Earth, he’ll know that the universe is just a bonus that comes with me.\" – Actress Starley Walker Speth",
    ["EquipDesc_4101275"]="White flowers are swaying in the wind. There’s a hint of fragrance floating at the tip of your nose.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101276"]="Some flowers are attached to the long black hair, just like the bright starlight alternates with the Milky Way.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101277"]="Unruly pink pigtails (the cowlick is part of its form).",
    ["EquipDesc_4101278"]="The accessory popular among electronica fans. Even your most hated enemy, shall praise love & peace in from of the god of music",
    ["EquipDesc_4101279"]="This rebellious inverted hairstyle resembles the one worn by urban legend clowns. It might still be acceptable on humans, but on clowns, it becomes an unshakable nightmare once you see a creature's head shaped like this.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101284"]="Lost all the hair and become stronger.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101285"]="This rebellious glowing hairstyle uses the luminescent coating to simulate monster eyes that resemble the ones worn by urban legend clowns. It might still be acceptable on humans, but on clowns, it becomes an unshakable nightmare once you see a creature's head shaped like this.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101286"]="A piece of headgear made out of tons of top-quality diamonds(syhthsised), a wonderful match for the stage",
    ["EquipDesc_4101289"]="Highly recommended by survivalists. Made from the thick skin of yetis, the Frosty Beanie can protect your head from the fierce wind and snow.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101290"]="The pro choice for ice-cold environment with a snowstorm. Now your ears will stay safe and sound throughout winter.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101291"]="Well, you've gotta admit that the standard in cowboy fashion is the hat, though the non-professionals think a cowboy hat is just a hat.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101292"]="On a quiet and breezy night illuminated by the moon hanging high in the sky, the Joker cackles after Pumpkin Jack knocks on the door...",
    ["EquipDesc_4101295"]="A small Snowier that likes to rest on people's heads. It does not fear wind, snow, or bumpiness, and can fall asleep regardless of the occasion... It's not necessarily a bad thing if it sleeps, because it will become more peaceful.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101296"]="Still warm from the oven, Sir the Bakery has decided to travel around the world! But first, get some sleep and build up the strength...",
    ["EquipDesc_4101297"]="A shiny leather top hat embellished with roses. Who will play the first note of the feast? Someone wearing such a costume, of course!",
    ["EquipDesc_4101298"]="A rare hat that had a magical aura. It seems that only some children are able to occasionally see this type of hat on the holy night, but most of them are probably just seeing an illusion...",
    ["EquipDesc_4101299"]="A hairpin with Pattie’s name on it. It is an accessory that has become popular among Pattie’s admirers at some point. This kind of fervor is really impressive.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101300"]="A hairpin with the name of The TOYS written on it. It is not designed by him, but he seems to be very fond of it and promotes it vigorously. That's the fashion.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101301"]="A hairpin with Kao's name on it. Kao is happy to share her good fortune and the magic of the number nine with people.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101302"]="A shiny leather top hat embellished with roses. Wear it and become a speck of red that capture everyone's eyes in the middle of the parade on the holy night!",
    ["EquipDesc_4101303"]="A hat that is mysterious like a fairy. Many children claim to have seen a hat like this on the holy night, but it is most likely some kind of fairy tale...",
    ["EquipDesc_4101304"]="The new snow of Christmas Eve and the almost-ripe mistletoe have an agreement to jointly fall on the head of the loveliest adventurer.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101305"]="Crafted with skulls taken from ancient monsters alive. Three claw marks can be seen on the surface, but don't worry, its toughness is beyond doubt.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101306"]="Once owned by a gladiator trading for victory with the demons, the sallet enjoys increasing radiance of the embedded gem after witnessing multiple owners.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101307"]="The golden tiger, representing wealth, sends its most trusted messenger to your side to bring you a whole year’s worth of fortune! Remember the code is to make a bow with your ears shaking three times.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101309"]="A fiery helmet that imparts a burning passion. This eternal flame can never be tempered.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101310"]="Fighting for the crown on the battlefield, at this moment I am alone. Where is this mortal but in Valhalla.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101311"]="Heavenly father points to me and orders this war to be victorious. His great power sustains the unfailing human being.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101312"]="The base is rice, topped with a variety of ingredients. An experienced sushi master has confidence in offering every customer something new in every aspect.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101313"]="Premium quality sashimi. Besides premium ingredients and a handy knife set, it also demands excellent skills from the chef. Each cut must be precise on the point, and each piece is a work of art.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101314"]="Specially processed communication device for Officer, with a surface coating that can isolate 99% of eavesdropping and interference. It is tough and lightweight.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101318"]="\"I’ve been a fan of The Little Mermaid since childhood. Now I have the chance to design the game, I must draw one out to wear!\" said Designer Meatball.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101321"]="The high quality velvet hat from the ancient East to Midgard. The copper coins and the “Kylin” accessories on it are a symbol of people’s wish to get rid of bad luck and pray for safety.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101322"]="The elegant velvet hat from the ancient East to Midgard. The gauze under the \"Kylin\" accessories on this hat is the ingenuity of a senior designer.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101323"]="The Hyottoko Mask made specially for grand festivals. It is said that after hanging it in the warmest part of one’s home, one can find the gold from under the mask the next day.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101324"]="A handmade headgear, embellished with eternal cherry blossoms that are processed by magic. Its aroma is faintly noticeable.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101325"]="Clear female short-cut hairstyle, display a unique charm in combat.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101326"]="Black short hair that radiating an aura of toughness.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101327"]="Cleaning Bandana with a knot at the back of head, preventing sweat drip into eyes.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101328"]="A commemorative hat given to honorary members by the ROX Anglers Association. There is an exclusive custom float on the top.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101333"]="This bestowal of Naght Sieger becoming a knight appears to be affected by him, emitting an aura of ice and flame.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101334"]="Hibram wore this hat when he was one of the twelve bishops. Made of silk, even though it looks heavy, it's pretty comfortable once you put it on.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101335"]=" A helmet contains powerful battle intent. Those who wear it are said to hear the screaming of wronged souls.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101336"]="Kotaro Higashi's hairstyle.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101337"]="Princess Maya's hairstyle.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101338"]="A commemorative hat given to honorary members by the ROX Anglers Association. There is an exclusive custom nameplate on the top.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101339"]="A large golden winged hat that symbolizes the sun, but it doesn't tell you how to walk when you put it on.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101340"]="The boar mask Inosuke Hashibira wears all the time.\nIt is not possible to wear the costumes of other <color=#CA2E0AFF>Demon Slayer: Kimetsu no Yaiba characters</color> while wearing this.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101341"]="It brings good luck to whoever wears it on the head.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101349"]="A cone-shaped hat in dark color with red thread tangled around it. When you put it on, you could hear an unusual voice that nobody else could hear.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101350"]="Dance with it in a specific venue, and the tinkling sound will console those wandering spirits.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101351"]="As the old oni says, an oni with two horns is a king among oni.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101352"]="A black baseball cap. Best choice for trendsetters.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101353"]="Ghosts appeared at night, dyeing the white moon purple, giving this the name: Bewitching Moon.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101354"]="Hopping Angeling is the perfect match for the Adventurer who has an angelic heart.\nDesigner: 冷遇の月",
    ["EquipDesc_4101355"]="The rainbow is born from love. According to legend, every couple in the world will be blessed when it rises.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101356"]="A delicate hat for nobles. Some say it's popular among supernatural species who thirst for blood to survive.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101357"]="Tiny and exquisite hat for a soiree. When the night falls, the bat decoration appears to be alive.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101358"]="The Striker cuts through the penalty area to score a goal and win the match!",
    ["EquipDesc_4101359"]="The Winger rushes up the side, beating the defense, and then feeds the ball to the center, securing victory!",
    ["EquipDesc_4101362"]="To the ruler of fallen souls and the trampler of life and death. May your curses be the divine order.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101363"]="To the manipulator and the mocker of destiny. May your lies be the eternal truth.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101364"]="Every Christmas Eve, the sleeping Gingerbread Men will wake up from their dream and start dancing to celebrate Christmas.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101365"]="A Christmas Tree is a must for Christmas!",
    ["EquipDesc_4101366"]="A Reindeer Hood that is useful in cold weather and a Christmas Costume Party!",
    ["EquipDesc_4101367"]="A Nutcracker-style officer hat. It may lead to another fashion trend.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101368"]="A hat that is embedded with jewels. A bit heavy, people only wear it for the holidays.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101369"]="A Nutcracker-style guard hat. It may lead to another fashion trend.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101370"]="A crown that is embedded with jewels. A bit heavy, people only wear it for the holidays.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101371"]="A silvery frame with a never-fading neon lens symbolizes the stage of a dream chaser.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101372"]="Getting to the stage is long and lonely, but if you carry your dreams, you might find a pair of wings along the way.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101374"]="A cozy sunflower hat. Put it on and thrive in the sunshine together!",
    ["EquipDesc_4101375"]="This adorable reindeer hat has pompoms dangling from both sides, and when you pull them, the antlers move too!",
    ["EquipDesc_4101376"]="Fluffy beanie. The rabbit lying on top seems pretty fond of the reserved spot.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101377"]="A prize from the Fishing Showdown Committee. You make the Snow Festival wonderful! <color=#ff5d5d>During daily fishing, there's a very small chance to obtain double the materials.</color>",
    ["EquipDesc_4101378"]="A legendary Champion Fishing King Headgear that is notable for its unique golden color. <color=#ff5d5d>During daily fishing, there's a very small chance to obtain double the materials.</color>",
    ["EquipDesc_4101379"]="It's a frog hat that's both windproof and waterproof. However, the frog on top appears to be still hibernating.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101380"]="The adorable twin-tail that goes down the waist looks even cuter in a bun!",
    ["EquipDesc_4101381"]="It's said that some psychics can see through everything without using their eyes upon reaching a certain level of practice; some can even tell where their destiny is heading.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101382"]="The god has left some scrambled words in the prophet's crystal orb, and the lost one called it—Truth.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101383"]="A crown representing the all-knowing and all-seeing power. Its former owner once bore the divine duty to watch the mortal world on behalf of the gods.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101384"]="Unstable energy substance. Those who know how to manipulate ancient energy can shape it at will.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101385"]="A statuette of a devoted tester. Containing magical powers, it seems to awaken at any moment.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101386"]="An ancient headset with a mysterious structure. Good for playing electronic music.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101387"]="An unruly high ponytail for youngsters, and the bangs make it pop even more.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101388"]="A modified aviation helmet that better fits a night flight. The goggles with a built-in night vision system can assist the pilot in landings, even under low-visibility circumstances.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101389"]="Allows the holder to experience one of the four extreme negative emotions that drove Thanatos into madness—Hatred, which turns a saint into a butcher.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101390"]="An all-in-one aviation headgear with integrated goggles. It can effectively protect the pilot from icy jet streams, when used in an open cockpit.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101391"]="It is the black cat at night, walking you to the heavenly rhythms in silence.​",
    ["EquipDesc_4101392"]="It is the pink cat of mystique, bringing you to the voice of your heart in the fantasy land.​",
    ["EquipDesc_4101394"]="In this virtual world made of codes, the No.1 Player will be the king who rules.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101395"]="Highly leakproof diving goggles with an ergonomic design that ensures maximum safety for the diver underwater.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101396"]="A crown that belongs to Anubis, the god responsible for weighing the heart. It's said that one can wear it to see the before and afterlife of the dead.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101397"]="A crown that belongs to Bastet, the mother and the fosterer of Pharaoh. It can prevent disease and expel evil spirits.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101398"]="Diving goggles that allow you to see the surroundings during a night diving! Made for freedom and exploration.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101399"]="Savage Hoods with a ferocious appearance. Hunters who wear this headgear will become the most ferocious beasts in the tribe.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101401"]="Wild yet elegant Leopard Hoods. It's said that those irregularly-patterned dots contain the secret to the tribe's good harvests and prosperity.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101402"]="While robots cannot understand human melodies, they can certainly compose their own.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101403"]="While robots cannot understand human melodies, they can certainly compose their own.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101404"]="Long hair in a rare silvery-blonde color, tied up with a cosmic-colored hair band. It's neat from top to bottom.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101405"]="A beautiful and elegant updo for ladies. As much attention is paid to the long curly locks, people are attracted to the sparkling blue rose tucked within the hair.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101406"]="A blessing hat handmade by Kafra Maid W. It's your best partner in refining. Put it on and give it a try! (Original Author: Regolark)",
    ["EquipDesc_4101407"]="So this is a cat, not a hamster? (Original Author: ☆ T O K K Y ☆)",
    ["EquipDesc_4101408"]="Black long hair that reflects a lady's tenderness. Shizue Izawa's daily hairstyle.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101409"]="Souei's hairstyle. It gives out a ruthless feeling to others.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101410"]="A short hairstyle with side-swept bangs. Hinata Sakaguchi's daily hairstyle.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101411"]="An adorable headgear resembling Rimuru. Very popular in Prontera.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101412"]="Mask of Footman, a member of Moderate Harlequin Alliance .",
    ["EquipDesc_4101413"]="A short and neat hairstyle for females. Souka's daily hairstyle.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101414"]="An adorable headgear resembling Milim. Very popular in Prontera.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101416"]="Mask of Laplace, a member of Moderate Harlequin Alliance .",
    ["EquipDesc_4101417"]="A cool-looking hat with black gold rhombus patterns. When tossed by bandsmen, it can arouse blasting cheers in the crowd enough to blow the roof off.​",
    ["EquipDesc_4101418"]="A pitch-black hat adorned with gilt roses that bloom at midnight with the roars of heavy metal music.​",
    ["EquipDesc_4101419"]="It's said that one will receive the warlord's blessing once putting on this helm. (Original Author: Thor)",
    ["EquipDesc_4101420"]="Worn by heralds reaping souls for Hel, these crowns are as sharp as scythes.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101421"]="Worn by heralds burying gods for Hel, these horned helms can pierce the lie called eternity.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101423"]="Secure those light golden flyaway strands with a lemon-printed hairband—the fluttering ribbon is a playful hint of summer's tail end.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101424"]="Golden double helix curls, jazzed up with lemon and plumeria hair accessories, glistening under the summer sun.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101426"]="A half-shaved hairstyle highlighted in shades of gold and purple. Each strand of hair screams the ultimate beauty of violence.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101427"]="With her twin tails dyed in scarlet and platinum, is she a lunatic or an aristocrat today?",
    ["EquipDesc_4101428"]="<color=#FF0000>(Unisex)</color> The hairstyle of the \"Dominator of the Universe,\" Boros.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101429"]="<color=#FF0000>(Male)</color> The hairstyle of the \"Hero Hunter,\" Garou.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101430"]="<color=#FF0000>(Female)</color> The hairstyle of the S-Class Hero, \"Terrible Tornado.\"",
    ["EquipDesc_4101431"]="<color=#FF0000>(Female)</color> The hairstyle of the B-Class Hero, \"Hellish Blizzard.\"",
    ["EquipDesc_4101432"]="<color=#FF0000>(Male)</color> The hairstyle of Speed-o'-Sound Sonic.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101433"]="Crimson long-curly hair that seems to burn one's eyes. At a glance, it's like a blooming rose in the dead of night.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101434"]="A sapient brain—something falling between a human brain and a mechanical one. It has been calling itself Mimir since the day it was activated.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101435"]="Its round ears filter out noise with the soft fur, listening quietly for the arrival of prey in the world of ice and snow.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101436"]="Rebellious side-parting bangs, like a wayward wildfire burning alone in the silent night.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101437"]="A sapient brain—something falling between a human brain and a mechanical one. It has been calling itself Bestla since the day it was activated.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101438"]="Its sharp ears were raised alertly, not letting go of any suspicious sounds.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101441"]="In fairy tales, this kind of nail is used to punish the evil souls. It delivers a pain so intense, as if drilling into the wicked core, that all fond memories are obliterated.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101442"]="Rabbits on the moon are known to have their ears turned pink when feeling shy.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101443"]="With sharp eyes and keen ears, they are the most reliable scouts in pre-war situations.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101446"]="Snow white rabbit ears that droop down peacefully in sound sleep.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101447"]="<color=#FF0000>(Unisex)</color> A white color doggie headgear based on the appearance of the Watchdog Man.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101448"]="Armor is not a must for a knight. A sleep hat is the mightiest helmet for a slumbering knight!",
    ["EquipDesc_4101449"]="Holding hands while swaying, the enduring pact of the Christmas duo.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101450"]="In their dreams, even the armor of a female knight smells sweet, far from anything bitter or stinky.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101451"]="A crown bestowed upon the winner, engraved with the god of guardian's decree written in runes.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101452"]="A crown bestowed upon the winner, engraved with the god of guardian's declaration written in runes.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101453"]="<color=#FF0000>(Male)</color> \"Demon Cyborg\" Genos' hairstyle.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101454"]="A crown named after the God of Snow, Ullr. May the frost and snow create an unparalleled supremacy.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101455"]="A helmet resembling an icy blade, its surface freezes the boiling blood of enemies, turning the frozen blood into a lifeless, icy gleam.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101458"]="The Queen's shed shell contains a unique power of blessing.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101459"]="Crown with spikes, symbolizing the wearer's nobility and aloofness.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101460"]="A commemorative ribbon for the RSX series. Can be used as blindfolds to simulate the darkness of a mine cave.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101461"]="A phantom of a red dragon and wearing it seems to bring dragon roars to your ears.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101462"]="Holding hands while swaying, the enduring pact of the Christmas duo.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101467"]="In their dreams, even the armor of a female knight smells sweet, far from anything bitter or stinky.\nSnowman Dyestuffs can be used in the wardrobe to unlock other colors.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101472"]="Armor is not a must for a knight. A sleep hat is the mightiest helmet for a slumbering knight!\nSnowman Dyestuffs can be used in the wardrobe to unlock other colors.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101473"]="A navy velvet cap with sky-blue feathers. Adorned with a shimmering emerald to lock in the initial burst of spring greenery.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101474"]="A dark blue velvet cap with a golden bell playing the melody of early spring in the refreshing breeze.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101475"]="Fire safety helmet with illumination system for environment reconnaissance and locating individuals in distress.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101476"]="Made with flame-resistant materials, this safety helmet's clear fire mask serves as the last defense in the battle for survival.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101477"]="A hat shaped like a giant mushroom. Maybe you'll find mushrooms growing from it after the rain?",
    ["EquipDesc_4101479"]="Designed to be light enough to be worn on the head, yet often ends up on the roadside.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101480"]="Featuring a yellow and black tiger stripe design, this hat should be treated like a tiger—keep your distance.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101481"]="A mask modeled after a male alien, using markers and corrugated paper.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101482"]="A mask modeled after a female alien, using markers and corrugated paper.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101483"]="With their imposing dual horns, longhorn beetles are the fiercest warriors in the forest.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101484"]="With dotted spots resting on a red shell, their wings are hidden underneath, ready to fly.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101485"]="Chocolate ice cream for two, split it up, twice the coolness!",
    ["EquipDesc_4101486"]="The best combo of strawberries and cream, indulge in the sweetness of summer!",
    ["EquipDesc_4101487"]="The bard's bandana, with its dazzling feathers, is the brightest color in the desert.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101488"]="The dancer's bandana, covered in gems that shimmer under the sun.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101489"]="Tiger laser vision shining bright, ready to slice through anything.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101490"]="With a tiger-eyed scope, it's easy to spot prey from afar.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101491"]="The owl beanie with folded wings, gazing sharply forward.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101492"]="Wings outstretched, the owl hat's vibrant feathers graze the white clouds.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101493"]="A jellyfish cap with crystal-blue tentacles—it's even cooler when worn to the side!",
    ["EquipDesc_4101494"]="A jellyfish cap with neon-pink tentacles—feels just like jelly!",
    ["EquipDesc_4101497"]="These dominating bloody red dragon horns are said to be worn by the dragon lord who resides in the Crystal Palace.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101498"]="Essential protective gear for ice hockey, designed for intense physical contact.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101499"]="Essential protective gear for ice hockey, designed for intense physical contact.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101500"]="The curse of this crown is broken, with only faded words left behind—\"Please turn into a swan and permanently reside by my lake.\"",
    ["EquipDesc_4101501"]="A hat once owned by a renowned captain. It is a symbol of leadership and courage.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101502"]="A mask worn by a group of assassins to conceal their identities. It seems to make the wearer slightly more agile.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101503"]="Adorned with pure white swan feathers, its keeper once devoutly prayed for the prince \"to see through the witch's disguise and recognize his true love.\"",
    ["EquipDesc_4101504"]="A hat made to look like a bee.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101505"]="Yellow, wiggling on top of the head, appears to be fascinated by the view from above. (Note: When Yellow Doll Hat meets up with Red Doll Hat, it will show a special expression!)",
    ["EquipDesc_4101506"]="Red, wiggling on top of the head, seems to have come up with another brilliant idea. (Note: When Red Doll Hat meets up with Yellow Doll Hat, it will show a special expression!)",
    ["EquipDesc_4101507"]="The Spirit Carp, darting freely beneath the icy surface, is said to reside at unpolluted ocean depths. <color=#ff5d5d>During daily fishing, there's a very small chance to obtain double the materials.</color>",
    ["EquipDesc_4101508"]="Its splendid golden body is the work of Nield, once given as a gift to the Obeaune princess of the deep sea. <color=#ff5d5d>During daily fishing, there's a very small chance to obtain double the materials.</color>",
    ["EquipDesc_4101509"]="A crown named after the Goddess of Snow, Skadi. May the frost and snow create an unparalleled supremacy.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101510"]="The aroma of coffee attracts the cute Poring. Guess you want a cup of coffee too!",
    ["EquipDesc_4101511"]="The people of Verus envision this protected brain can lead to a civilization that outshines its predecessors.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101512"]="Fluffy dragon headwear. Bring all the New Year's luck to every Adventuress!",
    ["EquipDesc_4101513"]="These calming emerald dragon horns are said to be worn by the dragon princess who resides in the Crystal Palace.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101515"]="Put on the Yellow Headgear matching the costume and play with your friends!",
    ["EquipDesc_4101516"]="Put on the Red Headgear matching the costume and play with your friends!",
    ["EquipDesc_4101517"]="A wide hood adorned with star patterns offers a view of the starry sky without raising your head.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101518"]="Delicate fins grow near the ears, resisting the crushing pressure of the ocean's depths.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101519"]="Put on the Red Headgear matching the costume and play with your friends!",
    ["EquipDesc_4101520"]="Put on the Yellow Headgear matching the costume and play with your friends!",
    ["EquipDesc_4101521"]="Beautiful princess or cool knight? In the world of fantasy, you can have it all!",
    ["EquipDesc_4101522"]="Royal prince or wandering knight? In the world of fantasy, you can have it all!",
    ["EquipDesc_4101523"]="To honor the dance between the witch and prince, boastfully inscribed—\"The witch and prince are a better match.\"",
    ["EquipDesc_4101524"]="A crown from a small kingdom, its backside inscription tells a sincere wish—\"Wish to see the girl who became a swan at the ball again.\"",
    ["EquipDesc_4101527"]="As sagas and chants turn to ashes, from them, your glory shall emerge.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101528"]="Though temples and altars may crumble, your glory will shine through their dusty ruins.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101531"]="A crown made of three white jade conches, a unique ornament of the Merfolk tribe.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101533"]="Raoh's helmet adorned with the Ken-Oh Legion emblem in the center.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101534"]="Bat's goggles. These are great for blocking the apocalyptic sandstorms.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101535"]="The helmet Yuria used to hide her identity as the Last Nanto General.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101536"]="Kenshiro's hairstyle.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101537"]="Raoh's hairstyle.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101538"]="Yuria's hairstyle.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101539"]="Mamiya's hairstyle.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101540"]="Thouzer's hairstyle.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101541"]="Open your eyes and see the world beyond.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101542"]="\"Behind their masks, they joke and turn the gear of the era.\"",
    ["EquipDesc_4101544"]="Jagi's helmet.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101545"]="Toki's hairstyle.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101546"]="\"Gilded feathers in the lady's hair, exuding the aroma of desire in every step.\"",
    ["EquipDesc_4101547"]="Keep out the blazing sun and enjoy some leafy shade.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101548"]="Imagine if your hat was a flower, would butterflies land on it?",
    ["EquipDesc_4101549"]="Jagi's helmet.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101550"]="Being the most esteemed goddess on Olympus, this prestige was enough to pardon the sin of pride.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101551"]="Seated on the queen's throne, hidden by crown and veil, the goddess' true visage is unseen by all.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101552"]="Made from special ice crystals off Ktullanux's back—it emits a chilling aura that gives you a headache.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101553"]="A hairpin modeled after the sword of Retribution—might even carry a bit of its power.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101554"]="Silver light graces her hair, adorned with three golden osmanthus blooms.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101555"]="The scent of osmanthus weaves through her hair, cashing away the last bit of cold.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101556"]="Rem Horn",
    ["EquipDesc_4101557"]="Rem Hairstyle",
    ["EquipDesc_4101558"]="Ram Hairstyle",
    ["EquipDesc_4101559"]="Emilia Hairstyle",
    ["EquipDesc_4101560"]="Beatrice Hairstyle",
    ["EquipDesc_4101561"]="Subaru Natsuki Hairstyle",
    ["EquipDesc_4101562"]="Roswaal Hairstyle",
    ["EquipDesc_4101563"]="Garfiel Hairstyle",
    ["EquipDesc_4101564"]="Frederica Hairstyle",
    ["EquipDesc_4101565"]="This safety helmet looks like a bomb, but its fuse is lit for some reason!",
    ["EquipDesc_4101566"]="This safety helmet looks like a bomb, but the inside is heating up for some reason!",
    ["EquipDesc_4101568"]="The splendor of Hades lights the realm of the dead, but this light is cold and void of warmth.\n<color=#FF0000>(Note: When night falls, this costume receives Hade's blessing, appearing in a completely different look.)</color>",
    ["EquipDesc_4101569"]="The splendor of Hades lights the realm of the dead, but this light is cold and void of warmth.\n<color=#FF0000>(Note: When night falls, this costume receives Hade's blessing, appearing in a completely different look.)</color>",
    ["EquipDesc_4101570"]="The splendor of Persephone lights the realm of the dead, but this light is bound and constrained.\n<color=#FF0000>(Note: When night falls, this costume receives Hade's blessing, appearing in a completely different look.)</color>",
    ["EquipDesc_4101571"]="The splendor of Persephone lights the realm of the dead, but this light is bound and constrained.\n<color=#FF0000>(Note: When night falls, this costume receives Hade's blessing, appearing in a completely different look.)</color>",
    ["EquipDesc_4101572"]="It's okay, run whenever you feel like it! [Designer: UltiAlfred]",
    ["EquipDesc_4101573"]="Hope everyone gets their own capybara! With them around, ROX is never lonely again! Plus better drops for oranges and gold! [Designer: 麻瓜ツ]",
    ["EquipDesc_4101574"]="These bear earmuffs seem to be trying hard to stay awake.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101575"]="These bear earmuffs seem to be already dreaming away.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101576"]="There's a raccoon tucked inside this gift box—go on, give it a loving hug!",
    ["EquipDesc_4101577"]="The soft bamboo green is calm and elegant, while the fleeting snake brings an air of mystery, exuding celestial grace.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101578"]="The soft bamboo green is fresh and subtle, while the fleeting snake brings an air of mystery, exuding celestial grace.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101579"]="Let the auspicious snow of today herald bountiful harvests in the year to come.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101580"]="Let the auspicious snow of today herald bountiful harvests in the year to come.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101581"]="With sin consumed in sacred flame, naught remained but a crown of bone—sole witness to an age drowned in darkness.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101582"]="In the empty castle tonight, lights shine. He's all dressed up just to share a dance with you.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101583"]="With her bonnet on, the young lady is ready to shine as the star of the night.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101584"]="A magnificent Pragna helmet of royal violet with flowing golden veins. It displays the courage of a mortal who draws their blade against the gods above.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101585"]="A majestic Pragna helmet of royal violet with long hair tied high. Storms may shift and rage, but a warrior's heart stands unshaken.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101586"]="The moonlight is the Phantom's spotlight. In that silver glow, the Phantom bows low, hat in hand—elegance, never forsaken.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101587"]="For the Phantom, the curtain call is a signature move. So leap into the air, hair wild, and make it look spectacular.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101588"]="The gunshots are just the butler's work bell—so if you're not involved, just stay behind him. The main course is about to be served.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101589"]="In all the chaos, look for the blooming flower. She'll set off explosions like background music—just her way of spicing up the party.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101590"]="Before setting sail, the captain gathered feathers dropped by seabirds, hoping they'd bring good luck.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101591"]="The captain's hat brim is inlaid with gilded patterns. After his voyage, people could faintly see a blue glow upon it...",
    ["EquipDesc_4101592"]="The keeper recounts how a white fox with red markings once leapt into the barren spring, where nothing flowed but a silent pool of moonlight.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101593"]="The keeper recounts how a fox kept waiting by the barren spring, until a fateful night when it awoke to warm spring water shimmering beneath floating blossoms.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101594"]="This Emperor Penguin Hat doesn't just block the cold—it laughs in the face of icy polar storms.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101595"]="A tiny note in the corner of the blueprint reads: \"Beacon of the Cosmos.\"",
    ["EquipDesc_4101596"]="A tiny note in the corner of the blueprint reads: \"Beacon of the Cosmos.\"",
    ["EquipDesc_4101597"]="A tiny note in the corner of the blueprint reads: \"It cannot be seen, yet it exists.\"",
    ["EquipDesc_4101598"]="Combine with the Alexander Outfit for maximum cuteness!",
    ["EquipDesc_4101600"]="Combine with the Baoku Lee Outfit for maximum luck!",
    ["EquipDesc_4101602"]="Keep this little luck-bringer cub for a year of blessings.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101603"]="No one can turn down a cute little cub lounging on their head.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101604"]="As the sun dips and the moon takes over, the stars blink awake. The sky turns a deep blue—his journey is just getting started.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101605"]="A tiny note in the corner of the blueprint reads: \"It cannot be seen, yet it exists.\"",
    ["EquipDesc_4101606"]="Chester's new drop! Inspired by the ocean, but totally made for DJs and street art.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101607"]="Chester's new drop! Inspired by the ocean, but totally made for DJs and street art.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101608"]="As the sun dips and the moon takes over, the stars blink awake. The sky turns a deep blue—her journey is just getting started.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101609"]="The divine gaze awakens. From darkness, light strikes forth; life blooms toward the sun.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101610"]="The divine gaze awakens. From darkness, light strikes forth; life blooms toward the sun.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101611"]="After a whole winter of training, Capoo's got the muscles it always wanted!",
    ["EquipDesc_4101612"]="Capoo's in its calmest state—go ahead, give it all the pats.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101613"]="Feeling blue? Just eat something awesome.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101614"]="Capoo's asking for a kiss!",
    ["EquipDesc_4101615"]="Try this face after messing up—no one can stay mad at you.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101616"]="Great for showing lots of moods—works almost anywhere.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101617"]="Warning! Capoo is angry! Calm it down before you get eaten!",
    ["EquipDesc_4101618"]="\nCongratulations on obtaining the perfect Capoo Headgear!\n<color=#ea7474>Whimsy Effect: Changes the headgear emoticons once every 10 seconds.</color>",
    ["EquipDesc_4101619"]="Throw those sparkly sweets in your mouth! Let the rainbow flavors explode on your teeth!",
    ["EquipDesc_4101620"]="Grab that puffy cotton candy! Hide those fluffy, sweet clouds in your mouth!",
    ["EquipDesc_4101621"]="Remember the one who makes you laugh—they're always worth your trust.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101622"]="We all have our edges, but that won't stop us from enjoying this moment of fun together.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101623"]="A precious keepsake from the summer adventure with Taichi, full of Digital World memories.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101624"]="A precious keepsake from the summer adventure with Mimi, full of Digital World memories.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101625"]="Bathed in the searing blaze of Olympus' skies—O mighty Sun, bear witness to my courage, and anoint me with your golden crown of glory!",
    ["EquipDesc_410162502"]="Bathed in the searing blaze of Olympus' skies—O mighty Sun, bear witness to my courage, and anoint me with your golden crown of glory!",
    ["EquipDesc_4101626"]="Among warriors, there's a saying: Victory knows no direction. Yet it crowned me once—and now it marches only with the thrust of my spear.",
    ["EquipDesc_410162602"]="Among warriors, there's a saying: Victory knows no direction. Yet it crowned me once—and now it marches only with the thrust of my spear.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101627"]="The moon below comes from the sky; the beloved nearby comes from my heart. All that studying finally paid off—now let the breeze carry the rising heat.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101628"]="Neat handwriting on the page tells how nervous she was during this late summer. Open the letter—her hair brushes past your fingers. You already know the answer.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101629"]="Their eyes are covered, yet they see more clearly—silent flames bring whispers of the ancient past...",
    ["EquipDesc_4101630"]="Unknown tendrils bind the dagger to their wrist; perhaps it’s destiny itself that has wrapped them in its grasp.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101631"]="Its whispers burn like eternal hatred—echoes of a lifetime of vengeance cling to your ears.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101632"]="Legend says the Banshee in the forest weaves crowns from the shadows of their visitors. Wear it—or destroy it?",
    ["EquipDesc_4101636"]="They say the laughter of the holidays calls the spirit of the snowy night—unicorn, appearing with a beautiful snowfall.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101637"]="Joy continues through the night as the unicorn keeps watch from the sky, even where no snowflake dares to fall.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101638"]="As storms are torn apart and currents silenced, the one true sovereign of the sea makes its descent...\n(A special effect triggers upon entering battle!)",
    ["EquipDesc_410163802"]="As storms are torn apart and currents silenced, the one true sovereign of the sea makes its descent...\n(A special effect triggers upon entering battle!)",
    ["EquipDesc_4101639"]="With earth shattered and waves crushed beneath its might, the one true sovereign of the sea makes its descent...\n(A special effect triggers upon entering battle!)",
    ["EquipDesc_410163902"]="With earth shattered and waves crushed beneath its might, the one true sovereign of the sea makes its descent...\n(A special effect triggers upon entering battle!)",
    ["EquipDesc_4101640"]="Wataru Ikusabe's hairstyle.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101641"]="The inside of the hat is stuffed with fluffy fur! Put it on and you'll feel nice and warm, like a little bear is sitting on your head.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101642"]="We leave our footprints on this world—and then, cheers!",
    ["EquipDesc_4101643"]="The first flower of spring—and the last. It falls from the branch, choosing to bloom across the world with you.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101648"]="The source of a knight's power—put it on and deliver steaming soup to everyone in the cold!",
    ["EquipDesc_4101649"]="The source of a knight's power—put it on and deliver delicious food to every hungry soul!",
    ["EquipDesc_4101652"]="Riding across the wild, people endlessly chase the first sign of green on the early spring horizon.",
    ["EquipDesc_4101653"]="White snow crowns the mountain peaks. With reins in hand, one rides through the frost, determined to behold the first gilded dawn of spring.",
    ["EquipDesc_4102001"]="Scientifically proven to increase one's beauty threefold.",
    ["EquipDesc_4102002"]="A mask worn to conceal the wearer's identity at a ball.",
    ["EquipDesc_4102003"]="A mask worn by Goblin leaders. Primitive yet strangely appealing.",
    ["EquipDesc_4102004"]="Legend tells that this golden mask was once worn by a queen.",
    ["EquipDesc_4102005"]="Earrings made from black wings. They emanate a demonic aura that imbues the wearer with mysterious power.",
    ["EquipDesc_4102006"]="Gorgeous earrings made from angel wings. They emanate a holy aura that imbues the wearer with mysterious power.",
    ["EquipDesc_4102007"]="A black blindfold that completely blocks out all light.",
    ["EquipDesc_4102008"]="Binoculars that allow you to see objects from a great distance.",
    ["EquipDesc_4102009"]="Used for swimming underwater. People will think you're crazy if you wear it on land.",
    ["EquipDesc_4102010"]="A unique eye protector that also seems to enhance the wearer's mental strength.",
    ["EquipDesc_4102011"]="A strange-looking mask that looks pretty scary. It is mainly worn to play pranks on people.",
    ["EquipDesc_4102022"]="A patch worn to cover one eye.",
    ["EquipDesc_4102024"]="An accessory made out of the wing feathers of a Pecopeco.",
    ["EquipDesc_4102025"]="Gives the ears an elvish look. Great if you're into that kind of thing.",
    ["EquipDesc_4102026"]="A mask shaped like butterfly wings.",
    ["EquipDesc_4102027"]="This small, cute item is a must-have for young men and women.",
    ["EquipDesc_4102028"]="Spooky headgear designed to look like a Whisper.",
    ["EquipDesc_4102029"]="A mask rumored to have been worn by the protagonist of a tragic story.",
    ["EquipDesc_4102030"]="A pair of glasses to help people with poor vision see the world clearly again.",
    ["EquipDesc_4102031"]="An eye patch with a unique style. Function meets high fashion.",
    ["EquipDesc_4102032"]="Makes the wearer's eyes bright and piercing.",
    ["EquipDesc_4102033"]="Small glasses that make the wearer look scholarly.",
    ["EquipDesc_4102034"]="Makes you feel dizzy for some reason.",
    ["EquipDesc_4102035"]="More stylish and more effective than ordinary sunglasses.",
    ["EquipDesc_4102036"]="Wear to hide your identity and create an air of mystery.",
    ["EquipDesc_4102037"]="A mask made out of steel. It is highly practical but is not very attractive.",
    ["EquipDesc_4102038"]="A sticker named after the Stars' Blessings. It is a prize that the Heines Family prepared for the Christmas event. The gold patches are as dazzling as a winter fire.",
    ["EquipDesc_4102039"]="Sunglasses worn by hot blooded youths - although the style is retro, it still looks great today.",
    ["EquipDesc_4102040"]="Food that vampires drink.",
    ["EquipDesc_4102041"]="The glasses of the Campus Festival set.",
    ["EquipDesc_4102042"]="A mask with a unique style, it's said that the mask makes people dance their hearts out.\n",
    ["EquipDesc_4102043"]="Wearing this kind of glasses requires a certain amount of skill, and its lens seems to contain an aura of time magic.",
    ["EquipDesc_4102044"]="Made with magically enchanted materials, this bandage is used to suppress overpowering magic.",
    ["EquipDesc_4102045"]="Is the expression under the mask crying or laughing?",
    ["EquipDesc_4102046"]="The first thing that hunters do before hunting is to get to know the prey. And there is no creature that knows the prey better than the prey itself. Based on this doctrine, hunter costumes dressed as prey have also become popular.",
    ["EquipDesc_4102047"]="A mysterious mask that transcends time and space. It's Chloe's most cherished treasure.",
    ["EquipDesc_4102048"]="Makes it possible for you to see more clearly in the water. Let's explore the underwater world!",
    ["EquipDesc_4102049"]="No matter how busy you are, don't forget to have breakfast!",
    ["EquipDesc_4102050"]="I have a good idea regarding the coming adventure!",
    ["EquipDesc_4102051"]="It looks like it will make people think it's filled with wisdom.",
    ["EquipDesc_4102052"]="The item popular among electronica fans. Even you leave the party, the echoes of carnival stay. Your life is a party",
    ["EquipDesc_4102053"]="A frightening mask that resembles the clowns in urban legends. Clowns use human mouths as a disguise to blend in better with human society, but everything will be too late when they speak and eat in ways people don't comprehend...",
    ["EquipDesc_4102054"]="This curvy mustache needs to be carefully maintained every day.",
    ["EquipDesc_4102055"]="A unique style of sunglasses, which is popular among the trendy crowd on the Midgard Continent.",
    ["EquipDesc_4102056"]="Uncanny laughter from non-human objects causes the air nearby to be filled with a bone-chilling sensation... Anyway, putting a transparent board on the shoulder printed with an absurd amount of \"HA\" is pretty cool.",
    ["EquipDesc_4102058"]="Carved from eternally-pure ice crystals, this pendant will never melt from the heat and will always be cold even in summer.",
    ["EquipDesc_4102059"]="Shaped like a sunblossom, it imprints a fiery red adornment on the character’s face. A prize reserved for those whose hearts are filled with glory.",
    ["EquipDesc_4102060"]="A peek into fate's favor, or perhaps a curse that gouges the eye.",
    ["EquipDesc_4102061"]="A Beelzebub's Mask that was once popular on the market. Finally, get to see the real stuff. Reminder: Don't wear it during Halloween.",
    ["EquipDesc_4102062"]="A special transformation tool that can transform a human into Ultraman Seven.\nCan be dismantled to get <color=#da696f>Seals of Light</color>, which can be used to exchange rare items in the Store of Light. <color=#da696f>Seals of Light</color> will be recycled when the ULTRAMAN event is over.",
    ["EquipDesc_4102063"]="An Eardrop embedded with the scales of Jormungandr. It's said the one who wears it can unshackle their fate from reincarnation.",
    ["EquipDesc_4102064"]="The angry eyes of Shura deter all evil.",
    ["EquipDesc_4102065"]="The beauty’s smile conquers both gods and ghosts.",
    ["EquipDesc_4102067"]="Don't let the annoying noise get in the way of your show. The show of the superstar begins now.",
    ["EquipDesc_4102068"]="Allows the holder to experience one of the four extreme negative emotions that drove Thanatos into madness—Maero, which makes a cold statue weep.",
    ["EquipDesc_4102070"]="Cut and carved from a single piece of aquamarine. This pair of earrings is adorned with dreamily bluish crystals, referred to as the Moon of Artemis due to its shape.",
    ["EquipDesc_4102072"]="It's rumored that a terrifying bare-bone visage covers half of Hel's face. In homage to this, her followers fashion these masks in its likeness.",
    ["EquipDesc_4102073"]="These explosive/bullet-proof tactical goggles are integrated with night vision and tracking capabilities, making them a must for high-risk missions.",
    ["EquipDesc_4102075"]="A pair of semi-rimless glasses that make you scholarly and somehow more attractive.",
    ["EquipDesc_4102076"]="Sponsored by the campus clinic, it usually appears on those wounded faces.",
    ["EquipDesc_4102078"]="A mask that is based on the \"Dominator of the Universe,\" Boros' appearance.",
    ["EquipDesc_4102079"]="As the nine realms flourish and perish and the rise and fall of gods, the golden eyes of the watcher oversee everything, bidding farewell to everything.",
    ["EquipDesc_4102081"]="With thunder and wind brewing among his beard and hair, the king's dignity is sacred and unshakable.",
    ["EquipDesc_4102082"]="The mask of Thouzer, adorned with a cross-shaped imperial star at the center of the forehead.",
    ["EquipDesc_4102088"]="Zeus transformed into a raven in the chilly rain to win Hera's love, which clouded her vision ever since.",
    ["EquipDesc_4102089"]="These tiny wings can't make you fly, but they do help keep out the noise and bring some peace of mind.",
    ["EquipDesc_4102090"]="A creepy mask with a glowing third eye in red—direct eye contact can be quite unsettling.",
    ["EquipDesc_4102091"]="Zeus transformed into a raven in the chilly rain to win Hera's love, which clouded her vision ever since.",
    ["EquipDesc_4102092"]="The witch hunts the whispers of desire buried deepest. At the moment your eyes met, you were already hers.",
    ["EquipDesc_4102093"]="Your opponent used a Muted Speech Card.",
    ["EquipDesc_4102094"]="Ordinary wild grass—yet put it between your lips, and you wear the cool of the wandering blade.",
    ["EquipDesc_4102095"]="If you ever catch the Phantom looking your way, you should really check your pockets—fast.",
    ["EquipDesc_4102096"]="The hunter hides their gaze—just to make the prey drop their guard.",
    ["EquipDesc_4102097"]="Amid the terrifying storm, the captain embraced the sea, and the waters cupped his face.",
    ["EquipDesc_4102098"]="Travelers sometimes show off their cooking here—these steaming Takoyaki are everyone's favorite!",
    ["EquipDesc_4102099"]="With its twisty frame, this pair of glasses has a playful vibe.",
    ["EquipDesc_4102104"]="It records the knight's path ahead, awaiting the call of the next great journey!",
    ["EquipDesc_4102106"]="Ever watchful, the falcon senses spring's nearness first, bearing a fallen feather to its master—a herald of the season's return.",
    ["EquipDesc_4103001"]="Smoking is hazardous to your health.",
    ["EquipDesc_4103002"]="A special fish that can be kept in your mouth. It smells, but has been specially processed so that it won't rot.",
    ["EquipDesc_4103003"]="A mouth covering made of tough metal.",
    ["EquipDesc_4103004"]="A hat that looks like a pacifier.",
    ["EquipDesc_4103005"]="A mask that protects the throat.",
    ["EquipDesc_4103006"]="A delicate flower that is placed in the mouth for a romantic touch.",
    ["EquipDesc_4103007"]="Would go great with a cup of coffee.",
    ["EquipDesc_4103008"]="Put this in your mouth and it might freshen your breath.",
    ["EquipDesc_4103009"]="Make sure you don't inhale the smoke.",
    ["EquipDesc_4103010"]="Stroke it and reminisce about the good old days.",
    ["EquipDesc_4103011"]="Don for instant ruggedness.",
    ["EquipDesc_4103012"]="An accessory made to look like an angry snarling mouth. Wear it and people will give you a wide berth.",
    ["EquipDesc_4103013"]="Sweet, colorful candy.",
    ["EquipDesc_4103014"]="A bright red rose that can be held in your mouth. I wonder if it has any thorns.",
    ["EquipDesc_4103015"]="Bubble gum to chew on. Not good for your dental health but great for your coolness.",
    ["EquipDesc_4103016"]="A big red nose.",
    ["EquipDesc_4103017"]="A mask with a rainbow pattern. Cheers up everyone who sees it.",
    ["EquipDesc_4103018"]="Guaranteed to keep people away.",
    ["EquipDesc_4103019"]="A blue medical mask that looks very reliable and safe.",
    ["EquipDesc_4103020"]="A tight mask that provides excellent protection even though it makes it more difficult to breathe.",
    ["EquipDesc_4103021"]="A gentle blooming white rose that symbolizes Radish Warrior's yearning for his beloved.",
    ["EquipDesc_4103022"]="The battle with the demon is exceptionally hard, and long exposure to such a battlefield, it is inevitable that there are hunters who fight in a brutal way, as evidenced by the accessories made of broken jaws.",
    ["EquipDesc_4103023"]="A combination of a mask and loudspeaker. The filter that wraps around the jaw can be removed. Capable of stable sound transmission of up to 50 decibels at a range of 30 feet.",
    ["EquipDesc_4103024"]="Tortilla chips seasoned with nacho cheese powder. Crunch your way to sabor delicioso!​",
    ["EquipDesc_4103025"]="Bee headphones with built-in dual-subwoofer speakers. It'll bring you to the realm of music!",
    ["EquipDesc_4103026"]="“Let the thunders witness my harvest!” Only the most experienced beach combers know that the hash weather come with the greatest harvest.",
    ["EquipDesc_4103028"]="A personalized straw hat with excellent light blocking ability, so beware of the color difference between your face and neck when returning from vacation.",
    ["EquipDesc_4103029"]="The delicate glutinous rice cooked in coconut milk dumplings wrapped in palm leaves and leave a fragrance on your lips when you bite into them.",
    ["EquipDesc_4103031"]="Perhaps the first \"tyrant boss\" was really a lazing lion on the open grassland...",
    ["EquipDesc_4103032"]="A lion that’s half-awake, but ready to hunt. Watch out for its sharp fangs!",
    ["EquipDesc_4103033"]="Thor's coronation gift to the Warrior. Contains the earth-shaking power of thunder.",
    ["EquipDesc_4103034"]="Thor's coronation gift to the Warrior.Contains the sky-shattering power of lightning.",
    ["EquipDesc_4103036"]="Cleaning Face Mask with a knot at the back of head, preventing dust entering mouth and nose.",
    ["EquipDesc_4103037"]="A very suspicious fishbone from a suspicious monster.",
    ["EquipDesc_4103038"]="Pastry for the Goddess of the Moon. Its patterns are just too adorable. It is recommended to consume it in one bite.",
    ["EquipDesc_4103039"]="The bamboo muzzle Nezuko Kamado is always biting.\nIt is not possible to wear the costumes of other <color=#CA2E0AFF>Demon Slayer: Kimetsu no Yaiba characters</color> while wearing this.",
    ["EquipDesc_4103040"]="Fangs that can easily pierce through skins. While some of them are invitations, most of them are death warnings.",
    ["EquipDesc_4103041"]="A stylish Mr. Nutcracker costume. The English-style mustache is the essence of this outfit.",
    ["EquipDesc_4103042"]="The Vuvuzela is a horn used for cheering on and encouraging players. Some say it can reach over 100 decibels if blown hard!",
    ["EquipDesc_4103044"]="Allows the holder to experience one of the four extreme negative emotions that drove Thanatos into madness—Despair, which darkens the sun forever.",
    ["EquipDesc_4103045"]="A veil that sprinkles star shards. It covers not only one's face but also the soul.",
    ["EquipDesc_4103047"]="Highly sophisticated jaw protector, shielding the exposed, vulnerable face together with the helmet.",
    ["EquipDesc_4103048"]="Malice takes root in the flesh, tearing you apart—and wounding those around you.",
    ["EquipDesc_4104127"]="An irresistible holiday treat, a delicacy even Porings can't resist. This massive sundae is now up for grabs!",
    ["EquipDesc_4104128"]="This large-capacity turtle shell-shaped supply pack contains all the necessary equipment and provisions for survival in extreme conditions.",
    ["EquipDesc_4107001"]="The backpack of the Campus Festival set.",
    ["EquipDesc_4107002"]="Fluffy Cat Backpack",
    ["EquipDesc_4107003"]="Campus Festival Backpack (Red)",
    ["EquipDesc_4107004"]="Campus Festival Backpack (Blue)",
    ["EquipDesc_4107005"]="Campus Festival Backpack (Green)",
    ["EquipDesc_4107006"]="Campus Festival Backpack (White)",
    ["EquipDesc_4107009"]="A special detector developed by the Rekenber Institute. It is able to detect the concentration of harmful substances in the air.",
    ["EquipDesc_4107010"]="A flower basket of Daytime Magicians. A light-colored pigeon that conveys their intentions to the audience makes the best partner.",
    ["EquipDesc_4107011"]="A paper crane of Night Magicians. This crane made out of playing cards is always moving around them as if it really is alive.",
    ["EquipDesc_4107013"]="A bard's lute that makes a simple and beautiful tone.",
    ["EquipDesc_4107014"]="A spray cay trendsetters carry with them to create all sorts of styles.",
    ["EquipDesc_4107015"]="A balloon carried by clowns to bring joy to children.",
    ["EquipDesc_4107016"]="A magical broom carried by witches who hide among the people. It is said that these witches only appear in front of others during a special festival and speak and act as they please.",
    ["EquipDesc_4107017"]="A peculiar ghost outfit that is worn by those who want to dress up as a resurrected dead person for a night march during a special festival.",
    ["EquipDesc_4107018"]="A gift sack named after the Stars' Blessings. It is a prize that the Heines Family prepared for the Christmas event. This bulging sack is filled with gifts.",
    ["EquipDesc_4107019"]="A uniquely designed white parasol that carries the promise between two lovers.",
    ["EquipDesc_4107020"]="An elegant eastern-styled back accessory. People will wear it on special occasions to welcome a new change.",
    ["EquipDesc_4107022"]="A lively Baby Nian. It lets out a cute growl occasionally.",
    ["EquipDesc_4107023"]="An eastern-styled lamp. Its design is quaint and it illuminates the road as well as the people near it in the night.",
    ["EquipDesc_4107024"]="A regal cavalry style battle flag. Charismatic and dignified, it symbolizes the honor of the royal family.",
    ["EquipDesc_4107025"]="Surfboards—the epitome of seaside cool. You can imagine the beating waves just by looking at it.",
    ["EquipDesc_4107026"]="An backpack that's suited for students. It's youthful and sweet.",
    ["EquipDesc_4107027"]="No matter how vicious the non-human creatures are, they will be exceptionally adorable as long as they are made into stuffed toys, and Baphomet is no exception. No one knows whether the first person who made a Baphomet doll did so in defiance of the Lord of the Demon World, or simply possessed a different fetish?",
    ["EquipDesc_4107030"]="Archaeologists wear this bag. Ruins on this continent are full of risks, and depending on the wits alone is not going to work for an explorer.",
    ["EquipDesc_4107031"]="A small blue mascot that brings deliciousness and good mood to parallel worlds.",
    ["EquipDesc_4107032"]="Don't go so fast! You'll scare someone!",
    ["EquipDesc_4107033"]="Giant bat wings that Rimuru obtained through \"Predator\" abilities.",
    ["EquipDesc_4107034"]="Remember to check how much oxygen is left before diving.",
    ["EquipDesc_4107035"]="Batik motif backpack made through a unique and complicated manufacturing process.",
    ["EquipDesc_4107036"]="Batik motif backpack made through a unique and complicated manufacturing process.",
    ["EquipDesc_4107037"]="Batik motif backpack made through a unique and complicated manufacturing process.",
    ["EquipDesc_4107039"]="A regal cavalry style battleflag. Charismatic and dignified, it symbolizes the honor of the regal cavalry.",
    ["EquipDesc_4107040"]="This dusty book of magic from the Academy is said to record the unknown history of Midgard.",
    ["EquipDesc_4107042"]="Enjoy a lazy time of tea and desserts at four in the afternoon.",
    ["EquipDesc_4107043"]="Celebrating the victory obtained by Team Lunatic in the Poring vs Lunatic event",
    ["EquipDesc_4107044"]="Celebrating the victory obtained by Team Poring in the Poring vs Lunatic event",
    ["EquipDesc_4107046"]="\"Starley said she's a world-class star. But in my eyes, she's the fixed star of the universe.\" – Astronaut Hurt Walker Speth",
    ["EquipDesc_4107047"]="Accessory for top performers. A artificial product that fit perfectly with the wearer and only the trend leaders can harness the charm",
    ["EquipDesc_4107048"]="According to the legends, victims of the terrible Jokers do not dissipate after death. Instead, they are chained by Jokers and are doomed to keep repeating the same actions they performed before their death. The resentment built up in this endless loop has turned them into crazy, mindless spirits, making them Jokers' accomplices.",
    ["EquipDesc_4107050"]="The deeper you venture into the abyss, the more bizarre the creatures burned by the flames are here. Even the imps here look fiercer than usual.",
    ["EquipDesc_4107051"]="A trophy that represents supreme honor is the best proof of an Adventurer's strength.",
    ["EquipDesc_4107052"]="No one knows which Craftsman originally built such a statue, yet people believe that it can bring them wealth and good luck. So, what is the price to pay for trading with the devil?",
    ["EquipDesc_4107053"]="Two instruments are indispensable to a parade procession. One is a snare drum, and the other is a sonorous trumpet. Blow this trumpet and rejoice on the holy night!",
    ["EquipDesc_4107054"]="These wings are light and fluffy like layers of snowflakes. When they flap, it looks like you can see falling snowflakes. Be careful not to bring it into places where it's too warm.",
    ["EquipDesc_4107055"]="Star Guild Rewards for the First Cross-Server KVM Competition",
    ["EquipDesc_4107056"]="Star Guild Rewards for the First Cross-Server KVM Competition",
    ["EquipDesc_4107057"]="Star Guild Rewards for the First Cross-Server KVM Competition",
    ["EquipDesc_4107058"]="Star Guild Rewards for the First Cross-Server KVM Competition",
    ["EquipDesc_4107059"]="Star Guild Rewards for the First Cross-Server KVM Competition",
    ["EquipDesc_4107060"]="Star Guild Rewards for the First Cross-Server KVM Competition",
    ["EquipDesc_4107061"]="Star Guild Rewards for the First Cross-Server KVM Competition",
    ["EquipDesc_4107062"]="Star Guild Rewards for the First Cross-Server KVM Competition",
    ["EquipDesc_4107063"]="Star Guild Rewards for the First Cross-Server KVM Competition",
    ["EquipDesc_4107064"]="Star Guild Rewards for the First Cross-Server KVM Competition",
    ["EquipDesc_4107065"]="2nd Place Prizes for the First Cross-Server KVM Competition",
    ["EquipDesc_4107066"]="3rd Place Prizes for the First Cross-Server KVM Competition",
    ["EquipDesc_4107067"]="The divine door of heaven opened and beams of gold shone through. The brave spread their wings to fly.",
    ["EquipDesc_4107068"]="The wings tainted with hatred and fury display a giant membrane between the horrifying bones when spread, as if venting all the sorrow and anger after hundreds of years of captivity.",
    ["EquipDesc_4107069"]="A Witchery Totem with a strong local touch. Seeing the luxurious pile made with bones of animals and humans, one is bound to relate it to wicked rituals.",
    ["EquipDesc_4107070"]="Treasure Tiger comes in the snow, and it will be a sign of a bountiful year. Step by step, it carries the breath of spring to the front.",
    ["EquipDesc_4107072"]="A hard shell that has been boiled completely red in the broth. It exudes an attractive aroma and has a mouth-watering appearance.",
    ["EquipDesc_4107073"]="The hovering eye that never sleeps. It is a creation that combines most advanced magic and technology.",
    ["EquipDesc_4107074"]="Eddga retains his dignity even though he has been shrunk to the size of a doll. Pet his ears and touch his palm, and he will talk back to you with his Roaaaarrrr...",
    ["EquipDesc_4107075"]="The same guitar used by The TOYS! Perfect for performing Prontera’s hottest new tunes.",
    ["EquipDesc_4107076"]="Handmade by court artisans from the East, it is made with a magic paper-cutting technique. The swimming goldfish on the lantern is faintly visible when lighting it up.",
    ["EquipDesc_4107079"]="A fan with exquisite and elegant patterns. Its surface has been stained with precious perfume and is popular with the nobility.",
    ["EquipDesc_4107080"]="An adorable little creature fed with Doritos chips. It's able to find the same Doritos addicts by tracing a special aroma.",
    ["EquipDesc_4107081"]="The lid on the basket could not contain the octopus seeking freedom. Time to make it into meat balls, sashimi and teppanyaki......",
    ["EquipDesc_4107082"]="A quality water gun passed down from the last water gun battle winner with top-notch shooting speed.",
    ["EquipDesc_4107083"]="Strictly speaking, it’s more than just a water gun. Maybe you can try filling it with cannonballs…",
    ["EquipDesc_4107084"]="An ancient craft with a history of a thousand years. It is said that you can hear the voice of guidance from the nether world after making a wish to it on a night when the moon and stars are bright in the night sky.",
    ["EquipDesc_4107085"]="A handicraft made with fresh flowers, which are painstakingly folded, interwoven and strung together with love.",
    ["EquipDesc_4107086"]="The one who wields the hammer is a representative of Thor's punishment.",
    ["EquipDesc_4107088"]="Special gear that is vital to the war on Titan. To use it will ease, operator must control the body balance with great proficiency.",
    ["EquipDesc_4107089"]="A wild Deviruchi who entered your camp by mistake. It seems to want to trade the fish in its hands for something...",
    ["EquipDesc_4107092"]="A combination of a long and a short sword that is used in pairs when attacking.",
    ["EquipDesc_4107093"]="A sword box that is entirely crafted from a meteorite. It is almost impossible to discern what lies within.",
    ["EquipDesc_4107094"]="The first generation of information flow computer produced by some dimensional authority, which has been discontinued and kept as a souvenir.",
    ["EquipDesc_4107095"]="A dragon-like monster that showed up with Princess Maya before.",
    ["EquipDesc_4107096"]="A weapon of the Ultraman Seven Suit. The energy of Spacium flows in this sword.\nCan be dismantled to get <color=#da696f>Seals of Light</color>, which can be used to exchange rare items in the Store of Light. <color=#da696f>Seals of Light</color> will be recycled when the ULTRAMAN event is over.",
    ["EquipDesc_4107097"]="The Wooden Box Tanjiro Kamado is always carrying on his back.\nIt is not possible to wear the costumes of other <color=#CA2E0AFF>Demon Slayer: Kimetsu no Yaiba characters</color> while wearing this.",
    ["EquipDesc_4107098"]="A unique-styled Teruteru bozu that can turn a cloudy sky with mizzle into a sunny day.",
    ["EquipDesc_4107100"]="The guardian of Giant Court, Loki's most loyal servant. Even though his flesh has long been destroyed, his soul could be summoned upon request.",
    ["EquipDesc_4107101"]="The red devil carries out redemption, while the blue devil awards rightfulness. Alongside the Twin Devils, mankind is protected.",
    ["EquipDesc_4107102"]="Shine, warriors of glory! Guide us to victory!",
    ["EquipDesc_4107103"]="Even though the Nutcrackers came to life, their spring needs to be loaded daily.",
    ["EquipDesc_4107105"]="It's a semitransparent umbrella with a frog on it. When raindrops fall on it, you will hear the sound of spring.",
    ["EquipDesc_4107106"]="A supersonic missile designed to be used in bombarding operations for long-range strategic bombers. It will tail the target like a shark once it locks on one.",
    ["EquipDesc_4107107"]="Allows the holder to experience one of the four extreme negative emotions that drove Thanatos into madness—Agony, which blows out the burning fire on the seas of liquor.",
    ["EquipDesc_4107108"]="Is the Angeling flapping his wings behind going to take the Adventurer to the realm of Porings together?",
    ["EquipDesc_4107109"]="The incarnation of Horus, the falcon of ancient Egypt. It represents the eternal dignity of the kingship, as well as a legend of revenge for one's father.",
    ["EquipDesc_4107110"]="A unicorn doll that always stays right beside the cradle. It's made of naivety and dreams, not cloth and cotton.",
    ["EquipDesc_4107111"]="A stylish fashion backpack, born to be free and wild, like its owner.",
    ["EquipDesc_4107112"]="Carrying the hope of the entire Arcade center and betting your precious token. Accept the challenge?",
    ["EquipDesc_4107113"]="Every ambitious hunter who plans to conquer the ocean should have a decent harpoon.​",
    ["EquipDesc_4107114"]="Reload the water shells and open fire to the blazing weather!​",
    ["EquipDesc_4107115"]="The starry wheel rotates as destiny revolves. Even the greatest mathematicians cannot figure out its inherent laws.",
    ["EquipDesc_4107116"]="A war drum painted with mysterious totems. When tribal wars break out, blood-bathing warriors will gain power from the drumrolls.",
    ["EquipDesc_4107119"]="Break through the walls of dimension! Let the world hears us!",
    ["EquipDesc_4107120"]="The wings of Battle Angel. She will hold up the flag of god, putting an end to the unrest and dispute.",
    ["EquipDesc_4107121"]="The wings of Judgement Angel. She will bring absolute justice to all living beings at the end of the century.",
    ["EquipDesc_4107122"]="The twin blades Souei carries on his back, finishing the enemy in one hit.",
    ["EquipDesc_4107123"]="The wings Souka acquired after becoming a Dragonewt.",
    ["EquipDesc_4107125"]="Deviruchi disguised as a megaphone. It sneaked into the scene at night and refused to leave after the performance.​",
    ["EquipDesc_4107126"]="The most ferocious executor in the lands of the dead. He will offer blood and wars for his goddess.",
    ["EquipDesc_4107127"]="A doll backpack that is based on Terrible Tornado's appearance.",
    ["EquipDesc_4107128"]="A portable speaker decorated with rivets and spikes. It releases the roars from deep in the soul.",
    ["EquipDesc_4107129"]="These glasses, crafted with some \"absolutely impossible\" technology, are seemingly capable of immersing people into insanity.",
    ["EquipDesc_4107130"]="The future wolf king rescued from poachers is still a cub in a basket waiting to be fed.",
    ["EquipDesc_4107131"]="Only by reciting the spell, \"Open Pumpkin,\" will it not bite you.",
    ["EquipDesc_4107133"]="Shimmering like stars in the night sky and delicate as sheer silk, these wings are even lighter than a dream.",
    ["EquipDesc_4107134"]="Starlight be your feathers; glory and honor be your wings! Among all the glittering stars, you are the most brilliant one!",
    ["EquipDesc_4107135"]="Cradled by the scent of fruit, drifting into peaceful dreams inside a golden apple.",
    ["EquipDesc_4107136"]="The divine figure who sounds the horn before dusk, yet the fading brilliance of that is merely the afterglow of bygone glory.",
    ["EquipDesc_4107139"]="Cradled by the scent of fruit, drifting into peaceful dreams inside a golden apple.",
    ["EquipDesc_4107140"]="Endured the trials of gales and snows; these wings stored enough power to soar again in the upcoming spring.",
    ["EquipDesc_4107141"]="Snow and frost mist surrendered to the King of Niflheim, turning into a cloak to worship their god.",
    ["EquipDesc_4107142"]="Professional device for operation in smoky or toxic environments, commonly used in hazardous tasks.",
    ["EquipDesc_4107143"]="An insanely large backpack that boosts your confidence. Full of treasures!",
    ["EquipDesc_4107144"]="Cute baby dragons. Treat them to tasty meals, and you'll receive amazing blessings!",
    ["EquipDesc_4107145"]="Known for its speed dash across the sky. No kingdom wants to be the crash site of this comet.",
    ["EquipDesc_4107146"]="Cloaked in starlight, wandering under the moonlight.",
    ["EquipDesc_4107147"]="An imposing trident, a strike from which can raise towering waves.",
    ["EquipDesc_4107148"]="Stuff your plush pals in your backpack and continue the grand adventure!",
    ["EquipDesc_4107149"]="Arrogant thunder forms a circle behind the king, joining him in judging the destinies of all lives.",
    ["EquipDesc_4107150"]="A sign painted with a cute face can also serve as a weapon if you can't find anything.",
    ["EquipDesc_4107151"]="Thouzer's cloak.",
    ["EquipDesc_4107152"]="Raoh's cloak.",
    ["EquipDesc_4107153"]="Energy: 100%. Countdown: 0. Initiating the ultimate energy cannon!",
    ["EquipDesc_4107154"]="Slingshot crafted from green vines, giving off a light, earthy scent.",
    ["EquipDesc_4107155"]="Money is the perfect building material for constructing the staircase of power and fame.",
    ["EquipDesc_4107156"]="Butterflies that only show up in the extravagant dreams of the rich, flapping their wings gracefully with immense wealth.",
    ["EquipDesc_4107157"]="Break the boundaries between virtual and reality. You are a traveler from another world and the best player.",
    ["EquipDesc_4107158"]="The four-leaf clover chest might contain fairies the books never told us about.",
    ["EquipDesc_4107159"]="Hera's envy rages day and night as she casts hateful looks at any woman who shares in her husband's affection.",
    ["EquipDesc_4107160"]="Untwisted golden thunder, its radiance embodies the honor of the gold of Olympus.",
    ["EquipDesc_4107161"]="Portable hand-crank ice shaver. Which syrup are you feeling today?",
    ["EquipDesc_4107162"]="A bit like the moon back home, but with two more ears—the soft glow of the bunny lantern.",
    ["EquipDesc_4107163"]="The evil skill \"Unseen Hand\" that is used by Petelgeuse. The \"Unseen Hand\" tears through its target.",
    ["EquipDesc_4107164"]="A curtain of ice bullets woven from mana not only hits the target but also releases a cold breeze nearby.",
    ["EquipDesc_4107165"]="Serpents in a gilded urn, swaying to the flute's melody.",
    ["EquipDesc_4107166"]="Feeling good? BOOM! Feeling bad? BOOM again!",
    ["EquipDesc_4107167"]="One shot is all it takes to take down a fortress—hit the trigger and unleash the explosion!",
    ["EquipDesc_4107168"]="Within the heavy sarcophagus rests the history of the banquet, waiting for those with wisdom and courage to bear the secret.\n<color=#FF0000>Note: This backpack has different forms for day and night. Refrain from peeking at its true appearance during the dark hours!</color>",
    ["EquipDesc_4107169"]="Within the heavy sarcophagus rests the history of the banquet, waiting for those with wisdom and courage to bear the secret.\n<color=#FF0000>Note: This backpack has different forms for day and night. Refrain from peeking at its true appearance during the dark hours!</color>",
    ["EquipDesc_4107170"]="Life is fleeting; let wings of pure white bring forth the gift of rebirth.\n<color=#FF0000>(Note: When night falls, this costume receives Hade's blessing, appearing in a completely different look.)</color>",
    ["EquipDesc_4107171"]="Life is fleeting; let wings of pure white bring forth the gift of rebirth.\n<color=#FF0000>(Note: When night falls, this costume receives Hade's blessing, appearing in a completely different look.)</color>",
    ["EquipDesc_4107172"]="Santa got caught in the chimney! That's one shocking surprise!",
    ["EquipDesc_4107174"]="A basket full of curious hatchlings, preparing to soar and discover the world.",
    ["EquipDesc_4107175"]="These glowing deep-sea creatures live in polar areas, moving with the tides and sparkling like stars in the abyss.",
    ["EquipDesc_4107176"]="With the divine blessing, the endless wisdom of the written realm shall take form and become reality.",
    ["EquipDesc_4107177"]="Though striking in beauty, it is innately poisonous.",
    ["EquipDesc_4107179"]="To lift the curse, you must uncover the secret of true love before the rose wilts.",
    ["EquipDesc_4107180"]="The blade was once borne by Narukami. When Narukami fell, a lone florist claimed the blade—and birthed the art of Sakuraflow.",
    ["EquipDesc_4107181"]="A mysterious companion delivers a letter from the Phantom—a provocation, no doubt, but this time the target's quite unexpected...",
    ["EquipDesc_4107182"]="Honestly, knives are the same—a skilled servant just picks whatever works best to carve today's main dish.",
    ["EquipDesc_4107183"]="An unseen force shattered the sturdy ship, sending the heavy anchor plunging into the depths, dragging the captain down...",
    ["EquipDesc_4107184"]="Want to stay a little longer? Make a Taiyaki Parfait—the keeper can't resist it!",
    ["EquipDesc_4107185"]="A little surprise in the design—if you look closely, you'll see a snake gliding gracefully among the clouds.",
    ["EquipDesc_4107186"]="A shape-shifting barrage of hovering cannons—perfect for offense or defense!",
    ["EquipDesc_4107187"]="Baoku Lee's got a pearl. Rub it, and it'll shine even more!",
    ["EquipDesc_4107188"]="Bon bon—! Can you hear it? The drums echoed through the night, leading the way home.",
    ["EquipDesc_4107189"]="A loyal servant from another planet, sworn to a higher power. However, if you offer fruit juice as tribute, it might just work for you (for a while).",
    ["EquipDesc_4107190"]="The brave soul who defies the dark—may your path shine with unyielding radiance.",
    ["EquipDesc_4107192"]="There's a dream hiding in every frosting and cream—one bite, and even your snores will sound sweet...",
    ["EquipDesc_4107193"]="A toy shaped like a Ferris wheel—perfect for any cute pet, or a whole bunch of them!",
    ["EquipDesc_4107195"]="Nothing escapes once the flying swords lock on—that's Piedmon's best magic trick!",
    ["EquipDesc_4107196"]="When the owl sweeps through the forest shadows, it is my silent sentinel. Clutching the olive from mountaintop heights, it descends—bearing truth and peace to the realms below.",
    ["EquipDesc_410719602"]="When the owl sweeps through the forest shadows, it is my silent sentinel. Clutching the olive from mountaintop heights, it descends—bearing truth and peace to the realms below.",
    ["EquipDesc_4107197"]="I imagined braving the storms head-on—but the midsummer's here, and my chances of mastering it feel slim. So I'll just pretend these wings on my back still mean something.",
    ["EquipDesc_4107199"]="Golden osmanthus falls overnight, bringing blessings and a full-moon reunion.",
    ["EquipDesc_4107200"]="A rusted relic of the abyss, reborn by the hand of an unnamed smith who forged his left eye into its steel. Now it blazes with wrath, vowing to burn away the thorns of bondage.",
    ["EquipDesc_4107202"]="With its beautiful wings, the unicorn carries people's wishes and smiles far away.",
    ["EquipDesc_4107203"]="Scylla, the abyss dragon who once condemned countless masts to the deep, now perches upon your shoulder—its once-proud head lowered in allegiance.\n(A special effect triggers upon entering battle!)",
    ["EquipDesc_4107204"]="Wataru Ikusabe's Soaring Dragon Sword—a faithful companion that has been with him through countless adventures and battles.",
    ["EquipDesc_4107205"]="The Lord of Dreadbone forged this shield from his own shattered bones. It's an unwavering sentinel that will shred all who dare oppose its chosen master.",
    ["EquipDesc_4107206"]="A brightly colored thermal box filled with \"treasures\" that boost your energy.",
    ["EquipDesc_4107208"]="With our horses beside us, we set the strings singing, and winter's chill fades away. When the song of wilderness ends, spring arrives at last!",
    ["EquipDesc_4108001"]="Fluffy Cat Tail",
    ["EquipDesc_4108003"]="A husky-shaped tail.",
    ["EquipDesc_4108005"]="A peculiar demon tail that is worn by those who want to dress up as a resurrected dead person for a night march during a special festival.",
    ["EquipDesc_4108006"]="In the long and fierce battles with the demons, some hunters have learned the tactic of confusing their prey by dressing up as demons, but it seems that there are hunters who really grow a Scorpion Stinger. The line between human and demon seems to be gradually blurred in the endless fight…",
    ["EquipDesc_4108008"]="Dragon tail with horrible appearance—purple dragon scales cover fleshlike sinews, and bones grow spikes on the sides. Keep away if you are still breathing.",
    ["EquipDesc_4108009"]="This is probably the cutest and most dangerous part of the messengers. Don't touch them just because they are moving in front of your eyes, it will lead to very troublesome consequences.",
    ["EquipDesc_4108010"]="A wearable belt bag. It can carry both life-saving medicines and injections as well as deadly weapons and ammunition.",
    ["EquipDesc_4108011"]="A friendly lion’s tail with a soft tuft of fur at its end.",
    ["EquipDesc_4108013"]="A dazzling diamond tail, which costs a fortune if you want to buy it.",
    ["EquipDesc_4108014"]="As the bunny tail lifts up, it ignores the laws of gravity but still feels happy when touched.",
    ["EquipDesc_4108015"]="A rabbit tail that looks cute when wagging. Hey, don't you pull it!",
    ["EquipDesc_4108017"]="A loot obtained from the Skeleton Dragon by Thanatos. Its hideous look deepens the mortal's fear of the Demon Swordsman.",
    ["EquipDesc_4108018"]="A Halo of Revitalization branded by Criatura Academy. \"Hey, the newcomer over there, let's do a self-introduction!\"",
    ["EquipDesc_4108019"]="A long and fluffy tail. Can I use it as a pillow when hibernating?",
    ["EquipDesc_4108021"]="A tail named after the God of Sea, Nield. The power within once sealed off the flame of Muspelheim.",
    ["EquipDesc_4108022"]="A tail left by the dragon once resided in Niflheim. The icy crystal at the end is radiating a terrifying power.",
    ["EquipDesc_4108023"]="Sweep away all the unhappiness from last year and roll in all the luck in the world from every direction.",
    ["EquipDesc_4108024"]="This spinning tail of the blade, sharp enough to slice through the heavens, has severed countless bodies of attackers.",
    ["EquipDesc_4108025"]="A scorpion fell to thunder, its body transformed into armor, and its soul ascended into a star.",
    ["EquipDesc_4108026"]="Crawling beneath the queen's throne, the double-headed serpent's tail is as vibrant as its master's dress.",
    ["EquipDesc_4108027"]="The cycle of life and death turns unceasingly; death stands as rebirth's prologue.\n<color=#FF0000>(Note: When night falls, this costume receives Hade's blessing, appearing in a completely different look.)</color>",
    ["EquipDesc_4108028"]="The cycle of life and death turns unceasingly; death stands as rebirth's prologue.\n<color=#FF0000>(Note: When night falls, this costume receives Hade's blessing, appearing in a completely different look.)</color>",
    ["EquipDesc_4108030"]="No tail adorns man—that's why it is the devil that brings omen.",
    ["EquipDesc_4108031"]="Just a little decoration without real purposes... but it looks insanely cool!",
    ["EquipDesc_4108032"]="Just a little decoration without real purposes... but it looks insanely cool!",
    ["EquipDesc_4108033"]="Through the long night, a ray of dawn falls upon whispered prayers.",
    ["EquipDesc_4108034"]="Amphiptere, my gentle friend, you embrace the land you cherish. Tell me, will you shed your sacred wings and forsake the heavens to embrace this delicate world?",
    ["EquipDesc_410803402"]="Amphiptere, my gentle friend, you embrace the land you cherish. Tell me, will you shed your sacred wings and forsake the heavens to embrace this delicate world?",
    ["EquipDesc_4108035"]="A tail that breaks apart towering waves—an emblem not merely of power and elegance, but of the absolute dominion of Strouf.\n(A special effect triggers upon entering battle!)",
    ["EquipDesc_410803502"]="A tail that breaks apart towering waves—an emblem not merely of power and elegance, but of the absolute dominion of Strouf.\n(A special effect triggers upon entering battle!)",
    ["EquipDesc_4109997"]="A replica of an Angeling's halo. It looks very authentic, but lacks some of the holy radiance.",
    ["EquipDesc_Standby1"]="Armor constructed of hard metal.",
    ["EquipDesc_Standby10"]="The cloak of Aegir, god of the sea. It protects its wearer with the blessing of the ocean.",
    ["EquipDesc_Standby11"]="A manteau created by purifying Peuz runestones.",
    ["EquipDesc_Standby12"]="Made from the skin of an entity that claimed to be Nidhogg the legendary dragon. It contains immense power.",
    ["EquipDesc_Standby13"]="Sturdy boots with a steel toe cap for added protection.",
    ["EquipDesc_Standby14"]="Boots made of a sturdy fabric.",
    ["EquipDesc_Standby15"]="Greaves forged through a special process. They provide excellent protection.",
    ["EquipDesc_Standby16"]="The cloak of Aegir, god of the sea. They seem to have the ability to make up for their own shortcomings.",
    ["EquipDesc_Standby17"]="Boots created by purifying Peuz runestones.",
    ["EquipDesc_Standby18"]="Comfortable yet highly protective boots made out of mithril.",
    ["EquipDesc_Standby19"]="Boots named after the mount Odin rode into battle. Their awesome power makes them highly sought after.",
    ["EquipDesc_Standby2"]="Armor made out of wood.",
    ["EquipDesc_Standby20"]="An ordinary hairpin with timeless elegance.",
    ["EquipDesc_Standby21"]="A magic ring protects its wearer and reduces damage taken.",
    ["EquipDesc_Standby22"]="Gloves that have been specially designed to improve grip.",
    ["EquipDesc_Standby23"]="A ring that enhances the wearer's ability to find the enemy's weakness.",
    ["EquipDesc_Standby24"]="A chain fastened around the necks of Matyrs. It is said to be related to their speed.",
    ["EquipDesc_Standby25"]="A ring with a small bead set in. It feels like the bead is watching you.",
    ["EquipDesc_Standby26"]="Gloves that harbor a mysterious power.",
    ["EquipDesc_Standby27"]="The only item that can cure Dullahan's poison.",
    ["EquipDesc_Standby29"]="A ring with a divine power that senses and enhances certain abilities.",
    ["EquipDesc_Standby3"]="The armor of Aegir, god of the sea. It is as beautiful as an Obeaune and looks almost as if it would enable the wearer to swim like a fish.",
    ["EquipDesc_Standby30"]="An orb filled with liquid of unknown powers.",
    ["EquipDesc_Standby31"]="A beautiful ring imbued with elven magic. A shocking buff will appear after it is put on.",
    ["EquipDesc_Standby34"]="A mysterious manteau with a protective spell that can convert the wearer's magic defense to physical defense.",
    ["EquipDesc_Standby35"]="Dark plated armor covered with sharp bones.",
    ["EquipDesc_Standby4"]="An extremely heavy piece of armor worn by members of the Legion.",
    ["EquipDesc_Standby5"]="Armor created by purifying Peuz runestones.",
    ["EquipDesc_Standby6"]="An armor made of a metal called Opcidium. The decoration of a black crystal looks profound.",
    ["EquipDesc_Standby7"]="Lightweight armor made from 100% cotton that makes the wearer feel light as a feather.",
    ["EquipDesc_Standby8"]="A coat made from 300 dragon scales.",
    ["EquipDesc_Standby9"]="A manteau worn by Soldier Skeletons.",
    ["EquipEnchantHighPropLock"]="Unlocked at Enchantment Stat Lv.10",
    ["EquipEnchantMidPropLock"]="Unlocked at Enchantment Stat Lv.5",
    ["EquipEnchantUnlock"]="Unlocked at Base Level %s.",
    ["EquipGenderTips_001"]="Wrong gender. Unable to equip.",
    ["EquipGet_4101377"]="Obtained from the 2024 Snow Festival event.",
    ["EquipInheritPlus001"]="Add/View Stat Preview",
    ["EquipInheritPlus002"]="%s Stat Preview",
    ["EquipInheritPlus004"]="Tap to Add",
    ["EquipInheritPlus005"]="Select Equipment",
    ["EquipInheritPlus006"]="No equipment that meets the requirement",
    ["EquipInheritPlus007"]="Equipment with exchangeable stats",
    ["EquipInheritPlus008"]="Add Equipment / View Stat Transfer",
    ["EquipInheritPlusDes"]="About Equipment Recycling\n\n You can use the Equipment Recycling feature to get rid of your unwanted gold equipment and convert them into Dream Sand proportionally.\n When recycling upgraded equipment, a certain number of corresponding materials will be returned to you. You can view more details in the Extra Rebate list.\n The Dream Sand container has a maximum capacity of 200,000,000, which you will not be able to keep recycling after it reaches the limit.",
    ["EquipInheritPlusHint1"]="This equipment possesses upgrading/refinement/enchantment stats, or it has been ascended. Consuming it will return a certain number of corresponding items. Continue?",
    ["EquipInheritPlusHint2"]="The equipment is currently used in a load-out. Recycle?",
    ["EquipInheritPlusHint3"]="Your Dream Sand has exceeded the maximum storage capacity, and the excess amount will be discarded. Recycle anyway?",
    ["EquipInheritPlusHint4"]="Your Dream Sand has reached the maximum storage capacity. Unable to recycle anymore!",
    ["EquipInheritPlusHint5"]="Stats overflow. The stats after the transfer will be lower than the original stats. Transfer anyway?",
    ["EquipInheritPlusHint6"]="Stat Transferred Successfully",
    ["EquipInheritPlusHint7"]="No Selected Equipment",
    ["EquipInheritPlusHint8"]="The amount of your obtained Dream Sand has not reached the minimum spending amount.",
    ["EquipInheritPlusHint9"]="Equipment will disappear after recycling. Continue anyway?",
    ["EquipInheritPlus_AttributeDes"]="%s   %s         <color=#e4854d>%s</color>",
    ["EquipInheritPlus_NonAttribute"]="<color=ffffff> - No Available Stats -</color>",
    ["EquipMakeSuccess"]="Crafting successful. Obtained %s.",
