    ["FC_Tips_07"]="ROX Fair Play Championship Invitation",
    ["FC_Tips_08"]="%s invited you to join the party %s in the ROX Fair Play Championship!",
    ["FC_Tips_09"]="◆ Create Party\n ① All registered participants in the ROX Fair Play Championship can create parties with other Adventurers on the same sub server.\n ② Each party consists of up to 8 Adventurers. Once the party formation time is over, parties with at least 6 members will be automatically established as participating parties, while those with fewer than 6 members will be disbanded.",
    ["FC_Tips_10"]="The party name is too long.",
    ["FC_Tips_11"]="Rewards can be claimed at 12:00 the next day after each round of the events.",
    ["FC_Tips_12"]="No rewards can be claimed right now.",
    ["FC_Tips_13"]="Betting Tickets: %s",
    ["FC_Tips_14"]="The next round of the championship has not started yet.",
    ["FC_Tips_15"]="Only the party leader can cancel matchmaking.",
    ["FC_Tips_16"]="The Party ID cannot be blank.",
    ["FC_Tips_17"]="Up to <color=#ec8a5a>1 character</color> can be selected on the <color=#ec8a5a>same account</color> to participate in the competition. Registered characters cannot be alternated later. Please confirm: do you want to use this character to register for the competition?",
    ["FC_Tips_18"]="The recruitment message has been sent to the chat channel.",
