    ["FairChampionTask_001"]="Daily Quest: Participate in betting 1 time.",
    ["FairChampionTask_002"]="Participate in the betting 1 time in total during the event.",
    ["FairChampionTask_003"]="Participate in the betting 3 times in total during the event.",
    ["FairChampionTask_004"]="Participate in the betting 10 times in total during the event.",
    ["FairChampionTask_005"]="Participate in the betting and consume 100 Betting Tickets in total during the event.",
    ["FairChampionTask_006"]="Participate in the betting and consume 1,000 Betting Tickets in total during the event.",
    ["FairChampionTask_007"]="Participate in the betting and consume 10,000 Betting Tickets in total during the event.",
    ["FairChampionTips_01"]="The matchmaking is in progress...",
    ["FairyAttribute_43"]="Max HP Percentage",
    ["FairyAttribute_45"]="Max SP Percentage",
    ["FairyBody_1"]="Large",
    ["FairyBody_2"]="Medium",
    ["FairyBody_3"]="Small",
    ["FairyChat_1"]="Good teamwork, two-leg.",
    ["FairyChat_10"]="Feel the fear brought by Kazla...",
    ["FairyChat_1001"]="Thanks, I've found the answer.",
    ["FairyChat_1002"]="Growing up means learning bit by bit, right?",
    ["FairyChat_1003"]="Leave it to me!",
    ["FairyChat_1004"]="Alright! Time to test the power—",
    ["FairyChat_1005"]="No need to fuss... just eat it, hehe...",
    ["FairyChat_1006"]="Got it! I'll do better next time, chirp!",
    ["FairyChat_1007"]="Bububu... Burp—Bubble's gotten bigger!",
    ["FairyChat_1008"]="Good news? Bad news?",
    ["FairyChat_1009"]="Bless you!",
    ["FairyChat_1010"]="Cleaver... Pierce... Shatter!",
    ["FairyChat_1011"]="Got stronger... but also hungrier...",
    ["FairyChat_1012"]="Now... I can definitrly help!",
    ["FairyChat_1013"]="I'm Flora, the fairy of flowers!",
    ["FairyChat_1014"]="Fall into the abyss with me...",
    ["FairyChat_11"]="Huh... me, battle? Really?",
    ["FairyChat_12"]="I... I'll try my best...",
    ["FairyChat_13"]="Hula, hula—lovely flowers, bless me with joy!",
    ["FairyChat_14"]="I know exactly what you're thinking.",
    ["FairyChat_2"]="Let's go!",
    ["FairyChat_3"]="Don't worry, I've got you!",
    ["FairyChat_4"]="Let's play hide and seek—",
    ["FairyChat_5"]="Hehe, your soul smells... yummy...",
    ["FairyChat_6"]="Don't mess up my feathers, chirp!",
    ["FairyChat_7"]="Bububu... Bubble's flying!",
    ["FairyChat_8"]="H-Hello!",
    ["FairyChat_9"]="Another beautiful day!",
    ["FairyHelp"]="Companion\n1. Equipping a Companion grants an exclusive ultimate skill. Ultimate cannot be switched during battle, and it cannot be reset by reset effects, and its cooldown cannot be reduced.\n2. Star upgrades will enhance the Companion's skill or stats, consuming Companions of the same name.\n3. Each Companion possesses 3 offensive and 3 defensive mastery types. These can be randomized through training, allowing you to keep or replace them freely.\n4. A Companion's stats and star level are affected by its mastery types and formation slot development. Formation slots can be upgraded to increase progress, starting from 0 up to 100%.\n5. At the same formation slot progress, a purple Companion's mastery is 60% that of a gold Companion.\n6. All deployed Companion's stats are active, but only one Companion of the same name may be assigned to the formation.\n7. Formation slot development progress resets at the end of each season, but the Companion's star level and mastery types remain unchanged.\n8. Companions can be obtained from the Vending Machine or the Exchange Center.",
    ["FairyRace_1"]="Angel",
    ["FairyRace_2"]="Demon",
    ["FairyRace_3"]="Supernature",
    ["FairyRace_4"]="Humans & Tree",
    ["FairyRace_5"]="Dragon & Beast",
    ["FairyRace_6"]="Fish & Insect",
    ["FairyStarHelp_9010101"]="Heart Erosion deals twice the amount of damage per second with doubled Final DMG effect.",
    ["FairyStarHelp_9010102"]="Increases 288,000 HP when deploying the formation.",
    ["FairyStarHelp_9010103"]="Whispering Corridor - Heart Erosion's fixed cooldown is reduced to 40 seconds, and the Overloaded duration is also reduced to 40 seconds.",
    ["FairyStarHelp_9010104"]="Increases Companion's mastery stats by an additional 17% when deploying the formation.",
    ["FairyStarHelp_9010105"]="Targets affected by Heart Erosion that leave the Whispering Corridor are Slowed by 35% for 3 seconds (can be dispelled). If they are inside the Whispering Corridor, they are forced out of Stealth and cannot enter Stealth again.",
    ["FairyStarHelp_9020101"]="The damage conversion effect from the shield of Love's Favor increases to 30% and its duration increases to 2 seconds.",
    ["FairyStarHelp_9020102"]="Increases 288,000 HP when deploying the formation.",
    ["FairyStarHelp_9020103"]="Heartlink Shield - Oracle's fixed cooldown is reduced to 40 seconds, and the Overloaded duration is also reduced to 40 seconds.",
    ["FairyStarHelp_9020104"]="Increases Companion's mastery stats by an additional 17%.",
    ["FairyStarHelp_9020105"]="Punish's duration increases to 5 seconds, and Divine Punishment's duration increases to 8 seconds.",
    ["FairyStarHelp_9030101"]="The chance of Ghostly Zone applying a Fear effect increases to 50%, and its damage coefficient increases to 2,000%.",
    ["FairyStarHelp_9030102"]="Increases 288,000 HP when deploying the formation.",
    ["FairyStarHelp_9030103"]="Soulbound Nightfall - Elegy's fixed cooldown is reduced to 40 seconds, and the Overloaded duration is also reduced to 40 seconds.",
    ["FairyStarHelp_9030104"]="Increases companion's mastery stats by an additional 17%.",
    ["FairyStarHelp_9030105"]="Soul Shock reduces the Final ASPD of all enemies by 500% and increases the fixed cooldown of their skills by 3 seconds for 6 seconds. The damage bonus effect duration against monsters increases to 24 seconds.",
    ["FairyStarHelp_9030201"]="Soul Snare deals 2 times damage to monsters and immobilizes Adventurers upon hit.",
    ["FairyStarHelp_9030202"]="Increases 288,000 HP when deploying the formation.",
    ["FairyStarHelp_9030203"]="Strangling Mask - Soul Snare's fixed cooldown is reduced to 40 seconds, and the Overloaded duration is also reduced to 40 seconds.",
    ["FairyStarHelp_9030204"]="Increases Companion's mastery stats by an additional 17%.",
    ["FairyStarHelp_9030205"]="Strangling Zone displacement effect ignores the enemy's Endure effect. Enemies inflicted with Soul Snare will have their PVP Final P.DMG RED and PVP Final M.DMG RED reduced by 120%.",
    ["FairyStarHelp_9040101"]="If the target is riding a battle mount, Fungal Adhesive reduces their MSPD by an additional 2.",
    ["FairyStarHelp_9040102"]="Increases 96,000 HP when deploying the formation.",
    ["FairyStarHelp_9040103"]="Fungal Adhesive - Cocoon's fixed cooldown is reduced to 30 seconds, and Withered Bloom's duration is also reduced to 30 seconds.",
    ["FairyStarHelp_9040104"]="Increases Companion's mastery stats by an additional 17%.",
    ["FairyStarHelp_9040105"]="Each time the spore grows, it increases the duration of Fungal Adhesive by 1 second.",
    ["FairyStarHelp_9040201"]="Mistbind deals twice the damage to monsters.",
    ["FairyStarHelp_9040202"]="Increases 288,000 HP when deploying the formation.",
    ["FairyStarHelp_9040203"]="Blossom Mirage - Mistbind's fixed cooldown is reduced to 40 seconds, and the Overloaded duration is also reduced to 40 seconds.",
    ["FairyStarHelp_9040204"]="Increases Companion's mastery stats by an additional 17%.",
    ["FairyStarHelp_9040205"]="Mistbind increases normal attack miss chance by 15% and skill deviation chance by 40%.",
    ["FairyStarHelp_9050101"]="While under the effect of Assault, immune to all damage over time from debuffs.",
    ["FairyStarHelp_9050102"]="Increases 288,000 HP when deploying the formation.",
    ["FairyStarHelp_9050103"]="Dragon Nova - Assault's fixed cooldown is reduced to 40 seconds, and the Overloaded duration is also reduced to 40 seconds.",
    ["FairyStarHelp_9050104"]="Increases companion's mastery stats by an additional 17%.",
    ["FairyStarHelp_9050105"]="Starpower now generates 1 stack every 0.25 seconds, up to 6 stacks. While Starpower is active, monsters take 30% more damage from party members.",
    ["FairyStarHelp_9050201"]="Flashbeak - Starpiercer's damage coefficient increases by 2,800%.",
    ["FairyStarHelp_9050202"]="Increases 96,000 HP when deploying the formation.",
    ["FairyStarHelp_9050203"]="Flashbeak - Starpiercer's fixed cooldown is reduced to 30 seconds; Hunt Lock's duration is reduced to 30 seconds after casting.",
    ["FairyStarHelp_9050204"]="Increases companion's mastery stats by an additional 17%.",
    ["FairyStarHelp_9050205"]="Starpiercer - Hunt reduces the target's lifesteal, healing, and recovery effects by an additional 65%. Casting Starpiercer - Hunt to a monster extends the duration to 15 seconds.",
    ["FairyStarHelp_9060101"]="Increases the shield conversion percentage to 25% during the Armor Leecher period.",
    ["FairyStarHelp_9060102"]="Increases 96,000 HP when deploying the formation.",
    ["FairyStarHelp_9060103"]="Reduces the fixed cooldown of Armor Leecher - Guardian to 45 seconds.",
    ["FairyStarHelp_9060104"]="Increases companion's mastery stats by an additional 17%.",
    ["FairyStarHelp_9060105"]="Gains immunity to all debuffs during the Armor Leecher period.",
    ["FairyStarHelp_9060201"]="Reduces the trigger interval of Dual Blades to 2 seconds.",
    ["FairyStarHelp_9060202"]="Increases 288,000 HP when deploying the formation.",
    ["FairyStarHelp_9060203"]="Reduces the fixed cooldown of Dual Blades - Cleaver to 40 seconds.",
    ["FairyStarHelp_9060204"]="Increases Companion's mastery stats by an additional 17%.",
    ["FairyStarHelp_9060205"]="Increases Cleaver's Final DMG Bonus by 20%, with buff removal effect chance increased by 30%.",
    ["FairyStarHelp_9060301"]="While Iron Wall is active, restores 10% of Max HP per second.",
    ["FairyStarHelp_9060302"]="Increases 96,000 HP when deploying the formation.",
    ["FairyStarHelp_9060303"]="Reduces the fixed cooldown of Seamless Shell Armor - Iron Wall to 45 seconds.",
    ["FairyStarHelp_9060304"]="Increases Companion's mastery stats by an additional 17%.",
    ["FairyStarHelp_9060305"]="After Iron Wall ends, gains 120% Final P.DMG RED and Final M.DMG RED for 5 seconds.",
