    ["FishMatchTips19"]="Automatic Fishing Rod x1",
    ["FishMatchTips2"]="Meoooow! This is for you. Thank you! Now I can have a big meal!",
    ["FishMatchTips20"]="You've caught a {0} cm long {1}.\n<color=#fce395>(This type of fish is not in the rankings yet. Continue to work hard!)</color>",
    ["FishMatchTips3"]="No data available yet. Keep up the hard work!",
