    ["FishMatchTips5"]="Release (%s/%s)",
    ["FishMatchTips6"]="Craft now (%s/%s)",
    ["FishMatchTips7"]="You've caught a {0} cm long {1}.\n<color=#fce395>(This type of fish is not in the Fish Print Rankings!)</color>",
    ["FishMatchTips8"]="Are you sure you want to release the fish on your hook?",
    ["FishMatchTips9"]="Are you sure you want to use the fish on your hook to make a fish print?\n<color=#FF6F76>(Any excess magic bait will disappear once you make a fish print.)</color>",
    ["FistOfTheNorthStarTips_01"]="◆Pass:\n1. Spend <color=#ec8a5a>4,888</color> Diamonds to unlock <color=#ec8a5a>Successor</color>.\n2. Upgrade the Pass to receive exclusive collaboration titles and collaboration Blue Card Sel. Packs.\n3. The max level of the Pass is <color=#ec8a5a>Lv.80</color>.\n◆Quests:\n1. 4 daily quests will be refreshed each day, and they are reset daily.\n2. Obtain <color=#ec8a5a>Savior Ratings</color> by completing daily quests and challenge quests.\n3. Challenge quests can be attempted throughout the event period.",
    ["FistOfTheNorthStarTips_02"]="◆Recharge Gifts:\n1. During the event, Adventurers can earn corresponding rewards by recharging a specified number of Diamonds in total.\n2. Each reward tier can only be claimed once.",
    ["FistOfTheNorthStarTips_03"]="Reserved",
    ["FistOfTheNorthStarTips_04"]="Reserved",
    ["FistOfTheNorthStarTips_21"]="Raoh—the eldest brother of Kenshiro, the Successor of Hokuto Shinken, is known as \"Ken-Oh.\" He has defeated countless martial artists and is titled \"The Conqueror of Century's End.\" His formidable strength enables him to crush enemies atop his giant stallion, \"Kokuoh-Go,\".",
    ["FistOfTheNorthStarTips_22"]="Refreshes at 05:00",
    ["FistOfTheNorthStarTips_23"]="Capture the Moment",
    ["FistOfTheNorthStarTips_24"]="Behold the Legend of the Conqueror",
    ["FistOfTheNorthStarTips_25"]="Kenshiro's Treasure",
