    ["FistOfTheNorthStarTips_32"]="Spend <color=#ec8a5a>8,888</color> Diamonds to activate the Successor?\n<color=#da696f>Tips: Items that take effect immediately are not eligible for cancellation.</color>",
    ["FistOfTheNorthStarTips_33"]="Spend <color=#ec8a5a>34,088</color> Diamonds to purchase the Successor Gift Box?\n<color=#da696f>Tips: Items that take effect immediately are not eligible for cancellation.</color>",
    ["FistOfTheNorthStarTips_34"]="You have successfully purchased the <color=#e7bb22>Successor</color>.",
