    ["GVEAwardTips_1"]="Round %s",
    ["GVEBattle_1"]="<color=#ff6f76>Otherworld Gate</color> Preparation Phase <color=#df4f52>%s</color>",
    ["GVEBattle_10"]="Countdown to exit: %s",
    ["GVEBattle_11"]="The trial has ended. During this phase, you can kill any monsters that you have not killed during the battle phase. No monsters will spawn in this phase. Please wait for the guild leader to distribute the rewards.",
    ["GVEBattle_12"]="Individual rewards for this round:",
    ["GVEBattle_13"]="Guild rewards for this round:",
    ["GVEBattle_14"]="All monsters have been killed. Trial has ended. Please exit and wait for the Guild Leader to distribute the rewards.",
    ["GVEBattle_2"]="<color=#ff6f76>Otherworld Gate</color> Battle Phase <color=#df4f52>%s</color>",
    ["GVEBattle_3"]="<color=#ff6f76>Otherworld Gate</color> Exit Phase <color=#df4f52>%s</color>",
    ["GVEBattle_4"]="Countdown to beginning of trial: %s",
    ["GVEBattle_5"]="Appearing soon: %s %s",
    ["GVEBattle_6"]="Time left: %s",
    ["GVEBattle_7"]="Next boss appears in: %s",
    ["GVEBattle_8"]="Current round: Round %s",
    ["GVEBattle_9"]="Current Battle: %s %s",
    ["GVERules_1"]="Collection Phase",
    ["GVERules_1_1"]="When the Guild reaches Lv.2, submitting Guild Orders will award you with the Otherworld Energy required for opening the Otherworld Gate.",
    ["GVERules_1_2"]="Once you have enough Otherworld Energy to meet the opening requirement, you can start the event.",
    ["GVERules_1_3"]="For newly joined members of a Guild, no Otherworld Energy will be awarded for Guild Orders submitted within the first 72 hours of joining.",
    ["GVERules_1_4"]="Once you have 100,000 Otherworld Energy, you will not be awarded with Otherworld Energy for orders submitted. Please start the event in time.",
    ["GVERules_2"]="Start Battle",
    ["GVERules_2_1"]="Once the activation requirement is fulfilled, the Guild Leader or Deputy Guild Leader can make an appointment for battle time the next day with the corresponding NPC in the guild.",
    ["GVERules_2_2"]="The corresponding amount of the Otherworld Energy will be deducted after the appointment. The battle will begin at the exact appointment time.",
    ["GVERules_3"]="Battle Phase",
    ["GVERules_3_1"]="The first boss will spawn when the Battle Phase starts. In this battle, you will take turns fighting the boss to wear it down. Once a boss is defeated, the next boss will spawn after 10 seconds.",
    ["GVERules_3_2"]="Individual rewards and guild rewards will be issued every time a boss is defeated.",
    ["GVERules_3_3"]="After the Battle Phase ends, bosses that are not yet defeated will remain until and of the Exit Phase (lasts for 5 minutes after the Battle Phase ends). You can still earn rewards if you kill the boss during this time period.",
    ["GVERules_3_4"]="Members who have joined the guild within the last 72 hours cannot participate in Otherworld Gate battles.",
    ["GVERules_4"]="Reward Issuance",
    ["GVERules_4_1"]="Rewards are divided into individual rewards and guild rewards.",
    ["GVERules_4_2"]="Individual rewards will be immediately granted every time a boss is defeated.",
    ["GVERules_4_3"]="Guild rewards will be immediately sent to the Guild Warehouse every time a boss is defeated, where they will be distributed by the guild leader.",
    ["GVERules_5"]="Difficulty Selection",
    ["GVERules_5_1"]="Before reserving the battle, the guild leader can decide on the difficulty level of the Boss they want to challenge. Rewards can vary from one difficulty to another.",
    ["GVERules_5_2"]="Once the battle reservation period is over, it is impossible to change the difficulty.",
    ["GVERules_5_3"]="Every Boss from the last difficulty must be defeated before advancing to the next difficulty.",
    ["GVE_1"]="Time left:",
