    ["GVG_ui_tips_050"]="<color=#3882CBFF>%s</color> successfully resisted the invaders until the end of the battle, protecting the Emperium from being destroyed and gaining ownership of the base!",
    ["GVG_ui_tips_051"]="<color=#3882CBFF>%s</color> [<color=#E15B65FF>%s</color>] managed to destroy the Emperium guarded by <color=#3882CBFF>%s</color>, earning ownership of the %s base! The next round of the Guild War will begin in 30 seconds!",
