    ["GVG_ui_tips_118"]="You can't participate in GVG battles within 7 days of leaving a guild.",
    ["GVG_ui_tips_201"]="Move strategically to avoid jet mechanisms and enemies.",
    ["GVG_ui_tips_202"]="Use a combination of traps and jet mechanisms to effectively stop the attackers.",
    ["GVG_ui_tips_203"]="Prioritize taking out snipers at high vantage points.",
    ["GVG_ui_tips_204"]="Use the angle of the terrain to snipe at targets down below.",
    ["GVG_ui_tips_205"]="Choose the suitable path to avoid being sniped by the defenders.",
    ["GVG_ui_tips_206"]="Use space and terrain to rout the attackers one by one.",
    ["GVG_ui_tips_207"]="You can boost your chances of survival by moving forward in a group.",
    ["GVG_ui_tips_208"]="Ambush at corners! You can use blind spots to gain the upper hand!",
    ["GVG_ui_tips_209"]="Use your space wisely and spread out to avoid defending snipers.",
    ["GVG_ui_tips_210"]="Choose the right ambush point and you can wipe out the attackers in one fell swoop!",
    ["GVG_ui_tips_222"]="No access to tactical actions. Only the party leader can operate.",
