    ["GamePlay_name_8"]="Relaxed Adventure",
    ["GamePlay_name_9"]="Free Your Hands",
    ["Gashapon"]="Not enough Gacha Coins",
    ["GashaponProbabilityDescription_1"]="About UP Companion Vending Machine\n1. During the event, Adventurers can use Companion Gacha Coins in the Up Companion Vending Machine.\n2. When you draw a Gold Companion, there's a 50% chance it will be the featured UP Gold Companions. And a 50% chance to obtain other Gold Companions (with the same drop rate).\n3. A Gold Companion is guaranteed within 200 draws (resets upon obtaining). If you pull a non-UP Gold Companion, the next one is guaranteed to be the UP Gold Companion.\n4. The number of draws in this event is tracked only in the Companion UP Vending Machine and is independent from other Vending Machine events.\n5. The current UP Gold Companion will be added to the Regular Vending Machine before the next UP Companion becomes available. Timing may vary by update.\nAbout Regular Vending Machine\n1. Adventures can use Companion Gacha Coins in the Regular Vending Machine.\n2. There's no guaranteed drop in the Regular Vending Machine. All Gold Companions have the same drop rates.",
    ["GashaponProbabilityDescription_2"]="Adventurer Vending Machine Event\n1. During the event, Adventurers can use Adventure Gacha Coins to draw from the Vending Machine.\n2. A Gold Card is guaranteed within 300 draws. Obtaining a Gold Card before that will not reset the counter.",
