    ["GeneralDressName_150011"]="Bloody Thunder Punishment",
    ["GeneralactivitiesQuest_08"]="[Daily Sign-in]\n1. Log in after 05:00 each day to claim your sign-in reward.\n2. During the event, you will receive 5 make-up sign-in chances. Make-up sign-ins must be completed in order and cannot be skipped to another day.\n3. Rewards must be claimed on the same day; if not collected, they will no longer be available the following day.",
    ["GeneralactivitiesQuest_09"]="[Cultivation Plan]\n1. The event includes both daily and cumulative quests. After completing the current phase and claiming the reward, the next phase will be unlocked.\n2. Each cumulative quest consists of 3 to 5 phases, with varying quest points awarded per phase.\n3. Accumulated quest points can be used to unlock progress rewards.",
    ["GeneralactivitiesQuest_10"]="[Light of Odin]\n1. You can collect 200 Odin's Blessing rewards every day from the Light of Odin screen.\n2. Rainbow Badges can drop up to 10 times daily, with 1 badge per drop.\n3. Moon Badges can drop up to 10 times daily, with 40 badges per drop.\n4. Use your collected badges at the Exchange Shop to exchange for event items.",
    ["GeneralactivitiesQuest_11"]="[Exchange Shop]\n1. Use Dream Crystal Badges to exchange for items in the Exchange Shop.\n2. Each item has its exchange limit.",
    ["Generalactivities_01"]="Available Make-ups: %s",
    ["Generalactivities_02"]="Current Make-up Requires: %s %s",
    ["Generalactivities_03"]="During the event, you can collect 200 Odin's Blessings every day. Consume Odin's Blessings for a chance to obtain badges, which can be used to exchange items in the Exchange Shop.",
    ["Generalactivities_04"]="Event Time: %s to %s",
    ["Generalactivities_05"]="Exchange Deadline:",
    ["Generalactivities_06"]="Adventurer's Diary",
    ["Generalactivities_07"]="Exchange your tokens for favorite materials! Time to hunt!",
