    ["GitBox_Rule_001"]="Gifting Rules\n1. The sender must currently have an activated Kafra's VIP Card.\n2. The sender and receiver must be friends of each other before the gifting event.\n3. If the sender and the receiver become friends after the start of the gifting event, then they must reach Base <color=#E8833C>Lv.50</color> to proceed.\n4. Each character can only receive up to <color=#E8833C>3</color> gift packs per each price bracket during the event.\n5. The gift pack must be sent out the same day of the purchase.",
    ["GitBox_Tips_001"]="You need to activate a Kafra's VIP Card to send friends Gift Packs!",
    ["GitBox_Tips_002"]="You need to reach Base Lv.50 to send friends Gift Packs!",
    ["GitBox_Tips_003"]="Your friend needs to reach Base Lv.50 to receive Gift Packs!",
    ["GitBox_Tips_004"]="Each Valentine's Day gift is very precious. It can only be given to your most cherished friend!\nAre you sure you want to give this gift to your friend <color=#E8833C>%s</color>?",
