    ["GoldenSteedBlessesTips01"]="Congratulations to <color=#FF6F76>%s</color> for winning <color=#FF6F76>%s</color> x<color=#FF6F76>%s</color> in this round of the Golden Steed Blessings Lucky Draw!",
