    ["GroupsInvitationContent"]="To my dearest friend, I am getting married and would like to share my joy with you. Hence, we cordially invite you to our wedding as a member of our Family and Friends group. We would be elated if you are able to attend our wedding. However, we would understand as well if you are unable to make it. We look forward to your reply.",
    ["GuestsInvitationContent"]="To my dearest friend, I am getting married and would like to share my joy with you. Hence, we cordially invite you to our wedding as a member of our Guest group. We would be elated if you are able to attend our wedding. However, we would understand as well if you are unable to make it. We look forward to your reply.",
    ["GuideInfo1"]="Searching for a guide...",
