    ["GuildCon_1"]="Can be exchanged for tons of Guild-exclusive rewards. (%s Guild Contribution has been frozen for now. Will be unfrozen %s hour(s) after joining a new guild.)",
    ["GuildCon_2"]="Can be exchanged for tons of Guild-exclusive rewards. (%s Guild Contribution has been frozen for now. Will be unfrozen after %s.)",
    ["GuildDefaultAnnounce_1"]="Welcome to our guild.",
    ["GuildDefaultAnnounce_2"]="Let's have fun together!",
    ["GuildDefaultAnnounce_3"]="Notice cannot exceed 5 lines-----------",
    ["GuildDismissNotice"]="<color=#E35656>This guild will disband after %s.</color>",
    ["GuildDismiss_1"]="Are you sure you want to disband the guild?\n<size=14>Note: After tapping disband, you can still go to the Guild Housekeeper to cancel it within 48 hours.</size>",
    ["GuildDismiss_2"]="Cancel disbanding of guild?",
    ["GuildDismiss_3"]="Only the Guild Leader can disband a guild.",
    ["GuildDismiss_4"]="You have to transfer the Guild Leader position before leaving the guild.",
    ["GuildDismiss_5"]="Are you sure you want to leave the guild?",
    ["GuildDismiss_6"]="<color=#E35656>This guild will be disbanded in 5 minutes.</color>",
    ["GuildDismiss_7"]="You can only disband the guild after %s.",
    ["GuildDismiss_8"]="1. After leaving a guild, no Otherworld Energy will be rewarded for Guild Orders within the first <color=#d49637>72 hours</color> of joining a new guild, and you will be unable to participate in Otherworld Gate battles during the first <color=#d49637>72 hours</color>.\n2. After leaving a guild, you won't be able to partake in GVG events for <color=#d49637>7 days</color>.",
    ["GuildDismiss_9"]="After logging out, the <color=#d49637>Bloody Branches</color> in your backpack will be reclaimed. Log out?",
    ["GuildGuildRecruit_3"]="Join",
    ["GuildIconTips_1"]="Current device is unable to upload custom icons. Please change your device and try again.",
    ["GuildIconTips_2"]="You can upload new custom icons in %s.",
    ["GuildIconTips_3"]="Current image format is not supported. Please change the image and try again.",
    ["GuildIconTips_4"]="Only guilds that are at Lv.2 or higher can upload custom icons.",
    ["GuildIconTips_5"]="Custom Guild Icons: \n\n1. Only guilds that are at Lv.2 or higher can upload custom icons.\n2. You will be unable to change the custom icon for 72 hours after successfully uploading it.\n3. Switching to an old icon or a system default icon will not trigger the 72-hour cooldown period.\n4. Currently, only JPG images are supported.\n",
    ["GuildIconTips_6"]="As you attempted to upload a prohibited guild icon, you will be unable to upload new guild icons until %s.",
    ["GuildIconTips_7"]="Uploading...",
    ["GuildIconTips_8"]="This image has not been approved and cannot be uploaded!",
    ["GuildInstruction_1"]="· Guild Funds are a core element in developing a guild.\n· Upgrading a guild costs tons of Guild Funds and daily guild maintenance costs a certain amount of Guild Funds.\n· You can obtain Guild Funds by submitting Guild Orders.",
    ["GuildInstruction_2"]="A certain amount of Funds will be consumed daily for maintenance at 05:00 (UTC+7).\nIf the Guild Funds are insufficient to meet the maintenance requirement, the guild will enter the downgrade protection status.\nAt the next time of maintenance, the downgrade protection status will be removed if you have sufficient Guild Funds. If the guild still fails to meet the requirement, its level will be downgraded by 1 (Lv.1 guilds will not be downgraded).\nDowngrade protection status lasts for 24 hours.",
    ["GuildInstruction_3"]="Downgrade Protection Explanation",
    ["GuildInstruction_4"]="Guild Level Explanation",
    ["GuildInstruction_5"]="Emperium Explanation",
    ["GuildLineInvitation_1"]="Your guild needs to reach Lv.2 to create a guild LINE group.",
    ["GuildMaidBubble600011"]="(Happy emoticon)",
    ["GuildMaidBubble600012"]="Seeing adventurers so happy makes me happy, too!",
    ["GuildMaidBubble600021"]="(Heart emoticon)",
    ["GuildMaidBubble600022"]="W also likes adventurers the most! I hope we'll never part!",
    ["GuildMaidBubble600031"]="(Worried emoticon)",
    ["GuildMaidBubble600032"]="Huh? What's troubling you? Is there anything I can do to help?",
    ["GuildMaidBubble600041"]="(Smile emoticon)",
    ["GuildMaidBubble600042"]="Adventurer! Tell me all about your latest travels!",
    ["GuildMaidBubble601011"]="(Smile emoticon)",
    ["GuildMaidBubble601012"]="It looks like you're in a good mood! I hope you can be happy every day!",
    ["GuildMaidBubble601021"]="(Heart emoticon)",
    ["GuildMaidBubble601022"]="I can really feel your love! Please let me do all I can to help you in the future!",
    ["GuildMaidBubble601031"]="(Worried emoticon)",
    ["GuildMaidBubble601032"]="I wish I could take away your worries...",
    ["GuildMaidBubble601041"]="(Smile emoticon)",
    ["GuildMaidBubble601042"]="I've taken care of business for today! Is there anything else I can do for you?",
    ["GuildMaidBubble602011"]="(Happy emoticon)",
    ["GuildMaidBubble602012"]="Haha! Did something good happen today? Tell me all about it!",
    ["GuildMaidBubble602021"]="(Shy emoticon)",
    ["GuildMaidBubble602022"]="*Cough, cough* Adventurer, you really like me...? I'm... I'm so happy!",
    ["GuildMaidBubble602031"]="(Worried emoticon)",
    ["GuildMaidBubble602032"]="Why have you been frowning so much today? How about you join me for a little break?",
    ["GuildMaidBubble602041"]="(Big grin emoticon)",
    ["GuildMaidBubble602042"]="Haha! What a beautiful day! Let's go on an adventure!",
    ["GuildMaidTips_1"]="Can be stationed",
    ["GuildMaidTips_2"]="Stationing",
    ["GuildMonsterLimitCountTip"]="There are %s monsters in your guild, but the maximum number of monsters allowed in a location is %s! Cannot use!",
    ["GuildNewBP_Info"]="Record",
    ["GuildNewBP_Info_bp"]="<color=#969696>%s: </color>\n<color=#d6c5a1>%s: </color><color=#dedede> Purchased Kingdom Glory Pass and increased the Guild Pass EXP by </color><color=#d6c5a1>%s</color><color=#dedede></color>.",
    ["GuildNewBP_Info_exp"]="<color=#969696>%s: </color>\n<color=#d6c5a1>%s</color><color=#dedede> Completed a Guild Order and increased the Guild Pass EXP by </color><color=#d6c5a1>%s</color><color=#dedede></color>.",
    ["GuildNewBP_Info_reward"]="<color=#969696>%s: </color>\n<color=#d6c5a1>%s: </color><color=#dedede> Claimed an Lv.</color><color=#d6c5a1>%s</color><color=#dedede> Enlightenment Reward</color>.",
    ["GuildNewBP_btn_get"]="Claim All",
    ["GuildNewBP_during"]="%s/%s days",
    ["GuildNewBP_help"]="1. The Guild Pass resets on the 15th of each month.\n 2. After the Guild reaches Lv.2, Guild Pass will be activated automatically.\n 3. Guild members who purchase the Kingdom Glory Pass and complete the Guild orders will receive Guild Pass EXP.\n 4. Each Guild member is entitled to a Guild reward and can only claim the reward they are entitled to.\n 5. The Guild Pass reward consists of Normal Rewards (top) and Enlightenment Rewards (bottom). Normal Rewards become available once the Guild member reaches the required Pass level, while Enlightenment Rewards require Guild members to spend their Enlightenment Coins.\n 6. A reward can only be claimed once per Normal Reward cycle for each tier. (Joining another Guild will not entitle you to claim the same Normal Reward again.)\n 7. Enlightenment Rewards need to be purchased in an order based on the rewards' level from the lowest to the highest. Switching Guilds will reset the level of Enlightenment Rewards back to 1.",
    ["GuildNewBP_tips_getreward"]="Purchase Guild Pass to receive Enlightenment Rewards (current level: Lv.%s)",
    ["GuildNewBP_unlock"]="Unlocking the Guild Pass requires the Guild to reach Lv.2.",
    ["GuildNewOrderTips_01"]="Activate the Super Order mode? (Once activated, the next refresh of Advanced Orders will double both the required goods and rewards!)",
    ["GuildNewOrderTips_02"]="Unlocks after Advanced Order Round 4",
    ["GuildNewOrderTips_03"]="(Current Round: %s)",
    ["GuildNewOrderTips_04"]="Assisting is not allowed when the Super Order mode is activated.",
    ["GuildNewOrder_btn_list"]="Contribution Ranking",
    ["GuildNewOrder_btn_submit"]="Submit",
    ["GuildNewOrder_daily_limitTips"]="The daily order refresh has been used up. Please come back tomorrow!",
    ["GuildNewOrder_help"]="1. Guild Order resets at 05:00 daily, and 8 Common Orders will appear each time.\n2. Upon completing these 8 Common Orders, you can spend Crystals to refresh the Guild Orders to obtain 8 Advanced Orders.\n3. Materials required to complete Advanced Orders can be obtained from the Exchange Center. Complete the Advanced Orders to increase the total Guild Order Progress.\n4. When you reach the maximum Guild Order Progress, 1 Limited-Time Order will be issued to every guild member, which is valid for 24 hours.\n5. The Limited-Time Order will not be refreshed nor reset.\n6. Custom Orders are reset at 05:00 daily, and you can use items from the Encyclopedia for submissions.\n7. After refreshing Advanced Orders 4 times, the Super Order feature will be unlocked. The goods required and the rewards granted by Super Orders will be 10 times that of usual Advanced Orders.",
    ["GuildNewOrder_list_desc"]="Completed Advanced Guild Orders",
