    ["GuildUpdateTips_7"]="Deputy Guild Leader",
    ["GuildUpdateTips_8"]="· When Guild Funds satisfy certain requirements, the Guild Leader can upgrade the guild.\n· The Guild Leader needs to talk to the Guild Housekeeper in the Guild territory for the upgrade.\n\nCurrent Guild Funds/Guild Funds needed for the upgrade: %s/%s.",
