    ["GuildWarehouse_1"]="%s-%s-%s",
    ["GuildWarehouse_10"]="- The Guild Warehouse is used to distribute the Guild Rewards earned in all Guild Events.\n- Only the Guild Leader or Deputy Guild Leader can distribute the items in the warehouse.\n- Members will receive the items via mail.",
    ["GuildWarehouse_2"]="%s successfully obtained %s ×%s.",
    ["GuildWarehouse_3"]="· Otherworld Gate Guild Gift Pack: In each Otherworld Gate event, the more donation, the higher the damage dealt and the more healing performed, which leads to more distribution chances. Distribution chances can be accumulated.\n· Guild KVM Gift Pack: The higher the contribution in Guild KVM, the more the distribution chances. Distribution chances can be accumulated.",
