    ["HalfYearCeremonyTips_001"]="<color=#97BCF8FF>New Year Wishes:</color>\n          1. Unlock clues about future updates based on how fast the entire server collects Drift Bottles.\n          2. The Drift Bottle collection progress will be refreshed at 5:00 AM each day.\n          3. Obtain bonus six-month anniversary gifts when you unlock the clues. \n\n<color=#97BCF8FF>Mega Raffle:</color>\n          1. You must have at least one Six-Month Anniversary Raffle Ticket to enter the draw.\n          2. In each region, the total prize is 4,000,000 Diamonds. There will be 2,022 players selected at random in each region and they will each win 2,022 Diamonds. The remaining players will receive 2,022 Crystals.\n          3. The more raffle tickets you have, the higher your chance of winning the grand prize!",
    ["HalfYearCeremonyTips_002"]="Your prize: %s",
    ["HalfYearCeremonyTips_003"]="Did not enter the raffle.",
    ["HalfYearCeremonyTips_004"]="Your raffle tickets: %s",
    ["HalfYearCeremonyTips_005"]="Raffle draw: %s",
    ["HalfYearCeremonyTips_006"]="Explore new chapters.",
    ["HalfYearCeremonyTips_007"]="Awesome third classes are now available.",
    ["HalfYearCeremonyTips_008"]="Home of complete freedom.",
    ["HalfYearCeremonyTips_009"]="Visit from an otherworldly guest.",
    ["HalfYearCeremonyTips_010"]="Server Drift Bottle collection: %s",
    ["HalfYearCeremonyTips_011"]="This content is locked.",
    ["HalfYearCeremonyTips_012"]="<color=#97BCF8FF><size=26>%s</size></color> players so far! The more rewards, the higher the chance!",
    ["HalfYearDriftBottleBlessing_001"]="Odin's holy light shines brightly in your heart, and wonderful blessings are hidden within the bottle.",
    ["HalfYearDriftBottleBlessing_002"]="May everyone find their own wonderland, and write their own legend.",
    ["HalfYearDriftBottleBlessing_003"]="On this joyous occasion, we wish you happiness and smiles every single day.",
    ["HalfYearDriftBottleBlessing_004"]="In 2022, we wish for all Midgard Adventurers to be blessed with good fortune and find rare treasures every step of the way.",
    ["HalfYearDriftBottleBlessing_005"]="Hey, Adventurer. Wanna join Poring for a joyous six-month anniversary celebration?",
    ["HalfYearDriftBottleBlessing_006"]="Shout out your dreams and keep persevering on! The road of adventure never ends!",
    ["HalfYearDriftBottleBlessing_007"]="We're thankful for your company and blessed to have you with us. ROX will continue to accompany you in this upcoming year!",
    ["HalfYearDriftBottleBlessing_008"]="I hear that every time a new feature is released, a developer loses his hair. Please let me keep my hair in this new year!",
    ["HalfYearDriftBottleBlessing_009"]="The adventure is endless and the story is far from over! Let's go on lots more adventures together in 2022!",
    ["HalfYearDriftBottleBlessing_010"]="We thank every single player that has witnessed the growth of ROX. It's all because of you!",
    ["HalfYearDriftBottleBlessing_011"]="I will always love ROX!",
    ["HalfYearDriftBottleBlessing_012"]="Even though I don't know who will get this, I wish that everything in life will go well for you, stranger from afar.",
    ["HalfYearDriftBottleBlessing_013"]="Exam season is almost upon us. Can Odin's Bloodline bless me to answer multiple choice questions correctly?",
    ["HalfYearDriftBottleBlessing_014"]="To my youth and RO, may you continue to stay by my side next year.",
    ["HalfYearDriftBottleBlessing_015"]="How I wish I could meet the pretty lady who saved me in that instance last time!",
    ["HalfYearDriftBottleBlessing_016"]="Love and peace! Wishing ROX continued popularity and wishing my refinement reaches Lv. 12.",
    ["HalfYearDriftBottleBlessing_017"]="Thank you MVPs and Mini Bosses! Please give me more orange cards!",
    ["HalfYearDriftBottleBlessing_018"]="Time does not wash away the wonderful memories. Age does not dilute the sweetness of friendship.",
    ["HalfYearDriftBottleBlessing_019"]="Sometimes you can know someone at just one glance. Some people stay with you through thick and thin.",
    ["HalfYearDriftBottleBlessing_020"]="May the friendship within your guild last forever. Cherish every day with your faithful companions.",
    ["HalfYearDriftBottleTips_001"]="<color=#97BCF8FF>Rules:</color>\n          1. Until 1/1/2022, there is a chance to obtain a Drift Bottle from fishing. There is a maximum number that can be obtained each day.\n          2. There are two types of Drift Bottles: official ones and player ones. The official ones come with a small gift.\n          3. Celebrate six months with Ragnarok X: Next Generation by throwing out your own Drift Bottle, and receive a gift. There's a chance that your message will be picked up by another player or even displayed in the game after the New Year Mega Raffle.\n          4. All unused Drift Bottles will be automatically thrown out each day at 5:00 AM and the corresponding gifts will be issued via mail.",
    ["HalfYearDriftBottleTips_002"]="Drift Bottle has been thrown.",
    ["HalfYearDriftBottleTips_003"]="From the development team",
    ["HalfYearDriftBottleTips_004"]="From a mystery player",
    ["HalfYearDriftBottleTips_005"]="From %s",
    ["HalfYearDriftBottleTips_006"]="You can still collect %s Drift Bottles today.",
    ["HalfYearDriftBottleType_001"]="Official Bottle",
    ["HalfYearDriftBottleType_002"]="%s",
    ["HalfYearDriftBottleType_003"]="Mystery Player",
    ["HalfYearMemoirDataDes_001"]="ROX has been together with you for <color=#e86890>%s</color> days. I remember every moment. We once stood at the peak together, experiencing the server launch event and enjoying the warm summer. We also went on adventures with our pets, defended against the Otherworld Invasion of the Slime, and participated in the exciting cross-server PVP season. We even celebrated the Halloween Revelry and awaited the arrival of the mysterious Glast Heim...",
    ["HalfYearMemoirDataDes_002"]="However, the most precious part of everything is, <color=#e86890>%s</color>, your arrival in Rune-Midgarts. (The statistics are collected until 12/17/2021.)",
    ["HalfYearMemoirDataDes_003"]="<color=#e86890>%s</color>, you possess the status of Kafra's VIP.",
    ["HalfYearMemoirDataDes_004"]="<color=#e86890>%s</color>, you have decided your path forward.",
    ["HalfYearMemoirDataDes_005"]="You have maintained your Novice class. We hope that you will be able to decide on your job advancement in the near future.",
    ["HalfYearMemoirDataDes_006"]="Among the numerous choices, you chose to become a <color=#e86890>%s</color>.",
    ["HalfYearMemoirDataDes_007"]="During your adventure, <color=#e86890>%s</color> monsters have filled your handbook.",
    ["HalfYearMemoirDataDes_008"]="To date, you have defeated <color=#e86890>%s</color> monsters.",
    ["HalfYearMemoirDataDes_009"]="You have fought and bested <color=#e86890>%s</color> enemies.",
    ["HalfYearMemoirDataDes_010"]="Throughout your journey, you have collected <color=#e86890>%s</color> decorations. They are still waiting for you to pick them.",
    ["HalfYearMemoirDataDes_011"]="Your Wardrobe is still empty. I wonder what the first lucky addition will be.",
    ["HalfYearMemoirDataDes_012"]="As you set off again, <color=#e86890>%s</color> mounts accompany you.",
    ["HalfYearMemoirDataDes_013"]="Friendship is a diamond that will sparkle throughout your adventure. You have become friends with <color=#e86890>%s</color> other adventurers.",
    ["HalfYearMemoirDataDes_014"]="In your heart, you seem to have found your own haven. You find peace regardless of the liveliness or calmness around you.",
    ["HalfYearMemoirDataDes_015"]="Among them, <color=#e86890>%s</color> is your closest companion.",
    ["HalfYearMemoirDataDes_016"]="You have also formed unbreakable bonds with <color=#e86890>%s</color> NPCs.",
    ["HalfYearMemoirDataDes_017"]="You are well versed in how to make money. At the Exchange Center, you have already sold <color=#e86890>%s</color> orders.",
    ["HalfYearMemoirDataDes_018"]="You have not unlocked your business talents yet. Hurry over to the Exchange Center to make your first transaction!",
    ["HalfYearMemoirDataDes_019"]="In this process, you have earned <color=#e86890>%s</color> Crystals.",
    ["HalfYearMemoirDataDes_020"]="You have also spent <color=#e86890>%s</color> Crystals to become stronger.",
    ["HalfYearMemoirDataDes_021"]="In order to search for rare treasures, you have generously spent <color=#e86890>%s</color> Diamonds.",
    ["HalfYearMemoirDataDes_022"]="You're a natural card collector. You have obtained <color=#e86890>%s</color> cards.",
    ["HalfYearMemoirDataDes_023"]="Unfortunately, you have not collected any cards yet. Cards can give you strong bonuses during battle. Don't give up!",
    ["HalfYearMemoirDataDes_024"]="Among them, the card <color=#e86890>%s</color> is the precious loot after nearly three months of fighting monsters.",
    ["HalfYearMemoirDataDes_025"]="In your adventures, you have unlocked <color=#e86890>%s</color> cards in your Academy Handbook.",
    ["HalfYearMemoirDataDes_026"]="12/18 is the six-month anniversary for ROX. Dear <color=#e86890>%s</color>, thank you for your support so far. We have prepared some surprises for you.\nThe six-month anniversary events will kick off on 12/18.\nWill you be joining us?",
    ["HalfYearMemoirTips_001"]="Event time: %s",
    ["HalfYearMusicBeatTips_001"]="Target score: %s",
    ["HalfYearMusicBeatTips_002"]="Current score: %s",
    ["HalfYearMusicBeatTips_003"]="Miss",
    ["HalfYearMusicBeatTips_004"]="Great",
    ["HalfYearMusicBeatTips_005"]="Perfect",
    ["HalfYearMusicBeatTips_006"]="Combo %s",
    ["HalloweenTips1"]="Not ranked yet",
    ["HalloweenTips2"]="<color=#E8833C>Halloween Revelry Party</color>\n\n1. Adventurers with a Base Level of <color=#E8833C>≥ Lv.51</color> can participate in the party by going to <color=#E8833C>Jakk</color> at <color=#E8833C>Odin's Statue in Prontera</color>.\n2. Jakk will summon a lot of monsters at the 6 party zones at <color=#E8833C>19:00 - 20:00</color> every day.\n3. Adventurers will get heaps of EXP and Zeny by eliminating the monsters. The amount of EXP and Zeny will decrease based on their level. Adventurers can also get <color=#E8833C>Halloween exclusive exchange materials</color> and <color=#E8833C>candy</color>.\n4. At the <color=#E8833C>10th, 20th, 35th, and 50th</color> minute of the party, Jakk will summon many <color=#E8833C>Minis</color> and <color=#E8833C>MVPs</color> at 12 respective areas in the inner and outer city. Eliminate them to get the rare materials they drop, as well as the super rare mount, <color=#E8833C>Pumpkin Carriage</color>.\n5. After the party ends every day, Jakk will rank all adventurers according to the amount of candy they have. Players ranked higher will obtain more exchange materials.\n6. Jakk has also opened an Exchange Shop during the event. Adventurers can exchange the exchange materials they obtained at the Exchange Shop for various Halloween exclusive rewards. The Exchange Shop will remain open for <color=#E8833C>7 days</color> after the event ends, and rewards can still be exchanged during this time.",
    ["HalloweenTips3"]="It's time for Jakk's party to start! Adventurers, you simply can't miss out on this Halloween Revelry Party! You just need to work together and destroy the constantly gathering monsters to get an unexpected surprise! The candies that drop during the party are imbued with the mysterious power of Halloween, and you'll have an unexpected magical experience if you eat it!",
    ["HalloweenTips4"]="<color=#E8833C>Spooky Code Event</color>\n\n1. The code of the day will be issued from <color=#E8833C>19:00</color> every day during the event for adventurers to crack.\n2. Adventurers can use an action against <color=#E8833C>Jakk</color> to get Inside Information, which could be the type or meaning of today's quiz, etc.\n3. Adventurers can use the <color=#E8833C>graffiti</color>, <color=#E8833C>cats and dogs</color>, <color=#E8833C>broom</color>, <color=#E8833C>ghost</color>, <color=#E8833C>mouse</color>, or <color=#E8833C>pigeon</color> in the location to perform an action or emoticon to get one letter of the code.\n4. Collect all the codes and rearrange them to reveal the ultimate secret.\n5. Adventurers can submit their answer in the World chat Channel before <color=#E8833C>0:00</color> every day, and adventurers who successfully crack the code will receive the reward via in-game mail. The first adventurer to submit the correct answer every day will get <color=#E8833C>Mount: Moonster</color>. The mount can only be obtained once.",
    ["HalloweenTips5"]="With the arrival of Halloween, the secrets of the night will no longer have a place to hide! Adventurers, talk to the ghosts wandering around Prontera to gather information. Assemble the codes of the information obtained to discover the ultimate secret of the ghostly world and get the Moonster mount! New mysteries are waiting to be uncovered every day!",
    ["HalloweenTips6"]="Adventurers, have you been having a good time at Jakk's party? The badges obtained during the party can be exchanged for gorgeous Halloween outfits. Collect enough badges and exchange them for the Witch outfit or the Bothersome Imp from Jakk's shop. Go look for Jakk now!",
    ["HalloweenTips7"]="Party Time: 20:00 - 21:00",
