    ["Home_18"]="About Farmland",
    ["HomesteadWarehouse_help"]="About Home Warehouse:\n1. Only furniture can be stored in the warehouse. Any obtained pieces will be automatically stored there without showing up in your backpack. Feel free to check on them in the warehouse.\n2. When decorating your home, there's no need to withdraw furniture from the warehouse. Just place them directly in the room, and the existing furniture in your warehouse will be automatically applied.\n3. Any furniture that Craftsman Rony finishes will be placed into the warehouse after claiming, so no worries about losing any furniture!",
    ["HomesteadWarehouse_type_1"]="Large Furniture",
    ["HomesteadWarehouse_type_2"]="Small Furniture",
    ["HomesteadWarehouse_type_3"]="Wall Decoration",
    ["HomesteadWarehouse_type_all"]="All",
    ["HomunculusDes1"]="When a Homunculus is on the battlefield, it will gain EXP when its summoner gains EXP.",
    ["HomunculusDes2"]="A Homunculus's attack or defense status will not affect how much EXP it gains.",
    ["HomunculusDes3"]="EXP gained by the Homunculus will not affect EXP gained by the summoner.",
    ["HomunculusDes4"]="Homunculi inherit the stats of their summoner in different ratios.",
    ["HomunculusDes5"]="As a Homunculus's number of evolutions increases, the inheritance ratio of stats they inherit will increase.",
    ["HomunculusDes6"]="A Homunculus's current level, the summoner's stats, and the inheritance ratio of each stat will affect the Homunculus's overall stats.",
    ["HomunculusDes7"]="Homunculi can evolve when they reach a certain level. Their level will be reset to Lv.1 after evolution.",
    ["HomunculusDes8"]="Homunculi gain new skills after evolving.",
    ["HomunculusDes9"]="Homunculi can evolve multiple times. The number of times a Homunculus can evolve is determined by the version's level cap.",
