    ["Img_Card_WLS1"]="Soul Web",
    ["Img_Card_WLS2"]="Soul Harvest",
    ["ImprovedLv"]="Ascend Lv.",
    ["InfoDes_fuhuo"]="<color=#97BCF8>Kafra Plus:</color>\nDear Adventurer, you can now be resurrected multiple times in the wild.\nAttempts reset at 05:00 daily.",
    ["InfoDes_wangpai"]="<color=#97BCF8>Kafra Plus:</color>\nDear Adventurer, you can now receive extra points from certain matches in the Ultimate Hunter Showdown.\nEnjoy the game!\nExtra attempts reset at 05:00 daily.",
    ["InheritSet_1"]="Diamond Cost Reduced",
    ["InheritSet_2"]="Reduce the Zeny cost of this transfer by %s",
    ["InheritUnset"]="Not currently selected",
    ["InheritanceRules"]="Equipment will not be consumed for equipment stat transfer.",
    ["InheritanceRulesOfEnchantment"]="Enchantment Stat Transfer",
    ["InheritanceRulesOfEnchantmentTips1"]="Equipment of the same type can transfer their Enchantment Stats to each other through <color=#B55558>Ordinary Transfer</color>.\nWeapons of different types can transfer their Enchantment Stats to each other through <color=#B55558>Advanced Transfer</color>.\nWeapon combinations of different types can transfer their Enchantment Stats through <color=#B55558>Special Advanced Transfer</color>. When conducting Special Advanced Transfer, Enchantment Stats will be <color=#B55558>calculated separately for each slot to determine the final stat and level</color>.\nStat: for the same slots, the stat with the lowest-level city of enchantment becomes the providing stat, and all corresponding slots of the main equipment combination will inherit this stat.\nLevel: the system will calculate total enchantment values of corresponding slots for secondary equipment combination, distribute these values to each piece of main equipment proportionately, and then determine the acquired level based on values distributed and the level of the stat inherited.",
    ["InheritanceRulesOfRefine"]="Refinement Stat Transfer",
    ["InheritanceRulesOfRefineExplainTips1"]="Equipment of the same type and quality can transfer their Refinement Stats to each other through Ordinary Transfer.\nWeapons of different quality but of the same type can transfer their Refinement Stats to each other through Advanced Transfer.",
    ["InheritanceRulesOfSlotStrengthen"]="Upgrading Stat Transfer",
    ["InheritanceRulesOfSlotStrengthenExplainTips1"]="Equipment of the same type can transfer their Upgrading Stats to each other through Ordinary Transfer.\nWeapons of different types and weapon combinations can transfer their Upgrading Stats to each other through Advanced Transfer and Special Advanced Transfer.",
    ["InheritanceRulesTips1"]="Ordinary, Advanced, and Special Advanced Transfers can be conducted on equipment.",
    ["InheritanceRulesTips2"]="Ordinary Transfers can be carried out for equipment of the same type by using Zeny. When the transfer cost exceeds the threshold, <color=#B55558>Poring Gold Coins</color> must be spent to offset the exceeded amount.",
    ["InheritanceRulesTips3"]="For weapons, Advanced Transfer can be performed across minor types in each major category (two-handed weapons, main-hand weapons, off-hand weapons, and daggers). Costs Diamonds.",
    ["InheritanceRulesTips4"]="For weapons, added a Special Advanced Transfer that can be performed across the three following combinations: main/off-hand weapons, dual daggers, and two-handed weapons. Costs Diamonds.",
    ["InheritanceRulesTips5"]="When spending Diamonds for transfer, you can use <color=#B55558>Dream Sand</color> to offset the cost of the Diamonds. But there is a minimum spending amount of how much <color=#B55558>Dream Sand</color> to spend each time, which the surplus will not be returned.\nAdvanced Transfer Total Cost = ((Original Transfer Cost x Poring Diamond Discount) - Dream Sand Offset Amount) x Kafra Plus Discount",
    ["InheritedEquipmentIsDamaged"]="Equipment with transferred stats has been damaged. Transfer stats?",
    ["InputCanNotBeEmpty"]="Cannot be blank.",
    ["InstanceDescription1"]="(Moon Euin freezes for a while.)\nThe power of the Fragments of Ymir's Heart is very hard to control and can cause monsters to transform? That is indeed quite dangerous. I understand now. Well then, <color=#CA2E0AFF>follow me</color>!",
    ["InstanceDescription10"]="With each floor posing different challenges, only the most powerful adventurers have what it takes to explore the heights of the Endless Tower, and legend has it that lucky adventurers have found the treasure waiting within.",
    ["InstanceDescription101"]="A thousand years ago, Baphomet tore a hole in time and space and led an army of monsters from another world to invade Midgard, with the intention of conquering the continent. As Baphomet waved his Demon Scythe, the brave heroes of the land rose up and let forth a defiant battle cry that pierced the raging flames of Prontera, sounding the song of Prontera's unyielding defense. Successor of Odin's bloodline, now it is your turn to return to the battle of a thousand years past and use your wisdom and courage to save the city...",
    ["InstanceDescription102"]="Hatred, despair, sorrow, agony... Thanatos, the Demon Swordsman who lost everything, extracted all his negative emotions with his own hands and sealed them in Thanatos Tower. Some say these emotions were thrown away because their master pursued the purest form of ultimate power, and they have gained self-consciousness over time. Yet some would say the master of these emotions is still hiding in the tower, vainly attempting to revive his only companion through an evil ritual. Whatever the fact might be or however it revealed itself to the world, one thing remains undebatable: one hundred years ago, a calamity struck the mortal realm, causing the seal within the tower to crumble; Thanatos, on the other hand, was nowhere to be found...",
    ["InstanceDescription103"]="A Ymir's Heart from the future has empowered the Verus to forge their most glorious civilization. The aspiration to decode divine forces through technology, embodying the dedication of several generations, has finally yielded the perfect creation known as \"Vesper.\" However, this awakened machine seems to have never recognized its creator...",
    ["InstanceDescription104"]="Bijou, the witch of mind and desire, ruled Arunafeltz like a puppeteer—feeding upon souls in her unholy quest for eternal life. Her sins were carved deep into her body—until the witch became a monster shaped by years of desecration. When the first Pope, guided by Goddess Freyja, shattered her illusion of immortality, the witch's scream echoed across Rachel and became the cry of the new Arunafeltz. Yet when Goddess Freyja slumbers, and the young Pope's heart wavers, a mysterious call beckons her back—to that brutal battlefield of old...",
    ["InstanceDescription1041"]="The fertile land lies frozen in frost, and the souls of the pure-hearted are bound in chains. She who usurped the crown sat upon the eternal throne, called herself Freyja, and bent the Pope to her will. This is the nightmare that haunts Pope Runa—welcome to the darkest trial that preceded Arunafeltz's rise.",
    ["InstanceDescription11"]="There is always a fearful presence of plague in Beelzebub's territory. Any living beings who dare to enter will die from erosion, be engulfed by venom, and gradually decay toward death. The only hope lies within a seed that dates back to the age of gods; when it becomes a colossal tree covering the sky, it shall resurrect the dying with its cleansing...",
    ["InstanceDescription2"]="For thousands of years, a terrifying legend has pervaded the seas... The ship of a pirate king, lost in the mist, was dragged to the bottom of the sea by the tentacles of the Kraken. Everyone on the ship was transformed into undead monsters, and since then, whenever a strange mist spread across the sea, ships foolish enough to venture into it were never seen again. On these waters, some have even claimed to have seen ships full of undead monsters wailing at them through the fog...",
    ["InstanceDescription3"]="Legend has it that in the depths of the sea lies an ancient temple, where Nield, God of the Sea, is said to reside. After Nield defeated his nemesis, the Kraken, the creatures dwelling in this stretch of sea built a huge statue of their god, located at the top of the temple. They say that the statue is imbued with Nield's power, and that those who venture too close to the statue will provoke the sea god's wrath and be banished by the power of lightning.",
    ["InstanceDescription30"]="There is a showdown looming on the pinnacle. Be the Guild that captures the most metal energy on the Throne Wars, and you will be crowned the winner! Don't give up until the very end, and fight for the glory of the Guild!",
    ["InstanceDescription4"]="Whenever the clock chimes at midnight, the castle in the depths of Geffen always seems to be accompanied by melodious music. It's said that Dracula waltzes along to the midnight music. The blood and the call of the soul are interwoven. It seems a banquet for demons is being held...",
    ["InstanceDescription4506"]="Located southwest of the capital, the city is built around an oasis and surrounded by a desert. It acts as a barrier, making it difficult for the capital's royal family to assert power in the region. Therefore, an underworld of thieves and bandits have become it's rulers. Rumor has it that the swordsman Thanatos sealed Morroc here, and the area's desertification is affected by his curse.",
    ["InstanceDescription4507"]="This port city situated southeast of the capital is the trading center of the Rune Kingdom. However, due to frequent severe weather conditions, fierce storms are often accompanied by huge waves that prevent ships from leaving the port and cause shipwrecks. Treasures fallen in the deep sea have become the reason for many treasure hunters and merchants to come here.",
    ["InstanceDescription5"]="Long ago, an ancient Egyptian pharaoh was buried in a pyramid in Morroc. As the glory of this past empire became buried by the sands of time, his legend disappeared into the annals of history. But now, the mummified Pharaoh has reawakened... Will the restless souls within the pyramid ever know peace again?",
    ["InstanceDescription5710"]="Collect carrots and avoid wolf attacks. Once you've reached the goal, you're the winner! Keep it up, Adventurer!",
    ["InstanceDescription6"]="As a beautiful girl transformed into a demon doomed to lurk in the darkness, Payon's Munak Cave claimed another victim. Only in the light of the full moon can her true face be seen once more, but in the depths of Moonlight Flower's heart lies nothing but hatred for the living...",
    ["InstanceDescription7"]="Once the ruler of a magnificent dynasty, how could he accept the fate of a prisoner on the Sealed Island? When the surging power of darkness spread throughout the island, what was once a prison has become the domain of the Dark Lord. The crimson sun reveals endless opportunities to slaughter. Every person who steps into the abyss has become fresh prey for the Dark Lord...",
    ["InstanceDescription8"]="Hidden in the depths of the Clock Tower, Owl Duke is a magician the most skilled at deceiving people. Even <color=#ff5252>Ryder</color>, the Mech Goren who has sprouted an independent consciousness, has become his most loyal follower.\nWhen the moonlight strikes the clock at midnight, the magic show will begin on time in the Clock Tower. And every adventurer who breaks into the stage will be part of this grand show…",
    ["InstanceDescription8166"]="Guess the hat that is not marked by Eddga and survive to win. Go for it! Adventurer!",
    ["InstanceDescription9"]="The Dragon Flame has been lit again, and the fiery doom of millennia past will now be known again. The dragons who once razed this continent extend their bare claws again, devouring vitality and prosperity with searing lava. The only hope of a soon-to-be-scorched land is to wait for another miracle—a new savior. Will history and legend judge that to be you?",
