    ["ItemDes_1011"]="Can be exchanged for lots of guild-exclusive rewards.",
    ["ItemDes_1012"]="Material for the guild construction and development. Requires more contribution from guild members!",
    ["ItemDes_1013"]="For credits! Go for it!",
    ["ItemDes_1014"]="A currency used at Criatura Academy. Can be used to redeem rewards.",
    ["ItemDes_1015"]="A stone that only appears in Endless Tower.",
    ["ItemDes_1016"]="Use at the Card Vending Machine to take part in the Vending Machine Event!",
    ["ItemDes_1017"]="Odin's Blessing. Increases Base EXP gained fivefold.",
    ["ItemDes_1018"]="Odin's Blessing. Increases Job EXP gained fivefold.",
    ["ItemDes_1019"]="Obtain any white card.",
    ["ItemDes_1020"]="Use at the Equipment Vending Machine to take part in the Vending Machine Event!",
    ["ItemDes_10201001"]="An HP-restoring potion made from Yellow Herbs. Use to immediately restore 14,000 HP, plus 6,000 HP every second for 5 seconds afterward. Cannot be used in PVP. Required Level: 20",
    ["ItemDes_10201002"]="An HP-restoring potion made with Orange Herb. Use to immediately restore 5,000 HP, plus 500 HP every second for 10 seconds afterward. Cannot be used in PVP. Required Level: 40",
    ["ItemDes_10201004"]="An HP-restoring potion made from Red Herbs. Use to immediately restore 2,000 HP, plus 800 HP every second for 5 seconds afterward. Cannot be used in PVP. Required Level: 1",
    ["ItemDes_10201005"]="An HP-restoring potion made from White Herbs. Use to immediately restore 32,000 HP, plus 12,800 HP every second for 5 seconds afterward. Cannot be used in PVP. Required Level: 50",
    ["ItemDes_10201006"]="An SP-restoring potion made with Blue Herb. Use to immediately restore 500 SP, plus 200 SP every second for 5 seconds afterward. Cannot be used in PVP. Required Level: 1",
    ["ItemDes_10201008"]="Fruit of Yggdrasil. It's said that eating it will refresh one's spirit. Completely restores the user's HP and SP. Cannot be used in PVP. Required Level: 1",
    ["ItemDes_10201009"]="Fruit of Yggdrasil. It's said that eating it will refresh one's spirit. Completely restores the user's HP and SP. Cannot be used in PVP. Required Level: 1. Can only be used in GVG and Abyssal scenes.",
    ["ItemDes_10201013"]="The taste of monster meat is amazing! This cooking ingredient can be obtained from specific monsters or purchased from vend shops.",
    ["ItemDes_10201014"]="A blue herb with a unique scent and energizing properties.\nUsed as a crafting material to produce Blue Medicine Kit and PVP Blue Medicine Kit.",
    ["ItemDes_10201015"]="A red herb with a unique scent and energizing properties.\nUsed as a crafting material to produce Red Medicine Kit and PVP Red Medicine Kit.",
    ["ItemDes_10201016"]="A yellow herb with a unique scent and energizing properties.\nUsed as a crafting material to produce Yellow Medicine Kit and PVP Yellow Medicine Kit.",
    ["ItemDes_10201017"]="A white herb with a unique scent and energizing properties.\nUsed as a crafting material to produce White Medicine Kit and PVP White Medicine Kit.",
    ["ItemDes_10201018"]="A mysterious potion that can seemingly remove all maladies. Use to recover from most negative status effects.\nCan't be used when affected by Stun, Freeze, Petrify, or Sleep.",
    ["ItemDes_10201023"]="An HP-restoring potion made from Yellow Herbs. Use to immediately restore 14,000 HP, plus 6,000 HP every second for 5 seconds afterward. Can only be used in PVP. Required Level: 20",
    ["ItemDes_10201024"]="An HP-restoring potion made with Orange Herb. Use to immediately restore 5,000 HP, plus 500 HP every second for 10 seconds afterward. Can only be used in PVP. Required Level: 40",
    ["ItemDes_10201025"]="An HP-restoring potion made from Red Herbs. Use to immediately restore 2,000 HP, plus 800 HP every second for 5 seconds afterward. Can only be used in PVP. Required Level: 1",
    ["ItemDes_10201026"]="An HP-restoring potion made from White Herbs. Use to immediately restore 32,000 HP, plus 12,800 HP every second for 5 seconds afterward. Can only be used in PVP. Required Level: 50",
    ["ItemDes_10201027"]="An SP-restoring potion made with Blue Herb. Use to immediately restore 500 SP, plus 200 SP every second for 5 seconds afterward. Can only be used in PVP. Required Level: 1",
    ["ItemDes_10201028"]="Once used, damage received from Fire attribute monsters is reduced by 15% for 10 minutes, it can stack up to 12 hours at most.",
    ["ItemDes_10201029"]="Once used, damage received from Water attribute monsters is reduced by 15% for 10 minutes, it can stack up to 12 hours at most.",
    ["ItemDes_10201030"]="Once used, damage received from Wind attribute monsters is reduced by 15% for 10 minutes, it can stack up to 12 hours at most.",
    ["ItemDes_10201031"]="Once used, damage received from Earth attribute monsters is reduced by 15% for 10 minutes, it can stack up to 12 hours at most.",
    ["ItemDes_10201032"]="An SP-restoring potion made with Purple Herb. Use to immediately restore 2,000 SP, plus 800 SP every second for 5 seconds afterward. Cannot be used in PVP. Required Level: 40",
    ["ItemDes_10201033"]="An SP-restoring potion made with Purple Herb. Use to immediately restore 2,000 SP, plus 800 SP every second for 5 seconds afterward. Can only be used in PVP. Required Level: 40",
    ["ItemDes_10201034"]="An advanced HP-restoring potion made from mixed herbs. Use to immediately restore 80,000 HP, plus 32,000 HP every second for 5 seconds afterward. Cannot be used in PVP. Required Level: 75",
    ["ItemDes_10201035"]="An advanced HP-restoring potion made from mixed herbs. Use to immediately restore 80,000 HP, plus 32,000 HP every second for 5 seconds afterward. Can only be used in PVP. Required Level: 75",
    ["ItemDes_10201040"]="A potion that emits a warm glow. Use to restore 60 Stamina.",
    ["ItemDes_10201041"]="A potion that emits a warm glow, but that is smaller than the average Stamina Potion. Use to restore 10 Stamina.",
    ["ItemDes_10201042"]="A green herb that is similar in appearance to a rotten crop.",
    ["ItemDes_10201043"]="Made from ground green Herbs. Use to immediately restore 420,000 HP, plus 179,200 HP every second for 5 seconds afterward. Cannot be used in PVP. Required Level: 120",
    ["ItemDes_10201044"]="Made from ground green Herbs. Use to immediately restore 420,000 HP, plus 179,200 HP every second for 5 seconds afterward. Required Level: 120",
    ["ItemDes_10201045"]="A new potion made with the latest alchemy—heals better than ever. Use to immediately restore 823,200 HP, plus 351,300 HP every second for 5 seconds afterward. Unavailable in PVP modes. Required Level: 130",
    ["ItemDes_10201046"]="A new potion made with the latest alchemy—heals better than ever. Use to immediately restore 823,200 HP, plus 351,300 HP every second for 5 seconds afterward. Required Level: 130",
    ["ItemDes_10202003"]="An item made from clipped Chonchon wings and possessing magical power. Can be used to move to a random location on the map.",
    ["ItemDes_10202004"]="An item made from clipped butterfly wings, it possesses a magical power. Can be used to move to a saved location on the map.",
    ["ItemDes_10202022"]="Sprout of Yggdrasil, filled with powerful vital energy. Restores 50% HP and 50% SP. Cannot be used in PVP. Required Level: 1",
    ["ItemDes_10202023"]="A card that allows one to change their name. Use to change your character's name!",
    ["ItemDes_10202024"]="Leaf of Yggdrasil, filled with powerful vital energy. Can revive characters who have lost their ability to fight.",
    ["ItemDes_10202025"]="There's a rumor that a person who finds a Magical Stone can use it to initialize their stats. Use to reset your Stat Points.",
    ["ItemDes_10202026"]="A stick that emits a blue light when you press the button. Those who see this light will forget parts of their memory. Can be used to reset skill points.",
    ["ItemDes_10202027"]="A special membership coupon for the gym. Use to increase your weight limit by 1,000.",
    ["ItemDes_10202029"]="Once used, your weapon's attribute will change to Fire for 20 minutes, it can stack up to 12 hours at most.",
    ["ItemDes_10202030"]="Once used, your weapon's attribute will change to Water for 20 minutes, it can stack up to 12 hours at most.",
    ["ItemDes_10202031"]="Once used, your weapon's attribute will change to Wind for 20 minutes, it can stack up to 12 hours at most.",
    ["ItemDes_10202032"]="Once used, your weapon's attribute will change to Earth for 20 minutes, it can stack up to 12 hours at most.",
    ["ItemDes_10202033"]="A certificate issued by Kafra Corporation, provided only to adventurers who have made contributions to the Chamber of Commerce. Use it to increase your Warehouse storage space.",
    ["ItemDes_10202034"]="Purchase to obtain the Endless Strength Blessing.",
    ["ItemDes_10202035"]="Purchase to obtain the Endless Magic Blessing.",
    ["ItemDes_10202036"]="Purchase to obtain the Endless Speed Blessing.",
    ["ItemDes_10202037"]="Purchase to obtain the Endless Meditatio Blessing.",
    ["ItemDes_10202038"]="Purchase to gain 1 stack of Angeling's Blessing.",
    ["ItemDes_10202039"]="Purchase to remove 1 stack of Deviling's Curse.",
    ["ItemDes_10202040"]="The kingdom herald's mysterious quest book. Use to accept mysterious quests.",
    ["ItemDes_10202041"]="A mysterious invitation from Tony Chir, the Arena Master, which is necessary to participate in the Ultimate Showdown. The handwriting of the invitation is rather messy, making it impossible for anyone to read what is written, but the Arena Master can easily tell whether it is true or fake.",
    ["ItemDes_10202042"]="A <color=#FF69B4>sharing box</color> that is filled with Halloween candy.\nYou will find that it is filled with snacks.\nIt will be placed on the ground after you use it to share with everyone.\nEach person can only take 1 piece of candy. There is a total of 10 pieces of candy.\n<color=#FF0000>(The sharing box will expire if you leave it for a long time.)</color>",
    ["ItemDes_10202043"]="Chunky Poring Candy exclusive to the Halloween event.\nEating it will make you big and fat, and some stats might get a buff or debuff. You can only eat a maximum of 5! Don't be greedy!\n<color=#FF0000>(The candy will expire if you don't eat it.)</color>",
    ["ItemDes_10202044"]="Deviruchi Candy exclusive to the Halloween event.\nEating it will make you small and skinny, and some stats might get a buff or debuff. You can only eat a maximum of 5! Don't be greedy!\n<color=#FF0000>(The candy will expire if you don't eat it.)</color>",
    ["ItemDes_10202045"]="Ghost Candy exclusive to the Halloween event.\nYou will enter Hiding mode after eating it and Crit Rate will increase greatly. The effect cannot be stacked.\n<color=#FF0000>(The candy will expire if you don't eat it.)</color>",
    ["ItemDes_10202046"]="Pumpkin Candy exclusive to the Halloween event.\nYou will enter Fervor mode after eating it and you will deal more damage against Large monsters. It has adverse side effects. The effect cannot be stacked.\n<color=#FF0000>(The candy will expire if you don't eat it.)</color>",
    ["ItemDes_10202049"]="Normal candy dropped by monsters in the Halloween event. Jakk will tabulate the number of candies obtained and you will be ranked accordingly.",
    ["ItemDes_10202050"]="Starshot used during the Christmas Shootout event. Can be fired using the Christmas Elk Slingshot in Geffen to deal moderate damage to Small Monster Balloons.\n<color=#FF0000>[Slingshot can be used at Base Lv.25 and above.]</color>\nConsume Odin's Blessing to earn Starshot.",
    ["ItemDes_10202051"]="Meteor Pellets used during the Christmas Shootout event. Can be fired using the Christmas Elk Slingshot in Geffen to deals high damage to Medium and Small Monster Balloons.\n<color=#FF0000>[Slingshot can be used at Base Lv.25 and above.]</color>\nYou can obtain Meteor Pellets from Carnival Activity Chests.",
    ["ItemDes_10202052"]="Icicle Ammo used during the Christmas Shootout event. Can be fired using the Christmas Elk Slingshot in Geffen to deal extreme damage to Medium and Large Monster Balloons.\n<color=#FF0000>[Slingshot can be used at Base Lv.25 and above.]</color>\nYou can obtain Icicle Ammo after clearing instances in the Heart Pedestal.",
    ["ItemDes_10202053"]="Cannon Balls used during the Christmas Shooting Festival. Can be fired using the fort in Geffen.\nGrants you a chance to earn extra rewards when shooting Gold Angeling Balloons, and has a <color=#FF0000>0.05%</color> chance to launch one-hit critical shots.\n<color=#FF0000>[The fort can be used at Base Lv.25 and above]</color>",
    ["ItemDes_10202054"]="Fireworks for the Painted Spring event. It deals a small amount of damage to Nian and can be equipped on the Quick Use bar.",
    ["ItemDes_10202055"]="Firecrackers for the Painted Spring event. Use them to make Phantom Nian vulnerable or instantly defeat Baby Nian. Can be equipped on the Quick Use bar.",
    ["ItemDes_10202056"]="Delicious dumplings with eastern characteristics made especially for the Spring Festival.\nSTR +10, VIT +10, and DEX +10 for 40 minutes.",
    ["ItemDes_10202057"]="Delicious rice cakes with eastern characteristics made especially for the Spring Festival.\nAGI +10, INT+10, and LUK +10 for 40 minutes.",
    ["ItemDes_10202058"]="Exclusive New Year Gift Box. Open to randomly obtain 8888/88888/888888 Zeny, and a random Spring Festival event item (Fireworks/Firecrackers/New Year Dish/Lucky Bag).",
    ["ItemDes_10202059"]="Lucky Trove. Open to randomly obtain a random Equipment Upgrading Metal, Refining Material, or Enchantment Material.\nThere is also a small chance to obtain Spring Festival exclusive Mount: Lion's Head Fireworks. (Non-bound item.)",
    ["ItemDes_10202060"]="A Lantern Festival Gift Box exclusive for Kafra VIPs.\nGet after successfully uniting the lanterns.",
    ["ItemDes_10202061"]="Eating it will grant you the Golden Rabbit Sweet Dumplings Blessing.\nLegend has it that if you go near someone who has eaten Silver Rabbit Sweet Dumplings, a bond will form between the both of you. When both of you perform the designated action within a short time span, you will receive Jade Rabbit's Blessing for 12 hours.\nThe designated action changes every day. Try asking around to find out what it is!\n<color=#FF0000>(The dumplings will expire if you don't eat it.)</color> ",
    ["ItemDes_10202062"]="Eating it will grant you the Silver Rabbit Sweet Dumplings Blessing.\nLegend has it that if you go near someone who has eaten Golden Rabbit Sweet Dumplings, a bond will form between the both of you. When both of you perform the designated action within a short time span, you will receive Jade Rabbit's Blessing for 12 hours.\nThe designated action changes every day. Try asking around to found out what it is!\n<color=#FF0000>(The dumplings will expire if you don't eat it.)</color> ",
    ["ItemDes_10202063"]="Eden Guerilla Forces Supplies. Open to randomly obtain a Equipment Upgrading Metal, Refining Material, and Enchantment Material.\nThere is also a small chance to obtain Candy Battle Exclusive Mount <Honey Jar> (Non-bound item).",
    ["ItemDes_10202064"]="Christmas Premium Pack. Open to randomly obtain a Equipment Upgrading Metal, Refining Material, Enchantment Material, and Limited-time bound mount.\nThere is also a small chance to obtain Christmas Exclusive Mount<Sasquatch Sled> (Non-bound item).",
    ["ItemDes_10202067"]="Open to get 1 random Demon Slayer: Kimetsu no Yaiba Cooking.",
    ["ItemDes_10202070"]="Toffee Projectiles used in the Candy Battle event. Can be fired using the Candy Slingshot in the Eden Group to deal moderate damage to Worker Bees. Toffee Projectiles are obtained by consuming Odin's Blessings or participating in MVP kills.\n<color=#FF0000>Reach Base Lv.25 or higher to use the slingshot</color>. ",
    ["ItemDes_10202071"]="Cotton Candy Projectiles used in the Candy Battle event. Can be fired using the Candy Slingshot in the Eden Group to deal moderate damage to Princess Bees. Cotton Candy Projectiles are obtained by participating in Daily Instances or MVP kills.\n<color=#FF0000>Reach Base Lv.25 or higher to use the slingshot</color>. ",
    ["ItemDes_10202072"]="The Candy Fort can only be used in the Eden Group.\nGrants you a chance to earn extra rewards when shooting Golden Queens, and has a 0.1% chance to directly shoot down a Golden Queen. Lollipop Projectiles are purchased from the Children's Day Merchant or obtained by participating in MVP kills.\n<color=#FF0000>Reach Base Lv.25 or higher to use the slingshot</color>. ",
    ["ItemDes_10202080"]="Knockback Punch",
    ["ItemDes_10202081"]="Immobilize",
    ["ItemDes_10202082"]="Stealth Potion",
    ["ItemDes_10202083"]="Summon Snowman Brothers",
    ["ItemDes_10202084"]="Poisonous Gas",
    ["ItemDes_10202085"]="CoCo Star Series drinks.\nAll Stats +5 for 20 minutes.",
    ["ItemDes_10202087"]="A Nightmare Mark is necessary for entering Nightmare Mode instances.",
    ["ItemDes_10202088"]="Item used to open Magic Box chests.",
    ["ItemDes_10202089"]="Item for resurrecting in place in a Heart Pedestal instance. When used in Nightmare, it grants exemption to resurrection penalties.",
    ["ItemDes_10202090"]="Using skills that cost Blue Gemstones in Nightmare Mode also requires the use of Soul Gemstones. Does not reduce card effects.",
    ["ItemDes_10202091"]="For use in Nightmare Mode's Soul Buyback. Speeds up the buyback process of an equipment slot.",
    ["ItemDes_10202092"]="A mysterious flag possessing the power of Nightmare. After planting it into the ground, 5 party members can active the mysterious magic circle by standing in the required position. When all the magic circles are activated, the party members can obtain any buff among <color=#ff3300>damage</color>, <color=#33ccff>defense</color>, and <color=#009900>recovery</color>, which lasts for 5 minutes.\n<color=#FF0000>Only can be used in Nightmare Instance, and the buff will disabled when the player leaves the instance. Please do not use it in narrow places to avoid not activating the magic circle.</color>",
    ["ItemDes_10202093"]="Exclusive item for Nightmare Mode. Leaf of Yggdrasil, filled with powerful vital energy. Can resurrect characters who have lost their ability to fight. <color=#FF0000>Can only be used in the Nightmare instance. Disabled in other scenes.</color>",
    ["ItemDes_10202094"]="Delicious crab casserole with a savory aroma infused with the ocean’s freshness.\nHoly Attribute Enhancement +10% for 30 minutes.",
    ["ItemDes_10202095"]="A simple fish steak is the ultimate test of a cook's mastery of flame grilling.\nGhost Attribute Enhancement +10% for 30 minutes.",
    ["ItemDes_10202114"]="A common dish made from fresh and delicious ingredients. Eaten by Adventurers all over the continent.\nAll Stats +3 for 10 minutes.",
    ["ItemDes_10202115"]="A small Birthday Cake, shared with all Guild members!\nHP +5%, P.ATK +5%, M.ATK +5%, Final DEF +5%, and Final M.DEF +5% for 12 hours.",
    ["ItemDes_10202116"]="Grass Jelly with Taro Balls is a refreshing summer drink.\nPVP Debuff Reduction +10%\nPVP Debuff RES +10%. Lasts 1 hour.",
    ["ItemDes_10202117"]="Chilled Watermelon Juice is a refreshing summer drink.\nP.ATK +10%\nM.ATK +10%. Lasts 1 hour.",
    ["ItemDes_10202118"]="Mango Frappe is a refreshing summer drink.\nPVP Final P.DMG Bonus +10%\nPVP Final M.DMG Bonus +10%. Lasts 1 hour.",
    ["ItemDes_10202122"]="A platter of dried fruits and nuts.\nNeutral Attribute Enhancement +10% for 30 minutes.",
    ["ItemDes_10202123"]="Frozen milk cake with an unforgettable taste and texture.\nFire Attribute Enhancement +10%, Earth Attribute Enhancement +10% for 30 minutes.",
    ["ItemDes_10202124"]="A spicy vegetable dish that’s delectably crispy.\nWind Attribute Enhancement +10%, Water Attribute Enhancement +10% for 30 minutes.",
    ["ItemDes_10202125"]="Fresh fish fillet flavored with a special blend of spices. A popular dish among witches looking for something a little different.\nPoison Attribute Enhancement +10% for 30 minutes.",
    ["ItemDes_10202132"]="Dragon Boat Gifts event consumable item. Carnival Activity reward. Can be used in the board game to throw dices. Removed when the event ends and converted into a certain number of Adventurer's Salad.",
    ["ItemDes_10202133"]="Use to unlock the Bamboo or Orchid Hairstyle depending on the character's gender.",
    ["ItemDes_10202134"]="A well-designed unlocking tool. Unlocks the [New Super Star] frame after use.",
    ["ItemDes_10202135"]="A card with a mystical power. Used to change a pet's nickname.",
    ["ItemDes_10202136"]="It's said that if you use all your strength, it can fly very far. Use to increase a pet's Favor by 100.",
    ["ItemDes_10202137"]="A mysterious voucher that contains time powder. Use it to speed up Summer Festival events by 3 hours.",
    ["ItemDes_10202138"]="Use it to grant the <color=#CA2E0AFF>Attack Resonance</color> effect for 2 minutes. Has a cooldown of 5 minutes.\nIncreases your Final Physical Damage Bonus, Final Magic Damage Bonus, Final PVP Physical Damage Bonus, and Final PVP Magic Damage Bonus by <color=#CA2E0AFF>5%*number of party members under the same effect</color>.",
    ["ItemDes_10202139"]="Use it to grant the <color=#CA2E0AFF>Defense Resonance</color> effect for 2 minutes. Has a cooldown of 5 minutes.\nIncreases your Final Physical Damage Reduction, Final Magic Damage Reduction, Final PVP Physical Damage Reduction, and Final PVP Magic Damage Reduction by <color=#CA2E0AFF>5%*number of party members under the same effect</color>.",
    ["ItemDes_10202140"]="Use it to grant the <color=#CA2E0AFF>Shield Resonance</color> effect for 2 minutes. Has a cooldown of 5 minutes.\nGrants yourself a shield equal to <color=#CA2E0AFF>10% of Max HP*number of party members under the same effect</color>.",
    ["ItemDes_10202141"]="Use it to grant the <color=#CA2E0AFF>Skill Link</color> effect for 2 minutes. Has a cooldown of 5 minutes.\nWhen a party member under the same effect casts an active skill, all members recover 1% of their HP.",
    ["ItemDes_10202142"]="Use it to grant the <color=#CA2E0AFF>Crit Link</color> effect for 2 minutes. Has a cooldown of 5 minutes.\nWhen a party member under the same effect triggers a critical hit, all members recover 0.15% of their HP.",
    ["ItemDes_10202143"]="After using this item, it carries <color=#CA2E0AFF>Life Chain</color> status for 2 minutes, with a cooldown of 5 minutes.\nIf you take damage with this status, damage taken is reduced by <color=#CA2E0AFF>3%*no. of people in your team with this status</color>, and the remaining damage is shared equally by all team members with this status within a 30-meter radius.",
    ["ItemDes_10202144"]="Use it to grant the <color=#CA2E0AFF>Movement Speed Burst</color> effect for 2 minutes. Has a cooldown of 5 minutes.\nIncreases Movement Speed of all party members by <color=#CA2E0AFF>0.5*number of party members under the same effect</color>.",
    ["ItemDes_10202145"]="Use it to grant the <color=#CA2E0AFF>Effect Burst</color> effect for 2 minutes. Has a cooldown of 5 minutes.\nWhile under the effect, inflicting a debuff on the enemy allows you to ignore <color=#CA2E0AFF>5%*number of party members under the same effect</color> of the enemy's Effect Resistance, Debuff Resistance, and PVP Debuff Resistance.",
    ["ItemDes_10202146"]="Use it to grant the <color=#CA2E0AFF>Stun Burst</color> effect for 2 minutes. Has a cooldown of 5 minutes.\nEach time you lose 10% of your HP, there is a <color=#CA2E0AFF>5%*number of party members under the same effect</color> chance of stunning enemies within 2 meters of you for 1 second.",
    ["ItemDes_10202148"]="Pet Adventure exchange item. Can be exchanged for rewards at the Prontera Pet Exchange Merchant. Destroyed at the end of the event, and returned to Adventurer's in part as Salad.",
    ["ItemDes_10202149"]="Used to power the Magic Gear.",
    ["ItemDes_10202150"]="The anniversary concert will be held on October 15. Adventurers will be able to watch the in-game livestream of the concert at that time. Use this invitation letter to submit a blessing, which has a chance of being displayed at the concert. Plus, submitting a blessing for the first time will grant a mysterious gift. Item will be destroyed when the event ends.",
    ["ItemDes_10202151"]="Used to vote for parties in the War of the Chosen, which can give the party 1 additional voting points. The item will be destroyed after the voting phase is over, so please use it in time.",
    ["ItemDes_10202152"]="Used to vote for parties in the War of the Chosen, which can give the party 3 additional voting points. The item will be destroyed after the voting phase is over, so please use it in time.",
    ["ItemDes_10202153"]="Used to vote for parties in the War of the Chosen, which can give the party 10 additional voting points. The item will be destroyed after the voting phase is over, so please use it in time.",
    ["ItemDes_10202154"]="Used to vote for parties in the War of the Chosen, which can give the party 20 additional voting points. The item will be destroyed after the voting phase is over, so please use it in time.",
    ["ItemDes_10202155"]="Item used for the 2022 New Year lottery. The more scrolls you collect before the lottery starts, the higher the probability of winning the grand prize. All the Gacha Scrolls will be destroyed after the event is over.",
    ["ItemDes_10202156"]="A voucher used to create a party in War of the Chosen, a symbol of power. The item will be destroyed after the preparation phase is over, so please use it in time.",
    ["ItemDes_10202157"]="Cannon Beans used during the Christmas Shooting Festival. Can be fired using the fort in Geffen.\nGrants you a chance to earn extra rewards when shooting Gold Angeling Balloons, and has a <color=#FF0000>0.05%</color> chance to launch one-hit critical shots.\n<color=#FF0000>Reach Base Lv.25 or higher to use the fort</color>. ",
    ["ItemDes_10202158"]="Starshot used during the Christmas Shootout event. Can be fired using the Christmas Elk Slingshot in Geffen to deal moderate damage to Small Monster Balloons.\n<color=#FF0000>Reach Base Lv.25 or higher to use the slingshot</color>.\n Consume Odin's Blessing to earn Starshot.",
    ["ItemDes_10202159"]="Meteor Marble used during the Christmas Shootout event. Can be fired using the Christmas Elk Slingshot in Geffen to deal high damage to Medium and Small Monster Balloons.\n<color=#FF0000>Reach Base Lv.25 or higher to use the slingshot</color>.\nYou can obtain Meteor Marble from Carnival Activity Chests.",
    ["ItemDes_10202160"]="Icicle Marble used during the Christmas Shootout event. Can be fired using the Christmas Elk Slingshot in Geffen to deal extreme damage to Medium and Large Monster Balloons.\n<color=#FF0000>Reach Base Lv.25 or higher to use the slingshot</color>. You can obtain Icicle Marble after clearing instances in the Heart Pedestal.",
    ["ItemDes_10202161"]="An item used in the Lunar Year of the Tiger event. After using it, players can summon Eddga, who will charge power for 10 seconds, and after 10 seconds, it will deal huge damage to the Nian according to the number of players around itself. The damage will be credited to the item user.",
    ["ItemDes_10202165"]="Doritos - Nacho Cheese flavored chips.\nReduce mining time by 10% for 20 minutes.",
    ["ItemDes_10202166"]="Doritos - BBQ flavored chips.\nIncrease the success chance of catching a pet by 5% for 20 minutes.",
    ["ItemDes_10202167"]="Doritos - Original flavored chips.\nIncrease non-battle MSPD by +1% for 20 minutes.",
    ["ItemDes_10202168"]="A textbook written by Travers, a Class Conversion instructor, with bad handwriting but worth reading. Can be used to activate branches of Class Conversion.",
    ["ItemDes_10202169"]="Freyja's Wedding Planners' VIP special gift. Get a 50% discount on a custom wedding.",
    ["ItemDes_10202170"]="A rose made of crystal, poured into a mold at a very high temperature and cooled to the color of ice, is a precious craft.",
    ["ItemDes_10202171"]="Absolutely clean water. It has the meaning of blessing when it is poured on others.",
    ["ItemDes_10202172"]="Item used in the Songkran Gala event. Consume it to get a chance to use the \"Lifebuoy\" in the Water Gun Battle. Using it outside the event will perform the Splash action.",
    ["ItemDes_10202173"]="Item used in the Songkran Gala event. Consume it to get a chance to use the \"Super Water Balloon\" in the Water Gun Battle. Using it outside the event will perform the Splash action.",
    ["ItemDes_10202174"]="Item used in the Songkran Gala event. Consume it to get a chance to use the \"Pressure Boost Valve\" in the Water Gun Battle. Using it outside the event will perform the Splash action.",
    ["ItemDes_10202175"]="Item used in the Songkran Gala event. Consume it to get a chance to use the \"Water Balloon\" in the Water Gun Battle. Using it outside the event will perform the Splash action.",
    ["ItemDes_10202176"]="Item used in the Songkran Gala event. Consume it to get a chance to use the \"Energy Drink\" in the Water Gun Battle. Using it outside the event will perform the Splash action.",
    ["ItemDes_10202177"]="The Trial Card is Kafra Corporation's way of providing adventurers with even more rewards! Activate to enjoy Kafra's Trial Card for 1 day. You can choose 7 privileges when you activate the Trial Card (cannot used with VIP Card).",
    ["ItemDes_10202180"]="Use to increase the EXP gained from killing monsters by 3 times through Odin's Blessings AFK. Lasts 12 hours and shares the cooldown (20 hours) with the 5x EXP Card.",
    ["ItemDes_10202181"]="Use to increase the EXP gained from killing monsters by 5 times through Odin's Blessings AFK. Lasts 12 hours and shares the cooldown (20 hours) with the 3x EXP Card.",
    ["ItemDes_10202182"]="This is Engineer 003's favorite midnight snack when he is working overtime, which powers him through the work with energy.\nEffect:\nMax HP +3%, P.ATK +3%, M.ATK +3%, Final P.DEF +3%, Final M.DEF +3%\nLasts 30 minutes",
    ["ItemDes_10202183"]="Item used in the Songkran Festival event. Consume it to get a chance to use the “Lifebuoy” in the Water Gun Battle. Players using it outside the event will perform the action [Throw Water].",
    ["ItemDes_10202184"]="Item used in the Songkran Festival event. Consume it to get a chance to use the “Super Water Balloon” in the Water Gun Battle. Players using it outside the event will perform the action [Throw Water].",
    ["ItemDes_10202185"]="Item used in the Songkran Festival event. Consume it to get a chance to use the “Pressure Boost Valve” in the Water Gun Battle. Players using it outside the event will perform the action [Throw Water].",
    ["ItemDes_10202186"]="Item used in the Songkran Festival event. Consume it to get a chance to use the “Water Balloon” in the Water Gun Battle. Players using it outside the event will perform the action [Throw Water].",
    ["ItemDes_10202187"]="Item used in the Songkran Festival event. Consume it to get a chance to use the “Energy Drink” in the Water Gun Battle. Players using it outside the event will perform the action [Throw Water].",
    ["ItemDes_10202188"]="The fish stew with various mushrooms offers interesting color and taste. After eating, increase the DMG dealt to and reduce DMG taken from Fire attribute monsters by 8% for 30 minutes",
    ["ItemDes_10202189"]="The fragrant dish covered with sea urchin meat is salty, fresh, and sweet. After eating, increase the DMG dealt to and reduce DMG taken from Water attribute monsters by 8% for 30 minutes.",
    ["ItemDes_10202190"]="The fish soup that would make a dead man's mouth water. Even the pickiest diner would rave about it. After eating, increase the DMG dealt to and reduce DMG taken from Wind attribute monsters by 8% for 30 minutes.",
    ["ItemDes_10202191"]="Slow-cooked homemade dish that pays great attention to the seasoning of the soup and the selection of ingredients. After eating, increase the DMG dealt to and reduce DMG taken from Earth attribute monsters by 8% for 30 minutes.",
    ["ItemDes_10202192"]="Scald in boiling water until the edges are rolled. Served with dipping sauce, it is crisp and delicious. After eating, increase the DMG dealt to and reduce DMG taken from Poison attribute monsters by 8% for 30 minutes.",
    ["ItemDes_10202193"]="A special dish served in a turtle shell. Very tasty. After eating, increase the DMG dealt to and reduce DMG taken from Undead attribute monsters by 8% for 30 minutes.",
    ["ItemDes_10202194"]="A candy basket filled with candy in various colors is a good gift for your favored companion. Charm +20, Favor +10. When given after married, you gain 2 Couple EXP.",
    ["ItemDes_10202196"]="The young potato hero keeps fighting and levelling up in a boundless world of cheese - until he evolves into Roller Coaster Cheese Chips and launches himself into your mouth contentedly. Grants +2.5% PvP Final Physical Damage Bonus, +2.5% PvP Final Magic Damage Bonus, +50% Final Attack Speed, +5% Final Haste, +5% Final Physical Damage Bonus, and +5% Final Magic Damage Bonus for 45 minutes.",
    ["ItemDes_10202198"]="A Mission issued by the Defense Force. Can be used to deploy soldiers. Missions can be completed directly at the Mission Board.",
    ["ItemDes_10202199"]="The body becomes quite robust after eating it...",
    ["ItemDes_10202201"]="This is lame.",
    ["ItemDes_10202202"]="A rare gold coin with a Poring pattern on it, which is a necessary consumable for equipment transfer that offsets 5 million Zeny.",
    ["ItemDes_10202203"]="You know, I've got something good to drink in my room, and I can teach you how to go after the boss at light speed.\nIncrease non-battle MSPD by 1 for 20 minutes.",
    ["ItemDes_10202204"]="I... I'm still kind of hungry.\nReduce mining time by 10% for 20 minutes.",
    ["ItemDes_10202205"]="We will go catch the pets when you are tired of eating. Not a problem.\nIncrease the success chance of catching a pet by 5% for 20 minutes.",
    ["ItemDes_10202208"]="Fragrant Pineapple Pastry, crisp and crunchy.\nEating it grants Freeze Resistance +30% and Curse Resistance +30%, lasting 30 minutes.",
    ["ItemDes_10202209"]="The King of Fruits! Nutritious and delicious.Upon consumption, grants PVP Final P.DMG Bonus +10% and PVP Final M.DMG Bonus +10% for 30 minutes.",
    ["ItemDes_10202210"]="An item necessary for Bards and Dancers to use skills.",
    ["ItemDes_10202211"]="An item needed for gender conversion, available from Geffen Tower.",
    ["ItemDes_10202214"]="Fragments of a secret scroll that records the skill to upgrade Guild Blessings. There is a high demand for them on the black market.",
    ["ItemDes_10202215"]="A rare currency printed with a Poring pattern on it. Use to get a 90% discount on the Advanced Transfer of equipment. Only 1 can be used for each Advanced Transfer.",
    ["ItemDes_10202216"]="Piping hot Udon. Use to recover 10% of Max HP every 5 seconds for 5 minutes.",
    ["ItemDes_10202217"]="Sweet Konpeitō. Use to recover 10% of Max SP every 5 seconds for 5 minutes.",
    ["ItemDes_10202218"]="A delicious Bento. Use to deal an additional 12.5% damage to Undead monsters and take 12.5% less damage from Undead monsters for 5 minutes.",
    ["ItemDes_10202219"]="Crispy Senbei. Use to deal an additional 12.5% damage to Demon monsters and take 12.5% less damage from Demon monsters for 5 minutes.",
    ["ItemDes_10202220"]="Trial EXP obtained from monsters.\nCan be used only in the Demon Slayer: Kimetsu no Yaiba Event.",
    ["ItemDes_10202221"]="A Trial EXP Pack obtained from powerful monsters. Open to get 20–40 Trial EXP.\nCan be used only in the Demon Slayer: Kimetsu no Yaiba Event.",
    ["ItemDes_10202224"]="Use to unlock Tanjiro Kamado Hairstyle.",
    ["ItemDes_10202225"]="Use to unlock Nezuko Kamado Hairstyle.",
    ["ItemDes_10202226"]="Use to unlock Zenitsu Agatsuma Hairstyle.",
    ["ItemDes_10202230"]="Beans exclusive to the Halloween event. Eating it will make you big and fat, and some stats might get a buff or debuff. You can only eat a maximum of 5! Don't be greedy!\n<color=#FF0000>(The bean will expire if you don't eat it.)</color>",
    ["ItemDes_10202231"]="Beans exclusive to the Halloween event. Eating it will make you small and skinny, and some stats might get a buff or debuff. You can only eat a maximum of 5! Don't be greedy!\n<color=#FF0000>(The bean will expire if you don't eat it.)</color>",
    ["ItemDes_10202232"]="Beans exclusive to the Halloween event. You will enter Hiding mode after eating it and Crit Rate will increase greatly. The effect cannot be stacked.\n<color=#FF0000>(The bean will expire if you don't eat it.)</color>",
    ["ItemDes_10202233"]="Beans exclusive to the Halloween event. You will enter Fervor mode after eating it and you will deal more damage against Large monsters. It has adverse side effects. The effect cannot be stacked.\n<color=#FF0000>(The bean will expire if you don't eat it.)</color>",
    ["ItemDes_10202234"]="The <color=#1EAEA4>Shadow Organization's</color> exclusive wine.\nDeals additional true damage equal to 0.04% of Max HP to <color=#ff6347>evil spirits</color> per second for 5 seconds after drinking. Loses effect upon death.\nEffective only in the Hyakki Yagyō Illusion.\n<color=#FF0000>The wine will expire if you keep it for a long time.</color>",
    ["ItemDes_10202235"]="Use to unlock Noble Hairstyle (M).",
    ["ItemDes_10202236"]="Use to unlock Gorgeous Hairstyle (F).",
    ["ItemDes_10202237"]="Consume the item at Vera to change to Bugaku Pupil Style (M).",
    ["ItemDes_10202238"]="Consume the item at Vera to change to Bugaku Pupil Style (F).",
    ["ItemDes_10202239"]="Paint Brush",
    ["ItemDes_10202240"]="Surface Paint",
    ["ItemDes_10202241"]="Use to activate the Glory Pass for the current phase. Cannot be used again.",
    ["ItemDes_10202242"]="Increases the success rate for leveling up the Shadow Equipment. In the event that you fail, your success rate will be increased in the next round.",
    ["ItemDes_10202244"]="Use the item to deploy a Land Mine at the current location, which takes 5s to activate.\nOnce it becomes active, any target that comes close within 2m will trigger the Land Mine, and it deals True Damage equal to 50% of HP to any target within 3m of it.\nThe Land Mine is visible to everyone and lasts 90s.\nThis item only works in GVG and Abyssal environments.",
    ["ItemDes_10202245"]="Use the item to deploy a Black Hole at the current location, which takes 5s to activate.\nOnce it becomes active, any enemy target that comes close within 3m will trigger the Black Hole to swallow in 1 enemy, rendering the enemy to be untargetable for 10s.\nThe Battlefield Black Hole is visible to everyone and lasts 90s with a 60s cooldown.\nFor the next 30s, targets who are sucked into the Black Hole won't get sucked in again.\nThis item only works in GVG and Abyssal environments.",
    ["ItemDes_10202246"]="Unable to be targeted, use skills, or deal normal attacks when used. Lasts for 5s.\nSpectral Scroll has a 60s cooldown after use.\nThis item only works in GVG and Abyssal environments.",
    ["ItemDes_10202247"]="If you die within 3 mins after using this item, you will come back to life with fully restored HP and SP.\nRespawn Scroll has a 300s cooldown after use.\nThis item only works in GVG and Abyssal environments.",
    ["ItemDes_10202248"]="Summon the Maid Taylin to serve you for 15 minutes. Please notice the time!",
    ["ItemDes_10202249"]="Use it to summon the maid Clarice to serve you",
    ["ItemDes_10202250"]="The slim test tube contains a red potion.",
    ["ItemDes_10202251"]="The slim test tube contains an orange potion.",
    ["ItemDes_10202252"]="The slim test tube contains a White Potion.",
    ["ItemDes_10202253"]="The slim test tube contains a Premium White Potion.",
    ["ItemDes_10202254"]="The slim test tube contains a gray potion.",
    ["ItemDes_10202255"]="Light it up and throw it out, and then enjoy the ocean of fire belonging to you.",
    ["ItemDes_10202256"]="Warning! Dangerous item! Do not use it on people!",
    ["ItemDes_10202257"]="Lean back, throw it out, and activate the mace. Please rescue the unfortunate people near the landing site in a timely manner.",
    ["ItemDes_10202258"]="The intoxicating bottle shines with a dazzling light.",
    ["ItemDes_10202259"]="Volatile, colorless, clear liquid. Low toxicity. Cannot be directly consumed in its pure liquid form.",
    ["ItemDes_10202260"]="Watch out, this thing will blow!",
    ["ItemDes_10202261"]="They are the seeds filled with blood-like horrible liquid.",
    ["ItemDes_10202262"]="The surface is covered with many thorns. Don't touch if you don't want to be hurt.",
    ["ItemDes_10202263"]="For experiment only. DO NOT PICK.",
    ["ItemDes_10202264"]="It's hard to believe a small bottle like this can accommodate such a terrifying plant.",
    ["ItemDes_10202265"]="Reloaded! Ready for launch!",
    ["ItemDes_10202266"]="Reloaded! Ready for super launch!!!",
    ["ItemDes_10202267"]="Give it a little warmth and it will give you a shower of sparks.",
    ["ItemDes_10202268"]="Contaminated by an unknown foreign creature, this test tube potion can temporarily transform the user into a zombie.",
    ["ItemDes_10202269"]="It's a bottle full of oil.",
    ["ItemDes_10202270"]="The powder is everywhere. Breathing it in is harmful to health.",
    ["ItemDes_10202271"]="Pungent, and tear-inducing. Use it when you want to cry.",
    ["ItemDes_10202272"]="Homunculus - Embryo, an item that is necessary to summon Homunculi.",
    ["ItemDes_10202273"]="A crystal used to evolve Homunculi.",
    ["ItemDes_10202274"]="A crystal used to evolve Homunculi.",
    ["ItemDes_10202275"]="A crystal used to evolve Homunculi.",
    ["ItemDes_10202276"]="A transmogrification item that turns you into Cookie. So cute that others may not suspect you. Obtained by defeating Cookie.",
    ["ItemDes_10202277"]="A transmogrification item that turns you into Christmas Cookie. So cute that others may not suspect you. Obtained by defeating Christmas Cookie.",
    ["ItemDes_10202278"]="A transmogrification item that turns you into Myst Case. So cute that others may not suspect you. Obtained by defeating Myst Case.",
    ["ItemDes_10202279"]="A transmogrification item that turns you into Cruiser. So cute that others may not suspect you. Obtained by defeating Cruiser.",
    ["ItemDes_10202280"]="Cold and white snowball. Let's toss it!",
    ["ItemDes_10202281"]="A point item in the Monster Invasion instance.",
    ["ItemDes_10202282"]="Magic from the god of Vegetables—increases the drop rate of vegetables!\nActivate Odin's Blessing to increase the dropping chance of Napa Cabbage, Onion, or Lemon when killing monsters.",
    ["ItemDes_10202283"]="Magic from the god of Barbecue—increases the drop rate of meat!\nActivate Odin's Blessing to increase the dropping chance of Beef, Lamb, or Chicken when killing monsters.",
    ["ItemDes_10202284"]="Magic from the god of Seafood—increases the drop rate of seafood!\nActivate Odin's Blessing to increase the dropping chance of Squid or Prawn when killing monsters.",
    ["ItemDes_10202288"]="A must-have to sober up. Effective in avoiding the negative status after getting drunk. Removes all drunk and tipsy effects after drinking and wakes the user up.",
    ["ItemDes_10202290"]="Refuel your Homunculus!",
    ["ItemDes_10202292"]="An item used in the Celebrate New Spring event. After using it, Adventurers can summon Eclipse, which will charge power for 5 seconds, then deal massive damage that ignores most of Nian's armor according to the number of Adventurers around Eclipse. The damage will be credited to the item user.",
    ["ItemDes_10202294"]="An extremely sensitive radar. You can use it to tell when MVP/Mini is about to be refreshed on the map.",
    ["ItemDes_10202295"]="After grilling the saury over the searing fire and applying the Special Sauce, its flavorful smell becomes even more pleasing and attractive. Upon consumption, increases the damage dealt to Ghost attribute monsters by 8% and reduces the damage taken from Ghost attribute monsters by 8%. Lasts for 30 minutes.",
    ["ItemDes_10202296"]="A fresh eel that has been stewed by the blazing fire, its fresh and palatable taste makes people mouth-watering. Upon consumption, increases the damage dealt to Angel monsters by 8% and reduces the damage taken from Angel monsters by 8%. Lasts for 30 minutes.",
    ["ItemDes_10202297"]="Cold-stirred clams with chili oil. A delightful dish that only belongs to people with patience. Upon consumption, increases the damage dealt to Formless monsters by 8% and reduces the damage taken from Formless monsters by 8%. Lasts for 30 minutes.",
    ["ItemDes_10202298"]="Fish stew made with Pearl Powder and pasta, added with Spiky Scale Fruit jam. Upon consumption, increases the damage dealt to Holy attribute monsters by 8% and reduces the damage taken from Holy attribute monsters by 8%. Lasts for 30 minutes.",
    ["ItemDes_10202299"]="Dumped into Hardening Potions and then oil-fried to golden brown and crispy. The Adventurer next door is crying for it. Upon consumption, increases the damage dealt to Shadow attribute monsters by 8% and reduces the damage taken from Shadow attribute monsters by 8%. Lasts for 30 minutes.",
    ["ItemDes_10202300"]="Eastern-style cakes are the go-to choice for afternoon tea.",
    ["ItemDes_10202310"]="A candy basket filled with candy in various colors. Perfect gift for your favored companion.\nCharm +5, Favor +2.\nWhen given to your companion after getting married, you can gain 1 Couple EXP. Gifting during the Journey of Star Chaser event will earn extra rewards.",
    ["ItemDes_10202321"]="Runestones containing forbidden power of blazing fire. Can be used in the Season Instance during the Frenzy Season.",
    ["ItemDes_10202322"]="Only a little spring water remains in this exquisite bottle. Can be used to put out the fire set by the mutant boss, granting you the treasure hidden in the ashes.\nHow to use: Can be set for Quick Use. Select the fire lit by the mutant boss and tap on this item to obtain rewards.",
    ["ItemDes_10202323"]="Crafted mostly from metal, these projectiles can penetrate the targets, causing damage via the cavity effect.\nExclusively used by Gunslinger.",
    ["ItemDes_10202325"]="Used to leave a message on the Jumbotron.",
    ["ItemDes_10202326"]="Used to leave a message on the Floor-To-Ceiling Screen.",
    ["ItemDes_10202327"]="Used to leave a message on the Small Screen.",
    ["ItemDes_10202328"]="When activated, it temporarily adds 2 levels to your life skills in <color=#ff5d5d>fishing/mining/gardening</color> for 12 hours. (Cannot exceed the current version's skill level cap.)",
    ["ItemDes_10202329"]="When activated, it temporarily adds 2 levels to your life skills in <color=#ff5d5d>smelting</color> for 12 hours. (Cannot exceed the current version's skill level cap.)",
    ["ItemDes_10202331"]="A stew whose ingredients are impossible to be identified.\nSTR +25, AGI +25, DEX +25, VIT +25, LUK + +25, INT +25\nMSPD +1\nReduce your body size by 30%.",
    ["ItemDes_10202332"]="Once used, your weapon's attribute will change to Holy for 20 minutes.\nStackable effect. Last up to 12 hours.",
    ["ItemDes_10202333"]="Once used, your weapon's attribute will change to Shadow for 20 minutes.\nStackable effect. Last up to 12 hours.",
    ["ItemDes_10202334"]="Once used, your weapon's attribute will change to Undead for 20 minutes.\nStackable effect. Last up to 12 hours.",
    ["ItemDes_10202335"]="Use to unleash mystical power for a limited time! When fighting against monsters up to 3 levels above your level, you'll get Physical Lifesteal, Magic Lifesteal, and Final DMG Bonus.\n(Ineffective against MVP, MINI, or Boss units.) Duration: 30 days.\nIt's a limited-time item, so don't forget to use it before it expires.",
    ["ItemDes_10202336"]="Consume the item at Vera to unlock GokuAku Pupil Style (M).",
    ["ItemDes_10202337"]="Consume the item at Vera to unlock GokuAku Pupil Style (F).",
    ["ItemDes_10202338"]="The essence left behind after smelting the precious equipment in the Magic Furnace, each containing formidable power.",
    ["ItemDes_10202342"]="Shadow Essence Crystal, the last fragment from shattered ancient Shadow Equipment. It provides a 90% cost reduction for Shadow Equipment Transfer.",
    ["ItemDes_10202344"]="Used at the Space Mart to get random discounts during the One-Punch Man collaboration event period. If there's an existing discount, then it grants you an even lower discount of up to 100%!",
    ["ItemDes_10202345"]="A dangerous and evil technological creation. Please eat with caution.\nAfter eating it, you will be modified by the Dark Power in 10 seconds.\nThere's a 50% chance to die instantly (reducing all primary stats by 20 for 1 hour after resurrection). \nThere's also a 50% chance to gain the Dark Power,\nincreasing your size by 50%,\nand all stats by 40 for 1 hour.\n(Cooldown: 1 hour)",
    ["ItemDes_10202346"]="A super tasty crab pot made from giant claw crabs. Upon consumption, increases the damage dealt to Undead monsters by 8% and reduces the damage taken from Undead monsters by 8%. Lasts for 30 minutes.",
    ["ItemDes_10202347"]="Folks living by the water often eat this dish. Upon consumption, increases the damage dealt to Dragon monsters by 8% and reduces the damage taken from Dragon monsters by 8%. Lasts for 30 minutes.",
    ["ItemDes_10202348"]="Great ingredients often only need a simple touch in the kitchen. Upon consumption, increases the damage dealt to Demi-Human monsters by 8% and reduces the damage taken from Demi-Human monsters by 8%. Lasts for 30 minutes.",
    ["ItemDes_10202349"]="Portable, convenient, tasty food created with human wisdom. Upon consumption, increases the damage dealt to Insect monsters by 8% and reduces the damage taken from Insect monsters by 8%. Lasts for 30 minutes.",
    ["ItemDes_10202350"]="Refreshing cold dishes that are tasty and good for your health. Upon consumption, increases the damage dealt to Fish monsters by 8% and reduces the damage taken from Fish monsters by 8%. Lasts for 30 minutes.",
    ["ItemDes_10202351"]="Eastern-style cakes are the go-to choice for afternoon tea. Upon consumption, increases the damage dealt to Plant monsters by 8% and reduces the damage taken from Plant monsters by 8%. Lasts for 30 minutes.",
    ["ItemDes_10202352"]="After using the item, you carry a delayed bomb that explodes after 3 seconds, knocking back and stunning all enemies within a 4-meter radius. This can only be used in the Battle Recap instance.",
    ["ItemDes_10202353"]="After using the item, you create a cyclone that lasts for 3 seconds, knocking back and slowing down all enemies within a 4-meter radius. This can only be used in the Battle Recap instance.",
    ["ItemDes_10202354"]="After using the item, you toss a smoke grenade 3 meters behind you, creating a dense fog that covers a 4-meter radius and making all enemies within range enter the Blind effect. This can only be used in the Battle Recap instance.",
    ["ItemDes_10202355"]="After using the item, your MSPD is increased for 3 seconds. This can only be used in the Battle Recap instance.",
    ["ItemDes_10202356"]="After using the item, you toss a cloud of dust 5 meters in front of you, causing a 4-meter radius dust explosion and making all enemies within range enter the Disoriented effect to move in the opposite direction. This can only be used in the Battle Recap instance.",
    ["ItemDes_10202357"]="Legend has it that this spell can undo any curse.\nWhen used, it deals damage equal to 0.04% of the target's Max HP every second for 5 seconds.\nOnly usable in the <color=#872657>Black Fairy Tale Illusion</color>.",
    ["ItemDes_10202370"]="No Gold Stars will be deducted after losing the Infinite Showdown Ranked Match. (Inapplicable for the Warlord tier)",
    ["ItemDes_10202371"]="Receive 1 extra Gold Star after winning the Infinite Showdown Ranked Match. (Inapplicable for the Warlord tier)",
    ["ItemDes_10202372"]="An essential blueprint used by the home craftsman Rony for crafting the \"Simple Single Bed.\"",
    ["ItemDes_10202373"]="An essential blueprint used by the home craftsman Rony for crafting the \"Comfy Twin Bed.\"",
    ["ItemDes_10202374"]="An essential blueprint used by the home craftsman Rony for crafting the \"Stylish Sofa.\"",
    ["ItemDes_10202375"]="An essential blueprint used by the home craftsman Rony for crafting the \"Rosewood Square Table.\"",
    ["ItemDes_10202376"]="An essential blueprint used by the home craftsman Rony for crafting the \"Rosewood Candlestand.\"",
    ["ItemDes_10202377"]="An essential blueprint used by the home craftsman Rony for crafting the \"Woolen Carpet.\"",
    ["ItemDes_10202378"]="An essential blueprint used by the home craftsman Rony for crafting the \"Spring Plotted Plant.\"",
    ["ItemDes_10202379"]="An essential blueprint used by the home craftsman Rony for crafting the \"Classy Piano.\"",
    ["ItemDes_10202380"]="An essential blueprint used by the home craftsman Rony for crafting the \"Artistic Painting.\"",
    ["ItemDes_10202381"]="An essential blueprint used by the home craftsman Rony for crafting the \"Battle Horn.\"",
    ["ItemDes_10202385"]="A surprise voucher is set to be released before the holiday, which can be exchanged for Mysterious Gift Pack x1 on the corresponding holiday.",
    ["ItemDes_10202389"]="Consume the item at Vera to change to Saitama Face (M).",
    ["ItemDes_10202390"]="Consume the item at Vera to change to Genos Face (M).",
    ["ItemDes_10202391"]="Consume the item at Vera to change to KING Face (M).",
    ["ItemDes_10202392"]="A special secret recipe that temporarily grants a certain Hyper Power.\nNot available to Hyper Players. The item expires at 00:00, seven days from the time it is obtained.\nCooldown: 24 hours.",
    ["ItemDes_10202393"]="Once used, your weapon's attribute will change to Ghost for 20 minutes.\nStacks up to 12 hours.",
    ["ItemDes_10202395"]="Cold and white snowball. Let's toss it!",
    ["ItemDes_10202396"]="A staff brimming with magic. Only effective against bosses in the Garm Invasion instance. Use the item to summon Witch's Staff, dealing 3,000,000 fixed damage to nearby targets after 4.5 seconds; if there are other party members nearby, the damage will be doubled.",
    ["ItemDes_10202398"]="For Hyper Players with extraordinary perseverance. Used to increase Base Level by 1. Applicable level range: 30-99.",
    ["ItemDes_10202399"]="For Hyper Players with extraordinary courage. Used to increase Job Level by 1. Applicable level range: 1st Class Lv.1 to 3rd Class Lv.59",
    ["ItemDes_10202401"]="An item used in the Celebrate New Spring event. After using it, Adventurers can summon Cosmic Dragon Lord, which will charge power for 5 seconds then deal massive damage that ignores most of Nian's armor according to the number of party members around Cosmic Dragon Lord. The damage will be credited to the item user.",
    ["ItemDes_10202402"]="A special secret recipe for the Spring Festival that temporarily increases damage dealt to Nian and Phantom Nian.",
    ["ItemDes_10202407"]="The proof of courage for fighting Raoh! Use this to challenge Raoh in the ultimate showdown! The holder of the proof will receive clearance rewards in the Raoh Battle.",
    ["ItemDes_10202409"]="Power of the North Star",
    ["ItemDes_10202410"]="Used for increasing the capacity of Divinity Backpack.",
    ["ItemDes_10202411"]="Defender Points",
    ["ItemDes_10202412"]="Can be used during combat, increasing Final Flee by 20%. (Effects of the same attribute do not stack; the item does not disappear after use.)",
    ["ItemDes_10202413"]="Can be used during combat, increasing Final Flee by 60%. (Effects of the same attribute do not stack; the item does not disappear after use.)",
    ["ItemDes_10202414"]="Can be used during combat, increasing Max SP by 40%. (Effects of the same attribute do not stack; the item does not disappear after use.)",
    ["ItemDes_10202415"]="Can be used during combat, increasing Max SP by 120%. (Effects of the same attribute do not stack; the item does not disappear after use.)",
    ["ItemDes_10202416"]="Can be used during combat, increasing Final Haste by 10%. (Effects of the same attribute do not stack; the item does not disappear after use.)",
    ["ItemDes_10202417"]="Can be used during combat, increasing Final Haste by 30%. (Effects of the same attribute do not stack; the item does not disappear after use.)",
    ["ItemDes_10202418"]="Can be used during combat, increasing Final ASPD by 100%. (Effects of the same attribute do not stack; the item does not disappear after use.)",
    ["ItemDes_10202419"]="Can be used during combat, increasing Final ASPD by 300%. (Effects of the same attribute do not stack; the item does not disappear after use.)",
    ["ItemDes_10202420"]="Can be used during combat, increasing Final Anti-Crit by 20%. (Effects of the same attribute do not stack; the item does not disappear after use.)",
    ["ItemDes_10202421"]="Can be used during combat, increasing Final Anti-Crit by 60%. (Effects of the same attribute do not stack; the item does not disappear after use.)",
    ["ItemDes_10202422"]="Can be used during combat, increasing PVP Final P.DMG Reduction by 10%. (Effects of the same attribute do not stack; the item does not disappear after use.)",
    ["ItemDes_10202423"]="Can be used during combat, increasing PVP Final P.DMG Reduction by 30%. (Effects of the same attribute do not stack; the item does not disappear after use.)",
    ["ItemDes_10202424"]="Can be used during combat, increasing PVP Final M.DMG Reduction by 10%. (Effects of the same attribute do not stack; the item does not disappear after use.)",
    ["ItemDes_10202425"]="Can be used during combat, increasing PVP Final M.DMG Reduction by 30%. (Effects of the same attribute do not stack; the item does not disappear after use.)",
    ["ItemDes_10202426"]="Can be used during combat, increasing skill damage reduction by 10%. (Effects of the same attribute do not stack; the item does not disappear after use.)",
    ["ItemDes_10202427"]="Can be used during combat, increasing Skill Damage Reduction by 30%. (Effects of the same attribute do not stack; the item does not disappear after use.)",
    ["ItemDes_10202428"]="Can be used during combat, increasing PVP Debuff Penetration by 10%. (Effects of the same attribute do not stack; the item does not disappear after use.)",
    ["ItemDes_10202429"]="Can be used during combat, increasing PVP Debuff Penetration by 30%. (Effects of the same attribute do not stack; the item does not disappear after use.)",
    ["ItemDes_10202430"]="Can be used during combat, increasing PVP Debuff Duration Reduction by 10%. (Effects of the same attribute do not stack; the item does not disappear after use.)",
    ["ItemDes_10202431"]="Can be used during combat, increasing PVP Debuff Duration Reduction by 30%. (Effects of the same attribute do not stack; the item does not disappear after use.)",
    ["ItemDes_10202432"]="Can be used during combat, increasing PVP Debuff Resistance by 10%. (Effects of the same attribute do not stack; the item does not disappear after use.)",
    ["ItemDes_10202433"]="Can be used during combat, increasing PVP Debuff Resistance by 30%. (Effects of the same attribute do not stack; the item does not disappear after use.)",
    ["ItemDes_10202434"]="Can be used during combat, increasing PVP Debuff Enhancement by 10%. (Effects of the same attribute do not stack; the item does not disappear after use.)",
    ["ItemDes_10202435"]="Can be used during combat, increasing PVP Debuff Enhancement by 30%. (Effects of the same attribute do not stack; the item does not disappear after use.)",
    ["ItemDes_10202436"]="Can be used during combat, increasing Neutral Resistance by 50%. (Effects of the same attribute do not stack; the item does not disappear after use.)",
    ["ItemDes_10202437"]="Can be used during combat, increasing Fire Resistance by 50%. (Effects of the same attribute do not stack; the item does not disappear after use.)",
    ["ItemDes_10202438"]="Can be used during combat, increasing Water Resistance by 50%. (Effects of the same attribute do not stack; the item does not disappear after use.)",
    ["ItemDes_10202439"]="Can be used during combat, increasing Wind Resistance by 50%. (Effects of the same attribute do not stack; the item does not disappear after use.)",
    ["ItemDes_10202440"]="Can be used during combat, increasing Earth Resistance by 50%. (Effects of the same attribute do not stack; the item does not disappear after use.)",
    ["ItemDes_10202441"]="Can be used during combat, increasing Poison Resistance by 50%. (Effects of the same attribute do not stack; the item does not disappear after use.)",
    ["ItemDes_10202442"]="Can be used during combat, increasing Holy Resistance by 50%. (Effects of the same attribute do not stack; the item does not disappear after use.)",
    ["ItemDes_10202443"]="Can be used during combat, increasing Ghost Resistance by 50%. (Effects of the same attribute do not stack; the item does not disappear after use.)",
    ["ItemDes_10202444"]="Can be used during combat, increasing Shadow Resistance by 50%. (Effects of the same attribute do not stack; the item does not disappear after use.)",
    ["ItemDes_10202445"]="Can be used during combat, increasing Neutral Resistance by 150%. (Effects of the same attribute do not stack; the item does not disappear after use.)",
    ["ItemDes_10202446"]="Can be used during combat, increasing Fire Resistance by 150%. (Effects of the same attribute do not stack; the item does not disappear after use.)",
    ["ItemDes_10202447"]="Can be used during combat, increasing Water Resistance by 150%. (Effects of the same attribute do not stack; the item does not disappear after use.)",
    ["ItemDes_10202448"]="Can be used during combat, increasing Wind Resistance by 150%. (Effects of the same attribute do not stack; the item does not disappear after use.)",
    ["ItemDes_10202449"]="Can be used during combat, increasing Earth Resistance by 150%. (Effects of the same attribute do not stack; the item does not disappear after use.)",
    ["ItemDes_10202450"]="Can be used during combat, increasing Poison Resistance by 150%. (Effects of the same attribute do not stack; the item does not disappear after use.)",
    ["ItemDes_10202451"]="Can be used during combat, increasing Holy Resistance by 150%. (Effects of the same attribute do not stack; the item does not disappear after use.)",
    ["ItemDes_10202452"]="Can be used during combat, increasing Ghost Resistance by 150%. (Effects of the same attribute do not stack; the item does not disappear after use.)",
    ["ItemDes_10202453"]="Can be used during combat, increasing Shadow Resistance by 150%. (Effects of the same attribute do not stack; the item does not disappear after use.)",
    ["ItemDes_10202454"]="Consume the item at Vera to change to Celebrity Pupil Style (M).",
    ["ItemDes_10202455"]="Consume the item at Vera to change to Celebrity Pupil Style (F).",
    ["ItemDes_10202456"]="The mighty visage of \"Savior\" Kenshiro. Unlocks Kenshiro Face (M) at Vera.",
    ["ItemDes_10202457"]="The mighty visage of \"Ken-Oh\" Raoh. Unlocks Raoh Face (M) at Vera.",
    ["ItemDes_10202458"]="The beautiful visage of \"Jibosei\" Yuria. Unlocks Yuria Face (F) at Vera.",
    ["ItemDes_10202459"]="The beautiful visage of \"Warrior\" Mamiya. Unlocks Mamiya Face (F) at Vera.",
    ["ItemDes_10202460"]="The mighty visage of \"Holy Emperor\" Thouzer. Unlocks Thouzer Face (M) at Vera.",
    ["ItemDes_10202461"]="Can only be used on Yuda to obtain an extra reward. Cooldown: 30 minutes. \nAnd when Keiraku Hiko shows up on Yuda, you can use this item to deal an extra massive amount of damage. After taking damage from several hits, Yuda will become stunned temporarily, unable to attack.",
    ["ItemDes_10202462"]="PS: Make sure the food is fresh when you eat it raw. STR +70 for 30 minutes.",
    ["ItemDes_10202463"]="Steamed river crabs, a totally different taste from sea crabs. AGI +70 for 30 minutes.",
    ["ItemDes_10202464"]="Spicy octopus—crunchy, tender, and tasty. VIT +70 for 30 minutes.",
    ["ItemDes_10202465"]="Grilled veggies with classic BBQ seasoning. INT +70 for 30 minutes.",
    ["ItemDes_10202466"]="A hotdog with a special seasoning—convenient and delicious. DEX +70 for 30 minutes.",
    ["ItemDes_10202467"]="A fruit platter filled with melon—sweet and refreshing. LUK +70 for 30 minutes.",
    ["ItemDes_10202468"]="The certificate for server transfer (within the same main server only). Server Transfer Card Expiration Time: December 22, 2025, 23:59:59.",
    ["ItemDes_10202469"]="Rem's face. Unlocks Rem Face (F) at Vera.",
    ["ItemDes_10202470"]="Ram's face. Unlocks Ram Face (F) at Vera.",
    ["ItemDes_10202471"]="Emilia's face. Unlocks Emilia Face (F) at Vera.",
    ["ItemDes_10202472"]="Beatrice's face. Unlocks Beatrice Face (F) at Vera.",
    ["ItemDes_10202473"]="Subaru Natsuki's face. Unlocks Subaru Natsuki Face (M) at Vera.",
    ["ItemDes_10202474"]="Roswaal's face. Unlocks Roswaal Face (M) at Vera.",
    ["ItemDes_10202475"]="Garfiel's face. Unlocks Garfiel Face (M) at Vera.",
    ["ItemDes_10202476"]="Frederica's face. Unlocks Frederica Face (F) at Vera.",
    ["ItemDes_10202477"]="Use Buyback Vouchers in the Universal Buyback event to trade in items that can be listed in the Crystal Exchange Center. Each voucher can cover 10,000 crystals worth of items.",
    ["ItemDes_10202478"]="Increases the Exchange Center Buyback Voucher usage limit by 1 per card.",
    ["ItemDes_10202479"]="A capsule made by compressing the device used to construct the ABR automated combat robot's framework.",
    ["ItemDes_10202480"]="Used to increase Base Level by 1. Applicable level range: At least 10 levels below the world level.",
    ["ItemDes_10202481"]="Used to increase Job Level by 1.",
    ["ItemDes_10202482"]="Legend has it that this sacred relic can counter vampires.\nWhen used, it deals damage equal to 0.04% of your Max HP to the target every second for 5 seconds.\nOnly effective against MVP, MINI, and Boss in the <color=#872657>Twilight Banquet</color>. Cooldown: 5 minutes.",
    ["ItemDes_10202484"]="An item used in the Celebrate New Spring event. After using it, Adventurers can summon Ethereal Serpent, which will charge power for 5 seconds then deal massive damage that ignores most of Nian's armor according to the number of party members around Ethereal Serpent. The damage will be credited to the item user. Cooldown: 60 seconds.",
    ["ItemDes_10202485"]="Unlocks Red Elegance (M) Face at Vera.",
    ["ItemDes_10202486"]="Unlocks Red Elegance (F) Face at Vera.",
    ["ItemDes_10202488"]="Summons a round trap to slow down monsters (effective only in the Spring Festival instance).",
    ["ItemDes_10202489"]="Summons a round trap to stun monsters (effective only in the Spring Festival instance).",
    ["ItemDes_10202490"]="Summons a round trap to deal damage to monsters continuously (effective only in the Spring Festival instance).",
    ["ItemDes_10202491"]="Increases your MSPD for a short while (effective only in the Spring Festival instance).",
    ["ItemDes_10202492"]="A small stone infused with Poison energy. Can be used to summon Poison Spirit - Serpens.",
    ["ItemDes_10202493"]="Item used in the Street Party 2025 event. Consume it to get a chance to use the \"Lifebuoy\" in the Water Gun Battle. Using it outside the event will perform the Splash action.",
    ["ItemDes_10202494"]="Item used in the Street Party 2025 event. Consume it to get a chance to use the \"Super Water Balloon\" in the Water Gun Battle. Using it outside the event will perform the Splash action.",
    ["ItemDes_10202495"]="Item used in the Street Party 2025 event. Consume it to get a chance to use the \"Pressure Boost Valve\" in the Water Gun Battle. Using it outside the event will perform the Splash action.",
    ["ItemDes_10202496"]="Item used in the Street Party 2025 event. Consume it to get a chance to use the \"Water Balloon\" in the Water Gun Battle. Using it outside the event will perform the Splash action.",
    ["ItemDes_10202497"]="Item used in the Street Party 2025 event. Consume it to get a chance to use the \"Energy Drink\" in the Water Gun Battle. Using it outside the event will perform the Splash action.",
    ["ItemDes_10202503"]="Targets a monster to deal True DMG equal to 1% of its Max HP.\n <color=#FF0000>Only usable in Dream Terror, and it expires over time!</color>",
    ["ItemDes_10202504"]="Use on yourself to boost offense ability for 5 seconds. The effect ends upon death.\n <color=#FF0000>Only usable in Dream Terror, and it expires over time!</color>",
    ["ItemDes_10202505"]="Use on yourself to boost offense ability for 5 seconds. The effect ends upon death.\n <color=#FF0000>Only usable in Dream Terror, and it expires over time!</color>",
    ["ItemDes_10202506"]="Use it on yourself to gain the following effects: Final P.PEN +200%, Final M.PEN +200%, Crit DMG Bonus +400%, and Final Crit +100% for 30 minutes. Non-stackable, will not disappear upon death, and will be cleared when switching scenes.\n<color=#FF0000>Only usable in Dream Terror, and it expires over time!</color>",
    ["ItemDes_10202507"]="Use on yourself to boost defense ability for 5 seconds. The effect ends upon death.\n <color=#FF0000>Only usable in Dream Terror, and it expires over time!</color>",
    ["ItemDes_10202508"]="Targets a target to deal True DMG equal to 1% of its Max HP.\n<color=#FF0000>Only applicable on Digital Monster collaboration MVP/MINIs in the wild.</color>",
    ["ItemDes_10202510"]="The item for charge-up in the Digital Monster collaboration's phase 1 instance.",
    ["ItemDes_10202511"]="The item for points in the Digital Monster collaboration's phase 1 instance.",
    ["ItemDes_10202512"]="Grants a <color=#EA538C>100%</color> chance to get an additional yield from fishing, mining, or gathering for 2 hours. (Not affected by other buffs.)",
    ["ItemDes_10202513"]="Every smelting has a <color=#EA538C>100%</color> chance to not consume Stamina for 2 hours.",
    ["ItemDes_10202516"]="This is Piedmon's challenge letter! You need a ticket to enter his realm.\nYou'll get one free ticket daily by logging in and can earn rewards in Phase 3 - Ultimate Challenge.",
    ["ItemDes_10202517"]="Fresh snake meat is tossed into a sizzling clay pot and seared on high heat to lock in the moisture and aroma, creating a crisp, sauce-rich delicacy. Upon consumption, increases Crit DMG Bonus by 28% for 30 minutes.",
    ["ItemDes_10202518"]="Shark fin is stewed in rich broth with scallops, abalone, and ham, served over rice—an elaborate banquet dish. Upon consumption, increases Final P.PEN by 14% for 30 minutes.",
    ["ItemDes_10202519"]="A seafood dish made with fresh lobster and mozzarella, beloved by a famous food blogger. Upon consumption, increases Final M.PEN by 14% for 30 minutes.",
    ["ItemDes_10202520"]="A timeless dessert. Upon consumption, increases Final P.DMG Bonus by 14% and Final M.DMG Bonus by 14% for 30 minutes.",
    ["ItemDes_10202521"]="They say Sky Deleter tastes better than Ferus. Increases Debuff Enhancement by 10 for 30 minutes.",
    ["ItemDes_10202522"]="High in calories, popular in cold regions. Increases Debuff Penetration by 10 for 30 minutes.",
    ["ItemDes_10202525"]="Some gift packs can be purchased with discounts using vouchers.",
    ["ItemDes_10202527"]="After use, there's a 100% chance of receiving an extra gathering reward while gathering.\n<color=#FF0000>The effective period ends at 04:59:59 on the final day of each round of the event. After that, items and buffs will be automatically removed.</color>",
    ["ItemDes_10202528"]="After use, there's a 100% chance of receiving an extra mining reward while mining.\n<color=#FF0000>The effective period ends at 04:59:59 on the final day of each round of the event. After that, items and buffs will be automatically removed.</color>",
    ["ItemDes_10202529"]="After use, there's a 100% chance of receiving an extra finishing reward while fishing.\n<color=#FF0000>The effective period ends at 04:59:59 on the final day of each round of the event. After that, items and buffs will be automatically removed.</color>",
    ["ItemDes_10202530"]="After use, there's a 100% chance of costing zero stamina while smelting.\n<color=#FF0000>The effective period ends at 04:59:59 on the final day of each round of the event. After that, items and buffs will be automatically removed.</color>",
    ["ItemDes_10202531"]="After use, there's a 15% chance of refunding the enhancement cost while enchanting in Prontera.\n<color=#FF0000>The effective period ends at 04:59:59 on the final day of each round of the event. After that, items and buffs will be automatically removed.</color>",
    ["ItemDes_10202532"]="After use, there's a 15% chance of refunding the enhancement cost while enchanting in Morroc.\n<color=#FF0000>The effective period ends at 04:59:59 on the final day of each round of the event. After that, items and buffs will be automatically removed.</color>",
    ["ItemDes_10202533"]="After use, there's a 15% chance of refunding the enhancement cost while enchanting in Einbroch.\n<color=#FF0000>The effective period ends at 04:59:59 on the final day of each round of the event. After that, items and buffs will be automatically removed.</color>",
    ["ItemDes_10202534"]="After use, there's a 15% chance of refunding the enhancement cost while enchanting in Izlude.\n<color=#FF0000>The effective period ends at 04:59:59 on the final day of each round of the event. After that, items and buffs will be automatically removed.</color>",
    ["ItemDes_10202535"]="After use, there's a 15% chance of refunding the enhancement cost while enchanting in Alberta.\n<color=#FF0000>The effective period ends at 04:59:59 on the final day of each round of the event. After that, items and buffs will be automatically removed.</color>",
    ["ItemDes_10202536"]="After use, there's a 20% chance of refunding the enhancement cost while enchanting in Payon.\n<color=#FF0000>The effective period ends at 04:59:59 on the final day of each round of the event. After that, items and buffs will be automatically removed.</color>",
    ["ItemDes_10202537"]="After use, there's a 20% chance of refunding the enhancement cost while enchanting in Geffen.\n<color=#FF0000>The effective period ends at 04:59:59 on the final day of each round of the event. After that, items and buffs will be automatically removed.</color>",
    ["ItemDes_10202538"]="After use, there's a 20% chance of refunding the enhancement cost while enchanting in Glast Heim.\n<color=#FF0000>The effective period ends at 04:59:59 on the final day of each round of the event. After that, items and buffs will be automatically removed.</color>",
    ["ItemDes_10202539"]="After use, there's a 25% chance of refunding the enhancement cost while enchanting in Comodo.\n<color=#FF0000>The effective period ends at 04:59:59 on the final day of each round of the event. After that, items and buffs will be automatically removed.</color>",
    ["ItemDes_10202540"]="After use, there's a 25% chance of refunding the enhancement cost while enchanting in Umbala.\n<color=#FF0000>The effective period ends at 04:59:59 on the final day of each round of the event. After that, items and buffs will be automatically removed.</color>",
    ["ItemDes_10202541"]="After use, there's a 25% chance of refunding the enhancement cost while enchanting in Juno.\n<color=#FF0000>The effective period ends at 04:59:59 on the final day of each round of the event. After that, items and buffs will be automatically removed.</color>",
    ["ItemDes_10202542"]="After use, there is a chance of refunding the refinement costs (including Refinement Vouchers). The specific chances are listed below:\n(Lv.0-8: 10%), (Lv.9-12: 15%), (Lv.13-15: 20%)\n<color=#FF0000>The effective period ends at 04:59:59 on the final day of each round of the event. After that, items and buffs will be automatically removed.</color>",
    ["ItemDes_10202543"]="After use, there is a chance of refunding the upgrade costs. The specific chances are listed below:\nWeapon (Lv.0-220: 10%), (Lv.221-260: 15%), (Lv.261-300: 20%)\nArmor (Lv.0-110: 10%), (Lv.111-130: 15%), (Lv.131-150: 20%)\nAccessory (Lv.0-55: 10%), (Lv.56-65: 15%), (Lv.66-75: 20%)\n<color=#FF0000>The effective period ends at 04:59:59 on the final day of each round of the event. After that, items and buffs will be automatically removed.</color>",
    ["ItemDes_10202544"]="After use, there's a 20% chance of refunding the ascension cost while ascending.\n<color=#FF0000>The effective period ends at 04:59:59 on the final day of each round of the event. After that, items and buffs will be automatically removed.</color>",
    ["ItemDes_10202545"]="After use, there's a 20% chance of refunding the purchase cost while purchasing items in the Crystal Shop.\n<color=#FF0000>The effective period ends at 04:59:59 on the final day of each round of the event. After that, items and buffs will be automatically removed.</color>",
    ["ItemDes_10202546"]="After use, there's a 20% chance of refunding the purchase cost while purchasing items in the Pet Store.\n<color=#FF0000>The effective period ends at 04:59:59 on the final day of each round of the event. After that, items and buffs will be automatically removed.</color>",
    ["ItemDes_10202547"]="After use, there's a 20% chance of refunding the purchase cost while purchasing items in the Guild Store.\n<color=#FF0000>The effective period ends at 04:59:59 on the final day of each round of the event. After that, items and buffs will be automatically removed.</color>",
    ["ItemDes_10202548"]="After use, there's a 20% chance of refunding the transfer cost while transferring.\n<color=#FF0000>The effective period ends at 04:59:59 on the final day of each round of the event. After that, items and buffs will be automatically removed.</color>",
    ["ItemDes_10202549"]="A charm infused with mysterious power that is used by Soul Linker to cast skills.",
    ["ItemDes_10202550"]="Used to increase Base Level by 1. Applicable level range: Base Level below 60.\nRewards - Get up to 23 of this item from the Kingdom Course. Recommended Base Level: Lv.37.",
    ["ItemDes_10202551"]="Used to increase Job Level by 1. Requirement: Job Level no higher than 2nd class Lv.50.\nRewards - Get up to 23 of this item from the Kingdom Course. Recommended Job Level: 2nd Class Lv.27.",
    ["ItemDes_10202552"]="An item used in the Painted Spring event. After using it, Adventurers can summon Kylin, which will charge power for 5 seconds, then deal massive damage that ignores Nian's armor according to the number of party members around Kylin. The damage will be credited to the item user. Cooldown: 60 seconds.",
    ["ItemDes_10202553"]="Use to obtain: Base EXP x150,000",
    ["ItemDes_10202554"]="Use to obtain: Job EXP x30,000",
    ["ItemDes_10204014"]="Let's spin 'round and 'round! Once purchased, use to ride the Carousel at the Amusement Park.",
    ["ItemDes_10204015"]="Bring your special someone and spin 'round and 'round! Once purchased, use to ride the Carousel at the Amusement Park.",
    ["ItemDes_10204016"]="A commemorative Gold Coin issued by Eden Group. Use to ride various Eden Group rides and recover Stamina.",
    ["ItemDes_10204017"]="A commemorative Silver Coin issued by Eden Group. Use to ride various Eden Group rides and recover Stamina.",
    ["ItemDes_10204020"]="An ore with magical powers. When using magic, it can negate the magic's counteractive power for the caster.",
    ["ItemDes_10204022"]="Terrifying poison in a skeleton-shaped bottle. Those who drink this may instantly die.",
    ["ItemDes_10204023"]="An arrow imbued with the power of Water.",
    ["ItemDes_10204024"]="An arrow imbued with the power of Fire.",
    ["ItemDes_10204025"]="A silver arrow imbued with divine power.",
    ["ItemDes_10204026"]="Open to get one random Headgear Crafting Material.",
    ["ItemDes_10204027"]="Open to get two random Headgear Crafting Materials.",
    ["ItemDes_10204028"]="Open to get three random Headgear Crafting Materials.",
    ["ItemDes_10204029"]="Open to get five random Headgear Crafting Materials.",
    ["ItemDes_10204030"]="Open to get Mount: Jet Pack.",
    ["ItemDes_10204031"]="Open to get Mount: Hamster.",
    ["ItemDes_10204032"]="Use to unlock Character Emoticon: Giggle.",
    ["ItemDes_10204033"]="Use to unlock Character Emoticon: Wave.",
    ["ItemDes_10204034"]="An arrow imbued with the power of Wind.",
    ["ItemDes_10204035"]="An arrow imbued with the power of Earth.",
    ["ItemDes_10204036"]="Use to obtain Mount: Moonster.\nCan be exchanged with <color=#CA2E0AFF>Jakk</color> during the <color=#CA2E0AFF>Halloween Revelry Party</color> event.",
    ["ItemDes_10204037"]="Use to obtain Mount: Pumpkin Carriage.\nCan be obtained from the <color=#CA2E0AFF>MVP</color> and <color=#CA2E0AFF>Mini</color> bosses during the <color=#CA2E0AFF>Halloween Revelry Party</color> event.",
    ["ItemDes_10204038"]="Use to obtain Mount: Whirlwind Skateboard.",
    ["ItemDes_10204039"]="Use to obtain Mount: Sasquatch Sled.",
    ["ItemDes_10204040"]="Use to obtain Mount: Jingle Bell.",
    ["ItemDes_10204041"]="Use to obtain Mount: Lion's Head Fireworks.",
    ["ItemDes_10204042"]="Use to obtain Mount: Panda Eiffel.",
    ["ItemDes_10204043"]="Use at the Card Vending Machine to take part in the Vending Machine Event!",
    ["ItemDes_10204044"]="Use at the Equipment Vending Machine to take part in the Vending Machine Event!",
    ["ItemDes_10204045"]="Use at the Headgear Vending Machine to take part in the Vending Machine Event!",
    ["ItemDes_10204046"]="A general reward for challenging MVP. Can be used at the corresponding Vending Machine.",
    ["ItemDes_10204047"]="A general reward for challenging Mini. Can be used at the corresponding Vending Machine.",
    ["ItemDes_10204048"]="A general reward for challenging instances. Can be exchanged for the Valkyrie set.",
    ["ItemDes_10204049"]="A general reward for challenging Endless Tower. Can be exchanged for the Odin set.",
    ["ItemDes_10204050"]="You can participate in the event at the Prontera Pet Book Vending Machine!",
    ["ItemDes_10204051"]="Regards from Defolty. Many of her numerous admirers open their Warehouse upwards of 20 times a day just to see her smile.",
    ["ItemDes_10204052"]="Regards from Telling. Always full of energy and busy, it's said that she will be the best wife and mother in all of Kafra.",
    ["ItemDes_10204053"]="Regards from Bennit. Even though she's a bit tomboyish, it's said that she actually likes knitting and reading romance novels. She's popular with some men who really like short skirts.",
    ["ItemDes_10204054"]="Regards from W. It is said that the Assassins Guild intends to pay her a higher salary for her to work there because too many people fainted after she called them \"big boy.\"",
    ["ItemDes_10204055"]="Regards from W. With her blond pigtails contributing to her cuteness, it's no wonder that she's one of the most popular girls in Kafra.",
    ["ItemDes_10204056"]="An instance reward for party members brought from an Lv.80 Pass. Open to obtain a Life Supply Pack.",
    ["ItemDes_10204057"]="A hidden treasure from Best Chef. Open to randomly obtain one of the following: Aquatic Salad, Mandragora Prawns, Nutritious Frog Meat, Meat n' Pumpkin, Healthy Meal, or Herbal Stew.",
    ["ItemDes_10204058"]="A super pack containing equipment materials, including Gold, Silver, Iron, STR/AGI/INT/DEX/VIT/LUK Stones, etc. Open to randomly obtain one type of material.",
    ["ItemDes_10204059"]="A super pack containing equipment Upgrading Metals, including Phracon I, Carnium I, Bascyx I, etc. Open to randomly obtain one type of Upgrading Metal.",
    ["ItemDes_10204060"]="A super pack containing equipment enchantment materials, including Sharpening Enchantment Stone, Toughening Enchantment Stone, Secret Enchantment Stone, etc. Open to randomly obtain one type of equipment enchantment material.",
    ["ItemDes_10204061"]="A refining material pack containing Elunium, Oridecon, and Bradium. Open to randomly obtain one type of equipment refining material.",
    ["ItemDes_10204062"]="An album used to collect cards. Open to randomly obtain one white quality monster card.",
    ["ItemDes_10204063"]="A super pack containing headgear crafting materials, including Jellopy, Zargon, Garlet, Scell, etc. Open to randomly obtain 10 headgear crafting materials.",
    ["ItemDes_10204064"]="A substantial basic battle supply pack. Open to obtain a Red Potion, Blue Potion, Fly Wing, Butterfly Wing, Seed of Yggdrasil, and Leaf of Yggdrasil.",
    ["ItemDes_10204065"]="A substantial intermediate battle supply pack. Open to obtain Yellow Potion, Purple Potion, Fly Wing, Butterfly Wing, Seed of Yggdrasil, and Leaf of Yggdrasil.",
    ["ItemDes_10204066"]="A kit containing Red Potions. Use it to obtain 100 Red Potions.",
    ["ItemDes_10204067"]="A pile of Fly Wings. Use it to obtain 10 Fly Wings.",
    ["ItemDes_10204068"]="A pile of Butterfly Wings. Use it to obtain 10 Butterfly Wings.",
    ["ItemDes_10204069"]="A kit containing White Potions. Use it to obtain 100 White Potions.",
    ["ItemDes_10204070"]="A kit containing Red Potions (PVP). Use it to obtain 100 Red Potions (PVP).",
    ["ItemDes_10204071"]="A kit containing White Potions (PVP). Use it to obtain 100 White Potions (PVP).",
    ["ItemDes_10204072"]="A kit containing Poison. Use it to obtain 100 Poison.",
    ["ItemDes_10204073"]="Trap pack. Use it to obtain 100 Traps.",
    ["ItemDes_10204074"]="A quiver filled with Silver Arrows. Use it to obtain 999 Silver Arrows.",
    ["ItemDes_10204075"]="A quiver filled with Exploding Arrows. Use it to obtain 999 Exploding Arrows.",
    ["ItemDes_10204076"]="A quiver filled with Frost Arrows. Use it to obtain 999 Frost Arrows.",
    ["ItemDes_10204077"]="A quiver filled with Wind Arrows. Use it to obtain 999 Wind Arrows.",
    ["ItemDes_10204078"]="A kit containing Blue Potions. Use it to obtain 100 Blue Potions.",
    ["ItemDes_10204079"]="A kit containing Seeds of Yggdrasil. Use it to obtain 3 Seeds of Yggdrasil.",
    ["ItemDes_10204080"]="A quiver filled with Earth Arrows. Use it to obtain 999 Earth Arrows.",
    ["ItemDes_10204082"]="A kit containing Blue Potions (PVP). Use it to obtain 100 Blue Potions (PVP).",
    ["ItemDes_10204083"]="A kit containing Leaves of Yggdrasil. Use it to obtain 10 Leaves of Yggdrasil.",
    ["ItemDes_10204085"]="A kit containing Panacea. Use it to obtain 12 Panacea.",
    ["ItemDes_10204086"]="A kit containing Yellow Potions. Use it to obtain 100 Yellow Potions.",
    ["ItemDes_10204087"]="A kit containing Yellow Potions (PVP). Use it to obtain 100 Yellow Potions (PVP).",
    ["ItemDes_10204088"]="A kit containing Fire Resistance Potions. Use it to obtain 10 Fire Resistance Potions.",
    ["ItemDes_10204089"]="A kit containing Water Resistance Potions. Use it to obtain 10 Water Resistance Potions.",
    ["ItemDes_10204090"]="A kit containing Wind Resistance Potions. Use it to obtain 10 Wind Resistance Potions.",
    ["ItemDes_10204091"]="A kit containing Earth Resistance Potions. Use it to obtain 10 Earth Resistance Potions.",
    ["ItemDes_10204093"]="A kit containing Yggdrasil Berries. Use it to obtain 10 Yggdrasil Berries.",
    ["ItemDes_10204094"]="A tome containing knowledge of the element of fire. Use it to obtain 10 Elemental Converters (Fire).",
    ["ItemDes_10204095"]="A tome containing knowledge of the element of water. Use it to obtain 10 Elemental Converters (Water).",
    ["ItemDes_10204096"]="A tome containing knowledge of the element of wind. Use it to obtain 10 Elemental Converters (Wind).",
    ["ItemDes_10204097"]="A tome containing knowledge of the element of earth. Use it to obtain 10 Elemental Converters (Earth).",
    ["ItemDes_10204098"]="Use to obtain the Campus Festival Set.",
    ["ItemDes_10204099"]="Use to obtain the Cat Set.",
    ["ItemDes_10204100"]="Use to obtain the Campus Festival Set (Red).",
    ["ItemDes_10204101"]="Use to obtain the Campus Festival Set (Blue).",
    ["ItemDes_10204102"]="Use to obtain the Campus Festival Set (Green).",
    ["ItemDes_10204103"]="Guild reward given to warriors. Can be used to purchase items and Guild Blessings at the Guild Store.",
    ["ItemDes_10204104"]="A reward for participating in Otherworld Gate. Open to obtain 50 Guild Contribution.",
    ["ItemDes_10204105"]="A reward for participating in Guild KVM. Open to obtain 2 Guild Contribution.",
    ["ItemDes_10204106"]="A pack containing pet-taming items, including Unripe Apple, Rainbow Carrot, Livestock Gore, Juicy Grape, etc. Open to randomly receive one type of the item.",
    ["ItemDes_10204107"]="A super pack items to help you become stronger. Open to randomly receive various Upgrading Metals, Enchantment Stones, Elunium, Oridecon, or Bradium.",
    ["ItemDes_10204108"]="Painstakingly crafted by the Smile Assistance. Open to randomly obtain a piece of normal headgear.",
    ["ItemDes_10204109"]="The Smile Assistance's favorite work. Open to randomly obtain a piece of premium headgear.",
    ["ItemDes_10204110"]="A gift box containing regards from Smile Assistance. Open to randomly obtain a basic headgear blueprint.",
    ["ItemDes_10204111"]="A premium gift box containing regards from the Smile Assistance. Open to randomly obtain a premium headgear blueprint.",
    ["ItemDes_10204112"]="A basic cooking pack. Open to obtain 3 of each of the following: Meat n' Pumpkin I, Healthy Meal I, Aquatic Salad I, Mandragora Prawns I, Nutritious Frog Meat I, and Steamed Egg n' Fish I.",
    ["ItemDes_10204113"]="A normal cooking pack. Open to obtain 5 of each of the following: Fruity Squid I, Spicy Fried Bug Leg I, Mixed Congee I, Fish Soup with Frog Legs I, Fish Fillet I, and Fly Leg Folk Remedy I.",
    ["ItemDes_10204114"]="A premium cooking pack. Open to obtain 5 of each of the following: Rat-on-a-Stick I, Delicious Prawns I, Fresh Snake I, Prawn-on-a-Stick I, Bug Leg Salad I, and Crispy Fish I.",
    ["ItemDes_10204115"]="A basic fishing bait pack. Open to obtain 3 of each of the following: Poison Spores, Spawn, Hedgehog Skin, Yoyo Tail, Elder Pixie's Moustache, and Spiderweb.",
    ["ItemDes_10204117"]="A premium upgrading supply pack. Open to obtain one of the following at random: Upgrading Metal, Vulcanfish, Hardshell Crab, Emberfish, or Upgrading Metal II.",
    ["ItemDes_10204118"]="Open to select a dye item. Can be used to change the color of hair or mounts.",
    ["ItemDes_10204119"]="An ancient branch imbued with magic. Its mysterious powers can summon any living monster and the mysterious <color=#CA2E0AFF>Gold Poring</color>.\nAdventurers can kill monsters for more drops and EXP. Kill Gold Porings to get <color=#CA2E0AFF>10</color> Odin's Blessings.\n(Killing a monster summoned by a Dead Branch does not use up Odin's Blessings. This item can only be used on certain maps.)",
    ["ItemDes_10204120"]="Having survived countless miserable years, after making a contract with this magic branch and blood, you can summon MVP/Mini that have already been killed.\nDue to residual magic, the summoned MVP/Mini level will be lower than the world level. Lasts only <color=#CA2E0AFF>1</color> hour.\nUsage Period: 20:00 - 24:00\n(This item can only be used on certain maps.)",
    ["ItemDes_10204121"]="Open to get Title: Phantom Adventurer.",
    ["ItemDes_10204122"]="Open to get Title: Endlessly Popular.",
    ["ItemDes_10204123"]="Proof of participation in the Fishing Contest. Collect a certain amount to exchange for rare items at the Fish Print Coin Shop.",
    ["ItemDes_10204124"]="Open to get a random rare bait.",
    ["ItemDes_10204126"]="A crystal pack filled with magic. Grants different numbers of Crystals when used at different levels.",
    ["ItemDes_10204127"]="An entrance gift carefully chosen for you by the Kafra ladies. Open it to see what's inside!",
    ["ItemDes_10204128"]="An exclusive pack prepared for adventurers who have come to Midgard for the first time. Contains Eden Group Ticket (Single), Eden Group Ticket (Double), Advanced Pickaxe, 2 Stamina Potions, Kafra's VIP Card, 4,000 Diamonds, and 1 Premium Headgear Gift Box.",
    ["ItemDes_10204129"]="Open to get 10 Odin's Blessings.",
    ["ItemDes_10204130"]="Open to choose an advanced head decoration for your class-exclusive mount.",
    ["ItemDes_10204131"]="Open to choose an intermediate body decoration for your class-exclusive mount.",
    ["ItemDes_10204132"]="Open to choose an advanced body decoration for your class-exclusive mount.",
    ["ItemDes_10204133"]="Open to get 100 Odin's Blessings.",
    ["ItemDes_10204134"]="A book sealed with a powerful force. Open it to choose one of the following cards: Eclipse Series Card, Dragon Fly Series Card, Mastering Series Card, or Ghostring Series Card.",
    ["ItemDes_10204135"]="A book sealed with a powerful force. Open it to choose one of the following cards: King Dramoh Series Card, Toad Series Card, Deviling Series Card, or Angeling Series Card.",
    ["ItemDes_10204136"]="A book sealed with a powerful force. Open it to choose one of the following cards: Mistress Series Card, Phreeoni Series Card, Kraken Series Card, or Eddga Series Card.",
    ["ItemDes_10204137"]="A book sealed with a powerful force. Open it to choose one of the following cards: Maya Series Card, Orc Hero Series Card, Pharaoh Series Card, or Orc Lord Series Card.",
    ["ItemDes_10204138"]="A book sealed with a powerful force. Open it to choose one of the following cards: Golden Thief Bug, Drake Series Card, or Osiris Series Card.",
    ["ItemDes_10204139"]="A book sealed with a powerful force. Open it to choose one of the following cards: Strouf Series Card, Moonlight Flower Series Card, or Dracula Series Card.",
    ["ItemDes_10204140"]="Endless Tower exchange item. Vali's breath that permeates throughout the tower. Can be exchanged for equipment upgrading items.",
    ["ItemDes_10204141"]="Endless Tower exchange item. Loki's breath that permeates throughout the tower. Can be exchanged for equipment enchantment items.",
    ["ItemDes_10204142"]="Endless Tower exchange item. Vidar's breath that permeates throughout the tower. Can be exchanged for equipment refining items.",
    ["ItemDes_10204143"]="Endless Tower exchange item. Freyr's breath that permeates throughout the tower. Can be exchanged for card packs.",
    ["ItemDes_10204144"]="Endless Tower exchange item. The lost soul of Vali wandering in the tower. Can be exchanged for equipment upgrading items.",
    ["ItemDes_10204145"]="Endless Tower exchange item. The lost soul of Loki wandering in the tower. Can be exchanged for equipment enchantment items.",
    ["ItemDes_10204146"]="Endless Tower exchange item. The lost soul of Vidar wandering in the tower. Can be exchanged for equipment refining items.",
    ["ItemDes_10204147"]="Endless Tower exchange item. The lost soul of Freyr wandering in the tower. Can be exchanged for card packs.",
    ["ItemDes_10204148"]="Endless Tower exchange item. The soul of Vali that retains its consciousness. Can be exchanged for equipment upgrading items.",
    ["ItemDes_10204149"]="Endless Tower exchange item. The soul of Loki that retains its consciousness. Can be exchanged for equipment enchantment items.",
    ["ItemDes_10204150"]="Endless Tower exchange item. The soul of Vidar that retains its consciousness. Can be exchanged for equipment refining items.",
    ["ItemDes_10204151"]="Endless Tower exchange item. The soul of Freyr that retains its consciousness. Can be exchanged for card packs.",
    ["ItemDes_10204152"]="Endless Tower exchange item. A magic tablet created by Vali. Can be exchanged for equipment upgrading items.",
    ["ItemDes_10204153"]="Endless Tower exchange item. A magic tablet created by Loki. Can be exchanged for equipment enchantment items.",
    ["ItemDes_10204154"]="Endless Tower exchange item. A magic tablet created by Vidar. Can be exchanged for equipment refining items.",
    ["ItemDes_10204155"]="Endless Tower exchange item. A magic tablet created by Freyr. Can be exchanged for card packs.",
    ["ItemDes_10204156"]="Endless Tower exchange item. The hand of Odin that represents supreme power. Can be used to obtain exclusive equipment.",
    ["ItemDes_10204157"]="Endless Tower exchange item. The eye of Odin that possesses the ability to see through anything. Can be used to obtain exclusive equipment.",
    ["ItemDes_10204158"]="Endless Tower exchange item. The soul of Odin with an aura of unparalleled power. Can be used to obtain exclusive equipment.",
    ["ItemDes_10204159"]="Endless Tower exchange item. The heart of Odin that beats with infinite life force. Can be used to obtain exclusive equipment.",
    ["ItemDes_10204160"]="A gift bag full of all kinds of supplies essential for life skills. Open for a chance to obtain a Stamina Reagent, Normal Pickaxe, Basic Cooking Ingredient, Alloy Pickaxe, Automatic Fishing Rod, or other life skill supplies.",
    ["ItemDes_10204161"]="Open to randomly obtain 1 of the following basic cooking ingredients: Meat n' Pumpkin I, Healthy Meal I, Aquatic Salad I, Mandragora Prawns I, Nutritious Frog Meat I, and Steamed Egg n' Fish I.",
    ["ItemDes_10204162"]="Open to select any one of the following cards: Fabre Card, Pecopeco Egg Card, Female Thief Bug Card, Hornet Card, Ambernite Card, Drainliar Card, Savage Bebe Card, Familiar Card, Plankton Card.",
    ["ItemDes_10204163"]="Open to select any one of the following cards: Picky Card, Picky (Shell) Card, Steel Chonchon Card, Pupa Card, Condor Card, Thief Bug Card, Chonchon Card, Male Thief Bug Card, Baby Desert Wolf Card.",
    ["ItemDes_10204164"]="Open to select any one of the following cards: Thief Bug Egg Card, Tarou Card, Spore Card, Poporing Card, Creamy Card, Poison Spore Card, Poring Card, Lunatic Card, Drops Card, Willow Card, Rocker Card, Mandragora Card",
    ["ItemDes_10204165"]="Open to select any one of the following cards: Horn Card, Dagger-wielding Skel Pirate Card, Skeleton Worker Card, Hunter Fly Card, Argos Card, Metaller Card, Flora Card, Caramel Card, Hydra Card",
    ["ItemDes_10204166"]="Open to select any one of the following cards: Vocal Card, Roda Frog Card, Savage Card, Dustiness Card, Myst Card, Whisper Card, Zombie Card, Axe-wielding Skel Pirate Card, Pecopeco Card.",
    ["ItemDes_10204167"]="Open to select any one of the following cards: Smokie Card, Kukre Card, Yoyo Card, Pirate Skeleton Card, Muka Card, Mantis Card, Stainer Card, Coco Card, Dead Plankton Card, Martin Card, Giearth Card, Anacondaq Card",
    ["ItemDes_10204168"]="Open to select any one of the following cards: Scorpion Card, Side Winder Card, Magnolia Card, Andre Card, Vadon Card, Marina Card, Archer Skeleton Card, Desert Wolf Card, Minorous Card",
    ["ItemDes_10204169"]="Open to select any one of the following cards: Sasquatch Card, Argiope Card, Swordfish Card, Hode Card, Frilldora Card, Marse Card, Matyr Card, Cornutus Card, Isis Card.",
    ["ItemDes_10204170"]="Open to select any one of the following cards: Golem Card, Soldier Skeleton Card, Vitata Card, Phen Card, Marine Sphere Card, Zerom Card, Ant Larva Card, Piere Card, Deniro Card, Mummy Card, Marduk Card, Verit Card",
    ["ItemDes_10204171"]="Open to select any one of the following cards: Arclouze Card, Requiem Card, Bigfoot Card, Snake Card, Wolf Card, Anubis Card, Skeleton Card, Munak Card, Deviace Card",
    ["ItemDes_10204172"]="Open to select any one of the following cards: Pasana Card, Marc Card, Dokebi Card, Nine Tail Card, Orc Zombie Card, Jakk Card, Sohee Card, Eggyra Card, Skeleton General Card.",
    ["ItemDes_10204173"]="Open to select any one of the following cards: Obeaune Card, Wormtail Card, Bongun Card, Greatest General Card, Horong Card, Orc Baby Card, Elder Willow Card, Flail-wielding Goblin Card, Mace-wielding Goblin Card, Mace-wielding Kobold Card, Hammer-wielding Goblin Card, Orc Warrior Card",
    ["ItemDes_10204174"]="Open to select any one of the following cards: Orc Skeleton Card, Ground Petite Card, Goblin Archer Card, Kobold Archer Card, Orc Lady Card, Zenorc Card, Goblin Steamrider Card, Rotar Zairo Card, Zombie Prisoner Card.",
    ["ItemDes_10204175"]="Open to select any one of the following cards: Sky Petite Card, High Orc Card, Marionette Card, Giant Whisper Card, Bapho Jr. Card, Dagger-wielding Goblin Card, Axe-wielding Kobold Card, Rybio Card, Raydric Card.",
    ["ItemDes_10204176"]="Open to select any one of the following cards: Hammer-wielding Kobold Card, Orc Archer Card, Wind Ghost Card, Wraith Card, Axe-wielding Goblin Card, Ghoul Card, Deviruchi Card, Nightmare Card, Sageworm Card, Bloody Knight Card.",
    ["ItemDes_10204177"]="Cool Event Corp. Adventure Gift Pack",
    ["ItemDes_10204178"]="Drooping Cat is waiting for you. Open to select a Drooping Cat headgear of your choice after use.",
    ["ItemDes_10204179"]="A book sealed with a powerful force. Open it to choose one of the following cards:\nPicky Card, Drainliar Card, Lunatic Card\nPupa Card, Steel Chonchon Card, Willow Card\nCondor Card, Fabre Card, Drops Card\nThief Bug Card, Savage Bebe Card, Male Thief Bug Card\nChonchon Card, Plankton Card, Baby Desert Wolf Card\nHornet Card, Thief Bug Egg Card, Pecopeco Egg Card\nAmbernite Card, Poporing Card, Female Thief Bug Card\nTarou Card, Creamy Card, Familiar Card\nSpore Card, Poison Spore Card, Picky (Shell) Card\nPoring Card, Rocker Card, Mandragora Card.",
    ["ItemDes_10204180"]="Welcome to Prontera. This Adventurer Assistance Pack has been prepared by W for adventurers to embark on their new adventure. It contains: Automatic Fishing Rod x1, Eden Group Ticket (Single) x1, Eden Group Ticket (Double) x1, Advanced Pickaxe x1, and Stamina Potion x2.",
    ["ItemDes_10204181"]="Open to get 1288-18888 Crystals at random!\nAdditionally, you may earn Odin's Resplendent Reliquary, Cat Hand Services Coins, Cool Event Corp. Coins, Kafra Corp. Coins, Fair Headgear Gift Box, Basic Headgear Blueprint Gift Box, Weapon Card Selection Pack I, Armor Card Selection Pack I, Accessory Card Selection Pack I, Weapon Card Selection Pack II, Armor Card Selection Pack II, or Accessory Card Selection Pack II. \n\n<color=#CA2E0AFF>You have a random chance of obtaining the above items, and each player's items may be different</color>",
    ["ItemDes_10204183"]="A book containing immense power. Open it to randomly obtain one of the following cards:\nSasquatch Card, Hode Card, Swordfish Card\nFrilldora Card, Marse Card, Minorous Card\nMarina Card, Andre Card, Argiope Card\nPhen Card, Scorpion Card, Archer Skeleton Card\nMatyr Card, Golem Card, Marduk Card\nVitata Card, Magnolia Card, Cornutus Card\nPiere Card, Marine Sphere Card, Isis Card\nDeniro Card, Zerom Card, Desert Wolf Card\nVadon Card, Mummy Card, Soldier Skeleton Card\nSide Winder Card, Verit Card, or Ant Larva Card.",
    ["ItemDes_10204184"]="Heaps of headgear are waiting for you! Open this to select any one of the dazzling headgears inside!",
    ["ItemDes_10204185"]="Prepare for PVP! Open to obtain 50 Yellow Potions and 50 Purple Potions, 20 Panaceas, 2 of each of the four kinds of elemental attribute Resistance Potion, 1 Magical Stone, and 1 Neuralizer.",
    ["ItemDes_10204186"]="Used to commend extraordinary warriors in Otherworld Gate. Open for a chance to obtain Guild Contribution x2, Bound I x1, Engraved I x1, or Validation I x1.",
    ["ItemDes_10204187"]="Used to commend extraordinary warriors in Otherworld Gate. Open for a chance to obtain Guild Contribution x10, Bound I x5, Engraved I x5 or Validation I x5.",
    ["ItemDes_10204188"]="Used to commend extraordinary warriors in Guild KVM. Open for a chance to obtain Guild Contribution x2, Inscription I x2 or Pioneer I x1.",
    ["ItemDes_10204189"]="A reward for participating in GVG battles. Open to obtain 10 Guild Contribution.",
    ["ItemDes_10204190"]="GVG City Owner reward. Open to obtain 24 Guild Contribution and 2 [Soul I] Shadow Equipment materials.",
    ["ItemDes_10204191"]="A comprehensive and thoughtfully-prepared gift box, presented to adventurers by the Kafra Corporation.\nOpen to randomly obtain a Fragrant Cassia Twig, Old Weapon, Scarlet Wine, Lost Gold Bracelet, Maple Sugar Cake, Doll Pendant, Luminous Scale, Coral Crystal, Lost Treasure, Lakebed Pearl, Topaz, Obsidian, Amethyst, Cosmic Stone, Refreshing Dew, Golden Feather, Magic Waste, or Leaf Bookmark. Go and give it to your favorite NPC to boost your Favor!",
    ["ItemDes_10204192"]="A book containing immense power. Open it to randomly receive one of the following cards:\nPicky Card, Drainliar Card, Lunatic Card\nPupa Card, Steel Chonchon Card, Willow Card\nCondor Card, Fabre Card, Drops Card\nThief Bug Card, Savage Bebe Card, Male Thief Bug Card\nChonchon Card, Plankton Card, Baby Desert Wolf Card\nHornet Card, Thief Bug Egg Card, Pecopeco Egg Card\nAmbernite Card, Poporing Card, Female Thief Bug Card\nTarou Card, Creamy Card, Familiar Card\nSpore Card, Poison Spore Card, Picky (Shell) Card\nPoring Card, Rocker Card, or Mandragora Card.",
    ["ItemDes_10204193"]="A book containing immense power. Open it to randomly receive one of the following cards:\nSavage Card, Roda Frog Card, Martin Card\nDustiness Card, Myst Card, Giearth Card\nMantis Card, Zombie Card, Metaller Card\nStainer Card, Hydra Card, Dead Plankton Card\nCoco Card, Smokie Card, Dagger-wielding Skel Pirate Card\nAnacondaq Card, Muka Card, Axe-wielding Skel Pirate Card\nFlora Card, Whisper Card, Skeleton Worker Card\nCaramel Card, Pecopeco Card, Pirate Skeleton Card\nKukre Card, Horn Card, Argos Card\nYoyo Card, Hunter Fly Card, or Vocal Card.",
    ["ItemDes_10204194"]="A book containing immense power. Open it to randomly obtain one of the following cards:\nSasquatch Card, Hode Card, Swordfish Card\nFrilldora Card, Marse Card, Minorous Card\nMarina Card, Andre Card, Argiope Card\nPhen Card, Scorpion Card, Archer Skeleton Card\nMatyr Card, Golem Card, Marduk Card\nVitata Card, Magnolia Card, Cornutus Card\nPiere Card, Marine Sphere Card, Isis Card\nDeniro Card, Zerom Card, Desert Wolf Card\nVadon Card, Mummy Card, Soldier Skeleton Card\nSide Winder Card, Verit Card, or Ant Larva Card.",
    ["ItemDes_10204195"]="Upgraded equipment can gain enhanced combat ability. Open to select one of the following upgrading materials:\nPhracon I x2, Carnium I x2, Bascyx I x2, Phracon II x1, Carnium II x1, or Bascyx II x1.",
    ["ItemDes_10204196"]="Refined equipment can gain enhanced combat ability. Open to select one of the following refining materials:\nElunium x3, Oridecon x3, Bradium x3, Enriched Elunium x1, Enriched Oridecon x1, or Enriched Bradium x1.",
    ["ItemDes_10204197"]="Enchanted equipment can gain enhanced combat ability. Open to select one of the following enchanting materials:\nSharpening Enchantment Stone x8, Toughening Enchantment Stone x8\nSecret Enchantment Stone x8, Blazing Enchantment Stone x4\nHardening Enchantment Stone x4, Gold Enchantment Stone x4\nTidal Current Enchantment Stone x2, Crystallize Enchantment Stone x2\nGlowing Star Enchantment Stone x2, Gloomy Enchantment Stone x1\nPetrifying Enchantment Stone x1, or Silverspirit Enchantment Stone x1.",
    ["ItemDes_10204198"]="Use to obtain Mount: Spring Picnic.",
    ["ItemDes_10204199"]="An exclusive Valentine's Day Upgrade Selection Pack. Open to select one of the following rewards:\nPhracon I x6\nCarnium I x6\nCarnium I x6\nPhracon II x3\nCarnium II x3\nBascyx II x3",
    ["ItemDes_10204200"]="An exclusive Valentine's Day Enchantment Selection Pack. Open to select one of the following rewards:\nSharpening Enchantment Stone x8\nToughening Enchantment Stone x8\nSecret Enchantment Stone x8\nBlazing Enchantment Stone x4\nHardening Enchantment Stone x4\nGold Enchantment Stone x4\nTidal Current Enchantment Stone x2\nCrystallize Enchantment Stone x2\nGlowing Star Enchantment Stone x2",
    ["ItemDes_10204201"]="An exclusive Valentine's Day Refinement Selection Pack. Open to select one of the following rewards:\nElunium x9\nOridecon x9\nBradium x9\nEnriched Elunium x3\nEnriched Oridecon x3\nEnriched Bradium x3",
    ["ItemDes_10204202"]="Use to obtain mount: Buzzing Honeypot.",
    ["ItemDes_10204203"]="Use to obtain the mount - Regal War Horse",
    ["ItemDes_10204204"]="Open to obtain 1 Odin",
    ["ItemDes_10204205"]="Once used, CoCo Drink Vouchers will become CoCo Drink Voucher (Redeemed).\nNotes are written on the back of the voucher:\n1) Visit a CoCo store in Taiwan before 21:00 on May 25, 2021 (time span subject to the store's business hours on that day) to redeem a drink. Drink vouchers cannot be used to redeem drinks after they expire.\n2) Show the voucher to the staff and use it to get a free Star Grape drink worth NT$75. The drink cannot be swapped for other drinks or have extra toppings added to it.\n3) Some stores may not support this exchange event. Adventurer should confirm with the staff before using this voucher.\n4) No compensation will be given if this voucher is used without confirmation.",
    ["ItemDes_10204206"]="A book sealed with a powerful force. Open it to choose one of the following cards: Doppelganger Series Card, Amon Ra Series Card, Dark Priest Series Card, Vagabond Wolf Series Card, or Dark Lord Series Card.",
    ["ItemDes_10204207"]="Open to choose between 1 Kafra Coin, 1 Cool Event Corp. Coin, or 1 Cat Hand Corp. Coin. Will be bound.",
    ["ItemDes_10204208"]="Given to brave Adventurers for their outstanding performance in KVM Cross-server. Unlock for a chance to get one of the following: 2 Guild Contributions, 2 Inscription I, 1 Pioneer I, 1 Luminary Selection Pack, 1 Shadow Equipment Basic Selection Pack.",
    ["ItemDes_10204209"]="A book sealed with a powerful force. Open it to choose one of the following cards: Time Holder Series Card, Morroc Series Card, Owl Duke Series Card, Chimera Series Card, or Mysteltainn Series Card.",
    ["ItemDes_10204210"]="A book sealed with a powerful force. Open it to choose one of the following cards: Tao Gunka Series Card, Lost Dragon Series Card, Ogretooth Series Card, Necromancer Series Card, or Mutant Dragonoid Series Card.",
    ["ItemDes_10204210_1"]="A book sealed with a powerful force. Open it to choose one of the following cards: Tao Gunka Series Card, Lost Dragon Series Card, Ogretooth Series Card, or Necromancer Series Card.",
    ["ItemDes_10204211"]="Open for a chance to get one of the following five items:\nLv.76 or above Random Blue Card x1,\nLv.76 or below Random Blue Card x1,\nAncient Tome Fragment x1,\nCollection Gift Box I x1 (containing Old Card Album x1 + Luminary Selection Pack x1),\nCollection Gift Box II x1 (containing MVP Coin x20 + Mini Coin x1 + Shadow Equipment Basic Selection Pack x1).\n<color=#CA2E0AFF>This is a potentially winnable item. Making a purchase or participating in the event does not guarantee you will obtain certain items.</color>",
    ["ItemDes_10204212"]="Dash at full speed! Use to participate in the Ragna GP event.",
    ["ItemDes_10204218"]="Open to get 100,000 Zeny.",
    ["ItemDes_10204219"]="Use to obtain Mount: Yamata no Orochi.\nSpeed: 5",
    ["ItemDes_10204220"]="A treasure Wine Spirit carries everywhere, as well as a commemorative reward of the <color=#872657>Hyakki Yagyō</color> event.",
    ["ItemDes_10204221"]="A chest the Lord of Hundred Spirits carries everywhere, as well as a basic reward of the <color=#872657>Hyakki Yagyō</color> event.",
    ["ItemDes_10204222"]="A chest the King of Thousand Spirits carries everywhere, as well as an advanced reward of the <color=#872657>Hyakki Yagyō</color> event.",
    ["ItemDes_10204223"]="A chest the King of Ten-Thousand Spirits carries everywhere, as well as the supreme reward of the <color=#872657>Hyakki Yagyō</color> event.",
    ["ItemDes_10204224"]="A mysterious chest given by the <color=#1EAEA4>Shadow Organization</color> to reward wise Adventurers who cracked the Shadow Code.",
    ["ItemDes_10204225"]="A bean basket filled with a variety of deliciously smelling beans.\nUse to put it on the floor and share it with everyone. There is a total of 10 beans, and each person can claim 1 bean from it.\n<color=#FF0000>It will expire after a period of time.</color>",
    ["ItemDes_10204226"]="Open the Battlefield Warrior Crate to obtain an exclusive battlefield title: Battlefield Warrior (7 Days) and Guild Contribution x10. There is also a chance to obtain Inscription I or Pioneer I.",
    ["ItemDes_10204227"]="Open the Battlefield Captain Crate to obtain an exclusive battlefield title: Battlefield Captain (7 Days) and Guild Contribution x15. There is also a chance to obtain Inscription II, Pioneer II, Bound I, or Engraved I.",
    ["ItemDes_10204228"]="Open the Battlefield Overlord Crate to obtain an exclusive battlefield title: Battlefield Overlord (7 Days) and Guild Contribution x20. There is also a chance to obtain Inscription II, Pioneer II, Bound II, Engraved II, Validation II, or Contract II.",
    ["ItemDes_10204229"]="Used to commend extraordinary warriors in Cross-Server Guild KVM. Open for a chance to obtain one of the following rewards: Guild Contribution x2, Inscription I x4, Inscription I x2, Pioneer I x2, Pioneer I x1.",
    ["ItemDes_10204231"]="A kit containing Red Slim Potions. Use it to obtain Red Slim Potion x100.",
    ["ItemDes_10204232"]="A kit containing Yellow Slim Potions. Use it to obtain Yellow Slim Potion x100.",
    ["ItemDes_10204233"]="A kit containing White Slim Potions. Use it to obtain White Slim Potion x100.",
    ["ItemDes_10204234"]="A kit containing Advanced White Slim Potions. Use it to obtain Advanced White Slim Potion x100.",
    ["ItemDes_10204235"]="A kit containing Gray Slim Potions. Use it to obtain Gray Slim Potion x100.",
    ["ItemDes_10204236"]="A kit containing Bomb Mushroom Spores. Use it to obtain 100 Bomb Mushroom Spores.",
    ["ItemDes_10204237"]="A kit containing Bloodsuck Plant Seeds. Use it to obtain 100 Bloodsuck Plant Seeds.",
    ["ItemDes_10204238"]="A kit containing Thorn Plant Seeds. Use it to obtain 100 Thorn Plant Seeds.",
    ["ItemDes_10204239"]="A kit containing Mandragora Flowerpots. Use it to obtain 100 Mandragora Flowerpots.",
    ["ItemDes_10204240"]="A kit containing Plant Bottles. Use it to obtain Plant Bottle x100.",
    ["ItemDes_10204241"]="A kit containing Bottle Grenades. Use it to obtain Bottle Grenade x100.",
