    ["ItemDes_10206001"]="A lure provided for beginner fishermen. It may not look like it has any special properties, but it's very durable.",
    ["ItemDes_10206002"]="Wet tentacles still covered with some water droplets. This cooking ingredient can be obtained from specific monsters or purchased from vend shops.",
    ["ItemDes_10206004"]="Hode skin, a favorite food of fishes.\nFishing bait. Used for fishing in Labyrinth Forest.",
    ["ItemDes_10206006"]="Magic bait that is only usable for one day. It has a mystical power that transforms fish into fish prints. This bait will automatically disappear once its magic loses its effectiveness.",
    ["ItemDes_10206007"]="A rare fishing bait. Just what exactly is it used for?",
    ["ItemDes_10206008"]="A mystical fishing rod that can automatically catch fish. It will be reduced to rubbish once its power is used up.",
    ["ItemDes_10206009"]="The fishing rod made of standard wood, so ordinary that it couldn't be more ordinary even if it tried. It's comfortable to hold, though.",
    ["ItemDes_10206010"]="A nutritious gray egg.\nFishing bait. Used for fishing in Aldebaran.",
    ["ItemDes_10206011"]="A fishy-smelling herb.\nFishing bait. Used for fishing in Aldebaran.",
    ["ItemDes_10206012"]="Metal spare parts that make a clanking noise.\nFishing bait. Used for fishing in Aldebaran.",
    ["ItemDes_10206013"]="A magical fishing rod enchanted by the magic of Gingerbread Man, suitable for cold regions, but it's fragile and easy to wear out due to its special treatment. Make sure you bring an extra rod.",
    ["ItemDes_10206014"]="Cost-effective fishing bait for ice fishing in the winter, appealing to smaller fish.",
    ["ItemDes_10206015"]="Rare fishing bait for ice fishing in the winter that is effective for catching bigger fish.",
    ["ItemDes_10206016"]="Luxurious fishing bait for ice fishing in the winter, those big fish are irresistible to red shrimp in this season.",
    ["ItemDes_10207001"]="A pickaxe used by novice miners. It's hard and durable.",
    ["ItemDes_10207002"]="An advanced pickaxe that is more comfortable and efficient. It can decrease time spent mining in the mines.",
    ["ItemDes_10207003"]="A special tool. This item will be automatically used when mining from rich veins, yielding tons of minerals.",
    ["ItemDes_10207004"]="Mining tool. A completely normal pickaxe. It's not a bad tool.\nA normal pickaxe that has never been used can be used as a smelting material to produce an Advanced Pickaxe.",
    ["ItemDes_10207005"]="Mining tool. A sturdy pickaxe suitable for mining more advanced ore veins.\nUsed to mine Lv.9 ore veins.",
    ["ItemDes_10207006"]="Mining tool. An advanced tungsten pickaxe with an increased mining speed.\nUsed to mine Lv.9 ore veins with a shortened mining time.",
    ["ItemDes_10207034"]="Obtained in the Ragna GP event. Exchanged for Ragna GP rewards at the Eden Group at Prontera South Gate.",
    ["ItemDes_1021"]="Use at the Headgear Vending Machine to take part in the Vending Machine Event!",
    ["ItemDes_10210001"]="The VIP Card is Kafra Corporation's way of providing adventurers with even more rewards! During its validity period, you can reselect your bonus once every 30 days and enjoy VIP Card top up cashback.",
    ["ItemDes_10210002"]="The Trial Card is Kafra Corporation's way of providing adventurers with even more rewards! \nActivate to enjoy Kafra's Trial Card for 7 days. You can choose 7 when you activate (cannot used with VIP Card).\nYou can choose privileges once during the 7 day validity. ",
    ["ItemDes_10210003"]="A membership identification that is issued by Kafra Corporation. Can be used to activate Kafra Plus: W's Prize for free.",
    ["ItemDes_10210004"]="A rare membership identification that is issued by Kafra Corporation. Can be used to activate Kafra Plus: Telling's Support for free. After activating the maid privilege, <color=#CA2E0AFF>Telling</color> Maid Ring becomes available for purchase in the Crystal Shop.",
    ["ItemDes_10210005"]="A premium membership identification that is issued by Kafra Corporation. Can be used to activate Kafra Plus: Clarice's Reply for free. After activating the advanced maid privilege,<color=#CA2E0AFF>Clarice</color> Advanced Maid Ring becomes available for purchase in the Crystal Shop.",
    ["ItemDes_10210006"]="A piece of meteor shard that can be used to unlock Season Pass.",
    ["ItemDes_10211001"]="A grade I Phracon that seems to radiate power from within.\nUpgrading material used to upgrade weapons from levels 21 through 60.",
    ["ItemDes_10211002"]="A grade II Phracon that seems to radiate power from within.\nUpgrading material used to upgrade weapons from levels 61 through 100.",
    ["ItemDes_10211003"]="A grade III Phracon that seems to radiate power from within.\nUpgrading material used to upgrade weapons from levels 101 through 140.",
    ["ItemDes_10211007"]="A grade I Carnium that seems to radiate power from within.\nUpgrading material used to upgrade armor from levels 11 through 30.",
    ["ItemDes_10211008"]="A grade II Carnium that seems to radiate power from within.\nUpgrading material used to upgrade armor from levels 31 through 50.",
    ["ItemDes_10211009"]="A grade III Carnium that seems to radiate power from within.\nUpgrading material used to upgrade armor from levels 51 through 70.",
    ["ItemDes_10211013"]="A grade I Bascyx that seems to radiate power from within.\nUpgrading material used to upgrade accessories from levels 6 through 15.",
    ["ItemDes_10211014"]="A grade II Bascyx that seems to radiate power from within.\nUpgrading material used to upgrade accessories from levels 16 through 25.",
    ["ItemDes_10211015"]="A grade III Bascyx that seems to radiate power from within.\nUpgrading material used to upgrade accessories from levels 26 through 35.",
