    ["ItemDes_10217001"]="A Cell Solution extracted from diseased monsters. Can be exchanged for event rewards with Jesse at Prontera South Gate.",
    ["ItemDes_10217002"]="Creature cells that have already begun to mutate. They have a strange luster about them. Can be exchanged for event rewards with Jesse at Prontera South Gate.",
    ["ItemDes_10217003"]="Black Powder dropped by diseased monsters. Can be exchanged for event rewards with Jesse at Prontera South Gate.",
    ["ItemDes_10217004"]="A contaminated animal heart that occasionally still beats. Can be exchanged for event rewards with Jesse at Prontera South Gate.",
    ["ItemDes_10217005"]="Halloween Revelry Party event exchange item. Can be exchanged for Halloween rewards with Jakk at Prontera.\nHas a chance of dropping from <color=#FF0000>Horongs/Familiars</color> during the Halloween Revelry Party.",
