    ["ItemDes_10217076"]="Halloween Carnival Party Exchange Item. Used to exchange for exclusive Halloween items with Jakk in Prontera\nChance of being dropped by <color=#FF0000>Evil Druid/ Wind Ghost</color> at the Halloween Party. Item cannot be kept after the event ends.",
    ["ItemDes_10217077"]="Halloween Carnival Party Exchange Item. Used to exchange for exclusive Halloween items with Jakk in Prontera\nChance of being dropped by <color=#FF0000>Verit/ Deviruchi</color> at the Halloween Party. Item cannot be kept after the event ends.",
    ["ItemDes_10217078"]="Halloween Carnival Party Exchange Item. Used to exchange for exclusive Halloween items with Jakk in Prontera\nChance of being dropped by <color=#FF0000>Khalitzburg/ Raydric Archer</color> at the Halloween Party. Item cannot be kept after the event ends.",
    ["ItemDes_10217079"]="Halloween Carnival Party Exchange Item. Used to exchange for exclusive Halloween items with Jakk in Prontera\nChance of being dropped by <color=#FF0000>Munak/ Baphomet Jr.</color> at the Halloween Party. Item cannot be kept after the event ends.",
