    ["ItemDes_10217092"]="A certificate of guarding the forest, which can be exchanged for Year of the Rabbit exclusive Mount Accessories.",
    ["ItemDes_10217093"]="Can be exchanged for Year of the Tiger exclusive Headgear.",
    ["ItemDes_10217094"]="A certificate of defeating the Nian, which can be exchanged for Year of the Rabbit exclusive Costume and Backpack.",
    ["ItemDes_10217095"]="Can be exchanged for Year of the Tiger exclusive Costume, Backpack, and Tail",
    ["ItemDes_10217096"]="A natural pink gemstone, carved by time into a delicate diamond shape, is rare to find even in major auction houses. It is the point item in the Valentine's Day event.",
    ["ItemDes_10217097"]="Made of mockingbirds’ feathers. When dipped in a special dye, its nib reacts with various types of ink to produce dark or light pink writing. It is the Event Token for the Valentine's Day event.",
    ["ItemDes_10217098"]="Golden hard particles with a luster that is as shining as real gold. Therefore, it is called “fake gold” by the nobility and is surprisingly popular among people. It’s the Exchange Item in the Valentine's Day event.",
    ["ItemDes_10217099"]="Growing at Lovebroke Cliff of the Payon Mountains, its flowers are bright and highly poisonous, and its fruits can be used as medicine. It’s the Exchange Item in the Valentine's Day event.",
    ["ItemDes_10217100"]="Clear and transparent crystals, which will turn pink when exposed to temperatures slightly above normal body temperature. Often used for implicit love confession. It’s the Exchange Item in the Valentine's Day event.",
    ["ItemDes_10217101"]="A special rock from a high latitude. It looks like a pink aurora and has the same composition as a meteorite. A Valentine's Day event point item.",
    ["ItemDes_10217102"]="This Quill is made from the feather of a pink swan. Fill stardust particles into its ink compartment to write words with the romance of the stars. A Valentine's Day event point item.",
    ["ItemDes_10217103"]="A particle formed when lightning particle clouds cool down. It falls only when the stars collide once every 10,000 years. A Valentine's Day event point item.",
    ["ItemDes_10217104"]="Investigation shows that this plant originally grows on the Valentine star that has exploded and disappeared 214 light-years away. After taking root on the moon, it is affected by the rotation period, undergoing asexual reproduction every 27.321 days. It is inedible. A Valentine's Day event point item.",
    ["ItemDes_10217105"]="A precious mineral found on the surface of a white dwarf star and formed out of high-density energy substances. Its hardness is about 131.4 times that of diamonds. A Valentine's Day event point item.",
    ["ItemDes_10217106"]="Be brave in the face of love and hatred! Let's go! Doritos!",
    ["ItemDes_10217107"]="The exchange token of the White Valentine's Day event. Flawless white paper crafts, each carrying a hazy sentiment.\n<color=#FF0000>It will be removed at the end of the event.</color>",
    ["ItemDes_10217108"]="The exchange token of the White Valentine's Day event. Its color is like the flushed face of a young girl. Some couples will write down a wish to grow old with their love.\n<color=#FF0000>It will be removed at the end of the event.</color>",
    ["ItemDes_10217110"]="Apex Rush event exchange item. Can be used to exchange for Apex Rush rewards at the Eden Group located at Prontera South Gate.",
    ["ItemDes_10217111"]="Item for the Songkran Festival. A soft and sweet cake, perfect for sharing with family and friends.",
    ["ItemDes_10217112"]="Item for the Songkran Festival. A kind of nourishing and oily skewer, which is extraordinarily tempting when sprinkled with secret seasoning for its aroma.",
    ["ItemDes_10217114"]="Item for the Songkran Festival. Iced orange soda, a must for vacation.",
    ["ItemDes_10217115"]="Item for the Songkran Festival. A salad made with a variety of fresh fruits that is delicious and not fattening.",
    ["ItemDes_10217116"]="Fuel needed for Island Tour.",
    ["ItemDes_10217117"]="Although it may look no different from the water used in general blessing ceremonies, you can feel the magical blessing it contains with just one touch.",
    ["ItemDes_10217118"]="Used during the day: Adds to buff.\nUsed at night: Select MVP & Mini to deal 0.5% damage to them, and give yourself a buff.\nCooldown: 60 mins",
    ["ItemDes_10217119"]="After use, you can plant a Moonlight Flag and obtain Drops of Moonlight by gathering the flags.\nEach person can gather up to three times daily.\nEach Flag can only be collected once by the same Adventurer.",
    ["ItemDes_10217120"]="Used to exchange for Sacred Moon Chant items (Exclusive event item of 2024 Sacred Moon Chant)",
    ["ItemDes_10217121"]="Used to exchange for Sacred Moon Chant items (Exclusive event item of 2024 Sacred Moon Chant)",
    ["ItemDes_10217122"]="Valuable medals that prove the valor and glory of The Chosen. Can be used to exchange for exclusive War of the Chosen rewards.",
    ["ItemDes_10217125"]="Materials containing strange Memory Fragments can be used to unlock character incidents in the Attacking Titans event.",
    ["ItemDes_10217126"]="A rare resource with amazing strength that can be exchanged for exclusive rewards with Eren Jaeger.\nExclusive rewards include one-time Costumes, Cards, Pets, and Mounts that will only be available during the event.",
    ["ItemDes_10217127"]="A precious resource with miraculous strength that can be exchanged for exclusive rewards with Eren Jaeger.\nExclusive rewards include one-time Costumes, Cards, Pets, and Mounts that will only be available during the event.",
    ["ItemDes_10217130"]="Use this to exchange for items in the Sky Shop.",
    ["ItemDes_10217131"]="The rich and delicious taste of fresh milk can't go wrong with a loaf of bread.",
    ["ItemDes_10217133"]="These ice cubes made from lemon-flavored soda look like sweet and sour crystals under the sun.",
    ["ItemDes_10217134"]="Nama chocolate is made from chocolate pulp, cream, and a variety of liquors.",
    ["ItemDes_10217135"]="Mikasa’s token, which can be exchanged for exclusive costume in Training Store",
    ["ItemDes_10217136"]="Levi’s token, which can be exchanged for exclusive costume in Training Store",
    ["ItemDes_10217137"]="A spell was cast on this iced soda to keep its cooling sensation even under a blazing sun.",
    ["ItemDes_10217138"]="A required fuel for the vehicle to run.",
    ["ItemDes_10217139"]="It's just a plain orange soda with some melted ice in it.",
    ["ItemDes_10217141"]="A cold light source without heat emission, expressing profound yet unspoken love.",
    ["ItemDes_10217142"]="An eye-catching and fragrant bouquet that symbolizes love and passion.",
    ["ItemDes_10217143"]="Grants permission to shake hands with idols for 10 seconds. Stackable.",
    ["ItemDes_10217144"]="Rumor says that you and your loved one will stay together forever if both names are written on them.",
    ["ItemDes_10217145"]="Capture and retain beautiful memories with this camera. Take good care of it!",
    ["ItemDes_10217146"]="Hard, ancient scales with cracks that mark the traces of time.\nCan be exchanged for rewards in the Explore Comodo event.",
    ["ItemDes_10217147"]="Weathered and eroded relics of stone shards that are painted with indistinct totems.\nCan be exchanged for rewards in the Explore Comodo event.",
    ["ItemDes_10217148"]="A coin that is imprinted with the avatar of Ultraman. Can be used to exchange limited items in the Store of Light.\nObtained by killing monsters while Odin's Blessing is activated and participating in Ultraman gameplay (World Quest, Monster Invasion, Treasury of Light, event-limited MVP/Mini).\nThis material will be recycled when the ULTRAMAN event is over.",
    ["ItemDes_10217149"]="A coin that is imprinted with the avatar of Ultraman Taro. Can be used to exchange limited items in the Store of Light.\nObtained by killing monsters while Odin's Blessing is activated and participating in Ultraman gameplay (World Quest, Treasury of Light, Monster Invasion, event-limited MVP/Mini).\nThis material will be recycled when the ULTRAMAN event is over.",
    ["ItemDes_10217150"]="A marvelous draw ticket that can be used in the Reward of Light event.\nThis material will be recycled when the ULTRAMAN event is over.",
    ["ItemDes_10217151"]="A seal that contains the Energy of Light. Can be used to exchange for rare limited items in the Store of Light.",
    ["ItemDes_10217157"]="Collect R, O, and X to claim mysterious rewards in The Original Love event. This item will be destroyed when the event ends.",
    ["ItemDes_10217158"]="Collect R, O, and X to claim mysterious rewards in The Original Love event. This item will be destroyed when the event ends.",
    ["ItemDes_10217159"]="Collect R, O, and X to claim mysterious rewards in The Original Love event. This item will be destroyed when the event ends.",
    ["ItemDes_10217160"]="Participate in Anniversary-related events to obtain Collection Vouchers. To claim event rewards, collect one each of the following four vouchers: R, O, X, 2. This item will be recollected at the end of the event.",
    ["ItemDes_10217162"]="A Halloween exchange item that can be exchanged for Halloween rewards with Jakk at Prontera.\nHas a chance of dropping in the <color=#872657>Hyakki Yagyō</color> and <color=#1EAEA4>Shadow Trail</color> events.",
    ["ItemDes_10217166"]="The pure Energy of Light. Can be used to increase the level of Treasury of Light.\nObtained by killing monsters while Odin's Blessing is activated and participating in Ultraman gameplay (World Quest, Monster Invasion, event-limited MVP/Mini).\nThis material will be recycled when the ULTRAMAN event is over.",
    ["ItemDes_10217167"]="A card that lights up the star! Let's rock the stage!​",
    ["ItemDes_10217168"]="You can claim mysterious rewards in the Becoming the Light of Next Generation event by collecting all the following items: Mysterious Glowing Object (Blue), Mysterious Glowing Object (Silver), Mysterious Glowing Object (Red), Mysterious Glowing Object (Gold), and The Power of Courage. All items will be destroyed when the event is over.",
    ["ItemDes_10217169"]="You can claim mysterious rewards in the Becoming the Light of Next Generation event by collecting all the following items: Mysterious Glowing Object (Blue), Mysterious Glowing Object (Silver), Mysterious Glowing Object (Red), Mysterious Glowing Object (Gold), and The Power of Courage. All items will be destroyed when the event is over.",
    ["ItemDes_10217170"]="You can claim mysterious rewards in the Becoming the Light of Next Generation event by collecting all the following items: Mysterious Glowing Object (Blue), Mysterious Glowing Object (Silver), Mysterious Glowing Object (Red), Mysterious Glowing Object (Gold), and The Power of Courage. All items will be destroyed when the event is over.",
    ["ItemDes_10217171"]="You can claim mysterious rewards in the Becoming the Light of Next Generation event by collecting all the following items: Mysterious Glowing Object (Blue), Mysterious Glowing Object (Silver), Mysterious Glowing Object (Red), Mysterious Glowing Object (Gold), and The Power of Courage. All items will be destroyed when the event is over.",
    ["ItemDes_10217172"]="You can claim mysterious rewards in the Becoming the Light of Next Generation event by collecting all the following items: Mysterious Glowing Object (Blue), Mysterious Glowing Object (Silver), Mysterious Glowing Object (Red), Mysterious Glowing Object (Gold), and The Power of Courage. All items will be destroyed when the event is over.",
    ["ItemDes_10217173"]="A Well-baked Cookie that looks simple and honest. The favorite of many residents in the fairy tale world. Can be used to exchange items in the Christmas Special Shop. Obtained from Christmas Draw Lucky Box, Toy Factory Quest, battles with MVP Garm, and Christmas Hide and Seek.",
    ["ItemDes_10217174"]="The straight textured finish and durable timber from far-off cold regions. Can be used for the repairing of a Sleigh. Obtained from Christmas Hide and Seek, Toy Factory Quest, and gift pack direct purchase.",
    ["ItemDes_10217175"]="An alloy that is tough and corrosion-resistant. Can be used for the repairing of a Sleigh. Obtained from battles with MVP Garm and gift pack direct purchase.",
    ["ItemDes_10217176"]="A unique-looking sewing needle. Looks like it serves other purposes as well.",
    ["ItemDes_10217186"]="Can be exchanged for Year of the Rabbit exclusive Headgear.",
    ["ItemDes_10217187"]="Can be exchanged for Year of the Rabbit exclusive Costumes and Backpacks.",
    ["ItemDes_10217188"]="An item obtained after selling your Ice Fishing catch. Use it at <color=#ff5d5d>Magic Gingerbread</color> to exchange for different items.",
    ["ItemDes_10217189"]="An item obtained after selling your big fish caught during Ice Fishing. Use it at <color=#ff5d5d>Magic Gingerbread</color> to exchange for different items.",
    ["ItemDes_10217190"]="Magic snowflakes during the Snow Festival; they won't melt, and they are not cold at all. Make a wish at <color=#ff5d5d>Magic Gingerbread</color> to exchange for different items.\n Making a wish costs 1 Fluffy Snowflake each time.",
    ["ItemDes_10217191"]="Mysterious yet splendid star shards.",
    ["ItemDes_10217192"]="Ancient cards that reveal your destiny.\nValentine's Day event item. Can be used to exchange rewards during the event.",
    ["ItemDes_10217193"]="Bird feather that is as dark as night.\nValentine's Day event item. Can be used to exchange rewards during the event.",
    ["ItemDes_10217194"]="Seeds that are infused with spiritual energy.\nValentine's Day event item. Can be used to exchange rewards during the event.",
    ["ItemDes_10217195"]="A bone fragment with a smooth surface engraved with divination sigils.\nValentine's Day event item. Can be used to exchange rewards during the event.",
    ["ItemDes_10217197"]="Dash in full speed! Can be used to participate in the Dashing Sweetheart event.",
    ["ItemDes_10217198"]="Apex Rush event exchange item. Can be used to exchange for Apex Rush rewards at the Eden Group located at Prontera South Gate.",
    ["ItemDes_10217199"]="Apex Rush event exchange item. Can be used to exchange for Apex Rush rewards at the Eden Group located at Prontera South Gate.",
    ["ItemDes_10217200"]="Obtained by completing the Instance Odyssey quests.",
    ["ItemDes_10217206"]="It's said this coupon came from the earlier Cat Hand Corp. Coin incident, handcrafted and handed out by 003. It was made to fill the emptiness of the past—those who receive it can relive that original spark of joy, and also give 003 a better excuse to fire those silly engineers.",
    ["ItemDes_10217207"]="A salty and delicious Seafood Onigiri made especially for the festive occasion.",
    ["ItemDes_10217208"]="A sweet and sour combination of frozen fruits and salad dressing. Refreshing and tasty.",
    ["ItemDes_10217214"]="Arcane ores in fiery red. Can be used to redeem items in the Season Store during the Frenzy Season.",
    ["ItemDes_10217215"]="Fresh napa cabbage is the perfect appetizer for drinking.",
    ["ItemDes_10217216"]="Purple onion with a special spicy taste.",
    ["ItemDes_10217217"]="A very sour fruit. People usually don't eat it directly.",
    ["ItemDes_10217218"]="Chewy lean beef with the perfect amount of fats.",
    ["ItemDes_10217219"]="Fresh and tender lamb with a unique gamy taste.",
    ["ItemDes_10217220"]="Delicious chicken. Can be cooked in various ways.",
    ["ItemDes_10217221"]="Squid that has been fine processed. Quality seafood.",
    ["ItemDes_10217222"]="Prawns freshly out of the sea. Gives you a soft and tender feeling in each bite.",
    ["ItemDes_10217223"]="Golden sparkling beer with a hint of wheat flavor.\nSlightly increases the character's blood alcohol content after drinking.\nNot for minors.",
    ["ItemDes_10217224"]="Aromatic red wine with a distinctive fragrance.\nModerately increases the character's blood alcohol content after drinking.\nNot for minors.",
    ["ItemDes_10217225"]="Strong hard liquor whiskey. A fine brew from overseas.\nSignificantly increases the character's blood alcohol content after drinking.\nNot for minors.",
    ["ItemDes_10217227"]="A necessity to become a legendary adventurer.\nThis item will be removed when the Demon Lord's Adventure Diary event is over.",
    ["ItemDes_10217228"]="A special coin carved with the Slime avatar.\nThis item will be removed when the Demon Lord's Adventure Diary event is over.",
    ["ItemDes_10217229"]="An ornament that is both wild and elegant.\nThis item will be removed when the Demon Lord's Adventure Diary event is over.",
    ["ItemDes_10217230"]="A transparent crystal.\nThis item will be removed when the Demon Lord's Adventure Diary event is over.",
    ["ItemDes_10217231"]="Seed of some high-yield crop.\nThis item will be removed when the Demon Lord's Adventure Diary event is over.",
    ["ItemDes_10217232"]="Mysterious puzzle pieces found in adventure. Collect a certain number of these to complete the set.\nThis item will be removed when the Demon Lord's Adventure Diary event is over.",
    ["ItemDes_10217233"]="Ancient puzzle pieces with faded color. More of these are presumable required to make up a complete set.\nThis item will be removed when the Demon Lord's Adventure Diary event is over.",
    ["ItemDes_10217234"]="Mushrooms in vivid colors. Maybe it can increase your poison resistance after eating them.\nThis item will be removed when the Demon Lord's Adventure Diary event is over.",
    ["ItemDes_10217235"]="A type of thorny vegetable that not even a monster wants to touch.\nThis item will be removed when the Demon Lord's Adventure Diary event is over.",
    ["ItemDes_10217236"]="These meat chunks still wriggle for some reason. It's said that they are necromancer's favorite.\nThis item will be removed when the Demon Lord's Adventure Diary event is over.",
    ["ItemDes_10217237"]="A kind of super bitter honey that tastes like cement.\nThis item will be removed when the Demon Lord's Adventure Diary event is over.",
    ["ItemDes_10217238"]="Fresh napa cabbage is the perfect appetizer for drinking.",
    ["ItemDes_10217239"]="A meatball made with minced meat wrapped around different fillings—juicy and springy.",
    ["ItemDes_10217240"]="A food with a tempting bean fragrance, so versatile it's nicknamed \"the hundred flavors.\"",
    ["ItemDes_10217241"]="Chewy lean beef with the perfect amount of fat.",
    ["ItemDes_10217242"]="Delicious chicken. Can be cooked in various ways.",
    ["ItemDes_10217243"]="Quality pork with exquisite taste.",
    ["ItemDes_10217244"]="A nutritious nut with a rich, pleasant flavor.",
    ["ItemDes_10217245"]="An edible seaweed with a unique ocean-fresh taste and texture.",
    ["ItemDes_10217246"]="Golden sparkling beer with a hint of wheat flavor.\nSlightly increases the character's blood alcohol content after drinking.\nNot for minors.",
    ["ItemDes_10217247"]="Aromatic red wine with a distinctive fragrance.\nModerately increases the character's blood alcohol content after drinking.\nNot for minors.",
    ["ItemDes_10217248"]="Strong hard liquor whiskey. A fine brew from overseas.\nSignificantly increases the character's blood alcohol content after drinking.\nNot for minors.",
    ["ItemDes_10217249"]="The proof of outstanding performance in the season league.",
    ["ItemDes_10217253"]="A bold declaration of justice and an introduction of the Heart Stealing.\nA point item of the Heart Stealing event. Can be obtained by completing event quests.",
    ["ItemDes_10217254"]="Its use depends on the owner's imagination. For example, a tool to leverage love.\nA point item of the Heart Stealing event. Can be used to exchange for rewards on the event page.",
    ["ItemDes_10217255"]="A professional tool that belongs to the phantom thief. Yet there are times it grabs nothing back.\nA point item of the Heart Stealing event. Can be used to exchange for rewards on the event page.",
    ["ItemDes_10217256"]="The flames this thing blasts liquefies metal. Perhaps it can kindle a loveless heart, too.\nA point item of the Heart Stealing event. Can be used to exchange for rewards on the event page.",
    ["ItemDes_10217257"]="It's going to splinter apart when the fuse burns out, so don't easily ignite the spark of love.\nA point item of the Heart Stealing event. Can be used to exchange for rewards on the event page.",
