    ["ItemDes_10217433"]="Upon use, it will randomly appear at one of the following locations: Bridge to Prontera Palace, Izlude's Garden Plaza, Alberta's Seaside Market, Geffen's Fountain Square, Morroc's Main City, Payon's Bright Lotus Pond, Glast Heim's Quiet Garden, Al De Baran's Clock Tower, Comodo's Dockyard Market, Umbala's Central Tree House, Juno's Sage Plaza, Einbroch's Central Plaza, Rachel's Holy Spring. Reach the destination through auto-path; then tap it to receive exclusive rare rewards.",
    ["ItemDes_10217439"]="An exchange material of the \"Secrets of the Institute\" event. Can be used to exchange items in the event store.",
    ["ItemDes_10217440"]="An exchange material of the \"Secrets of the Institute\" event. Can be used to exchange items in the event store.",
    ["ItemDes_10217441"]="Earned while purifying Mt. Soukai, can be exchanged in the collaboration shop.",
    ["ItemDes_10217443"]="An exchange item for the Frostbound Exploration 2025 event that can be used to redeem items in the Exchange Shop.",
    ["ItemDes_10217444"]="An exchange item for the Frostbound Exploration 2025 event that can be used to redeem items in the Exchange Shop.",
    ["ItemDes_10217445"]="Required materials for repairing the sleigh in the Frostbound Exploration 2025 event.",
    ["ItemDes_10217447"]="An exchange material for the Painted Spring event. Can be used to exchange items in the Exchange Shop.",
    ["ItemDes_10217448"]="An exchange material for the Painted Spring event. Can be used to exchange items in the Exchange Shop.",
    ["ItemDes_10218001"]="Complete the return quests or party up with bonus players. Bonus players can obtain Novice Coins by challenging instances, consuming MVP/MINI reward times and Odin’s Blessings. Use this currency to exchange items in the Memory Store.",
    ["ItemDes_10218002"]="Astrology Points can be accumulated by completing quests in the Journey of Star Chaser event. Collect Astrology Points to receive the corresponding rewards.",
    ["ItemDes_10218004"]="A coin with an intricate design. Can be used to exchange for items in the Costume Store.",
    ["ItemDes_10218005"]="The currency symbolizes the Guild's enlightenment. Can be used to purchase Guild Pass Enlightenment Rewards.",
    ["ItemDes_10218006"]="Used to increase the level of Return Pass.",
    ["ItemDes_10218007"]="Used to make a wish in the Six-month Celebration.",
    ["ItemDes_10218008"]="Use this to exchange for items in the Crescent-Aria Shop. (2023 Dragon Boat Rally event item)",
    ["ItemDes_10218009"]="Use this to exchange for items in the Crescent-Aria Shop. (2023 Dragon Boat Rally event item)",
    ["ItemDes_10218013"]="One-Punch Man Collaboration Item: Can be used at the Collaboration Vending Machine during the event.\n The system will remove it when the event is over. Please use it promptly!",
    ["ItemDes_10218014"]="One-Punch Man Collaboration Item: Can be used at the Exchange Shop during the event.\n The system will remove it when the event is over. Please use it promptly!",
    ["ItemDes_10218015"]="One-Punch Man Collaboration Item: Can be used in the Disaster Extermination event.\n The system will remove it when the event is over. Please use it promptly!",
    ["ItemDes_10218016"]="One-Punch Man Collaboration Item: An EXP item for the collaboration event pass.\n The system will remove it when the event is over. Please use it promptly!",
    ["ItemDes_10218017"]="Currency used for purchasing furniture and upgrading Home.",
    ["ItemDes_10218018"]="A coin bearing Odin's insignia that can be used to ascend Odin Equipment.",
    ["ItemDes_10218019"]="Special currency to be used in the ROXIC for strength improvement.",
    ["ItemDes_10218020"]="Exclusive points for Hyper Players. Earned by completing quests and can be used to exchange rewards.",
    ["ItemDes_10218021"]="An exclusive token for the Larve event, which can be used to exchange items in the event store.",
    ["ItemDes_10218022"]="An Exclusive item for the Sausage Battle event, which can be used to feed Yellow or Red at Prontera/Prontera South Gate.",
    ["ItemDes_10218023"]="Exclusive points for the Spring Thanks Event in the Spring Festival. Earned by completing quests and can be used to exchange rewards.",
    ["ItemDes_10218024"]="A coin symbolizes the spirit of courage and valor, which can be used in the Warrior Exchange Shop for items.\nObtained in the Infinite Showdown Ranked Match.",
    ["ItemDes_10218026"]="Fist of the North Star Collaboration Item: An EXP item for the collaboration event pass.\nThe system will remove it when the event is over. Please use it promptly!",
    ["ItemDes_10218027"]="Fist of the North Star Collaboration Item: Can be used at the Collaboration Vending Machine during the event.\nThe system will remove it when the event is over. Please use it promptly!",
    ["ItemDes_10218028"]="Fist of the North Star Collaboration Item: Can be used at the Jigsaw Puzzle Piece during the event.\nHow to obtain: Courage Hymn, MVP kills, and collaboration gift packs.\n\nThe system will remove it when the event is over. Please use it promptly!",
    ["ItemDes_10218029"]="Fist of the North Star Collaboration Item: Obtained by participating in the Worthy Component event daily.\nOpen for a chance to obtain: Collab Card Sel. Packs or other rewards.\nPlease tap Preview to learn more.",
    ["ItemDes_10218030"]="Can be used in the betting of the ROX Fair Play Championship and in exchange for event items.",
    ["ItemDes_10218031"]="Exclusive coins for the championship. Can be used to purchase exclusive equipment, cards, and other items for various cultivations.",
    ["ItemDes_10218032"]="Once you have enough, you can use them to exchange for rewards in the Growth Support gameplay.",
    ["ItemDes_10218034"]="Exclusive coins for the championship. Can be used to purchase exclusive consumable items.",
    ["ItemDes_10218035"]="Exclusive coins for the championship. Can be used to purchase exclusive buffs.",
    ["ItemDes_10218036"]="Guild reward given to warriors. Can be used to purchase items at the Guild Store.",
    ["ItemDes_10218037"]="You can access the custom list to submit this order and receive rich rewards after completing it.",
    ["ItemDes_10218039"]="An exquisite Re:ZERO token. Can be used at the Capital Fair.",
    ["ItemDes_10218040"]="An exquisite Re:ZERO token. Can be used at the Capital Fair.",
    ["ItemDes_10218041"]="An exquisite Re:ZERO gacha coin. Can be used at the Otto Gacha Lucky Draw.",
    ["ItemDes_10218042"]="The pass EXP of Re:ZERO - Gift from Another World.",
    ["ItemDes_10218043"]="An exquisite Re:ZERO draw token. Can be used to open the door in Find Beatrice's Door.",
    ["ItemDes_10218044"]="Advanced guild reward given to warriors. Can be used to purchase items at the Guild Store.",
    ["ItemDes_10218045"]="Can be used in Fat Tiger's Adventure Treasure Pool. Each Fortune Ticket gives you 1 draw chance.",
    ["ItemDes_10218047"]="This shiny gold chip flips through your fingers—will luck be on your side this time?\nCan be used in the Lightning Wheel event.",
    ["ItemDes_10218048"]="Dash, dash, and dash again! Nothing can stop you now!\nCan be used in the Valor Workshop.",
    ["ItemDes_10218049"]="This shiny badge is granted only to the boldest sailor!\nCan be used in the Valor Workshop.",
    ["ItemDes_10218050"]="A proof you've crossed every mountain and ocean.",
    ["ItemDes_10218051"]="An exquisite Companion gacha coin. Can be used at the Companion Gacha Lucky Draw.",
    ["ItemDes_10218052"]="Dash, dash, and dash again! The banner of victory is waiting to be claimed!\nCan be used in the Valor Workshop.",
    ["ItemDes_10218055"]="Digital Monster Collaboration Gacha Coin: Can be used to draw rewards from the Adventure Treasury.\nThe system will remove it when the event is over. Please use it promptly!\n ",
    ["ItemDes_10218056"]="A portable data drive with Digimon info—plug it into the terminal and use it in the Digimon Vault to draw rewards.",
    ["ItemDes_10218057"]="Digital Monster Collaboration Item: Pass EXP item for the collaboration event.",
    ["ItemDes_10218061"]="Gacha Coins that all Adventures love. Can be used in the Adventurer's Diary event to draw rewards.",
    ["ItemDes_10218062"]="Mashin Hero Wataru Collaboration Gacha Coin: Can be used to draw rewards from the Demon Realm Treasure.\nThe system will remove it when the event is over. Please use it promptly!",
    ["ItemDes_10218063"]="Mashin Hero Wataru Collaboration Item: An EXP item for the collaboration event pass.\nThe system will remove it when the event is over. Please use it promptly!",
    ["ItemDes_10218064"]="Mashin Hero Wataru Collaboration Item: Can be used in the Mashin Call event.\nThe system will remove it when the event is over. Please use it promptly!",
    ["ItemDes_10218065"]="Currency used to exchange for Heart Pedestal equipment.",
    ["ItemDes_10218069"]="Mashin Hero Wataru Collaboration Item: Can be used in the Treasure Clash event.\nThe system will remove it when the event is over. Please use it promptly!",
    ["ItemDes_10218070"]="Mashin Hero Wataru Collaboration Item: Can be used in the Mashin Trial event to refresh the options.\nThe system will remove it when the event is over. Please use it promptly!",
    ["ItemDes_10218071"]="A lucky coin filled with blessings! Use it to draw premium cultivation materials!\nCan be used in the Good Tidings event!\nCoins will be reclaimed after the event, so please spend them in time.",
    ["ItemDes_10218079"]="A Fortune Hammer for use in the Painted Spring: Golden Steed Blessings event.",
    ["ItemDes_10218085"]="Unlocks Battle Achievement quests (except for Orders Coming In).\nCan be purchased from the Crystal Shop every week.",
    ["ItemDes_10219001"]="Use to obtain Mount: Steampunk Heli",
    ["ItemDes_10219002"]="Open to select one of the Shadow Equipment Materials",
    ["ItemDes_10219003"]="Open to select one of the Shadow Equipment Materials",
    ["ItemDes_10219004"]="Open to select one of the Shadow Equipment Materials",
    ["ItemDes_10219005"]="A precious chest from Nightmare Mode. Requires a Magic Box Key to open.",
    ["ItemDes_10219006"]="A reward for helping out new Adventurers. Awarded for helping low-level Adventurers clear instances. Only drops a maximum of 10 times a day in an instance.",
    ["ItemDes_10219007"]="Open to get 10,000 Zeny.",
    ["ItemDes_10219008"]="A collection of all the world's delicacies. Open to obtain a total of 54 kinds of food.",
    ["ItemDes_10219009"]="Open to obtain the Biohazard Set. Includes Biohazard Mask, Biohazard Suit, and Biohazard Detector.",
    ["ItemDes_10219010"]="Open to obtain the Fluffy Cat Set. Includes Fluffy Cat Ears, Fluffy Cat Outfit, Fluffy Cat Backpack, and Fluffy Cat Tail.",
    ["ItemDes_10219011"]="Use to obtain Mount: Plai Ngam Elephant (30 Days).",
    ["ItemDes_10219012"]="Use to obtain Mount: Panda Eiffel (30 days).",
    ["ItemDes_10219013"]="Use to obtain Mount: Whirlwind Skateboard (7 days)",
    ["ItemDes_10219015"]="Use to obtain Mount: Rubber Duckie.",
    ["ItemDes_10219016"]="A book containing immense power. Open to select one of the following cards:\nVocal Card, Dagger-wielding Skel Pirate Card, Yoyo Card\nRoda Frog Card, Skeleton Worker Card, Pirate Skeleton Card\nSavage Card, Hunter Fly Card, Muka Card\nDustiness Card, Argos Card, Mantis Card\nMyst Card, Metaller Card, Stainer Card\nWhisper Card, Flora Card, Coco Card\nZombie Card, Caramel Card, Dead Plankton Card\nAxe-wielding Skel Pirate Card, Hydra Card, Martin Card\nPecopeco Card, Smokie Card, Giearth Card\nHorn Card, Kukre Card, Anacondaq Card",
    ["ItemDes_10219017"]="Enchant equipment to enhance combat ability. Open to select one of the following enchantment materials:\nGloomy Enchantment Stone x4, Petrifying Enchantment Stone x4\nSilverspirit Enchantment Stone x4, Cold Enchantment Stone x2\nPraying Enchantment Stone x2, Rosecrystal Enchantment Stone x2\nLost Spirit Enchantment Stone x1, Illumination Enchantment Stone x1\nSteel Dust Enchantment Stone x1",
    ["ItemDes_10219019"]="Use to obtain Mount: Plai Kaew Elephant",
    ["ItemDes_10219020"]="Use to obtain Mount: Ragnacycle",
    ["ItemDes_10219021"]="Use to obtain Mount: Blazing Adventure.",
    ["ItemDes_10219022"]="Use to obtain Mount: Hamster (30 Days).",
    ["ItemDes_10219023"]="Open to get Rice Dumpling x4, Perfume Sachet x4, Paper Gourd x2, and Colorful Rope x1. Removed when the event ends and converted into a certain number of Adventurer's Salad.",
    ["ItemDes_10219024"]="You can choose one of following: MVP Coins, Mini Coins or Valkyrie Coins.",
    ["ItemDes_10219026"]="Use to obtain Mount: Heat Wave Breeze Beach Chair",
    ["ItemDes_10219027"]="A mysterious gift pack containing Rainbow Carrot, Unripe Apple, Morning Dew, Livestock Gore, Old Broom, and Worn Bronze Armor. Use to select and obtain one of the items.",
    ["ItemDes_10219028"]="A mysterious gift pack containing Rainbow Carrot, Juicy Grape, Unripe Apple, Morning Dew, Livestock Gore, Armlet of Obedience, Worn Bronze Armor, and Discarded Coin. Use to select and obtain one of the items.",
    ["ItemDes_10219029"]="A bountiful gift pack that contains Earth Spirit Stone I, Fire Spirit Stone I,\nWater Spirit Stone I, Wind Spirit Stone I,\nNeutral Spirit Stone I, Shadow Spirit Stone I,\nUndead Spirit Stone I, Natural Scale I,\nDerelict Spirit Scale I, and Pet Advancement Pill I. Use to select and obtain one of the items.",
    ["ItemDes_10219030"]="A precious gift pack that contains Earth Skill Sheet, Fire Skill Sheet,\nWater Skill Sheet I, Wind Skill Sheet I,\nNeutral Skill Sheet I, Shadow Skill Sheet I, and Undead Skill Sheet I. Use to select and obtain one of the items.",
    ["ItemDes_10219031"]="Use to obtain Mount: Baby Whale.",
    ["ItemDes_10219032"]="Open a Mysterious Pet Box\nTo randomly obtain 6-60 Pet Coins.\nAnd a chance of obtaining pet taming or cultivation items.\n<color=#CA2E0AFF>What's more, you'll have a small chance to obtain the Cage of Phreeoni, Moonlight Flower, Drake, Strouf, or Pharaoh.</color>\n<color=#CA2E0AFF>Please refer to the preview for more information.</color>\n\n<color=#CA2E0AFF>This is a potentially winnable item. Making a purchase or participating in the event does not guarantee you will obtain certain items.</color>\n",
    ["ItemDes_10219033"]="Open to select one of the following refining materials:\n3 Enriched Elunium,\n3 Enriched Oridecon,\n3 Enriched Bradium,\n1 HD Elunium,\n1 HD Oridecon,\n1 HD Bradium,\n3 Blessed Oridecon I,\n3 Blessed Elunium I,\n3 Blessed Bradium I,\n1 Blessed Oridecon II,\n1 Blessed Elunium II,\n1 Blessed Bradium II.",
    ["ItemDes_10219034"]="Open to select one of the following upgrading materials:\nPhracon I x8,,\nCarnium I x8,\nBascyx I x8,\nPhracon II x4,\nCarnium II x4,\nBascyx II x4,\nPhracon III x2,\nCarnium III x2,\nBascyx III x2,\nPhracon IV x1,\nCarnium IV x1,\nBascyx IV x1.",
    ["ItemDes_10219035"]="Open to select one of the following enchantment materials:\nShattering Shroom x10, Tough Vine x10,\nArcane Flower x10, Goldflower x10,\nScorched Mushroom x10, Withered Chastetree x10,\nWater Seeking Flower x10, Sea Gem Grass x10,\nFirefly Grass x10, Grim Grass x10,\nOchre Seedling x10, Quiet Flower x10,\nMoonflower x10, Praying Flower x10,\nCrystal Rose x10, Resurrection Leaf x10,\nRadiance Flower x10, Coldsteel Orchid x10",
    ["ItemDes_10219036"]="Open to select one of the following upgrading materials:\nShell 10 pcs,\nTurquoise 10 pcs,\nCobblestone 10 pcs,\nVulcanfish 10 pcs,\nHardshell Crab 10 pcs,\nEmberfish 10 pcs,\nButterfly Cowrie 10 pcs,\nWhitefeather Cowrie 10 pcs,\nMystic Mussel 10 pcs,\nSaury 10 pcs,\nHunter Fish 10 pcs,\nCrystal Stickleback 10 pcs.",
    ["ItemDes_10219037"]="Open to select one of the following refining materials:\nStarlight Snail 8 pcs,\nGlowfish 8 pcs,\nNight Pearl 8 pcs,\nYarn Marina 8 pcs,\nSandfish 8 pcs,\nMaple Leaf Fish 8 pcs,\nGhostfish 8 pcs,\nDevilfish 8 pcs,\nClearwater Pearl 8 pcs,\nTwilight Fish 8 pcs,\nArmor Crab 8 pcs,\nPupa Sulcata 8 pcs.",
    ["ItemDes_10219038"]="Open to select one of the following cooking ingredients:\nMeat n' Pumpkin I x5, Healthy Meal I x5\nMandragora Prawns I x5, Nutritious Frog Meat I x5\nSteamed Egg n' Fish I x5, Fruity Squid I x5\nSpicy Fried Bug Leg I x5, Mixed Congee I x5\nFish Soup with Frog Legs I x5, Fish Fillet I x5\nFly Leg Folk Remedy I x5, Bug Leg Salad I x5\nRat-on-a-Stick I x5, Fresh Snake I x5\nPrawn-on-a-Stick I x5, Delicious Prawns I x5\nCrispy Fish I x5, Aquatic Salad I x5\n",
    ["ItemDes_10219039"]="Open to select one of the following cooking ingredients:\nSmooth Clam Flesh I x5, Cold Jellyfish with Sauce I x5\nBraised Bear Paw I x5, Sour Conch I x5\nFish n' Crab I x5, Bitter Fish I x5\nAncient Balm I x5, Braised Meat n' Kelp I x5\nGrilled Steak I x5, Fried Eggs with Squid I x5\nFish Stew I x5, Tuna Sashimi I x5\nFragrant Meat I x5, Stir-fried Tongue I x5\nFresh Pufferfish I x5, Fragrant Arowana Fillet I x5\nSashimi Platter I x5, Carp Bento I x5",
    ["ItemDes_10219040"]="Open to select one of the following cooking ingredients:\nMarinated Skewers I x5, Fruit Dessert I x5\nMinty Grill I x5, Grilled Clams I x5\nSalt-baked Trout I x5, Marinated Eel I x5\nFruit Tea I x5, Refreshing Grill I x5\nShredded Fish Rice Ball I x5, Mysterious Canned Fish I x5\nSmoked Dragon Meat I x5, Spicy Fried Loach I x5\nMarinated Beef I x5, Rose Chocolate I x5\nCreamy Meat Stew I x5, Roasted Frog I x5\nShrimp Ball I x5, Juicy Oyster I x5",
    ["ItemDes_10219041"]="Open to select one of the following cooking ingredients:\nMeat n' Pumpkin II x5, Healthy Meal II x5\nAquatic Salad II x5, Mandragora Prawns II x5\nNutritious Frog Meat II x5, Steamed Egg n' Fish II x5\nFruity Squid II x5, Spicy Fried Bug Leg II x5\nMixed Congee II x5, Fish Soup with Frog Legs II x5\nFish Fillet II x5, Fly Leg Folk Remedy II x5\nBug Leg Salad II x5, Rat-on-a-Stick II x5\nFresh Snake II x5, Prawn-on-a-Stick II x5\nDelicious Prawns II x5, Crispy Fish II x5",
    ["ItemDes_10219042"]="Open to select one of the following cooking ingredients:\nSmooth Clam Flesh II x5, Cold Jellyfish with Sauce II x5\nBraised Bear Paw II x5, Sour Conch II x5\nFish n' Crab II x5, Bitter Fish II x5\nAncient Balm II x5, Braised Meat n' Kelp II x5\nGrilled Steak II x5, Fried Eggs with Squid II x5\nFish Stew II x5, Tuna Sashimi II x5\nFragrant Meat II x5, Stir-fried Tongue II x5\nFresh Pufferfish II x5, Fragrant Arowana Fillet II x5\nSashimi Platter II x5, Carp Bento II x5",
    ["ItemDes_10219043"]="Open to select one of the following cooking ingredients:\nMarinated Skewers II x5, Fruit Dessert II x5\nMinty Grill II x5, Grilled Clams II x5\nSalt-baked Trout II x5, Marinated Eel II x5\nFruit Tea II x5, Refreshing Grill II x5\nShredded Fish Rice Ball II x5, Mysterious Canned Fish II x5\nSmoked Dragon Meat II x5, Spicy Fried Loach II x5\nMarinated Beef II x5, Rose Chocolate II x5\nCreamy Meat Stew II x5, Roasted Frog II x5\nShrimp Ball II x5, Juicy Oyster II x5",
    ["ItemDes_10219044"]="Open to select one of the following blueprints:\nSahkkat Blueprint, Criatura Academy Hat Blueprint, Fisherman Hat Blueprint, Feather Bonnet Blueprint, Blood Rose Blueprint, Bandit Beard Blueprint, Angry Snarl Blueprint, Bubble Gum in Mouth Blueprint, Glasses Blueprint, Dark Blindfold Blueprint, Red Glasses Blueprint, Mini Glasses Blueprint, Feeler Blueprint, Starry Headband Blueprint, Flower Hairpin Blueprint, Heart Hairpin Blueprint, Big Ribbon Blueprint, Circlet Blueprint, Mini Propeller Hair Band Blueprint, Diadem Blueprint, Clown Nose Blueprint, Goblin Mask Blueprint, Whisper Mask Blueprint, Kitsune Mask Blueprint, Honeybee Hat Blueprint, Sheep Hat Blueprint, Poo Poo Hat Blueprint, Smokie Hat Blueprint",
    ["ItemDes_10219045"]="Open to select one of the following blueprints:\nBeret Blueprint, Ph.D Hat Blueprint, Onigiri Hat Blueprint, Pirate Bandana Blueprint, Spiked Mask Blueprint, Metal Mask Blueprint, Welding Mask Blueprint, Samurai Mask Blueprint, Angled Glasses Blueprint, Geek Glasses Blueprint, Luxury Sunglasses Blueprint, Cyclop's Eye Guard Blueprint, Shot Apple Blueprint, Cat Paw Hairpin Blueprint, Crescent Hairpin Blueprint, Bao Bao Blueprint, Sinulog Hat Blueprint, Gemmed Sallet Blueprint, Helm Blueprint, Close Helmet Blueprint, Opera Masque Blueprint, Ball Mask Blueprint, Opera Phantom Mask Blueprint, Masquerade Blueprint, Sea Otter Hat Blueprint, Teddybear Hat Blueprint, Munak Turban Blueprint, Bongun Hat Blueprint",
    ["ItemDes_10219046"]="Open to obtain [Pet] Unripe Apple x4, [Pet] Rainbow Carrot x4, [Pet] Morning Dew x2, and [Pet] Juicy Grape x1. Will be destroyed at the end of the event and returned to Adventurer's in part as Salad.",
    ["ItemDes_10219047"]="Grab a SEA Batik Backpack Selection Pack! Once opened, you can choose one of the following backpacks: Tropical Backpack, Batik Backpack or Lanna Backpack",
    ["ItemDes_10219048"]="Open to obtain one of the following items at random:\n Advanced Pickaxe, Automatic Fishing Rod, Red Rose, Lollipop, Lucky Origami Crane, Meat n' Pumpkin I, Healthy Meal I, Aquatic Salad I, Mandragora Prawns I, Nutritious Frog Meat I, Steamed Egg n' Fish I",
    ["ItemDes_10219049"]="Use to obtain Mount: Black Lightning",
    ["ItemDes_10219050"]="Open to select one of the Shadow Equipment Materials",
    ["ItemDes_10219051"]="Open to select one of the following Shadow Equipment Skill Materials:\nValidation I x6\nSoul I x4\nContract I x3",
    ["ItemDes_10219052"]="Use to obtain Mount: Rubber Duckie (3 Days).",
    ["ItemDes_10219053"]="Lets you select 1 Valkyrie Coin, Endless Coin, or Pet Coin.",
    ["ItemDes_10219054"]="Lets you select 1 accessory from the gift box's contents.",
    ["ItemDes_10219055"]="Lets you select 1 accessory from the gift box's contents.",
    ["ItemDes_10219056"]="Open a Mysterious Pet Box\nTo obtain 6-60 Pet Coins at random\nAnd a chance of obtaining Pet Advancement Pill I, Pet Mousse, Persimmon Dewdrop, Dark Ink, Strange Cloth, Livestock Gore, Worn Bronze Armor, Mimic Scroll, Juicy Grape, and Smiling Pumpkin.\nWhat’s more, you’ll have <color=#CA2E0AFF>a chance to claim the Moonlight Flower Pet Cage!</color> \n\n<color=#CA2E0AFF>This is a potentially winnable item. Making a purchase or participating in the event does not guarantee you will obtain certain items.</color>",
    ["ItemDes_10219057"]="Open to randomly get one of following pet transmog unlocking items: Deviruchi Wing, Colorful Glasses, Bio Mask, Inferno Helm, Gold Hoop, Miner’s Backpack, Hip Hop Necklace, Butterfly Mask, Poring Backpack, Bow Tie, Gentleman's Glasses, Windproof Glasses, and Diving Helm.",
    ["ItemDes_10219058"]="Use to obtain Mount: Ranga.",
    ["ItemDes_10219059"]="Use to obtain Mount: Cloud Nine.",
