    ["ItemDes_10219061"]="Ultimate Hunter Showdown Select Gift Pack. Open to select and obtain one of the following Shadow Equipment Materials:\nOption A: Bound I x3\nOption B: Engraved I x2",
    ["ItemDes_10219062"]="Ultimate Hunter Showdown Select Gift Pack. Open to select and obtain one of the following Shadow Equipment Materials:\nOption A: Validation I x2\nOption B: Contract I x1",
