    ["ItemDes_10219076"]="Release it by the fountain of Prontera to get a random reward. There's a chance to get the Mid-Autumn-limited \"Fairy Rabbit\" Pet. Will be converted into a certain number of Adventurer's Salad when the event ends.",
    ["ItemDes_10219077"]="Release it by the fountain of Prontera to get a random reward, equivalent to releasing 10 Normal Lanterns. There's a chance to get the Mid-Autumn-limited \"Fairy Rabbit\" Pet. Will be converted into a certain number of Adventurer's Salad when the event ends.",
