    ["ItemDes_10219144"]="A mysterious gift pack containing Rainbow Carrot, Unripe Apple, Morning Dew, Livestock Gore, Worn Bronze Armor, Dark Ink, and Strange Cloth. Use to select and obtain one of the items.",
    ["ItemDes_10219145"]="A precious gift pack that contains Earth Skill Sheet I, Fire Skill Sheet I, Water Skill Sheet I, Wind Skill Sheet I, Neutral Skill Sheet I, Shadow Skill Sheet I, Undead Skill Sheet I, Poison Skill Sheet I, Ghost Skill Sheet I, and Holy Skill Sheet I. Use to select and obtain one of the items.",
    ["ItemDes_10219146"]="A bountiful gift pack that contains Earth Spirit Stone I, Fire Spirit Stone I, Water Spirit Stone I, Wind Spirit Stone I, Neutral Spirit Stone I, Shadow Spirit Stone I, Undead Spirit Stone I, Poison Spirit Stone I, Ghost Spirit Stone I, Holy Spirit Stone I, Natural Scale I, Derelict Spirit Scale I, Departed Soul Scale I, Silent Destiny Scale I, and Pet Advancement Pill I. Use to select and obtain one of the items.",
    ["ItemDes_10219147"]="Get Turboriders upon use",
    ["ItemDes_10219148"]="Use to obtain Mount: Jingle Bell (14d).",
    ["ItemDes_10219149"]="Use to obtain Mount: Rubber Duckie (15 Days).",
    ["ItemDes_10219150"]="Use to obtain Mount: Hamster (15 Days).",
    ["ItemDes_10219151"]="Use to obtain Mount: Jingle Bell (3 Days).",
    ["ItemDes_10219152"]="Exclusive reward for the Champions of the War of the Chosen. Open to get 100 Odin's Blessings.",
    ["ItemDes_10219153"]="Use to obtain Mount: Sleipnir",
    ["ItemDes_10219154"]="Open to randomly receive a guaranteed part of New Year Return Accessories and a large number of Crystals. There is even a chance to get the precious mount: Treasure Tiger or a random Spring Festival-exclusive Class Mount Accessory.",
    ["ItemDes_10219155"]="Lucky Trove. Open to randomly obtain a random Equipment Upgrading Metal, Refining Material, or Enchantment Material.\nThere is also a small chance to obtain Spring Festival exclusive Mount: Year of the Tiger Mount (Non-bound item).",
    ["ItemDes_10219156"]="Exclusive New Year Gift Box for the Year of Tiger. Open to randomly obtain 8,888/88,888/888,888 Zeny, and a random Spring Festival event item (Fireworks/Firecrackers/Spring Festival Cooking/Forest Companion Badges).",
    ["ItemDes_10219157"]="Use to obtain Mount: Space Visitor.",
    ["ItemDes_10219158"]="Use to obtain Mount: Steampunk Heli (30 Days)",
    ["ItemDes_10219159"]="Use to obtain Mount: Steampunk Heli (7 Days)",
    ["ItemDes_10219160"]="Use to obtain Mount: Black Lightning (7 Days)",
    ["ItemDes_10219161"]="Open to select one of the following Upgrading Materials: \nPhracon I x16, \nCarnium I x16, \nBascyx I x16, \nPhracon II x8, \nCarnium II x8, \nBascyx II x8, \nPhracon III x4, \nCarnium III x4, \nBascyx III x4, \nPhracon Ⅳ x2, \nCarnium Ⅳ x2, \nBascyx Ⅳ x2.",
    ["ItemDes_10219162"]="Open to select one of the following Enchantment materials:\nSharpening Enchantment Stone x32, Toughening Enchantment Stone x32,\nSecret Enchantment Stone x32, Blazing Enchantment Stone x16,\nHardening Enchantment Stone x16, Gold Enchantment Stone x16,\nTidal Current Enchantment Stone x8, Crystallize Enchantment Stone x8,\nGlowing Star Enchantment Stone x8, Gloomy Enchantment Stone x4,\nPetrifying Enchantment Stone x4, Silverspirit Enchantment Stone x4,\nCold Enchantment Stone x2, Praying Enchantment Stone x2,\nRosecrystal Enchantment Stone x2, Lost Spirit Enchantment Stone x1,\nIllumination Enchantment Stone x1, Steel Dust Enchantment Stone x1.\n",
    ["ItemDes_10219163"]="Open to select one of the following Refining Materials:\nElunium x36,\nOridecon x36,\nBradium x36,\nEnriched Elunium x12,\nEnriched Oridecon x12,\nEnriched Bradium x12,\nHD Elunium x4,\nHD Oridecon x4,\nHD Bradium x4.",
    ["ItemDes_10219164"]="Open to select one of the Shadow Equipment Materials",
    ["ItemDes_10219165"]="Ultimate Hunter Showdown Select Gift Pack. Open to select and obtain one of the following Shadow Equipment Materials:\nInscription I x32, Inscription II x16,\nInscription III x8, Pioneer I x16,\nPioneer II x8, Pioneer III x4",
    ["ItemDes_10219166"]="Ultimate Hunter Showdown Select Gift Pack. Open to select and obtain one of the following Shadow Equipment Materials:\nBound I x12, Bound II x6,\nBound III x3, Engraved I x8,\nEngraved II x4, Engraved III x2",
    ["ItemDes_10219167"]="Ultimate Hunter Showdown Select Gift Pack. Open to select and obtain one of the following Shadow Equipment Materials:\nValidation I x8, Validation II x4,\nValidation III x2, Contract I x4,\nContract II x2, Contract III x1",
    ["ItemDes_10219168"]="Use to obtain Mount: Flying Dragon.",
    ["ItemDes_10219169"]="Open a Mysterious Pet Box\nTo obtain 6-60 Pet Coins at random\nAnd a chance of obtaining Pet Advancement Pill I, Pet Mousse, Rainbow Carrot, Unripe Apple, Morning Dew, Livestock Gore, Dark Ink, Strange Cloth, Worn Bronze Armor, Juicy Grape, Armlet of Obedience, Discarded Coin, Mimic Scroll, and Smiling Pumpkin.\n\n<color=#CA2E0AFF>What's more, you'll have a small chance to obtain the Moonlight Flower Cage or Phreeoni Pet Cage!</color>\n\n<color=#CA2E0AFF>Above listed are potentially winnable items. Making a purchase or participating in the event does not guarantee that you will obtain certain items.</color>",
    ["ItemDes_10219170"]="A mystical gift pack that contains Rainbow Carrot x10, Juicy Grape x1, Unripe Apple x10, Singing Flower x1, Morning Dew x10, Goldflower Nectar x1, Livestock Gore x10, Well-Dried Bone x1, Old Broom x10, Armlet of Obedience x1, Worn Bronze Armor x10, Discarded Coin x1, Dark Ink x10, Silvery Shell x1, Strange Cloth x10, Silver Knife of Chastity x1, Broken Egg Shell x10, Mimic Scroll x1, Magical Lithography x10, and Smiling Pumpkin x1. Use to select and obtain one of the items.",
    ["ItemDes_10219171"]="Open to get bound items Lv.1 Upgrading Metal x30 and Stamina Potion x1.",
    ["ItemDes_10219172"]="Open to get Stamina Potion x1 and have a chance to get bound items among Lv.1 Gold Ore x50, Lv.1 Silver Ore, Lv.1 Iron Ore x50, Lv.1 Pure Jewelstone x25, and Lv.1 Impure Jewelstone x25.",
    ["ItemDes_10219173"]="Open to get bound items Lv.1 Muspellium x80 and Stamina Potion x1.",
    ["ItemDes_10219174"]="Open to get Stamina Potion x1 and have a chance to get bound items among Lv.1 Rough Oridecon x20, Lv.1 Rough Bradium x20, and Lv.1 Rough Elunium x20.",
    ["ItemDes_10219175"]="Open to get bound items among Cat Hand Services Coin x50, MVP Coin x50, Mini Coin x50, and Valkyrie Coin x50.",
    ["ItemDes_10219176"]="Open to get bound items Butterfly Wing x5 and Seed of Yggdrasil x3.",
    ["ItemDes_10219177"]="Use to obtain Mount: Sakura Globe.",
    ["ItemDes_10219178"]="Use to obtain the following three unlocking items:\nEmoticon Bubble Unlock - Good Work;\nUnlock - Wide-Angle Camera (group photo);\nUnlock - Guild Name Sticker Frame",
    ["ItemDes_10219179"]="Open to select one of the following Upgrading Materials:\nPhracon I x32,\nCarnium I x32,\nBascyx I x32,\nPhracon II x16,\nCarnium II x16,\nBascyx II x16,\nPhracon III x8,\nCarnium III x8,\nBascyx III x8,\nPhracon IV x4,\nCarnium IV x4,\nBascyx V x2,\nPhracon V x2,\nCarnium V x2,\nBascyx IV x4,",
    ["ItemDes_10219180"]="Open to select one of the following Battle Achievement items:\nAssault Illusion Spar Lv.1 x30,\nTechnique Illusion Spar Lv.1 x30,\nMagic Illusion Spar Lv.1 x30,\nShield Illusion Spar Lv.1 x30,\nGuardian Illusion Spar Lv.1 x30,\nOrigin Illusion Spar Lv.1 x30.",
    ["ItemDes_10219181"]="Open the Comodo Card Pack grants chances to obtain one of the following items:\n Cat Hand Services Coin ×2,000\n Comodo Card Selection Pack II ×1\n Comodo Card Selection Pack I ×1, including Comodo Area MVP/Mini Cards.\n \n \n <color=#CA2E0AFF>This is a potentially winnable item. Making a purchase or participating in the event does not guarantee you will obtain certain items.</color>",
    ["ItemDes_10219182"]="Open it to choose one of the following cards:\n Ogretooth Card: Day ×1,\n Ogretooth Card: Night ×1,\n Ogretooth Card: Undead ×1,\n Lost Dragon Card: Day ×1,\n Lost Dragon Card: Night ×1,\n Lost Dragon Card: Undead ×1,\n Necromancer Card: Day ×1,\n Necromancer Card: Night ×1,\n Necromancer Card: Undead ×1,\n Tao Gunka Card: Day ×1,\n Tao Gunka Card: Night ×1,\n Tao Gunka Card: Undead ×1.",
