    ["ItemDes_10219200"]="A gilt-edged gift box tied with white ribbon.\nOpen to randomly obtain one of the following items: Upgrading Metal, Muspellium, Coal Ore, Rough Oridecon, Bradium, and Rough Elunium.\nIt is said that a very few lucky adventurers can get [Headgear: Crystal Tiara] from it.",
    ["ItemDes_10219201"]="A gilt-edged gift box tied with pink ribbon.\nOpen to randomly obtain one of the following items: Fly Wing, Butterfly Wing, Elemental Converter, Resistance Potion, and Potion for PVP.\nIt is said that a very few lucky adventurers can get [Promise Carriage (30 Days)] from it",
