    ["ItemDes_1022"]="You can use KVM Points to exchange for fantastic rewards!",
    ["ItemDes_10221001"]="Delicately packaged White Valentine’s Day Gift Box, will increase the Favor after being gifted to others, and will increase Couple EXP when being gifted between a couple. During the event, players who receive this gift box will get an additional random type of cookies!\n<color=#FF0000>[Daily Gifting Limit: 10 times]</color>",
