    ["ItemDes_10221004"]="Delicately packaged Chocolate Gift Box.\nCharm +200, Favor +100.\nAfter getting married, give this to your partner to gain 10 Couple EXP.\nDuring the event, Adventurers who receive this gift box will get an additional random type of cookie!\n<color=#FF0000>Daily purchase limit: 10</color>",
