    ["ItemDes_10229243"]="A solid iron supply pack.",
    ["ItemDes_10229244"]="Opens automatically upon acquisition, granting the owner the reward of WOC Ranked Match Server Champion.\n<color=#FF6F76>Tips: The frame bundle (Avatar Frame, Chat Frame, and Side Bar) reward is a unique item. You won't receive it again if you have it already.</color>",
    ["ItemDes_10229245"]="Opens automatically upon acquisition, granting the owner the reward of WOC Elimination Match Qualifier.\n<color=#FF6F76>Tips: The frame bundle (Avatar Frame, Chat Frame, and Side Bar) reward is a unique item. You won't receive it again if you have it already.</color>",
