    ["ItemDes_10229456"]="An all-inclusive Christmas furniture value box that contains every piece you can think of. Open to obtain all Christmas furniture in the gift box.\nFurniture will be placed directly in your warehouse. View them by going to your home.",
    ["ItemDes_10229457"]="A mysterious Christmas furniture box with unknown contents, some say it includes an oversized Christmas tree and a not-yet-released gingerbread man doll. Open to obtain 1 random piece of Christmas furniture in the box.\nFurniture will be placed directly in your warehouse. View them by going to your home.",
