    ["ItemDes_10229552"]="An exclusive reward for the Sausage Battle event. It will be distributed to everyone in the winning camp via mail during the settlement of each phase. Use to obtain this effect: Weight Limit +500 for 7 days (unstackable, timer continues even when offline).",
