    ["ItemDes_10229577"]="A participation medal of the War of the Chosen: Heimdall Season that can be used as a piece of furniture.\nOpen to obtain: Distinguished Warrior Medal.\nFurniture will be placed directly in your warehouse. View them by going to your home.",
    ["ItemDes_10229578"]="A championship trophy of the War of the Chosen: Heimdall Season that can be used as a piece of furniture.\nOpen to obtain: Gjallarhorn (Gold).\nFurniture will be placed directly in your warehouse. View them by going to your home.",
    ["ItemDes_10229579"]="A 2nd place trophy of the War of the Chosen: Heimdall Season that can be used as a piece of furniture.\nOpen to obtain: Gjallarhorn (Silver).\nFurniture will be placed directly in your warehouse. View them by going to your home.",
    ["ItemDes_10229580"]="A 3rd place trophy of the War of the Chosen: Heimdall Season that can be used as a piece of furniture.\nOpen to obtain: Gjallarhorn (Bronze).\nFurniture will be placed directly in your warehouse. View them by going to your home.",
    ["ItemDes_10229581"]="The limited-edition Spring Festival Red Envelope obtained through top-ups. Use it to send 20 red envelopes with a random amount worth a total of 1,000 Diamonds in the world channel. Let's see who's got better luck!",
    ["ItemDes_10229582"]="Use to randomly obtain one special effect from a past season.",
    ["ItemDes_10229584"]="A kit containing Green Potions. Use it to obtain 100 Green Potions.",
    ["ItemDes_10229585"]="A kit containing Green Potions (PVP). Use it to obtain 100 Green Potions (PVP).",
    ["ItemDes_10229586"]="Open to obtain Crystal x5,000 and 1 random Mount Decoration Sel. Pack.\nPlease refer to the Odds Announcement for details of the Mount Decoration Sel. Pack.",
    ["ItemDes_10229587"]="Open to obtain Crystal x8,000 and 1 random Spring Outfit Reward (Tiger/Rabbit), as well as a chance to receive the Year of the Tiger Mount.\nPlease refer to the Odds Announcement for details of the Spring Outfit Sel. Pack (Tiger/Rabbit) and the Year of the Tiger Mount.",
    ["ItemDes_10229588"]="Open to obtain Crystal x20,000 and 1 Spring Outfit Sel. Pack (Tiger/Rabbit), as well as a chance to receive 1 random Spring Festival Mount.\nPlease refer to the Odds Announcement for details of the Spring Festival Mount.",
    ["ItemDes_10229589"]="Lucky Bag. Open to randomly obtain a random Equipment Upgrading Metal, Refinement Material, or Enchantment Material.\nThere is also a small chance to obtain Spring Festival exclusive Mount: Year of the Dragon Mount (Non-bound item).",
    ["ItemDes_10229590"]="Exclusive New Year Gift Box for the Year of the Dragon. Open to randomly obtain 8,888/88,888/888,888 Zeny and a random Spring Festival event item (Fireworks/Firecrackers/Divine Dragon Claw/Dish/Furniture Material/Sky Companion Badge).",
