    ["ItemDes_10231001"]="Unidentifiable strange seeds that yield crops suitable for furniture crafting.",
    ["ItemDes_10231002"]="Unidentifiable strange seeds that yield crops suitable for furniture crafting.",
    ["ItemDes_10231003"]="Unidentifiable strange seeds that yield crops suitable for furniture crafting.",
    ["ItemDes_10231004"]="Nurture them well and watch them grow into grand holly trees.\nUnique seeds for getting Christmas furniture. Requires Gardening Lv.1 to plant this seed.",
    ["ItemDes_10231005"]="Modified to sprout on their own, not just on other plants.\nUnique seeds for getting Christmas furniture. Requires Gardening Lv.1 to plant this seed.",
    ["ItemDes_10231011"]="An indistinguishable seed. Randomly grows into a crop from the Mjolnir Mountains.\n Requires Gardening Lv.1 to plant this seed.",
    ["ItemDes_10231012"]="An indistinguishable seed. Randomly grows into a crop from the Morroc Desert.\n Requires Gardening Lv.3 to plant this seed.",
    ["ItemDes_10231013"]="An indistinguishable seed. Randomly grows into an aquatic crop from the deep sea.\n Requires Gardening Lv.5 to plant this seed.",
    ["ItemDes_10231014"]="An indistinguishable seed. Randomly grows into a crop from Payon Cavern.\n Requires Gardening Lv.6 to plant this seed.",
    ["ItemDes_10231015"]="An indistinguishable seed. Randomly grows into a magical crop from Geffen Dungeon.\n Requires Gardening Lv.8 to plant this seed.",
    ["ItemDes_10231016"]="An indistinguishable seed. Randomly grows into a rotten crop from Glast Heim.\n Requires Gardening Lv.9 to plant this seed.",
    ["ItemDes_10231017"]="An indistinguishable seed. Randomly grows into a mysterious crop from Al De Baran Clock Tower.\nRequires Gardening Lv.10 to plant this seed.",
    ["ItemDes_10231018"]="An indistinguishable seed. Randomly grows into a rotten crop from Comodo Cave.\nRequires Gardening Lv.11 to plant this seed.",
    ["ItemDes_10231019"]="An indistinguishable seed. Randomly grows into a terrifying crop from Umbala.\nRequires Gardening Lv.12 to plant this seed.",
    ["ItemDes_10231020"]="An indistinguishable seed. Randomly grows into a mysterious tech crop from Juno Clock Tower.\nRequires Gardening Lv.13 to plant this seed.",
    ["ItemDes_10231021"]="An indistinguishable seed. Randomly grows into a contaminated crop from Einbroch.\nRequires Gardening Lv.14 to plant this seed.",
    ["ItemDes_10231101"]="A pouch of fingerlings from Prontera Pond. When released into Home's Pond, they will randomly grow into a kind of fish from Prontera.\n Requires Fishing Lv.1 to release these fingerlings.",
    ["ItemDes_10231102"]="A pouch of fingerlings from Morroc Desert. When released into Home's Pond, they will randomly grow into a kind of fish from Morroc Desert.\n Requires Fishing Lv.3 to release these fingerlings.",
    ["ItemDes_10231103"]="A pouch of fingerlings from the forest creeks. When released into Home's Pond, they will randomly grow into a kind of fish from the forest creeks.\n Requires Fishing Lv.4 to release these fingerlings.",
    ["ItemDes_10231104"]="A pouch of fingerlings from the deep sea. When released into Home's Pond, they will randomly grow into a kind of fish from the deep sea.\n Requires Fishing Lv.5 to release these fingerlings.",
    ["ItemDes_10231105"]="A pouch of fingerlings from Payon Cavern. When released into Home's Pond, they will randomly grow into a kind of fish from Payon Cavern.\n Requires Fishing Lv.6 to release these fingerlings.",
    ["ItemDes_10231106"]="A pouch of fingerlings from Geffen Cavern. When released into Home's Pond, they will randomly grow into a kind of fish from the Geffen Cavern.\n Requires Fishing Lv.8 to release these fingerlings.",
    ["ItemDes_10231107"]="A pouch of fingerlings from Glast Heim. When released into Home's Pond, they will randomly grow into a school of fish originating from Glast Heim.\nA fishing skill level of Lv.9 is required to release these fingerlings.",
    ["ItemDes_10231108"]="A pouch of fingerlings from Clock Tower. When released into Home's Pond, they will randomly grow into a school of fish originating from Clock Tower.\nA fishing skill level of Lv.10 is required to release these fingerlings.",
    ["ItemDes_10231109"]="A pouch of fingerlings from Comodo. When released into Home's Pond, they will randomly grow into a school of fish originating from Comodo.\nA fishing skill level of Lv.11 is required to release these fingerlings.",
    ["ItemDes_10231110"]="A pouch of fingerlings from Umbala. When released into Home's Pond, they will randomly grow into a school of fish originating from Umbala.\nA fishing skill level of Lv.12 is required to release these fingerlings.",
    ["ItemDes_10231111"]="A pouch of fingerlings from Juno. When released into Home's Pond, they will randomly grow into a school of fish originating from Juno.\nA fishing skill level of Lv.13 is required to release these fingerlings.",
    ["ItemDes_10231112"]="A pouch of fingerlings from Einbroch. When released into Home's Pond, they will randomly grow into a fish from Einbroch.\nA fishing skill level of Lv.14 is required to release these fingerlings.",
    ["ItemDes_10231113"]="A trophy made of mysterious material. Given in recognition of Adventurers with good performance in ROXIC.\nOpen to obtain: ROXIC Trophy.\nFurniture will be placed directly in your warehouse. View them by going to your home.",
    ["ItemDes_10231114"]="A trophy made of mysterious material. Given in recognition of Adventurers with outstanding performance in ROXIC.\nOpen to obtain: ROXIC Trophy.\nFurniture will be placed directly in your warehouse. View them by going to your home.",
    ["ItemDes_10231115"]="A trophy made of mysterious material. Given in recognition of Adventurers with the best performance in ROXIC.\nOpen to obtain: ROXIC Trophy.\nFurniture will be placed directly in your warehouse. View them by going to your home.",
    ["ItemDes_10231201"]="Basic crop featuring large and sturdy leaves. Can be used for crafting furniture.",
    ["ItemDes_10231202"]="Medium crop, great for weaving mats and nets. Can be used for crafting furniture.",
    ["ItemDes_10231203"]="Advanced crop, a valuable and ancient type of wood. Can be used for crafting furniture.",
    ["ItemDes_10231204"]="A basic ore. This coarse iron ore needs further refining.",
    ["ItemDes_10231205"]="An intermediate ore that glows in a splendid shade of violet.",
    ["ItemDes_10231206"]="An advanced ore. This kind of complicated ore requires magic-involved processing to extract the substances within.",
    ["ItemDes_10231207"]="A rare item. Its shape is constantly shifting, entirely unpredictable. Can be submitted to the craftsman for crafting rare furniture.\nThere's a small chance of getting this item when harvesting the farmland or mining the ore vein.",
    ["ItemDes_10231208"]="Used for exploring ore veins in the Mine. Consume flames to journey into the depths and uncover ore veins hidden in the shadows.",
    ["ItemDes_10231209"]="Used to increase Farmland Fertility by 50. Greater Fertility leads to higher harvest yields.",
    ["ItemDes_10231210"]="Used to increase the growth rate of fingerlings in the Pond by 60%. Lasts for 1 hour. Can only be used once during the effective period.",
    ["ItemDes_10231211"]="A candle with wondrous time-control ability. Used to accelerate crafting progress by 30 minutes.",
    ["ItemDes_10231212"]="Ronald's gift to all estate owners. This magical paper crane allows the user to teleport into their Home instantly.",
    ["ItemDes_10231213"]="Lush greenery with Christmas blessings dotted with red berries.\nCan be used to craft Christmas furniture at the Home Craftsman.",
    ["ItemDes_10231214"]="A legendary plant known for taking the life of the god of light.\nCan be used to craft Christmas furniture at the Home Craftsman.",
    ["ItemDes_10231215"]="Premium Xuan Paper is perfect for penning down blessing calligraphy.",
    ["ItemDes_10231216"]="Precious wood with a delicate and elegant aroma.",
    ["ItemDes_10232001"]="Use to obtain Mount: Warmth of Spring Water.\nSpeed: 4.5",
    ["ItemDes_10232009"]="Open to select one of the following Costumes. Tap Preview for more details.",
    ["ItemDes_10232012"]="Open to get one mount decoration reward of the S7 Pass of your choice.",
    ["ItemDes_10232014"]="Use to obtain a 2-Seater Mount: White Whale. The mount can switch between Flight mode and Airborne mode.\nSpeed (Flight/Airborne): 8/4\n<color=#FF0000>Can be used at the Capital Fair to exchange for White Whale Fragments.</color>.",
    ["ItemDes_10232015"]="Use to obtain a 2-Seater Mount: White Whale. The mount can switch between Flight mode and Airborne mode.\nSpeed (Flight/Airborne): 8/4\n<color=#FF0000>Can be used at the Capital Fair to exchange for White Whale Fragments.</color>.",
    ["ItemDes_10232016"]="The limited-edition Spring Festival Red Envelope obtained through top-ups. Use it to send 20 red envelopes with a random amount worth a total of 1,000 Diamonds in the world channel. Let's see who's got better luck!",
    ["ItemDes_10232017"]="Xmas Headgear Sel. Pack. Open to select one of the following Headgear:\nDozy Bear Earmuffs,\nSnore Bear Earmuffs.",
    ["ItemDes_10232018"]="Open to randomly obtain an Ancient Divinity Box from Slot I to VIII.",
    ["ItemDes_10232019"]="Open to randomly obtain an Antique Divinity Box from Slot I to VIII.",
    ["ItemDes_10232020"]="Open to randomly obtain a Divinity Box from Slot I to VIII.",
    ["ItemDes_10232021"]="Open to select an Elite Physical Divinity Box from Slot I to VIII. Tap Preview for more details.",
    ["ItemDes_10232022"]="Open to select an Elite Magical Divinity Box from Slot I to VIII. Tap Preview for more details.",
    ["ItemDes_10232023"]="Open to obtain a Gold Divinity - Spear of Eternity for Slot I.\nThe first three secondary attributes will be randomly selected from the following attribute pool. Any additional secondary attributes, beyond the first three, obtained through upgrades will be randomly selected from the overall attribute pool.\nSTR +105, AGI +105, VIT +105, DEX +105, LUK +105, STR +8%, AGI +8%, VIT +8%, DEX +8%, LUK+8%, Holy/Neutral Enhancement +26%, Earth/Fire Enhancement +26%, Water/Wind Enhancement +26%, Poison/Ghost Enhancement +26%, Shadow/Undead Enhancement +26%, Bonus DMG to Large Monsters +26%, Bonus DMG to Medium Monsters +26%, Bonus DMG to Small Monsters +26%, Crit DMG Bonus +42%, Final P.PEN +21%, Final P.DMG Bonus +21%, P.ATK +21%",
