    ["ItemDes_10401035"]="This broken blade is a piece of loot for defeating Thanatos. Can be used to craft equipment.",
    ["ItemDes_10401036"]="This tattered battle robe is a piece of loot for defeating Thanatos. Can be used to craft equipment.",
    ["ItemDes_10401037"]="This shattered armor plate is a piece of loot for defeating Thanatos. Can be used to craft equipment.",
    ["ItemDes_10401038"]="This rusty chain is a piece of loot for defeating Thanatos. Can be used to craft equipment.",
    ["ItemDes_10401039"]="This disordered and hazy memory fragment is a piece of loot for defeating Thanatos. Can be used to craft equipment.",
    ["ItemDes_10401040"]="The gun chamber's still warm as if recalling the destruction caused by the shots it fired. Can be used to craft equipment.",
    ["ItemDes_10401041"]="The crystal core, a replica of Ymir's Heart, is science's take on divine power. Can be used to craft equipment.",
    ["ItemDes_10401042"]="The shattered white armor piece probably belonged to Vesper's head. Can be used to craft equipment.",
    ["ItemDes_10401043"]="The honorary defender title from Verus City is carved into a fragment of Vesper's debris. Can be used to craft equipment.",
    ["ItemDes_10401044"]="Verus City's technological marvels are all condensed into this tiny chip. Can be used to craft equipment.",
    ["ItemDes_10401045"]="Odd pieces made of unknown materials dropped from Vesper's body. Can be used to craft equipment.",
    ["ItemDes_10401046"]="The truth withers while falsehood blossoms evermore behind iron bars.",
    ["ItemDes_10401047"]="The witch who aspired to godhood was born without a heart—within her chest pulses only frozen stone.",
    ["ItemDes_10401048"]="Horns—emblems of longing—tear through mortal form, ever reaching toward the heavens.",
    ["ItemDes_10401049"]="Guided by the stars, she peered into the destinies of all—never knowing hers would perish beneath them.",
    ["ItemDes_10401050"]="To all, it is the sacred key—the passage to realms divine.",
    ["ItemDes_10401051"]="Deities can see into the human heart, and devils can too.",
    ["ItemDes_10402001"]="A Lv.1 Rough Elunium that contains Elunium. Further processing is required to reveal its true value.\nUsed as a smelting material to produce Elunium.",
    ["ItemDes_10402002"]="A very light, non-toxic metal.\nUsed as a material to refine armor from levels 1 through 4.",
    ["ItemDes_10402003"]="A very light, non-toxic metal.\nUsed as a material to refine armor from levels 5 through 8.",
    ["ItemDes_10402004"]="A Lv.1 Rough Oridecon that is rare and hard to obtain.\nUsed as a smelting material to produce Oridecon.",
    ["ItemDes_10402005"]="A mysterious metal known as Oridecon. It is the hardest matter ever found.\nUsed as a material to refine weapons from levels 1 through 4.",
    ["ItemDes_10402006"]="A mysterious metal known as Oridecon. It is the hardest matter ever found.\nUsed as a material to refine weapons from levels 5 through 8.",
    ["ItemDes_10402010"]="A Lv.4 Pure Jewelstone that is as untainted as glass.",
    ["ItemDes_10402011"]="A mysterious gem that can extract enchantment stats from equipment. With the skillful hand of a senior enchanter, the enchantment stats will be saved inside.",
    ["ItemDes_10402012"]="A Lv.4 Impure Jewelstone that contains dark unknown substances.",
    ["ItemDes_10402013"]="A bright ore. You can feel the divine power within it. A necessary material for crafting Blessed Bradium.",
    ["ItemDes_10402014"]="Mysterious Ore that has been blessed by the God of Luck. When used in refining, the refinement is guaranteed to succeed.",
    ["ItemDes_10402029"]="Colorful mushrooms. Staring at them for a long time may lead to hallucinations. Used as a smelting material to produce Umbala's Enchantment Stone.",
    ["ItemDes_10402030"]="Daffodils that glow in the dark are said to be guides from the dead. Used as a smelting material to produce Umbala's Enchantment Stone.",
    ["ItemDes_10402031"]="The flowers that only bloom in the misty weather, are an extremely valuable species. Used as a smelting material to produce Umbala's Enchantment Stone.",
    ["ItemDes_10402032"]="The color is bright red and the flesh is sweet and juicy. Enjoy it in moderation.",
    ["ItemDes_10402033"]="Ganoderma lucidum, parasitic on rattan plants, is named Ghost Reishi because it grows after the rattan has withered.",
    ["ItemDes_10402034"]="Somehow it has grown into a scary look. Do not approach it.",
    ["ItemDes_10402035"]="A strange flower that can hallucinate people.",
    ["ItemDes_10402036"]="Even though it's hideous, it has a sweet smell. People called it a fruit, but it's actually a flower with spiky scales.",
    ["ItemDes_10402037"]="Cause of Mutation: Unknown. Impact: Unknown.",
    ["ItemDes_10402038"]="It's a living creature that falls between the plant and animal category, which hunts down the prey using its jagged leaves.",
    ["ItemDes_10402039"]="A type of vine that grows in humid and gloomy environments. Can be used to refine a tiny amount of shimmering element.",
    ["ItemDes_10402040"]="A rare fruit that emits fragrance when it ripens. Can be used to refine purple crystals with extremely high purity through alchemy.",
    ["ItemDes_10402047"]="A fruit that quickly goes bad once removed from its branch.",
    ["ItemDes_10402048"]="A common flower that holds amazing medicinal value.",
    ["ItemDes_10402049"]="Trumpet-like flowers that mostly grow outdoors.",
    ["ItemDes_10402050"]="Thrives in rotting places and can really mess with your mind.",
    ["ItemDes_10402051"]="A magical flower that tinkles like a wind chime in the wind.",
    ["ItemDes_10402052"]="A sweet-tasting flower that is perfect for making lots of tasty treats and drinks.",
    ["ItemDes_10402060"]="A Lv.5 Pure Jewelstone that is as untainted as glass.\n Used as a smelting material to produce STR Stone V, INT Stone V, and LUK Stone V.",
    ["ItemDes_10402061"]="A Lv.5 Impure Jewelstone that contains dark unknown substances.\n Used as a smelting material to produce AGI Stone V, VIT Stone V, and DEX Stone V.",
    ["ItemDes_10402062"]="A Lv.5 Iron Ore that contains Iron metal. Further processing is required to reveal its true value.\n Used as a smelting material to produce Iron V.",
    ["ItemDes_10402063"]="A Lv.5 Silver Ore that contains Silver metal. Further processing is required to reveal its true value.\n Used as a smelting material to produce Sliver V.",
    ["ItemDes_10402064"]="A Lv.5 Gold Ore that contains Gold metal. Further processing is required to reveal its true value.\n Used as a smelting material to produce Gold V.",
    ["ItemDes_10402065"]="A Lv.5 Coal Ore that contains Coal metal. Further processing is required to reveal its true value.\n Used as a smelting material. Commonly used as a fine smelting medium.",
    ["ItemDes_10402066"]="Large, intelligent fish species that live in schools.",
    ["ItemDes_10402067"]="A sea cucumber covered in tiny, sharp spikes.",
    ["ItemDes_10402068"]="Blood-red Hydra—its tentacles catch prey way bigger than itself.",
    ["ItemDes_10402069"]="Schooling fish whose roe is valued even more than their flesh.",
    ["ItemDes_10402070"]="Freshwater mud crabs grow to impressive size after reaching maturity.",
    ["ItemDes_10402071"]="Tiny octopus that stay at the bottom of the food chain.",
    ["ItemDes_10402072"]="Dark-colored herb with golden tips.",
    ["ItemDes_10402073"]="A colorful succulent that thrives in dry places.",
    ["ItemDes_10402074"]="Juicy and sweet fruit from a dry region.",
    ["ItemDes_10402075"]="Butterfly-shaped flower with great medicinal uses.\n Used as a crafting material to produce Orange Potion and Orange Potion (PVP).",
    ["ItemDes_10402076"]="The proboscis of a large bloodthirsty mosquito, known for its sharpness and durability.",
    ["ItemDes_10402077"]="A flashy pointy tip that carries deadly venom.",
    ["ItemDes_10402078"]="Said to be the hair of a barbarian, though their existence remains unconfirmed.",
    ["ItemDes_10402079"]="The last tear shed by a water creature in its dying moments.",
    ["ItemDes_10402080"]="A broken demon wing that still radiates evil energy.",
    ["ItemDes_10402081"]="A busted horn from a goat monster. Tough as rock.",
    ["ItemDes_10402082"]="A fluffy snowball—might melt or might not.",
    ["ItemDes_10402083"]="A fragment of the eternal ice found deep inside the ice cave.",
    ["ItemDes_10402084"]="The tail of a monster once sealed beneath layers of ancient ice.",
    ["ItemDes_10402085"]="A product of certain sinister alchemical experiments.",
    ["ItemDes_10402086"]="An orb packed with the power of Water.",
    ["ItemDes_10402087"]="A long-lost giant's heart, still pulsing beneath the earth.",
    ["ItemDes_10402088"]="Its fragrance helps calm the mind.",
    ["ItemDes_10402089"]="A neatly trimmed succulent that catches everyone's eye.",
    ["ItemDes_10402090"]="A scaly-skinned fruit that glows in the dark.",
    ["ItemDes_10402091"]="Slightly sweet, and becomes medicinal when dried.",
    ["ItemDes_10402092"]="A flower that blooms from ashes, symbolizing hope reborn.",
    ["ItemDes_10402093"]="Looks plain by day, but glows like starlight at night.",
    ["ItemDes_10402094"]="Looks poisonous, but it's actually a rare medicinal plant.",
    ["ItemDes_10402095"]="This amphibious snake returns to land to lay eggs during the breeding season.",
    ["ItemDes_10402096"]="A true ruler of the sea—you'll need both skill and luck to catch it.",
    ["ItemDes_10402097"]="A premium seafood with great commercial value.",
    ["ItemDes_10402098"]="Said to bring life-changing luck.",
    ["ItemDes_10402099"]="Tastes even better when dried.",
    ["ItemDes_10402100"]="The king of freshwater shrimp.",
    ["ItemDes_10402101"]="Loves sleeping, eating crab burgers, and catching jellyfish.",
    ["ItemDes_10402102"]="Looks like a Crab but tastes totally different.",
    ["ItemDes_10402103"]="A skilled digger that only peeks out when the tide recedes.",
    ["ItemDes_10402104"]="Buried with the dead, but valuable enough to tempt grave robbers.",
    ["ItemDes_10402105"]="Popular among young girls, it is said to bring sweet romance to anyone who wears it.",
    ["ItemDes_10402106"]="Filled with resentment—better not touch it.",
    ["ItemDes_10402107"]="It's shiny and colorful, but gives off an ominous vibe.",
    ["ItemDes_10402108"]="Their name is just a string of random numbers.",
    ["ItemDes_10402109"]="A soul-nurtured jade that feels cool when placed in your palm.",
    ["ItemDes_10402110"]="A blue energy crystal that resonates weakly with Odin's bloodline.",
    ["ItemDes_10402111"]="A red energy crystal that resonates strongly with Odin's bloodline.",
    ["ItemDes_10402112"]="An ancient calendar that measures time with knotted strings.",
    ["ItemDes_10402113"]="A crimson talisman that backfires even on its creator when used.",
    ["ItemDes_10402114"]="A gemstone that stores magic, making it very valuable.",
    ["ItemDes_10402115"]="Filled with strange terms and formulas—way too hard for most people to understand.",
    ["ItemDes_10402116"]="Death comes in an instant.",
    ["ItemDes_10402117"]="Full of ideas, but may never have the chance to become a true masterpiece.",
    ["ItemDes_10402118"]="A Lv.5 Rough Oridecon that is rare and hard to obtain.\nUsed as a smelting material to produce UHD Oridecon.",
    ["ItemDes_10402119"]="A Lv.5 Rough Elunium that contains Elunium. Further processing is required to reveal its true value.\nUsed as a smelting material to produce UHD Elunium.",
    ["ItemDes_10402120"]="A Lv.5 Rough Bradium that seems to contain certain magical powers.\nUsed as a smelting material to produce UHD Bradium.",
    ["ItemDes_10402121"]="A Lv.6 Pure Jewelstone that is as untainted as glass.\nUsed as a smelting material to produce STR Stone VI, INT Stone VI, and LUK Stone VI.",
    ["ItemDes_10402122"]="A Lv.5 Impure Jewelstone that contains unknown dark substances.\nUsed as a smelting material to produce AGI Stone VI, VIT Stone VI, and DEX Stone VI.",
    ["ItemDes_10402123"]="A Lv.4 Blessed Ore that is imbued with protective power.\nUsed as smelting material to produce Blessed Oridecon IV, Blessed Elunium IV, and Blessed Bradium IV.",
    ["ItemDes_10403001"]="Socketing Material",
    ["ItemDes_10403002"]="A basic equipment upgrading material. Used to slightly boost the capabilities of equipment.",
    ["ItemDes_10403003"]="An intermediate equipment upgrading material. Used to somewhat boost the capabilities of equipment.",
    ["ItemDes_10403004"]="An advanced equipment upgrading material. Used to significantly boost the capabilities of equipment.",
    ["ItemDes_10403005"]="A superior equipment upgrading material. Used to immensely boost the capabilities of equipment.",
    ["ItemDes_10403009"]="An extremely rare ore obtained from a deep vein. It is an item necessary for guild creation and upgrading.",
    ["ItemDes_10403010"]="A plant with three heart-shaped leaves. It blooms with white flowers during the months of June and July, and sometimes you can even find ones with four leaves. These plants are called clovers and are said to bring people good luck. This is an item required for Guild Orders. It can be obtained from specific monsters or purchased from vend shops.",
    ["ItemDes_10403011"]="Treasure buried with the dead when they cross over to the afterlife. Most are of high value. Used to craft headgears. It can be obtained from Demon monsters or purchased from vend shops.",
    ["ItemDes_10403012"]="An unnamed viscous liquid. This is an item required for Guild Orders. It can be obtained from specific monsters or purchased from vend shops.",
    ["ItemDes_10403016"]="A carving that represents an Orc Warrior's status. This is an item required for Guild Orders. It can be obtained from specific monsters or purchased from vend shops.",
    ["ItemDes_10403017"]="A bone from an undead Skeleton General. Used to craft talismans. It can be obtained from specific monsters or purchased from vend shops.",
    ["ItemDes_10403018"]="A smooth copper plate. Can be used in enchantments.",
    ["ItemDes_10403019"]="A gemstone with magical powers. A necessary material for upgrading enchantment stats.",
