    ["ItemDes_10403045"]="A necessary material for changing faces.",
    ["ItemDes_10403046"]="Rewards from the Opening Festival Event can be exchanged for other Items during the event. Items can be exchanged for up to 7 days after the event ends. After that, the system will automatically withdraw this item and send an Adventurer Salad as its replacement at a 1:1 ratio.",
    ["ItemDes_10403047"]="Special dye. Can be used to change the color of Pecopeco to white.",
    ["ItemDes_10403048"]="Love Confession event reward. Can be used to exchange for other items in the Love Confession event.",
    ["ItemDes_10403049"]="Rare dye. Can be used to change the color of hair and pupils.",
    ["ItemDes_10403050"]="A gemstone with magical powers. A necessary material for upgrading enchantment stats.",
    ["ItemDes_10403051"]="A gemstone with magical powers. A necessary material for upgrading enchantment stats.",
    ["ItemDes_10403052"]="A gemstone with magical powers. A necessary material for upgrading enchantment stats.",
    ["ItemDes_10403053"]="A powder with a pungent odor that makes people uncomfortable.\nThis is an item required for Guild Orders. It can be obtained from specific monsters or purchased from vend shops.",
    ["ItemDes_10403054"]="An old spell book that contains a sizable record of ancient powerful magic.\nThis is an item required for Guild Orders. It can be obtained from specific monsters or purchased from vend shops.",
    ["ItemDes_10403055"]="An imprisoned soul that exudes a feeling of sadness and resentment.\nThis is an item required for Guild Orders. It can be obtained from specific monsters or purchased from vend shops.",
    ["ItemDes_10403056"]="A giant mole claw with tens of thousands of germs.\nThis is an item required for Guild Orders. It can be obtained from specific monsters or purchased from vend shops.",
    ["ItemDes_10403057"]="A damp reef fragment.\nThis is an item required for Guild Orders. It can be obtained from specific monsters or purchased from vend shops.",
    ["ItemDes_10403058"]="A mirror made of crystal. It's of better quality than glass mirrors.\nThis is an item required for Guild Orders. It can be obtained from specific monsters or purchased from vend shops.",
    ["ItemDes_10403059"]="This discarded gear may have been part of a clock.\nThis is an item required for Guild Orders. It can be obtained from specific monsters or purchased from vend shops.",
    ["ItemDes_10403060"]="A pair of gloves worn by an executioner. It's stained with blood.\nThis is an item required for Guild Orders. It can be obtained from specific monsters or purchased from vend shops.",
