    ["ItemDes_10403063"]="A small dough of sticky rice, somewhat dry and hard.\nFish bait for use at fishing spots in Aldebaran.",
    ["ItemDes_10403064"]="A thin and long tongue that is disgusting.\nFish bait for use at fishing spots in Aldebaran.",
    ["ItemDes_10403065"]="Small pieces of wood shavings.\nFish bait for use at fishing spots in Aldebaran.",
    ["ItemDes_10403067"]="Equipment ascending material. A dazzling star stone.",
    ["ItemDes_10403068"]="Equipment ascending material. A crystal that coagulates great spiritual energy.",
    ["ItemDes_10403069"]="Equipment ascending material. Razor-sharp fangs that seemingly could bring bad luck.",
    ["ItemDes_10403070"]="Equipment ascending material. Fabric that has been through multiple generations and dynasties.",
    ["ItemDes_10403071"]="Equipment ascending material. Crystal debris gives the membrane a matte texture, but somehow it is still reflective.",
    ["ItemDes_10403072"]="Equipment ascending material. A special leather made by soaking the sandworm heart and frog slime.",
    ["ItemDes_10403073"]="Slimy chunks of bird meat from Comodo.",
    ["ItemDes_10403074"]="Sliced meat marinated with Comodo's special sea salt.",
    ["ItemDes_10403075"]="The kernel that can only be found in the desert. One of the foods of the Comodo birds.",
    ["ItemDes_10403076"]="Tough and chewy meat, the outer loin of a lizard-like creature.",
    ["ItemDes_10403077"]="A red onion with a particularly pungent flavor. A crucial ingredient in Comodo cooking.",
    ["ItemDes_10403078"]="A fresh spice that combines different flavors and offers a wonderful surprise to people.",
    ["ItemDes_10403079"]="A kind of lice that resides on the sea creatures of Comodo, very disgusting.",
    ["ItemDes_10403080"]="Ivory-colored down fur, a symbol of prestige.",
    ["ItemDes_10403081"]="The essence obtained by refining the Kokomo sea water.",
    ["ItemDes_10403082"]="Bait that can be used on desert creatures.",
    ["ItemDes_10403083"]="Debris of gorgeous shells by the sea.",
    ["ItemDes_10403084"]="Kokomo beach sand mixed with various minerals and debris.",
    ["ItemDes_10403085"]="A skeleton with an evil aura, terrifying to look at.",
    ["ItemDes_10403086"]="Magic stones that come in different shapes and forms, hence the name formless.",
    ["ItemDes_10403087"]="Terribly sharp and dense teeth that are frightening.",
    ["ItemDes_10403088"]="A stone with an unidentified aura, which seems to hint at something.",
