    ["ItemDes_10403090"]="Shell fragments that concentrate the spiritual energy of heaven and earth. Smashed for some reason.",
    ["ItemDes_10403091"]="Shell species with a small amount of magical energy that can be found on the Kokomo beach.",
    ["ItemDes_10403092"]="Durable cornerstone that can be found everywhere on the Kokomo beach.",
    ["ItemDes_10403093"]="A magical breath that can survive long periods of wind and rain.",
    ["ItemDes_10403094"]="Very hard animal skin with sharp thorns on top.",
    ["ItemDes_10403095"]="A smooth membrane that can even reflect light, great for crafting costumes.",
    ["ItemDes_10403096"]="Sea salt crystallized by the unique environment of the Kokomo.",
    ["ItemDes_10403097"]="Unique cores that can only be found in desert insects. Ideal for crafting items.",
    ["ItemDes_10403098"]="Mucus on the mutant frogs. It is colorless, odorless, and non-toxic. Please feel free to use it.",
    ["ItemDes_10403099"]="Equipment upgrading material. Taken from a broken ancient armor. The patterns are spooky.",
    ["ItemDes_10403100"]="Equipment upgrading material. Pale and yellowish bone spurs. Watch out for its jagged edges.",
    ["ItemDes_10403101"]="Equipment upgrading material. A crystal that has mysterious power.",
    ["ItemDes_10403102"]="Equipment upgrading material. The dry and twisted branches are perfect for psychics.",
    ["ItemDes_10403103"]="Equipment upgrading material. Slender, sharp blades with finely serrated edges.",
    ["ItemDes_10403104"]="Equipment upgrading material. Crystalline debris that lets out a faint glow.",
    ["ItemDes_10403105"]="Equipment upgrading material. Beautiful scales that refract colorful light in the sun.",
    ["ItemDes_10403106"]="Equipment upgrading material. Soft, shiny bristle that's soft to the touch.",
    ["ItemDes_10403107"]="Equipment upgrading material. Magical cloth that calls for help when someone cuts it.",
    ["ItemDes_10403108"]="Equipment upgrading material. The fangs that have torn through countless enemies are as sharp as they can be.",
    ["ItemDes_10403109"]="Equipment upgrading material. Nails that have been dipped in poison. Do not get scratched.",
    ["ItemDes_10403110"]="Equipment upgrading material. Ancient stone slab with a pattern of thorns.",
    ["ItemDes_10403111"]="Bright red crystals said to be the favorite of some monsters. This is a material required for Guild Orders. It can be obtained from killing specific monsters or purchased from vend shops.",
    ["ItemDes_10403112"]="The large moss attached to the stone is very vigorous. This is a material required for Guild Orders. It can be obtained from killing specific monsters or purchased from vend shops.",
    ["ItemDes_10403113"]="Red-hot metal block with faint black carbonized spots. This is a material required for Guild Orders. It can be obtained from killing specific monsters or purchased from vend shops.",
    ["ItemDes_10403114"]="Stout plant roots with fine rootlets. This is a material required for Guild Orders. It can be obtained from killing specific monsters or purchased from vend shops.",
    ["ItemDes_10403115"]="Dangerous black mixture. Use it with caution. This is a material required for Guild Orders. It can be obtained from killing specific monsters or purchased from vend shops.",
    ["ItemDes_10403116"]="A viscous biofluid that barely flows. This is a material required for Guild Orders. It can be obtained from killing specific monsters or purchased from vend shops.",
    ["ItemDes_10403117"]="Highly cohesive soil with very little sand. This is a material required for Guild Orders. It can be obtained from killing specific monsters or purchased from vend shops.",
    ["ItemDes_10403118"]="Transparent amber shard, the small creature inside has disappeared. This is a material required for Guild Orders. It can be obtained from killing specific monsters or purchased from vend shops.",
    ["ItemDes_10403119"]="Cooking ingredient. Viscous and cloudy monster biofluid.",
    ["ItemDes_10403120"]="Cooking ingredient. Ground powder of aged monster skin.",
