    ["ItemDes_10403125"]="Points obtained from the Illusion. Every day, when the <color=#872657>Twilight Banquet Illusion</color> ends, Jakk will rank all Adventurers according to their points.",
    ["ItemDes_10403126"]="A hatred condensed crystal. Very valuable and is in great demand from the Guilds.",
    ["ItemDes_10403127"]="The required consumable to dye the Mount into Tree Green.",
    ["ItemDes_10403128"]="A sparkling crystalline substance that should be able to work wonders!",
    ["ItemDes_10403129"]="An ultramarine gem that reflects a riot of color under the sun.",
    ["ItemDes_10403130"]="You only need a teeny tiny amount of this to kill an adult.",
    ["ItemDes_10403131"]="A type of algae that has mutated for unknown reasons. As it grows, it can become ridiculously enormous.",
    ["ItemDes_10403132"]="Sand and gravel in black color, wherein shines a golden glow. Perfect medium for alchemy.",
    ["ItemDes_10403133"]="A rusty brass plate with blurred symbols.",
    ["ItemDes_10403134"]="A writing instrument from ancient times. It's said that only a few people still retain the habit of using a quill.",
    ["ItemDes_10403135"]="A finely ground phosphorus powder. Please keep it safe and away from fire.",
    ["ItemDes_10403136"]="A finely ground carbon powder. Can be used as a material in alchemy.",
    ["ItemDes_10403137"]="Bone spurs of a beast. It's insanely sharp even before sharpening.",
    ["ItemDes_10403138"]="A stinger of a mutant bee. It's bigger and pointier compared to other ordinary stingers.",
    ["ItemDes_10403139"]="Feathers in vivid and chromatic colors. Came off from a beautiful bird.",
