    ["ItemDes_10403141"]="A trunk that is full of inversed thorns. Don't get hurt touching it.",
    ["ItemDes_10403142"]="A gigantic leaf that can be used as a fan. It's durable and thick.",
    ["ItemDes_10403143"]="Product of an alchemic failure. Still possessing the magic power of the alchemist.",
    ["ItemDes_10403144"]="A natural glue that is very adhesive.",
    ["ItemDes_10403145"]="Calcified substance shards that can be used as armor reinforcements.",
    ["ItemDes_10403146"]="An undead fragment retained in a weird method.",
    ["ItemDes_10403147"]="A bone fossil that has been severely weathered.",
    ["ItemDes_10403148"]="A smooth and sharp canine tooth from a beast. It's still dripping blood.",
    ["ItemDes_10403149"]="Opening Festival event reward. Can be used to exchange for other items in the Opening Festival event.",
    ["ItemDes_10403150"]="A transparent, crystal-clear gemstone. Can be sold to the general merchant for a large amount of Zeny.",
    ["ItemDes_10403151"]="This colorless and crystal clear damaged diamond can be sold to the merchant for a large amount of Zeny.",
    ["ItemDes_10403153"]="Fragments in fiery red. 50 Fire Boulder Fragments can be synthesized into 1 Fire Boulder Crystal.",
    ["ItemDes_10403154"]="Crystalized fragments in fiery red. 20 Fire Boulder Crystals can be synthesized into 1 Frenzy Firestone.",
    ["ItemDes_10403157"]="A fire that's said to have been burning for a long time.",
    ["ItemDes_10403158"]="Corroded iron scraps.",
    ["ItemDes_10403159"]="A valuable industrial gas that can cause hallucinations if you take in too much.",
    ["ItemDes_10403160"]="Ocean blue crystals from a weird kind of ore.",
    ["ItemDes_10403161"]="Diluted but still fatally poisonous.",
    ["ItemDes_10403162"]="Mysteriously glowing rubble containing some kind of mineral.",
    ["ItemDes_10403163"]="Nectar from a queen bee. Great for beauty and skincare.",
    ["ItemDes_10403164"]="A metal hose that is essential for certain industrial uses.",
    ["ItemDes_10403165"]="Monster cartilage, as sharp as a knife.",
    ["ItemDes_10403166"]="Mutated dragon blood caused by contamination.",
    ["ItemDes_10403167"]="A strange monster eye that seems to still be alive.",
    ["ItemDes_10403168"]="Beautiful, light wings that humans have always dreamed of possessing.",
    ["ItemDes_10403169"]="Mining helmet that witnessed a catastrophic iron mine accident.",
    ["ItemDes_10403170"]="Debris left from mining silica stones.",
    ["ItemDes_10403171"]="Monster hide that is thick, warm, and durable.",
    ["ItemDes_10403172"]="Scorching lava shell, perfect for outdoor adventures.",
    ["ItemDes_10403173"]="Possibly left behind by a former Adventurer?",
    ["ItemDes_10403174"]="Said to be an evil token given to those selected by demons.",
    ["ItemDes_10403175"]="Keep in low temperatures for storage to avoid explosion.",
    ["ItemDes_10403176"]="Bead spawned by a monster, encapsulating the essence of its life.",
    ["ItemDes_10403178"]="The required consumable to dye the Mount into Icy Blue.",
    ["ItemDes_10403179"]="Scarlet Dyestuffs from Lutie. Use a certain number of dyestuffs to unlock Dreamscape Knight Pajamas (Scarlet) / Slumbering Knight Hat (Scarlet) / Sweet Dream Knight Hat (Scarlet) in the wardrobe.",
    ["ItemDes_10403180"]="Green Dyestuffs from Lutie. Use a certain number of dyestuffs to unlock Dreamscape Knight Pajamas (Green) / Slumbering Knight Hat (Green) / Sweet Dream Knight Hat (Green) in the wardrobe.",
    ["ItemDes_10403181"]="Violet Dyestuffs from Lutie. Use a certain number of dyestuffs to unlock Dreamscape Knight Pajamas (Violet) / Slumbering Knight Hat (Violet) / Sweet Dream Knight Hat (Violet) in the wardrobe.",
    ["ItemDes_10403182"]="Special Dyestuffs from Lutie. Use a certain number of dyestuffs to unlock Dreamscape Knight Pajamas (Nightmare) / Slumbering Knight Hat (Nightmare) / Sweet Dream Knight Hat (Nightmare) in the wardrobe.",
    ["ItemDes_10403183"]="Ominous crimson fragments. Combine 100 of these to create 1 Disaster Crystal.",
    ["ItemDes_10403184"]="For dyeing the costume rewards of the Pass (February to April 2024).",
    ["ItemDes_10403185"]="Ominous violet fragments. Combine 100 of these to create 1 Primal Sin Crystal.",
    ["ItemDes_10403186"]="Used for upgrading Divinities. Grants 100 Divinity EXP.",
    ["ItemDes_10403187"]="Used for synthesizing Gold Divinities. Obtained by dismantling gold-quality Divinities.",
    ["ItemDes_10403188"]="Used for targeted synthesis of gold-quality Divinities. Targeted synthesis allows you to select corresponding affixes.",
    ["ItemDes_10403190"]="Used for upgrading Divinities. Grants 1,000 Divinity EXP.",
    ["ItemDes_10403194"]="Used for upgrading Divinities. Grants 10,000 Divinity EXP.",
    ["ItemDes_10403195"]="Used for synthesizing Gold Divinities.\nA stone tablet inscribed with the prophecy of Ragnarok, where destruction is but a part of rebirth.",
    ["ItemDes_10403196"]="The near-weightless wing of a giant mosquito monster.",
    ["ItemDes_10403197"]="A razor-sharp feather from a giant bird.",
    ["ItemDes_10403198"]="Thick pelt, ideal for crafting warm garments.",
    ["ItemDes_10403199"]="A stone formed through buried rocks that have been frozen for a long time.",
    ["ItemDes_10403200"]="Maybe hoarded by some brain-eating monsters?",
    ["ItemDes_10403201"]="A hallmark creation of ancient alchemical craft.",
    ["ItemDes_10403202"]="A ritual flag used by an evil cult.",
    ["ItemDes_10403203"]="A favorite delicacy among certain monsters.",
    ["ItemDes_10403204"]="Weathered bones from some dead beast.",
    ["ItemDes_10403205"]="A meteorite said to have fallen from a star—still shimmering faintly.",
    ["ItemDes_10403206"]="A piece of shiny greed jade of exceptional value.",
    ["ItemDes_10403207"]="A pearl from the ocean depths that emits a faint glow at night.",
    ["ItemDes_10403208"]="Rare desert sand that sparkles like stars.",
    ["ItemDes_10403209"]="Beast fang with a faint purple venom glow.",
    ["ItemDes_10403210"]="Volcanic ash dye. Can be used to change the color of mount accessories.",
    ["ItemDes_10403212"]="Ominous crimson fragments. Combine 100 of these to create 1 Evernight Crystal.",
    ["ItemDes_10403213"]="Shimmering green fragments. Can be combined to forge the Heart of Emerald.",
    ["ItemDes_10403214"]="Shimmering red fragments. Can be combined to forge the Heart of Crimson.",
    ["ItemDes_10403215"]="Used for Companion training.",
    ["ItemDes_10403216"]="Use for upgrading the Companion formation slots. Only usable in S8 and will be removed at the end of the season.",
    ["ItemDes_10403217"]="An exclusive item for the Together As One event. It'll be automatically removed after the event and has no other purpose.",
    ["ItemDes_10403218"]="Use for upgrading the Companion formation slots. Only usable in S9 and will be removed at the end of the season.",
    ["ItemDes_10403219"]="Can be used in the Thanksgiving Support - Support Vote to participate in voting.",
    ["ItemDes_10404001"]="One of the fragments of an old, worn scroll. The mottled words on it expresses the former glory of Glast Heim, but adventurers are only keen to find the priceless treasures detailed in the scroll.",
    ["ItemDes_10404002"]="One of the fragments of an old, worn scroll. The mottled words on it expresses the former glory of Glast Heim, but adventurers are only keen to find the priceless treasures detailed in the scroll.",
    ["ItemDes_10404003"]="One of the fragments of an old, worn scroll. The mottled words on it expresses the former glory of Glast Heim, but adventurers are only keen to find the priceless treasures detailed in the scroll.",
    ["ItemDes_10405001"]="A valuable fragment. Collect 50 to directly redeem a Golden Thief Bug Card.",
    ["ItemDes_10405002"]="A valuable fragment. Collect 50 to directly redeem a Drake Card.",
    ["ItemDes_10405003"]="A valuable fragment. Collect 125 to directly redeem a Strouf Card.",
