    ["ItemDes_10406122"]="A Lv.2 Coal Ore that contains coal. Further processing is required to reveal its true value.\nIt is a great smelting medium.",
    ["ItemDes_10406123"]="A Lv.2 Iron Ore that contains iron. Further processing is required to reveal its true value.\nUsed as a smelting material to produce Iron II.",
