    ["ItemDes_10406138"]="A Lv.3 Silver Ore that contains silver. Further processing is required to reveal its true value.\nUsed as a smelting material to produce Silver III.",
    ["ItemDes_10406139"]="A Lv.3 Coal Ore that contains coal. Further processing is required to reveal its true value.\nIt is a great smelting medium.",
    ["ItemDes_10406140"]="A Lv.3 Iron Ore that contains iron. Further processing is required to reveal its true value.\nUsed as a smelting material to produce Iron III.",
    ["ItemDes_10406141"]="A Lv.3 Pure Jewelstone that is as untainted as glass.\nUsed as a smelting material to produce STR Stone III, INT Stone III, and LUK Stone III.",
    ["ItemDes_10406142"]="A Lv.3 Impure Jewelstone that contains dark unknown substances.\nUsed as a smelting material to produce AGI Stone III, VIT Stone III, and DEX Stone III.",
    ["ItemDes_10406143"]="A Lv.5 Upgrading Metal that feels cold to the touch. Used as a smelting material to produce Phracon V, Carnium V, and Bascyx V.",
