    ["ItemDes_10406145"]="A Lv.4 Rough Bradium that seems to contain certain magical powers.",
    ["ItemDes_10406146"]="A Lv.4 Rough Elunium that contains Elunium metal. Further processing is required to reveal its true value.",
    ["ItemDes_10406147"]="A Lv.3 Blessed Ore that is imbued with protective power.\nUsed as smelting material to produce Blessed Oridecon III, Blessed Elunium III, and Blessed Bradium III.",
    ["ItemDes_10406148"]="A Lv.6 Muspellium that is very strong and highly resistant to flames, but extremely difficult to process.\nUsed as a smelting material to produce Comodo Enchantment Stones.",
    ["ItemDes_10406149"]="A Lv.4 Gold Ore that contains gold. Further processing is required to reveal its true value.\nUsed as a smelting material to produce Gold IV.",
