    ["ItemDes_10406427"]="Equipment upgrading material. Grade II gold. A hard and stable metal that shines as bright as the sun.",
    ["ItemDes_10406428"]="A grade IV Phracon that seems to radiate power from within.\nUpgrading material used to upgrade weapons from levels 141 through 180.",
    ["ItemDes_10406429"]="A grade IV Carnium that seems to radiate power from within.\nUpgrading material used to upgrade armor from levels 71 through 90.",
    ["ItemDes_10406430"]="A grade IV Bascyx that seems to radiate power from within.\nUpgrading material used to upgrade accessories from levels 36 through 45.",
    ["ItemDes_10406431"]="Enchantment material. Used to grant accessories Morroc's Gold enchantment.",
    ["ItemDes_10406432"]="A grade II blessed stone that seems to contain a protective power especially for weapons.\nUsed as a material to protect weapons from levels 9 through 12 from damage upon refinement failure.\nWhen this option is checked during refining, if the weapon breaks afterward, the item will be used to prevent the damage.",
    ["ItemDes_10406433"]="A grade II blessed stone that seems to contain a protective power especially for armor.\nUsed as a material to protect armor from levels 9 through 12 from damage upon refinement failure.\nWhen this option is checked during refining, if the armor breaks afterward, the item will be used to prevent the damage.",
    ["ItemDes_10406434"]="A grade II blessed stone that seems to contain a protective power especially for accessories.\nUsed as a material to protect accessories from levels 9 through 12 from damage upon refinement failure.\nWhen this option is checked during refining, if the accessory breaks afterward, the item will be used to prevent the damage.",
    ["ItemDes_10406435"]="Enchantment material. Used to grant weapons Payon's Gloomy enchantment.",
    ["ItemDes_10406436"]="Enchantment material. Used to grant armor Payon's Petrifying enchantment.",
    ["ItemDes_10406437"]="Enchantment material. Used to grant accessories Payon's Silverspirit enchantment.",
    ["ItemDes_10406438"]="Equipment upgrading material. A crystal corrupted by evil.",
    ["ItemDes_10406439"]="Equipment upgrading material. A crystal that almost appears to be an illusion.",
    ["ItemDes_10406440"]="Equipment upgrading material. Incantations can be heard from it occasionally.",
    ["ItemDes_10406441"]="Enchantment material. Used to grant weapons Geffen's Cold enchantment.",
    ["ItemDes_10406442"]="Enchantment material. Used to grant armor Geffen's Praying enchantment.",
    ["ItemDes_10406443"]="Enchantment material. Used to grant accessories Geffen's Rosecrystal enchantment.",
    ["ItemDes_10406444"]="A grade I blessed stone that seems to contain a protective power created especially for weapons.\nUsed as a material to protect weapons from levels 5 to 8 from damage upon refinement failure.\nWhen this option is checked during refining, if the weapon breaks afterward, the item will be used to prevent the damage.",
    ["ItemDes_10406445"]="A grade I blessed stone that seems to contain a protective power especially for armor.\nUsed as a material to protect armor from levels 5 to 8 from damage upon refinement failure.\nWhen this option is checked during refining, if the armor breaks afterward, the item will be used to prevent the damage.",
