    ["ItemDes_10406501"]="Advanced cooking tool.\nUsed to cook Lv.3–4 food items.",
    ["ItemDes_10406502"]="Repair tool. A regular repair tool commonly seen on the market. Used as a necessary material for the repair of white quality equipment.",
    ["ItemDes_10406503"]="Repair tool. An advanced repair tool that has been enhanced. Used as a necessary material for the repair of blue quality or higher equipment.",
    ["ItemDes_10406504"]="Equipment upgrading material. Fabric decorated with gold.",
    ["ItemDes_10406505"]="Equipment upgrading material. Antique fabric dating back to the glorious days of the past.",
    ["ItemDes_10406506"]="Equipment upgrading material. Thread endowed with the power of sealing.",
    ["ItemDes_10406511"]="One of the hardest metals found in the Ash Vacuum, difficult to temper because of its high density. Used to refine Lv.5–8 accessories.",
    ["ItemDes_10406513"]="A crystal obtained from Undead monsters, it contains the power of death. Used to craft headgears. Buy from vendor shops.",
    ["ItemDes_10406562"]="The sharp tooth of Familiars that can be used to make clothes and decorations. This smelting material can be obtained from specific monsters or purchased from vend shops.",
    ["ItemDes_10406563"]="An eternal flame. This smelting material can be obtained from specific monsters or purchased from vend shops.",
    ["ItemDes_10406564"]="A heart with mysterious immortal powers that will never stop beating. This smelting material can be obtained from specific monsters or purchased from vend shops.",
    ["ItemDes_10406565"]="Rough and firm animal fur. This smelting material can be obtained from specific monsters or purchased from vend shops.",
    ["ItemDes_10406566"]="Animal hide that can be used to make items such as clothes and blankets. This smelting material can be obtained from specific monsters or purchased from vend shops.",
