    ["ItemDes_10406831"]="The poison gland of an insect, touching it with your bare hands can lead to serious consequences. Used by merchants for production. It can be obtained from specific monsters or purchased from vend shops.",
    ["ItemDes_10406832"]="The silk spun by spiders. It's soft, elastic, and sticky.\nFishing bait. Used for fishing in Sograt.",
    ["ItemDes_10406833"]="The stinger at the tip of an insect's tail. You might want to avoid touching it. Used to craft weapons. It can be obtained from specific monsters or purchased from vend shops.",
    ["ItemDes_10406834"]="A splendid feather of a Pecopeco. This is an item required for Guild Orders. It can be obtained from specific monsters or purchased from vend shops.",
    ["ItemDes_10406835"]="A large piece of meat from a big animal. This cooking ingredient can be obtained from specific monsters or purchased from vend shops.",
    ["ItemDes_10406837"]="Wolf pelt that can act as a good thermal insulator. This is an item required for Guild Orders. It can be obtained from specific monsters or purchased from vend shops.",
    ["ItemDes_10406838"]="A withered heart of the dead. Used to craft decorations. It can be obtained from specific monsters or purchased from vend shops.",
    ["ItemDes_10406839"]="Unpleasantly sticky mud obtained from Formless monsters. Used to craft headgears. It can be purchased from vend shops.",
    ["ItemDes_10406840"]="Stone fragments in different shapes. This is an item required for Guild Orders. It can be obtained from specific monsters or purchased from vend shops.",
    ["ItemDes_10406841"]="Dust from a star. Used to craft decorations. It can be obtained from specific monsters or purchased from vend shops.",
    ["ItemDes_10406842"]="I don't know how you got hold of it, but I'm pretty sure its owner is not very pleased.\nFishing bait. Used for fishing in Sograt.",
    ["ItemDes_10406843"]="A snake scale with a sharp edge. Used to craft weapons. It can be obtained from specific monsters or purchased from vend shops.",
    ["ItemDes_10406844"]="A long forked tongue. This is an item required for Guild Orders. It can be obtained from specific monsters or purchased from vend shops.",
    ["ItemDes_10406845"]="The white egg of an ant.\nFishing bait. Used for fishing in Labyrinth Forest.",
    ["ItemDes_10406848"]="A branch from a plant monster, it seems to possess ancient wisdom. Used to craft headgears. It can be purchased from vend shops.",
    ["ItemDes_10406849"]="Surprisingly sharp gills obtained from fish monsters. Used to craft headgears. It can be purchased from vend shops.",
    ["ItemDes_10406850"]="A symbol of eternal love. This rose obtained from Demi-Human monsters will never wither. Used to craft headgears. It can be purchased from vend shops.",
    ["ItemDes_10406851"]="A round skin that has been rolled up and dried. This is an item required for Guild Orders. It can be obtained from specific monsters or purchased from vend shops.",
    ["ItemDes_10406852"]="Black fluid produced by a Marse. Used for cooking. It can be obtained from specific monsters or purchased from vend shops.",
    ["ItemDes_10406853"]="A black, shiny insect carapace. This is an item required for Guild Orders. It can be obtained from specific monsters or purchased from vend shops.",
    ["ItemDes_10406854"]="An old and worn parchment inscribed with an unknown language. Used by merchants for production. It can be obtained from specific monsters or purchased from vend shops.",
    ["ItemDes_10406856"]="An old-fashioned braided pigtail. This is an item required for Guild Orders. It can be obtained from specific monsters or purchased from vend shops.",
    ["ItemDes_10406857"]="A transparent silk thread that is barely visible to the naked eye. Can be obtained from specific monsters or purchased from vend shops.",
    ["ItemDes_10406858"]="Brown dirt and gravels obtained from Formless monsters. Used to craft headgears. It can be purchased from vend shops.",
    ["ItemDes_10406859"]="A pointy demon tail. Can be obtained from specific monsters or purchased from vend shops.",
    ["ItemDes_10406860"]="A Goblin ore that glows blue. Used to craft armor. It can be obtained from specific monsters or purchased from vend shops.",
    ["ItemDes_10406861"]="A Goblin ore that glows red. It can be obtained from specific monsters or purchased from vend shops.",
    ["ItemDes_10406862"]="A broken piece of armor. Its owner must have fought a fierce battle. Used to craft armor. It can be obtained from specific monsters or purchased from vend shops.",
    ["ItemDes_10406863"]="A thick piece of metal that seems to be reusable somewhere. Used to craft armor. It can be obtained from specific monsters or purchased from vend shops.",
    ["ItemDes_10406864"]="A hard and rough fingernail from an Orc. This is an item required for Guild Orders. It can be obtained from specific monsters or purchased from vend shops.",
    ["ItemDes_10406865"]="A gorgeous-looking accessory made of gold, it is very eye-catching indeed. Used to craft armor. It can be obtained from specific monsters or purchased from vend shops.",
    ["ItemDes_10406866"]="A jewel covered in dust, it is nowhere near as splendid as it used to be. Used to craft decorations. It can be obtained from specific monsters or purchased from vend shops.",
    ["ItemDes_10406868"]="A contract signed by the dead, which can be obtained from Undead monsters. Used to craft headgears. It can be purchased from vend shops.",
    ["ItemDes_10406869"]="Long, deep grudges that piled up like fallen leaves. Used to craft talismans. It can be obtained from specific monsters or purchased from vend shops.",
    ["ItemDes_10406874"]="Bacteria that grows on moldy substances. It can cause disease when inhaled. This is an item required for Guild Orders. It can be obtained from specific monsters or purchased from vend shops.",
    ["ItemDes_10406875"]="A gloomy-looking pile of soft soil. This is an item required for Guild Orders. It can be obtained from specific monsters or purchased from vend shops.",
    ["ItemDes_10406877"]="A horse mane burning with flames. Can be obtained from specific monsters or purchased from vend shops.",
    ["ItemDes_10406881"]="The thin, skinny wing of a bat. This cooking ingredient can be contained from specific monsters or purchased form vendors.",
    ["ItemDes_10406882"]="The leaf Smokies use to change form. This is an item required for Guild Orders. It can be obtained from specific monsters or purchased from vend shops.",
    ["ItemDes_10406883"]="An egg shell fragment. This is an item required for Guild Orders. It can be obtained from specific monsters or purchased from vend shops.",
    ["ItemDes_10406885"]="An old, dirty bandage that seems worthless. This is an item required for Guild Orders. It can be obtained from specific monsters or purchased from vend shops.",
    ["ItemDes_10406886"]="The tail of a Yoyo.\nFishing bait. Used for fishing in Sograt.",
    ["ItemDes_10406887"]="The soft and silky tail of a fox. This is an item required for Guild Orders. It can be obtained from specific monsters or purchased from vend shops.",
    ["ItemDes_10406888"]="An ordinary flower found everywhere. This is an item required for Guild Orders. It can be obtained from specific monsters or purchased from vend shops.",
    ["ItemDes_10406890"]="A skull taken from a corpse, it has a spooky glow. Can be obtained from specific monsters or purchased from vend shops.",
    ["ItemDes_10406891"]="Feelers obtained from certain insects or monsters. Used to craft headgears. It can be purchased from vend shops.",
    ["ItemDes_10406892"]="A woody stem. This is an item required for Guild Orders. It can be obtained from specific monsters or purchased from vend shops.",
    ["ItemDes_10406893"]="A ring placed in a cow's nose so that it can be steered with ease.\nFishing bait. Used for fishing in the Underwater Cave.",
    ["ItemDes_10406895"]="A flower with various organs, just like a human. Used for fishing. It can be obtained from specific monsters or purchased from vend shops.",
    ["ItemDes_10406896"]="A Deviruchi's wings that look like those of a bat. Can be obtained from specific monsters or purchased from vend shops.",
    ["ItemDes_10406897"]="The horns of a Deviruchi. Can be obtained from specific monsters or purchased from vend shops.",
    ["ItemDes_10406899"]="A girl's long, soft hair that catches the eyes of males. This is an item required for Guild Orders. It can be obtained from specific monsters or purchased from vend shops.",
    ["ItemDes_10406901"]="Despite being simple to make, this dish uses expensive ingredients and therefore is favored by many.",
    ["ItemDes_10406902"]="Loach deep-fried with orc spices known to be devilish hot. Rumor has it that it packs a punch.",
    ["ItemDes_10406903"]="Meat infused with the sweetness of pumpkin.",
    ["ItemDes_10406904"]="Egg and flour make for a healthy meal.",
    ["ItemDes_10406905"]="Salad with a smooth texture and a grass-like fragrance.",
    ["ItemDes_10406906"]="The addition of Mandragora leaf removed the odor from the prawns.",
    ["ItemDes_10406907"]="Tender frog meat coupled with crispy Chrysalis. This is a dish rich in protein.",
    ["ItemDes_10406908"]="The perfect fusion of fish meat and steamed eggs. It has a savory smell.",
    ["ItemDes_10406909"]="Chewy tentacles with jam.",
    ["ItemDes_10406910"]="This super-spicy fried snack is loved by many.",
    ["ItemDes_10406911"]="Porridge with mushrooms and lotus seeds. It leaves a lingering aftertaste.",
    ["ItemDes_10406912"]="Adding frog's feet to creamy fish soup creates a rich aroma.",
    ["ItemDes_10406913"]="Fish fillet topped with nectar for a natural, sweet flavor.",
    ["ItemDes_10406914"]="This unique recipe has a strange selection of ingredients, but it's surprisingly good.",
    ["ItemDes_10406915"]="Cold bug leg salad that grants the eater unparalleled courage.",
    ["ItemDes_10406916"]="Rat skewer with tomato sauce. It's delicious, provided that you don't mind the main ingredient.",
    ["ItemDes_10406917"]="Snake meat that is tender and fresh, a rare delicacy.",
    ["ItemDes_10406918"]="Crispy bug meets delicious crayfish. Its taste and texture are in perfect ratio.",
    ["ItemDes_10406919"]="Cooked using simple methods, amplifying the natural, sweet taste of the prawns.",
    ["ItemDes_10406920"]="This fish meat is golden and crispy on the outside and soft and tender on the inside. This says a lot about the chef's heat control.",
    ["ItemDes_10406921"]="Tender clam flesh, a common dish for people living along the coast.",
    ["ItemDes_10406922"]="Crispy and crunchy.",
    ["ItemDes_10406923"]="An expensive dish that is popular among the nobles of Prontera.",
    ["ItemDes_10406924"]="Nutritious conch that tastes bitter.",
    ["ItemDes_10406925"]="Fish and crab meat in a single dish—double the satisfaction.",
    ["ItemDes_10406926"]="Fish meat that tastes sour and bitter.",
    ["ItemDes_10406927"]="A secret recipe from an ancient time. The strange combination of items in this recipe is hardly known.",
    ["ItemDes_10406928"]="The perfect combination of sea and land.",
    ["ItemDes_10406929"]="Tender and juicy, the result of combining the art of pan-frying and grilling.",
    ["ItemDes_10406930"]="The golden egg wash envelops the springy squid. It produces a pleasant sizzling sound when it goes into the pan.",
    ["ItemDes_10406931"]="Yummy fish stew.",
    ["ItemDes_10406932"]="A slab of raw tuna.",
    ["ItemDes_10406933"]="The flower fragrance that comes with this grilled meat makes it seem less oily.",
    ["ItemDes_10406934"]="A delicious dish made by stir-frying bamboo with animal tongue.",
    ["ItemDes_10406935"]="Tasty pufferfish. Be careful not to get poisoned!",
    ["ItemDes_10406936"]="The sap's faint fragrance conceals the fishy smell.",
    ["ItemDes_10406937"]="Simply cut into slice and placed onto a plate, presenting the most natural flavor of the ingredients.",
    ["ItemDes_10406938"]="A bento set with carp as its main dish. It has a complex yet delicious taste.",
    ["ItemDes_10406939"]="Even hardcore carnivores go bonkers over this.",
    ["ItemDes_10406940"]="A refreshing dessert that has a sweet and sour taste. Few can resist its temptation.",
    ["ItemDes_10406941"]="The mild mint fragrance removed the greasy taste of roasted meat.",
    ["ItemDes_10406942"]="Clam meat that is charcoal-grilled to neutralize its smell.",
    ["ItemDes_10406943"]="Made using a traditional cooking method that brings out the natural flavor of the trout.",
    ["ItemDes_10406944"]="Saltwater clashes with freshwater, waging a battle on one's tongue.",
    ["ItemDes_10406945"]="A fruity drink with hints of tea that leave one wanting more.",
    ["ItemDes_10406946"]="A very refreshing dish, and the meat tastes good too.",
    ["ItemDes_10406947"]="Made by mixing sliced fish into rice and then rolled into a ball.",
    ["ItemDes_10406948"]="Looks scary, but you will never know how it tastes like unless you open it.",
