    ["ItemDes_10406999"]="Meat infused with the sweetness of pumpkin.",
    ["ItemDes_10407001"]="A mouth-watering juicy apple. Can be used for pet taming. (Each taming will consume this taming item x6.)",
    ["ItemDes_10407002"]="A rare rainbow-colored radish with a strong aroma. Can be used for pet taming. (Each taming will consume this taming item x6.)",
    ["ItemDes_10407003"]="Delicious Savage Babe meat loved by many. Condor finds it to be very tasty. Learn Pet Taming and use it on a Condor to tame it (this pet taming item is consumed on every attempt). Requires Lv.1 Taming.",
    ["ItemDes_10407004"]="Blood taken from some kind of animal, and it has a fishy smell. Can be used for pet taming. (Each taming will consume this taming item x6.)",
    ["ItemDes_10407005"]="Nutritious bones have no other shortcomings except being a little hard. Can be used for pet capture and interaction (Each capture will consume 6 of this capture item).",
    ["ItemDes_10407006"]="This bitter grass becomes sweet when chewed. Can be used for pet capture and interaction (Each capture will consume 6 of this capture item).",
    ["ItemDes_10407007"]="Golden sticky honey that emits a sweet fragrance. Can be used for pet capture and interaction (Each capture will consume 6 of this capture item).",
    ["ItemDes_10407008"]="No mouse can ever resist cheese, at least not Tarou. Learn Pet Taming and use it on a Tarou to tame it (this pet taming item is consumed on every attempt). Requires Lv.1 Taming.",
    ["ItemDes_10407009"]="A delicate poisonous grass, it's extremely dangerous. Can be used for pet capture and interaction (Each capture will consume 6 of this capture item).",
    ["ItemDes_10407010"]="Fresh and juicy grape, high in sugar content. Can be used for pet taming. (Each taming will consume this taming item x6.)",
    ["ItemDes_10407011"]="Transparent dew still rolls on the leaves. Can be used for pet taming. (Each taming will consume this taming item x6.)",
    ["ItemDes_10407012"]="A baked sweet potato. Smokie finds it to be very tasty. Learn Pet Taming and use it on a Smokie to tame it (this pet taming item is consumed on every attempt). Requires Lv.2 Taming.",
    ["ItemDes_10407013"]="Premium quality banana grown in the tropics. Yoyo finds it to be very tasty. Learn Pet Taming and use it on a Yoyo to tame it (this pet taming item is consumed on every attempt). Requires Lv.2 Taming.",
    ["ItemDes_10407014"]="Dull ancient coins that have value as collector items. Can be used for pet taming. (Each taming will consume this taming item x6.)",
    ["ItemDes_10407015"]="Partially worn copper armor, still very awe-inspiring if you look closely. Can be used for pet taming. (Each taming will consume this taming item x6.)",
    ["ItemDes_10407016"]="A drink made of bird's blood. Hunter Fly finds it to be very tasty. Learn Pet Taming and use it on a Hunter Fly to tame it (this pet taming item is consumed on every attempt). Requires Lv.2 Taming.",
    ["ItemDes_10407017"]="A coffin made of oak wood. Whisper really likes it. Learn Pet Taming and use it on a Whisper to tame it (this pet taming item is consumed on every attempt). Requires Lv.3 Taming.",
    ["ItemDes_10407018"]="The juiciest cactus in the desert. Muka finds it to be very tasty. Learn Pet Taming and use it on a Muka to tame it (this pet taming item is consumed on every attempt). Requires Lv.3 Taming.",
    ["ItemDes_10407019"]="A healthy and chubby Hode. Pecopeco finds it to be very tasty. Learn Pet Taming and use it on a Pecopeco to tame it (this pet taming item is consumed on every attempt). Requires Lv.3 Taming.",
    ["ItemDes_10407020"]="Deadly venom secreted and loved by Anacondaqs, it's their favorite item. Learn Pet Taming and use it on a Anacondaq to tame it (this pet taming item is consumed on every attempt). Requires Lv.3 Taming.",
    ["ItemDes_10407021"]="A thick pelt that can be used to keep warm. Sasquatch really likes it. Learn Pet Taming and use it on a Sasquatch to tame it (this pet taming item is consumed on every attempt). Requires Lv.3 Taming.",
    ["ItemDes_10407022"]="The tail of a scorpion that doesn't look like a filling food, but Side Winder finds it to be very tasty. Learn Pet Taming and use it on a Side Winder to tame it (this pet taming item is consumed on every attempt). Requires Lv.3 Taming.",
    ["ItemDes_10407023"]="A magical stone slab. The materials used and inscription cannot be dated. Can be used for pet capture and interaction (Each capture will consume 6 of this capture item).",
    ["ItemDes_10407024"]="A superior quality small wok obtained from an elite chef. Magnolia really likes it. Learn Pet Taming and use it on a Magnolia to tame it (this pet taming item is consumed on every attempt). Requires Lv.3 Taming.",
    ["ItemDes_10407025"]="Moss that drinks morning dew. Marina finds it to be very tasty. Learn Pet Taming and use it on a Marina to tame it (this pet taming item is consumed on every attempt). Requires Lv.4 Taming.",
    ["ItemDes_10407026"]="An arrow made of Mithril. Archer Skeleton really likes it. Learn Pet Taming and use it on an Archer Skeleton to tame it (this pet taming item is consumed on every attempt). Requires Lv.4 Taming.",
    ["ItemDes_10407027"]="It's said this is a relic of a master tamer. Can be used for pet taming and interaction. (Each taming will consume this taming item x6.)",
    ["ItemDes_10407028"]="Ink, darker than night. Anything stained by it is hard to wash off. Can be used for pet taming and interaction. (Each taming will consume this taming item x6.)",
    ["ItemDes_10407029"]="Expensive shells, a good choice for making jewelry. Can be used for pet capture and interaction (Each capture will consume 6 of this capture item).",
    ["ItemDes_10407030"]="Flowers with an elegant fragrance, they have a calming effect. Can be used for pet capture and interaction (Each capture will consume 6 of this capture item).",
    ["ItemDes_10407031"]="An old shabby letter, it seems to have been re-written many times. Can be used for pet capture and interaction (Each capture will consume 6 of this capture item).",
    ["ItemDes_10407032"]="Items once owned by someone's beloved woman a long ago. Bongun really likes it. Learn Pet Taming and use it on a Bongun to tame it (this pet taming item is consumed on every attempt). Requires Lv.4 Taming.",
    ["ItemDes_10407033"]="An old magic broom, it has other uses aside from sweeping. Can be used for pet capture and interaction (Each capture will consume 6 of this capture item).",
    ["ItemDes_10407034"]="A weapon made of pure silver, it is impervious to all evil. Can be used for pet capture and interaction (Each capture will consume 6 of this capture item).",
    ["ItemDes_10407035"]="Scorching blue flames. Nine Tail really likes it. Learn Pet Taming and use it on a Nine Tail to tame it (this pet taming item is consumed on every attempt). Requires Lv.4 Taming.",
    ["ItemDes_10407036"]="Broken egg shards, the creature inside has long gone. Can be used for pet capture and interaction (Each capture will consume 6 of this capture item).",
    ["ItemDes_10407037"]="Flail-wielding Goblin's beloved ring. Learn Pet Taming and use it on a Flail-wielding Goblin to tame it (this pet taming item is consumed on every attempt). Requires Lv.5 Taming.",
    ["ItemDes_10407038"]="Magic milk with a swet, smooth taste. Can be used for pet capture and interaction (Each capture will consume 6 of this capture item).",
    ["ItemDes_10407039"]="Cuffs made of lead. Mace-wielding Kobold really likes it. Learn Pet Taming and use it on a Mace-wielding Kobold to tame it (this pet taming item is consumed on every attempt). Requires Lv.5 Taming.",
    ["ItemDes_10407040"]="A magical certificate of military status. It eminates a smell of iron and blood. Can be used for pet capture and interaction (Each capture will consume 6 of this capture item).",
    ["ItemDes_10407041"]="A hallowed-out pumpkin used for trick or treat. Can be used for pet taming. (Each taming will consume this taming item x6.)",
    ["ItemDes_10407042"]="A hammer made of pure gold. Hammer-wielding Kobold really likes it. Learn Pet Taming and use it on a Hammer-wielding Kobold to tame it (this pet taming item is consumed on every attempt). Requires Lv.5 Taming.",
    ["ItemDes_10407043"]="Axe-wielding Goblin's beloved ring. Learn Pet Taming and use it on a Axe-wielding Goblin to tame it (this pet taming item is consumed on every attempt). Requires Lv.5 Taming.",
    ["ItemDes_10407044"]="A lovely blue ice crystal. Marionette really likes it. Learn Pet Taming and use it on a Marionette to tame it (this pet taming item is consumed on every attempt). Requires Lv.5 Taming.",
    ["ItemDes_10407045"]="Legend says a ghostly soul haunts it. It feels cold to the touch. Can be used for pet taming. (Each taming will consume this taming item x6.)",
    ["ItemDes_10407046"]="Dagger-wielding Goblin's beloved ring. Learn Pet Taming and use it on a Dagger-wielding Goblin to tame it (this pet taming item is consumed on every attempt). Requires Lv.5 Taming.",
    ["ItemDes_10407047"]="A strange stone that emites light at night. The darker the night, the brighter it shines. Can be used for pet capture and interaction (Each capture will consume 6 of this capture item).",
    ["ItemDes_10407048"]="A book that contains the secret for summoning demons. Baphomet Jr. really likes it. Learn Pet Taming and use it on a Baphomet Jr. to tame it (this pet taming item is consumed on every attempt). Requires Lv.5 Taming.",
    ["ItemDes_10407049"]="A dragon scale more dazzling than the sun, nothing can pierce it. Can be used for pet capture and interaction (Each capture will consume 6 of this capture item).",
    ["ItemDes_10407050"]="A leaf that is very soft to the touch and has clearly-visible veins. Used to catch and interact with pets. (Each capture will consume 6 of this capture item.)",
    ["ItemDes_10407051"]="A fruit that is bursting with juice and can be left in the sun to be dried. Used to catch and interact with pets. (Each capture will consume 6 of this capture item.)",
    ["ItemDes_10407052"]="A shiny, round stone. Used to catch and interact with pets. (Each capture will consume 6 of this capture item.)",
    ["ItemDes_10407053"]="Ore dug up from the seabed. Used to catch and interact with pets. (Each capture will consume 6 of this capture item.)",
    ["ItemDes_10407054"]="Freshly-squeezed strawberry juice. You can still see some pulp floating on the surface. Used to catch and interact with pets. (Each capture will consume 6 of this capture item.)",
    ["ItemDes_10407055"]="A shiny gold coin of high value. Used to catch and interact with pets. (Each capture will consume 6 of this capture item.)",
    ["ItemDes_10407056"]="A ring that legends state was left behind by a master beast tamer. A claw mark is carved on the inside. Used to catch and interact with pets. (Each capture will consume 6 of this capture item.)",
    ["ItemDes_10407057"]="A scroll that lets you blend into your environment and lower unfamiliar pets' vigilance. Can be used for pet taming. (Each taming will consume this taming item x6.)",
    ["ItemDes_10407058"]="An exquisitely-made cross crafted of pure silver. Used to catch and interact with pets. (Each capture will consume 6 of this capture item.)",
    ["ItemDes_10407059"]="When you read it, you can hear faint whispers. It's said to have come from a deity. Used to catch and interact with pets. (Each capture will consume 6 of this capture item.)",
    ["ItemDes_10407060"]="A sacred religious tome that dispels doubts. Used to catch and interact with pets. (Each capture will consume 6 of this capture item.)",
    ["ItemDes_10407061"]="A sacred flame that never burns out. Those with evil in their hearts will be burned if they touch it. Used to catch and interact with pets. (Each capture will consume 6 of this capture item.)",
    ["ItemDes_10407062"]="A sharp and ferocious-looking dragon tooth taken from a Black Dragon. Used to catch and interact with pets. (Each capture will consume 6 of this capture item.)",
    ["ItemDes_10407063"]="A gem passed down through several masters. Its bloody scent cannot be dispersed. Used to catch and interact with pets. (Each capture will consume 6 of this capture item.)",
    ["ItemDes_10407064"]="A Crystal Candy Ball. Can be used for taming Garm Baby. (Each taming consumes this taming item x6.)",
    ["ItemDes_10408001"]="A basic projectile used for the Pet Slingshot. Capable of dealing damage equivalent to 10% of the target's max HP (capped at 1,000). This helps trim the target's HP during pet taming.",
    ["ItemDes_10408002"]="A fair projectile used for Pet Slingshot. Capable of dealing damage equivalent to 15% of the target's max HP (capped at 2000). This helps to trim the target's HP during pet taming.",
    ["ItemDes_10408003"]="An advanced projectile used for Pet Slingshot. Capable of dealing damage equivalent to 20% of the target's max HP (capped at 3000). This helps to trim the target's HP during pet taming.",
    ["ItemDes_10409001"]="The invention of a Kafra employee. You can put your pet in this cage and auction it off in the <color=#CA2E0AFF>Diamond Auction House</color>.",
    ["ItemDes_10409002"]="The fruit of painstaking research done by the Geffen Magic Society. Capable of searching for items sold and bought in vend shops and their prices. It can also reveal the location of the corresponding shops.",
