    ["ItemDes_10409231"]="A currency for the Pet Advanced Transfer. Can be used on the Pet interface for transferring pets of the same quality.",
    ["ItemDes_1041"]="Luck that has been compensated from failing to refine armor. Accumulate a certain amount to use to ensure successful refinement.",
    ["ItemDes_10410001"]="It's available in the shape of small figures and claws, which symbolizes the friendship between the pet and its owner. Increases pet Stamina by 18 upon consumption.",
    ["ItemDes_10410002"]="Layers of whipping cream touch up with a cherry on top. So delicious that it's impossible to pass. Increases pet Stamina by 36 upon consumption.",
    ["ItemDes_10410003"]="A heart-shaped cake in pink color embedded with claws with wings. Increases pet Stamina by 72 upon consumption.",
    ["ItemDes_10410004"]="As smooth as butter, as sweet as first love. Feed it to a pet to increase Favor by 200.",
    ["ItemDes_10410005"]="A pet stamina recovery item. Used to restore 1,000 pet stamina.",
    ["ItemDes_10411001"]="Increase pet EXP by 6000 upon consumption.",
    ["ItemDes_10411002"]="Increase pet EXP by 12000 upon consumption.",
    ["ItemDes_10411003"]="Increase pet EXP by 24000 upon consumption.",
    ["ItemDes_10411004"]="Increase Pet Talent level upon consumption.",
    ["ItemDes_10411005"]="This food is said to be a favorite of all pets. Used to increase pet's Favor by 200 points.",
    ["ItemDes_10412001"]="A pet book that can only be read by Neutral attribute pets. It enables the pet to execute Neutral Attribute Attack, which deals Neutral physical damage that is equivalent to 300% of the pet's ATK.",
    ["ItemDes_10412002"]="A pet book that can only be read by Neutral attribute pets. It enables the pet to execute Neutral Attribute Mastery, which grants both the pet and its owner 20% Neutral Attribute Enhancement for 60 seconds.",
    ["ItemDes_10412003"]="A pet book that can only be read by Neutral attribute pets. It enables the pet to execute Neutral Attribute Proficiency, which grants both the pet and its owner 20% bonus damage to Neutral attribute targets and 20% Neutral Resistance for 60 seconds.",
    ["ItemDes_10412004"]="A pet book that can only be read by Neutral attribute pets. It enables the pet to execute Spell Fist, which deals Neutral magic damage that is equivalent to 500% of the pet's M.ATK.",
    ["ItemDes_10412051"]="A pet book that can only be read by Holy attribute pets. It enables the pet to execute Holy Attribute Attack, which deals Holy physical damage that is equivalent to 300% of the pet's ATK.",
    ["ItemDes_10412052"]="A pet book that can only be read by Holy attribute pets. It enables the pet to execute Holy Attribute Mastery, which grants both the pet and its owner 20% Holy Attribute Enhancement for 60 seconds.",
    ["ItemDes_10412053"]="A pet book that can only be read by Holy attribute pets. It enables the pet to execute Holy Attribute Proficiency, which grants both the pet and its owner 20% bonus damage to Holy attribute targets and 20% Holy Resistance for 60 seconds.",
    ["ItemDes_10412054"]="A pet book that can only be read by Holy attribute pets. It enables the pet to execute Holy Light, which deals Holy magic damage that is equivalent to 500% of the pet's M.ATK to a single target and at the same time, dispels Kyrie Eleison effect.",
    ["ItemDes_10412101"]="A pet book that can only be read by Earth attribute pets. It enables the pet to execute Earth Attribute Attack, which deals Earth physical damage that is equivalent to 300% of the pet's ATK.",
    ["ItemDes_10412102"]="A pet book that can only be read by Earth attribute pets. It enables the pet to execute Earth Attribute Mastery, which grants both the pet and its owner 20% Earth Attribute Enhancement for 60 seconds.",
    ["ItemDes_10412103"]="A pet book that can only be read by Earth attribute pets. It enables the pet to execute Earth Attribute Proficiency, which grants both the pet and its owner 20% bonus damage to Earth attribute targets and 20% Earth Resistance for 60 seconds.",
    ["ItemDes_10412104"]="A pet book that can only be read by Earth attribute pets. It enables the pet to execute Heaven's Drive, which commands spikes to protrude from the ground and deals Earth magic damage equivalent to 200% of the pet's M.ATK to enemies within 3 meters of the specified location.",
    ["ItemDes_10412151"]="A pet book that can only be read by Fire attribute pets. It enables the pet to execute Fire Attribute Attack, which deals Fire physical damage that is equivalent to 300% of the pet's ATK.",
    ["ItemDes_10412152"]="A pet book that can only be read by Fire attribute pets. It enables the pet to execute Fire Attribute Mastery, which grants both the pet and its owner 20% Fire Attribute Enhancement for 60 seconds.",
    ["ItemDes_10412153"]="A pet book that can only be read by Fire attribute pets. It enables the pet to execute Fire Attribute Proficiency, which grants both the pet and its owner 20% bonus damage to Fire attribute targets and 20% Fire Resistance for 60 seconds.",
    ["ItemDes_10412154"]="A pet book that can only be read by Fire attribute pets. It enables the pet to execute Fire Bolt, which summons fire bolts from above and deals Fire magic damage that is equivalent to 600% of the pet's M.ATK.",
    ["ItemDes_10412201"]="A pet book that can only be read by Water attribute pets. It enables the pet to execute Water Attribute Attack, which deals Water physical damage that is equivalent to 300% of the pet's ATK.",
    ["ItemDes_10412202"]="A pet book that can only be read by Water attribute pets. It enables the pet to execute Water Attribute Mastery, which grants both the pet and its owner 20% Water Attribute Enhancement for 60 seconds.",
    ["ItemDes_10412203"]="A pet book that can only be read by Water attribute pets. It enables the pet to execute Water Attribute Proficiency, which grants both the pet and its owner 20% bonus damage to Water attribute targets and 20% Water Resistance for 60 seconds.",
    ["ItemDes_10412204"]="A pet book that can only be read by Water attribute pets. It enables the pet to execute Cold Bolt, which summons cold bolts from above and deals Water magic damage that is equivalent to 600% of the pet's M.ATK to a single target.",
    ["ItemDes_10412251"]="A pet book that can only be read by Wind attribute pets. It enables the pet to execute Wind Attribute Attack, which deals Wind physical damage that is equivalent to 300% of the pet's ATK.",
    ["ItemDes_10412252"]="A pet book that can only be read by Wind attribute pets. It enables the pet to execute Wind Attribute Mastery, which grants both the pet and its owner 20% Wind Attribute Enhancement for 60 seconds.",
    ["ItemDes_10412253"]="A pet book that can only be read by Wind attribute pets. It enables the pet to execute Wind Attribute Proficiency, which grants both the pet and its owner 20% bonus damage to Wind attribute targets and 20% Wind Resistance for 60 seconds.",
    ["ItemDes_10412254"]="A pet book that can only be read by Wind attribute pets. It enables the pet to execute Lightning Bolt, which deals Wind magic damage that is equivalent to 600% of the pet's M.ATK to a single target.",
    ["ItemDes_10412301"]="A pet book that can only be read by Shadow attribute pets. It enables the pet to execute Shadow Attribute Attack, which deals Shadow physical damage that is equivalent to 300% of the pet's ATK.",
    ["ItemDes_10412302"]="A pet book that can only be read by Shadow attribute pets. It enables the pet to execute Shadow Attribute Mastery, which grants both the pet and its owner 20% Shadow Attribute Enhancement for 60 seconds.",
    ["ItemDes_10412303"]="A pet book that can only be read by Shadow attribute pets. It enables the pet to execute Shadow Attribute Proficiency, which grants both the pet and its owner 20% bonus damage to Shadow attribute targets and 20% Shadow Resistance for 60 seconds.",
    ["ItemDes_10412304"]="A pet book that can only be read by Shadow attribute pets. It enables the pet to execute Shadow Bolt, which deals Shadow magic damage that is equivalent to 500% of the pet's M.ATK.",
    ["ItemDes_10412351"]="A pet book that can only be read by Ghost attribute pets. It enables the pet to execute Ghost Attribute Attack, which deals Ghost physical damage that is equivalent to 300% of the pet's ATK.",
    ["ItemDes_10412352"]="A pet book that can only be read by Ghost attribute pets. It enables the pet to execute Ghost Attribute Mastery, which grants both the pet and its owner 20% Ghost Attribute Enhancement for 60 seconds.",
    ["ItemDes_10412353"]="A pet book that can only be read by Ghost attribute pets. It enables the pet to execute Ghost Attribute Proficiency, which grants both the pet and its owner 20% bonus damage to Ghost attribute targets and 20% Ghost Resistance for 60 seconds.",
    ["ItemDes_10412354"]="A pet book that can only be read by Ghost attribute pets. It enables the pet to execute Soul Strike, which summons holy spirits and deals Ghost magic damage that is equivalent to 400% of the pet's M.ATK to a single target. Deals an additional 50% bonus damage to Undead targets.",
    ["ItemDes_10412401"]="A pet book that can only be read by Poison attribute pets. It enables the pet to execute Poison Attribute Attack, which deals Poison physical damage that is equivalent to 300% of the pet's ATK.",
    ["ItemDes_10412402"]="A pet book that can only be read by Poison attribute pets. It enables the pet to execute Poison Attribute Mastery, which grants both the pet and its owner 20% Poison Attribute Enhancement for 60 seconds.",
    ["ItemDes_10412403"]="A pet book that can only be read by Poison attribute pets. It enables the pet to execute Poison Attribute Proficiency, which grants both the pet and its owner 20% bonus damage to Poison attribute targets and 20% Poison Resistance for 60 seconds.",
    ["ItemDes_10412404"]="A pet book that can only be read by Poison attribute pets. It enables the pet to execute Envenom, which deals Poison magic damage that is equivalent to 400% of the pet's M.ATK and has a 50% chance to poison the enemy for 5 seconds.",
    ["ItemDes_10412451"]="A pet book that can only be read by Undead Attribute pets. It enables the pet to execute Undead Attribute Attack, which deals Undead physical damage that is equivalent to 300% of the pet's ATK.",
    ["ItemDes_10412452"]="A pet book that can only be read by Undead attribute pets. It enables the pet to execute Undead Attribute Mastery, which grants both the pet and its owner 20% Undead Attribute Enhancement for 60 seconds.",
    ["ItemDes_10412453"]="A pet book that can only be read by Undead attribute pets. It enables the pet to execute Undead Attribute Proficiency, which grants both the pet and its owner 20% bonus damage to Undead attribute targets and 20% Undead Resistance for 60 seconds.",
    ["ItemDes_10412454"]="A pet book that can only be read by Undead attribute pets. It enables the pet to execute Death Gaze, which strikes fear into the target, deals Undead magic damage that is equivalent to 300% of the pet's M.ATK, and stuns the target for 2 seconds.",
    ["ItemDes_10412501"]="A pet book that can be read by pets of any attribute. It enables the pet to execute Harden, which increases its DEF and M.DEF by 200.",
    ["ItemDes_10412502"]="A pet book that can be read by pets of any attribute. It enables the pet to execute Empower, which increases its ATK by 400.",
    ["ItemDes_10412503"]="A pet book that can be read by pets of any attribute. It enables the pet to execute Magic Soul, which increases its M.ATK by 400.",
    ["ItemDes_10412504"]="A pet book that can be read by pets of any attribute. It enables the pet to execute Brace, which increases its Max HP by 20000.",
    ["ItemDes_10412505"]="A pet book that can be read by pets of any attribute. It enables the pet to execute Finesse, which increases its Final Hit Rate and Final Dodge Rate by 30%.",
    ["ItemDes_10412506"]="A pet book that can be read by pets of any attribute. It enables the pet to execute Fatality, which increases its Final Crit Rate and Final Anti-Crit Rate by 30%.",
    ["ItemDes_10412507"]="A pet book that can be read by pets of any attribute. It enables the pet to execute Charge, which increases its Crit Damage by 100%.",
    ["ItemDes_10412508"]="A pet book that can be read by pets of any attribute. It enables the pet to execute Fervor, which increases its Final Attack Speed by 50%.",
    ["ItemDes_10412509"]="A pet book that can be read by pets of any attribute. It enables the pet to execute Swift, which increases its Final haste by 30%.",
    ["ItemDes_10412510"]="A pet book that can be read by pets of any attribute. It enables the pet to execute Counter, which increases its Reflect Damage by 20%.",
    ["ItemDes_10412511"]="A pet book that can be read by pets of any attribute. It enables the pet to execute Lifesteal, which increases its Lifesteal by 20%.",
    ["ItemDes_10412512"]="A pet book that can be read by pets of any attribute. It enables the pet to execute Increase Strength, which increases the STR of both the pet and its owner by 20 for 60 seconds.",
    ["ItemDes_10412513"]="A pet book that can be read by pets of any attribute. It enables the pet to execute Increase Agility, which increases the AGI of both the pet and its owner by 20 for 60 seconds.",
    ["ItemDes_10412514"]="A pet book that can be read by pets of any attribute. It enables the pet to execute Increase Vitality, which increases the VIT of both the pet and its owner by 20 for 60 seconds.",
    ["ItemDes_10412515"]="A pet book that can be read by pets of any attribute. It enables the pet to execute Increase Intelligence, which increases the INT of both the pet and its owner by 20 for 60 seconds.",
    ["ItemDes_10412516"]="A pet book that can be read by pets of any attribute. It enables the pet to execute Increase Dexterity, which increases the DEX of both the pet and its owner by 20 for 60 seconds.",
    ["ItemDes_10412517"]="A pet book that can be read by pets of any attribute. It enables the pet to execute Increase Luck, which increases the LUK of both the pet and its owner by 20 for 60 seconds.",
    ["ItemDes_10412518"]="A pet book that can be read by pets of any attribute. It enables the pet to execute Self-Healing, which is a channeling skill that heals 10% of its Max HP per second for 5 seconds.",
    ["ItemDes_10412519"]="A pet book that can be read by pets of any attribute. It enables the pet to execute Provoke, which forces enemies within 4 meters to attack it for 5 seconds.",
    ["ItemDes_10412520"]="A pet book that can be read by pets of any attribute. It enables the pet to execute Detoxify, which removes Poison effect from itself and all nearby party members (including players and their pets in battle).",
    ["ItemDes_10412521"]="A pet book that can be read by pets of any attribute. It enables the pet to execute Cure, which heals itself or its owner for 300% of its M.ATK.",
    ["ItemDes_10412522"]="A pet book that can be read by pets of any attribute. It enables the pet to execute Recover, which heals all party members for 100% of its M.ATK per second for 5 seconds.",
    ["ItemDes_10412523"]="A pet book that can be read by pets of any attribute. It enables the pet to execute Poison Attack, whereby normal attacks have 30% chance to poison the target for 5 seconds.",
    ["ItemDes_10412524"]="A pet book that can be read by pets of any attribute. It enables the pet to execute Piercing Attack, whereby normal attacks ignore 50% of the target's DEF.",
    ["ItemDes_10412525"]="A pet book that can be read by pets of any attribute. It enables the pet to execute Splashing Attack, whereby normal attacks have 100% chance to deal Neutral physical damage equivalent to 30% of the pet's ATK to surrounding units within a 3 meters fan-shaped area.",
    ["ItemDes_10412526"]="A pet book that can be read by pets of any attribute. It enables the pet to execute Execrating Attack, whereby normal attacks have 30% chance to curse the target for 5 seconds.",
    ["ItemDes_10412527"]="A pet book that can be read by pets of any attribute. It enables the pet to execute Silencing Attack, whereby normal attacks have 30% chance to silence the target for 5 seconds.",
    ["ItemDes_10412528"]="A pet book that can be read by pets of any attribute. It enables the pet to execute Stunning Attack, whereby normal attacks have 30% chance to stun the target for 2 seconds.",
    ["ItemDes_10412529"]="A pet book that can be read by pets of any attribute. It enables the pet to execute Shield Reflect, which reflects 50% incoming melee physical damage for 5 seconds.",
    ["ItemDes_10412551"]="A rare skill book that can be read by any pet. Pets who read this book <color=#40cb5e>have a chance to gain a new skill or have an existing skill replaced</color>. Can be used via the <color=#40cb5e>Pets interface</color>.",
    ["ItemDes_10413001"]="The tough, green stem of a plant.\nFishing bait. Used for fishing at Prontera South Gate.",
    ["ItemDes_10413002"]="A thick piece of leather that is used for multiple purposes. Used to craft armor. It can be obtained from specific monsters or purchased from vend shops.",
    ["ItemDes_10413003"]="A metal plate that is hard enough to protect its wearer. Used to craft armor. It can be obtained from specific monsters or purchased from vend shops.",
    ["ItemDes_10413004"]="The larva of Fabre. Looks harmless.\nFishing bait. Used for fishing at Prontera South Gate.",
    ["ItemDes_10413005"]="The thin tail of a rat. It wiggles along with the current when put into water.\nFishing bait. Used for fishing at Prontera South Gate.",
    ["ItemDes_10413006"]="Cooking ingredient. A part of a beast that has a good balance between fat and lean meat. Suitable for cooking.",
    ["ItemDes_10413007"]="Cooking ingredient. Gooey but nutritious liquid egg.",
    ["ItemDes_10413008"]="Cooking ingredient. Air-dried meat strips that have a crunchy and unique texture.",
    ["ItemDes_10413009"]="Cooking ingredient. Contains all kind of grains and has high nutritional value.",
    ["ItemDes_10413010"]="Cooking ingredient. Coarse salt that is used for exorcisms, but to no avail.",
    ["ItemDes_10413011"]="Cooking ingredient. Sweet candy that is loved by children.",
    ["ItemDes_10413012"]="It is almost impossible to escape if these jagged fangs latch on.\nFishing bait. Used for fishing in Payon East Forest.",
    ["ItemDes_10413013"]="The curled up outer shell of an insect.\nFishing bait. Used for fishing in Payon East Forest.",
    ["ItemDes_10413014"]="Give this shell a push and it will go on spinning forever.\nFishing bait. Used for fishing in Payon East Forest.",
    ["ItemDes_10413015"]="A slab of green and rotten meat. It gives off a foul smell.\nFishing bait. Used for fishing in Munak Cave 1F.",
    ["ItemDes_10413016"]="A gray flea that can jump really high.\nFishing bait. Used for fishing in Munak Cave 1F.",
    ["ItemDes_10413017"]="A small piece of beehive. It is adhesive and can be used to stick onto something.\nFishing bait. Used for fishing in Munak Cave 1F.",
    ["ItemDes_10413018"]="Cooking ingredient. The meat of a kobold. Looks the same as any dog meat.",
    ["ItemDes_10413019"]="Cooking ingredient. The dried rations of a traveler. I wonder who that unlucky person is...",
    ["ItemDes_10413020"]="Cooking ingredient. A special type of spice made by orcs. It has a strong and tangy smell.",
    ["ItemDes_10413021"]="Cooking ingredient. The blood of a demon. One can sense the ominous aura emitting from it from afar.",
    ["ItemDes_10413022"]="Cooking ingredient. A sour, citrus fruit. A good choice for quenching thirst.",
    ["ItemDes_10413023"]="Cooking ingredient. The meat of a dragon. Rare ingredients like this are quite valuable.",
    ["ItemDes_10413024"]="Cooking ingredient. A can packed with raw meat. Has to be processed before eating.",
    ["ItemDes_10413025"]="Cooking ingredient. Fuel that is originally used to power machines. Perhaps using it for cooking can inspire some new dishes.",
    ["ItemDes_10413026"]="Nasty-looking slime from a Thief Bug. This is an item required for Guild Orders. It can be obtained from specific monsters or purchased from vend shops.",
    ["ItemDes_10413027"]="The sharp tooth of an animal. This is an item required for Guild Orders. It can be obtained from specific monsters or purchased from vend shops.",
    ["ItemDes_10413028"]="A Caramel hide with sharp quills.\nFishing bait. Used for fishing at Prontera West Gate.",
    ["ItemDes_10413029"]="Small bone fragments with sharp edges. This is an item required for Guild Orders. It can be obtained from specific monsters or purchased from vend shops.",
    ["ItemDes_10413030"]="A pile of dust. This is an item required for Guild Orders. It can be obtained from specific monsters or purchased from vend shops.",
    ["ItemDes_10413031"]="The air sac of an animal that contains some gas inside. This is an item required for Guild Orders. It can be obtained from specific monsters or purchased from vend shops.",
    ["ItemDes_10413032"]="A pair of broken shackles whose owner can no longer be traced. Used by merchants for production. It can be obtained from specific monsters or purchased from vend shops.",
    ["ItemDes_10413033"]="A mysterious necklace that is rumored to possess the power of clairvoyance. Can be obtained from specific monsters or purchased from vend shops.",
    ["ItemDes_10413034"]="The remains of something burnt. It has a smoky smell. This is an item required for Guild Orders. It can be obtained from specific monsters or purchased from vend shops.",
    ["ItemDes_10413035"]="Fragment of a Goblin's mask. This is an item required for Guild Orders. It can be obtained from specific monsters or purchased from vend shops.",
    ["ItemDes_10413036"]="A sharp and strong Kobold tooth. This is an item required for Guild Orders. It can be obtained from specific monsters or purchased from vend shops.",
    ["ItemDes_10413037"]="Dew formed on a plant, it feels refreshing. Used by merchants for production. It can be obtained from specific monsters or purchased from vend shops.",
    ["ItemDes_10413038"]="Cooking ingredient. A tender green plant that grows in dark, damp places.",
    ["ItemDes_10413039"]="Part of Yggdrasil. Used by merchants for production. It can be obtained from specific monsters or purchased from vend shops.",
    ["ItemDes_10413040"]="Worn-out tools that might be reusable. Used by merchants for production. It can be obtained from specific monsters or purchased from vend shops.",
    ["ItemDes_10413041"]="The hard shell of a Vadon that produces a dull thud on impact. Used to craft armor. It can be obtained from specific monsters or purchased from vend shops.",
    ["ItemDes_10413042"]="A hammer made of steel. Can be used to craft equipment.",
    ["ItemDes_10413043"]="A hammer made of silver. Can be used to craft equipment.",
    ["ItemDes_10413044"]="A hammer made of gold. Can be used to craft equipment.",
    ["ItemDes_10413045"]="Cooking ingredient. Flattened ox head meat, can be processed so that it's easy to store.",
    ["ItemDes_10413046"]="Cooking ingredient. Chocolate with malicious intent.",
    ["ItemDes_10413047"]="Cooking ingredient. A rare type of flower petal that grows on thorns.",
    ["ItemDes_10413048"]="Outdoor cooking kit.\nUsed to cook Lv.5-6 food items.",
    ["ItemDes_10413049"]="A dark green eyeball obtained from a brute. Used to craft headgears. It can be purchased from vend shops.",
    ["ItemDes_10413050"]="The scale of a Fish monster, it looks rather spooky. Used to craft headgears. It can be purchased from vend shops.",
    ["ItemDes_10413051"]="A flat pan suitable for frying.\nUsed to cook Lv.1-2 food items.",
    ["ItemDes_10413052"]="A broken arrow that might be reusable. Used to craft arrows. It can be purchased from Sundries Merchants or vend shops.",
    ["ItemDes_10413053"]="A broken trap that might be reusable. Used to craft traps. It can be purchased from Sundries Merchants or vend shops.",
    ["ItemDes_10413054"]="The ear of an orc. Some people think that it is a warrior's medal.\nThis is an item on Guild Orders. It can be obtained from specific monsters or purchased from vend shops.",
    ["ItemDes_10413055"]="Unwanted metal that might still have some value.\nThis is an item on Guild Orders. It can be obtained from specific monsters or purchased from vend shops.",
    ["ItemDes_10413056"]="An item that belonged to the dead. It seems like it's safe to take it.\nThis is an item on Guild Orders. It can be obtained from specific monsters or purchased from vend shops.",
    ["ItemDes_10413057"]="A metal buckle that seems to be part of a piece of clothing.\nThis is an item on Guild Orders. It can be obtained from specific monsters or purchased from vend shops.",
    ["ItemDes_10413058"]="An elastic ball that can bounce very high.\nThis is an item on Guild Orders. It can be obtained from specific monsters or purchased from vend shops.",
    ["ItemDes_10413059"]="Broken glass that should be handled with care.\nThis is an item on Guild Orders. It can be obtained from specific monsters or purchased from vend shops.",
    ["ItemDes_10413060"]="An unusual bone fragment that is barely visible to the naked eye.\nThis is an item on Guild Orders. It can be obtained from specific monsters or purchased from vend shops.",
    ["ItemDes_10413061"]="Torn pages from an old book, the text written on them no longer legible.\nThis is an item on Guild Orders. It can be obtained from specific monsters or purchased from vend shops.",
    ["ItemDes_10413062"]="Shackles used to confine prisoners.\nThis is an item on Guild Orders. It can be obtained from specific monsters or purchased from vend shops.",
    ["ItemDes_10413063"]="Smelting material. A cursed blade that is rumored to bring misfortune upon those who were hurt by it.",
    ["ItemDes_10413064"]="I... I'm not drunk, I can have a few more! Used to make potions. It can be purchased from Sundries Merchants or vend shops.",
    ["ItemDes_10413065"]="Smelting material. A piece of fragile cloth that has become worn-out with age.",
    ["ItemDes_10413066"]="Smelting material. An old but classic-looking armor plate.",
    ["ItemDes_10413067"]="Smelting material. Leather with spikes. Although it does provide a form of protection, but it also deters people from getting close.",
    ["ItemDes_10413068"]="Smelting material. Extremely strong shackles used to restrict movements.",
    ["ItemDes_10413069"]="A bug with a light body which allowed it to float in the air.\nFishing bait. Used for fishing in Orc Dungeon.",
    ["ItemDes_10413070"]="A dangerous organism that wriggles. It would wrap itself around any living thing nearby.\nFishing bait. Used for fishing in Orc Dungeon.",
    ["ItemDes_10413071"]="An item necessary for hunters to use trap-related skills.",
    ["ItemDes_10413072"]="A secret recipe from an ancient time. The strange combination of items in this recipe is hardly known.\nFinal Attack Speed +20% for 30 minutes.",
    ["ItemDes_10413073"]="The flower fragrance that comes with this grilled meat makes it seem less oily.\nDamage to Large Monsters +7.5% for 30 minutes.",
    ["ItemDes_10413074"]="A slab of raw tuna.\nFinal Magic Damage Bonus +4% for 30 minutes.",
    ["ItemDes_10413075"]="A delicious dish made by stir-frying bamboo with animal tongue.\nDamage to Medium Monsters +7.5% for 30 minutes.",
    ["ItemDes_10413076"]="Tasty pufferfish. Be careful not to get poisoned!\nDamage to Small Monsters +7.5% for 30 minutes.",
    ["ItemDes_10413077"]="Even hardcore carnivores go bonkers over this.\nPhysical Lifesteal +6% for 30 minutes.",
    ["ItemDes_10413078"]="A refreshing dessert that has a sweet and sour taste. Few can resist its temptation.\nPhysical Reflect Damage +6% for 30 minutes.",
    ["ItemDes_10413079"]="The mild mint fragrance removed the greasy taste of roasted meat.\nMagic Lifesteal +6% for 30 minutes.",
    ["ItemDes_10413080"]="Clam meat that is charcoal-grilled to neutralize its smell.\nMagic Reflect Damage +6% for 30 minutes.",
    ["ItemDes_10413081"]="A very refreshing dish, and the meat tastes good too.\nDebuff Resistance +10% for 30 minutes.",
    ["ItemDes_10413082"]="Family-sized cooking kit.\nUsed to cook Lv.7-9 food items.",
