    ["ItemDes_10413168"]="A pipe obtained from the Corsair. Can be used to craft equipment.",
    ["ItemDes_10413169"]="A chain hook obtained from the Corsair. Can be used to craft equipment.",
    ["ItemDes_10413170"]="A bone obtained from the Corsair. Can be used to craft equipment.",
    ["ItemDes_10413171"]="A crow feather obtained from the Corsair. Can be used to craft equipment.",
    ["ItemDes_10413172"]="A bone obtained from Osiris. Can be used to craft equipment.",
    ["ItemDes_10413173"]="A heart obtained from Osiris. Can be used to craft equipment.",
    ["ItemDes_10413174"]="A core obtained from Osiris. Can be used to craft equipment.",
    ["ItemDes_10413175"]="A curse obtained from Osiris. Can be used to craft equipment.",
    ["ItemDes_10413176"]="A bandage obtained from Osiris. Can be used to craft equipment.",
    ["ItemDes_10413177"]="A pearl obtained from Osiris. Can be used to craft equipment.",
    ["ItemDes_10413178"]="A whirlpool obtained from Strouf. Can be used to craft equipment.",
    ["ItemDes_10413179"]="Fury obtained from Strouf. Can be used to craft equipment.",
    ["ItemDes_10413180"]="A beard obtained from Strouf. Can be used to craft equipment.",
    ["ItemDes_10413181"]="A broken halberd obtained from Strouf. Can be used to craft equipment.",
    ["ItemDes_10413182"]="A fin obtained from Strouf. Can be used to craft equipment.",
    ["ItemDes_10413183"]="A crystal core obtained from Strouf. Can be used to craft equipment.",
    ["ItemDes_10413184"]="A tooth obtained from Moonlight Flower. Can be used to craft equipment.",
    ["ItemDes_10413185"]="A heart obtained from Moonlight Flower. Can be used to craft equipment.",
    ["ItemDes_10413186"]="A tail obtained from Moonlight Flower. Can be used to craft equipment.",
    ["ItemDes_10413187"]="A bell obtained from Moonlight Flower. Can be used to craft equipment.",
    ["ItemDes_10413188"]="Gloves obtained from Moonlight Flower. Can be used to craft equipment.",
    ["ItemDes_10413189"]="A claw obtained from Moonlight Flower. Can be used to craft equipment.",
    ["ItemDes_10413190"]="A glass obtained from Dracula. Can be used to craft equipment.",
    ["ItemDes_10413191"]="Dark flame obtained from Dracula. Can be used to craft equipment.",
    ["ItemDes_10413192"]="A heart obtained from Dracula. Can be used to craft equipment.",
    ["ItemDes_10413193"]="A fang obtained from Dracula. Can be used to craft equipment.",
    ["ItemDes_10413194"]="Collar obtained from Dracula. Can be used to craft equipment.",
    ["ItemDes_10413195"]="A fingernail obtained from Dracula. Can be used to craft equipment.",
    ["ItemDes_10413196"]="The tooth of a fox. This is an item for COC Missions. It can be obtained from specific monsters or purchased from the COC.",
    ["ItemDes_10413197"]="A common type of adhesive. This is an item for COC Missions. It can be obtained from specific monsters or purchased from the COC.",
    ["ItemDes_10413198"]="The venom of a monster, it should be used with caution. This is an item for COC Missions. It can be obtained from specific monsters or purchased from the COC.",
    ["ItemDes_10413199"]="The thin wing of a Mantis. This is an item for COC Missions. It can be obtained from specific monsters or purchased from the COC.",
    ["ItemDes_10413200"]="It feels very smooth to the touch. This is an item for COC Missions. It can be obtained from specific monsters or purchased from the COC.",
    ["ItemDes_10413201"]="The scale of an Obeaune. This is an item for COC Missions. It can be obtained from specific monsters or purchased from the COC.",
    ["ItemDes_10413202"]="Animal offal. This is an item for COC Missions. It can be obtained from specific monsters or purchased from the COC.",
    ["ItemDes_10413203"]="Smelting ingredient. Holds the spirit of pranking.",
    ["ItemDes_10413204"]="Gift item. Autumn's osmanthus branches and leaves. With their fresh, pleasant fragrance, they are most suitable for pairing with wine and creating a romantic atmosphere.",
    ["ItemDes_10413205"]="Gift item. A weapon with a style that seems to precede Ragnarok. It is full of history and may or may not have a soul attached to it.",
    ["ItemDes_10413206"]="Gift item. Wine made from a mysterious fruit. It has a bright, blood-red color and an incredibly complex taste. It seems it would be perfect for a night of storytelling.",
    ["ItemDes_10413207"]="Gift item. A somewhat old-looking bracelet made of pure gold and covered in gorgeous gemstones. It's unknown who left it behind.",
    ["ItemDes_10413208"]="Gift item. A maple-flavored cake that seems to be some chef's secret recipe. It tastes like pure bliss.",
    ["ItemDes_10413209"]="Gift item. A cute plush doll pendant. People can't help but smile at its cute expression. It's a healing gift that can bring happiness.",
    ["ItemDes_10413210"]="Gift item. Blue scales that glitter in the night. They seem to have come from some deep-sea fish.",
    ["ItemDes_10413211"]="Gift item. A white coral crystal from the seabed. It's said to emit a mysterious blue glow under the moonlight.",
    ["ItemDes_10413212"]="Gift item. A treasure chest from an unknown ancient shipwreck, overgrown with seaweed. Its value is unknown.",
    ["ItemDes_10413213"]="Gift item. High-quality pearls scattered at the bottom of the lake. They seem to have come not from natural clam shells, but from a treasure chest overturned by some nobles.",
    ["ItemDes_10413214"]="Gift item. A hard and warm yellow gemstone that becomes warm due to human body temperature. It's a kind of valuable decorative ore.",
    ["ItemDes_10413215"]="Gift item. Ore formed by the sudden cooling of lava flowing out of a volcano. It is said the person who possesses it will never cry again. This crystal-clear black gem is also an indispensable accessory for fashionable people.",
    ["ItemDes_10413216"]="Gift item. A mysterious gemstone that possesses a strong divination power. It is especially expensive due to its beautiful appearance and seems to be a must-have for those interested in the occult.",
    ["ItemDes_10413217"]="Gift item. A crystalline ore with a faint green luster. It is as hard as steel, and it is commonly used for decorative purposes due to its excellent brilliance.",
    ["ItemDes_10413218"]="Gift item. The dew of dawn taken from the leaves of plants deep in the forest. It is sweet, cool, and reminiscent of the nighttime summer breeze.",
    ["ItemDes_10413219"]="Gift item. A golden feather, with a faint luster of dark gold. It seems to come from some kind of legendary sacred bird, but no one has seen what it actually looks like.",
    ["ItemDes_10413220"]="Gift item. A decaying plant that exudes hidden magic power. Due to its decay, it is impossible to distinguish what it once was. It is often used to provide nutrients for new plants.",
    ["ItemDes_10413221"]="Gift item. These delicate green leaves are often used as bookmarks because they are so cute and light.",
    ["ItemDes_10413222"]="\"Flessi\" is carved in the bottom of this antique music box, while the top has a sad clown wearing an over-the-top wig on it. Seemingly worn down over time, the paint is chipping off somewhat, and the brass winding mechanism has begun to rust a bit, making it no longer able to be wound up. Perhaps the only way you'll be able to understand the story behind it is by asking the music box's owner, Flessi. Once used, your fate will be mysteriously bound to Flessi's.",
    ["ItemDes_10413223"]="The continent of Midgard is home to the most precious of crystals. Legend states that it was formed before the destruction of Yggdrasil and was soaked in the power of its roots. It is perfectly clear and free of impurities, and it emits a colorful glow beneath the sunlight. The crystal merchant Sinclair is rumored to be searching everywhere for it. Once used, your fate will be mysteriously bound to Sinclair's.",
    ["ItemDes_10413224"]="This translucent, clever-looking eye belonging to the Wolf King looks like a blue gem without careful inspection. Among Desert Wolf packs, whenever a Wolf King dies, the other wolves in their pack will remove the Wolf King's eyeball and pass it down as a vessel of strength. It's said to be a necessary material for crafting Oliver Wolf Headgear, and recently, Geffen's headgear merchant Ingael has issued a bounty in an attempt to get it. Once used, your fate will be mysteriously bound to Ingael's.",
    ["ItemDes_10413226"]="The figure of a race car from another world. It is said that in this other world, a race car is a super mount with speed comparable to using a Fly Wing.\nIt is rumored to be a beloved item of an adventurer from another world who is popular in Prontera. Give this to this adventurer to increase your Favor with him.",
    ["ItemDes_10413227"]="The figure of a race car from another world. Its bright green body gives it a feeling of boundless energy that makes one unable to look away.\nIt is rumored to be a beloved item of an adventurer from another world who is popular in Prontera. Give this to this adventurer to increase your Favor with him",
    ["ItemDes_10413228"]="The figure of a race car from another world. The exquisite appearance seems to hint that this race car from another world is a remarkable invention.\nIt is rumored to be a beloved item of an adventurer from another world who is popular in Prontera. Give this adventurer to increase your Favor with him",
    ["ItemDes_10413229"]="Part of a meteorite found in Sograt Desert. Emitting a faint reddish glow, it seems to contain a mysterious power. However, no one can say exactly what purpose it may serve. Rumor has it that Hollgrehenn, the greatest blacksmith in Prontera, is collecting meteorite fragments just like this one.",
    ["ItemDes_10413230"]="A sharp bone obtained from the Dark Lord. Can be used to craft equipment.",
    ["ItemDes_10413231"]="A demon sigil obtained from the Dark Lord. Can be used to craft equipment.",
    ["ItemDes_10413232"]="Greed obtained from the Dark Lord. Can be used to craft equipment.",
    ["ItemDes_10413233"]="Gold jewelry obtained from the Dark Lord. Can be used to craft equipment.",
    ["ItemDes_10413234"]="Hatred obtained from the Dark Lord. Can be used to craft equipment.",
    ["ItemDes_10413235"]="Corrupted breath obtained from the Dark Lord. Can be used to craft equipment.",
    ["ItemDes_10413236"]="A bloodstained plate with a foul stench.\nFishing bait. Used for fishing in Glast Heim.",
    ["ItemDes_10413237"]="A shattered ornament ball that is of no use, yet still retains its bright color.\nFishing bait. Used for fishing in Glast Heim.",
    ["ItemDes_10413238"]="A tattered page from ancient tome. A glimmer of magic shines through the words.\nFishing bait. Used for fishing in Glast Heim.",
    ["ItemDes_10413239"]="Cooking kit reserved for the royals.\nUsed to cook Lv.9 food items.",
    ["ItemDes_10413240"]="A kit containing Advanced White Potions. Use it to obtain 100 Advanced White Potions.",
    ["ItemDes_10413241"]="A kit containing Advanced White Potions (PVP). Use it to obtain 100 Advanced White Potions (PVP).",
    ["ItemDes_10413242"]="Cooking ingredient. Fresh sea bream that can be grilled for a simple yet tasty dish.",
    ["ItemDes_10413243"]="Cooking ingredient. A type of crab that crystallizes salt and spreads it across the surface of its body.",
    ["ItemDes_10413244"]="Resembles both a lizard and an eel. Feeds on nutritious worms.\nSmelting material. Used to synthesize High Density Elunium.",
    ["ItemDes_10413245"]="A fish that's good at concealing itself. Often hides beneath fine sand to lie in wait for scented prey.\nSmelting material. Used to synthesize High Density Oridecon.",
    ["ItemDes_10413246"]="Ore found on the sea floor. Has a natural magnetic force and can attach itself to metal.\nSmelting material. Used to synthesize High Density Bradium.",
    ["ItemDes_10413247"]="A marine sturgeon with crisscrossing teeth. It sometimes uses debris or wood chips to sharpen its teeth.\nSmelting Material used to synthesize Phracon V.",
    ["ItemDes_10413248"]="A large marina that is attracted to food with sugar.\nSmelting Material used to synthesize Carnium V.",
    ["ItemDes_10413249"]="A group of scavenging crabs, often seen as ominous things.\nSmelting Material used to synthesize Bascyx V.",
    ["ItemDes_10413250"]="A fish with a dark brown pattern that looks like rust spots from afar.\nSmelting Material used to synthesize Weapon Protection Stone III.",
    ["ItemDes_10413251"]="Sensitive to scented bait, hence the name.\nSmelting Material used to synthesize Protected Elunium III.",
    ["ItemDes_10413252"]="A small fish with a pointed mouth.\nSmelting Material used to synthesize Protected Bradium III.",
    ["ItemDes_10413253"]="Surgeonfish with a royal blue and bright yellow body. It seems to offer a pretty good taste too?",
    ["ItemDes_10413254"]="Be careful not to hurt your toes by what may look like steamed buns on the beach! These box crabs are Comodo's signature creatures.",
    ["ItemDes_10413255"]="Precious species that are often caught because they are curious about everything.",
    ["ItemDes_10413256"]="An ancient species of fish with an ugly appearance, its luminous feelers are the bait for its prey.",
    ["ItemDes_10413257"]="Sea urchins with huge thorns. It's impossible to eat them even if they are caught.",
    ["ItemDes_10413258"]="Fish with no meat at all. Perhaps it makes a delicious fish soup.",
    ["ItemDes_10413259"]="The fine-scaled fish with sharp horns on their heads live in dark caves.",
    ["ItemDes_10413260"]="A hard-shelled conch with curved, spiny thorns that inhabits the silt at the bottom of the water.",
    ["ItemDes_10413261"]="Exotic species with a powerful bite. Quite aggressive.",
    ["ItemDes_10413262"]="Fishy, smelly baits in twisted shapes and with wet beetle mucus on them.\nFishing bait. Used for fishing in Umbala's fishing points.",
    ["ItemDes_10413263"]="The wool ball made of biological fibers will swell when it meets water.\nFishing bait. Used for fishing in Umbala's fishing points.",
    ["ItemDes_10413264"]="Cut from the corpses of diseased creatures, barely retaining the flesh.\nFishing bait. Used for fishing in Umbala's fishing points.",
    ["ItemDes_10413265"]="You and your cat both want to have a taste of this saury.",
    ["ItemDes_10413266"]="A kind of ferocious fish that is popular because of its unique taste.",
    ["ItemDes_10413267"]="Shellfish that live on underwater rocks. The taste is excellent.",
    ["ItemDes_10413268"]="A very precious fish that only lives in unpolluted and beautiful waters.",
    ["ItemDes_10413269"]="People named it the Horse-Faced Fish because of how its body resembles a horse face.",
    ["ItemDes_10413270"]="A fish that looks weird and lives in the deep sea. FYI: Seahorses are one of the few creatures where males are responsible for giving birth.",
    ["ItemDes_10413271"]="Fishing baits that are made of escargot. It's said that it's one of the baits that yield the highest return.",
    ["ItemDes_10413272"]="Fishing baits that are made of mashed shrimp. It's suitable for shallow waters.",
    ["ItemDes_10413273"]="Fishing baits that are made of plastics. Almost looks real.",
    ["ItemDes_10413274"]="A can of magical fishing baits. It's said that you can use it to fish up the mysterious Pet Food!\nFishing Baits. Can be used at the fishing spot in the Underwater Cave.",
    ["ItemDes_10413275"]="Special honey cookies are a sweetness no one can resist.\nFishing bait that can be used in Einbroch's fishing points.",
    ["ItemDes_10413276"]="Decayed venomous canine contains lethal venom that can kill a person in just a single drop.\nFishing bait that can be used in Einbroch's fishing points.",
    ["ItemDes_10413277"]="The slag from intense smelting processes is packed with nutrients.\nFishing bait that can be used in Einbroch's fishing points.",
    ["ItemDes_10413278"]="Maybe... you could fish with it? Fishing bait. Used for fishing in Rachel.",
    ["ItemDes_10413279"]="Don't stare at it too long. Fishing bait. Used for fishing in Rachel.",
    ["ItemDes_10413280"]="Isn't it a bit too gross for fishing? Fishing bait. Used for fishing in Rachel.",
    ["ItemDes_10413281"]="Made by soaking and fermenting boiled old corn until soft and sweet.\nFishing bait, usable at the Bio Lab Fishing Spot.",
    ["ItemDes_10413282"]="Steamed sweet potato mashed with millet and flour—works great on all kinds of fish.\nFishing bait, usable at the Bio Lab Fishing Spot.",
    ["ItemDes_10413283"]="Lightly roast barley steeped in beer for three days before use.\nFishing bait, usable at the Bio Lab Fishing Spot.",
    ["ItemDes_10413284"]="Dried krill ground into powder, mixed with cheese and milk—perfect for carnivorous fish.\nFishing bait, usable at the Bio Lab Fishing Spot.",
    ["ItemDes_10413285"]="Mixed minced meat molded into shape, a super versatile bait.\nFishing bait, usable at the Bio Lab Fishing Spot.",
    ["ItemDes_10413286"]="Who in the world thought this could be used for fishing?\nFishing bait, usable at the Bio Lab Fishing Spot.",
    ["ItemDes_10415001"]="Cooking ingredient shaped like a crane. The flower is a symbol of longing for a lover, regardless of where or when.",
    ["ItemDes_10415002"]="Cooking ingredient. This flower is very rare and extremely difficult to come across, but somehow it blooms like a weed somewhere on Comodo.",
    ["ItemDes_10415003"]="Cooking ingredient. It can well adapt to the sandy environment of Comodo and is a very nutritious plant.",
    ["ItemDes_10415004"]="A violet flower that is highly ornamental. It has a variety of usage and is easy to grow.\nSmelting material. It can be used to synthesize Enchantment Stones of Comodo.",
    ["ItemDes_10415005"]="A flower that blooms on grass branches that look like wolf tails, as if a sword that slashes monsters.\nSmelting material. It can be used to synthesize Enchantment Stones of Comodo.",
    ["ItemDes_10415006"]="The Comodo residents describe it as a flame that leaped and danced in the wind.\nSmelting material. It can be used to synthesize Enchantment Stones of Comodo.",
    ["ItemDes_10415007"]="A gray herb with a unique scent and energizing properties.",
    ["ItemDes_10416001"]="A mysterious metal known as Oridecon. It is the hardest matter ever found.\nUsed as a material to refine weapons from levels 13 through 15.",
    ["ItemDes_10416002"]="A very light, non-toxic metal.\nUsed as a material to refine armor from levels 13 through 15.",
    ["ItemDes_10416003"]="One of the hardest metals found in the Ash Vacuum, difficult to temper because of its high density.\nUsed as a material to refine accessories from levels 13 through 15.",
    ["ItemDes_10416132"]="Hollgrehenn's masterpiece. There's a 5% chance to instantly boost the equipment's refinement level to Lv.5 without downgrading or damaging it. Can be used on all equipment with a refinement level lower than Lv.5.",
    ["ItemDes_10416133"]="Hollgrehenn's masterpiece. There's a 5% chance to instantly boost the equipment's refinement level to Lv.6 without downgrading or damaging it. Can be used on all equipment with a refinement level lower than Lv.6.",
    ["ItemDes_10416134"]="Hollgrehenn's masterpiece. There's a 5% chance to instantly boost the equipment's refinement level to Lv.7 without downgrading or damaging it. Can be used on all equipment with a refinement level lower than Lv.7.",
    ["ItemDes_10416135"]="Hollgrehenn's masterpiece. There's a 5% chance to instantly boost the equipment's refinement level to Lv.8 without downgrading or damaging it. Can be used on all equipment with a refinement level lower than Lv.8.",
    ["ItemDes_10416140"]="Hollgrehenn's masterpiece. There's a 5% chance to instantly boost the equipment's refinement level to Lv.5 without downgrading or damaging it. Can be used on all equipment with a refinement level lower than Lv.5.",
    ["ItemDes_10416141"]="Hollgrehenn's masterpiece. There's a 5% chance to instantly boost the equipment's refinement level to Lv.6 without downgrading or damaging it. Can be used on all equipment with a refinement level lower than Lv.6.",
    ["ItemDes_10416142"]="Hollgrehenn's masterpiece. There's a 5% chance to instantly boost the equipment's refinement level to Lv.7 without downgrading or damaging it. Can be used on all equipment with a refinement level lower than Lv.7.",
    ["ItemDes_10416143"]="Hollgrehenn's masterpiece. There's a 5% chance to instantly boost the equipment's refinement level to Lv.8 without downgrading or damaging it. Can be used on all equipment with a refinement level lower than Lv.8.",
    ["ItemDes_10416146"]="Hollgrehenn's masterpiece. There's a 5% chance to instantly boost the equipment's refinement level from Lv.12 to Lv.13 without downgrading or damaging it. Can only be used on equipment with a Lv.12 refinement level.",
    ["ItemDes_10416147"]="Hollgrehenn's masterpiece. There's a 5% chance to instantly boost the equipment's refinement level from Lv.13 to Lv.14 without downgrading or damaging it. Can only be used on equipment with a Lv.13 refinement level.",
    ["ItemDes_10416148"]="Hollgrehenn's masterpiece. There's a 5% chance to instantly boost the equipment's refinement level from Lv.14 to Lv.15 without downgrading or damaging it. Can only be used on equipment with a Lv.14 refinement level.",
    ["ItemDes_10416200"]="Hollgrehenn's masterpiece. There's a 5% chance to instantly boost the equipment's refinement level to Lv.10 without downgrading or damaging it. Can be used on all equipment with a refinement level lower than Lv.10.",
    ["ItemDes_10416201"]="Hollgrehenn's masterpiece. There's a 5% chance to instantly boost the equipment's refinement level to Lv.11 without downgrading or damaging it. Can be used on all equipment with a refinement level lower than Lv.11.",
    ["ItemDes_10416202"]="Hollgrehenn's masterpiece. There's a 5% chance to instantly boost the equipment's refinement level to Lv.12 without downgrading or damaging it. Can be used on all equipment with a refinement level lower than Lv.12.",
    ["ItemDes_10416203"]="Hollgrehenn's masterpiece. There's a 5% chance to instantly boost the equipment's refinement level to Lv.6 without downgrading or damaging it. Can be used on all equipment with a refinement level lower than Lv.6.",
    ["ItemDes_10416204"]="Hollgrehenn's masterpiece. There's a 5% chance to instantly boost the equipment's refinement level to Lv.7 without downgrading or damaging it. Can be used on all equipment with a refinement level lower than Lv.7.",
    ["ItemDes_10416205"]="Hollgrehenn's masterpiece. There's a 5% chance to instantly boost the equipment's refinement level to Lv.8 without downgrading or damaging it. Can be used on all equipment with a refinement level lower than Lv.8.",
    ["ItemDes_10416206"]="Hollgrehenn's masterpiece. There's a 5% chance to instantly boost the equipment's refinement level to Lv.9 without downgrading or damaging it. Can be used on all equipment with a refinement level lower than Lv.9.",
    ["ItemDes_10417001"]="A grade I blessed stone that seems to contain a protective power specially for weapons.\nUsed as a material to protect weapons from levels 13 through 15 from damage upon refinement failure.",
    ["ItemDes_10417002"]="A grade I blessed stone that seems to contain a protective power specially for armor.\nUsed as a material to protect armor from levels 13 through 15 from damage upon refinement failure.",
    ["ItemDes_10417003"]="A grade I blessed stone that seems to contain a protective power specially for accessories.\nUsed as a material to protect accessories from levels 13 through 15 from damage upon refinement failure.",
    ["ItemDes_10417004"]="A grade I protection stone imbued with power that can be used in weapon refinement from levels 5 through 8.\nThe refinement will not be downgraded after using the protection stone. However, due to the large amount of magical power in the stone, the weapon being protected will be affected by energy backlash during refinement. The backlash significantly reduces the chance of upgrading the weapon refinement, and significantly increase the chance of damage.\nAfter the refinement is used, the item will be consumed and the effect will be active whenever the refinement is done at levels 5 through 8. When using both equipment protection and blessed equipment stones, the number of blessed equipment stones consumed will be doubled.",
    ["ItemDes_10417005"]="A grade I protection stone imbued with power that can be used in armor refinement from levels 5 through 8.\nThe refinement will not be downgraded after using the protection stone. However, due to the large amount of magical power in the stone, the armor being protected will be affected by energy backlash during refinement. The backlash significantly reduces the chance of upgrading the armor refinement, and significantly increase the chance of damage.\nAfter the refinement is used, the item will be consumed and the effect will be active whenever the refinement is done at levels 5 through 8. When using both equipment protection and blessed equipment stones, the number of blessed equipment stones consumed will be doubled.",
    ["ItemDes_10417006"]="A grade I protection stone imbued with power that can be used in accessory refinement from levels 5 through 8.\nThe refinement will not be downgraded after using the protection stone. However, due to the large amount of magical power in the stone, the accessory being protected will be affected by energy backlash during refinement. The backlash significantly reduces the chance of upgrading the accessory refinement, and significantly increase the chance of damage.\nAfter the refinement is used, the item will be consumed and the effect will be active whenever the refinement is done at levels 5 through 8. When using both equipment protection and blessed equipment stones, the number of blessed equipment stones consumed will be doubled.",
    ["ItemDes_10417007"]="A grade II protection stone imbued with power that can be used in weapon refinement from levels 9 through 12.\nThe refinement will not be downgraded after using the protection stone. However, due to the large amount of magical power in the stone, the weapon being protected will be affected by energy backlash during refinement. The backlash significantly reduces the chance of upgrading the weapon refinement, and significantly increase the chance of damage.\nAfter the refinement is used, the item will be consumed and the effect will be active whenever the refinement is done at levels 9 through 12. When using both equipment protection and blessed equipment stones, the number of blessed equipment stones consumed will be doubled.",
    ["ItemDes_10417008"]="A grade II protection stone imbued with power that can be used in armor refinement from levels 9 through 12.\nThe refinement will not be downgraded after using the protection stone. However, due to the large amount of magical power in the stone, the armor being protected will be affected by energy backlash during refinement. The backlash significantly reduces the chance of upgrading the armor refinement, and significantly increase the chance of damage.\nAfter the refinement is used, the item will be consumed and the effect will be active whenever the refinement is done at levels 9 through 12. When using both equipment protection and blessed equipment stones, the number of blessed equipment stones consumed will be doubled.",
    ["ItemDes_10417009"]="A grade II protection stone imbued with power that can be used in accessory refinement from levels 9 through 12.\nThe refinement will not be downgraded after using the protection stone. However, due to the large amount of magical power in the stone, the accessory being protected will be affected by energy backlash during refinement. The backlash significantly reduces the chance of upgrading the accessory refinement, and significantly increase the chance of damage.\nAfter the refinement is used, the item will be consumed and the effect will be active whenever the refinement is done at levels 9 through 12. When using both equipment protection and blessed equipment stones, the number of blessed equipment stones consumed will be doubled.",
    ["ItemDes_10417010"]="A grade III protection stone imbued with power that can be used in weapon refinement from levels 13 through 15.\nThe refinement will not be downgraded after using the protection stone. However, due to the large amount of magical power in the stone, the weapon being protected will be affected by energy backlash during refinement. The backlash significantly reduces the chance of upgrading the weapon refinement, and significantly increase the chance of damage.\nAfter the refinement is used, the item will be consumed and the effect will be active whenever the refinement is done at levels 13 through 15. When using both equipment protection and blessed equipment stones, the number of blessed equipment stones consumed will be doubled.",
    ["ItemDes_10417011"]="A grade III protection stone imbued with power that can be used in armor refinement from levels 13 through 15.\nThe refinement will not be downgraded after using the protection stone. However, due to the large amount of magical power in the stone, the armor being protected will be affected by energy backlash during refinement. The backlash significantly reduces the chance of upgrading the armor refinement, and significantly increase the chance of damage.\nAfter the refinement is used, the item will be consumed and the effect will be active whenever the refinement is done at levels 13 through 15. When using both equipment protection and blessed equipment stones, the number of blessed equipment stones consumed will be doubled.",
    ["ItemDes_10417012"]="A grade III protection stone imbued with power that can be used in accessory refinement from levels 13 through 15.\nThe refinement will not be downgraded after using the protection stone. However, due to the large amount of magical power in the stone, the accessory being protected will be affected by energy backlash during refinement. The backlash significantly reduces the chance of upgrading the accessory refinement, and significantly increase the chance of damage.\nAfter the refinement is used, the item will be consumed and the effect will be active whenever the refinement is done at levels 13 through 15. When using both equipment protection and blessed equipment stones, the number of blessed equipment stones consumed will be doubled.",
    ["ItemDes_10417013"]="Said to be a stone that fell off the sun. Can be used to synthesize Last Stand Divine Stone.",
    ["ItemDes_10417014"]="Said to be a stone that fell off a star. Can be used to synthesize Armorclad Divine Stone.",
    ["ItemDes_10417015"]="Said to be a stone that fell off the moon. Can be used to synthesize Spiritcutter Divine Stone.",
    ["ItemDes_10417016"]="A stone with the power of Last Stand that protects warriors' weapons during refinement.",
    ["ItemDes_10417017"]="A stone with the power of Armorclad that protects warriors' weapons during refinement.",
    ["ItemDes_10417018"]="A stone with the power of Spiritcutter that protects warriors' weapons during refinement.",
    ["ItemDes_10417019"]="A fish with a tail that blooms like a flower, this fish is known for its beauty as an ornamental species.",
    ["ItemDes_10417020"]="A schooling fish known for its vast populations, it is the primary food source for riverside communities.",
    ["ItemDes_10417021"]="Why does this young blue whale appear here?",
    ["ItemDes_10418001"]="A grade V Phracon that seems to radiate power from within.\nUpgrading material used to upgrade weapons from levels 181 through 240.",
    ["ItemDes_10418002"]="A grade V Carnium that seems to radiate power from within.\nUpgrading material used to upgrade armor from levels 91 through 120.",
    ["ItemDes_10418003"]="A grade V Bascyx that seems to radiate power from within.\nUpgrading material used to upgrade accessories from levels 46 through 60.",
    ["ItemDes_10418004"]="A grade VI Phracon that seems to radiate power from within.\nUpgrading material used to upgrade weapons from levels 241 through 300.",
    ["ItemDes_10418005"]="A grade VI Carnium that seems to radiate power from within.\nUpgrading material used to upgrade armor from levels 121 through 150.",
    ["ItemDes_10418006"]="A grade VI Bascyx that seems to radiate power from within.\nUpgrading material used to upgrade accessories from levels 61 through 75.",
    ["ItemDes_10418007"]="A grade VII Phracon that seems to radiate power from within.\nUpgrading material used to upgrade weapons from levels 301 through 320.",
    ["ItemDes_10418008"]="A grade VII Carnium that seems to radiate power from within.\nUpgrading material used to upgrade armor from levels 151 through 160.",
    ["ItemDes_10418009"]="A grade VII Bascyx that seems to radiate power from within.\nUpgrading material used to upgrade accessories from levels 76 through 80.",
    ["ItemDes_10419001"]="Enchantment material. Used to grant weapons Aldebaran's Dark Stillness enchantment.",
    ["ItemDes_10419002"]="Enchantment material. Used to grant armor Aldebaran's Solar enchantment.",
    ["ItemDes_10419003"]="Enchantment material. Used to grant accessories Aldebaran's Starlight enchantment.",
    ["ItemDes_10419004"]="Enchantment material. Use to grant weapons Comodo's [Violet] enchantment.",
    ["ItemDes_10419005"]="Enchantment material. Use to grant armor Comodo's [Emerald] enchantment.",
    ["ItemDes_10419006"]="Enchantment material. Use to grant accessories Comodo's [Fiery] enchantment.",
    ["ItemDes_10419007"]="Enchantment material. Used to grant weapons Einbroch's Last Stand enchantment.",
    ["ItemDes_10419008"]="Enchantment material. Used to grant armors Einbroch's Armorclad enchantment.",
    ["ItemDes_10419009"]="Enchantment material. Used to grant accessories Einbroch's Spiritcutter enchantment.",
    ["ItemDes_10419010"]="An enhancement material that can be used in any main city when refining Lv.15 weapon enchantments. It reduces the required Enchantment Stones while allowing you to change attributes without lowering the level.",
    ["ItemDes_10419011"]="An enhancement material that can be used in any main city when refining Lv.15 armor enchantments. It reduces the required Enchantment Stones while allowing you to change attributes without lowering the level.",
    ["ItemDes_10419012"]="An enhancement material that can be used in any main city when refining Lv.15 accessory enchantments. It reduces the required Enchantment Stones while allowing you to change attributes without lowering the level.",
    ["ItemDes_10419013"]="An enchantment conversion material that can be used at Al De Baran when converting enchantments on Alberta accessories. Changes the origin of the enchantment attribute and boosts the enchantment level by 1, but cannot exceed the enchantment level cap.",
    ["ItemDes_1042"]="Luck that has been compensated from failing to refine accessories. Accumulate a certain amount to use to ensure successful refinement.",
    ["ItemDes_10420001"]="Cooking ingredient. This ashy powder is a good combustion agent.",
    ["ItemDes_10420002"]="Cooking ingredient. Spice developed with the aid of magic. Has a distinct fragrance.",
    ["ItemDes_10420003"]="Cooking ingredient. A slender metal thorn. Looks quite fragile.",
    ["ItemDes_10420004"]="Cooking ingredient. Fragrant and crispy nut.",
    ["ItemDes_10420005"]="Cooking ingredient. A very tough branch that's hard to break.",
    ["ItemDes_10420006"]="Cooking ingredient. Flour that is a little damp.",
    ["ItemDes_10420007"]="A plain kebab feeding countless Comodo residences. Eat it to gain Stun RES +23%, and Blind RES +23% for 30 minutes.",
    ["ItemDes_10420008"]="A main dish cooked with various Kokomo seafood and flavoring spices. Eat it to gain Freeze RES +23%, and Curse RES +23% for 30 minutes.",
    ["ItemDes_10420009"]="Delicious salad with a touch of the sea. A single bite is totally addictive. Eat it to gain Immobilization RES +23%, and Poison RES +23% for 30 minutes.",
    ["ItemDes_10420010"]="Tenderloin wrapped with the finest snapper skin, and then roasted to enhance the aroma and flavor. With the rich taste and aroma, it is famous on Comodo. Eat it to gain Petrify RES +23%, and Bleed RES +23% for 30 minutes.",
    ["ItemDes_10420011"]="Hot, and brings happiness. Come and feel how the tender flesh of crabs dance on your tongue. Eat it to gain Sleep RES +23%, and Armor Breakage RES +23% for 30 minutes.",
    ["ItemDes_10420012"]="Cooked with special spices and the most natural method, the flavor is reserved as much as possible. Eat it to gain Silence RES +23%, and Weapon Breakage RES +23% for 30 minutes.",
    ["ItemDes_10420043"]="Eat it to obtain a 1-hour Golden Jar Cookies Blessing.\nLegend has it that after a bond is created between you and someone who has eaten Silver Jar Cookies when you are near them, both of you will be rewarded with a Paper Crane and 12-hour Cupid's Blessing when you make a Cheers Emote within a short period of time.\nNote: The effect may be upgraded when you obtain Cupid's Blessing more than once!\n<color=#FF0000>It will go away when the event is over! Make sure you eat it during the event!</color>",
    ["ItemDes_10420044"]="Eat it to obtain a 1-hour Silver Jar Cookies Blessing.\nLegend has it that after a bond is created between you and someone who has eaten Golden Jar Cookies when you are near them, both of you will be rewarded with a Paper Crane and 12-hour Cupid's Blessing when you make a Cheers action within a short period of time.\nNote: The effect may be upgraded when you obtain Cupid’s Blessing more than once!\n<color=#FF0000>It will go away when the event is over! Make sure you eat it during the event!</color>\n  ",
    ["ItemDes_10420045"]="A tentacle in scarlet color. The suction on it is still pretty strong, even though it has been dead for a long time.",
    ["ItemDes_10420046"]="Ground powder made of pearls. It's the go-to cooking ingredient for the rich.",
    ["ItemDes_10420047"]="A special potion that can solidify materials into blocks.",
    ["ItemDes_10420048"]="A strange raw stone. Probably can be used as a cooking ingredient.",
    ["ItemDes_10420049"]="A foamy substance that is created by whisking the monster egg white at high speed.",
    ["ItemDes_10420050"]="Salinized crystal in white color. Can be used as a cooking ingredient.",
    ["ItemDes_10420051"]="Featuring large claws and a hefty tail, this crab prefers living on land.",
    ["ItemDes_10420052"]="Famous for its bad temper. Supposedly, it can stress itself to death if caught.",
    ["ItemDes_10420053"]="This black clam is popular due to its exquisite flavor.",
    ["ItemDes_10420054"]="A massive, strange tentacle belonging to a weird monster.",
    ["ItemDes_10420055"]="This meat chunk emits a rotten smell. Yuck!",
    ["ItemDes_10420056"]="An artificial chemical designed to increase the flavor of food.",
    ["ItemDes_10420057"]="Comes from the recycling of mining slag from extensive coal extraction.",
    ["ItemDes_10420058"]="This giant cactus has mutated from absorbing excessive pollutants in Einbroch.",
    ["ItemDes_10420059"]="A nutrient-rich fruit that flourishes in arid areas.",
    ["ItemDes_10420060"]="Smoked and tasty cured meat.",
    ["ItemDes_10420061"]="This giant beak only broke after centuries of weathering.",
    ["ItemDes_10420062"]="This giant claw only broke after centuries of weathering.",
    ["ItemDes_10420063"]="A kind of active, evil blood.",
    ["ItemDes_10420064"]="Mineral salt, a common ingredient for cooking.",
    ["ItemDes_10420065"]="Bloody severed limbs... no clue where they come from.",
    ["ItemDes_10422001"]="Specialty beach cooking utensil that can be used in multiple ways.\nCooking material. Used for cooking level 11 dishes.",
    ["ItemDes_10422002"]="An HP-restoring potion made from Gray Herbs. Use to immediately restore 300,000 HP, plus 128,000 HP every second for 5 seconds afterward. Cannot be used in PVP. Required Level: 100",
    ["ItemDes_10422003"]="An HP-restoring potion made from Gray Herbs. Use to immediately restore 300,000 HP, plus 128,000 HP every second for 5 seconds afterward. Can only be used in PVP. Required Level: 100",
    ["ItemDes_10422004"]="Reminder: You can trust an Alchemist's pot, but never ever let them get near the stove.",
    ["ItemDes_10422005"]="A pure gemstone that locks weapon attributes and improves enchantment success rates.",
    ["ItemDes_10422006"]="A pure gemstone that locks armor attributes and improves enchantment success rates.",
    ["ItemDes_10422007"]="A pure gemstone that locks accessory attributes and improves enchantment success rates.",
    ["ItemDes_10422008"]="Used in Lv.4-8 weapon refinement to prevent the equipment from downgrading, breaking, or reducing success rates.",
    ["ItemDes_10422009"]="Used in Lv.4-8 armor refinement to prevent the equipment from downgrading, breaking, or reducing success rates.",
    ["ItemDes_10422010"]="Used in Lv.4-8 accessory refinement to prevent the equipment from downgrading, breaking, or reducing success rates.",
    ["ItemDes_10422011"]="A common cooking tool used around Rachel.",
    ["ItemDes_10422012"]="Used in Lv.9-12 weapon refinement (<color=#FF0000>currently only available in Lv.9-12 refinement</color>) to prevent the equipment from downgrading, breaking, or reducing success rates.",
    ["ItemDes_10422013"]="Used in Lv.9-12 armor refinement (<color=#FF0000>currently only available in Lv.9-12 refinement</color>) to prevent the equipment from downgrading, breaking, or reducing success rates.",
    ["ItemDes_10422014"]="Used in Lv.9-12 accessory refinement (<color=#FF0000>currently only available in Lv.9-12 refinement</color>) to prevent the equipment from downgrading, breaking, or reducing success rates.",
    ["ItemDes_10423001"]="A crystal with a golden glow that resembles the sun.\nThis smelting material can be obtained from specific monsters or purchased from vend shops.",
    ["ItemDes_10423002"]="Light red quartz mineral that will turn green if exposed to air for too long.\nThis smelting material can be obtained from specific monsters or purchased from vend shops.",
    ["ItemDes_10423003"]="Sand that sparkles like stars. Taken from the tip of a witch's broomstick.\nThis smelting material can be obtained from specific monsters or purchased from vend shops.",
    ["ItemDes_10423004"]="This smelting material can be obtained from specific monsters or purchased from vend shops.",
    ["ItemDes_10423005"]="Proof of loyalty. Carries chivalric resolve.\nThis smelting material can be obtained from specific monsters or purchased from vend shops.",
    ["ItemDes_10423006"]="A small bead made of glass.\nThis smelting material can be obtained from specific monsters or purchased from vend shops.",
    ["ItemDes_10423007"]="A contract with a curse on it.\nThis smelting material can be obtained from specific monsters or purchased from vend shops.",
    ["ItemDes_10423008"]="Metal that's rusted through from severe wind erosion.\nThis smelting material can be obtained from specific monsters or purchased from vend shops.",
    ["ItemDes_10423009"]="Smooth fabric that's soft to the touch.\nThis smelting material can be obtained from specific monsters or purchased from vend shops.",
    ["ItemDes_10423010"]="A pointer used to indicate time.\nThis smelting material can be obtained from specific monsters or purchased from vend shops.",
    ["ItemDes_10423011"]="A messy ball of tough twisted string.\nThis smelting material can be obtained from specific monsters or purchased from vend shops.",
    ["ItemDes_10423012"]="A piece of ghastly-looking coagulated blood.\nThis smelting material can be obtained from specific monsters or purchased from vend shops.",
    ["ItemDes_10423013"]="Equipment ascending material. Grade IV iron. Despite being a strong metal, it remains lightweight and is easy to temper compared to other metals.",
    ["ItemDes_10423014"]="Equipment ascending material. Grade IV silver. Not a strong metal but it shines beautifully under the sun.",
    ["ItemDes_10423015"]="Equipment ascending material. Grade IV gold. A hard and stable metal that shines as bright as the sun.",
    ["ItemDes_10423016"]="Enchantment material. Used to grant weapons Umbala's Sage Green enchantment.",
    ["ItemDes_10423017"]="Enchantment material. Used to grant armors Umbala's Creeper enchantment.",
    ["ItemDes_10423018"]="Enchantment material. Used to grant accessories Umbala's Greenwood enchantment.",
    ["ItemDes_10423019"]="Equipment crafting material. A grade IV jewel infused with Strength.",
