    ["ItemDes_10423025"]="Equipment crafting material. A compound mixture of various metals and iron that is hard and durable.",
    ["ItemDes_10423026"]="Equipment crafting material. A strange crystal core tangled by vines.",
    ["ItemDes_10423027"]="Equipment crafting material. Converged by magic crystal in sage green that no one knows how it works even now.",
    ["ItemDes_10423028"]="Equipment crafting material. Colorful and vivid silk thread that is popular on the market.",
    ["ItemDes_10423029"]="Equipment crafting material. Equipment crafting material. A thin, almost weightless scarlet satin.",
    ["ItemDes_10423030"]="Equipment crafting material. A totem bone stick obtained from ancient tribes seems to belong to some kind of giant beast.",
    ["ItemDes_10423032"]="Enchantment material. Used to grant weapons Juno Float Island's Fortitude enchantment.",
    ["ItemDes_10423033"]="Enchantment material. Used to grant armors Juno Float Island's Dust-laden enchantment.",
    ["ItemDes_10423034"]="Enchantment material. Used to grant accessories Juno Float Island's Empyrean enchantment.",
    ["ItemDes_10423035"]="A fine silver ingot with extremely high purity. Can be used on the smelting and ascension of talismans.",
    ["ItemDes_10423036"]="Pearls from the deep sea, whose scattered lights can illuminate the darkness at night. Can be used on the ascension of accessories.",
    ["ItemDes_10423037"]="A sharp canine tooth extracted from a beast. After polishing, the surface presents a shiny jade-like gloss.",
    ["ItemDes_10423038"]="Thick and heavy scale. It's incredibly strong and durable.",
    ["ItemDes_10423039"]="Gold-plated silk thread. Popular among people for its multi-purpose nature.",
    ["ItemDes_10423040"]="Clothes made of this kind of satin are beautiful, soft, and well-fitted.",
    ["ItemDes_10423041"]="The \"Comodo\" ship that once dominated the seas vanished mysteriously, leaving behind only its anchor.",
    ["ItemDes_10423042"]="Materialized from the final breath exhaled by a demon lord before death.",
    ["ItemDes_10423043"]="Symbolizing a once invincible iron-blooded army.",
    ["ItemDes_10423044"]="A mask resembling a demon that people put on in a peculiar celebration.",
    ["ItemDes_10423045"]="A flower made from a precious crystal that glimmers brilliantly under sunlight.",
    ["ItemDes_10423046"]="Looks like amber, exceptionally rare.",
    ["ItemDes_10423047"]="Equipment crafting material. A grade V jewel infused with Strength.",
    ["ItemDes_10423048"]="Equipment crafting material. A grade V jewel infused with Agility.",
