    ["ItemDes_10423055"]="Equipment ascending material. Grade V gold. A hard and stable metal that shines as bright as the sun.",
    ["ItemDes_10423056"]="Equipment ascending material. A rare metal whetstone that really sharpens your blade.",
    ["ItemDes_10423057"]="Equipment ascending material. A colorful rope crafted with special techniques, ideal for garment crafting.",
    ["ItemDes_10423058"]="Equipment ascending material. Premium cotton from the deserts near Rachel, famous across the land.",
    ["ItemDes_10423059"]="Equipment ascending material. Features a retro style.",
    ["ItemDes_10423060"]="Equipment ascending material. A crystal-clear jade, among the most valuable of its kind.",
    ["ItemDes_10423061"]="Equipment ascending material. It's said to be made from divine blood.",
    ["ItemDes_10424001"]="Egg and flour make for a healthy meal.",
    ["ItemDes_10424002"]="Salad with a smooth texture and a grass-like fragrance.",
    ["ItemDes_10424003"]="The addition of Mandragora leaf removed the odor from the prawns.",
    ["ItemDes_10424004"]="Tender frog meat coupled with crispy Chrysalis. This is a dish rich in protein.",
