    ["ItemDes_10427001"]="An item used to unlock the Skeleton Worker pet's transmog, Hip-hop Chain. A popular accessory among miners that displays their obsession with precious metals.",
    ["ItemDes_10427002"]="An item used to unlock the Giearth pet's transmog, Miner Backpack. Giearth can discern who the owner is by the details so you will never take the wrong backpack by mistake.",
    ["ItemDes_10427003"]="An item used to unlock the Yoyo pet's transmog, Gold Band. Every owner and Yoyo can completely prove their closeness, and they convey a little zen.",
    ["ItemDes_10427004"]="An item used to unlock the Phreeoni pet's transmog, Deviruchi Wing. Phreeoni move lighter after wearing them, which may just be a psychological effect.",
    ["ItemDes_10427005"]="An item used to unlock the Baby Desert Wolf pet's transmog, Diving Helmet. The diving helmet is snow white, so one day it will be able to play in the water, right?",
    ["ItemDes_10427006"]="An item used to unlock the Desert Wolf pet's transmog, Desert Wolf. The Desert Wolf lives on hot sand, so it's most suitable for the helmet to be made of steel.",
    ["ItemDes_10427007"]="An item used to unlock the Drainliar pet's transmog, Bio Mask. A mask that is used to deal with Drainliar that are not completely domesticated yet. It has gradually become fashionable.",
    ["ItemDes_10427008"]="An item used to unlock the Familiar pet's transmog, Wind-shield Glasses. It does not usually rely on its sense of sight, but eyes should still be protect... probably.",
    ["ItemDes_10427009"]="An item used to unlock the Vocal pet's transmog, Colorful Glasses. Fans of rock think different and prefer eye-catching and fancy designs.",
    ["ItemDes_10427010"]="An item used to unlock the Rocker pet's transmog, Gentleman Glasses. Don't let them get anywhere near the old books. Who knows if their hunger is for knowledge or for food.",
    ["ItemDes_10427011"]="An item used to unlock the Eclipse pet's transmog, Rose Wreath. It's not recommended to buy expensive rabbit headgear because it's often disposable.",
    ["ItemDes_10427012"]="An item used to unlock the Lunatic pet's transmog, Butterfly Bow. Some rabbits might go semi-permanently mad from discomfort after wearing it. Quite normal.",
    ["ItemDes_10427013"]="An item used to unlock the Mastering pet's transmog, Adventure Backpack. Maybe years have passed but King Poring's dreams of adventure from when he was young has not faded at all.",
    ["ItemDes_10427014"]="An item used to unlock the Poring pet's transmog, Poring Backpack. It's said that a Poring's backpack contains a part of itself to save its life in case of danger...",
    ["ItemDes_10427015"]="An item used to unlock the Hornet pet's transmog, Butterfly Mask. A ball is a necessity for the life of soldier bees, and also a battlefield for fashion.",
    ["ItemDes_10427016"]="An item used to unlock the Mistress pet's transmog, Alchemy Mask. What exactly does the queen bee's compound eyes see through lenses filled with magic?",
    ["ItemDes_10427017"]="An item used to unlock the Dustiness pet's transmog, Bamboo Dragonfly. A small bamboo dragonfly designed just for Dustiness. It can't fly and doesn't need to.",
    ["ItemDes_10427018"]="An item used to unlock the Dragon Fly pet's transmog, Star Crown. The length can be adjusted to fit, and it's suitable for dragon flies of all ages and sizes.",
    ["ItemDes_10427019"]="An item used to unlock the Roda Frog pet's transmog, Swimming Goggles. They say there's a trend among the Roda Frog s that \"practicality is beauty.\"",
    ["ItemDes_10427020"]="An item used to unlock the Frog King pet's transmog, Diving Goggles. Why do some species need special tools to move underwater?",
    ["ItemDes_10427021"]="An item used to unlock the Whisper pet's transmog, Illuminated Unicorn. Hard objects can make light, floaty ghosts seem real.",
    ["ItemDes_10427022"]="An item used to unlock the Ghostring pet's transmog, Inferno Horn. The Ghostring is very satisfied with this—finally! It can dress up as a real devil!",
    ["ItemDes_10427023"]="An item used to unlock the Side Winder pet's transmog, Bell of Fortune. The Anacondaq will beat time with bells, and it might lead the snakes in a rap.",
    ["ItemDes_10427024"]="An item used to unlock the Snake pet's transmog, Star Halo. To balance the nastiness of the side winder's reputation. However, it seems to scare even more people away.",
    ["ItemDes_10427025"]="An item used to unlock the Zombie pet's transmog, Wanderer’s Scarf. The burial did not completely take away the rotting bodies, but their upper garments.",
    ["ItemDes_10427026"]="An item used to unlock the Ghoul pet's transmog, Zealot Mask. This mask will show off the Ghoul's teeth and handsome side.",
    ["ItemDes_10427027"]="An item used to unlock the Moonlight Flower pet's transmog, Butterfly Bell. This accessory harmonizes with the fur, and also symbolizes the imprint of civilization.",
    ["ItemDes_10427028"]="An item used to unlock the Myst pet's transmog, Midnight Horong. Raising Myst requires a certain amount of guts, so making accessories for them is even more...",
    ["ItemDes_10427029"]="An item used to unlock the Sasquatch pet's transmog, Pulse Headset. They make Sasquatch look more human-like, because the headphones aren't even on their ears...",
    ["ItemDes_10427030"]="An item used to unlock the Golem pet's transmog, Tri-color Wig. These warm stone friends are finally showing the tri-color wig some attention.",
    ["ItemDes_10428001"]="A Lv.6 Upgrading Metal that feels cold to the touch.",
    ["ItemDes_10428002"]="A Lv.7 Muspellium that is very strong and highly resistant to flames, but extremely difficult to process.",
    ["ItemDes_10428003"]="A Lv.7 Upgrading Metal that feels cold to the touch.\nUsed as a smelting material to produce Phracon VII, Carnium VII, and Bascyx VII.",
    ["ItemDes_10428004"]="Enchantment material. Used to grant weapons Rachel's Decomposition enchantment.",
    ["ItemDes_10428005"]="Enchantment material. Used to grant armors Rachel's Crystallization enchantment.",
    ["ItemDes_10428006"]="Enchantment material. Used to grant accessories Rachel's Manifestation enchantment.",
    ["ItemDes_10428007"]="Enchantment material. Used to grant weapons Einbroch's Temperforge enchantment.",
    ["ItemDes_10428008"]="Enchantment material. Used to grant armors Einbroch's Moltencore enchantment.",
    ["ItemDes_10428009"]="Enchantment material. Used to grant accessories Einbroch's Smelting enchantment.",
    ["ItemDes_1060"]="Used for Chessboard Investigation",
    ["ItemDes_10701001"]="A Gacha Coin used in the Demon Slayer: Kimetsu no Yaiba collaboration.",
    ["ItemDes_10701002"]="An event token used in the Demon Slayer: Kimetsu no Yaiba collaboration.",
    ["ItemDes_10701003"]="The limited-time exchange token for Night Club Party. Can be used to exchange for multiple rewards with the Boss Lady in the Rose Red Tavern.\nWill be removed after the event.",
    ["ItemDes_10701004"]="A gold coin with a dragon printed on it.\nThis item will be removed when the Demon Lord's Adventure Diary event is over.",
    ["ItemDes_10701005"]="Exchange items obtained in Midsummer Cram School. Removed at the end of the event and redeemed for Zeny.",
    ["ItemDes_10701006"]="Exchange items obtained in Midsummer Cram School. Removed at the end of the event and redeemed for Zeny.",
    ["ItemDes_10801001"]="Soft fur obtained from Lunatic. It is an excellent crafting material for headgears.",
    ["ItemDes_10801002"]="A magical herb that radiates rainbow-colored rays.",
    ["ItemDes_10801003"]="A blueprint necessary to craft Angeling's Halo replica.",
    ["ItemDes_10801004"]="It's missing a little luck as compared to the Four-Leaf Clover, which is why it ended up in Fabre's stomach.",
    ["ItemDes_10801005"]="The valkyries bestowed this halo containing their divine power upon Angeling.",
    ["ItemDes_10801006"]="Ygnizem's favorite ribbon bow. Angeling found it lying around.",
    ["ItemDes_10801007"]="A mysterious alchemy device that emits waves of strange power.",
    ["ItemDes_10801008"]="An alchemy device core that looks like an alchemy stone.",
    ["ItemDes_10801009"]="The blueprint of the sewer drafted by Charlie, the best craftsman of Prontera.",
    ["ItemDes_10801010"]="Water that is holy and pure. It's ideal for praying.",
    ["ItemDes_10801011"]="A functioning device used to observe weather. Based on the data generated, a person with the right knowledge can predict weather changes in the next few days.",
    ["ItemDes_10801012"]="It is said that this bewitching flower, which only grows in the depths of Labyrinth Forest, is the incarnation of Evelyn's power.",
    ["ItemDes_10801013"]="An unknown seed buried under the Sealstone. It has been in this state for many years, which makes people doubt whether it can germinate.",
    ["ItemDes_10801014"]="A beautiful, vital flower. It is rumored that Evelyn draws spiritual energy from this flower to maintain her youth.",
    ["ItemDes_10801015"]="A ring that symbolizes love. Anna received this token of love from her lover, Lukas, when she was still alive.",
