    ["ItemDes_10801163"]="The seeds of Floral Tree. It soothes and refreshes the mind when brewed as a tea.",
    ["ItemDes_10801164"]="Water melted from snow mountains: sweet, chilly, and refreshing.",
    ["ItemDes_10801165"]="A fragrant tea known for its tranquilizing effects.",
