    ["ItemDes_10801172"]="Mysterious well.",
    ["ItemDes_10801184"]="Traces left by Warg, the Garm. Can be submitted to Evelyn in the Warg Tracking event to progress the quest.",
    ["ItemDes_10802001"]="An old, tattered book that has been around for so many years that it's no longer legible.",
    ["ItemDes_10802002"]="Fabric required to make the outfit for job advancement.",
    ["ItemDes_10802003"]="A hard, solid ore with an unusual glow.",
    ["ItemDes_10802004"]="The core of Myst, it's filled with magical power.",
    ["ItemDes_10802005"]="The cloth that wraps around Whispers. It is very clean after purification.",
    ["ItemDes_10802006"]="The pelt of Martin, it's a good thermal insulator.",
    ["ItemDes_10802007"]="The bone of a Skeleton. The gloomy aura that surrounds it is terrifying.",
    ["ItemDes_10802008"]="Clothes made by the Blacksmith that are readily available for purchase.",
    ["ItemDes_10802009"]="A Bongun's finger.",
