    ["ItemDes_10802051"]="Stinky Algae.",
    ["ItemDes_10802052"]="Slimy Gland.",
    ["ItemDes_10802053"]="The dish Martistine wanted.",
    ["ItemDes_10803001"]="The juice of Mandragora petals. It's a good conductor of magic power.",
    ["ItemDes_10803002"]="A branch imbued with magic power that drives the actions of Willows.",
    ["ItemDes_10803003"]="The mane of Savage Bebe with the right amount of softness.",
    ["ItemDes_10803004"]="A tender bud that looks tasty.",
    ["ItemDes_10803005"]="The venom of Poison Spore. It is said to cause hallucinations.",
    ["ItemDes_10803006"]="The pelt of a Baby Desert Wolf. It's a material of high quality.",
    ["ItemDes_10803007"]="Nectar collected by Creamy. It gets fermented in Creamy's body and becomes really delicious.",
    ["ItemDes_10803008"]="Coco's acorn. Why do people say it will destroy the world?",
    ["ItemDes_10803009"]="I don't see how this leaf can be useful. Why bother collecting it?",
    ["ItemDes_10803010"]="Gorgeous-looking white fur.",
    ["ItemDes_10803011"]="A special book that contains methods for locating mines. Only the Giearth can understand it.",
    ["ItemDes_10803012"]="The tentacles of Hydra. God knows who will eats these.",
    ["ItemDes_10803013"]="Fragment of a broken axe that has aged with time.",
    ["ItemDes_10803014"]="Fragment of a broken knife that has aged with time.",
    ["ItemDes_10803015"]="It looks ordinary, but it contains deadly venom.",
    ["ItemDes_10803016"]="The core of Myst. I wonder what kind of secret does it hide.",
    ["ItemDes_10803017"]="One man's meat is another man's poison. It's hard to understand what these gourmets are thinking about sometimes.",
    ["ItemDes_10803018"]="Just how does this thing live?",
    ["ItemDes_10803019"]="An ordinary piece of cloth. How did it managed to move around?",
    ["ItemDes_10803020"]="A thousand-year-old... ugh, this smell is unbearable.",
    ["ItemDes_10803021"]="Widely acknowledged for its heavenly taste, no wonder Vadons hated humans so much.",
    ["ItemDes_10803022"]="Knock, knock... Very solid indeed.",
    ["ItemDes_10803023"]="These wings doesn't seem to be cut off, they are probably dismantled... What's going on?",
    ["ItemDes_10803024"]="A helmet that symbolizes the glory of ancient Egypt. You should respect its owner.",
    ["ItemDes_10803025"]="This is actually a fish fin????",
    ["ItemDes_10803026"]="Tough but not heavy. What an incredible material!",
