    ["ItemDes_10905001"]="A romantic item specially made by the Magic Guild. Produces the romantic effect of petals falling from the sky after use, covering guests in a floral shower. Particularly suitable for weddings.",
    ["ItemDes_10905002"]="The top champagne from the finest winery in Midgard, it fizzes with luxuriant bubbles and a charming aroma when opened. Spraying its foam creates extraordinary momentum before any banquet. A must for wedding celebrations and other occasions.",
    ["ItemDes_10905003"]="A romantic item specially made by the Magic Guild. Produces heart-shaped bubbles and colorful twinkling stars after use, symbolizing the beauty of romance. Especially suitable for creating a romantic atmosphere at weddings and other occasions.",
    ["ItemDes_10905004"]="A romantic item specially made by the Magic Guild. The left wing of Cupid. A solitary Cupid wing appears behind the user, allowing them to float through the air and land directly in the spotlight. If two people use the left and right wings together, the effect will be even more magnificent.",
    ["ItemDes_10905005"]="A romantic item specially made by the Magic Guild. The right wing of Cupid. A solitary Cupid wing appears behind the user, allowing them to float through the air and land directly in the spotlight. If two people use the left and right wings together, the effect will be even more magnificent.",
    ["ItemDes_10905006"]="A romantic item specially made by the Magic Guild. Calls upon Cupid to fire a golden arrow of love at whoever uses it. Especially suitable for sweet occasions, such as weddings.",
    ["ItemDes_10906001"]="Proof for attending your friend's wedding as a member of their Family and Friends group. Witness their moment of happiness.",
    ["ItemDes_10906002"]="Proof for attending your friend's wedding as a member of their Guest group. Witness their moment of happiness.",
    ["ItemDes_10906003"]="Proof of obtaining Jimmy Lin's favor. Owning this item allow you to select Jimmy Lin as your wedding witness in the Couple Series.",
    ["ItemDes_10906004"]="Use to obtain Mount: Promise Carriage (3 Days).",
    ["ItemDes_10906005"]="Use to obtain Mount: Promise Carriage (7 Days).",
    ["ItemDes_10906006"]="Use to obtain Mount: Promise Carriage (30 Days).",
    ["ItemDes_10906007"]="Use to obtain Mount: Promise Carriage (90 Days).",
    ["ItemDes_10906008"]="Use to obtain Mount: Promise Carriage.",
    ["ItemDes_10906009"]="Freyja's Wedding Planners' special gift. Get a 10% discount on a custom wedding. ",
    ["ItemDes_10906010"]="Freyja's Wedding Planners' special gift Get a 20% discount on a custom wedding. ",
    ["ItemDes_10907001"]="Represents the honest love between you and your partner. Used to level up Couple Skills.",
    ["ItemDes_10907002"]="A mysterious crystal that exudes an air of love. Use to obtain 5 Couple EXP.",
    ["ItemDes_10907003"]="A mysterious crystal that exudes an overwhelming air of love. Use to obtain 10 Couple EXP.",
    ["ItemDes_10907004"]="Even inexperienced lovers exude a sweet love.",
    ["ItemDes_10907005"]="Albums are used to collect cards. Once opened, you’ll have a chance to get one blue quality card at random.",
