    ["ItemDes_10908077"]="A shining star. Use it to unlock the title S3-Tank Master.",
    ["ItemDes_10908078"]="A shining star. Use it to unlock the title S3-Healing Master.",
    ["ItemDes_10908079"]="A shining star. Use it to unlock the title S3-Server Dominator.",
    ["ItemDes_10908080"]="A shining star. Use it to unlock the title S3-The Chosen.",
    ["ItemDes_10908081"]="A shining star. Use it to unlock the title S3-Group Dominator.",
    ["ItemDes_10908082"]="A shining star. Use it to unlock the title S3-Season Participant.",
    ["ItemDes_10908083"]="A shining star. Use it to unlock the title Next Generation Party Novice.",
    ["ItemDes_10908084"]="A shining star. Use it to unlock the title ROX Publicity Ambassador.",
    ["ItemDes_10909001"]="A well-designed unlocking tool. Unlocks the [Round and Round] interactive emote after use.",
    ["ItemDes_10909002"]="A well-designed unlocking tool. Unlocks the [Hug] interactive emote after use.",
    ["ItemDes_10909003"]="A well-designed unlocking tool. Unlocks the [Heart] interactive emote after use.",
    ["ItemDes_10909004"]="Use to unlock the social action - Play It Cool",
    ["ItemDes_10912001"]="Use to roll the dice for a random number. You will move forward a number of steps corresponding to the dice roll. (Can only be used in Wonderland.)",
    ["ItemDes_10912002"]="Use to control the dice to roll a number. You will move forward a number of steps corresponding to the dice roll. (Can only be used in Wonderland.)",
    ["ItemDes_10912003"]="Use to roll the dice for one of the following random numbers: 4, 5, or 6. You will move forward a number of steps corresponding to the dice roll. (Can only be used in Wonderland.)",
    ["ItemDes_10912004"]="Use to roll the dice for one of the following random numbers: 1, 2, or 3. You will move forward a number of steps corresponding to the dice roll. (Can only be used in Wonderland.)",
    ["ItemDes_10912005"]="Use to roll the dice for 1. You will move forward a number of steps corresponding to the dice roll. (Can only be used in Wonderland.)",
    ["ItemDes_10912006"]="Use to roll the dice for 6. You will move forward a number of steps corresponding to the dice roll. (Can only be used in Wonderland.)",
    ["ItemDes_10912007"]="Use to roll the dice for a random number. You will obtain a number of Starshine Coins corresponding to the dice roll. (Can only be used in Wonderland.)",
    ["ItemDes_10912008"]="Use to roll the dice for a random number. You will obtain a number of dice corresponding to the dice roll. These dice will not be Normal Dice or Blind Box Dice. (Can only be used in Wonderland.)",
    ["ItemDes_10912009"]="Grants one of the following items:\n2 Angel Dice,\n2 Demon Dice,\n1 Normalization Dice,\n1 Lucky Dice,\n1 Remote Control Dice,",
    ["ItemDes_10912010"]="Heavenly Leader Headgear Gift Pack. Open to obtain Benimaru Headgear (Male) or Shuna Hair Accessory (Female), according to your gender.",
    ["ItemDes_10912011"]="Heavenly Leader Outfit Gift Pack. Open to obtain Benimaru Set (Male) or a Shuna Set (Female), according to your gender.",
    ["ItemDes_10912012"]="Ardent Assistant Headgear Gift Pack. Open to obtain Diablo Headgear (Male) or a Shion Hair Accessory (Female), according to your gender.",
    ["ItemDes_10912013"]="Ardent Assistant Outfit Gift Pack. Open to obtain a Diablo Set (Male) or a Shion Set (Female), according to your gender.",
    ["ItemDes_10912014"]="True Demon Lord Headgear Gift Pack. Open to obtain Rimuru Headgear (Male) or Milim Headgear (Female), according to your gender.",
    ["ItemDes_10912015"]="True Demon Lord Outfit Gift Pack. Open to obtain a Rimuru Demon King Set (Male) or a Milim Demon King Set (Female), according to your gender.",
    ["ItemDes_10912016"]="An item for unlocking Mecha Skin - Roaring Tiger.",
    ["ItemDes_10912017"]="Use to obtain Mount: Treasure Tiger.\nSpeed: 6",
    ["ItemDes_10912018"]="Use to obtain Mount: Black Lightning (15 Days).",
    ["ItemDes_10912019"]="Open to get Normal Pickaxe x3, Eden Group Ticket (Single) x2, Beauty Treatment Coupon x1, Odin’s Resplendent Reliquary x1; and a certain chance to get an orange quality Equipment.",
    ["ItemDes_10914001"]="A grade reward commemorative coin from the Wonderland minigame. You can exchange for items you like at Shuna's Exchange Shop!",
    ["ItemDes_10914002"]="A silver-quality Wonderland commemorative coin. You can exchange for items you like at Shuna's Exchange Shop!",
    ["ItemDes_10914003"]="A gold-quality Wonderland commemorative coin. You can exchange for items you like at Shuna's Exchange Shop!",
    ["ItemDes_10915300"]="Musket shot from the armory. This is used up every time the musket is fired.",
    ["ItemDes_10915301"]="Rocket cannon ammo from the armory. This is used up every time the rocket is launched.",
    ["ItemDes_10915302"]="Regeneration potion from the armory. This is used up every time the regeneration potion is used.",
    ["ItemDes_10915303"]="Stealth potion from the armory. This is used up every time the stealth potion is used.",
    ["ItemDes_19000001"]="Open to select one of the following Outfits: Hypebeast, Brilliant Light Coin.",
    ["ItemDes_19000002"]="Open to select one of the following Headgears: (Head) Sonic Love, Afterglow, Brilliant Light Coin.",
