    ["JobWarmUpActivitiesText_001"]="%s——%s",
    ["JobWarmUpActivitiesText_002"]="Not listed",
    ["JobWarmUpActivitiesText_003"]="Congratulations on reaching #%s! Rewards will be issued via mail after the event!",
    ["JobWarmUpActivitiesText_004"]="Shadow Equipment can be activated without completing the quest during the event!",
    ["JobWarmUpActivitiesText_005"]="Event Time: %s——%s\n①Daily Login: Claim corresponding rewards by logging in every day during the event.\n②Season Quest: Claim rewards by completing special season quests during the event, and receive the appearance reward by taking photos with a Super Novice.\n③Hit the Season Rankings: Get into the top 100 in the Season Weekly Ranking to claim rewards. The higher the ranking, the better the rewards.\n1st prize: Halo of Revitalization x1, Gacha Coin Selection Pack x6\n2nd-50th prize: Halo of Revitalization x1, Gacha Coin Selection Pack x3\n51th-100th prize: Halo of Revitalization x1, Gacha Coin Selection Pack x1\n④Shadow Equipment Relief: Shadow Equipment can be activated without completing the quest during the event!",
    ["JobWarmUpActivitiesText_006"]="You are currently #%s in the weekly ranking. Reach the top 100 in the weekly ranking to win rewards.",
    ["JobWarmUpActivitiesText_007"]="Reward Claimed",
    ["JobWarmUpActivitiesText_008"]="Sign in daily and claim special rewards",
    ["JobWarmUpActivitiesText_009"]="Complete the season quest to win the Backpack reward",
    ["JobWarmUpActivitiesText_010"]="Hit the season ranking to get the special halo",
    ["JobWarmUpActivitiesText_101"]="Event Time: %s——%s\n①Daily Login: Claim corresponding rewards by logging in every day during the event.\n②Challenge Quest: Claim rewards by completing quests during the event. Some challenges will be updated daily. Please make sure to complete them in time!\n③Shadow Equipment Relief: Shadow Equipment can be activated without completing the quest during the event!",
