    ["JoinDay"]="Joined on {2}-{1}-{0}",
    ["JokerBoxTips1"]="<color=#e7bb22>Clown's Box Event</color>\n\n1. Kill clowns within <color=#CFFDA3EF>70 seconds</color> of their existence to get rewards. Clowns will self-destruct once they run out of time, and no rewards will be given if they self-destruct.\n2. Basic Reward Rules: If a party deals damage to a clown, all party members within the same location will get Zeny, Base EXP, and Job EXP.\n3. Extra Reward Rules: Rewards will be granted to parties based on <color=#CFFDA3EF>the amount of damage dealt</color>. Members of the same party have the same chance to get the Clown Headgear, various rare Headgear Blueprints and their corresponding crafting materials, various cooking, potions, and Kafra Corp. Coins.",
    ["KVMLeaverTips_1"]="The KVM is in the Battle Phase. Forcibly leaving will incur the following penalties:\n●In addition to the failed results, <color=#ff0000>an additional 5 points will be deducted</color>\n●After forcibly leaving, <color=#ff0000>you cannot participate in KVM matchmaking for 2 mins</color>\n\nAre you sure you want to leave?",
    ["KVMLeaverTips_2"]="There are players in the Party who are in the KVM Quit Punishment state, and cannot join KVM matchmaking",
    ["KVMtips1"]="You can't use %s in KVM Arena.",
    ["KVMtips2"]="Your opponent canceled joining the battle. We're finding a new match for you. Thank you for your patience!",
    ["KVMtips3"]="Matchmaking time too long. We were unable to find a suitable opponent for you, so we canceled matchmaking.",
    ["KVMtips4"]="Server is busy. Temporarily unable to matchmake.",
