    ["KemoIslandText_009"]="Claim %s Odin's Blessings during the event everyday!",
    ["KemoIslandText_010"]="Exchange limit reached.",
    ["KemoIslandText_011"]="Event Time: %s (UTC+7)",
    ["KemoIslandText_012"]="Exchange Duration: %s (UTC+7)",
    ["KemoIslandText_013"]="Event Description\n1. Event Time: %s (UTC+7)\n2. Exchange Period: %s (UTC+7)\n3. Event Requirement: Adventurer's Base Level ≥ 25.\n4. Sampling Center: Adventurers can exchange Serum Sample and Genetic Sequence for rewards in the Sampling Center. Event items can be purchased from the Exchange Center or obtained in Light of Odin. After the event ends, the Sampling Center will remain open during the exchange period. Please make your exchanges in time!\n5. Light of Odin: During the event, Adventurers who meet the event requirement can obtain event items by consuming Odin's Blessings to defeat monsters. Event items can be exchanged for rewards in the Sampling Center, or sold to other Adventurers through the Exchange Center. During the event period, defeat monsters with Odin's Blessings to earn exchange materials.\nItems Small Medium Large\nSerum Sample 0.8000%% 1.6000%% 2.4000%%\nGenetic Sequence 0.4000%% 0.8000%% 1.2000%%\nDuring this event, Adventurers can claim 500 Odin's Blessings every day on the Light of Odin screen.",
    ["Knapsack tips_1"]="You currently don't have this type of item.\nTry to obtain more through daily events or Exchange Center.",
