    ["KvmOBTips03"]="Character View",
    ["KvmRuleDesc"]="<color=#e7bb22>Matchmaking rules:</color>\n1. Every party must have 5 members. The party leader will take control.\n2. In order to start matchmaking, all members must not be engaged in other activities.\n3. When a match is found, all members must confirm that they are ready before the party can enter the battlefield.\n<color=#e7bb22>Battlefield rules:</color>\n1. The battlefield is played over best-of-three matches, eliminate all opponents to win.\n2. Certain items cannot be used on the battlefield.\n3. If none of the teams have been completely eliminated, the result will be calculated based on the number of remaining players, first blood, and damage dealt. <color=#e7bb22>Reward rules:</color>\nWarrior > 0 Point\nGuardian > 1100 Points\nFortress > 1400 Points\nEpic > 1700 Points\nLegend > 2000 Points\nThe daily limit for KVM Points resets at 00:00.",
    ["KvmSysInfo_1601"]="Form a party of 5 to start matchmaking.",
    ["KvmSysInfo_1602"]="You must be in party mode to start matchmaking.",
    ["KvmSysInfo_1603"]="Unable to start matchmaking because one or more party member(s) is offline.",
