    ["KvmSysInfo_1609"]="s% has canceled the matchmaking.",
    ["KvmSysInfo_1610"]="The player is in a PVP matchmaking queue.",
    ["KvmSysInfo_1611"]="A match has been found and all players are ready. Confirm to proceed to the battlefield.",
