    ["LeadText_1901"]="Tap to use a <color=#FF6F76>Normal Attack</color>",
    ["LeadText_2001"]="Tap to switch <color=#FF6F76>Magic Bait</color>",
    ["LeadText_2002"]="Use <color=#FF6F76>Bait</color> to catch rare fish!",
    ["LeadText_2201"]="The <color=#FF6F76>Academy Handbook</color> is an <color=#FF6F76>essential guide</color> to adventuring in Midgard.",
    ["LeadText_2301"]="<color=#FF6F76>Life Skills</color> Learn Life Skills, <color=#FF6F76>discover</color> the many resources of the world, and <color=#FF6F76>craft</color> them into essential items for your adventure!",
    ["LeadText_2401"]="<color=#FF6F76>Wardrobe</color> Create your own unique style!",
    ["LeadText_2501"]="Tap the <color=#FF6F76>Upgrade</color> button.",
    ["LeadText_2502"]="Confirm to <color=#FF6F76>Upgrade</color>.",
    ["LeadText_2601"]="In the world of RO, Guilds are like loving <color=#FF6F76>families</color> that require careful management and protection.",
    ["LeadText_2701"]="<color=#FF6F76>Mounts</color> are your trusty travel companions!",
    ["LeadText_2801"]="The <color=#FF6F76>RO Carnival</color> is a grand celebration featuring various fun daily events and limited-time events for all in the world of RO. Take part to earn <color=#FF6F76>Daily Activity Chests</color>!",
    ["LeadText_2901"]="Tap <color=#FF6F76>Odin's Blessing</color>",
    ["LeadText_2902"]="Tap <color=#FF6F76>Recommended Training Points</color>",
