    ["LiquorParty_Food_gift"]="Gift of Boss Lady",
    ["LiquorParty_Food_help"]="Prepped Dish Instruction:\n1. Hand over the required food ingredient and help the Boss Lady to finish the food preparation.\n2. The Boss Lady will hand out corresponding rewards for each Prepped Dish completed.\n3. By joining a Booze-up party and tapping the button to sync the dishes and Prepped Dishes, party members can share the food ingredients when handing them over.\n4. When a character leaves the Booze-up party, the progress of the prepped dishes will remain unchanged, and the character won't get the shared food ingredients from the party.\n5. Event Time: %s",
    ["LiquorParty_Food_monsterTitle"]="Target Monster",
