    ["LiquorParty_FriendList_teamInfo"]="%s invites you to join %s",
    ["LiquorParty_FriendList_title"]="Search for Drinking Buddy",
    ["LiquorParty_Friend_help"]="Mode Instruction:\n1.The Booze-up party is separate from the in-game party, and won't affect the party-up feature inside the game.\n2. It's possible to sync up the Prepped Dish progress across the Booze-up party, which greatly increases the efficiency of preparing dishes.\n3. Leaving the Booze-up party won't affect the Prepped Dish progress of an individual.\n4. Hurry up and find your buddies to form a Booze-up party to prepare the dishes!\n5. Event Time: %s",
