    ["LoadingTtips305006"]="You can exchange for the items you like at Shuna's Exchange Shop!",
    ["LoadingTtips307001"]="In auto mode, you'll only get the lowest ratings in the minigames!",
    ["LoadingTtips307002"]="The semi-auto mode will not skip the minigames. Please pay attention to the countdown and respond in time!",
    ["LoadingTtips307003"]="You can receive rare items on the tiles that trigger advance events!",
    ["LoadingTtips307004"]="Remote Control Dice are very precious! Please use them wisely!",
    ["LoadingTtips307005"]="All interactive elements in Wonderland will be reset every time you walk past the hot spring!",
    ["LoadingTtips307006"]="You can exchange the items you like at Tempest Market!",
    ["LoadingTtips307007"]="Different events will occur based on the tribe you selected!",
    ["Loading_tips_1"]="When you sit down and rest, your HP and SP will be restored!",
    ["Loading_tips_10"]="The South Gate's Eden Group is the place to go if you're looking for love and romance!",
    ["Loading_tips_11"]="Players who are from different dimensions but in the same zone will not be able to see each other!",
    ["Loading_tips_12"]="Information for monsters that are from different dimensions but in the same zone will not be the same!",
    ["Loading_tips_13"]="Mini and MVP monsters will only refresh on Dimension 1.",
    ["Loading_tips_14"]="Gardening gathering materials and Concentrated Ore will only refresh in Dimension 1 zones.",
    ["Loading_tips_15"]="Shops can only be set up in Dimension 1 zones.",
    ["Loading_tips_16"]="Daily Events refresh at 5:00 every day.",
    ["Loading_tips_17"]="You can buy mysterious scrolls from general merchants and use them to change your weapons stats.",
    ["Loading_tips_18"]="Once you reach Base Lv.26, you can participate in the Fishing Contest once every day.",
    ["Loading_tips_19"]="Give gifts to your friends to improve your Favor with them.",
    ["Loading_tips_2"]="When the capital's fountain erupts at 12:00 and 20:00 every day, you'll gain Odin's Blessing!",
    ["Loading_tips_20"]="When you get a new weapon, head to the Magic Furnace to transfer your weapon stats.",
    ["Loading_tips_208001"]="It is said that players can charge the abandoned Giant Goren Bru in the machine factory to get his help!",
    ["Loading_tips_208002"]="There are horrible Gatekeeper Goren roaming around the machine factory, so be careful to escape their attention!",
    ["Loading_tips_208003"]="There are 2 small Gorens in the machine factory that can control the hand crank generators, and they only take physical and magical damage respectively!",
    ["Loading_tips_208004"]="Attacking the <color=#528fff>Blue-eyed Goren</color> will recharge <color=#528fff>Bru</color>!",
    ["Loading_tips_209001"]="Guide the <color=#528fff>snowball</color> to the correct spot and detonate the <color=#528fff>ice wall</color> obstructing the path!",
    ["Loading_tips_209002"]="Step on the wrong <color=#ff5252>ice floe</color> and you'll lose your life in the icy water. Please choose your route carefully!",
    ["Loading_tips_209003"]="The <color=#ff5252>Ancient Fire Dragon</color> hidden in its lair can take you through the treacherous <color=#528fff>Frost Canyon</color>!",
    ["Loading_tips_209004"]="Try <color=#528fff>skating</color> on the slopes of Frost Canyon!",
    ["Loading_tips_21"]="Look for Brock Sledgehammer in Prontera to remove cards already inserted in your equipment.",
    ["Loading_tips_22"]="Complete side quests to obtain titles, costumes, dyestuffs, and other rewards.",
    ["Loading_tips_23"]="Pressing and holding on other team members will pop up buttons for Follow, Chat, and other functions.",
    ["Loading_tips_24"]="Dear adventurer, you will need to queue again if you don't enter the game within 10 minutes of starting character creation",
    ["Loading_tips_25"]="Dear adventurer, queue data is protected for 2 minutes. You can leave the game and return within this time without losing your place in the queue",
    ["Loading_tips_251001"]="It's said that only <color=#528fff>Rune Knight Commander Dami</color>'s <color=#528fff>Engraved Sword</color> can slay Baphomet!",
    ["Loading_tips_251002"]="The Illusion Key will be destroyed every Monday if it is not used!",
    ["Loading_tips_251003"]="The Black Market Merchant will distribute rewards based on the number of Illusion Certificates given by Adventurers!",
    ["Loading_tips_251004"]="The fewer the number of players that enter the Illusion, the stronger the monsters will be!",
    ["Loading_tips_251005"]="Adventurers with high stats will be balanced with other players in the Illusion Trial!",
    ["Loading_tips_251006"]="There is a limit to the number of times players can be resurrected during each battle in the Illusion Trial!",
    ["Loading_tips_26"]="Dear adventurer, if you accidentally disconnect or quit during your adventure, you can join the game again within 2 minutes with no need to queue",
    ["Loading_tips_261001"]="Legend has it that only the <color=#528fff>Totem</color> can seal Thanatos!",
    ["Loading_tips_261002"]="The Tower Key, if not used, will be destroyed every Monday!",
    ["Loading_tips_261003"]="The Black Market Merchant will distribute rewards to Adventurers based on the number of Illusion Certificates they submit!",
    ["Loading_tips_261004"]="The fewer people enter the Illusion, the stronger the monsters will be!",
    ["Loading_tips_261005"]="Adventurers with high stats will be balanced with other players in Trial Illusion!",
    ["Loading_tips_261006"]="There is a respawn limit for each battle in Trial Illusion!",
    ["Loading_tips_27"]="Dear adventurer, you will have to queue again if you change servers, so please choose carefully",
    ["Loading_tips_271001"]="By transforming into an Energy Robot, you can gain and transfer energy and activate the mechanisms in Area 2 to open the mechanical door.",
    ["Loading_tips_271002"]="Unused Key of Ruins will be destroyed every Monday.",
    ["Loading_tips_271003"]="The Black Market Merchant will distribute rewards to Adventurers based on the number of Illusion Certificates they submit!",
    ["Loading_tips_271004"]="The fewer people enter the Illusion, the stronger the monsters will be!",
    ["Loading_tips_271005"]="Adventurers with high stats will be balanced with other players in Trial Illusion!",
    ["Loading_tips_271006"]="There is a respawn limit for each battle in Trial Illusion!",
    ["Loading_tips_271007"]="By transforming into a Destruction Robot, you can gain energy for destruction and shatter Vesper's shield in the instance.",
    ["Loading_tips_271008"]="By transforming into an Energy Robot, you can seize Essence Energy Orbs and blast open the boss' shield during the final boss fight! Be sure to protect yourself!",
    ["Loading_tips_271009"]="By transforming into a Destruction Robot, you can take down the boss' Essence Energy Orbs during the final boss fight! Be sure to protect yourself!",
    ["Loading_tips_28"]="Dear adventurer, there may be some unexpected gifts if your queue time reaches a certain amount",
    ["Loading_tips_3"]="When your backpack load reaches 50%, 75%, and 100%, you'll be penalized by varying degrees.",
    ["Loading_tips_300001"]="You can earn <color=#528fff>Power of Light</color> from the Monster Invasion. The more Power of Light, the better the rewards! If you <color=#528fff>successfully defeat the Golden Fortress</color>, everyone in the instance will have their <color=#528fff>Power of Light doubled</color>!",
    ["Loading_tips_300002"]="Golden Fortress's Absolute Shield can only be disarmed by <color=#528fff>Ultraman Taro</color>'s ultimate! <color=#528fff>Search for Ultra Badges</color> to stop Golden Fortress!",
    ["Loading_tips_300003"]="There are various kinds of <color=#528fff>Justice Orbs</color> that will increase different stats for the entire party! Look for the orbs that fit you the best, and stop <color=#528fff>Golden Fortress</color>!",
    ["Loading_tips_311001"]="Seems like Beelzebub can release the Fatality that prevents the wound from healing! Pay attention to your HP at all times!!!",
    ["Loading_tips_311002"]="Giant Plague Soul is able to cast an AoE skill that covers an extensive area. While it seems not to deal much damage, you should beware of Quake II, which deals severe damage!!!",
    ["Loading_tips_311003"]="Plague Soul carries over the attributes from the dead character and possesses a double amount of HP. Beelzebub can create Plague Soul out of thin air based on the current threat target!!!",
    ["Loading_tips_311004"]="Fatality prevents the round from healing and keeps it in a rotten state. Somehow Yggdrasil Berry and Seed of Yggdrasil can nullify this effect!!!",
    ["Loading_tips_4"]="You can change the angle of the camera by adjusting the focus distance.",
    ["Loading_tips_5"]="The Pet Slingshot, invented by the Pet Association, can help you to accurately control the HP of monsters.",
    ["Loading_tips_6"]="The lower a monster's remaining HP, the easier it will be to catch high-quality pets!",
    ["Loading_tips_7"]="Geffen's Shop Finder can help you quickly find the right stall to trade goods.",
    ["Loading_tips_8"]="Alberta's Crystal Merchant sells mysterious gadgets that can help you solve any problems you run into on your adventures.",
    ["Loading_tips_9"]="A pet researcher who does not want to be named says that a huge breakthrough is about to be made in pet talent research!",
    ["LockedD1escribe_1"]="Unlocks when Base Level reaches <color=#FF751CFF>Lv.6</color>.\nOn the long road to greatness, mounts are your best friends!",
    ["LockedD1escribe_10"]="Unlocks when Base Level reaches <color=#FF751CFF>Lv.25</color>.\nLet Lil' Kitty's magic do the hard work for you!",
    ["LockedD1escribe_11"]="Unlocks when Base Level reaches <color=#FF751CFF>Lv.30</color>.\nGet more powerful stats to make yourself stronger!",
    ["LockedD1escribe_12"]="Unlocks when Base Level reaches <color=#FF751CFF>Lv.35</color>.\nCall your friends to join you for a fun PvP party!",
    ["LockedD1escribe_13"]="Unlocks when Base Level reaches <color=#FF751CFF>Lv.40</color>.\nGo for your goals and break through your limits!",
    ["LockedD1escribe_14"]="Unlocks when Base Level reaches <color=#FF751CFF>Lv.30</color>.\nCreate your own divine weapons!",
    ["LockedD1escribe_2"]="Complete the Lv.10 Main Quest <color=#FF751CFF>Report</color> to claim <color=#FF751CFF>Headgear</color>.\nPut on your headgear and let's get super-cute!",
    ["LockedD1escribe_3"]="Complete the Lv.11 Main Quest <color=#FF751CFF>Say Goodbye</color>.\nYou'll get new decorations and skills after advancing your job!",
    ["LockedD1escribe_4"]="Complete the Lv.11 Tutorial Quest <color=#FF751CFF>Tutorial - Academy Education</color> to unlock.\nThe academy is the place to go if you want to collect adventure information!",
    ["LockedD1escribe_5"]="Complete the Lv.12 Tutorial Quest <color=#FF751CFF>Tutorial - Card Magic</color> to obtain <color=#FF751CFF>cards</color>.\nThey say that when adventuring, matching your cards and equipment is key!",
    ["LockedD1escribe_6"]="Complete the Lv.15 Main Quest <color=#FF751CFF>Repair the Mission Board</color> to unlock.\nThe Mission Board is the best way for you to upgrade! Repair it as soon as you can!",
    ["LockedD1escribe_7"]="Unlocks when Base Level reaches <color=#FF751CFF>Lv.17</color>.\nJoin a guild to meet like-minded friends!",
    ["LockedD1escribe_8"]="Opens when Base Level reaches <color=#FF751CFF>Lv.20</color>.\nInstances are zones that provide an even greater challenge!",
    ["LockedD1escribe_9"]="Unlocks when Base Level reaches <color=#FF751CFF>Lv.25</color>.\nNo pain, no gain! Challenge MVPs that appear suddenly in the wild!",
    ["LockedDescribe_1"]="Cheese!\nTake a picture of yourself with your partners!",
    ["LockedDescribe_10"]="The Midgard Amusement Park is open for business!\nWith events every day, the fun never ends!",
    ["LockedDescribe_11"]="Explore the memories of Ymir's Heart!\nDefeat the formidable enemies of the past!",
    ["LockedDescribe_12"]="Insert cards into your equipment!\nFeel their magic!",
    ["LockedDescribe_13"]="Adventurers sharing the same ideals unite!\nAre you ready to join your new family?",
    ["LockedDescribe_14"]="Odin shall bestow you with the blessings of the gods!\nReceive your blessing and enjoy more adventure experience!",
    ["LockedDescribe_15"]="Discover the innate potential of your equipment!\nGain a helping hand in your adventures!",
    ["LockedDescribe_16"]="Powerful monsters roam the continent!\nMuster your courage and challenge them!",
    ["LockedDescribe_17"]="Push your equipment to the next level!\nIt's time to get refining!",
    ["LockedDescribe_18"]="Pit your wits and courage against your rivals in the Arena!\nShow the world your might!",
    ["LockedDescribe_19"]="Challenge Endless Tower!\nExplore the limits of your power!",
    ["LockedDescribe_2"]="Immortalize your legend in your personal chronicles!\nRecord the highlights of your adventure!",
    ["LockedDescribe_20"]="Make equipment with your own two hands!\nYou too can become a master blacksmith!",
    ["LockedDescribe_21"]="Try out new skills!",
    ["LockedDescribe_22"]="The Midgard Chamber of Commerce is now open!\nWhatever you're looking for, you can buy it here!",
    ["LockedDescribe_3"]="Hey! Let's all be friends!\nLove makes adventuring all that much better!",
    ["LockedDescribe_4"]="Cooking, mining, fishing...\nAll manner of Life Skills are waiting for you!",
    ["LockedDescribe_5"]="So many clothes to choose from...\nThe choices are simply overwhelming!",
    ["LockedDescribe_6"]="A new class, a new journey!\nExperience a new adventure!",
    ["LockedDescribe_7"]="Take on the requests of the Mission Board!\nBuild up your adventure experience!",
    ["LockedDescribe_8"]="Mounts are the ultimate companions throughout your adventure!\nRide like the wind and into the future!",
    ["LockedDescribe_9"]="Equipment is the foundation of your adventure!\nUpgrading is the root of attaining advanced equipment!",
