    ["LoginTips066"]="Kafra has prepared a mysterious gift for you. Enter the game to claim it",
    ["LoginTips067"]="I have read and agree to the [a href=https://sf1-cdn-tos.douyinstatic.com/obj/ies-hotsoon-draft/GSDK/3f86cba9-cc4b-4e1a-bd15-6b71c5cf9135.html]Terms of Service[/a], [a href=https://lf3-cdn-tos.draftstatic.com/obj/ies-hotsoon-draft/GSDK/75821d06-98ae-40a9-a073-8ddebd08a87f.html]Privacy Policy[/a], and [a href=https://lf3-cdn-tos.draftstatic.com/obj/ies-hotsoon-draft/GSDK/2a061652-7993-434e-9896-92dfd1298f94.html]Community Standard[/a].",
    ["LoginTips068"]="To ensure the security of your account, please bind it to a third-party social media account as soon as possible, and avoid clearing your device's cached data or doing anything that could result in wiping your data.",
    ["LoginTips069"]="Are you sure you want to clear your account's login record?\n(Your account will not be deleted.)",
