    ["LoginTips081"]="This account has encountered an error. Please try again later!",
    ["LoginTips082"]="Your device has been bannned. You can play again after %s. Please contact service for help! :",
    ["LoginTips083"]="I have read and agree to the[a href=https://lf16-ga18cdn-alisg.bytedgame.com/obj/sf-game-alisg/ga18/%E5%8D%8F%E8%AE%AE/ROSEATermsofService.html] \"Terms of Service\" [/a] and[a href=https://lf16-ga18cdn-alisg.bytedgame.com/obj/sf-game-alisg/ga18/terms/ROSEAPrivacyPolicy.html] \"Privacy Policy\"[/a] and[a href=https://sf16-draftcdn-sg.ibytedtos.com/obj/ies-hotsoon-draft-sg/GSDK/ROX_SEA_EN_CommunityGuideline_en.html] \"Gaming Community Guidelines\"[/a].",
    ["LoginTips084"]="Are you sure you want to log in with your new %s account?\n(You will not be able to use this account to bind again after logging in)",
    ["LoginTips085"]="There is currently an unbound tourist account\nAfter login, you will not be able to bind this account with the tourist account\nDo you want to continue?",
    ["LoginTips086"]="I have read and agree to the[a href=https://lf16-ga18cdn-alisg.bytedgame.com/obj/sf-game-alisg/ga18/%E5%8D%8F%E8%AE%AE/ROSEATermsofService.html] \"Terms of Service\" [/a] and[a href=https://lf16-ga18cdn-alisg.bytedgame.com/obj/sf-game-alisg/ga18/Nuverse-PPVN.html] \"Privacy Policy\"[/a].",
    ["LoginTips087"]="I have read and agree to the[a href=https://lf16-ga18cdn-alisg.bytedgame.com/obj/sf-game-alisg/ga18/%E5%8D%8F%E8%AE%AE/ROSEATermsofService.html] \"Terms of Service\" [/a] and[a href=https://lf16-ga18cdn-alisg.bytedgame.com/obj/sf-game-alisg/ga18/Nuverse-PPID.html] \"Privacy Policy\"[/a].",
    ["LoginTips088"]="A drop/gain restriction penalty has been placed on your account. During the penalty period, you will not be able to get EXP, Job EXP, Zeny or drop items when killing monsters, doing life skills, or other daily missions. All items and stamina used when smelting, cooking, crafting and other activities will not be returned. You also can't take Crystals from the Exchange Center, etc.",
    ["LoginTips089"]="Device cannot detect the corresponding app. Please install and try again",
    ["LoginTips090"]="Current account information is invalid! Please log in again!",
    ["LoginTips091"]="Login failed. Please return to the account selection screen to log in again.",
    ["LoginTips092"]="Reached the max capacity on player registration:",
    ["LoginTips093"]="o(╥﹏╥)o The server is under maintenance...\n\n<color=#6799ff>Please refer to the in-game notice or [a href=https://game.naver.com/lounge/RAGNAROK_X_Next_Generation/pre_campaign]Official Forum[/a] for details.</color>",
