    ["MVPRankDrop"]="Damage Ranking Bonus",
    ["MVPRareDrop"]="Rare Bonus",
    ["MVPRules_1"]="Rare Bonus",
    ["MVPRules_10"]="Settles upon the death of the MVP. Adventurers who dealt the last hit to the MVP will receive the reward. MVP of a higher version level yields more MVP Coins; event-exclusive MVP will drop unique event items.",
    ["MVPRules_11"]="You can obtain the Last Hit Reward %s times per day. Rewards from the event-exclusive MVP do not count toward this limit, but there's still a daily cap on them.",
    ["MVPRules_12"]="%s's Last Hit Bonus is as follows:",
    ["MVPRules_13"]="Individual Participation Bonus",
    ["MVPRules_14"]="Settles upon the death of the MVP. Adventurers who were in combat with the MVP and within the MVP's scene before its death can receive rewards. MVP of a higher version level yields more MVP Coins; event-exclusive MVP will drop unique event items.",
    ["MVPRules_15"]="You can obtain the Individual Participation Bonus %s times per day. Rewards from the event-exclusive MVP do not count toward this limit, but there's still a daily cap on them.",
    ["MVPRules_16"]="%s's Individual Participation Bonus is as follows:",
    ["MVPRules_17"]="First Hit Bonus",
    ["MVPRules_18"]="Settles upon the death of the MVP. Adventurers who dealt the first hit to the MVP will receive the reward. MVP of a higher version level yields more MVP Coins; event-exclusive MVP will drop unique event items.",
    ["MVPRules_19"]="You can obtain the First Hit Reward %s times per day. Rewards from the event-exclusive MVP do not count toward this limit, but there's still a daily cap on them.",
    ["MVPRules_2"]="This bonus is determined when the MVP dies. Parties are ranked according to the damage they dealt to the MVP itself. The more damage the party dealt, the higher the chance of getting the bonus. Drop rate is shared between all party members who contributed in the combat.",
    ["MVPRules_20"]="%s's Discovery Bonus is as follows:",
    ["MVPRules_21"]="MVPs that spawn during the in-game morning and daytime drop normal MVP cards. MVPs that spawn during the in-game night drop Night MVP cards. MVPs that spawn during the Void phenomenon (in-game time does not matter) drop Void MVP cards",
    ["MVPRules_22"]="Abyssal MVPs will drop all kinds of materials for Shadow Equipment Cultivation. If you obtain any rare rewards from an Abyssal MVP battle, a maximum of 1 rare reward chance will be deducted. No deduction will be made if you did not obtain any rare rewards. Abyssal MVPs and normal MVPs will share the same daily rare reward chances.",
    ["MVPRules_23"]="1. Bonus player trigger conditions: Can be triggered when below World level 30.",
    ["MVPRules_24"]="2. Party with a bonus player. Every time the bonus player uses 1 Instance reward chance, the non-bonus player will get a reward.",
    ["MVPRules_25"]="3. Party with a bonus player. Every time the bonus player uses 1 MVP/mini chance, the non-bonus player will get a reward.",
    ["MVPRules_26"]="4. Party with a bonus player. Every time the bonus player uses 500 Odin points, the non-bonus players close to the bonus player will get a reward.",
    ["MVPRules_27"]="5. Exclusive Odin EXP Multiplier\n10x for Lv.1-49 Adventurers\n9x for Lv.50-69 Adventurers\n8x for Lv.70-89 Adventurers\n7x for Lv.90-99 Adventurers\n6x for Lv.100-160 Adventurers",
    ["MVPRules_28"]="Bonus Rewards",
    ["MVPRules_3"]="Adventurers can get rare rewards %s times per day. In order to participate in the distribution of rare rewards, a Party with members who are still eligible to claim rare rewards must be ranked top-15 in the damage rankings. If all members of a Party ranked top-15 have no reward chances left, the rewards will be given to the Party ranked No. 16, and so on. Rewards from the event-exclusive MVP do not count toward this limit.",
    ["MVPRules_31"]="The settlement will take place when the MVP dies, and only the top 10 parties in terms of damage dealt will participate in the distribution of rare rewards. If all members within a top-10 party have 0 remaining rare reward chances, that party will not be allowed to participate in the distribution, and the next party in rank order will be considered. Rewards from the event-exclusive MVP do not consume the chance.",
    ["MVPRules_32"]="Party Distribution Weightage = Party's Damage Ranking Weightage + Party's Damage Proportion Weightage",
    ["MVPRules_33"]="The party's damage ranking weightage distribution rules are as follows:",
    ["MVPRules_34"]="The party's damage proportion weightage distribution rules are as follows:\nThe damage proportion weightage for each party = (%s - total ranking weightage) x the party's damage proportion.",
    ["MVPRules_35"]="Party members with remaining rare reward chances not equal to 0 have an equal probability of getting drops.",
    ["MVPRules_36"]="Party members with 0 remaining rare reward chances or who have already received a rare reward during this kill will not participate in the distribution, and their contributed damage will not be factored into the weightage allocation process.",
    ["MVPRules_4"]="%s's Rare Bonus is as follows:",
    ["MVPRules_5"]="Ranking Bonus",
    ["MVPRules_6"]="Settles upon the death of the MVP. There will be a ranking for all participating Parties based on total damage dealt. Parties ranked the 1st and the 2nd will receive 3 and 2 MVP Coins, respectively. Parties ranked from the 3rd to the 10th will receive 1 MVP Coin. Event-exclusive MVP will drop unique event items.",
    ["MVPRules_7"]="You can obtain the Ranking Reward %s times per day. Rewards from the event-exclusive MVP do not count toward this limit, but there's still a daily cap on them.",
    ["MVPRules_8"]="%s's Ranking Bonus is as follows:",
    ["MVPRules_9"]="Last Hit Bonus",
    ["MVPRules_Title"]="%s's Drop Rules are as follows:",
    ["MVPTeamName"]="%s's Party",
    ["MVPTips_1"]="%s time(s)",
    ["MVPTips_2"]="Bonus chances refresh at 5:00.",
    ["MVPTips_3"]="You have used up your bonus chances.",
    ["MVPTips_4"]="Damage dealt is less than 1%.",
    ["MVPTips_5"]="Battle Time Spent: %s'%s'%s",
    ["MVPTips_6"]="This user has violated a rule.\nThis will not count towards all reward issuances.",
    ["MVPTips_7"]="Yet to refresh",
    ["MVPWeatherTip_1"]="Current MVP/Mini spawns under the Void weather. Killing it has a chance of dropping their respective Void cards.",
    ["MVPWeatherTip_2"]="Current MVP/Mini spawns during the day (Morning and daytime in-game). Killing it has a chance of dropping their respective Day cards.",
    ["MVPWeatherTip_3"]="Current MVP/Mini spawns at night (Evening and night in-game). Killing it has a chance of dropping their respective Night cards.",
    ["MVPWeather_1"]="Haze",
    ["MVPWeather_2"]="Day",
    ["MVPWeather_3"]="Night",
