    ["MagicStoneSetting"]="About Stones",
    ["MaidTeleport11401001"]="Rush to the Endless Tower.",
    ["MaidTeleport11701001"]="Ymir's Heart has been pieced together!",
    ["MailContent_1"]="%s",
    ["MailContent_1001"]="You have been removed from the %s guild.",
    ["MailContent_1002"]="Your guild position has been changed to %s.",
    ["MailContent_1003"]="Dear Adventurer, you have joined the %s guild.",
    ["MailContent_1004"]="Dear Adventurer, %s helps you complete this Guild Order, and the rewards are as follows:",
    ["MailContent_1005"]="Dear Adventurer, this week's Guild Progress Rewards are as follows:",
    ["MailContent_1006"]="Your guild position has been changed to %s.",
    ["MailContent_1007"]="Dear Adventurer, congratulations on discovering %s! Your rewards are as follows:",
    ["MailContent_1008"]="Dear Adventurer, unfortunately, the %s guild has been disbanded. Go and find another guild to join.",
    ["MailContent_1009"]="Dear Adventurer, the Otherworld Gate's current donation progress has exceeded 130,000. After reaching 150,000, guild members will not be able to earn progress when submitting Guild Orders. Please start the battle phase as soon as possible!",
    ["MailContent_1010"]="Dear Adventurer, individual rewards for this boss attack round are as follows:",
    ["MailContent_1011"]="Dear Adventurer, your rewards are as follows:",
    ["MailContent_1012"]="Dear Adventurer, your individual rewards for the Otherworld Gate this time are as follows:",
    ["MailContent_1013"]="Esteemed Guild Leader, your guild, %s, can now be upgraded to Lv.<color=#FF1E10>%s</color>.\n<color=#FF1E10>If your maintenance funds are sufficient</color>, head to the Guild Housekeeper to upgrade your guild as soon as possible!",
    ["MailContent_1014"]="As you have not been online for seven consecutive days, %s's Guild Leader position has been transferred to %s.",
    ["MailContent_1015"]="As the former Guild Leader %s was offline for seven consecutive days, the Guild Leader position has been transferred to %s.",
    ["MailContent_1016"]="Dear Adventurer, the Otherworld Gate will open at %s tomorrow. Please make sure you're ready to take part!",
    ["MailContent_1017"]="Dear Adventurer, Guild Pass unlock conditions have been achieved! Go complete guild quests to earn huge rewards!",
    ["MailContent_1018"]="Dear Adventurer, the monster you summoned was killed after you left the battle. Your own drop rewards are as follows.",
    ["MailContent_1019"]="Dear Adventurer,\n Congratulations on placing No.%s in the MVP Best Challenger event! Your rewards are as follows:",
    ["MailContent_1020"]="Dear Adventurers,\nHere are your unclaimed Guild Pass rewards from last month. Please accept them.",
    ["MailContent_1021"]="Dear Adventurer,\nCongratulations on achieving the required points in the MVP Best Challenger event! Your rewards are as follows:",
    ["MailContent_1022"]="Dear Adventurer, the guild you belong to has modified Today's Notice. The revised content is as follows:\n%s",
    ["MailContent_1023"]="Dear Adventurer, the Otherworld Gate is ready. Please open it soon.",
    ["MailContent_1101"]="Dear Adventurer, your unclaimed instance rewards are as follows:",
    ["MailContent_1102"]="Dear Adventurer, your rewards of Twilight Banquet Illusion are as follows:",
    ["MailContent_1104"]="Dear Adventurer, congratulations on achieving rank No. %s in the <color=#ff6f76>Dashing Sweetheart</color> Personal Ranking! Your rewards are below.",
    ["MailContent_1105"]="Dear Adventurer, congratulations on becoming No.%s in the daily rankings of the <color=#ff6f76>Dashing Sweetheart</color> event. Here is your reward!",
    ["MailContent_12001"]="Dear Adventurer, the red envelope you sent was not claimed within 24 hours, so the amount you sent has been returned to you. Please take a look!",
    ["MailContent_12002"]="Dear Adventurer, as the remaining claiming amount of the adventurer you sent a red envelope to was insufficient, the excess amount has been returned to you via mail. Please take a look!",
    ["MailContent_1201"]="Dear Adventurer, you were outbid in the auction for %s. Your %s Diamonds have been returned!",
    ["MailContent_1202"]="Dear Adventurer, you won the auction for %s! Head to [Exchange Center] - [Transaction History] to claim your goods!",
    ["MailContent_1301"]="Dear Adventurer, unfortunately you did not earn enough Merit in this event and do not qualify for any rewards. Please continue to do your best in future events!",
    ["MailContent_1302"]="Dear Adventurer, in light of your outstanding performance in the Guild War, the Guild War Committee has decided to award you a bronze medal! Thanks for your contribution to the guild! Here is your reward!",
    ["MailContent_1303"]="Dear Adventurer, in light of your outstanding performance in the Guild War, the Guild War Committee has decided to award you a silver medal! Thanks for your contribution to the guild! Here is your reward!",
    ["MailContent_1304"]="Dear Adventurer, in light of your outstanding performance in the Guild War, the Guild War Committee has decided to award you a gold medal! Thanks for your contribution to the guild! Here is your reward!",
    ["MailContent_1305"]="Dear member of %s,\n Your guild successfully obtained ownership rights for %s in last guild event. The Guild War Committee has sent rewards to adventurers who earned ≥200 Merit.\n May you and your guild one day take over the entire continent!",
    ["MailContent_1306"]="Dear Adventurer,\ncongratulations on your outstanding achievement and becoming the No.%s Guild in the current Guild War. Thanks for your contribution to the Guild! Here is your reward!",
    ["MailContent_1307"]="Dear Adventurer,\nCongratulations on becoming the champion in this Cross-Server GVG with your Guild. As the successor of Odin's bloodline, may your glory be with the gods. The Guild Reward will be sent directly to the Guild Warehouse, and here is the personal reward for you.",
    ["MailContent_1308"]="Dear Adventurer,\nCongratulations on becoming the 1st Runner-up in this Cross-Server GVG with your Guild. Your deeds will spread across the Midgard. The Guild Reward will be sent directly to the Guild Warehouse. Please check it.",
    ["MailContent_1309"]="Dear Adventurer,\nCongratulations on becoming the 2nd Runner-up in this Cross-Server GVG with your Guild. Your outstanding performance will lead the way for the successors. The Guild Reward will be sent directly to the Guild Warehouse. Please check it.",
    ["MailContent_1310"]="Dear Adventurer,\nCongratulations on becoming the 3rd Runner-up in this Cross-Server GVG with your Guild. Thank you for contributing to the Guild. The Guild Reward will be sent directly to the Guild Warehouse. Please check it.",
    ["MailContent_1311"]="Dear Adventurer, you reached the rank of Trainee Hunter in last week's Ultimate Showdown! Here is your reward!",
    ["MailContent_1312"]="Dear Adventurer, you reached the rank of Silver Hunter in last week's Ultimate Showdown! Here is your reward!",
    ["MailContent_1313"]="Dear Adventurer, you reached the rank of Gold Hunter in last week's Ultimate Showdown! Here is your reward!",
    ["MailContent_1314"]="Dear Adventurer, you reached the rank of Diamond Hunter in last week's Ultimate Showdown! Here is your reward!",
    ["MailContent_1315"]="Dear Adventurer, you reached the rank of Ultimate Hunter in last week's Ultimate Showdown! Here is your reward!",
    ["MailContent_1316"]="Dear Adventurer, the uploaded Guild Icon is against regulations, and as such the Guild Icon has been reset.\nA new icon can also not be uploaded before <color=#CA2E0AFF>%s</color>. Please be careful not to upload images against the regulations~",
    ["MailContent_14001"]="Dear %s, sorry to have kept you waiting. As an apology, Kafra has prepared a small gift. Please remember to claim it",
    ["MailContent_14002"]="Dear%s, you've reached your limit for daily queue gifts",
    ["MailContent_14003"]="Dear %s, congratulations on correctly guessing the Lucky Lottery numbers! Your total rewards are as follows.",
    ["MailContent_14004"]="Dear %s, congratulations on being the first to correctly guess all of the Lucky Lottery numbers for this event! Here's your lucky prize!",
    ["MailContent_14005"]="Dear %s, Happy Birthday! On this most special of days, I'd like to wish you the sincerest of birthday wishes on behalf of Kafra Logistics! I've enclosed a small gift for you, and I hope I get the chance to wish a happy birthday next year, and each year after that! (*╹▽╹*) Your Faithful Friend, W",
    ["MailContent_14006"]="Dear %s, according to my records, today is your guildmate %s's birthday! Be a good friend and make sure you don't forget to send them your warmest birthday wishes! I've prepared a delicious cake to celebrate the occasion. I hope the two of you can share the sweet joy of this special celebration together! Your Faithful Friend, W",
    ["MailContent_14007"]="Dear %s, thank you for binding your email. W has prepared a gift for you, please remember to claim it!",
    ["MailContent_14008"]="Dear %s, thank you for binding your phone number. W has prepared a gift for you, please remember to claim it!",
    ["MailContent_14010"]="Dear Adventurer, welcome to Midgard! Are you ready to embark on a wonderful journey? To aid you in your explorations, we've prepared a special Novice Gift Pack for you. May you enjoy every moment in Ragnarok X: Next Generation. We look forward to seeing your heroic tales carved into the land of the Rune Kingdom!",
    ["MailContent_14011"]="Dear %s, you ranked No.%s in this voting event. Everyone is crazy about your stunning appearance! Here is an exclusive reward for our new Star Power stars. Please remember to claim it.",
    ["MailContent_14012"]="Dear %s, the selection process for the event is now over, and the smooth running of the event all comes down to your support. You are the brightest star in the kingdom! As a thank you, we've prepared this special reward for you. Please remember to claim it.",
    ["MailContent_14013"]="Dear Adventurer, \nThe Otherworld Rally Pack event has ended. The final discount level reached is Lv. %s, so the final package price is %s Diamonds. Your purchase price is: %s. So the total return you get is: %s Diamonds. Please accept them!",
    ["MailContent_14014"]="Dear %s, congratulations on your exemplary performance! You ranked #%s in the last Wonderland Trial event! Your rewards have been distributed as follows. Make sure you check them out!",
    ["MailContent_14015"]="Dear Adventurer, the Wonderland event is now over! Please find your unclaimed rewards attached. Make sure you check them!",
    ["MailContent_1402"]="Dear Adventurer,\n\nYour partner has sent you a small gift full of love in the event \"Star Festival Gifts\". Please claim it!\n\nHave a good day ahead and safe travels on your adventures!\nKafra Star Festival Office",
    ["MailContent_1403"]="Dear Adventurer,\n\nCongratulations on your successful pairing in the event \"Star Festival Gifts\". We wish you a brilliant & fruitful experience in the event!\n\nHave a good day ahead and safe travels on your adventures!\nKafra Star Festival Office",
    ["MailContent_1404"]="Dear Adventurer,\n\nYou have a lot of unclaimed rewards in the \"Star Festival Gifts\" event. To protect our customers' interests, we have reissued your rewards to you via mail. Don't forget to claim it!\n\nHave a good day ahead and safe travels on your adventures!\nKafra Star Festival Office",
    ["MailContent_1405"]="Dear Adventurer,\n\nYou have a lot of unclaimed rewards in the \"Return\" event. To protect our customers' interests, we have reissued your rewards to you via mail. Don't forget to claim it!\n\nHave a good day ahead and safe travels on your adventures!\nKafra Return Office",
    ["MailContent_1406"]="Dear Adventurer,\n\nYour partner has sent you a small gift full of love in the event “In the Name of Love”, please claim it!\n\n",
    ["MailContent_1407"]="Dear Adventurer,\n\nCongratulations on your successful pairing in the event “In the Name of Love”, and we wish you a brilliant & fruitful experience in the event!\n\n",
    ["MailContent_1408"]="Dear Adventurer,\n\nThere are a lot of rewards you have not claimed in the event “In the Name of Love”. Adhering to the principle that interests of customers go first, the Valentine’s Day Agency has reissued the rewards to you via mail. Don’t forget to claim it!\n\n",
    ["MailContent_1409"]="Dear Adventurer,\n\nYour partner has sent you a small love-filled gift in the event. Please claim it!",
    ["MailContent_1410"]="Dear Adventurer,\n\nCongratulations on your successful pairing in the event, and we wish you a sweet and successful journey as you take on the challenges together and a brilliant & fruitful experience in the event!",
    ["MailContent_1411"]="Dear Adventurer,\n\nYou have a lot of unclaimed rewards in the event. Adhering to our commitment to prioritizing customer interests, the Kafra Agency has reissued the rewards to you via mail. Don't forget to claim them!",
    ["MailContent_1412"]="Dear Adventurer,\n      \nBecause there is a bonus player in your party and you helped them reach their goals. So now we are sending you corresponding rewards.",
    ["MailContent_1413"]="Dear Adventurers:\n\nHey! Your friend %s is back!\nYou must miss him sick while he was gone. Why not give him a friendly greeting?",
    ["MailContent_1414"]="Dear Adventurer,\n\nThere are a lot of rewards you have not claimed in the event “Returned”. Adhering to the principle that interests of customers go first, the rewards have been reissued to you via mail. Don’t forget to claim it!\n\nWishing you happy adventuring!\n\nKafra Return Office",
    ["MailContent_15001"]="Dear Adventurer,\nCongratulations on becoming the lucky finalist in this round of the Cool Event Corporation Points Lottery! Your prize has been sent to your mailbox.",
    ["MailContent_15002"]="Dear Adventurer,\nYou may be interested to know that the <color=#FF6F76>%s</color> is now available from the Cool Event Corporation Points Lottery! Head to the Prontera Vending Machine now to participate in the event!",
    ["MailContent_15003"]="Dear Adventurer,\nCongratulations on becoming the lucky finalist in this round of the Kafra Corporation Points Lottery! Your prize has been sent to your mailbox.",
    ["MailContent_15004"]="Dear Adventurer,\nYou may be interested to know that the <color=#FF6F76>%s</color> is now available from the Kafra Corporation Points Lottery! Head to the Prontera Vending Machine now to participate in the event!",
    ["MailContent_15005"]="Dear Adventurer,\nCongratulations on becoming the lucky finalist in this round of the Cat Hand Services Points Lottery! Your prize has been sent to your mailbox.",
    ["MailContent_15006"]="Dear Adventurer,\nYou may be interested to know that the <color=#FF6F76>%s</color> is now available from the Cat Hand Services Points Lottery! Head to the Prontera Vending Machine now to participate in the event!",
    ["MailContent_15007"]="Dear %s, you ranked No.%s in this voting event. Everyone is crazy about your stunning appearance! Here is an exclusive reward for our new Star Power stars. Please remember to claim it.",
    ["MailContent_15008"]="Dear %s, the selection process for the event is now over, and the smooth running of the event comes down to your support. You are the brightest star in the kingdom! We've prepared this special reward for you as a token of our thanks. Please remember to claim it.",
    ["MailContent_15009"]="Your unused Drift Bottles have been automatically thrown. Here are your rewards. Thank you for taking part in this event.",
    ["MailContent_15010"]="Here are your unclaimed rewards from the New Year raffle. Thank you for taking part in this event.",
    ["MailContent_16001"]="Dear Adventurer, the ranking of your total KVM points during the event is %s. You are the brightest star in the kingdom! Now you will receive your exclusive rewards, don’t forget to claim it!",
    ["MailContent_16002"]="Dear Adventurer, your total personal points of KVM during the event is %s. Thank you for your support, and we have prepared a special reward for you as a token of our appreciation, please claim it!",
    ["MailContent_16003"]="Dear Adventurer, your party has been created, and we look forward to your good results in the contest. Your party is as follows:%s",
    ["MailContent_16004"]="Dear Adventurer, we are very sorry to inform you that the party you created has been disbanded due to insufficient number of members. We look forward to your participation next time and thank you for your support!",
    ["MailContent_16005"]="Dear Adventurer, the event has ended, and the unused votes have been collected. Thank you for your support!",
    ["MailContent_16006"]="Dear Adventurer, thank you for participating in War of the Chosen. Your team’s performance and strength shines throughout the kingdom. Please accept these exclusive rewards",
    ["MailContent_16007"]="Dear Adventurer, thank you for participating in this season of War of the Chosen. Your team's performance exceeds any other team throughout the land. You have earned the title of this server’s Qualifying Match Champion! Here is your prize of honor. Please accept.",
    ["MailContent_16008"]="Dear Adventurer, congratulations! Your team has become the sole winning Grand Champion in War of the Chosen on your server. You are the pride of your server! Now we present you exclusive full server rewards. Please accept.",
    ["MailContent_16009"]="Dear Adventurer,\nIt’s a new year and we would like to wish you all a happy new year!\n\nThank you for your company throughout the year. The stories of your adventures will forever be etched in the history of Midgard and become the poems sung by the bards.\n\nPlease accept this gift, which is a tribute from the Lord Odin and a collection of all the good wishes in the world.\n\nMay all things go well and we will meet again year after year!\n\nROX on New Year’s Eve\n",
    ["MailContent_16010"]="You have unclaimed rewards in the Spring Festival Sign-in. We are going to send them to you via mail!",
    ["MailContent_16011"]="Dear Adventurer, you didn’t claim the rewards of this event in time and they are now being issued to you. Don’t forget to claim it!",
    ["MailContent_16012"]="Dear Adventurers, congratulation on binding with your friends. Complete the Friend Quests to obtain great rewards!",
    ["MailContent_16013"]="Dear Adventurer, here is the unclaimed reward from the event. Please claim it!",
    ["MailContent_16020"]="Dear Adventurer, here is the unclaimed reward from the event. Please claim it!",
    ["MailContent_16021"]="Dear Adventurer, thank you for participating in this year's War of the Chosen. Your Party's excellent performance amazed the entire kingdom. Iron rewards are now being issued to you. Please check them out!",
    ["MailContent_16022"]="Dear Adventurer, thank you for participating in this year's War of the Chosen. Your Party's excellent performance amazed the entire kingdom. Bronze rewards are now being issued to you. Please check them out!",
    ["MailContent_16023"]="Dear Adventurer, thank you for participating in this year's War of the Chosen. Your Party's excellent performance amazed the entire kingdom. Silver rewards are now being issued to you. Please check them out!",
    ["MailContent_16024"]="Dear Adventurer, thank you for participating in this year's War of the Chosen. Your Party's excellent performance amazed the entire kingdom. Gold rewards are now being issued to you. Please check them out!",
    ["MailContent_16025"]="Dear Adventurer, thank you for participating in this year's War of the Chosen. Your party has displayed absolute dominance in the matches and gained the honor of being in the top 8 of the Qualifying Matches. Your glorious rewards are now being issued. Please check them out!",
    ["MailContent_16026"]="Dear Adventurer, thank you for participating in this year's War of the Chosen. Your party has displayed absolute dominance in the matches and gained the honor of being in the top 4 of the Qualifying Matches. Your glorious rewards are now being issued. Please check them out!",
    ["MailContent_16027"]="Dear Adventurer, thank you for participating in this year's War of the Chosen. Your party has displayed absolute dominance in the matches and gained the honor of being in the top 2 of the Qualifying Matches. Your glorious rewards are now being issued. Please check them out!",
    ["MailContent_16028"]="Dear Adventurer, thank you for participating in this year's War of the Chosen. Your party has displayed absolute dominance in the matches and gained the honor of being the best in the kingdom, winning the championship of the Qualifying Matches. Your glorious rewards are now being issued. Please check them out!",
    ["MailContent_16029"]="Dear Adventurer, thank you for participating in this year's War of the Chosen. Your party has displayed absolute dominance in the matches and gained the honor of being in the top 8 of the Elimination Matches. Your glorious rewards are now being issued. Please check them out!",
    ["MailContent_16030"]="Dear Adventurer, thank you for participating in this year's War of the Chosen. Your party has displayed absolute dominance in the matches and gained the honor of being in the top 4 of the Elimination Matches. Your glorious rewards are now being issued. Please check them out!",
    ["MailContent_16031"]="Dear Adventurer, thank you for participating in this year's War of the Chosen. Your party has displayed absolute dominance in the matches and gained the honor of being the best in the kingdom, winning the championship of the Elimination Matches. Your glorious rewards are now being issued. Please check them out!",
    ["MailContent_16032"]="Dear Adventurer, thank you for participating in this year's War of the Chosen. Your party has displayed absolute dominance in the matches and gained the honor of being in the top 8 of the Elimination Match Finals. Your glorious rewards are now being issued. Please check them out!",
    ["MailContent_16033"]="Dear Adventurer, thank you for participating in this year's War of the Chosen. Your party has displayed absolute dominance in the matches and gained the honor of being in the top 4 of the Elimination Match Finals. Your glorious rewards are now being issued. Please check them out!",
    ["MailContent_16034"]="Dear Adventurer, thank you for participating in this year's War of the Chosen. Your party has displayed absolute dominance in the matches and gained the honor of being in the top 2 of the Elimination Match Finals. Your glorious rewards are now being issued. Please check them out!",
    ["MailContent_16035"]="Dear Adventurer, thank you for participating in this year's War of the Chosen. Your party has displayed absolute dominance in the matches and gained the honor of being the Champion of the Elimination Match Finals. Your glorious rewards are now being issued. Please check them out!",
    ["MailContent_16038"]="Please find your reissued rewards for Operation Monster Hunter, attached. Don’t forget to claim them!",
    ["MailContent_16039"]="Please find your reissued rewards for the Demon Slayer: Kimetsu no Yaiba event, attached. Don’t forget to claim them!",
    ["MailContent_16040"]="Dear Adventurer, here are your unclaimed rewards of the Contribution Points from yesterday. Please accept them!",
    ["MailContent_16041"]="Dear Adventurer, the Spring Gratitude event is about to end. We hope you can complete the challenge in time to claim the final prize!",
    ["MailContent_16042"]="Dear Adventurer, here are your unclaimed rewards during the Spring Gratitude event. Please accept them!",
    ["MailContent_17001"]="Dear Adventurer, here is the unclaimed achievement reward from the event. Please claim it!",
    ["MailContent_17003"]="Dear Adventurer, here is the unclaimed reward from the event. Please claim it!",
    ["MailContent_17005"]="Dear Adventurer, %s has gifted you a Glory Pass. Please check.",
    ["MailContent_17006"]="Dear Adventurer,\nThe following are your unclaimed level rewards in Treasury of Light.\nWe're now reissuing them to you. Please check.",
    ["MailContent_17007"]="Dear Adventurer,\n You ranked No. %s in yesterday's Ice Fishing event. Here are your rewards!",
    ["MailContent_17008"]="Dear Adventurer,\n You fished up tons of big fish in the Fishing Showdown and ranked No. %s at the end of the event. Here are your rewards!",
    ["MailContent_17009"]="Dear Adventurer, here are your unclaimed rewards during the event. Please accept them!",
    ["MailContent_17010"]="Dear Adventurer, here are your unclaimed rewards during the event. Please accept them!",
    ["MailContent_18001"]="Dear Adventurer, here is the unclaimed reward from the event. Please claim it!",
    ["MailContent_18002"]="%s removes you from the Booze-up party. Go look for other drinking buddies to enjoy the event!",
    ["MailContent_19002"]="Dear Adventurer, this season has already finished. Here are your unclaimed season rewards. Please check them out in time!",
    ["MailContent_19003"]="Dear Adventurer, here are the privilege rewards of the week after you activated the Season Pass. Please check them out in time!",
    ["MailContent_19004"]="Dear Adventurer, here are the privilege rewards of the month after you activated the Season Pass. Please check them out in time!",
    ["MailContent_19005"]="Dear Adventurer, in light of your outstanding performance in the Guild War, you will now receive the corresponding number of Blazing Points! Below are your rewards. Please accept them!",
    ["MailContent_19006"]="Dear Adventurer, congratulations on meeting the requirement of Blazing Points! Below are your rewards. Please accept them!",
    ["MailContent_19007"]="Dear Adventurer, you have unclaimed rewards in the Moonlit Party event. Please claim them in time.",
    ["MailContent_20000"]="Dear Adventurer, thank you for participating in this year's War of the Chosen. Your Party has displayed absolute dominance in the Ranked Match and performed exceptionally well, with Party's points ranking 1st of the server. Your glorious rewards are now being issued. Please check them out!",
    ["MailContent_20001"]="Dear Adventurer, thank you for participating in this year's War of the Chosen. Your Party has displayed absolute dominance in the matches and ranked <color=#ff646f>Final Four in the Group</color>. Your glorious rewards are now being issued. Please check them out!",
    ["MailContent_20002"]="Dear Adventurer, thank you for participating in this year's War of the Chosen. Your Party has displayed absolute dominance in the matches and become a <color=#ff646f>Group Finalist</color>. Your glorious rewards are now being issued. Please check them out!",
    ["MailContent_20003"]="Dear Adventurer, thank you for participating in this year's War of the Chosen. Your Party has displayed absolute dominance in the matches and seized the honor of being the <color=#ff646f>Group Champion</color>. Your glorious rewards are now being issued. Please check them out!",
    ["MailContent_20004"]="Dear Adventurer, thank you for participating in this year's War of the Chosen. Your Party has displayed absolute dominance in the matches and ranked <color=#ff646f>Final Four in the Elimination Match</color>. Your glorious rewards are now being issued. Please check them out!",
    ["MailContent_20005"]="Dear Adventurer, thank you for participating in this year's War of the Chosen. Your Party has displayed absolute dominance in the matches and become an <color=#ff646f>Elimination Match Finalist</color>. Your glorious rewards are now being issued. Please check them out!",
    ["MailContent_20006"]="Dear Adventurer, thank you for participating in this year's War of the Chosen. Your Party has displayed absolute dominance in the matches and seized the honor of being the <color=#ff646f>Champion of the Elimination Match</color>. Your glorious rewards are now being issued. Please check them out!",
    ["MailContent_20007"]="Dear Adventurer, thank you for participating in this year's War of the Chosen. We all see how well your Party performed and made it into the <color=#ff646f>Elite Eight of the Group</color>. Hope to see your good progress next time!",
    ["MailContent_20008"]="Dear Adventurer, thank you for participating in this year's War of the Chosen. We all see how well your Party performed and made it into the <color=#ff646f>Final Four of the Group</color>. Hope to see your good progress next time!",
    ["MailContent_20009"]="Dear Adventurer, thank you for participating in this year's War of the Chosen. We all see how well your Party performed and made it into the <color=#ff646f>Group Final</color>. Hope to see your good progress next time!",
    ["MailContent_2001"]="Dear Adventurer, due to some unknown reason, your last top up did not arrive in time. We will reissue the following:",
    ["MailContent_20010"]="Dear Adventurer, thank you for participating in this year's War of the Chosen. We all see how well your Party performed and made it into the <color=#ff646f>Elite Eight of the Elimination Match</color>. Hope to see your good progress next time!",
    ["MailContent_20011"]="Dear Adventurer, thank you for participating in this year's War of the Chosen. We all see how well your Party performed and made it into the <color=#ff646f>Final Four of the Elimination Match</color>. Hope to see your good progress next time!",
    ["MailContent_20012"]="Dear Adventurer, thank you for participating in this year's War of the Chosen. We all see how well your Party performed and made it into the final, seizing the <color=#ff646f>1st Runner-up of the Elimination Match</color>. Hope to see your good progress next time!",
    ["MailContent_20013"]="Dear Adventurer, thank you for participating in this year's War of the Chosen. Your Party has displayed absolute dominance in the matches and ranked <color=#ff646f>Elite Eight in the Group</color>. Your glorious rewards are now being issued. Please check them out!",
    ["MailContent_2002"]="Dear Adventurer, due to some unknown reason, your last VIP Card top up did not arrive in time. We will reissue the following:",
    ["MailContent_2003"]="Dear Adventurer, congratulations on placing No.%s in the <color=#ff6f76>[Guild KVM]</color> individual contribution rankings. Thanks for your contribution to the guild! Here is your reward!",
    ["MailContent_2004"]="Dear Adventurer, due to some unknown reason, your VIP Card top up gift did not take effect. We will compensate you the difference via mail. Please make sure you claim it in time!",
    ["MailContent_2005"]="Esteemed Adventurer, please accept this gift from the Kafra Corporation! It'll keep you energized and your Stamina full!",
    ["MailContent_2006"]="Dear %s, your report regarding %s has been received. We will deal with it as soon as possible! Please wait to hear back from us!",
    ["MailContent_2007"]="Dear Adventurer, thank you for recharging via our official website. Your purchased Diamonds have been automatically added to your currency bar. Please take a look!",
    ["MailContent_2008"]="Dear Adventurer, thank you for participating in the MyCard Top Up event. Here are your event rewards.",
    ["MailContent_2009"]="Dear Adventurer, thank you for participating in the Apple Gift Card event. Please accept the following redemption rewards:",
    ["MailContent_20099"]="Dear Adventurer,\nYour War of the Chosen Party has a match at <color=#ff646f>%s today</color>. Please arrange your schedules properly, sync the data, and log into the Contest Server beforehand to avoid missing the event. Thank you for supporting our contest.",
    ["MailContent_2010"]="Dear Adventurer, thank you for participating in the Apple Gift Card event. Please accept the following redemption rewards:",
    ["MailContent_20100"]="Dear Adventurer,\nYou performed excellently in this year's War of the Chosen, making a significant contribution to your team's victory. Here is your glorious reward. Please check it out!",
    ["MailContent_20101"]="Dear Adventurer,\nYou performed excellently in this year's War of the Chosen, making a significant contribution to your team's victory. Here is your glorious reward. Please check it out!",
    ["MailContent_20102"]="Dear Adventurer,\nYou performed excellently in this year's War of the Chosen, making a significant contribution to your team's victory. Here is your glorious reward. Please check it out!",
    ["MailContent_20103"]="Dear Adventurer,\nYou performed excellently in this year's War of the Chosen, making a significant contribution to your team's victory. Here is your glorious reward. Please check it out!",
    ["MailContent_20104"]="Dear Adventurer, your ROXIC party has been created, and we look forward to your good results in the contest.",
    ["MailContent_20105"]="Dear Adventurer, we are very sorry to inform you that your ROXIC party has been disbanded due to the insufficient number of members. We look forward to your participation next time, and thank you for your support!",
    ["MailContent_20106"]="Dear Adventurer, congratulations on advancing in this round of the ROXIC. Below are the contest supplies.",
    ["MailContent_20107"]="Dear Adventurer, you have been eliminated from this round of the ROXIC. We look forward to your participation next time, and thank you for your support!",
    ["MailContent_20108"]="Dear Adventurer, congratulations on securing the championship title in this ROXIC! Your heroic efforts will be forever remembered by every Adventurer!",
    ["MailContent_20109"]="Dear Adventurer, you have successfully registered for the ROX Fair Play Championship. Create or join a party now!",
    ["MailContent_2011"]="Dear Adventurer, thank you for participating in the Apple Gift Card event. Please accept the following redemption rewards:",
    ["MailContent_20110"]="Dear Adventurer, we are very sorry to inform you that your ROX Fair Play Championship party has been disbanded due to the insufficient number of members. We look forward to your participation next time, and thank you for your support!",
    ["MailContent_20111"]="Dear Adventurer, your ROX Fair Play Championship party has been created, and we look forward to your good results in the contest.",
    ["MailContent_20112"]="Dear Adventurer, thank you for your active participation. Here are your rewards! Please check them out!",
    ["MailContent_20113"]="Dear Adventurer, thank you for participating in the ROX Fair Play Championship. Your Party has displayed absolute dominance in the matches and advanced to the <color=#ff646f>Elimination Match</color>. Your glorious rewards are now being issued. Please check them out!",
    ["MailContent_20114"]="Dear Adventurer, thank you for participating in the ROX Fair Play Championship. Your Party has displayed absolute dominance in the matches and advanced to <color=#ff646f>Top 16</color>. Your glorious rewards are now being issued. Please check them out!",
    ["MailContent_20115"]="Dear Adventurer, thank you for participating in the ROX Fair Play Championship. Your Party has displayed absolute dominance in the matches and advanced to <color=#ff646f>Top 8</color>. Your glorious rewards are now being issued. Please check them out!",
    ["MailContent_20116"]="Dear Adventurer, thank you for participating in the ROX Fair Play Championship. Your Party has displayed absolute dominance in the matches and advanced to <color=#ff646f>Top 4</color>. Your glorious rewards are now being issued. Please check them out!",
    ["MailContent_20117"]="Dear Adventurer, thank you for participating in the ROX Fair Play Championship. Your Party has displayed absolute dominance in the matches and advanced to <color=#ff646f>Top 2</color>. Your glorious rewards are now being issued. Please check them out!",
    ["MailContent_20118"]="Dear Adventurer, thank you for participating in the ROX Fair Play Championship. Your Party has displayed absolute dominance in the matches and became the <color=#ff646f>Champion</color>. Your glorious rewards are now being issued. Please check them out!",
    ["MailContent_20119"]="Dear Adventurer, congratulations on achieving No.%s on the Oblivion Realm Leaderboard! Here is your reward!",
    ["MailContent_2012"]="Dear Adventurer, congratulations on successfully purchasing the Cat Hand Services New Year Special Gift Pack. Please accept the following rewards:",
    ["MailContent_20120"]="Dear Adventurer, thank you for participating in the ROX Fair Play Championship. We all see how well your Party performed and made it into <color=#ff646f>Top 32</color>. Better luck next time!",
    ["MailContent_20121"]="Dear Adventurer, thank you for participating in the ROX Fair Play Championship. We all see how well your Party performed and made it into <color=#ff646f>Top 16</color>. Better luck next time!",
    ["MailContent_20122"]="Dear Adventurer, thank you for participating in the ROX Fair Play Championship. We all see how well your Party performed and made it into <color=#ff646f>Top 8</color>. Better luck next time!",
    ["MailContent_20123"]="Dear Adventurer, thank you for participating in the ROX Fair Play Championship. We all see how well your Party performed and made it into <color=#ff646f>Top 4</color>. Better luck next time!",
    ["MailContent_20124"]="Dear Adventurer, thank you for participating in the ROX Fair Play Championship. We all see how well your Party performed and became <color=#ff646f>2nd Place</color>. Better luck next time!",
    ["MailContent_2013"]="Dear Adventurer, you have purchased the ROX Giftpack-1 more than once. Please contact our customer service personnel for refund or compensation related matters.",
    ["MailContent_20130"]="Dear Adventurer,\nThe following are your unclaimed rewards in Vanguard Assault.\nWe're now reissuing them to you. Please check.",
    ["MailContent_20130_1"]="Dear Adventurer,\nThe following are your unclaimed rewards in Darkness Purge.\nWe're now reissuing them to you. Please check.",
    ["MailContent_20131"]="Dear Adventurer,\nThe following are your unclaimed rewards in Legion Invasion.\nWe're now reissuing them to you. Please check.",
    ["MailContent_20131_1"]="Dear Adventurer,\nThe following are your unclaimed rewards in Demon Invasion.\nWe're now reissuing them to you. Please check.",
    ["MailContent_20132"]="Dear Adventurer,\nThe following are your unclaimed rewards in Raoh Battle.\nWe're now reissuing them to you. Please check.",
    ["MailContent_20132_1"]="Dear Adventurer,\nThe following are your unclaimed rewards in Ultimate Challenge.\nWe're now reissuing them to you. Please check.",
    ["MailContent_20133"]="Dear Adventurer, thank you for joining Raoh Battle this time.\nYou've achieved <color=#ff646f>No.%s</color> on the leaderboard. Here are your rewards.",
    ["MailContent_20133_1"]="Dear Adventurer, thank you for joining Ultimate Challenge this time.\nYou've achieved <color=#ff646f>No.%s</color> on the leaderboard. Here are your rewards.",
    ["MailContent_2014"]="Dear Adventurer, thank you for recharging via our official website. Your purchased Diamonds have been automatically added to your currency bar. Please take a look!",
    ["MailContent_20140"]="Dear Adventurer, congratulations on making it into the top 10 of the Master Challenge in Stage 1 of the Doomsday Battle. Here are your rewards—please check them out!",
    ["MailContent_20141"]="Dear Adventurer, congratulations on making it into the top 30 of the Master Challenge in Stage 1 of the Doomsday Battle. Here are your rewards—please check them out!",
    ["MailContent_20142"]="Dear Adventurer, congratulations on making it into the top 80 of the Master Challenge in Stage 1 of the Doomsday Battle. Here are your rewards—please check them out!",
    ["MailContent_20143"]="Dear Adventurer, you have performed exceptionally well in the Master Challenge in Stage 1 of the Doomsday Battle. Here are your rewards—please check them out!",
    ["MailContent_20144"]="Dear Adventurer, congratulations on making it into the top 10 of the Master Challenge in Stage 2 of the Doomsday Battle. Here are your rewards—please check them out!",
    ["MailContent_20145"]="Dear Adventurer, congratulations on making it into the top 30 of the Master Challenge in Stage 2 of the Doomsday Battle. Here are your rewards—please check them out!",
