    ["MailContent_20148"]="Dear Adventurer, congratulations on making it into the top 10 of the Master Challenge in Stage 3 of the Doomsday Battle. Here are your rewards—please check them out!",
    ["MailContent_20149"]="Dear Adventurer, congratulations on making it into the top 30 of the Master Challenge in Stage 3 of the Doomsday Battle. Here are your rewards—please check them out!",
    ["MailContent_2015"]="Dear Adventurer,\n\nWe have detected a malicious refund by your account. The system has deducted an equivalent amount of Diamonds from your account (%s) as a form of punishment. Players who commit serious violations will also be subject to other forms of punishment. If you have further questions regarding this action, please contact us via Settings - Customer Service. Thank you.",
    ["MailContent_20150"]="Dear Adventurer, congratulations on making it into the top 80 of the Master Challenge in Stage 3 of the Doomsday Battle. Here are your rewards—please check them out!",
    ["MailContent_20151"]="Dear Adventurer, you have performed exceptionally well in the Master Challenge in Stage 3 of the Doomsday Battle. Here are your rewards—please check them out!",
    ["MailContent_20152"]="Dear Adventurer, congratulations on making it into the top 10 of the Master Challenge Overall Rankings of the Doomsday Battle. Here are your rewards—please check them out!",
    ["MailContent_20153"]="Dear Adventurer, congratulations on making it into the top 30 of the Master Challenge Overall Rankings of the Doomsday Battle. Here are your rewards—please check them out!",
