    ["MailContent_20155"]="Dear Adventurer, you have performed exceptionally well in the Master Challenge Overall Rankings of the Doomsday Battle. Here are your rewards—please check them out!",
    ["MailContent_20156"]="Dear Adventurer, congratulations on making it into the top 10 of the Master Challenge in Stage 1 of the Thanatos Tower. Here are your rewards—please check them out!",
    ["MailContent_20157"]="Dear Adventurer, congratulations on making it into the top 30 of the Master Challenge in Stage 1 of the Thanatos Tower. Here are your rewards—please check them out!",
