    ["MailContent_20159"]="Dear Adventurer, you have performed exceptionally well in the Master Challenge in Stage 1 of the Thanatos Tower. Here are your rewards—please check them out!",
    ["MailContent_2016"]="Dear Adventurer,\n\nThank you for topping up via the official website. Please check your mailbox, as we've sent you a gift as a small token of our appreciation!",
    ["MailContent_20160"]="Dear Adventurer, congratulations on making it into the top 10 of the Master Challenge in Stage 2 of the Thanatos Tower. Here are your rewards—please check them out!",
    ["MailContent_20161"]="Dear Adventurer, congratulations on making it into the top 30 of the Master Challenge in Stage 2 of the Thanatos Tower. Here are your rewards—please check them out!",
    ["MailContent_20162"]="Dear Adventurer, congratulations on making it into the top 80 of the Master Challenge in Stage 2 of the Thanatos Tower. Here are your rewards—please check them out!",
