    ["MailContent_20169"]="Dear Adventurer, congratulations on making it into the top 30 of the Master Challenge Overall Rankings of the Thanatos Tower. Here are your rewards—please check them out!",
    ["MailContent_2017"]="Dear Adventurer,\nYou have successfully redeemed the Google Play Gift Card Pack Reward.\nHere is <color=#CA2E0AFF>Kafra Corp. Coin x3</color>, please claim them.",
    ["MailContent_20170"]="Dear Adventurer, congratulations on making it into the top 80 of the Master Challenge Overall Rankings of the Thanatos Tower. Here are your rewards—please check them out!",
