    ["MailContent_20199"]="Dear Adventurers, here are your unclaimed season tier rewards:",
    ["MailContent_2020"]="Dear Adventurer,\nYou have successfully redeemed the Google Play Gift Card Pack Reward.\nHere is <color=#CA2E0AFF>Basic Headgear Blueprint Gift Box x1</color> and <color=#CA2E0AFF>Automatic Fishing Rod x1</color>. Please claim them.",
