    ["MailContent_20217"]="Dear Adventurer, congratulations on achieving No. %s on this season's Cross-Server Infinite Showdown Ranked Match! Here is your reward!",
    ["MailContent_20220"]="Dear Adventurer, the Apex GVG League kicks off at <color=#ff646f>21:30 tonight</color>. Get ready!",
    ["MailContent_20221"]="Dear Adventurer, congratulations on winning this round of the Apex GVG League! Here is your reward!",
    ["MailContent_20222"]="Dear Adventurer, sorry you didn't win this round of the Apex GVG League. We hope you achieve better results in the next battle. Here is your reward!",
    ["MailContent_20223"]="Dear Adventurer, the Apex GVG League has ended. Glory to your guild, crowned as <color=#ff646f>Champion</color>! Exclusive glorious rewards have been distributed to all members. Please see the attachment.",
    ["MailContent_20224"]="Dear Adventurer, the Apex GVG League has ended. Glory to your guild, crowned as <color=#ff646f>2nd Place</color>! Exclusive glorious rewards have been distributed to all members. Please see the attachment.",
    ["MailContent_20225"]="Dear Adventurer, the Apex GVG League has ended. Glory to your guild, crowned as <color=#ff646f>3rd Place</color>! Exclusive glorious rewards have been distributed to all members. Please see the attachment.",
    ["MailContent_20226"]="Dear Adventurer, the Apex GVG League has ended. Congratulations to your guild for achieving an <color=#ff646f>excellent result</color>! Exclusive glorious rewards have been distributed to all members. Please see the attachment.",
    ["MailContent_20227"]="Dear Adventurer, thanks to everyone's feedback, we have carried out a comprehensive optimization. Compensation will be provided following this update. We apologize for the inconvenience caused!",
    ["MailContent_20228"]="Dear Adventurer,\nCongratulations on becoming the lucky finalist in this round of the Demon Realm Treasure Lucky Draw! Your prize has been sent to your mailbox.",
    ["MailContent_20229"]="Dear Adventurer,\nYou may be interested to know that the <color=#FF6F76>%s</color> is now available from the Demon Realm Treasure Lucky Draw! Open the Demon Realm Treasure Vending Machine to join in!",
    ["MailContent_20230"]="Dear Adventurer,\nYour unclaimed Exchange Center items have been returned. Please check.",
    ["MailContent_20231"]="Dear Adventurer, the Bladepoint Clash %s Stage <color=#ff646f>%s</color> has successfully concluded! Congratulations! Your region achieved <color=#ff646f>No. %s</color>! Exclusive rewards for all members of your region have now been sent. Please check your mail!",
    ["MailContent_20232"]="Dear Adventurer, all Bladepoint Clash stages have successfully concluded! Congratulations! Your region achieved <color=#ff646f>No. %s</color>! Exclusive rewards for all members of your region have now been sent. Please check your mail!",
    ["MailContent_20233"]="Dear Adventurer,\nHere is your unclaimed reward from the Thanksgiving Support event. We're now reissuing it to you. Please claim it!",
    ["MailContent_20234"]="Dear Adventurer,\nHere is your unclaimed reward from the Thanksgiving Support event. We're now reissuing it to you. Please claim it!",
    ["MailContent_20235"]="Dear Adventurer,\nHere is your unclaimed reward from the Thanksgiving Support event. We're now reissuing it to you. Please claim it!",
    ["MailContent_20236"]="Dear Adventurer,\nThe following are your unclaimed rewards in the Good Tidings event.\nWe're now reissuing them to you. Please check.",
    ["MailContent_20237"]="Dear Adventurer,\nThe following are your unclaimed progress rewards in the Good Tidings event.\nWe're now reissuing them to you. Please check.",
    ["MailContent_20238"]="Dear Adventurer,\nYou ranked No. %s in today's Total Invasion event. Here is your reward!",
    ["MailContent_20240"]="The draw you joined for %s has been completed! The prize is now listed in the Auction House. Crystals earned from the auction will be distributed to you based on the points you contributed. Feel free to join the bidding!",
    ["MailContent_20241"]="The draw you joined for %s was unsold and has now been relisted. Crystals earned from the auction will be distributed to you based on the points you contributed. Feel free to join the bidding!",
    ["MailContent_20242"]="The final price of the draw you joined for %s is %s Diamond(s). Based on your contributed points, you've received %s Crystal(s).",
    ["MailContent_20260"]="Dear Adventurer,\nCongratulations on becoming the lucky finalist in this round of the Golden Steed Blessings Lucky Draw! Your prize has been sent to your mailbox.",
    ["MailContent_20261"]="Dear Adventurer,\nYou may be interested to know that the <color=#FF6F76>%s</color> is now available from the Golden Steed Blessings Lucky Draw! Enter the Golden Steed Blessings event to join in!",
    ["MailContent_21001"]="Dear Adventurer, you have unclaimed rewards in the Time to Shine event. Please claim them in time.",
    ["MailContent_21002"]="Dear Adventurer, you have reached #%s in the Time to Shine's season weekly ranking. Here are your rewards.",
    ["MailContent_21003"]="Dear Adventurer,\n\nYou have unclaimed Return Pass rewards in the \"Return\" event. To protect our customers' interests, we have reissued your rewards to you via mail. Don't forget to claim it!\n\nHave a good day ahead and safe travels on your adventures!\nKafra Return Office",
    ["MailContent_21004"]="Dear Adventurer,\nhere is the reward you earned by spending Star Wish Coins in the Make a Wish event. Please claim it!",
    ["MailContent_21005"]="Dear Adventurer,\nhere is the reward you earned in the Make a Wish event. Please claim it!",
    ["MailContent_21007"]="Dear Adventurer,\nHere is your unclaimed reward from the Anniversary Stage Attire event. Please claim it!",
    ["MailContent_21009"]="Dear Adventurer,\nCongratulations on becoming No.%s on the Feeding Leaderboard in the current Sausage Battle. Thanks for your feeding! Here is your reward!",
    ["MailContent_2101"]="Esteemed Adventurer, congratulations on winning the auction! Your <color=#ec8a5a>%s</color> can now be claimed from the collection interface!",
    ["MailContent_21010"]="Dear Adventurer,\nCongratulations to your camp on winning the current Sausage Battle. Thanks for your feeding! Here is your reward!",
    ["MailContent_21011"]="Dear Adventurer,\nThanks for your feeding in the current Sausage Battle! Here is your reward!",
    ["MailContent_2102"]="Esteemed Adventurer, unfortunately you didn't win the auction for the item you wanted. Thanks for taking part!",
    ["MailContent_21020"]="Dear Adventurer,\nHere is your unclaimed reward from the Furniture Box event. Please claim it!",
    ["MailContent_2103"]="Esteemed Adventurer, the auction for the <color=#ec8a5a>%s</color> you bid on has ended. The Diamonds you bid have been returned.",
    ["MailContent_2104"]="Esteemed Adventurer, the bidder you supported in the <color=#ec8a5a>%s</color> auction won! Please accept your earnings!",
    ["MailContent_2105"]="Esteemed Adventurer, the <color=#ec8a5a>%s</color> pre-order has ended. Please collect your pre-order amount.",
    ["MailContent_2106"]="Esteemed Adventurer, the <color=#ec8a5a>%s</color> pre-order you issued has been canceled. Please claim your refund and re-issue your pre-order.\n(If you can't see the pre-order option, this means that the pre-order function for this product has been deactivated.)",
    ["MailContent_2107"]="Dear Adventurer, thanks to your contribution, the Exchange Center's stock has been increased.\nBased on your contribution to the Exchange Center, the committee will grant you a dividend from the sale of last week's stock.\nYour contribution earnings are: <color=#ec8a5a>%s</color> Crystals\nPlease take a look!",
    ["MailContent_2108"]="Dear adventurer, <color=#ec8a5a>%s</color> has a new item for sale, go check it out at the Purchase Shop\n \n ------------------Purchase Shop Services",
    ["MailContent_2109"]="Dear adventurer, your [Transaction History] contains orders that will expire in <color=#ec8a5a>7 days</color>. Go to [Purchase Shop] - [Transaction History] to view them",
    ["MailContent_2110"]="Dear Adventurer, your Transaction History contains invalid orders and has been returned for processing.\nWe apologize for any inconvenience caused.",
    ["MailContent_2111"]="Dear Adventurers\n  We have detected that the recent transaction, %s in the Exchange Center, has violated the rules. To maintain the fairness and balance of the game, we will carry out the following procedures for the violation:\n  1. All item(s) and currency involved in this transaction will be taken away and returned to both parties.\n  2. Buyer:\n  The buyer will receive a full refund of the transaction and have the purchased item taken away.\n  If the buyer has already performed actions on the item (use, cultivation, etc.), then they could keep the item without receiving a refund.\n  3. Seller:\n  The seller will receive the item previously sold and have the currency involved in this transaction deducted. If the seller does not have enough currency to support the action above, their balance will be in a negative status after the deduction. Such will not prevent the seller from obtaining this currency in the future.\n \n  We strive to provide a harmonious and fair gaming environment. Please abide by the User Agreement and Rules. We also encourage everyone to report any violations to the official operating team. Please get in touch with customer service if you have any concerns.\n  Thank you for your love and support of Ragnarok X: Next Generation",
    ["MailContent_2112"]="Dear Adventurers\n  We have detected that the recent transaction, %s in the Exchange Center, has violated the rules. To maintain the fairness and balance of the game, we will carry out the following procedures for the violation:\n  1. All item(s) and currency involved in this transaction will be taken away and returned to both parties.\n  2. Buyer:\n  The buyer will receive a full refund of the transaction and have the purchased item taken away.\n  If the buyer has already performed actions on the item (use, cultivation, etc.), then they could keep the item without receiving a refund.\n  3. Seller:\n  The seller will receive the item previously sold and have the currency involved in this transaction deducted. If the seller does not have enough currency to support the action above, their balance will be in a negative status after the deduction. Such will not prevent the seller from obtaining this currency in the future.\n \n  We strive to provide a harmonious and fair gaming environment. Please abide by the User Agreement and Rules. We also encourage everyone to report any violations to the official operating team. Please get in touch with customer service if you have any concerns.\n  Thank you for your love and support of Ragnarok X: Next Generation",
    ["MailContent_22000"]="Dear Adventurer: \nYou have missed %s weeks this season. As per your Season Pass Privileges, here is the point compensation for the missed weeks. Please check it out!",
    ["MailContent_22001"]="Dear Adventurer, you've achieved the Elite tier in this season's Infinite Showdown Ranked Mode! Here is your reward!",
