    ["MailContent_22037"]="Dear Adventurer, congratulations on achieving Warlord in this season's Infinite Showdown Ranked Match! Here is your reward!",
    ["MailContent_22101"]="Dear Adventurer, the Hyper Event is about to begin. Since you've logged in early, we will record the days you haven't logged in and use that to trigger the Hyper Event when it starts.",
    ["MailContent_22102"]="Dear Adventurer, your Hyper Challenge is about to end. Complete the challenge as soon as possible to claim all the prizes!",
    ["MailContent_22103"]="Dear Adventurer,\n Here is your unclaimed reward from the Hyper Event. We're now reissuing it to you. Please claim it!",
    ["MailContent_22104"]="Dear Adventurer, your apprentice has completed a quest and is a Hyper Player. Here is your reward. Please claim it!",
    ["MailContent_23005"]="Dear Adventurer, the following are your unclaimed level rewards in The Journey of Courage Pass. We're now reissuing them to you. Please check.",
    ["MailContent_2301"]="Hey, Adventurer!\n\nIf you are receiving this letter, it means that the Arena has recognized the strength you've shown against the elite monsters of the world.\nBut now is not the time to become complacent—the Arena is never short of good fighters. If you wish to be accepted among our ranks, you will not only need to show your strength, you will also need the Goddess of Luck's blessings. And so, we cordially invite you to prove your might in a battle for the title of Ultimate Fighter in the Arena.\nHaha. Are you feeling confident, rookie? I look forward to seeing you get beaten!\n\nNow, allow me to explain the process of the competition.\nQualifier Registration Time: 21:00 - 21:03\nQualifier Entry Time: 21:03 - 21:05\n\nWe will hold 30 qualifier matches at the same time, and the finals will officially start 2 minutes after the qualifier matches in all arenas are over. When that happens, we will send an announcement to remind you to advance to the finals, if you're lucky enough to make it that far. Don't forget to pay attention to the finals announcement!\nYour invitation is attached to this letter. I will be waiting for you at the door of the Red Rose Tavern. Do you have what it takes to join the fight? That all depends on you!\n\n—Tony Chir",
    ["MailContent_2302"]="Hey, Adventurer!\n\nI hear you've been quite active these days. In fact, I am writing to inform you that you have qualified for the Ultimate Showdown! Forget about how well you did last time—now's your chance to prove yourself all over again! Isn't it exciting? Haha! I look forward to seeing you there!\n\nThe schedule is the same as before:\nQualifier Registration Time: 21:00 - 21:03\nQualifier Entry Time: 21:03 - 21:05\n\nWe will hold 30 qualifier matches at the same time, and the finals will officially start 2 minutes after the qualifiers are over. When that happens, we will send an announcement to remind you to advance to the finals, if you're lucky enough to make it that far. Don't forget to pay attention to the finals announcement!\nWell, that's all for now. I'll be waiting for you to come find me! Haha!\n\n—Tony Chir",
    ["MailContent_24000"]="Dear Adventurer, we're sorry to inform you that you didn't win any reward in the Joker Lucky Draw.\nHere's the list of winners:\n%s",
    ["MailContent_24001"]="Congratulations Adventurer! You've won a grand prize in the Joker Lucky Draw. Here's your reward!\nHere's the list of winners:\n%s",
    ["MailContent_24002"]="Dear Adventurer, thank you for your contribution to the world event - %s. Since you've already participated and completed the event for today, no rewards will be given to you. Please come back tomorrow!\n <size=18><color=#A1979FFF>Event Completion Time: %s</color></size>",
    ["MailContent_24003"]="Dear Adventurer, your contribution reward from the world event, %s, has been sent via mail.\n<size=18><color=#A1979FFF>Event Completion Time: %s</color></size>",
    ["MailContent_24004"]="Dear Adventurer, congratulations on having a friendly chat with your future friends during the White Valentine's Day event! Here are your rewards—please check them out!",
    ["MailContent_24005"]="Dear Adventurer, congratulations on participating in the Battle Aid Give Back Rewards during the Fist of the North Star collaboration event! Here are your rewards—please check them out!",
    ["MailContent_24006"]="Congratulations Adventurer! You've won a grand prize in the Joker Lucky Draw. Here's your reward!\nHere's the list of winners:\n%s",
    ["MailContent_24007"]="Congratulations Adventurer! You've won a grand prize in the anniversary celebration. Here's your reward!",
    ["MailContent_2401"]="Dear Adventurer,\nIt's clear you've made many close friends during your adventure in Midgard. \n\nYour friend <color=#ec8a5a>%s</color> even sent you a <color=#ec8a5a>Valentine's Day Gift Pack</color> as a token of your camaraderie! May your friendship last forever and your adventure be wonderful!",
    ["MailContent_2501"]="Dear Adventurer,\nThis event has ended! Your unused <color=#ffe788>%s</color> have been converted into the following reward!",
    ["MailContent_2502"]="Dear Adventurer,\nThis event is already over. Of your unused <color=#ffe789>%s</color>, %s has been converted to the following rewards. Please remember to claim them.",
    ["MailContent_2503"]="Dear Adventurer,\nThis event is already over. Your unused <color=#ffe788>Dragon Boat Tickets, Rice Dumplings, Perfume Sachets, Gourds, Colorful Ropes, and Dragon Boat Material Packs</color> have been converted to the following rewards. Please remember to claim them.",
    ["MailContent_2504"]="Dear Adventurer, \nThis event is over, and your unused <color=#ffe788>%s</color> will be converted into the following rewards. Please check the rewards when you have a chance.",
    ["MailContent_2505"]="Dear Adventurer,\nThe progress for daily point rewards has been reset. The following are your unclaimed rewards from yesterday.\nPlease remember to claim them.",
    ["MailContent_2506"]="Dear Adventurer,\nThe following are your unclaimed rewards in the Frostbound Exploration Event.\nWe're now reissuing them to you. Please check.",
    ["MailContent_2507"]="Dear Adventurer,\nThis season has ended! Your unused <color=#ffe788>%s</color> have been converted into the following reward!",
    ["MailContent_2601"]="Dear Adventurer,\nThe new Pass season has begun. The following are your unclaimed level rewards for the previous month. Please remember to claim them.",
    ["MailContent_3001"]="If you are reading this letter, it means that you have been recognized by the continent's preeminent association of intellectuals!\n\nThat's right, we are from the <color=#d44f62>Schwarzwald Republic</color>'s <color=#d44f62>Rekenber Institute</color>! We develop only the highest-quality products, just as we only reach out to the highest-quality people!\n\nPlease <color=#d44f62>open your envelope</color> and confirm the contents as soon as possible!",
    ["MailContent_3002"]="Dear Adventurer, congratulations! You guessed a Lucky Number in the last Kingdom Quiz! Here's your unclaimed reward.",
    ["MailContent_3003"]="Dear Adventurer, congratulations! You correctly guessed all of the Lucky Numbers in the last Kingdom Quiz! It looks like Lady Luck is truly on your side!",
    ["MailContent_3004"]="You're amazing! The fish print you made ranked No.%s of the ones I received yesterday! Here's a little something for you!\nI look forward to more surprises from you!",
    ["MailContent_3005"]="Wow!\nYou've discovered the secret behind the Faerie's Code <color=#d14d75>before</color> everybody else!\nTo applaud your unparalleled intelligence, <color=#1EAEA4>Jakk, the Faerie Envoy</color> has prepared a <color=#d14d75>special reward</color> for you!\nHush! Keep your voice down! He won't be happy to see the code he specially prepared to be solved and shared!\nAfter all, he thinks he's the smartest!",
    ["MailContent_3006"]="Wow!\nYou found<color=#1EAEA4>Jakk, the Faerie Envoy's</color> secret, and solved Faerie's Code today! You're awesome!\nRemember to always use your wits on your adventures, too!",
    ["MailContent_3007"]="Wow! You've been the first to crack the Faerie's Code a few times now! You never fail to amaze me!\nYou've already gotten the big prize and you've also showcased extraordinary intelligence!\nI believe that everyone in the world has acknowledged you!\nAnd so, we'll award today's prize to other Adventurers who possess a high level of intelligence like you!\nIntelligence can be extraordinary, but don't let it incur a sphere solitary—because true intelligence cannot grow in solitude.\nThank you for your understanding!",
    ["MailContent_3008"]="Dear Adventurer,\n\nThank you for your support of the Exchange Center during the Thanksgiving Appreciation Day event. As you have not collected your tax refund before the end of the event, we will be reissuing your total tax refund of <color=#ec8a5a>%s</color> Crystals. Please remember to claim them.\n\nOnce again, thank you for actively participating in the Thanksgiving Appreciation Day event!",
    ["MailContent_3009"]="Don't be suspicious of this letter when you receive it. Your strength has been recognized by the indestructible <color=#d44f62>Kingdom Defense Force</color> of the <color=#d44f62>Rune-Midgarts Kingdom</color>.\n\nI declare that this letter is not an advertisement. Please <color=#d44f62>open it</color> as soon as possible to confirm the contents!\n\nNote: The contents of this letter are top secret. Do not share it with anyone!",
    ["MailContent_3010"]="Dear Adventurer, your Return Challenge is about to end. Complete the challenge as soon as possible to claim all the prizes!",
    ["MailContent_3011"]="Dear Adventurers,\nGreetings from the Ragnarok X: Next Generation team! \n\nWe wish all of you the best this Chinese New Year's Eve! \n\nWherever you are,\nand whoever you're with,\nknow that Ragnarok will always be here with you!\nOver the past year, we've come a long way and had a lot of fun fighting side by side with all of you.\nAs the sound of firecrackers fills the air, we'd like to express our sincerest thanks to all of you for your unrelenting support!\nRest assured, we have even more fun and surprises lined up for your adventure in the New Year! \n\nLet us explore 2021 and the next generation of Ragnarok together! \n\nRagnarok X: Next Generation is eternally grateful for your love and support!",
    ["MailContent_3012"]="Dear Adventurers,\nIt's February once again, and love is in the air...\nThe season of love is upon us once more!\nDo you remember the first time you found that special someone to share your life with in the magical world of Ragnarok?\nHow about the first time you confessed your love beside the carousel? \n\nBrave adventurers, let your love shine a light over all of Midgard!\nWe hope you find the love of a lifetime in Ragnarok X: Next Generation! \n\nHappy Valentine's Day!\n\nTo celebrate this special occasion, we'd like to present you with a gift pack to help you succeed in confessing your love. \n\nRagnarok X: Next Generation is eternally grateful for your love and support!",
    ["MailContent_3013"]="Dear Adventurers,\nAlthough the New Year has only just begun, we know that many of you are already working hard... and so are we! \n\nSo, let's start the New Year with a bang! \n\nPlease accept this red envelope, a little gift from us to each adventurer!\nMay you succeed in everything you do, and may this year be your best yet! \n\nIn addition, our Facebook Chinese New Year event is still underway.\nPlease stay tuned to our official fan page for more amazing content: <color=#6495ED>[a href=https://www.facebook.com/ROXNextGeneration]Tap here to check it out![/a]</color> \n\nWe wish each and every adventurer a fantastic New Year. Let's strive for even more fun and adventure, together! \n\nRagnarok X: Next Generation is eternally grateful for your love and support!",
    ["MailContent_3014"]="Please do not doubt the veracity of this letter. By the time you receive this, know that you've been recognized by top experts in Midgard's archaeological community! That's right, we're the researchers who know everything there is to know about Glast Heim—<color=#d44f62>Eden Group</color>! This time our research is finally about to enter the history books! (Two crooked stick figures are drawn in the corner of the letter. They look like they're throwing confetti in celebration.)",
    ["MailContent_4000"]="Before you embark on your new adventure, we've prepared a gift to aid you on your journey—a [Newcomer Pack]! We hope it helps you on your travels across this exciting continent! Please tap here to claim it!",
    ["MailContent_4001"]="Thank you for participating in the South Gate Sign-in Sharing event. We hope this unique memory will stay with you and your friends forever! Please find your newly-issued [South Gate Sign-in Rewards] attached—check them out now!",
    ["MailContent_4002"]="We've prepared a [School Starter Reward] to get you ready for life at the academy! Tap to claim it—your exciting new school life is about to begin!",
    ["MailContent_4003"]="Esteemed Adventurer, please accept this gift from Odin, courtesy of the Kafra Corporation! May Odin's blessings fill your journey with fun, passion, and endless surprises!",
    ["MailContent_4004"]="Dear Adventurer, the following is your VIP Card Exclusive Voting Gift Pack, please claim it. Vote for your favorite party in the War of the Chosen!",
    ["MailContent_5001"]="Dear Adventurer, your dazzling performance at the Purchase Shop has attracted the attention of the senior executives of the Central Purchase Shop. We intend to make you one of our core customers and provide you with premium services. If you are interested in learning more about this, please go to Jakdal who works at the Purchase Shop in Prontera. He will answer all your questions.",
    ["MailContent_5002"]="Dear <color=#CA2E0AFF>%s</color>,\nYour ex-partner, <color=#CA2E0AFF>%s</color>, has forsaken the vows you made to one another and has filed for a unilateral divorce. I have punished your ex-partner in the name of Odin. Your marriage is now over with the termination of your relationship. Try not to let your pain overwhelm you. Press forward bravely and pursue your own happiness!\nMay Odin protect you forever!\nArchbishop Wolmas",
    ["MailContent_5003"]="Dear <color=#CA2E0AFF>%s</color>,\nYour partner, <color=#CA2E0AFF>%s</color>, has not returned to Midgard in <color=#CA2E0AFF>%s</color> days. Has your relationship changed under the merciless test of time? If you want to leave this relationship and start over, please <color=#CA2E0AFF>come to me</color> and file for an <color=#CA2E0AFF>unilateral divorce</color>.\nAs the cost of ending the marriage contract is closely related to the loyalty of both persons to the relationship, given that your partner has been missing for a long time, it has been deemed that your partner has betrayed the loyalty condition of the contract. Therefore, when you unilaterally terminate the contract to dissolve the relationship, you will <color=#CA2E0AFF>not be required to pay any price</color>.\nMay Odin protect you forever!\nArchbishop Wolmas",
    ["MailContent_6001"]="Dear Adventurer, the mentorship bond request you sent to <color=#d14d75>%s</color> has been approved. Best of luck in your mentorship!",
    ["MailContent_6002"]="Dear Adventurer, <color=#d14d75>%s</color> has chosen to terminate your mentorship bond.",
    ["MailContent_6003"]="Dear Adventurer, based on your total completed Academy Daily Quests today, the Academy has given you the rating of <color=#d14d75>%s</color> Points! Here is a reward for you from the Academy!",
    ["MailContent_6004"]="Dear Adventurer, your student <color=#d14d75>%s</color> graduated and gave you a rating of <color=#7ACEFF>%s</color>. We hope you keep working hard in your mentorship career!",
    ["MailContent_6005"]="Dear Adventurer, your outstanding performance at the Academy last month earned you a ranking of <color=#d14d75>%s</color>. Below are your rewards from the Academy.",
    ["MailContent_7001"]="Dear Adventurer, your Kafra Plus privilege is expiring in %s. You will not be able to receive any support or other relevant content after it expires. Arrangements should be made in advance. You are always welcome at Kafra Corporation.",
    ["MailContent_80000"]="Lucky Adventurer, unbelievable! You've won the grand prize with your impressive luck in the Blessing of Fortune event! Your exclusive reward is ready—hope it brings you tons of joy. Go check it out now!",
    ["MailContent_80001"]="Dear Adventurer, The Blessing of Fortune results are here! Based on your participation, your share prize has been sent. Go check it out now!",
    ["MailContent_80002"]="Here is your unclaimed Pass Rewards. We're now reissuing it to you. Please claim it!",
    ["MailContent_88002"]="Congratulations! You earned 50 Blessing Points in the New Year Wish event. Here's your reward!",
    ["MailContent_9002"]="Dear Adventurer, since 1 extra material has been used at every level of dagger upgrading, we will be compensating the additional materials that have been used after this maintenance. We are sorry for the inconvenience caused and we thank you for your understanding.",
    ["MailContent_99999"]="Guild Order Contribution Leaderboard Reward Mail Content",
    ["MailReplacementContent_1_1"]="Esteemed Adventurer:\nIn order to improve your experience in the game, we will replace MVP and Mini Card Fragments in the Exchange Center and your Backpack with new universal Card Fragments. The specific replacement rules are as follows:\n\n1. Replacement Ratio:\n2. Bound and unbound Card Fragments will be replaced respectively with new bound and unbound Card Fragments.\n3. New Card Fragments can be exchanged for a range of selectable card gift packs.\n\nWe will replace your original Card Fragments after the update, and will send you your corresponding new items via in-game mail.",
    ["MailReplacementContent_2_1"]="Esteemed Adventurer:\n We have finished replacing your MVP/Mini Card Fragments! Here are the details:\n%s\n\n The total amount obtained is as follows:\n\n %s\n\n Your corresponding new items have been attached to this message. Please claim them!",
    ["MailReplacementContent_2_2"]="%s-> %s",
    ["MailReplacementContent_2_3"]="(Bound)",
