    ["MapWeatherForecast_001"]="This area's weather is currently %s . Plants will grow significantly faster.",
    ["MashinInstance1"]="Today's Special Monster Effect: <color=e14558>Knockback, Stun</color>.\nBlizzard Trap: Adds one stack of <color=e14558>Blizzard</color> to the challenger once every 30 seconds.\nBlizzard: Each stack reduces Final P.DMG Bonus and Final M.DMG Bonus by <color=#7ACEFF>1%</color>.",
    ["MashinInstance2"]="Today's Special Monster Effect: <color=e14558>Stun, Freeze</color>.\nBinding Trap: Adds one stack of <color=e14558>Mana Binding</color> to the challenger once every 30 seconds.\nMana Binding: Each stack reduces Crit DMG Bonus by <color=#7ACEFF>2%</color>, Final P.PEN and Final M.PEN by <color=#7ACEFF>1%</color>.",
    ["MashinInstance3"]="Today's Special Monster Effect: <color=e14558>Freeze, Stun</color>.\nBlizzard Trap: Adds one stack of <color=e14558>Blizzard</color> to the challenger once every 30 seconds.\nBlizzard: Each stack reduces Final P.DMG Bonus and Final M.DMG Bonus by <color=#7ACEFF>1%</color>.",
    ["MashinInstance4"]="Today's Special Monster Effect: <color=e14558>Blind, Knockback</color>.\nBinding Trap: Adds one stack of <color=e14558>Mana Binding</color> to the challenger once every 30 seconds.\nMana Binding: Each stack reduces Crit DMG Bonus by <color=#7ACEFF>2%</color>, Final P.PEN and Final M.PEN by <color=#7ACEFF>1%</color>.",
    ["MashinInstance5"]="Today's Special Monster Effect: <color=e14558>Freeze, Stun</color>.\nBlizzard Trap: Adds one stack of <color=e14558>Blizzard</color> to the challenger once every 30 seconds.\nBlizzard: Each stack reduces Final P.DMG Bonus and Final M.DMG Bonus by <color=#7ACEFF>1%</color>.",
    ["MashinInstance6"]="Today's Special Monster Effect: <color=e14558>Knockback, Freeze</color>.\nBinding Trap: Adds one stack of <color=e14558>Mana Binding</color> to the challenger once every 30 seconds.\nMana Binding: Each stack reduces Crit DMG Bonus by <color=#7ACEFF>2%</color>, Final P.PEN and Final M.PEN by <color=#7ACEFF>1%</color>.",
    ["MashinInstance7"]="Today's Special Monster Effect: <color=e14558>Blind, Stun</color>.\nBlizzard Trap: Adds one stack of <color=e14558>Blizzard</color> to the challenger once every 30 seconds.\nBlizzard: Each stack reduces Final P.DMG Bonus and Final M.DMG Bonus by <color=#7ACEFF>1%</color>.",
