    ["MidAutumnTips_001"]="Event Rules:\nThe event is divided into event phase and reward claim phase.\n\nDuring the event phase, completed non-exchange Luna Palace Wanted quests (quest chains) will be counted, additional Carnival Activity/OX Quiz rewards will be presented, and using Odin's Blessing to kill monsters above Lv.55 will generate additional drops.\n\nBefore the reward collection time ends, players can still exchange/use Lanterns, craft Moon Cakes, claim completed quest rewards, and purchase Mid-Autumn Packs. The questions of the OX Quiz will also be replaced accordingly.\n\nLanterns can only be used next to the Prontera Fountain. There is a chance with each use to get the Mid-Autumn limited \"Fairy Rabbit\" Pet. On your 50th, 100th, and 150th use you are guaranteed the \"Fairy Rabbit\\.\" (Obtaining Fairy Rabbits outside of the guaranteed times will not reset the aforementioned times)",
    ["MidAutumnTips_002"]="Spend <color=#CA2E0AFF>%s</color> Diamonds to purchase the gift pack?",
    ["MidAutumnTips_003"]="Use <color=#CA2E0AFF>%s</color> Lantern(s) before getting the minimum reward guarantee!",
    ["MidAutumnTips_004"]="Craft a total of <color=#CA2E0AFF>%s</color>.",
    ["MidAutumnTips_005"]="Event Time: %s (Rewards Claim Ends: %s)",
    ["MidAutumnTips_006"]="Today's Purchase Limit: <size=22>%s</size>",
    ["MidAutumnTips_007"]="Dear Adventurer,\nThis event is over.",
