    ["MoonFestivalTips_034"]="UID not entered or entered in wrong format.",
    ["MoonFestivalTips_035"]="Rules:\nDuring the event, collect event materials to make Hundred-Flavor Kebabs and sell them to other people's markets. This will earn you Fun Party Coins, which can be used in the Exchange Shop for rare items! Find the market that offers the highest purchase price to get as many Fun Party Coins as possible!\nUsing the Wishing Lantern grants you a chance to receive rare pets!\nThe event includes an event period and a reward-collection period. Participating in the event during the reward-collection period will not count toward the event's progress. You can only collect rewards in the exchange shop during this time.\n\n- Roasted Kebab\nYou can use event materials to make Hundred-Flavor Kebabs during the event.\n\n- Festive Night Market\nDuring the event, you can sell Hundred-Flavor Kebabs at other people's markets or at your own Night Market to obtain exchange materials.\nPurchase prices update daily.\nEach Night Market has a daily purchase limit of 250, which is shared among all Adventurers.\nAt each Night Market, a single Adventurer can sell up to 50 items.\nYou can visit your friends' or guild members' Night Markets.\nThe Night Market is a cross-server gameplay feature. You can directly visit other Adventurers' Night Markets by entering their UID.\nWhen an item is sold in your Night Market, you will receive 1 exchange item as a rebate.\nHowever, you won't get any rebate if you sell items at your own Night Market.\n\n- Flavor Trial\nDaily quests' progress updates every day. Complete quests to claim Chef's Points and accumulate the points to claim rewards.\n\n- Journey of Fresh Tastes\nPet Adventure: Select a pet for the adventure and complete it to claim rewards. Each adventure location has recommended pets, distinct every day. Sending recommended pets grants you extra rewards.\n\n- Firework Blessing\nDuring the event, activate Odin's Blessing and defeat monsters to obtain materials.\nSize --- Cumin --- Meat Chunk --- Fresh Vegetables --- Bamboo Stick\nSmall --- 2.08% --- 2.08% --- 0.83% --- 0.42%\nMedium --- 4.17% --- 4.17% --- 1.67% --- 0.83%\nLarge --- 6.25% --- 6.25% --- 2.50% --- 1.25%\nDaily Limit --- 125 --- 125 --- 50 --- 25\nBound? No --- No --- No --- No\nDuring the event, the success rate of evolving pets to S/A quality increased by 50%.\nThe Wishing Lantern, when used, will appear at a location randomly selected from the location pool. Once you arrive at that location, tap the lantern to receive rewards.",
