    ["MountSkill_21085"]="Special Effect: Increases MSPD of you and nearby party members within 10 meters by <color=#44afee>20%</color> (out of combat) for <color=#44afee>7</color> seconds. Cooldown: <color=#44afee>60</color> seconds.",
    ["MountSkill_80094"]="Offers periodic acceleration (immune to control effects in the Ragna GP scene)",
    ["MountSkill_80110"]="Increase speed at night",
    ["MountSkill_80181"]="\"Slumber, slumber, O my darling baby.\" Switches the form automatically when the night falls and randomly turns a nearby player's head into a bear's for 30 seconds.",
    ["MountSkill_80235"]="Periodic Acceleration",
    ["MountSkill_80267"]="Offers periodic acceleration (immune to control effects in the Dashing Sweetheart scene)",
    ["MountSkill_80268"]="Releases Garuru Tomahawk, which launches multiple missiles from the chest.",
    ["MountSkill_80270"]="Can switch between mecha and flight mode. Switching modes grants a temporary speed boost.",
    ["MountSkill_80271"]="Increases MSPD of you and nearby party members within 10 meters by <color=#44afee>20%</color> (out of combat) for <color=#44afee>7</color> seconds. Cooldown: <color=#44afee>60</color> seconds.",
