    ["MultipleJobTips_003"]="Are you sure you want to consume <color=#FF4500>Tome of Travers</color> to activate the branch - <color=#FF4500>%s</color>?\nYou can switch to this branch permanently for free after activation.",
    ["MultipleJobTips_004"]="Are you sure you want to convert to <color=#FF4500>{0}</color>? Once converted, The Class Conversion feature will be on a <color=#FF4500>{1}-minute</color> cooldown, during which you cannot perform Class Conversion again. After conversion, the new sub-class branch will use its corresponding load-outs.",
    ["MultipleJobTips_005"]="Cooldown:",
    ["MultipleJobTips_006"]="The Class Conversion is on cooldown.",
    ["MultipleJobTips_007"]="The player is undergoing Job Advancement.",
