    ["MultipleJobTips_009"]="<color=#ff5d5d>%s x %s</color>",
    ["MultipleJobTips_010"]="<color=#bcff3a>%s x %s</color>",
    ["MultipleJobTips_012"]="%s",
    ["MultipleJobTips_013"]="Would you like to convert your Class to <color=#FF4500>{0}</color>? After the conversion, Class Conversion will enter a cooldown of <color=#FF4500>{1} minute</color>, during which you cannot convert Classes. After the conversion, the new Class will use the corresponding load-outs, and the character's gender will change. Equipped/transmogrified gender-specific costumes will be removed/untransmogrified, and 1 Gender Conversion Voucher will be consumed.",
    ["MultipleJobTips_014"]="Insufficient gender conversion vouchers, available from Crystal Merchant",
    ["MultipleJobTips_015"]="Unable to view other info when switching classes.",
