    ["NpcCamp67247"]="Eden Group",
    ["NpcHasNoAttr"]="You need to equip the relevant equipment to view the enchantment list!",
    ["NpcInfo_61001"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> Arielle's lively voice makes a good impression on others, and that is the reason why this girl is already a world-famous singer at such a young age. Praise follows her wherever she goes, and people have nicknamed her the \"Music Fairy.\"",
    ["NpcInfo_6100101"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> Arielle's singing voice not only heals the body, but the soul too. The world is her stage. Wherever there is a soul that needs comforting, the Music Fairy will be there.",
    ["NpcInfo_6100102"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> To Arielle, singing is a duty and a responsibility. Although her talents and hard work are important, her audience are the ones who keep her going, and offering her singing to them gives her both satisfaction and joy.",
    ["NpcInfo_6100103"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> \"Having said that,\" Arielle massages her throat and says, \"I wish that adventurers would be more careful in the wild. After all, a singer shouldn't overexert their voice.\"",
    ["NpcInfo_6100201"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> \"Kafra's service is first-class. It will never lose to Cat Hand Services or Cool Event Corporation! Please enjoy Kafra's high-quality service today!\" Full of passion, W follows her sister Defolty's example to promote Kafra throughout the land. Her sweet voice and smile have made her \"Miss Popular\" among Kafra's new generation.",
    ["NpcInfo_6100202"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> Although her cute, juvenile charm has made her popular among the young adventurers of the land, W herself is unaware of her own occasional coyness. \"Huh!? Me? No, I'm not a kid!\" she says, as her face turns red.",
    ["NpcInfo_6100203"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> As the youngest member of the service center, W admires her big sister Defolty's enthusiasm and professionalism, and she hopes to one day handle her affairs with the same mastery and vision. \"I should also try my best to become an excellent service professional like my predecessors!\" She raises her hands to cheer for herself, as a group of young adventurers quietly gather around her and snap several dozen photos.",
    ["NpcInfo_61004"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> No one knows what Smile Assistance's name used to be, just like how her smile seems to never have faded since the first day she appeared.\n<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> \"A girl who likes to smile will always have good luck,\" says Smile Assistance. \"Though I did lose a stack of headgear designs yesterday...\"",
    ["NpcInfo_6100401"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> People had once tried all sorts of ways to see Smile Assistance drop her smile, but nothing succeeded. Even if you handed her poisonous Scorpions or disgusting Spawns, you would only see her reject them with her smiling face.",
    ["NpcInfo_6100402"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> Smile Assistance's lips curve at a precise 30 degrees to form her perfect smile, which sometimes makes people wonder if her facial muscles have been fixed with Glue. However, just when exactly did Smile Assistance first appear outside the Prontera South Gate?",
    ["NpcInfo_6100403"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> Like the identity of the Magic Furnace's owner, the answer to this question is one of the two greatest unsolved mysteries of Prontera. Every passing adventurer seeks the answer, but none have succeeded. They'll only hear Smile Assistance greeting in her silvery voice, \"Hi there! I'm Smile Assistance. How can I help you?\"",
    ["NpcInfo_61005"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> Brock Sledgehammer's sturdy physique has become a unique sight in Central Prontera. Be it socketing or dismantling, with a swing of his hammer, Brock can do it all without breaking a sweat.\n<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> \"There's one thing I don't understand.\" Brock takes a glance at Hollgrehenn standing directly opposite him and says, \"The girls always say that he and I are OTP. What does that even mean?\"",
    ["NpcInfo_6100501"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> When Brock first came to Prontera, he always scared the children with his rough appearance, especially his eye patch, which made people think that he'd committed some kind of crime. In fact, Brock's eye was injured by an iron spark during his days as an apprentice blacksmith in his youth.",
    ["NpcInfo_6100502"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> Apart from his work, Brock has no special hobbies. He occasionally goes to the tavern with Hollgrehenn for a drink and listens to Hollgrehenn talking drunken nonsense, but as Brock drank a lot with his master in his early years, he now finds it impossible to get drunk. \"Young Hollgrehenn is good at everything, but he really can't drink to save his life.\" Brock shakes his head helplessly as he watches Hollgrehenn talking to himself.",
    ["NpcInfo_6100503"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> Once in a while, Brock helps Hollgrehenn get home when he's drunk, and maybe due to the fact that the two of them stick out like a sore thumb, many of Hollgrehenn's fans have become quite excited by the idea of this blacksmith \"couple,\" and have even written a novel about them.",
    ["NpcInfo_61006"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> There is a Parrot Mailbox in every city, but there's a deep, dark secret about it that no one knows... The parrots can't fly.\n<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color>\"Whenever an adventurer passes by, I will squawk 'New mail! New mail!'\" the parrot says cockily. \"When they fall for it, the look on their face is epic!\"",
    ["NpcInfo_61007"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> Vali is often seen with dark circles around his bloodshot eyes early in the morning, making everyone think he's working too hard at appraising items. However, the truth is—\n<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> \"That new series was so good;\" Vali says while yawning. \"I couldn't stop binge watching!\"",
    ["NpcInfo_61008"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> It looks like a regular furnace on the outside, but when an adventurer tosses their equipment into it, something amazing will happen.",
    ["NpcInfo_6100801"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> No one knows when the Magic Furnace was created, but it is said that it was made by a powerful mage. However, for some reason, the mage went missing. The Magic Furnace has been Hollgrehenn's companion ever since. Although the two of them are always together, the magic furnace does not actually belong to him.",
    ["NpcInfo_6100802"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> The Magic Furnace's flame stays lit all year round, but some say that it possesses actual emotions. When in a good mood, the flame beats rhythmically and emits a pleasant puffing sound.",
    ["NpcInfo_6100803"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> There was once a mage who tried to take possession of the Magic Furnace, but they were immediately rejected by its magic. It seems as though the Magic Furnace has its own consciousness and can recognize its true master. Until its master returns, it will remain in place as an uncontrollable entity. \"Huff-puff—\" The flames of the Magic Furnace seem to be rising.",
    ["NpcInfo_61009"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> Despite being known as the \"Greatest Blacksmith\" in Midgard, Hollgrehenn often goes drinking with his friend, Xavier, to relieve stress. However, it is said that all it takes is one glass to knock him out. A fan once witnessed a drunk Hollgrehenn hugging his hammer and repeatedly professing his love for it. Upon witnessing this tragic scene, the fan left quietly with tears in their eyes.",
    ["NpcInfo_6100901"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> No one knows that the handsome blacksmith with hundreds of adoring fans is actually a simple creature who has given up on love. In his youth, he was shot down upon confessing to his one true love. After that moment, he lost all confidence in himself. Even though he went on to become the \"Greatest Blacksmith,\" he often talks to his hammer about his sorrows.",
    ["NpcInfo_6100902"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> Apart from his old friend Xavier, who he grew up with, Hollgrehenn can only open his heart to his \"iron friends.\" \"Why didn't she like me? I loved her so much...\" He tells his sad story of unrequited love to his hammer every time he gets drunk.",
    ["NpcInfo_6100903"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> Whenever you see Hollgrehenn, Brock Sledgehammer is usually not far behind. It's probably because they're always swinging their hammers together that Hollgrehenn's female fans fantasize about a relationship between them, and refer to them as the \"Hammer Sweethearts.\"",
    ["NpcInfo_61010"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> Accustomed to seeing the constant flow of Zeny and endless transactions, the Exchange Center Worker's mind is completely at peace.\n<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> \"Let the prices fluctuate more violently,\" says the Exchange Center Worker. \"More Zeny is always welcome.\"",
    ["NpcInfo_6101001"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> In his first few years of work, Jakdal was full of passion and enthusiastic, just like Tamdia from the Chamber of Commerce. However, as he got used to seeing the ever-changing market and the customers whose attitudes changed just as quickly, he gradually became numb.",
    ["NpcInfo_6101002"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> Sometimes, he will even remain silent with a smile on his face and mentally plan what to eat after work while facing a customer shouting at the top of their lungs right in front of him.",
    ["NpcInfo_6101003"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> \"Yes, sir. Today's prices are indeed 10 times higher than yesterday's. However, you can choose to come back again the day after tomorrow, and perhaps by then the price will be 20 times less than today's,\" replied Jakdal mechanically to an irate customer, entirely unperturbed himself.",
    ["NpcInfo_61011"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> As a member of the Wigner Chamber of Commerce, the Chamber of Commerce Worker always serves his numerous customers with the greatest patience.\n<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> \"Buying and selling, that's what trade is about,\" the Chamber of Commerce Worker says scornfully. \"What does that Exchange Center Worker next door know anyway?\"",
    ["NpcInfo_6101101"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> Although he has to serve hundreds of customers every day, Tamdia's motto is \"the customer comes first.\" On some days, despite having no time for even a sip of water, he still persists on answering every single customer query.",
    ["NpcInfo_6101102"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> \"The Wigner Chamber of Commerce provides the best service in trade. I cannot bring shame to the Chamber!\" exclaims Tamdia as he adjusts his collar in the mirror, for appearances too are a high priority.",
    ["NpcInfo_6101103"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> Being one of the most renowned Chamber of Commerce service staff in the land, Tamdia is immensely proud. In particular, when he sees Jakdal working mechanically and unenthusiastically every day, he feels that he himself is indeed the benchmark for the service industry.",
    ["NpcInfo_61012"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> Originally working for the Lindra Trading Company, Vienna joined the Wigner Chamber of Commerce with her sisters when the family business went bankrupt. Ever since then, they have promoted their business everywhere they go. \"One day, I will make the name of Lindra Trading Company known across Midgard again!\" With quiet determination, Vienna throws her smooth, silky hair back and confidently introduces the new goods to her customers.",
    ["NpcInfo_61013"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> Vera's pursuit of beauty has made her an Appearance Merchant. She has her unique take on everything from eye colors to hairstyles.\n<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> \"Even if you're going to take on a boss, your eye makeup should be just right,\" says Vera as she examines her face in the mirror. \"Beauty is essential at all times!\"",
    ["NpcInfo_6101301"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> As the leading fashionista in Prontera, Vera's style of dress is the object of imitation for many girls. She greatly enjoys this feeling of being a trendsetter, and occasionally shares her beauty tips with the adventurers who patronize her shop.",
    ["NpcInfo_6101302"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> \"I'll let you in on a secret. The trendy hair color for the next season will be alpaca brown. Hehe,\" winks Vera at a blushing adventurer, the sequins at the corners of her eyes glittering.",
    ["NpcInfo_6101303"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> The time Vera spends on her beauty regime every day probably takes up the majority of her downtime. However, she thinks these hours are worth it, for beauty is what makes a fashionista most productive after all.",
    ["NpcInfo_61014"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> After going through three iterations, the Mission Board's design was at last finalized. It is placed in the most prominent location of the main city, where adventurers can easily find it, and citizens often post their unresolvable issues there, hoping for someone to help them.",
    ["NpcInfo_61015"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> A mindless tool for the developers. They are unemployed and the writer did not even bother to write a description for them.",
    ["NpcInfo_61016"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> A mindless tool for the developers. They are unemployed and the writer did not even bother to write a description for them.",
    ["NpcInfo_61017"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> At Izlude Island's airship platform, Hodges from Juno arrives and departs on time on his airship. Perhaps it's because he's too used to being up in the air, but Hodges always feels uncomfortable when he's on the ground.\n<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> \"Oh boy, the air is too dense on the ground!\" Hodges says while holding his throat. \"I'm suffocating!\"",
    ["NpcInfo_61020"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> The Endless Stone stands tall on a faraway island. No one knows when it appeared there, or who created it. Until one day, a brave adventurer brought along his party and touched the mysterious monument. No one could have foreseen what happened next...",
    ["NpcInfo_61022"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> The shadow of a valkyrie of Vahalla. She stays behind in Midgard to provide support to adventurers. With her divine powers, she created a place for adventurers to rest temporarily and train.",
    ["NpcInfo_61023"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> A vending machine placed outside the walls of Prontera, providing equipment to adventurers day in and day out. Rumor says that if one inserts Gacha Coins continuously, they may get a piece of S-grade equipment one day.",
    ["NpcInfo_61024"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> Many quiz enthusiasts congregate at Prontera, the capital of the kingdom. The OX Quiz is an event held specially for them.\n<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> \"There is only one correct answer,\" the OX Quiz Registrar says dismissively. \"The unprepared will fall by the wayside!\"",
    ["NpcInfo_6102401"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> Cindy's mind is like an encyclopedia of Midgard. She has been academically-inclined since a young age and knows every obscure piece of information by heart. She will never allow anyone to challenge the authority of her knowledge.",
    ["NpcInfo_6102402"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> Even though her astonishingly vast reserves of knowledge easily scare off adventurers who want to be friends with her, she is on surprisingly good terms with the gourmet cook, Grace. \"After all, delicious food is essential to thinking clearly. Grace, let me try that Dark Shredded Squid you created last week. I can't wait to taste it!\" says Cindy as she excitedly looks at the plate in Grace's hands.",
    ["NpcInfo_6102403"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> Grace can't remember how she became friends with Cindy. It seems to have been a chance encounter in a forest while she was out looking for new ingredients. Cindy had been intently taking notes about a mushroom and her seriousness tickled Grace, who then tossed her a can. \"Hey. Wanna try it?\"",
    ["NpcInfo_61030"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> <color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> The sweet and innocent W is the youngest of the Kafra girls, but is by no means any less competent than her sisters. There is even a rumor that the Assassins Guild intends to recruit her for her ability to make men faint simply by calling them \"big boy.\"",
    ["NpcInfo_61031"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> Lil' Kitty hails from Meow Island, but ever since he experienced how prosperous the human city Prontera is, he never wants to leave anymore.\n<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> \"Never did I think that humans could be capable of making delicacies such as canned fish!\" Lil' Kitty exclaims in disbelief. \"There's nothing on Meow Island that tastes this good!\"",
    ["NpcInfo_6103101"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color>Lil' Kitty is the youngest in the family. Since a young age, he's been full of curiosity and willing to give any new thing a try, often causing trouble in the process. Not even the respected elder of the family could do anything about him. One look at his adorable face, and he could not bring himself to scold him. All Lil' Kitty has to do is to say \"I'm sorry, meow!\" and no one can resist him!",
    ["NpcInfo_6103102"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> Lil' Kitty's best playmates on Meow Island are his cousins, Mewlande and Mewliea. Being the youngest of the notorious trio, Lil' Kitty is unfortunately always the one who takes the blame. Mewlande is the model student in everyone's eye, but only Lil' Kitty knows his scheming nature. Whenever Lil' Kitty sees Mewlande showing off his toothy grin, he cannot help but wonder what his cousin is up to this time.",
    ["NpcInfo_6103103"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> The first time Lil' Kitty came to Prontera, the careless cat was too excited and did not realize that he had lost his wallet. Luckily, the owner of Rose Red Tavern, Isabella Trista, was willing to take him in for a night. That was the time he first tasted the Fruity Squid dish, and it was more delicious than anything he had ever eaten before.\n\n<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> \"Never did I think that humans could be capable of making delicacies such as canned fish!\" Lil' Kitty exclaims in disbelief. \"There's nothing on Meow Island that tastes this good!\"",
    ["NpcInfo_61037"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> Flessi single-handedly created the landmark Amusement Park outside the Prontera South Gate. While he is an amiable gent most of the time, he transforms into a bad-tempered amusement park manager when naughty kids hide crow eggs in the Carousel.\n<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> \"Which kid was it this time?! How many times do I have to say it?! Don't get the Carousel dirty! If I catch you, I'll send you to Commander Bernard!\" Flessi will yell with great agitation.",
    ["NpcInfo_6103701"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> No one knows why Flessi built the Amusement Park. Some say it is a gift for his grandson, while others say he has no kith nor kin. Occasionally, he can be spotted walking deep into the forest with cotton candy in his hand, as if to meet someone.",
    ["NpcInfo_6103702"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> A special piece of music is played at the Amusement Park every Sunday morning. Flessi was once asked what it is and he sighed, gazing at the rocking Mini Train as he replied with a smile, \"This music is dedicated to all who enjoy this Amusement Park.\"",
    ["NpcInfo_6103703"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> Flessi sometimes reminisces about Little Rick, a childhood friend of his. Flessi has spent the greater part of his life realizing the dream they shared—creating an Amusement Park for children. However, the music-loving Rick only left one song for this Amusement Park. The musical genius who loved to eat cotton candy once took a blow from a crazed monster for Flessi, and is now buried deep in the forest.",
    ["NpcInfo_61039"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> Alix, who spends a great amount of time mingling with different guilds, is perhaps the person who knows the most secrets in all of Midgard. However, it is for this very reason that even though he has learned to be tactful and worldly, he is also very cautious and always carries many self-defense weapons on his person. \"My life is worth more than anything in the world. I'm not going to risk losing my head for a bit of Zeny,\" said Alix, pulling his head back a little.",
    ["NpcInfo_6103901"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> Like Tamdia and Jakdal, Alix is always dressed in a well-ironed suit. However, unlike them, it conceals many offensive weapons, and he is ready to run at a moment's notice. Moving among different powers is a very dangerous game, after all.",
    ["NpcInfo_6103902"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> \"The value of secrets lies in the possibility of their revelation.\" Rumor has it that Alix has sold information to some important people too, but of course, he himself will never admit to that.",
    ["NpcInfo_6103903"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> Alix does not actually make much Zeny from his business dealings with guilds. At least, the seaside property he bought in Alberta was definitely not fully financed by such business. No one knows just how many sources of information Alix actually has.",
    ["NpcInfo_61040"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> As a vending machine merchant, Meimei's job is to take care of the vending machines beside her. In the eyes of others, they are just machines, but to Meimei, they are her beloved children.\n<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> \"With a twist of the wrist,\" Meimei sings happily, \"a big surprise to your item list!\"",
    ["NpcInfo_61041"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> A vending machine placed outside the walls of Prontera, providing cards to adventurers day in and day out. Rumor says that if one inserts Gacha Coins continuously, they may get an S-grade card one day.",
    ["NpcInfo_61042"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> A vending machine placed outside the walls of Prontera, providing headgear to adventurers day in and day out. Rumor says that if one inserts Gacha Coins continuously, they may get a piece of S-grade headgear one day.",
    ["NpcInfo_61043"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> A mindless tool for the developers. They are unemployed and the writer did not even bother to write a description for them.",
    ["NpcInfo_61044"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> Every merchant needs a sturdy cart. The Kafra Corporation discovered this business opportunity quickly, and to satisfy the dreams of the merchants, have been continuously developing newer models.\n<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> \"The Light Wheel series is no longer in fashion,\" the Kafra Cart Shop Employee says with conviction. \"Everyone wants a Flaming Arrow now. It's such a thrill to ride as it charges forward!\"",
    ["NpcInfo_6104401"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> Cynthia has been a fan of Kafra since a young age, and wanted nothing more than to join the organization. Even though her family wanted her to carry on the family's headgear shop, she insisted on working at the Kafra Cart Shop.",
    ["NpcInfo_6104402"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> However, hardship often ensues when one insists on having one's own way. When Cynthia first joined Kafra, she often made mistakes. Thankfully, another new recruit, W, encouraged her and cheered her on. \"Someday, I will be as good and as confident as W!\" Cynthia thought to herself.",
    ["NpcInfo_6104403"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> Though Cynthia may not be one of the more popular employees at Kafra for now, none of the cart rental staff are more knowledgeable than her about the company's models. Her colleagues are all very pleased with her development.",
    ["NpcInfo_61047"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> Many adorable monsters live in the outskirts of Prontera, which is precisely why Pet Merchant Lyra is here.\n<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> \"If I can catch an Eclipse and make it my pet, surely we'll turn heads as we walk down the street?\" Lyra fancies dreamily.",
    ["NpcInfo_6104701"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> Lyra and her sister, Moira, are both researchers specializing in monsters. Lyra is lively and extroverted, full of curiosity about everything, and spends all day thinking about catching exotic monsters to create new gadgets. Moira often says that she wouldn't be surprised if one day Lyra cuts off all of her Sasquatch's nails and sticks them to her own hand.",
    ["NpcInfo_6104702"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> From her Drainliar, which she caught when she was a child, to her present favorite, a Sasquatch, Lyra easily owns more than a dozen pets. However, it is said that she has recently found a new target, and is often seen hanging around the South Gate in the middle of the night. Who knows when she will get her hands on her new pet.",
    ["NpcInfo_6104703"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> \"Isn't the Eclipse supposed to love Durian Grass more than anything? I've gathered so much of it that the stench is killing me, but I haven't even seen so much as a clump of Eclipse fur,\" Lyra grumbled in the darkness of the bushes, adjusting the tissues stuffed up her nose.",
    ["NpcInfo_61048"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> Moore's weapon shop on Izlude Island has garnered quite a bit of fame; almost every novice who studies at Criatura Academy is his customer.\n<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> \"These aren't the toughest weapons there are,\" Moore says carefully. \"But they should be enough to last the adventurers through their novice stage.\"",
    ["NpcInfo_61049"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> Vivi was originally a student of Merchant Instructor Hamid, until one day when she could no longer tolerate his selfish nature, so she decided to walk out on him and started her own business.\n<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> \"Wow, the business is doing better than I thought,\" Vivi says in a tone of surprise. \"Looks like the novices love affordable armor.\"",
    ["NpcInfo_61050"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> Born and raised on Izlude Island, Leirah draws a lot of inspiration from the seaside scenery and uses it in her accessory designs. Unfortunately, her designs have not gained mainstream popularity.\n<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> \"Only those who are truly beautiful can understand my works!\" Leirah says stubbornly. \"Fashion is not only about the accessories, the wearer's looks are important too!\"",
    ["NpcInfo_61051"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> Valde originally dreamed of becoming a bard, but as his songs were so bad, he had no choice but to put down his lyre and pick up a hammer.\n<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> \"I've come to learn that there's not much difference between the sound of music and a hammer hitting metal,\" Valde says with delight. \"Ding dong, ding dong, music to my ears!\"",
    ["NpcInfo_6105101"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> Likely because his childhood passion for music has never waned, despite becoming a blacksmith, Valde still enjoys visiting the Rose Red Tavern to hear the Obeaunes sing. Of course, such moments must be enjoyed with the owner's signature Peachy Poring cocktail.",
    ["NpcInfo_6105102"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> \"According to my three years of basic musical studies, Hollgrehenn's hammering rhythm is the most melodic in all of Prontera! It's no wonder you're the Greatest Blacksmith—even your tonality fits perfectly!\" Valde looks at Hollgrehenn with admiration in his eyes.",
    ["NpcInfo_6105103"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> Valde grew up alongside his neighbor, Polly, whose optimistic and outgoing nature rubbed off on Valde. Perhaps it is due to Polly's influence that Valde so decisively abandoned his instrument and devoted himself whole-heartedly to his iron hammer instead.",
    ["NpcInfo_61052"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> In Prontera, where there is an abundance of talent, the young blacksmith Polly has to go the extra mile to stay afloat. Her bubbly character gains the favor of many novice adventurers.\n<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> \"One should never stop trying to improve.\" Polly nods with conviction. \"I'm not only tempering equipment for others, but also tempering myself.\"",
    ["NpcInfo_6105201"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> The naturally optimistic Polly has always been able to find joy in any hardship. Even in the most difficult situation, she can still find a reason to face it with a smile. \"If Prontera rains today, doesn't that mean I can see a rainbow tomorrow?\" With this in her mind, Polly shoves the agony of forgetting her umbrella to the back of her mind.",
    ["NpcInfo_6105202"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> Polly and Valde grew up together. Having seen Valde studying his favorite instrument, the hujia, Polly was genuinely happy for him, even going so far as to defend Valde when the neighbors complained about him. However, reality proved that Valde simply didn't have the talent to learn an instrument.",
    ["NpcInfo_6105203"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> Fortunately, Valde had been influenced by Polly's contagious optimism. On the day he gave up playing the hujia, young Polly gave Valde her first hammer. \"In the future, we can use hammers to make music together!\" The tears in the rims of Valde's eyes immediately disappeared. How wonderful it is to have such a good friend!",
    ["NpcInfo_61053"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> Due to her passion for accessory design, Laetitia traveled to Prontera and drew much inspiration from the cityscape, resulting in many impressive accessories.\n<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> \"Staying in one place for too long will cause one to become stagnant.\" Laetitia thinks to herself, \"Perhaps it's time for me to head to another city and start afresh...\"",
    ["NpcInfo_6105301"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> After countless instances of wanting to pick up and move to a new city only to be persuaded to stay by her enthusiastic customers in Prontera, Laetitia finally decided to begin planning regular trips for herself. After all, being an artist, she has to gather inspiration, right?",
    ["NpcInfo_6105302"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> Lately, Laetitia has mainly been concerned with how to use cameras to record materials for inspiration. Little did she expect, although she's gifted in design, her camera skills can't even compare with those of children on the roadside.",
    ["NpcInfo_6105303"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> After the eighth overexposed photo, Laetitia decided to give up on using a camera to record things. \"Hm... They do say that the eyes are the highest-resolution camera...\" said Laetitia to comfort herself as she tossed the camera into her bag.",
    ["NpcInfo_61054"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> Grote came to Morroc to train his mental fortitude and decided to stay after witnessing Antonia's great crafting skills.\n<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> \"Never could I have imagined there would be a girl so agile and strong!\" Grote says dreamily, \"She's like a valkyrie! This is love at first sight... for the second time!\"",
    ["NpcInfo_6105401"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> Although Grote is a master of weapon forging, he seems to have forgotten this fact after seeing Antonia. For in her presence, he acts like he's a new graduate from Criatura Academy.",
    ["NpcInfo_6105402"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> Grote isn't the least bit defeated after being met with Antonia's cold look because every day he can come up with new ideas to pursue her. If roses won't win her over, then give her a cactus! Grote gazes in Antonia's direction with a dopey grin on his face.",
    ["NpcInfo_6105403"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> Over time, adventurers passing by and Grote's customers became aware of his intentions, and from time to time, they tease him and Antonia. Although Antonia sometimes gives them a blank and impatient stare, Grote seems to find joy in it.",
    ["NpcInfo_61055"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> In the desert city of Morroc, Antonia swings her hammer and crafts day after day. Despite being a female blacksmith, which is a rare sight, she possesses more perseverance and strength than any man.\n<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> \"If anyone tells me that a woman can't swing a hammer...\" Antonia smiles. \"I'd be more than happy to show them otherwise!\"",
    ["NpcInfo_6105501"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> Being a descendant of the Lugenburg Family, Antonia has learned the importance of strength since childhood. In the city of Morroc, where force is used to settle all manner of disputes, Antonia's hammer has beaten back several unruly rogues looking to create trouble.",
    ["NpcInfo_6105502"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> But recently, Antonia has been a bit troubled. That Grote, who seemingly came out of nowhere, always has a dopey grin on his face when he's around her, making Antonia at a loss of what to do. She had warned him clearly, but he stationed himself not far away from her. How could anyone not be afraid of her hammer?",
    ["NpcInfo_6105503"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> \"If you want to date me, you must prove that your hammer skills are better than mine. Then I'll think about it.\" Faced with Grote's fervent pursuit, Antonia seems extremely impatient and even came up with such an excuse to dodge his advances. However, it must be kept in mind that Grote is also a renowned master craftsman.",
    ["NpcInfo_61056"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> Renee is a well-known master craftswoman in the desert city of Morroc. No one knows why she would rather stay in this barren place, but some adventurers travel to the desert just to get accessories made by her.\n<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> \"No pain, no gain,\" Renee says meaningfully. \"It's the same for both you and me.\"",
    ["NpcInfo_6105601"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> People always speculate about the reason Renee stayed here. It's said that she seems to be looking for some mysterious material—a precious ore that only appears in the desert. Without this ore, Renee cannot complete the ideal accessory she has been longing to craft for so long.",
    ["NpcInfo_6105602"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> \"If I can help the people in this barren place understand the significance of accessories in one's life, then I'd count that as a success,\" thought Renee as she hung another newly-crafted necklace on the stand.",
    ["NpcInfo_6105603"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> Although many people cross the desert seeking Renee, she has a particular soft spot for the customers from Morroc. Giving priority to customers hailing from desert areas is her service tenet, so it's no wonder there are always rumors that Renee's sweetheart is from Morroc.",
    ["NpcInfo_61057"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> In the mountainous city of Payon, many master craftsmen live in seclusion. The little-known Leming is one of them. He is always hard at work on his latest creation, but has never truly tested the power of his weapons.\n<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> \"I am just a craftsman,\" said Leming tranquilly. \"Whether a weapon is powerful or weak depends on who wields it.\"",
    ["NpcInfo_6105701"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> Nobody knows how strong Leming is, for he has never been seen in a quarrel or fight. However, there are tales in Payon of Leming actually being a highly skilled fighter. Leming, however, doesn't seem to care about the rumors, and immerses himself in his work.",
    ["NpcInfo_6105702"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> Occasionally, Leming stares blankly at the talkative Yuna opposite him. He wonders how a person can have such a variety of expressions and words. After all, she's supposed to be a blacksmith just like himself, is she not?",
    ["NpcInfo_6105703"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> Perhaps it was Leming's obtrusive silence which piqued Yuna's interest, for teasing Leming when no customers are around has become Yuna's new hobby. \"Do you know why heroes wear skin-tight clothes?\" Leming looked at her in stony silence. \"...\" \"Because… time is tight when you're saving people!\" The corners of Leming's lips twitched involuntarily.",
    ["NpcInfo_61058"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> Firmly believing good armor to guarantee the safety of adventurers in the field, Gyuri always strives for perfection in her work.\n<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> \"Not even the teeth of an Eddga can leave a mark on my armor,\" said Gyuri. \"The sturdiest of armor protects the softest of hearts.\"",
    ["NpcInfo_6105801"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> On the surface, Gyuri looks like a cute young lady, and people cannot resist befriending her. However, only those familiar with her know that Gyuri the perfectionist explodes into a rage when even the slightest flaw appears in her work. Approaching her at such times should be avoided at all costs.",
    ["NpcInfo_6105802"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> The only person who can return Gyuri to normal is perhaps her friend Charlene. Charlene always manages to make an appearance when Gyuri is swinging her hammer in frenzy and distracts her with some exotic materials.",
    ["NpcInfo_6105803"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> \"I won't tolerate flaws in my masterpieces. Each tiny crack can become a weakness in battle. As an armor craftsman, that would be simply unacceptable!\" Gyuri ran her fingers over the freshly polished new armor, her scrutinizing eyes sparkling.",
    ["NpcInfo_61059"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> Blacksmith Yuna, completely different from the taciturn Leming, possesses an eloquence on par with the excellence of her accessory crafting techniques. She is always talking nonstop, and adventurers often find themselves unwittingly talked into buying her wares. By the time they come to their senses, they will find a pile of extra accessories in their backpack and a large amount of Zeny missing.",
    ["NpcInfo_6105901"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> Perhaps because she learned to live alone when she was young, Yuna acquired the ability to join any conversation no matter where she is, forming a natural intimacy with everyone. Her optimistic and cheery disposition makes people reluctant to recall her tragic past of having lost both parents.",
    ["NpcInfo_6105902"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> Although Yuna's uncle Jeff has returned to Payon after many years away, Yuna, long used to living by herself, still carries on her accessory crafting business alone. The occasional teasing of Leming across from her is her daily recreation.",
    ["NpcInfo_6105903"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> \"Life goes on. Not all that comes out of the blue are accidents. They may be surprises too!\" Yuna smiles playfully with her head tilted to one side and says, \"Why not have a look at today's accessories? They're 20% off!\"",
    ["NpcInfo_61060"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> There is a master craftsman living in seclusion in the magic city of Geffen. Although he is not widely known throughout Midgard like Hollgrehenn, his abilities are no less impressive.\n<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> \"There's a price to pay for fame.\" Anderson sips his drink and says, \"Day and night, Hollgrehenn is chased by his fans; he has no privacy at all. Not the kind of life I'm looking for. Hell no!\"",
    ["NpcInfo_6106001"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> Although Anderson seems to not care about popularity at all, he will sometimes coolly smooth out his hair whenever a beautiful woman walks by, seemingly wanting to prove that he is no less good-looking than Hollgrehenn.",
    ["NpcInfo_6106002"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> Hollgrehenn and Anderson actually competed to see who was the better blacksmith in a forging competition several years ago. However, Anderson lost to Hollgrehenn by a single vote, and thus the title of \"Greatest Blacksmith\" has been ever out of his grasp. It's no wonder that Anderson seems to always harbor a bit of resentment.",
    ["NpcInfo_6106003"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> \"This is a world that values appearances above all. I wonder who the title of Greatest Blacksmith would've gone to had the last vote hadn't been a woman who valued good looks...\" said Anderson indignantly as he watched the group of fans engaged in a passionate discussion about Hollgrehenn.",
    ["NpcInfo_61061"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> Dael, who has come to Geffen especially in search of the best armor crafting methods, thinks only about the perfect fusion between magic and crafting techniques. Her research is rather fruitful, for her armor is always sturdier and more reliable than that of others.\n<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> \"Of course, the price won't be cheap,\" says Dael matter-of-factly. \"Research does require funding after all!\"",
    ["NpcInfo_6106101"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> Perhaps the biggest difference between Dael and other research-oriented merchants lies in how she focuses her research efforts only on those areas that are profitable. She would never conduct any research that has no prospect of bringing in Zeny.",
    ["NpcInfo_6106102"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> \"People like Anderson may say they don't care about fame, but in fact, they are just downright jealous at heart! I'm much more real. I only care about how much Zeny I made!\" says Dael, happily recounting the payment she had just received.",
    ["NpcInfo_6106103"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> Although Dael appears to only care for money, she is very scrupulous when it comes to armor crafting and spares no coin when investing in the research of new armor materials. It is no wonder that, despite the hefty price tag, she is still Geffen's most popular armor craftswoman.",
    ["NpcInfo_61062"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> The unique atmosphere of magic in Geffen attracted the master craftswoman Jeanne to the city. She is passionate about infusing elements into the accessories she makes in order to strengthen them.\n<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> \"A merchant who refuses to become a mage can never be a good blacksmith,\" Jeanne says firmly.",
    ["NpcInfo_6106201"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> Jeanne grew up in the Mjolnir Mountains and nobody knew who her birth parents were. An elderly blacksmith couple took her in and brought her up, teaching her all the techniques they had learned in their lifetimes. Jeanne was gifted and soon became a skilled accessory craftswoman.",
    ["NpcInfo_6106202"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> For reasons unknown, Jeanne would occasionally gaze vacantly at Geffen in the distance ever since she was a child, as though there was some mysterious power calling to her. Therefore, when she turned 17, she went to Geffen alone and began an accessory crafting business.",
    ["NpcInfo_6106203"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> After arriving at Geffen, Jeanne became greatly interested in the magic in the city, and taught herself with the help of a spell book borrowed from Dael. What shocked Dael was that Jeanne's magical talent seemed to be superior to her own. Within a matter of months, Jeanne had improved tremendously, and was soon incorporating magic into accessory crafting. \"There seems to be a curious power within me that helped me learn magic very quickly.\" says Jeanne as she lowers her head thoughtfully.",
    ["NpcInfo_61063"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> As an enchanter, Sapir's job is to enchant adventurers' weapons, but the never-ending overtime work is taking a toll on him.\n<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> \"How I wish I could just take a trip and get away from it all.\" Sapir quietly says to himself.",
    ["NpcInfo_6106301"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> \"If I increase the enchanting fee by a few thousand Zeny, I'll be able to save up enough for my travels.\" Sapir often checks and calculates his savings in the middle of the night.",
    ["NpcInfo_6106302"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> Sapir has a map of the entire land of Midgard in his room. Whenever he finds himself dozing off at work, he will look at the empty spots on the map that he has not yet flagged. This gives him a little bit of motivation to go on, as it reminds him that he has a dream to fulfill.",
    ["NpcInfo_6106303"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> When he was young, Sapir dreamed of leaving Meow Island to become a wanderer who travels far and wide. When he grew older, he learned that a hungry man cannot do anything, let alone travel.",
    ["NpcInfo_61064"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> In the capital city Prontera, Hobson's unique enchanting skills are unanimously respected by all adventurers. Armor that she has enchanted gains attributes like no other.\n<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> \"Which attribute will it be?\" Hobson winks mischievously, \"I'm just as curious as you!\"",
    ["NpcInfo_6106401"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> Hobson is always seen with a friendly smile, and adventurers all across Prontera say that they feel at ease when they see her smile.",
    ["NpcInfo_6106402"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> However, little do they know that whenever Hobson sees adventurers passing by, she will spin a tale in her mind. \"Wow, look at those two. They're walking so close to each other. There must be something going on between them!\" \"...That girl with the Kitsune Mask is a cutie for sure, I can see it from her figure. Now if only I could catch a glimpse of her face...\"",
    ["NpcInfo_6106403"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> As a child, Hobson once dreamed of becoming Midgard's top novelist. With her extraordinary imagination, she hoped to write novels that would take the whole land by storm. However, Prontera would have lost its Master Enchanter.",
    ["NpcInfo_61066"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> In the Desert City of Morroc, Master Enchanter Quincy lives in a constant struggle against the weather.\n<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> \"Enchanting requires high temperatures and plenty of air!\" Quincy says discontentedly. \"Don't talk to me about success rates! If your enchantment fails, blame the weather, not me! It's all a matter of bad weather and good weather.\"",
    ["NpcInfo_6106601"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> Few people know that the irascible Master Quincy was once a pleasant young man who would always get shy when talking to girls. However, after being cheated out of tens of thousands of Zeny in enchanting materials by beautiful female tricksters, he lost his faith in adventurers and became as temperamental and unpredictable as the weather in Morroc.",
    ["NpcInfo_6106602"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> For Master Quincy, the only place he likes in Morroc is probably the Desert Green Tavern. On the weekends, whether it's a sunny day or a raging sandstorm outside, as long as he can ask Heflee Trista to fix him her special signature drink, he'll get a good night's sleep.",
    ["NpcInfo_6106603"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> Whenever someone questions whether Master Quincy's enchantment success rate is as good as that of Prontera's Sapir, he can always find an excuse. \"Enchanting requires high temperatures and plenty of air!\" Quincy says discontentedly, \"Don't talk to me about success rates! If your enchantment fails, blame the weather, not me! It's all a matter of bad weather and good weather.\"",
    ["NpcInfo_61067"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> After a chance encounter with the heroic Halmod of the Lugenburg Family, Master Enchanter Stella was smitten, and even decided to stay in Morroc from that moment on.\n\"I'd really like to know how much time Halmod spends working out every day...\" Stella wipes the drool from her mouth and says, \"Well, it's all out of appreciation for the wonderful things the world has to offer!\"",
    ["NpcInfo_6106701"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> \"I'm not an overly-romantic person; I just don't see why I should deprive myself of all the wonderful things the world has to offer.\" Stella finds a reasonable explanation to tell herself after the twentieth time she's winked at young adventurers passing by. After all, Stella's favorite hobby is flirting with young adventurers.",
    ["NpcInfo_6106702"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> At the age of 15, Stella was determined to travel to every corner of Midgard so that she could see every handsome boy in the land. No one knows how many places she visited before coming to Morroc, but it is said that she has compiled a special compendium of all the most talented and handsome young men in Midgard.",
    ["NpcInfo_6106703"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> It is common knowledge that Stella stayed in Morroc because of Halmod, but that is not all. The young assassins of the Assassins Guild are also a major reason she cannot leave. \"That Hassan guy is always wearing a mask. One day, I'll take his mask off and see what he looks like.\" Stella even fantasizes about the mysterious Assassins Guild leader.",
    ["NpcInfo_61068"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> The first time Mewliea arrived in Morroc from Meow Island, she was shocked by the sheer barrenness and desolation.\n<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> \"I didn't expect to find so much sand on the other side of the sea!\" Mewliea says, shaking her fur out. \"Oh dear! My fur is full of sand again... and I've only just finished brushing it, meow!\"",
    ["NpcInfo_6106801"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> \"Although this place doesn't look like much, there are so many adventurers here, and they're each begging me to stay and aid them! I think I can manage to put up with the conditions here for their sake. After all, as a noble Doram Master Enchanter, I cannot discriminate between regions, meow!\" Mewliea raises her noble claws and strokes the hair on her head.",
    ["NpcInfo_6106802"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> \"Can't you tell it's me!? My sister's purple bow is nowhere near as pretty as mine, meow!” Mewliea has always been the apple of her family's eye, and hates being mistaken for her twin sister Mewleta. This is why she wears a bright red bow on her head at all times.",
    ["NpcInfo_6106803"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> As the only girl in Doram's \"Troublesome Trio,\" Mewliea has her brother Mewlande to give her advice and her cousin Lil' Kitty to take the blame, allowing her to play the role of the adorable favorite daughter who can do no wrong.",
    ["NpcInfo_61069"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> On his travels, Tracy was rescued from the claws of an Eddga by a female Archer. He was so grateful to be alive that he became intent on settling down in Payon with her.\n<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> \"I know I've mentioned this many times, but I really am willing to commit to her according to the local customs here,\" Tracy says sadly. \"But she always turns me down. Why?\"",
    ["NpcInfo_6106901"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> Every morning, Tracy can be seen fishing at the Exquisite Pond on the outskirts of Payon. The truth is, he is not particularly fond of fishing, but his savior, the legendary archer, practices archery in the fields near the pond every morning.",
    ["NpcInfo_6106902"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> Tracy has been turned down countless times by the archer, but still doesn't understand that his failure is directly related to his looks and height, stubbornly believing that he simply hasn't fully expressed his value and sincerity.",
    ["NpcInfo_6106903"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> \"I think it must be because I haven't completely integrated into the culture here. That must be why she keeps refusing my advances. As long as I do my best to fit in, I know she'll be mine.\" Tracy persists in thinking like this, while quietly writing down the fashion trends and habits of the passing Payon youth in his notebook.",
    ["NpcInfo_61070"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> After reading a spooky novel, Eudora came to Payon in search of a ghostly legend, but outside a gloomy cave, her adventure came to a sudden halt.\n<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color>\"Those archers told me there were Munaks in this cave,\" Eudora thinks to herself excitedly. \"That's exactly why I'm here!\"",
    ["NpcInfo_6107001"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> Although Eudora is a very pretty girl, every time she talks about her obsession for ghost stories, she scares away all of her admirers. But she doesn't care. \"What is love compared to ghost hunting?\"",
    ["NpcInfo_6107002"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> \"Rumor has it that before she came to Payon, Eudora journeyed deep into Geffen's underground to explore the mystery of the legendary Ghoul. Unfortunately, the unghostly appearance of the Ghoul soon made her lose interest. It was at that time that she heard about the legends of Payon from passing adventurers.",
    ["NpcInfo_6107003"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> \"I won't leave until I see the legendary Munak!” Eudora tried thinking of countless ways to enter the legendary Munak cave, but the Euin Family, who strictly guard the cave, would not let her pass, thus preventing her from achieving her dream. Every time she tried to sneak past Guild Master Sky Euin and get into the cave, she would be caught.",
    ["NpcInfo_61071"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> Hailing from Meow Island, Mewleta was delighted to find herself in Payon, a city brimming with nature's blessings.\n<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> \"The people here are so friendly!\" Looking down at her claws, she exclaims, \"My paws aren't even big enough to carry all the dried fish they give me every day!\"",
    ["NpcInfo_6107101"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> Mewleta is the most intelligent of all the young Doram, and is the complete opposite of her twin sister Mewliea. She never takes part in any of the Troublesome Trio's plans. In fact, her favorite pastime is simply to lie under a tree and bask in the sun, and she prefers natural dried fish a lot more than the cooked and seasoned kind invented by humans.",
    ["NpcInfo_6107102"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> The purple bow on Mewleta's forehead was given to her by her human friend when she was a child, and she has always cherished it. When her twin sister Mewliea saw her bow, she immediately pulled a big red bow from out of nowhere and placed it on her own head, saying that it would allow others to distinguish between them in terms of taste.",
    ["NpcInfo_6107103"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> \"If the weather's good tomorrow, we can dry some sardines at Drizzle Cottage.\" The pure-hearted Mewleta doesn't mind her sister's unruliness, caring only about her dried fish.",
    ["NpcInfo_61072"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> Gardner, who claims to have gone to Meow Island to hone his enchantment skills, took a special trip to Geffen, the city of magic, in order to further the enchantment capabilities of the Doram. His unique enchanting style imbues mages with newfound inspiration, and they often return to him for repeated pleasant exchanges. But on the topic of whether enchanting is magic or not, Gardner has never been able to reach a consensus with the mages.",
    ["NpcInfo_6107201"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> Gardner insists that enchanting is an important branch of magic and that good enchanters can add unique value to equipment, which is more practical than learning more profound and complex magic.",
    ["NpcInfo_6107202"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> The enchanting techniques of the Doram have given Gardner new insight in this field. \"All young people interested in enchanting should visit Meow Island to learn all they can!\" Every time someone asks about the secrets of enchanting, Gardner praises Meow Island with pride.",
    ["NpcInfo_6107203"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> In addition to his enchanting work in Geffen, Gardner likes to study the old enchanting tomes found tucked away in the dark corners of Geffen Library. He occasionally argues with members of the Wizard Guild that, \"Enchantment truly is a kind of magic, although there are only a few true Master Enchanters...\" while pulling at his hat with pride.",
    ["NpcInfo_61073"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> Eufemiah is great at upgrading armor with magic, and learned her craft for the purpose of protecting her companions in the Mage Guild during close combat.\n<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> \"As everyone knows, mages do not excel in close combat,\" Eufemiah says, \"Even a firm handshake can pose a threat to them.\"",
    ["NpcInfo_6107301"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> When she was 6 years old, Eufemiah was chased by monsters in the Geffen wilderness. Just as she thought her life was over, she was saved by a passing mage, and from then on, she became determined to become a mage who could protect others in need. However, when studying at the Magic Academy, she discovered the vulnerability of mages in close combat, and so she turned her attention to armor enchantment.",
    ["NpcInfo_6107302"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> \"Since mages strive to protect others, they must first know how to protect themselves!\" Every new member of the Mage Guild has heard Eufemiah's words of wisdom, which she drills into new recruits every year at the initiation ceremony.",
    ["NpcInfo_6107303"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> Every time she sees mages passing in and out of Geffen, Eufemiah feels a wave of pride rising in her heart. She knows she must work harder to become the top enchanter in the land, for everyone in the Mage Guild.",
    ["NpcInfo_61074"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> Ever since he traveled from his home on Meow Island to the magic city of Geffen, Mewlande has been immersing himself in the city's magical aura.\n\"I never thought that humans could do such amazing things with magic!\" Mewlande places his paws under his chin. \"I need to learn from them...\"",
    ["NpcInfo_6107401"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> As the smartest member of Meow Island's \"Troublesome Trio,\" Mewlande is the shining star of the Doram's younger generation. In the eyes of the Doram elders, he is caring, intelligent, and eager to learn.",
    ["NpcInfo_6107402"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> But his cousin, Lil' Kitty, knows that every time Mewlande has that mysterious smile on his face, someone is in for a spot of bad luck, and often this person is Lil' Kitty himself. This is the dark side of Mewlande, a side known only to Lil' Kitty and Mewliea, the other members of the \"Troublesome Trio.\"",
    ["NpcInfo_6107403"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> Mewlande was shocked by Geffen's many outstanding mages and strong magical aura, and decided to stay in order to learn from them and spread this magical aura to Meow Island. \"How can I let the noble and wise Doram be outshone by those humans?\" he thought.",
    ["NpcInfo_61075"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color>Many adorable little creatures hide amongst the greenery and extensive mountain ranges of Payon, which is perhaps why Pet Merchant Moira is here.\n<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> \"Many people think monsters are dangerous,\" Moira says, \"But not me. As long as you have some skills, they can certainly become close friends with humans.\"",
    ["NpcInfo_6107501"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> Moira possesses a monster notebook in which she has been recording the characteristics of each monster and how to get along with them since she was young. However, it is a pity that she has no intention of sharing it. \"These records aren't complete yet. It would be too rash to make them public now. I don't want any monster or human to be harmed because of these notes,\" says Moira as she closes the notebook and puts it away carefully.",
    ["NpcInfo_6107502"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> The biggest difference between Moira and her sister Lyra is that Moira's interest lies in studying how humans and monsters can live together in peace instead of collecting monsters as pets. The taming of monsters is what really brings her joy.",
    ["NpcInfo_6107503"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> \"Of course the research target for this month is the Nine Tails dwelling in Payon West! I haven't got any records of them in my notebook yet,\" says Moira as she packs the equipment needed to tame a Nine Tail.",
    ["NpcInfo_61080"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> Walde, having grown up with Russford, shakes his head in frustration each time he hears Russford's theory of him being the illegitimate son of a noble family. However, whenever others mock his good friend, he can't help standing up for him. \"Russford may not actually be from a noble family, but, judging by your manners, there's no way you guys were born into nobility either.\" Walde glares sternly at the children roaring with laughter.",
    ["NpcInfo_6108001"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> In his heart, Walde doesn't really believe Russford to be the lost son of a noble family either but, out of compassion and to support his friend, each time Russford enthusiastically talks of these wild fancies, he goes along with it, looking at Russford as if looking at his own silly child.",
    ["NpcInfo_6108002"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> Unlike his good friend, Walde is a steady and practical doer. He never entertains unrealistic fantasies and firmly believes the improvement of his own skill to be the way forward.",
    ["NpcInfo_6108003"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> Walde's life motto is that skill can change lives. He is convinced that his skill can change not only his own life, but also the lives of many more adventurers. Therefore, he approaches each and every weapon upgrade with particular care and attention.",
    ["NpcInfo_61081"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> Since he was very young, Russford has believed himself to be the lost child of some noble family. He believes his family will come with a butler, a carriage, and a suit to bring him home one day, and that he is merely out gaining life experience for the present.\n<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> \"Russford. Just listen to the sound of such a genteel name! It's got airs similar to the likes of Tristan and Kroneika. My real identity will surely be revealed one day!\" Russford adjusts his sleeves as if he were a nobleman, proudly raising his head high.",
    ["NpcInfo_6108101"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> If daydreaming had different levels of proficiency, Russford would undoubtedly be at the max level. He can find clues of himself being of noble birth in the little things of daily life. For example, the free dessert he won at the restaurant must have been left for him by the family who had been watching him secretly for years, and the old insignia he found on the street must have been a clue for him. Such things can keep him dreaming for days on end.",
    ["NpcInfo_6108102"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> Every time Walde hears these fancies and speculations of Russford's, he can only raise a hand to his forehead and sigh in frustration. Twenty customers win the same dessert each day, and that insignia of unknown origin is sold by the dozen in the second-hand market. However, after a few tries at talking Russford round, Walde has understood that any further attempt would be in vain. Perhaps the ability to dream with such optimism is a blessing for Russford.",
    ["NpcInfo_6108103"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> Oddly enough, Russford's luck can actually be surprisingly good at times. Kind strangers would bring his wallet back to him should he lose it. On the few occasions when dishonest merchants tried to sell him poor quality materials, passing experts helped him out. There have been a few times when Walde couldn't help wonder if there really was someone secretly looking out for Russford.",
    ["NpcInfo_61082"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> The cute and delicate-looking Sheila has been thinking about nothing except vampire romance stories lately. Perhaps because she grew up alone, Sheila has an extraordinary passion for romance novels and girly comics. She is able to quote lines from them at any time and can't help incorporating elements of the stories into her accessory upgrades. As Sheila looks intently at the book in front of her with loving eyes, she says, \"How boring would this world be without love stories? Lord Dracula, please enjoy my blood!\"",
    ["NpcInfo_6108201"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> Just from looking at Sheila's sweet smile, it is difficult for everyone to believe that she actually grew up in an orphanage. Not a trace of gloom can ever be found on her face, as if the sun is always beaming its radiance upon her.",
    ["NpcInfo_6108202"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> However, Sheila's optimism and cheerfulness are entirely the product of the girly comics she has read since she was very young. She firmly believes that she will meet her Prince Charming as long as she lives her life to the fullest. \"After all, only strong and determined female protagonists can have a happy ending,\" thinks Sheila with great enthusiasm.",
    ["NpcInfo_6108203"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> Sheila's friend, however, has the complete opposite personality to her. Rosha has always had an inexplicable fondness for creepy skeletons, and scoffs at the plots of the girly comic that Sheila fantasizes about. \"Girly comics are so puerile. All they can do is torment simple girls like you.\" Rosa shakes her head at Sheila's obsession for the legend of Dracula.",
    ["NpcInfo_61083"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> Maxfeld was an influential student when he was at Criatura Academy, and all new students have heard the legendary tale about how he singlehandedly challenged three senior weapon upgraders. It can be said that nobody on Izlude Island can compare with him when it comes weapon upgrades.\n<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> Despite this, Maxfeld modestly tells people, \"Weapon upgrading is filled with infinite possibilities. I've only just touched the tip of the iceberg.\"",
    ["NpcInfo_6108301"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> Maxfeld's talent for weapon upgrades has been shown since childhood. Even when he was a freshman who has just begun his studies, he could see at a glance what materials the teachers mistakenly put into failed upgrades. The mentors said that perhaps Midgard would be getting another talented weapons upgrader.",
    ["NpcInfo_6108302"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> Despite coming from a well-off family, Maxfeld has no aristocratic arrogance at all. Of his best friends Valentina and Zimmerman, one is similarly of noble birth, but the other is of an ordinary background. \"Friends are friends. It has nothing to do with their backgrounds.\" Maxfeld looked at his boisterous friends in the distance and laughed quietly.",
    ["NpcInfo_6108303"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> However, Maxfeld always had one regret—after his father died, he left him a special sword, but it had been set aside for so long that it was no longer usable. He has always wanted to find a suitable material to upgrade it, but due to the special material of the sword, it seems as though the materials for upgrading it could only be found as far away as Morroc. \"Who knows when I'll be able to wield this sword,\" Maxfeld thinks wistfully.",
    ["NpcInfo_61084"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> \"It's so troublesome being handsome as me!\" exclaimed Zimmerman again after gazing at his own features in the mirror for a long time. Even though his dashing appearance once won him enough votes to make him the second most popular senior amongst the new students of Criatura Academy, the vanity in his tone—apparent the moment he opens his mouth—destroys any fantasies he may have inspired.\n<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> \"How could Maxfeld be the most popular? He simply cannot compare to my good looks. There must be something wrong with the taste of the new students,\" said Zimmerman jealously, casting a sideways glance at Maxfeld who was beside him.",
    ["NpcInfo_6108401"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> Despite losing to Maxfeld in the popularity rankings, it does not affect the fact that Zimmerman sees Maxfeld as his best friend. After all, when he was still a quiet and meek child, Maxfeld was the first to stand up for him and chase away the older kids who had been bullying him.",
    ["NpcInfo_6108402"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> Due to his effeminate features back then, Zimmerman was often bullied by the other boys. However, Maxfeld told him, \"Appearance doesn't mean anything. Your destiny lies in your own hands.\" After graduation, they stayed on Izlude Island to upgrade equipment for the new students and adventurers passing through. His armor upgrading skills improved day by day, and he gradually gained everyone's recognition.",
    ["NpcInfo_6108403"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> Now, many years later, Zimmerman has grown from a timid boy into an over-confident young man, while Maxfeld has remained old-fashioned and upright. Zimmerman can't help teasing him, \"That idiot spends all day reading his books about weapon upgrading. Who knows when he'll ever get a girlfriend?\"",
    ["NpcInfo_61085"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> Valentina is a pretty senior who is exceedingly popular with the new students. Elegant and demure, with an air of gentility and possessing an enviable figure, it's no exaggeration to describe her as having been blessed by gods. However, only Zimmerman and Maxfeld, her two close friends who have known her for years, are aware that despite her glamorous appearance, she is a complete airhead. When others assume she is pondering an accessory upgrade, she may well be thinking, \"Oh no! I forgot to hang out the laundry again yesterday. What time can I get home today?\"",
    ["NpcInfo_6108501"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> Valentina, who grew up in an affluent family, has an inborn air of nobility about her. However, her family environment has had no impact on her carefree personality, even in public settings. Maxfeld, who grew up with her, knows that whenever Valentina appears to be elegant and serene, she is actually daydreaming.",
    ["NpcInfo_6108502"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> \"Why can't I ever remember where I left my keys? Hey Maxfeld! Wait for me!\" Valentina never being able to find her keys when she leaves her house was a daily occurrence during their school days.",
    ["NpcInfo_6108503"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> After Zimmerman became a close friend of Maxfeld's, the inseparable trio came into being quite naturally. Zimmerman, who had still been somewhat shy, gradually grew more cheerful and carefree after discovering Valentina's absent-minded personality. His teasing about her messy room is quite merciless too.",
    ["NpcInfo_61086"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> Jonsen, who chose not to take over his family's chain of businesses, began a career in weapon crafting in spite of the tremendous pressure. Although in the eyes of others, being a small-time blacksmith is nothing compared with the life he could have led as head of the family business, Jonsen does not think so. \"The family business belongs to the older generation. My life and career are only just beginning.\"",
    ["NpcInfo_6108601"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> Jonsen is most unconventional among the younger generation of the family. Ever since he was little, he has preferred hammering away to discussing how to do business with his elder brothers and sisters, and the occasional sight of the swords and shields carried by passing members of the Kingdom Defense Force thrilled him greatly. After some time, everyone came to see him as a weirdo and stopped talking to him.",
    ["NpcInfo_6108602"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> Jonsen, however, was unconcerned. \"Jobs that deal with Zeny don't suit me at all. I much prefer calculating the angle for a hammer to strike a weapon.\" After all, even if he has few friends at home, Jonsen still has blacksmith friends like Polly and Valde to keep him company.",
    ["NpcInfo_6108603"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> When Jonsen eventually decided to go out on his own, he made up his mind to leave Prontera for Izlude Island, where his family had no influence, to start his own weapon upgrading business. Although parting from Valde saddened him somewhat, it did not halt the pursuit of his childhood dreams. Someday they will meet again at the heights of their careers, and they will share a look and smile, understanding each other's thoughts at once.",
    ["NpcInfo_61087"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> Cornelia's parents died in a fight against monsters. As a result, Cornelia, who has lived with her granny since childhood, was determined to become the world's most brilliant armor craftswoman. \"Good armor will surely protect my loved ones for me,\" said Cornelia, her eyes beaming with determination.",
    ["NpcInfo_6108701"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> Cornelia lived in Geffen when she was young. Her parents were first-class mages; however, in a freak monster attack, they perished trying to protect the city, leaving behind the 7-year-old Cornelia. Her granny eventually told her what happened to her parents. \"When I grow up, I'll protect my granny! I'll protect everyone!\" thought Cornelia, making her wish while holding back the tears in her eyes.",
    ["NpcInfo_6108702"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> With this wish of protecting everyone, Cornelia began her studies on Izlude Island. Among the many subjects, craftsmanship was the one in which she excelled, so she began to specialize in the field of armor crafting. She examined the weaknesses of each class and crafted armor based on those points, instantly becoming very popular with both the teachers and students at the academy.",
    ["NpcInfo_6108703"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> \"I may not be strong enough right now but someday, I will create great armor that can protect everyone, so no one else will have to lose their loved ones,\" thinks Cornelia with determination while swinging the hammer in her hand.",
    ["NpcInfo_61088"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> Frederica has put a considerable amount of effort into convincing her family that she is different from the ordinary blacksmiths hammering away on the streets. After all, design is a part of accessory crafting too, and it is not something just anyone can do.\n<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> \"They only need their physical strength to make a living. I need my brains too! Look at these blueprints. Not just anyone could draw them!\" said Frederica with some frustration, scrunching up another design.",
    ["NpcInfo_6108801"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> Born into a family which emphasized military strength, Frederica's childhood was very tough. She had to practice combat skills, undergo strength training, and fight every day. Being a girl completely uninterested in fighting, Frederica made up her mind to escape such a life.",
    ["NpcInfo_6108802"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> Frederica sought out and apprenticed with the best accessory designer in the city. Not only did she acquire the skills required to design accessories, she also made use of the strength she had honed since childhood to become an independent blacksmith capable of crafting her own accessories.",
    ["NpcInfo_6108803"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> When she was at last about to leave her family, she finally informed everyone that she was going to become an accessory craftswoman. Although much time was spent overcoming the family's derision, Frederica's skill and dedication soon proved to everyone just how serious she was about her chosen career.",
    ["NpcInfo_61090"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> Originally working for the Lindra Trading Company, Vienna joined the Wigner Chamber of Commerce with her sisters when the family business went bankrupt. Ever since then, they have promoted their business everywhere they go. \"One day, I will make the name of Lindra Trading Company known across Midgard again!\" With quiet determination, Vienna throws her smooth, long hair back and confidently introduces the new goods to her customers.",
    ["NpcInfo_6109001"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> Vienna has viewed money differently from her sisters since childhood. \"You see, if you just pile up Zeny in your money bag, you're basically lugging around a pile of scrap iron. You have to turn it into something everyone loves to give it value. Who knows, maybe one day people will stop using Zeny and start using Beny! Then what will it be worth?\" Vienna was only 12 when she first said this to her sister.",
    ["NpcInfo_6109002"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> Business on Izlude Island has improved significantly since Vienna took over. They even say that she can sometimes be seen at the gates of Criatura Academy promoting her latest goods to the students. Her ability to close a sale is probably the best in Midgard.",
    ["NpcInfo_6109003"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> \"Now, what should I bring for the new students this afternoon? Hmm... If they're good-looking enough, I'll give them a 10% discount. After all, I was young once, too! Ohohoho!\" Vienna thinks to herself happily.",
    ["NpcInfo_61091"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> Originally working for the Lindra Trading Company, Anna joined the Wigner Chamber of Commerce with her sisters when the family business went bankrupt, and became a merchant in the Morroc branch.\n<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> \"The people in Morroc love to drop by my shop,\" Anna says proudly, but she looks worried as she starts to rub her cheeks. \"But the desert dust is bad for a girl's skin.\"",
    ["NpcInfo_61092"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> Originally working for the Lindra Trading Company, Sheila joined the Wigner Chamber of Commerce with her sisters when the family business went bankrupt, and became a merchant in the Payon branch.\n<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> \"My sisters are always worried that I can't get along well with the people here,\" Sheila says grudgingly. \"They may speak in a dialect that I don't know, but they make their purchases way faster than people from other places!\"",
    ["NpcInfo_61093"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> Originally working for the Lindra Trading Company, Lydia joined the Wigner Chamber of Commerce with her sisters when the family business went bankrupt, and became a merchant in the Geffen branch.\n<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> \"I'm curious what those mages are doing all the time,\" Lydia grumbles. \"They don't even leave their house to shop!\"",
    ["NpcInfo_61094"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> Originally working for the Lindra Trading Company, Phoebe joined the Wigner Chamber of Commerce with her sisters when the family business went bankrupt, and became a merchant in the Alberta branch.\n<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> \"The great thing about being next to the harbor is that you never have trouble getting stock,\" Phoebe says confidently. \"I've a way with the people of the Alson Fleet. They always give me a discount!\"",
    ["NpcInfo_61095"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> Novia dreamed of becoming an adventurer and travelling throughout the land, until a Lunatic at the South Gate gobbled up one of her shoes.\n<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> \"Ever since then, I've invented a hundred ways to eat a Lunatic,\" Novia vents.",
    ["NpcInfo_6109501"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> The legend of the \"Midnight Lunatic Killer\" is now known to all outside the Prontera South Gate. On a dark windy night, a black-haired figure was seen catching Lunatics outside the South Gate. In fact, that was the very night Novia tried to catch a Lunatic in order to study ways to cook them. That night, the number of Lunatics outside the South Gate was reduced by more than half by the morning.",
    ["NpcInfo_6109502"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> However, after discovering the joys of cooking, Novia went to Izlude Island to cook for the students of Criatura Academy, and her special student set meals and delicious snacks soon became a specialty of Izlude Island.",
    ["NpcInfo_6109503"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> \"If I really were to become an adventurer, how would everyone be able to enjoy such delicious lunches every day?\" Novia thinks with pride whenever she sees young adventurers coming and going.",
    ["NpcInfo_61096"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> Many gourmets and chefs congregate in Prontera, the capital of the kingdom. Grace is one of them; her exquisite culinary skills are widely sought after, and rumors say that even the nobles of the seven royal families invite her to be the head chef at their banquets.\n<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> \"Sometimes I have crazy ideas,\" Grace says. \"For example, adding Grasshopper Leg to soup.\"",
    ["NpcInfo_6109601"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> Grace, a gifted gourmet with boundless enthusiasm for food, is the favorite chef of the royal family. However, she doesn't care who she cooks for. For Grace, the most important thing is finding people to taste her new culinary inventions every day, even if they contain exotic and experimental ingredients.",
    ["NpcInfo_6109602"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> Although those close to Grace know that she sometimes makes dishes that are just plain wrong, most passersby have nothing but praise for her cuisine. After all, not everyone is lucky enough to taste the cuisine of the royal chef.",
    ["NpcInfo_6109603"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> \"See these? They're Giant Tiger Prawns I just caught in the river outside the city. If I wrap some egg shells around them and fry them, they'll taste amazing!\" Grace points to the Giant Tiger Prawns still writhing in her basket and chuckles with delight.",
    ["NpcInfo_61097"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> After witnessing the misery of the people living in Morroc, Stefanie can no longer turn a blind eye. Using whatever scarce resources are available, she cooks food to fill their stomachs.\n<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color>\"Did you know?\" Stefanie says seriously. \"If the heat is just right, even cactus can be delicious!\"",
    ["NpcInfo_6109701"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> Before coming to Morroc, Stefanie would never stay in a city for more than two months, as she firmly believes that the entire land is full of wonderful ingredients for making delicious food. She believed that she should try her best to collect all the ingredients the world has to offer, and become a first-rate cook.",
    ["NpcInfo_6109702"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> The only problem was Stefanie underestimated the scarcity of Morroc's resources. \"How can people live without delicious food? Even if the resources here are limited, we can still create infinite tasty dishes with the ingredients available!\" She was so determined to achieve her goal that she decided to stay at the Desert Green Tavern in Morroc.",
    ["NpcInfo_6109703"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> Since Stefanie's arrival in Morroc, the dining tables of the locals have been graced by a whole host of new dishes, such as Stir Fried Cactus, Braised Scorpion, and Spicy Side Winder Head. Though these dishes sound dubious, they are surprisingly delicious.",
    ["NpcInfo_61098"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> The mountainous city of Payon has a unique cuisine, and that is what Albel came for.\n<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> \"The people here often say, 'Food above all.'\" Albel rubs his chin and thinks hard. \"I wonder what it would be like if food really was up above in the sky...\"",
    ["NpcInfo_6109801"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> Albel is a theoretical gourmet who collects recipes to expand her collection as a connoisseur. Although she occasionally puts her knowledge into practice, such occasions are so rare that even though she is known as a culinary genius, few people have actually tasted her cooking.",
    ["NpcInfo_6109802"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> After coming to Payon, she found that the unique recipes there were completely different from those she had collected in the past, which made Albel desperate to try cooking them herself. This experience resulted in Payon gaining a new master chef of natural cuisine.",
    ["NpcInfo_6109803"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> \"One day, I will uncover the rules of Payon cuisine. All delicious dishes have something in common—there must be some secret I haven't quite mastered yet, but I'll discover it sooner or later...\" Albel mused confidently as she marinated a squid according to the recipe before her.",
    ["NpcInfo_61099"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> When Nicola first came to Geffen, the city of magic, it was only to pursue a handsome mage. Though she got her heart broken quickly, she soon found a new interest—fusing magic elements and cooking them together to create amazing delicacies.\n<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> \"There's nothing a good meal can't solve!\" Nicola proclaims. \"And if that doesn't work, eat another!\"",
    ["NpcInfo_6109901"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> After the mage's rejection, the depressed Nicola binged herself on all the fine food Geffen had to offer and put on several pounds in just a few days. However, it was also thanks to this that she turned her grief into motivation, fusing magic elements and the original Geffen cuisine together to create the magic cuisine unique to Geffen. It was surprisingly popular with the locals, and the supply could hardly keep up with the demand.",
    ["NpcInfo_6109902"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> The success of the magic cuisine persuaded Nicola to settle in Geffen. \"After all, apart from love, food is the most important thing in life.\" Nicola has since become Geffen's iconic gourmet cook, and the gloom of unrequited love has been entirely cast aside.",
    ["NpcInfo_6109903"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> As Nicola's cooking gained in following, many of Geffen's young mages have also become ardent admirers of hers. Sadly, Nicola has no wish to be entangled in romance again, and will only speak to them of magic, food, and nothing else.",
    ["NpcInfo_61100"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> There is no shortage of seafood at the harbor of Alberta. Rachel grew up there, and that is the reason why she has such a vast knowledge of fish dishes.\n<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> \"Just give me a fish bone and I can make a yummy soup out of it,\" Rachel says confidently.",
    ["NpcInfo_6110001"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> Perhaps it is because Rachel spent so much time at the seaside as a child that she considers seafood to be the freshest and tastiest food in the world. She seems to always be able to come up with new ways to cook seafood, and even if she eats it every day of the year, she will never tire of it.",
    ["NpcInfo_6110002"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> Rachel's most renowned talent is her ability to identify different fish through smell alone, and even with her eyes closed, she can immediately distinguish tuna from hairtail, just with her nose.",
    ["NpcInfo_6110003"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> \"Even ordinary fish have their own unique flavor. It's impossible for me to ever make a mistake. To be a legendary seafood chef, one must have a good sense of smell.\" Whenever she talks about cooking fish, Rachel's eyes always shine with confidence.",
    ["NpcInfo_61101"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> As the son of a veteran sailor, Hayden too once dreamed of a life of freedom on the open waves. However, ever since his father was lost at sea, he has devoted himself to looking after his mother, and chose to stay in Alberta to work as a fishing gear merchant.\n<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> \"My passion for the sea is second to none! Just you wait and see. I'll definitely return to the sea one day!\" says Hayden as he gazes resolutely at the fishing boats docked at the harbor.",
    ["NpcInfo_6110101"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> Even though he can't be at sea for now, Hayden takes advantage of his vast knowledge of the sea to carefully pick out suitable fishing gear and bait for every adventurer setting sail. Adventurers who have used his fishing gear are all full of praise for him.",
    ["NpcInfo_6110102"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> Hayden sometimes goes over to see Elysia for a little fortune-telling to see what his lucky color and direction are. Actually, he isn't very interested in such things, and only uses it as an excuse to exchange a few more words with her. After all, the solemn Elysia seems to only be interested in fortune-telling.",
    ["NpcInfo_6110103"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> However, Hayden has been planning to chat with Elysia about some new topics. \"Since she's interested in fortune-telling... why not take her to the seaside to look at the stars? I can say I want her help with astrology,\" murmurs Hayden to himself, intermittently sneaking glances at Elysia across the way.",
    ["NpcInfo_61102"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> Sam was a hardworking miner at Mjolnir Mine. It was only after a mining incident that he decided to choose another path, and now runs a mining company in Alberta instead.\n<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> \"I shouldn't have come here,\" Sam says dejectedly. \"There are no mines by the sea!\"",
    ["NpcInfo_61103"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> As a shrewd merchant famous in all Alberta, Russell lives by his maxim \"Thriftiness is a true crime. As long as you are spending, you are providing the bread for someone's next meal.\" Everyone says that there's nothing Russell can't sell, especially with customers who believe in all his flowery wheedling.",
    ["NpcInfo_6110301"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> Russell became the direct supplier for the Alson Fleet at the young age of twenty. In a port city like Alberta, there is no organization more free-handed than the Alson Fleet.",
    ["NpcInfo_6110302"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> \"I don't just rely on my tongue to do business. What really counts is my brain,\" smirks Russell with a copy of \"Continental Economy\" in his hand. In his mind, everything can be traded.",
    ["NpcInfo_6110303"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> Nonetheless, the usually shrewd and calm Russell also has an enemy who gets under his skin—the resident merchant of Izlude Island, Sipera. Whenever adventurers arrive from the island, they always question his prices. \"I have to waste so much breath every single time, all because of that woman, Sipera! Student discount?! Is she running a charity?\" Russell grumbles as he rolls his eyes.",
    ["NpcInfo_61104"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> Sinclair became a Crystal merchant because of his love for Crystals. As long as they pay in Crystal, adventurers can buy anything they want from him.\n<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color>\"Hmm? What do I want Crystals for?\" Sinclair replies without thinking, \"Why, to count them, of course!\"",
    ["NpcInfo_6110401"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> Sinclair is often seen sitting in Alberta's port and squinting with one eye as he examines each of his Crystals in the setting sun. As he turns the tiny stones around in his fingers, he remarks, \"Excellent quality indeed! Seems like my customers have all been very generous of late. Hehe!\"",
    ["NpcInfo_6110402"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> Although he seems to be wholly obsessed with collecting Crystals, Sinclair also has rather high standards when it comes to selecting goods. After all, he is a long-term supplier for the Alson Fleet. Quality must certainly be guaranteed when working with such a prestigious fleet.",
    ["NpcInfo_6110403"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> \"The way you exhaust your brainpower for Zeny really makes me worry you'll start losing your hair,\" Sinclair often mocks Material Merchant Russell opposite him. In his eyes, a common currency like Zeny simply cannot compare to his Crystals and is completely unworthy of Russell's hard work.",
    ["NpcInfo_61106"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> In the sandy and windy land of Morroc, the usefulness of a pair of glasses is obvious. Rylai has come here precisely because she discovered this business opportunity.\n<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> \"But I didn't know that the locals are so poor,\" says Rylai regretfully. \"They'd rather spend Zeny on Grasshopper's Legs than buy a pair of glasses!\"",
    ["NpcInfo_6110601"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> When Rylai first arrived at Morroc with the ambition of making glasses popular but then only managing to sell one pair in a month, she began to suspect that there was something wrong with her strategy. However, she will not give up on her plan so easily. Perseverance—yes, only perseverance—will prove that she was right.",
    ["NpcInfo_6110602"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> \"There's no way I'll lose to Ingael. Ugly Munak Turbans are so not my style,\" thought Rylai indignantly. Before coming to Morroc, she made a bet with Ingael that she would be able to make her glasses the fashion of Morroc. Should she fail, she would have to wear a Munak Turban made by Ingael for three months.",
    ["NpcInfo_6110603"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> Despite the glasses' poor sales, Rylai's fighting spirit does not seem to have been dampened in any way. \"Isn't it just a case of resource scarcity and poor economic development? When they realize the protection glasses provide against the wind and sand, they'll surely understand how wise this choice is.\" And so Rylai, sporting her pair of super cool red shades, has stubbornly stayed in Morroc.",
    ["NpcInfo_61107"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> It has been some years since Villard set up her mask shop in Payon, but lately, he has been thinking about exploring some places further afield.\n<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> \"I've heard that a race called Goblins resides in Geffen. The masks they wear are very unique,\" Villard says longingly. \"How I wish I could go and have a look.\"",
    ["NpcInfo_6110701"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> It is said that Villard has always wanted to create a series of masks modeled after rare monsters. To capture the essence of the creatures to create stunning masks, she has spent much time studying monsters, going as far as hiding in the wild to take photos of them.",
    ["NpcInfo_6110702"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> Villard formed a deep friendship with the culinary genius Albel while she was out observing monsters. Villard's combat abilities are nowhere near as good as Albel's. Once, she was almost eaten by a Willow Elder when she went too close to observe the pattern of its bark. Luckily, Albel, who was passing by after fishing, saved her.",
    ["NpcInfo_6110703"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> To thank Albel for saving her life, Villard has set her heart on designing a stylish mask full of cooking ingredients for Albel. Though Albel has turned her down many times, for \"no one wants to see a cook wearing a Fruity Squid mask\", Villard, however, is very insistent. \"Designing a mask for a culinary genius that fully shows off her talent is an expression of my deepest gratitude!\"",
    ["NpcInfo_61108"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> No one knows that Jolie, the headgear merchant of Izlude Island, once wished to become a Kafra service employee. However, she had to begrudgingly give up this dream as she simply couldn't memorize the hundreds of guidelines in the employee manual.\n<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color>\"But I can still design adorable merchandise for the Kafra ladies,\" Jolie says contentedly. \"The Kafra Doll series is extremely popular!\"",
    ["NpcInfo_6110801"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> Jolie once spent three months studying the Kafra employee manual, but unfortunately, memory is not something that can be improved through hard work. Thus, Jolie's Kafra dream was not meant to be. However, during her studies at Kafra, she was inspired to design Kafra-themed headgear, and started a headgear business.",
    ["NpcInfo_6110802"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> \"Let me think about the new headgear for the next season. Should I use W or Defolty as the inspiration? Dear me, the Kafra ladies are just so cute!\" Jolie can't help exclaim her admiration every time she passes by a Kafra service point.",
    ["NpcInfo_6110803"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> Jolie's business has been flourishing ever since the success of the Kafra series, and adventurers from throughout Prontera take pride in owning headgear from the series.",
    ["NpcInfo_61109"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> Since Ingael set up his headgear shop in Geffen, he has sold almost nothing else apart from Mage Hats.\n<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> \"These mages have no idea what taste is. They actually said that the hat I am wearing is a husky?!\" Ingael says angrily. \"It is clearly a wolf. A wolf, see?\"",
    ["NpcInfo_6110901"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> The truth is that when Ingael was young, his mother wanted to scare him with the story about the boy who cried wolf, and so casually pointed to a husky as a reference. As a result, even after growing up and seeing real wolves, Ingael still unconsciously incorporates the features of huskies into his designs.",
    ["NpcInfo_6110902"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> Ingael also has extraordinary confidence in his taste and designs, and does not accept any criticism or doubt. He firmly believes that the trendsetter who dictates the latest fashion can only be himself and no one else. Therefore, it is definitely a wolf, and cannot possibly be a husky. Nonetheless, there is one person who is the exception.",
    ["NpcInfo_6110903"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> For some unknown reason, Ingael has always been rather meek in the face of the Eufemiah the enchanter. When Eufemiah first set eyes on Ingael's headgear, she couldn't help gushing, \"Wow, what a cute husky!\" \"Haha... D-do you think so? I can make another one for you too, but... it's a wolf (in a faltering voice).\" Ingael blushed unconsciously.",
    ["NpcInfo_61110"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> Born and raised in Alberta, Felix has always liked to incorporate features of her hometown into her headgear designs.\n<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> \"Perhaps people will be willing to wear the Fish Head Hat I designed,\" says Felix, gesticulating wildly. \"How I'd love to be a fish, swimming freely through the ocean!\"",
    ["NpcInfo_6111001"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> Even though no one has even seen so much as a glimpse of the Fish Head Hat, Felix promotes her design enthusiastically. However, every time the deal is about to be sealed, she informs the customer, \"Actually, I don't have enough funds to start making them yet. Once production is successful, I'll let you know right away!\"",
    ["NpcInfo_6111002"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> Felix has thoroughly racked her brains about how to save up enough funds and materials to make the Fish Head Hats. The Diadems that make the hearts of noble ladies race and the Gemmed Sallets that generals can't wait to get their hands on are also Felix's creations.",
    ["NpcInfo_6111003"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> Rumor has it that bespoke headgear created by Felix appears even at the grand ceremonies of the seven royal families. However, Felix doesn't accept orders from just anyone. Some people say that she once turned away a nobleman from the seven royal families because he had once publicly dismissed Alberta as a rural fishing village. The nobleman was so angered by Felix's refusal that he almost had her shop set ablaze, but was stopped by others. \"I don't make headgear for people who don't respect Alberta,\" said Felix, shaking her head proudly.",
    ["NpcInfo_61111"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> Mouth accessories have always been puzzling to adventurers and Albertans alike, but Marlow couldn't care less.\n<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color>\"Don't you think it's pretty interesting to wear a Bandit Beard?\" Marlow laughs heartily, \"And a Donut in Mouth will make any girl cuter, this I guarantee!\"",
    ["NpcInfo_61112"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> A mindless tool for the developers. They are unemployed and the writer did not even bother to write a description for them.",
    ["NpcInfo_611126"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> Octavia has received a good education in the arts since childhood and earnestly believes that accessory upgrading is also an art. She likes to travel with fleets to different cities, collecting materials and incorporating the cultural characteristics of various places into her designs.\n<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> \"The essence of upgrading accessories is to infuse them with the spirit of art,\" says Octavia devoutly to the customers who came to have their accessories upgraded.",
    ["NpcInfo_61113"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> Born to a family with three sons already, Hervor has been doted upon since childhood, yet she does not want to be a delicate princess and envies her brothers who are able to join the Kingdom Defense Force. \"Who says girls must be cute and dainty? Plenty of girls are bold and dashing too, like valkyries!\" said Hervor earnestly, gazing at the valkyrie armor in front of her.",
    ["NpcInfo_6111301"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> Perhaps because she only has male siblings, Hervor had no interest in playing house like other young girls, preferring instead to watch her brothers practice fighting. She adored their armor and equipment and did not care for the soft toys and dolls that her mother tried to give to her.",
    ["NpcInfo_6111302"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> After Hervor grew up, she became obsessed with the legend of the valkyries and wished for nothing more than to become a great female warrior just like them. However, due to her weak constitution, she failed the Kingdom Defense Force's selection. Fortunately, she soon found a new goal, and used her knowledge and passion for equipment to become an equipment upgrading merchant.",
    ["NpcInfo_6111303"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> Hervor's main pastime at present is daydreaming with luxurious Valkyrian armor in her arms, imagining herself as a majestic warrior dressed in such a suit of armor. \"Forget it. Since that's not my fate, I'll help other young ladies look as magnificent as possible!\" thinks Hervor, pulling herself together again.",
    ["NpcInfo_611147"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> Even in the barren desert, Jude is always the perfect gentleman. Whenever a female adventurer passes by, he tips his hat in greeting.\n<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> \"A real gentleman always respects a lady, even in regards to business matters,\" says Jude, flashing a brilliant smile as he tips his hat and gives a slight bow to the customer in front of him.",
    ["NpcInfo_61116"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> Mariano often seems to be in a world of his own, with a face of complete indifference to the outside world, as though earning a little more is of little concern to him. \"I don't work overtime. If you want your equipment upgraded, come earlier tomorrow,\" said Mariano calmly, waving off the mage who had just rushed over from Geffen.",
    ["NpcInfo_6111601"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> Unlike other merchants who rush to get the prime spots near the Central Fountain, Mariano prefers to stay in an inconspicuous corner of Prontera. Almost nobody passes by that spot close to the sewer, and he seems not to care a jot about how many customers he has or how his business does.",
    ["NpcInfo_6111602"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> According to the nearby Brock, he has only seen Mariano's face full of expression on one occasion: when Sheila, who happened to be passing him, stopped and pestered him for a photo, saying that he looked like the main character in the new comic she was reading. Confronted with Sheila's enthusiasm and barrage of questions, Mariano's face showed his indecision between getting angry and forcing a smile. The scene tickled Brock, who couldn't help but laugh to himself.",
    ["NpcInfo_6111603"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> \"Sheila… I don't know what to make of her.\" Whenever Mariano mentions Sheila, he feels rather at a loss for words. \"What vampire count? What comic book character? Just what is going on in that head of hers?\"",
    ["NpcInfo_61118"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> Adelaide has no memories from before he was 25 years old. After surviving a disaster at sea, he started a weapon upgrading business in Morroc. He has a recurring dream in which he appears to be in a city with an endless blue sky, and a vague figure calls out to him as they stand beneath that sky. However, each time he tries to approach, he will suddenly wake up. \"Perhaps I'll be able to find that city again someday. And that person too.\"",
    ["NpcInfo_6111801"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> When Adelaide woke up in a village in Morroc, he found himself without a clue about his own identity. Villagers told him that he had been found unconscious in the Central Plains of Morroc and would have been eaten by a pack of Baby Desert Wolves had a passing assassin not saved him and brought him to the village.",
    ["NpcInfo_6111802"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> Adelaide was given this name by Hassan from the Assassins Guild. Although he lost all his memories, he discovered by chance that he was skilled in weapon upgrading and therefore began upgrading weapons for a living, and to raise enough funds to go in search of his lost memories.",
    ["NpcInfo_6111803"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> Perhaps due to the fear of what may lie in his memories, Adelaide appears quiet and reserved, which has led many young girls in Morroc to view him as cold and mysterious. Unbeknownst to him, his popularity has risen so much that he is now trailing just behind Hassan, the most popular guy in all Morroc.",
    ["NpcInfo_61119"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> Fenn went to Izlude Island to learn about armor upgrading when he was young. He originally intended to stay at Criatura Academy and upgrade armor for the new students. His later return to Morroc was entirely because he met Audrey at the Academy. Fenn fell in love with Audrey at first sight and followed her back to Morroc after graduation.\n<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> \"To love deeply is a kind of mistake too. To gain one thing, something else will have to be sacrificed,\" sighs Fenn as he gazes at Audrey standing nearby.",
    ["NpcInfo_6111901"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> Perhaps because he has read too much poetry, Fenn sometimes thinks he is a sentimental poet, and Audrey is his muse. To express his irrepressible feelings, he used to write a love poem on a leaf every day and secretly push it through the gap under Audrey's front door.",
    ["NpcInfo_6111902"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> The result was not unexpected. Not only was Audrey unimpressed, she also began wondering where this stalker sending her weird poems every day came from. Seeing Audrey's disgust, Fenn of course could not admit to being the culprit.",
    ["NpcInfo_6111903"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> \"Not everyone appreciates the work of a genius. I understand that being exceptional is always rather lonely. It's just that, Audrey... I thought she would understand me...\" Fenn casts a melancholy glance at Audrey, completely oblivious to how awful his poetry is.",
    ["NpcInfo_61120"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> Audrey was born into a very traditional family. Despite's Morroc's harsh natural environment, she has grown up to be the prettiest girl in the village. She enrolled at Criatura Academy with the dream of becoming a first class accessory upgrader and returned to Morroc without hesitation after graduation.\n<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> \"Morroc will become the richest place in all the land one day. I have to come back and bring the best techniques to the people here,\" said Audrey, batting her long lashes.",
    ["NpcInfo_6112001"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> Perhaps it is because since childhood she has seen too many people suffering from the hardships caused by the scarcity of resources in Morroc that Audrey has always felt concerned for the people of her hometown. Even though a better environment and better jobs are available on Izlude Island, she chose to return to Morroc all the same.",
    ["NpcInfo_6112002"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> However, since her return to Morroc, Audrey has felt that she's being pestered by some weird stalker. Every day she receives a love poem on a leaf that appears through the gap under her front door, but not once has she managed to catch the culprit. Hence, she has added three more locks to her door.",
    ["NpcInfo_6112003"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> \"Morroc's already got Renee, an outstanding accessory craftswoman, but there are still many whose accessories are yet to have their hidden beauty uncovered. My job is to help them discover that beauty,\" says Audrey with a gentle smile, fiddling with a necklace in her hands.",
    ["NpcInfo_61122"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> The beautiful, lovely Aphra has an unusually cool, shrewd heart and can always find the best solution in any dilemma. As Aphra says, \"If you can't understand the power of defense, you won't become a great adventurer. Only those who know how to defend can know how to attack.\"",
    ["NpcInfo_6112201"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> Born to the Richard Family, Aphra had grown tired of fighting for military power and politics, so she went to Alberta alone and started her accessory crafting business. \"After all, I prefer enjoying the scenery to watching certain people's hypocrisy.\"",
    ["NpcInfo_6112202"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> Aphra sometimes returns to Prontera to see her beloved cousin Hervor. Among her family's fake smiles, only Hervor's seems genuine and adorable, so Aphra is still willing to listen to her cousin's innocent and pure imagination.",
    ["NpcInfo_6112203"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> During her days at Alberta, Aphra met the lively, cute Valerie. Perhaps it is because she has so much free time, but thanks to Valerie's influence, Aphra has taken quite an interest in gossip. Together, they enjoy watching the sunset while discussing their favorite pairings.",
    ["NpcInfo_61123"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> The freedom-loving Valerie fell in love with Alberta's sunset the first time she saw it. The vastness of the sea seemingly to embrace both the sky and earth provided her with countless inspirations. \"Perhaps I should set up my own accessory workshop here. The smell of the sea is quite exhilarating,\" said Valerie, taking in a deep breath. The charm of the sea breeze was irresistible.",
    ["NpcInfo_6112301"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> When Valerie was young, she aspired to become a creative artist who traveled all over the land and made art for everyone. \"Wonderful things don't wait till you are prepared for them. They all come as surprises.\" With this belief deeply rooted in her mind, Valerie eventually succeeded in becoming an independent accessory craftswoman, wandering all over the land in search of inspiration.",
    ["NpcInfo_6112302"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> Her experience of being pursued by an Anacondaq in the desert prompted her to create an exquisite anti-poison necklace, and the Willow Elder she encountered by chance in Payon became a model for the design of Willow rings. Each accessory sold by Valerie has an interesting experience of hers hidden behind it.",
    ["NpcInfo_6112303"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> After arriving at Alberta, Valerie became close friends with Aphra next door. After all, it is easy for two people both in love with Alberta's sunset to find a good time for gossip. \"Do you think Wolton's really got feelings for Octavia?\" asked Valerie casually, chatting leisurely with Aphra while munching on a piece of dried fish.",
    ["NpcInfo_61124"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> Strung and Wolton are cousins who grew up together. As Strung watched his cousin Wolton learn weapon crafting since a young age, he too developed a deep interest for weapons. However, in order to avoid competing with his own kin, Strung specializes in weapon upgrades.\n<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> \"How can the weapons of great heroes be left in their primitive forged state? I can make great improvements for your weapons!\" Strung says proudly, thumping his chest.",
    ["NpcInfo_6112401"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> Perhaps a stubborn personality like Strung's makes him naturally suited for a career in upgrading weapons, which requires both passion and concentration. From his first exposure to weapon upgrading, he has displayed extraordinary talent and is even more careful and focused in casting than his cousin.",
    ["NpcInfo_6112402"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> To improve his skill in weapon upgrading, Strung quickly became obsessed with collecting different ores and studying their effects in upgrading weapons. Perhaps even Wolton could not have thought his bubbly cousin capable of putting so much effort into studying his craft.",
    ["NpcInfo_6112403"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> \"Ahem. Upgrading weapons is not just a matter of inlaying some jewels. Upgrading a good weapon to improve its compatibility with its user is the highest achievement in weapon upgrading,\" Strung says seriously after clearing his throat.",
    ["NpcInfo_61125"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> Bernie is a natural master of persuasion, always making honeyed words sound like music to people's ears and convincing all customers who come to have their armor upgraded that his work deserves a higher price.\n<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> \"You should know that the man standing before you is the best armor upgrader in all Alberta. Such a price is already the lowest possible,\" says Bernie with sincerity glittering in his eyes, thoroughly convincing the listener.",
    ["NpcInfo_6112501"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> In fact, Bernie's armor upgrading does include his own unique techniques. However, to raise more funds for pet food, Bernie still resorts to using his lavish language skills to increase all his fees by just a tiny bit.",
    ["NpcInfo_6112502"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> Bernie has no interest in romance, but he is dedicated to his pet. The hamster Rolle, who has been with him for years, is not just his mount. To Bernie, Rolle is his friend of many years. Bernie himself can skimp on food, but Rolle's food must be branded goods of the best quality.",
    ["NpcInfo_6112503"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> Bernie has no interest in romance, but he is dedicated to his pet. The hamster Rolle, who has been with him for years, is not just his mount. To Bernie, Rolle is his friend of many years. Bernie himself can skimp on food, but Rolle's food must be branded goods of the best quality.\n<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> \"Rolle, oh Rolle, have you put on weight again? Seems like you'll have to go on a diet soon. Otherwise, you'll end up stuck outside the door,\" says Bernie with a grin and stroking Rolle's back.",
    ["NpcInfo_6112601"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> Octavia believes that beauty in this world has no fixed form. It can be infused into any piece of furniture, clothing, or accessory. Therefore, no one should ever be able to find a fixed style in her designs because having no style is her style.",
    ["NpcInfo_6112602"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> \"There are no standards to beauty, just like how in accessory upgrading, there is no absolute good or bad. Perhaps Payon's people may find a design ugly, but Alberta's citizens may appreciate it.\" Octavia looks intently at the crystal accessory in her hands.",
    ["NpcInfo_6112603"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> Due to her habit of visiting various places for sightseeing and finding inspiration, Octavia has become great friends with Captain Carew, despite their age difference. They often chat about the customs and cultures of different places, and Captain Carew occasionally brings Octavia some inspiring art pieces from his voyages.",
    ["NpcInfo_61129"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> To get closer to her crush, Doreen, who has been secretly infatuated with Hugo since childhood, also studied smelting and upgrades and specialized in jewelry. However, Hugo with his stiff personality has never been able to pick up on Doreen's flirtations. \"Even the shiniest accessories are nowhere near as dazzling as Hugo...\" Doreen said in a daze, holding a ring in her hand and looking at the nearby figure.",
    ["NpcInfo_6112901"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> Doreen was a silent child. She had few friends and was the most introverted girl in all of Payon—that was until Usken and Hugo appeared. The naturally outgoing Usken and the righteous Hugo rescued Doreen from her loneliness. Ever since then, they have been Payon's unbreakable trio.",
    ["NpcInfo_6112902"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> Unlike Usken, who is jolly all day long, Hugo's silent, elegant manner made Doreen feel more than just close childhood friendship toward him. Although he himself hasn't noticed, Usken's radar detected her crush immediately.",
    ["NpcInfo_6112903"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> \"Usken, give my ring back to me!\" Doreen's anxious face flushed bright red as she embarrassedly evaded Hugo's line of sight. 'That Usken, he knows I designed this ring for Hugo! He's clearly doing this on purpose!'",
    ["NpcInfo_61130"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> The taciturn Broll is shrouded in mystery from head to foot, deterring everyone from approaching him casually. Apart from occasionally asking for information when he is upgrading a weapon for someone, Broll is like an air conditioner on silent mode at other times, for people will practically feel drafts blowing even before getting near him. \"There isn't much to say,\" says Broll, looking up for a moment before switching back to his poker face once more.",
    ["NpcInfo_6113001"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> Broll is often puzzled as to why Kennan on the opposite side is always surrounded by so many people. The constant chatter is so annoying, and isn't he supposed to be a blacksmith who upgrades armor? What could there possibly be to talk about so much? Although it seems Kennan isn't too happy about it either. However, as long as these girls don't disturb Broll's work, he will turn a blind eye.",
    ["NpcInfo_6113002"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color>Perhaps because Broll and Kennan are too close to each other, some of Kennan's fans soon discovered this handsome blacksmith with a chilly aura. A fan once tried to take a photo of Broll, but she dropped and broke her camera after Broll shot a chilly glare in her direction.",
    ["NpcInfo_6113003"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> \"It wasn't a glare. I just glanced at her. I don't have time to lose my temper at a little girl over of a photo. Can't you see the pile of weapons I still have to finish upgrading?\" replies Broll coldly. This was his longest statement in the past month.",
    ["NpcInfo_61131"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> Kennan, an Adonis well-known in Geffen, has a popularity only rivaled by Hollgrehenn, the \"Greatest Blacksmith.\" Kennan's supporters' group and Hollgrehenn's fan club have the same strict management structure and application requirements. However, Kennan himself does not care for it much. \"I'm just a blacksmith who upgrades armor. You guys really shouldn't spend that much time on me,\" says Kennan, glancing at the onlooking crowd in resignation as he shakes his head.",
    ["NpcInfo_6113101"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> Although Kennan has gradually become used to the cheers of his supporters' group, he is still occasionally given a fright. For example, the birthday chorus sung in complete harmony the moment he opened his door on his birthday gave him quite a turn. He was actually rushing out and even had a shoe in his hand.",
    ["NpcInfo_6113102"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> Kennan's supporters' group's activities are not limited to occasionally surprising Kennan. They sometimes also put up adverts under Geffen Tower, making passersby wonder just who the cheesy shoutout \"Yo! Yo! Check it out! Geffen's Kennan is the best, no doubt!\" is meant for.",
    ["NpcInfo_6113103"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> Perhaps because his incredible popularity has drawn him more attention and interest, his armor upgrading business is increasingly known further afield, and many girls from other cities, attracted by his fame, come to ask him to upgrade their armor. \"Upgrading armor is fine of course, but can you guys turn off the camera flash? I can't work like this,\" says Kennan, resignedly shielding his eyes with his hand.",
    ["NpcInfo_61132"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> Alexia is the youngest child in the family and has been a mischievous troublemaker since a young age, though no one has ever reprimanded her. Perhaps it is just such an environment of freedom which allowed Alexia to grow up into the most creative accessory upgrader, perfectly combining Geffen's magic and the art of accessory upgrading.\n<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> \"If I catch that guy bullying girls again, I'll add a little somethin' somethin' into his accessory!\" Sometimes, when Alexia sees arrogant bullies, her mischievous soul is let loose once more.",
    ["NpcInfo_6113201"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> Perhaps because there are already two excellent mages in the family, Alexia has never received any pressure from them and can do what she likes according to her free-spirited nature. Even when it comes to playing pranks, her sister will always cover for her. Despite her love of pranks, though, Alexia is still a good child.",
    ["NpcInfo_6113202"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> The extremely righteous Alexia hates bullying with a vengeance. Once, to stop a repulsive middle-aged man from making advances on Priscilla, Alexia actually threw her favorite ring at him. The enchanted ring left that rogue trembling all over for a good while.",
    ["NpcInfo_6113203"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> Alexia made a name for herself in this fight, and ever since then, the girls in Geffen have gained another option for self defense—upgrading their accessories into anti-pervert weapons. However, Alexia's popularity with the opposite sex plummeted. After all, most people don't like the idea that their girlfriend might be secretly carrying an offensive weapon.",
    ["NpcInfo_61133"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> The first 10 years of Gerald's life were ruled by regularity and proceeded at a steady pace. However, just as he was learning about upgrade techniques, he met the biggest uncertainty in his life—Matilda. Since then, his life has been full of uncertainty. If Matilda hasn't broken his hammer one day, then she may appear outside his door looking pitiful and begging for financial assistance again the next. However, for Gerald, who was very quiet in his childhood days, it seems to be a joy of life.\n<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> \"That Matilda... Is there a day she doesn't get into trouble?\" sighs Gerald with his head resting in his hands.",
    ["NpcInfo_6113301"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> People's impression of Gerald has always been that of a hardworking and reliable blacksmith. Only Gerald himself knows that, since meeting Matilda, he has gone further and further down the path of being an emergency relief worker. When they were young, it was helping Matilda locate her lost metal materials. Now that they have grown up, it is paying Matilda's rent, which may have been either lost or spent.",
    ["NpcInfo_6113302"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> If Gerald is asked why he's always taking care of Matilda, he himself may not even have an answer. Perhaps it is because when they were young, she was the first to offer a hand every time he fell down, or perhaps it is because, in spite of her current extravagance, she still remembers to buy him birthday cakes. Whatever the case may be, that's how friends are, and neither will really desert the other because of these trivialities.",
    ["NpcInfo_6113303"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> \"I'm giving you three more chances this month. I'll only lend you money three more times at max. It's time you learned to save up.\" Gerald looks at Matilda in resignation as she stands swinging her arms. He is by no means a rich man, so he cannot keep lending her Zeny like an ATM.",
    ["NpcInfo_61135"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> Matilda's life motto is to enjoy life. However, being incapable of resisting the urge to buy anything that takes her fancy, Matilda has not been able to make ends meet for a long time and occasionally turns to her good friend Gerald in emergencies.\n<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> \"Life should be spent living in the moment. Carpe diem! Leave tomorrow's worries to tomorrow!\" says Matilda as she adjusts her hair in front of the mirror, turning her head left and right. The 3,000 Zeny she had just pocketed was immediately exchanged for a shiny piece of headgear.",
    ["NpcInfo_6113501"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> Actually, as a premium accessory upgrader, Matilda's income is fairly substantial. However, she seems incapable of resisting the urge to spend, and more than half of the piles of things at home are items which only had her favor for a few days before being cast aside to gather dust in the corner.",
    ["NpcInfo_6113502"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> Fortunately, when Matilda was young, she found a meal ticket—Gerald, her friend who was studying accessory upgrading together with her. Matilda decided to become great friends with Gerald the first time she saw him simply because he looked as though he was quite good with saving Zeny. And Gerald has indeed not disappointed her.",
    ["NpcInfo_6113503"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> Gerald, an introvert since childhood, can never imagine that his first friend took a liking to him for his economic sensibility. \"Dear Gerald, I was passing by the clothing store when I saw a black and green suit that would look really good on you. But... Can you...\" \"How much Zeny do you need?\" replies Gerald, cutting Matilda off without even looking up.",
    ["NpcInfo_61138"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> Dazzling jewelry holds no attraction for Rosha. She only draws inspiration from spiked steel gloves, bloodstained roses, and other macabre items.\n\"Accessories with stories are far more attractive, don't you think?\" asks Rosha as she fiddles with a piece of steel that she had just found on a monster carcass. Perhaps some new headgear is about to be created.",
    ["NpcInfo_6113801"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> Even though they are great friends who grew up in the same orphanage, Rosha has been the complete opposite of the cute and lovely Sheila since they were children. While Sheila is bright and cheerful, desiring a happily-ever-after, Rosha has always been drawn to things with an aura of mystery and darkness, with many of the accessories she has designed being inspired by horror stories.",
    ["NpcInfo_6113802"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> \"Only optimistic little fools like you believe in happy endings where Cinderella and the Prince live happily ever after,\" Rosha says, looking at Sheila who is devouring a copy of \"Rebirth of a Pampered Maid,\" before rolling her eyes again. \"Rosha, don't be so negative. You'll only meet a prince if you're optimistic and positive! That's how it is in books!\" replies Sheila, smiling sweetly at Rosha.",
    ["NpcInfo_6113803"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> \"In this world, if a princess with a distinguished lineage is not what a prince likes, then it must be a powerful witch capable of creating illusions,\" Rosha shakes her head and turns the punk skeleton on the table around. \"I think these skeletons are much better.\"",
    ["NpcInfo_61145"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> The naturally timid Lethi blushes whenever she speaks to customers, but her shyness has gained her a following amongst the new arrivals on Izlude Island all the same. After all, who wouldn't be fond of a gentle and beautiful lady?\n\"Erm... Please don't crowd around me. There are so many of you. I... I don't know who to listen to first.\" When faced with the new academy students swarming around her, Lethi can only try to back away.",
    ["NpcInfo_6114501"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> Because of her strict upbringing, Lethi always speaks with a low and gentle voice. Her social circle is solely made up of the students in the academy and she blushes easily when she converses with strangers. Therefore, her friends have given her the nickname \"Strawberry.\"",
    ["NpcInfo_6114502"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> However, recently, each time Lethi finds herself overwhelmed by a large group of new students, the nearby enchanter, Elvira, will silently place herself in front of her, wait for order to resume among the students, and then depart again without a word, giving Lethi only a simple nod in acknowledgment. Lethi is sure that she doesn't know this enchanter. Why is she helping her then?",
    ["NpcInfo_6114503"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> What Lethi doesn't know is that a few years ago when she was still a student of Criatura Academy, she gave her water bottle to an exhausted masked traveler who had collapsed in the desert during a sandstorm in Morroc. That traveler has kept that bottle engraved with Lethi's name until now, and has made her way to Izlude Island, where she is now silently repaying Lethi's kindness from a distance in her own way.",
    ["NpcInfo_61146"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> Collecting all sorts of weird and quirky oddities has been Sampson's hobby since childhood. If his collection were to be put on display in its entirety, it may possibly stretch from Prontera's Central Fountain all the way to the Amusement Park.\n\"The value of those materials is immeasurable. They can all become priceless treasures if they're put to good use,\" says Sampson as he picks up a piece of iron from under a shrub.",
    ["NpcInfo_6114601"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> A normal person walking into Sampson's room will immediately be scared out of it again, for it is not only full of common materials, but also creepy things like Bat Wings and Thief Bug Shells.",
    ["NpcInfo_6114602"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> However, Sampson has no qualms about sharing the same bed with these items. \"Look, this decoration was made by stringing Animal Eyeballs together. Hanging it on the headboard creates quite a unique ambiance, doesn't it?\" Sampson will remark, looking on at the stiffening smile of his visitor with satisfaction.",
    ["NpcInfo_6114603"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> The most remarkable item in Sampson's vast collection is an Orc outfit that he picked up from Orc Village. He proudly displays this outfit in the most prominent place in his house. \"Look at that texture, so closely resembling animal fur. Not everyone can come by such a precious find.\"",
    ["NpcInfo_6114701"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> Jude always keeps his goods neat and tidy, dusts his materials with great care each day. To him, guaranteeing the quality of the items he's selling is an important aspect of trade, and keeping those items free from any dust is showing respect to the trade itself.",
    ["NpcInfo_6114702"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> Jude comes from the bustling capital of Prontera and received a fine education as a nobleman and gentleman since childhood. Even though his family has fallen on hard times and he followed his parents to Morroc to expand the business and begin afresh, he still holds himself to the standards of a gentleman.",
    ["NpcInfo_6114703"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> \"Manners are of the greatest importance in this land. It has nothing to do with poverty or wealth. It is a basic attitude,\" says Jude gently as he sips his tea, his posture akin to that of a nobleman sitting in a high-class restaurant in Prontera.",
    ["NpcInfo_61148"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> Despite having grown up in the port city of Alberta, Elysia has acquired none of the characteristics that people associate with an Alberta local—optimism, cheerfulness, and a carefree attitude. Elysia is the typical pessimist, storing food at all times to be used in case of disaster. \"You can only survive a disaster if you are thoroughly prepared at every moment. The same goes for a powerful guild. Having a stockpile of materials prepared all the time is the way to go,\" says Elysia in complete seriousness.",
    ["NpcInfo_6114801"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> Perhaps because she was deeply influenced by an encounter with an astrologist when she was young, Elysia has always paid extra attention to mysterious phenomena and legends about ancient civilizations. She tries to tell her own fortune every day before heading out so as to be sure which will be her lucky direction that day.",
    ["NpcInfo_6114802"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> \"How well your business fares is intimately connected with your lucky color, lucky direction, and even the weather for that day. Don't underestimate these things, or else misfortune may befall you,\" explains Elysia seriously to Rachel, who is standing not far off.",
    ["NpcInfo_6114803"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> Perhaps because Elysia's belief in the supernatural is quite well-known, sometimes Hayden the fishing gear merchant casually asks her about his lucky direction of the day. However, for several times in succession, Hayden has found that he did actually get a few more orders than usual after listening to Elysia. Perhaps Elysia really does know something about astrology after all.",
    ["NpcInfo_61149"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> Perhaps because she grew up in Payon, the city of nature, Charlene possesses the innate ability to become close with any person or animal. \"Sincerity is essential in business. There is no man who can't be moved by a heart full of sincerity. If there is, move him to his grave,\" says Charlene with a smile, batting her eyelashes. Nobody knows whether she is joking or being serious.",
    ["NpcInfo_6114901"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> Charlene has spent her time between monsters and the villagers of Payon since childhood. Her bubbly and cheerful appearance won over the hearts of the villagers with ease. However, there was an incident of a crying child who complained to his father that Charlene had scared him with a spider. No one believed him, of course.",
    ["NpcInfo_6114902"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> When Charlene recalls this incident, she does not deny it. \"Actually, it was Won Bo who accidentally left a spider on my materials. I merely put it into his pocket to return it to him. I didn't mean to frighten him,\" says Charlene, smiling innocently.",
    ["NpcInfo_6114903"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> Occasionally, Charlene gazes in the direction of the Payon General's residence absentmindedly. Tamdia, being the busybody he is, once asked her if she had a crush on Lee Hyuk, who stood at the gate of the residence. Charlene grinned at him, replying, \"Well in that case, since you spend all day looking at Jakdal, shall I help you with your confession?\"",
    ["NpcInfo_61150"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> Yuri came to Geffen, the city of magic, from Payon and is curious about every single thing. After all, in Payon where nature is most respected, you won't find materials and food enhanced with magic wherever you go.\n<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> \"I'm excited to know what value these materials can bring to our guild!\" exclaims Yuri, his cheery face full of excitement.",
    ["NpcInfo_6115001"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> \"How many types of Geffen cuisine have you tried? Had a bite of Nicola's new recipe yet?\" Yuri can never control his impulse to chatter away with customers, like a naive and curious child.",
    ["NpcInfo_6115002"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> Whenever Yuri has some spare time, he spends it strolling around Geffen. Whether it is checking out Ingael's hats or trying Nicola's new recipes, the energetic Yuri will not be found wasting a single moment.",
    ["NpcInfo_6115003"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> Charlene of Payon is Yuri's cousin. She has only one thing to say about Yuri leaving Payon to set up a business in Geffen. \"Ever since darling Yuri left, the elderly in the village must have been feeling rather lonely. There's no one to listen to their stories and chat with them all day now.\"",
    ["NpcInfo_61151"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> When Arthail was young, his greatest wish was to join the Kingdom Defense Force. Sadly, his innate Vitality was too weak and he didn't even pass the first round of selection. Left with no alternative, he joined the Serpentrod Group and went on to provide equipment and materials for the Defense Force.",
    ["NpcInfo_6115101"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> \"We are the best suppliers for the Kingdom Defense Force. To uphold the honor of the Kingdom, I only bring in the very best of materials to my warehouse.\" Arthail gazes proudly at the Defense Force base, as if he was a member too.",
    ["NpcInfo_6115102"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> Children in Prontera are taught to learn from the Kingdom Defense Force from a young age, and Arthail is perhaps one of those best educated in this tradition. Even after joining the Serpentrod Group, he did his best to make the collaboration between the Defense Force and the Group possible.",
    ["NpcInfo_6115103"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> Arthail may always appear strict and upright, but he's actually endearingly silly in daily life, often spotted wearing odd socks. \"Ahahaha! I didn't notice. I was in a hurry to leave the house today,\" Arthail will admit sheepishly, unconsciously drawing his legs back a little.",
    ["NpcInfo_61152"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> \"A woman should maintain her elegance at all times. Nothing's worth making a fuss over.\" The silver-haired Daphne is the dream lover of many young assassins. She always looks so indifferent, but every now and then, a smile as charming as a Mandragora plays on her lips. Who could have guessed that this graceful lady who can keep her presence of mind at all times used to be the most mysterious shadow assassin in the Assassins Guild? \"Shh. Say no more of the past.\" she says with a wink before turning back to her materials.",
    ["NpcInfo_6115201"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> Many versions of Daphne's legend exist. The most commonly believed one has it that she used to be a top shadow assassin who went after lawless robbers in the desert. However, it is unknown why Daphne now has not a hint of an assassin's air about her, and is all grace and gentleness instead.",
    ["NpcInfo_6115202"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> Some say that Daphne had been gravely injured in a battle and was rescued by a passing merchant. To repay that merchant's kindness of saving her life, Daphne gave up her dangerous career to help him manage his business.",
    ["NpcInfo_6115203"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> \"Tales are merely tales. The truth is always much simpler. Perhaps I was just tired, and wished to live as an ordinary woman,\" Daphne smiles, shaking her head. She glances at the goods in her hands and smiles subtly at the nearby boys trying to sneak a peek at her.",
    ["NpcInfo_61153"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> Jeff, born and raised in Payon, has no wish to ever leave his home again. The bustle of Prontera and the fantasy of Geffen cannot compare to the refreshing nature of Payon. To each passing adventurer, Jeff can't help giving some advice. \"Upgrading your equipment's quality is essential to protecting the lands of Payon.\"",
    ["NpcInfo_6115301"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> Jeff has been to various places in Midgard for business. However, after ten years of traveling, he finally decided to return to Payon. He might have recalled his grandpa's words, telling him that Payon's natural environment was a haven for the long-term development of mankind. Of course, it could also have been that he missed someone, and wished to see the young girl of his memories.",
    ["NpcInfo_6115302"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> When he first left Payon, he remembered Yuna as a young girl who had often pestered him to go fishing. By the time he returned, that bubbly young girl had grown into an eloquent little blacksmith. He knew that life hadn't been easy for her all these years, and nobody saw the trials she had endured hidden behind her brilliant smile.",
    ["NpcInfo_6115303"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> Jeff, young and reckless back then, had left Payon in spite of his family's objections. Three years later, his sister and brother-in-law both died in an accidental fire, leaving behind the young Yuna. By the time Jeff returned to Payon, Yuna had brought herself up and became a well-known craftsperson of accessories. \"I won't let Yuna face any difficulty alone again,\" says Jeff as he clenches his fists.",
    ["NpcInfo_61154"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> Priscilla's sweet voice and lovely appearance have won her the hearts of many Geffen mages, and her sales performance in the Serpentrod Group has been improving day by day. The sweet-toothed Priscilla forgets she is at work whenever she sees a donut. \"Materials enhanced with magic are like chocolate donuts sprinkled with colorful jelly beans!\" Who can resist Priscilla's childlike enthusiasm for donuts?",
    ["NpcInfo_6115401"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> When Priscilla is in a good mood, she makes herself desserts, such as puddings, lemon cakes, and even chocolate donuts. However, it seems her skills are extremely erratic, and occasionally, clouds of black smoke drift out from her kitchen.",
    ["NpcInfo_6115402"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> If Priscilla's dress happens to be stained by jam during breakfast in the morning, then the mages of Geffen typically find Priscilla without a hint of smiles for the rest of that day. Dark clouds seem to hover around her and no one dares approach. Normality only resumes after she changes into a new dress the next day.",
    ["NpcInfo_6115403"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> \"La la la! If I manage to sell five more materials today, I'll reward myself with strawberry pudding!\" thinks Priscilla, smiling energetically at the passing adventurers.",
    ["NpcInfo_61159"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> The turning point in Enchanter Benjiah's life happened when he arrived at Alberta. Benjiah, who was originally from the desert, was shocked when he first laid eyes on the sea. He couldn't believe that there was a place more vast than the desert.\n\"Although the magnificence of the desert is amazing, but after experiencing the desert wind for so long, I would like to experience the sea breeze more,\" thought Benjiah as he looked towards the endless sea and closed his eyes contentedly.",
    ["NpcInfo_6115901"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> Benjiah grew up in the deepest part of Sograt Desert and was used to seeing vicious monsters. He had traveled across the whole continent and was hardly surprised by anything new anymore, but all that changed when he arrived in Alberta. The vastness of the sea touched him deeply.",
    ["NpcInfo_6115902"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> Benjiah started his life as an enchanter in Alberta. He always felt he would see different sights and sceneries in Alberta. For example, while he was watching the sea alone during sunset, Nastia who was drinking red wine came into view. It was a sight that he couldn't forget.",
    ["NpcInfo_6115903"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> Benjiah tried to get closer to Nastia but found that there was always a hint of sadness that shrouded her persona and separated her from the rest of the world. Even when she was smiling, she seemed distant. \"Maybe I am not the person who can unlock her heart,\" a disappointed Benjiah thought.",
    ["NpcInfo_61160"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> Master Enchanter Nastia settled down in the seaside city Alberta as enjoying a drink in the sea breeze is her favorite pastime. \"The attraction of enchanting can only be understood after you experience it for yourself. Just like the feeling of getting tipsy, words cannot describe it,\" said Nastia with a drunk blush and a slight smile.",
    ["NpcInfo_6116001"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> You can always catch Nastia with a bottle of wine at the harbor during dusk. Some say she is waiting for her lover who is out at sea while some say it is just because she loves Alberta's sunset. No matter what, Nastia would always smile mysteriously and say, \"Don't you think that the sea breeze and wine are a perfect match?\"",
    ["NpcInfo_6116002"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> The ex-lady boss of Sapphire Blue Tavern always keeps some red wine that was specially brewed for Nastia. Every time she mentions Nastia, she can't help but sigh, \"Nastia used to be such a bubbly and outgoing girl. Such a pity...\"",
    ["NpcInfo_6116003"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> Throughout the year, the only time that Nastia doesn't drink is during winter. Once, someone saw Nastia alone in the snow looking out at the harbor. \"It's snowing again. You said you'd be back before the snow to help me warm my wine...\" She looked rather lonely as she whispered to herself.",
    ["NpcInfo_61161"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color>Mewcia from Meow Island. She's been in love with the coastal city Alberta since she felt the charm of the ocean. You can see her coming and going from time to time.\n<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color>“I clouldn't choose between Alberta's sunset and sunrise...”Mewcia said while drawing a circle with her claw, “...If I didn't have to get up so early, I'd watch them both~”",
    ["NpcInfo_6116101"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color>Mewcia is famous among her family for being tender and cute. She's talented at enchanting, however she's often indecisive, and it can take her a day just to choose what shoes to wear.",
    ["NpcInfo_6116102"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color>One of the most decisive decisions Mewcia ever made was to settle in Alberta, as sh loves the ocean even more than dried fish. \"Alberta's dried fish is fresher anyway, and I get to see the beautiful scenery everyday.\" Mewcia thought happily.",
    ["NpcInfo_6116103"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color>Mewcia sometimes goes to Izlude to see her brother Mewkus. The island scenery of Izlude is different from that of Alberta. Mewcia prefers the buildings in Alberta, but it's nice to be around the natural island scenery of Izlude sometimes.",
    ["NpcInfo_61162"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> The bustle of new academy students made Blake feel that he had made the right choice in coming to Izlude Island. The air of youthfulness that filled the island instilled in him a sense of positivity. \"Although it's the same old enchanting job, work has more meaning to it when you're in a place with a good atmosphere,\" said Blake with a contented smile.",
    ["NpcInfo_6116201"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> Forced by circumstances, Blake lived through many bloodied years of being a bounty hunter when he was young. Maybe it was because he was so used to seeing death and murder, when he arrived at Izude Island and saw so many young faces, he felt a weird tug on his heartstrings. He thought it might be time for him to change his job.",
    ["NpcInfo_6116202"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> Blake stayed in Izlude and started a new journey as an enchanter once more. Everything to him now looked peaceful and beautiful. Be it the uniform of the academy students or the unique Izlude cuisine, they all filled him with unspeakable happiness.",
    ["NpcInfo_6116203"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> Apart from enchanting, Blake's favorite pastime is to look for Hayden, a fishing gear merchant in Alberta, over the weekends. He'd ask for tips and purchase fishing gear from Hayden. \"Oh gosh, how could I have missed out on something so interesting for so many years! I've got to make up for it now,\" mumbled Blake to himself while fiddling with the fishing rod in his hands.",
    ["NpcInfo_61163"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> As a renowned Armor Master Enchanter in the continent, Elvira chose to start her business in Izude where new academy students gather. \"It is precisely because young adventurers lack experience that they need stronger armor.\" Elvira seems to have placed that responsibility upon herself, or maybe it is just because there is someone important here.",
    ["NpcInfo_6116301"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> Before becoming a Master Enchanter, Elvira's dream was to become an independent wanderer. She once tried to journey through the Sograt Desert alone, but she encountered a huge sandstorm and lost all sources of water. Just as she thought she was going to spend her last waking moments among snakes and sand, a passing adventurer saved her and gave Elvira her water bottle.",
    ["NpcInfo_6116302"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> A disoriented Elvira could not remember how her savior looked like but fortunately, the water bottle had Criatura Academy's unique badge and her name, Lethi, on it.",
    ["NpcInfo_6116303"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> Elvira decided that Izlude Island would be the last stop of her journey because there was where Criatura Academy was situated. She was confident that she would find that young adventurer and repay her. \"Lethi, what a beautiful name.\"",
    ["NpcInfo_61164"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> When Mewkus from Meow Island first set foot on Izlude Island and saw all the new academy students that were gathered there, he couldn't help but exclaimed, \"Humans actually managed to create such an interesting academy...\" Mewkus stroked his beard and decided to stay and observe further.",
    ["NpcInfo_6116401"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> Mewkus was the most passionate about academia among his clan. Compared to the genius of Mewlande, Mewkus was an academic who conducted his research seriously. So when he heard that Izlude Island had an adventurer academy built by humans, he couldn't resist visiting it.",
    ["NpcInfo_6116402"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> \"Meow Island could really learn from Criatura Academy. Our enchanting skills should be systematically passed down just like this,\" thought Mewkus while scribbling down notes and contemplating about how to approach this subject with the clan elders.",
    ["NpcInfo_6116403"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> Mewkus's cousin, Mewsha, who stays in Alberta visits him occasionally. However, Mewkus thinks her visits are just excuses for her to come see Izude's sights. After all, everyone in the clan knows how much of a fan Mewsha is of the sea.",
    ["NpcInfo_61165"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> If Sipera could be said to have had any regrets in life, it would certainly be that she had become a merchant too early in life and missed out on years in the academy. That's why when she came to Izlude Island and saw the new students coming and going, she couldn't help but stay.\n\"Ah! How lovely youth is! Even the air is fragrant with the scent of dreams!\" Sipera exclaims, lifting her head and drawing in a deep breath.",
    ["NpcInfo_6116501"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> Perhaps it is because she started life as a merchant far too early, she doesn't have many childhood friends, and is therefore always very envious of the friendship between young adventurers. Every time she sees a group of adventurers reporting in, she can never resist excitedly giving them student discounts.",
    ["NpcInfo_6116502"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> Each time Russell of the Serpentrod Group hears about how easily Sipera gives these discounts away, he cannot help but moan, \"It's all thanks to selfish sellers like her who don't care about their peers that profit margins in the whole industry are shrinking.\" However, Sipera doesn't agree. How can Zeny compare to the friendship of young adventurers?",
    ["NpcInfo_6116503"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> \"Sweet little things, please don't argue! The friendships formed in your student years are the most precious. If only I hadn't... Oh, how I envy you!\" Sipera says, covering her face and looking as if she is moved to tears. The new students who were arguing a moment ago are alarmed, fleeing immediately after a glance at each other. \"Ah, sweet youth.\"",
    ["NpcInfo_61166"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> As Prontera's only male hairstylist, Chester proclaims himself as an encyclopedia of the fashion world and has a hand in the latest trends of every season.\n\"You have to follow the minutest changes in fashion trends to be a first-class hairstylist,\" says Chester with a snap of the fingers as he adjusts the new fringe he designed.",
    ["NpcInfo_6116601"]="Rather than becoming a famous adventurer, Chester has always cared more about whether his clothes, style, and hair are at the forefront of fashion. Naturally, he began a career in hairstyling.",
    ["NpcInfo_6116602"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> While Vera specializes in hair color, Chester is more concerned about the overall styling of the haircut. \"Color is useless without a good style. Could you possibly think that pink choppy bangs are fashionable?\"",
    ["NpcInfo_6116603"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> Vera and Chester are stylists of equal fame in Prontera, and are on somewhat acrimonious terms. It is hard to imagine that they were an enviable couple just a few years ago. The reason for their breakup was Chester criticizing a new hair dye Vera had come up with as being old-fashioned.",
    ["NpcInfo_61172"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> A mysterious artist from another world. He immediately won the hearts of everyone with his amazing voice when he arrived at Rose Red Tavern. He is undoubtedly what people call a heartthrob. He is always seen with a black skateboard and seems to be exploring the endless possibilities of this vast continent. He became good friends with Morts the bard after a musical showdown.\n<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> On the stage, Jimmy Lin smiles with confidence as he says, \"If the unpredictability of the future stops you from moving forward, then you have halved your chances of achieving your dreams!\"",
    ["NpcInfo_6117201"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> Jimmy Lin once told Young, the Mount Merchant, that he was a racer back in his own world. A \"race car\" seems to be a type of mount with speed comparable to using a Fly Wing. Jimmy Lin seems to be collecting these race car models!",
    ["NpcInfo_6117202"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> There's a rumor circulating that Jimmy Lin has recently been obsessed with cooking. But the source of this rumor comes from the lady boss of Rose Red Tavern, Isabella Trista. \"Our dearest heartthrob singer has been frequently researching recipes at the tavern recently. His look of concentration always sweeps our customers off their feet!\" Isabella played with her hair as she smiled in resignation.",
    ["NpcInfo_6117203"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> \"I could feel that Jimmy was extraordinary even when I first met him! The music from his world was pretty interesting as well.\" Arielle the Music Fairy has never hidden that she thinks highly of Jimmy Lin's talent. After all, a bosom friend that shares an understanding of music is hard to come by.",
    ["NpcInfo_61190"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color>When Kayden was born and showed his extraordinary talent for making trouble, the troublesome Heine Family Unicorn eventually become troublemaking twin. “If the ability to cause trouble is also included in the heir’s selection criteria, then I must be the most suitable heir to the throne!\"",
    ["NpcInfo_6119001"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color>There is a magical telepathic connection between Kayden and Beth, so when they play hide-and-seek to decide who are in charge, it's always hard to tell. “I don't want to be tied to my sister all the time, I'm a man!\" Kayden asked the chieftain for a way to release the telepathic connection. “The chieftain said that as long as my sister and I complete the Glast Heim quests, he will consider my plea to separate us.”",
    ["NpcInfo_6119002"]="\n<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color>Actually, Kayden does not hate his sister. He just couldn’t figure out why he and his sister have the exact same enchantment mindset, when it's clear that he's a weapon enchanter and Beth is a defense enchanter. “I’m afraid that one day I'll fall for a girl and then find out that my sister likes her too.\" Kayden was very worried. “And, of course, it could be that we both fall for the same boy at the same time.\"",
    ["NpcInfo_6119003"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color>What Kayden doesn’t know is that the people in Glast Heim like them, and their vitality and vibrancy is changing the Glast Heim little by little. “The people here don't seem to mind the trouble we make, they even give us clear water and candies.” Kayden scratched his head. “Is my charm that great? Hey Adventurer, you like me too right?”",
    ["NpcInfo_61191"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color>As a member of the Heine family, Beth discovered his talent in enchantment since his childhood. After careful consideration, she chose to be a defense enchanter. “Kayden was so cute when he was little, biting his finger and calling me…”",
    ["NpcInfo_6119101"]="\n<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color>Because of the telepathic connection with Kayden, Beth acted as a baby translator at a very young age. As Kayden gradually became able to speak, Beth's role changed from a baby translator to a teacher. “I want a life of my own!” Beth told Kayden through the telepathic connection. “So you'll have to deliver the love letters yourself, deliver mine, too, by the way.\"",
    ["NpcInfo_6119102"]="\n<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color>Beth had prepared a gorgeous gown for her coming-of-age ceremony. The gown was changed into a war dress.” Although the two were confined together after the coming-age ceremony. “ the wall couldn't prevent telepathy or stop Beth from making the day of her release the day of her true adulthood.",
    ["NpcInfo_6119103"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color>Beth loves everything about the Glast Heim, including the broken statues, the dried-up fountains, and the ghostly spirits. ‘History cannot be called history if it has not been annihilated in time, just as defensive armor cannot be called armor before it withstands attacks. I hope to see more things in the Glast Heim that are different, dangerous, deadly, whatever, and then I will defeat them one by one and guard those who should be guarded, like Adventurers?",
    ["NpcInfo_61192"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color>Meoffel from Cat Island is a famous accessory enchanting merchant and melee expert. “You get what you pay for, and no forgeries shall escape my sight!” Meoffel shows his sharp claws. “The reason I learned to fight is to reason with unreasonable customers meow!”",
    ["NpcInfo_6119201"]="\n<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color>Long years of fighting experience has given Meoffel unusually sharp claws, which are useful for digging up treasures. He has established a good working relationship with the Eden Group stationed here, sometimes by helping them excavate some small and delicate objects, and sometimes by identifying the enchantment stats on small objects. In return, Meoffel has learned a lot about archaeology from humans. “I really love this place, meow! I might stay here for a long time!” When writing to his friends on Cat Island, Meoffel has enclosed a Glast Heim Coin in his letter.",
    ["NpcInfo_6119202"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color>According to the age calculation on Cat Island, Meoffel is a cat that has just entered his middle age. “I'm in my prime!” Meoffel pointed to the white fur on his head. “I'm not old or bald! This side part hairstyle makes me more handsome when I run!” After going through his rebellious youth, Meoffel's obsession with being handsome seems to focus on his hairstyle. For him, a trendy hairstyle is as attractive as shiny gold coins. Meoffel did try to dye his hair, but it didn't fit his aesthetic standard of “being outstanding while dressing down”.",
    ["NpcInfo_6119203"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color>In Glast Heim, Meoffel's favorite spot is the Quiet Back Garden. He had planned to camp here, but was talked out of it by the Eden Group. “They say there's something unusual here at night. Could it be… a ghost? But I won't leave here until I find the Glast Heim’s treasures!\" Meoffel excitedly held up a jeweled cufflink. “An intricate and ornate style like this probably belongs to the Royal House of Schmidt! The enchantment it wears is… Shadow?” Meoffel lying face down on the ground, both ears alertly pricked up, as if listening for sounds underground. “Adventurer, do you really want to explore alone?”",
    ["NpcInfo_61217"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> A mysterious artist from another world. He immediately won the hearts of everyone with his amazing voice when he arrived at Rose Red Tavern. He is undoubtedly what people call a heartthrob. He is always seen with a black skateboard and seems to be exploring the endless possibilities of this vast continent. He became good friends with Morts the bard after a musical showdown.\n<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> On the stage, Schumann smiles with confidence as he says, \"If the unpredictability of the future stops you from moving forward, then you have halved your chances of achieving your dreams!\"",
    ["NpcInfo_6121701"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> Schumann once told Young, the Mount Merchant, that he was a racer back in his own world. A \"race car\" seems to be a type of mount with speed comparable to using a Fly Wing. Schumann seems to be collecting these race car models!",
    ["NpcInfo_6121702"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> There's a rumor circulating that Schumann has recently been obsessed with cooking. But the source of this rumor comes from the lady boss of Rose Red Tavern, Isabella Trista. \"Our dearest heartthrob singer has been frequently researching recipes at the tavern recently. His look of concentration always sweeps our customers off their feet!\" Isabella played with her hair as she smiled in resignation.",
    ["NpcInfo_6121703"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> \"I could feel that Schumann was extraordinary even when I first met him! The music from his world was pretty interesting as well.\" Arielle the Music Fairy has never hidden that she thinks highly of Schumann's talent. After all, a bosom friend that shares an understanding of music as well is hard to come by.",
    ["NpcInfo_61227"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> If Klein could keep silent during weapon enchantment, then he would surely be a strong contender for the most handsome guy on the island. \"It's impossible not to talk!\" said Klein with conviction, \"If every customer chatted with their weapons like me, then their weapons would also become handier!\"",
    ["NpcInfo_6122701"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> \"But a silent Klein sounds scarier.\" Welch stopped her work to comment, \"Let's imagine that Klein is silent to your weapon one day. Believe me, it's either an unbeatable Divine Weapon, or... you can look for its maker to have a friendly spar.\"",
    ["NpcInfo_6122702"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> In addition to his hobby of chatting with weapons, Klein also likes to listen to all the different adventure stories. Every time he hears the ending of the story where the warrior killed the dragon, married the princess, and became king, his eyes are always sparkling as he asks questions, \"And then what? Did the warrior become the evil dragon? Will the princess fall in love with another warrior? How did they divide up the dragon's treasure?\" Of course, these questions are generally not answered, so Klein goes over the scenarios in his head again and again before going to sleep.",
    ["NpcInfo_6122703"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> The day finally came when Klein decided to embark on an adventure. \"I want to become a hero!\" The kitten on his head said \"meow\" in response, and Klein became more confident. He bought a fine horse, ordered the best sword and shield for himself, and the only thing left was to get a partner to go on the adventure with him. His gaze turned to the Adventurer in front of him. This person always came to him with gifts that he could not refuse. This person never becomes irritable even if failing to get the desired enchanted attribute, and is not bad in terms of strength. Hmm... Klein fell into deep thought. How can he get the Adventurer to agree to his request?",
    ["NpcInfo_61228"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> Very few people knew that it was not Welch's dream to be an Armor Enchanter.\n\"I want to make warm clothes,\" wished young Welch in the cold home of five without a fireplace.",
    ["NpcInfo_6122801"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> After she grew up, Welch's clothing store business did very well. The clothes in her shop were of good quality and inexpensive. On cold winter nights, she also gave free cotton clothes to the hobos. The hobos who received her help would also volunteer to watch the store for Welch and do simple cleaning work. \"It's strange... I didn't put on more clothes, but my heart is warm when I see them wearing my clothes.\"",
    ["NpcInfo_6122802"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> Even so, Welch discovered that the hobos she recognized were slowly disappearing. \"They got left in the winter nights without a fireplace. A cotton coat and a place to stay didn't improve anything.\" Welch poured out her doubts to the understanding Uncle Benson. \"I can only make clothes, or make more clothes.\" Uncle Benson advised Welch to go into the world outside the island to find answers while he stayed to help her run the clothing store.",
    ["NpcInfo_6122803"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> When she returned, Welch had become an excellent Armor Enchanter. She gave the clothing store to Uncle Benson and opened an Armor Enchantment store instead. \"My teacher in Geffen told me that finding the root cause and reducing the suffering from it is more important than finding relief for it, like ending our war with monsters, for example.\" Welch explained, \"I have no talent for combat. I only hope that the magic on armor will protect brave fighters like you, Adventurer.\"",
    ["NpcInfo_61229"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> Mistley knows, but does not care that some trade peers mock her for being a \"humanoid enchanted accessory showcase\".\n\"When buyers see how perfect the effect is in use, they will take out their Zeny.\"",
    ["NpcInfo_6122901"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> Mistley has loved all kinds of shiny accessories from a young age. When her mother left early for work, Mistley would get out of bed and rush to her mother's accessories. Sometimes, she would be able to see some special pieces of sparkling jewelry, such as a ruby brooch with a pentagram, a crystal pendant cut into a diamond shape, or a necklace made of obsidian and pale pearls.",
    ["NpcInfo_6122902"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> \"This is an enchanted accessory, so it will have a distinctive luster. The people who give this luster to accessories are us Enchanters.\" Mistley still has her elegant and confident smile even after explaining about the accessories she wears to customers for the thousandth time. \"But luster like this is not only for precious gems. Even plain rings and stone pendants have their unique beauty. Let me show you!\"",
    ["NpcInfo_6122903"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> Mistley has a serious obsession with cleanliness, and she is likely to inadvertently show her nasty side if she encounters an unkempt customer. \"I met a customer who didn't have a bath for six months! His hair was like dried rotten seaweed!\" Mistley pinched her nose, \"Adventurer, you must not become that way! Well... if that really happens, I will allow you to meet me if you wear a hood, the type which only shows your nostrils. So, don't ever let yourself become raggedy and full of wounds.\"",
    ["NpcInfo_61236"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> Supassara is undoubtedly a star from the original world. Ever since her arrival, the whole of Payon seems to have become livelier due to her presence.",
    ["NpcInfo_6123601"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> Practically no one talks to her except a few individuals. After all, when facing such a glamorous star, shying away is perfectly normal.",
    ["NpcInfo_6123602"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> When talking about looking after cats and dogs or other related topics, she seems to show a huge interest. This seems to explain why she is never seen away from her pets.",
    ["NpcInfo_6123603"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> She previously tried forming a psychic society and a horror games club. However, due to her immense courage, she ended up as the only permanent member left.",
    ["NpcInfo_61237"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> This stunning beauty never before seen in Morroc seems to attract attention wherever she goes. All of this is due to the efforts of Heflee and the Adventurer in keeping her here.",
    ["NpcInfo_6123701"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> Personal topics like her hobbies have always remained a mystery. Numerous people have tried to cater to her likes but they have always failed.",
    ["NpcInfo_6123702"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> Observant individuals have noticed that each time she appears, she wears berets of different materials, colors, and styles, but no one knows why she does this.",
    ["NpcInfo_6123703"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> There are even rumors that she goes to a secret location at a fixed time each day to hula hoop. What a disciplined young lady.",
    ["NpcInfo_61238"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> This lively boy who possesses a curious mind always exudes passion. He sings at the Red Rose Tavern, which gives him the opportunity to listen to stories of adventure.",
    ["NpcInfo_6123801"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> He seems to feel an affinity for everything in this world, but even those close to him do not know why.",
    ["NpcInfo_6123802"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> His musical style is completely different from anything else on the continent, which is why he is so popular with young people.",
    ["NpcInfo_6123803"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> In his free time, he always reads books about history and monsters, and plans to undergo training to become an adventurer. Such a passionate person is rare nowadays.",
    ["NpcInfo_61252"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color>Rowena wants her master to teach her how to make a new potion soon after she becomes a potion-making apprentice in Geffen Tower.",
    ["NpcInfo_6125201"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color>\"You want to craft a potion that can cure social anxiety?\" The potion-making master with thin hair looks at her with pity and says, \"Indeed, potions can cure sickness, but social anxiety is not a disease. I can introduce you to a new master, and maybe you will learn a thing or two from him.\"",
    ["NpcInfo_6125202"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color>This new master is a weapon enchantment master, and he is also the most popular master in Geffen Tower with many friends. He has such a bleeding heart, and when he learns about Rowena's intention, he wants to cure this stressful apprentice in his own way. As for how to cure it—\n\"Rowena, this is the cutest person across the entire field of alchemy. Allow me to introduce the two of you to each other!\" \"Rowena, this is our genius high wizard. You guys are the same age!\" \"Rowena, this is Master Jesqurienne, and she cares about you a lot!\"\nIt's nighttime already. Rowena, who has been faking her laughter all day, decides to make a countdown timer for this living nightmare. ",
    ["NpcInfo_6125203"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color>The plan is simple, without compromising the time for practice, go to a place where nobody knows her and live a happy and carefree life. Rowena finds her master and puts a super delicate and detailed map on his desk, the word \"Umbala\" is marked with a giant red circle. \"Master! I'm going here!\"\nTen days later, Rowena is already standing on the soil of Umbala.\n\"Dang it! I ate all the food back in the airship!\" Rowena pulls out a handful of Zeny and walks toward the food stall not far away. \"Hold on, does the merchant here in Umbala even use Zeny?!\" Just about Rowena wants to open her mouth and say something, \"H-How am I supposed to communicate with them?!\"",
    ["NpcInfo_61253"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color>A handsome man with blond hair who is playing with his slightly curved mustache smiles at you all of a sudden and says, \"I go by many names, call me Dias for now.\"",
    ["NpcInfo_6125301"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color>\"Beauty is a flower with dew, and I am the floral dew collector.\"\nAs one of the only two mystics on the island, Dias never tries to hide his passion for beautiful women. \"If beauty is a weapon, then I want to be the weapon's target. What? Are you asking me about the armor enchantment orders? I don't even bother with such things before the last day hits me!\"",
    ["NpcInfo_6125302"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color>Yes, Dias has never been interested in armor enchantment. Sometimes, he will spend the entire month in a tavern. By looking at how friendly and overzealous the tavern owner treats Dias, it seems like Dias is still doing good financially.\nBills with ridiculous numbers, looming wealth, and a mysterious past make the people in Umbala start guessing his true identity.",
    ["NpcInfo_6125303"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color>\"I'm only an unlucky castaway who hanged tight to a piece of rotten wood and floated my way to Comodo. Soon after, I won some money here but got knocked out and dumped into the swamp at night.\" Dias continues, \"Good for me that they didn't take my Zeny. I think it could be the case that I was talking to the boss lady earlier.\"\nThis episode of Dias-guessing is wrapped up with a quick response from Dias, and no one asks why he wants to stay in Umbala anymore. After all, everyone has their own secret.",
    ["NpcInfo_61254"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color>In Umbala, only a few people know that La Grada has a robust body hiding under her princess dress and jewel-embedded crown.",
    ["NpcInfo_6125401"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color>\"A warrior who doesn't want to be a fair lady is not a good accessory enchanter.\" Paused momentarily, La Grada covers up her mouth and laughs, \"I'm not the same kind of idiot as Hollgrehenn, whose brain is made out of muscles. As an accessory enchanter, you need to carve your body figure like a gemstone.\"",
    ["NpcInfo_6125402"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color>To carve carefully is La Grada's work ethic. No matter the order's size, she always spends a decent amount of time choosing the way to place the enchantment. Compared to Dias, who spends all day in a tavern and piles up the orders, customers are usually willing to make an early appointment and wait for a while to show their respect for the enchanter's work ethic and master skills.",
    ["NpcInfo_6125403"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color>However, an impatient customer once broke into La Grada's enchantment workshop just to find out the postponed order had been completed long ago, but the customer had no trace of the enchanter herself.\n\"I was only out there with Dias looking for inspiration. After all, we are both mythic.\" La Grada shows her signature smile of a fair lady, \"Where to? Hey! This is a secret!\"",
    ["NpcInfo_61263"]="Fashion goes in a cycle, you know!",
    ["NpcInfo_61311"]="Isbern is a reliable married gentleman with a blissful family and a not-so-blissful face.\n\"I have a tender heart.\" Isbern wrote in his diary, \"But the kids cry even louder after hearing what I said.\"",
    ["NpcInfo_6131101"]="Enchanting weapons is only a side hustle for Isbern. His primary occupation is the lecturer of magic theory at Juno University. Working multiple jobs allows him to support the well-being of his family, but it also thins his weary body. Now with the stress of academic evaluation, the contrast between Isbern's intimidating face and his tender soul seems to have grown increasingly bigger...",
    ["NpcInfo_6131102"]="However, the troubles brought by his appearance were only momentary. Soon as the students realized their seemingly intimidating teacher would buy up all the apples from a stall owner on a freezing winter night and make them into apple pies for everyone, they would all be like, \"Ah! That's who you are.\" And soon after—\n\n\"Let me pass this course, please!\" \"Can I get into the male dormitory? My boyfriend is sick!\" \"I will let you take care of my kitten while I am gone!\" Such words are often heard.",
    ["NpcInfo_6131103"]="\"Let me pass this course, please!\" \"Can I get into the male dormitory? My boyfriend is sick!\" \"I will let you take care of my kitten while I am gone!\"\n\nFor Isbern, his kids, wife, and students are his burden, troublesome yet sweet. In the stillness of the midnight, Isbern would sometimes long for the old days when he was all alone and free. However, when he falls asleep and wakes up in the morning, the thoughts of those bygone moments fade, distilled into a stream of profound memories.\n\nWhat remains are bonds and responsibilities.",
    ["NpcInfo_61312"]="In the eyes of the elders, the chubby-faced, saucer-eyed Lucian seems to be a little boy who never grows up.\n\"I am not a kid!\" Lucian objects strongly. He then smiles bashfully, \"I've got a crush on someone. Her name is Lily.\"",
    ["NpcInfo_6131201"]="Born in a prestigious family, surrounded by the family's love and a bunch of house pets, the young master grew up happily and smoothly. After reaching adulthood, he chose to become an accessory enchanter, an occupation he favored. Nevertheless, the first ten hours after the grand opening of his shop, not a single order came through.\n\nOn the eleventh, however, an unexpected \"Lily\" arrived at this helpless young man's shop.",
    ["NpcInfo_6131202"]="\"Lily told me not to set the prices of these enchanted accessories too low. People might think I'm selling knock-offs.\" Lucian scratches his head, \"But I want everyone to afford a good-looking enchanted accessory. Am I doing it wrong?\"\n\nUnconvinced of Lily's words, Lucian returns home and turns to the elders for advice. And after being told a bunch of market numbers and the law of value, he reluctantly marks up the price.",
    ["NpcInfo_6131203"]="However, there is still something that Lucian doesn't want to compromise, something that has been approved by Lily, his fiancee.\n\nIf a customer arrives at their shop on the anniversary of their first meeting, they will receive a budding lily. Moreover, should the customer be with their beloved one, then this smiley shop owner would be more than happy to enchant your lily with a magic spell that keeps it ever-blooming.",
    ["NpcInfo_61313"]="A handsome man with blond hair, who has been playing with his slightly curved mustache, suddenly opens his mouth, \"I go by many names. For now, you can call me Dias.\"\n(Reach the next phase of Favor to unlock more content.)",
    ["NpcInfo_6131301"]="A handsome man with blond hair, who has been playing with his slightly curved mustache, suddenly opens his mouth, \"I go by many names. For now, you can call me Dias.\"\n\n\"Beauties are flowers with dew, and I am a dew collector that attends to the flowers.\"\n\nAs one of the only two mystics on the island, Dias never tries to hide his passion for beautiful women. \"If beauty is a weapon, then I want to be the weapon's target. What? Are you asking me about the armor enchantment orders? I don't bother with such things until the last day hits me!\"\n(Reach the next phase of Favor to unlock more content.)",
    ["NpcInfo_6131302"]="A handsome man with blond hair, who has been playing with his slightly curved mustache, suddenly opens his mouth, \"I go by many names. For now, you can call me Dias.\"\n\n\"Beauties are flowers with dew, and I am a dew collector that attends to the flowers.\"\n\nAs one of the only two mystics on the island, Dias never tries to hide his passion for beautiful women. \"If beauty is a weapon, then I want to be the weapon's target. What? Are you asking me about the armor enchantment orders? I don't bother with such things until the last day hits me!\"\n\nYes, Dias has never been interested in armor enchantment. Sometimes, he would spend the entire month in a tavern. However, by looking at how friendly and overzealous the tavern owner treats him, it seems Dias is still doing good financially.\n\nBills with astronomical numbers, looming wealth, and a mysterious past have sparked the curiosity of people in Umbala about his true identity.\n(Reach the next phase of Favor to unlock more content.)",
    ["NpcInfo_6131303"]="A handsome man with blond hair, who has been playing with his slightly curved mustache, suddenly opens his mouth, \"I go by many names. For now, you can call me Dias.\"\n\n\"Beauties are flowers with dew, and I am a dew collector that attends to the flowers.\"\n\nAs one of the only two mystics on the island, Dias never tries to hide his passion for beautiful women. \"If beauty is a weapon, then I want to be the weapon's target. What? Are you asking me about the armor enchantment orders? I don't bother with such things until the last day hits me!\"\n\nYes, Dias has never been interested in armor enchantment. Sometimes, he would spend the entire month in a tavern. However, by looking at how friendly and overzealous the tavern owner treats him, it seems Dias is still doing good financially.\n\nBills with astronomical numbers, looming wealth, and a mysterious past have sparked the curiosity of people in Umbala about his true identity.\n\n\"I'm only an unlucky castaway who hanged tight to a piece of rotten wood and floated my way to Comodo. Later, I won some money there but got knocked out and dumped into the swamp at night.\" Dias continues, \"Good for me that they didn't take my Zeny. Maybe it was just because I had a few extra words with the landlady?\"\n\nThis episode of who-he-is soon gets wrapped up with a quick response from Dias, and no one asks why he wants to stay in Umbala anymore. After all, everyone has their own secret.",
    ["NpcInfo_61330"]="Elsa left quite an impression on Juno's social group for sure — \"a breeze of flirtation.\"\n\"I'm totally aware of my charming appearance and my nasty side. What's my nasty side?\" Behind her feather fan, the beauty smiles softly, \"Well, it's keeping my heart to myself.\"",
    ["NpcInfo_6133001"]="In her social life, Elsa's always flooded with invites, and she's never without a dance partner, either. She doesn't mind when people call her a \"social butterfly\" because the moment she steps out in style, all the slurs turn into flowers and praise.\n\"You know, with humans being so phony about their preferences, how could they stick to loving just one person forever? So, let's dance another one, shall we?\"",
    ["NpcInfo_6133002"]="Balls are always Elsa's favorite event. She's not just showing up at other people's parties; she hosts her own too. \"If you're the type who goes home at midnight, skip this one—this party's for grown-ups only.\"\nAs for her main business of enchanting armor? Maybe first, she should figure out how to get rid of all the admirers outside her shop.",
    ["NpcInfo_6133003"]="Lately, Elsa's been planning a new upscale dance party. She's working behind the scenes, inviting the town's single elites under a gentleman's name and making sure to check every guest's credentials.\n\"How about we make a bet with these young men and women?\" Elsa said, flashing her typical bad-girl smile, \"You guess—is love the crash of hormones or the meeting of two hearts?\"",
    ["NpcInfo_61331"]="In the eyes of the elders, the chubby-faced, saucer-eyed Lucian seems to be a little boy who never grows up.\n\"I am not a kid!\" Lucian objects strongly. He then smiles bashfully, \"I've got a crush on someone. Her name is Lily.\"",
    ["NpcInfo_6133101"]="Born in a prestigious family, surrounded by the family's love and a bunch of house pets, the young master grew up happily and smoothly. After reaching adulthood, he chose to become an accessory enchanter, an occupation he favored. Nevertheless, the first ten hours after the grand opening of his shop, not a single order came through.\nOn the eleventh, however, an unexpected \"Lily\" arrived at this helpless young man's shop.",
    ["NpcInfo_6133102"]="\"Lily told me not to set the prices of these enchanted accessories too low. People might think I'm selling knock-offs.\" Lucian scratches his head, \"But I want everyone to afford a good-looking enchanted accessory. Am I doing it wrong?\"\nUnconvinced of Lily's words, Lucian returns home and turns to the elders for advice. And after being told a bunch of market numbers and the law of value, he reluctantly marks up the price.",
    ["NpcInfo_6133103"]="However, there is still something that Lucian doesn't want to compromise, something that has been approved by Lily, his fiancee.\nIf a customer arrives at their shop on the anniversary of their first meeting, they will receive a budding lily. Moreover, should the customer be with their beloved one, then this smiley shop owner would be more than happy to enchant your lily with a magic spell that keeps it ever-blooming.",
    ["NpcInfo_61332"]="A handsome man with blond hair who is playing with his slightly curved mustache smiles at you all of a sudden and says, \"I go by many names, call me Dias for now.\"",
    ["NpcInfo_6133201"]="\"Beauty is a flower with dew, and I am the floral dew collector.\"\nAs one of the only two mystics on the island, Dias never tries to hide his passion for beautiful women. \"If beauty is a weapon, then I want to be the weapon's target. What? Are you asking me about the armor enchantment orders? I don't even bother with such things before the last day hits me!\"",
    ["NpcInfo_6133202"]="Yes, Dias has never been interested in armor enchantment. Sometimes, he will spend the entire month in a tavern. By looking at how friendly and overzealous the tavern owner treats Dias, it seems like Dias is still doing well financially.\nBills with ridiculous numbers, looming wealth, and a mysterious past make the people in Umbala start guessing his true identity.",
    ["NpcInfo_6133203"]="\"I'm only an unlucky castaway who hanged tight to a piece of rotten wood and floated my way to Comodo. Soon after, I won some money here but got knocked out and dumped into the swamp at night.\" Dias continues, \"Good for me that they didn't take my Zeny. I think it could be the case that I was talking to the boss lady earlier.\"\nThis episode of Dias-guessing is wrapped up with a quick response from Dias, and no one asks why he wants to stay in Umbala anymore. After all, everyone has their own secret.",
    ["NpcInfo_6135001"]="When Beatria was little, her family went through a period of wandering before finally settling in Rachel. There, she met someone who would shape her future.\nShe saw a white-haired old priest resting on a stone bench as he prepared to return to the temple. Some noisy kids bumped into his notebook and knocked it to the ground. Though she was still new to the town, young Beatria ran over to pick it up for him. The pages that lay open before her immediately drew her attention.\n(More story unlocked at the next Favor level.)",
    ["NpcInfo_6135002"]="\"What's this?\" little Beatria asked. \"It's a notebook about weapon enchantments,\" the old man replied with a gentle smile.\n\"Is it powerful?\" \"Well, it shapes a weapon's soul and turns your thoughts into its edge. If you enjoy doing that... yeah, it's pretty amazing.\"\n(More story unlocked at the next Favor level.)",
    ["NpcInfo_6135003"]="On a hot afternoon in Rachel, little Beatria ran her curious fingers across the brittle pages, and a colorful new world opened up before her. Now, following her heart, the grown-up Beatria has joined the temple and devoted herself fully to studying weapon enchantments. She isn't the most talented student there, but she's definitely the most determined. Whether friend or stranger, everyone is willing to hand their weapon to her. Why?\nBecause she's Beatria—\nBecause it's Beatria, after all!",
    ["NpcInfo_6135101"]="When Beatria suddenly became obsessed with studying enchantments, Virgil also gave it a try—curious about the thing that made his sister so \"passionate.\" Maybe it could bring some excitement into his dull life. Unfortunately, it turned out to be yet another calm, uneventful success. Beatria felt a bit discouraged, and Virgil didn't find any joy in it either.\nHe stopped using enchantment techniques after that.\n(More story unlocked at the next Favor level.)",
    ["NpcInfo_6135102"]="Things changed after Virgil joined the temple just to kill time.\nTo celebrate both siblings doing well in their studies again, their mother asked a craftsman to forge a set of blessing jewelry for them. But when Virgil went to pick it up, he found the craftsman's young apprentice getting his butt beaten red. Turned out the kid had accidentally dropped Beatria's piece into the blazing crucible, and the hand-forged necklace melted in seconds.\n\"Move. I'll do it myself.\" Amid the apprentice's loud crying, Virgil grabbed the forging hammer.\n(More story unlocked at the next Favor level.)",
    ["NpcInfo_6135103"]="As expected, everything went smoothly.\nWhen Beatria received her new necklace, Virgil heard the surprise in her voice. \"You made this yourself?\"\n\"Yeah.\" \"And the enchantment on it—you added that too?\"\n\"If you don't like it, give it back.\" Virgil frowned and reached to take it from her. But she happily put on the necklace—something that was really just a lump of steel, carrying only her family's blessings.\nAt that moment, a thought suddenly popped into Virgil's mind:\nMaybe... a blessing alone isn't so bad.",
    ["NpcInfo_6135201"]="No one really knows where this executioner wandering the Rachel Plains comes from, but the thieves living out there know better than anyone how scary he is.\nHe's basically a maniac who feels no pain, and the wounds on his body are basically a tally of how many thieves he's taken down. He's way scarier than any knight guard—like, a hundred times worse.\n(More story unlocked at the next Favor level.)",
    ["NpcInfo_6135202"]="So a few groups of thieves secretly teamed up and set a deadly trap for Medea at the oasis.\nMeanwhile, Medea's just sitting by the clear water, lost in thought, noticing nothing at all. He's Medea the Phendark, who feels no pain and one who doesn't die. Sometimes, he suddenly recalls the fear and sorrow he sees in the eyes of thieves whenever he wipes out their camps.\nThey... are afraid of dying too? Then why—why do they swing their blades at innocent people? The next day, the battle begins... and ends—\n(More story unlocked at the next Favor level.)",
    ["NpcInfo_6135203"]="He survives.\nMedea climbs out of the freezing water.\nThe pain is sharp—bone-deep. But what hurts more than his wounds is his heart. He isn't afraid of death; he welcomes it. But... it feels like someone long gone is refusing to let him die...\nHis old coat is torn to rags, and a small piece of armor floats up from the water. It's a fragment of the armor his wife—a weapon enchanter—made for him, the same armor he once destroyed with his own hands in a moment of hopeless despair.\n\"Don't you want to see me, Naya?\" Medea mutters, holding the fragment as tightly as he once held his wife.\n\"Alright. I get it. I promise you. I promise.\"",
    ["NpcInfo_61990"]="He was once a rising academic star. Driven by an obsession with cutting-edge weapons and enchantment technology, he travelled across the world to the Republic's Rekensheim Institute and joined the Bio Lab. He speaks politely but feels distant—he'd rather pour all his energy into research. To him, nothing is more exciting than channeling technology into weapons.",
    ["NpcInfo_61991"]="A newcomer to the Bio Lab, he got the chance to intern there at a very young age. Maybe because he's young, he's a bit awkward when talking to people—but privately, he's a hardcore rock-music fan. He works with armor every day and takes his job seriously, just not as fanatically as some of his seniors.",
    ["NpcInfo_61992"]="A priest who loves beautiful accessories—after growing tired of temple life, she used her early knowledge to land a job in the Bio Lab, finally mixing her love for accessories with tech research. Maybe because she used to be a priest, she's warm and kind to everyone.",
    ["NpcInfo_61993"]="A believer in market economics, she sees serving big companies as her life goal. She can be sharp-tongued, but she's fair in business and has a keen sense for the economy—so she profits often.",
    ["NpcInfo_61994"]="She used to be a housewife, now she's a materials merchant. She's serious about everything and couldn't stand staying home all day, so she became a food supplier for the Bio Lab. Her housewife days made her picky about ingredients—if something doesn't meet her standards, she'll never sell it.",
    ["NpcInfo_62014"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> Every Knight dreams of having a Pecopeco as their adventure partner. In order to fulfill their dreams, the Pecopeco keeper works tirelessly to breed healthy, lively Pecopecos.\n<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> \"My Cocoas will all leave me one day; the loss will be incredibly hard,\" says the Pecopeco keeper with a sad expression, but at the next moment, it turns into a smile. \"But no worries; I've another Cocoa to look after!\"",
    ["NpcInfo_62036"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> Every Hunter dreams of having a falcon as their adventure partner. In order to fulfill their dreams, the Falcon keeper works tirelessly to breed agile, obedient falcons.\n<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> \"My sincere advice to all hunters,\" the Falcon Keeper says seriously. \"Learn Falconry Mastery before coming here to get a Falcon.\"",
    ["NpcInfo_62071"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> Captain Carew was a member of the Alson Fleet until he met a charming lady on Izlude Island and decided to stay there.\n<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> \"Even if I go out to sea, I know where to return,\" Captain Carew says affectionately. \"Because I found the harbor of my heart.\"",
    ["NpcInfo_62130"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> Perhaps because he has spent too much time with animals, Young sometimes can't help speaking to mounts. \"That customer just now couldn't appreciate your charms. You're clearly ten times more adorable than her Drops,\" he says as he strokes the head of a sobbing and distressed Hamster, consoling it fondly.",
    ["NpcInfo_6213001"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> Young used to be a member of the Chivalry. His beloved mount was gravely injured in a battle while trying to save him, and Young was deeply touched by his mount's devotion. Therefore, after he was invalided out of the Chivalry, he started looking after abandoned mounts.",
    ["NpcInfo_6213002"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> Many had tried persuading Young to return to the city, find a new job, and begin afresh, but Young preferred to stay with the mounts. He then began a mount rental service. However, Young is very particular about his customers. Those who look as though they won't be kind to his mounts are turned away.",
    ["NpcInfo_6213003"]="<color=#FFFFFF00>jayw</color> \"Mounts have minds of their own too. If you treat them well, they will return the kindness,\" Young said as he gave the Alpaca beside him some feed.",
