    ["PersonalizedTips001"]="Tap to edit your tag.",
    ["PersonalizedTips002"]="No tag set",
    ["PersonalizedTips003"]="Personalized signature cannot be blank.",
    ["PersonalizedTips004"]="Tag contents cannot be blank.",
    ["PersonalizedTips005"]="Please select the badge you wish to replace.",
    ["PersonalizedTips006"]="Are you sure you want to switch to this style?",
    ["PersonalizedTips007"]="Personalized signature configured successfully!",
    ["PersonalizedTips008"]="You've spent 100 Crystals to give this adventurer a Like!",
    ["PersonalizedTips009"]="You've spent 100 Crystals to give this tag a Like!",
    ["PersonalizedTips010"]="Unlocked %s!",
    ["PersonalizedTips011"]="Not yet edited.",
    ["PersonalizedTips012"]="Are you sure you want to spend %s %s to unlock this style?",
    ["PersonalizedTips013"]="Are you sure you want to spend %s Crystals to give this adventurer a Like?",
    ["PersonalizedTips014"]="Are you sure you want to spend %s %s to gift %s ×%s?",
    ["PersonalizedTips015"]="Are you sure you want to spend %s %s to unlock this style?",
    ["PersonalizedTips016"]="Receiving gifts will increase your Charm!",
    ["PersonalizedTips017"]="Clear instances to get Likes and increase your Like count!",
    ["PersonalizedTips018"]="Give gifts to others to improve your Favor with them!",
    ["PersonalizedTips019"]="There are currently no adventurers who have obtained this badge.",
    ["PersonalizedTips020"]="You haven't obtained this badge yet!",
    ["PersonalizedTips021"]="Your birth date cannot be changed within 180 days of the last time it was changed~",
    ["PersonalizedTips022"]="{1}/{0}",
    ["PersonalizedTips023"]="Time left: %s",
    ["PersonalizedTips024"]="The Adventurer is very shy, and the access to the Gifts Accepted Record is friends-only.",
    ["PetAbandonmentDialog_1"]="Our little flaws led us to the right person~ ε≡٩(๑>₃<)۶ ",
    ["PetAbandonmentDialog_2"]="When you are about to give up, think about why you persevered until now in the first place.(*･ω< ) ",
    ["PetAbandonmentDialog_3"]="The late night bell marks the start of a long night, the stars shine bright in the night sky~φ(>ω<*)",
    ["PetAbandonmentDialog_4"]="We always have our own difficulties and are unwilling to be mediocre~(*/ω＼*)",
    ["PetAbandonmentDialog_5"]="You're my one and only hero~(｡･ω･｡)",
    ["PetActivityDesc_001"]="Event Rules:\n1. Event Time: \n<b>·</b>Play the board game and kill monsters above level 21 with Odin's Blessing during the event to get randomly dropped exchange materials\n<b>·</b>During the exchange period, players can exchange items at the pet exchange store in Prontera\n\n2. Board game draw cost:\n<b>·</b>It costs 1 draw coupon per dice roll for the pet event\n<b>·</b>It costs <color=#CA2E0AFF>3600</color> Crystals per roll when you don't have any coupons for the Pet event. Kafra's VIP Card users can enjoy a <color=#CA2E0AFF>20% discount</color>\n\n3. Obtaining Draw Coupons: New Carnival event activity rewards have been added for the duration of the event\n\n4. Board game rewards:\n<b>·</b>When Poring lands on a space with an item icon, the item for that space will be obtained\n<b>·</b>An additional pass reward will be obtained when passing the [Start] space\n<b>·</b>Accumulate a certain number of laps around the board to get corresponding milestone rewards",
    ["PetAtkForceMagic"]="Magical",
    ["PetAtkForcePhysics"]="Physical",
    ["PetCaptureTips_1"]="No monsters available for capturing.",
    ["PetCaptureTips_2"]="This target cannot be captured.",
    ["PetCaptureTips_3"]="Insufficient favorite items. Unable to tame.",
    ["PetCaptureTips_4"]="You must be at a level higher than the monster to tame it as a pet. Your level is not high enough yet!",
    ["PetCaptureTips_5"]="You must be at a level higher than the monster to tame it as a pet. Your level is not high enough yet!",
    ["PetCatching_1"]="Unfortunately, this pet escaped capture and wandered off.",
    ["PetCatching_2"]="Successfully adopted pet.",
    ["PetCatching_3"]="Released this pet.",
    ["PetCatching_4"]="The player (<color=#e7bb22>%s</color>) is capturing at the moment.",
    ["PetCatching_5"]="Your pet taming level needs to be at <color=#e7bb22>%s</color> to capture this pet.",
    ["PetCharacterDesc1"]="Actively attacks monsters in the wild.",
    ["PetCharacterDesc2"]="Only attacks monsters that its master is attacking.",
    ["PetCharacterDesc3"]="Only attacks monsters that attack its master.",
    ["PetCharacterName1"]="Aggressive",
    ["PetCharacterName2"]="Calm",
    ["PetCharacterName3"]="Protective",
    ["PetChattest001"]="Master! I will keep you safe as long as I'm full of energy!",
    ["PetChattest002"]="I'm not getting sick, and I feel great! Today's another good day for adventure!",
    ["PetChattest003"]="Target monster found! Please issue the combat command, master!",
    ["PetChattest004"]="Roll, roll, roll around. Master, let me show you a trick!",
    ["PetChattest005"]="The invincible me is back again! Do you miss me, master?",
    ["PetChattest006"]="I'm so full of energy that I won't even flinch if the demon lord is here!",
    ["PetChattest007"]="Clever pets always keep themselves in an optimal state, just like me!",
    ["PetChattest008"]="Master, you should hit the bed early like me to keep you energized!",
    ["PetChattest009"]="I'm full... Burp! But a little bit of snacks wouldn't hurt...",
    ["PetChattest010"]="I have to do my best for my master! I love my master so much!",
    ["PetChattest101"]="Master! Am I your favorite pet?",
    ["PetChattest102"]="Master! The way you gather and fight in the quests and instances looks super cool!",
    ["PetChattest103"]="The great Odin! May my master be blessed and receive the desired card.",
    ["PetChattest104"]="I want to stay with my master forever. Please don't ditch me...",
    ["PetChattest105"]="A long time ago, there was an adorable pet and a dauntless master...",
    ["PetChattest106"]="Another day of battling alongside master! I'm so lucky to meet my master!",
    ["PetChattest107"]="The monster ahead seems to have the materials my master needs. Allow me to take it down!",
    ["PetChattest108"]="I wonder if my master is happy today. Your happiness makes me happy too!",
    ["PetChattest109"]="I am top-notch when it comes to being a pet! So... Can we hang out more?",
    ["PetChattest110"]="Even the most ordinary day is extraordinary with my master!",
    ["PetChattest201"]="Master... I feel... exhausted...",
    ["PetChattest202"]="Are the clouds in the sky cotton candy? I want it...",
    ["PetChattest203"]="I can't even outfight a Poring right now...",
    ["PetChattest204"]="I want to rest... But I need to keep my master accompanied...",
    ["PetChattest205"]="Nighty-night, master. Zzzzz...",
    ["PetChattest206"]="I'm starving... I can't take it anymore... Is it time to say goodbye to master...",
    ["PetChattest207"]="I-I'm not hungry at all! It's just time to feed me!",
    ["PetChattest208"]="Why the sky is spinning... I... I am about to fall...",
    ["PetChattest209"]="I smell something delicious... hee-hee... hee-hee...",
    ["PetChattest210"]="Master, are you putting me on a diet... I'm really hungry...",
    ["PetDecorationDes_0000"]="A pet’s default skin. Simple, but classic.",
    ["PetDecorationDes_0001"]="Bathed in searing flames, this skin can intimidate anyone!",
    ["PetDecorationDes_0002"]="Clarity Ripple",
    ["PetDecorationDes_3001"]="Giearth can discern who the owner is by the details so you will never take the wrong backpack by mistake.",
    ["PetDecorationDes_3002"]="It's not recommended to buy expensive Lunatic headgear because it's often disposable.",
    ["PetDecorationDes_3003"]="A mask that is used to deal with Drainliar that are not completely domesticated yet. It has gradually become fashionable.",
    ["PetDecorationDes_3004"]="A ball is a necessity for the life of soldier bees, and also a battlefield for fashion.",
    ["PetDecorationDes_3005"]="A small bamboo dragonfly designed just for Dustiness. It can't fly and doesn't need to.",
    ["PetDecorationDes_3006"]="The length can be adjusted to fit, and it's suitable for dragon flies of all ages and sizes.",
    ["PetDecorationDes_3007"]="Why do some species need special tools to move underwater?",
    ["PetDecorationDes_3008"]="Hard objects can make light, floaty ghosts seem real.",
    ["PetDecorationDes_3009"]="The Ghostring is very satisfied with this—finally! It can dress up as a real devil!",
    ["PetDecorationDes_3010"]="To balance the nastiness of the side winder's reputation. However, it seems to scare even more people away.",
    ["PetDecorationDes_3011"]="They make Sasquatch look more human-like, because the headphones aren't even on their ears...",
    ["PetDecorationDes_3012"]="These warm stone friends are finally showing the tri-color wig some attention.",
    ["PetDecorationDes_3013"]="Don't let them get anywhere near the old books. Who knows if their hunger is for knowledge or for food.",
    ["PetDecorationDes_3014"]="It does not usually rely on its sense of sight, but eyes should still be protect... probably.",
    ["PetDecorationDes_3015"]="Some rabbits might go semi-permanently mad from discomfort after wearing it. Quite normal.",
    ["PetDecorationDes_3016"]="Raising Myst requires a certain amount of guts, so making accessories for them is even more...",
    ["PetDecorationDes_3017"]="Fans of rock think different and prefer eye-catching and fancy designs.",
    ["PetDecorationDes_3018"]="It's said that a Poring's backpack contains a part of itself to save its life in case of danger...",
    ["PetDecorationDes_3019"]="Phreeoni move lighter after wearing them, which may just be a psychological effect.",
    ["PetDecorationDes_3020"]="They say there's a trend among the Roda Frog s that \"practicality is beauty.\"",
    ["PetDecorationDes_3021"]="Maybe years have passed but King Poring's dreams of adventure from when he was young has not faded at all.",
    ["PetDecorationDes_3022"]="This accessory harmonizes with the fur, and also symbolizes the imprint of civilization.",
    ["PetDecorationDes_3023"]="Every owner and Yoyo can completely prove their closeness, and they convey a little zen.",
    ["PetDecorationDes_3024"]="The Desert Wolf lives on hot sand, so it's most suitable for the helmet to be made of steel.",
    ["PetDecorationDes_3025"]="The diving helmet is snow white, so one day it will be able to play in the water, right?",
    ["PetDecorationDes_3026"]="The Anacondaq will beat time with bells, and it might lead the snakes in a rap.",
    ["PetDecorationDes_3027"]="A popular accessory among miners that displays their obsession with precious metals.",
    ["PetDecorationDes_3028"]="What exactly does the queen bee's compound eyes see through lenses filled with magic?",
    ["PetDecorationDes_3029"]="The burial did not completely take away the rotting bodies, but their upper garments.",
    ["PetDecorationDes_3030"]="This mask will show off the Ghoul's teeth and handsome side.",
    ["PetDecorationGetWay_0001"]="How to unlock: Spend items",
    ["PetDecorationGetWay_0002"]="How to unlock: Participate in the Anniversary event and obtain",
    ["PetDecorationGetWay_0003"]="How to unlock: Purchase from the Pet Shop",
    ["PetDecorationName_0000"]="No decoration",
