    ["PetDecorationName_3030"]="Zealot Mask",
    ["PetDialog_1"]="Our little flaws led us to the right person~\nε≡٩(๑>₃<)۶",
    ["PetDialog_10"]="When you are about to give up, think about why you persevered until now in the first place.",
    ["PetDialog_11"]="The late night bell marks the start of a long night, the stars shine bright in the night sky~\nφ(>ω<*)",
    ["PetDialog_12"]="We always have our own difficulties and are unwilling to be mediocre~\n(*/ω＼*)",
    ["PetDialog_13"]="You're my one and only hero~\n(｡･ω･｡)",
    ["PetDialog_14"]="Let's head to Rose Red Tavern for a drink~\n(>ω･* )ﾉ",
    ["PetDialog_15"]="Didn't you promise to go fishing with me?\n(￣.￣)",
    ["PetDialog_16"]="Things we lose have a way of coming back to us in the end~\n（￣︶￣）↗",
    ["PetDialog_17"]="Sunshine, daisies, butter mellow~\no(￣▽￣)ｄ",
    ["PetDialog_18"]="Do you like rainy days?\n(´･ᴗ･`)",
    ["PetDialog_19"]="Comfort me when I'm angry, hug me when I'm calm~\n(≧ω≦)/",
    ["PetDialog_2"]="Take your time to find the right direction in life~\n_φ_(．．）",
    ["PetDialog_20"]="If you're willing, I'm ready~\nಠᴗ",
    ["PetDialog_21"]="Every pet is lonely inside~\n( ･´ω`･ )",
    ["PetDialog_22"]="Nothing is more fatal to happiness than the memory of happiness~\n(〃´-ω･)",
    ["PetDialog_23"]="Death is not the end of life, being forgotten is~\n(〃'▽'〃)",
    ["PetDialog_24"]="Master, I'm out of steam~ I need some Milk Tea to continue fighting~ Get it for me from the pet shop, please?\n(｡･ω･｡)",
    ["PetDialog_25"]="For my master's safety, I'll venture forth and defeat the monsters!\nε≡٩(๑>₃<)۶",
    ["PetDialog_26"]="Go away, you disgusting monsters! Stay away from my master!\nε≡٩(๑>₃<)۶",
    ["PetDialog_27"]="It is not the endless mines that wear obstruct your way, but a single grain of sand within the mines.\n( ･´ω`･ )",
    ["PetDialog_28"]="A thousand pickaxe swings a day, Hollgrehenn comes right away~\n（￣︶￣）↗",
    ["PetDialog_29"]="My favorite pastime is to fish at a pond in the afternoon.\n_φ_(．．）",
    ["PetDialog_3"]="I'm your present~\n(っ•̀ω•́)っ",
    ["PetDialog_30"]="I relax by gazing at the reflection on the lake.\n(〃´-ω･)",
    ["PetDialog_31"]="Let me lie down for awhile among the flowerbeds outside of the South Gate~\n(≧ω≦)/",
    ["PetDialog_32"]="Sunshine, daisies, butter mellow. I'm a material-gathering guru!\n(〃'▽'〃)",
    ["PetDialog_33"]="Master, there are many pets gathering materials. I need some extra time to fight with them over it.\n(*/ω＼*)",
    ["PetDialog_4"]="Let me lie down for a while among the flowerbeds outside of the South Gate~\n╭(๑´^`๑)╮​",
    ["PetDialog_5"]="Have a break, have a cake~\n(*/ω＼*)",
    ["PetDialog_6"]="Drink some soda, let off some steam~\nヾ(ｏ･ω･)ﾉ",
    ["PetDialog_7"]="When will I get lucky?\n(〃´-ω･)",
    ["PetDialog_8"]="Pets don't get to choose, but you do~\n(〃'▽'〃)",
    ["PetDialog_9"]="You're my whole world~\nヾ(=･ω･=)o",
