    ["PetTaskMF_1"]="%s (Countered by %s)",
    ["PetTaskMF_10"]="Not countered by other attributes.",
    ["PetTaskMF_11"]="No pet with this Life affix.",
    ["PetTaskMF_12"]="More advanced pet hoe still locked.",
    ["PetTaskMF_13"]="Countered by Holy and Fire attributes.",
    ["PetTaskMF_14"]="Unable to start pet fishing as you do not have enough bait.",
    ["PetTaskMF_15"]="1",
    ["PetTaskMF_16"]="Estimated stamina required: %s",
    ["PetTaskMF_17"]="<color=#e7bb22>Rules:</color>\n\n<color=#e7bb22>Wilderness AFK Time:</color>\n1. Killing monsters in the wild while online and pet AFK farming will use up this time.\n2. When all time is used up, you and your pet will not earn any more rewards from AFK Farming.\n3. Wilderness AFK time refreshes at 5:00 AM daily. <color=#e7bb22>Assignments:</color>\n1. There are four types of assignments: Monster-killing, Fishing, Mining, and Gardening.\n2. You can send up to 5 eligible pets on assignments at the same time.\n3. You can select from 1, 2, or 3-hour assignments.\n4. After sending a pet on an assignment and going AFK, you will earn rewards when the time is up.\n5. You can use crystals to complete assignments instantly (this applies to Gardening only; other assignments cannot be canceled or completed instantly).\n\n<color=#e7bb22>Monster-killing Assignments:</color>\n1. The selected pet must be at a higher level than the selected monster.\n2. The sum of the pet's stats affects the rewards multiplier.\n3. The pet's attribute counter and the monster's size affect the rewards multiplier.\n4. World Lv.and whether you carry Odin's Blessing affects rewards.\n\n<color=#e7bb22>Life Assignments: </color>\n1. New pet affixes\nMiner - Pet can carry out mining assignments.\nFisherman - Pet can carry out fishing assignments.\nGardener - Pet can carry out gardening assignments.\n2. Only pets with the relevant affix can perform the relevant Life assignments.\n3. Selecting high-grade fishes will consume the relevant bait.\n4. The effectiveness of gardening is affected by how many pets are currently AFK gardening a particular plant.\n5. Pet life assignments grant its master the relevant Life EXP.\n",
    ["PetTaskMF_18"]="%dh %dmin",
    ["PetTaskMF_2"]="%s attribute counter, %s attribute bonus",
    ["PetTaskMF_3"]="Wilderness AFK Time remaining:\n<color=#ffdf04>%d hour(s) %d minute(s)</color>",
    ["PetTaskMF_4"]="When Wilderness AFK Time is used up, AFK Farming <color=#ff9a56>will not grant any more rewards</color>.",
    ["PetTaskMF_5"]="Current stamina: <color=#ffdf04>%d</color>",
    ["PetTaskMF_6"]="Mining: <color=#ff9a56>Lv.%d</color>",
    ["PetTaskMF_7"]="Fishing: <color=#ff9a56>Lv.%d</color>",
    ["PetTaskMF_8"]="Gathering: <color=#ff9a56>Lv.%d</color>",
    ["PetTaskMF_9"]="You do not have any pets that have a higher level than this monster.",
    ["PetText_001"]="Resting",
    ["PetText_002"]="Weak",
    ["PetText_003"]="Sprightly",
    ["PetText_004"]="Full Energy",
    ["PetText_005"]="You can interact with pets %s/%s more time(s) today.",
