    ["ProfessionDes_1010"]="Can advance to Expanded Super Novice to learn more battle styles.",
    ["ProfessionDes_1100"]="You may advance to the <color=#ff9ba3>Knight</color> and <color=#ff9ba3>Crusader</color> job classes. They possess superior defense and endurance.",
    ["ProfessionDes_1200"]="You may advance to the <color=#ffd16d>Priest</color> and <color=#ffd16d>Monk</color> job classes. Their improved healing will greatly enhance your combat capabilities.",
    ["ProfessionDes_1300"]="You may advance to the <color=#97deff>Wizard</color> and <color=#97deff>Sage</color> job classes. Use their elemental skills to multiply your magic damage.",
    ["ProfessionDes_1400"]="You may advance to the <color=#c587ff>Assassin</color> and <color=#c587ff>Rogue</color> job classes. You'll deal destructive damage with bursts of potent blows.",
    ["ProfessionDes_1500"]="You may advance to the <color=#e2f496>Hunter</color> and <color=#e2f496>Bard</color> job classes. Let loose a hail of their deadly arrows from afar.",
    ["ProfessionDes_1600"]="You may advance to the <color=#7acdd4>Blacksmith</color> and <color=#7acdd4>Alchemist</color> job classes. Create a unique experience with their signature cart abilities.",
