    ["Property317"]="Magic DMG Reflection",
    ["Property317_Des"]="Reflects the M.DMG taken. The reflect effect only triggers if your final reflected damage is higher than the attacker's final Lifesteal value. Reflected damage is affected by your M.DEF, Final M.DMG RED, Final DMG RED, and PVP Final M.DMG RED.",
