    ["Property325"]="PVP Debuff RES",
    ["Property325_Des"]="Reduce your chance of being inflicted with debuffs (effective in PVP scenes).",
    ["Property326"]="Debuff Reduction",
    ["Property326_Des"]="Increases the chance of reducing the duration of inflicted debuffs. The debuff will be nullified if the duration becomes too insignificant after the reduction (effective in both PVP and PVE). In PVP battles, this attribute will be converted into PVP Debuff Reduction at a <color=#FF0000>30%%</color> ratio.",
