    ["PvpHunter_005"]="Ultimate Hunter",
    ["PvpHunter_tips_001"]="Event Description",
    ["PvpHunter_tips_002"]="Rules",
    ["PvpHunter_tips_003"]="Available Time: Cross-server events are open from 20:00 to 21:00 every Mon., Wed., and Fri.",
    ["PvpHunter_tips_004"]="Adventurers whose Base Level ≥ Lv.30 can participate.",
    ["PvpHunter_tips_005"]="Daily Participation Limit: 5 times",
    ["PvpHunter_tips_006"]="Preparation Phase",
    ["PvpHunter_tips_007"]="Skills cannot be used in the preparation room. The showdown begins once there are 30 adventurers in the room.",
    ["PvpHunter_tips_008"]="If you quit during the preparation phase, your participation attempt will not be deducted, but there will be matchmaking penalties.",
    ["PvpHunter_tips_009"]="Battle Phase",
    ["PvpHunter_tips_010"]="A 20-player limited-time survival challenge. Survive to the end to win.",
    ["PvpHunter_tips_011"]="There is a 10-second countdown after the battle phase starts. Adventurers can choose where they want to start.",
    ["PvpHunter_tips_012"]="The arena shrinks gradually after the match starts. Adventurers will take damage when they are in the danger zone.",
    ["PvpHunter_tips_013"]="Monsters or other adventurers will drop equipment of their class when they are killed.",
    ["PvpHunter_tips_014"]="Adventurers are awarded a different amount of points according to their Survival Ranking.",
    ["PvpHunter_tips_015"]="Event Restrictions",
    ["PvpHunter_tips_016"]="Fly Wing and Butterfly Wing cannot be used on the battlefield.",
    ["PvpHunter_tips_017"]="PVE potion, Yggdrasil Berry, and Seed of Yggdrasil cannot be used on the battlefield.",
    ["PvpHunter_tips_018"]="If you quit during the battle phase, you will be unable to participate in the Ultimate Hunter event again for 10 minutes.",
    ["PvpHunter_tips_019"]="Pets cannot be used in the Arena.",
    ["PvpHunter_tips_020"]="Event Reward",
    ["PvpHunter_tips_021"]="Points per Round",
    ["PvpHunter_tips_022"]="Results are determined when a player is defeated in the arena or when there is only one player remaining in the arena.",
    ["PvpHunter_tips_023"]="Adventurers are awarded a different amount of points according to their Survival Ranking.",
    ["PvpHunter_tips_024"]="No. 1 Reward: 25 points",
    ["PvpHunter_tips_025"]="No. 2 Reward: 20 points",
    ["PvpHunter_tips_026"]="No. 3 Reward: 15 points",
    ["PvpHunter_tips_027"]="No. 4-6 Reward: 10 points",
    ["PvpHunter_tips_028"]="No. 7-10 Reward: 5 points",
    ["PvpHunter_tips_029"]="No. 11-15 Reward: 2 points",
    ["PvpHunter_tips_030"]="No. 16-20 Reward: 1 point",
    ["PvpHunter_tips_031"]="Tiers and Rewards",
    ["PvpHunter_tips_032"]="Season results are tallied and all points are cleared at 5:00 AM every Monday.",
    ["PvpHunter_tips_033"]="For tier requirements and detailed reward information, please view the Ultimate Hunter Showdown - Reward Preview tab.",
    ["PvpHunter_tips_034"]="Rules",
    ["PvpHunter_tips_035"]="Mechanics",
    ["PvpHunter_tips_036"]="Everyone's class will become Novice after they enter the arena.",
    ["PvpHunter_tips_037"]="Pick up class equipment to automatically transform and obtain corresponding skills.",
    ["PvpHunter_tips_038"]="Kill monsters to get EXP. The amount of EXP gained increases with the level of the monsters killed.",
    ["PvpHunter_tips_039"]="Unable to open this in the Ultimate Hunter event.",
