    ["QixiText_001"]="Daily Wish: %s/%s times",
    ["QixiText_002"]="Gifting Chances Today: %s/%s",
    ["QixiText_003"]="The Milky Way responds to your %s, and you obtain %s.",
    ["QixiText_004"]="Your partner obtains %s through %s.",
    ["QixiText_005"]="You gift %s to your partner with love.",
    ["QixiText_006"]="Your partner sends you %s as a gift of love.",
    ["QixiText_007"]="The Milky Way have responded to your wishes today. Come again tomorrow!",
    ["QixiText_008"]="You’ve used up all of your gifting chances for today!",
    ["QixiText_009"]="Zeny Wish",
    ["QixiText_010"]="Crystal Wish",
    ["QixiText_011"]="Diamond Wish",
    ["QixiText_012"]="Please pair up first before participating in the Star Festival Gift event!",
    ["QixiText_013"]="Exchange Chances: %s",
    ["QixiText_014"]="Invite",
    ["QixiText_015"]="The  \\“Sea of Stars\\” event has ended. Exchange for rewards now!",
    ["QixiText_016"]="You don't have any friends yet, please add some first!",
    ["QixiText_017"]="No friends available, go find more friends!",
    ["QixiText_018"]="Quick Invite",
    ["QixiText_019"]="Quick Decline",
    ["QixiText_020"]="Invite",
    ["QixiText_021"]="Accept",
    ["QixiText_022"]="You are not yet a friend of this person and cannot send an invitation!",
    ["QixiText_023"]="You are not yet a friend of this person and cannot send a pairing invitation!",
    ["QixiText_024"]="Event Info\n1. Event Duration: %s\n2. Exchange Duration: %s\n3. Event Conditions: Friends can only participate in the event after the pairing, and the contract can not be cancelled after it is reached. Hurry to find the your loved one!\n4. Event Description - Perfect Match: Quest count can be shared, and completions (by both parties) will accumulate. Get more points, and unlock those awesome rewards! Except Total Recharge Diamonds, Total Exchange Center transaction amount, total equipment upgrading/enchanting/refining/smelting, for other quest chains, it is necessary to claim the rewards of the previous quest to start counting the next quest chain. Completed quests with unclaimed rewards will not be counted. Please collect quest rewards in time.\n5. Event Description - Wish Upon a Star: Make a wish to get the Event Exchange Items. Players can make 9 wishes per day, with the 1st to 2nd time consuming Zeny, the 3rd to 5th time consuming Crystals, and the 6th to 9th time consuming Diamonds. Please pay attention to this!\n6. Event Description - Sweet Exchange: Players can exchange Star Festival gifts here after collecting enough event items!\n7. Event Description - Magpie Bridge Blessings: After successful pairing, players can get Event Exchange Items by consuming Odin's Blessings to kill the monsters!\n8. Event Description - Point Gift Pack: After completing the quest The Perfect Match, both sides will get points and can claim Star Festival gift packs once their accumulated points reach the conditions!\n9. Event Description - Gift of Love: Players can give 10 event items to their loved one every day, and Kafra's VIPs enjoy more gifting chances!",
    ["QixiText_025"]="Are you sure you want to spend %s Crystals to make a wish?",
    ["QixiText_026"]="Are you sure you want to spend %s Diamonds to make a wish?",
    ["QuestFinishBtn"]="Complete",
    ["Quest_Help01_01"]="Mission Board Rules:\n1. 10 missions are available on the Mission Board on a daily basis, complete those missions to receive Odin & Experience\n2. Once receive a mission, players can use [Mission Order] to complete the mission instantaneously. However, by doing so, bonus rewards will be unavailable.\n3. Players complete missions through normal procedures can receive bonus rewards, qualified missions can not be completed with [Mission Order].\n4. Complete Special Missions to receive [Mission Order].",
    ["QueuingTme"]="Queue Time",
    ["QuickInheritanceRules"]="Quick Transfer Rules:\n1. With Quick Transfer, you can conduct Ordinary Transfer on armor and accessories from other load-outs to the current one in one tap; Adventurers can choose items to transfer for each part manually.\n2. For individual parts, transfer follows the Ordinary Transfer rules.\n3. Special Note: If the equipment from the original load-out is already equipped in the current one, it cannot be transferred.\n4. Quick Transfer consumes the total cost of multiple parts' Ordinary Transfer.",
