    ["RE0_answer_01"]="What's Emilia's magic attribute?",
    ["RE0_answer_02"]="Fire",
    ["RE0_answer_03"]="Water",
    ["RE0_answer_04"]="Wind",
    ["RE0_answer_05"]="Earth",
    ["RE0_answer_06"]="What race is Rem?",
    ["RE0_answer_07"]="Cat",
    ["RE0_answer_08"]="Dog",
    ["RE0_answer_09"]="Lizard",
    ["RE0_answer_10"]="Demon",
    ["RE0_answer_11"]="What is Subaru Natsuki good at?",
    ["RE0_answer_12"]="Flips",
    ["RE0_answer_13"]="Magic Tricks",
    ["RE0_answer_14"]="Speed Reading",
    ["RE0_answer_15"]="Fishing",
    ["RE0_answer_16"]="To Emilia, what role does Puck, her contracted spirit, play?",
    ["RE0_answer_17"]="Mother",
    ["RE0_answer_18"]="Father",
    ["RE0_answer_19"]="Sister",
    ["RE0_answer_20"]="Brother",
    ["RE0_answer_21"]="What task does Rem handle at the Roswaal Mansion?",
    ["RE0_answer_22"]="Cleaning",
    ["RE0_answer_23"]="Laundry",
    ["RE0_answer_24"]="Cooking",
    ["RE0_answer_25"]="Everything",
    ["RE0_answer_26"]="What does Subaru Natsuki usually wear?",
    ["RE0_answer_27"]="Tracksuit",
    ["RE0_answer_28"]="Suit",
    ["RE0_answer_29"]="Swimwear",
    ["RE0_answer_30"]="Combat Suit",
    ["RE0_npc_01"]="A totally lost and useless protagonist.",
    ["RE0_npc_02"]="Gets summoned to another world and ends up in a tricky situation.",
    ["RE0_npc_03"]="With a brave spirit and a naturally shameless personality, he manages to face the harsh destiny despite being frustrated by tough times.",
    ["RE0_npc_04"]="The \"Witch of Envy,\" is a beautiful half elf girl with silver hair and violet-blue eyes who once came close to destroying the world.",
    ["RE0_npc_05"]="She's very kind and always happy to lend a hand, but somehow, she just won't admit it openly.",
    ["RE0_npc_06"]="A cat-shaped spirit named Puck follows her around everywhere. She's one of the candidates for the next king of the Lugunica Kingdom.",
    ["RE0_npc_07"]="She's the maid handling all the chores at Roswaal Mansion.",
    ["RE0_npc_08"]="It's pretty much her talent that keeps the mansion functioning smoothly and well.",
    ["RE0_npc_09"]="She's a powerful demon survivor and really looks up to her twin sister, Ram.",
    ["ROXicDialog_00"]="For glory!",
    ["ROXicDialog_01"]="Welcome to the Pantheon Arena. Here you can perform gender conversion and job advancement first, or go directly to the cultivation area.",
    ["ROXicDialog_02"]="Are you ready to compete for this glory?",
