    ["RaidInstance39"]="◆ Each leaderboard tallies only once at 05:00 on the tally day. The overall leaderboard is based on the combined scores of the sub-leaderboards and will end once all sub-leaderboards are completed.\n◆ Leaderboard Rewards: If the Adventurers' results are the same, the rewards of the highest ranking are granted regardless of the Adventurers' rankings.\n◆ Leaderboard rewards will be sent via mail.",
