    ["RamadanQuestDesc_101"]="Kill monsters %s/%s times",
    ["RamadanQuestDesc_102"]="Go mining %s/%s times",
    ["RamadanQuestDesc_103"]="Upgrade equipment %s/%s times",
    ["RamadanQuestDesc_104"]="Give gifts to friends %s/%s times",
    ["RamadanQuestDesc_105"]="Complete Guild Orders: %s/%s times",
    ["RamadanQuestDesc_106"]="Go gathering %s/%s times",
    ["RamadanQuestDesc_107"]="Enchant %s/%s times",
    ["RamadanQuestDesc_108"]="Clear any Daily Instances %s/%s times",
    ["RamadanQuestDesc_109"]="Perform smelting %s/%s times",
    ["RamadanQuestDesc_110"]="Exchange Center transaction amount reach %s/%s",
    ["RamadanQuestDesc_111"]="Log in to the game %s/%s times",
    ["RamadanQuestDesc_112"]="Recharge %s/%s Diamonds",
    ["RamadanQuestDesc_119"]="Consume %s/%s Odin’s Blessings",
    ["RamadanQuestDesc_120"]="Clear any Daily Instances %s/%s times",
    ["RamadanQuestDesc_121"]="Send gifts to friends %s/%s times",
    ["RamadanQuestDesc_122"]="Recharge %s/%s Diamonds in a day",
    ["RamadanTitle_10000"]="Personal Quests",
    ["RamadanTitle_10001"]="Friend Quests",
    ["RamadanTitle_10002"]="1. Non-event cumulative quests reset at 05:00 daily.\n2. For Friend Quests, completing quests contributes to quest progress after you are bound to a friend.\n3. Send friends exclusive gifts daily, and you can receive event-exclusive exchange items. Up to 36 rewards can be obtained throughout the event period. After reaching the maximum, only the Favor will be increased.",
    ["RamadanTitle_10003"]="Sacred Moon Homework",
    ["RamadanTitle_10004"]="Sacred Moon Calendar",
    ["RamadanTitle_10005"]="Sacred Moon Fellowship",
    ["RamadanTitle_10006"]="Blessing in Prontera can earn you Night Hunt <color=#ffd633>MVP High Damage Items</color>",
    ["RamadanTitle_10007"]="MVPs & Minis mutated at night can produce <color=#ffd633>Crescent-Aria Shop exchange materials</color>",
    ["RamadanTitle_10008"]="Bless",
    ["RamadanTitle_10009"]="Go to MVP",
    ["RamadanTitle_10010"]="1. Binding can only be done with friends who are ≥25 Base level.\n2. A character can be bound to 1 friend at most.\n3. Send friends exclusive gifts daily, and you can receive event-exclusive exchange items. Up to 36 rewards can be obtained throughout the event period. After reaching the maximum, only the Favor will be increased.",
    ["RamadanTitle_10011"]="Bound Friend %s",
    ["RamadanTitle_10012"]="Invite List",
    ["RamadanTitle_10013"]="Request List",
    ["RamadanTitle_10014"]="Day Prayer\n1. Complete \"Journey of Star Chaser\" quests during the event to obtain Drum Beat action unlocking items. The action has to be used in the backpack to unlock it.\n2. During the event, performing blessing at Prontera Fountain (Drum Beat at certain areas) earns you event-exclusive rewards. Up to 3 times a day.\n3. After the Moonlight Flag is used, a Flag will be placed on the ground, and Adventurers can start gathering. After gathering, they will obtain Drops of Moonlight. The Flag has a gathering limit. Each Flag can only be collected by the same Adventurer 1 time, and each person has a limit of 3 gathering attempts per day.\n4. Drops of Moonlight grant buffs when used during the day. At night, they can be used on MVPs and Minis to deal damage and grant buffs.\n  \nNight Hunt\n1. During the event, the MVP & Mini bosses will mutate at night. If you defeat them, there's a chance they will summon clones after 10 minutes. The clones will appear in a random spot on the same map. Successfully taking them down will grant you Gifts of Stars exchange materials and Void rewards.\n2. Each player can earn MVP clone drops and participation rewards 3 times per day respectively. The attempts do not count towards your regular MVP rewards.\n3. Bind with a friend during the event and use Odin's Blessings to auto-battle to get event-exclusive materials. Daily limit: Baklava x150, Sachet x15.\n  \nGifts for Friends\nDuring the event, sending an exclusive gift to your friend can increase the Favor between the two of you, and you will also receive extra rewards. Up to 36 extra rewards can be obtained throughout the event period. After reaching the maximum, only the Favor will be increased each time you send a gift.",
    ["RamadanTitle_10015"]="You have refused to be bound to your Friend",
    ["RamadanTitle_10016"]="You are bound to your Friend",
    ["RankName_1"]="Warrior",
    ["RankName_2"]="Guardian",
    ["RankName_3"]="Fortress",
    ["RankName_4"]="Epic",
    ["RankName_5"]="Legendary",
    ["RankingTagText_001"]="Popularity Master",
    ["RankingTagText_002"]="Super Charming",
    ["RankingTagText_003"]="Filthy Rich",
    ["RankingTagText_004"]="Level Climber",
    ["RankingTagText_005"]="Shining New Star",
    ["RateBreak"]="Break Chance",
    ["RateFail"]="Failure Chance",
    ["RateHigh"]="High",
    ["RateLow"]="Low",
    ["RateLower"]="Very Low",
    ["RateLowest"]="Extremely Low",
    ["RateMiddle"]="Average",
    ["RateReset"]="Break Chance",
    ["RateSuccess"]="Success Chance",
    ["Re0_Dungeon_CardDDes001"]="When receiving lethal damage, triggers Self-Regeneration, instantly recovers 30% HP, and heals 2% Max HP per second for 10 seconds (Cooldown: 60 seconds. This effect does not stack.)",
    ["Re0_Dungeon_CardDDes002"]="There is a 3% chance of getting a buff when using normal attacks or dealing skill damage, increasing the damage dealt against all MVPs, Minis, and Bosses by 20%. Lasts 10 seconds with a 20-second cooldown.",
    ["Re0_Dungeon_CardDDes003"]="The chance for triggering Auto Spell: Lv.5 Frost Diver (instantaneous) is 6% when launching melee normal attacks, and 3% when launching ranged normal attacks. Not stackable.",
    ["Re0_Dungeon_CardDDes004"]="Applies the Investigate effect to the weapon: For every 50 points of P.DEF that the target has, increases your damage dealt by 1% (up to 30%). Consumes an additional 20 SP when attacking every time (normal attacks/skills). P.DEF/M.DEF -30%, Flee -30%.",
    ["Re0_Dungeon_CardDDes005"]="When using normal attacks/skills, there is a 10% chance that the next damage comes with a Lv.6 Ice Arrow Auto Spell, dealing 600% Water attribute Adaptive DMG. Cooldown: 2 seconds. Increases damage dealt to Bleeding targets by 100%.",
    ["Re0_Dungeon_CardDDes006"]="When using normal attacks/skills, there is a 10% chance that the next damage comes with a Lv.8 Magic Crasher Auto Spell, dealing 220% Neutral attribute Adaptive DMG. Cooldown: 2 seconds. Increases damage dealt to Bleeding targets by 100%.",
    ["Re0_Dungeon_CardDDes007"]="There is a 15% chance to increase your Final P.DEF by 72% for 6 seconds when being hit. Cooldown: 12 seconds.",
    ["Re0_Dungeon_CardDDes008"]="There is a 15% chance to gain a shield equal to 24% of your Max HP for 6 seconds when being hit. Cooldown: 12 seconds.",
    ["Re0_Dungeon_CardDDes009"]="Increases your Final DMG Reduction by 45% for 6 seconds when total damage taken exceeds 20% of your Max HP. Triggers once every 18 seconds.",
    ["Re0_Dungeon_CardDDes010"]="When dealing ranged normal attacks, there is a 1.5% chance (stackable) of inflicting Bleed on the target. Lasts 10 seconds.",
    ["Re0_Dungeon_CardDDes011"]="When dealing melee normal attacks, there is a 0.2% chance (stackable) of triggering Auto Spell: Lv.10 Strip Weapon, and the probability of stripping weapons is 15%. Lasts 12 seconds.",
    ["Re0_Dungeon_CardDDes012"]="Reduces Max HP by 25% and grants a permanent Endure status.",
    ["Re0_Dungeon_CardDDes013"]="There's a 40% chance of gaining immunity to M.DMG. Skill SP cost is increased by 50%.",
    ["Re0_Dungeon_CardDDes014"]="Increases Immobilization Resistance by 100%. Gains the Entertainment Skill: Speed-o'-Sound Sonic (Soul) Transformation to transform into Speed-o'-Sound Sonic for 1 minute. Cooldown: 3 minutes.",
    ["Re0_Dungeon_CardDDes015"]="Increases Freeze Resistance by 100%. Gains the Entertainment Skill: Genos (Soul) Transformation to transform into Genos for 1 minute. Cooldown: 3 minutes.",
    ["Re0_Dungeon_CardDDes016"]="Gains the infinite Endure effect and the Entertainment Skill: Terrible Tornado (Soul) Transformation to transform into Terrible Tornado for 1 minute. Cooldown: 3 minutes.",
    ["Re0_Dungeon_CardDDes017"]="Increases Stun Resistance by 100%. Gains the ability to transform into Saitama for 1 minute. Cooldown: 3 minutes. In Saitama form, you can defeat a monster with a single blow! Engaging in MVP/MINI/Boss battles will forcibly terminate the transformation.",
    ["Re0_Dungeon_CardDDes018"]="There's a 2% chance with every normal attack and a 6% chance with each skill to summon Tanjiro Kamado for assistance for 30 seconds. Cooldown: 300 seconds. (Only one assistant can be active at a time.)",
    ["Re0_Dungeon_CardDDes019"]="There's a 2% chance with every normal attack and a 6% chance with each skill to summon Inosuke Hashibira for assistance for 30 seconds. Cooldown: 300 seconds. (Only one assistant can be active at a time.)",
    ["Re0_Dungeon_CardDDes020"]="There's a 2% chance with every normal attack and a 6% chance with each skill to summon Hinokami Tanjiro Kamado for assistance for 30 seconds. Cooldown: 300 seconds. (Only one assistant can be active at a time.)",
    ["Re0_Dungeon_CardDDes021"]="Increases Earth/Water/Fire/Wind elemental reduction by 30% and Final P.DMG/M.DMG Bonus by 35%.",
    ["Re0_Dungeon_CardDDes022"]="Revives on the spot after dying, recovering all HP and SP. (Cooldown: 300 seconds. Unstackable.)",
    ["Re0_Dungeon_CardDDes023"]="Each normal attack hit has a 3% chance to trigger Lv.10 Fire Ball instantly.",
    ["Re0_Dungeon_CardDDes024"]="Normal attacks have| a 20% chance to trigger Holy Blessing, converting your armor attribute into Holy for 3 seconds. Additionally, increases your Holy & Neutral attribute damage by 2% and Holy & Neutral attribute resistance by 2% for 3 seconds. Stacks up to 10 times.",
    ["Re0_Dungeon_CardDDes025"]="Your Wind & Ghost attribute M.DMG has a 30% chance to deal an additional 100% damage. All damage taken is increased by 40%. (Unique set effect. Cannot be stacked.)",
    ["Re0_Dungeon_CardDDes026"]="When dealing skill damage on the target, Fatal Missile will be automatically cast, dealing Adaptive Neutral DMG equal to 360% of Adaptive ATK to the target. Cooldown: 3 seconds. If the target is immobilized, Fatal Missile deals an additional Adaptive Neutral DMG equal to 1.5% of the target's Max HP. When the average refinement level reaches Lv.+6 or every subsequent level, the damage coefficient of Fatal Missile is increased by an additional 60% up to 10 levels.",
    ["Re0_Dungeon_CardDDes027"]="Increases Fire Bolt and Cold Bolt's coefficient by 40% per skill level. Every 100 INT increases Fire Bolt and Cold Bolt's coefficient by 1% per skill level (up to 80%). When equipped by Warlock, Sorcerer, or Super Novice, the fixed cast time is reduced by 0.5 seconds. (This fixed cast time reduction does not stack with Sacrament.)",
    ["Re0_Dungeon_CardDDes028"]="Increases the damage against Insect monsters by 10%.Depending on the refinement level, for each level above Lv.6, the damage against Insect monsters is increased by 3%, and the damage of Porcellio is increased by 25%. Automatically summon a Porcellio to join the battle (only one can exist at a time. Cooldown: 5 minutes.). Skill 1: Deals 397% melee Adaptive Earth DMG to a single target within 3 meters. Cooldown: 3 seconds. Skill 2: Applies a Lv.10 Pneuma to the master. Cooldown: 40 seconds.",
    ["Re0_Dungeon_CardDDes029"]="Reduces Max HP by 25% and increases Final Crit by 25%. When dealing Neutral attribute Crit DMG, it inflicts one hit that deals an additional 10% damage to the target (an additional 60% damage if the target is poisoned). Depending on the average refinement level of the weapon, for each level above Lv.5, the bonus damage coefficient of this card is increased by 2.2% up to 10 levels.",
    ["Re0_Dungeon_CardDDes030"]="When casting normal attacks or skills, there's a 10% chance to summon Kenshiro to release Hokuto Hyakuretsu Ken, dealing 1,800% weapon attribute P.DMG. Cooldown: 20 seconds. (Attack range: 125-degree fan-shaped area x5m) After triggering, it increases P.ATK by 50% and Final P.PEN by 25% for 10 seconds.",
    ["Re0_Dungeon_CardDDes031"]="When casting normal attacks or skills, there's a 10% chance to summon Kenshiro to release Hokuto Hyakuretsu Ken, dealing 1,800% weapon attribute M.DMG. Cooldown: 20 seconds. (Attack range: 125-degree fan-shaped area x5m) After triggering, it increases M.ATK by 50% and Final M.PEN by 25% for 10 seconds.",
    ["Re0_Dungeon_CardDDes032"]="When casting normal attacks or skills, there's a 10% chance to summon Raoh to release Tensho Honretsu, dealing 2,400% weapon attribute P.DMG. Cooldown: 20 seconds. (Attack range: straight line, 12m long and 3m wide) After triggering, it increases the damage against MVP and MINI by 20% for 10 seconds.",
    ["Re0_Dungeon_CardDDes033"]="When casting normal attacks or skills, there's a 10% chance to summon Raoh to release Tensho Honretsu, dealing 2,400% weapon attribute P.DMG. Cooldown: 20 seconds. (Attack range: straight line, 12m long and 3m wide) After triggering, it increases your P.ATK by 50% and Crit DMG Bonus by 25% for 10 seconds.",
    ["Re0_Dungeon_CardDDes034"]="When dealing skill damage on the target, there's a 10% chance of casting Fatal Missile automatically, dealing Adaptive Shadow DMG equal to 2,000% of Adaptive ATK to the target. For every 10% Max HP lost by the target, the trigger rate increases by 8%, up to 40%. When the average refinement level reaches Lv.+6 or every subsequent level, the damage coefficient is increased by an additional 500% up to 2,500%. Triggers once every 20 seconds.",
    ["Re0_Dungeon_CardDDes035"]="When your Holy Enhancement is higher than the Shadow Enhancement, there's a 9% chance to summon a Holy Magic Circle when attacked, applying a Holy Armor to yourself and making each of your normal attacks and skills to deal an additional Adaptive Holy DMG equal to 100% and 300% of Adaptive ATK, respectively. When your Shadow Enhancement is higher than the Holy Enhancement, there's a 9% chance to summon a Shadow Magic Circle when attacked, applying a Shadow Armor to yourself and making each of your normal attacks and skills to deal an additional Adaptive Shadow DMG equal to 100% and 300% of Adaptive ATK, respectively. The Magic Circle effect triggers every 10 seconds, lasting 20 seconds. If the Holy Enhancement and the Shadow Enhancement are equal, the Magic Circle will be triggered in either attribute at random. When your Final Crit is higher than Final Penetration, this bonus damage may trigger critical damage.",
    ["Re0_Dungeon_CardDDes036"]="There's a <color=#FFA500>20%%</color> chance to reset the skill cooldown while casting.",
    ["Re0_Dungeon_CardDDes037"]="There's a 40% chance of gaining immunity to M.DMG. Skill SP cost is increased by 50%. (This effect cannot stack and cannot be used in PVP mode.)",
    ["Re0_Dungeon_CardDDes038"]="Revives on the spot after dying, recovering all HP and SP. (Cooldown: 300 seconds. This effect does not stack.）",
    ["Re0_Dungeon_CardDDes039"]="Reflects <color=#FFA500>15%%</color> of the damage taken as Neutral DMG when hit.",
    ["Re0_Dungeon_CardDDes040"]="There's a <color=#FFA500>20%%</color> chance to stun the attacker for <color=#FFA500>4</color> seconds when hit.",
    ["Re0_Dungeon_CardDDes041"]="There's a <color=#FFA600>20%%</color> chance to stun the attacker for <color=#FFA600>4</color> seconds when hit.",
    ["Re0_Dungeon_CardDDes042"]="Reflects <color=#FFA500>100%%</color> of the damage taken as Neutral P.DMG when hit.",
    ["Re0_Dungeon_CardDDes043"]="Increases your Final DMG Bonus by <color=#FFA500>10%%</color> after fleeing an attack.",
    ["Re0_Dungeon_CardDDes044"]="There's a <color=#FFA500>5%%</color> chance to trigger the Kyrie Eleison effect when taking normal attack damage.",
    ["Re0_Dungeon_CardDDes045"]="Increases normal attack damage by <color=#FFA500>60%%</color>, with each attack consuming 100 SP.",
    ["Re0_Dungeon_CardDDes046"]="There's a <color=#FFA500>5%%</color> chance to summon a meteor for 2 seconds when taking normal attack damage.",
    ["Re0_Dungeon_CardDDes047"]="Inflicts Poison on the target for 6 seconds when taking normal attack damage.",
    ["Re0_Dungeon_CardDes001"]="<color=#9c6f59>When receiving lethal damage, triggers Self-Regeneration, instantly recovers 30% HP, and heals 2% Max HP per second for 10 seconds (Cooldown: 60 seconds. This effect does not stack.)</color>",
    ["Re0_Dungeon_CardDes002"]="<color=#9c6f59>There is a 3% chance of getting a buff when using normal attacks or dealing skill damage, increasing the damage dealt against all MVPs, Minis, and Bosses by 20%. Lasts 10 seconds with a 20-second cooldown.</color>",
    ["Re0_Dungeon_CardDes003"]="<color=#9c6f59>The chance for triggering Auto Spell: Lv.5 Frost Diver (instantaneous) is 6% when launching melee normal attacks, and 3% when launching ranged normal attacks. Not stackable.</color>",
    ["Re0_Dungeon_CardDes004"]="<color=#9c6f59>Applies the Investigate effect to the weapon: For every 50 points of P.DEF that the target has, increases your damage dealt by 1% (up to 30%). Consumes an additional 20 SP when attacking every time (normal attacks/skills). P.DEF/M.DEF -30%, Flee -30%.</color>",
    ["Re0_Dungeon_CardDes005"]="<color=#9c6f59>When using normal attacks/skills, there is a 10% chance that the next damage comes with a Lv.6 Ice Arrow Auto Spell, dealing 600% Water attribute Adaptive DMG. Cooldown: 2 seconds. Increases damage dealt to Bleeding targets by 100%.</color>",
    ["Re0_Dungeon_CardDes006"]="<color=#9c6f59>When using normal attacks/skills, there is a 10% chance that the next damage comes with a Lv.8 Magic Crasher Auto Spell, dealing 220% Neutral attribute Adaptive DMG. Cooldown: 2 seconds. Increases damage dealt to Bleeding targets by 100%.</color>",
    ["Re0_Dungeon_CardDes007"]="<color=#9c6f59>There is a 15% chance to increase your Final P.DEF by 72% for 6 seconds when being hit. Cooldown: 12 seconds.</color>",
    ["Re0_Dungeon_CardDes008"]="<color=#9c6f59>There is a 15% chance to gain a shield equal to 24% of your Max HP for 6 seconds when being hit. Cooldown: 12 seconds.</color>",
    ["Re0_Dungeon_CardDes009"]="<color=#9c6f59>Increases your Final DMG Reduction by 45% for 6 seconds when total damage taken exceeds 20% of your Max HP. Triggers once every 18 seconds.</color>",
    ["Re0_Dungeon_CardDes010"]="<color=#9c6f59>When dealing ranged normal attacks, there is a 1.5% chance (stackable) of inflicting Bleed on the target. Lasts 10 seconds.</color>",
    ["Re0_Dungeon_CardDes011"]="<color=#9c6f59>When dealing melee normal attacks, there is a 0.2% chance (stackable) of triggering Auto Spell: Lv.10 Strip Weapon, and the probability of stripping weapons is 15%. Lasts 12 seconds.</color>",
    ["Re0_Dungeon_CardDes012"]="<color=#9c6f59>Reduces Max HP by 25% and grants a permanent Endure status.</color>",
    ["Re0_Dungeon_CardDes013"]="<color=#9c6f59>There's a 40% chance of gaining immunity to M.DMG. Skill SP cost is increased by 50%.</color>",
    ["Re0_Dungeon_CardDes014"]="<color=#9c6f59>Increases Immobilization Resistance by 100%. Gains the Entertainment Skill: Speed-o'-Sound Sonic (Soul) Transformation to transform into Speed-o'-Sound Sonic for 1 minute. Cooldown: 3 minutes.</color>",
    ["Re0_Dungeon_CardDes015"]="<color=#9c6f59>Increases Freeze Resistance by 100%. Gains the Entertainment Skill: Genos (Soul) Transformation to transform into Genos for 1 minute. Cooldown: 3 minutes.</color>",
    ["Re0_Dungeon_CardDes016"]="<color=#9c6f59>Gains the infinite Endure effect and the Entertainment Skill: Terrible Tornado (Soul) Transformation to transform into Terrible Tornado for 1 minute. Cooldown: 3 minutes.</color>",
    ["Re0_Dungeon_CardDes017"]="<color=#9c6f59>Increases Stun Resistance by 100%. Gains the ability to transform into Saitama for 1 minute. Cooldown: 3 minutes. In Saitama form, you can defeat a monster with a single blow! Engaging in MVP/MINI/Boss battles will forcibly terminate the transformation.</color>",
    ["Re0_Dungeon_CardDes018"]="<color=#9c6f59>There's a 2% chance with every normal attack and a 6% chance with each skill to summon Tanjiro Kamado for assistance for 30 seconds. Cooldown: 300 seconds. (Only one assistant can be active at a time.)</color>",
    ["Re0_Dungeon_CardDes019"]="<color=#9c6f59>There's a 2% chance with every normal attack and a 6% chance with each skill to summon Inosuke Hashibira for assistance for 30 seconds. Cooldown: 300 seconds. (Only one assistant can be active at a time.)</color>",
    ["Re0_Dungeon_CardDes020"]="<color=#9c6f59>There's a 2% chance with every normal attack and a 6% chance with each skill to summon Hinokami Tanjiro Kamado for assistance for 30 seconds. Cooldown: 300 seconds. (Only one assistant can be active at a time.)</color>",
    ["Re0_Dungeon_CardDes021"]="<color=#9c6f59>Increases Earth/Water/Fire/Wind elemental reduction by 30% and Final P.DMG/M.DMG Bonus by 35%.</color>",
    ["Re0_Dungeon_CardDes022"]="<color=#9c6f59>Revives on the spot after dying, recovering all HP and SP. (Cooldown: 300 seconds. Unstackable.)</color>",
    ["Re0_Dungeon_CardDes023"]="<color=#9c6f59>Each normal attack hit has a 3% chance to trigger Lv.10 Fire Ball instantly.</color>",
    ["Re0_Dungeon_CardDes024"]="<color=#9c6f59>Normal attacks have a 20% chance to trigger Holy Blessing, converting your armor attribute into Holy for 3 seconds. Additionally, increases your Holy & Neutral attribute damage by 2% and Holy & Neutral attribute resistance by 2% for 3 seconds. Stacks up to 10 times.</color>",
    ["Re0_Dungeon_CardDes025"]="<color=#9c6f59>Your Wind & Ghost attribute M.DMG has a 30% chance to deal an additional 100% damage. All damage taken is increased by 40%. (Unique set effect. Cannot be stacked.)</color>",
    ["Re0_Dungeon_CardDes026"]="<color=#9c6f59>When dealing skill damage on the target, Fatal Missile will be automatically cast, dealing Adaptive Neutral DMG equal to 360% of Adaptive ATK to the target. Cooldown: 3 seconds. If the target is immobilized, Fatal Missile deals an additional Adaptive Neutral DMG equal to 1.5% of the target's Max HP. When the average refinement level reaches Lv.+6 or every subsequent level, the damage coefficient of Fatal Missile is increased by an additional 60% up to 10 levels.</color>",
    ["Re0_Dungeon_CardDes027"]="<color=#9c6f59>Increases Fire Bolt and Cold Bolt's coefficient by 40% per skill level. Every 100 INT increases Fire Bolt and Cold Bolt's coefficient by 1% per skill level (up to 80%). When equipped by Warlock, Sorcerer, or Super Novice, the fixed cast time is reduced by 0.5 seconds. (This fixed cast time reduction does not stack with Sacrament.)</color>",
    ["Re0_Dungeon_CardDes028"]="<color=#9c6f59>Increases the damage against Insect monsters by 10%.Depending on the refinement level, for each level above Lv.6, the damage against Insect monsters is increased by 3%, and the damage of Porcellio is increased by 25%. Automatically summon a Porcellio to join the battle (only one can exist at a time. Cooldown: 5 minutes.). Skill 1: Deals 397% melee Adaptive Earth DMG to a single target within 3 meters. Cooldown: 3 seconds. Skill 2: Applies a Lv.10 Pneuma to the master. Cooldown: 40 seconds.</color>",
    ["Re0_Dungeon_CardDes029"]="<color=#9c6f59>Reduces Max HP by 25% and increases Final Crit by 25%. When dealing Neutral attribute Crit DMG, it inflicts one hit that deals an additional 10% damage to the target (an additional 60% damage if the target is poisoned). Depending on the average refinement level of the weapon, for each level above Lv.5, the bonus damage coefficient of this card is increased by 2.2% up to 10 levels.</color>",
    ["Re0_Dungeon_CardDes030"]="<color=#9c6f59>When casting normal attacks or skills, there's a 10% chance to summon Kenshiro to release Hokuto Hyakuretsu Ken, dealing 1,800% weapon attribute P.DMG. Cooldown: 20 seconds. (Attack range: 125-degree fan-shaped area x5m) After triggering, it increases P.ATK by 50% and Final P.PEN by 25% for 10 seconds.</color>",
    ["Re0_Dungeon_CardDes031"]="<color=#9c6f59>When casting normal attacks or skills, there's a 10% chance to summon Kenshiro to release Hokuto Hyakuretsu Ken, dealing 1,800% weapon attribute M.DMG. Cooldown: 20 seconds. (Attack range: 125-degree fan-shaped area x5m) After triggering, it increases M.ATK by 50% and Final M.PEN by 25% for 10 seconds.</color>",
    ["Re0_Dungeon_CardDes032"]="<color=#9c6f59>When casting normal attacks or skills, there's a 10% chance to summon Raoh to release Tensho Honretsu, dealing 2,400% weapon attribute P.DMG. Cooldown: 20 seconds. (Attack range: straight line, 12m long and 3m wide) After triggering, it increases the damage against MVP and MINI by 20% for 10 seconds.</color>",
    ["Re0_Dungeon_CardDes033"]="<color=#9c6f59>When casting normal attacks or skills, there's a 10% chance to summon Raoh to release Tensho Honretsu, dealing 2,400% weapon attribute P.DMG. Cooldown: 20 seconds. (Attack range: straight line, 12m long and 3m wide) After triggering, it increases your P.ATK by 50% and Crit DMG Bonus by 25% for 10 seconds.</color>",
    ["Re0_Dungeon_CardDes034"]="<color=#9c6f59>When dealing skill damage on the target, there's a 10% chance of casting Fatal Missile automatically, dealing Adaptive Shadow DMG equal to 2,000% of Adaptive ATK to the target. For every 10% Max HP lost by the target, the trigger rate increases by 8%, up to 40%. When the average refinement level reaches Lv.+6 or every subsequent level, the damage coefficient is increased by an additional 500% up to 2,500%. Triggers once every 20 seconds.</color>",
    ["Re0_Dungeon_CardDes035"]="<color=#9c6f59>When your Holy Enhancement is higher than the Shadow Enhancement, there's a 9% chance to summon a Holy Magic Circle when attacked, applying a Holy Armor to yourself and making each of your normal attacks and skills to deal an additional Adaptive Holy DMG equal to 100% and 300% of Adaptive ATK, respectively. When your Shadow Enhancement is higher than the Holy Enhancement, there's a 9% chance to summon a Shadow Magic Circle when attacked, applying a Shadow Armor to yourself and making each of your normal attacks and skills to deal an additional Adaptive Shadow DMG equal to 100% and 300% of Adaptive ATK, respectively. The Magic Circle effect triggers every 10 seconds, lasting 20 seconds. If the Holy Enhancement and the Shadow Enhancement are equal, the Magic Circle will be triggered in either attribute at random. When your Final Crit is higher than Final Penetration, this bonus damage may trigger critical damage.</color>",
    ["Re0_Dungeon_CardDes036"]="<color=#9c6f59>There's a <color=#FFA500>20%%</color> chance to reset the skill cooldown while casting.</color>",
    ["Re0_Dungeon_CardDes037"]="<color=#9c6f59>There's a 40% chance of gaining immunity to M.DMG. Skill SP cost is increased by 50%. (This effect cannot stack and cannot be used in PVP mode.)</color>",
    ["Re0_Dungeon_CardDes038"]="<color=#9c6f59>Revives on the spot after dying, recovering all HP and SP. (Cooldown: 300 seconds. This effect does not stack.）</color>",
    ["Re0_Dungeon_CardDes039"]="<color=#9c6f59>Reflects <color=#FFA500>15%%</color> of the damage taken as Neutral DMG when hit.</color>",
    ["Re0_Dungeon_CardDes040"]="<color=#9c6f59>There's a <color=#FFA500>20%%</color> chance to stun the attacker for <color=#FFA500>4</color> seconds when hit.</color>",
    ["Re0_Dungeon_CardDes041"]="<color=#9c6f59>There's a <color=#FFA600>20%%</color> chance to stun the attacker for <color=#FFA600>4</color> seconds when hit.</color>",
    ["Re0_Dungeon_CardDes042"]="<color=#9c6f59>Reflects <color=#FFA500>100%%</color> of the damage taken as Neutral P.DMG when hit.</color>",
    ["Re0_Dungeon_CardDes043"]="<color=#9c6f59>Increases your Final DMG Bonus by <color=#FFA500>10%%</color> after fleeing an attack.</color>",
    ["Re0_Dungeon_CardDes044"]="<color=#9c6f59>There's a <color=#FFA500>5%%</color> chance to trigger the Kyrie Eleison effect when taking normal attack damage.</color>",
    ["Re0_Dungeon_CardDes045"]="<color=#9c6f59>Increases normal attack damage by <color=#FFA500>60%%</color>, with each attack consuming 100 SP.</color>",
    ["Re0_Dungeon_CardDes046"]="<color=#9c6f59>There's a <color=#FFA500>5%%</color> chance to summon a meteor for 2 seconds when taking normal attack damage.</color>",
    ["Re0_Dungeon_CardDes047"]="<color=#9c6f59>Inflicts Poison on the target for 6 seconds when taking normal attack damage.</color>",
    ["Re0_Dungeon_CardDes048"]="There is a 3% chance of getting a buff when using normal attacks or dealing skill damage, increasing the damage dealt against all MVPs, Minis, and Bosses by 20%. Lasts 10 seconds with a 20-second cooldown.",
    ["Re0_Dungeon_CardDes049"]="Normal attacks have a 20% chance to trigger Holy Blessing, converting your armor attribute into Holy for 3 seconds. Additionally, increases your Holy & Neutral attribute damage by 2% and Holy & Neutral attribute resistance by 2% for 3 seconds. Stacks up to 10 times.",
    ["Re0_Dungeon_CardDes050"]="Applies the Investigate effect to the weapon: For every 50 points of P.DEF that the target has, increases your damage dealt by 1% (up to 30%). Consumes an additional 20 SP when attacking every time (normal attacks/skills). P.DEF/M.DEF -30%, Flee -30%.",
    ["Re0_Dungeon_CardDes051"]="Revives on the spot after dying, recovering all HP and SP. (Cooldown: 300 seconds. Unstackable.)",
    ["Re0_Dungeon_CardDes052"]="There's a 40% chance of gaining immunity to M.DMG. Skill SP cost is increased by 50%.",
    ["Re0_Dungeon_CardDes053"]="When receiving lethal damage, triggers Self-Regeneration, instantly recovers 30% HP, and heals 2% Max HP per second for 10 seconds (Cooldown: 60 seconds. This effect does not stack.)",
    ["Re0_Dungeon_CardDes054"]="Gains the infinite Endure effect and the Entertainment Skill: Terrible Tornado (Soul) Transformation to transform into Terrible Tornado for 1 minute. Cooldown: 3 minutes.",
    ["Re0_Dungeon_CardDes055"]="Increases Immobilization Resistance by 100%. Gains the Entertainment Skill: Speed-o'-Sound Sonic (Soul) Transformation to transform into Speed-o'-Sound Sonic for 1 minute. Cooldown: 3 minutes.",
    ["Re0_Dungeon_CardDes056"]="Increases Stun Resistance by 100%. Gains the ability to transform into Saitama for 1 minute. Cooldown: 3 minutes. In Saitama form, you can defeat a monster with a single blow! Engaging in MVP/MINI/Boss battles will forcibly terminate the transformation.",
    ["Re0_Dungeon_CardDes057"]="Increases Earth/Water/Fire/Wind elemental reduction by 30% and Final P.DMG/M.DMG Bonus by 35%.",
    ["Re0_Dungeon_CardDes058"]="Your Wind & Ghost attribute M.DMG has a 30% chance to deal an additional 100% damage. All damage taken is increased by 40%. (Unique set effect. Cannot be stacked.)",
    ["Re0_Dungeon_CardDes059"]="When dealing skill damage on the target, Fatal Missile will be automatically cast, dealing Adaptive Neutral DMG equal to 360% of Adaptive ATK to the target. Cooldown: 3 seconds. If the target is immobilized, Fatal Missile deals an additional Adaptive Neutral DMG equal to 1.5% of the target's Max HP. When the average refinement level reaches Lv.+6 or every subsequent level, the damage coefficient of Fatal Missile is increased by an additional 60% up to 10 levels.",
    ["Re0_Dungeon_CardDes060"]="Increases Fire Bolt and Cold Bolt's coefficient by 40% per skill level. Every 100 INT increases Fire Bolt and Cold Bolt's coefficient by 1% per skill level (up to 80%). When equipped by Warlock, Sorcerer, or Super Novice, the fixed cast time is reduced by 0.5 seconds. (This fixed cast time reduction does not stack with Sacrament.)",
    ["Re0_Dungeon_CardDes061"]="Reduces Max HP by 25% and increases Final Crit by 25%. When dealing Neutral attribute Crit DMG, it inflicts one hit that deals an additional 10% damage to the target (an additional 60% damage if the target is poisoned). Depending on the average refinement level of the weapon, for each level above Lv.5, the bonus damage coefficient of this card is increased by 2.2% up to 10 levels.",
    ["Re0_Dungeon_CardDes062"]="When casting normal attacks or skills, there's a 10% chance to summon Kenshiro to release Hokuto Hyakuretsu Ken, dealing 1,800% weapon attribute P.DMG. Cooldown: 20 seconds. (Attack range: 125-degree fan-shaped area x5m) After triggering, it increases P.ATK by 50% and Final P.PEN by 25% for 10 seconds.",
    ["Re0_Dungeon_CardDes063"]="When casting normal attacks or skills, there's a 10% chance to summon Kenshiro to release Hokuto Hyakuretsu Ken, dealing 1,800% weapon attribute M.DMG. Cooldown: 20 seconds. (Attack range: 125-degree fan-shaped area x5m) After triggering, it increases M.ATK by 50% and Final M.PEN by 25% for 10 seconds.",
    ["Re0_Dungeon_CardDes064"]="When casting normal attacks or skills, there's a 10% chance to summon Raoh to release Tensho Honretsu, dealing 2,400% weapon attribute P.DMG. Cooldown: 20 seconds. (Attack range: straight line, 12m long and 3m wide) After triggering, it increases the damage against MVP and MINI by 20% for 10 seconds.",
    ["Re0_Dungeon_CardDes065"]="When casting normal attacks or skills, there's a 10% chance to summon Raoh to release Tensho Honretsu, dealing 2,400% weapon attribute P.DMG. Cooldown: 20 seconds. (Attack range: straight line, 12m long and 3m wide) After triggering, it increases your P.ATK by 50% and Crit DMG Bonus by 25% for 10 seconds.",
    ["Re0_Dungeon_CardDes066"]="When dealing skill damage on the target, there's a 10% chance of casting Fatal Missile automatically, dealing Adaptive Shadow DMG equal to 2,000% of Adaptive ATK to the target. For every 10% Max HP lost by the target, the trigger rate increases by 8%, up to 40%. When the average refinement level reaches Lv.+6 or every subsequent level, the damage coefficient is increased by an additional 500% up to 2,500%. Triggers once every 20 seconds.",
    ["Re0_Dungeon_CardDes067"]="When your Holy Enhancement is higher than the Shadow Enhancement, there's a 9% chance to summon a Holy Magic Circle when attacked, applying a Holy Armor to yourself and making each of your normal attacks and skills deal an additional Adaptive Holy DMG equal to 100% and 300% of Adaptive ATK, respectively. When your Shadow Enhancement is higher than the Holy Enhancement, there's a 9% chance to summon a Shadow Magic Circle when attacked, applying a Shadow Armor to yourself and making each of your normal attacks and skills deal an additional Adaptive Shadow DMG equal to 100% and 300% of Adaptive ATK, respectively. The Magic Circle effect triggers every 10 seconds, lasting 20 seconds. If the Holy Enhancement and the Shadow Enhancement are equal, the Magic Circle will be triggered in either attribute at random. When your Final Crit is higher than Final Penetration, this bonus damage may trigger critical damage.",
    ["Re0_Dungeon_CardDes068"]="Subaru Natsuki gains the forbidden power that defies the Source of Life. Upon death, you will be revived on the spot in 2 seconds, with both your HP and SP restored to what they were 5 seconds ago. Can only be triggered once every 180 seconds.",
    ["Re0_Dungeon_CardDes069"]="Enhances your combat abilities using Rem's Demon Form. When attacked, there's an 11% chance to enter Demon Form, boosting your Final P.DMG and M.DMG Bonus by 60% while turning your armor into Undead attribute, making you immune to debuffs for 6 seconds (excluding special debuffs from MVP, MINI, and Instance Boss). Can only be triggered once every 20 seconds.",
    ["Re0_Dungeon_CardDes070"]="Emilia excels in controlling heat and incorporating Ice into Fire. In battle, your attacks and hits taken have an 11% chance to cast an ice hammer and a 6% chance to deal 280% Adaptive Fire DMG 2 times to all enemies within range, with a 4% chance to freeze them for 3 seconds. Frozen enemies are unable to move, cast normal attacks or skills, and will remain frozen even when attacked. Can only be triggered once every 3 seconds.",
    ["Re0_Dungeon_CardDes071"]="Enters the Well-Fed state when your HP is over 90%. While active, your HP is locked at 80% or above of your Max HP for 6 seconds under Baoku Lee's protection. This protection ends early after 20 hits or if damage exceeds 35% of your Max HP. Once the protection ends, the Well-Fed state cannot be triggered again for 20 seconds.",
    ["Re0_Dungeon_CardDes072"]="When using normal attacks and skills, there's a 6% and 18% chance to unleash God Typhoon, dealing 2,100% weapon attribute P.DMG to all enemies within a 12x3 meter area and reducing their Final P.DEF by 20%. While the skill is active, it increases your P.ATK by 40% and Final P.DMG Bonus by 35% for 10 seconds.",
    ["Re0_Dungeon_CardDes073"]="When using normal attacks and skills, there's a 6% and 18% chance to unleash Heaven's Charm, dealing 2,100% weapon attribute P.DMG to all enemies within a 12x3 meter area and reducing their Final M.DEF by 20%. While the skill is active, it increases your M.ATK by 40% and Final M.DMG Bonus by 35% for 10 seconds.",
    ["Re0_Dungeon_CardDes074"]="When using normal attacks|skills, there's a 6%|18% chance to unleash Crescent Tear, dealing 2,100% weapon attribute P.DMG (crit possible) to all enemies within a 12x3 meter area. Crescent Tear reduces all targets' Final Anti-Crit by 20%. If the targets are Adventurers, the effect becomes a 13% reduction in PVP Final P.DMG RED instead for 6 seconds. Cooldown: 20 seconds. While the skill is active, it increases your Crit DMG Bonus by 80% and Final P.DMG Bonus by 30% for 10 seconds. Cooldown: 20 seconds.",
    ["Re0_Dungeon_CardDes075"]="When using normal attacks|skills, there's a 6%|18% chance to unleash Phoenix Energy Wave using the Phoenix Dragon Sword, dealing 2,100% weapon attribute P.DMG (crit possible) to all enemies within a 12x3 meter area. The powerful energy wave reduces all targets' Final P.DMG RED by 20%. If the targets are Adventurers, the effect becomes a 70% reduction in Fire/Ghost Resistance instead for 6 seconds (unstackable). Cooldown: 20 seconds. While the skill is active, it increases your Crit DMG Bonus by 80% and P.ATK by 35% for 10 seconds. Cooldown: 20 seconds.",
    ["Re0_Dungeon_CardDes076"]="When using normal attacks|skills, there's a 6%|18% chance to unleash Tiger Energy Wave using the Tiger Sword, dealing 2,100% weapon attribute M.DMG (cannot crit) to all enemies within a 12x3 meter area. The powerful energy wave reduces all targets' Final M.DMG RED by 20%. If the targets are Adventurers, the effect becomes a 75% reduction in Wind/Water Resistance instead for 6 seconds (unstackable). Cooldown: 20 seconds. While the skill is active, it increases your Final M.PEN by 40% and M.ATK by 35% for 10 seconds. Cooldown: 20 seconds.",
    ["Re0_Dungeon_CardDes077"]="Starving Alexander comes down the mountain to hunt for juicy prey. Applies a Tender mark to targets upon dealing damage, with a 20-second cooldown. If the target is an Adventurer, they gain 1 stack of Tender for every 400 VIT they process (minimum 1, maximum 30 stacks). If the target is not an Adventurer, they gain 25 stacks of Tender for 10 seconds. Each stack of Tender increases the caster's Crit DMG Bonus by 8%. The mark can be dispelled.",
    ["Re0_Dungeon_CardName001"]="Orc Disaster Card",
    ["Re0_Dungeon_CardName002"]="Alien Pedant (Ultraman Gold Card Set)",
