    ["Re0_Dungeon_JobDeDes001"]="High ASPD, short skill cooldowns, focused on support skills",
    ["Re0_Dungeon_JobDeDes002"]="High ASPD, holy attribute counter, flexible and mobile",
    ["Re0_Dungeon_JobDeDes003"]="Melee damage, resilient, with self-healing",
    ["Re0_Dungeon_JobDeDes004"]="Increasingly brave, low cost and high efficiency, close-range control",
    ["Re0_Dungeon_JobDeDes005"]="Crowd control and damage combos",
    ["Re0_Dungeon_JobDeDes006"]="Auto Spell, normal attack enchantment, bonus elemental damage",
    ["Re0_Dungeon_JobDeDes007"]="Uses normal attack crits and skill combos for burst damage",
    ["Re0_Dungeon_JobDeDes008"]="Good at flanking while staying invisible with powerful finishing blows",
    ["Re0_Dungeon_JobDeDes009"]="Smooth controls, steady damage output",
    ["Re0_Dungeon_JobDeDes010"]="Physical enhancement, moving field, group buff",
    ["Re0_Dungeon_JobDeDes011"]="Elemental enhancement, moving field, group buff",
    ["Re0_Dungeon_JobDeDes012"]="High ATK, focused on support skills",
    ["Re0_Dungeon_JobDeDes013"]="Good at surpassing the limitation by upgrading with strong melee attacks",
    ["Re0_Dungeon_JobDeDes014"]="High-penetration normal attacks combined with skills can inflict massive damage to enemies",
    ["Re0_Dungeon_JobDeDes015"]="Relies on ASPD and high burst damage in battle",
    ["Re0_Dungeon_JobDeDes016"]="Skilled in the art of the Ninja Sword, specializing in physical burst damage to dominate the battlefield",
    ["Re0_Dungeon_JobDeDes017"]="Skilled in the art of the Shuriken, specializing in magical burst damage to dominate the battlefield",
    ["Re0_Dungeon_JobDeDes018"]="Masters of advanced kicking skills, excelling in melee controls and inflicting heavy damage to finish enemies off",
