    ["ReNameCD"]="You can only change your name once every three days.",
    ["ReasoningDialogue7001"]="Use the clues at hand to deduce what went down.",
    ["ReasoningDialogue7002"]="The <color=#CA2E0AFF>conflict</color> between Einbech Village and the machines goes way back; this didn't happen overnight...",
    ["ReasoningDialogue7003"]="The villagers loathe and fear the machines, and they themselves think <color=#CA2E0AFF>humans will eventually be replaced</color>...",
    ["ReasoningDialogue7004"]="The idea of <color=#CA2E0AFF>machines with their own personalities trying to dominate humans</color> isn't just a fantasy. Dr. Milian has talked to you about this part of history...",
    ["ReasoningDialogue7005"]="Yet, after many years of suffering, humans seem to have <color=#CA2E0AFF>lost their will to resist</color>, particularly those at the bottom of the food chain, such as Einbech Village...?",
    ["ReasoningDialogue7006"]="No, it doesn't sound right. Think again.",
    ["ReasoningDialogue7007"]="Yes, this is it!",
    ["ReasoningDialogue8002"]="In the meantime, the machines have slowly <color=#CA2E0AFF>woven themselves into every part of human life</color>...",
    ["ReasoningDialogue8003"]="If the plan fails, the institute won't let you or the villagers go. But will 140 stick with you through the trouble...?",
    ["ReasoningDialogue8004"]="140 wants to be an ally to humans but has never been accepted. You're slightly concerned this could lead to some resentment?",
    ["ReasoningDialogue8005"]="To 140, who is the real enemy...?!",
