    ["RechargeMonthCardTip"]="VIP Card Top-Up Gift Explanation:\n1. You can only choose 1 top-up tier that you have topped up before commencing a new top-up.\n2. When activating multiple VIP Cards, you have to wait until the second VIP Card becomes effective before topping up again in order to receive the top-up gift.",
