    ["RecurringTips_1"]="<color=#E8833C>Return Challenge</color>\n\n1. Adventurers can participate in the Return Challenge within <color=#E8833C>10 days</color> of returning.\n2. Login rewards and return quests are refreshed at <color=#E8833C>5:00</color> every day.\n3. After accepting return quests, their progress is recorded until the quests are completed or the event ends.\n4. There are two tiers of Return Pass: Standard Tier and Advanced Tier.\n5. It's required to purchase the Advanced Tier before claiming corresponding rewards.",
    ["RecurringTips_2"]="Log in for <color=#FF0000>%s</color> day(s) to unlock new quests.",
    ["RecurringTips_3"]="<color=#E8833C>Rewards are doubled during %s</color>",
