    ["RefineConsumption"]="Refinement Cost",
    ["RefineConsumptionExplainTips1"]="The refinement cost is dependent on the quality of the equipment that will be refined. The better the quality, the higher the cost.",
    ["RefineConsumptionExplainTips2"]="The refinement cost is different for weapons/armor/accessories.",
    ["RefineConsumptionExplainTips3"]="The refinement cost is and stat(s) increased are the same. The cost for Daggers/One-Handed Weapons/Two-Handed Weapons is 1.5/2/3 times that of Shields, respectively.",
    ["RefineConsumptionResult"]="Refinement Results",
    ["RefineConsumptionResultExplainTips1"]="There are four possible outcomes that can happen to a piece of equipment during refinement: Level +1, +0, -1, or equipment breakage (Only happens when performing unsafe refinement).",
    ["RefineConsumptionResultExplainTips2"]="Broken equipment cannot be upgraded/refined/enchanted, nor can it be used for upgrades or crafting.",
    ["RefineConsumptionResultExplainTips3"]="The stats of broken equipment can be transferred to other non-broken equipment. You can use <color=#E8833C>specific equipment</color> (unimproved equipment or basic crafting equipment) to repair broken equipment.",
    ["RefineConsumptionResultExplainTips4"]="You can use the Blessed Ore that corresponds to the equipment slot to prevent it from breaking.",
    ["RefineConsumptionResultExplainTips5"]="The ore will only be consumed when the equipment breaks.",
    ["RefineConsumptionResultExplainTips6"]="Lady Luck smiles upon thee. This refinement is guaranteed to succeed.",
    ["RefineConsumptionResultExplainTips7"]="When using a corresponding Equipment Protection Crystal, refinement won’t reduce the equipment’s level, but it will reduce the chance of leveling up while increasing the chance of damage to the equipment. When using both the Equipment Protection Crystal and Equipment Blessing Crystal, the costs of the Equipment Blessing Crystal will be doubled.",
    ["RefineConsumptionResultExplainTips8"]="When Equipment Protection Crystal is selected, it will be deducted each time a refinement occurs.",
    ["RefineEquipBreak"]="The equipment broke. You salvaged the following:",
    ["RefineFailTips"]="Adventurer <color=#32abea>{0}</color> failed to refine <color=#f47261>+{1} {2}</color>.",
    ["RefineInherit"]="Refinement Transfer",
    ["RefineInheritExplainTips1"]="Pieces of equipment of the same type and quality can transfer their refinement levels, stage levels, and guarantee progress interchangeably.",
    ["RefineInheritExplainTips2"]="Transferring stats uses up a certain amount of Zeny.",
    ["RefineInheritExplainTips3"]="A certain amount of diamonds will be consumed for Advanced Transfer.",
    ["RefineLevelEquipDecompose"]="This equipment has refinement level(s). Are you sure you want to dismantle it?",
    ["RefineRulesDes_01"]="Refinement Stage",
    ["RefineRulesDes_02"]="A failed refinement increases the guarantee progress, while a successful one resets its progress level. There are 5 stages: Stages 1 to 4 boost certain equipment stats, and Stage 5 guarantees success on the next refinement.",
    ["RefineRulesDes_03"]="Progression increases more quickly when refining without items, or when using a Blessing Stone or a standalone Blessed Bradium, Blessed Elunium, or Blessed Oridecon. Using a Protection Stone (including combinations with Blessed Bradium, Blessed Elunium, or Blessed Oridecon) results in normal progress only.",
    ["RefineRulesDes_04"]="Both the stage level and its accumulated progress are linked to the refinement level. When a refinement fails, the progress for that specific level is preserved.",
    ["RefineSmallLevelTips_01"]="Stage Level Boost",
    ["RefineSuccessfulTips"]="Adventurer <color=#32abea>{0}</color> succeeded in refining <color=#f47261>+{1} {2}</color>!",
    ["RefundPolicy"]="[a href=https://member.gnjoy.com/support/terms/common/commonterm.asp?category=mobile_terms1]退款政策[/a]",
