    ["RepletionName_5"]="Max",
    ["RepurchaseInstructions"]="Rules:\n1. Spend a certain number of Crystals in the Exchange Center to claim the chest.\n2. This event may last multiple rounds, and a new round will begin automatically once the previous one ends (resets are subject to event requirements).\n3. If there are multiple rounds, the displayed time is for the current round, not the total event time. If there's only one round, the displayed time reflects the total event time.",
    ["RepurchaseInstructions_01"]="Rules:\n1. Spend a certain number of Crystals in the Exchange Center to claim the chest.\n2. This event may last multiple rounds, and a new round will begin automatically once the previous one ends (resets are subject to event requirements).\n3. If there are multiple rounds, the displayed time is for the current round, not the total event time. If there's only one round, the displayed time reflects the total event time.",
    ["RepurchaseInstructions_02"]="Rules:\n1. Spend a certain amount of Zeny to claim the chest.\n2. This event may last multiple rounds, and a new round will begin automatically once the previous one ends (resets are subject to event requirements).\n3. If there are multiple rounds, the displayed time is for the current round, not the total event time. If there's only one round, the displayed time reflects the total event time.\nPS: The event only lasts <1> round.",
    ["RepurchaseInstructions_03"]="Rules:\n1. Consume Diamonds (excluding exchanging for Crystals or Zeny, selling Diamonds, or sending Red Envelopes) and reach a certain amount to claim the chest.\n2. This event may last multiple rounds, and a new round will begin automatically once the previous one ends (resets are subject to event requirements).\n3. If there are multiple rounds, the displayed time is for the current round, not the total event time. If there's only one round, the displayed time reflects the total event time.\nPS: The event only lasts <1> round.",
    ["RepurchaseInstructions_04"]="Rules:\n1. Top up a certain number of Diamonds to claim the chest.\n2. This event may last multiple rounds, and a new round will begin automatically once the previous one ends (resets are subject to event requirements).\n3. If there are multiple rounds, the displayed time is for the current round, not the total event time. If there's only one round, the displayed time reflects the total event time.\nPS: The event only lasts <1> round.",
    ["RepurchaseInstructions_05"]="Rules:\n1. Consume Diamonds (excluding exchanging for Crystals or Zeny, selling Diamonds, or sending Red Envelopes), use vouchers, or make direct cash purchases (excluding Voucher packs, Diamond packs, and items from the external shop) to earn Starlight Points at the corresponding rate. Reach the required amount of Starlight Points to claim the chest.\n2. Using vouchers and making direct cash purchases will be converted into equivalent Diamond consumption, with a 1:1 Diamond-to-Starlight Point ratio.\n3. This event may last multiple rounds, and a new round will begin automatically once the previous one ends (resets are subject to event requirements).\n4. If there are multiple rounds, the displayed time is for the current round, not the total event time. If there's only one round, the displayed time reflects the total event time.\n5. After claiming the final reward tier, repeatable rewards will be unlocked. Each time the required amount is reached, the reward may be claimed again (unlimited).\nPS: The event only lasts <1> round.",
    ["RepurchaseTaxCanUseShortage"]="You've exceeded the remaining Buyback Voucher usage limit",
