    ["ResetQualityPoint"]="Stat Points reset. Go ahead and allocate them.",
    ["ResetSkillTip"]="Do you want to reset your Skill Point allocation?",
    ["ResetWeightTip"]="Use a Gym Pass to increase Weight Limit by 1000.\n%d more available to be used.",
    ["ResonateDesc_1"]="Armors of great warriors covered in blood.\nSouls of Einherjar sleeping under Yggdrasill.\nThese are all eternal legends, hidden in the swaying flames.\nOh, successor of Odin's Bloodline, upgrading your equipment will invoke the power of the resonance of fire. Go forth and fulfill your duty.",
