    ["ResonateDesc_27"]="Awakening Criteria:\nIncrease the Enchantment Level of 8 equipment to +36.",
    ["ResonateDesc_28"]="Awakening Criteria:\nIncrease the Enchantment Level of 8 equipment to +39.",
    ["ResonateDesc_29"]="Awakening Criteria:\nIncrease the Enchantment Level of 8 equipment to +42.",
    ["ResonateDesc_3"]="The boundless power of the ocean.\nThe soothing song of the sea.\nWho is willing to brave the waves?\nOh, successor of Odin's Bloodline, refining your equipment will invoke the power of the resonance of water. Go forth and fulfill your duty.",
    ["ResonateDesc_30"]="Awakening Criteria:\nIncrease the Enchantment Level of 8 equipment to +45.",
    ["ResonateDesc_31"]="Awakening Criteria:\nIncrease the Refinement of 2 equipment to +6.",
    ["ResonateDesc_32"]="Awakening Criteria:\nIncrease the Refinement of 4 equipment to +7.",
    ["ResonateDesc_33"]="Awakening Criteria:\nIncrease the Refinement of 6 equipment to +8.",
    ["ResonateDesc_34"]="Awakening Criteria:\nIncrease the Refinement of 8 equipment to +9.",
    ["ResonateDesc_35"]="Awakening Criteria:\nIncrease the Refinement of 8 equipment to +10.",
    ["ResonateDesc_36"]="Awakening Criteria:\nIncrease the Refinement of 8 equipment to +11.",
