    ["ResonateWeapon_table_8"]="Lv.%s",
    ["ResonateWeapon_text_1"]="Stage level is based on weapon count, weapon score, and awakening rating.",
    ["ResonateWeapon_text_11"]="For daggers, the highest two pieces are evaluated for ratings; for all other weapon types, only the highest-scoring item is used.",
    ["ResonateWeapon_text_2"]="For each weapon type, the system picks one gold-quality weapon with the highest score for rating.",
    ["ResonateWeapon_text_3"]="Daggers are special since the system evaluates the two highest-scoring pieces instead of one.",
    ["ResonateWeapon_text_4"]="If the weapons you own (equipped, in the backpack, or in the warehouse) no longer meet the stage level requirement, your awakening level will decrease.",
    ["ResonateWeapon_text_5"]="Weapon score is determined by its refinement, upgrade, and enchantment levels.",
    ["ResonateWeapon_text_6"]="The number of weapon types depends on the different weapon categories.\nTwo-Handed Weapon: 600\nOne-Handed Weapon: 400\nOff-hand Weapon: 200\nDagger: 300",
