    ["Resonate_Blank_Desc"]="Oh, successor of Odin's bloodline.\nHeed the resonance of all things in the universe.\nWhen winter falls, whose spirit dwelling in their blood trembles with excitement?\nWhen the sandstorm comes, Odin's power flowing through your veins will gather again.\n<color=#ffc821>Buff stats are not included in Bloodline Awakening</color>.",
