    ["RuneEquip_None"]="No Divinities in this part. Obtain them from Oblivion Realm of the season, MVP, and MINI.",
    ["RuneLabelDesc_101"]="Reduces damage taken from monsters with Fervor by 15%.",
    ["RuneLabelDesc_102"]="Reduces the reflection chance of Spikes to 8.5%.",
    ["RuneLabelDesc_103"]="Reduces damage taken from monsters with Invisibility by 15%.",
    ["RuneLabelDesc_104"]="Reduces damage taken from the Reflective Shield to at most 15% of Max HP.",
    ["RuneLabelDesc_105"]="Normal attacks and skills deal 1 extra hit on the Healing Shield.",
    ["RuneLabelDesc_106"]="Reduces Protective Mist's damage reduction effect by 15%, down to the 10% minimum.",
    ["RuneLabelDesc_1101"]="Reduces damage taken from monsters with Fervor by 30%.",
    ["RuneLabelDesc_1102"]="Reduces the reflection chance of Spikes to 7%.",
    ["RuneLabelDesc_1103"]="Reduces damage taken from monsters with Invisibility by 30%.",
    ["RuneLabelDesc_1104"]="Reduces damage taken from the Reflective Shield to at most 10% of Max HP.",
    ["RuneLabelDesc_1105"]="Normal attacks deal 1 extra hit on Healing Shield, while skills deal 3 extra hits on Healing Shield.",
    ["RuneLabelDesc_1106"]="Reduces Protective Mist's damage reduction effect by 30%, down to the 10% minimum.",
    ["RuneLabelDesc_1201"]="Reduces the healing ban effect of Virus to 70% and its poison damage to 12%.",
    ["RuneLabelDesc_1202"]="Reduces the blind chance of Restricted Vision to 14%.",
    ["RuneLabelDesc_1203"]="Reduces the Arcane Leech effect to 20%.",
    ["RuneLabelDesc_1204"]="Reduces the damage of each Burn stack to 5.3%.",
    ["RuneLabelDesc_1205"]="Reduces each stack's effect of Chill by 30% and increases its max stacks to 7.",
    ["RuneLabelDesc_1206"]="Reduces the chance of Corrosion to 20%.",
    ["RuneLabelDesc_1301"]="Reduces the duration of Electrify to 3 seconds.",
    ["RuneLabelDesc_1302"]="Gains 0.8 seconds of immunity to pulling every second within the Vortex.",
    ["RuneLabelDesc_1303"]="Reduces damage taken from Death Link to 20%.",
    ["RuneLabelDesc_1304"]="Reduces the duration of Disrupt to 4 seconds.",
    ["RuneLabelDesc_1305"]="Reduces the duration of Irresistible to 4 seconds.",
    ["RuneLabelDesc_1306"]="Reduces damage taken from Thunder Wrath by 30%.",
    ["RuneLabelDesc_1401"]="There's a 30% chance of not generating a venom pit when targeted by Venom Pit.",
    ["RuneLabelDesc_1402"]="Reduces damage taken from Aqua Sphere to 70%.",
    ["RuneLabelDesc_1403"]="Reduces damage taken from Polar Charge to 70%.",
    ["RuneLabelDesc_1404"]="Increases MSPD for 5 seconds (Cavalry Combat: +1 MSPD; others: +2 MSPD) when Scythe of Hell is activated.",
    ["RuneLabelDesc_1405"]="Increases MSPD for 5 seconds (Cavalry Combat: +1 MSPD; others: +2 MSPD) when Spirit Bomb is activated.",
    ["RuneLabelDesc_1406"]="Reduces the healing ban effect of Viral Spores to 70%.",
    ["RuneLabelDesc_1501"]="Increases MSPD for 7 seconds (Cavalry Combat: +1 MSPD; others: +2 MSPD) when Blazing Golden Thief Bug is activated.",
    ["RuneLabelDesc_1502"]="Increases the damage against monsters within the range of Mitigation Tablet to 15%.",
    ["RuneLabelDesc_1503"]="Reduces damage taken from Evil Heart to 70%.",
    ["RuneLabelDesc_1504"]="Reduces damage taken from Fire Tablet to 20%.",
    ["RuneLabelDesc_1505"]="Turns damage taken from blocking Life Link into healing effects.",
    ["RuneLabelDesc_1506"]="Reduces blind duration from Blinding Tablet to 2 seconds and its Hit Rate Reduction effect to 20%.",
    ["RuneLabelDesc_1601"]="Reduces damage taken from Thunderstorm to 28%.",
    ["RuneLabelDesc_1602"]="Reduces damage taken from Cyclone to 21% and its slow duration to 3 seconds.",
    ["RuneLabelDesc_1603"]="Reduces damage taken from Radiant Cross to 14%.",
    ["RuneLabelDesc_1604"]="Reduces the immobilization duration of Time Shackles to 3 seconds.",
    ["RuneLabelDesc_1605"]="Reduces damage taken from Meteor to 35% and gains immunity to its knockback effect.",
    ["RuneLabelDesc_1606"]="Reduces damage taken from Timed Mine to 35%.",
    ["RuneLabelDesc_201"]="Reduces the healing ban effect of Virus to 85% and its poison damage to 14%.",
    ["RuneLabelDesc_202"]="Reduces the blind chance of Restricted Vision to 22%.",
    ["RuneLabelDesc_203"]="Reduces the Arcane Leech effect to 25%.",
    ["RuneLabelDesc_204"]="Reduces the damage of each Burn stack to 6.6%.",
    ["RuneLabelDesc_205"]="Reduces each stack's effect of Chill by 15% and increases its max stacks to 6.",
    ["RuneLabelDesc_206"]="Reduces the chance of Corrosion to 25%.",
    ["RuneLabelDesc_2101"]="Reduces damage taken from monsters with Fervor by 15% (30% at max level).",
    ["RuneLabelDesc_2102"]="Reduces the reflection chance of Spikes to 8.5% (7% at max level).",
    ["RuneLabelDesc_2103"]="Reduces damage taken from monsters with Invisibility by 15% (10% at max level).",
    ["RuneLabelDesc_2104"]="Reduces damage taken from the Reflective Shield to at most 15% of Max HP (10% at max level).",
    ["RuneLabelDesc_2105"]="Normal attacks and skills deal 1 extra hit on the Healing Shield (3 hits at max level).",
    ["RuneLabelDesc_2106"]="Reduces Protective Mist's damage reduction effect by 15% (30% at max level), down to the 10% minimum.",
    ["RuneLabelDesc_2201"]="Reduces the healing ban effect of Virus to 85% (70% at max level) and its poison damage to 14% (12% at max level).",
    ["RuneLabelDesc_2202"]="Reduces the blind chance of Restricted Vision to 22% (14% at max level).",
    ["RuneLabelDesc_2203"]="Reduces the Arcane Leech effect to 25% (20% at max level).",
    ["RuneLabelDesc_2204"]="Reduces the damage of each Burn stack to 6.6% (5.3% at max level).",
    ["RuneLabelDesc_2205"]="Reduces each stack's effect of Chill by 15% (30% at max level) and increases its max stacks to 6 (7 stacks at max level).",
    ["RuneLabelDesc_2206"]="Reduces the chance of Corrosion to 25% (20% at max level).",
    ["RuneLabelDesc_2301"]="Reduces the duration of Electrify to 4 seconds (3 seconds at max level).",
    ["RuneLabelDesc_2302"]="Gains 0.5 seconds (0.8 seconds at max level) of immunity to pulling every second within the Vortex.",
    ["RuneLabelDesc_2303"]="Reduces damage taken from Death Link to 25% (20% at max level).",
    ["RuneLabelDesc_2304"]="Reduces the duration of Disrupt to 5 seconds (4 seconds at max level).",
    ["RuneLabelDesc_2305"]="Reduces the duration of Irresistible to 5 seconds (4 seconds at max level).",
    ["RuneLabelDesc_2306"]="Reduces damage taken from Thunder Wrath by 15% (30% at max level).",
    ["RuneLabelDesc_2401"]="There's a 15% chance of not generating a venom pit when targeted by Venom Pit (30% at max level).",
    ["RuneLabelDesc_2402"]="Reduces damage taken from Aqua Sphere to 85% (70% at max level).",
    ["RuneLabelDesc_2403"]="Reduces damage taken from Polar Charge to 85% (70% at max level).",
    ["RuneLabelDesc_2404"]="Increases MSPD for 3 seconds (Cavalry Combat: +1 MSPD; others: +2 MSPD) when Scythe of Hell is activated (5 seconds at max level).",
    ["RuneLabelDesc_2405"]="Increases MSPD for 3 seconds (Cavalry Combat: +1 MSPD; others: +2 MSPD) when Spirit Bomb is activated (5 seconds at max level).",
    ["RuneLabelDesc_2406"]="Reduces the healing ban effect of Viral Spores to 85% (70% at max level).",
    ["RuneLabelDesc_2501"]="Increases MSPD for 5 seconds (Cavalry Combat: +1 MSPD; others: +2 MSPD) when Blazing Golden Thief Bug is activated (7 seconds at max level).",
    ["RuneLabelDesc_2502"]="Increases the damage against monsters within the range of Mitigation Tablet to 15% (30% at max level).",
    ["RuneLabelDesc_2503"]="Reduces damage taken from Evil Heart to 85% (70% at max level).",
    ["RuneLabelDesc_2504"]="Reduces damage taken from Fire Tablet to 25% (20% at max level).",
    ["RuneLabelDesc_2505"]="No longer take damage when blocking Life Link (convert damage to healing at max level).",
    ["RuneLabelDesc_2506"]="Reduces blind duration from Blinding Tablet to 2.5 seconds (2 seconds at max level) and its Hit Rate Reduction effect to 25% (20% at max level).",
    ["RuneLabelDesc_2601"]="Reduces damage taken from Thunderstorm to 34% (28% at max level).",
    ["RuneLabelDesc_2602"]="Reduces damage taken from Cyclone to 25% (20% at max level) and its slow duration to 4 seconds (3 seconds at max level).",
    ["RuneLabelDesc_2603"]="Reduces damage taken from Radiant Cross to 17% (14% at max level).",
    ["RuneLabelDesc_2604"]="Reduces the immobilization duration of Time Shackles to 4 seconds (3 seconds at max level).",
    ["RuneLabelDesc_2605"]="Reduces damage taken from Meteor to 42% (35% at max level) and its knockback effect to 5m (immune to knockback at max level).",
    ["RuneLabelDesc_2606"]="Reduces damage taken from Timed Mine to 42% (35% at max level).",
    ["RuneLabelDesc_301"]="Reduces the duration of Electrify to 4 seconds.",
    ["RuneLabelDesc_302"]="Gains 0.5 seconds of immunity to pulling every second within the Vortex.",
    ["RuneLabelDesc_303"]="Reduces damage taken from Death Link to 25%.",
    ["RuneLabelDesc_304"]="Reduces the duration of Disrupt to 5 seconds.",
    ["RuneLabelDesc_305"]="Reduces the duration of Irresistible to 5 seconds.",
    ["RuneLabelDesc_306"]="Reduces damage taken from Thunder Wrath by 15%.",
    ["RuneLabelDesc_401"]="There's a 15% chance of not generating a venom pit when targeted by Venom Pit.",
