    ["RuneLabelSuitDesc_11"]="3-Piece Judgment: Reduces damage taken from monsters with Judgment affixes by an additional 30%.",
    ["RuneLabelSuitDesc_12"]="6-Piece Judgment: Increases Final DMG of normal attacks and skills by 15% when attacking monsters with Judgment affixes.",
    ["RuneLabelSuitDesc_21"]="3-Piece Curse Breaker: There's a 50% chance to remove 1 Curse Breaker affix 2 times while being inflicted with Curse Breaker affixes. Cooldown: 30 seconds.",
    ["RuneLabelSuitDesc_22"]="6-Piece Curse Breaker: Increases the chance of removing debuffs to 100% and reduces the cooldown to 20 seconds. Grants a 5-second immunity to Curse Breaker affixes when removing them.",
    ["RuneLabelSuitDesc_31"]="3-Piece Prophet: Gains a \"Burial\" effect (HP won't fall below 1) before getting hit by Prophet affixes for 6 seconds. Cooldown: 120 seconds.",
    ["RuneLabelSuitDesc_32"]="6-Piece Prophet: Reduces the cooldown of the \"Burial\" effect to 60 seconds and gains immunity to control effects when the \"Burial\" effect is activated. Restores 20% of Max HP every second for 5 seconds when the effect wears off.",
    ["RuneLabelSuitDesc_41"]="3-Piece Revelation: Gains a shield equal to 30% of Max HP for 10 seconds when a Revelation affix is selected and activated. Cooldown: 60 seconds.",
    ["RuneLabelSuitDesc_42"]="6-Piece Revelation: Increases the shield multiplier to 60% and blocks 2 extra hits (up to 100% of Max HP per hit) within 10 seconds after the shield disappears.",
    ["RuneLabelSuitDesc_51"]="3-Piece Annihilation: Normal attacks and skills deal 1 extra hit when attacking monsters that are created by the effect of Annihilation affixes. Each point of damage dealt to it increases your Final DMG by 0.3% for 20 seconds, stacking up to 30 times.",
    ["RuneLabelSuitDesc_52"]="6-Piece Annihilation: The skill now deals extra damage up to 3 times, and each point of damage dealt to it increases your Final DMG to 0.5%, stacking up to 60 times.",
    ["RuneLabelSuitDesc_61"]="3-Piece Ark: Increases MSPD for 3 seconds (Cavalry Combat: +1 MSPD; others: +2 MSPD) when an Ark affix is triggered.",
    ["RuneLabelSuitDesc_62"]="6-Piece Ark: Increases MSPD (Cavalry Combat: +1 MSPD; others: +2 MSPD) when an Ark affix is triggered. This effect will be removed upon taking any damage or exiting combat.",
    ["RuneLevel"]="+%s",
    ["RuneLevelUp_DeputyAttrLocked"]="Upgrade to Lv.%s to obtain",
