    ["RuneLevelUp_Tips13"]="Random",
    ["RuneLevelUp_Tips14"]="The Divinity exists in the load-out of another class. Continue anyway?",
    ["RuneLevelUp_Tips2"]="Some inserted Divinities are gold quality. Upgrade anyway?",
    ["RuneLevelUp_Tips3"]="Divinity upgraded!",
    ["RuneLevelUp_Tips4"]="No EXP items or Divinities were inserted.",
    ["RuneLevelUp_Tips5"]="Divinity has reached the max level.",
    ["RuneLevelUp_Tips6"]="These may include %s. Continue to upgrade?",
    ["RuneLevelUp_Tips7"]="Divinities with excessive EXP",
    ["RuneLevelUp_Tips8"]="gold-quality Divinities",
    ["RuneLevelUp_Tips9"]="upgraded Divinities",
    ["RuneLightDesc_21"]="<color=#C0BFBF>Flash: When dealing normal attacks or skills, there's a 10% | 20% chance to gain a buff, increasing damage against all normal monsters, MVPs, MINIs, and Bosses by 84% for 6 seconds. Cooldown: 12 seconds.\n(Reaching max level has a 1% chance to activate)</color>",
    ["RuneLightDesc_22"]="<color=#C0BFBF>Flash: When healed, there's a 25% chance to gain a buff, increasing Physical/Magic Lifesteal by 84% and Physical/Magic ATK percentage by 84% for 6 seconds. Cooldown: 12 seconds.\n(Reaching max level has a 1% chance to activate)</color>",
    ["RuneLightDesc_23"]="<color=#C0BFBF>Flash: When taking damage that exceeds 20% of Max HP in a single hit, there's an 80% chance to reduce the damage taken by 60% (including True DMG). When triggered, P.ATK and M.ATK percentage is increased by 120%. Lasts 6 seconds. Cooldown: 12 seconds.\n(Reaching max level has a 1% chance to activate)</color>",
    ["RuneLightDesc_24"]="<color=#C0BFBF>Flash: When dealing normal attacks or skills to the affix summons, they can be directly executed. Cooldown: 24 seconds.\n(Reaching max level has a 1% chance to activate)</color>",
    ["RuneLightDesc_25"]="<color=#C0BFBF>Flash: When taking damage, there's a 20% chance to deal 1,680% weapon attribute Adaptive DMG that ignores defense to the attacker and enemies within 4 meters of the attacker. Cooldown: 24 seconds. If your Final Crit is higher than Final P.PEN or Final M.PEN, it may trigger critical damage.\n(Reaching max level has a 1% chance to activate)</color>",
    ["RuneLightDesc_26"]="<color=#C0BFBF>Flash: When dealing damage using normal attacks or skills, there's a 35% | 70% chance to automatically chant the spell of Hammer of God on the target, dealing a total of 3,231% weapon attribute Adaptive DMG within a 5-meter radius in 2 hits. Cooldown: 16 seconds. If your Final Crit is higher than Final P.PEN or Final M.PEN, it may trigger critical damage.\n(Reaching max level has a 1% chance to activate)</color>",
    ["RuneLightDesc_27"]="<color=#C0BFBF>Flash: Has a 20% chance to negate debuffs from MVPs and MINIs, granting 6 seconds of immunity to all debuffs. Can trigger once every 18 seconds. When applying debuffs to MVPs or MINIs, ignore 40 points of their Debuff Resistance and Debuff Duration Reduction.\n(Reaching max level has a 1% chance to activate)</color>",
    ["RuneLightDesc_28"]="<color=#C0BFBF>Flash: Attacking a monster with the same element as your highest elemental enhancement increases your Final DMG Bonus by 84%. Attacking a monster with a different element as your highest elemental enhancement increases your Final DMG Bonus by 28%. Both effects last for 10 seconds. Can trigger once every 20 seconds. Additionally, deal 5% extra damage to all monster races and gain 5% extra Job EXP upon defeating monsters (does not apply to Odin Blessing EXP or event EXP).\n(Reaching max level has a 1% chance to activate)</color>",
    ["RuneLightDesc_31"]="<color=#BF9400>Flash</color>: When dealing normal attacks or skills, there's a <color=#3DB00A>10%</color> | <color=#3DB00A>20%</color> chance to gain a buff, increasing damage against all normal monsters, MVPs, MINIs, and Bosses by <color=#3DB00A>84%</color> for <color=#3DB00A>6</color> seconds. Cooldown: <color=#3DB00A>12</color> seconds.",
    ["RuneLightDesc_32"]="<color=#BF9400>Flash</color>: When healed, there's a <color=#3DB00A>25%</color> chance to gain a buff, increasing Physical/Magic Lifesteal by <color=#3DB00A>84%</color> and Physical/Magic ATK percentage by <color=#3DB00A>84%</color> for <color=#3DB00A>6</color> seconds. Cooldown: <color=#3DB00A>12</color> seconds.",
    ["RuneLightDesc_33"]="<color=#BF9400>Flash</color>: When taking damage that exceeds <color=#3DB00A>20%</color> of Max HP in a single hit, there's an <color=#3DB00A>80%</color> chance to reduce the damage taken by <color=#3DB00A>60%</color> (including True DMG). When triggered, P.ATK and M.ATK percentage is increased by <color=#3DB00A>120%</color>. Lasts <color=#3DB00A>6</color> seconds. Cooldown: <color=#3DB00A>12</color> seconds.",
    ["RuneLightDesc_34"]="<color=#BF9400>Flash</color>: When dealing normal attacks or skills to the affix summons, they can be directly executed. Cooldown: <color=#3DB00A>24</color> seconds.",
    ["RuneLightDesc_35"]="<color=#BF9400>Flash</color>: When taking damage, there's a <color=#3DB00A>20%</color> chance to deal <color=#3DB00A>1,680%</color> weapon attribute Adaptive DMG that ignores defense to the attacker and enemies within <color=#3DB00A>4</color> meters of the attacker. Cooldown: <color=#3DB00A>24</color> seconds. If your Final Crit is higher than Final P.PEN or Final M.PEN, it may trigger critical damage.",
    ["RuneLightDesc_36"]="<color=#BF9400>Flash</color>: When dealing damage using normal attacks or skills, there's a <color=#3DB00A>35%</color> | <color=#3DB00A>70%</color> chance to automatically chant the spell of Hammer of God on the target, dealing a total of <color=#3DB00A>3,231%</color> weapon attribute Adaptive DMG within a <color=#3DB00A>5</color>-meter radius in <color=#3DB00A>2</color> hits. Cooldown: <color=#3DB00A>16</color> seconds. If your Final Crit is higher than Final P.PEN or Final M.PEN, it may trigger critical damage.",
    ["RuneLightDesc_37"]="<color=#BF9400>Flash</color>: Has a <color=#3DB00A>20%</color> chance to negate debuffs from MVPs and MINIs, granting <color=#3DB00A>6</color> seconds of immunity to all debuffs. Can trigger once every <color=#3DB00A>18</color> seconds. When applying debuffs to MVPs or MINIs, ignores <color=#3DB00A>40</color> points of their Debuff Resistance and Debuff Duration Reduction.",
    ["RuneLightDesc_38"]="<color=#BF9400>Flash</color>: Attacking a monster with the same element as your highest elemental enhancement increases your Final DMG Bonus by <color=#3DB00A>84%</color>. Attacking a monster with a different element as your highest elemental enhancement increases your Final DMG Bonus by <color=#3DB00A>28%</color>. Both effects last for <color=#3DB00A>10</color> seconds. Can trigger once every <color=#3DB00A>20</color> seconds. Additionally, deal <color=#3DB00A>5%</color> extra damage to all monster races and gain <color=#3DB00A>5%</color> extra Job EXP upon defeating monsters (does not apply to Odin Blessing EXP or event EXP).",
    ["RuneLightDesc_41"]="<color=#959595>Flash: When dealing normal attacks or skills, there's a 10% | 20% chance to gain a buff, increasing damage against all normal monsters, MVPs, MINIs, and Bosses by 84% for 6 seconds. Cooldown: 12 seconds.\n(Reaching max level has a 1% chance to activate)</color>",
    ["RuneLightDesc_42"]="<color=#959595>Flash: When healed, there's a 25% chance to gain a buff, increasing Physical/Magic Lifesteal by 84% and Physical/Magic ATK percentage by 84% for 6 seconds. Cooldown: 12 seconds.\n(Reaching max level has a 1% chance to activate)</color>",
    ["RuneLightDesc_43"]="<color=#959595>Flash: When taking damage that exceeds 20% of Max HP in a single hit, there's an 80% chance to reduce the damage taken by 60% (including True DMG). When triggered, P.ATK and M.ATK percentage is increased by 120%. Lasts 6 seconds. Cooldown: 12 seconds.\n(Reaching max level has a 1% chance to activate)</color>",
    ["RuneLightDesc_44"]="<color=#959595>Flash: When dealing normal attacks or skills to the affix summons, they can be directly executed. Cooldown: 24 seconds.\n(Reaching max level has a 1% chance to activate)</color>",
    ["RuneLightDesc_45"]="<color=#959595>Flash: When taking damage, there's a 20% chance to deal 1,680% weapon attribute Adaptive DMG that ignores defense to the attacker and enemies within 4 meters of the attacker. Cooldown: 24 seconds. If your Final Crit is higher than Final P.PEN or Final M.PEN, it may trigger critical damage.\n(Reaching max level has a 1% chance to activate)</color>",
    ["RuneLightDesc_46"]="<color=#959595>Flash: When dealing damage using normal attacks or skills, there's a 35% | 70% chance to automatically chant the spell of Hammer of God on the target, dealing a total of 3,231% weapon attribute Adaptive DMG within a 5-meter radius in 2 hits. Cooldown: 16 seconds. If your Final Crit is higher than Final P.PEN or Final M.PEN, it may trigger critical damage.\n(Reaching max level has a 1% chance to activate)</color>",
    ["RuneLightDesc_47"]="<color=#959595>Flash: Has a 20% chance to negate debuffs from MVPs and MINIs, granting 6 seconds of immunity to all debuffs. Can trigger once every 18 seconds. When applying debuffs to MVPs or MINIs, ignore 40 points of their Debuff Resistance and Debuff Duration Reduction.\n(Reaching max level has a 1% chance to activate)</color>",
    ["RuneLightDesc_48"]="<color=#959595>Flash: Attacking a monster with the same element as your highest elemental enhancement increases your Final DMG Bonus by 84%. Attacking a monster with a different element as your highest elemental enhancement increases your Final DMG Bonus by 28%. Both effects last for 10 seconds. Can trigger once every 20 seconds. Additionally, deal 5% extra damage to all monster races and gain 5% extra Job EXP upon defeating monsters (does not apply to Odin Blessing EXP or event EXP).\n(Reaching max level has a 1% chance to activate)</color>",
