    ["Rune_BagLoad"]="Backpack Capacity: %s/%s",
    ["Rune_Help"]="Divinity System\n1. Divinity is a way to acquire godly powers. When Adventurers equip Divinity, they obtain the corresponding power.\n  \n2. Divinity Content\nEach Divinity includes: 1) Affix 2)Main Attribute 3) Secondary Attribute 4) Flash\n3. Affix\nAffixes are used to counter new monster affixes.\nDivinity affixes are acquired randomly from the affix pool and related to the slot, while affix quantity is related to quality.\nThe effects of the affixes will increase further when the Divinity is fully upgraded.\nEquipping a specified number of the same type of Divinities will activate a set effect.\n4. Main Attribute\nThe main attribute types of Divinity are related to the slot, while its values are related to quality.\nThe main attribute value of Divinity increases with each level of upgrade.\n5. Secondary Attribute\nSecondary attributes in Divinity are acquired randomly from the secondary attribute pool, with different pools coming with different qualities. Secondary attributes in each Divinity will not be repeated.\nSecondary attributes are acquired by default, and their quantity is related to quality. Upgrading the Divinity to a certain level grants you a new secondary attribute.\n6. Flash\nThere's a 1% chance to activate the Flash effect when a gold-quality Divinity reaches its max level.",
    ["Rune_SuitLocked"]="Not Activated",
    ["Rune_SuitUnlock"]="%s-Piece Set",
    ["SEAValentinesDayText_001"]="No invites from your friends at the moment. Go invite somebody now!",
    ["SEA_AY_Help01_01"]="Adventure Journey Details:\n1. The [Adventure Journey] is an accumulative historical data type task that looks back into the past, adding up the statistics of the player since they started the game.\n2. The quests can still be completed during the event.\n3. Through the completion of the various [Adventure Journey] quests, they player can earn Achievement Points, increase Chest levels (every 100 points upgrades 1 level, capped at Lv. 80).\n4. The [Boundless Heroism] quest series count the number of Diamond recharges during this Anniversary event. This does not include the historical recharge records",
    ["SEA_AY_Return"]="Tap to return to previous floor",
