    ["SEA_AnniversaryCommand"]="Enter <color=#EA538C>\"Happy 4th Anniversary\"</color> in the public channel to claim the password reward",
    ["SEA_AnniversaryCommand_CommandLock"]="Enter the password and claim it later!",
    ["SEA_AnniversaryCommand_Day1"]="1day",
    ["SEA_AnniversaryCommand_Day2"]="2days",
    ["SEA_AnniversaryCommand_Day3"]="3days",
    ["SEA_AnniversaryCommand_Day4"]="4days",
    ["SEA_AnniversaryCommand_Day5"]="5days",
    ["SEA_AnniversaryCommand_Day6"]="6days",
    ["SEA_AnniversaryCommand_Day7"]="7days",
    ["SEA_AnniversaryCommand_Day8"]="8days",
    ["SEA_AnniversaryCommand_EndTime"]="Deadline: June 30",
    ["SEA_AnniversaryCommand_Help01_01"]="Daily Blessing Details:\n1. During the Anniversary event, login every day and claim the [Sign-in Rewards].\n2. The Anniversary is 18 June, and the password will be released on that day. Enter the password in the public channel to activate the [Password Rewards].\n3. After the password has been activated, it can be used until the end of the Anniversary event, and can be used to activate the [Password Rewards].\n4. The number of [Password Rewards] available is equal to the number of days you've signed in",
    ["SEA_AnniversaryCommand_Lock"]="Claim the reward after it's activated!",
    ["SEA_AnniversaryFuncDesc1"]="Claimable Rewards",
    ["SEA_AnniversaryFuncDesc2"]="Go to Achievements to claim rewards.",
    ["SEA_AnniversaryFuncDesc3"]="Claimable Rewards",
    ["SEA_AnniversaryFuncDesc4"]="Purchase Costumes",
    ["SEA_Anniversary_Duration"]="Event Period: %s/%s/%s to %s/%s/%s",
    ["SEA_Anniversary_WorldKVM"]="War of the Chosen II starts on \n<size=20>20/06/2022</size>",
    ["SEA_Year2MemoirDes1_004"]="\nKafra's VIP seat awaits your arrival.",
    ["SEA_Year2MemoirDes1_010"]="\nTrust your intuition,",
    ["SEA_Year2MemoirDes1_011"]="You are on the path to multi-class conversion.",
    ["SEA_Year2MemoirDes1_017"]="\nAdventurer, awaken your Shadow Equipment.",
    ["SEA_Year2MemoirDes1_018"]="\nYou still need to fight MVP & MINI,",
    ["SEA_Year2MemoirDes1_019"]="Still need to break the record of zero instances cleared,",
    ["SEA_Year2MemoirDes1_021"]="Still need to climb the Endless Tower,",
    ["SEA_Year2MemoirDes1_023"]="Still need to guard the honor of your guild in KVM.",
    ["SEA_Year2MemoirDes1_024"]="\nSuch and such,",
    ["SEA_Year2MemoirDes1_025"]="Will forge the mentality of a brave warrior.",
    ["SEA_Year2MemoirDes1_026"]="\nEnjoy being single or secretly in love with someone.",
    ["SEA_Year2MemoirDes1_027"]="Just be yourself.",
    ["SEA_Year2MemoirDes1_028"]="\nWalk this world alone or go with the flow.",
    ["SEA_Year2MemoirDes1_029"]="Just follow yourself.",
    ["SEA_Year2MemoirDes1_032"]="\nWhether you are a lone wolf or surrounded by partners,",
    ["SEA_Year2MemoirDes1_033"]="Just stay loyal to yourself.",
    ["SEA_Year2MemoirDes1_036"]="\nThe Exchange Center door is open for you;",
    ["SEA_Year2MemoirDes1_037"]="Come finish your first order!",
    ["SEA_Year2MemoirDes1_038"]="\nSelect and list the commodities;",
    ["SEA_Year2MemoirDes1_039"]="Make your first pot of gold.",
    ["SEA_Year2MemoirDes1_040"]="\nTrade with Crystals,",
    ["SEA_Year2MemoirDes1_041"]="To purchase your favorite items.",
    ["SEA_Year2MemoirDes1_042"]="\nTrade with Diamonds,",
    ["SEA_Year2MemoirDes1_043"]="To buy whatever you want.",
    ["SEA_Year2MemoirDes1_044"]="\nNo one can turn down,",
    ["SEA_Year2MemoirDes1_045"]="The thrill of a shopping spree!",
    ["SEA_Year2MemoirDes1_053"]="\nOnly for picking the best partner!",
    ["SEA_Year2MemoirDes1_055"]="\nGet new costumes,",
    ["SEA_Year2MemoirDes1_056"]="To fill up your wardrobe!",
    ["SEA_Year2MemoirDes1_057"]="\nAdd new actions,",
    ["SEA_Year2MemoirDes1_058"]="To define your socializing style!",
    ["SEA_Year2MemoirDes1_059"]="\nPurchase new mounts,",
    ["SEA_Year2MemoirDes1_060"]="And ramble across the continent with them!",
    ["SEA_Year2MemoirDes_001"]="Hello, <color=#c69d46>%s</color>,",
    ["SEA_Year2MemoirDes_002"]="Since <color=#c69d46>%s</color>,",
    ["SEA_Year2MemoirDes_003"]="you've spent <color=#c69d46>%s</color> days in Midgard,",
    ["SEA_Year2MemoirDes_004"]="and became Kafra's VIP on <color=#c69d46>%s</color>.",
    ["SEA_Year2MemoirDes_005"]="\nThe days fly by,\nLet us recap,\nThe legend that is written in your name.",
    ["SEA_Year2MemoirDes_006"]="On <color=#c69d46>%s</color>, you advanced to the First Class <color=#c69d46>%s</color>,",
    ["SEA_Year2MemoirDes_007"]="<color=#c69d46>%s</color> days later, you successfully advanced to the Second Class,",
    ["SEA_Year2MemoirDes_008"]="<color=#c69d46>%s</color> days later, you advanced to Transcendent Second Class,",
    ["SEA_Year2MemoirDes_009"]="<color=#c69d46>%s</color> days later, you successfully advanced and became an honorable Third Class Adventurer.",
    ["SEA_Year2MemoirDes_010"]="You also activated <color=#c69d46>%s</color> Sub Classes,\nshowing to the world your talent as a versatile Adventurer.",
    ["SEA_Year2MemoirDes_011"]="\nShowing to the world your talent as a versatile Adventurer.",
    ["SEA_Year2MemoirDes_012"]="You have upgraded <color=#c69d46>%s</color> times,",
    ["SEA_Year2MemoirDes_013"]="refined <color=#c69d46>%s</color> times to <color=#c69d46>%s</color>,",
    ["SEA_Year2MemoirDes_014"]="enchanted <color=#c69d46>%s</color> times to <color=#c69d46>%s</color>,",
    ["SEA_Year2MemoirDes_015"]="and logged your journey of equipment cultivation on <color=#c69d46>%s</color> cards.",
    ["SEA_Year2MemoirDes_016"]="BY ODIN, you managed to get yourself <color=#c69d46>%s</color> Gold Cards!",
    ["SEA_Year2MemoirDes_017"]="You have leveled up Shadow Equipment <color=#c69d46>%s</color> times.",
    ["SEA_Year2MemoirDes_018"]="You have fought MVP & MINI in <color=#c69d46>%s</color> battles,",
    ["SEA_Year2MemoirDes_019"]="experienced <color=#c69d46>%s</color> thrilling instances,",
    ["SEA_Year2MemoirDes_020"]="and received Likes in <color=#c69d46>%s</color> instances.",
    ["SEA_Year2MemoirDes_021"]="You have climbed <color=#c69d46>%s</color> floors in Endless Tower,",
    ["SEA_Year2MemoirDes_022"]="cleared <color=#c69d46>%s</color> raids,",
    ["SEA_Year2MemoirDes_023"]="and Participated in <color=#c69d46>%s</color> battles in the blood-bathed KVM.\nYou practiced tirelessly to forge a blazing heart of the warrior.",
    ["SEA_Year2MemoirDes_024"]="\nYou practiced tirelessly,",
    ["SEA_Year2MemoirDes_025"]="Forging a blazing heart of the warrior.",
    ["SEA_Year2MemoirDes_026"]="<color=#c69d46>%s</color>, you established a sweet relationship with your loved one.",
    ["SEA_Year2MemoirDes_027"]="You established a sweet relationship with your loved one.",
    ["SEA_Year2MemoirDes_028"]="<color=#c69d46>%s</color>,",
    ["SEA_Year2MemoirDes_029"]="You joined <color=#c69d46>%s</color>.",
    ["SEA_Year2MemoirDes_030"]="\nTime went by quick, and things have changed,",
    ["SEA_Year2MemoirDes_031"]="you are now <color=#c69d46>%s</color>'s <color=#c69d46>%s</color>.",
    ["SEA_Year2MemoirDes_032"]="You became friends with <color=#c69d46>%s</color> Adventurers.",
    ["SEA_Year2MemoirDes_033"]="May your friendship last forever.",
    ["SEA_Year2MemoirDes_034"]="You have sent a total of <color=#c69d46>%s</color> gifts to your friends.",
    ["SEA_Year2MemoirDes_035"]="Your generosity is received bit by bit and treasured by them.",
    ["SEA_Year2MemoirDes_036"]="\nYou are a frequent visitor to the Exchange Center.",
    ["SEA_Year2MemoirDes_037"]="\nYou have completed <color=#c69d46>%s</color> orders.",
    ["SEA_Year2MemoirDes_038"]="\nAs a seller,",
    ["SEA_Year2MemoirDes_039"]="\nYou have earned yourself <color=#c69d46>%s</color> Crystals in Exchange Center.",
    ["SEA_Year2MemoirDes_040"]="As a buyer using Crystals,",
    ["SEA_Year2MemoirDes_041"]="You have spent <color=#c69d46>%s</color> Crystals in Exchange Center.",
    ["SEA_Year2MemoirDes_042"]="As a buyer using Diamonds,",
    ["SEA_Year2MemoirDes_043"]="You have spent <color=#c69d46>%s</color> Diamonds in Exchange Center.\nFairtrade and equivalent exchange. You have memorized the pattern of the market by heart.",
    ["SEA_Year2MemoirDes_044"]="\nFairtrade and equivalent exchange,",
    ["SEA_Year2MemoirDes_045"]="You have memorized the pattern of the market by heart.",
    ["SEA_Year2MemoirDes_046"]="Fished <color=#c69d46>%s</color> times.",
    ["SEA_Year2MemoirDes_047"]="Fishing level reached Lv.<color=#c69d46>%s</color>.",
    ["SEA_Year2MemoirDes_048"]="Gardened <color=#c69d46>%s</color> times.",
    ["SEA_Year2MemoirDes_049"]="Gardening level reached Lv.<color=#c69d46>%s</color>.",
    ["SEA_Year2MemoirDes_050"]="Mined <color=#c69d46>%s</color> times.",
    ["SEA_Year2MemoirDes_051"]="Mining level reached Lv.<color=#c69d46>%s</color>.",
    ["SEA_Year2MemoirDes_052"]="Tamed pets <color=#c69d46>%s</color> times,",
    ["SEA_Year2MemoirDes_053"]="And finally own a total of <color=#c69d46>%s</color> pets as of now.",
    ["SEA_Year2MemoirDes_054"]="Your pet collection progress is at <color=#c69d46>%s</color>%%.",
    ["SEA_Year2MemoirDes_055"]="You have <color=#c69d46>%s</color> costumes;",
    ["SEA_Year2MemoirDes_056"]="Defined and manifested the fashion trend.",
    ["SEA_Year2MemoirDes_057"]="You have <color=#c69d46>%s</color> actions;",
    ["SEA_Year2MemoirDes_058"]="Lit up the star of socializing.",
    ["SEA_Year2MemoirDes_059"]="You have <color=#c69d46>%s</color> mounts;",
    ["SEA_Year2MemoirDes_060"]="Walked through the weather of four seasons.",
    ["SEA_Year2MemoirDes_061"]="\nEven when time gets old,",
    ["SEA_Year2MemoirDes_062"]="Our memories will never fade.",
    ["SEA_Year2MemoirShareDes1_003"]="Start from the beginning, and learn the knowledge for trading to earn your first pot of Crystals.",
    ["SEA_Year2MemoirShareDes_001"]="<color=#c69d46>%s</color>, Adventurer <color=#c69d46>%s</color> has arrived Midgard!",
    ["SEA_Year2MemoirShareDes_002"]="Starting from the beginning, you have carried out <color=#c69d46>%s</color> upgrades, <color=#c69d46>%s</color> refinements, and <color=#c69d46>%s</color> enchantments.",
    ["SEA_Year2MemoirShareDes_003"]="Starting from the beginning, you have learned the knowledge for trading and earned <color=#c69d46>%s</color> Crystals.",
    ["SEA_Year2MemoirShareDes_004"]="Let these shiny pieces of equipment and Crystals",
    ["SEA_Year2MemoirShareDes_005"]="Be the proof of your efforts in the past <color=#c69d46>%s</color> days!",
    ["SEA_YearMemoirDes_001"]="%s, You arrive in the Rune Kingdom, under the name %s.",
    ["SEA_YearMemoirDes_002"]="%s, you gained the friendship of the Kafra Company.",
    ["SEA_YearMemoirDes_003"]="The Adventure on Day <color=#ecc993>%s</color> made you more powerful.",
    ["SEA_YearMemoirDes_004"]="Now, you've become a Second Class Adventurer on Day <color=#ecc993>%s</color>.",
    ["SEA_YearMemoirDes_005"]="Transcendent Second Class Adventurer - Day %s,",
    ["SEA_YearMemoirDes_006"]="Third Class Adventurer - Day <color=#ecc993>%s</color>.",
    ["SEA_YearMemoirDes_021"]="\nYou have a little knowledge of equipment development.",
    ["SEA_YearMemoirDes_022"]="<color=#ecc993>%s</color> upgrades, <color=#ecc993>%s</color> refinements, and <color=#ecc993>%s</color> enchantments.",
    ["SEA_YearMemoirDes_023"]="You finally craft a Refinement Level <color=#ecc993>%s</color> <color=#ecc993>%s</color>,",
    ["SEA_YearMemoirDes_024"]="and your highest level of Enchantment reached <color=#ecc993>%s</color>.",
    ["SEA_YearMemoirDes_031"]="\nWant to get the most powerful equipment?\nGo to Hollgrehenn.\nHe will tell you the secrets of equipment development.\nBut stay calm.",
    ["SEA_YearMemoirDes_041"]="\nYou are a natural monster hunter.",
    ["SEA_YearMemoirDes_042"]="During MVP&MINI battle number <color=#ecc993>%s</color>,",
    ["SEA_YearMemoirDes_043"]="you sounded the final death knell for monsters <color=#ecc993>%s</color> times.",
    ["SEA_YearMemoirDes_044"]="You completed the instance <color=#ecc993>%s</color> times,",
    ["SEA_YearMemoirDes_045"]="and received <color=#ecc993>%s</color> Likes from witnesses of your bloody triumph.",
    ["SEA_YearMemoirDes_051"]="\nBattle is the spice of Adventure.\nWhy not try the Eclipse outside the kingdom?\nThe furry pelts must feel nice!",
    ["SEA_YearMemoirDes_061"]="\nThe luckiest Adventurer will meet companions and lovers.",
    ["SEA_YearMemoirDes_062"]="You made the promise on %s,",
    ["SEA_YearMemoirDes_063"]="Join %s on %s,",
    ["SEA_YearMemoirDes_064"]="Time passed, and you are the <color=#ecc993>%s</color> of <color=#ecc993>%s</color>.",
    ["SEA_YearMemoirDes_065"]="You have bonded with <color=#ecc993>%s</color> of your friends.",
    ["SEA_YearMemoirDes_071"]="\nYou seem to love the freedom of traveling alone,\nor perhaps fate is still selecting companions for you.\nThere's no need to rush,\nwhether you travel alone or in company,\nthe scenery waits for you.",
    ["SEA_YearMemoirDes_081"]="\nYou are a frequent visitor of the Exchange Center,",
    ["SEA_YearMemoirDes_082"]="and you have successfully made <color=#ecc993>%s</color> trades.",
    ["SEA_YearMemoirDes_083"]="You earned <color=#ecc993>%s</color> Crystals.",
    ["SEA_YearMemoirDes_084"]="You have spent <color=#ecc993>%s</color> Crystals, and <color=#ecc993>%s</color> Diamonds.",
    ["SEA_YearMemoirDes_091"]="\nHave you heard the pleasant tinkle of coins falling to the ground?\nGo to the Exchange Center now,\nand let them fall into your hands!",
    ["SEA_YearMemoirDes_101"]="\nOutside of Adventure, your daily life is just as interesting.",
    ["SEA_YearMemoirDes_102"]="You went fishing <color=#ecc993>%s</color> times and became a Lv. <color=#ecc993>%s</color> Fishing Master.",
    ["SEA_YearMemoirDes_103"]="You went mining <color=#ecc993>%s</color> times and became a Lv. <color=#ecc993>%s</color> Mining Expert.",
    ["SEA_YearMemoirDes_104"]="You obtained <color=#ecc993>%s</color> Gardening Achievements to become a Lv. <color=#ecc993>%s</color> Gardening Master.",
    ["SEA_YearMemoirDes_105"]="You captured pets <color=#ecc993>%s</color> times and had <color=#ecc993>%s</color> adorable pets grow with you.",
    ["SEA_YearMemoirDes_106"]="Your pet collection is at <color=#ecc993>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SEA_YearMemoirDes_111"]="\nWant to try discovering the joys of life?\nThe world is still vast\nafter the adventuring is over.",
    ["SEA_YearMemoirDes_Data"]="%sSo far",
    ["SEA_YearMemoirDes_Duration"]="Event Time: %s",
    ["SEA_YearMemoirDes_End"]="End",
    ["SEA_YearMemoirDes_EndTime"]="Rewards expiration:%s",
    ["SEA_YearMemoirDes_Open"]="Start",
    ["SEA_YearMemoirDes_RewardTips"]="Watch the Memoirs to activate rewards",
    ["SEA_YearMemoirDes_Title"]="Adventure Recap",
    ["SEA_YearMemoirShareDes_001"]="%s, I arrive in the Rune Kingdom, under the name %s……",
    ["SEA_YearMemoirShareDes_002"]="I Refined a total of <color=#ecc993>%s</color> times, I'm at the level of the max Refinement +<color=#ecc993>%s</color> levels!",
    ["SEA_YearMemoirShareDes_003"]="<color=#ecc993>%s</color> MVP & MINI battles, and <color=#ecc993>%s</color> Instances make up the legend of the monster hunter!",
    ["SEA_YearMemoirShareDes_004"]="I met <color=#ecc993>%s</color> Adventure companions.",
    ["SPCure"]="SP Regen",
    ["SSBRDes_1"]="Upon this gilded leaderboard, the eternal deeds of all Adventurers are engraved—each one a testament to their stand against the forces of evil. The fate of Midgard shall rest in the hands of those who rise to defend it. Let it be known—the Total Invasion leaderboard is renewed each day at 23:05 (UTC+7).",
    ["SSBRDes_2"]="The warriors from all sides are already fired up! Just look at this leaderboard—it shows every tough defense and every fierce attack, recording victory after victory! Keep fighting! Fate is ready to crown the final winner!",
    ["SSBRDes_3"]="By the will of the heavens, the world turns its eyes to this sacred battleground. The rankings shift with every move the chosen warriors make, and the fighting spirit keeps rising as time goes on. Chosen ones—let this leaderboard witness your battles and record your own epic tale!",
    ["SSBRDes_4"]="The battles aren't over yet! Brave warriors keep jumping from one fierce battleground to another, fighting with both their weapons and their willpower. Now, with all heroes gathered, let's look at the rankings and see—who fought their way to the very top?",
    ["SSBRName_1"]="Total Invasion",
    ["SSBRName_2"]="Apex GVG League",
    ["SSBRName_3"]="War of the Chosen",
    ["SSBRName_4"]="Overall Leaderboard",
    ["SameProp"]="Some of the selected stats are the same. Unable to transfer.",
