    ["SchoolOpeningDesc_001"]="· During the event period, complete quests to get <color=#FFA462FF>Freshman Vouchers</color>\n· You can exchange <color=#FFA462FF>Freshman Vouchers</color> for items at <color=#FFA462FF>Serea</color> in Prontera.\n· Items can be exchanged at the Exchange Shop up to <color=#FFA462FF>7</color> days after the event ends.",
    ["SchoolOpeningDesc_002"]="Quest Time %s-%s (Exchange Deadline: %s)",
    ["SchoolQuestDesc_001"]="Log In",
    ["SchoolQuestDesc_002"]="Upgrade 1 time",
    ["SchoolQuestDesc_003"]="Complete 1 Daily Instance.",
    ["SchoolQuestDesc_004"]="Complete 1 Mission Board Quest.",
    ["SchoolQuestDesc_005"]="Trade in the Exchange Center once (list or purchase an item).",
    ["SchoolQuestDesc_006"]="Complete the Tavern Minigame once.",
    ["SchoolQuestDesc_007"]="Talk to Morts in Prontera.",
    ["SchoolQuestDesc_008"]="Refine 1 time",
    ["SchoolQuestDesc_009"]="Ride the Mini Train and take and share a photo.",
    ["SchoolQuestDesc_010"]="Capture a Poring Hot Air Balloon photo and share it for good luck!",
    ["Season1_ActityKR_Desc1"]="来自异世界的跨次元联动！邂逅利姆露朱菜，兑换同款主角时装，与暴风龙猪头帝热血战斗，在史莱姆的奇境异想里掷下命运之骰，一切皆有可能！",
    ["Season1_ActityKR_Desc2"]="想拥有陪你打怪升级，共同成长的忠实旅伴吗？带上宠物弹弓，去野外捕捉你的心仪宠物吧~全新宠物图鉴，个性养成玩法，从今天起，你将成为下一个宠物大师！",
    ["Season1_ActityKR_Desc3"]="以血与火铸就功勋，跨服公会战开启！跟随会长的脚步，为公会夺取更多据点与战略资源。英勇的战士啊，举起武器，击破对方水晶！",
    ["Season1_ActityKR_Name1"]="转生史莱姆",
    ["Season1_ActityKR_Name2"]="宠物",
    ["Season1_ActityKR_Name3"]="跨服公会战",
    ["Season1_ActitySEA_Desc1"]="Super cute and super powerful—The Super Novice is here! A wild variety of weapons and skill combinations are at your disposal in this job! Take on the challenge now, Adventurers in Prontera! Instead of hesitating before the Temple of Dawn, why don't you listen to your heart...",
    ["Season1_ActitySEA_Desc2"]="Where do you want to spend your Songkran festival this year? How about escaping the arid land of heat and heading to an island for a magical tour? Conquer the water gun battle, and dominate this ocean with a harpoon on the back! Oh, by the way, remember to wear sunscreen...",
    ["Season1_ActitySEA_Desc3"]="In the praise of lies and the hilarity of deception, Loki, the god of mischief, comes as Ragnarok descends, endowing The Chosen the power to mock destiny. Are you a gladiator in the arena? Or are you a gambler spectating outside? There's more than one way to amuse the god...",
    ["Season1_ActitySEA_Desc4"]="Forge your medals with blood and fire! The Cross-Server GVG begins now! Follow your guild leader and seize more strongholds and tactical resources! Courageous warriors, raise your weapons! Let's shatter the crystal of your foes!",
    ["Season1_ActitySEA_Name1"]="Super Novice",
    ["Season1_ActitySEA_Name2"]="Songkran Festival",
    ["Season1_ActitySEA_Name3"]="Cross-Server GVG",
    ["Season1_ActitySEA_Time1"]="4.4",
    ["Season1_ActitySEA_Time2"]="4.11",
    ["Season1_ActitySEA_Time3"]="4.5",
    ["Season1_ActitySEA_Time4"]="4.23",
    ["Season1_ActityTW_Desc1"]="Super cute and super powerful—The Super Novice is here! A wild variety of weapons and skill combinations are at your disposal in this job! Take on the challenge now, Adventurers in Prontera! Instead of hesitating before the Temple of Dawn, why don't you listen to your heart...",
    ["Season1_ActityTW_Desc2"]="Who says adults can't celebrate Children's Day? Grab your ticket and head to the amusement park at South Gate for an all-out racing competition! They say the winner will receive a mysterious gift from the rainbow itself—bringing back the brightest memories of childhood...",
    ["Season1_ActityTW_Desc3"]="Forge your medals with blood and fire! The Cross-Server GVG begins now! Follow your guild leader and seize more strongholds and tactical resources! Courageous warriors, raise your weapons! Let's shatter the crystal of your foes!",
    ["Season1_ActityTW_Desc4"]="以血与火铸就功勋，跨服公会战开启！跟随会长的脚步，为公会夺取更多据点与战略资源。英勇的战士啊，举起武器，击破对方水晶！",
    ["Season1_ActityTW_Name1"]="Super Novice",
    ["Season1_ActityTW_Name2"]="Children's Day",
    ["Season1_ActityTW_Name3"]="神选S3",
    ["Season1_ActityTW_Name4"]="Cross-Server GVG",
    ["Season1_Actity_Desc1"]="A class that is able to use various skills from other classes, with multiple playstyles to choose from.",
    ["Season1_Actity_Desc2"]="Participate in the Race Event to win an exclusive title and an exquisite appearance!",
    ["Season1_Actity_Desc3"]="Party up with your guild members to excel in the Cross-Server GVG!",
    ["Season1_Actity_Time1"]="Super Novice",
    ["Season1_Actity_Time2"]="Children's Day Event",
    ["Season1_Actity_Time3"]="Cross-Server GVG",
