    ["Season1_Level_9"]="Lv.9",
    ["Season2_ActityALL_Desc1"]="Mutant Monsters crave the power of the Fire Boulders. Little do they know that while these stones grant them strength, they will eventually reduce everything to ashes...\nIn some corners of the world, the blazing weather will lead to the mutation of some monsters. It's yet to know where the mutation will happen or what kind of monster will mutate, but once the mutation takes place, they will move around the entire scene...\nMutant monsters have special physiques: normal attacks can only deal very limited damage to them. Adventurers need to launch attacks to weaken them, relying on the attributes that counter those of the monsters. But always stay vigilant: once the monsters are brought to the verge of death, the power of the Fire Boulders will cure them. So try your best to kill them at once...\n<color=#ad6964>Participation rewards are limited to 5 per day.</color>\n<color=#ad6964>Rewards from the Kill Rankings are limited to 3 per day.</color>",
    ["Season2_ActityALL_Desc2"]="Fresh arrivals in the wardrobe! Check out the five incredible sections: Character Aura, Wakes, Teleport, Kills, and Broadcast! The fanatic designers of Midgard once gazed at the sun and got this new inspiration...",
    ["Season2_ActityALL_Desc3"]="The season-exclusive instance is now available, featuring Mutant Bosses eagerly awaiting your challenge! Monsters who have won the Fire Boulders have managed to infiltrate the instance. They hold enticing rewards, but beware, for they are exceedingly dangerous as well...\nMutation Energy has been detected in Ancient Pyramid and Demon's Castle. Don’t forget to bring Blazing Runes with you if you are going there for an expedition. Eliminate the mutant monsters if you find any, though it might be difficult...",
    ["Season2_ActityALL_Desc4"]="Season PVP is coming in hot! Compete for the Frenzy Rune buff in GVG, KVM, and Ultimate Showdown events, defeat opponents to earn Season Points and Season PVP Points, and win rewards for reaching the points targets!\nThe Fire Boulder awakens the innate hostility dwelling within monsters and ignites the flames of war in the human world! Those still in possession of their faculties enter the arena with one intention—to finally put an end to the conflict. However, they will soon discover that the key to victory lies not in maintaining one's rationality, but in losing oneself to the frenzy...",
    ["Season2_ActityALL_Name1"]="Mutant Monster",
    ["Season2_ActityALL_Name2"]="New Special Effect",
    ["Season2_ActityALL_Name3"]="Season Instance",
    ["Season2_ActityALL_Name4"]="Season League",
    ["Season2_ActityALL_Time1"]="4/7",
    ["Season2_ActityALL_Time2"]="4/7",
    ["Season2_ActityALL_Time3"]="4/7",
    ["Season2_ActityALL_Time4"]="18/7",
    ["Season2_ActitySEA_Desc1"]="Get ready for the grand ceremony! Let's celebrate ROX's 2nd anniversary all together! Join us in the festivities as we reminisce about the memories of the past two years. Share your thoughts on the big screen and let go of all your burdens. Electro Poring is geared up and ready to dance with you!",
    ["Season2_ActitySEA_Desc2"]="Get ready, because the lovable demon lord Rimuru is back! Embark on a new adventure, retracing your footsteps from the past. Roll the dice of destiny once more and explore a larger map in search of treasures! Encounter thrilling random events and select from three major factions as you forge the one-of-a-kind legendary adventure!",
    ["Season2_ActitySEA_Desc3"]="In the realm of Niflheim, the perpetual cold fog becomes the goddess's skirt, while the ceaseless cries of the departed consist of her paean. The Chosen Ones, battle in the name of Hel, for the goddess only bestows her smile upon the ultimate victor...",
    ["Season2_ActitySEA_Desc4"]="Brand-new class: Gunslinger arrives in ROX! Get ready for sniper rifles, pistols, rifles, and shotguns, and feel the thrill of blazing gunfire combined with the exhilarating roar of a Harley-Davidson! The Gunslinger class guarantees you to embrace such exciting romance! When the sound of gunfire echoes, whose chest will your bullet pierce?",
    ["Season2_ActitySEA_Name1"]="Music Carnival",
    ["Season2_ActitySEA_Name2"]="Reincarnated Slime",
    ["Season2_ActitySEA_Name3"]="War of the Chosen",
    ["Season2_ActitySEA_Name4"]="New Class: Gunslinger",
    ["Season2_ActitySEA_Name5"]="Star Festival",
    ["Season2_ActitySEA_Name6"]="Cross-Server GVG S2",
    ["Season2_ActitySEA_Time1"]="8/6",
    ["Season2_ActitySEA_Time2"]="25/6",
    ["Season2_ActitySEA_Time3"]="11/8",
    ["Season2_ActityTW_Desc1"]="The 15-player instance—Thanatos Tower—is now available! The seals are broken, the tower is collapsing, and hatred, despair, sorrow, and regret have taken form once again, sweeping across the land of Midgard. Adventurer holding the Tower Key, follow Merlin and let hope light your path!",
    ["Season2_ActityTW_Desc2"]="Happy Dragon Boat Festival! The MVPs and MINIs seem to have mutated into scarier forms for the holiday... Party up with friends and bring justice to these monsters! And hey—word is Odin's buff is stronger at night!",
    ["Season2_ActityTW_Desc3"]="Where to beat the heat in the blazing summertime? How about setting off under starlight on a magical tour to the famous landmarks in Hong Kong, Macao, and Taiwan? Conquer the water gun battles, and dominate this ocean with a harpoon on the back! Oh, by the way, remember to wear sunscreen...",
    ["Season2_ActityTW_Desc4"]="Get ready, because the lovable demon lord Rimuru is back! Embark on a new adventure, retracing your footsteps from the past. Roll the dice of destiny once more and explore a larger map in search of treasures! Encounter thrilling random events and select from three major factions as you forge the one-of-a-kind legendary adventure!",
    ["Season2_ActityTW_Desc5"]="Brand-new class: Gunslinger arrives in ROX! Get ready for sniper rifles, pistols, rifles, and shotguns, and feel the thrill of blazing gunfire combined with the exhilarating roar of a Harley-Davidson! The Gunslinger class guarantees you will embrace such exciting romance! When the sound of gunfire echoes, whose chest will your bullet pierce?",
    ["Season2_ActityTW_Desc6"]="The pet system's updated again! Along with better catching and a smoother evolution interface, there's now a pet transformation feature. Give your pet special accessories and let them show off a cool new look that really stands out!",
    ["Season2_ActityTW_Desc7"]="In the praise of lies and the hilarity of deception, Loki, the god of mischief, comes as Ragnarok descends, endowing The Chosen the power to mock destiny. Are you a gladiator in the arena? Or are you a gambler spectating outside? There's more than one way to amuse the god...",
    ["Season2_ActityTW_Desc8"]="Star Festival",
    ["Season2_ActityTW_Desc9"]="Cross-Server GVG S2",
    ["Season2_Badeg_1"]="Ember Badge",
    ["Season2_Badeg_2"]="Glowing Badge",
    ["Season2_Badeg_3"]="Burning Badge",
    ["Season2_Badeg_4"]="Ghostflame Badge",
    ["Season2_Badeg_5"]="Stormfire Badge",
    ["Season2_Badeg_6"]="Wyrmfire Badge",
    ["Season3_ActitySEA_Desc1"]="The newest members of the pet family are coming! Take some time to check it out! Now, which one is your favorite: Insect, Undead, Fish, Demi-Human, Demon, or Brute? If you're not so sure, here is a reminder from the ROX Association of Adventurers: Love plus dominance equals successful taming. Grab your gear, Adventurer, dive into the wilderness, and get yourself a new pet!",
    ["Season3_ActitySEA_Desc2"]="Secession, conspiracy, and betrayal... Have you ever heard the Halloween Tale? Why not be a decent Adventurer, stay sharp, and track down Jakk in Prontera! Wisdom is the key to mysteries, as people would say, but it's also the road sign to the Black Fairy Tale. May all truth-unveiling travelers have a memorable night...",
    ["Season3_ActitySEA_Desc3"]="Blend into the shadow, and take down your foes with deadly subtlety. The new class, Ninja, is coming! Combine wind, water, and fire to unleash your shuriken of magic? Or dance with your blade, delivering fatal physical attacks? Or rather explore your own way of Nindo, developing a unique combat style? Well, the choice is now waiting for you. Become a Ninja in ROX and try out those incredible moves yourself! Please stay tuned!",
    ["Season3_ActitySEA_Desc4"]="Ding! Here's an invitation to move into a home! Fancy a cozy stay with friends after an adventure? How about moving all the mines, farmlands, and ponds to your home and creating your own personal world? In a home where time flows quietly, there's limitless fun in every corner!",
    ["Season3_ActitySEA_Desc5"]="One-Punch ROX! The fantastic collaboration between One-Punch Man and ROX is kicking off! Mr. Saitama, the justice incarnation of the anime world, is now coming to ROX! Fight alongside this legendary hero to fend off Carnage Kabuto and Mosquito Girl to safeguard the continent of Midgard!",
    ["Season3_ActitySEA_Desc6"]="On Christmas night, the biting wind taps at Lutie's door once more. Beyond this stunning town filled with fairy tales, the evil Warg—Garm is creeping up quietly. Travelers heading to Lutie, keep an eye out for unexpected guests lurking in the shadows. They're into sweets and toys just like everyone but don't count on them being on the side of good.",
    ["Season3_ActitySEA_Desc7"]="Atop the majestic expanse of Bifrost, Heimdall gazes with his golden eyes, overwatching everything and the chosen ones. Who among the watched shall seize the ultimate glory in the waning hours before the downfall of gods and the onset of Ragnarok? In this arena of life and death, hymns need not be played for the gods; we honor the brave and pay tribute to the fallen souls!",
    ["Season3_ActitySEA_Name1"]="New Pet",
    ["Season3_ActitySEA_Name2"]="Black Fairy Tale",
    ["Season3_ActitySEA_Name3"]="New Class: Ninja",
    ["Season3_ActitySEA_Name4"]="Home System",
    ["Season3_ActitySEA_Name5"]="New Collaboration: One-Punch Man & ROX",
    ["Season3_ActitySEA_Name6"]="Holy Night",
    ["Season3_ActitySEA_Time1"]="20/10",
    ["Season3_ActitySEA_Time2"]="30/10",
    ["Season3_ActitySEA_Time3"]="12/12",
    ["Season3_ActitySEA_Time4"]="12/12",
    ["Season3_ActitySEA_Time5"]="01/12",
    ["Season3_ActitySEA_Time6"]="20/12",
    ["Season3_ActitySEA_Time7"]="12/12",
    ["Season3_ActityTW_Desc1"]="New PVP mode is here! 2V2, 3V3, 6V6—cross-server matchmaking and nonstop battles! Fight side by side with party members across different maps, sharpen your skills, and reach the highest rank. The battlefield has no room for fear—grab your weapon and carve your name—your glory—into the seat of champions!",
    ["Season3_ActityTW_Desc2"]="Secession, conspiracy, and betrayal... Have you ever heard the Halloween Tale? Why not be a decent Adventurer, stay sharp, and track down Jakk in Prontera! Wisdom is the key to mysteries, as people would say, but it's also the prologue of the Black Fairy Tale. May all truth-unveiling travelers have a memorable night...",
    ["Season3_ActityTW_Desc3"]="Blend into the shadows, and take down your foes with deadly subtlety. The new class, Ninja, is coming! Combine wind, water, and fire to unleash your shuriken of magic? Or dance with your blade, delivering fatal physical attacks? Or rather explore your own way of Nindo, developing a unique combat style? Well, the choice is now waiting for you. Become a Ninja in ROX and try out those incredible moves yourself! Please stay tuned!",
    ["Season3_ActityTW_Desc4"]="The Lv.140 update is here—welcome to Einbroch, the City of Steel! Machinery roars, heralding Rekenber's rising ambition, while beneath it hums the muted lament of the oppressed. Yet even in oppression, the flower of liberty blooms. New fields, new caves, new monsters, new stories—ready to explore?",
    ["Season3_ActityTW_Desc5"]="One-Punch ROX! The fantastic collaboration between One-Punch Man and ROX is kicking off! Mr. Saitama, the justice incarnation of the anime world, is now coming to ROX! Fight alongside this legendary hero to fend off Carnage Kabuto and Mosquito Girl to safeguard the continent of Midgard!",
    ["Season3_ActityTW_Desc6"]="The newest member of the pet family is coming! Take some time to check it out! Now, which one is your favorite: Insect, Undead, Fish, Demi-Human, Demon, or Brute? If you're not so sure, here is a reminder from the ROX Association of Adventurers: Love plus dominance equals successful taming. Grab your gear, Adventurer, dive into the wilderness, and get yourself a new pet!",
    ["Season3_ActityTW_Desc7"]="On Christmas night, the biting wind taps at Lutie's door once more. Beyond this stunning town filled with fairy tales, the evil Warg—Garm is creeping up quietly. Travelers heading to Lutie, keep an eye out for unexpected guests lurking in the shadows. They're into sweets and toys just like everyone but don't count on them being on the side of good.",
    ["Season3_ActityTW_Name1"]="Infinite Showdown",
    ["Season3_ActityTW_Name2"]="Black Fairy Tale",
    ["Season3_ActityTW_Name3"]="New Class: Ninja",
    ["Season3_ActityTW_Name4"]="City of Steel",
    ["Season3_ActityTW_Name5"]="New Collaboration: One-Punch Man & ROX",
    ["Season3_ActityTW_Name6"]="New Pet",
    ["Season3_ActityTW_Name7"]="Holy Night",
    ["Season3_Badeg_1"]="Feather Badge",
    ["Season3_Badeg_2"]="Fledgling's Badge",
    ["Season3_Badeg_3"]="Swiftwing's Badge",
    ["Season3_Badeg_4"]="Skydancer's Badge",
    ["Season3_Badeg_5"]="Soaring Conqueror's Badge",
    ["Season3_Badeg_6"]="Heavenly Descendant's Badge",
    ["Season4LevelRewardExp"]="<color=#FFFFFF>%s</color><color=#8484B7>/%s</color>",
    ["Season4_ActityALL_Desc11"]="Songkran Gala! Ocean-themed costumes are making a splash! Embrace the holiday vibe, travel through famous landmarks, and fight alongside your friends in the Water Gun Battle once again! With the blue shores and sunshine, joy is within your reach!",
    ["Season4_ActityALL_Desc2"]="Exclusive seasonal instances are now accessible, filled with demonic beings encircling the mystical realms, awaiting challengers...\nWith the apocalypse, the hidden realms reveal their malevolent corners. The monsters imprisoned within are carrying out ancient rituals: is it the prelude to the ever-night of Midgard or the awakening of their king? Brave Adventurers, ready your weapons and assemble. Amidst the layers of darkness, the most alluring spoils await their new owner...",
    ["Season4_ActityALL_Desc3"]="In every land besieged by the storming sands, the revelry of the Calamity Boxes can be seen. The survivors who have escaped from the revelry have concluded the following strategies to deal with them:\n①These Calamity Boxes possess unique characteristics. Normal attacks only do little damage and Adventurers need to utilize attacks of counter elements to trigger additional effects.\n②Stay cautious at all times; unforeseen circumstances can occur as a Calamity Box is on the verge of death...\n③Calamity Boxes appear exclusively in areas experiencing Whirlsand weather. There's a daily limit on drops, and no additional rewards will be granted within the same day once the limit is reached. The reward count reset daily at 05:00.",
    ["Season4_ActityALL_Desc4"]="The globally popular \"Larva\" series is here! Pick a side and use your sausage items to vote for your favorite—Yellow or Red—to win collaboration costumes, s-class pets, 2-seater mounts, and more! Amidst Midgard's tales of adventure, the hilarious comedy of Yellow and Red plays on...",
    ["Season4_ActityALL_Desc5"]="Raid 3.0 kicks off! Enemies from the future? A Ymir's Heart from the future has empowered the Welsh to forge their most glorious civilization. The aspiration to decode divine forces through technology, embodying the dedication of several generations, has finally yielded the perfect creation known as \"Vesper.\" However, this awakened Mech Creature seems to have never recognized its creator...",
    ["Season4_ActityALL_Desc7"]="On the White Valentine's Day, let the melody of the Pure White Love Song fill the air! No matter if you're single or a couple, complete daily quests to collect Paper Cranes and Affection rewards. Participate in the Soulmate Test to receive extra special treats—Golden/Silver Jar Cookies. Plus, there are new swan-themed costumes available for you to grab!",
    ["Season4_ActityALL_Desc8"]="Under the sacred moon, these mutated monsters start acting up under the curtain of darkness. Prayers during the day grant the strength to overcome them at night, offering special loot from the \"Night Hunt.\" Oddly enough, the \"Foreign Merchant\" Kusari seems quite fascinating about the special loot...",
    ["Season4_ActityALL_Desc9"]="Shatter the sky and crack open the earth with jabs and kicks—Here comes the new class - Taekwon! With combined powers of sun, moon, and stars, let's ditch the weapons and kick your way toward your goal! The road to the top may never end, but every one shall kneel before Taekwon!",
    ["Season4_ActityALL_Name2"]="Oblivion Realm",
    ["Season4_ActitySEA_Time1"]="05/03",
    ["Season4_ActitySEA_Time2"]="05/03",
    ["Season4_ActitySEA_Time3"]="14/03",
    ["Season4_ActitySEA_Time4"]="26/03",
    ["Season4_ActitySEA_Time5"]="02/04",
    ["Season4_ActitySEA_Time6"]="09/04",
    ["Season4_Badeg_1"]="Primitive Badge",
    ["Season4_Badeg_2"]="Entropy Badge",
    ["Season4_Badeg_3"]="Disarray Badge",
    ["Season4_Badeg_4"]="Madness Badge",
    ["Season4_Badeg_5"]="Chaos Badge",
    ["Season4_Badeg_6"]="Abyss Badge",
    ["Season5_ActityALL_Desc1"]="In every land besieged by the rage of thunder, the revelry of the Calamity Boxes can be seen. The survivors who have escaped from the revelry have concluded the following strategies to deal with them:\n①These Calamity Boxes possess unique characteristics. Normal attacks only do little damage and Adventurers need to utilize attacks of counter elements to trigger additional effects.\n②Stay cautious at all times; unforeseen circumstances can occur as a Calamity Box is on the verge of death...\n③Calamity Boxes appear exclusively in areas experiencing Raging Thunder weather. There's a daily limit on drops, and no additional rewards will be granted within the same day once the limit is reached. The reward count reset daily at 05:00.",
    ["Season5_ActityALL_Desc12"]="Happy Children's Day! Join the \"Apex Rush\" event and race to recapture your childish moment! We've optimized the ticket entry system, mount abilities, and the rewards for repeat participation to make sure every Adventurer can reach the finish line easily and enjoy the purest happiness!",
    ["Season5_ActityALL_Desc2"]="Exclusive seasonal instances are now accessible, filled with demonic beings encircling the mystical realms, awaiting challengers...\nWith the approaching judgment day, the hidden realms reveal their malevolent corners. The monsters imprisoned within are carrying out ancient rituals: is it the prelude to the ever-night of Midgard or the awakening of their king? Brave Adventurers, ready your weapons and assemble. Amidst the layers of darkness, the most alluring spoils await their new owner...\nFor this season, the occurrence rate of Prophet and Judgement monster affixes has been boosted.",
    ["Season5_ActityALL_Desc3"]="Unleash the power of Odin's bloodline and claim the gifts of the gods! The Divinity System is coming soon! Eight gods come with eight Divinities, guiding you on the path to the pinnacle! Enhance your Divinities through adventures, select the perfect combination, and create a whole new PVE experience. Let the ancient Divinities carve your glory!",
    ["Season5_ActityALL_Desc4"]="The 3rd Anniversary Celebration kicks off! Join us tonight for a wild party! Follow the instructions, pick your new anniversary costumes, and play a round of Card Phantom! Lady Luck won't smile at everyone, so who will get that ultimate Joker card? The stars are shining while the North Star is high, and who will be the next guest from the Otherworld?",
    ["Season5_ActityALL_Desc5"]="A classic masterpiece from the last century, a post-apocalyptic legend—Fist of the North Star—collaboration kicks off now! Join Kenshiro in Midgard to fend off Raoh's invasion and experience the epic showdown between \"The Savior of the Century's End\" and \"The Conqueror of Century's End\"! Tear-away costumes, Kokuoh-Go mount, and powerful cards are now available!",
    ["Season5_ActityALL_Desc6"]="Fair fight and strategy! The ROX Fair Play Championship kicks off now! In this stat-balanced arena, pick your equipment and party members freely, and challenge others or be challenged. Only the brave will prevail when crossing paths. Who will walk away in regret, and who will ascend to the throne? Legends may never fade, or maybe you will become a legend!",
    ["Season5_ActityALL_Desc8"]="Beat the summer heat with Criatura's \"Midsummer Cram School\" to power up your adventures! Strengthen your skills with \"Daily Practice,\" aim for the top in the \"Score Summary,\" and trade your points for lots of supplies. Both sweat and talent are essential for success!",
    ["Season5_ActityALL_Desc9"]="Myths come in many forms. Across different dimensions, the pantheon is rewritten. Hera, the Queen, feared by all gods for her jealousy and power, arrives in the War of the Chosen! Brave warriors, give your best fight for this noble goddess!",
    ["Season5_ActitySEA_Time1"]="6/12",
    ["Season5_ActitySEA_Time2"]="6/12",
    ["Season5_ActitySEA_Time3"]="6/12",
    ["Season5_ActitySEA_Time4"]="6/12",
    ["Season5_ActitySEA_Time5"]="6/18",
    ["Season5_ActitySEA_Time6"]="6/18",
