    ["Season5_ActitySEA_Time8"]="8/15",
    ["Season5_ActitySEA_Time9"]="8/26",
    ["Season5_Badeg_1"]="Slumbering Thunder Badge",
    ["Season5_Badeg_2"]="Electric Surge Badge",
    ["Season5_Badeg_3"]="Thunderbolt Badge",
    ["Season5_Badeg_4"]="Flashstorm Badge",
    ["Season5_Badeg_5"]="Shining Echo Badge",
    ["Season5_Badeg_6"]="Divine Vengeance Badge",
    ["Season5_Reward_10"]="Unlocks the privilege to buy Heroic Medal",
    ["Season5_Reward_20"]="Unlocks the privilege to buy Kill Broadcast",
    ["Season5_Reward_30"]="Unlocks the privilege to buy Wake Effect",
    ["Season5_Reward_40"]="Unlocks the privilege to buy Kill Effect",
    ["Season5_Reward_59"]="Unlocks the privilege to buy Mount Decoration",
    ["Season5_Reward_70"]="Unlocks the privilege to buy Teleport Effect",
    ["Season6_ActityALL_Desc1"]="In every land besieged by the crimson moon, the revelry of the Calamity Boxes can be seen. The survivors who have escaped from the revelry have concluded the following strategies to deal with them:\n①These Calamity Boxes possess unique characteristics. Normal attacks only do little damage and Adventurers need to utilize attacks of counter elements to trigger additional effects.\n②Stay cautious at all times; unforeseen circumstances can occur as a Calamity Box is on the verge of death...\n③Calamity Boxes appear exclusively in areas experiencing Crimson Moon weather. There's a daily limit on drops, and no additional rewards will be granted within the same day once the limit is reached. The reward count reset daily at 05:00.",
    ["Season6_ActityALL_Desc2"]="From a convenience store straight into another world? The popular anime \"Re: Zero − Starting Life in Another World\" collaboration is here! Meet classic characters such as Natsuki Subaru, Emilia, and Rem in Midgard and unlock favor rewards! Tons of cool items and collaboration costumes are available through Beatrice's Magic Door! Don't miss out!",
    ["Season6_ActityALL_Desc3"]="Halloween has come. Cowboys searching for treasure, fill your cups with the crimson brew, and join the shadowy blood feast! Shine your revolvers, hunt the monsters of the night, grab the map, and decode Jakk's riddle. The one who collects the most stirrup coins might just win a mysterious gift—an invitation to immortality...",
    ["Season6_ActityALL_Desc4"]="The snowy Lutie comes alive with Christmas bells ringing again. Reindeer dash through the frost with gifts, and the Toy Factory hums nonstop. But under the fireworks-lit night sky, the fearsome Garm is on the prowl, licking its claws. Adventurers, it's time to rise and defend the peace and prosperity of Lutie!",
    ["Season6_ActityALL_Desc5"]="The fourth class is live! Let's meet the six major fourth classes: Dragon Knight, Cardinal, Arch Mage, Meister, Wind Hawk, and Shadow Cross! New skills and mounts are ready to go. The journey from a Novice to a Fourth-Class Adventurer starts now!",
    ["Season6_ActityALL_Desc8"]="Fair Play Championship S2 is kicking off! Join forces with your party members and keep the glory going in the arena! Check out the new \"Explosive Whiz\" costume in the prize pool—let's shroud the arena with smoke and flame!",
    ["Season6_ActityALL_Desc9"]="Beyond the reach of Zeus' radiance lies the realm of Hades. Who among the chosen of the mortal world will summon the courage to unlock the gate of life and death? In an arena where triumph meets sorrow, the god of the underworld salutes to your soul.",
    ["Season6_ActitySEA_Time1"]="10/11",
    ["Season6_ActitySEA_Time2"]="10/29",
    ["Season6_ActitySEA_Time3"]="11/11",
    ["Season6_ActitySEA_Time4"]="11/11",
    ["Season6_ActitySEA_Time5"]="12/02",
    ["Season6_ActitySEA_Time6"]="12/10",
    ["Season6_ActitySEA_Time7"]="12/19",
    ["Season6_Badeg_1"]="Waning Crescent Badge",
    ["Season6_Badeg_2"]="Last Quarter Badge",
    ["Season6_Badeg_3"]="First Quarter Badge",
    ["Season6_Badeg_4"]="Crimson Moon Badge",
    ["Season6_Badeg_5"]="Eclipse Badge",
    ["Season6_Badeg_6"]="Evernight Badge",
    ["Season7_ActityALL_Desc1"]="Fat Tiger Alert—! Brace yourself, Adventurers! The cutest tiger in history, Alexander, is making his way to Prontera, along with Fat Dragon and Archie! Unlock special collaboration rewards, including costumes, cards, pets, and more! Always wanted a round and cuddly tiger companion? Now's your chance—but only for a limited time!",
    ["Season7_ActityALL_Desc10"]="The fourth class is live! Let's meet the six major fourth classes: Imperial Guard, Inquisitor, Elemental Master, Abyss Chaser, Troubadour, and Trouvere, Biolo! New skills and mounts are ready to go. The journey from a Novice to a Fourth-Class Adventurer starts now!",
    ["Season7_ActityALL_Desc11"]="In every land besieged by the storming sands, the revelry of the Calamity Boxes can be seen. The survivors who have escaped from the revelry have concluded the following strategies to deal with them:\n1. These Calamity Boxes possess unique characteristics. Normal attacks only do little damage and Adventurers need to utilize attacks of counter elements to trigger additional effects.\n2. Stay cautious at all times; unforeseen circumstances can occur as a Calamity Box is on the verge of death...\n3. Calamity Boxes appear exclusively in areas experiencing Whirlsand weather. Only 30 items can be obtained per day, and no additional rewards will be granted within the same day once the limit is reached. The reward count reset daily at 05:00.",
    ["Season7_ActityALL_Desc2"]="Bells toll, and drums roar. Through storm and sand strides the wanderer from afar, bearing the oldest tales of astrology. Beneath the seemingly erratic constellations lies a destiny foretold—one that only the devout may discern through earnest prayer and be graced by the gift from the stars. But beware—lurking in the shadows are monsters of the dark, drawn to the same celestial power...",
    ["Season7_ActityALL_Desc3"]="Heflee from the Desert Green Tavern invites all Adventurers to the wildest party in the Morroc Desert! So pick up your water gun, dive into the fun, and show everyone what you've got! Tonight—you're the star of the party!",
    ["Season7_ActityALL_Desc5"]="Cuteness overload—Bugcat Capoo has officially joined ROX for the collaboration! Fueled by pure food-powered determination, Capoo chomped right through the Dimensional Gap and landed in Midgard! Adventurers, are you ready? Roll your dice and dive into a wild and fun treasure hunt with Capoo!",
    ["Season7_ActityALL_Desc7"]="Growing up is tough—but in the world of candy, anyone can escape for a bit and chase the wind! Adventurers, grab your magical items and let your playful heart carry you far away!",
    ["Season7_ActityALL_Desc8"]="Eternal blaze scorches the land, and the crimson sun looms above—an eye of the gods watching from the heavens. O brave ones chosen by fate—raise your weapons! Beneath the sun's divine gaze, let the fiercest trial of fire and will commence!",
    ["Season7_ActityALL_Desc9"]="Unleash the power of Odin's bloodline and claim the gifts of the gods! The Divinity System is coming soon! Eight gods come with eight Divinities, guiding you on the path to the pinnacle! Enhance your Divinities through adventures, select the perfect affix combination, and create a whole new PVE experience. Let the ancient Divinities carve your glory!",
    ["Season7_ActitySEA_Time1"]="2/14",
    ["Season7_ActitySEA_Time10"]="4/16",
    ["Season7_ActitySEA_Time11"]="4/16",
    ["Season7_ActitySEA_Time12"]="4/29",
    ["Season7_ActitySEA_Time13"]="5/22",
    ["Season7_ActitySEA_Time2"]="2/14",
    ["Season7_ActitySEA_Time3"]="2/14",
    ["Season7_ActitySEA_Time4"]="2/20",
    ["Season7_ActitySEA_Time5"]="3/18",
    ["Season7_ActitySEA_Time6"]="3/6",
    ["Season7_ActitySEA_Time7"]="4/10",
    ["Season7_ActitySEA_Time8"]="4/8",
    ["Season7_ActitySEA_Time9"]="4/8",
    ["Season8_ActityALL_Desc1"]="A millennium has passed. At long last, the Rainbow Bridge trembles with the echo of a sacred horn. The black ravens take wing, drawn by the ancestral ties that whisper through their veins—bringing with them a new power. They were once the most faithful of Odin's kin. And now, they return—for you. O successor of Odin's bloodline—heed the goddess' call, bind your fate to theirs, and rise to fulfill your divine purpose...",
    ["Season8_ActityALL_Desc2"]="Ding—Hey Adventurer! You've just received a special invitation from the Wonderland! Can you believe it? It's already been 4 years since you started this journey with ROX! Now, Captain Carew's Valor is about to set sail once again. New season, new class, new gameplay, new collaborations—so much to look forward to! Though time moves on, our hearts stay true. In the journeys yet to come, may ROX walk with you still—toward the ever-glimmering starry sky!",
    ["Season8_ActityALL_Desc3"]="The fourth class is live! Let's meet the final round of the fourth classes: Hyper Novice, Night Watch, Shinkiro, Shiranui, and Sky Emperor! New skills and mounts are ready to go. The journey from a Novice to a Fourth-Class Adventurer starts now!",
    ["Season8_ActityALL_Desc4"]="When two distinct worlds collided through the fabric of time and space, a miracle was born. Though fleeting, that encounter forged a bond—one destined to light the shadows. Adventurer, will your heart recall that long-buried summer when the melody echoes once more? \"The gate to the Digital World is open—DigiDestined—let's go!\"",
    ["Season8_ActityALL_Desc5"]="Listen! From the mountaintop comes the clash of countless bells—born from the goddess's spear striking the earth! O valiant warriors, lift your eyes and behold the olive road, leading to the seat of the triumphant. March forth! Wield your might! Chosen of glory, let art and justice sing your praise, while wisdom and victory bow low before your reign!",
    ["Season8_ActityALL_Desc6"]="Beat the summer heat with Criatura's \"Midsummer Cram School\" to power up your adventures! Strengthen your skills with \"Daily Practice,\" aim for the top in the \"Score Summary,\" and trade your points for lots of supplies. Both sweat and talent are essential for success!",
    ["Season8_ActityALL_Desc7"]="The curtain of battle has lifted, and the silent crystal shines once more. Will you strike as the spear, charging into the enemy stronghold? Or wield the shield, safeguarding the sacred crystal? Here, the tide of attack and defense shifts in the blink of an eye—only wisdom joined with courage shall prevail. Warriors of the guild, seize your arms, and turn this clash of fire and steel into an everlasting merit!",
    ["Season8_ActityALL_Desc8"]="Greetings! The golden autumn graces the world once more! A season famed for reunion when strangers become friends, and distant bonds are rekindled. Around the glowing hearth, we shall craft the flavors of memory itself. Adventurers, come have a taste! Let's see who's the real master chef!",
    ["Season8_ActitySEA_Time1"]="6/11",
    ["Season8_ActitySEA_Time2"]="6/11",
    ["Season8_ActitySEA_Time3"]="6/11",
    ["Season8_ActitySEA_Time4"]="7/1",
    ["Season8_ActitySEA_Time5"]="7/14",
    ["Season8_ActitySEA_Time6"]="8/8",
    ["Season8_ActitySEA_Time7"]="9/22",
    ["Season8_ActitySEA_Time8"]="9/28",
    ["Season9_ActityALL_Desc1"]="The savior from another world has arrived! His gaze set upon the awe-inspiring, mysterious Mt. Soukai. O heroes of this land, rise and march beside him—your courage will light the path ahead. Uncover the sacred treasures within the mountain's heart, break through the storm of gray clouds, and ascend toward the radiant summit bathed in the touch of rainbow light!",
    ["Season9_ActityALL_Desc3"]="Look! The golden bells upon the treetops are swaying in the wind! The season of snow and laughter is back! Snowflakes bring new adventures and colorful treasures. Pass the challenges set by the Snowland Envoy, and treasure chests will reward you with surprises!",
    ["Season9_ActityALL_Desc4"]="A haunting echo sweeps across heaven and earth, announcing the Soul Linker, master of souls and elements, has joined the Midgard adventure. When mortals gain the right to bend nature and the cycle of life and death, how shall such awe-inspiring power be shaped? Adventurers, step forth—and forge the new destiny that awaits!",
    ["Season9_ActityALL_Desc5"]="The annual Snow Festival is back again! Everyone in Lutie is grabbing their fishing poles and talking excitedly about the upcoming Ice Fishing Contest. Casting strength, reeling speed, even the bait you choose—all of it affects your catch. Come on! Grab your rod and let's see who's the real champion!",
    ["Season9_ActityALL_Desc6"]="As winter's frost fades, the new spring breeze brushes against our faces. The auspicious Golden Steed has arrived in Midgard with rare treasures, but the wicked Nian is right on its heels! Brave Adventurers, join forces to light the firecrackers, drive away the Nian, and welcome the warmth of spring with a spectacular firework display!",
    ["Season9_ActityALL_Desc7"]="Dear Adventurers, the Data Link is upon us! Soon, the barriers between servers will fall, allowing you to join forces with Adventurers from distant lands on a shared path of discovery! Across time and space, may you and your companions, old and new, embark together into a realm where the familiar joys meet the fresh wonders as you continue exploring worlds beyond worlds!",
    ["Season9_ActitySEA_Time1"]="10/11",
    ["Season9_ActitySEA_Time2"]="11/24",
    ["Season9_ActitySEA_Time3"]="10/31",
    ["Season9_ActitySEA_Time4"]="11/24",
