    ["SeasonMonster_Help"]="Calamity Surge Explanation:\n 1. During the season, there's a chance for certain maps to encounter the special weather condition \"Whirlsand.\"\n 2. During the special weather, the map will spawn a number of wandering monsters with unique mechanisms, with a chance to drop seasonal materials when defeated.\n 3. There's a daily limit (30) on how many seasonal materials can be obtained each day. The limit will be reset daily at 05:00.",
    ["SeasonNoticeName1"]="Season of Revitalization",
    ["SeasonNoticeName2"]="Season of Frenzy ",
    ["SeasonNoticeName3"]="Season of Warriors",
    ["SeasonNoticeName4"]="Apocalypse Season",
