    ["Setting_Info_38"]="Failed to send text message!",
    ["Setting_Info_39"]="Verification code sent!",
    ["Setting_Info_40"]="1. Players can choose 1 character from their account to link and get the reward. Information from other characters in the account will also be linked. \n2. Players can refresh their account linkage on the 1st of every month at 00:00 (GMT +7). Players who have linked accounts last month can tap \"OK\" to continue linking for 1 month. The linkage extension will last 1 month, where players need to link their mobile number/email address for verification for the following month. You know and agree that after you link your mobile phone number/email address, we will use your mobile phone number/email address in accordance with the principles and methods mentioned in the \"Privacy Agreement\". We may send you event invitations, customer care packages, surveys, promotion info, etc.\n3. Characters who have received the current month's reward who change their mobile number/email will no longer be able to receive the reward; the reward can be collected for the following month. \n4. If the mobile number/email provided is incorrect and cannot be linked, the reward will not be re-sent. \n5. If players want to unlink their mobile number/email, please send an email to CS at cs@roxnextgeneration.com. \n6. Terms and conditions are subject to change without notice.",
    ["Setting_Info_41"]="I have read [/a] and [a href=https://lf16-ga18cdn-alisg.bytedgame.com/obj/sf-game-alisg/ga18/%E5%8D%8F%E8%AE%AE/ROSEAPrivacyPolicy.html] Privacy Policy [/a] and agree to receive marketing materials. \n\n ",
    ["Setting_Info_42"]="Are you sure you want to change your region to <color=#ffae78>%s</color>? You can only change once.",
