    ["ShadowWeapon_tips_031"]="Post-Transfer Effect: %s",
    ["ShadowWeapon_tips_032"]="Would you like to carry out a Shadow Equipment Transfer? Upon doing so, the levels of both pieces of equipment, along with their corresponding skill slot levels, will be swapped. Currently equipped Shadow Equipment will be removed and will need to be re-equipped.",
