    ["Sign62285"]="LaliWee",
    ["Sign62286"]="「MoonGarden」",
    ["Sign62287"]="ไร้อันดับ",
    ["Sign62288"]="ต่างที่นินจา.จงกราบWinzza",
    ["Sign62289"]="「Liv」",
    ["Sign62290"]="RoGer'X'",
    ["Sign62291"]="「BEES」",
    ["Sign62292"]="「GaNgSTeR」",
    ["Sign66011"]="Christmas Shop",
    ["Sign66013"]="Reward Exchange Bureau",
    ["Sign67325"]="Toy Factory Special Supply",
    ["Sign67326"]="Toy Factory Special Supply",
    ["Sign67327"]="Sleigh Repair",
    ["Sign69997"]="Kafra Plus",
    ["SignRepaireTip"]="About Make-up Sign-ins:\n1. If you missed any sign-in day this month, you can use make-up sign-ins to obtain the rewards.\n2. When you sign-in, the earlier rewards will be prioritized (You cannot use make-up sign-ins before the server launches).\n3. You can get 3 make-up sign-ins per month. They will reset to zero in the next month.\n4. Kafra's VIP card has an option to grant bonus make-up sign-ins.",
    ["SigninTips_001"]="Failed to connect several times, try again?\n<color=#CA2E0AFF>(If after 2 minutes it doesn't work, you'll automatically be moved to the back of the queue)</color>",
    ["SigninTips_002"]="Your login identity has expired, please login again",
    ["SigninTips_003"]="The queue is full, please try again",
    ["SingInterrupted"]="Channeling stopped.",
    ["SingMountLimit"]="You cannot mount or dismount in the middle of a casting.",
    ["SingSilenced"]="Silence interrupted channeling.",
    ["SkillAim_RaceError"]="The target's race is incorrect.",
    ["SkillAim_TypeError"]="The target's type is incorrect.",
    ["SkillCastTips_1"]="You have not met the requirement(s) to use the skill.",
    ["SkillCastTips_2"]="You cannot mount or dismount while in combat.",
    ["SkillCost_HpLack"]="You have insufficient HP!",
    ["SkillCost_NeedLoadItem"]="Please select the stone artifact to load!",
    ["SkillCost_SpLack"]="You have insufficient SP!",
    ["SkillDes1"]="Upgrade Job levels to obtain new skill points, which can then be used to increase skill levels.",
    ["SkillDes2"]="Skills are divided into <color=#CA2E0AFF>active skills </color>and<color=#CA2E0AFF> passive skills</color>. Active skills take effect after a certain cast time, and passive skills take effect immediately after cooldown.",
    ["SkillDes3"]="The upgrade and stat points allocation of some skills will only be available when their prerequisite skills reach a certain level.",
    ["SkillDes4"]="Casting materials are required for the release of some skills. For details about the required materials, please refer to the skill descriptions.",
    ["SkillDesTitle"]="Skill Stat Points Allocation Description",
    ["SkillDesc_1000101"]="Deal <color=#338dc3>200%%</color> physical damage to an enemy.",
    ["SkillDesc_1000102"]="Heal yourself for <color=#338dc3>300</color> HP.",
    ["SkillDesc_1000103"]="Lie on the floor and feign death. Clears all Threats from monsters and restores self Max HP by <color=#44afee>10%%</color> and self Max SP by <color=#44afee>10%%</color> every <color=#44afee>5</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_1000105"]="Using the Pet Taming skill causes the pet to enter the Taming state, and the Pet Slot Machine will pop out. The pet's quality and remaining HP will determine the chance of success and obtaining a pet with high stats. The less remaining HP the pet that is being tamed has, the higher the chance of success and the pet having high stats.",
    ["SkillDesc_1000106"]="Pets with the Merchant affix can run a shop. Classes other than Merchant can only run a shop in the Commercial District of Prontera. Merchants can request pets to run a shop on the World Map.",
    ["SkillDesc_10030112"]="During the event, use it in MVP/Mini to deal damage that is 0.5% of HP",
    ["SkillDesc_1010001"]="Deals weapon attribute P.DMG equal to (<color=#44afee>%s%%</color> P.ATK + <color=#44afee>%s</color>) to a single enemy target.",
    ["SkillDesc_1010018"]="Can only be used when equipped with a Cart. After casting, attacks a single enemy target with the Cart, dealing neutral attribute P.DMG equal to (<color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of P.ATK + <color=#44afee>%s</color>).",
    ["SkillDesc_101030211"]="Enter Hiding mode and become undetectable by enemies for <color=#44afee>10</color> seconds. While Hiding, Movement Speed is <color=#44afee>100%%</color> of its usual amount. Taking any damage or attacking will cancel Hiding.",
    ["SkillDesc_101030212"]="Deal (<color=#44afee>300%%</color> of ATK + <color=#44afee>900</color>) physical damage of your weapon's attribute to an enemy. If used while Hiding, deal an additional <color=#44afee>200%%</color> physical damage and stun the target for <color=#44afee>2</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_10106004"]="Remove all nearby party members' <color=#44afee>Poison</color> status and/or your own <color=#44afee>Poison</color> status. Cooldown duration is <color=#44afee>30</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_10106005"]="Enter Hiding mode and become undetectable by enemies for <color=#44afee>30</color> seconds. While Hiding, Movement Speed is <color=#44afee>80%%</color> of its usual amount. Taking any damage or attacking will cancel Hiding.",
    ["SkillDesc_10106006"]="Roll <color=#44afee>7</color> meters backwards and dodge an enemy unit's attack, increasing Dodge by <color=#44afee>20</color> and entering Stealth for <color=#44afee>5</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_10106008"]="Attack with Venom Knife, dealing (<color=#44afee>390%%</color> of ATK + <color=#44afee>1,560</color>) Neutral physical damage and poisoning the enemy target for 7 seconds. When poisoned, the target will take Poison physical damage equal to <color=#44afee>20%%</color> of the caster's ATK every second, their DEF will be decreased by <color=#44afee>25%%</color>, and they will not naturally recover HP and SP for the duration of the effect. The damage effect can stack up to <color=#44afee>5</color> times. When the target's HP is less than <color=#44afee>25%%</color>, they will stop taking damage, but the other debuffs will still be in effect.",
    ["SkillDesc_10106009"]="Enjoy a <color=#44afee>20%%</color> discount when purchasing items from NPC shops and a <color=#44afee>5%%</color> discount when purchasing items from the Chamber of Commerce using Zeny.",
    ["SkillDesc_10106011"]="Deal (<color=#44afee>78%%</color> of ATK + <color=#44afee>156</color>) Fire physical damage to enemies within <color=#44afee>3</color> meters of you. After casting this skill, your weapon will gain <color=#44afee>Fire attribute</color>, and normal attacks will deal <color=#44afee>20%%</color> more damage for <color=#44afee>5</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_10106012"]="Deals <color=#44afee>60%%</color> more damage to a single enemy for <color=#44afee>3</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_10106018"]="Summon a fireball, dealing (<color=#44afee>99%%</color> of M.ATK + <color=#44afee>396</color>) Fire magic damage to enemy units within <color=#44afee>3</color> meters of you and reveals nearby enemy units who are Hiding for <color=#44afee>10</color> seconds. While having the Sight effect, you can use it to knock back enemy units <color=#44afee>4</color> meters, dealing (<color=#44afee>%198%%</color> of M.ATK + <color=#44afee>792</color>) Fire magic damage and stunning them for <color=#44afee>2</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_10106028"]="Heal a friendly target and yourself for (<color=#44afee>220</color> × (Character's level + INT)/10) + <color=#44afee>440</color>) HP. If the target is an Undead or Demon monster, deals Holy magic damage equal to the amount the friendly unit is healed for to it.",
    ["SkillDesc_1012004"]="Use the strength of the holy cross to attack the enemy, dealing holy attribute P.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of P.ATK to a single enemy target.",
    ["SkillDesc_1012005"]="Summon a cross-shaped holy field centered around you, subjecting enemy units within <color=#44afee>4</color> meters to judgment, and dealing holy attribute P.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of P.ATK every 0.5 seconds to the area for <color=#44afee>3</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_1013003"]="Strike the target, dealing weapon attribute P.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of P.ATK. Have a <color=#44afee>50%%</color> chance to snatch <color=#44afee>(%s + Max ((your DEX − target DEX) / 100,0))</color> points from their highest stat, which can be added to yourself for <color=#44afee>8</color> seconds. While the target's stats are being snatched, they cannot be snatched again. You can snatch no more than one target at a time.",
    ["SkillDesc_1013004"]="Deals weapon attribute P.DMG equal to (<color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of P.ATK + DEX x <color=#44afee>%s</color>) to a single enemy target. When <color=#44afee>behind</color> the target, increases the damage dealt by <color=#44afee>100%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_1014001"]="After using Magnum Break, its buff lasts <color=#44afee>%s</color> second(s) longer.\nAfter using Aspersio, your normal attack deals <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> more damage.\nHoly Cross and Grand Cross now deal weapon attribute instead of Holy damage.\nThe P.ATK bonus from Call Spirits and Zen no longer scales solely with AGI but instead with your highest primary stat (excluding VIT).",
    ["SkillDesc_1014002"]="Imbues the dagger with shadow power and rapidly stabs enemies in front of you, dealing weapon attribute P.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of P.ATK to all enemies within along a <color=#44afee>6x3</color> path (up to <color=#44afee>8</color> targets). For <color=#44afee>each</color> target less than 8, the damage coefficient increases by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>. Every <color=#44afee>%s</color> point(s) of STR, AGI, DEX, or LUK (whichever is higher) increases your damage coefficient by <color=#44afee>1%%</color> (up to <color=#44afee>400%%</color> of your P.ATK). When attacking from behind, the damage is increased by <color=#44afee>100%%</color>. When your Final Crit is higher than Final P.PEN, this skill may trigger critical damage.",
    ["SkillDesc_1014003"]="Raises the shield and charges forward in a straight line, putting enemies under a suppression effect and knocking them back along the path toward the endpoint. Slams the ground at the end of the charge, dealing weapon attribute P.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of P.ATK to all enemies within a <color=#44afee>4</color>-meter radius. Can be cast up to <color=#44afee>3</color> times in a row. When your Final Crit is higher than Final P.PEN, this skill may trigger critical damage.",
    ["SkillDesc_1014004"]="Slices and dices a single enemy target at lightning speed, dealing weapon attribute P.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of P.ATK. Every <color=#44afee>%s</color> point(s) of STR, AGI, DEX, LUK (whichever is higher) increases your damage coefficient by <color=#44afee>1%%</color> (up to <color=#44afee>400%%</color> of your P.ATK). Has a <color=#44afee>20%%</color> chance to stun them for <color=#44afee>3</color> seconds. Each normal attack reduces Mega Sonic Blow's cooldown by <color=#44afee>1</color> second. When your Final Crit is higher than Final P.PEN, this skill may trigger critical damage.",
    ["SkillDesc_1014005"]="Rapidly spins the weapon to strike a single enemy target, dealing weapon attribute P.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of P.ATK. Every <color=#44afee>%s</color> point(s) of STR, AGI, DEX, LUK (whichever is higher) increases your damage coefficient by <color=#44afee>1%%</color> (up to <color=#44afee>1,200%%</color> of your P.ATK). Deals extra damage based on the enemy's size <color=#44afee>(Large: +30%%, Medium: +20%%, Small: +10%%)</color>. When your Final Crit is higher than Final P.PEN, this skill may trigger critical damage.",
    ["SkillDesc_1014006"]="When your highest primary stat is DEX and exceeds <color=#44afee>3,000</color>, each <color=#44afee>additional</color> point of DEX increases your P.ATK by <color=#44afee>%s</color>. When your highest primary stat is AGI and exceeds <color=#44afee>3,000</color>, each <color=#44afee>additional</color> point of AGI increases your P.ATK by <color=#44afee>%s</color>. When your highest primary stat is LUK and exceeds <color=#44afee>3,000</color>, each <color=#44afee>additional</color> point of LUK increases your P.ATK by <color=#44afee>%s</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_1014007"]="When casting Soul Strike, its damage coefficient increases by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> for <color=#44afee>each</color> Spirit Sphere exists.\nCall Spirits and Zen increase M.ATK based on INT.\nWhen casting Critical Explosion, each Spirit Sphere consumed increases M.ATK by an additional <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_1014008"]="Calls down meteors at the target location. Every <color=#44afee>1</color> second, a meteor drops at the target's current location, dealing <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> Fire attribute M.DMG to all enemies in a <color=#44afee>4</color>-meter radius for <color=#44afee>5</color> seconds. Inflicts enemies with <color=#44afee>Scorch</color> for <color=#44afee>6</color> seconds, which reduces their Fire Resistance by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_1014009"]="Fires a powerful lightning bolt, dealing 6 rounds of Wind attribute M.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of M.ATK in total to the target and enemies within a <color=#44afee>6</color>-meter radius of the target. Hit enemies are inflicted with <color=#44afee>Electrolysis</color> for <color=#44afee>6</color> seconds, which reduces their Wind Resistance by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_1014010"]="Summons an ice orb that follows the target, dealing <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> Water attribute M.DMG to the target and the area within a <color=#44afee>6</color>-meter radius to the target every <color=#44afee>1</color> second for <color=#44afee>5</color> seconds. Hit enemies are inflicted with <color=#44afee>Cold</color> for <color=#44afee>6</color> seconds, which reduces their Freeze Resistance by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_1014011"]="Erupts the ground ahead, dealing <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> Earth attribute M.DMG to enemies in a <color=#44afee>12x4</color> meter straight-line area. Hit enemies are inflicted with <color=#44afee>Rockfall</color> for <color=#44afee>6</color>, which reduces their Petrify Resistance by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_1014012"]="Generates a strong gravitational field, dealing <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> Neutral attribute Adaptive DMG to enemies within a <color=#44afee>6</color>-meter radius <color=#44afee>once</color> every <color=#44afee>0.5</color> seconds for <color=#44afee>5</color> seconds. Hit enemies are inflicted with <color=#44afee>Gravity Overload</color>, which reduces their MSPD, Final ASPD, and Final Haste by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>, <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>, and <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>, respectively.",
    ["SkillDesc_1014013"]="Attacks the target <color=#44afee>7</color> times using Ghost Power, each dealing <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> Ghost attribute M.DMG. There's a <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> chance to inflict <color=#44afee>Curse</color> for <color=#44afee>4</color> seconds. If you have Spirit Spheres, there's a <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> chance to consume <color=#44afee>1</color> of them to reset the cooldown of this skill. While under the effects of Critical Explosion, the reset chance is increased by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_1014014"]="When your highest primary stat is STR, AGI, INT, or LUK, every <color=#44afee>%s</color> point(s) of that stat increases Beast Bane's damage against Brute, Insect, and Fish monsters by an additional <color=#44afee>1%%</color>, up to <color=#44afee>50%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_1100121"]="Deal (<color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of ATK + <color=#44afee>%s</color>) physical damage of your weapon's attribute to an enemy. After learning <color=#44afee>Fatal Blow</color>, this skill has a chance of stunning the target. The chance to stun increases as <color=#44afee>Fatal Blow</color>'s skill level increases.",
    ["SkillDesc_1100122"]="Deals (<color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of ATK + <color=#44afee>%s</color>) Fire physical damage to enemies within <color=#44afee>3</color> meters. After casting this skill, your weapon will gain the <color=#44afee>Fire attribute</color>, and normal attacks will deal <color=#44afee>20%%</color> more damage for <color=#44afee>%s</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_1100123"]="Gain the Endure effect, preventing you from being interrupted or knocked back when being attacked. Also increases DEF and M.DEF by <color=#44afee>%s</color>. The Endure effect will be removed after <color=#44afee>10</color> seconds or being attacked <color=#44afee>%s</color> times.",
    ["SkillDesc_1100124"]="Provoke an enemy unit within <color=#44afee>4</color> meters, decreasing their DEF by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>, increasing their ATK by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>, and forcing them to attack you for <color=#44afee>10</color> seconds. This skill does not affect players.",
    ["SkillDesc_1100125"]="ATK increases by <color=#44afee>%s</color> when equipped with a One-Handed Sword.",
    ["SkillDesc_1100126"]="Increases the effectiveness of HP recovery items by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>. When your HP falls below <color=#44afee>30%%</color> of Max HP, heal yourself for <color=#44afee>4%%</color> of Max HP every <color=#44afee>1</color> second for <color=#44afee>%s</color> second(s). This effect can only trigger once every <color=#44afee>60</color> seconds. After activating Self-Ignite in PVP, the skill's recovery effect will not be triggered.",
    ["SkillDesc_1100127"]="Whenever your normal attacks hit, your Physical Damage Bonus is increased by <color=#44afee>20</color>, increasing by <color=#44afee>%s</color> more for every <color=#44afee>50</color> STR. Can stack up to <color=#44afee>8</color> times. Lasts for <color=#44afee>5</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_1100128"]="When casting Bash, there's a <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> chance to apply <color=#44afee>Armor Break</color> to the enemy for <color=#44afee>5</color> seconds, <color=#44afee>stunning</color> the target for 2 seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_1100129"]="P.ATK is increased by (<color=#44afee>%s</color> + <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of STR) when equipped with a One-Handed Sword/Two-Handed Sword.",
    ["SkillDesc_1110121"]="Enters the Counter state and gains a shield that absorbs damage up to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of Max HP for <color=#44afee>4.5</color> seconds. When the shield ends (it will end earlier if it reaches the damage limit), deals Neutral P.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of Max HP to all enemy units within <color=#44afee>3</color> meters, and increases the target's Threat by a large amount.",
    ["SkillDesc_1110122"]="Gain the Auto Counter effect for <color=#44afee>3</color> seconds. While Auto Counter is in effect, you will be immune to <color=#44afee>melee physical</color> damage. After this state ends, deal (<color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of ATK + <color=#44afee>40%%</color> × Number of times hit (Maximum of 10 times) + <color=#44afee>%s</color>) physical damage to enemies within a 120° fan-shaped area in the direction you are facing.",
    ["SkillDesc_1110123"]="Pulls up to <color=#44afee>8</color> enemy units within <color=#44afee>4</color> meters toward you, clashing with them to deal (<color=#44afee>%s%%</color> + (Number of Monsters - <color=#44afee>1</color>) × <color=#44afee>50%%</color>) × ATK physical damage of your weapon's attribute. Affected targets are stunned for a short time and then knocked back <color=#44afee>1</color> meter, toward their original location.",
    ["SkillDesc_1110124"]="Can only be used when equipped with a Spear. Continuously attack an enemy for a short time, dealing <color=#44afee>5</color> attacks that inflict a total of (<color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of ATK + <color=#44afee>%s</color>) physical damage of your weapon's attribute. Deals <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> more damage to Large targets.",
    ["SkillDesc_1110125"]="Can only be used when equipped with a Spear. Deals weapon attribute P.DMG equal to (<color=#44afee>%s%%</color> P.ATK + <color=#44afee>%s</color>) to enemy units within a <color=#44afee>4x2</color> rectangular area in the direction you are facing, <color=#44afee>stunning</color> them for <color=#44afee>2</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_1110126"]="Can only be used when equipped with a Spear. Deals (<color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of ATK + <color=#44afee>%s</color>) physical damage of your weapon's attribute to an enemy unit.",
    ["SkillDesc_1110127"]="For the next <color=#44afee>%s</color> seconds, Final ASPD increases <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> (for every <color=#44afee>25</color> AGI, effect increases <color=#44afee>1%%</color>) points.",
    ["SkillDesc_1110128"]="Charges towards a faraway enemy target (cannot be silenced after the charge starts), dealing (<color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of ATK + <color=#44afee>%s</color>) Neutral physical damage to enemies in a straight line and stunning them for <color=#44afee>2</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_1110129"]="P.ATK is increased by (<color=#44afee>%s</color> + <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> x STR) during Cavalry Combat.\nEach release of Normal Attacks or skills grants <color=#44afee>1</color> stack of Courage, which increases MSPD by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> and P.DEF by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>. Stacks up to <color=#44afee>3</color> times and lasts <color=#44afee>6</color> seconds. Up to <color=#44afee>1</color> stack of Courage can be obtained per second.",
    ["SkillDesc_1110130"]="Can only be used when mounted in Cavalry Combat. Deals neutral attribute P.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of P.ATK to a single enemy target. (Every <color=#44afee>60</color> STR increases the P.ATK coefficient by an additional <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>, up to <color=#44afee>2,000%%</color>.) Also reduces the target's ASPD by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> and MSPD by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> for <color=#44afee>4</color> seconds. Using a spear inflicts an additional <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> damage.",
    ["SkillDesc_1110131"]="P.ATK is increased by (<color=#44afee>%s</color> + <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of STR) when equipped with a Spear.",
    ["SkillDesc_1110132"]="Can mount Pecopeco while fighting, but Final ASPD decreases by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> due to the restrictions of mounted combat. At max level of this skill, Final ASPD will return to normal.",
    ["SkillDesc_1110134"]="Within <color=#44afee>12</color> seconds of using this skill, damage received decreases by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> (increases by an additional <color=#44afee>1%%</color> for every <color=#44afee>50</color> VIT you have) and prevents you from being interrupted when being attacked. This effect will be removed after being attacked <color=#44afee>%s</color> times.",
    ["SkillDesc_1110135"]="When equipped with a Sword, each normal attack has a <color=#44afee>20%%</color> chance (every <color=#44afee>50</color> STR increases an additional <color=#44afee>1%%</color>, up to <color=#44afee>30%%</color>) of dealing bonus weapon attribute P.DMG equal to (<color=#44afee>%s%%</color> P.ATK + <color=#44afee>%s</color>) that ignores defense. If the normal attack is critical, the bonus damage will also be critical.",
    ["SkillDesc_1111121"]="Increases P.ATK by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> and Crit DMG by <color=#44afee>50%%</color> for <color=#44afee>40</color> seconds. Normal attacks now have a <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> chance to cause the target to Bleed for <color=#44afee>5</color> seconds. When Bleeding, the target will take Neutral attribute P.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>20%%</color> of the caster's P.ATK every second, reducing their P.ATK by <color=#44afee>25%%</color> and their ASPD by <color=#44afee>25%%</color>. They are not able to naturally recover HP and SP for the duration of the effect.",
    ["SkillDesc_1111122"]="Can only be used when equipped with a Spear. Twirls the spear and rapidly thrusts at an enemy target, dealing weapon attribute P.DMG equal to (<color=#44afee>%s</color> x STR + <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of P.ATK). Every <color=#44afee>80</color> STR increases the P.ATK coefficient by an additional <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>, up to <color=#44afee>2,000%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_1111123"]="Damage an enemy's joints, reducing their combat capabilities. Deals (<color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of ATK + <color=#44afee>%s</color>) physical damage of your weapon's attribute to an enemy unit and has a <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> chance to cause them to gain a random debuff for <color=#44afee>5</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_1111124"]="Infuses your weapon with power, increasing Final Crit Rate by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> (increases by an additional <color=#44afee>1%%</color> for every 50 AGI you have) and Crit Damage Bonus by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> (increases by an additional <color=#44afee>1%%</color> for every 50 STR you have) for <color=#44afee>10</color> seconds. Each critical hit refreshes the remaining buff time.",
    ["SkillDesc_1111125"]="Gain the Berserk effect on use. Fully restores HP and empties SP, increases Max HP by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>, ATK by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>, and Movement Speed by <color=#44afee>30%%</color>. Grants the Endure effect, and decreases DEF and M.DEF by <color=#44afee>50%%</color>. While Berserk is in effect, you cannot actively use skills or healing items, healing effects are decreased by <color=#44afee>100%%</color>, and HP and SP will not recover naturally. This effect is removed after <color=#44afee>30</color> seconds or when HP falls below <color=#44afee>5%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_1111126"]="Marks the target on use. All friendly targets within 30 meters gain the Endure effect and deal <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> more damage to the marked target for <color=#44afee>10</color> seconds. A party member will lose the Endure effect if they are more than 30 meters away from the caster.",
    ["SkillDesc_1111127"]="Enters Blocking status upon use. Has a <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> chance to weapon block enemy attacks when taking P.DMG from front enemies, up to <color=#44afee>15</color> times within <color=#44afee>6</color> seconds. Successful blocks negate the physical damage taken this time, and deal weapon attribute P.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> P.ATK to the target (can trigger crit). When equipped with Two-Handed Sword, increases the damage coefficient by <color=#44afee>100%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_1111131"]="Gain the Self-Ignite effect on use to inflict heavy damage upon enemies at the cost of your own HP. You will lose <color=#44afee>1%%</color> of your Max HP every second while also dealing (<color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of Max HP + <color=#44afee>%s</color>) Neutral <color=#44afee>sacred physical</color> damage that ignores DEF to nearby enemies. This effect will be removed when your HP falls below <color=#44afee>10%%</color>. You will be unable to naturally recover HP and SP while having the Self-Ignite effect. You will be unable to naturally recover HP and SP while under the effect of Self-Ignite, and will be unable to trigger Increase HP Recovery's HP regen effect in PVP. This skills damage does not work with Lifesteal.",
    ["SkillDesc_1111132"]="Converts VIT to ATK, increasing ATK by <color=#44afee>2</color> for every <color=#44afee>%s</color> VIT (not including VIT gained through buffs) you have.",
    ["SkillDesc_1111133"]="After using this skill, ATK of all party members within 30 meters increases by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> for <color=#44afee>120</color> seconds. A party member will lose this effect if they are more than 30 meters from the caster.",
    ["SkillDesc_1112001"]="Increases damage dealt by Dragon's Breath by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> after mounting your dragon, and damage dealt to small and medium Monsters by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> when mounted with a spear.",
    ["SkillDesc_1112002"]="The dragon breathes scorching fire, dealing Fire attribute P.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of P.ATK to enemies in a 6-meter, 120-degree fan-shaped area at the front. Hit enemies have a <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>chance of being burned, losing <color=#44afee>2%%</color> Max HP per second for <color=#44afee>3</color> seconds. The burn effect is ineffective against MVP, MINI, and Boss.",
    ["SkillDesc_1112003"]="The dragon breathes chilling air, dealing Water attribute P.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of P.ATK to enemies in a 6-meter, 120-degree fan-shaped area at the front. Hit enemies have a <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> chance of being frozen for <color=#44afee>3</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_1112004"]="Your dragon projects a massive roar, dealing Regular Physical Damage equal to<color=#44afee>%s%%</color> Physical Attack to enemy targets within a 4-meter range, with a <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> chance of inflicting Terror. Targets suffering from Terror will move at random for <color=#44afee>3</color> sec. Terror cannot effect Boss, MVP, or MINI targets.",
    ["SkillDesc_1112005"]="Inflicts Death Bound on an enemy. When attacked, <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of lost HP will be converted into Regular Physical Damage and dealt to the bound enemy, along with multiple stacks of Threat for <color=#44afee>4</color> sec (cannot be dispelled). Death Bound will be lifted when the distance between you and the target is greater than 12 meters.",
    ["SkillDesc_1112006"]="Charges forward 8 meters in the desired direction and delivers a powerful blow, dealing weapon attribute P.DMG equal to (<color=#44afee>%s%%</color> P.ATK + <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> Max HP) in a 4-meter radius.",
    ["SkillDesc_1112007"]="Summons the power of the Runes and enchants a shield, increasing the effect of [Unbreakable] when attacked. Each stack of [Unbreakable] increases Final Physical Defense and Final Magic Defense by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> for <color=#44afee>6</color> sec. Can be stacked up to <color=#44afee>5</color> times, after which a Rune Shield equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of Max HP for <color=#44afee>6</color> sec. This effect may be triggered once every <color=#44afee>24</color> sec as long as a shield is equipped.",
    ["SkillDesc_1112008"]="Hurls a Spectral Spear in the desired direction, dragging the first enemy it touches back to you and dealing Weapon attribute P.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of P.ATK. Can only be used when equipped with a Spear. The enemy will be immobilized, and their damage taken will be increased by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> for <color=#44afee>3</color> seconds when they are dragged back to you.",
    ["SkillDesc_1112009"]="Wields a lance, inflicting 10 quick jabs at a 150-degree fan-shaped area in 3 seconds and dealing weapon attribute P.DMG equal to (<color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of P.ATK + <color=#44afee>%s</color> x STR) to all targets in range. Each time the target takes damage, the damage of the next Hundred Spears will be increased by <color=#44afee>6%%</color>. Grants the Endure effect during the effective period. Each jab deals increased damage based on the number of enemies in range, and the increased amount equals the number of targets x <color=#44afee>10%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_1112010"]="Grants 1 stack of Wind Cutter effect every time a normal attack triggers a crit, increasing Crit DMG Bonus by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> for <color=#44afee>3</color> sec. Stacks up to <color=#44afee>6</color> times. Upon reaching max stacks, deals an additional weapon attribute P.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> P.ATK to the target each time a crit is triggered. Additional damage can crit as well.",
    ["SkillDesc_1112011"]="Enchants a weapon and modifies its attributes. After enhancement, normal attacks and damage will reflect the weapon’s skill, with an increased <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> in corresponding elemental damage. This effect will not be triggered if a weapon’s attributes are reset.",
    ["SkillDesc_1112012"]="Activate the power within your sword, creating a Dark Flame Sword array that follows you and grants you the Dark Flame Sword state for <color=#44afee>24</color> seconds. While Dark Flame Sword is active, each normal attack that hits a target grants the party members within <color=#44afee>30</color> meters a stack of the <color=#44afee>Dark Flame</color> effect. Each stack of <color=#44afee>Dark Flame</color> increases the Final Hit by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> and the Final Crit by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>. Stacks up to <color=#44afee>12</color> times and lasts for <color=#44afee>4</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_1112013"]="Unleash a downward attack with a weapon, causing the ground to erupt in a violent explosion, inflicting fire attribute P.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of the P.ATK to enemies within a <color=#44afee>4</color>-meter range. (Every <color=#44afee>80</color> STR increases the P.ATK coefficient by an additional <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>, up to <color=#44afee>1,500%%</color>.) Also inflicts a <color=#44afee>25%%</color> Slow effect on the targets within range for <color=#44afee>12</color> seconds, stacking up to <color=#44afee>3</color> times. This skill can trigger crits, and the cooldown for this skill is reduced by <color=#44afee>2</color> seconds every time a crit is triggered by a normal attack.",
    ["SkillDesc_1112901"]="Use to receive the Nosiege Rune Blessing. This blessing grants a <color=#44afee>5%%</color> increase to Final Physical Damage Bonus, Final Magic Damage Bonus, Final PvP Physical Damage Bonus and Final PvP Magic Damage Bonus from each party member while in effect. (Counts as 1 party member when no party members remain).",
    ["SkillDesc_1112902"]="Use to receive the Raido Rune Blessing. This blessing grants a <color=#44afee>5%%</color> increase to Final Physical Damage Reduction, Final Magic Damage Reduction, Final PvP Physical Damage Reduction and Final PvP Magic Damage Reduction from each party member while in effect. (Counts as 1 party member when no party members remain).",
    ["SkillDesc_1112903"]="Use to receive the Berkana Rune Blessing. Grants a shield equal to<color=#44afee>10%%</color> Max HP from each party member with this blessing every 30 sec while the buff is in effect, lasting for 15 sec. (Counts as 1 party member when no party members remain).",
    ["SkillDesc_1112904"]="Use to receive the Isa Rune Blessing. Recovers <color=#44afee>1%%</color> HP team-wide when a party members with this blessing casts an active skill. (Does not apply to normal attacks. Counts as 1 party member when no party members remain).",
    ["SkillDesc_1112905"]="Use to receive the Othila Rune Blessing. Recovers <color=#44afee>0.15%%</color> Max HP team-wide when a party members with this blessing triggers a crit. (Applies to normal attacks and skill crits. Counts as 1 party member when no party members remain).",
    ["SkillDesc_1112906"]="Use to receive the Uruz Rune Blessing. Reduces damage taken by <color=#44afee>3%%</color> from each party member with this blessing. Remaining damage will be shared among the blessed party members. (Counts as 1 party member when no party members remain).",
    ["SkillDesc_1112907"]="Use to receive the Thurisaz Rune Blessing. This blessing increases MSPD by <color=#44afee>0.5%%</color> x number of party members under the same effect. (When not in a party, the default number of party members is 1.)",
    ["SkillDesc_1112908"]="Use to receive the Pertz Runestone Blessing. For each party member carrying this blessing when inflicting debuffs on enemies, ignores <color=#44afee>5%%</color> resistance buffs and ignores <color=#44afee>5</color> Debuff Resistance and PVP Debuff Resistance. (It counts as 1 party member when not being any party.)",
    ["SkillDesc_1112909"]="Use to receive the Hagalaz Rune Blessing. For every <color=#44afee>10%%</color> HP lost, each party member with this blessing grants a <color=#44afee>5%%</color> chance of dealing Stun to enemies within <color=#44afee>2%%</color> meters for <color=#44afee>1%%</color> sec. (Counts as 1 party member when no party members remain).",
    ["SkillDesc_1113001"]="The <color=#44afee>Dark Flame Sword</color> summons <color=#44afee>6</color> energy swords that transform into <color=#44afee>Servant Weapons</color> for the duration of the <color=#44afee>Dark Flame Sword</color> exists. During normal attacks, there is a <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> chance to consume <color=#44afee>1</color> energy sword to deal weapon attribute P.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of P.ATK to the target and deal weapon attribute P.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of P.ATK to all enemies within <color=#44afee>4</color> meters of the target. The energy sword's damage can trigger crits. Every <color=#44afee>5</color> seconds, <color=#44afee>1</color> new energy sword is replenished, and for every <color=#44afee>250%%</color> of Final ASPD, the replenishment time is reduced by <color=#44afee>0.5</color> seconds, with a minimum replenishment time of <color=#44afee>2.5</color> seconds for <color=#44afee>1</color> energy sword.",
    ["SkillDesc_1113002"]="When equipped with a <color=#44afee>Servant Weapon</color>, the range of normal attacks increases by <color=#44afee>2</color> meters. Damage dealt by the <color=#44afee>Servant Weapon</color> marks the primary target (splash damage does not mark additional enemies). While the target is marked, each time they are attacked by a member of the caster's party, there is a <color=#44afee>20%%</color> chance to apply <color=#44afee>1</color> additional mark for <color=#44afee>10</color> seconds. When the mark reach <color=#44afee>%s</color> stacks, <color=#44afee>1</color> <color=#44afee>Ultimate Servant Weapon</color> will drop and the <color=#44afee>Ultimate Servant Weapon</color> lasts for <color=#44afee>10</color> seconds. When a party member picks it up, they instantly replenish <color=#44afee>6</color> energy swords and gain the lv.<color=#44afee>%s</color> <color=#44afee>Servant Weapon</color>'s damage effect for <color=#44afee>10</color> seconds. If the caster picks it up, their energy swords will be fully replenished. No more than <color=#44afee>1</color> Ultimate Servant Weapon can drop per <color=#44afee>%s</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_1113003"]="Teleports instantly to the target's side, dealing weapon attribute P.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of P.ATK to the target and all enemies within <color=#44afee>6</color> meters of the target. This damage can trigger critical hits, and there's a <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> chance to inflict <color=#44afee>Blind</color> to the target for <color=#44afee>3</color> seconds. Casting this skill consumes all energy swords. For each <color=#44afee>1</color> energy sword consumed, it increases the damage coefficient by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>. You need at least <color=#44afee>1</color> energy sword to use this skill.",
    ["SkillDesc_1113004"]="Summons the Demolition Sword that orbits around you, with each energy sword dealing weapon attribute P.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of P.ATK every second to enemies within <color=#44afee>6</color> meters. This damage can trigger critical damage. Casting this skill consumes all energy swords, and each <color=#44afee>1</color> critical hit restores <color=#44afee>1</color> energy sword. The Demolition Sword lasts for <color=#44afee>%s</color> seconds. You need at least <color=#44afee>1</color> energy sword to use this skill.",
    ["SkillDesc_1113005"]="Normal attacks and skills have a chance to grant <color=#44afee>1</color> stack of <color=#44afee>Storm Force</color> (<color=#44afee>12%%</color> chance for normal attacks, <color=#44afee>36%%</color> for skills), lasting <color=#44afee>8</color> seconds. Once you've gathered <color=#44afee>%s</color> stacks of <color=#44afee>Storm Force</color>, your next attack will trigger a Storm Slash, hitting the target <color=#44afee>5</color> times, with each strike dealing weapon attribute P.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of P.ATK. The effect of Storm Slash varies depending on your weapon:\nWith a <color=#44afee>two-handed sword</color>, the damage can trigger critical hits.\nWith an <color=#44afee>one-handed sword and shield</color>, for every <color=#44afee>24</color> VIT, you get an extra <color=#44afee>1%%</color> coefficient, capped at <color=#44afee>520%%</color>.\nWith a <color=#44afee>spear</color>, every <color=#44afee>24</color> STR increases the coefficient by <color=#44afee>1%%</color>, also capped at <color=#44afee>520%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_1113006"]="Summons a dragon from the sky to rain down blazing flames, scorching the ground and dealing Fire attribute P.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of P.ATK to enemies in a straight line.",
    ["SkillDesc_1113007"]="Using <color=#44afee>Pierce</color>, <color=#44afee>Spear Stab</color>, <color=#44afee>Spear Boomerang</color>, <color=#44afee>Spiral Stab</color>, <color=#44afee>Phantom Strike</color>, <color=#44afee>Hundred Spears</color>, or <color=#44afee>Madness Crusher</color> grants you <color=#44afee>1</color> stack of the <color=#44afee>Charge</color> effect. When it reaches <color=#44afee>12</color> stacks, you can activate the <color=#44afee>Pierce</color> effect, dealing extra <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> damage with the skills listed above when using a spear, up to a maximum of <color=#44afee>10</color> times. The <color=#44afee>Charging Pierce</color> effect lasts for <color=#44afee>12</color> seconds, and no further <color=#44afee>Charge</color> stacks can be gained during the effective period of <color=#44afee>Charging Pierce</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_1113008"]="Unleashes a powerful weapon swing, striking all targets within <color=#44afee>4</color> meters and dealing weapon attribute P.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of P.ATK. If you're wielding a spear, you deal bonus damage equal to <color=#44afee>40</color> times your STR. When you attack with a one-handed sword, you deal bonus damage equal to <color=#44afee>1.5%%</color> of your Max HP and draw a lot of Threat.",
    ["SkillDesc_1113009"]="Harnesses the power of madness and hurls your spear at a targeted area, smashing the ground and dealing weapon attribute P.DMG equal to (<color=#44afee>%s%%</color> P.ATK + <color=#44afee>40</color> x STR) to all enemies within a <color=#44afee>6</color>-meter radius. The impact creates a tremor that pulls enemies toward the center of the area and slows them by <color=#44afee>33%%</color>. The <color=#44afee>slow</color> effect lasts for <color=#44afee>5</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_1113010"]="Sacrifices <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of your Max HP to leave behind a <color=#44afee>Vigor</color> at your location. The <color=#44afee>Vigor</color> lasts up to <color=#44afee>12</color> seconds, and it cannot be absorbed by you, but <color=#44afee>1</color> party member can absorb it, gaining the <color=#44afee>Vigor</color> buff. While under the effect of <color=#44afee>Vigor</color>, the party member's skill will be boosted by <color=#44afee>%s</color> times, and their skill attacks will deal bonus damage equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of the Dragon Knight's Max HP, capped at <color=#44afee>400%%</color> of their own ATK. The <color=#44afee>Vigor</color> effect lasts for <color=#44afee>15</color> seconds. If no one absorbs the <color=#44afee>Vigor</color>, when it disappears, the caster will recover <color=#44afee>10%%</color> of their HP.",
    ["SkillDesc_1113011"]="Charges up to enter a defensive stance, gaining <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> Final P.DMG RED and Final M.DMG RED. While charging, your MSPD is reduced by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>. When the charge ends, you deal weapon attribute P.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of your Max HP to all enemies within a <color=#44afee>3</color>-meter radius and taunt them for <color=#44afee>0.5</color> seconds, forcing them to attack you. For every additional <color=#44afee>0.5</color> seconds of charging, the taunt range expands by <color=#44afee>0.5</color> meters, the duration extends by <color=#44afee>0.5</color> seconds, and extra damage equal to <color=#44afee>0.5%%</color> of your Max HP is added.",
    ["SkillDesc_1113012"]="A <color=#44afee>dragon</color> can be mounted during combat. When mounted, using <color=#44afee>Dragon Breath - Fire</color>, <color=#44afee>Dragon Breath - Water</color>, and <color=#44afee>Dragonic Aura</color> increases the skill's damage coefficient by <color=#44afee>1%%</color> for every <color=#44afee>%s</color> STR/VIT possessed, up to <color=#44afee>400%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_1120001"]="You can ride the <color=#44afee>Pecopeco</color> in battle. While mounted in Cavalry Combat, Physical Attack is increased by <color=#44afee>%s</color> + (STR or VIT, whichever is higher) × <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_1120002"]="Recover the HP of a single friendly target unit, or your own by Physical Attack*<color=#44afee>%s%%</color> (not affected by healing stat bonus and resistances). If the target is an undead or demon type, Holy Attribute Physical Damage equal to Physical Attack*<color=#44afee>%s%%</color> is dealt.",
    ["SkillDesc_1120003"]="Permanently increases max HP by <color=#44afee>%s</color>, and increases self-healing effect by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_1120004"]="Physical Attack is increased by (<color=#44afee>%s</color> + Strength × <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>) when using spear type weapons.",
    ["SkillDesc_1120005"]="Use the strength of the holy cross to attack the enemy, dealing Holy Attribute Physical Damage to enemy units equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> P.ATK. Grants a stack of <color=#daa520>Sacred Force</color>, <color=#daa520>each</color> of which increases P.ATK by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> and MSPD by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>. Stacks up to <color=#44afee>3</color> times and lasts <color=#44afee>6</color> seconds. Can be triggered once per second. Must have a Two-Handed Spear equipped to use.",
    ["SkillDesc_1120006"]="Summon a cross-shaped holy shield around you, subjecting enemy units within <color=#44afee>4</color> meters of you to Judex, dealing Holy Attribute Physical Damage equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> P.ATK every 0.5 seconds. When there is <color=#daa520>Sacred Force</color>, consumes one stack of <color=#daa520>Sacred Force</color> to increase the holy shield damage coefficient equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> P.ATK. The holy shield lasts <color=#44afee>3</color> seconds. Must have Two-Handed Spear equipped to use.",
    ["SkillDesc_1120007"]="Use the shield to hit the enemy hard, dealing weapon attribute Physical Damage equal to (Physical Attack*<color=#44afee>%s%%</color> + own <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> Max HP + own Vitality*<color=#44afee>%s</color>), with a <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> chance to stun the target for <color=#44afee>1</color>s. If the target is a monster, this generates a large amount of Threat. Must have Shield equipped to use.",
    ["SkillDesc_1120008"]="Throw the shield at the enemy unit from a distance, dealing weapon attribute P.DMG equal to (<color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of P.ATK + <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of Max HP + <color=#44afee>%s</color> of VIT), ricocheting off the next enemy target within <color=#44afee>6</color> meters. The ricochet damage is equal to the throwing damage and continues ricocheting off the hit target for a maximum of <color=#44afee>2</color> times (each target can only take damage from this skill once). Must have the shield equipped to use.",
    ["SkillDesc_1120009"]="When a shield is equipped, there is a <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> chance to defend automatically when attacked. Damage blocked cannot exceed <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of Max HP. Must have Shield equipped to use.",
    ["SkillDesc_1120010"]="Each time the active skill is used, you enter a <color=#44afee>Quickened weapon</color> state, where attack speed is increased by <color=#44afee>%s</color> and Crit increased by <color=#44afee>%s</color> for <color=#44afee>10</color>s. Can be activated a max of one time every <color=#44afee>30</color>s.",
    ["SkillDesc_1120011"]="Deduct <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> Max HP from yourself to enter the Sacrifice state, where the next <color=#44afee>%s</color> normal attacks each have an additional weapon attribute Physical Damage (can Crit) that is equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> Max HP. The Sacrifice state lasts <color=#44afee>6</color>s, and in this state, normal attacks cannot be dodged. Each normal attack in the Sacrifice state is recorded, and at the end of the Sacrifice state, you recover HP equal to (<color=#44afee>0.8%%</color> Max HP*Number of Crits). (The recovery effect is not affected by healing bonuses and reductions.) Must have Two-Handed Sword equipped to use.",
    ["SkillDesc_1120012"]="Swing the sword, dealing weapon attribute Physical Damage (can Crit) to enemies within <color=#44afee>4</color> meters that is equal to (Physical Attack*<color=#44afee>%s%%</color> + own <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> Max HP), and recovers HP equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of total damage dealt. (The recovery effect is not affected by healing bonuses and reductions.) Must have Two-Handed Sword equipped to use.",
    ["SkillDesc_1121001"]="Hit the target hard, dealing Holy Attribute Physical Damage to the target and targets within <color=#44afee>3</color> meters that is equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>. If the target is an undead or demon monster type, damage is increased by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_1121002"]="Transforms your armor and that of <color=#44afee>%s</color> team member(s) to the Holy Attribute, and increases Anti-Crit by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> and Crit DMG reduction by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>. Lasts <color=#44afee>%s</color>s.",
    ["SkillDesc_1121003"]="Each time a skill is used, you have a <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> chance to obtain the <color=#44afee>Holy Sound</color> state, which increases the damage you deal by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> for <color=#44afee>3</color>s. Can be activated a max of one time every <color=#44afee>3</color>s.",
    ["SkillDesc_1121004"]="Aim at the target's vitals, increasing the Final Physical Penetration by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> when using Spear type weapons (every <color=#44afee>50</color> STR increases Final Physical Penetration by an extra <color=#44afee>1%%</color>), dealing an additional <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> damage to small and medium-sized monsters.",
    ["SkillDesc_1121005"]="Launch a sweeping attack on enemies within <color=#44afee>4</color> meters, dealing weapon attribute Physical Damage that is equal to (<color=#44afee>%s%%</color> + (Number of targets -1) x<color=#44afee>%s%%</color>) P.ATK, and stunning them for <color=#44afee>2</color> seconds. This generates the Moon Formation within a range of <color=#44afee>4</color> meters of yourself, and the enemy units in the Formation deal <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> reduced damage to you. The Moon Formation lasts <color=#44afee>6</color>s. Consumes <color=#daa520>all</color> stacks of <color=#daa520>Sacred Force</color> if there are any. Depending on the <color=#daa520>Sacred Force</color> stacks consumed, increases <color=#7ACEFF><color=#44afee>2|6|10</color></color> times for Kyrie Eleison to block off damage every <color=#44afee>4</color> seconds over the next <color=#44afee>12</color> seconds, up to <color=#7ACEFF><color=#44afee>6%%|18%%|30%%</color></color> of Max HP. Loses its effect when either limit is exceeded. Must have Two-Handed Spear equipped to use.",
    ["SkillDesc_1121006"]="Deals Holy Attribute Physical Damage to the specified target that is equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> P.ATK, and inflicting the <color=#44afee>Pressure</color> mark. While active, every time you are attacked by your Holy Attribute, an additional <color=#44afee>Pressure</color> mark is added to the stack, with each <color=#44afee>Pressure</color> stack increasing the damage the target takes from team members by <color=#44afee>1%%</color> for a max of <color=#44afee>%s</color> stacks. Lasts <color=#44afee>6</color>s. Consumes <color=#daa520>all</color> stacks of <color=#daa520>Sacred Force</color> if there are any. When Pressure ends, depending on the stacks of <color=#daa520>Sacred Force</color> consumed, deals Holy Attribute Physical Damage to the target that is equal to P.ATK x (<color=#44afee>313%%|713%%|1213%%</color> x stacks).",
    ["SkillDesc_1121007"]="Every time you are hit by a melee Physical Attack that deals damage, the attacker is dealt weapon Physical Damage equal to own Max HP <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>, and damage from <color=#44afee>automatic defense</color> will also reflect damage. Must have Shield equipped to use.",
    ["SkillDesc_1121008"]="Summon a light shield to protect yourself, and for <color=#44afee>5</color>s, the damage you take is reduced by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>. For <color=#44afee>5</color>s, it also reduces the attacker's Movement Speed by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>, and damage from <color=#44afee>automatic defense</color> also slows the attacker. Must have Shield equipped to use.",
    ["SkillDesc_1121009"]="Slams the shield to the ground, dealing weapon attribute P.DMG to all enemies within a range of <color=#44afee>4</color> meters that is equal to (<color=#44afee>%s%%</color> P.ATK + <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> Max HP) and increasing the target's damage taken by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> for <color=#44afee>3</color> seconds. If there is only one target within range, an additional weapon attribute P.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of Max HP is dealt. If the target is a monster, a large amount of Threat is added. Must have Shield equipped to use.",
    ["SkillDesc_1121010"]="Gain 1 stack of <color=#44afee>Battle Intent</color> for every normal Crit for <color=#44afee>3</color>s, stacking up to <color=#44afee>50</color> times. Each stack of <color=#44afee>Battle Intent</color> increases Final Crit by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> and Crit Damage Bonus by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>. Whenever you take a hit that exceeds <color=#44afee>35%%</color> of your Max HP, (<color=#44afee>%s%%</color>*remaining <color=#44afee>Battle Intent</color> stacks) damage will be reduced (up to <color=#44afee>20</color> stacks). (Can reduce True Damage, and lowers Battle Intent after triggering, for a max of <color=#44afee>20</color> stacks.) Must have Two-Handed Sword equipped to use.",
    ["SkillDesc_1121011"]="Gather energy, and use up 10 stacks of <color=#44afee>Battle Intent</color> to deal a heavy slash to the target, dealing weapon attribute Physical Damage (can Crit) that is equal to Physical Attack*(<color=#44afee>%s%%</color> + remaining Battle Intent stack * <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> * Max HP), recovering HP equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> Max HP * remaining Battle Intent stacks. (The recovery effect is not affected by healing bonuses and reductions.) Must have Two-Handed Sword equipped to use.",
    ["SkillDesc_1121012"]="At the cost of <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of your Max HP, you deal weapon attribute Physical Damage (can Crit) equal to (Physical Attack*<color=#44afee>%s%%</color> + <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>*own Max HP), and if this damage triggers a Crit, <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of Max Hp is recovered, and <color=#44afee>1</color>s of cooldown reduced. (The recovery effect is not affected by healing bonuses and reductions.) Must have Two-Handed Sword equipped to use.",
    ["SkillDesc_1122001"]="You can ride the <color=#44afee>Gryphon</color> in battle. While mounted, your <color=#44afee>slow</color> and <color=#44afee>stun</color> resistance is increased by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_1122002"]="The Gryphon rushes to the specified area, trampling all enemies within <color=#44afee>4</color> meters when it reaches its destination, dealing weapon attribute physical Damage equal to Physical Attack*<color=#44afee>%s%%</color>, and stunning them for <color=#44afee>5</color>s. You must be riding a <color=#44afee>Gryphon</color> to use this skill.",
    ["SkillDesc_1122003"]="Applies a shield to all friendly units in your team that is <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of your Max HP, lasting for a max of <color=#44afee>2</color>s. When the shield disappears, it deals weapon physical Damage to all enemy units within <color=#44afee>3</color> meters that is equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of the initial value of the shield.",
    ["SkillDesc_1122004"]="Charge the target <color=#44afee>4</color> times to make a crossed spear formation, with each charge dealing weapon attribute physical Damage equal to Physical Attack*<color=#44afee>%s%%</color>, inflicting a stack of Bleed. Each Bleed stack causes the target to lose HP equal to Physical Attack*<color=#44afee>%s%%</color> per second for <color=#44afee>3</color> seconds. Consumes <color=#daa520>all</color> stacks of <color=#daa520>Sacred Force</color> if there are any. Depending on the <color=#daa520>Sacred Force</color> stacks consumed, increases the damage coefficient of each charge equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%|%s%%|%s%%</color> of the P.ATK. For every <color=#44afee>2%%</color> of the target's life reduced, the charge damage coefficient increases by <color=#44afee>1%%</color>. Must have Two-Handed Spear equipped at time of use.",
    ["SkillDesc_1122005"]="The wrath of the messenger of gods descends from the sky, dealing Holy Attribute Physical Damage to all enemies within <color=#44afee>4</color> meters of the specified location equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> P.ATK. The damage is doubled when there is only one target in range. Consumes <color=#daa520>all</color> stacks of <color=#daa520>Sacred Force</color> if there are any, and inflicts the following bonus effects on targets within the range based on the <color=#daa520>Sacred Force</color> stacks consumed (effects can be stacked):\n<color=#44afee>1</color> stack or above: Targets take <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> more Holy damage from you for <color=#44afee>12</color> seconds. When there is only one target within the range, this effect increases an extra <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.\n<color=#44afee>2</color> stacks or above: Removes all buffs from targets. When there is only one target within the range, this effect also removes all buffs from the target once every <color=#44afee>2</color> seconds for <color=#44afee>8</color> seconds. Non-effective against <color=#44afee>MVP</color>, <color=#44afee>MINI</color>, and <color=#44afee>Boss</color>.\n<color=#44afee>3</color> stacks or above: Immobilizes targets for <color=#44afee>3</color> seconds. When there is only one target within the range, this effect lasts <color=#44afee>6</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_1122006"]="Increases your Holy attribute damage dealt to Earth, Fire, Water, and Wind attribute enemies by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_1122007"]="Increases <color=#44afee>Shield Charge</color>, <color=#44afee>Shield Boomerang</color>, and <color=#44afee>Earth Drive</color> damage by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>. When the shield is equipped, you gain an additional <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> Physical Defense and Magic Defense.",
    ["SkillDesc_1122008"]="Demonstrates death-defying courage and enters the <color=#44afee>Devotion</color> state, increasing Max HP by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>. However, your P.ATK will be reduced by <color=#44afee>50%%</color> during the period. Meanwhile, you will take <color=#44afee>50%%</color> of the damage your Party members receive for <color=#44afee>8</color> seconds, with a maximum equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of your Max HP.",
    ["SkillDesc_1122009"]="Raise the shield and charge straight ahead, inflicting <color=#44afee>Overpower</color> on enemies along your path and knocking them back <color=#44afee>8</color> meters. At the end of the charge, hit the ground and deal weapon attribute Physical Damage to all enemies within <color=#44afee>4</color> meters equal to (Physical Attack*<color=#44afee>%s%%</color> + own <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> Max HP). If the target has the <color=#44afee>Overpower</color> status, you deal an additional weapon attribute Physical Damage equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> Max HP of damage taken, and reduce <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> attack speed and Movement Speed for <color=#44afee>4</color>s. Must have Shield equipped to use.",
    ["SkillDesc_1122010"]="When you take damage within <color=#44afee>3</color>s that exceeds <color=#44afee>30%%</color> of your Max HP in damage, you enter a <color=#44afee>Oath Blade</color> state, and get a shield that is <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of your Max HP. Based on the amount of HP lost, your Physical Lifesteal is increased (every <color=#44afee>2%%</color> of Max HP increases Physical Lifesteal by <color=#44afee>1%%</color> and Final Attack Speed by <color=#44afee>1%%</color>). <color=#44afee>Oath Blade</color> lasts <color=#44afee>%s</color>s, and can be activated once every <color=#44afee>30</color>s.",
    ["SkillDesc_1122011"]="Deduct <color=#44afee>10%%</color> of your Max HP, and designate an enemy to form a <color=#44afee>Life Vow</color> with (exclusive effect). When you use <color=#44afee>Sacrifice</color>, <color=#44afee>Fearless Charge</color>, or <color=#44afee>Life Vow</color> for your own HP deduction, the target you have established a contract with also takes weapon Physical Damage that is equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of the deducted amount. The total deduction amount cannot exceed <color=#44afee>30%%</color> of the caster's Max HP, and <color=#44afee>Life Vow</color> lasts for up to <color=#44afee>12</color>s. Every normal attack Crit reduces the cooldown of this skill by <color=#44afee>1</color>s.",
    ["SkillDesc_1122012"]="Summons the Holy Spirit to possess you, entering you into the <color=#44afee>Inspiration</color> state. <color=#44afee>Inspiration</color> lasts for <color=#44afee>10</color>s, during which your normal attacks are turned into <color=#44afee>Holy Spirit Radiance</color> that shoots at the target. <color=#44afee>Holy Spirit Radiance</color> deals Holy Attribute Physical Damage to all targets along its path that is equal to Physical Attack*<color=#44afee>%s%%</color>. If there is only one target in its path, the target takes additional Holy Attribute Physical Damage (can Crit) that is <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of the caster's Max HP. While <color=#44afee>Holy Spirit Radiance</color> is active, <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of damage taken is stored and deducted in the form of Bleed within <color=#44afee>3</color>s. For every <color=#44afee>30</color> times you Crit, you activate <color=#44afee>Cleanse</color> once, and remove Bleed from all stored damage.",
    ["SkillDesc_1123001"]="Enters an attack stance and gains the following effects based on the equipped weapon type:\nOne-Handed Sword & Shield: Increases P.ATK by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> and damage taken by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.\nTwo-Handed Sword: Increases P.ATK by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.\nTwo-Handed Spear: Increases Holy Enhancement by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> and Neutral Enhancement by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_1123002"]="Enters Defensive Stance automatically upon deactivating Offensive Stance.\nDefensive Stance: Increases PVP Debuff Duration Reduction by <color=#44afee>%s</color> and PVP Debuff Resistance by <color=#44afee>%s</color>.\nWhile in Defensive Stance, switching back to Offensive Stance is not allowed within <color=#44afee>10</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_1123003"]="Can only be used in <color=#44afee>Offensive Stance</color>. Teleports to the target and delivers a slashing attack, dealing weapon attribute P.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of P.ATK. Consumes all <color=#44afee>Rage</color> stacks to deal additional weapon attribute P.DMG equal to (the caster's <color=#44afee>3%%</color> of Max HP x Rage stacks, up to <color=#44afee>%s</color> times the caster's P.ATK). The skill can trigger crits.",
    ["SkillDesc_1123004"]="Using skills that consume Max HP grants <color=#44afee>2</color> <color=#44afee>Rage</color> stack, lasting 5 seconds (max <color=#44afee>6</color> stacks). Each <color=#44afee>Rage</color> stack increases Final Crit by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> and Crit DMG Bonus by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>. Gaining <color=#44afee>each additional stack</color> of <color=#44afee>Rage</color> makes normal attacks apply the additional damage effect from the <color=#44afee>Sacrifice</color> <color=#44afee>once</color>. If it triggers a critical hit, then <color=#44afee>Sacrifice</color>'s cooldown is reduced by <color=#44afee>1</color> second. Triggers <color=#44afee>once</color> per stack. Switching to Defensive Stance will no longer stack up the <color=#44afee>Rage</color> effect.",
    ["SkillDesc_1123005"]="When Max HP falls below <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>, the stance shifts from offensive to defensive automatically. Recovering Max HP to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> or remaining unharmed during Defensive Stance for <color=#44afee>6</color> seconds restores Offensive Stance once its cooldown is over. Upon switching to Defensive Stance, all party members gain the <color=#44afee>Engagement</color> effect for <color=#44afee>%s</color> second(s), which will be activated when you enter Offensive Stance again. The <color=#44afee>Engagement</color> effect empowers their next attack with additional corresponding attribute damage equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of the attacker's Adaptive ATK.",
    ["SkillDesc_1123006"]="Hurls a shield, striking enemies within a <color=#44afee>6</color>-meter radius and dealing weapon attribute P.DMG equal to (<color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of P.ATK + (<color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of Max HP + <color=#44afee>%s</color> x VIT, up to <color=#44afee>%s</color> times the P.ATK)). After switching to <color=#44afee>Offensive Stance</color> and releasing Shield Shooting, for the next <color=#44afee>10</color> seconds, using <color=#44afee>Shield Charge</color>, <color=#44afee>Shield Boomerang</color>, or <color=#44afee>Earth Drive</color> grants you a <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> chance to increase the P.ATK coefficient of the skill by an additional <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_1123007"]="Can only be used in <color=#44afee>Defensive Stance</color>. Raises the shield to activate a <color=#44afee>Holy Shield Zone</color>, absorbing damage for all allies within a <color=#44afee>4</color>-meter radius (excluding damage from MVP, MINI, and Boss units). While active, MSPD is reduced by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>, and skills cannot be used. The <color=#44afee>Holy Shield Zone</color> lasts <color=#44afee>3</color> seconds. When the <color=#44afee>Holy Shield Zone</color> ends, enters Offensive Stance automatically and releases the absorbed damage in front, dealing weapon attribute P.DMG equal to (<color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of P.ATK + <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of Max HP + <color=#44afee>%s</color> x VIT, up to <color=#44afee>%s</color> times the caster's P.ATK) to all enemies within a <color=#44afee>12</color> meters x <color=#44afee>6</color> meters straight-line area.",
    ["SkillDesc_1123008"]="Can only be used in <color=#44afee>Defensive Stance</color>. Consumes <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of Max HP to revive all fallen party members within a <color=#44afee>30</color>-meter radius, restoring them to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> and <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of their Max HP and Max SP, respectively. Casting this skill clears your <color=#44afee>Devotion</color> status; switching to Offensive Stance is not allowed for the next <color=#44afee>10</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_1123009"]="Allows the Imperial Guard to ride an Imperial Gryphon in combat. While in Offensive Stance, gains <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>, <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>, and <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> Bonus DMG against Dragon monsters, Undead monsters, and Formless monsters, respectively, and shares <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of this effect with all party members. While in Defensive Stance, gains <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of Final P.DEF and <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of Final M.DEF, and shares <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of this effect with all party members. For <color=#44afee>every</color> additional party member, all allies gain <color=#44afee>1</color> stack of <color=#44afee>Unity</color>. Each stack of <color=#44afee>Unity</color> increases the shared effect of <color=#44afee>Imperial Force</color> by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_1123010"]="While possessing Sacred Force, your weapon attribute becomes Holy. In Offensive Stance, automatically regenerates <color=#44afee>1</color> stack of <color=#44afee>Sacred Force</color> every <color=#44afee>%s</color> seconds during combat. Using <color=#44afee>Holy Cross</color> grants you a <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> chance to gain <color=#44afee>1</color> extra stack of <color=#44afee>Sacred Force</color>. Using other skills have a <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> chance to consume <color=#44afee>1</color> stack of <color=#44afee>Sacred Force</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_1123011"]="Can only be used in <color=#44afee>Offensive Stance</color>. Summons holy light to sentence the target, dealing Holy weapon attribute P.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of P.ATK. Consumes all <color=#44afee>Sacred Force</color> stacks to deal additional Holy attribute P.DMG equal to (<color=#44afee>%s%%</color> x Sacred Force stacks) of P.ATK.",
    ["SkillDesc_1123012"]="Can only be used in <color=#44afee>Offensive Stance</color>. Summons a holy field for <color=#44afee>3</color> seconds, dealing Holy attribute P.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of P.ATK to all targets within a <color=#44afee>6</color>-meter radius every <color=#44afee>0.3</color> seconds. When you possess <color=#44afee>Sacred Force</color>, Cross Rain's damage is increased by an additional (<color=#44afee>%s%%</color> x Sacred Force stacks). When Cross Rain ends, it creates a <color=#44afee>Cross Field</color> that lasts for <color=#44afee>10</color> seconds, granting all party members inside the field the <color=#44afee>Judgment</color> effect, which boosts damage dealt to MVP and MINI units by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_1200121"]="Heals a friendly target and yourself for (<color=#44afee>%s</color> × (Character's level + INT) / <color=#44afee>10</color>) + <color=#44afee>%s</color>) HP. If the target is an Undead or Demon monster, deals Holy magic damage to it equal to the amount the friendly unit is healed.",
    ["SkillDesc_1200122"]="Increases healing effect of \"Heal\" skill by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_1200123"]="Increases your ATK by (<color=#44afee>%s</color> + <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of STR) and deals <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> more damage to Demon and Undead monsters.",
    ["SkillDesc_1200124"]="Reduces damage received from Demon and Undead monsters by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_1200125"]="Deals Holy attribute M.DMG equal to (<color=#44afee>%s%%</color> M.ATK + <color=#44afee>%s</color>) to enemies within a <color=#44afee>4</color>-meter area and lowers their P.DEF and M.DEF by (<color=#44afee>20</color> + <color=#44afee>2%%</color> INT x <color=#44afee>%s</color>) for <color=#44afee>5</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_1200126"]="Increase the STR, DEX, and INT of all friendly targets within 30 meters by <color=#44afee>%s</color> for <color=#44afee>120</color> seconds and remove <color=#44afee>Curse</color> and <color=#44afee>Petrify</color> effects on all friendly targets. Loses effect if more than 30 meters from the caster.",
    ["SkillDesc_1200127"]="Deal (<color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of M.ATK + <color=#44afee>%s</color>) Holy magic damage to enemies within <color=#44afee>3</color> meters. Through the power of the holy spirit, reveals nearby enemy units who are Hiding for <color=#44afee>15</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_1200128"]="<color=#44afee>Blessing</color> gains the effects of <color=#44afee>Increase Agility</color>. Increases all party members' ASPD by <color=#44afee>%s</color>, AGI by <color=#44afee>%s</color>, and Movement Speed by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>. Loses its effect when the caster is more than 30 meters away.",
    ["SkillDesc_1200129"]="Smite the enemy with divine light, dealing Holy magic damage equal to (<color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of M.ATK + <color=#44afee>%s</color>) and dispelling the target's <color=#44afee>Kyrie Eleison</color> effect.",
    ["SkillDesc_1200130"]="Bless party members with holy power. After using this skill, heal friendly targets within 30 meters for <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of M.ATK + <color=#44afee>%s</color>) HP for <color=#44afee>10</color> seconds. Loses effect if more than 30 meters from the caster.",
    ["SkillDesc_121001"]="Fires <color=#44afee>1</color> bullet, dealing <color=#44afee>196%%</color> P.DMG.",
    ["SkillDesc_1210121"]="Consecrates an area, healing party members for (<color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of M.ATK + <color=#44afee>%s</color>) HP per <color=#44afee>0.5</color> seconds (a character can receive up to two Sanctuary healing effects at the same time). Undead and Demon monsters that enter this area take (<color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of M.ATK + <color=#44afee>%s</color>) Holy magic damage every second for <color=#44afee>5</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_1210122"]="Consumes <color=#44afee>60%%</color> of your Max SP to resurrect one friendly target and restore <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> (for every <color=#44afee>30</color> INT, additionally increases this effect by <color=#44afee>1%%</color>) of their HP. When cast on Demon or Undead monsters, it is equivalent to casting <color=#44afee>Turn Undead</color> of the same level on them.",
    ["SkillDesc_1210123"]="When equipped with a Mace, ATK increases by (<color=#44afee>%s</color> + <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of STR), not including STR gained through buffs.",
    ["SkillDesc_1210124"]="Increases the next active skill damage of a selected allied target by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> for <color=#44afee>%s</color> seconds. Can only take effect <color=#44afee>once</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_1210125"]="Using this skill has a chance to instantly kill an Undead target. If it fails, deals (<color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of M.ATK + <color=#44afee>%s</color>) Holy magic damage instead. When used on a boss, this skill has a chance to Crit, dealing <color=#44afee>50%%</color> more damage to Undead and Demon monsters. The chance to instantly kill is determined by your <color=#44afee>INT</color>, <color=#44afee>LUK</color>, <color=#44afee>Skill Level</color>, and the <color=#44afee>target's current HP</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_1210127"]="Converts your weapon or a party member's weapon within 30 meters to a <color=#44afee>Holy attribute</color> weapon for <color=#44afee>%s</color> seconds. Loses its effect when the caster is more than 30 meters away. Not effective when cast upon non-party members.",
    ["SkillDesc_1210128"]="Prays for allies, increasing their P.DMG (normal attack) by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> for <color=#44afee>15</color> seconds. While active, skills that deal P.DMG will also inflict additional Holy attribute P.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of the caster's P.ATK and ignore defense. The additional damage triggers once every <color=#44afee>2</color> seconds. Damage from periodic debuffs won't trigger this effect. When the caster's <color=#44afee>Final Crit</color> is higher than <color=#44afee>Final P.PEN</color>, this skill's P.DMG may trigger critical damage. Loses its effect when the ally is more than 30 meters away from the caster.",
    ["SkillDesc_1210129"]="Increases P.DEF of all party members within 30 meters by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> (every <color=#44afee>50</color> VIT adds extra <color=#44afee>1%%</color>, up to <color=#44afee>400%%</color>) for <color=#44afee>10</color> seconds. Loses its effect when the caster is more than <color=#44afee>30</color> meters away.",
    ["SkillDesc_1210130"]="After casting, increases the SP Regen of you and all party members within 30 meters by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> and increases Magic Damage Bonus by <color=#44afee>%s</color>. Lasts for <color=#44afee>10</color> seconds. Loses effect if more than 30 meters from the caster.",
    ["SkillDesc_1210132"]="Erects a defensive barrier that is immune to <color=#44afee>ranged physical damage</color>. The barrier can take up to <color=#44afee>%s</color> hits, lasting <color=#44afee>%s</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_1210133"]="Grant a damage shield to a friendly target within 30 meters. The shield can be damaged up to <color=#44afee>%s</color> times or withstand damage equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of the target's Max HP, losing its effect when either limit is exceeded, after <color=#44afee>10</color> seconds, or when the caster is more than 30 meters away.",
    ["SkillDesc_1210135"]="Increase SP Regen, recovering (<color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of Max SP + <color=#44afee>%s</color>) SP every <color=#44afee>10</color> seconds and increasing the effect of SP recovery items by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_1210136"]="Increases <color=#44afee>Holy Light</color>'s damage by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>, with a <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> chance to deal double damage. If double damage is triggered, the target will be stunned for <color=#44afee>2</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_1210137"]="Decreases an enemy's MSPD by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>, Final ASPD by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>, and Final Haste by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> for <color=#44afee>10</color> seconds. Every <color=#44afee>20</color> points of INT will decrease the enemy's Final ASPD by an additional <color=#44afee>1%%</color> and Final Haste by <color=#44afee>0.1%%</color>. Dispels <color=#44afee>Increase Agility</color> and <color=#44afee>Sword Speed Boost</color> effects on the target.",
    ["SkillDesc_1210138"]="When using a Mace, each normal attack has a <color=#44afee>20%%</color> chance (increases by an additional <color=#44afee>1%%</color> for every <color=#44afee>50</color> STR you have) to deal a bonus of (<color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of ATK + <color=#44afee>%s</color>) physical damage of your weapon's attribute.",
    ["SkillDesc_1211121"]="Increase your Max SP by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>, SP Regen by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>, and amount healed by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>. Reduce SP consumption of skills by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_1211122"]="Protects you or a friendly unit with divine power, immediately granting immunity to death and restoring HP equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of Max HP (amount healed is also affected by Healing Effect) upon taking lethal damage. Lasts for <color=#44afee>%s</color> seconds. Can only take effect once. Loses its effect when the caster is more than 30 meters away.",
    ["SkillDesc_1211123"]="Creates a cross-shaped sanctuary at the specified location, dealing (<color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of M.ATK + <color=#44afee>%s</color>) Holy M.DMG every <color=#44afee>0.5</color> seconds to enemy units that enter the area. Undead and Demon enemies take <color=#44afee>50%%</color> more damage. Lasts for <color=#44afee>6</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_1211124"]="Immediately interrupts the enemy's casting or channeling, and silences all enemy units within <color=#44afee>4</color> meters for <color=#44afee>%s</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_1211125"]="Say a prayer of intercession for friendly targets within 30 meters, increasing their Final haste by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> for <color=#44afee>120</color> seconds. Loses effect if more than 30 meters from the caster.",
    ["SkillDesc_1211126"]="When casting <color=#44afee>Angelus</color>, additionally increases M.DEF of all party members within <color=#44afee>30</color> meters by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> (every <color=#44afee>50</color> VIT adds an extra <color=#44afee>1%%</color>, up to <color=#44afee>400%%</color>) for <color=#44afee>10</color> seconds. Loses its effect when the caster is more than <color=#44afee>30</color> meters away.",
    ["SkillDesc_1211127"]="Increases the LUK of friendly targets within 30 meters by <color=#44afee>%s</color> and your own Crit by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> for <color=#44afee>120</color> seconds. Loses effect if a party member is more than 30 meters away.",
    ["SkillDesc_1211129"]="Creates a barrier at the specified location. You and all party members will be <color=#44afee>immune to melee P.DMG </color> for <color=#44afee>%s</color> seconds within the barrier. The barrier can block up to <color=#44afee>%s</color> hits.",
    ["SkillDesc_1211132"]="Reduce SP consumption of skills by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_1211133"]="Lay down judgment on an enemy, dealing (<color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of M.ATK +<color=#44afee>%s</color>) Holy sacred magic damage that ignores DEF and <color=#44afee>half of that amount</color> of Holy <color=#44afee>sacred magic</color> damage to enemies within <color=#44afee>3</color> meters of the target.",
    ["SkillDesc_1211134"]="Heal party members for (<color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of M.ATK + <color=#44afee>%s</color>) HP.",
    ["SkillDesc_1211135"]="Deals Holy <color=#44afee>sacred P.DMG</color> equal to ((<color=#44afee>%s%%</color> + <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> x stacks of Holy Light mark) x P.ATK) to a single target, and the damage ignores the target's DEF. In meanwhile, deals Holy sacred P.DMG equal to ((<color=#44afee>150%%</color> + <color=#44afee>15%%</color> x stacks of Holy Light mark) x P.ATK) to other targets who are within a <color=#44afee>4</color>-meter range of the single target. The damage also ignores targets' DEF. This skill deals double damage to the Undead and Demon monsters.",
    ["SkillDesc_1211136"]="For <color=#44afee>%s</color> second(s), normal attacks with a Mace deal an additional <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of your ATK as Holy sacred physical damage that ignores DEF. Inflicts the target with stack of Holy Strike. Holy Strike can stack up to <color=#44afee>20</color> times and lasts for <color=#44afee>10</color> seconds. Each stack of Holy Strike on the target causes them to receive <color=#44afee>2%%</color> more damage from your normal attacks.",
    ["SkillDesc_1212001"]="Summons the Life Tree to resurrect all dead party members within <color=#44afee>30</color> meters and restore <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of their HP. Surviving party members in range will be granted the <color=#44afee>Sigil of the Life Tree</color> (members resurrected by the skill will not receive the sigil). The <color=#44afee>Sigil of the Life Tree</color> restores <color=#44afee>6%%</color> of the target's HP and SP while increasing Final Damage Reduction by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> for <color=#44afee>%s</color> seconds. Costs 1 <color=#44afee><color=#44afee>Blue Gemstone</color></color> to use.",
    ["SkillDesc_1212002"]="Prayer offerings increase divine power for <color=#44afee>6</color> seconds, increasing Bonus Heal by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> and granting debuff immunity. Also removes debuffs from self and <color=#44afee>%s</color> other party members. (Unable to grant immunity or remove debuffs from bosses. Debuff removal is done in the order of highest to lowest. If the number of debuffs is the same, it is done in the order of lowest HP to highest.) Costs 1 <color=#44afee>Blue Gemstone</color> to use.",
    ["SkillDesc_1212003"]="Grants <color=#44afee>Kyrie Eleison</color> to all party members (skill’s shield effect cannot be stacked but is given priority before other skills). <color=#44afee>Kyrie Eleison</color> resists up to <color=#44afee>%s</color> attacks for <color=#44afee>10</color> sec. Once the amount of damage resisted exceeds <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of the grantees Max HP, the shield will disappear.",
    ["SkillDesc_1212004"]="Obtains the gift of the Holy Spirit and comprehends the mastery of the Holy attribute. Increases the Holy damage you deal to Earth, Fire, Water, and Wind attributes by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>, and increases your M.ATK by (<color=#44afee>%s</color> + VIT x <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>).",
    ["SkillDesc_1212005"]="Adds <color=#44afee>Sacrament</color> to Oper Auditorium. Also decreases the fixed channeling time of party members by <color=#44afee>%s</color> seconds and fixed cooldown by <color=#44afee>%s</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_1212006"]="Deals Holy magic damage equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of M.ATK by using powerful divine light to an enemy unit and inflicts <color=#44afee>Reversed Bloodflow</color> on the target. While under the effect of <color=#44afee>Reversed Bloodflow</color>, all healing and lifesteal received by the enemy has no effect (has no effect on bosses) and <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of the healing and lifesteal received will be converted into Neutral magic damage for <color=#44afee>4</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_1212007"]="Unleashes a holy light that pulls in all enemies within a <color=#44afee>4</color>-meter area, dealing Holy DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of Adaptive ATK and slowing them by <color=#44afee>50%%</color> every <color=#44afee>0.5</color> seconds. The pull lasts for <color=#44afee>3</color> seconds. At the end of the pull, any enemies still connected to the holy light will take Holy DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of Adaptive ATK and be <color=#44afee>immobilized</color> for <color=#44afee>%s</color> seconds. The skill cannot be cast if there are no connectable units within range. Costs <color=#44afee>1</color> Blue Gemstone to use.",
    ["SkillDesc_1212008"]="Upon dealing Holy damage to enemies, gains the effect of <color=#44afee>Oratio</color>, increasing Holy Enhancement by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> for <color=#44afee>5</color> seconds. This effect can only be triggered once every <color=#44afee>25</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_1212009"]="Upon dealing Holy damage to enemies, inflicts the effect of <color=#44afee>Exhort</color> on them. While under the effect of <color=#44afee>Exhort</color>, target's P.ATK and M.ATK decrease by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> for <color=#44afee>5</color> seconds. (Has no effect on bosses. This effect can be reduced by Weapon Breakage Resistance.) This effect can only be triggered once every <color=#44afee>25</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_1212010"]="Summons two rays of divine light around oneself and deals <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> Holy damage of a type that matches their own to enemies within 3 meters every second. When dealing damage to the same target, damage increases by <color=#44afee>5%%</color> each time. Lasts <color=#44afee>12</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_1212011"]="Blessed by the Holy Spirit, MSPD is increased by <color=#44afee>%s</color> while in combat. Gains Holy Spirit Protection when your HP drops to <color=#44afee>50%%</color>, during which each time you take damage, you will recover HP equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of the damage taken. Lasts <color=#44afee>6</color> seconds. If fatal damage is received during this time, the <color=#44afee>Sacred Blessing</color> effect will trigger automatically (only triggers <color=#44afee>once</color>. <color=#44afee>Sacred Blessing</color> must be learned). Holy Spirit Protection triggers up to <color=#44afee>once</color> every <color=#44afee>40</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_1212012"]="Your next normal attack within 12 seconds inflicts an <color=#44afee>Ascalon Mark</color> on the target. This <color=#44afee>mark</color> lasts for 4 seconds, during which time it will record the normal attack damage you deal to the target. When the duration of <color=#44afee>Ascalon Mark</color> ends, a Holy Spirit will be summoned, dealing (<color=#44afee>%s%%</color> x <color=#44afee>recorded damage</color>) True DMG to the target using her sword.",
    ["SkillDesc_1212013"]="Dealing damage with a mace puts you in the <color=#44afee>Rule of Order</color> state, increasing your Crit DMG Bonus by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> and Final P.PEN by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>, up to <color=#44afee>5</color> stacks for <color=#44afee>3</color> seconds. At full stacks, normal attacks have an <color=#44afee>80%%</color> chance to reduce the cooldown of <color=#44afee>Sacred Hammer</color> and <color=#44afee>Holy Strike</color> by <color=#44afee>0.25</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_1213001"]="Adds the <color=#44afee>Compassion</color> effect to <color=#44afee>Light Blessing</color> and <color=#44afee>Coluceo Heal</color>, allowing party members within <color=#44afee>30</color> meters to recover HP equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of the caster's Max HP every second. The <color=#44afee>Dilectio</color> effect lasts for <color=#44afee>5</color> seconds. For every <color=#44afee>%s</color> INT the caster possesses, the healing effect is increased by <color=#44afee>0.6%%</color>, up to <color=#44afee>3%%</color>. This effect can be triggered <color=#44afee>once</color> every <color=#44afee>20</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_1213002"]="Heals a specified party member for an amount equal to (<color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of their lost HP + caster's INT x <color=#44afee>2</color>). For every <color=#44afee>%s</color> INT the caster possesses, the healing effect is increased by <color=#44afee>1%%</color>, up to <color=#44afee>60%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_1213003"]="Each time you heal a party member with an active skill, you receive <color=#44afee>1</color> stack of <color=#44afee>Votum</color>. Every stack of <color=#44afee>Votum</color> boosts your Max HP by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>. The <color=#44afee>Votum</color> effect lasts for <color=#44afee>6</color> seconds, stacking up to <color=#44afee>%s</color> times.",
    ["SkillDesc_1213004"]="Casts <color=#44afee>Impositio Manus</color> to increase the party members' M.DMG (normal attack) by an additional <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>. While active, skills that deal M.DMG will also inflict additional Holy attribute M.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of the caster's M.ATK and ignore defense. The additional damage triggers once every <color=#44afee>2</color> seconds. Damage from periodic debuffs won't trigger this effect. Loses its effect when the ally is more than 30 meters away from the caster.",
    ["SkillDesc_1213005"]="Gathers energy at your location to summon the Portal Nexus. After <color=#44afee>3</color> seconds, all party members within the area are teleported to the preselected location.",
    ["SkillDesc_1213006"]="Normal attacks have a <color=#44afee>9%%</color> chance to trigger the <color=#44afee>Destruction</color> effect. If your Final Crit is higher than Final P.PEN, <color=#44afee>Destruction</color> reduces the target's Final Anti-Crit by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> and Crit DMG Reduction by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>. If your Final P.PEN is higher than Final Crit, <color=#44afee>Destruction</color> reduces the target's Final P.DEF by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>. The <color=#44afee>Destruction</color> effect lasts for <color=#44afee>6</color> seconds. Enemies affected by <color=#44afee>Destruction</color> will be randomly inflicted with one of the following debuffs: <color=#44afee>stun</color>, <color=#44afee>trap</color>, or <color=#44afee>immobilize</color> for <color=#44afee>3</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_1213007"]="Receives the blessing of the Holy Light, gaining <color=#44afee>1</color> stack of the <color=#44afee>Holy Light</color> effect. During this time, each normal attack has an <color=#44afee>11%%</color> chance to grant you <color=#44afee>1</color> extra stack of <color=#44afee>Holy Light</color>. While under the effect of <color=#44afee>Holy Light</color>, every normal attack has a <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> chance to summon Holy Light to strike the enemy, dealing Holy attribute P.DMG equal to (<color=#44afee>%s%%</color> P.ATK x <color=#44afee>Holy Light</color> stacks) that ignores defense. The <color=#44afee>Holy Light</color> effect can stack up to <color=#44afee>5</color> times and lasts for up to <color=#44afee>6</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_1213008"]="When your Final Crit is higher than Final P.PEN, <color=#44afee>Petitio</color>, <color=#44afee>Presens Acies</color>, and <color=#44afee>Sacred Hammer</color> can trigger critical hits. When <color=#44afee>Holy Light</color> is fully stacked, each Petitio triggered will also deal Holy attribute P.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of P.ATK that ignores defense to all enemies within <color=#44afee>4</color> meters, with the damage split among the targets within range.",
    ["SkillDesc_1213009"]="Whenever you deal Holy DMG to an enemy, you gain <color=#44afee>1</color> stack of <color=#44afee>Fidus Animus</color>. Each stack of <color=#44afee>Fidus Animus</color> increases your Debuff Resistance by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> and Debuff Duration Reduction by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>. Can be stacked up to <color=#44afee>5</color> times and lasts for <color=#44afee>6</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_1213010"]="Using <color=#44afee>Signum Crucis</color>, <color=#44afee>Judge</color>, <color=#44afee>Magnus Exorcismus</color>, or <color=#44afee>Pneumaticus Procella</color> has a <color=#44afee>10%%</color> chance to inflict the <color=#44afee>Requiem</color> effect to all targets within range <color=#44afee>1</color> time. Enemies under the effect of <color=#44afee>Requiem</color> lose <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of their Max SP per second, and all their buffs are temporarily suspended. Each time they take Holy DMG, there's a <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> chance they'll be stunned for <color=#44afee>0.5</color> seconds. <color=#44afee>Requiem</color> lasts for <color=#44afee>6</color> seconds. For every <color=#44afee>1</color> stack of <color=#44afee>Fidus Animus</color> you have, the chance of inflicting <color=#44afee>Requiem</color> increases by <color=#44afee>4%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_1213011"]="Unleashes a powerful judgment of light on the target, dealing Holy attribute M.DMG equal to (<color=#44afee>%s%%</color> M.ATK + caster's <color=#44afee>INT</color> x <color=#44afee>%s</color>) that ignores defense (the extra damage coefficient increased by INT will not exceed <color=#44afee>600%%</color>). If the target is a character, they will enter the <color=#44afee>Silent</color> state. While the target is under the effect of <color=#44afee>Silent</color>, it instantly interrupts their <color=#44afee>Solo</color>, <color=#44afee>Ensemble</color>, <color=#44afee>Chant</color>, and <color=#44afee>Chorus</color> skills, preventing the target from using <color=#44afee>Solo</color>, <color=#44afee>Ensemble</color>, <color=#44afee>Chant</color>, and <color=#44afee>Chorus</color> skills during this time. The <color=#44afee>Silent</color> effect lasts for <color=#44afee>6</color> seconds. If the target is a monster, they will enter the <color=#44afee>Justice</color> state, causing each attack from a party member to deal Holy attribute M.DMG equal to (<color=#44afee>50%%</color> M.ATK + caster's <color=#44afee>INT</color> x <color=#44afee>25</color>) that ignores defense (the extra damage coefficient increased by INT will not exceed <color=#44afee>150%%</color>; the Holy DMG will not exceed <color=#44afee>100%%</color> of the caster's M.ATK/P.ATK). The <color=#44afee>Justice</color> effect lasts for <color=#44afee>6</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_1213012"]="Summons a holy spirit storm in the target area, dealing Holy attribute M.DMG equal to (<color=#44afee>%s%%</color> M.ATK + <color=#44afee>INT</color> x <color=#44afee>%s</color>) (the extra damage coefficient increased by INT will not exceed <color=#44afee>150%%</color>) that ignores defense to all enemies within a <color=#44afee>6</color>-meter radius every <color=#44afee>0.5</color> seconds. The damage is split among all targets in the area. Pneumaticus Procella lasts for <color=#44afee>8</color> seconds. <color=#44afee>Undead</color> and <color=#44afee>Demon</color> monsters in the area take <color=#44afee>50%%</color> additional damage.",
    ["SkillDesc_1220001"]="When using glove-type weapons, P.ATK increases by an additional AGI x<color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_1220002"]="Every <color=#44afee>%s</color> seconds, spirit is gathered into 3 Spirit Spheres surrounding you, with each Spirit Sphere increasing your Physical Attack by AGI x <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> points for a maximum of <color=#44afee>5</color> Spheres. (Other skills can increase the Spirit Spheres limit to 20.)",
    ["SkillDesc_1220003"]="Plunges the enemy into a desolate situation, dealing weapon attribute Physical Damage to an enemy unit within <color=#44afee>3</color> meters that is equal to Physical Attack*<color=#44afee>%s%%</color>. Other targets within range are knocked back to a position <color=#44afee>7</color> meters away from the target, and the knocked back targets are stunned for <color=#44afee>2</color>s.",
    ["SkillDesc_1220004"]="Gather a large amount of spirits to form Spirit Spheres that circle you, increasing the max number of Spirit Spheres you can carry (up to 5 Spirit Spheres at a time). The number of Spirit Spheres generated from Zen and Call Spirits are the same, and after learning Zen, each Spirit Sphere can increase the caster's Physical Attack by an additional Agility*<color=#44afee>%s%%</color> points.",
    ["SkillDesc_1220005"]="Explodes all Spirit Spheres, entering the Critical Explosion state. Every Spirit Sphere used in Critical Explosion increases Physical Attack by an additional <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>. Critical Explosion lasts <color=#44afee>30</color>s.",
    ["SkillDesc_1220006"]="When heavy knuckles are equipped, normal attacks have a <color=#44afee>20%%</color> chance to trigger Triple Attack, dealing <color=#44afee>3</color> attacks to the enemy, with each attack dealing weapon attribute Physical Damage equal to Physical Attack*<color=#44afee>%s%%</color>. This skill can trigger Crits. The triggered Triple Attack is considered a normal attack, and Attack Speed is affected by Attack Speed bonuses.",
    ["SkillDesc_1220007"]="Quickly attack the enemy unit <color=#44afee>4</color> times, with each attacking dealing weapon attribute Physical Damage equal to Physical Attack*<color=#44afee>%s%%</color>. Must be cast within <color=#44afee>3</color>s of Triple Attack. When Raging Quadruple Blow is placed in the automatic skills bar, triggering Triple Attack automatically triggers Raging Quadruple Blow. This skill can trigger Crits. Can only be used when heavy knuckles are equipped. This skill does not use up SP.",
    ["SkillDesc_1220008"]="A swift strike to the enemy unit deals weapon attribute Physical Damage equal to Physical Attack*<color=#44afee>%s%%</color>. Must be cast within <color=#44afee>3</color>s of Raging Quadruple Blow. When casting, it uses up Spirit Sphere*<color=#44afee>1</color>. When Combo Finish is placed in the automatic skills bar, triggering Triple Attack automatically triggers Raging Quadruple Blow and Combo Finish. This skill can trigger Crits. Can only be used when heavy knuckles are equipped.",
    ["SkillDesc_1220009"]="When heavy knuckles are equipped, the Monk's Attack Speed is increased by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>, with every <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> Final Attack Speed (including Final Attack Speed converted from Attack Speed) increasing the trigger rate of Triple Attack by <color=#44afee>8%%</color>, up to a max of <color=#44afee>100%%</color>. When it is increased to <color=#44afee>100%%</color>, normal attacks are replaced by Triple Attacks.",
    ["SkillDesc_122001"]="Fires <color=#44afee>1</color> bullet that scatters into <color=#44afee>3</color> shrapnel to a <color=#44afee>60</color>-degree radius ahead, each dealing <color=#44afee>152%%</color> P.DMG.",
    ["SkillDesc_1220010"]="Use inner strength to hit the Spirit Sphere into enemy target bodies, dealing weapon attribute Physical Damage <color=#44afee>2</color> times that is equal to Physical Attack*<color=#44afee>%s%%</color>. Every <color=#44afee>%s</color> points of Physical Defense the target has increases the damage of this skill by <color=#44afee>1%%</color>, for a max of <color=#44afee>3000%%</color>. Uses Spirit Sphere*<color=#44afee>1</color>. Can only be used when light knuckles are equipped.",
    ["SkillDesc_1220011"]="Fires a spirit wave at the target, dealing weapon attribute Physical Damage to the target within an area of <color=#44afee>3</color> meters <color=#44afee>3</color> times that is equal to Physical Attack*<color=#44afee>%s%%</color>. Uses Spirit Sphere *<color=#44afee>1</color>. Can only be used when light knuckles are equipped.",
    ["SkillDesc_1220012"]="After casting, Spirit Spheres are sent out from a distance to attack an enemy unit. Each Spirit Sphere deals weapon attribute Physical Damage that is equal to Physical Attack*<color=#44afee>%s%%</color>. This this skill is used, up to <color=#44afee>2</color> Spirits Spheres are used in a normal state, and a max of <color=#44afee>4</color> in the Critical Explosion state. Can only be used when light knuckles are equipped. (Cannot be used when you have no Spirit Spheres.)",
    ["SkillDesc_1220013"]="When light knuckles are equipped, normal attacks are no longer melee punches, but transformed into shooting Spirit Spheres at the target, dealing weapon attribute Physical Damage <color=#44afee>2</color> times that is equal to the total Physical Attack*<color=#44afee>%s%%</color>. Normal attack range increases to <color=#44afee>%s</color> meters, and the attack ranges of Investigate, Spirit Wave, Finger Offensive, Blade Stop, Power Velocity, Tiger Cannon, Earth Shaker, Ride in Lightening increase to <color=#44afee>%s</color> meters.",
    ["SkillDesc_1220015"]="Attack a single enemy target <color=#44afee>4</color> times rapidly, dealing weapon attribute P.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of P.ATK. This skill can trigger Crits. Can only be used when heavy knuckles are equipped. This skill doesn't consume SP.",
    ["SkillDesc_1220016"]="Perform a swift strike, dealing weapon attribute P.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of P.ATK to a single enemy target. This skill can trigger Crits. Can only be used when heavy knuckles are equipped.",
    ["SkillDesc_1221001"]="Rest in place, recovering SP that is <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>*Spirits Recovery times every 0.5s. Only this skill can recover SP under the effect of Asura's prohibition. ",
    ["SkillDesc_1221002"]="The Monk quickly moves <color=#44afee>8</color> meters ahead, and at the end of the move deals Weapon attribute Physical Damage equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> P.ATK to enemy units within <color=#44afee>4</color> meters, and increases your Movement Speed by <color=#44afee>20%%</color>for <color=#44afee>6</color> seconds. Each successful hit increases MSPD by <color=#44afee>10%%</color>, up to <color=#44afee>80%%</color>. This skill can be recharged for <color=#44afee>once</color>.\nIn the Critical Explosion state, Body Relocation becomes Enhanced Body Relocation with one charge obtained. Enhanced Body Relocation costs <color=#44afee>2</color> Spirit Spheres and increases movement distance to <color=#44afee>13</color> meters. (Body Relocation and Enhanced Body Relocation do not share charges and cooldown.)",
    ["SkillDesc_1221003"]="Strike a powerful blow at the enemy, dealing weapon attribute Physical Damage to enemy units that is equal to Physical Attack*<color=#44afee>%s%%</color>, and knocking back enemies <color=#44afee>4</color> meters. Can only be used in the Critical Explosion state.",
    ["SkillDesc_1221004"]="Uses a special Gentle Touch technique to increase the Force Field conversion speed to the limit. When attacking, there is a <color=#44afee>35%%</color> chance to generate <color=#44afee>1</color> Spirit Sphere, and this can be triggered a max of once every <color=#44afee>%s</color> seconds. When attacked, generates 1 Spirit Sphere upon losing every <color=#44afee>10%%</color> of Max HP. Can be triggered once every <color=#44afee>%s</color> seconds",
    ["SkillDesc_1221005"]="After casting, you appear in front of the enemy unit in a flash and perform a powerful strike, immobilizing the target for <color=#44afee>1</color> second and dealing weapon attribute P.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of P.ATK (every <color=#44afee>15</color> points of STR increases weapon attribute damage by an additional <color=#44afee>1%%</color>, up to <color=#44afee>800%%</color>), meanwhile granting you <color=#44afee>50%%</color> Final P.DMG Reduction, <color=#44afee>30%%</color> Final DMG Reduction, and for every <color=#44afee>1%%</color> of your SP, dealing additional weapon attribute P.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>5%%</color> of P.ATK. This skill can trigger crits, but can only be used under the Critical Explosion state. After casting, removes the Critical Explosion state and consumes all your SP. You cannot use any healing potions for <color=#44afee>%s</color> seconds after using the skill. Spirit Sphere costs are based on various skills. Direct casting costs 5 Spirit Spheres, Combo Finish costs 4, Tiger Knuckle Fist costs 3, and Chain Crush Combo costs 1.",
    ["SkillDesc_1221006"]="Attack the enemy unit <color=#44afee>4</color> times, each time dealing weapon attribute Physical Damage that is <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of Physical Attack, with a <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> chance to Immobilize the enemy for <color=#44afee>2</color>s. Must be cast within <color=#44afee>3</color>s of Combo Finish, using up Spirit Sphere*<color=#44afee>1</color>. When Tiger Knuckle Fist is placed in the automatic skills bar, casting Triple Attack automatically triggers Raging Quadruple Blow, Combo Finish, and Tiger Knuckle Fist. This skill can trigger Crits. Can only be used when heavy knuckles are equipped.",
    ["SkillDesc_1221007"]="Deals weapon attribute Physical Damage that is <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of Physical Attack to enemy units, and enemies that take damage enter the Crush state, during which the damage dealt by you is increased by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> for <color=#44afee>3</color>s. Must be cast within <color=#44afee>3</color> seconds of Combo Finish or Tiger Knuckle Fist. Chain Crush Combo uses Spirit Sphere*<color=#44afee>1</color>. When Chain Crush Combo is placed in the automatic skills bar, casting Triple Attack automatically triggers Raging Quadruple Blow, Combo Finish, Tiger Knuckle Fist, and Chain Crush Combo. This skill can trigger Crits. Can only be used when heavy knuckles are equipped.",
    ["SkillDesc_1221008"]="When heavy knuckles are equipped, every <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of Final Attack Speed (including Final Attack Speed converted from Attack Speed) reduces the attack time of Raging Quadruple Blow, Tiger Knuckle Fist, Dragon Combo, and Gate of Hell by <color=#44afee>5%%</color>. The reduction limit is <color=#44afee>75%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_1221009"]="After casting, your Spirit Spheres are combined into a huge sword, which is launched to pierce enemies, dealing weapon attribute Physical Damage to all enemies in its path that is equal to Physical Attack*(<color=#44afee>%s%%</color> + number of Spirit Spheres used*<color=#44afee>100%%</color>). Every <color=#44afee>%s</color> points of Physical Defense that the target has increases the damage of this skill by <color=#44afee>1%%</color>, for a max of <color=#44afee>1000%%</color>. This skill uses a max of Spirit Sphere*<color=#44afee>2</color> when cast in the normal state, and a uses max of Spirit Sphere*<color=#44afee>4</color> in the Critical Explosion state. Can only be used when light knuckles are equipped.",
    ["SkillDesc_1221010"]="Deals weapon attribute Physical Damage to the target that is equal to Physical Attack*<color=#44afee>%s%%</color>, and injecting Inner Strength into the target's body that lasts for <color=#44afee>%s</color>s, during which every time the target takes damage from you, it triggers Inner Strength, and takes an additional weapon attribute Physical Damage that is equal to (<color=#44afee>30%%</color>*castor's Physical Attack). When Power Velocity is injected into the target, you have a <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> chance of obtaining <color=#44afee>1</color> Spirit Sphere when dealing damage. This lasts <color=#44afee>7</color>s. Can only be used when light knuckles are equipped.",
    ["SkillDesc_1221011"]="Explode Spirit Spheres, dealing weapon attribute Physical Damage to all enemies within <color=#44afee>4</color> meters of yourself that is equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of Physical Attack. When this skill is cast, Spirit Sphere*<color=#44afee>1</color> is used. If cast in the Critical Explosion state, damage is increased by an additional <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>. Can only be used when light knuckles are equipped.",
    ["SkillDesc_1221012"]="When light knuckles are equipped, casting Finger Offensive, Blade Stop, Tiger Cannon, or Ride in Lightening gives you a <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> chance to recover Spirit Sphere*<color=#44afee>1</color>. If case in the Critical Explosion state, you have the same chance of recovering <color=#44afee>2</color> Spirit Spheres.",
    ["SkillDesc_1221013"]="After channeling, appear in front of the enemy unit in a flash and perform a powerful strike, dealing weapon attribute P.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>1%%</color> of P.ATK (every <color=#44afee>20</color> points of STR increases weapon attribute damage by an additional <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>), granting <color=#44afee>50%%</color> Final P.DMG Reduction, <color=#44afee>30%%</color> Final DMG Reduction, and for every <color=#44afee>1%%</color> of your SP, dealing additional weapon attribute P.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>5%%</color> of P.ATK. This skill can trigger Crits. During the cooldown period, you cannot recover your SP by any other effects other than Spirits Recovery.",
    ["SkillDesc_1221014"]="Strike a powerful blow at the enemy, dealing weapon attribute P.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of P.ATK to a single enemy target, and knocking them back for <color=#44afee>4</color> meters.",
    ["SkillDesc_1222001"]="When debuffs are inflicted on you, it removes and resists all debuff states for <color=#44afee>%s</color>s. Can be triggered a max of once every <color=#44afee>%s</color>s.",
    ["SkillDesc_1222002"]="Trigger your potential, entering the Rising Dragon state, during which you add <color=#44afee>%s</color> stacks of Critical Explosion and increase the number of Spirit Spheres you carry and the Spirit Sphere limit by <color=#44afee>%s</color> (up to the maximum). The time interval used for Call Spirits is reduced by <color=#44afee>%s</color>s, and the Critical Explosion state added to Rising Dragon will not be removed by this skill. Lasts <color=#44afee>30</color>s.",
    ["SkillDesc_1222003"]="Deals attribute-less Physical Damage to enemy groups within <color=#44afee>4</color> meters of yourself that is equal to Physical Attack*<color=#44afee>%s%%</color>, and adds the Cursed state, during which attacks are restricted for <color=#44afee>%s</color>s. The Cursed state lasts <color=#44afee>6</color>s.",
    ["SkillDesc_1222004"]="Increases DMG Immunity by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> and MSPD by <color=#44afee>%s</color> for 3 seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_1222005"]="Gather spirit in your dantian and Howl, sending out a sound wave that sends all enemies within <color=#44afee>4</color> meters of you into the Fear state for <color=#44afee>2</color>s, dealing attribute-less Physical Damage that is equal to Physical Attack*<color=#44afee>%s%%</color>. If there are concealed targets in range, the Stealth effect is removed.",
    ["SkillDesc_1222006"]="Using swift combo kicks, you attack the enemy unit <color=#44afee>2</color> times, each attack dealing weapon attribute Physical Damage that is <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of Physical Attack. This skill can trigger Crits. Can only be used when heavy knuckles are equipped.",
    ["SkillDesc_1222007"]="Leap up and deal a heavy strike to the target, dealing weapon attribute Physical Damage that is <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of Physical Attack, and stunning the hit enemy for <color=#44afee>3</color>s. Must be cast within <color=#44afee>3</color>s of Dragon Combo. When cast, Spirit Sphere*<color=#44afee>2</color> is used. This skill can trigger Crits. Can only be used when heavy knuckles are equipped.",
    ["SkillDesc_1222008"]="Have at least one Spirit Sphere when you use this skill. Launch a storm-like attack on the enemy unit instantly, attacking <color=#44afee>5</color> times. Each attack deals Physical Damage equal to (Physical Attack*<color=#44afee>%s%%</color> + Agility*<color=#44afee>%s</color>). Each attach uses <color=#44afee>1</color> Spirit Sphere, and if no Spirit Spheres are used, the attack stops early. In the Critical Explosion state, each attack is transformed into Physical Damage that is equal to (<color=#44afee>%s%%</color> Physical Attack + Agility*<color=#44afee>%s</color>), attacking a max of <color=#44afee>5</color> times. Can only be used when heavy knuckles are equipped. This skill does not use up SP.",
    ["SkillDesc_1222009"]="When heavy knuckles are equipped, every Spirit Sphere used increases your Knuckle Power. Every stack of Knuckle Power increases your Final Crit by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> and increases your Crit DMG Bonus by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>, up to <color=#44afee>15</color> stacks for <color=#44afee>5</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_1222010"]="After casting, powerful Spirit Spheres are shot at the the designated target, dealing weapon attribute Physical Damage to the target that is equal to Physical Attack*(<color=#44afee>%s%%</color> + number of Spirit Spheres used*<color=#44afee>200%%</color>), and dealing additional damager that is based on the target's lost HP. Every <color=#44afee>1%%</color> of HP lost by the target increases damage by <color=#44afee>2%%</color>. This skill must be cast in the Critical Explosion state, and cannot be used when there are no Spirit Spheres. It uses a max of Spirit Sphere*<color=#44afee>4</color>. Can only be used when light knuckles are equipped.",
    ["SkillDesc_1222011"]="Deal a heavy blow to the ground, sending out <color=#44afee>3</color> shock waves. Each wave deals weapon attribute Physical Damage to all enemies in the attack path in the specified direction that is equal to Physical Attack*<color=#44afee>%s%%</color>. Every time damage is taken, you add one stack of Seismic to the target, and targets in the Seismic state have their speed slowed by <color=#44afee>30%%</color> for <color=#44afee>3</color>s, for a max of <color=#44afee>3</color> stacks. When the max number of stacks is reached, it stuns the target in Seismic state for <color=#44afee>3</color>s. Uses Spirit Sphere*<color=#44afee>3</color>. When cast in the Critical Explosion state, each attack wave deals an additional <color=#44afee>200%%</color> weapon attribute Physical Damage. Can only be used when light knuckles are equipped.",
    ["SkillDesc_1222012"]="Guided for <color=#44afee>2</color>s, and fires Spirit Spheres into the specified range of <color=#44afee>4</color> meters, exploding them. Each Spirit Sphere deal weapon attribute Physical Damage to all enemies in range that is equal to Physical Attack*<color=#44afee>%s%%</color>, adding a stack of Dazzle to enemies which lasts <color=#44afee>30</color>s, for a max of <color=#44afee>20</color> stacks. Each stack increases the damage the enemy takes from you by <color=#44afee>5%%</color>. When this skill is cast, it uses all remaining Spirit Spheres. Can only be used when light knuckles are equipped.",
    ["SkillDesc_1222013"]="When light knuckles are equipped, every time Spirit Spheres are used to trigger Investigate, Spirit Wave, Finger Offensive, Blade Stop, Rampage Blaster, Tiger Cannon, Earth Shaker, or Ride in Lightening, there is an additional calculation of your Final Physical Penetration (<color=#44afee>%s%%</color>*number of Spirit Spheres used in one go).",
    ["SkillDesc_1223001"]="Strengthens the will to eradicate monsters. Increases <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> and <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> damage dealt to Demon monsters and Undead monsters, while reducing <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> and <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> damage received from them. When equipping Heavy Knuckle, if AGI reaches <color=#44afee>3,000</color>, every additional <color=#44afee>1</color> AGI grants <color=#44afee>4</color> extra ATK.",
    ["SkillDesc_1223002"]="Strengthens the faith during combat. When dealing or receiving damage from Adventurers, gain <color=#44afee>Powerful Faith</color>, increasing Max HP by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>. When dealing or receiving damage from MVP, MINI, and Boss units, gains <color=#44afee>Firm Faith</color>, reducing damage received from them by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> (excluding True DMG). When dealing or receiving damage from normal monsters, gain <color=#44afee>Sincere Faith</color>, increasing the Base EXP and Job EXP by an additional <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> (excluding Odin's Blessing and event bonus). Only one type of faith can be active at a time.",
    ["SkillDesc_1223003"]="Activates the judge state for <color=#44afee>10</color> seconds. While active, Triple Attack, Raging Quadruple Blow, Tiger Knuckle Fist, and Dragon Combo gain an additional P.DMG equal to (STR/AGI x <color=#44afee>%s</color>, whichever is higher) in each stage of the attack. If AGI is greater than STR, Asura Strike deals an additional (AGI x <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>) weapon attribute P.DMG. When STR is greater than AGI, Gate of Hell deals an additional (STR x <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>) weapon attribute P.DMG in each stage of the attack.",
    ["SkillDesc_1223004"]="Activates Exorcism Flame for <color=#44afee>10</color> seconds. While active, using Blade Stop, Earth Shaker, Tiger Cannon, and Ride in Lightening has a <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> chance to grant <color=#44afee>1</color> stack of <color=#44afee>Zen</color>. For every <color=#44afee>%s</color> STR, the chance of triggering Zen increases by <color=#44afee>1%%</color>, capped at <color=#44afee>10%%</color>. This effect cannot be triggered without learning <color=#44afee>Zen</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_1223005"]="When using class skills to attack enemies, applies <color=#44afee>Brand</color> to the target. Triggers <color=#44afee>once</color> every <color=#44afee>0.5</color> seconds. The <color=#44afee>Brand</color> effect lasts for <color=#44afee>6</color> seconds, stacking up to <color=#44afee>10</color> times. Each stack increases your damage dealt to the target by an additional <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_1223006"]="Upon activation, enters the <color=#44afee>Faith</color> state for <color=#44afee>10</color> seconds. During this time, for <color=#44afee>each</color> stack of <color=#44afee>Brand</color> applied to <color=#44afee>a</color> new target, you gain 1 stack of <color=#44afee>Faith</color>, increasing your PVP Final P.DMG RED by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> and PVP Final M.DMG RED by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>, stacking up to <color=#44afee>10</color> times and lasting <color=#44afee>6</color> seconds. Faith, Judgement, and Flame can not be activated at the same time.",
    ["SkillDesc_1223007"]="Upon activation, enters the <color=#44afee>Judgement</color> state for <color=#44afee>10</color> seconds. During this time, whenever an enemy gains an additional Brand stack, they suffer weapon attribute P.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of P.ATK. If your Final Crit is higher than Final P.PEN, this skill may trigger critical damage. Faith, Judgement, and Flame can not be activated at the same time.",
    ["SkillDesc_1223008"]="Upon activation, enters the <color=#44afee>Flame</color> state for <color=#44afee>10</color> seconds. During this time, attacking a target afflicted with Brand has a (<color=#44afee>%s%%</color> x Brand stacks) chance of triggering a flame explosion, which deals weapon attribute P.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of P.ATK to all enemies within a <color=#44afee>4</color>-meter radius. Triggers <color=#44afee>once</color> every <color=#44afee>2</color> seconds. If your Final Crit is higher than Final P.PEN, this skill may trigger critical damage. Faith, Judgement, and Flame can not be activated at the same time.",
    ["SkillDesc_1223009"]="Retrieves all Brand stacks you applied, clearing all buffs from the target and silencing the target for <color=#44afee>5</color> seconds (not effective against MVP, MINI, and Boss units). For each retrieved Brand stack, you restore <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of Max HP and <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of Max SP.",
    ["SkillDesc_1223010"]="Can only be used in Judge state. Summons the Gate of Judgment, dealing weapon attribute P.DMG equal to (<color=#44afee>%s%%</color> + (STR or AGI, whichever is higher)/<color=#44afee>%s</color> x <color=#44afee>10%%</color>, up to <color=#44afee>1,500%%</color> of the caster's P.ATK). Then, removes all Brand stacks from the target, dealing weapon attribute P.DMG equal to (<color=#44afee>%s%%</color> + <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> x Brand stacks). The damage dealt by the Gate of Judgment may trigger critical damage.",
    ["SkillDesc_1223011"]="Can only be used in the Exorcism Flame state. Launches blazing projectiles, striking all enemies within a <color=#44afee>6</color>-meter radius <color=#44afee>5</color> times and each time dealing weapon attribute P.DMG equal to (<color=#44afee>%s%%</color> + STR/<color=#44afee>%s</color> x <color=#44afee>1%%</color>, up to <color=#44afee>300%%</color> of the caster's P.ATK). Then, remove all Brand stacks from all targets in the area, dealing weapon attribute P.DMG equal to (<color=#44afee>%s%%</color> + <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> x Brand stacks) P.ATK.",
    ["SkillDesc_1223012"]="Unleashes a devastating explosion of stored energy in the body, dealing weapon attribute P.DMG equal to (<color=#44afee>%s%%</color> + (STR or AGI, whichever is higher)/<color=#44afee>%s</color> x <color=#44afee>10%%</color>, up to <color=#44afee>1500%%</color> of the caster's P.ATK) to all targets within an <color=#44afee>6</color>-meter radius. If your Final Crit is higher than Final P.PEN, this skill may trigger critical damage. The explosion speeds up your blood flow, and for the next <color=#44afee>6</color> seconds, casting Asura Strike, Gate of Hell, Tiger Cannon, and Ride in Lightening does not consume Spirit Spheres.",
    ["SkillDesc_123001"]="Fires <color=#44afee>1</color> bullet, dealing a total of <color=#44afee>159%%</color> P.DMG in three separate attacks. Equipping this weapon will reduce the Final Hit of normal attacks and firearm skills by <color=#44afee>10%%</color> when the target is more than <color=#44afee>5</color> meters away.",
    ["SkillDesc_124001"]="Fires <color=#44afee>1</color> bullet, dealing a total of <color=#44afee>518%%</color> P.DMG. Equipping this weapon will reduce the Final Hit of normal attacks and firearm skills by <color=#44afee>10%%</color> when the target is more than <color=#44afee>5</color> meters away.",
    ["SkillDesc_1300121"]="Deals (<color=#44afee>%s%%</color> M.ATK + <color=#44afee>%s</color>) Water magic damage to an enemy and has a <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> chance to freeze them for <color=#44afee>%s</color> seconds. While frozen, the target's Armor attribute will become <color=#44afee>Water</color>, their M.DEF will be decreased by <color=#44afee>20%%</color>, and their HP and SP will not recover naturally. When the frozen effect is dispelled in advance due to being attacked, the Water armor attribute effect will persist for another <color=#44afee>3</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_1300122"]="Call down a lightning bolt on an enemy, dealing Wind attribute M.DMG equal to (<color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of M.ATK + <color=#44afee>%s</color>). Every <color=#44afee>%s</color> point(s) of INT will increase the skill coefficient of M.ATK by an additional <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_1300123"]="Shoot a fireball, dealing (<color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of M.ATK + <color=#44afee>%s</color>) Fire magic damage to enemy units within <color=#44afee>3</color> meters of the specified location.",
    ["SkillDesc_1300124"]="Summons a fireball, dealing (<color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of M.ATK + <color=#44afee>%s</color>) Fire magic damage to enemy units within <color=#44afee>3</color> meters of you and reveals nearby enemy units who are Hiding for <color=#44afee>10</color> seconds. When the Sight effect is active, you can launch <color=#44afee>Sightrasher</color> to knock back nearby enemy units <color=#44afee>4</color> meters, dealing (<color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of M.ATK + <color=#44afee>%s</color>) Fire magic damage and stunning them for <color=#44afee>2</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_1300125"]="Summon Holy spirits to attack, dealing (<color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of M.ATK + <color=#44afee>%s</color>) Ghost magic damage to an enemy. Deals <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> more damage to Undead monsters.",
    ["SkillDesc_1300126"]="Envelop yourself with spiritual energy, reducing your P.DMG and M.DMG received by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> (every <color=#44afee>300</color> VIT reduces an additional <color=#44afee>1%%</color>, up to <color=#44afee>10%%</color>) for <color=#44afee>10</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_1300127"]="Increase SP Regen, restoring (<color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of Max SP + <color=#44afee>%s</color>) SP every <color=#44afee>10</color> seconds and increasing the effectiveness of SP recovery items by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_1300128"]="Call down a fire bolt on an enemy, dealing Fire attribute M.DMG equal to (<color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of M.ATK + <color=#44afee>%s</color>). Every <color=#44afee>%s</color> point(s) of INT will increase the skill coefficient of M.ATK by an additional <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_1300129"]="Conjures a ring of fire to obstruct enemies from advancing, dealing (<color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of M.ATK + <color=#44afee>%s</color>) Fire magic damage to enemies that attempt to pass the fire wall. Lasts for <color=#44afee>10</color> seconds. The ring of fire can obstruct enemies up to <color=#44afee>%s</color> times and will persist for at least <color=#44afee>3</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_1300130"]="Call down an ice bolt on an enemy, dealing Water attribute M.DMG equal to (<color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of M.ATK + <color=#44afee>%s</color>). Every <color=#44afee>%s</color> point(s) of INT will increase the skill coefficient of M.ATK by an additional <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_1300131"]="Deal (<color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of M.ATK + <color=#44afee>%s</color>) Neutral magic damage to an enemy on use.",
    ["SkillDesc_1310122"]="Conjures <color=#44afee>7</color> waves of Storm Gust at the specified location. Each wave deals (<color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of M.ATK + <color=#44afee>%s</color>) Water magic damage to enemies within the area and has a <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> chance to slow them by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>. The Slow effect lasts for <color=#44afee>3</color> seconds and can stack up to <color=#44afee>3</color> times. When stacked 3 times, the enemy will be <color=#44afee>frozen</color> for <color=#44afee>3</color> seconds. Each target can only be slowed and frozen by one Storm Gust at any one time. When a target is frozen by this skill, it will no longer be affected by this skill's Slow effect. This skill's freeze effect will not be removed when the enemy takes damage.",
    ["SkillDesc_1310123"]="Shoot a ball of lightning at an enemy, dealing (<color=#44afee>%s%%</color>of M.ATK + <color=#44afee>%s</color>) Wind magic damage and knocks them back <color=#44afee>4</color> meters.",
    ["SkillDesc_1310126"]="Knock nearby enemy units back <color=#44afee>4</color> meters using the fireball summoned through Sight, dealing <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of M.ATK + <color=#44afee>%s</color>) Fire magic damage to them and stunning them for <color=#44afee>2</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_1310128"]="Attack with a blast of telekinetic force, dealing a total of (<color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of M.ATK + <color=#44afee>%s</color>) Ghost magic damage to enemy units within the area. If there are multiple targets in the area, the damage will be distributed evenly to all of them (up to a maximum of <color=#44afee>8</color> targets).",
    ["SkillDesc_1310129"]="Attacks a target <color=#44afee>5</color> times in a row using Ghost Power, dealing Ghost attribute M.DMG equal to (<color=#44afee>%s%%</color> M.ATK + %s). Napalm Vulcan has a <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> chance to deal double damage. When the target takes damage, there's a <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> chance of being <color=#44afee>cursed</color>, reducing their Final HP by <color=#44afee>15%%</color> and healing received by <color=#44afee>50%%</color> for <color=#44afee>6</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_1310130"]="Calls earth spikes to erupt from the ground, dealing (<color=#44afee>%s%%</color> M.ATK + <color=#44afee>%s</color>) Earth magic damage to enemy units within <color=#44afee>4</color> meters. The skill has a <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> chance to stun the target for <color=#44afee>3</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_1310131"]="Commands spikes to protrude from the ground near the target, dealing Earth attribute M.DMG equal to (<color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of M.ATK + <color=#44afee>%s</color>) to a single enemy target. Every <color=#44afee>%s</color> point(s) of INT will increase the skill coefficient of M.ATK by an additional <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_1310132"]="Creates a barrier at the specified location. You and all party members will be <color=#44afee>immune to melee physical damage</color> for <color=#44afee>%s</color> seconds within the barrier. The barrier can take up to <color=#44afee>%s</color> hits.",
    ["SkillDesc_1310133"]="Summons a fire pillar, dealing (<color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of M.ATK (every <color=#44afee>%s</color> INT increases the damage by <color=#44afee>1%%</color> up to <color=#44afee>880%%</color> +<color=#44afee>%s</color>) Fire attribute M.DMG to a single enemy target. If the target is ignited, they will be detonated, dealing (<color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of M.ATK (every <color=#44afee>%s</color> INT increases the damage by <color=#44afee>1%%</color> up to <color=#44afee>1,980%%</color> + <color=#44afee>%s</color>) Fire attribute M.DMG to all enemy units within <color=#44afee>3</color> meters of them. The detonation does not ignite targets.",
    ["SkillDesc_1310134"]="Creates a quagmire with a radius of <color=#44afee>4</color> meters at the specified location. Enemy units within the quagmire will have their Movement Speed decreased by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>, Final ASPD decreased by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>, and Final Haste decreased by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>. The quagmire lasts for <color=#44afee>7</color> seconds, and units in the quagmire have a <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> chance per second for their Armor's attribute to switch to Earth. This Earth attribute effect lasts for <color=#44afee>3</color> seconds. This skill is ineffective against MVP, Mini, and Boss monsters.",
    ["SkillDesc_1311121"]="Channels for <color=#44afee>%s</color> seconds, summoning <color=#44afee>%s</color> meteors to rain down at the specified location. Each meteor deals (<color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of M.ATK + <color=#44afee>%s</color>) Fire magic damage to the enemy unit hit and has a <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> chance to stun the target for <color=#44afee>3</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_1311122"]="Release a powerful electric shock at the specified location, dealing (<color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of M.ATK + <color=#44afee>%s</color>) Wind magic damage to enemies within the area <color=#44afee>6</color> times. Has a <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> chance to Blind enemies in range for <color=#44afee>10</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_1311123"]="Freezes the air nearby, dealing (<color=#44afee>%s%%</color> M.ATK + <color=#44afee>%s</color>) Water magic damage to enemy units in a <color=#44afee>4</color> meter radius, and has a <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> chance to freeze them for <color=#44afee>3</color> seconds. While frozen, the target's Armor attribute will become <color=#44afee>Water</color>, their M.DEF will be decreased by <color=#44afee>20%%</color>, and their HP and SP will not recover naturally. When the frozen effect is dispelled in advance due to being attacked, the Water armor attribute effect will persist for another <color=#44afee>3</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_1311124"]="Rapidly amplifies the gravity at the specified location, dealing Earth magic damage (equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of magic attack + <color=#44afee>%s</color>) every <color=#44afee>0.5</color> seconds to enemy units within the area for <color=#44afee>%s</color> seconds. Damage reduces by <color=#44afee>10%%</color> chance every time it deals and have a chance to stun enemies for <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> seconds for <color=#44afee>2</color>. If the target was not stunned, slows them by <color=#44afee>40%%</color> for <color=#44afee>4</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_1311125"]="After using this skill, increases Final M.DMG Bonus of all party members within 30 meters by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> for <color=#44afee>30</color> seconds. Loses its effect when the caster is more than 30 meters away.",
    ["SkillDesc_1311126"]="Increases Max SP by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> and increases your M.ATK by Max SP/<color=#44afee>100</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_1311131"]="Consume a Blue Gemstone to create a quagmire at the specified location. Enemy units that enter the area will have their MSPD and ASPD lowered by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> and all their <color=#44afee>Hasten</color> effects will be dispelled. If an enemy remains in the quagmire for 2 seconds, they will be petrified for <color=#44afee>7</color> seconds. While having the Petrify effect, their armor attribute will become Earth, DEF will be increased by <color=#44afee>25%%</color>, M.DEF will be reduced by <color=#44afee>25%%</color>, HP and SP will not recover naturally, and lose <color=#44afee>1%%</color> HP every <color=#44afee>5</color> seconds. When the target's HP is less than <color=#44afee>25%%</color>, they will stop taking damage. When the Petrify effect is dispelled, the Earth armor attribute effect will persist for another <color=#44afee>3</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_1311132"]="All Fire attribute skills have a <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> chance to inflict Kindle on the enemy unit on hit. While under the effect of Kindle, targets will take Fire attribute M.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of the caster's M.ATK per second for each stack, stacking up to <color=#44afee>4</color> times. Additionally, the enemies receive <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> more Fire attribute DMG from the caster for <color=#44afee>8</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_1311133"]="Deals (<color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of M.ATK + <color=#44afee>%s</color>) Wind magic damage to an enemy. If other enemy units are near the target, Chain Lightning will automatically bounce to and hit them, bouncing up to <color=#44afee>%s</color> times. If there are no other targets to bounce to, Chain Lightning will deal the remaining damage to the current target up to <color=#44afee>2</color> times.",
    ["SkillDesc_1311134"]="After casting a Ghost attribute skill, there is a <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> chance to gain <color=#44afee>1</color> stack of <color=#44afee>Intense Telekinesis</color>, reducing fixed cast time by <color=#44afee>0.2</color> seconds, increasing Ghost attribute enhancement by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>, and reducing SP consumption by <color=#44afee>5%%</color>. This effect lasts for <color=#44afee>6</color> seconds and can stack up to <color=#44afee>6</color> times.",
    ["SkillDesc_1312001"]="Shrouds an enemy unit in a thin, transparent layer of telekinetic energy. Has a <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> chance to immobilize the target for <color=#44afee>5</color> seconds (has no effect on bosses). While immobilized, increases damage dealt by the caster with other Ghost skills by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>. Regardless of whether the target is immobilized, once White Imprison dissipates, the target takes Ghost magic damage equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of M.ATK.",
    ["SkillDesc_1312002"]="Uses telekinesis to deal ghost attribute M.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of M.ATK to a faraway single enemy target. While the target is under the effect of White Imprison or their HP falls below <color=#44afee>30%%</color>, this skill deals <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> increased damage and resets its cooldown.",
    ["SkillDesc_1312003"]="Shrouds yourself in a thin, transparent layer of telekinetic energy, turning your armor attribute into <color=#44afee>Ghost</color> and making you immune to damage in all attributes (except damage from MVP, MINI, and Boss) other than Ghost damage for <color=#44afee>5</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_1312004"]="Increases the distance of all ranged skills cast by <color=#44afee>%s</color> meter(s).",
    ["SkillDesc_1312005"]="Greatly increases the caster's understanding of magic, increasing Magic Penetration by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> but also increasing SP cost by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_1312006"]="Each time you use an active skill for your current class that is of the Wind, Earth, Water, or Fire attribute, you gain the corresponding attribute orb. Each attribute orb enhances that attribute by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>. There can be a maximum of <color=#44afee>4</color> attribute orbs at the same time and <color=#44afee>4</color> of the same attribute orbs. The attribute orbs last <color=#44afee>20</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_1312007"]="Spends all of your current attribute orbs, each dealing magic damage of the corresponding attribute equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of Magic Attack to the enemy unit. Deals <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> Neutral magic damage instead if there are no attribute orbs. When spending 4 of the same attribute orbs, inflicts the enemy with the following debuffs for <color=#44afee>3</color> seconds:\n Fire: Inflicts the target with <color=#44afee>Burn</color>, causing them to lose <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of their Max HP every second (not effective for Bosses, MVPs, and MINIs).\n Water: Reduces the target's Freeze Resistance by <color=#44afee>50%%</color> and inflicts the target with <color=#44afee>Freeze</color>.\n Earth: Reduces the target's Petrify Resistance by <color=#44afee>50%%</color> and inflicts the target with <color=#44afee>Petrify</color>.\n Wind: Reduces the target's Blind Resistance by <color=#44afee>50%%</color> and inflicts the target with <color=#44afee>Blind</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_1312008"]="When you deal Water damage to a target frozen by you, their Freeze is removed and you are not granted the effect of Water Armor Extension. You also deal Water magic damage equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of M.ATK to the target. Removing <color=#44afee>Freeze</color> does not affect the next application of <color=#44afee>Freeze</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_1312009"]="Upon dealing damage to the target with Wind skills, there is a <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> chance to inflict the target with <color=#44afee>Electrify</color> for <color=#44afee>6</color> seconds. When two enemy targets with <color=#44afee>Electrify</color> come within <color=#44afee>4</color> meters of each other, current flows between them to form a chain lightning which then seeks out another target under the effect of <color=#44afee>Electrify</color> within <color=#44afee>4</color> meters of them. The chain lightning deals Wind magic damage equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of M.ATK to each unit under the effect of <color=#44afee>Electrify</color> and removes the <color=#44afee>Electrify</color> effect from them.",
    ["SkillDesc_1312010"]="Creates a lightning storm that follows the target, dealing Wind magic damage equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of M.ATK every 0.5 seconds to the target and an area of <color=#44afee>3</color> meters around the target. It also inflicts <color=#44afee>Confuse</color> on all enemies within range. Enemies under the effect of <color=#44afee>Confuse</color> will move erratically for <color=#44afee>6</color> seconds. Each target can only take damage from one Confusion Storm from the same caster, but can be hit by Confusion Storms from different casters.",
    ["SkillDesc_1312011"]="Spreads an icy fog, with a <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> chance of converting enemy armor attributes to water attributes for <color=#44afee>6</color> sec. Enemies in range are also inflicted with <color=#44afee>Frost Misty</color>, reducing their Movement Speed by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> for the duration of the effect and granting a <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> chance of being <color=#44afee>Frozen</color> for <color=#44afee>3</color> sec after taking damage. Frost Misty’s effect lasts for <color=#44afee>6</color> and is cleared after triggering Frozen.",
    ["SkillDesc_1312012"]="Unleashes a powerful quake within a specified range, dealing Earth Magic Damage equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> Magic Attack with a <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> chance of inflicting Petrify for <color=#44afee>3</color> sec. Targets within range will be forced towards the center of the attack.",
    ["SkillDesc_1312013"]="Shrouds yourself in the power of flames, charging <color=#44afee>8</color> meters in the specified direction and dealing Fire magic damage equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of M.ATK to each enemy unit in your path. You also leave behind a <color=#44afee>3</color>-meter-wide Path of Fire, inflicting <color=#44afee>Burn</color> on enemies within it and causing them to lose <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of their Max HP every second (Not effective against Boss monsters, MVP, MINI). The Path of Fire lasts <color=#44afee>7</color> seconds. Targets on the path will be slowed by a further <color=#44afee>50%%</color>. This skill can be recharged for<color=#44afee>2</color> times",
    ["SkillDesc_1312014"]="While within the range of the Path of Fire or Fire Wall, grants yourself <color=#44afee>Flame Guard</color>. While under the effect of Flame Guard, grants yourself a shield equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of Max HP for <color=#44afee>6</color> seconds. Triggers once every <color=#44afee>12</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_1312015"]="When you inflict Earth damage on a target that was petrified by you, the target will get out of the Petrify state immediately and receive Earth attribute M.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of Max HP, up to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of ATK. The hit target will not enter the Earth Armor effect. Forcibly removing Petrify from a petrified target will curse them. Their Max HP is reduced by <color=#44afee>15%%</color>, and healing received is reduced by <color=#44afee>50%%</color> for <color=#44afee>6</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_1313001"]="When you have <color=#44afee>4</color> identical elemental energy orbs, you enter the <color=#44afee>Climax</color> state, increasing your corresponding elemental power by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>, Debuff Penetration by <color=#44afee>%s</color>, and Debuff Enhancement by <color=#44afee>%s</color>. When you have enough energy orbs under the effect of Climax, casting <color=#44afee>Crimson Arrow</color>, <color=#44afee>All Bloom</color>, <color=#44afee>Rock Down</color>, <color=#44afee>Violent Quake</color>, <color=#44afee>Frozen Slash</color>, <color=#44afee>Rain of Crystal</color>, <color=#44afee>Destructive Hurricane</color>, or <color=#44afee>Storm Cannon</color> no longer grants energy orbs but instead consumes them to add extra effect to the skills.",
    ["SkillDesc_1313002"]="Launches a fire arrow at the target, dealing Fire attribute M.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of M.ATK. While under the effect of <color=#44afee>Climax</color>, the fire arrow explodes on impact, dealing extra damage equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of the target's lost HP (capped at <color=#44afee>1,400%%</color> M.ATK). Consumes <color=#44afee>2</color> Fire energy orbs when cast.",
    ["SkillDesc_1313003"]="Summons a flower field at the designated location, where flame buds continuously explode, dealing Fire attribute M.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of M.ATK to all targets within a <color=#44afee>6</color>-meter radius every <color=#44afee>0.5</color> seconds. While under the effect of <color=#44afee>Climax</color>, the exploding flame buds will trigger the target's <color=#44afee>Kindle</color> effect, dealing extra Fire attribute M.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>0.9%%</color> of Max HP to the target (capped at <color=#44afee>250%%</color>) for <color=#44afee>4</color> seconds. Consumes <color=#44afee>4</color> Fire energy orbs when cast.",
    ["SkillDesc_1313004"]="Hurls a boulder at the target, dealing Earth attribute M.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of M.ATK. While under the effect of <color=#44afee>Climax</color>, it deals extra Earth attribute M.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of M.ATK. After Rock Down deals damage, there's a (<color=#44afee>30%%</color> + INT/<color=#44afee>%s</color> x <color=#44afee>1%%</color>) chance to inflict <color=#44afee>Curse</color> to the target (the increased chance from INT will not exceed <color=#44afee>40%%</color>). Consumes <color=#44afee>2</color> Earth energy orbs when cast.",
    ["SkillDesc_1313005"]="Triggers an earthquake at the target to make the rocks randomly emerge from the ground, dealing Earth attribute M.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of M.ATK within a <color=#44afee>6</color>-meter radius every <color=#44afee>1</color> second for <color=#44afee>4</color> seconds. While under the effect of <color=#44afee>Climax</color>, the rocks emerge at <color=#44afee>2</color> times the original speed and there's a (<color=#44afee>20%%</color> + INT/<color=#44afee>%s</color> x <color=#44afee>1%%</color>) chance to inflict <color=#44afee>Petrify</color> to the target (the increased chance from INT will not exceed <color=#44afee>30%%</color>). Consumes <color=#44afee>4</color> Earth energy orbs when cast.",
    ["SkillDesc_1313006"]="Unleashes <color=#44afee>5</color> sharp ice shards at targets within <color=#44afee>6</color> meters, dealing Water attribute M.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of M.ATK to each target. While under the effect of <color=#44afee>Climax</color>, it deals extra Water attribute M.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of M.ATK. After Frozen Slash deals damage, there's a (<color=#44afee>20%%</color> + INT/<color=#44afee>%s</color> x <color=#44afee>1%%</color>) chance to inflict <color=#44afee>Frost Misty</color> to the target (the increased chance from INT will not exceed <color=#44afee>40%%</color>). Consumes <color=#44afee>2</color> Water energy orbs when cast.",
    ["SkillDesc_1313007"]="Calls down the rain of crystals centered around you, dealing Water attribute M.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of M.ATK to all enemies within a <color=#44afee>6</color>-meter radius every <color=#44afee>0.5</color> second for <color=#44afee>4</color> seconds. While under the effect of <color=#44afee>Climax</color>, the duration is extended by <color=#44afee>2</color> seconds. After dealing damage, there's a (<color=#44afee>20%%</color> + INT/<color=#44afee>%s</color> x <color=#44afee>1%%</color>) chance to inflict <color=#44afee>Freeze</color> to the target (the increased chance from INT will not exceed <color=#44afee>30%%</color>). Consumes <color=#44afee>4</color> Water energy orbs when cast.",
    ["SkillDesc_1313008"]="Unleashes a tornado around you, dealing Wind attribute M.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of M.ATK to all enemies within a <color=#44afee>6</color>-meter radius. While under the effect of <color=#44afee>Climax</color>, it deals extra Wind attribute M.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of M.ATK. After Destructive Hurricane deals damage, it knocks back enemies <color=#44afee>6</color> meters and launches them into the air for <color=#44afee>1.5</color> seconds. Consumes <color=#44afee>2</color> Wind energy orbs when cast.",
    ["SkillDesc_1313009"]="Channels for <color=#44afee>4</color> seconds, continuously launching storms at the target and dealing Wind attribute M.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of M.ATK to all targets along the straight line every <color=#44afee>0.5</color>. While under the effect of <color=#44afee>Climax</color>, the storm range is enlarged by <color=#44afee>4</color> and there's a (<color=#44afee>20%%</color> + INT/<color=#44afee>%s</color> x <color=#44afee>1%%</color>) chance to inflict <color=#44afee>Blind</color> to the target (the increased chance from INT will not exceed <color=#44afee>30%%</color>). Consumes <color=#44afee>4</color> Wind energy orbs when cast.",
    ["SkillDesc_1313010"]="When <color=#44afee>Intense Telekinesis</color> is fully stacked, <color=#44afee>Soul Strike</color> is replaced by <color=#44afee>Soul Vulcan Strike</color>. After a <color=#44afee>1.2</color>-second cast time, <color=#44afee>Soul Vulcan Strike</color> deals Ghost attribute M.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> to the target.",
    ["SkillDesc_1313011"]="Frozen targets will no longer have the <color=#44afee>Freeze</color> effect removed immediately upon taking damage. The <color=#44afee>Freeze</color> effect will only be removed once the accumulated damage equals <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of the target's Max HP. <color=#44afee>Jack Frost</color> can still instantly remove the target's <color=#44afee>Freeze</color> effect.",
    ["SkillDesc_1313012"]="Petrified targets will no longer have the <color=#44afee>Petrify</color> effect removed immediately upon taking damage. The <color=#44afee>Petrify</color> effect will only be removed once the accumulated damage equals <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of the target's Max HP. <color=#44afee>Sienna Execrate</color> can still instantly remove the target's <color=#44afee>Petrify</color> effect.",
    ["SkillDesc_1313013"]="When <color=#44afee>Intense Telekinesis</color> is fully stacked, <color=#44afee>Soul Strike</color> is replaced by <color=#44afee>Soul Vulcan Strike</color>. After a <color=#44afee>1.2</color>-second cast time, <color=#44afee>Soul Vulcan Strike</color> deals Ghost attribute M.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> to the target.",
    ["SkillDesc_1320001"]="Increases INT by <color=#44afee>%s</color> and enables moving while casting magic, but reduces Final Magic Damage by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_1320002"]="When released, a magic barrier is applied to all party members within a <color=#44afee>12</color>-meter radius for <color=#44afee>8</color> seconds, blocking <color=#44afee>%s</color> hit(s) of M.DMG dealt by skills, with every <color=#44afee>1,000</color> INT increasing the times of blocking by 1, up to <color=#44afee>10</color> times.\nEach time damage is successfully blocked, <color=#44afee>4%%</color> of your Max SP is consumed, increasing the attacker's fixed cooldown by <color=#44afee>0.5</color> seconds and your Final M.DMG Bonus by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>. These effects last for <color=#44afee>10</color> seconds, stacking up to <color=#44afee>10</color> times.\nThe skill can only be released if your remaining SP is higher than <color=#44afee>60%%</color> of your Max SP, and if your SP drops below <color=#44afee>20%%</color> of your Max SP, all barrier effects will be removed.",
    ["SkillDesc_1320003"]="Deals M.ATK ×[<color=#44afee>%s%%</color>] Neutral magic damage to enemies within a [<color=#44afee>4</color>]m radius and inflicts [<color=#44afee>Spell Breaker</color>] on them for [<color=#44afee>%s</color>] seconds. If an enemy attempts to <color=#44afee>cast</color>, <color=#44afee>chant</color>, or <color=#44afee>channel</color> while [<color=#44afee>Spell Breaker</color>] is in effect, their skill is interrupted and they are [<color=#44afee>silenced</color>] for [<color=#44afee>3</color>] seconds, and the effect of Spell Breaker is removed then. [<color=#44afee>Spell Breaker</color>] can only be triggered once each time.",
    ["SkillDesc_1320004"]="Reduces the M.DEF of enemies within a specified [<color=#44afee>4</color>]m area by [<color=#44afee>%s%%</color>] for [<color=#44afee>%s</color>] seconds, with a [<color=#44afee>%s%%</color>] chance to remove [<color=#44afee>1</color>] buff from the target. Buffs cannot be removed from an <color=#44afee>MVP</color>, <color=#44afee>MINI</color>, or Instance <color=#44afee>Boss</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_1320005"]="When equipped with a book weapon, normal attacks become close-range magic attacks, and M.ATK is increased by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>. For every <color=#44afee>15</color> <color=#44afee>INT</color>, increases Final ASPD by <color=#44afee>1%%</color>. When equipped with a two-handed book, increases your Final ASPD by an additional <color=#44afee>20%%</color> for every <color=#44afee>1</color> level the weapon has been refined.",
    ["SkillDesc_1320006"]="When <color=#44afee>Auto Spell</color> is released, if Sage is equipped with a <color=#44afee>Book</color> weapon, there's a <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> chance (every <color=#44afee>40</color> INT increases the chance by <color=#44afee>1%%</color>, up to <color=#44afee>20%%</color>) to cast Elemental Arrow to the target. The level of the Elemental Arrow will be divided by <color=#44afee>3</color>, rounded down, with every <color=#44afee>750</color> INT increasing the level by <color=#44afee>1</color>, up to <color=#44afee>4</color> levels. This lasts for <color=#44afee>%s</color> second(s). The triggered type of Elemental Arrow is related to the consumed medium (<color=#44afee>Great Earth</color>/<color=#44afee>Flame Heart</color>/<color=#44afee>Mystic Frozen</color>/<color=#44afee>Rough Wind</color>).",
    ["SkillDesc_1320007"]="Sages have come to understand the mysteries of magic through long-term melee combat experience. After an Elemental Arrow triggered by their <color=#44afee>Auto Spell</color> hits a target, they inflict an <color=#44afee>Elemental Mark</color> on them. Whenever a party member deals Earth, Fire, Water, or Wind damage while <color=#44afee>Elemental Mark</color> is in effect, the target will take <color=#44afee>%s</color> corresponding Earth, Fire, Water, or Wind magic damage (the attribute of damage dealt by Elemental Mark is the same as the attribute of damage triggering it, and no damage will be triggered for Neutral damage). The mark lasts for <color=#44afee>2</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_1320008"]="When dealing Earth, Fire, Water, or Wind damage to enemies who are under the effect of [<color=#44afee>Elemental Mark</color>] (all Elemental Marks inflicted by yourself and party members on enemies can be triggered), Earth, Fire, Water, or Wind enhancement will be increased by [<color=#44afee>%s%%</color>] according to the type of damage dealt (this effect does not apply when Neutral damage is dealt). At the same time, Final M. PEN and M.ATK percentage will be increased by [<color=#44afee>%s%%</color>] and [<color=#44afee>%s%%</color>] respectively for [<color=#44afee>3</color>] seconds (additionally increases Final M.PEN by 1%% for every 100 INT).",
    ["SkillDesc_1320009"]="The Sage enters the [<color=#44afee>Habitual Casting</color>] state when releasing [<color=#44afee>2</color>] Elemental Arrows of the same attribute. While in this state, the cast time of Elemental Arrows of the same attribute is reduced by [<color=#44afee>%s</color>] seconds, lasting [<color=#44afee>%s</color>] seconds. The [<color=#44afee>Habitual Casting</color>] state is removed after it is triggered once.",
    ["SkillDesc_1320010"]="Increases the cast range of <color=#44afee>Heaven's Drive</color>, <color=#44afee>Fire Bolt</color>, <color=#44afee>Cold Bolt</color>, and <color=#44afee>Lightning Bolt</color> by <color=#44afee>%s</color>m.",
    ["SkillDesc_1320011"]="Enters the [<color=#44afee>Enhanced Elemental Arrow</color>] state after casting a skill, which increases the range of the corresponding Elemental Arrows you cast to a [<color=#44afee>3</color>]m radius. [<color=#44afee>Enhanced Elemental Arrow</color>] lasts for <color=#44afee>%s</color>] seconds. The triggered type of Enhanced Elemental Arrow is related to the <color=#44afee>1</color> consumed medium (<color=#44afee>Great Earth</color>/<color=#44afee>Flame Heart</color>/<color=#44afee>Mystic Frozen</color>/<color=#44afee>Rough Wind</color>).",
    ["SkillDesc_1320012"]="Creates an <color=#44afee>8</color> × <color=#44afee>8</color>m elemental field around you that lasts for <color=#44afee>%s</color> seconds. The attribute of the elemental field will correspond to the consumed medium (Great Earth/Flame Heart/Mystic Frozen/Rough Wind). Field effect: Deals magic damage of the corresponding attribute ×<color=#44afee>%s%%</color> to all enemy targets within range every second and reduces damage taken from the corresponding attribute in the field by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>. Only <color=#44afee>1</color> type of elemental field can exist at any time. The creation of a new elemental field will terminate the previous elemental field. If there are multiple elemental fields of the same attribute, their effects do not stack. Costs <color=#44afee>1</color> Yellow Gemstone.",
    ["SkillDesc_1321001"]="Converts [<color=#44afee>%s%%</color>] of <color=#44afee>Max SP</color> to [<color=#44afee>%s%%</color>] of <color=#44afee>Max HP</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_1321002"]="Exchange SP with the target player. After the exchange, the target gains your current SP and you gain <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of the target's Max SP. When the target is an enemy player, the target will be inflicted with <color=#44afee>Deplete</color>, which prevents them from recovering SP. While under the <color=#44afee>Deplete</color> status, 10%% of Max SP is deducted every second. The player cannot recover SP by consuming potions or regenerating SP naturally. <color=#44afee>Deplete</color> lasts for <color=#44afee>5</color> seconds. When the target is a monster, restores your SP by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of Max SP.",
    ["SkillDesc_1321003"]="When casting <color=#44afee>Spell Breaker</color>, <color=#44afee>Dispell</color>, or <color=#44afee>Soul Change</color> on an enemy player, deals Neutral damage equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of your Max SP to them.",
    ["SkillDesc_1321004"]="When an enemy player casts <color=#44afee>Spell Breaker</color>, <color=#44afee>Dispell</color>, or <color=#44afee>Soul Change</color>, the target has a <color=#44afee>Mental Breakdown</color>m which has a <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> chance to reduce the target's M.ATK by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> and M.DEF by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> for <color=#44afee>6</color> seconds. This has no effect on Boss, Mini, or MVP targets.",
    ["SkillDesc_1321005"]="Shoots spider webs at the target, immobilizing them for <color=#44afee>%s</color> seconds. Increases the damage the target takes from Fire attribute attacks by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>. The immobilization effect ends early after an <color=#44afee>immobilized</color> target takes Fire damage <color=#44afee>%s</color> times.",
    ["SkillDesc_1321006"]="Enchants the weapon, granting yourself the <color=#44afee>Spell Fist state</color>. <color=#44afee>Spell Fist</color> changes the attribute of your weapon to a corresponding element depending on the consumed medium (<color=#44afee>Great Earth</color>/<color=#44afee>Flame Heart</color>/<color=#44afee>Mystic Frozen</color>/<color=#44afee>Rough Wind</color>). While the <color=#44afee>Spell Fist</color> is active, the Final Hit is increased by an extra <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> and every <color=#44afee>50</color> INT increases the Final Hit by an additional <color=#44afee>1%%</color>. Normal attacks made while Spell Fist is in effect have a <color=#44afee>20%%</color> chance to deal additional corresponding attribute M.DMG equal to M.ATK x <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> to the target 6 times. <color=#44afee>Spell Fist</color> lasts for <color=#44afee>600</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_1321007"]="Sages comprehend the secrets of battle once again, using the power of magic to enhance weapons. <color=#44afee>Striking</color> lasts for <color=#44afee>%s</color> seconds. While this status is in effect, increases the damage you deal to the target by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> for every 1%% Max HP they lose during this time.\nCosts 1 Red Gemstone.",
    ["SkillDesc_1321008"]="Extensive studying of elements has increased the <color=#44afee>Earth</color>/<color=#44afee>Fire</color>/<color=#44afee>Water</color>/<color=#44afee>Wind</color> damage of Sages by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_1321009"]="After actively casting Fire Bolt, Cold Bolt, Lightning Bolt, or Heaven's Drive, there is a <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> chance to enter the <color=#44afee>Memorize</color> state. <color=#44afee>Memorize</color> lasts for <color=#44afee>2</color> seconds. <color=#44afee>Memorize</color> also makes the next Elemental Bolt cast instantly. Elemental Bolts cast in the <color=#44afee>Memorize</color> state will not trigger <color=#44afee>Memorize</color> and other skills related to Elemental Bolts.",
    ["SkillDesc_1321010"]="After actively casting Fire Bolt, Cold Bolt, Lightning Bolt, or Heaven's Drive, there is a <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> chance to double the damage immediately. Elemental Arrows cast through Double Casting will not trigger <color=#44afee>Memorize</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_1321011"]="Extensive studying of monsters has increased your DMG Reduction against damage dealt by Fire, Water, Wind, and Earth monsters by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> and increased your damage dealt to Fire, Water, Wind, and Earth monsters by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_1321012"]="After you and your party members leave the elemental field, the field's effect will last for another <color=#44afee>%s</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_1322001"]="Deals M.ATK ×<color=#44afee>%s%%</color> Fire magic damage in a <color=#44afee>4</color>m radius around you, removes all debuffs on you, and summons Warmer to protect you. <color=#44afee>Warmer</color> lasts for <color=#44afee>%s</color> seconds. During this time, you are immune to upcoming <color=#44afee>Freeze</color> and <color=#44afee>Slow</color> effects (immunity does not apply to effects from MVP, Mini, and Boss units). This skill can still be cast even when you are controlled or silenced.",
    ["SkillDesc_1322002"]="Turns rocks within a specified <color=#44afee>4</color>-meter area into hard spears that stab out from the ground under the enemy's feet, dealing Earth attribute M.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of M.ATK (every 8 INT increases the damage by <color=#44afee>1%%</color> up to <color=#44afee>1,500%%</color>) and reducing the MSPD of targets within range by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> for <color=#44afee>%s</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_1322003"]="Deals Water attribute M.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of M.ATK (every 12 INT increases the damage by <color=#44afee>1%%</color> up to <color=#44afee>1,000%%</color>) to enemies within range, with a <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> chance to <color=#44afee>freeze</color> the target for <color=#44afee>3</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_1322004"]="Summons several giant bolts of lightning to strike the target, dealing Wind attribute M.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of M.ATK (every 12 INT increases the damage by <color=#44afee>1%%</color> up to <color=#44afee>1000%%</color>) to the target and enemies within a <color=#44afee>4</color>-meter radius of the target. There is a <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> chance to <color=#44afee>stun</color> the hit target for <color=#44afee>%s</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_1322005"]="Sorcerers can sign a pact of life & magic with elemental spirits to summon powerful elemental spirits. Elemental spirits will exist in the form of a <color=#44afee>shield</color> that protects the Sorcerer (the shield's value is equal to the Sage's M.ATK x 900%%, up to 300%% of the caster's Max HP). The shield's value is affected by the increased percentage of the Max HP. Only 1 elemental spirit can exist at a time, and it consumes <color=#44afee>%s</color> SP every second while it exists. The elemental spirit disappears when the <color=#44afee>shield</color> is depleted or you run out of <color=#44afee>SP</color>, and it exists for up to <color=#44afee>%s</color> second(s). The elemental spirit inherits some stats of the Sage. The attribute of the summoned spirit is related to the consumed medium (<color=#44afee>Great Earth</color>/<color=#44afee>Flame Heart</color>/<color=#44afee>Mystic Frozen</color>/<color=#44afee>Rough Wind</color>).",
    ["SkillDesc_1322006"]="Stimulates the potential of spirits, inspiring Earth Spirits to comprehend <color=#44afee>Gravitational Field</color>, Fire Spirits to comprehend <color=#44afee>Meteor Storm</color>, Water Spirits to comprehend <color=#44afee>Storm Gust</color>, and Wind Spirits to comprehend <color=#44afee>Lord of Vermilion</color>. When an elemental spirit is on the field, you can command it to continuously channel for <color=#44afee>%s</color> seconds and cast the above skills at the target <color=#44afee>4</color>m area. The above skills deal M.ATK ×<color=#44afee>%s%%</color> magic damage of the corresponding attribute to targets within range of the skills every <color=#44afee>0.5</color> seconds. Other special effects of the skills remain unchanged. When possessed by an elemental spirit, the above skills do not need to be continuously channeled and can be cast instantly, but the damage will be reduced by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_1322007"]="Elemental power bursts out as the currently summoned elemental spirit is sacrificed to create a Lightdark Wall for each party member for [<color=#44afee>%s</color>] seconds. While the Lightdark Wall exists, all party members in the area are immune to upcoming melee and ranged physical damage [<color=#44afee>%s</color>] times. The number of times is deducted when any member within range takes melee or ranged damage, and the number of times is shared.",
    ["SkillDesc_1322008"]="Increases the damage dealt by spirits by [<color=#44afee>%s%%</color>]. When a spirit exists, the Sorcerer gains 1 stack of [Spirit Sympathy] every [2] seconds, which increases the corresponding elemental enhancement by [<color=#44afee>%s%%</color>], up to [<color=#44afee>%s</color>] stacks. Also, increases Sorcerer's MSPD in battle by [<color=#44afee>%s</color>]. [Spirit Sympathy] is removed when the current spirit dies or a new spirit is summoned. The complete effect of [Spirit Sympathy] continues when you are possessed by a spirit and will be removed after the possession ends.",
    ["SkillDesc_1322009"]="Grants the Sorcerer an elemental insignia that has a range of <color=#44afee>4</color>m. This insignia is of the same attribute as the summoned spirit, and all party members of the same attribute will recover HP equal to their own M.ATK ×<color=#44afee>%s%%</color> every second. Enemy units of the countered attribute within range will lose HP equal to their own M.ATK ×<color=#44afee>%s%%</color> every second. This effect lasts for <color=#44afee>20</color> seconds. This skill can only be cast when an elemental spirit exists.",
    ["SkillDesc_1322010"]="Channels for <color=#44afee>4</color> seconds. While channeling, consumes <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of your Max HP every second to restore the spirit's HP by the summoner's M.ATK ×<color=#44afee>%s%%</color> until the spirit's HP has been restored to its initial Max HP. This skill is terminated when your HP is insufficient to meet the cost and can only be cast when your HP is equal to 30%% of your Max HP at least.",
    ["SkillDesc_1322011"]="Sacrifices a summoned elemental spirit to transfer its power to yourself in the form of elemental possession for <color=#44afee>%s</color> seconds, granting you the following effects according to the attribute of the sacrificed spirit:\nTera: Changes the Sorcerer's armor and weapon attribute to Earth and reduces the damage taken by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>. Successful Book attacks have a 50%% chance to reduce the enemy's ASPD and MSPD within a 2x4m area in front of you by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> and <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>, respectively, for 3 seconds.\nAgni: Changes the Sorcerer's armor and weapon attribute to Fire and increases MSPD by <color=#44afee>%s</color>. Expands the range of Advanced Book's melee attacks to a 4m fan-shaped area with a 180-degree angle.\nAqua: Changes the Sorcerer's armor and weapon attribute to Water and summons crashing waves within 4m of the Sorcerer, dealing Water attribute M.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of M.ATK to enemies within range every 1 second. Meanwhile, enemies within range are knocked back 4m, and their MSPD is reduced by 40%% for 2 seconds.\nVentus: Changes the Sorcerer's armor and weapon attribute to Wind. When taking damage, there is a <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> chance to attack the attacker with a chain lightning, dealing Wind attribute M.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> x M.ATK to them and blinding them for 2 seconds. This effect can only be triggered once every 0.2 seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_1322012"]="Give orders to the spirit, enabling the skill to put it in attack mode, or disabling the skill to put it in defense mode. In attack mode, the spirit assists the Sorcerer in attacking. In defense mode, the spirit does not actively attack and will recover ([<color=#44afee>%s%%</color>] + [<color=#44afee>%s%%</color>] × the depleted shield percentage) Max Shield every second. Meanwhile, [<color=#44afee>%s%%</color>] of the damage taken by the spirit will be borne by the Sorcerer instead. This skill is set to attack mode by default.",
    ["SkillDesc_1323001"]="Causes the ground to rise in a <color=#44afee>6</color>-meter radius, dealing Earth attribute M.DMG equal to (<color=#44afee>%s%%</color> +INT/<color=#44afee>%s</color> x <color=#44afee>1%%</color>, up to <color=#44afee>400%%</color> of the caster's M.ATK) every <color=#44afee>0.5</color> seconds over a duration of <color=#44afee>5</color> seconds. When Tera, the Earth Spirit, is present, the total damage coefficient of Terra Drive is increased to <color=#44afee>%s</color> and there's a <color=#44afee>15%%</color> chance to inflict <color=#44afee>Crystallize</color> to the enemies, preventing them from moving and attacking and changing their armor attribute to Earth (Terra Drive is unaffected by Earth attribute armor with Crystallize) for <color=#44afee>6</color> seconds. <color=#44afee>Crystallize</color> can be resisted with Petrify Resistance.",
    ["SkillDesc_1323002"]="Engulfs the ground with searing flames in a <color=#44afee>6</color>-meter radius, dealing Fire attribute M.DMG equal to (<color=#44afee>%s%%</color> +INT/<color=#44afee>%s</color> x <color=#44afee>1%%</color>, up to <color=#44afee>400%%</color> of the caster's M.ATK) every <color=#44afee>0.5</color> seconds over a duration of <color=#44afee>5</color> seconds. When Agni, the Fire Spirit, is present, the total damage coefficient of Conflagration is increased to <color=#44afee>%s</color> and there's a <color=#44afee>5%%</color> chance to inflict <color=#44afee>Firestorm</color> to the enemies, triggering <color=#44afee>a</color> fire explosion every <color=#44afee>2</color> seconds and dealing <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> Fire attribute damage to the target. <color=#44afee>Firestorm</color> lasts for <color=#44afee>6</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_1323003"]="Summons a powerful blizzard across a <color=#44afee>6</color>-meter radius, dealing Water attribute M.DMG equal to (<color=#44afee>%s%%</color> +INT/<color=#44afee>%s</color> x <color=#44afee>1%%</color>, up to <color=#44afee>400%%</color> of the caster's M.ATK) every <color=#44afee>0.5</color> seconds over a duration of <color=#44afee>5</color> seconds. When Aqua, the Water Spirit, is present, the total damage coefficient of Diamond Storm is increased to <color=#44afee>%s</color> and there's a <color=#44afee>15%%</color> chance to inflict <color=#44afee>Instant Freeze</color> to the enemies, preventing them from moving and attacking, and changing their armor attribute to Water (Diamond Storm is unaffected by Water attribute armor with Instant Freeze) for <color=#44afee>6</color> seconds. <color=#44afee>Instant Freeze</color> can be resisted with Freeze Resistance.",
    ["SkillDesc_1323004"]="Electrifies the ground across a <color=#44afee>6</color>-meter radius, dealing Wind attribute M.DMG equal to (<color=#44afee>%s%%</color> +INT/<color=#44afee>%s</color> x <color=#44afee>1%%</color>, up to <color=#44afee>400%%</color> of the caster's M.ATK) every <color=#44afee>0.5</color> seconds over a duration of <color=#44afee>5</color> seconds. When Ventus, the Wind Spirit, is present, the total damage coefficient of Lightning Land is increased to <color=#44afee>%s</color> and there's a <color=#44afee>5%%</color> chance to inflict <color=#44afee>Conductive</color> to the enemies, triggering <color=#44afee>a</color> lightning chain every <color=#44afee>2</color> seconds and dealing <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> Wind attribute area damage to the target within a <color=#44afee>6</color>-meter radius. <color=#44afee>Conductive</color> lasts for <color=#44afee>6</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_1323005"]="Conjures a Venom Swamp within a <color=#44afee>6</color>-meter radius on the ground, dealing Poison attribute M.DMG equal to (<color=#44afee>%s%%</color> +INT/<color=#44afee>%s</color> x <color=#44afee>1%%</color>, up to <color=#44afee>400%%</color> of the caster's M.ATK) to enemies within range every <color=#44afee>0.5</color> seconds over a duration of <color=#44afee>5</color> seconds. When Serpens, the Poison Spirit, is present, the total damage coefficient of Venom Swamp is increased to <color=#44afee>%s</color> and there's a <color=#44afee>8%%</color> chance to inflict <color=#44afee>Lethal Venom</color> to the enemies, generating a <color=#44afee>4</color>-meter poison cloud every <color=#44afee>3</color> seconds and applying <color=#44afee>1</color> stack of Poison that lasts <color=#44afee>6</color> seconds to everyone within the area, stacking up to <color=#44afee>5</color> times. The poison cloud lasts for <color=#44afee>6</color> seconds. Each stack of Poison deals <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> Poison attribute M.DMG to the carrier. <color=#44afee>Lethal Venom</color> lasts for <color=#44afee>6</color> seconds. <color=#44afee>Lethal Venom</color> can be resisted with Poison Resistance.",
    ["SkillDesc_1323006"]="Elemental Spirit gains an additional HP equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of M.ATK. While an Elemental Spirit exists, your M.DMG of the corresponding attribute is increased by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>, and damage received from the corresponding attribute is reduced by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_1323007"]="While an Elemental Spirit exists, your highest Elemental Enhancement attribute can be converted to match the summoned spirit for <color=#44afee>%s</color> second(s). Summoning another spirit will automatically cancel this effect.",
    ["SkillDesc_1323008"]="Consumes <color=#44afee>1</color> Venom Energy Stone to transform the existing spirit into Serpens, the Poison Spirit, replacing <color=#44afee>one</color> previously summoned Water, Fire, Earth, or Wind Spirit. While Serpens is present, it drains <color=#44afee>%s</color> SP every second and can exist up to <color=#44afee>%s</color> second(s). Serpens can cast Elemental Shield, Spirit Possession, Elemental Action, Spirit Control, and Spirit Insignia. When possessed by Serpens, Sorcerer's armor and weapon attributes become Poison, and their Poison attribute M.DMG ignores <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of the target's M.DEF. Using Elemental Action while Serpens is present triggers <color=#44afee>Venom Dust</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_1323009"]="Sacrifices the current Elemental Spirit to grant all party members <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of Elemental Enhancement and Resistance of their corresponding attributes for <color=#44afee>%s</color> second(s). Spell Enchanting is automatically triggered when Spirit Possession is used, without entering the cooldown.",
    ["SkillDesc_1323010"]="After using Spell Fist or Spirit Possession to change the weapon attribute, the damage dealt to enemies carries the <color=#44afee>Elemental Buster</color> effect of the corresponding weapon attribute (only applies on <color=#44afee>1</color> target when multiple enemies exist), reducing <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of the target's Elemental Resistance for <color=#44afee>10</color> seconds. Once the effect ends, an additional corresponding attribute M.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of M.ATK will be dealt. Triggers <color=#44afee>once</color> every <color=#44afee>20</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_1323011"]="When  dealing normal attacks with a book weapon, there's a <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> chance to auto-cast Elemental Arrow to deal M.DMG of the corresponding attribute equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of Max SP (up to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of M.ATK). Each trigger consumes <color=#44afee>10%%</color> of Max SP, and this effect will not trigger if Max SP is below <color=#44afee>10%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_1323012"]="When Advanced Book is learned and equipped with a Spell Book, the normal attack range increases by <color=#44afee>2</color> meters. For each additional weapon refinement level, Final M.DMG Bonus is increased by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>. For every <color=#44afee>3</color> additional weapon refinement levels, the Elemental Arrow triggered by Auto Spell is increased by <color=#44afee>1</color> level, up to <color=#44afee>3</color> levels.",
    ["SkillDesc_1400121"]="When you deal normal attacks while equipped with a Dagger, there will be a <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> chance to deal <color=#44afee>double damage</color>. If Double Attack is triggered, then this attack is guaranteed to hit the target. After the Hiding status is removed, the first attack within <color=#44afee>5</color> seconds is guaranteed to be triggered.",
    ["SkillDesc_1400122"]="Increases Final Flee by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> and MSPD by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>. Fleeing increases P.ATK by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> and Final ASPD by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> for <color=#44afee>5</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_1400125"]="After using this skill, you maintain <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of your MSPD for <color=#44afee>6</color> seconds and enter the Hiding state, becoming undetectable to enemies. Actively attacking, taking damage, or being affected by anti-stealth will cancel the Hiding state. After the Hiding state is removed, you will receive an <color=#44afee>Assassinate</color> effect for <color=#44afee>3</color> seconds. Dealing damage the first time under the <color=#44afee>Assassinate</color> effect applies an Assassination mark to the first target that takes damage from you. This mark lasts for <color=#44afee>6</color> seconds. Your attacks will deal <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> increased damage to the marked target.",
    ["SkillDesc_1400130"]="Deals (<color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of ATK + <color=#44afee>%s</color>) physical damage of your weapon's attribute to an enemy target and lowers their Movement Speed by <color=#44afee>40%%</color> for <color=#44afee>5</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_1400131"]="Deals (<color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of ATK + <color=#44afee>%s</color>) physical damage of your weapon's attribute to an enemy. If used while Hiding, stuns the target for <color=#44afee>2</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_1400132"]="Attack with Venom Knife, dealing (<color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of ATK + <color=#44afee>%s</color>) physical damage of your weapon's attribute to an enemy. If the target of Venom Knife is poisoned, deals an additional <color=#44afee>100%%</color> physical damage of your weapon's attribute.",
    ["SkillDesc_1400133"]="Removes the <color=#44afee>Poison</color> status from yourself and all party members within 30 meters and makes you and your party members immune to Poison for <color=#44afee>8</color> seconds. Loses its effect when the caster is more than 30 meters away. When the Poison effect is removed by Detoxify, the target is healed for <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of their current HP.",
    ["SkillDesc_1410121"]="P.ATK is increased by (<color=#44afee>%s</color> + <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of STR), and ASPD is increased by (<color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of STR) when equipped with a Dagger in your right hand.",
    ["SkillDesc_1410122"]="P.ATK is increased by (<color=#44afee>%s</color> + <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of STR), and ASPD is increased by (<color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of STR) when your left hand acquires the ability to use a Dagger and is equipped with a Dagger.",
    ["SkillDesc_1410123"]="Increase damage of <color=#44afee>Sonic Blow</color> by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>. Whenever you land a critical attack with your normal attack, <color=#44afee>Sonic Blow</color> cooldown is reduced by 1 second.",
    ["SkillDesc_1410124"]="When equipped with a Katar, Crit increases by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_1410125"]="Slices and dices a single enemy target at lightning speed, dealing weapon attribute P.DMG equal to (<color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of P.ATK + <color=#44afee>%s</color> × STR (up to <color=#44afee>400%%</color> of caster's P.ATK)) to them. Has a <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> chance to stun them for <color=#44afee>3</color> seconds. This skill may trigger critical damage.",
    ["SkillDesc_1410126"]="Shoots spikes in the specified direction, dealing (<color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of P.ATK + <color=#44afee>%s</color>) weapon attribute P.DMG to enemies within the area and stuns them for <color=#44afee>3</color> seconds. Every <color=#44afee>7</color> STR increases the damage coefficient by an extra <color=#44afee>1%%</color>, up to <color=#44afee>1700%%</color>. When using this skill while Hiding, there is a <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> chance that using this skill will not cancel Hiding. If your Final Crit is higher than Final Penetration, this skill may trigger critical damage.",
    ["SkillDesc_1410128"]="Apply poison to your weapon. Your normal attacks deal <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> Poison physical damage for <color=#44afee>%s</color> seconds and has a <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> chance to poison the target for <color=#44afee>7</color> seconds. The poison on your weapon will not be removed when you are killed. When poisoned, the target will take Poison physical damage equal to <color=#44afee>20%%</color> of the caster's Physical ATK every second, their DEF will be decreased by <color=#44afee>25%%</color>, and they will not naturally recover HP and SP for the duration of the effect. The damage effect can stack up to <color=#44afee>5</color> times. When the target's HP is less than <color=#44afee>25%%</color>, they will stop taking damage, but the poison will still be in effect.",
    ["SkillDesc_1410129"]="Tosses a bottle filled with deadly poison at the specified location. The bottle will break when it hits the floor, leaving behind poison for <color=#44afee>4</color> seconds. Enemies in the area take (<color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of ATK + <color=#44afee>%s</color>) Poison physical damage every second and gain 1 stack of Poison. Poison lasts for <color=#44afee>10</color> seconds. When poisoned, the target will take Poison physical damage equal to <color=#44afee>20%%</color> of the caster's ATK every second, their DEF will be decreased by <color=#44afee>25%%</color>, and they will not naturally recover HP and SP for the duration of the effect. This damage effect can stack up to <color=#44afee>5</color> times. When the target's HP is less than <color=#44afee>25%%</color>, they will stop taking damage, but the other debuffs will remain in effect.",
    ["SkillDesc_1410130"]="Triggers the toxins in the target and enemy units within <color=#44afee>4</color> meters, dealing ((<color=#44afee>%s%%</color> + <color=#44afee>80%%</color> × Number of Poison stacks) ATK + <color=#44afee>%s</color>) Poison physical damage to them and removing their Poison effect.",
    ["SkillDesc_1410131"]="Attacks with Venom Knife, dealing (<color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of ATK + <color=#44afee>%s</color>) physical damage of your weapon's attribute and causing the enemy target to be poisoned for <color=#44afee>7</color> seconds. When poisoned, the target will take Poison physical damage equal to <color=#44afee>20%%</color> of the caster's ATK every second, their DEF will be decreased by <color=#44afee>25%%</color>, and they will not naturally recover HP and SP for the duration of the effect. The damage effect can stack up to <color=#44afee>5</color> times. When the target's HP is less than <color=#44afee>25%%</color>, they will stop taking damage, but the other debuffs will still be in effect.",
    ["SkillDesc_1410133"]="Rolls back <color=#44afee>7</color> meters, evading enemy attacks and entering Hiding mode. After the Hiding effect granted by this skill is removed, increases Flee by <color=#44afee>%s</color> for <color=#44afee>5</color> seconds. Grants the effect of Shadow Cloak after rolling and reduces <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of damage when the next time taking damage equal to more than <color=#44afee>25%%</color> of Max HP within <color=#44afee>2</color> seconds. (True Damage can be reduced)",
    ["SkillDesc_1410134"]="When dual-wielding, normal attacks have a <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> chance to lower enemy units' P.DEF by (<color=#44afee>5</color> x <color=#44afee>character's level</color>) for <color=#44afee>4</color> seconds. The debuff of reduced defense can be countered by Armor Break.",
    ["SkillDesc_1410135"]="While Hiding, gain Sneak Attack effect (canceling Hiding by using normal attack will cause it to be guaranteed a critical attack). Within <color=#44afee>%s</color> seconds of canceling Hiding, skills that gain bonus effects during Hiding will still retain the bonus effects and skills that are only usable during Hiding can still be used. Also, damage received will be reduced by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_1410136"]="Applies venom to your weapon, increasing the Poison physical damage of poisoned weapons by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of Physical ATK, and extending the duration of Poison effect caused by <color=#44afee>Enchant Poison</color>, <color=#44afee>Venom Dart</color>, and <color=#44afee>Venom Spreader</color> by <color=#44afee>%s</color> second(s). The effect will not be removed when you are killed.",
    ["SkillDesc_1410137"]="Multiples your ASPD by <color=#44afee>%s</color> after using this skill. Loses its effect after <color=#44afee>6</color> seconds or <color=#44afee>%s</color> normal attacks. For <color=#44afee>every</color> critical hit from a normal attack or every time <color=#44afee>Double Attack</color> is triggered, the cooldown of this skill is reduced by <color=#44afee>0.5</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_1411121"]="When equipped with a Katar, Crit Damage increases by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_1411122"]="Fires a shockwave from a distance, dealing (<color=#44afee>%s%%</color> P.ATK + <color=#44afee>%s</color> x DEX + <color=#44afee>%s</color>) weapon attribute P.DMG that ignores defense to an enemy. Every <color=#44afee>4</color> STR/DEX increases the damage coefficient by an extra <color=#44afee>1%%</color>, up to <color=#44afee>3,000%%</color>. If your Final Crit is higher than Final P.PEN, this skill may trigger critical damage.",
    ["SkillDesc_1411123"]="Deals (<color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of P.ATK + <color=#44afee>%s</color>) weapon attribute P.DMG (every 6 STR increases it by an extra <color=#44afee>1%%</color>, up to <color=#44afee>2,000%%</color>) to enemy units within <color=#44afee>3</color> meters and has a <color=#44afee>25%%</color> chance to randomly inflict the target with a Blind, Stun, or Bleed effect which will persist for <color=#44afee>3</color> seconds. If this skill is used while Hiding, the chance to inflict the debuffs increases by an extra <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>. If your Final Crit is higher than Final P.PEN, this skill may trigger critical damage.",
    ["SkillDesc_1411125"]="Applies deadly poison to your weapon. Enchant Poison will turn your weapon's attribute to Poison and increase your Poison damage by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>. The effect will not be removed when you are killed.",
    ["SkillDesc_1411131"]="After <color=#44afee>3</color> seconds of casting this skill, your entire party gains <color=#44afee>5</color> seconds of Hiding effect. Once the Hiding effect of the Assassination Halo fades, you get an extra <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> Final Flee and <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> Final ASPD for <color=#44afee>5</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_1411132"]="Deals (<color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of ATK + <color=#44afee>%s</color>) physical damage of your weapon's attribute to an enemy. If this skill's damage is lethal, it can be used again within <color=#44afee>10</color> seconds. This skill enters cooldown whether or not it is used within 10 seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_1411133"]="Flashes to a single target and unleashes <color=#44afee>7</color> fast slashes, immobilizing them for 2 seconds during the attack. Each slash deals weapon attribute P.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of P.ATK. For every <color=#44afee>15%%</color> of the target's Max HP lost, the damage of subsequent slashes increases by <color=#44afee>5%%</color>. Increases your Final DMG Reduction by <color=#44afee>100%%</color> during the attack. After using this skill, all debuffs on you are cleared, and you are immune to debuffs and knockback effects during the attack. If your Final Crit is higher than Final Penetration, this skill may trigger critical damage.",
    ["SkillDesc_1412001"]="Increases the chance of inflicting Poison on the enemy by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> after dealing normal attacks and its duration by <color=#44afee>%s</color> second(s) when Enchant Poison is in effect.\nIgnores <color=#44afee>15</color> of the target's Debuff Resistance and Debuff Duration Reduction when applying Poison.",
    ["SkillDesc_1412002"]="Enhances Poison's effect, inflicting an additional <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> Poison DMG on targets suffering from Poison. During this time, the target also takes Poison attribute P.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of P.ATK. Once the target's HP falls below <color=#44afee>25%%</color>, the effects of Poison are no longer automatically cleared.\nIf your Final Crit is higher than Final P.PEN, Enchant Poison, Poison, and Enhanced Enchant Poison may trigger critical damage.",
    ["SkillDesc_1412003"]="Removes Enchant Deadly Poison from yourself and applies a poisonous mist to your weapon that spreads in a 3-meter radius for <color=#44afee>5</color> seconds. Enemies within range take Poison Damage equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of Physical Attack and suffer 1 stack of Poison for <color=#44afee>6</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_1412004"]="After killing a target inflicted with Poison, a ring of poisonous mist will form at the site of their death. (Effect is dependent on your current level of Poison Mist. Target killed by the poisonous mist will not generate a new poisonous mist after its death.) Can create up to <color=#44afee>%s</color> rings at the same time (including Poison Mist triggered by clearing Enchant Deadly Poison).",
    ["SkillDesc_1412005"]="Flashes to a designated location and inflicts Cross Impact on all enemies within a <color=#44afee>4</color>-meter radius, dealing weapon attribute P.DMG equal to (<color=#44afee>%s%%</color> P.ATK + <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of the target's Max HP + <color=#44afee>%s</color> x the target's VIT). When attacking MVP, MINI, or Boss, effects related to Max HP in the damage coefficient will not take effect. Instead, it deals extra damage equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of P.ATK. Each successful execution recovers <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of your lost HP. Each hit reduces the skill's cooldown by <color=#44afee>1</color> second.",
    ["SkillDesc_1412006"]="Surges forward <color=#44afee>12</color> meters in the desired direction, leaving only a ghostly shadow in your wake. All enemies in the path take Neutral P.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of P.ATK, with a <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> chance of immobilizing them for <color=#44afee>3</color> seconds. Every enemy hit by Phantom reduces the skill cooldown by <color=#44afee>%s</color> seconds. Releasing Dark Illusion removes all debuffs, grants immunity to all debuffs (debuffs from MVP, MINI, and Boss cannot be removed or negated by this immunity effect), and increases MSPD by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> for <color=#44afee>3</color> seconds. Can be released even under Control.",
    ["SkillDesc_1412007"]="While in Hiding, you activate Hallucination Walk for <color=#44afee>10</color> seconds. Your first attack will damage the target, making them wounded for <color=#44afee>6</color> seconds and reducing their healing received by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>. Hallucination Walk ends after any target is wounded. When attacking the wounded target, the skill attacks deal additional weapon attribute P.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of the target's Max HP. When attacking MVP, MINI, or Boss, it deals additional damage equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of P.ATK instead. This effect can trigger once every <color=#44afee>1</color> second, up to a maximum of <color=#44afee>%s</color> times.",
    ["SkillDesc_1412008"]="Summons eight blades that work in unison to form Blade Guardian. While in effect, each blade has a <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> chance of blocking upcoming P.DMG. For each attack successfully blocked, the energy generated will charge one of the blades and reduce Counter Blade's fixed cooldown by <color=#44afee>1.5</color> seconds. This effect will remain active for<color=#44afee>8</color> sec, after which the first enemy you attack during the subsequent <color=#44afee>6</color> seconds triggers an onslaught of flying blades, dealing Weapon attribute P.DMG equal to ((<color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of P.ATK + <color=#44afee>%s</color> × STR) x blade count).",
    ["SkillDesc_1412009"]="Every <color=#44afee>0.5</color> seconds, your spinning weapon deals weapon attribute P.DMG equal to (<color=#44afee>%s%%</color> P.ATK + <color=#44afee>%s</color> x STR) to enemies within <color=#44afee>4</color> meters for <color=#44afee>3</color> seconds. <color=#44afee>Each</color> enemy hit adds <color=#44afee>1</color> Spin Point, up to a maximum of <color=#44afee>10</color> stacks, with Spin Points lasting for <color=#44afee>12</color> seconds. If your Final Crit is higher than Final P.PEN, this skill may trigger critical damage.",
    ["SkillDesc_1412010"]="Consumes all Spin Points accumulated from the Rolling Cutter and casts a concealed weapon at a single enemy, dealing weapon attribute P.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of P.ATK. If your Final Crit is higher than Final P.PEN, this skill may trigger critical damage. Every <color=#44afee>1</color> stack of Spin Points increases the damage of Spinning Cross Impact by (<color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of P.ATK + <color=#44afee>%s</color> x STR).",
    ["SkillDesc_1412011"]="Grants a <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> chance of inflicting a grievous wound when triggering a crit with a normal attack, which lasts for <color=#44afee>3</color> seconds and stacks up to <color=#44afee>6</color> times. Each stack increases the damage dealt from a normal attack by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>, and reduces the Final HP of targets by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> (effects of the same type reduce up to <color=#44afee>50%%</color>; non-effective against MVP, MINI, and Boss).",
    ["SkillDesc_1412012"]="Grants Hiding, which camouflages yourself and will not cancel Hiding when being attacked. Increases Final Damage Reduction by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> while the effect is active.",
    ["SkillDesc_1413001"]="When your Final P.PEN is higher than Final Crit, for <color=#44afee>each</color> stack of <color=#44afee>Poison</color> applied by you, the target's Final P.DEF is reduced by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>. When your Final Crit is higher than Final P.PEN, for <color=#44afee>each</color> stack of <color=#44afee>Poison</color> applied by you, the target's Crit DMG Reduction is reduced by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>. When <color=#44afee>Poison</color> is naturally removed, it deals Poison attribute P.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> based on the number of <color=#44afee>Poison</color> stacks.",
    ["SkillDesc_1413002"]="Increases your Final Flee by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>. For every <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> <color=#44afee>Final ASPD</color> possessed, <color=#44afee>Rolling Cutter</color>'s duration is extended by <color=#44afee>1</color> second, up to <color=#44afee>3</color> seconds. For every <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> <color=#44afee>Final Haste</color> possessed, <color=#44afee>Rolling Cutter</color>'s attack interval is reduced by <color=#44afee>0.1</color> seconds. Can be reduced to a minimum of <color=#44afee>0.3</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_1413003"]="Consumes all Spin Points to unleash knives within a <color=#44afee>6</color>-meter radius, dealing weapon attribute P.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> to all enemies within range. For every <color=#44afee>1</color> Spin Point consumed, the damage is increased by an additional <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>. When <color=#44afee>Double Attack</color> is triggered, <color=#44afee>Dancing Knife</color>'s cooldown is reduced by <color=#44afee>1</color> second, but it won't trigger if the cooldown is already less than <color=#44afee>12</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_1413004"]="Summons multiple shadow daggers to strike forward, dealing weapon attribute P.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> to all enemies on the path. When <color=#44afee>Double Attack</color> is triggered by normal attacks, <color=#44afee>Shadow Stab</color>'s cooldown is reduced by <color=#44afee>1</color> second, but it won't trigger if the cooldown is already less than <color=#44afee>6</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_1413005"]="Unleashes <color=#44afee>7</color> quick slashes at enemies within a <color=#44afee>6</color>-meter radius, each dealing weapon attribute P.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> to all enemies in the area. After the slashes, deal an additional hit of weapon attribute P.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> to all enemies in the area. The damage is split among all targets in the area. The skill's damage is increased by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> for each <color=#44afee>1</color> stack of <color=#44afee>Shadow Scar</color> applied on the target.",
    ["SkillDesc_1413006"]="Consumes all Spin Points to thrust in a straight line, dealing weapon attribute P.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> to all enemies within range. For every <color=#44afee>1</color> Spin Point consumed, the damage is increased by an additional <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>. This skill can trigger critical damage, which applies <color=#44afee>1</color> stack of <color=#44afee>Dark Claw</color> upon a critical hit. When a critical hit is dealt by a normal attack using a katar, <color=#44afee>Impact Crater</color>'s cooldown is reduced by <color=#44afee>1</color> second, but it won't trigger if the cooldown is already less than <color=#44afee>12</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_1413007"]="Moves near the target, dealing <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> damage to all targets within a <color=#44afee>4</color>-meter range. This skill can trigger critical damage, which applies <color=#44afee>1</color> stack of <color=#44afee>Dark Claw</color> upon a critical hit. When a critical hit is dealt by a normal attack using a katar, <color=#44afee>Savage Impact</color>'s cooldown is reduced by <color=#44afee>1</color> second, but it won't trigger if the cooldown is already less than <color=#44afee>8</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_1413008"]="Teleports instantly to a specified location, dealing weapon attribute P.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> to the enemies within a <color=#44afee>6</color>-meter range and inflicting <color=#44afee>Immobilize</color> to them for <color=#44afee>3</color> seconds. The damage is split among all targets and can trigger critical hits. For <color=#44afee>each</color> stack of <color=#44afee>Dark Claw</color> applied on the target, their damage taken is increased by <color=#44afee>85%%</color>, up to <color=#44afee>600%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_1413009"]="Instantly cancels the <color=#44afee>Blade Guard</color> or <color=#44afee>Blade Strike</color> from Counter Blade, then charges up and enters the defensive stance. While charging, blades spin around you, making you immune to all incoming damage (except from MVP, MINI, and Boss units). You cannot move during the charge. When the charge ends, blades are launched at all targets within <color=#44afee>6</color> meters, dealing weapon attribute P.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>. For <color=#44afee>each</color> stack of <color=#44afee>Blade Guard</color> or <color=#44afee>Blade Strike</color> consumed by Blade Barrier, <color=#44afee>1</color> additional hit of equal damage will be dealt when the charge ends. When your Final Crit is higher than Final P.PEN, the blades can trigger critical hits.",
    ["SkillDesc_1413010"]="Using a dagger increases your Final P.PEN by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>. Using a katar increases your Final Crit by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>. When a weapon is equipped, the normal attack range is increased by <color=#44afee>2</color> meters, and you automatically dash to targets within range when attacking.",
    ["SkillDesc_1413011"]="Infuses shadow power into the weapon. Using a skill while equipped with a dagger to deal damage has a <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> chance to summon a phantom behind the target to attack, applying <color=#44afee>1</color> stack of <color=#44afee>Shadow Scar</color> (cannot be triggered by <color=#44afee>Eternal Slash</color>). As <color=#44afee>Shadow Scar</color> stacks increase, the target takes weapon attribute P.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> dealt by the phantom, and <color=#44afee>each</color> stack of <color=#44afee>Shadow Scar</color> increases the damage by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>. When <color=#44afee>Shadow Scar</color> reaches <color=#44afee>7</color> stacks, it is removed upon the next phantom attack, and Shadow Exceed cannot trigger again for <color=#44afee>15</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_1413012"]="Triggering <color=#44afee>Dark Claw</color> with katar attacks the target with Shadow Claw, dealing weapon attribute P.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> to the target and all enemies within a <color=#44afee>3</color>-meter radius. Shadow Claw can trigger critical hits, and its damage is split by all enemies within range.",
    ["SkillDesc_1420001"]="Enjoy a <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> discount when purchasing items from NPC shops and a <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> discount when purchasing items from the Chamber of Commerce using Zeny.",
    ["SkillDesc_1420002"]="After using <color=#44afee>Enchant Poison</color>, your weapon attribute will change to <color=#44afee>Poison</color>. Each normal attack will have an <color=#44afee>8%%</color> chance to grant you the <color=#44afee>Dip</color> state. The <color=#44afee>Dip</color> state can stack up to <color=#44afee>%s</color> times and last for <color=#44afee>10</color> seconds. Each stack of <color=#44afee>Dip</color> increases your Poison Attribute Enhancement by <color=#44afee>1%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_1420003"]="When equipped with a <color=#44afee>Dagger</color>, gain a <color=#44afee>20%%</color> chance to increase your P.PEN by <color=#44afee>%s</color> when dealing damage. When equipped with a <color=#44afee>Bow</color>, gain a <color=#44afee>20%%</color> chance to increase your Crit by <color=#44afee>%s</color> and your Crit DMG Bonus by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> when dealing damage. This effect lasts <color=#44afee>2</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_1420004"]="Launches a ranged attack that targets the enemy's vital points, dealing weapon attribute P.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of P.ATK.",
    ["SkillDesc_1420005"]="Fires two arrows at the same time, each arrow dealing weapon attribute P.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of P.ATK to a single enemy target (this damage can be critical). Each critical normal attack reduces the skill's cooldown by 1 second. Must equip a <color=#44afee>Longbow</color> to cast.",
    ["SkillDesc_1420006"]="Shoots a poisonous arrow, dealing <color=#44afee>200%%</color> weapon attribute P.DMG to the target (this damage can be critical). When you are in the <color=#44afee>Dip</color> state, you additionally deal Poison P.DMG equal to (<color=#44afee>42%%</color> x Dip Stacks ^<color=#44afee>1.8</color>) x P.ATK to the target and enemies within <color=#44afee>4</color> meters of the target (this damage can be critical). After this skill hits, it will consume all of your <color=#44afee>Dip</color> stacks. Must equip a Longbow to cast.",
    ["SkillDesc_1420007"]="Normal attacks have an <color=#44afee>8%%</color> chance to cast Lv.<color=#44afee>%s</color> <color=#44afee>Double Strafe</color>. Must equip a <color=#44afee>Longbow</color> to trigger.",
    ["SkillDesc_1420008"]="Increases the skill range of <color=#44afee>Bow Normal Attack</color>, <color=#44afee>Assault</color>, <color=#44afee>Ranged Toxic Attack</color>, <color=#44afee>Double Strafe</color>, <color=#44afee>Repeated Shot</color>, <color=#44afee>Triangle Slot</color>, and <color=#44afee>Bone Rotting Arrow</color> by <color=#44afee>%s</color> meters. Each point of STR additionally increases Hit by <color=#44afee>1</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_1420009"]="Rogue can equip two <color=#44afee>daggers</color>. When using dagger-type weapons, P.ATK increases by (DEX x <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>).",
    ["SkillDesc_1420010"]="Deals weapon attribute P.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of P.ATK + DEX x <color=#44afee>%s</color> to an enemy unit. When <color=#44afee>behind</color> the target, increases damage dealt by <color=#44afee>100%%</color>. Must equip a <color=#44afee>Dagger</color> to cast.",
    ["SkillDesc_1420011"]="Deals weapon attribute P.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of P.ATK + <color=#44afee>%s</color> x DEX to enemies within <color=#44afee>4</color> meters and has a <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> chance to inflict the <color=#44afee>Blind</color> state. The <color=#44afee>Blind</color> state lasts <color=#44afee>3</color> seconds. Must equip a <color=#44afee>Dagger</color> to cast.",
    ["SkillDesc_1420012"]="Captures the target and afflicts them with <color=#44afee>Overpower</color> for <color=#44afee>6</color> seconds. Captured targets cannot move or use normal attacks, and take weapon attribute P.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of P.ATK + DEX x <color=#44afee>%s</color> every <color=#44afee>0.5</color> seconds. During Close Confine, you cannot use normal attacks or skills. <color=#44afee>Close Confine</color> will end prematurely when you move or if the target dies. The target can use <color=#44afee>Hiding</color>, <color=#44afee>Charge Attack</color>, <color=#44afee>Sonic Wave</color>, <color=#44afee>Trample</color>, <color=#44afee>Shield Press</color>, <color=#44afee>Body Relocation</color>, <color=#44afee>Flame Shock</color>, <color=#44afee>Roll Away</color>, <color=#44afee>Warg Strike</color>, <color=#44afee>Marionette Control</color>, <color=#44afee>Front Side Slide</color>, or <color=#44afee>Self Destruction</color> to escape <color=#44afee>Close Confine</color>. Except for the above skills, they cannot cast any other skills while Close Confine is active. Must equip a <color=#44afee>Dagger</color> to cast. Close Confine's control effect does not work against MVP, Mini, and Boss units.",
    ["SkillDesc_1421001"]="After use, there is a <color=#44afee>50%%</color> chance of copying a random <color=#44afee> active attack skill</color> from the enemy player. The level of the copied skill is (<color=#44afee>%s</color> x max level of the target skill / 5). After copying, the copied skill will appear on the skill tree and can be added to the skill bar (the skill obtained by copying will still be available after logging out, resetting skills, or switching load-outs). This skill consumes 1 <color=#44afee> Paint Brush</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_1421002"]="Boosts the <color=#44afee>Base EXP</color> and <color=#44afee>Job EXP</color> you acquire by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>. When you kill a monster, there is a <color=#44afee>15%%</color> chance to gain an additional <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of Zeny from the monster.",
    ["SkillDesc_1421003"]="When the number of enemy units within <color=#44afee>4</color> meters of yourself is less than <color=#44afee>2</color>, increases your P.ATK by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>. When dealing damage, there is a <color=#44afee>20%%</color> chance to decrease the MSPD of the target by <color=#44afee>50%%</color>. The <color=#44afee>Slow</color> effect lasts <color=#44afee>2</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_1421004"]="Strips one of the enemy target's accessories in a very fast way. The base success rate of stripping is <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>. Based on the <color=#44afee>DEX</color> difference on both sides, the success rate of this skill will be increased by <color=#44afee>(your DEX - target's DEX) / 5,000</color> x <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>. The stripped equipment cannot provide an attribute bonus to the carrier within <color=#44afee>12</color> seconds. When casting the skill on monsters, decreases the monsters' P.ATK and M.ATK by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_1421005"]="Shoot three arrows at the same time, each arrow deals weapon attribute P.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of P.ATK, which can trigger Critical Hits. You must be equipped with a <color=#44afee>longbow</color> when releasing the skill. When this skill is loading, each time a normal attack triggers a Critical Hit, returns <color=#44afee>1</color> second of CD.",
    ["SkillDesc_1421006"]="Rains down an Arrow Shower over a specified range of <color=#44afee>4</color> meters, dealing weapon attribute P.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of P.ATK to all enemy targets within the range. Bone Rotting Arrows can deal crit damage, and reduce the skill's own cooldown by 1 second for each target hit. The Arrow Shower also contaminates the ground, decreasing the MSPD of enemies in the contaminated area by <color=#44afee>50%%</color>. The contaminated area lasts <color=#44afee>3</color> seconds. Must equip a <color=#44afee>Longbow</color> to cast.",
    ["SkillDesc_1421007"]="Draw a Man Hole trap on the ground with a radius of <color=#44afee>3</color> meters, lasting <color=#44afee>100</color> seconds. When triggered, the nearest <color=#44afee>1</color> enemy in the area of effect will be sucked into the center of the trap. The trapped enemy cannot be selected for <color=#44afee>%s</color> seconds, nor can they cast skills or launch normal attacks in the trap, and they won't be sucked in by the Man Hole again for <color=#44afee>%s</color> seconds. Only <color=#44afee>1</color> Man Hole can exist at one time. This skill consumes 1 <color=#44afee>Paint Brush</color> and 1 <color=#44afee>Surface Paint</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_1421008"]="When Repeated Shot trigger <color=#44afee>Double Strafe</color>, there is a <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> chance to add <color=#44afee>1</color> stack of <color=#44afee> Dip</color> to yourself. When you actively cast <color=#44afee>Double Strafe</color>, there is a <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> chance that you will add <color=#44afee>2</color> stacks of <color=#44afee>Dip</color> to yourself. When you actively cast <color=#44afee>Triangle Slot </color>, there is a <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> chance to add <color=#44afee>3</color> stacks of <color=#44afee>Dip</color> to yourself.",
    ["SkillDesc_1421009"]="Deals weapon attribute P.DMG equal to (<color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of P.ATK + DEX x <color=#44afee>%s</color>) to enemy units, and there is a <color=#44afee>(%s%% + 1%% x (Max ((your level − the enemy's level), 0)^2) / 10)</color> chance of hijacking the target to teleport to random nearby areas of the same map. The hijack teleport does not apply to <color=#44afee>Monster</color>, <color=#44afee>MVP</color>, <color=#44afee>Mini</color>, and <color=#44afee>BOSS</color> units. <color=#44afee>Dagger</color> must be equipped to cast the skill.",
    ["SkillDesc_1421010"]="Strips the enemy target's armor, muffler, or shoes (one of the above) in a very fast way. The base success rate of stripping is <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>. Based on the <color=#44afee>DEX</color> difference on both sides, the success rate of this skill will be increased by <color=#44afee>(your DEX - target's DEX) / 5,000</color> x <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>. The stripped equipment cannot provide an attribute bonus to the carrier within <color=#44afee>12</color> seconds. When casting the skill on monsters, decreases the monsters' P.DEF and M.DEF by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_1421011"]="Attaches Shadow Power to your dagger and strikes forward within a range of <color=#44afee>6</color> meters, dealing weapon attribute P.DMG equal to ((<color=#44afee>300%%</color> + (8 − number of Hits) x <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>) of P.ATK + DEX x (8 − number of targets) x 30) to each target in your path. Increases damage by <color=#44afee>100%%</color> when you are at the back of the target. Must have a <color=#44afee>Dagger</color> equipped to use.",
    ["SkillDesc_1421012"]="When enabled, you will enter the state of <color=#44afee>Reject Sword</color>. When you receive melee P.DMG, reflects <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of the damage to the attacker. Reject Sword lasts for <color=#44afee>15</color> seconds and can reflect damage <color=#44afee>10</color> times at most during this time. Must have a <color=#44afee>Dagger</color> equipped to use.",
    ["SkillDesc_1422001"]="Transforms yourself into a shadow form and attaches to the target's shadow. Cannot be selected by others. <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of the damage received during this period will be taken by the target (up to <color=#44afee>100%%</color> of your <color=#44afee>Max HP</color>). Meanwhile, enjoys <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of the target's healing received (up to <color=#44afee>100%%</color> of your <color=#44afee>Max HP</color>). The possession lasts <color=#44afee>3</color> seconds. After it ends, slashes the target once, dealing weapon attribute P.DMG equal to (<color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of P.ATK + DEX x <color=#44afee>%s</color>). During the possession, you cannot be selected as a skill target and you will be immune to area damage, but you are not immune to damage caused by the debuff that you are carrying.",
    ["SkillDesc_1422002"]="When you are inflicted with debuff such as <color=#44afee>Freeze</color>, <color=#44afee>Silence</color>, <color=#44afee>Blind</color>, <color=#44afee>Confuse</color>, <color=#44afee>Petrify</color>, <color=#44afee>Stun</color>, <color=#44afee>Curse</color>, and <color=#44afee>Immobilize</color>, there is a <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> chance of inflicting the same one on the caster for <color=#44afee>3</color> seconds. Triggers once at most every <color=#44afee>9</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_1422003"]="Draw a dummy in place, then retreat <color=#44afee>8</color> meters immediately. After <color=#44afee>1</color> second, the dummy explodes, dealing weapon attribute P.DMG equal to (<color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of P.ATK + DEX x <color=#44afee>%s</color>) to enemies within <color=#44afee>4</color> meters. This skill consumes 1 <color=#44afee>Paint Brush</color> and <color=#44afee>Surface Paint</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_1422004"]="The Rogue flashes out from the shadow. When you appear from <color=#44afee>Shadow Form</color> or from <color=#44afee>Hiding</color>, there is a <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> chance to put enemies within a <color=#44afee>4</color>-meter radius into the state of <color=#44afee>Confuse</color> or <color=#44afee>Fear</color> for <color=#44afee>3</color> seconds. For every <color=#44afee>1</color> enemy who enters the state of <color=#44afee>Confuse</color> or <color=#44afee>Fear</color>, gain a stack of <color=#44afee>Frenzy</color> for yourself. Each stack of Frenzy increases your P.ATK by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>, DEX by <color=#44afee>%s</color> points, and MSPD by <color=#44afee>0.2</color> points. Stacks up to <color=#44afee>5</color> times, and lasts <color=#44afee>10</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_1422005"]="Draw the <color=#44afee>Dimension Door</color> at the enemy target's location. <color=#44afee>3</color> seconds later, teleport the target to the location of the <color=#44afee>Dimension Door</color>. If the target is not in the current scene or the target is more than 20m away from the trap, they cannot be teleported. This skill consumes 1 <color=#44afee>Paint Brush</color> and <color=#44afee>Surface Paint</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_1422006"]="Enter the <color=#44afee>Shadow Spell</color> state after use. When attacking a target with <color=#44afee>Normal Attack</color>, <color=#44afee>Double Strafe</color>, <color=#44afee>Repeated Shot</color>, or <color=#44afee>Triangle Slot</color>, additionally deals weapon attribute P.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of the original skill damage to enemies within a <color=#44afee>4</color>m radius of your target (If this attack kills the target or if the target dies before the arrow hits the target, area damage cannot be triggered). The <color=#44afee>Shadow Spell</color> state lasts <color=#44afee>6 </color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_1422007"]="Rogues are proficient in hiding and launching attacks. When in the <color=#44afee>Hiding</color> state, taking damage will not reveal yourself. The Hiding state also adds <color=#44afee>20</color> stacks of <color=#44afee>Ghost Power</color> to yourself, forcing your weapon attribute to turn into <color=#44afee>Ghost</color> during the period. Launching <color=#44afee>normal attacks</color> with a bow will reduce 1 stack of <color=#44afee>Ghost Power</color>. Triggering <color=#44afee>Double Strafe</color> with <color=#44afee>Repeated Shot</color>, or releasing <color=#44afee>Ranged Toxic Attack</color>, <color=#44afee>Double Strafe</color>, <color=#44afee>Triangle Slot</color>, or <color=#44afee>Bone Rotting Arrow</color> will reduce 3 stacks of <color=#44afee>Ghost Power</color>. Using normal attacks or skills that consume <color=#44afee>Ghost Power</color>, or casting the <color=#44afee>Shadow Spell</color> skill will not reveal yourself. During the Hiding, when the normal attacks trigger Critical Hits, there is a <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> chance to add 1 stack of Ghost Power; when <color=#44afee>Ranged Toxic Attack</color>, <color=#44afee>Double Strafe</color>, <color=#44afee>Triangle Slot</color>, or <color=#44afee>Bone Rotting Arrow</color> triggers Critical Hits, there is a <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> chance to add <color=#44afee>3 stacks</color> of Ghost Power to yourself. When <color=#44afee>Hiding</color> ends, the effect of <color=#44afee>Ghost Power</color> will also end.",
    ["SkillDesc_1422008"]="Reduces damage received by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> while Hiding. When the <color=#44afee>Hiding</color> is in cooldown, killing each enemy shortens the cooldown of <color=#44afee>Hiding</color> by <color=#44afee>%s</color> second(s). Killing an Adventurer shortens the cooldown of <color=#44afee>Hiding</color> by an additional <color=#44afee>%s</color> second(s).\nWhile under the effect of Hiding, using Enchant Poison will not clear your Hiding effect.",
    ["SkillDesc_1422009"]="Strips the enemy target's primary and secondary weapons in a very fast way. The base success rate of stripping is <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>. Based on the <color=#44afee>DEX</color> difference on both sides, the success rate of this skill will be increased by <color=#44afee>(your DEX - target's DEX) / 5,000</color> x <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> The stripped equipment cannot provide attribute bonus to the carrier within <color=#44afee>10</color> seconds. Enemy units that have been disarmed cannot launch normal attacks. When casting the skill on monsters, decreases the monsters' P.ATK and M.ATK by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_1422010"]="Strike the target, dealing weapon attribute P.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of your P.ATK. There is a <color=#44afee>50%%</color> chance to snatch <color=#44afee>%s</color> points of the target's highest stat. Based on the <color=#44afee>DEX</color> difference between you and the target, you may gain additional <color=#44afee>(your DEX − target DEX) / 100</color> points of the snatched stat for<color=#44afee>8</color> seconds. While the target's stat is being snatched, they cannot be snatched again. You can snatch no more than one target at a time. A <color=#44afee>Dagger</color> must be equipped to cast the skill.",
    ["SkillDesc_1422011"]="Summons a Shadow Cage around the target with a side length of <color=#44afee>8</color> meters. The cage exists for <color=#44afee>3</color> seconds, during which enemies other than the selected targets will be knocked back after entering the prison, and the <color=#44afee>Final P.DEF</color> of enemy targets in the prison will be decreased by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>. When the selected target leaves the <color=#44afee>Shadow Cage</color>, they will receive True DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of Max HP, and their MSPD will be decreased by <color=#44afee>75%%</color> for <color=#44afee>6</color> seconds. The Shadow Cage will disappear after the target leaves it. Must have a <color=#44afee>Dagger</color> equipped to use. (This skill does not apply to MVP, MINI, and BOSS.)",
    ["SkillDesc_1422012"]="When you deal damage to an enemy using <color=#44afee>Ambush</color>, <color=#44afee>Back Stab</color>, <color=#44afee>Shadow Pierce</color>, or <color=#44afee>Snatcher</color>, inflicts <color=#44afee>Bleed</color> on the target, causing them to receive neutral attribute P.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of your P.ATK per second for <color=#44afee>10</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_1423001"]="Channels the abyssal power into the body, gaining <color=#44afee>5</color> Abyssal Orbs, which grants the ability to harness abyssal power. Using this skill while Hiding does not remove the Hiding effect. Each active Abyssal Orb increases PVP Debuff Resistance by <color=#44afee>%s</color> and PVP Debuff Duration Reduction by <color=#44afee>%s</color>. While under the effect of Abyss Slayer, using skills or normal attacks, there's <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> chance to deal extra damage equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of the target's Max HP (up to <color=#44afee>%s</color> of the caster's P.ATK). This effect triggers <color=#44afee>once</color> every <color=#44afee>1</color> second and the Abyssal Orb lasts for <color=#44afee>12</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_1423002"]="Upon an unsuccessful equipment strip, and neither Double Strip or Strip All fail is triggered, there's a chance to trigger Shadow Equipment Disarm. The base success rate is <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>, which increases based on the DEX difference between the caster and the target. For every <color=#44afee>%s</color> DEX difference, the success rate increases by <color=#44afee>1%%</color>, up to <color=#44afee>20%%</color>. If successful, the target's Shadow Equipment's Inscription and Pioneer effects are disabled for the next <color=#44afee>12</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_1423003"]="Consumes <color=#44afee>1</color> Abyssal Orb to summon a <color=#44afee>6</color>-meter-wide Abyss Square, dealing weapon attribute P.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of P.ATK every <color=#44afee>0.5</color> seconds to all enemies within Abyss Square and pulling them toward the center. Abyss Square lasts for <color=#44afee>5</color> seconds. If your Final Crit is higher than Final P.PEN, this skill may trigger critical damage.",
    ["SkillDesc_1423004"]="Consumes <color=#44afee>1</color> Abyssal Orb to call forth a devastating meteor, dealing weapon attribute P.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of P.ATK to all enemies within a <color=#44afee>6</color>-meter radius. Enemies within the Abyss Square receive an additional <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> damage. When possessing <color=#44afee>Abyssal Orbs</color>, this skill's cooldown is reduced to <color=#44afee>10</color> seconds. If your Final Crit is higher than Final P.PEN, Omega Abyss Strike may trigger critical damage.",
    ["SkillDesc_1423005"]="When using a longbow, there's a <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> chance for Shadow Spell to consume <color=#44afee>1</color> Abyssal Orb, creating a <color=#44afee>4</color>-meter radius abyssal zone that lasts for <color=#44afee>3</color> at the target area. Targets within the abyssal zone are inflicted with Blind and Confuse. Triggers <color=#44afee>once</color> every <color=#44afee>3</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_1423006"]="When equipping a longbow, increases your damage dealt to Large monsters, Medium monsters, Small monsters, and Demi-Human monsters by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>, <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>, <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>, <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>, respectively. For every <color=#44afee>200</color> STR, your Hit is increased by <color=#44afee>%s</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_1423007"]="Wraps an arrow with chains and fires it at the target, dealing weapon attribute P.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of P.ATK upon hit, with potential critical damage. The chains then trap the target, dealing the same damage to other enemies (up to <color=#44afee>6</color>) within <color=#44afee>6</color> meters and trapping them as well. The trap effect lasts for <color=#44afee>1.5</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_1423008"]="With a surge of speed, rapidly fires <color=#44afee>5</color> arrows, each dealing weapon attribute P.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of P.ATK. These arrows may trigger critical damage, and the caster becomes untargetable while casting the skill. Frenzy Shot deals an additional <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> damage to enemies within Abyss Square.",
    ["SkillDesc_1423009"]="When equipping a dagger, increases your PVP Final P.DMG Bonus by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>. When your DEX reaches 3,000, every <color=#44afee>additional</color> DEX increases your P.ATK by <color=#44afee>4</color>. When attacking a target within Abyss Square, <color=#44afee>Deft Stab</color>, <color=#44afee>Unlucky Rush</color>, and <color=#44afee>Abyss Dagger</color> deal an additional <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> damage.",
    ["SkillDesc_1423010"]="Executes <color=#44afee>5</color> rapid strikes on the target, dealing weapon attribute P.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of P.ATK in total. When attacking targets inflicted with <color=#44afee>Curse</color>, <color=#44afee>Blind</color>, <color=#44afee>Confuse</color>, <color=#44afee>Fear</color>, or <color=#44afee>Slow</color>, their debuff durations are reset to 5 seconds (only applies on debuffs with less than <color=#44afee>5</color> seconds remaining). For <color=#44afee>every</color> successful debuff reset, your DEX is increased by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>, stacking up to <color=#44afee>5</color> times and lasting <color=#44afee>10</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_1423011"]="Dashes toward the target, dealing weapon attribute P.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of P.ATK and there's a <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> chance to inflict <color=#44afee>Cruse</color> to the enemy. While under the effect, the target's Max HP is reduced by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>, with the healing received and recovery effect reduced by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> (ineffective against MVP, MINI, and Boss). The Curse lasts for <color=#44afee>10</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_1423012"]="When possessing Abyssal Orbs, every dagger attack has a <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> chance to consume <color=#44afee>1</color> Abyssal Orb, summoning <color=#44afee>5</color> <color=#44afee>Abyss Daggers</color> around the target and attacking the target <color=#44afee>5</color> times, dealing weapon attribute P.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of P.ATK in total. Triggers <color=#44afee>once</color> every <color=#44afee>2</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_1500121"]="Shoots <color=#44afee>2</color> arrows at the same time, dealing a total of (<color=#44afee>%s%%</color> P.ATK + <color=#44afee>%s</color>) physical damage of your weapon's attribute to a single enemy. Can be used with Elemental Arrow.",
    ["SkillDesc_1500122"]="Shoots <color=#44afee>4</color> waves of arrows at a specified range, each wave dealing (<color=#44afee>%s%%</color> P.ATK + <color=#44afee>%s</color>) physical damage of your weapon's attribute. Can be used with Elemental Arrow.",
    ["SkillDesc_1500123"]="Permanently increase your DEX by <color=#44afee>%s</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_1500124"]="Using a Longbow or Shortbow increases normal attack and all shooting skills' range by <color=#44afee>%s</color> meter(s). When no more than <color=#44afee>1</color> enemy is within 4 meters, Final DMG Bonus is increased by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>; if more than <color=#44afee>1</color> enemy is nearby, Final DMG Reduction is reduced by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> (Only MVP, MINI, Boss, and Adventurer units are counted). Using Instrument or Whip increases the normal attack range by <color=#44afee>%s</color> meter(s) and the ranged arrow skill range by <color=#44afee>%s</color> meter(s).",
    ["SkillDesc_1500125"]="Increase your AGI by <color=#44afee>%s</color> and DEX by <color=#44afee>%s</color> for <color=#44afee>%s</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_1500126"]="Deals (<color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of ATK + <color=#44afee>%s</color>) physical damage of your weapon's attribute to an enemy target and stuns them for <color=#44afee>%s</color> second(s). Can be used in conjunction with Elemental Arrow.",
    ["SkillDesc_1500127"]="Deploys a Claymore Trap with a damage radius of <color=#44afee>3</color> meters and a trigger radius of <color=#44afee>2</color> meters at the specified location. After detonating, deals fire attribute P.DMG equal to ((DEX + <color=#44afee>100</color>) x (<color=#44afee>10</color> + INT/<color=#44afee>2</color>) x <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> + <color=#44afee>%s</color>) to all enemies within the area and inflicts the Kindle effect on them for <color=#44afee>5</color> seconds. The trap lasts for <color=#44afee>180</color> seconds. Up to <color=#44afee>7</color> traps can be deployed at the same time.",
    ["SkillDesc_1500128"]="After equipping a Silver Arrow, your <color=#44afee>normal attacks</color>, <color=#44afee>Double Strafe</color>, <color=#44afee>Charge Arrow</color>, <color=#44afee>Multi Firing</color>, or <color=#44afee>Focused Shot</color> will expend an arrow, changing your damage type to <color=#44afee>Holy</color> and increasing skill damage by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_1500130"]="<color=#44afee>Normal attacks</color>, <color=#44afee>Double Strafe</color>, <color=#44afee>Charge Arrow</color>, <color=#44afee>Multi Firing</color>, <color=#44afee>Focused Shot</color>, <color=#44afee>Sharp Shooting</color>, <color=#44afee>Arrow Shower</color>, <color=#44afee>Musical Strike</color>, <color=#44afee>Throw Arrow</color>, <color=#44afee>Severe Rainstorm</color>, and<color=#44afee>Arrow Vulcan</color>, <color=#44afee>Rhythm Shooting</color>, <color=#44afee>Rose Blossom</color> can be used in conjunction with Elemental Bolts, increasing skill damage by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>. When using Exploding Arrow, Silver Arrow, Freezing Arrow, Wind Arrow, and Earth Arrow, your damage type will change to Fire, Holy, Water, Wind, and Earth, respectively.",
    ["SkillDesc_1510121"]="Increases damage dealt to Brute, Insect, and Fish monsters by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>. Each <color=#44afee>80</color> DEX increases an additional <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> damage (up to <color=#44afee>50%%</color>).",
    ["SkillDesc_1510122"]="After renting a falcon, normal attacks have a chance to trigger a falcon attack. Triggering this effect deals ((<color=#44afee>Steel Crow</color> damage + (INT/<color=#44afee>8</color>)^<color=#44afee>1.8</color> + DEX x <color=#44afee>2</color>) × <color=#44afee>%s</color> + <color=#44afee>%s</color>) Neutral attribute P.DMG that ignores defense. The initial falcon attack rate is <color=#44afee>10%%</color>. The falcon's initial size modifier against enemies is <color=#44afee>100%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_1510123"]="Can only be used if you own a falcon. Commands your falcon to attack an enemy unit, dealing ((<color=#44afee>Steel Crow</color> damage + (INT/<color=#44afee>8</color>)^<color=#44afee>1.8</color> + DEX × <color=#44afee>2</color>) × <color=#44afee>%s</color> + <color=#44afee>%s</color>) <color=#44afee>Neutral</color> P.DMG that <color=#44afee>ignores defense</color> and increases your ASPD by <color=#44afee>30</color> for <color=#44afee>12</color> seconds. Can stack up to <color=#44afee>5</color> times. The falcon's initial size modifier against enemies is <color=#44afee>100%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_1510124"]="When the falcon strikes, deals Neutral attribute P.DMG equal to (<color=#44afee>%s</color> + (INT or DEX) x <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>) that ignores defense.\nFor every <color=#44afee>1</color> additional INT, your P.ATK is increased by <color=#44afee>4</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_1510125"]="Deploys an Ice Trap with a damage radius of <color=#44afee>3</color> meters and trigger radius of <color=#44afee>2</color> meters at the specified location. After detonating, deals water attribute P.DMG equal to ((DEX + <color=#44afee>100</color>) x (<color=#44afee>10</color> + INT/<color=#44afee>2</color>) x <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> + <color=#44afee>%s</color>) to all enemy units within the area and has a <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> chance to freeze the target for <color=#44afee>%s</color> second(s). If the target is not frozen, its MSPD is decreased by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> for <color=#44afee>%s</color> second(s). The trap lasts for <color=#44afee>180</color> seconds. Up to <color=#44afee>7</color> traps can be deployed at the same time.",
    ["SkillDesc_1510127"]="Deploys a Land Mine with a damage radius of <color=#44afee>3</color> meters and a trigger radius of <color=#44afee>2</color> meters at the specified location. After detonating, deals earth attribute P.DMG equal to ((DEX + <color=#44afee>100</color>) x (<color=#44afee>10</color> + INT/<color=#44afee>2</color>) x <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> + <color=#44afee>%s</color>) to all enemies within the area. The trap lasts for <color=#44afee>180</color> seconds. Up to <color=#44afee>7</color> traps can be deployed at the same time.",
    ["SkillDesc_1510128"]="Increases Intelligence by <color=#44afee>%s</color> and the maximum number of traps that can be deployed at the same time by <color=#44afee>%s</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_1510129"]="Increases trap damage by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>. Uses all detonable traps that have been deployed.",
    ["SkillDesc_1510130"]="Your falcon actively searches for enemies. Reveals stealthed units within <color=#44afee>8</color> meters and inflicts a Falcon's Mark on them for <color=#44afee>10</color> seconds. Your normal attacks and skills deal <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> more damage to units with Falcon's Mark. All monsters within the area will notice your falcon, and you gain <color=#44afee>1</color> Threat.",
    ["SkillDesc_1510131"]="After equipping an Exploding Arrow, your <color=#44afee>normal attacks</color>, <color=#44afee>Double Strafe</color>, <color=#44afee>Charge Arrow</color>, <color=#44afee>Multi Firing</color>, or <color=#44afee>Focused Shot</color> will expend an arrow, changing your damage type to <color=#44afee>Fire</color> and increasing skill damage by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>. There is a <color=#44afee>20%%</color> chance to ignite the target for <color=#44afee>5</color> seconds. Ignited targets receive <color=#44afee>20%%</color> Fire magic damage per second.",
    ["SkillDesc_1510132"]="Deploys an Electric Shock trap with a damage radius of <color=#44afee>3</color> meters and a trigger radius of <color=#44afee>2</color> meters at the specified location. After detonating, deals wind attribute P.DMG equal to ((DEX + <color=#44afee>100</color>) x (<color=#44afee>10</color> + INT/<color=#44afee>2</color>) x <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> + <color=#44afee>%s</color>) to all enemies within the area. The trap lasts for <color=#44afee>180</color> seconds. Up to <color=#44afee>7</color> traps can be deployed at the same time.",
    ["SkillDesc_1510133"]="Aim and fire an arrow, dealing weapon attribute P.DMG equal to (<color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of P.ATK + <color=#44afee>%s</color>) to an enemy and marking the target for <color=#44afee>10</color> seconds. The Mark effect can be stacked up to 5 times. Each stack of the Marks increases the P.DMG dealt to the target by <color=#44afee>8%%</color> (can be stacked with Multi Firing Marks). This skill can be used in conjunction with Elemental Arrow.",
    ["SkillDesc_1511121"]="Sends your falcon to attack an enemy, dealing ((<color=#44afee>Steel Crow</color> damage + (INT/<color=#44afee>8</color>)^<color=#44afee>1.8</color> + DEX × <color=#44afee>2</color>) × <color=#44afee>%s</color> + <color=#44afee>%s</color>) <color=#44afee>Neutral</color> attribute P.DMG that <color=#44afee>ignores defense</color>. The falcon's initial size modifier against enemies is <color=#44afee>100%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_1511123"]="Increases your Movement Speed by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> and Dodge by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_1511124"]="Increases sniping ability in a short period of time. After casting the skill, increases six basic attributes by <color=#44afee>10</color> points each, P.ATK by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>, Crit DMG Bonus by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>, and Final Physical Penetration by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>. Every <color=#44afee>50</color> DEX adds: <color=#44afee>0.25%%</color> P.ATK, <color=#44afee>1%%</color> Crit DMG, and <color=#44afee>0.5%%</color> Final Physical Penetration. Lasts <color=#44afee>15</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_1511126"]="Deploy an Anklesnare with an effect radius of <color=#44afee>3</color> meters and a trigger radius of <color=#44afee>2</color> meters at the specified location. After detonating, deals ((DEX + <color=#44afee>100</color>) × (<color=#44afee>10</color> + INT/<color=#44afee>10</color>) × <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>) + <color=#44afee>%s</color>) Neutral physical damage to all enemies within the area and has a <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> chance to immobilize them for <color=#44afee>%s</color> second(s). Immobilized units can cast skills but cannot move. After the Immobilize state ends, the unit becomes immune to Immobilize for <color=#44afee>1.5</color> seconds. Your other traps deal <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> more damage to immobilized units. Anklesnare lasts for <color=#44afee>180</color> seconds. Up to <color=#44afee>7</color> traps can be deployed at the same time.",
    ["SkillDesc_1511128"]="While having multiple arrows in your hand, fire <color=#44afee>7</color> arrows to the <color=#44afee>60°</color> fan-shaped area in front of you and knock back the hit target for <color=#44afee>2</color> meters. Each arrow deals weapon attribute physical damage equal to (<color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of Physical Attack) to an enemy and marks the target for<color=#44afee>10</color> seconds. The Mark effect can be stacked up to 5 times. Each stack of the Marks increases the physical damage dealt to the target by <color=#44afee>8%%</color> (can be stacked with Focused Shot). This skill can be used in conjunction with Elemental Arrow.",
    ["SkillDesc_1511130"]="After equipping a Freezing Arrow, your <color=#44afee>normal attacks</color>, <color=#44afee>Double Strafe</color>, <color=#44afee>Charge Arrow</color>, <color=#44afee>Multi Firing</color>, or <color=#44afee>Focused Shot</color> will expend an arrow, changing your damage type to <color=#44afee>Water</color> and increasing skill damage by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>. There is a <color=#44afee>100%%</color> chance to slow the target by <color=#44afee>30%%</color> for <color=#44afee>2</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_1511131"]="Charges up and fires a powerful arrow at a target, dealing (<color=#44afee>%s%%</color> P.ATK + <color=#44afee>%s</color>) Physical Damage of your Weapon's attribute to enemies in its path and knocking them back <color=#44afee>4</color> meters. This skill has a <color=#44afee>30%%</color> chance to increase skill damage by an additional <color=#44afee>100%%</color>. Can be used in conjunction with Elemental Bolt.",
    ["SkillDesc_1511132"]="Deploys a Sandman trap with an effect radius of <color=#44afee>3</color> meters and trigger radius of <color=#44afee>2</color> meters at the specified location. After detonating, deals ((DEX + <color=#44afee>100</color>) × (<color=#44afee>10</color> + INT/<color=#44afee>10</color>) × <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>) + <color=#44afee>%s</color> Neutral physical damage to all enemy in range and has a <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> chance to make the target sleep for <color=#44afee>%s</color> seconds. After the Sleep state ends, the unit that triggered the Sandman trap becomes immune to Sleep for <color=#44afee>1.5</color> seconds. The trap lasts for <color=#44afee>180</color> seconds. Up to <color=#44afee>7</color> traps can be deployed at the same time.",
    ["SkillDesc_1511133"]="Whenever a beast attacks, you gain a stack of Ace Tamer. When in the Ace Tamer state, your ATK increases by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> for <color=#44afee>7</color> seconds. Ace Tamer can stack up to <color=#44afee>3</color> times.",
    ["SkillDesc_1511134"]="Increases your LUK by <color=#44afee>%s</color> and chance to trigger a beast attack by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_1511135"]="When using <color=#44afee>Falcon Assault</color> and <color=#44afee>Blitz Beat</color>, there is a <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> chance to peck the enemy unit, stunning it for <color=#44afee>%s</color> second(s), during which your normal attacks and skills deal <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> more damage.",
    ["SkillDesc_1512001"]="Mounts a Warg that increases MSPD by <color=#44afee>4</color> points in battle (<color=#44afee>2</color> points in PVP). Reduces ASPD by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> and Final Haste by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> while increasing P.ATK by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>. When not mounted on any combat mount, a Warg will be summoned to follow by your side.",
    ["SkillDesc_1512002"]="Commands your Warg to dash forward <color=#44afee>12</color> meters in the desired direction, dealing Neutral attribute P.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> P.ATK to all enemies in its path and reducing MSPD by <color=#44afee>%s</color>. To cast, mount a Warg first.",
    ["SkillDesc_1512003"]="Commands a Warg to savagely bite a target, dealing <color=#44afee>Neutral</color> attribute P.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of P.ATK, with a <color=#44afee>50%%</color> chance of inflicting Bleed. While in effect, the target loses HP equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of Max HP per second for <color=#44afee>4</color> seconds (does not apply to MVP, MINI, or Boss). Can only be triggered when the Warg is following. The Warg's initial size modifier against enemies is <color=#44afee>100%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_1512004"]="Grants a <color=#44afee>2%%</color> chance of triggering Prowling Wolf when dealing a normal attack. Once triggered, your Warg launches a vicious attack, dealing Neutral attribute P.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of P.ATK and an additional <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> when the target's HP is below <color=#44afee>20%%</color>. Can only be triggered when the Warg is following. The Warg's initial size modifier against enemies is <color=#44afee>100%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_1512005"]="Grants Aimed Bolt, during which you are immobilized. After drawing your bowstring back, you then fire a powerful arrow at one target, dealing weapon attribute P.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of P.ATK. Every <color=#44afee>4</color> DEX increases the damage coefficient of this skill by <color=#44afee>1%%</color> of P.ATK, up to <color=#44afee>3,000%%</color>. If your Final Crit is higher than Final P.PEN, this skill may trigger critical damage. Can be used with Elemental Arrow. If the hit target's HP is below <color=#44afee>50%%</color>, the cooldown of Aimed Bolt is reduced by <color=#44afee>4</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_1512006"]="Spins rapidly while firing continuously, dealing <color=#44afee>6</color> attacks to enemies within a <color=#44afee>6</color>-meter radius for <color=#44afee>3</color> seconds and inflicting weapon attribute P.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of P.ATK. Can be used with Elemental Arrow. If your Final Crit is higher than Final P.PEN, this skill may trigger critical damage. The healing gained from Physical Lifesteal through this skill's damage is increased by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>. This skill can be cast while moving and is not affected by Vulture's Eye.",
    ["SkillDesc_1512007"]="Grants Fear Breeze upon triggering a crit, increasing Crit Damage Bonus by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> for <color=#44afee>2</color> sec. Can be stacked up to <color=#44afee>4</color> times.",
    ["SkillDesc_1512008"]="A normal attack that splits into multiple arrows, dealing <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> Splash Damage to up to <color=#44afee>2</color> enemies in a 3-meter range. Arrows that deal Splash Damage can deal crits but cannot trigger Falconry Mastery or Prowling Wolf.",
    ["SkillDesc_1512009"]="Use to grant Aimed Fire, reducing Final Attack Speed by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>. While in effect, each normal attack unleashes <color=#44afee>3</color> arrows on a target, dealing Weapon-based Physical Damage equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> Physical Attack per arrow, with a chance of triggering a crit, Falconry Mastery, or Prowling Wolf for <color=#44afee>10</color> sec. May be paired with Elemental Arrows. Split Arrows cannot be triggered for the duration of the skill.",
    ["SkillDesc_1512010"]="Continuously fire at enemies within a 60° fan-shaped area in front of you for 3 seconds, dealing weapon attribute physical damage equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of Physical Attack per arrow. This skill can be used in conjunction with Elemental Arrow. When a target is hit by no less than <color=#44afee>5</color> arrows, they will be Wounded, reducing their healing received by <color=#44afee>50%%</color> (including Lifesteal) for <color=#44afee>5</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_1512011"]="Extracts the elemental power of an arrow, fusing it with a trap that covers a 4-meter radius. Upon consuming [Arrow] and [Trap], the arrow’s attributes are granted to the elemental trap, after which, if an enemy triggers it, the armor attributes of all enemies within range will be synchronized with the trap’s elemental attribute (does not apply to Boss, MINI and MVP targets). This effect lasts for <color=#44afee>3</color> sec, and the trap itself can exist for up to <color=#44afee>%s</color> sec, with a maximum of <color=#44afee>7</color> traps at one time (including all other trap types).",
    ["SkillDesc_1512012"]="A modified trap, which increasing the trigger area of effect by <color=#44afee>2</color> meters and granting increased Movement Speed while pursuing the triggerer. Upon triggering the trap, it will use <color=#44afee>%s</color> Movement Speed to pursue the enemy before exploding. Does not apply to [Elemental Trap].",
    ["SkillDesc_1513001"]="When you have <color=#44afee>1</color> stack of <color=#44afee>Ace Tamer</color>, command your falcon to snipe the target by consuming every stack of <color=#44afee>Ace Tamer</color>. Each <color=#44afee>1</color> stack of <color=#44afee>Ace Tamer</color> consumed deals <color=#44afee>1</color> hit, with each hit dealing ((Steel Crow damage + (INT/8)^1.8 + DEX x 2) x <color=#44afee>%s</color>) <color=#44afee>Neutral</color> attribute P.DMG that ignores defense. The falcon's initial size modifier against enemies is <color=#44afee>100%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_1513002"]="Increases the range of <color=#44afee>Blitz Beat</color>, <color=#44afee>Falcon Assault</color>, and <color=#44afee>Hawk Boomerang</color> by <color=#44afee>%s</color> meters. When your <color=#44afee>DEX</color> is higher than <color=#44afee>INT</color>, <color=#44afee>Falconry Mastery</color>, <color=#44afee>Blitz Beat</color>, <color=#44afee>Falcon Assault</color>, and <color=#44afee>Hawk Boomerang</color> deal <color=#44afee>%s</color> times, <color=#44afee>%s</color> times, <color=#44afee>%s</color> times, and <color=#44afee>%s</color> times the Neutral attribute DMG equal to ((Steel Crow damage + (DEX/8)^1.8 + INT x 2) that ignores defense, respectively. When you have a longbow equipped and your <color=#44afee>Final Crit</color> is higher than <color=#44afee>Final P.PEN</color>, the damage dealt by <color=#44afee>Falconry Mastery</color>, <color=#44afee>Blitz Beat</color>, <color=#44afee>Falcon Assault</color>, and <color=#44afee>Hawk Boomerang</color> can trigger critical hits.",
    ["SkillDesc_1513003"]="Rents a <color=#44afee>wind hawk</color> for combat. When normal attacks do not trigger <color=#44afee>Falconry Mastery</color>, there is a <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> chance to trigger <color=#44afee>Blitz Beat</color>, <color=#44afee>Falcon Assault</color>, and <color=#44afee>Hawk Boomerang</color>. This effect triggers once every <color=#44afee>3</color> seconds. Nature Friendly cannot be triggered by the splash effect of <color=#44afee>Splitting Arrows</color>, and it won't apply the <color=#44afee>Intimidation</color> effect when triggered. <color=#44afee>Precision Shot</color> can trigger the attack effect. If your INT reaches <color=#44afee>3,000</color> or higher, every <color=#44afee>1</color> additional INT increases your P.ATK by <color=#44afee>4</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_1513004"]="Increases the range of <color=#44afee>Warg Bite</color> by <color=#44afee>%s</color> meters. There's a <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> chance to trigger <color=#44afee>Warg Bite</color> when <color=#44afee>Wind Warg</color> is in follow mode and the normal attack doesn't trigger <color=#44afee>Prowling Wolf</color>. When you have a longbow equipped and your <color=#44afee>INT</color> is higher than <color=#44afee>DEX</color>, the skill coefficient of <color=#44afee>Prowling Wolf</color>, <color=#44afee>Warg Strike</color>, and <color=#44afee>Warg Bite</color> is increased by 1%% (up to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>) for every <color=#44afee>%s</color> INT you possessed. When you have a longbow equipped and your <color=#44afee>Final Crit</color> is higher than <color=#44afee>Final P.PEN</color>, the damage of <color=#44afee>Prowling Wolf</color>, <color=#44afee>Warg Strike</color>, and <color=#44afee>Warg Bite</color> can trigger critical hits.",
    ["SkillDesc_1513005"]="Mounts the <color=#44afee>wind hawk</color> to take <color=#44afee>Flight</color> for <color=#44afee>6</color> seconds, increasing MSPD by <color=#44afee>5</color>. During the flight, you can't attack and are immune to all ongoing ground effects from enemies (except those from MVP, MINI, and Instance Boss units). You also receive a shield equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of your Max HP. When time is up, or the shield is depleted, the <color=#44afee>Flight</color> is canceled immediately. Upon landing, enemies within <color=#44afee>6</color> meters are inflicted with <color=#44afee>Blind</color> for <color=#44afee>3</color> seconds, and you enter <color=#44afee>Bombard</color> for <color=#44afee>6</color> seconds, increasing your damage against enemies with less than <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> HP by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_1513006"]="When dealing damage to enemies with Aimed Bolt, No Limits, Arrow Storm, Gale Storm, or Crescive Bolt, there's a <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> chance to apply <color=#44afee>Wind Sign</color> to the target. While marked, the target cannot enter <color=#44afee>Hiding</color>. The <color=#44afee>Wind Sign</color> lasts for <color=#44afee>5</color> seconds and can only be triggered <color=#44afee>once</color> every <color=#44afee>20</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_1513007"]="When <color=#44afee>Wind Sign</color> is applied to the target, <color=#44afee>Calamity Gale</color> is summoned at the target's location. <color=#44afee>Calamity Gale</color> will follow the target, dealing weapon attribute P.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of P.ATK every <color=#44afee>0.5</color> to all enemies within a <color=#44afee>3</color>-meter radius. <color=#44afee>Calamity Gale</color> lasts for <color=#44afee>5</color> and up to <color=#44afee>8</color> <color=#44afee>Calamity Gale</color> can be summoned at the same time.",
    ["SkillDesc_1513008"]="Launches the destructive Arrow Storm, dealing weapon attribute P.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of P.ATK to targets within a <color=#44afee>6</color>-meter radius. For each <color=#44afee>1</color> additional target hit, Gale Storm's damage increases by <color=#44afee>20%%</color>, up to <color=#44afee>100%%</color>. Hitting <color=#44afee>6</color> or more targets reduces the cooldown by <color=#44afee>8</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_1513009"]="Creates a sniper zone at your position, allowing you to cast Crescive Bolt <color=#44afee>5</color> times and deal weapon attribute P.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of P.ATK to all enemies on the path each time. Consumes <color=#44afee>10%%</color> Max SP for per cast. <color=#44afee>Each</color> successive cast increases the damage by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>. The sniper zone lasts for <color=#44afee>12</color> seconds but disappears if you leave.",
    ["SkillDesc_1513010"]="For every <color=#44afee>%s</color> INT you have, the damage of traps is increased by <color=#44afee>1%%</color>, up to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>, and the range of traps is increased by <color=#44afee>2</color> meters.",
    ["SkillDesc_1513011"]="Shoots at a targeted area to create a <color=#44afee>4</color>-meter radius Elemental Arrow Array. Consumes <color=#44afee>arrows</color> on use, and the array adopts the element of the current <color=#44afee>arrow</color> type. Enemies in the array take extra <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> elemental damage from party members. The array lasts for <color=#44afee>8</color> seconds and doesn't count toward the trap limit.",
    ["SkillDesc_1513012"]="Wind Hawk can ride their summoned <color=#44afee>Wind Warg</color> in battle. Using the whistle automatically mounts the <color=#44afee>Wind Warg</color>. Using the <color=#44afee>whistle</color> again will dismount, switching the <color=#44afee>Wind Warg</color> to follow mode, and you can remount after <color=#44afee>5</color> seconds. When <color=#44afee>Wind Warg</color> is in follow mode, the chance to trigger Prowling Wolf is increased by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_1520001"]="Releases a powerful arrow from an instrument, dealing (P.ATK ×<color=#44afee>%s%%</color>) total physical damage of your weapon's attribute to an enemy over <color=#44afee>3</color> attacks. An instrument weapon must be equipped. Can be used in conjunction with Elemental Arrow.",
    ["SkillDesc_1520002"]="Deals (P.ATK ×<color=#44afee>%s%%</color>) Neutral physical damage to all enemies within <color=#44afee>4</color>m, with a <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> chance to <color=#44afee>freeze</color> them for <color=#44afee>4</color> seconds. The chance of freezing targets who have lower INT than yourself increases by ((your INT - target's INT)/(Base Level ×<color=#44afee>300</color>)).",
    ["SkillDesc_1520003"]="Improves the ability to control musical instruments, increasing P.ATK by (INT ×<color=#44afee>%s%%</color>) when using an instrument weapon, and increasing MSPD by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> when performing a music skill.",
    ["SkillDesc_1520004"]="Performs a solo skill, dealing (P.ATK ×<color=#44afee>%s%%</color> + INT ×<color=#44afee>%s</color>) physical damage of your weapon's attribute to all enemies within <color=#44afee>4</color>m every <color=#44afee>1</color> second. The performance lasts <color=#44afee>30</color> seconds and consumes <color=#44afee>10</color> SP every second. An instrument weapon must be equipped.",
    ["SkillDesc_1520005"]="Performs a solo skill, increasing the Final ASPD of party members within <color=#44afee>6</color>m by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> during the performance. Additionally increases the Final ASPD bonus by <color=#44afee>1%%</color> for every <color=#44afee>%s</color> INT of the caster. The performance lasts <color=#44afee>30</color> seconds and consumes <color=#44afee>10</color> SP every second. An instrument weapon must be equipped. Effects of the same songs do not stack when their performance ranges overlap.",
    ["SkillDesc_1520006"]="Performs a solo skill, increasing the Max HP of party members within <color=#44afee>6</color>m by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> during the performance. Additionally increases the Max HP bonus by <color=#44afee>1%%</color> for every <color=#44afee>%s</color> VIT of the caster. The performance lasts <color=#44afee>30</color> seconds and consumes <color=#44afee>10</color> SP every second. An instrument weapon must be equipped. Effects of the same songs do not stack when their performance ranges overlap.",
    ["SkillDesc_1520007"]="Releases a powerful sound wave, dealing (P.ATK ×<color=#44afee>%s%%</color> + AGI or INT (whichever is higher) ×<color=#44afee>%s</color>) total physical damage of your weapon's attribute to all enemies along the specified path over <color=#44afee>5</color> attacks.",
    ["SkillDesc_1520008"]="Reduces the SP cost of solo and ensemble skills by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_1520009"]="When an instrument is equipped, each <color=#44afee>1</color> INT additionally increases your Haste by <color=#44afee>%s</color>. When a whip is equipped, each <color=#44afee>1</color> AGI additionally increases your Haste by <color=#44afee>%s</color>. Bards or Dancers can use this skill to stop solo or ensemble skills that are being performed.\n(The Haste bonus takes effect only after equipping the skill to the skill slot.)",
    ["SkillDesc_1520010"]="Invites <color=#44afee>Bards</color> or <color=#44afee>Dancers</color> in the party to perform an ensemble together. They will gain the <color=#44afee>Ensemble</color> status after the invite, and ensemble skills can be performed when the ensemble partner is nearby. While under the Ensemble status, you both take <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> less damage. Using this skill again cancels the <color=#44afee>Ensemble</color> status.",
    ["SkillDesc_1520011"]="Performs an ensemble skill, creating a fixed <color=#44afee>6</color>m field that increases the adaptive damage of party members within range by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>. The performance lasts <color=#44afee>30</color> seconds and consumes <color=#44afee>20</color> SP every second (the ensemble partner's SP is not consumed). The specified ensemble partner must have learned this skill (the skill's effect level is equal to the sum of the skill level of you both divided by <color=#44afee>2</color> and rounded to a whole number). An instrument or whip weapon must be equipped. Effects of the same songs do not stack when their performance ranges overlap.",
    ["SkillDesc_1520012"]="Performs an ensemble skill, creating a fixed <color=#44afee>6</color>m field that increases the Base EXP and Job EXP of party members within range by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> (Odin bonus EXP and event EXP are not counted). The performance lasts <color=#44afee>30</color> seconds and consumes <color=#44afee>20</color> SP every second (the ensemble partner's SP is not consumed). The specified ensemble partner must have learned this skill (the skill's effect level is equal to the sum of skill level of you both divided by <color=#44afee>2</color> and rounded to a whole number). An instrument or whip weapon must be equipped.",
    ["SkillDesc_1521001"]="Generate maddening sounds at the target area with an instrument, dealing P.ATK ×<color=#44afee><%s%%></color> + INT ×<color=#44afee><%s></color> physical damage of your weapon's attribute to targets within range and <color=#44afee>confusing</color> them. <color=#44afee>Confused</color> enemies can't tell where they are moving for <color=#44afee>3</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_1521002"]="Shoots a large number of bolts continuously, dealing (P.ATK x<color=#44afee>%s%%</color> + (INT + AGI) x<color=#44afee>%s</color>) total physical damage of your weapon's attribute to an enemy over <color=#44afee>6</color> attacks. This skill can be used while a music skill is being performed, and can be used with Elemental Bolt. A whip or instrument weapon must be equipped.",
    ["SkillDesc_1521003"]="Performs a solo skill, reducing the casting time of all party members within <color=#44afee>4</color>m by <color=#44afee>%s</color> seconds and making their casting uninterruptable during the performance. The performance lasts <color=#44afee>30</color> seconds and consumes <color=#44afee>10</color> SP every second. An instrument weapon must be equipped. Effects of the same songs do not stack when their performance ranges overlap.",
    ["SkillDesc_1521004"]="Performs a solo skill, increasing the Threat of all monsters within <color=#44afee>4</color>m by <color=#44afee>1</color> during the performance. Non-monster targets will stop and watch, becoming immobilized for <color=#44afee>%s</color> seconds. This skill only takes effect on targets once until they leave the performance range. The performance lasts <color=#44afee>30</color> seconds and consumes <color=#44afee>10</color> SP every second. An instrument weapon must be equipped. Effects of the same songs do not stack when their performance ranges overlap.",
    ["SkillDesc_1521005"]="Shoots countless bolts into the sky, dealing weapon attribute P.DMG equal to (<color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of P.ATK + (INT + AGI) x<color=#44afee>%s</color>) to all enemies within <color=#44afee>4</color> meters every <color=#44afee>0.5</color> seconds for <color=#44afee>3</color> seconds. The damage increases by <color=#44afee>10%%</color> every wave. Can be used with Elemental Arrow.",
    ["SkillDesc_1521006"]="While under the Solo and Ensemble status, gains 1 stack of <color=#44afee>Polymeric Note</color> every <color=#44afee>3</color> seconds. <color=#44afee>Polymeric Note</color> lasts for <color=#44afee>10</color> seconds and stacks up to <color=#44afee>10</color> times. Each stack increases P.ATK by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_1521007"]="Increases Max SP by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> and SP Regen by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>. Also increases MSPD by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> when performing a solo.\nIf your INT reaches <color=#44afee>3,000</color> or higher, every <color=#44afee>1</color> additional INT increases your P.ATK by <color=#44afee>4</color>.\nIf your AGI reaches <color=#44afee>3,000</color> or higher, every <color=#44afee>1</color> additional AGI increases your P.ATK by <color=#44afee>4</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_1521008"]="Performs an ensemble skill, creating a fixed <color=#44afee>6</color>m field that increases the Final Physical Damage Bonus and Final Magic Damage Bonus of party members within range by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>. For every <color=#44afee>50</color> INT or AGI the caster has (whichever is higher), additionally increases party members' Final Physical and Magic Damage Bonus by <color=#44afee>0.6%%</color>. The performance lasts <color=#44afee>30</color> seconds and consumes <color=#44afee>20</color> SP every second (the ensemble partner's SP is not consumed). The specified ensemble partner must have learned this skill. The skill's effect level is equal to the skill level of both parties divided by <color=#44afee>2</color>, rounded down. An instrument or whip weapon must be equipped. Effects of the same songs do not stack when their performance ranges overlap.",
    ["SkillDesc_1521009"]="Performs an ensemble skill, creating a fixed <color=#44afee>6</color>m field that reduces the Wind, Earth, Water, and Fire damage taken by party members within range by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> and increases their Debuff Resistance by <color=#44afee>%s</color>. For every <color=#44afee>50</color> INT or AGI the caster has, additionally increases the Wind, Earth, Water, and Fire DMG Reduction by <color=#44afee>0.5%%</color> and Debuff Resistance of party members by <color=#44afee>0.5</color>. (Debuff Resistance and Elemental DMG Reduction can be increased by up to <color=#44afee>70</color> and <color=#44afee>70%%</color>, respectively.) The performance lasts <color=#44afee>60</color> seconds and consumes <color=#44afee>15</color> SP every second (the ensemble partner's SP is not consumed). The specified ensemble partner must have learned this skill. The skill's effect level is equal to the sum of the skill levels of both parties divided by <color=#44afee>2</color>, rounded down. An instrument or whip must be equipped to cast the skill. Effects of the same songs do not stack when their performance ranges overlap.",
    ["SkillDesc_1521010"]="When an ensemble skill is in effect, the Bard and Dancer do not need to maintain the ensemble posture and can move freely within the skill's range using attack skills (but not solo skills). The damage you take during the ensemble is reduced by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_1521011"]="Chorus Skill: The performer sings in a beautiful voice of morning dew, granting the <color=#44afee>Salvation</color> status to all allied units within <color=#44afee>30</color> meters. This status, while active, reduces their damage taken by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> and restores <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of their lost HP every <color=#44afee>4</color> times they are attacked (the healing triggers once every <color=#44afee>4</color> seconds). <color=#44afee>Salvation</color> lasts <color=#44afee>10</color> seconds. Every Bard or Dancer-branch class existing in the party will reduce the damage taken by an additional <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> and increase the healing by an additional <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>. Casting this skill consumes <color=#44afee>Throat Lozenge</color> x1.",
    ["SkillDesc_1521012"]="Performs a chorus skill that creates a huge echo with singing, dealing (P.ATK ×<color=#44afee>%s%%</color> + (AGI + INT) ×<color=#44afee>%s</color>) physical damage of your weapon's attribute to all enemies along the specified <color=#44afee>8</color>m path. For every Bard or Dancer in the party, additionally increases damage by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>, up to <color=#44afee>75%%</color>. Casting this skill consumes <color=#44afee>Throat Lozenge</color> ×1.",
    ["SkillDesc_1522001"]="Attacks the target with a high-pitched sound, dealing (P.ATK ×<color=#44afee>%s%%</color>) physical damage of your weapon's attribute to the target and stunning them for <color=#44afee>3</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_1522002"]="Creates a <color=#44afee>4</color>-meter sonic field at a designated location, dealing weapon attribute P.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of P.ATK to enemies within range every <color=#44afee>0.5</color> seconds for <color=#44afee>8</color> seconds. Targets within range will be slowed by <color=#44afee>50%%</color>. Casting this skill consumes <color=#44afee>Throat Lozenge</color> x1.",
    ["SkillDesc_1522003"]="Whenever performing a solo, ensemble, or chorus, grants yourself 1 stack of <color=#44afee>Echo</color>. Each stack of <color=#44afee>Echo</color> increases the damage of <color=#44afee>Dominion Impulse</color> by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>. <color=#44afee>Echo</color> lasts <color=#44afee>15</color> seconds and can stack up to <color=#44afee>10</color> times.",
    ["SkillDesc_1522004"]="Tells the fortune of all party members, distributing one of the <color=#44afee>[Grail]</color>, <color=#44afee>[Sceptre]</color>, <color=#44afee>[Sword]</color>, and <color=#44afee>[Star Coin]</color> cards to each member and randomly generating the points of each card, up to <color=#44afee>%s</color> points (the number of card points is equal to the number of buff stacks). <color=#44afee>[Grail]</color>: Grants <color=#44afee>2%%</color> Max HP regen for every 1 point (restores HP 1 time every 5 seconds) for <color=#44afee>30</color> seconds. <color=#44afee>[Sceptre]</color>: Grants <color=#44afee>4%%</color> M.ATK for every 1 point for <color=#44afee>30</color> seconds. <color=#44afee>[Sword]</color>: Grants <color=#44afee>4%%</color> P.ATK for every 1 point for <color=#44afee>30</color> seconds. <color=#44afee>[Star Coin]</color>: Grants <color=#44afee>4%%</color> Final DMG Reduction for every 1 point for <color=#44afee>30</color> seconds. The deck is shuffled when this skill is used repeatedly, and cards will be reassigned to party members again.",
    ["SkillDesc_1522005"]="There is a <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> chance to resurrect 1 designated ally with <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of their Max HP and <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of their Max SP. There is an additional {[(<color=#44afee>INT</color> + <color=#44afee>AGI</color>) /<color=#44afee>Base Level</color>] x <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>} chance to successfully resurrect (up to <color=#44afee>30%%</color>).",
    ["SkillDesc_1522006"]="Summons a marionette at the specified location. The marionette then bursts open, dealing (P.ATK ×<color=#44afee>%s%%</color>) Neutral physical damage to all enemy targets within <color=#44afee>3</color>m. After that, you appear at the location of the marionette.",
    ["SkillDesc_1522007"]="Performs a solo skill, restoring <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of Max HP to all party members within <color=#44afee>4</color>m every 3 seconds. The performance lasts <color=#44afee>30</color> seconds and consumes <color=#44afee>10</color> SP every second. An instrument or whip weapon must be equipped.",
    ["SkillDesc_1522008"]="Whenever the performance of <color=#44afee>[Assassin Cross of Sunset]</color>, <color=#44afee>[The Apple of Idun]</color>, <color=#44afee>[A Poem of Bragi]</color>, or <color=#44afee>[Circle of Nature's Sound]</color> ends, their buffs will last for an additional <color=#44afee>%s</color> seconds. This effect is triggered once every <color=#44afee>30</color> seconds. The effect increases by <color=#44afee>1</color> second for every <color=#44afee>600</color> <color=#44afee>INT</color> or <color=#44afee>AGI</color> (whichever is higher), up to <color=#44afee>15</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_1522009"]="Performs an ensemble skill, creating a fixed <color=#44afee>6</color>m field that puts all enemy units within range to <color=#44afee>sleep</color> for <color=#44afee>4</color> seconds. <color=#44afee>Sleeping</color> targets cannot move or attack, and their Final Physical and Final Magic Damage Reduction are reduced by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>. <color=#44afee>10</color> stacks of <color=#44afee>sleep</color> will be applied at the beginning, and 1 stack will be removed each time the target takes damage from a normal attack or skill. Targets that awaken from <color=#44afee>sleep</color> cannot be put to <color=#44afee>sleep</color> again within <color=#44afee>8</color> seconds. The performance lasts <color=#44afee>30</color> seconds and consumes <color=#44afee>20</color> SP every second (the ensemble partner's SP is not consumed). The specified ensemble partner must have learned this skill. The skill's effect level is equal to the skill level of both parties divided by 2, rounded down. An instrument or whip weapon must be equipped.",
    ["SkillDesc_1522010"]="When you are not sending an ensemble invite, you can perform an ensemble with a marionette that cannot attack, move, or take damage. The marionette's skill level in the ensemble is <color=#44afee>Lv.%s</color>, and the performance time of the ensemble is reduced by <color=#44afee>10</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_1522011"]="Performs a chorus skill with a unique musical rhythm that makes all enemy targets within <color=#44afee>6</color>m enter a <color=#44afee>dancing</color> state and dance wildly (they are unable to move or attack during this time) for <color=#44afee>3</color> seconds. They then become <color=#44afee>exhausted</color>, losing <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> Max HP and Max SP every second with their healing effect reduced by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> (this has no effect on bosses, MVP, and MINI). <color=#44afee>Exhaustion</color> lasts for <color=#44afee>3</color> seconds. For every Bard or Dancer in the party, additionally increases the Max HP and Max SP lost every second by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> and the healing effect reduction by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>. Casting this skill consumes <color=#44afee>Throat Lozenge</color> ×1.",
    ["SkillDesc_1522012"]="Whenever another Bard or Dancer in the party uses a chorus skill within 30m, if your corresponding chorus skill is on cooldown, there is a <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> chance of reducing your chorus skill cooldown by <color=#44afee>1</color> second.",
    ["SkillDesc_1523001"]="While performing alongside an ensemble partner, attacking using <color=#44afee>Musical Strike</color>, <color=#44afee>Throw Arrow</color>, <color=#44afee>Arrow Vulcan</color>, <color=#44afee>Metallic Sound</color>, or <color=#44afee>Rhythm Shooting</color> has a <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> chance to apply <color=#44afee>Sound Blend</color> to the target. This effect triggers <color=#44afee>once</color> every <color=#44afee>2</color> seconds. <color=#44afee>Sound Blend</color> can be stacked up to <color=#44afee>5</color> times. Each stack of <color=#44afee>Sound Blend</color> increases the damage received by the target from both the caster and the ensemble partner by <color=#44afee>6%%</color>. <color=#44afee>Sound Blend</color> lasts for <color=#44afee>6</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_1523002"]="During a solo or ensemble performance, for every <color=#44afee>5</color> seconds, a random music note of the following will be on roll call: do, re, mi, fa, sol, la, si. Casting Rhythm Shooting deals weapon attribute P.DMG equal to (<color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of P.ATK + (INT or AGI, whichever is higher) x <color=#44afee>%s</color>, up to <color=#44afee>2</color> times the P.ATK) to the target. Depending on the call, Rhythm Shooting's initial damage varies: do -> <color=#44afee>1</color>, re -> <color=#44afee>9/8</color>, mi -> <color=#44afee>5/4</color>, fa -> <color=#44afee>4/3</color>, sol -> <color=#44afee>3/2</color>, la -> <color=#44afee>5/3</color>, si -> <color=#44afee>15/8</color>. This skill can be used in conjunction with Elemental Arrow.",
    ["SkillDesc_1523003"]="Shoots an arrow imbued with rose seeds, dealing weapon attribute P.DMG equal to (<color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of P.ATK + (INT or AGI, whichever is higher) x <color=#44afee>%s</color>, up to <color=#44afee>5</color> times the P.ATK) to enemies within a <color=#44afee>6</color>-meter radius. For every <color=#44afee>additional</color> target in the area, Rose Blossom's damage increases by <color=#44afee>6%%</color>, up to <color=#44afee>30%%</color>. This skill can be used in conjunction with Elemental Arrow.",
    ["SkillDesc_1523004"]="Sends out an echo blast, clearing all <color=#44afee>Sound Blend</color> effects and dealing weapon attribute P.DMG equal to (<color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of P.ATK + (INT or AGI, whichever is higher) x <color=#44afee>%s</color>, up to <color=#44afee>3</color> times the P.ATK). For <color=#44afee>each</color> stack of <color=#44afee>Sound Blend</color> cleared, Metallic Fury's damage increases by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_1523005"]="Performs a solo skill, increasing the damage against Demon monsters by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of all party members within a 6-meter radius. The performance lasts <color=#44afee>30</color> seconds and consumes <color=#44afee>15</color> SP every second. An instrument weapon must be equipped. Effects of the same songs do not stack when their performance ranges overlap. (Affected by Lingering Sound)",
    ["SkillDesc_1523006"]="Performs a solo skill, increasing the Final M.PEN and Final M.DMG Bonus of all party members within a 6-meter radius by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> and <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>. The performance lasts <color=#44afee>30</color> seconds and consumes <color=#44afee>15</color> SP every second. An instrument weapon must be equipped. Effects of the same songs do not stack when their performance ranges overlap. (Affected by Lingering Sound)",
    ["SkillDesc_1523007"]="Performs an ensemble skill, creating a <color=#44afee>6</color>-meter fixed field that increases the highest main attribute (STR, AGI, INT, DEX, or LUK) of party members within range by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>. The performance lasts <color=#44afee>30</color> seconds and consumes <color=#44afee>30</color> SP every second (the ensemble partner's SP is not consumed). The specified ensemble partner must have learned this skill. The skill's effect level is equal to the sum of the skill levels of both parties divided by 2, rounded to a whole number. An instrument or whip must be equipped to cast the skill. Effects of the same songs do not stack when their performance ranges overlap.",
    ["SkillDesc_1523008"]="If party members are within an ensemble range, they gain <color=#44afee>Retrospection</color>, allowing them to retain the ensemble buffs even after leaving the field or after the ensemble ends. <color=#44afee>Retrospection</color> lasts for <color=#44afee>%s</color> second(s) and can be triggered <color=#44afee>once</color> every <color=#44afee>%s</color> seconds. <color=#44afee>Retrospection</color> can only be triggered by an ensemble; while active, other ensemble buffs can still be received.",
    ["SkillDesc_1523009"]="When performing with an ensemble partner, the ensemble casting range is increased by <color=#44afee>4</color> meters, and its effective range is increased by <color=#44afee>2</color> meters. During the ensemble, you or your partner may temporarily leave the area, but if only <color=#44afee>1</color> performer remains within the range, and another one does not return within <color=#44afee>%s</color> seconds, the ensemble will be forcibly terminated.",
    ["SkillDesc_1523010"]="After starting the ensemble, if the partner is outside the performance range, there's a <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> chance to trigger <color=#44afee>Musical Interlude</color>. Each successful trigger delays the partner's return timer by <color=#44afee>2</color> seconds. This effect can only be triggered <color=#44afee>once</color> every <color=#44afee>2</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_1523011"]="During an ensemble, all party members within 30 meters have a <color=#44afee>30%%</color> chance to gain Mystic Symphony's <color=#44afee>Inspire</color> effect every <color=#44afee>5</color> seconds, reducing their damage taken by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>. The <color=#44afee>Inspire</color> effect lasts for <color=#44afee>10</color> seconds. Each party member can only receive this effect <color=#44afee>once</color> every <color=#44afee>14</color> seconds. Mystic Symphony can only be triggered by an ensemble.",
    ["SkillDesc_1523012"]="Performs a hunting chorus and sends waves of terrifying wails, dealing weapon attribute P.DMG equal to (<color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of P.ATK + (INT or AGI, whichever is higher) x <color=#44afee>%s</color>, up to <color=#44afee>1.5</color> times the P.ATK) to enemies within a <color=#44afee>6</color>-meter radius every 0.5 seconds for <color=#44afee>6</color> seconds. Enemies within the area have a <color=#44afee>8%%</color> chance to suffer <color=#44afee>Remorse</color>. While under the effect of <color=#44afee>Remorse</color>, any debuffs removed from the enemies will be reapplied, lasting for <color=#44afee>6</color> seconds. Casting this skill consumes Throat Lozenge x1.",
    ["SkillDesc_1530001"]="Grab and throw an arrow with a whiplash, dealing (P.ATK ×<color=#44afee>%s%%</color>) total physical damage of your weapon's attribute to an enemy over <color=#44afee>3</color> attacks. A whip weapon must be equipped. Can be used in conjunction with Elemental Arrow.",
    ["SkillDesc_1530002"]="Deals (P.ATK ×<color=#44afee>%s%%</color>) Neutral physical damage to all enemies within <color=#44afee>4</color>m, with a <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> chance to <color=#44afee>stun</color> them for <color=#44afee>2</color> seconds. The chance of stunning targets who have lower AGI than yourself increases by ((your AGI - target's AGI)/(Base Level ×<color=#44afee>300</color>)).",
    ["SkillDesc_1530003"]="Enhances your overall physical capabilities, increasing P.ATK by (AGI ×<color=#44afee>%s%%</color>) when using a whip weapon, and increasing MSPD by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> when performing a music skill.",
    ["SkillDesc_1530004"]="Performs a solo skill, dealing (P.ATK ×<color=#44afee>%s%%</color> + AGI ×<color=#44afee>%s</color>) physical damage of your weapon's attribute to all enemies within <color=#44afee>4</color>m every second. The performance lasts <color=#44afee>30</color> seconds and consumes <color=#44afee>10</color> SP every second. A whip weapon must be equipped.",
    ["SkillDesc_1530005"]="Performs a solo skill, increasing the Final Physical Defense Penetration and Physical Damage Bonus of party members within <color=#44afee>6</color>m by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> and <color=#44afee>%s</color>, respectively, during the performance. The performance lasts <color=#44afee>30</color> seconds and consumes <color=#44afee>10</color> SP every second. A whip weapon must be equipped. Effects of the same songs do not stack when their performance ranges overlap.",
    ["SkillDesc_1530006"]="Performs a solo skill, increasing the Earth, Fire, Water, Wind, and Holy damage dealt by party members within <color=#44afee>6</color>m by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> during the performance. The performance lasts <color=#44afee>30</color> seconds and consumes <color=#44afee>10</color> SP every second. A whip weapon must be equipped. Effects of the same songs do not stack when their performance ranges overlap.",
    ["SkillDesc_1531001"]="Wink of Charm bewitches enemies in the target area, dealing (P.ATK x<color=#44afee>%s%%</color> + AGI x<color=#44afee>%s</color>) physical damage of your weapon's attribute to targets within range, and <color=#44afee>charms</color> them. <color=#44afee>Charmed</color> enemies will move toward you at the MSPD of <color=#44afee>5</color> and can't attack or use skills for <color=#44afee>3</color> seconds (invalid for BOSS, MVP, and MINI monsters).",
    ["SkillDesc_1531002"]="Performs a solo skill, increasing the Crit Damage Bonus of party members within <color=#44afee>4</color>m by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> during the performance. The performance lasts <color=#44afee>30</color> seconds and consumes <color=#44afee>10</color> SP every second. A whip weapon must be equipped. Effects of the same songs do not stack when their performance ranges overlap.",
    ["SkillDesc_1531003"]="Performs a solo skill, reducing the Final Haste of all enemy units within <color=#44afee>4</color>m by (<color=#44afee>%s</color> + your AGI/<color=#44afee>500</color>)%% during the performance. The performance lasts <color=#44afee>30</color> seconds and consumes <color=#44afee>10</color> SP every second. A whip weapon must be equipped. Effects of the same songs do not stack when their performance ranges overlap.",
    ["SkillDesc_1532001"]="Attacks the target with a high-pitched sound, dealing (P.ATK ×<color=#44afee>%s%%</color>) physical damage of your weapon's attribute to the target and stunning them for <color=#44afee>3</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_1532002"]="Deals (P.ATK ×<color=#44afee>%s%%</color>) physical damage of your weapon's attribute to all enemies within the specified <color=#44afee>4</color>m sound wave field every <color=#44afee>0.5</color> seconds for <color=#44afee>8</color> seconds, and slows them by <color=#44afee>50%%</color>. Casting this skill consumes <color=#44afee>Throat Lozenge</color> ×1.",
    ["SkillDesc_1532003"]="Whenever performing a solo, ensemble, or chorus, grants yourself 1 stack of <color=#44afee>Echo</color>. Each stack of <color=#44afee>Echo</color> increases the damage of <color=#44afee>Dominion Impulse</color> by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>. <color=#44afee>Echo</color> lasts <color=#44afee>15</color> seconds and can stack up to <color=#44afee>10</color> times.",
    ["SkillDesc_1532004"]="Tells the fortune of all party members, distributing one of the <color=#44afee>[Grail]</color>, <color=#44afee>[Sceptre]</color>, <color=#44afee>[Sword]</color>, and <color=#44afee>[Star Coin]</color> cards to each member and randomly generating the points of each card, up to <color=#44afee>%s</color> points (the number of card points is equal to the number of buff stacks). <color=#44afee>[Grail]</color>: Grants <color=#44afee>2%%</color> Max HP regen for every 1 point (restores HP 1 time every 5 seconds) for <color=#44afee>30</color> seconds. <color=#44afee>[Sceptre]</color>: Grants <color=#44afee>4%%</color> M.ATK for every 1 point for <color=#44afee>30</color> seconds. <color=#44afee>[Sword]</color>: Grants <color=#44afee>4%%</color> P.ATK for every 1 point for <color=#44afee>30</color> seconds. <color=#44afee>[Star Coin]</color>: Grants <color=#44afee>4%%</color> Final DMG Reduction for every 1 point for <color=#44afee>30</color> seconds. The deck is shuffled when this skill is used repeatedly, and cards will be reassigned to party members again.",
    ["SkillDesc_1532005"]="There is a <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> chance to resurrect 1 designated ally with <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of their Max HP and <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of their Max SP. There is an additional ((<color=#44afee>INT</color> + <color=#44afee>AGI</color>)/<color=#44afee>Base Level</color>/<color=#44afee>2000</color> ×<color=#44afee>Skill Level</color>) chance to successfully revive an ally (up to <color=#44afee>30%%</color>).",
    ["SkillDesc_1532006"]="Summons a marionette at the specified location. The marionette then bursts open, dealing (P.ATK ×<color=#44afee>%s%%</color>) Neutral physical damage to all enemy targets within <color=#44afee>3</color>m. After that, you appear at the location of the marionette.",
    ["SkillDesc_1532007"]="Performs a solo skill, restoring <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of Max HP to all party members within <color=#44afee>4</color>m every 3 seconds. The performance lasts <color=#44afee>30</color> seconds and consumes <color=#44afee>10</color> SP every second. An instrument or whip weapon must be equipped.",
    ["SkillDesc_1532008"]="Whenever the performance of <color=#44afee>[Humming]</color>, <color=#44afee>[Moonlit Serenade]</color>, <color=#44afee>[Fortune's Kiss]</color>, or <color=#44afee>[Circle of Nature's Sound]</color> ends, their buffs will last for an additional <color=#44afee>%s</color> seconds. This effect is triggered once every <color=#44afee>30</color> seconds. The effect increases by <color=#44afee>1</color> second for every <color=#44afee>600</color> <color=#44afee>INT</color> or <color=#44afee>AGI</color> (whichever is higher), up to <color=#44afee>15</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_1532009"]="Performs an ensemble skill, creating a fixed <color=#44afee>6</color>m field that puts all enemy units within range to <color=#44afee>Sleep</color> for <color=#44afee>4</color> seconds. Targets under the <color=#44afee>Sleep</color> effect cannot move or attack, and their Final Physical and Final Magic Damage Reduction are reduced by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>. <color=#44afee>10</color> stacks of <color=#44afee>Sleep</color> will be applied at the beginning, and 1 stack will be removed each time the target takes damage from a normal attack or skill. Targets that awaken from <color=#44afee>Sleep</color> cannot be put to <color=#44afee>Sleep</color> again within <color=#44afee>8</color> seconds. The performance lasts <color=#44afee>30</color> seconds and consumes <color=#44afee>20</color> SP every second (the ensemble partner's SP is not consumed). The specified ensemble partner must have learned this skill. The skill's effect level is equal to the sum of skill levels of both parties divided by 2, rounded down. An instrument or whip weapon must be equipped.",
    ["SkillDesc_1532010"]="When you are not sending an ensemble invite, you can perform an ensemble with a marionette that cannot attack, move, or take damage. The marionette's skill level in the ensemble is <color=#44afee>Lv.%s</color>, and the performance time of the ensemble is reduced by <color=#44afee>10</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_1532011"]="Performs a chorus skill with a unique musical rhythm that makes all enemy targets within <color=#44afee>6</color>m enter a <color=#44afee>[dancing]</color> state and dance wildly (they are unable to move or attack during this time) for <color=#44afee>3</color> seconds. They then become <color=#44afee>[exhausted]</color>, losing <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> Max HP and Max SP every second with their healing effect reduced by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> (this has no effect on bosses, MVP, and MINI). <color=#44afee>[Exhaustion]</color> lasts for <color=#44afee>3</color> seconds. For every Bard or Dancer in the party, additionally increases the Max HP and Max SP lost every second by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> and the healing effect reduction by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>. Casting this skill consumes <color=#44afee>[Throat Lozenge]</color> ×1.",
    ["SkillDesc_1532012"]="Whenever another Bard or Dancer in the party uses a chorus skill within 30m, if your corresponding chorus skill is on cooldown, there is a <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> chance of reducing your chorus skill cooldown by <color=#44afee>1</color> second.",
    ["SkillDesc_1533001"]="While performing alongside an ensemble partner, attacking using <color=#44afee>Musical Strike</color>, <color=#44afee>Throw Arrow</color>, <color=#44afee>Arrow Vulcan</color>, <color=#44afee>Metallic Sound</color>, or <color=#44afee>Rhythm Shooting</color> has a <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> chance to apply <color=#44afee>Sound Blend</color> to the target. This effect triggers <color=#44afee>once</color> every <color=#44afee>2</color> seconds. <color=#44afee>Sound Blend</color> can be stacked up to <color=#44afee>5</color> times. Each stack of <color=#44afee>Sound Blend</color> increases the damage received by the target from both the caster and the ensemble partner by <color=#44afee>6%%</color>. <color=#44afee>Sound Blend</color> lasts for <color=#44afee>6</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_1533002"]="During a solo or ensemble performance, for every <color=#44afee>5</color> seconds, a random music note of the following will be on roll call: do, re, mi, fa, sol, la, si. Casting Rhythm Shooting deals weapon attribute P.DMG equal to (<color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of P.ATK + (INT or AGI, whichever is higher) x <color=#44afee>%s</color>, up to <color=#44afee>2</color> times the P.ATK) to the target. Depending on the call, Rhythm Shooting's initial damage varies: do -> <color=#44afee>1</color>, re -> <color=#44afee>9/8</color>, mi -> <color=#44afee>5/4</color>, fa -> <color=#44afee>4/3</color>, sol -> <color=#44afee>3/2</color>, la -> <color=#44afee>5/3</color>, si -> <color=#44afee>15/8</color>. This skill can be used in conjunction with Elemental Arrow.",
    ["SkillDesc_1533003"]="Shoots an arrow imbued with rose seeds, dealing weapon attribute P.DMG equal to (<color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of P.ATK + (INT or AGI, whichever is higher) x <color=#44afee>%s</color>, up to <color=#44afee>5</color> times the P.ATK) to enemies within a <color=#44afee>6</color>-meter radius. For every <color=#44afee>additional</color> target in the area, Rose Blossom's damage increases by <color=#44afee>6%%</color>, up to <color=#44afee>30%%</color>. This skill can be used in conjunction with Elemental Arrow.",
    ["SkillDesc_1533004"]="Sends out an echo blast, clearing all <color=#44afee>Sound Blend</color> effects and dealing weapon attribute P.DMG equal to (<color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of P.ATK + (INT or AGI, whichever is higher) x <color=#44afee>%s</color>, up to <color=#44afee>3</color> times the P.ATK). For <color=#44afee>each</color> stack of <color=#44afee>Sound Blend</color> cleared, Metallic Fury's damage increases by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_1533005"]="Performs a solo skill, increasing the damage against Angel monsters by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of all party members within a 6-meter radius. The performance lasts <color=#44afee>30</color> seconds and consumes <color=#44afee>15</color> SP every second. A whip weapon must be equipped. Effects of the same songs do not stack when their performance ranges overlap. (Affected by Lingering Sound)",
    ["SkillDesc_1533006"]="Performs a solo skill, allowing party members within a 6-meter radius to ignore <color=#44afee>%s</color> of Debuff Resistance and Debuff Duration Reduction when applying debuffs to monsters they have already damaged. The performance lasts <color=#44afee>30</color> seconds and consumes <color=#44afee>15</color> SP every second. An instrument weapon must be equipped. Effects of the same songs do not stack when their performance ranges overlap. (Affected by Lingering Sound)",
    ["SkillDesc_1533007"]="Performs an ensemble skill, creating a <color=#44afee>6</color>-meter fixed field that increases the highest main attribute (STR, AGI, INT, DEX, or LUK) of party members within range by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>. The performance lasts <color=#44afee>30</color> seconds and consumes <color=#44afee>30</color> SP every second (the ensemble partner's SP is not consumed). The specified ensemble partner must have learned this skill. The skill's effect level is equal to the sum of the skill levels of both parties divided by 2, rounded to a whole number. An instrument or whip must be equipped to cast the skill. Effects of the same songs do not stack when their performance ranges overlap.",
    ["SkillDesc_1533008"]="If party members are within an ensemble range, they gain <color=#44afee>Retrospection</color>, allowing them to retain the ensemble buffs even after leaving the field or after the ensemble ends. <color=#44afee>Retrospection</color> lasts for <color=#44afee>%s</color> second(s) and can be triggered <color=#44afee>once</color> every <color=#44afee>%s</color> seconds. <color=#44afee>Retrospection</color> can only be triggered by an ensemble; while active, other ensemble buffs can still be received.",
    ["SkillDesc_1533009"]="When performing with an ensemble partner, the ensemble casting range is increased by <color=#44afee>4</color> meters, and its effective range is increased by <color=#44afee>2</color> meters. During the ensemble, you or your partner may temporarily leave the area, but if only <color=#44afee>1</color> performer remains within the range, and another one does not return within <color=#44afee>%s</color> seconds, the ensemble will be forcibly terminated.",
    ["SkillDesc_1533010"]="After starting the ensemble, if the partner is outside the performance range, there's a <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> chance to trigger <color=#44afee>Musical Interlude</color>. Each successful trigger delays the partner's return timer by <color=#44afee>2</color> seconds. This effect can only be triggered <color=#44afee>once</color> every <color=#44afee>2</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_1533011"]="During an ensemble, all party members within 30 meters have a <color=#44afee>30%%</color> chance to gain Mystic Symphony's <color=#44afee>Inspire</color> effect every <color=#44afee>5</color> seconds, reducing their damage taken by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>. The <color=#44afee>Inspire</color> effect lasts for <color=#44afee>10</color> seconds. Each party member can only receive this effect <color=#44afee>once</color> every <color=#44afee>14</color> seconds. Mystic Symphony can only be triggered by an ensemble.",
    ["SkillDesc_1533012"]="Performs a hunting chorus and sends waves of terrifying wails, dealing weapon attribute P.DMG equal to (<color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of P.ATK + (INT or DEX, whichever is higher) x <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>, up to <color=#44afee>30</color> times the P.ATK) to enemies within a <color=#44afee>6</color>-meter radius every 0.5 seconds for <color=#44afee>6</color> seconds. Enemies within the area have a <color=#44afee>8%%</color> chance to suffer <color=#44afee>Remorse</color>. Each time the enemy enters the state of <color=#44afee>Remorse</color>, the duration of active debuffs on the enemy is extended by <color=#44afee>1</color> second. When Remorse ends, any debuffs it caused will disappear. Remorse lasts for <color=#44afee>6</color> seconds. Casting this skill consumes Throat Lozenge x1.",
    ["SkillDesc_1600001"]="Enjoy a <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> discount when purchasing items from NPC shops and a <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> discount when purchasing items from the Chamber of Commerce using Zeny.",
    ["SkillDesc_1600002"]="Earn <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> more when selling items to NPC shops and <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> more when selling items to the Chamber of Commerce.",
    ["SkillDesc_1600003"]="Increases weight limit by <color=#44afee>%s</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_1600004"]="Allows the usage of pushcarts that can carry a heavy load. You can rent a pushcart that has an initial weight limit of <color=#44afee>8000</color> from the Kafra Service. Each level up increases the weight limit by <color=#44afee>500</color>. Current weight limit is <color=#44afee>%s</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_1600005"]="Can only be used when equipped with a pushcart. After casting, attacks an enemy target within a circular area using the pushcart, dealing (<color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of ATK + <color=#44afee>%s</color>) Neutral physical damage. After learning <color=#44afee>Weight Utility</color>, the damage of this skill increases with maximum weight.",
    ["SkillDesc_1600006"]="Lets out an incredible roar. After casting, all party members gain <color=#44afee>%s</color> STR for <color=#44afee>120</color> seconds. Loses effect if more than 30 meters from the caster.",
    ["SkillDesc_1600007"]="Whenever your normal attacks hit, your Physical Damage Bonus is increased by <color=#44afee>20</color>, increasing by <color=#44afee>%s</color> more for every <color=#44afee>50</color> STR. Can stack up to <color=#44afee>8</color> times. Lasts for <color=#44afee>5</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_1600008"]="Deals (<color=#44afee>%s%%</color> ATK + <color=#44afee>%s</color>) Neutral physical damage to an enemy and inflicts Bounty on it for <color=#44afee>10</color> seconds. Killing a monster with Bounty earns you <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> more Zeny.",
    ["SkillDesc_1600009"]="Expends <color=#44afee>%s</color> Zeny, dealing (<color=#44afee>%s%%</color> ATK + <color=#44afee>%s</color>) physical damage of your weapon's attribute to an enemy.",
    ["SkillDesc_1600010"]="Set up a shop to sell items. You can list up to <color=#44afee>%s</color> items for sale currently.",
    ["SkillDesc_1610001"]="Receive <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> less damage from Fire attribute monsters and <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> less damage from Neutral attribute monsters. Increases Fire DMG dealt by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_1610002"]="When using a weapon, ATK increases by (<color=#44afee>%s</color> + <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of STR).",
    ["SkillDesc_1610003"]="Casting Crazy Uproar increases your ATK by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> and the Physical Attack of all party members within 30 meters by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>. Loses effect if more than 30 meters from the caster.",
    ["SkillDesc_1610004"]="Increases the Final ASPD of all party members by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> (increases by an additional <color=#44afee>1%%</color> for every <color=#44afee>50</color> AGI) for <color=#44afee>40</color> seconds. Loses effect if more than 30 meters from the caster.",
    ["SkillDesc_1610005"]="<color=#44afee>Adrenaline Rush</color> causes all party members within 30 meters to gain <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of base weapon modifier, up to <color=#44afee>100%%</color>, for <color=#44afee>40</color> seconds. Loses effect if more than 30 meters from the caster.",
    ["SkillDesc_1610006"]="Rides on the pushcart and charges forward, dealing neutral attribute P.DMG equal to (<color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of P.ATK + <color=#44afee>%s</color>) to enemies in the path within <color=#44afee>3</color> meters of the pushcart. Enemies that have taken damage will not be damaged again within <color=#44afee>1.5</color> seconds. During the charge, you gain the Endure and Control Immunity effects, with damage received decreased by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>, and MSPD increased by <color=#44afee>%s</color>. However, other attacks are disabled during this period. Lasts for <color=#44afee>8</color> seconds. After Cart Blitz kills <color=#44afee>8</color> targets or deals <color=#44afee>32</color> hits, the charge will end prematurely. After learning <color=#44afee>Weight Utility</color>, the damage of this skill increases with maximum weight.",
    ["SkillDesc_1610007"]="Hurls the pushcart forward, dealing (<color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of ATK + <color=#44afee>%s</color>) Neutral physical damage to enemies in its path. The pushcart stays put after reaching the maximum distance for up to <color=#44afee>5</color> seconds. Casting the skill again causes you to rush toward the pushcart's location and deal the same amount of physical damage to enemies near the pushcart. After learning <color=#44afee>Weight Utility</color>, the damage of the first part of this skill increases with maximum weight.",
    ["SkillDesc_1610008"]="Decreases Zeny required to cast <color=#44afee>Mammonite</color>, <color=#44afee>Hurl Zeny</color>, and <color=#44afee>Zeny Storm</color> by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_1610009"]="Slams the ground, dealing weapon attribute P.DMG equal to (<color=#44afee>%s%%</color> P.ATK + <color=#44afee>%s</color>) to enemy units within <color=#44afee>4</color> meters and has a <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> chance to stun them for <color=#44afee>2</color> seconds. Can stun up to <color=#44afee>8</color> targets.",
    ["SkillDesc_1610010"]="Stuns the enemy for <color=#44afee>1</color> second and slashes <color=#44afee>5</color> times, dealing weapon attribute P.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of P.ATK in total. Every <color=#44afee>50</color> STR increases the damage by an additional <color=#44afee>5%%</color>, up to <color=#44afee>800%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_1610011"]="Charges towards the location of the pushcart. Upon reaching, deals (<color=#44afee>%s%%</color> ATK + <color=#44afee>%s</color>) Neutral physical damage to enemies around you.",
    ["SkillDesc_1610012"]="Increases damage of <color=#44afee>Cart Revolution</color>, <color=#44afee>Cart Blitz (only for first instance of damage)</color>, <color=#44afee>Cart Hurl (only for the first stage)</color>, and <color=#44afee>Cart Termination</color> by <color=#44afee>1%%</color> for every increase of your maximum weight by <color=#44afee>%s</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_1611001"]="Can only be used when equipped with a pushcart. After casting, removes Decrease Agility state. Increases Movement Speed by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> and Final Dodge Rate by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> (increases by an additional <color=#44afee>1%%</color> for every <color=#44afee>30</color> VIT you have). Cannot be dispelled. Lasts for <color=#44afee>6</color> seconds. Does not stack with other Movement Speed increase effects.",
    ["SkillDesc_1611002"]="Killing monsters in the wild earns you <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> more Zeny.",
    ["SkillDesc_1611003"]="Deals weapon attribute P.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of P.ATK to an enemy and has a <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> chance to break the enemy's armor. Every <color=#44afee>30</color> STR increases the chance by an extra <color=#44afee>1%%</color>. Lasts for <color=#44afee>6</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_1611004"]="Expends <color=#44afee>%s</color> Zeny and increases the damage of your normal attacks by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>. Lasts for <color=#44afee>10</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_1611005"]="Throws <color=#44afee>%s</color> Zeny for a ranged attack, dealing Neutral attribute P.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of P.ATK to a single enemy target. This skill has a <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> chance to deal double damage.",
    ["SkillDesc_1611006"]="Increases the damage of <color=#44afee>Mammonite</color>, <color=#44afee>Hurl Zeny</color>, <color=#44afee>Zeny Storm</color>, and <color=#44afee>Zenypult</color> by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_1611007"]="Expends <color=#44afee>%s</color> Zeny and blasts enemy units in a specified circular area with Zeny <color=#44afee>6</color> times. Each blast deals (<color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of ATK + <color=#44afee>400</color> (increases by an additional <color=#44afee>100</color> for every <color=#44afee>50</color> STR you have)) Neutral physical damage and slows the enemy by <color=#44afee>50%%</color> for <color=#44afee>3</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_1611008"]="Deals <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> ATK + <color=#44afee>%s</color>) Neutral physical damage to enemy units within the area and stuns them for <color=#44afee>3</color> seconds. After learning <color=#44afee>Weight Utility</color>, the damage of this skill increases with maximum weight.",
    ["SkillDesc_1611009"]="During Cart Blitz, increases damage by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> and an additional increase of <color=#44afee>20%%</color> each time the same target is hit. Knocks back the target <color=#44afee>2</color> meters. (The same target will not be knocked back for <color=#44afee>1.5</color> seconds.)",
    ["SkillDesc_1611010"]="Casting <color=#44afee>Savage Slash</color> and <color=#44afee>Melt Down</color> grants you <color=#44afee>1</color> stack of <color=#44afee>Savage</color> for <color=#44afee>10</color> seconds. Each stack grants you <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> Lifesteal and Final P.PEN, stacking up to <color=#44afee>5</color> times.",
    ["SkillDesc_1611997"]="Blasts enemy units in a specified circular area with Zeny <color=#44afee>6</color> times. Each blast deals Neutral attribute P.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>155%%</color> of P.ATK + <color=#44afee>400</color> (every <color=#44afee>50</color> STR increases an additional <color=#44afee>100</color>) and slows the enemy by <color=#44afee>50%%</color> for <color=#44afee>3</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_1611998"]="Deals Neutral attribute P.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>750%%</color> of P.ATK to a single enemy target. This skill has a <color=#44afee>50%%</color> chance to crit.",
    ["SkillDesc_1612001"]="Learns the basic skills to operate Magic Gear and ride it into battle, granting its effect for <color=#44afee>120</color> sec. Magic Gear’s Movement Speed is increased by <color=#44afee>4</color> in PVE mode, and <color=#44afee>2</color> in PVP mode. While riding it, all Cart-related skills are cast by the Magic Gear in a new way, however their effect remains unchanged. The Magic Gear manually launches normal attacks with its weapons, granting a <color=#44afee>20%%</color> chance of dealing <color=#44afee>%s</color>x normal damage and decreasing the target’s Movement Speed by <color=#44afee>50%%</color> for <color=#44afee>2</color> sec. Overheating will be caused by boarding the Magic Gear too often, and you will cannot ride the Magic Gear within 6 sec.",
    ["SkillDesc_1612002"]="While riding [Magic Gear], <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of damage dealt and <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of damage taken is converted into Energy, up to the equivalent of <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> Max HP. When Max HP is lower than <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>, accumulated Energy will be converted into a shield that remains in effect for <color=#44afee>10</color> sec (can be triggered once every <color=#44afee>24</color> sec).",
    ["SkillDesc_1612003"]="Propels the Magic Gear forward <color=#44afee>10</color> meters, dealing Regular Physical Damage equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of Physical Attack to enemies within a 3-meter range upon reaching its final destination.",
    ["SkillDesc_1612004"]="Sets the countdown for the Magic Gear's detonator, then eject yourself <color=#44afee>4</color> meters backward. During the <color=#44afee>2</color>-second countdown, the Magic Gear pulls enemies within <color=#44afee>6</color> meters toward its center. After the countdown, it explodes, dealing Fire attribute P.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of the target's Max HP to enemies within <color=#44afee>6</color> meters. If the target is a BOSS, MVP, or MINI, it deals Fire attribute P.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of P.ATK. You cannot board the Magic Gear for <color=#44afee>36</color> seconds after using this skill.",
    ["SkillDesc_1612005"]="Fires a rocket punch from the Magic Gear, dealing Weapon-based Physical Damage equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> Physical Attack to a target, with a chance of reducing cooldown for this skill by <color=#44afee>1</color> sec for each crit dealt.",
    ["SkillDesc_1612006"]="Deploys the Magic Gear's Vulcan Arm, unleashing a continuous <color=#44afee>6</color>-missile attack on targets within a <color=#44afee>6</color>-meter range for <color=#44afee>3</color> seconds. Each bombardment deals Fire attribute P.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of P.ATK to enemies within range and an additional <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> damage to small and medium-sized monsters. It also has a <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> chance to slow down the targets within range by <color=#44afee>50%%</color> for <color=#44afee>3</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_1612007"]="Fires the Magic Gear's Arm Cannon in a fixed location, dealing Fire attribute P.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> to all enemies within a <color=#44afee>6</color>-meter range. The Magic Gear can carry up to <color=#44afee>5</color> cannon balls.",
    ["SkillDesc_1612008"]="Grants 1 stack of Savage Fury for every crit triggered, increasing Physical Attack by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> and Final Attack Speed by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> for <color=#44afee>3</color> sec. Can be stacked up to <color=#44afee>6</color> times, after which Blood Thirst is granted, increasing Physical Lifesteal by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> for <color=#44afee>6</color> sec. Blood Thirst can be triggered once every <color=#44afee>24</color> sec.",
    ["SkillDesc_1612009"]="Grants normal attacks a <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> chance of inflicting a powerful quake beneath the enemy’s feet and an eruption of lava, dealing Fire Damage equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> Physical Attack. This probability increases by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> when a normal attack triggers a crit.",
    ["SkillDesc_1612010"]="Hurls an axe in a desired direction, dealing Weapon-based Physical Damage equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> Physical Attack to all enemies in its path. After reaching its maximum trajectory, the axe will return to you, dealing an equal amount of damage to the enemies in its path.",
    ["SkillDesc_1612011"]="Increases the damage coefficient of Axe Boomerang by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>. When thrown in the desired direction, targets in its path will be slowed by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> for <color=#44afee>2</color> sec.",
    ["SkillDesc_1612012"]="Places a launcher that hurls tons of Zeny every <color=#44afee>0.5</color> sec up to <color=#44afee>24</color> times (counted as each time a target takes damage), lasting for <color=#44afee>18</color> sec max. The launcher effects targets within a <color=#44afee>6</color>-meter range, dealing Neutral Physical Damage equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> Physical Attack. Up to <color=#44afee>3</color> launchers can be placed at the same time, each costing <color=#44afee>3000</color>Zeny.",
    ["SkillDesc_1612013"]="\nInflicts Lure on targets who take damage from [Mammonite], [Hurl Zeny], [Zeny Storm], or [Zenypult], reducing their Final Physical Defense by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>, which can be stacked up to <color=#44afee>6</color> times. Also reduces their Movement Speed by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> (Not effective against boss-level monsters), which can be stacked up to <color=#44afee>5</color> times. Both effects last for <color=#44afee>6</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_1612996"]="Places a launcher that hurls tons of Zeny every <color=#44afee>0.5</color> seconds up to <color=#44afee>24</color> times (consumed each time a target takes damage), lasting for up to <color=#44afee>18</color> seconds. When the launcher detects enemy targets within a <color=#44afee>6</color>-meter range, it starts to hurl Zeny, each hurl dealing Neutral attribute P.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>100%%</color> of P.ATK to the targets in the affected area. Up to <color=#44afee>3</color> launchers can be placed at the same time, each costing <color=#44afee>3,000</color> Zeny.",
    ["SkillDesc_1613001"]="Activates the drone attack system on the <color=#44afee>Magic Gear</color>, attacking enemies in a <color=#44afee>180</color>-degree fan-shaped area in front, with each attack dealing weapon attribute P.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of P.ATK to up to <color=#44afee>3</color> targets at a time. The drone can trigger critical hits when using a <color=#44afee>mace</color>. The attack system can only be activated while mounted on the <color=#44afee>Magic Gear</color>, lasts <color=#44afee>20</color> seconds, and automatically deactivates when you exit the <color=#44afee>Magic Gear</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_1613002"]="Summons a <color=#44afee>4</color>-meter radius defensive field at your position, protecting all allies within it from damage coming from outside. The amount of damage blocked is equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of <color=#44afee>Meister</color>'s Max HP, and the field lasts for <color=#44afee>5</color> seconds. The field can only be activated while mounted on the <color=#44afee>Magic Gear</color>, but it doesn't block damage from enemies who have already entered the field.",
    ["SkillDesc_1613003"]="Summons the automated combat robot, <color=#44afee>Battle Warrior</color>, which automatically joins the battle. After <color=#44afee>%s</color> attacks, <color=#44afee>Battle Warrior</color> performs a <color=#44afee>Strike</color>, dealing Neutral attribute P.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of P.ATK to all enemies in a <color=#44afee>180</color>-degree fan-shaped area in front of the <color=#44afee>Battle Warrior</color>, with a chance to trigger critical hits. <color=#44afee>Battle Warrior</color> lasts up to <color=#44afee>%s</color> seconds and consumes <color=#44afee>ABR Capsule</color> x<color=#44afee>1</color> when summoned. <color=#44afee>ABR - Battle Warrior</color> and <color=#44afee>ABR - Dual Cannon</color> cannot be summoned at the same time.",
    ["SkillDesc_1613004"]="Summons the automated combat robot, <color=#44afee>Dual Cannon</color>, which automatically joins the battle. Every <color=#44afee>%s</color> seconds, <color=#44afee>Dual Cannon</color> fires <color=#44afee>Arm Cannon</color>, dealing Fire attribute P.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of P.ATK to the target and all enemies within a <color=#44afee>4</color>-meter radius. <color=#44afee>Dual Cannon</color> lasts up to <color=#44afee>%s</color> seconds and consumes <color=#44afee>ABR Capsule</color> x<color=#44afee>1</color> when summoned. <color=#44afee>ABR - Battle Warrior</color> and <color=#44afee>ABR - Dual Cannon</color> cannot be summoned at the same time.",
    ["SkillDesc_1613005"]="Commands the automated combat robot, <color=#44afee>ABR - Battle Warrior</color> and <color=#44afee>ABR - Dual Cannon</color> to repeatedly cast <color=#44afee>Strike</color> and <color=#44afee>Arm Cannon</color> within <color=#44afee>%s</color> seconds. The attack frequency of the <color=#44afee>Magic Gear</color>'s drone attack system is also <color=#44afee>doubled</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_1613006"]="Summoning <color=#44afee>ABR - Battle Warrior</color> increases the damage of <color=#44afee>Knuckle Boost</color>, <color=#44afee>Activation Attack Machine</color>, and <color=#44afee>Rush Quake</color> by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>. Summoning <color=#44afee>ABR - Dual Cannon</color> increases the damage of <color=#44afee>Vulcan Arm</color>, <color=#44afee>Arm Cannon</color>, and <color=#44afee>Axe Stomp</color> by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_1613007"]="Dashes to the target location, creating ground shockwaves that pull in all enemies within <color=#44afee>6</color> meters. Then, follow up with a powerful strike that deals weapon attribute P.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of P.ATK to the enemy, with a <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> chance to inflict <color=#44afee>Armor Break</color> for <color=#44afee>5</color> seconds to all enemies within the area. Requires a <color=#44afee>mace</color> to use, and the damage can trigger critical hits.",
    ["SkillDesc_1613008"]="While mounted on the <color=#44afee>Magic Gear</color>, your normal attacks utilize the Magic Gear's turbo weapon, reducing <color=#44afee>ASPD</color> bonus to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of the original but increasing base normal attack damage by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>. Using Turbo Drive hammer while in <color=#44afee>Magic Gear</color> mode converts the damage of <color=#44afee>Midas Touch</color>, <color=#44afee>Zeny Storm</color>, <color=#44afee>Hurl Zeny</color>, and <color=#44afee>Zenypult</color>to <color=#44afee>weapon attribute</color>. When your Final Crit is higher than Final P.PEN, all the above skills can trigger critical hits and generate substantial Threats when dealing damage. Threats won't be generated while Emergency Armor is active.",
    ["SkillDesc_1613009"]="Swings the axe to split the ground, creating a fissure that deals Fire attribute P.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of P.ATK to all targets within range and <color=#44afee>slows</color> them down for <color=#44afee>4</color> seconds. At the end of the fissure, flames erupt, dealing Fire attribute P.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of Max HP (capped at <color=#44afee>2,000%%</color> P.ATK) to targets within a <color=#44afee>6</color>-meter radius and <color=#44afee>launching</color> them into the air for <color=#44afee>2</color> seconds. Requires an <color=#44afee>axe</color> to use.",
    ["SkillDesc_1613010"]="While mounted on <color=#44afee>Magic Gear</color>, the damage of <color=#44afee>Cart Revolution</color>, <color=#44afee>Cart Hurl</color>,<color=#44afee>Cart Blitz</color>, and <color=#44afee>Cart Termination</color> is converted to <color=#44afee>Fire attribute</color>. When <color=#44afee>Activation Attack Machine</color> is active, and <color=#44afee>Cart Hurl</color> is cast, the drone stays at the initial position, dealing Fire attribute P.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of P.ATK every second to all enemies within the area. Casting <color=#44afee>Cart Blitz</color> will apply the <color=#44afee>Activation Attack Machine</color> effect. <color=#44afee>Cart Termination</color> will deal additional Fire attribute P.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of P.ATK to enemies on the path.",
    ["SkillDesc_1613011"]="While mounted on <color=#44afee>Magic Gear</color>, there's a <color=#44afee>2.5%%</color> chance to swap your armor attribute to resist damage when taking <color=#44afee>Earth</color>, <color=#44afee>Fire</color>, <color=#44afee>Water</color>, and <color=#44afee>Wind</color> attribute damage (damage from periodic effects caused by debuffs won't trigger this). This effect can be triggered <color=#44afee>once</color> every <color=#44afee>6</color> seconds. While mounted on <color=#44afee>Magic Gear</color> and attacked by large, medium, or small monsters, you take <color=#44afee>15%%</color>, <color=#44afee>10%%</color>, and <color=#44afee>5%%</color> less damage, respectively, and your PVP Final M.DMG RED and PVP Final P.DMG RED are increased by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_1613012"]="Using <color=#44afee>Suicidal Destruction</color> to exit the Magic Gear activates <color=#44afee>Emergency Armor</color>. While under the effect of <color=#44afee>Emergency Armor</color>, your MSPD is increased by <color=#44afee>4</color>, and <color=#44afee>Suicidal Destruction</color> is disabled, but other skills that require the <color=#44afee>Magic Gear</color> remain usable. <color=#44afee>Armor Swap</color> does not apply to Emergency Armor. <color=#44afee>Emergency Armor</color> lasts for <color=#44afee>%s</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_1620001"]="Summons Marine Sphere at a specified location, and they will explode after 3 seconds, dealing weapon attribute P.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of P.ATK + INT × <color=#44afee>17</color> to all enemy units within a <color=#44afee>4</color>-meter area. This skill consumes <color=#44afee>Marine Sphere Bottle</color> ×1.",
    ["SkillDesc_1620002"]="Summons a Plant monster in a specified location within a <color=#44afee>6</color>-meter radius. The Plant monster automatically attacks enemy targets within <color=#44afee>3</color> meters, dealing Neutral attribute P.DMG equal to (<color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of P.ATK + INT x <color=#44afee>%s</color>) to the monster targets each time. When attacking character targets, deals True DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of the target's Max HP and lasts for <color=#44afee>12</color> seconds. This skill consumes <color=#44afee>Plant Bottle</color> x1 and cannot be released again within <color=#44afee>2</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_1620003"]="Learn how to summon Homunculi, including <color=#44afee>Lif</color>, <color=#44afee>Amistr</color>, <color=#44afee>Vanilmirth</color>, and <color=#44afee>Filir</color>. There can only be <color=#44afee>1</color> Homunculus existing at a time. The summoned Homunculi carries most of their owner's stats and costs <color=#44afee>Embryo</color> x1 to summon.\nLv.1: Summon <color=#44afee>Lif</color>.\nLv.2: Summon <color=#44afee>Amistr</color>.\nLv.3: Summon <color=#44afee>Vanilmirth</color>.\nLv.4: Summon <color=#44afee>Filir</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_1620004"]="Resurrects the Homunculus and recovers <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of its Max HP.",
    ["SkillDesc_1620005"]="When using one-handed axe, two-handed axe, or mace, P.ATK increases by INT x <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_1620006"]="Strengthens the physical force of the Alchemist to their peak level. There is a <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> chance of dealing x<color=#44afee>2</color> damage when using <color=#44afee>Mace</color> in normal attacks or casting <color=#44afee>Impulsive Slash</color> (The probability of double damage caused by <color=#44afee>Impulsive Slash</color> is calculated separately for each target within range).",
    ["SkillDesc_1620007"]="Makes your or a friendly target's armor indestructible and immune to Armor Break during the given period. The odds of the target's armor being divested by the skill <color=#44afee>Strip Armor</color> decrease by <color=#44afee>25%%</color> for <color=#44afee>%s</color> second(s). The duration is further increased by <color=#44afee>0.1</color> seconds for every <color=#44afee>20</color> INT. This skill consumes <color=#44afee>Glistening Coat</color> x1.",
    ["SkillDesc_1620008"]="Protects the target's weapon from being broken during the armor protection period. The odds of the target's weapon being divested by the skill <color=#44afee>Strip Weapon</color> decrease by <color=#44afee>25%%</color> for <color=#44afee>%s</color> second(s). The duration increases by <color=#44afee>0.1</color> seconds for every <color=#44afee>20</color> INT.",
    ["SkillDesc_1620009"]="Throws the Slim Potion to the specified location, recovering HP equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of the potion healing amount on allied units within a <color=#44afee>4</color>-meter area. The healing amount increases by 1%% for every <color=#44afee>5</color> VIT.\nLv.1: Throws <color=#44afee>Red Slim Potion</color>.\nLv.2: Throws <color=#44afee>Yellow Slim Potion</color>.\nLv.3: Throws <color=#44afee>White Slim Potion</color>.\nLv.4: Throws <color=#44afee>Premium White Slim Potion</color>.\nLv.5: Throws <color=#44afee>Gray Slim Potion</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_1620010"]="Increases the recovery effect of Alchemist Potion by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_1620011"]="Throws the Bottle Grenade at the <color=#44afee>4</color>-meter target area, dealing Fire P.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of P.ATK + INT x <color=#44afee>%s</color> to the enemy units within the area per <color=#44afee>0.5</color> seconds. The on-fire area lasts <color=#44afee>12</color> seconds. This skill consumes <color=#44afee>Bottle Grenade</color> x1.",
    ["SkillDesc_1620012"]="Throws the Acid Bottle and burns the target, inflicting the target with <color=#44afee>Bleed</color> status and dealing weapon attribute P.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of P.ATK + INT x <color=#44afee>%s</color> to the inflicted target every second. Lasts <color=#44afee>4</color> seconds. This skill consumes <color=#44afee>Acid Bottle</color> x1.",
    ["SkillDesc_1620013"]="Switches the Homunculus to a non-battle stance, rendering it to become untargetable while recovering <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of Max HP over the next <color=#44afee>10</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_1620901"]="Summons Marine Sphere at a specified location, and they will explode after 3 seconds, dealing weapon attribute P.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of P.ATK + INT × <color=#44afee>17</color> to all enemy units within a <color=#44afee>4</color>-meter area. This skill consumes <color=#44afee>Marine Sphere Bottle</color> ×1.",
    ["SkillDesc_1620902"]="Summons a Plant monster in a specified location within a <color=#44afee>6</color>-meter radius. The Plant monster automatically attacks enemy targets within <color=#44afee>3</color> meters, dealing weapon attribute P.DMG equal to (<color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of P.ATK + INT x <color=#44afee>%s</color>) to the monster targets each time (Crit available). When attacking character targets, deals True DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of the target's Max HP and lasts for <color=#44afee>12</color> seconds. This skill consumes <color=#44afee>Plant Bottle</color> x1 and cannot be released again within <color=#44afee>2</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_1620911"]="Throws the Bottle Grenade at the <color=#44afee>4</color>-meter target area, dealing Fire P.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of P.ATK + INT x <color=#44afee>%s</color> to the enemy units within the area per <color=#44afee>0.5</color> seconds. The on-fire area lasts <color=#44afee>12</color> seconds. This skill consumes <color=#44afee>Bottle Grenade</color> x1.",
    ["SkillDesc_1620912"]="Throws the Acid Bottle and burns the target, inflicting the target with <color=#44afee>Bleed</color> status and dealing weapon attribute P.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of P.ATK + INT x <color=#44afee>%s</color> to the inflicted target every second. Lasts <color=#44afee>4</color> seconds. This skill consumes <color=#44afee>Acid Bottle</color> x1.",
    ["SkillDesc_1621001"]="Reduces the Water, Fire, Earth, and Wind damage taken by a Phase 1 Homunculus by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.\nReduces the Water, Fire, Earth, and Wind damage taken by a Phase 2 Homunculus by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.\nReduces the Water, Fire, Earth, and Wind damage taken by a Phase 3 Homunculus by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_1621002"]="Permanently boosts the stats of Homunculi:\n<color=#44afee>Lif</color>: Increases its Max HP by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> and healing effectiveness by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.\n<color=#44afee>Amistr</color>: Increases its Max HP by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> and P.DEF & M.DEF by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.\n<color=#44afee>Vanilmirth</color>: Increases its P.DMG by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> and Final P.PEN by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.\n<color=#44afee>Filir</color>: Increases its P.ATK by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>, Final Crit by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>, and Crit DMG Bonus by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_1621003"]="Implants the Blood Sucker into the target for <color=#44afee>5</color> seconds. Whenever the target receives healing, <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of the healing effect will be transferred to you (This effect doesn't work on the Boss, MVP, and Mini units). At the same time, when dealing damage to the target, there is a <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> chance of increasing your Lifesteal effect by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> for <color=#44afee>10</color> seconds. The Blood Sucker becomes ineffective if the target is more than <color=#44afee>8</color> meters away from you. Each implant consumes <color=#44afee>Bloodsuck Plant Seed</color> x1.",
    ["SkillDesc_1621004"]="Increases the duration of active skills' fixed cooldown by <color=#44afee>%s</color> second(s) and <color=#44afee>fixed cast time</color> by <color=#44afee>%s</color> second(s) of the enemies within <color=#44afee>4</color> meters. Lasts <color=#44afee>5</color> seconds. This skill consumes <color=#44afee>Mandragora Flowerpot</color> x1. Each Crit reduces its fixed cooldown by <color=#44afee>1</color> second.",
    ["SkillDesc_1621005"]="Takes the Demonic Potion and removes all control effects on you (this effect doesn't work on Boss, MVP, and Mini units), rendering yourself into the <color=#44afee>Demonic</color> state, increasing your MSPD by <color=#44afee>%s</color>, Crit DMG Bonus by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>, Final P.PEN by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>, and P.ATK by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> for <color=#44afee>15</color> seconds. Due to the side effect of the potion, you will be silenced for <color=#44afee>6</color> seconds after the effect wears off.",
    ["SkillDesc_1621009"]="Breathes fire at a 60-degree fan-shaped area in front of you with a radius of <color=#44afee>6</color> meters, dealing fire attribute P.DMG equal to (<color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of P.ATK + INT x <color=#44afee>%s</color>) to the enemy units within the area per <color=#44afee>0.5</color> seconds. Casting time: 5 seconds. Grants the Endure effect during the effective period.",
    ["SkillDesc_1621010"]="Throws the Acid Bottle Grenade at the target, dealing Fire P.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of P.ATK + INT x <color=#44afee>%s</color>. The targets hit by the Acid Bottle Grenade have a <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> chance of entering the <color=#44afee>Armor Breakage</color> and <color=#44afee>Weapon Breakage</color> states for 3 seconds. This skill consumes <color=#44afee>Bottle Grenade</color> x1 and <color=#44afee>Acid Bottle</color> x1.",
    ["SkillDesc_1621011"]="Implants the Bomb Mushroom Spore into the target. The mushroom spore explodes after <color=#44afee>3</color> seconds, dealing weapon attribute P.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of P.ATK + INT x <color=#44afee>%s</color> to the target and the nearby units within <color=#44afee>3</color> meters of the target. This skill consumes <color=#44afee>Bomb Mushroom Spore</color> x1.",
    ["SkillDesc_1621012"]="Within the next <color=#44afee>15</color> seconds, increases your MSPD by <color=#44afee>%s</color> and P.ATK by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>. Cannot use this skill if the Cart is not equipped.",
    ["SkillDesc_1621013"]="During the armor protection period, the odds of the target's accessory being divested by the skill <color=#44afee>Strip Accessory</color> decrease by <color=#44afee>25%%</color> for <color=#44afee>%s</color> second(s). The duration increases by <color=#44afee>0.1</color> seconds for every <color=#44afee>20</color> INT.",
    ["SkillDesc_1621904"]="Increases the duration of active skills' fixed cooldown by <color=#44afee>%s</color> second(s) and <color=#44afee>fixed cast time</color> by <color=#44afee>%s</color> second(s) of the enemies within <color=#44afee>4</color> meters. Lasts <color=#44afee>5</color> seconds. This skill consumes <color=#44afee>Mandragora Flowerpot</color> x1. Each Crit reduces its fixed cooldown by <color=#44afee>1</color> second.",
    ["SkillDesc_1621911"]="Implants the Bomb Mushroom Spore into the target. The mushroom spore explodes after <color=#44afee>3</color> seconds, dealing weapon attribute P.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of P.ATK + INT x <color=#44afee>%s</color> to the target and the nearby units within <color=#44afee>3</color> meters of the target. This skill consumes <color=#44afee>Bomb Mushroom Spore</color> x1.",
    ["SkillDesc_1622001"]="Increases your maximum loading capacity by <color=#44afee>%s</color> and boosts the damage of Cart Revolution, Cart Tornado, Cart Cannon, and Heavy Cannon by <color=#44afee>0.5%%</color> for each <color=#44afee>%s</color> loading capacity increased.",
    ["SkillDesc_1622002"]="Allows the Alchemist to learn how to craft potions, alchemy items, plant items, and projectiles.\nLearns to craft potions at Lv.1: <color=#44afee>Red Slim Potion Kit</color>, <color=#44afee>Yellow Slim Potion Kit</color>, <color=#44afee>White Slim Potion Kit</color>, <color=#44afee>Gray Slim Potion Kit</color>, and <color=#44afee>Premium White Slim Potion Kit</color>.\nLearns to craft alchemy items at Lv.2: <color=#44afee>Bottle Grenade</color>, <color=#44afee>Acid Bottle</color>, <color=#44afee>Marine Sphere Bottle</color>, <color=#44afee>Glistening Coat</color>, and <color=#44afee>Alcohol</color>.\nLearns to craft plant items at Lv.3: <color=#44afee>Bomb Mushroom Spore</color>, <color=#44afee>Bloodsuck Plant Seed</color>, <color=#44afee>Thorn Plant Seed</color>, <color=#44afee>Mandragora Flowerpot</color>, and <color=#44afee>Plant Bottle</color>.\nLearns to craft projectiles at Lv.4: <color=#44afee>Cannon Ball</color> and <color=#44afee>Super Cannon Ball</color>.\nLearns to craft special items at Lv.5: <color=#44afee>Explosive Powder</color>, <color=#44afee>Corrosion Potion</color>, <color=#44afee>Oil Bottle</color>, <color=#44afee>Smoke Powder</color>, and <color=#44afee>Tear Gas</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_1622003"]="When the Alchemist is using a Mace, their normal attacks have a <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> chance of dealing weapon attribute P.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of P.ATK + INT x <color=#44afee>%s</color> to the enemies within <color=#44afee>3</color> meters. The damage can be critical.",
    ["SkillDesc_1622004"]="Spins the Cart at high-speed to create a tornado, dealing weapon attribute P.DMG equal to (<color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of P.ATK + INT x <color=#44afee>%s</color>) to the enemies within <color=#44afee>5</color> meters per <color=#44afee>0.5</color> seconds. Enemies within the area will be knocked back by <color=#44afee>2</color> meters and stunned for <color=#44afee>1</color> second. Casting time: <color=#44afee>5</color> seconds. Grants the Endure effect during the effective period. A Cart must be equipped to cast this skill.",
    ["SkillDesc_1622005"]="Summons a man-eating plant from Hell and hides it beneath the ground for <color=#44afee>30</color> seconds. When enemies get close to the plant, it will pop out from the ground and attack the enemies 1 time every 3 seconds, each attack dealing Neutral attribute P.DMG equal to (<color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of P.ATK + INT x <color=#44afee>%s</color>) to monster targets. When attacking character targets, deals True DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of the target's Max HP each time, and there is a <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> chance of stunning the enemies for <color=#44afee>3</color> seconds. The plant attacks up to <color=#44afee>5</color> times and remains on the surface for up to <color=#44afee>15</color> seconds once it pops out. This skill consumes <color=#44afee>Marine Sphere Bottle</color> x1. (Takes effect 1 second after being stepped on).",
    ["SkillDesc_1622006"]="Sacrifices the Homunculus and extracts life energy from it, which grants you a boost of stats over the next <color=#44afee>15</color> seconds.\n<color=#44afee>Lif</color>: Increases Max HP by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> and healing effectiveness by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.\n<color=#44afee>Amistr</color>: Increases Max HP by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> and P.DEF & M.DEF by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.\n<color=#44afee>Vanilmirth</color>: Increases P.ATK by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> and Final P.PEN by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.\n<color=#44afee>Filir</color>: Increases P.ATK by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>, Final Crit by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>, and Crit DMG Bonus by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_1622007"]="Fills up your surrounding area within <color=#44afee>3</color> meters with the <color=#44afee>Illusion Doping</color> effect for <color=#44afee>90</color> seconds, dealing weapon attribute P.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of P.ATK + INT x <color=#44afee>%s</color> to the enemies within the area each second and inflicting them with <color=#44afee>Illusion</color>. Enemies inflicted with <color=#44afee>Illusion</color> will have blurry vision, which decreases their Final Hit by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> and MSPD by <color=#44afee>%s</color>. Stacks up to <color=#44afee>2</color> times. This skill consumes <color=#44afee>Concentrated Alcohol</color> x1.",
    ["SkillDesc_1622008"]="Sets up the <color=#44afee>Thorn Trap</color>, which lasts for 120s in a specified area. Enemies who enter this area will be <color=#44afee>trapped</color> for <color=#44afee>3</color>s and receive weapon attribute P.DMG equal to (<color=#44afee>180%%</color> of P.ATK + INT x <color=#44afee>%s</color>) each second. The trapped enemies will get out of the <color=#44afee>trap</color> state early if they receive Fire DMG. There can only be <color=#44afee>7</color> Thorn Traps existing at the same time. This skill consumes <color=#44afee>Thorn Plant Seed</color> x1.",
    ["SkillDesc_1622010"]="Uses a Cart to shoot Cannon Balls to a target area within <color=#44afee>4</color> meters, dealing weapon attribute P.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of P.ATK + INT x <color=#44afee>%s</color> to enemies within <color=#44afee>4</color> meters. The maximum loading capacity is <color=#44afee>10</color>. Each attack consumes <color=#44afee>Cannon Ball</color> (if the skill level is maxed out, it consumes <color=#44afee>Super Cannon Ball</color>). When shooting <color=#44afee>Super Cannon Balls</color>, the area of damage increases by <color=#44afee>2</color> meters, additionally dealing Physical True Damage equal to <color=#44afee>1.2%%</color> of the target's lost HP (this effect does not apply to a target who is an MVP, Mini, or Boss). The maximum loading capacity of Super Cannon Balls is <color=#44afee>8</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_1622011"]="Transforms the Cart into Heavy Cannon and refills all the shells, which increases the normal attack range to <color=#44afee>24</color> meters with a fixed <color=#44afee>2</color>-second attack interval. During this period, each normal attack becomes a projectile that attacks the enemies, dealing weapon attribute P.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of P.ATK + INT x <color=#44afee>%s</color>, <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of P.ATK + INT x <color=#44afee>%s</color>, and <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of P.ATK + INT x <color=#44afee>%s</color> to the enemies that are <color=#44afee>0–8</color>, <color=#44afee>8–16</color>, and <color=#44afee>16–24</color> meters away, respectively. Each normal attack consumes <color=#44afee>Cannon Shells</color>. You cannot move when operating Heavy Cannon, and its maximum loading capacity is <color=#44afee>5</color>. Every <color=#44afee>4</color> seconds, it will automatically refill 1 shell, and you can cast this skill again to release you from the Heavy Cannon. This skill can only be used when equipping <color=#44afee>Axe weapons</color> and renting the <color=#44afee>Hovercannon</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_1622014"]="Increases your P.REF by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> and reduces your P.DMG taken by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>, but decreases your Fire RES by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_1622015"]="Summons a Wall Of Thorns in the target area that lasts for <color=#44afee>20</color> seconds. The enemy receives weapon attribute P.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of P.ATK + <color=#44afee>INT x %s</color> and gets knocked back by <color=#44afee>2</color> meters when touching it (The wall deals damage to enemies that cannot be knocked back once every <color=#44afee>0.2</color> seconds). The Wall Of Thorns will be shattered after receiving damage <color=#44afee>%s</color> times. If the Wall Of Thorns receives Fire DMG, it turns into a <color=#44afee>Fire Barricade</color>, which does not knock back the enemies, but deals Fire P.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of P.ATK + <color=#44afee>INT x %s</color> to the enemies within the area every <color=#44afee>0.5</color> seconds. Lasts <color=#44afee>20</color> seconds. There can only be <color=#44afee>1</color> Wall Of Thorns existing at a time, requiring <color=#44afee>Thorn Plant Seed</color> x1 to cast.",
    ["SkillDesc_1622016"]="When using <color=#44afee>Demonstration</color>, <color=#44afee>Demonic Fire</color>, and <color=#44afee>Wall Of Thorns</color>, depending on the items consumed, the <color=#44afee>Demonstration</color>, <color=#44afee>Demonic Fire</color>, and the ignited <color=#44afee>Wall Of Thorns</color> carry additional effects as follows:\nConsume <color=#44afee>Oil Bottle</color> x1: Increases the damage dealt by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.\nConsume <color=#44afee>Explosive Powder</color> x1: There is a <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> chance of generating an explosive effect and dealing Fire P.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>100%%</color> of P.ATK + INT x <color=#44afee>60</color> to the target and their nearby units within <color=#44afee>3</color> meters.\nConsume <color=#44afee>Smoke Powder</color> x1: Increases the Final Dodge of allied units within the area by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> every <color=#44afee>0.5</color> seconds and decreases the Final Hit of the enemy units within the area by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> every <color=#44afee>0.5</color> seconds for <color=#44afee>1</color> second.\nConsume <color=#44afee>Tear Gas</color> x1: Makes the target within the area enter a <color=#44afee>Blind</color> state. Lasts <color=#44afee>5</color> seconds.\nConsume <color=#44afee>Corrosion Potion</color> x1: Ignores <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of the enemy's P.DEF.",
    ["SkillDesc_1622905"]="Summons a man-eating plant from Hell and hides it beneath the ground for <color=#44afee>30</color> seconds. When enemies get close to the plant, it will pop out from the ground and attack the enemies 1 time every 3 seconds, each attack dealing weapon attribute P.DMG equal to (<color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of P.ATK + INT x <color=#44afee>%s</color>) to monster targets (Crit available). When attacking character targets, deals True DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of the target's Max HP each time, and there is a <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> chance of stunning the enemies for <color=#44afee>3</color> seconds. The plant attacks up to <color=#44afee>5</color> times and remains on the surface for up to <color=#44afee>15</color> seconds once it pops out. This skill consumes <color=#44afee>Marine Sphere Bottle</color> x1. (Takes effect 1 second after being stepped on).",
    ["SkillDesc_1622907"]="Fills up your surrounding area within <color=#44afee>3</color> meters with the <color=#44afee>Illusion Doping</color> effect for <color=#44afee>90</color> seconds, dealing weapon attribute P.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of P.ATK + INT x <color=#44afee>%s</color> to the enemies within the area each second and inflicting them with <color=#44afee>Illusion</color>. Enemies inflicted with <color=#44afee>Illusion</color> will have blurry vision, which decreases their Final Hit by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> and MSPD by <color=#44afee>%s</color>. Stacks up to <color=#44afee>2</color> times. This skill consumes <color=#44afee>Concentrated Alcohol</color> x1.",
    ["SkillDesc_1622908"]="Sets up the <color=#44afee>Thorn Trap</color>, which lasts for 120s in a specified area. Enemies who enter this area will be <color=#44afee>trapped</color> for <color=#44afee>3</color>s and receive weapon attribute P.DMG equal to (<color=#44afee>180%%</color> of P.ATK + INT x <color=#44afee>%s</color>) each second. The trapped enemies will get out of the <color=#44afee>trap</color> state early if they receive Fire DMG. There can only be <color=#44afee>7</color> Thorn Traps existing at the same time. This skill consumes <color=#44afee>Thorn Plant Seed</color> x1.",
    ["SkillDesc_1622915"]="Summons a Wall Of Thorns in the target area that lasts for <color=#44afee>20</color> seconds. The enemy receives weapon attribute P.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of P.ATK + <color=#44afee>INT x %s</color> and gets knocked back by <color=#44afee>2</color> meters when touching it (The wall deals damage to enemies that cannot be knocked back once every <color=#44afee>0.2</color> seconds). The Wall Of Thorns will be shattered after receiving damage <color=#44afee>%s</color> times. If the Wall Of Thorns receives Fire DMG, it turns into a <color=#44afee>Fire Barricade</color>, which does not knock back the enemies, but deals Fire P.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of P.ATK + <color=#44afee>INT x %s</color> to the enemies within the area every <color=#44afee>0.5</color> seconds. Lasts <color=#44afee>20</color> seconds. There can only be <color=#44afee>1</color> Wall Of Thorns existing at a time, requiring <color=#44afee>Thorn Plant Seed</color> x1 to cast.",
    ["SkillDesc_1623001"]="Increases your damage dealt to Plant and Demi-Human monsters by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>. There's a <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> chance to consume no skill items when casting skills of your own class.",
    ["SkillDesc_1623002"]="Consumes Plant Bottle x1 to transform the existing Homunculus, Amistr or Filir, into a Withered Guardian (same attribute as the summoner) that lasts for <color=#44afee>%s</color> second(s) and is untargetable. Withered Guardian and Wooden Fairy can only exist <color=#44afee>one</color> at a time, and no other Homunculus may be summoned while it's active. The Withered Guardian inherits all skills from the transformed Homunculus upon summoning. When casting Amistr's <color=#44afee>Sharp Horn Charge</color>, it will not apply a taunt effect on enemies. While Withered Guardian is present, each attack grants you <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of Final P.DMG Bonus, stacking up to <color=#44afee>6</color> times. This effect lasts <color=#44afee>6</color> seconds and triggers <color=#44afee>once</color> every <color=#44afee>2</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_1623003"]="Consumes Plant Bottle x1 to transform the existing Homunculus, Lif or Vanilmirth, into a Wooden Fairy (same attribute as the summoner) that lasts for <color=#44afee>%s</color> second(s) and is untargetable. Withered Guardian and Wooden Fairy can only exist <color=#44afee>one</color> at a time, and no other Homunculus may be summoned while it's active. The Wooden Fairy inherits all skills from the transformed Homunculus upon summoning. When casting Vanilmirth's <color=#44afee>Caprice</color> or <color=#44afee>Chaotic Blessing</color>, it will not deal damage to the Wooden Fairy. While Wooden Fairy is present, it senses all nearby enemies, revealing any hidden enemies within a <color=#44afee>%s</color>-meter radius.",
    ["SkillDesc_1623004"]="Consumes Acid Bottle x1 to create a <color=#44afee>6</color>-meter Acidified Zone, dealing adaptive attribute P.DMG equal to (<color=#44afee>%s%%</color> + INT/<color=#44afee>%s</color> x <color=#44afee>1%%</color>, up to <color=#44afee>500%%</color>) of P.ATK to all enemies within range every <color=#44afee>0.5</color> seconds. Lasts <color=#44afee>6</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_1623005"]="Enhances the power of acid and fire by adding Catalyst Infusion, increasing the damage of <color=#44afee>Acid Terror</color>, <color=#44afee>Acid Demonstration</color>, and <color=#44afee>Acidified Zone</color> by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>. If the target carries a shield, the damage effect is modified to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_1623006"]="Hovercannon automatically fires at <color=#44afee>1</color> nearest target within a <color=#44afee>12</color>-meter radius for a set period of time, each dealing weapon attribute P.DMG equal to (<color=#44afee>%s%%</color> + INT/<color=#44afee>%s</color> x <color=#44afee>1%%</color>, up to <color=#44afee>750%%</color>) of P.ATK for <color=#44afee>10</color> seconds, during which, Cart Tornado and Heavy Cannon cannot be used. Consumes Normal Cannon Ball x<color=#44afee>1</color>. If your Final Crit is higher than Final P.PEN, Automated Cannon may trigger critical damage.",
    ["SkillDesc_1623007"]="Charges and unleashes a powerful strike, attacking <color=#44afee>5</color> times, each dealing weapon attribute P.DMG equal to (<color=#44afee>%s%%</color> + INT/<color=#44afee>%s</color> x <color=#44afee>1%%</color>, up to <color=#44afee>400%%</color>) of P.ATK. <color=#44afee>Each</color> critical hit landed during the attack increases the damage of the next attack by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>. If your Final Crit is higher than Final P.PEN, Charged Blitz may trigger critical damage.",
    ["SkillDesc_1623008"]="While the Advance Protection is active, the Shadow Equipment Disarm success rate of removing the target's Shadow Equipment's Pioneer and Inscription effects is reduced by <color=#44afee>25%%</color> for <color=#44afee>%s</color> second(s). Each additional <color=#44afee>20</color> INT increases the duration of this skill by <color=#44afee>0.1</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_1623009"]="Summons plant, dealing Earth attribute P.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of P.ATK to all enemies within range, unveiling hidden enemies, and removing <color=#44afee>6</color> ongoing ground-based effect(s) (excluding ground-based effects inflicted by MVP, MINI, and Bos s units). Consumes Marine Sphere Bottle x1.",
    ["SkillDesc_1623010"]="Genetic Shift grants a breakthrough in physical prowess. For every <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of Final ASPD, the attack time for Impulsive Slash and Charged Blitz is reduced by <color=#44afee>1%%</color>, up to <color=#44afee>50%%</color>. When using Demonic Potion, the physical prowess is increased significantly, as well as the body size. During this period, your attacks ignore size decay effects, receive <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> less M.DMG, and no longer suffer the negative effect of Demonic Potion.",
    ["SkillDesc_1623011"]="Normal attacks and skills have an <color=#44afee>8%%</color> and <color=#44afee>12%%</color> chance to reduce the enemy's highest main attribute bonus by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>, Debuff Resistance by <color=#44afee>%s</color>, and Debuff Duration Reduction by <color=#44afee>%s</color>. Trigger <color=#44afee>once</color> every <color=#44afee>20</color> seconds, lasting <color=#44afee>10</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_1623012"]="When your INT reaches 3,000, every <color=#44afee>additional</color> INT grants <color=#44afee>4</color> extra ATK. When HP falls below <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>, grants a shield equal to (INT x <color=#44afee>%s</color>), up to <color=#44afee>20%%</color> of your Max HP. The shield lasts for <color=#44afee>8</color> seconds and can only trigger once every <color=#44afee>15</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_1700001"]="When equipped with a Revolver, increase your P.ATK by (<color=#44afee>%s</color> + LUK x <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>) and your Hit by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_1700002"]="Fires <color=#44afee>1</color> bullet to launch an aimed attack from afar that targets the enemy's vital points, dealing weapon attribute P.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of P.ATK. This skill can trigger crit and be dodged. When equipped with a Sniper Rifle, this skill's damage coefficient will be increased by an additional <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_1700003"]="Fires <color=#44afee>1</color> bullet to launch an attack to the fan-shaped area ahead, dealing weapon attribute P.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of P.ATK, knocking back the enemies within range for <color=#44afee>5</color> meters and stunning them for <color=#44afee>%s</color> seconds. This skill can trigger crit and be dodged. When equipped with a Shotgun, this skill's damage coefficient will be increased by an additional <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_1700004"]="Each normal attack that hits a target increases your ASPD by <color=#44afee>%s</color> and P.ATK by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> for <color=#44afee>3</color> seconds. Stacks up to <color=#44afee>10</color> times.",
    ["SkillDesc_1700005"]="When equipped with a Shotgun, increases your P.ATK by (<color=#44afee>%s</color> + <color=#44afee>LUK x </color><color=#44afee>%s%%</color>). Your normal attack now deals additional <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> damage to targets who are under the effect of Bleed.",
    ["SkillDesc_1700006"]="Fires <color=#44afee>1</color> bullet to launch a charged attack to the fan-shaped area ahead, dealing weapon attribute P.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of P.ATK to all enemies on the path. When equipped with a Sniper Rifle, this skill's damage coefficient will be increased by an additional <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> and inflict the target with <color=#44afee>Bleed</color>, dealing Neutral attribute P.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of P.ATK over <color=#44afee>6</color> seconds. This skill can trigger crit and be dodged.",
    ["SkillDesc_1700007"]="Expand the Concentration Realm around yourself, increasing your Final DMG Bonus by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> and reducing the melee and ranged damage taken by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> every second. Stacks up to <color=#44afee>3</color> times and lasts for <color=#44afee>60</color> seconds. Leaving the realm will cause both the realm and concertation effect to expire.",
    ["SkillDesc_1700008"]="Increase the skill range of <color=#44afee>Revolver Normal Attack</color> by <color=#44afee>%s</color> meters, <color=#44afee>Shotgun Normal Attack</color> by <color=#44afee>%s</color> meters, <color=#44afee>Sniper Rifle Normal Attack</color> by <color=#44afee>%s</color> meters, and <color=#44afee>Automatic Rifle Normal Attack</color> by <color=#44afee>%s</color> meters. In addition, increase your Final Hit by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_1700009"]="Consume <color=#44afee>10,000</color> Zeny to apply a <color=#44afee>Magical Bullet</color> effect on yourself, turning your firearm damage to Ghost attribute P.DMG and increasing your Ghost attribute enhancement by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>. Last for <color=#44afee>300</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_1700100"]="UI button. Tap to switch between main/off-hand weapons. Cooldown applies.",
    ["SkillDesc_1700101"]="Revolver Reload",
    ["SkillDesc_1700102"]="Shotgun Reload",
    ["SkillDesc_1700103"]="Sniper Rifle Reload",
    ["SkillDesc_1700104"]="Automatic Rifle Reload",
    ["SkillDesc_1700107"]="All Gunslinger's attacks now cost <color=#4a4eff>0</color> bullets.",
    ["SkillDesc_1710001"]="Empties all remaining bullets to launch an elegant quick fire to a specified direction, finishing the entire clip (the max magazine capacity of a Revolver) while moving. Each bullet deals weapon attribute P.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of P.ATK and knocks back the enemies. The shooting can last up to <color=#44afee>6</color> seconds, and each additional <color=#44afee>300</color> ASPD grants 1 extra bullet. During the effective period, your MSPD is increased by <color=#44afee>20%%</color>. This skill can trigger crit and be dodged.",
    ["SkillDesc_1710002"]="Empties all remaining bullets to fire <color=#44afee>5</color> shots, each of which randomly targets a nearby enemy within <color=#44afee>5</color> meters, dealing weapon attribute P.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of P.ATK. After one shot is fired, another enemy within range will be randomly selected as the next target. This skill can trigger crit and be dodged.",
    ["SkillDesc_1710003"]="After reloading, you will enter the <color=#44afee>Stealth</color> state, increasing your MSPD by <color=#44afee>%s</color>. This effect lasts for <color=#44afee>4</color> seconds and triggers once every <color=#44afee>12</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_1710004"]="Charge toward a specified direction for <color=#44afee>8</color> meters and increase your Final Flee by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> for <color=#44afee>5</color> seconds. This skill can have up to 2 charges.",
    ["SkillDesc_1710005"]="Consume <color=#44afee>1</color> bullet to perform a backflip. Afterwards, hold the skill button to stay in the aim state to adjust your aim direction within the fan-shaped area ahead, then release the button to immediately fire <color=#44afee>2</color> consecutive penetrating bullets that travel <color=#44afee>16</color> meters toward the aiming direction, each dealing weapon attribute P.DMG equal to (<color=#44afee>%s</color> + Aim Time x <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of P.ATK) to all enemies on the path and inflicting a <color=#44afee>Bleed</color> effect that deals Neutral attribute P.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of P.ATK every second for <color=#44afee>6</color> seconds. When equipped with a Sniper Rifle, this skill's damage coefficient will be increased by an additional (<color=#44afee>%s%% x Aim Time</color>). This skill can trigger crit and be dodged.",
    ["SkillDesc_1710006"]="Mark the target with a <color=#44afee>Crimson Marker</color> for <color=#44afee>%s</color> seconds, preventing them from entering the Stealth state and exposing their location on the minimap. Max <color=#44afee>3</color> charges.\n Each normal attack fires an additional lucky bullet to the enemy carrying <color=#44afee>Crimson Marker</color>, dealing weapon attribute P.DMG equal to (<color=#44afee>%s</color> x LUK) of P.ATK. This skill can trigger crit and doesn't consume extra bullets.",
    ["SkillDesc_1710007"]="Use the Grenade Launcher to attack all enemies carrying <color=#44afee>Crimson Marker</color> within the circular area of a <color=#44afee>30</color>-meter radius, dealing weapon attribute P.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of P.ATK to all enemies within <color=#44afee>1</color> meter and <color=#44afee>stunning</color> them for <color=#44afee>1</color> second when the grenade explodes. The explosion also leaves a <color=#44afee>1</color>-meter radius burning area that lasts for <color=#44afee>5</color> seconds, dealing weapon attribute P.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of P.ATK every second to the enemies within. This skill can trigger critical damage.",
    ["SkillDesc_1710008"]="Toss a coin toward the target location to create a gigantic coin that covers a 3-meter radius for <color=#44afee>%s</color> seconds. Effects will be triggered variously, according to different patterns on the coin:\nFront - Angel: Charms the enemy who enters the area until the coin disappears.\nBack - Demon: Fears the enemy who enters the area until the coin disappears.",
    ["SkillDesc_1710009"]="While under the effect of Magical Bullet, your P.ATK is increased by (LUK x <color=#44afee>%s</color>). Normal attack has a <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> chance to remove <color=#44afee>1</color> buff from the enemy. When a buff is successfully removed, it deals Ghost attribute P.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of P.ATK to the target.",
    ["SkillDesc_1710010"]="Consume 1 bullet to enter the aim state. While aiming, you can release Mass Spiral: Phase III.",
    ["SkillDesc_1710011"]="Consume <color=#44afee>1</color> bullet to flip <color=#44afee>1</color> meter backwards, entering the aim state. When finished aiming, fires <color=#44afee>2</color> consecutive penetrating bullets that travel <color=#44afee>12</color> meters, each dealing weapon attribute P.DMG equal to (<color=#44afee>%s</color> + Cast Time x <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of P.ATK) to all enemies on the path. Upon hitting an enemy, inflicts a <color=#44afee>Bleed</color> effect that deals Neutral attribute P.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of P.ATK every second for <color=#44afee>6</color> seconds. When equipped with a Sniper Rifle, this skill's damage coefficient will be increased by an additional <color=#44afee>%s%% x P.ATK</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_1711001"]="Consume <color=#44afee>30,000</color> Zeny to craft a Gatling Station on the spot that lasts for <color=#44afee>60</color> seconds. It's impossible to interrupt the crafting process, and the Gatling Station will be available to all Adventurers. Max <color=#44afee>3</color> charges.\nWhen mounting the Gatling Station, the character will be in Endure state. You can hold the attack button to strafe the enemies within the <color=#44afee>120°</color> fan-shaped area ahead, each wave dealing weapon attribute P.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> P.ATK. This skill can trigger crit. The Gatling Station disappears after strafing for <color=#44afee>10</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_1711002"]="An exclusive effect for Gatling Fever.\nAfter Gatling's gunfire last for <color=#44afee>3</color> seconds, it knocks back the enemy for <color=#44afee>0.6</color> meters. If the enemy collides with something while being knocked back, they will additionally receive Neutral attribute P.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of P.ATK. This damage can only be triggered once every <color=#44afee>0.1</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_1711003"]="Consume all remaining bullets to launch a bullet storm within <color=#44afee>5</color> meters of your position for<color=#44afee>3</color> seconds, dealing weapon attribute P.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of P.ATK to nearby targets once every <color=#44afee>0.5</color> seconds. This skill can trigger crit and be dodged, and you can move around while casting.",
    ["SkillDesc_1711004"]="Normal attack has a <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> chance to fire 1 extra bullet, dealing damage equal to <color=#44afee>50%% (each 30 LUK increases 1%%)</color> of the current normal attack without costing extra bullets.",
    ["SkillDesc_1711005"]="Toss a stun grenade to a specific location, which can attach to and move along with the target. The grenade explodes after <color=#44afee>1</color> second, inflicting a Blinding Flash effect on all enemies within <color=#44afee>3</color> meters for <color=#44afee>%s</color> second(s). Enemies under this effect will receive extra Holy attribute P.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of P.ATK. This damage can trigger crit. Extra damage can be triggered up to <color=#44afee>%s</color> time(s). (Warning: Don't blind yourself!)",
    ["SkillDesc_1711006"]="Before casting <color=#44afee>Fallen Angel</color>, there is a <color=#44afee>25%%</color> chance to leave a <color=#44afee>Stun Grenade</color> on the spot. The level of the <color=#44afee>Stun Grenade</color> is <color=#44afee>%s</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_1711007"]="Place an amplification matrix that lasts for 20 seconds. When the bullets of your skills or certain party member's skills pass through the barrier, the matrix enhances these bullets, enabling them to deal extra weapon attribute P.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of P.ATK and inflict a <color=#44afee>Bleed</color> effect to enemy hit, dealing Neutral attribute P.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of P.ATK every second for <color=#44afee>3</color> seconds.\nThe following skills' bullets will be affected: <color=#44afee>Piercing Shot</color>, <color=#44afee>Elegant Shot</color>, and <color=#44afee>Machinegunning</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_1711008"]="Marks a target and launches a missile, which follows the target and deals weapon attribute P.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of P.ATK after <color=#44afee>2</color> seconds. This skill can trigger critical damage.",
    ["SkillDesc_1711009"]="Increase your normal attack damage by an additional <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> and reduce your Final Hit by an additional <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>. Last for <color=#44afee>20</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_1711010"]="Cast a divine defense shield on yourself that lasts for <color=#44afee>%s</color> seconds, reducing all received ranged P.DMG by <color=#44afee>99%%</color>, increasing your damage reduction against Undead monsters by <color=#44afee>50%%</color>, reducing the MSPD of the damage source by <color=#44afee>50%%</color> when you take their damage, and their Final Hit by <color=#44afee>50%%</color> for <color=#44afee>2</color> seconds. After taking damage <color=#44afee>%s</color> times, the divine defense shield will exhaust.\nWhen the shield exhausts, it solidifies nearby targets and <color=#44afee>stuns</color> the enemies within a <color=#44afee>4</color>-meter radius for <color=#44afee>%s</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_1711011"]="Receive 1 stack of <color=#44afee>Heat</color> every time you reload, granting you an additional <color=#44afee>%s</color> ASPD with each stack. Last for <color=#44afee>30</color> seconds and stack up to <color=#44afee>6</color> times.\nWhen there are <color=#44afee>6</color> stacks of <color=#44afee>Heat</color>, you will enter the <color=#44afee>Overloaded</color> mode, where your normal attacks no longer cost bullets and deal an additional <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of True DMG. Every <color=#44afee>12</color> points of LUK increases the True DMG coefficient by <color=#44afee>1%%</color>. The <color=#44afee>Overloaded</color> mode lasts up to <color=#44afee>%s</color> seconds. Active skills are unable to be used under the <color=#44afee>Overloaded</color> mode, and all <color=#44afee>Heat</color> effects will be removed after exiting the state.",
    ["SkillDesc_1711012"]="Increase the magazine capacity of all firearms:\nRevolver: +<color=#44afee>%s</color> rounds.\nShotgun: +<color=#44afee>%s</color> rounds.\nAutomatic Rifle: +<color=#44afee>%s</color> rounds.\nSniper Rifle: +<color=#44afee>%s</color> rounds.",
    ["SkillDesc_1711013"]="Machinegun strafe, a skill with a prolonged cast time. Hold the skill button to strafe the frontal area with a fire rate of 1 round per 0.1 seconds, dealing damage equal to (a%% x P.ATK) on hit. Last up to N seconds. During the Machinegunning process, you can change direction within the 120° area in front of you or release the button to end the skill early. This skill can trigger crit.",
    ["SkillDesc_1712001"]="Toss a Revolver at the target location and another one in the opposite direction to attack nearby enemies, dealing weapon attribute P.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of P.ATK every <color=#44afee>0.2</color> seconds to enemies within <color=#44afee>4</color> meters for <color=#44afee>3</color> seconds. Use the skill again to quickly move to the nearest Revolver location, dealing weapon attribute P.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of P.ATK to enemies within <color=#44afee>7</color> meters of your position. Max 2 charges. Can trigger crit.\nWhen the player comes into contact with any Revolver or stays more than <color=#44afee>18</color> meters away from them, the skill will end automatically.",
    ["SkillDesc_1712002"]="Predator sets up a futuristic sniper rifle taken from outer space to expand the vision and launch a <color=#44afee>12</color>-meter long powerful laser beam at the target direction, dealing weapon attribute P.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of P.ATK. This skill can trigger critical damage. Enemies within the scorched area of Slug Shot now take <color=#44afee>25%%</color> more damage.",
    ["SkillDesc_1712003"]="Predator launches a charged, high-compression energy bolt that is powerful enough to twist the spacetime and gets pushed back by the recoil for <color=#44afee>5</color> meters. The energy bolt can travel up to <color=#44afee>7</color> meters and pull enemies within <color=#44afee>3</color> meters to the center point. When the energy bolt reaches its destination, it deals weapon attribute P.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of P.ATK to nearby enemies within <color=#44afee>4</color> meters, leaving a scorched area on the spot for <color=#44afee>4</color> seconds. Enemies within the scorched area will receive weapon attribute P.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of P.ATK every second, their MSPD reduced by <color=#44afee>50%%</color>. This skill may trigger critical damage.",
    ["SkillDesc_1712004"]="Predator calls for backup, deploys <color=#44afee>6</color> missile pods nearby, and then summons <color=#44afee>1</color> extra missile pod at the locations of all enemies within a <color=#44afee>12</color>-meter range who are marked with <color=#44afee>Crimson Marker</color>. Enemies hit by the missile pods will receive Neutral attribute P.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of P.ATK and be <color=#44afee>stunned</color> for <color=#44afee>3</color> seconds.\nPredator then randomly shoots at <color=#44afee>3</color> missile pods to detonate them, dealing Neutral attribute P.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of P.ATK to all enemies within <color=#44afee>4</color> meters. After <color=#44afee>2</color> seconds, the rest of the missile pods will also be detonated, dealing Neutral attribute P.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of P.ATK to all enemies within <color=#44afee>4</color> meters. This skill can trigger crit.",
    ["SkillDesc_1712005"]="Mass Spiral's damage has a <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> chance to ignore the target's defense. If the target's HP is lower than <color=#44afee>20%%</color> before getting hit, the skill has a <color=#44afee>50%%</color> chance to kill the target instantly. Not effective against <color=#44afee>Boss/MVP/MINI</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_1712006"]="When casting Mass Spiral, its second shot has a <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> chance to launch <color=#44afee>1</color> penetrating bullet at <color=#44afee>1</color> random enemy within a <color=#44afee>60</color>-degree wide, <color=#44afee>16-meter</color> long fan-shaped area ahead, dealing weapon attribute P.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> P.ATK to all enemies on the path. Every extra <color=#44afee>50</color> LUK increases the triggering chance by <color=#44afee>1%%</color>, up to <color=#44afee>60%%</color>. This skill can trigger crit.",
    ["SkillDesc_1712007"]="Predator and the target marked with <color=#44afee>Crimson Marker</color> enter a <color=#44afee>Duel</color> together. When one of them dies, the other one will receive the <color=#44afee>Decider</color> effect.\nUpon receiving the <color=#44afee>Decider</color> effect, it immediately restores the buff holder's HP & SP by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> and increases their damage by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> for <color=#44afee>12</color> seconds. If the <color=#44afee>Predator</color> receives the <color=#44afee>Decider</color> effect, they will reload all firearms immediately and recover one charge of the <color=#44afee>Crimson Marker</color>.\nIf your LUK reaches 3,000 or higher, every <color=#44afee>1</color> additional LUK increases your P.ATK by <color=#44afee>4</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_1712008"]="Targets marked with <color=#44afee>Crimson Marker</color> are also inflicted with a <color=#44afee>Bleed</color> state, receiving Neutral P.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of P.ATK every second.\nWithin a <color=#44afee>5</color>-meter range of the Predator, each additional target carrying their Crimson Marker grants one stack of <color=#44afee>Pursuit</color> effect to the Predator. Each stack increases the Predator's MSPD by <color=#44afee>0.5</color> and damage by <color=#44afee>1%%</color>.\nIf your LUK reaches 3,000 or higher, every <color=#44afee>1</color> additional LUK increases your P.ATK by <color=#44afee>4</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_1712009"]="Gatling's Machinegunning has a <color=#44afee>20%%</color> chance to inflict a <color=#44afee>Blinding Flash</color> effect on the target for <color=#44afee>%s</color> seconds. Can only be triggered <color=#44afee>once</color> every <color=#44afee>12</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_1712010"]="Gatling's damage has a <color=#44afee>10%%</color> chance to call down <color=#44afee>Fire Rain</color> over a <color=#44afee>3</color>-meter radius area at the target location for <color=#44afee>3</color> seconds, dealing Fire attribute P.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of P.ATK every second to all enemies within. This skill can trigger crit and apply a <color=#44afee>Kindle</color> effect on the target for <color=#44afee>3</color> seconds, dealing Fire attribute P.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of P.ATK every second.",
    ["SkillDesc_1712011"]="While casting Fire Dance, your damage taken is reduced by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>, the damage of your next normal attack is increased by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>, and when Fire Dance is finished, this normal attack deals an additional <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> True DMG to the target based on your total damage taken during the Fire Dance casing period. This skill can trigger crit.",
    ["SkillDesc_1712012"]="Before casting Fire Dance, deals an additional Neutral attribute P.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of P.ATK to the target within<color=#44afee>2</color> meters of your position. The skill can trigger crit and has a <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> chance to forcefully knock the target Airborne for <color=#44afee>1</color> second, allowing Fire Dance to deal an additional <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> damage to the Airborne target and keep them in the air once successfully hitting them. The Airborne effect is not effective on MVP, MINI, and Boss units.",
    ["SkillDesc_1712013"]="Quickly move to the nearest Revolver location and release Madness Canceller: Phase III automatically. 2 charges.",
    ["SkillDesc_1712014"]="Deal P.DMG to nearby targets.",
    ["SkillDesc_1712015"]="Shoot 3 random explosives to detonate them, dealing Neutral attribute P.DMG to enemies nearby. After 2 seconds, the rest of the explosives will also be detonated, dealing Neutral attribute P.DMG to all enemies within 4 meters.",
    ["SkillDesc_1713001"]="When attacking, there's a (<color=#44afee>%s%%</color> + DEX or LUK (whichever is higher) / <color=#44afee>%s</color> x <color=#44afee>1%%</color> (up to <color=#44afee>10%%</color>)) chance to grant an instant full reload.",
    ["SkillDesc_1713002"]="Increases your damage against Demi-Human monsters by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>. When inflicting a debuff on a monster, you gain <color=#44afee>%s</color> Debuff Penetration and <color=#44afee>%s</color> Debuff Enhancement for <color=#44afee>6</color> seconds. Triggers once every <color=#44afee>12</color> seconds.\nWhen attacking Adventurers, increases damage dealt by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> and reduces their PVP Final P.DMG RED by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> and PVP Final M.DMG RED by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> for <color=#44afee>6</color> seconds. Triggers once every <color=#44afee>12</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_1713003"]="Reduces the channeling time of Gatling Fever by <color=#44afee>50%%</color>. While in combat after casting, the Gatling will automatically lock onto enemies and auto-fire for <color=#44afee>%s</color> second(s).",
    ["SkillDesc_1713004"]="While in the Concentration Realm, each stack of <color=#44afee>Focus</color> increases your Final Hit by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>, stacking up to <color=#44afee>3</color> times for <color=#44afee>3</color>.\nUpon leaving the <color=#44afee>Concentration Realm</color>, its fixed cooldown is reduced by <color=#44afee>1</color> second for each stack of <color=#44afee>Focus</color> exists.",
    ["SkillDesc_1713005"]="When using automatic rifles or revolvers, normal attacks have a <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> chance to trigger a <color=#44afee>Headshot</color> effect, dealing extra True DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of the target's Max HP. Triggers <color=#44afee>once</color> every <color=#44afee>1</color> second. When using sniper rifles or shotguns, skills have a <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> chance to trigger a <color=#44afee>Pierce</color> effect, removing buffs (e.g., defense, HP, VIT, damage reduction) from the target. Triggers <color=#44afee>once</color> every <color=#44afee>8</color> seconds. The <color=#44afee>headshot</color> and <color=#44afee>Pierce</color> effects are not effective on MVP, MINI, and Boss units.",
    ["SkillDesc_1713006"]="If there's a Stealth enemy within <color=#44afee>8</color> meters, enters <color=#44afee>Vigilante</color> state. During <color=#44afee>Vigilante</color> state, if you're attacked by a Stealth target, you will be able to detect all Stealth enemies (even if they enter Stealth again) within <color=#44afee>8</color> meters for <color=#44afee>6</color> seconds. While <color=#44afee>Vigilante</color> is active, your PVP Debuff Resistance and PVP Debuff Duration Reduction are increased by <color=#44afee>%s</color>, and you take <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> less damage. Triggers up to <color=#44afee>15</color> times (periodic damage from debuffs does not count). The <color=#44afee>Vigilante</color> effect ends after <color=#44afee>8</color> seconds or when all damage reduction attempts are used up.",
    ["SkillDesc_1713007"]="When using rifle or revolver for normal attacks, there's a (<color=#44afee>%s%%</color> + DEX or LUK (whichever is higher) / <color=#44afee>%s</color> x <color=#44afee>1%%</color>, up to <color=#44afee>15%%</color>) chance to automatically throw a grenade at the target, dealing weapon attribute P.DMG equal to (<color=#44afee>%s%%</color> + DEX or LUK (whichever is higher) / <color=#44afee>%s</color> x <color=#44afee>1%%</color>, up to <color=#44afee>600%%</color>) of P.ATK. Basic Grenade can trigger critical damage.",
    ["SkillDesc_1713008"]="Consumes <color=#44afee>1</color> bullet to fire a spinning shot, dealing weapon attribute P.DMG equal to (<color=#44afee>%s%%</color> + DEX or LUK (whichever is higher) / <color=#44afee>%s</color> x <color=#44afee>10%%</color>, up to <color=#44afee>2,500%%</color> of your P.ATK) to the target and enemies within <color=#44afee>4</color> meters of the target. Spiral Shooting can trigger critical damage.",
    ["SkillDesc_1713009"]="Fires a spinning shot, dealing weapon attribute P.DMG equal to (<color=#44afee>%s%%</color> + DEX or LUK (whichever is higher) / <color=#44afee>%s</color> x <color=#44afee>1%%</color>, up to <color=#44afee>600%%</color> of your P.ATK) to enemies along a <color=#44afee>12x6</color> straight line for a total of <color=#44afee>6</color> times. There's a <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> chance to inflict <color=#44afee>Bleed</color> to the target, which deals weapon attribute P.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of P.ATK to the target every second. The Bleed effect lasts for <color=#44afee>10</color> seconds. This skill consumes all bullets upon release. Magazine for One can trigger critical damage.",
    ["SkillDesc_1713010"]="Fires a bunch of grenades at the target using a grenade launcher. The grenades land near the target and deal <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> weapon attribute P.DMG to the target and all enemies within <color=#44afee>4</color> meters of the target. If your Final Crit is higher than Final P.PEN, Grenades Dropping can trigger critical damage.",
    ["SkillDesc_1713011"]="Fires the shotgun, dealing weapon attribute P.DMG equal to (<color=#44afee>%s%%</color> + DEX/<color=#44afee>%s</color> x <color=#44afee>10%%</color>, up to <color=#44afee>3,000%%</color> of P.ATK) to the target. While <color=#44afee>Focus</color> is active, Wild Fire's damage is increased by an additional (<color=#44afee>%s%%</color> x stacks of Focus). This skill consumes <color=#44afee>1</color> stack of <color=#44afee>Focus</color> and <color=#44afee>1</color> bullet. If your Final Crit is higher than Final P.PEN, Wild Fire can trigger critical damage.",
    ["SkillDesc_1713012"]="Initiates Mission Bombard to rain down explosive across an <color=#44afee>18x6</color> straight-line area for 3 times, each strike dealing weapon attribute P.DMG equal to (<color=#44afee>%s%%</color> + DEX/<color=#44afee>%s</color> x <color=#44afee>5%%</color>, up to <color=#44afee>2,000%%</color> of your P.ATK) to enemies within a <color=#44afee>6x6</color>-meter area. If your Final Crit is higher than Final P.PEN, Mission Bombard can trigger critical damage. Targets hit by the explosive enter a <color=#44afee>Concussion</color> state, suffering from intermittently <color=#44afee>Stun</color> and <color=#44afee>Blurry Vision</color> for <color=#44afee>5</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_1800001"]="Consumes <color=#44afee>%s</color> Zeny to throw 1 Shuriken at the target, dealing Adaptive DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of the ATK.\n",
    ["SkillDesc_1800002"]="Flips the Tatami under the target, dealing weapon attribute P.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of the P.ATK and knocking the target toward their direction.\n",
    ["SkillDesc_1800003"]="Upon equipping a Ninja Sword, it increases P.ATK and P.PEN by <color=#44afee>%s</color> and extends the normal attack range by <color=#44afee>%s</color> meter(s). When attacking an enemy within range, automatically dashes toward the enemy.",
    ["SkillDesc_1800004"]="Slashes the target rapidly, dealing Shadow attribute P.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of the P.ATK and entering <color=#44afee>Hiding</color> afterward. Lasts for <color=#44afee>%s</color> second(s).",
    ["SkillDesc_1800005"]="While in <color=#44afee>Hiding</color>, your MSPD is increased by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>, and you won't become visible when performing normal attacks. This skill costs <color=#44afee>5%%</color> of your Max SP per second.\n(When your SP reaches <color=#44afee>0</color>, the <color=#44afee>Hiding</color> effect will be canceled.)",
    ["SkillDesc_1800006"]="Launches a sword aura in a designated direction, dealing P.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of P.ATK to enemies in the path.\nWhen cast in <color=#44afee>Hiding</color>, the skill effect will turn into a sword aura carrying Shadow attribute, dealing Shadow attribute P.DMG equal to (<color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of P.ATK + <color=#44afee>%s</color> of STR).\nWhenever the skill defeats a target, its cooldown is reduced by <color=#44afee>4</color> seconds.\n",
    ["SkillDesc_1800007"]="Upon equipping Huuma Shuriken, it increases M.ATK by <color=#44afee>%s</color> and M.PEN by <color=#44afee>%s</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_1800008"]="Throws Huuma Shuriken at a designated location, and it stops at the endpoint for <color=#44afee>3</color> seconds, dealing weapon attribute DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of the M.ATK to all enemies it touches in the path and all enemies near the endpoint each second.",
    ["SkillDesc_1800009"]="After forming a seal, summon a water area in a designated direction. Enemies in this area, except for the Ninja class, will have their MSPD reduced by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>, and their ASPD will be reduced by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>. Soon after, a wave is summoned along the water area, dealing Water attribute DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of the M.ATK and knocking back all enemies in the path.\nAfter use, you gain <color=#44afee>%s</color> stack(s) of <color=#447aee>Water Mark</color> for <color=#44afee>10</color> seconds, stacks up to <color=#44afee>3</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_1800010"]="When possessing the <color=#447aee>Water Mark</color>, the skill <color=#44afee>Throw Huuma Shuriken</color> becomes <color=#44afee>Vortex Shuriken</color>.\nAfter forming a seal, throws Vortex Shuriken at a designated location, and it stops at the endpoint for <color=#44afee>3</color> seconds, dealing Water attribute M.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of the M.ATK each second to all enemies it touches in the path and all enemies near the endpoint and inflicting a <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> Slow effect each second when it reaches the endpoint. Stacks up to <color=#44afee>3</color>.\nAfter use, it grants you <color=#44afee>1</color> stack of <color=#447aee>Water Mark</color> for <color=#44afee>10</color> seconds. Stacks up to <color=#44afee>3</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_1810001"]="By training Ninpou to vitalize your energy, increasing your Max SP by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> and your SP Regen by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.\nWhen releasing an Escape Technique, its damage increases by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> for each <color=#44afee>10%%</color> Max SP left.\n",
    ["SkillDesc_1810002"]="The Ninja vanishes into the shadow, swiftly moving to any location within <color=#44afee>12</color> meters. Following the move, the Ninja's Final DMG Reduction is increased by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> for <color=#44afee>3</color> seconds.\nUsing this skill will not cancel <color=#44afee>Hiding</color>, and there is a <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> chance to reset the <color=#44afee>Hiding</color> duration to <color=#44afee>10</color> seconds.\n",
    ["SkillDesc_1810003"]="Casts an illusion on the target, distorting their senses and making all enemies and party members seen by the target appear as shadows for <color=#44afee>%s</color> second(s). During the illusion, the target is unable to perform normal attacks and falls into hallucination, with all active skills altered to launch a shuriken at one random nearby target (ally or enemy). If it hits yourself, it deals True DMG equal to your <color=#44afee>Max Hp x %s%%</color>. If it hits other targets, it deals Adaptive DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of ATK. During the illusion, any healing effects received by the target are nullified, converting the healing into True DMG at <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>. (This skill effect is considered a control skill and is ineffective against MVP, MINI, or Boss.)\n",
    ["SkillDesc_1810004"]="When in <color=#44afee>Hiding</color>, the skill <color=#44afee>Mist Slash</color> becomes <color=#44afee>Shadow Slash</color>.\nSummons a shadow clone next to the target, performing <color=#44afee>6</color> shadow slashes one after another, each dealing Shadow attribute P.DMG equal to (<color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of P.ATK + <color=#44afee>%s</color> of STR). After each slash, the Ninja will randomly pick another target within range for the next slash.\nThis skill will not cancel your <color=#44afee>Hiding</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_1810005"]="The Ninja unleashes their inner strength, pushing their body to the limit.\nWhen the skill is activated, it costs <color=#44afee>10%%</color> Max HP each second to grant a stack of <color=#44afee>Soul</color>, and you cannot recover HP during this period. Each stack of <color=#44afee>Soul</color> increases your P.ATK and P.PEN by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> for <color=#44afee>12</color> seconds. Stacks up to <color=#44afee>9</color>.\nWhen this skill is activated, it will forcibly shut down when your Max HP reaches <color=#44afee>10%%</color>.\nThis skill will not cancel your <color=#44afee>Hiding</color>.\n",
    ["SkillDesc_1810006"]="Enters a stance and swiftly dashes forward, piercing all enemies in the path and dealing (<color=#44afee>6</color> + the number of <color=#44afee>Soul</color> stacks) x weapon attribute P.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of the P.ATK, rendering them immobile.\nUpon swinging the sword, the pierced enemies take weapon attribute P.DMG equal to (<color=#44afee>9</color> + the number of <color=#44afee>Soul</color> stacks) x <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of the P.ATK <color=#44afee>twice</color>.\nWhen the skill is over, it uses up all <color=#44afee>Soul</color> stacks, and the skill <color=#44afee>Soul</color> will be forcibly shut down.\n",
    ["SkillDesc_1810007"]="The Ninja quickly dashes beside the target, dealing weapon attribute P.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of the P.ATK while applying <color=#44afee>1</color> stack of <color=#44afee>Trauma</color> effect on the target. Targets with a Trauma effect take an additional <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> damage from you and your party members for <color=#44afee>5</color> seconds. Stacks up to <color=#44afee>3</color>.\nIf the target carries a <color=#44afee>Trauma</color> effect applied by a Ninja in a different gender, then all <color=#44afee>Trauma</color> effects will turn into the <color=#44afee>Cross Trauma</color> effects for <color=#44afee>10</color> seconds, non-stackable.\nTargets with a <color=#44afee>Cross Trauma</color> effect receive an additional <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> damage from you and your party member and will not receive another <color=#44afee>Trauma</color> effect.\n",
    ["SkillDesc_1810008"]="The Ninja hones their skills in altering the nature of water and fire to grant bonus effects to the following Escape Marks:\n<color=#447aee>Water Mark</color>: Each stack increases the damage of Suiton by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>. When a <color=#447aee>Water Mark</color> is acquired, it restores your SP by <color=#44afee>33%%</color> Max SP x stacks of <color=#447aee>Water Mark</color>.\n<color=#da4855>Fire Mark</color>: Each stack increases the damage of Katon by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>. When a <color=#da4855>Fire Mark</color> is acquired, you lose Max SP equal to <color=#44afee>33%%</color> x stacks of <color=#da4855>Fire Mark</color> when you use Katon. It cannot be cast when there's insufficient SP. (SP loss doesn't count as SP consumption.)\nMarks of different attributes cannot exist at the same time.\n",
    ["SkillDesc_1810009"]="After forming a seal, it releases a burst of fire in a designated direction, dealing Fire attribute DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of the M.ATK.\nAfter use, you gain <color=#44afee>%s</color> stack(s) of <color=#da4855>Fire Mark</color> for <color=#44afee>10</color> seconds. Stacks up to <color=#44afee>3</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_1810010"]="When possessing the <color=#da4855>Fire Mark</color>, the skill <color=#44afee>Throw Huuma Shuriken</color> becomes <color=#44afee>Explosive Shuriken</color>.\nThe Ninja throws Explosive Shuriken at a designated location, dealing Fire attribute M.DMG equal to (<color=#44afee>%s%%</color> + every <color=#44afee>12</color> INT increases <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>) of the M.ATK to the first hit enemy in the path. It explodes afterward, dealing Fire attribute M.DMG equal to (<color=#44afee>%s%%</color> + INT x <color=#44afee>%s</color>) of the M.ATK to all nearby enemies.\nAfter use, it grants you <color=#44afee>1</color> stack of <color=#da4855>Fire Mark</color> for <color=#44afee>10</color> seconds. Stacks up to <color=#44afee>3</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_1810011"]="By stomping the ground, the Ninja suppresses the nearby shadows, dealing Adaptive DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of ATK and inflicting <color=#44afee>Kagehumi</color> to nearby enemies for <color=#44afee>10</color> seconds. Targets under <color=#44afee>Kagehumi</color> who are also under the <color=#44afee>Hiding</color> will have their <color=#44afee>Hiding</color> removed instantly and becomes <color=#44afee>Immobilize for 5</color> seconds.\n Target under <color=#44afee>Zangetsu</color> (inflicted by a female Ninja with the skill <color=#44afee>Zangetsu</color>) will become vulnerable and have their ASPD and Haste reduced by <color=#44afee>%s</color> for <color=#44afee>10</color> seconds.\n",
    ["SkillDesc_1810012"]="While under the influence of an illusion, all skills are controlled by the caster, turning them into a skill that launches a shuriken at one random nearby target (ally or enemy). If it hits yourself, it deals Ture DMG equal to your <color=#44afee>Max Hp x %s%%</color>. If it hits other targets, it deals Adaptive DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of ATK.",
    ["SkillDesc_1811001"]="Leaps backward, dealing weapon attribute P.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of the P.ATK to all enemies within a certain range of the starting position. The damage coefficient of the skill is increased by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> for each enemy present within this range.",
    ["SkillDesc_1811002"]="Cast an illusion on the target, using a scarecrow as a medium to bind the target's soul. The scarecrow will disappear after taking <color=#44afee>%s</color> normal attack(s).\nIf the scarecrow exists for <color=#44afee>5</color> seconds, the target under the illusion will suffer True DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of their Max HP and be stunned for <color=#44afee>5</color> seconds. If the target is more than <color=#44afee>6</color> meters away from the scarecrow, this effect will be triggered immediately.\nTargets damaged by this skill gain immunity to it for the next <color=#44afee>30</color> seconds.\n(This skill is ineffective against MVP, MINI, and Boss.)\n",
    ["SkillDesc_1811003"]="Removes all debuffs after releasing (except for the debuffs from Boss, MVP, and Mini), leaving a wooden stake on the spot and moving a certain distance to the back. <color=#44afee>This skill is usable even under control effects</color>.\nUpon receiving fatal damage, this skill will be used automatically to nullify the damage if it's not in cooldown. This skill consumes SP equal to <color=#44afee>40%%</color> of Max SP.",
    ["SkillDesc_1811004"]="The Ninja performs meditation to balance the inner energy flow, regenerating <color=#44afee>10%%</color> of Max HP and Max SP every second during the casting period, up to <color=#44afee>10</color> seconds.\nIf HP and SP are restored to the <color=#44afee>max</color>, then the mediation will stop, reducing the cooldown of all class skills by (<color=#44afee>%s x meditation duration</color>) second(s).\nThe meditation will be interrupted when receiving damage, causing a <color=#44afee>3</color>-second Stun.\n(<color=#44afee>The Stun cannot be reduced or resisted by the debuff resistance</color>.)\n",
    ["SkillDesc_1811005"]="<color=#44afee>Throw Shuriken</color> has a <color=#44afee>50%%</color> chance to deal extra Shadow attribute P.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of the P.ATK and leave a shadow area for <color=#44afee>5</color> seconds every 5 meters it moves, up to <color=#44afee>3</color> shadow areas can exist at the same time.\nIf you are under the <color=#44afee>Hiding</color> state while moving inside the shadow area, the <color=#44afee>Hiding</color> state will remain for <color=#44afee>1</color> second after you leave the shadow area.",
    ["SkillDesc_1811006"]="Executes <color=#44afee>10</color> rapid slashes to the fan-shaped area at front, each slash dealing weapon attribute P.DMG equal to (<color=#44afee>%s%%</color> + <color=#44afee>1%%</color> increased by every <color=#44afee>25</color> STR, up to <color=#44afee>480%%</color>) of the P.ATK, with the final slash dealing extra weapon attribute P.DMG equal to (<color=#44afee>%s%%</color> + <color=#44afee>1%%</color> increased by every <color=#44afee>5</color> STR, up to <color=#44afee>2,400%%</color>) of the P.ATK.\nIf the skill is cast under the <color=#44afee>Hiding</color> state, the damage converts to Shadow attribute, with the final slash releasing a Shadow attribute sword aura, dealing damage to all enemies in the path.\n(The Ninja is under the <color=#44afee>Endure</color> state during the entire skill casting period.)\n",
    ["SkillDesc_1811007"]="When releasing <color=#44afee>Mist Slash</color>, <color=#44afee>North Wind</color>, <color=#44afee>Final Strike</color>, <color=#44afee>Cross Strike</color>, <color=#44afee>Chaotic Dance</color>, and <color=#44afee>Iaijutsu</color>, there is a <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> chance to summon a Shadow Clone to release the same skill, dealing Shadow attribute P.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of the original DMG.",
    ["SkillDesc_1811008"]="The Ninja hones their skills in altering the nature of Wind, extending the duration of all Escape Marks to <color=#44afee>15</color> seconds and granting the Wind Mark bonus effects:\n<color=#8aa362>Wind Mark</color>: Each mark increases Fuuton damage by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>, and acquiring the <color=#8aa362>Wind Mark</color> reduces all Escape Techniques' fixed cast time by <color=#44afee>33%%</color> x the number of marks.",
    ["SkillDesc_1811009"]="Reduces the fixed cast time of your Escape Techniques by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> and synchronizes the enhancement value of <color=#da4855>Fire</color>, <color=#447aee>Water</color>, and <color=#8aa362>Wind</color> attributes to the highest of the three. Meanwhile, the M.PEN is increased by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> for 10 seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_1811010"]="Consumes all Escape Marks to summon a thundercloud that follows you for <color=#44afee>12</color> seconds. Each <color=#44afee>1.5</color> seconds, it deals Wind attribute M.DMG equal to (<color=#44afee>%s%%</color> + <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> increased by every <color=#44afee>12</color> INT, up to <color=#44afee>100%%</color>) of M.ATK to 1 random nearby enemy.\nAfter use, you gain <color=#44afee>%s</color> stacks of <color=#8aa362>Wind Mark</color> for <color=#44afee>10</color> seconds, stacks up to <color=#44afee>3</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_1811011"]="When possessing the <color=#8aa362>Wind Mark</color>, the skill <color=#44afee>Throw Huuma Shuriken</color> becomes <color=#44afee>Gusty Shuriken</color>.\nThe Ninja throws Gusty Shuriken in a designated direction, pulling all nearby enemies in the path and dealing Wind attribute M.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of the M.ATK to them. When it reaches the endpoint, it deals Wind attribute M.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> + (INT x <color=#44afee>%s</color>) of the M.ATK to nearby enemies every second for <color=#44afee>5</color> seconds.\nAfter use, it grants you <color=#44afee>1</color> stack of <color=#8aa362>Wind Mark</color> for <color=#44afee>10</color> seconds. Stacks up to <color=#44afee>3</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_1812001"]="By invoking fear of death in enemies through an illusion, a Reaper is summoned to the target location to follow the target for <color=#44afee>10</color> seconds. While the Reaper exists, it reduces the Max HP of nearby enemies by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> (effects of the same type reduce up to <color=#44afee>50%%</color>; non-effective against MVP, MINI, and Boss). Stacks up to <color=#44afee>7</color>. Enemies who receive <color=#44afee>7</color> stacks will die instantly. Exiting the Reaper's range of influence restores the Max HP limit but not the lost HP.",
    ["SkillDesc_1812002"]="<color=#44afee>Swirling Shuriken</color>'s damage coefficient is increased by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>, and it creates a spiky area filled with Makibishi for <color=#44afee>10</color> seconds. Enemies enter the area receive either a <color=#44afee>Bleed</color> or <color=#44afee>Stun</color> effect for <color=#44afee>3</color> seconds (the <color=#44afee>Bleed</color> deals Neutral attribute P.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>20%%</color> of the P.ATK per second). Additionally, the area deals weapon attribute Adaptive DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>, with each <color=#44afee>80</color> STR or INT (whichever is higher) increasing the damage coefficient by <color=#44afee>1%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_1812003"]="<color=#44afee>Swirling Shuriken</color>'s damage effect changes to cause original skill coefficient x M.ATK's weapon attribute M.DMG, and <color=#44afee>Swirling Shuriken</color>'s damage coefficient is increased by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>. If used while possessing an escape mark, the damage attribute changes to match the corresponding mark, and an additional stack of the corresponding mark is gained after use.",
    ["SkillDesc_1812004"]="Using <color=#44afee>Cast-off Ciceda Shell</color> or <color=#44afee>Shadow Jump</color> while not in the Hiding state will make you enter the <color=#44afee>Hiding</color> state for <color=#44afee>10</color> seconds. When you exit the Hiding state, your damage is increased by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> for 6 seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_1812005"]="Enter the Iaijutsu stance for <color=#44afee>1</color> second, increasing your shield by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> x P.ATK x (1 + Max HP percentage) during the stance period. Following the stance, perform a quick draw and slash, dealing weapon attribute P.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of the P.ATK to all enemies within a fan-shaped area in front. If you take damage during the stance, a sword aura will be generated within the area once you draw it, dealing extra True DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> x damage taken during the period. The skill consumes <color=#44afee>10%%</color> Max SP.\n",
    ["SkillDesc_1812006"]="After shutting down <color=#44afee>Soul</color>, it increases your Physical Lifesteal by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> and enhances your healing effect by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>. The duration of this effect is identical to the duration of <color=#44afee>Soul</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_1812007"]="When <color=#44afee>Soul</color> is active, it pushes your limit further. Stacks up to 10. There is a <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> chance to gain one stack of Soul in each second when <color=#44afee>Soul</color> is active, but it costs <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of your Max HP every second when <color=#44afee>Soul</color> is active. You cannot shut down <color=#44afee>Soul</color> by yourself once it is activated, and <color=#44afee>Soul</color> will only shut down when your HP reaches <color=#44afee>1%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_1812008"]="Every time an enemy is hit by <color=#44afee>Mist Slash</color>, <color=#44afee>North Wind</color>, <color=#44afee>Shadow Slash</color>, <color=#44afee>Cross Strike</color>, <color=#44afee>Chaotic Dance</color>, <color=#44afee>Iaijutsu Strike</color>, or <color=#44afee>Ninja Sword Normal Attack</color>, the cooldown of <color=#44afee>Final Strike</color> is reduced by <color=#44afee>%s</color> second(s).",
    ["SkillDesc_1812009"]="After using <color=#44afee>Final Strike</color>, it deals extra weapon attribute P.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of your lost HP.",
    ["SkillDesc_1812010"]="The duration of all Escape Marks becomes <color=#44afee>20</color> seconds. While <color=#44afee>is not under the Izayoi state</color>, each use of the Escape Technique grants a stack of <color=#44afee>Ninjutsu Enhancement</color> for <color=#44afee>10</color> seconds. Stacks up to <color=#44afee>%s</color>. Each stack of <color=#44afee>Ninjutsu Enhancement</color> increases your Fire, Water, and Wind attributes by <color=#44afee>2%%</color>. Using <color=#44afee>Izayoi</color> consumes all stacks of <color=#44afee>Ninjutsu Enhancement</color>. For each stack of <color=#44afee>Ninjutsu Enhancement</color> consumed, it increases the duration of <color=#44afee>Izayoi</color> by <color=#44afee>1</color> second.",
    ["SkillDesc_1812011"]="Summon two shadow clones and gather natural energy with you, then throw out a Supercharged Shuriken (won't trigger the SP loss of the <color=#da4855>Fire Mark</color>) that carries the same attribute of your current Escape Mark toward a designated location. The Supercharged Shuriken has a larger effect range with an effect level of Lv.<color=#44afee>%s</color>, and its damage coefficient is <color=#44afee>3</color> times the original one. When casting, you gain <color=#44afee>3</color> stacks of Escape Marks corresponding to your Shuriken attribute for <color=#44afee>20</color> seconds. Escape Marks of different attributes cannot exist at the same time. If there are no existing Escape Marks, then a Supercharged Shuriken with a random attribute will be thrown.\n(This skill is considered an Escape Technique.)",
    ["SkillDesc_1812012"]="When possessing <color=#44afee>3</color> stacks of <color=#da4855>Fire Mark</color>, the skill <color=#44afee>Katon - Fire Breath</color> becomes <color=#44afee>Kajinton - Kagutsuchi</color>.\nAfter forming a seal, consume all marks to summon a headless god of war at a designated location, dealing Fire attribute M.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of M.ATK to nearby enemies when it lands. Soon after, the god of war erupts magma that deals Fire attribute M.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of the M.ATK. Every <color=#44afee>8</color> INT increases the damage coefficient of this effect by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>, up to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.\nEnemies located at the center of the magma receive an additional Fire attribute M.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of M.ATK. Every <color=#44afee>8</color> INT increases the damage coefficient of this effect by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>, up to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_1812013"]="When possessing <color=#44afee>3</color> stacks of <color=#447aee>Water Mark</color>, the skill <color=#44afee>Suiton - Wave</color> becomes <color=#44afee>Suijinton - Mitsuha</color>.\nAfter forming a seal, consume all marks to create a water area in a designated location. Enemies within the water area have their MSPD reduced by <color=#44afee>%s</color> for <color=#44afee>10</color> seconds (only one water area exists at a time for each summoner, regardless of the number of summons). Soon after, a water dragon will be summoned above the water area, dealing Water attribute M.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of M.ATK when it lands.\nA vortex will be created in the middle of the water area upon its creation, pulling enemies <color=#44afee>1</color>m closer every <color=#44afee>0.5</color> seconds and dealing Water attribute M.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of the M.ATK, with every <color=#44afee>480</color> INT increasing this effect's damage coefficient by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>, up to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_1812014"]="When possessing <color=#44afee>3</color> stacks of <color=#8aa362>Wind Mark</color>, the skill <color=#44afee>Fuuton - Thundercloud</color> becomes <color=#44afee>Raijinton - Takemikazuchi</color>.\nAfter forming a seal, consume all marks to call forth a thunder beast in the air above the designated location (only one thunder beast exists at a time for each summoner, regardless of the number of summons). The thunder beast creates lightning that deals Wind attribute M.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of the M.ATK per second to enemies below and interrupts skill casting (non-effective against MVP, MINI, Boss, and enemies under the <color=#44afee>Endure</color> state) for <color=#44afee>5</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_1813001"]="When you have any Escape Marks, switching them will trigger Ninjutsu Fusion, depending on the elements. Switching between Wind Mark and Fire Mark grants <color=#44afee>Ninjutsu Fusion - Enton</color>. Switching between Water Mark and Fire Mark grants <color=#44afee>Ninjutsu Fusion - Muton</color>. Switching between Wind Mark and Water Mark grants <color=#44afee>Ninjutsu Fusion - Ranton</color>. Ninjutsu Fusion marks last <color=#44afee>%s</color> second(s) and only <color=#44afee>1</color> mark can exist at a time.",
    ["SkillDesc_1813002"]="When <color=#44afee>Izayoi</color> is not activated, the fixed cast time under the Ninjutsu Fusion is reduced by <color=#44afee>0.5</color> seconds. While under the effect of Silent Night, Ninjutsu Fusion boosts the weaker element by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> to match the stronger one. <color=#44afee>Ninjutsu Fusion - Enton</color> syncs Wind Enhancement and Fire Enhancement. <color=#44afee>Ninjutsu Fusion - Muton</color> syncs Fire Enhancement and Water Enhancement. <color=#44afee>Ninjutsu Fusion - Ranton</color> syncs Wind Enhancement and Water Enhancement.",
    ["SkillDesc_1813003"]="The caster fuses Katon and Fuuton to instantly fire thousands of lightning-flame chakra needles, dealing <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> Wind attribute M.DMG to all enemies in a <color=#44afee>12x6</color> area. After piercing enemies, the needles explode, dealing <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> Fire attribute M.DMG to them. Casting this skill requires <color=#44afee>Ninjutsu Fusion - Enton</color> to be activated, and doing so removes the Ninjutsu Fusion state. This skill does not stack additional Escape Marks. For every <color=#44afee>1</color> additional target in the area, the skill's damage increases by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_1813004"]="The caster fuses Katon and Suiton to create a shroud of searing mist across a <color=#44afee>12x6</color> meter area, each second dealing Fire attribute M.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of Max HP (up to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of the caster's M.ATK) and Water attribute M.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of Max HP (up to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of the caster's M.ATK) for <color=#44afee>5</color> seconds. Casting this skill requires <color=#44afee>Ninjutsu Fusion - Muton</color> to be activated, and doing so removes the Ninjutsu Fusion state. This skill does not stack additional Escape Marks. When the target's Max HP is higher than 100 million, the M.ATK cap of the Fire/Water attribute DMG increases by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> for every additional 200 million HP (does not apply to MVP, MINI, and Boss units).",
    ["SkillDesc_1813005"]="The caster fuses Fuuton and Suiton to dash toward and blast the target with overload energy, dealing <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> Wind attribute M.DMG and <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> Water attribute M.DMG. Casting this skill requires <color=#44afee>Ninjutsu Fusion - Ranton</color> to be activated, and doing so removes the Ninjutsu Fusion state. This skill does not stack additional Escape Marks. For every <color=#44afee>10%%</color> of the target's HP missing, the skill damage increases by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_1813006"]="While Izayoi is active, using skills that add Katon, Suiton, and Fuuton Marks to yourself and deal damage to the target will apply <color=#44afee>Scorch Seal</color>, <color=#44afee>Deepwater Seal</color>, and <color=#44afee>Lightning Seal</color> to the target. Seals cannot be stacked and last <color=#44afee>%s</color> second(s). While the seal exists, the target will have their resistance to the corresponding element reduced by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>. Multiple different seals can coexist.",
    ["SkillDesc_1813007"]="The number of summoned shadow clones increases by <color=#44afee>2</color>. While active, if a clone triggers an attack, the additional Mirror Images will also cast the same skill using the same damage coefficient. Each time a Mirror Image is summoned, you gain <color=#44afee>1</color> stack of <color=#44afee>Dark Image</color>, which boosts your Shadow Enhancement by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> per stack. The <color=#44afee>Dark Image</color> effect lasts <color=#44afee>8</color> seconds and stacks up to <color=#44afee>5</color> times.",
    ["SkillDesc_1813008"]="DebuffWhen a Shadow Clone hits an enemy, there's a <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> chance to apply <color=#44afee>1</color> stack of <color=#44afee>Nightmare</color> to the target. <color=#44afee>Nightmare</color> stacks up to <color=#44afee>5</color> times and lasts <color=#44afee>6</color> seconds. <color=#44afee>Nightmare</color> reduces the target's P.DMG Reflection by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> and healing effect by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>. Each time a Nightmare stack is added, one random debuff (<color=#44afee>Fear</color>, <color=#44afee>Slow</color>, or <color=#44afee>Blind</color>) is applied to the target for <color=#44afee>1.5</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_1813009"]="Dashes forward and unleashes a flashing slash at all enemies within a <color=#44afee>4</color>-meter radius at the destination, dealing Shadow attribute P.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of P.ATK and applying <color=#44afee>Armor Break</color> on them for <color=#44afee>3</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_1813010"]="When the target reaches <color=#44afee>5</color> stacks of <color=#44afee>Nightmare</color>, Dark Image pierces the target's body and transforms into a shadow strike, dealing <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> Shadow attribute P.DMG and removing all <color=#44afee>Nightmare</color> stacks from them. The damage increases by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> for every <color=#44afee>1</color> additional stack of <color=#44afee>Nightmare</color> the target has. Triggers <color=#44afee>once</color> every <color=#44afee>10</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_1813011"]="Consumes all your <color=#44afee>Dark Image</color> stacks to unleash a powerful slash across a <color=#44afee>10x6</color> area, dealing Shadow attribute P.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of P.ATK to all enemies within range. The damage increases by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> for every <color=#44afee>1</color> additional stack of <color=#44afee>Dark Image</color> you have. After the slash, you return to your original position.",
    ["SkillDesc_1813012"]="While <color=#44afee>Dark Image</color> is active, you can trigger the Hiding effect of Shadow Slash, North Wind, and Chaotic Dance without entering the Stealth state. <color=#44afee>Each</color> stack of <color=#44afee>Dark Image</color> you have, your damage taken is reduced by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>. If you take fatal damage, all <color=#44afee>Dark Image</color> stacks will be consumed to block the fatal blow <color=#44afee>once</color>. Triggers up to <color=#44afee>once</color> every <color=#44afee>%s</color> second(s). <color=#44afee>Dark Image</color> triggers only when <color=#44afee>Cast-off Ciceda Shell</color> is on cooldown, and you are in <color=#44afee>Meditation</color> state.",
    ["SkillDesc_1820011"]="The Ninja casts a realm of moonlight upon themselves for <color=#44afee>10</color> seconds. Enemies within the realm will be inflicted with the <color=#44afee>Zangetsu</color> state and have their P.DEF and M.DEF reduced by <color=#44afee>%s</color>, and they are no longer invisible when Hiding.\nIf the target is under the <color=#44afee>Kagehumi</color> state (inflicted by a male Ninja with the skill<color=#44afee>Kagehumi</color>), they will become vulnerable, and their ASPD and Haste will be reduced by <color=#44afee>%s</color> for <color=#44afee>10</color> seconds.\n",
    ["SkillDesc_1900001"]="When equipped with tomes, Taekwon's Normal Attack speed remains constant regardless of buffs or debuffs.\nAfter learning <color=#44afee>Union of the Stars</color>, dealing damage with normal attacks restores <color=#44afee>3</color> Energy.",
    ["SkillDesc_1900002"]="Taekwon is an avid collector of martial arts tomes from every school and sect. When equipped with these secret tomes as weapons, increases P.ATK by (<color=#44afee>%s</color> + <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> x STR) and P.PEN by <color=#44afee>%s</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_1900003"]="Taekwon kicks upward, launching the target into the air and dealing neutral physical damage equal to (<color=#44afee>%s%%</color> x P.ATK + <color=#44afee>%s</color>). For every <color=#44afee>%s</color> STR, increases the damage coefficient by <color=#44afee>1%%</color> (up to <color=#44afee>450%%</color>).\nAfter learning <color=#44afee>Feeling of the Stars</color>, restores <color=#44afee>%s</color> Energy each time the skill deals damage.\n",
    ["SkillDesc_1900004"]="Taekwon quickly turns and launches a sweeping kick, dealing neutral physical damage equal to (<color=#44afee>%s%%</color> x P.ATK + <color=#44afee>%s</color>) to the fan-shaped area in front and restoring HP equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of Max HP for each enemy hit (up to 5). For every <color=#44afee>%s</color> STR, increases the damage coefficient by <color=#44afee>1%%</color> (up to <color=#44afee>400%%</color>).\nAfter learning <color=#44afee>Feeling of the Stars</color>, restores ((0/1/1/2) x <color=#44afee>%s</color>) Energy based on the number of targets (0/1/2/3 or above) hit each time the skill deals damage.\n",
    ["SkillDesc_1900005"]="Taekwon kicks the target with focused strength, dealing neutral physical damage equal to (<color=#44afee>%s%%</color> x P.ATK + <color=#44afee>%s</color>) and exposing 1 of the target's <color=#44afee>weakness</color> for <color=#44afee>5</color> seconds, reducing their P.DEF by <color=#44afee>5%%</color>, stacking up to <color=#44afee>10</color> times. For every <color=#44afee>%s</color> STR, increases the damage coefficient by <color=#44afee>1%%</color> (up to <color=#44afee>450%%</color>).\nAfter learning <color=#44afee>Feeling of the Stars</color>, restores <color=#44afee>%s</color> Energy each time the skill deals damage.\n",
    ["SkillDesc_1900006"]="Taekwon dashes in the direction ahead and launches a fast kick, dealing Neutral attribute P.DMG equal to (<color=#44afee>%s%%</color> x P.ATK + <color=#44afee>%s</color>). The faster the MSPD, the longer Taekwon dashes, and the more damage Taekwon deals.\nAfter learning <color=#44afee>Feeling of the Stars</color>, restores <color=#44afee>%s</color> Energy each time the skill deals damage.\nThe cooldown for Flying Side Kick will be reset after releasing <color=#44afee>Union of the Stars</color> each time.\n",
    ["SkillDesc_1900007"]="Taekwon is good at increasing movement speed significantly by running. When the MSPD is no lower than <color=#44afee>5</color> and Taekwon moves in the same direction continuously, MSPD is increased by <color=#44afee>%s</color> every second, up to <color=#44afee>%s</color> MSPD, until Taekwon stops or changes directions.",
    ["SkillDesc_1900008"]="Taekwon cheers nearby party members. For <color=#44afee>20</color> seconds after casting the skill, the ATK of all party members within range increases by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> for <color=#44afee>60 seconds</color> for every new party member that enters the skill area, stacking up to <color=#44afee>5</color> times. The new party member gains the same number of stacks as the highest stack currently.\n(The skill is interrupted if the caster moves, casts another skill, or comes under a control effect.)\n",
    ["SkillDesc_1900009"]="Taekwon accepts an additional Daily Wanted quest through casting the skill. Completing the quest grants an additional EXP reward based on the level and increases Final DMG Reduction by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> for 12 hours. (Quest is refreshed at 05:00 daily.)\n",
    ["SkillDesc_1910001"]="When Taekwon deals damage with normal attacks or non-Ultimate skills, gains an additional <color=#44afee>%s</color> Energy. For damage taken equal to <color=#44afee>20%%</color> of Max HP, has a <color=#44afee>10%%</color> chance to gain <color=#44afee>%s</color> Energy, which fade quickly after leaving combat.\nAt <color=#44afee>100</color> Energy, consumes all Energy and gains a Star for <color=#44afee>10</color> seconds, up to 3 Stars.",
    ["SkillDesc_1910002"]="Consumes <color=#44afee>1</color> Star and enters <color=#44afee>Union of the Stars</color>, during which you will gain Endure and increase P.ATK by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> for <color=#44afee>6</color> seconds.\nWhile in Union of the Stars, you can accumulate Energy but cannot use <color=#44afee>Union of the Stars</color> again.\n",
    ["SkillDesc_1910003"]="When Taekwon has at least 1 Star and takes damage, if the damage exceeds (<color=#44afee>5%%</color> x Max HP), the damage is reduced by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.\nWhile being in <color=#44afee>Union of the Stars</color>, the effect is applied to all party members within 5 meters of Taekwon.",
    ["SkillDesc_1910004"]="Consumes <color=#44afee>3</color> Stars and enters <color=#44afee>Anger of the Stars</color>, during which Final DMG Bonus is reduced by <color=#44afee>40%%</color> and base MSPD is increased by <color=#44afee>%s</color> for <color=#44afee>3</color> seconds (<color=#44afee>%s</color> more seconds in PVP).\nWhile Anger of the Stars is active, Taekwon is also considered to be under <color=#44afee>Union of the Stars</color>. Cannot accumulate Energy and cannot use <color=#44afee>Union of the Stars</color> again.\n",
    ["SkillDesc_1910005"]="After casting <color=#44afee>Rising Kick</color>, the skill becomes <color=#44afee>Axe Kick</color>.\nTaekwon stomps and shatters the ground nearby, dealing neutral physical damage equal to (<color=#44afee>%s%%</color> x P.ATK + <color=#44afee>%s</color>) to enemies nearby and reducing their MSPD by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> for <color=#44afee>3</color> seconds. For every <color=#44afee>%s</color> STR, increases the damage coefficient by <color=#44afee>1%%</color> (up to <color=#44afee>400%%</color>).\nAfter learning <color=#44afee>Feeling of the Stars</color>, restores <color=#44afee>%s</color> Energy each time the skill deals damage.\n",
    ["SkillDesc_1910006"]="After casting <color=#44afee>Round Kick</color>, the skill becomes <color=#44afee>Whirlwind Kick</color>.\nTaekwon spins quickly, dealing neutral physical damage equal to (<color=#44afee>%s%%</color> x P.ATK + <color=#44afee>%s</color>) twice to enemies nearby and restoring HP equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of P.ATK for each enemy hit (up to 5). For every <color=#44afee>%s</color> STR, increases the damage coefficient by <color=#44afee>1%%</color> (up to <color=#44afee>480%%</color>).\nAfter learning <color=#44afee>Feeling of the Stars</color>, restores ((0/1/1/2) x <color=#44afee>%s</color>) Energy based on the number of targets (0/1/2/3 or above) hit each time the skill deals damage.\n",
    ["SkillDesc_1910007"]="After casting <color=#44afee>Shattering Kick</color>, the skill becomes <color=#44afee>Ignition Kick</color>.\nTaekwon kicks the target with focused strength, dealing neutral physical damage equal to (<color=#44afee>%s%%</color> x P.ATK + <color=#44afee>%s</color>) and exposing 1 of the target's <color=#44afee>weakness</color> for 5 seconds, reducing their P.DEF by <color=#44afee>5%%</color>, stacking up to <color=#44afee>10</color> times. For every <color=#44afee>%s</color> STR, increases the damage coefficient by <color=#44afee>1%%</color> (up to <color=#44afee>450%%</color>).\nAfter learning <color=#44afee>Feeling of the Stars</color>, restores <color=#44afee>%s</color> Energy each time the skill deals damage.\n",
    ["SkillDesc_1910008"]="While in <color=#44afee>Union of the Stars</color>, <color=#44afee>Rising Kick</color> becomes <color=#44afee>Ultimate Axe Kick</color>.\nTaekwon stomps 2 times with the power of the stars, each stomp dealing Weapon attribute P.DMG equal to (<color=#44afee>%s%%</color> x P.ATK + <color=#44afee>%s</color>) to nearby enemies, damage multiplied by <color=#44afee>1.5</color> each time, and stunning them for <color=#44afee>0.5</color> seconds. The last stomp has a larger area. For every <color=#44afee>%s</color> STR, increases the damage coefficient by <color=#44afee>1%%</color> (up to <color=#44afee>300%%</color>). If there are multiple targets in the area, the damage will be distributed evenly to all of them.",
    ["SkillDesc_1910009"]="While in <color=#44afee>Union of the Stars</color>, <color=#44afee>Round Kick</color> becomes <color=#44afee>Ultimate Whirlwind Kick</color>.\nTaekwon kicks upward continuously with the power of the stars, dealing Weapon attribute P.DMG equal to (<color=#44afee>%s%%</color> x P.ATK + <color=#44afee>%s</color>) to nearby enemies and restoring <color=#44afee>%s</color> HP for each enemy hit (up to 5). For every <color=#44afee>%s</color> STR, increases the damage coefficient by <color=#44afee>1%%</color> (up to <color=#44afee>500%%</color>). If there are multiple targets in the area, the damage will be distributed evenly to all of them.",
    ["SkillDesc_1910010"]="While in <color=#44afee>Union of the Stars</color>, <color=#44afee>Shattering Kick</color> becomes <color=#44afee>Ultimate Ignition Kick</color>.\nTaekwon explodes with the power of the stars and kicks the enemy, dealing weapon attribute physical damage equal to (<color=#44afee>%s%%</color> x P.ATK +<color=#44afee>%s</color>) 2 times, damage multiplied by <color=#44afee>1.5</color> each time. For every <color=#44afee>%s</color> STR, increases the damage coefficient by <color=#44afee>1%%</color> (up to <color=#44afee>150%%</color>) and deals additional True DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of Max HP. (Not effective against Boss, MVP, and MINI.)",
    ["SkillDesc_1911001"]="Taekwon summons the power of the sun, offering <color=#44afee>%s</color> Zeny and summoning a Sun Realm at the target location for <color=#44afee>10</color> minutes.\nWhile Taekwon stands in the realm, increases all DEF by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> and all P.DMG dealt by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>. When the target's HP is above <color=#44afee>50%%</color> of Max HP, Taekwon ignores <color=#44afee>1%%</color> of the target's P.DEF for every <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> above.\nWhile Taekwon stands in the realm, all <color=#44afee>kicking skills</color> now deal Fire attribute damage with an additional <color=#44afee>30%%</color> damage. (The effect fades when Taekwon dies, leaves the realm, or casts <color=#44afee>Union of the Moon</color>.)",
    ["SkillDesc_1911002"]="While Taekwon stands in the realm of <color=#44afee>Union of the Sun</color>, has a <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> chance to place an additional stack of <color=#44afee>Anger of the Sun</color> on the target each time Taekwon deals damage to an enemy. Each stack increases the target's Threat to Taekwon by (<color=#44afee>1%%</color> x number of buff stacks x <color=#44afee>%s</color>). At <color=#44afee>10</color> stacks, removes the effect and stuns the target for <color=#44afee>6</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_1911003"]="Taekwon heals party members with the power of the sun. The realm of <color=#44afee>Union of the Sun</color> restores total HP equal to (<color=#44afee>%s%%</color> x P.ATK + <color=#44afee>%s</color>) to party members within every 3 seconds, dividing the amount equally. If a party member is at full HP, the member gains a shield equal to <color=#44afee>30%%</color> of the excessive HP restored (stacks up to 10%% of the member's Max HP) for <color=#44afee>9</color> seconds.\n",
    ["SkillDesc_1911004"]="While Taekwon stands in the realm of <color=#44afee>Union of the Sun</color> and casts this skill, increases your Max HP by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> and links with the 4 party members standing closest. As long as the link exists, Taekwon takes <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of the member's damage taken. The link breaks when the linked member leaves the realm or fades when Taekwon's HP is below <color=#44afee>20%%</color>.\n",
    ["SkillDesc_1911005"]="Taekwon blocks damage received. Hold the skill to stay in the block stance, and increase Final DMG Reduction by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> for up to 5 seconds. After exiting the block stance, launches a kick and deals neutral physical damage equal to (<color=#44afee>%s%%</color> x P.ATK + <color=#44afee>%s</color>) to enemies in a fan-shaped area in front. For every <color=#44afee>%s</color> STR, increases the damage coefficient by <color=#44afee>1%%</color> (up to <color=#44afee>450%%</color>).\n(Damage sharing from Blessing of the Sun is not blocked by this skill.)\nAfter learning <color=#44afee>Feeling of the Stars</color>, restores ((0/1/1/2) x <color=#44afee>%s</color>) Energy based on the number of targets (0/1/2/3 or above) hit each time the skill deals damage.\n",
    ["SkillDesc_1911006"]="While in <color=#44afee>Union of the Stars</color>, <color=#44afee>Counter Kick</color> becomes <color=#44afee>Ultimate Counter Kick</color>.\nTaekwon blocks damage received. Hold the skill to stay in the block stance, and increase Final DMG Reduction by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> for up to 5 seconds. If the block stance lasts more than <color=#44afee>3</color> seconds, launches a kick with a wide range of Ki Wave when exiting the block stance, and deals Weapon attribute P.DMG equal to (<color=#44afee>%s%%</color> x P.ATK + <color=#44afee>%s</color>) to enemies in a fan-shaped area in front. For every <color=#44afee>%s</color> STR, increases the damage coefficient by <color=#44afee>1%%</color> (up to <color=#44afee>450%%</color>). If there are multiple targets in the area, the damage will be distributed evenly to all of them.\nThis skill deals additional Neutral attribute P.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>10%%</color> of the damage taken while blocking. For every <color=#44afee>%s</color> STR, increases the block damage conversion coefficient by <color=#44afee>0.1%%</color> (up to <color=#44afee>24%%</color>).\n(Damage sharing from Blessing of the Sun is not blocked by this skill.)\n",
    ["SkillDesc_1911007"]="Taekwon jumps and gains Endure. Upon landing, increases Final Flee by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> for <color=#44afee>3</color> seconds.\n",
    ["SkillDesc_1911008"]="<color=#44afee>Counter Kick</color> and <color=#44afee>Ultimate Counter Kick</color> are enhanced. During the block stance, <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of the damage taken each time is reflected back to the attacker.",
    ["SkillDesc_1911009"]="<color=#44afee>Counter Kick</color> and <color=#44afee>Ultimate Counter Kick</color> are enhanced. During the block stance, restores HP equal to (<color=#44afee>%s%%</color> x P.ATK + <color=#44afee>%s</color>) after taking damage each time.",
    ["SkillDesc_1911010"]="After casting <color=#44afee>Axe Kick</color>, the skill becomes <color=#44afee>Blast Kick</color>.\nTaekwon focuses the power and stomps the ground, triggering an explosion that deals neutral physical damage equal to (<color=#44afee>%s%%</color> x P.ATK + <color=#44afee>%s</color>) to nearby targets and stuns them for <color=#44afee>0.2</color> seconds. For every <color=#44afee>%s</color> STR, increases the damage coefficient by <color=#44afee>1%%</color> (up to <color=#44afee>450%%</color>).\nAfter learning <color=#44afee>Feeling of the Stars</color>, restores ((0/1/1/2) x <color=#44afee>%s</color>) Energy based on the number of targets (0/1/2/3 or above) hit each time the skill deals damage.\n",
    ["SkillDesc_1911011"]="After casting <color=#44afee>Whirlwind Kick</color>, the skill becomes <color=#44afee>Cyclone Kick</color>.\nTaekwon spins and creates a storm, dealing neutral physical damage equal to (<color=#44afee>%s%%</color> x P.ATK + <color=#44afee>%s</color>) to targets nearby and restoring HP equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of P.ATK for each enemy hit (up to 5). For every <color=#44afee>%s</color> STR, increases the damage coefficient by <color=#44afee>1%%</color> (up to <color=#44afee>450%%</color>).\nAfter learning <color=#44afee>Feeling of the Stars</color>, restores ((0/1/1/2) x <color=#44afee>%s</color>) Energy based on the number of targets (0/1/2/3 or above) hit each time the skill deals damage.\n",
    ["SkillDesc_1911012"]="After casting <color=#44afee>Ignition Kick</color>, the skill becomes <color=#44afee>Atomic Kick</color>.\nTaekwon kicks the target with focused strength and destroys the target, dealing neutral physical damage equal to (<color=#44afee>%s%%</color> x P.ATK + <color=#44afee>%s</color>). If the target has <color=#44afee>3</color> stacks of <color=#44afee>weakness</color>, consumes all <color=#44afee>3</color> stacks of <color=#44afee>weakness</color> and deals additional true damage equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of Max HP (ineffective against MVP, Boss, and MINI).For every <color=#44afee>%s</color> STR, increases the damage coefficient by <color=#44afee>1%%</color> (up to <color=#44afee>450%%</color>).\nAfter learning <color=#44afee>Feeling of the Stars</color>, restores up to <color=#44afee>%s</color> Energy each time the skill deals damage.\n",
    ["SkillDesc_1912001"]="Taekwon summons the power of the moon, offering <color=#44afee>%s</color> Zeny and summoning a Moon Realm at the target location for <color=#44afee>10</color> minutes.\n While Taekwon stands in the realm, increases all P.DMG dealt by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> and MSPD by <color=#44afee>%s</color>. Normal attacks will follow the target. When the target's HP is below <color=#44afee>50%%</color> of Max HP, Taekwon ignores <color=#44afee>1%%</color> of their P.DEF for every <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> below.\n While Taekwon stands in the realm, all kick skills deal weapon attribute damage. If within the moon realm, the cast time of the <color=#44afee>Ultimate</color> is reduced by <color=#44afee>40%%</color>. (The effect fades when Taekwon dies, leaves the realm, or casts <color=#44afee>Union of the Sun</color>).",
    ["SkillDesc_1912002"]="While Taekwon stands in the realm of <color=#44afee>Union of the Moon</color> and deals damage to an enemy, there's a <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> chance to deal additional True DMG equal to <color=#44afee>2%%</color> of the target's Max HP. If the target is a Boss, the damage becomes weapon attribute P.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of P.ATK.",
    ["SkillDesc_1912003"]="Taekwon strengthens party members and weakens the enemy with the power of the moon. The realm of <color=#44afee>Union of the Moon</color> increases the ATK of party members within range by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> and places a stack of <color=#44afee>Moonlight</color> on enemies in the realm (up to 6) every 3 seconds, each stack reducing their DEF by <color=#44afee>%s</color> for <color=#44afee>6</color> seconds, stacking up to <color=#44afee>5</color> times.",
    ["SkillDesc_1912004"]="While Taekwon stands in the realm of <color=#44afee>Union of the Moon</color> and casts this skill, protects all party members in the realm from the next <color=#44afee>%s</color> times they take physical damage and increases their Final Flee by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> for <color=#44afee>6</color> seconds.\n",
    ["SkillDesc_1912005"]="Taekwon launches a fast kick at the target, dealing Neutral attribute P.DMG equal to (<color=#44afee>%s%%</color> x P.ATK + <color=#44afee>%s</color>). The kick launches the target into the air, and the target cannot receive healing for <color=#44afee>3</color> seconds. For every <color=#44afee>%s</color> STR, increases the damage coefficient by <color=#44afee>1%%</color> (up to <color=#44afee>1,200%%</color>).\nThis skill can be cast as an area damage skill during <color=#44afee>High Jump</color>, and its damage coefficient is increased by an additional <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.\n",
    ["SkillDesc_1912006"]="While in <color=#44afee>Union of the Stars</color>, <color=#44afee>Storm Kick</color> becomes <color=#44afee>Super Ultimate Storm Kick</color>.\nTaekwon launches a fast kick at the target, dealing weapon attribute P.DMG equal to (<color=#44afee>%s%%</color> x P.ATK + <color=#44afee>%s</color>) twice. The kick launches the target into the air, and the target cannot receive healing for <color=#44afee>3</color> seconds. For every <color=#44afee>%s</color> STR, increases the damage coefficient by <color=#44afee>1%%</color> (up to <color=#44afee>600%%</color>).\nThis skill can be cast as an area knock-back damage skill during <color=#44afee>High Jump</color>. Union of the Stars ends after release.",
    ["SkillDesc_1912007"]="When party members within <color=#44afee>30</color> meters of Taekwon use skills or normal attacks <color=#44afee>%s</color> times, all party members gain a shield equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of Max HP for <color=#44afee>2</color> seconds, during which all debuffs on them are removed, and they become immune to all debuffs (triggers once every <color=#44afee>20</color> seconds).",
    ["SkillDesc_1912008"]="Only available within the realm of <color=#44afee>Union of the Sun</color>.\nTaekwon leaps into the air, condenses the power of sunlight, and slams the Power of Light into the ground and surrounding area with a kick, dealing Fire attribute physical damage equal to (<color=#44afee>%s%%</color> x P.ATK + <color=#44afee>%s</color>) to all enemies around the target. For every <color=#44afee>%s</color> STR, increases the damage coefficient by <color=#44afee>1%%</color> (up to <color=#44afee>300%%</color>).\nAfter learning <color=#44afee>Feeling of the Stars</color>, restores ((0/1/1/2) x <color=#44afee>%s</color>) Energy based on the number of targets (0/1/2/3 or above) hit each time the skill deals damage.\n",
    ["SkillDesc_1912009"]="Only available within the realm of <color=#44afee>Union of the Moon</color>.\nTaekwon focuses and condenses the power of moonlight to pull all enemies within <color=#44afee>4</color> meters, then unleashes a wave of celestial light with a forward kick, dealing 2 consecutive instances of weapon attribute physical damage equal to (<color=#44afee>%s%%</color> x P.ATK + <color=#44afee>%s</color>) to the fan-shaped area in front and stuns them for <color=#44afee>%s</color> seconds. For every <color=#44afee>%s</color> STR, increases the damage coefficient by <color=#44afee>1%%</color> (up to <color=#44afee>300%%</color>).\nAfter learning <color=#44afee>Feeling of the Stars</color>, restores ((0/1/1/2) x <color=#44afee>%s</color>) Energy based on the number of targets (0/1/2/3 or above) hit each time the skill deals damage.\n",
    ["SkillDesc_1913001"]="Enhances your control over the weather and increases damage to Demi-Human monsters by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.\nIn the sun realm, if your Shadow/Neutral Enhancement is higher than Fire Enhancement, the highest elemental enhancement is converted to Fire attribute. If not, nothing changes.\nIn the moon realm, if your Fire/Neutral Enhancement is higher than Shadow Enhancement, the highest elemental enhancement is converted to Shadow attribute. If not, nothing changes.",
    ["SkillDesc_1913002"]="Within the realm of <color=#44afee>Union of the Sun</color>, accumulates the power of <color=#44afee>Stars</color> to shift the sun's phases. At <color=#44afee>1/2/3</color> <color=#44afee>Stars</color>, the corresponding sun phases are <color=#44afee>Sunrise</color>, <color=#44afee>Noon</color>, <color=#44afee>Sunset</color>. These phases can stack and last <color=#44afee>8</color> seconds.\n<color=#44afee>Sunrise</color>: Grants immunity to <color=#44afee>Blind</color> and <color=#44afee>Freeze</color>.\n<color=#44afee>Noon</color>: Surrounds you in flames, dealing <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> weapon attribute P.DMG to enemies within a <color=#44afee>3</color>-meter radius every <color=#44afee>1</color> second.\n<color=#44afee>Sunset</color>: Increases your Fire Enhancement by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_1913003"]="Within the realm of <color=#44afee>Union of the Moon</color>, accumulates the power of <color=#44afee>Stars</color> to shift the moon's phases. At <color=#44afee>1/2/3</color> <color=#44afee>Stars</color>, the corresponding moon phases are <color=#44afee>Moonrise</color>, <color=#44afee>Midnight</color>, <color=#44afee>Moonset</color>, respectively. These phases can stack and last <color=#44afee>8</color> seconds.\n<color=#44afee>Moonrise</color>: Grants a shield equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of your Max HP for <color=#44afee>8</color> seconds.\n<color=#44afee>Midnight</color>: While the shield is active, you gain Endure.\n<color=#44afee>Moonset</color>: While the shield is active, you gain <color=#44afee>%s</color> PVP Debuff Resistance and <color=#44afee>%s</color> PVP Debuff Duration Reduction.",
    ["SkillDesc_1913004"]="Upon activation, enter <color=#44afee>Twinkling Galaxy</color> state and instantly gain 3 stars for <color=#44afee>%s</color> second(s). During this time, dealing damage to targets with skills has a <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> chance to grant you <color=#44afee>%s</color> energy.",
    ["SkillDesc_1913005"]="Within the sun realm, there's a <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> chance to generate a 4-meter radius flame zone beneath the target, dealing <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> Fire attribute P.DMG to enemies within range every second for <color=#44afee>4</color> seconds. Triggers once every <color=#44afee>8</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_1913006"]="Within the moon realm, there's a <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> chance to generate a 4-meter radius vortex of lunar beneath the target, dealing weapon attribute P.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of P.ATK to all enemies within the vortex every <color=#44afee>0.5</color> seconds and pulling them toward the center. The vortex of lunar lasts for <color=#44afee>4</color> seconds. Triggers once every <color=#44afee>8</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_1913007"]="Increases your damage dealt to the target by an additional <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>. When you have 1 star or more, your PVP Debuff Resistance is increased by <color=#44afee>%s</color>, and your PVP Debuff Duration Reduction is increased by <color=#44afee>%s</color>. Each star also increases your P.DMG by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_1913008"]="When cast within the sum realm, this skill consumes 3 stars and channels searing solar energy through the caster, dealing <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> Fire attribute P.DMG to the target and enemies within a 6-meter radius. For every <color=#44afee>%s</color> of STR you have, your damage coefficient is increased by <color=#44afee>10%%</color>, up to <color=#44afee>2,400%%</color>. Also applies <color=#44afee>Sunset Blast</color> to the target for <color=#44afee>6</color> seconds. When dealing Fire attribute DMG to the target, the target takes extra <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> Fire attribute P.DMG. Triggers once <color=#44afee>every</color> second.",
    ["SkillDesc_1913009"]="Releases with 3 stars in the moon realm, dealing <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> weapon attribute P.DMG to the target and enemies within a 6-meter radius. For every <color=#44afee>%s</color> of STR you have, your damage coefficient is increased by <color=#44afee>10%%</color>, up to <color=#44afee>3,000%%</color>. After using the skill, you ignore <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of the target's P.DMG Reflection for <color=#44afee>6</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_1913010"]="When having 3 stars, summon a falling meteor within a <color=#44afee>6</color>-meter radius every <color=#44afee>0.5</color> seconds, dealing <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> weapon attribute P.DMG to targets within the area. For every <color=#44afee>%s</color> STR you have, your damage coefficient is increased by <color=#44afee>10%%</color>, up to <color=#44afee>300%%</color> for <color=#44afee>3</color> seconds. Each hit reduces the target's defense by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>, stacking up to <color=#44afee>3</color> times and lasting <color=#44afee>6</color> seconds. If the target is an Adventurer, it also reduces their PVP Final P.DMG RED by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>, stacking up to <color=#44afee>3</color> times and lasting up to <color=#44afee>6</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_1913011"]="When taking fatal damage, all your debuffs are cleared, and the fatal blow is negated, granting you <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of Max HP instantly. While within the sun realm or moon realm, for the next <color=#44afee>5</color> seconds, you recover <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of your HP every second. Cooldown: <color=#44afee>20</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_1913012"]="Upon activation, you enter the Harmony state and merge the effects of the sun realm (<color=#44afee>kicking skill</color> damage) and moon realm (<color=#44afee>ultimate</color> cast time reduction), gaining both buffs for <color=#44afee>%s</color> second(s).",
    ["SkillDesc_1920001"]="When using a Two-Handed Rod, Soul Linker gains <color=#44afee>30</color> Soul Essences upon entering battle. Each hit on an enemy has a <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> chance to grant <color=#44afee>1</color> Soul Essence. Soul Collect grants up to <color=#44afee>2</color> Soul Essences per second, up to a max of <color=#44afee>50</color>. Soul Essences will not reset for 10 seconds after leaving combat. If you get back into a fight during that time, you will not trigger the effect that grants Soul Essences again.",
    ["SkillDesc_1920002"]="Consumes <color=#44afee>1</color> Soul Essence to deal Ghost attribute M.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of M.ATK to the target and enemies within <color=#44afee>4</color> meters. For every <color=#44afee>%s</color> INT, further increases damage coefficient by <color=#44afee>1%%</color>, up to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_1920003"]="When attacking with a Two-Handed Rod, there's a <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> chance to gain <color=#44afee>1</color> stack of <color=#44afee>Soul Insight</color>. Taking damage also has a <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> chance to gain <color=#44afee>1</color> stack of <color=#44afee>Soul Insight</color>. When <color=#44afee>Soul Insight</color> is gained or refreshed, immediately restores <color=#44afee>5</color> Soul Essences. Each stack of <color=#44afee>Soul Insight</color> increases Final DMG by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>, up to <color=#44afee>5</color> times, lasting <color=#44afee>15</color> seconds. The effect clears after <color=#44afee>10</color> seconds out of combat or upon death.",
    ["SkillDesc_1920004"]="Deals Ghost attribute M.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of M.ATK to all enemies within a 150-degree fan-shaped area. For every <color=#44afee>%s</color> INT, further increases damage coefficient by <color=#44afee>1%%</color>, up to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>. Hitting MVP, MINI, or Boss units grants <color=#44afee>10</color> Soul Essences; hitting each Adventurer grants <color=#44afee>5</color> Soul Essences; defeating a normal monster grants <color=#44afee>5</color> Soul Essences.",
    ["SkillDesc_1920005"]="When using a Two-Handed Rod, there's a <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> chance to instantly remove any MSPD debuff. Triggers once every <color=#44afee>20</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_1920006"]="When HP drops below <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>, forcefully knocks back enemies within <color=#44afee>4</color> meters by <color=#44afee>6</color> meters and inflicts <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> Slow for <color=#44afee>2</color> seconds. Triggers once every <color=#44afee>30</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_1920007"]="Entering battle with a One-Handed Rod and Shield grants <color=#44afee>Warm Wind</color> if your highest elemental enhancement is Earth, Fire, Water, or Wind. Increases M.ATK by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>, and the damage of Espa, Esha, and Eswhoo adapts to the current Warm Wind elemental attribute.",
    ["SkillDesc_1920008"]="Inflicts a <color=#44afee>%s</color>-second control effect on all enemies within <color=#44afee>4</color> meters. The control type depends on the <color=#44afee>Warm Wind</color> elemental attribute: <color=#44afee>Earth</color> -> <color=#44afee>Petrify</color>, <color=#44afee>Fire</color> -> <color=#44afee>Stun</color>, <color=#44afee>Water</color> -> <color=#44afee>Freeze</color>, and <color=#44afee>Wind</color> -> <color=#44afee>Sleep</color>. Must be used while <color=#44afee>Warm Wind</color> is active.",
    ["SkillDesc_1920009"]="While affected by <color=#44afee>Warm Wind</color>, gain additional effects depending on its elemental attribute: Earth -> Final DMG taken reduced by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>, Fire -> M.ATK increased by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>, Water -> SP cost of all Talisman skills reduced by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>, and Wind -> MSPD increased by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_1920010"]="When using a One-Handed Rod and Shield, if VIT is the highest primary stat: Every <color=#44afee>%s</color> VIT grants +<color=#44afee>4</color> M.ATK. Every <color=#44afee>%s</color> LUK increases damage dealt by Espa, Esha, Eswhoo, and Eske by <color=#44afee>0.1%%</color>, up to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_1920011"]="Deals (<color=#44afee>%s%%</color> M.ATK + <color=#44afee>%s</color>) Neutral attribute M.DMG to a single target. Espa's elemental attribute DMG changes based on Warm Wind.",
    ["SkillDesc_1920012"]="Deals (<color=#44afee>%s%%</color> M.ATK + <color=#44afee>%s</color>) Neutral attribute M.DMG to all enemies within <color=#44afee>4</color> meters. Esha's elemental attribute DMG changes based on Warm Wind.",
    ["SkillDesc_1921001"]="When a skill that consumes Soul Essences deals damage, there's a <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> chance to leave a Soul Fragment on the ground (up to <color=#44afee>6</color> pieces at once), lasting <color=#44afee>1.5</color> seconds. If within <color=#44afee>10</color> meters, Soul Fragments automatically return when they vanish, dealing Ghost attribute M.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of M.ATK to enemies in their path and restoring <color=#44afee>1</color> Soul Essence each.",
    ["SkillDesc_1921002"]="Enters the <color=#44afee>Soul Division</color> state and automatically attacks the nearest enemy within <color=#44afee>10</color> meters. Each strike deals Ghost attribute M.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> M.ATK and restores <color=#44afee>1</color> Soul Essence. Attacks occur <color=#44afee>once</color> every <color=#44afee>1</color> second. <color=#44afee>Soul Division</color> lasts <color=#44afee>10</color> seconds. For every <color=#44afee>%s</color> INT, increases damage coefficient by <color=#44afee>1%%</color>, up to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_1921003"]="Each Soul Essence increases your Final DMG Bonus by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>. When consuming <color=#44afee>10</color> or more Soul Essences at once, gain <color=#44afee>Soul Unity</color>, boosting the damage of <color=#44afee>Soul Explosion</color>, <color=#44afee>Soul Harvest</color>, and <color=#44afee>Curse Explosion</color> by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> for <color=#44afee>6</color> seconds. Triggers <color=#44afee>once</color> every <color=#44afee>10</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_1921004"]="Enters Spirit Form for <color=#44afee>2</color> seconds, removing all debuffs and becoming untargetable. You can't use normal attacks or cast skills during this time. When it ends, restore <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of Max HP. Can be used even while controlled.",
    ["SkillDesc_1921005"]="While possessing Soul Essences, if attacked by a Stealth target, apply <color=#44afee>Soul Gaze</color> on them, revealing them for <color=#44afee>5</color> seconds and increasing their Final DMG taken by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>. Triggers <color=#44afee>once</color> every <color=#44afee>10</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_1921006"]="Summons Wraith Hands within <color=#44afee>4</color> meters, dealing weapon attribute M.DMG equal to (<color=#44afee>%s%%</color> M.ATK + <color=#44afee>%s</color>) after a short delay. Enemies hit are inflicted with <color=#44afee>Vulnerable</color>, reducing their Final DMG dealt by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> for <color=#44afee>3</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_1921007"]="Summons a zone that inflicts constant damage within <color=#44afee>4</color> meters, dealing Neutral attribute M.DMG equal to (<color=#44afee>%s%%</color> M.ATK + <color=#44afee>%s</color>) to all enemies within the area every <color=#44afee>0.5</color> seconds for <color=#44afee>6</color> seconds. Eswhoo's elemental attribute DMG changes based on Warm Wind.",
    ["SkillDesc_1921008"]="When Espa deals damage, it slows the target by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> and temporarily disables all MSPD buffs for <color=#44afee>1.5</color> seconds.\nWhen Esha deals damage, it applies <color=#44afee>Armor Break</color> to the target for <color=#44afee>3</color> seconds.\nEnemies within Eswhoo's field remain in a state of Blind.",
    ["SkillDesc_1921009"]="When Espa, Esha, or Eswhoo defeats an enemy, there's a <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> chance to <color=#44afee>infect</color> a <color=#44afee>single</color> nearest enemy within <color=#44afee>4</color> meters for <color=#44afee>6</color> seconds, dealing Neutral M.DMG equal to (<color=#44afee>%s%%</color> M.ATK + <color=#44afee>%s</color>) each second. Eske's elemental attribute DMG changes based on Warm Wind.",
    ["SkillDesc_1921010"]="Espa, Esha, and Eswhoo have a <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> chance to inflict <color=#44afee>Soul Fatigue</color> for <color=#44afee>3</color> seconds. Targets under the effect of <color=#44afee>Soul Fatigue</color> will have their healing and recovery reduced by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_1921011"]="Grants party members Golem's Soul, increasing their damage reduction against small, medium, and large monsters by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> and nullifying any defense-reduction debuffs (P.DEF / M.DEF, Final P.DEF / Final M.DMG, Final P.DMG RED / Final M.DMG RED, and PVP Final P.DMG RED / PVP Final M.DMG RED) for <color=#44afee>8</color> seconds The effect does not stack with Shadow's Soul, Falcon's Soul, and Fairy's Soul.",
    ["SkillDesc_1921012"]="Grants party members Shadow's Soul, increasing their damage boost against small monsters by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> (as elemental effects) and nullifying any attack-reduction debuffs (P.ATK / M.ATK, P.PEN / M.PEN, Final P.DMG Bonus / Final M.DMG Bonus, PVP Final P.DMG Bonus / PVP Final M.DMG Bonus) for <color=#44afee>8</color> seconds The effect does not stack with Falcon's Soul, Fairy's Soul, and Golem's Soul.",
    ["SkillDesc_1922001"]="Teleports instantly to the target location, gaining <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> MSPD for <color=#44afee>3</color> seconds. Immunes to all movement debuffs while active. Can be used up to <color=#44afee>2</color> times in a row.",
    ["SkillDesc_1922002"]="When the highest elemental enhancement is Shadow, Soul Explosion, Soul Harvest, Soul Division, Curse Explosion, Soul Taint, and Soul Revolution deal Shadow DMG instead of Ghost. For every <color=#44afee>%s</color> LUK, these skills (Soul Explosion, Soul Harvest, Soul Division, Curse Explosion, and Soul Revolution) ignore <color=#44afee>1%%</color> of the monster's Final M.DEF, up to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_1922003"]="Compresses immense dark soul power into a blast and launches it to a single enemy, dealing Ghost attribute M.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of M.ATK. For every <color=#44afee>%s</color> INT, further increases damage coefficient by <color=#44afee>1%%</color>, up to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>. Requires at least <color=#44afee>10</color> Soul Essences; consumes up to <color=#44afee>20</color>. <color=#44afee>Each</color> extra Soul Essence consumed ignores <color=#44afee>5%%</color> of the target's Final M.DMG RED.",
    ["SkillDesc_1922004"]="If the highest elemental enhancement is Ghost or Shadow, the damage attribute of Azure Dragon Talisman, White Tiger Talisman, Vermilion Bird Talisman, and Black Tortoise Talisman changes to match that element and further increases its power by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_1922005"]="Summons the tempest of Azure Dragon to pull all enemies within <color=#44afee>6</color> meters toward the center for <color=#44afee>1</color> second before detonating the thunder orbs, dealing Wind attribute M.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of M.ATK to all targets and stunning them for <color=#44afee>2</color> seconds. After casting, gains <color=#44afee>Azure Dragon Seal</color> for <color=#44afee>10</color> seconds, increasing MSPD by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>. <color=#44afee>Azure Dragon Seal</color>, <color=#44afee>White Tiger Seal</color>, <color=#44afee>Vermilion Bird Seal</color>, and <color=#44afee>Black Tortoise Seal</color> cannot exist at the same time.",
    ["SkillDesc_1922006"]="Summons the fierce aura of the White Tiger to claw all enemies within an <color=#44afee>8</color>-meter, 150-degree fan-shaped area <color=#44afee>3</color> times, each strike inflicting Earth attribute M.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of M.ATK. After casting, gains <color=#44afee>White Tiger Seal</color> for <color=#44afee>10</color> seconds, increasing damage against targets below <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> HP by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>. <color=#44afee>Azure Dragon Seal</color>, <color=#44afee>White Tiger Seal</color>, <color=#44afee>Vermilion Bird Seal</color>, and <color=#44afee>Black Tortoise Seal</color> cannot exist at the same time.",
    ["SkillDesc_1922007"]="Extends the duration of Golem's Soul, Shadow's Soul, Falcon's Soul, and Fairy's Soul by <color=#44afee>4</color> seconds. When party members are under these effects, their cooldown time is reduced by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_1922008"]="Bestows Falcon's Soul upon party members, enhancing damage against medium monsters by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> and temporarily nullifying critical-type debuffs (ASPD, Final ASPD, Crit, Final Crit, Hit, Final Hit, Crit DMG Bonus, Final P.DMG Bonus, and PVP Final P.DMG Bonus) for <color=#44afee>8</color> seconds. This effect cannot stack with Shadow's Soul, Fairy's Soul, and Golem's Soul.",
    ["SkillDesc_1922009"]="Bestows Fairy's Soul upon party members, enhancing damage against large monsters by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> and temporarily nullifying casting-type debuffs (variable/fixed cooldown, Haste, Final Haste, and variable/fixed cast time) for <color=#44afee>8</color> seconds. This effect cannot stack with Falcon's Soul, Shadow's Soul, and Golem's Soul.",
    ["SkillDesc_1922010"]="Automatically gains <color=#44afee>1</color> stack of <color=#44afee>Soul Gathering</color> every <color=#44afee>12</color> seconds. Dealing skill damage to enemies has a <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> chance to add <color=#44afee>1</color> stack of <color=#44afee>Soul Gathering</color>, and using Golem's Soul, Shadow's Soul, Falcon's Soul, and Fairy's Soul also has a <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> chance to gain <color=#44afee>1</color> stack of Soul Gathering. <color=#44afee>Soul Gathering</color> lasts <color=#44afee>10</color> seconds, stacking up to <color=#44afee>5</color> times. Each stack of Soul Gathering increases PVP Debuff Resistance / PVP Debuff Duration Reduction by <color=#44afee>3</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_1922011"]="Consumes <color=#44afee>1</color> stack of <color=#44afee>Soul Gathering</color> and <color=#44afee>1</color> <color=#44afee>Soa Charm</color> to apply <color=#44afee>Protective Talisman</color> on a target for <color=#44afee>6</color> seconds, reducing incoming Final DMG by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> and converting <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of the damage into healing. The effects trigger up to <color=#44afee>once</color> per second. The effect of <color=#44afee>Protective Talisman</color>, <color=#44afee>Samurai Talisman</color>, <color=#44afee>Mage Talisman</color>, and <color=#44afee>Five Elements Talisman</color> cannot stack. Replaced if another talisman is applied. Consumes <color=#44afee>10%%</color> Max SP upon casting.",
    ["SkillDesc_1922012"]="Consumes <color=#44afee>1</color> stack of <color=#44afee>Soul Gathering</color> and <color=#44afee>1</color> <color=#44afee>Soa Charm</color> to apply <color=#44afee>Five Elements Talisman</color> on a target for <color=#44afee>6</color> seconds, increasing damage dealt to <color=#44afee>Neutral</color>, <color=#44afee>Earth</color>, <color=#44afee>Fire</color>, <color=#44afee>Water</color>, and <color=#44afee>Wind</color> armor enemies by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>. The effects of <color=#44afee>Protective Talisman</color>, <color=#44afee>Samurai Talisman</color>, <color=#44afee>Mage Talisman</color>, and <color=#44afee>Five Elements Talisman</color> cannot stack. Replaced if another talisman is applied. Consumes <color=#44afee>10%%</color> Max SP upon casting.",
    ["SkillDesc_1923001"]="Calls forth the Flames of Vermilion Bird, scorching an <color=#44afee>8x4</color>-meter area for <color=#44afee>3</color> seconds, dealing Fire attribute M.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of M.ATK per second. After casting, gains <color=#44afee>Vermilion Bird Seal</color> for <color=#44afee>10</color> seconds; during this time, attacks inflict a <color=#44afee>Wounded</color> effect for <color=#44afee>5</color> seconds, reducing healing received and recovery effect by 30%%. <color=#44afee>Azure Dragon Seal</color>, <color=#44afee>White Tiger Seal</color>, <color=#44afee>Vermilion Bird Seal</color>, and <color=#44afee>Black Tortoise Seal</color> cannot exist at the same time.",
    ["SkillDesc_1923002"]="Conjures the Shield of Black Tortoise to guard a target, absorbing damage equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of your M.ATK, up to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of your Max HP. After casting, gains <color=#44afee>Black Tortoise Seal</color> for <color=#44afee>10</color> seconds. While <color=#44afee>Black Tortoise Seal</color> is active, every time you take damage, reflect Water M.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of M.ATK to the attacker and inflict a <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> Slow, triggering at most <color=#44afee>once</color> <color=#44afee>per second</color>. <color=#44afee>Azure Dragon Seal</color>, <color=#44afee>White Tiger Seal</color>, <color=#44afee>Vermilion Bird Seal</color>, and <color=#44afee>Black Tortoise Seal</color> cannot exist at the same time.",
    ["SkillDesc_1923003"]="Casting Azure Dragon Talisman, White Tiger Talisman, Vermilion Bird Talisman, or Black Tortoise Talisman grants <color=#44afee>1</color> stack of <color=#44afee>Four Guardians Blessing</color>. <color=#44afee>Four Guardians Blessing</color> can stack up to <color=#44afee>4</color> times. Each stack of <color=#44afee>Four Guardians Blessing</color> reduces damage taken by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> for <color=#44afee>8</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_1923004"]="Consumes <color=#44afee>4</color> stacks of <color=#44afee>Four Guardians Blessing</color> to form the Five Elements Field in an <color=#44afee>8x8</color>-meter area. Each second, deals Neutral attribute True DMG equal to <color=#44afee>5%%</color> of Max HP to Adventurers within the area and weapon attribute M.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of M.ATK to monsters. Party members inside the <color=#44afee>Elemental Four Guardians Field</color> take <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> less damage. Lasts <color=#44afee>6</color> seconds. The field has <color=#44afee>5</color> nodes, and party members standing on them have a <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> chance to reduce control effects by <color=#44afee>1</color> second.",
    ["SkillDesc_1923005"]="Consumes <color=#44afee>15</color> Soul Essences to gain <color=#44afee>Soul Armor</color> for <color=#44afee>3</color> seconds. During this time, <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of damage taken is stored instead of being received. When the effect ends, deals Ghost attribute M.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of M.ATK and unleashes an extra <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of the stored damage as Ghost attribute M.DMG to enemies within <color=#44afee>6</color> meters, up to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of your ATK.",
    ["SkillDesc_1923006"]="Consumes <color=#44afee>30</color> Soul Essences to <color=#44afee>Curse</color> a target, reducing the target's Max HP by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> and healing received and recovery effect by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> for <color=#44afee>5</color> seconds. When the Curse ends, the evil spirit reapplies <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of all damage you dealt during the period as True DMG to the target.",
    ["SkillDesc_1923007"]="Casting Protective Talisman, Samurai Talisman, Mage Talisman, or Five Elements Talisman grants <color=#44afee>1</color> stack of <color=#44afee>Divine Resonance</color>. Each stack of <color=#44afee>Divine Resonance</color> reduces Final DMG taken by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> and shortens fixed cast time by <color=#44afee>0.1</color> seconds. <color=#44afee>Divine Resonance</color> lasts up to <color=#44afee>12</color> seconds and stacks up to <color=#44afee>6</color> times.",
    ["SkillDesc_1923008"]="Consumes <color=#44afee>1</color> stack of <color=#44afee>Soul Gathering</color> and <color=#44afee>1</color> <color=#44afee>Soa Charm</color> to cast <color=#44afee>Soul Theft Talisman</color> on an enemy, inflicting <color=#44afee>Lost Soul</color>. The target cannot gain buffs, loses <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> Max SP per second, and loses <color=#44afee>1</color> buff <color=#44afee>each</color> second. <color=#44afee>Lost Soul</color> lasts <color=#44afee>5</color> seconds. You restore <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> Max SP whenever <color=#44afee>a</color> buff is removed from the target.",
    ["SkillDesc_1923009"]="Consumes <color=#44afee>1</color> stack of <color=#44afee>Soul Gathering</color> and <color=#44afee>1</color> <color=#44afee>Soa Charm</color> to apply <color=#44afee>Samurai Talisman</color> on a target. Every <color=#44afee>2</color> seconds, grants a buff that doubles the next damage. Lasts <color=#44afee>%s</color> second(s) or <color=#44afee>6</color> skills. The effects of <color=#44afee>Protective Talisman</color>, <color=#44afee>Samurai Talisman</color>, <color=#44afee>Mage Talisman</color>, and <color=#44afee>Five Elements Talisman</color> cannot stack. Replaced if another talisman is applied. Consumes <color=#44afee>10%%</color> Max SP upon casting.",
    ["SkillDesc_1923010"]="Consumes <color=#44afee>1</color> stack of <color=#44afee>Soul Gathering</color> and <color=#44afee>1</color> <color=#44afee>Soa Charm</color> to apply <color=#44afee>Mage Talisman</color> on a target, allowing them to use skills instantly without casting. Lasts <color=#44afee>%s</color> second(s) or <color=#44afee>10</color> skills. The effects of <color=#44afee>Protective Talisman</color>, <color=#44afee>Samurai Talisman</color>, <color=#44afee>Mage Talisman</color>, and <color=#44afee>Five Elements Talisman</color> cannot stack. Replaced if another talisman is applied. Consumes <color=#44afee>10%%</color> Max SP upon casting.",
    ["SkillDesc_1923011"]="Purifies fallen Adventurer souls within the Shrine of the Underworld. If they revive within the <color=#44afee>Shrine of the Underworld</color>, they cannot use normal attacks or cast skills for <color=#44afee>%s</color> second(s). <color=#44afee>Each</color> affected Adventurer consumes <color=#44afee>1</color> stack of Shrine Intensity.",
    ["SkillDesc_1923012"]="Consumes <color=#44afee>6</color> <color=#44afee>Soa Charms</color> to summon the Shrine of the Underworld for <color=#44afee>12</color> seconds, using all <color=#44afee>Divine Resonance</color> stacks to increase the Intensity of the <color=#44afee>Shrine of the Underworld</color> accordingly. When a party member dies inside, <color=#44afee>1</color> stack of Shrine Intensity is consumed automatically and revives them instantly with <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> Max HP and <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> Max SP. The Shrine of the Underworld disappears when you die.",
    ["SkillDesc_200004"]="Grabs hold of a Water Gun and launches a water bomb in a chosen direction.",
    ["SkillDesc_200005"]="Grabs hold of a Water Gun and launches a mega water bomb in a chosen direction.",
    ["SkillDesc_200006"]="Pull out the harpoon shooter from the back and launch forward. The harpoon will split once you hit a swimming fish, attacking multiple targets.",
    ["SkillDesc_200007"]="Spin the barrels at high speed and shoot forward.",
    ["SkillDesc_200008"]="Launches a harpoon to tag the prey, attracting a killer whale to devour it.",
    ["SkillDesc_20016"]="Uses it to block the next <color=#44afee>%s</color> attack(s). Consuming <color=#44afee>%s</color> chance(s) may trigger the cooldown of this skill for <color=#44afee>%s</color> seconds; if players are in a water bubble, they will be released from it.",
    ["SkillDesc_20017"]="Hurls a Water Balloon in a specified area, dealing <color=#44afee>%s</color> Soak to enemies within <color=#44afee>%s</color>m.",
    ["SkillDesc_20018"]="Hurls a Super Water Balloon in a specified area, dealing <color=#44afee>%s</color> Soak to enemies within <color=#44afee>%s</color>m.",
    ["SkillDesc_20019"]="Adjusts the Water Gun’s pressure valve, increasing the spray’s pressure while decreasing cooldown for water bombs by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> for <color=#44afee>%s</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_20020"]="Cracks open an Energy Drink which increases Movement Speed by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> for <color=#44afee>%s</color> seconds and reduces Soak by <color=#44afee>%s</color> point(s) per second.",
    ["SkillDesc_20021"]="Rescues a party member, helping them get out of the water bubble. Movement during the rescue will interrupt the rescue operation.",
    ["SkillDesc_21067"]="<color=#FFEC14>Flash</color>: When dealing normal attacks or skills, there's a <color=#70F953>10%</color> | <color=#70F953>20%</color> chance to gain a buff, increasing damage against all normal monsters, MVPs, MINIs, and Bosses by <color=#70F953>84%</color> for <color=#70F953>6</color> seconds. Cooldown: <color=#70F953>12</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_21068"]="<color=#FFEC14>Flash</color>: When healed, there's a <color=#70F953>25%</color> chance to gain a buff, increasing Physical/Magic Lifesteal by <color=#70F953>84%</color> and Physical/Magic ATK percentage by <color=#70F953>84%</color> for <color=#70F953>6</color> seconds. Cooldown: <color=#70F953>12</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_21069"]="<color=#FFEC14>Flash</color>: When taking damage that exceeds <color=#70F953>20%</color> of Max HP in a single hit, there's an <color=#70F953>80%</color> chance to reduce the damage taken by <color=#70F953>60%</color> (including True DMG). When triggered, P.ATK and M.ATK percentage is increased by <color=#70F953>120%</color>. Lasts <color=#70F953>6</color> seconds. Cooldown: <color=#70F953>12</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_21070"]="<color=#FFEC14>Flash</color>: When dealing normal attacks or skills to the affix summons, they can be directly executed. Cooldown: <color=#70F953>24</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_21071"]="<color=#FFEC14>Flash</color>: When taking damage, there's a <color=#70F953>20%</color> chance to deal <color=#70F953>1,680%</color> weapon attribute Adaptive DMG that ignores defense to the attacker and enemies within <color=#70F953>4</color> meters of the attacker. Cooldown: <color=#70F953>24</color> seconds. If your Final Crit is higher than Final P.PEN or Final M.PEN, it may trigger critical damage.",
    ["SkillDesc_21072"]="<color=#FFEC14>Flash</color>: When dealing damage using normal attacks or skills, there's a <color=#70F953>35%</color> | <color=#70F953>70%</color> chance to automatically chant the spell of Hammer of God on the target, dealing a total of <color=#70F953>3,231%</color> weapon attribute Adaptive DMG within a <color=#70F953>5</color>-meter radius in <color=#70F953>2</color> hits. Cooldown: <color=#70F953>16</color> seconds. If your Final Crit is higher than Final P.PEN or Final M.PEN, it may trigger critical damage.",
    ["SkillDesc_21076"]="<color=#FFEC14>Flash</color>: Has a <color=#70F953>20%</color> chance to negate debuffs from MVPs and MINIs, granting <color=#70F953>6</color> seconds of immunity to all debuffs. Can trigger once every <color=#70F953>18</color> seconds. The immunity effect works against debuffs applied by MVP and MINI affixes, such as Virus, Restricted Vision, Burn, Chill, and Corrosion. However, certain debuffs from MVPs and MINIs are unaffected by this effect. When applying debuffs to MVPs or MINIs, ignores <color=#70F953>40</color> points of their Debuff Resistance and Debuff Duration Reduction.",
    ["SkillDesc_21077"]="<color=#FFEC14>Flash</color>: Attacking a monster with the same element as your highest elemental enhancement increases your Final DMG Bonus by <color=#70F953>84%</color>. Attacking a monster with a different element as your highest elemental enhancement increases your Final DMG Bonus by <color=#70F953>28%</color>. Both effects last for <color=#70F953>10</color> seconds. Can trigger once every <color=#70F953>20</color> seconds. Additionally, deal <color=#70F953>5%</color> extra damage to all monster races and gain <color=#70F953>5%</color> extra Job EXP upon defeating monsters (does not apply to Odin Blessing EXP or event EXP).",
    ["SkillDesc_30001102"]="Angeling charges at you and deals <color=#C09333>Holy</color> <color=#ff3300>physical</color> damage, but it has to rest for 2 seconds due to the impact.",
    ["SkillDesc_30001104"]="A huge wave of Little Poring is approaching!",
    ["SkillDesc_30001105"]="The Angeling takes a bite of an apple and instantly recovers some stamina.",
    ["SkillDesc_30002102"]="Winds up and prepares a Charge Attack.",
    ["SkillDesc_30002103"]="Reflects an amount of damage received for a period.",
    ["SkillDesc_30003102"]="Deviling deals <color=#ff3300>physical</color> damage and <color=#ffae78>stuns</color> everyone, while throwing rotten apples in your faces!",
    ["SkillDesc_30003104"]="A huge wave of Little Poring is approaching!",
    ["SkillDesc_30003105"]="The Deviling cackles menacingly and <color=#b4ceff>slows</color> nearby targets.",
    ["SkillDesc_30004102"]="Drake marks and slows a target, then fires the Ultimate Water Cannon multiple times at it.",
    ["SkillDesc_30004104"]="Drake's Crow summons a giant sphere of water and traps the furthest target. Trapped targets suffocate and receive a huge amount of damage over time, and they can only be rescued by others by popping the sphere.",
    ["SkillDesc_30004105"]="Drake's pegleg is corroded by water and has to be repaired during combat. When repairing, Drake's HP Recovery Speed will increase. After repairing, Drake's Movement Speed and ASPD will increase.",
    ["SkillDesc_30005102"]="Strouf raises its trident and summons lightning, striking multiple times at targets in the battle.",
    ["SkillDesc_30005103"]="The Strouf channels an ancient curse, inflicting a Frost Mark on a random target. Once the channeling is finished, a Frost Nova emits from it and the marked target, dealing magic damage to a huge area nearby.",
    ["SkillDesc_30005104"]="The Strouf brandishes its gigantic trident and strikes at a target in front of it three times.",
    ["SkillDesc_30006102"]="Goblin Leader dances where he stands and summons a totem that spawns Lil' Goblins continuously.",
    ["SkillDesc_30006103"]="Goblin Leader dances where he stands, increasing his and his followers' combat prowess.",
    ["SkillDesc_30007102"]="Mistress inflicts Chaos and deals <color=#5A7D29>Wind</color> <color=#0033ff>magic</color> damage on all targets.",
    ["SkillDesc_30007103"]="Mistress fires multiple stinger shots in all directions, dealing <color=#8438AD>Poison</color> <color=#0033ff>magic</color> damage to targets hit.",
    ["SkillDesc_30007104"]="Mistress selects 3 targets and fires Hive Trap at them, dealing AoE <color=#FFFFF0>true</color> damage and <color=#b4ceff>slowing</color> them.",
    ["SkillDesc_30008102"]="Phreeoni charges at a player and swallows them.",
    ["SkillDesc_30008103"]="Phreeoni deals AoE <color=#6B5531>Earth</color> <color=#ff3300>physical</color> damage in a certain direction and <color=#b6bacc>petrifies</color> the targets hit.",
    ["SkillDesc_30008104"]="Phreeoni spits out a mouthful of corrosive acid, dealing <color=#0033ff>magic</color> damage over time to all targets within range.",
    ["SkillDesc_30009102"]="Maya selects a target and charges at it, dealing <color=#6B5531>Earth</color> <color=#ff3300>physical</color> damage to enemies in her path.",
    ["SkillDesc_30009105"]="Maya incubates a swam of ants that assist her in attacking.",
    ["SkillDesc_30009106"]="When Maya is in Defensive Stance, she is immune to all ranged attacks and will recover a large amount of HP.",
    ["SkillDesc_30010102"]="Eddga tosses a fire bottle at a location, dealing <color=#AB4050>Fire</color> <color=#0033ff>magic</color> damage over time to all targets within the area.",
    ["SkillDesc_30010103"]="Eddga slashes rapidly with his razor-sharp claws, dealing <color=#ff3300>physical</color> damage and causing all targets to <color=#ff9ca1>bleed</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_30010104"]="Eddga stamps the ground three times, dealing AoE <color=#FFFFF0>true</color> damage. Damage is shared among all targets in the area.",
    ["SkillDesc_30011102"]="Moonlight Flower whirls its bell before smashing it into the ground, dealing area damage to nearby targets.",
    ["SkillDesc_30011103"]="When Moonlight Flower receives a large amount of damage, it will inflict the Biteback Spell on the target. When the affected target casts a skill, the amount of SP required will increase and it will receive magic damage from Moonlight Flower's Biteback Spell.",
    ["SkillDesc_30011104"]="Moonlight Flower casts Land Protector on the spot and is immune to magic damage and trap damage within its area.",
    ["SkillDesc_30012102"]="Orc Hero unleashes powerful tornadoes in all directions, dealing <color=#ff3300>physical</color> damage to targets hit.",
    ["SkillDesc_30012103"]="Orc Hero selects a target, dealing AoE <color=#6B5531>Earth</color> <color=#ff3300>physical</color> damage and inflicting <color=#b9eb72>Armor Break</color> on the target",
    ["SkillDesc_30012104"]="Orc Hero lets out a furious howl, dealing AoE <color=#6B5531>Earth</color> <color=#0033ff>magic</color> damage and <color=#b4ceff>slowing</color> nearby targets.",
    ["SkillDesc_30012105"]="Orc Hero raises its shield, absorbing all damage and <color=#d6b4ff>countering</color> with <color=#FFFF00>Holy</color> damage for a period.",
    ["SkillDesc_30013103"]="Osiris creates a poisonous swamp. Targets within the area are slowed drastically and inflicted with Deadly Poison.",
    ["SkillDesc_30013104"]="Do not look directly into Osiris' eyes, or its Petrifying Gaze will turn you into stone and you will be forever trapped in the Ancient Pyramid.",
    ["SkillDesc_30013106"]="Osiris deals damage to targets around it with its dark power and invokes the mysterious energy of the pyramid to heal itself.",
    ["SkillDesc_30014103"]="Doppelganger leaps into the air and thrusts its weapon into the ground, creating three large fissures. Targets in the fissures will take <color=#6B5531>Earth</color> <color=#0033ff>magic</color> damage, be <color=#b4ceff>slowed</color>, and inflicted with 5 stacks of <color=#ff0000>Trauma</color>. Targets that accumulate 10 stacks of Trauma will die immediately!",
    ["SkillDesc_30014104"]="Doppelganger makes a chopping gesture and quickly charges in the direction of a random fissure. Targets slashed by it will directly accumulate 10 stacks of <color=#ff0000>Trauma</color> and die.",
    ["SkillDesc_30014106"]="Doppelganger infuses the power of spirits into the earth, stopping both space and time for itself. Targets in range will be gradually <color=#b4ceff>slowed</color> until they are <color=#7ACEFF>immobilized</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_30015103"]="Orc Lord leaps at a target and smashes its great axe into the ground, causing an earthquake that deals <color=#6B5531>Earth</color> <color=#ff3300>physical</color> damage and <color=#ffae78>stuns</color> nearby targets.",
    ["SkillDesc_30015104"]="Orc Lord spins its great axe around, creating a cyclone of destruction and thereby becoming immune to all ranged damage as it moves slowly towards a random target. The cyclone pulls nearby targets into it and deals a large amount of <color=#ff3300>physical</color> damage.",
    ["SkillDesc_30015105"]="Orc Lord bellows and inflicts a Flag Mark on 5 nearby targets. While the effect is active, damage received by Orc Lord will be shared by the marked targets.",
    ["SkillDesc_30016102"]="Dracula deals ranged damage with a powerful knockback effect, with itself at the center of the AOE. Watch out! The knockback range will gradually increase.",
    ["SkillDesc_30016104"]="Dracula continuously absorbs the blood pearls in the environment's pool of blood. The more blood pearls absorbed, the greater Judex's damage becomes.",
    ["SkillDesc_30016107"]="Dracula transforms into a demon, pulling in all targets and casting a huge energy blood orb to deal damage. The true demon has arrived!",
    ["SkillDesc_30017102"]="Pharaoh conjures a gravitational field that pulls targets towards it, then it summons a lightning bolt and deals <color=#0033ff>magic</color> damage to them.",
    ["SkillDesc_30017103"]="Pharaoh randomly selects 5 targets and steals from their Maximum HP every second to heal itself.",
    ["SkillDesc_30017104"]="Pharaoh deals damage and ensnares nearby targets. After the ensnare state ends, randomly selects a target and inflicts <color=#b9eb72>Black Death</color>, drastically decreasing all its stats till it dies and infecting nearby targets periodically.",
    ["SkillDesc_30019102"]="Morroc uses his power as the First Demon to cast the forbidden Devilish Rite, calling forth a Hell Tornado to deal violent damage to targets near him. Targets with more stacks of the <color=#ff00ff>Demon King's Curse</color> will take more <color=#FFFFF0>true damage</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_30019106"]="Morroc has both <color=#00ffff>Arcane</color> and <color=#ff3300>Boulder</color> phantoms. The Arcane phantom has magic immunity while the Boulder phantom has physical immunity. Both phantoms will sacrifice themselves to Morroc after a time, granting Morroc their power and restoring a large amount of his HP. They also grant him a massive buff in the form of <color=#00ffff>Magic Reflect Damage</color>/<color=#ff3300>Physical Reflect Damage</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_30019107"]="Morroc focuses the great power of his demonic eyes and launches distorting black holes around him. Targets who come into contact with the black holes will take <color=#54478E>Shadow</color> <color=#0033ff>magic</color> damage.",
    ["SkillDesc_30019108"]="The earth trembles before the fury of the Demon King. All targets in Morroc's domain are captured and bound by the <color=#ff00ff>Hand of the Demon King</color> while Morroc channels his destructive Hellfire. Targets who do not manage to <color=#ff0000>free themselves</color> from the Hand of the Demon King will be burnt to ash.",
    ["SkillDesc_30020103"]="When Amon Ra is resurrected, it will be surrounded by flaming pillars that burn all creatures that come near, dealing <color=#AB4050>Fire</color> <color=#0033ff>magic</color> damage.",
    ["SkillDesc_30020104"]="Amon Ra unleashes his most loyal servant, <color=#ff0000>Khalitzburg</color>. A chain links the two. Enemies who touch the chain will take damage, and Amon Ra will periodically <color=#40FF00>share HP</color> with Khalitzburg, with the one who has the higher HP percentage sharing HP with the one who has the lower percentage.",
    ["SkillDesc_30020106"]="After Amon Ra chants an ancient curse for a period of time, it will summon a giant destructive meteor. A <color=#ff0000>Mimic</color> will also appear and self-destruct 10 seconds after appearing, dealing massive <color=#FFFFF0>true</color> damage to all nearby targets and inflicting them with several stacks of <color=#ff0000>Fatigue</color>. <color=#ff0000>Only Khalitzburg's weapon can destroy the Mimic.</color>",
    ["SkillDesc_30021102"]="Dark Priest blasts the fan-shaped area in front with dark powers, dealing <color=#54478E>Shadow</color> <color=#0033ff>magic</color> damage and inflicting Blind.",
    ["SkillDesc_30021104"]="Dark Priest randomly flashes to the target location, ignites the ground beneath his feet and summons a cross of black flames, dealing a large amount of <color=#54478E>Shadow</color> <color=#0033ff>magic</color> damage.",
    ["SkillDesc_30022102"]="Hibram prayed to the wrong deity... Perform 3 Cross attacks, dealing <color=#0033ff>magic</color> damage with each attack and summoning <color=#b9eb72>Hibram's Confusion</color> when last attack successfully hits.",
    ["SkillDesc_30022105"]="Hibram spreads crazy beliefs, infecting everyone with the plague with his spittle and summoning <color=#b9eb72>Hibram's Madness</color> while inflicting Poison effect.",
    ["SkillDesc_30022107"]="By the time Hibram understood the truth, it was too late to go back... Summon <color=#b9eb72>Truth's Shadow</color>, which will destroy the battlefield after a period of time. You must kill it first!",
    ["SkillDesc_30023102"]="Kraken spins quickly, dealing <color=#316DA2>Water</color> <color=#ff3300>physical</color> damage and knocking back nearby targets.",
    ["SkillDesc_30023104"]="The Kraken fires a pulse beam from its head, dealing a large amount of <color=#0033ff>magic</color> damage to targets in its path.",
    ["SkillDesc_30023108"]="Kraken will Judex nearby targets and summon demonic tentacles to attack them, dealing <color=#FFFF00>Holy</color> damage. After the Judex ends, targets below 30% HP will be instantly killed.",
    ["SkillDesc_30024100"]="Tao Gunka summons 3 stone statues around itself, which connect with Tao Gunka when getting close, and provide <color=#FF4500>damage boost</color>, <color=#FF4500>damage reduction</color> and <color=#FF4500>damage reflection</color>, respectively. The statues are drawn back to Tao Gunka when getting too far.",
    ["SkillDesc_30024104"]="Tao Gunka marks 4 random targets, and deals a great amount of damage to 4 marked players after 10 seconds. Unmarked players could stay near to marked players to <color=#FF4500>share</color> the marks. After marking, Tao Gunka spits stone bullets at 4 market targets, inflicting <color=#FF4500>Instant Death</color> within a small landing zone of the bullet.",
    ["SkillDesc_30024107"]="Tao Gunka has a 50% chance to initiate self-destruction, which deals a great amount of area damage according to the <color=#FF4500>HP lost</color>. Besides, Tao Gunka has a 50% chance to mock the target! Also, Tao Gunka deals high damage to distant enemies.",
    ["SkillDesc_30025102"]="Lost Dragon inflicts <color=#FF4500>Intimidate</color> to all targets, deals Physical Damage to a large area, and deals additional <color=#54478E>Shadow</color> <color=#0033ff>Magic Damage</color> to targets with <color=#FF4500>Intimidate</color>. After 1 revival, Lost Dragon inflicts <color=#FF4500>Instant Death</color>. After 2 revivals, Lost Dragon recovers a certain amount of HP for each defeated target with <color=#FF4500>Intimidate</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_30025106"]="Lost Dragon inflicts <color=#FF4500>Immobilize</color> on 2 farthest targets, and leaps to the target locations, dealing high <color=#54478E>Shadow</color> <color=#0033ff>Magic</color> Damage to near and far areas successively.",
    ["SkillDesc_30025121"]="Lost Dragon shakes its tail and deals <color=#54478E>Shadow</color> <color=#0033ff>Magic</color> Damage to targets behind.",
    ["SkillDesc_30026106"]="While the Lord of the Dead raises the large shield, wraiths accumulate Energy during the attack. The more Energy they absorb, the more fearsome the incoming <color=#b9eb72>counterstrike</color> would be.",
    ["SkillDesc_30026111"]="The Lord of the Dead gathers sins, pulling enemies toward it for 6s before detonating their <color=#b9eb72>sin</color> to deal <color=#ff3300>Physical Damage</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_30026112"]="The Lord of the Dead judges good and evil, sending souls back to where they belong. When judged, souls need to enter the <color=#b9eb72>opposite areas</color>, balancing out their good and evil to avoid the influence.",
    ["SkillDesc_30027103"]="The Dark Lord performs Death's Embrace on a randomly selected target, during which time he kindles all Dark Plane areas. If there is a target within the Dark Plane, they will also share the damage from Death's Embrace.",
    ["SkillDesc_30027104"]="The Dark Lord inflicts a random Attribute Resistance Reduction effect on all targets on the field then generates energy orbs of the opposing attribute. Once he finishes channeling, he deals magic damage of four different attributes.",
    ["SkillDesc_30027106"]="The Dark Lord flies up into the air to form a giant Dark Energy Orb to destroy the Sealing Sword and all targets on the field. You must infuse the Sealing Sword with power to resist this attack.",
    ["SkillDesc_30028102"]="The Owl Duke starts a game and deals cards randomly, stabbing his targets according to the order of the cards and dealing <color=#FFFFF0>true</color> damage to targets within range.",
    ["SkillDesc_30028105"]="The Owl Duke makes a nightingale appear from his hat—wait, no! He throws a nightingale bomb at a random target, inflicting Vulnerable on the target and dealing <color=#AB4050>Fire</color> <color=#0033ff>magic</color> damage to targets within a close range when it explodes.",
    ["SkillDesc_30028106"]="The Owl Duke changes the weather above the theater, letting lightning gather on 4 random targets. Once charged, he calls a lightning tornado to the targets' location, dealing <color=#5A7D29>Wind</color> <color=#0033ff>magic</color> damage to the targets and inflicting Vulnerable. It also grants Lightning Enhancement to the Owl Duke.",
    ["SkillDesc_30028109"]="The Owl Duke summons a Dark Frame assistant and starts performing a magic show. What is real and what is fake on this deadly stage?",
    ["SkillDesc_30029102"]="Mutant Dragonoid puts the world to sleep, and stirs the air pressure to deal Wind Magic Damage!\n Anyone daring to disturb the slumber will be haunted by endless resentment, and takes additional true damage from the air pressure.",
    ["SkillDesc_30029104"]="Mutant Dragonoid calls to the offspring of the dragon blood, accelerating the growth of dragonlings, and sends them to battle!\n If successfully born, Mutant Dragonoid will initiate fiercer attacks!\n If the birth is hampered, Mutant Dragonoid will resort to defense in grief.",
    ["SkillDesc_30029111"]="Mutant Dragonoid awakens the dragon blood, and smashes the battlefield with a dragon-like figure!\n Knocks targets back multiple times, and sends the icicles falling. Getting hit by one of them is definitely the end for you!\n If utilizing smaller ice cubes, however...",
    ["SkillDesc_30030100"]="When an enemy is defeated somewhere, Beelzebub produces a <color=#DC143C>Plague Soul</color> at that spot according to that enemy's <color=#DC143C>Stats</color>. When <color=#DC143C>4</color> or more Plague Souls are present on the field at the same time, Beelzebub sacrifices all of them to summon a <color=#DC143C>Giant Plague Soul</color> to the fight!",
    ["SkillDesc_30030104"]="Beelzebub keeps pulling the space rift, randomly summons <color=#DC143C>3 Chonchon descendants</color> to the field, and guides the <color=#DC143C>meteors</color> falling from the void. Note: If all the Chonchons are killed, Beelzebub will be disturbed, thus <color=#DC143C>forced into a halt!!!</color> Wait... aren't Chonchons <color=#DC143C>invulnerable?</color>",
    ["SkillDesc_30030107"]="Beelzebub returns to the field's center and enters the <color=#6495ED>Invulnerable state</color>, knocking back nearby Adventurers. Beelzebub summons 3 <color=#006400>venom orbs</color> that will gradually move toward the ground and explode, dealing massive <color=#DC143C>sharing damage</color>.\nAfter all venom orbs explode, if there is <color=#DC143C>at least one</color> venom orb that fails to deal damage to Adventurers, everyone will be inflicted with <color=#DC143C>punishment</color>!",
    ["SkillDesc_30030108"]="Beelzebub springs into the midair and summons his mighty helpers in conquering the Parallel World—the Plague Soul Legion and the mighty Calamity Sphere. Faced with the countless Plague Souls, only the most powerful Adventurers have a chance of survival! Defeat Beelzebub's legion with more than 50% Adventurers alive to earn blessings. Otherwise, Beelzebub will summon the mighty <color=#DC143C>Calamity Sphere</color>, and here comes the end of the world!",
    ["SkillDesc_30031102"]="Time Holder invites the player to a game of rock-paper-scissors: a winning hand grants the target increased damage dealt, a draw deals <color=#0033ff>magic</color> damage to the target, while a losing hand punishes the target with <color=#FFFFF0>true</color> damage equal to 100% of their HP.",
    ["SkillDesc_30031103"]="Time Holder issues a warning, dealing Ghost <color=#0033ff>magic</color> damage to targets in range of its pulse and inflicting them with Lightspeed Aging.",
    ["SkillDesc_30031105"]="Time Holder leaves behind an afterimage and charges at the target, dealing impact damage to targets near itself and its afterimage with torrential time. It also inflicts a stack of Time Disorder on the targets.",
    ["SkillDesc_30031107"]="Time Holder's time family answer its summons and appear around it to assist the Overseer in its attacks.",
    ["SkillDesc_30032107"]="Arc Angeling casts healing energy, creating a healing well that recovers its HP each second.",
    ["SkillDesc_30032108"]="Arc Angeling initiates a trial of devotion, summoning Holy Light Illusion and Offering Pillar. Using healing skills near the Holy Light Illusion heals the Offering Pillar. If the Offering Pillar <color=#b9eb72>isn't healed to the Max HP</color> before the end of the countdown, Holy Light Illusion will deal devastating damage to nearby Adventurers.",
    ["SkillDesc_30033106"]="Gioia stirs the electric current, splitting Adventurers into two groups: anodes and cathodes. Adventurers with opposite charges need to stay close to each other to prevent triggering an electrical explosion.",
    ["SkillDesc_30033107"]="Gioia hurls the insulating gel and gets ready to discharge, continuously dealing <color=#5A7D29>Wind attribute</color> <color=#0033ff>M.DMG</color>. Those who stay within the insulating gel are <color=#b9eb72>immune</color> to the damage.",
    ["SkillDesc_30034103"]="RSX-0806 opens its furnace and fires coal chunks that can't be blocked to both the front and back, dealing Neutral attribute <color=#ff3300>Physical</color> Damage to all players hit.",
    ["SkillDesc_30034106"]="RSX-0806 repairs itself, restoring a large amount of HP. After using the skill, scraps will be scattered on the field. Picking up the scraps might lower your Max HP but increase Final DMG for the entire party.",
    ["SkillDesc_30034108"]="RSX-0806 hurls its chainsaw, forming a devastating vortex at the landing point that pulls in players, dealing Neutral attribute <color=#ff3300>Physical</color> Damage to players within range.",
    ["SkillDesc_30035104"]="After a brief charge, Nidhoggr's Shadow deals Shadow attribute <color=#ff3300>Magic</color> Damage to players to its left and right and Neutral attribute <color=#ff3300>Physical</color> Damage to players in its frontal and rear rectangular areas.",
    ["SkillDesc_30035107"]="With a mighty flap of its wings, Nidhoggr's Shadow draws in players from a wide area and executes a series of attacks, dealing damage in multiple stages. Be sure to dodge!",
    ["SkillDesc_30035108"]="Ascending into the sky, Nidhoggr's Shadow blankets a large area with blazing flames, turning it to scorched earth where players continuously suffer burning damage and receive significant damage upon leaving the area. During this, it summons multiple bursts of flame judgments, dealing <color=#44afee>Fire attribute</color> <color=#ff3300>Magic</color> Damage.",
    ["SkillDesc_30036105"]="Gloom Under Night fires a barrage of Doom Shadows in all directions, dealing Ghost attribute <color=#0033ff>M</color>.DMG to Adventurers upon contact.",
    ["SkillDesc_30036106"]="The flames around Gloom Under Night grow fiercer, spreading over its body and changing its armor to Fire attribute. Each time it deals damage, it also inflicts additional Holy DMG.",
    ["SkillDesc_30036107"]="Gloom Under Night erupts with fiery phantoms, knocking back nearby Adventurers and linking two of them together. Linked Adventurers take continuous <color=#AB4050>Fire attribute</color> <color=#0033ff>M</color>.DMG until they touch to break the link.",
    ["SkillDesc_30037109"]="Retribution raises both hands and plunges the sword into the ground, releasing dark energy that spreads outward. Soon after, numerous blades erupt from the ground, dealing Shadow attribute <color=#0033ff>M</color>.DMG and instantly executing any Adventurers marked for a death sentence.",
    ["SkillDesc_30037110"]="Retribution launches nearby Adventurers into the air and unleashes a flurry of slashes, dealing multiple stages of Shadow attribute <color=#0033ff>M</color>.DMG.",
    ["SkillDesc_30039106"]="Shadow Chaser Gertie traps Adventurers inside the Shadow Cage. Adventurers inside take increased damage, which scales higher with more people in the same cage. Adventurers leaving the cage will have their MSPD reduced and take True DMG.",
    ["SkillDesc_30039107"]="Shadow Chaser Gertie plants timed bombs that absorb nearby shadow energy. When they explode, they deal P.DMG in a small area. If placed inside the Shadow Graveyard, the blast becomes stronger, hitting all Adventurers with heavy True DMG.",
    ["SkillDesc_30039108"]="Shadow Chaser Gertie gathers shadow energy and unleashes a devastating attack, dealing massive True DMG to targets upon contact. The residual energy spawns Man Hole under Adventurers.",
    ["SkillDesc_30040106"]="Genetic Flamel summons a permanent Automated Cannon to assist in battle. The cannon self-repairs, restoring 50% HP after destruction and re-entering combat after a short time.",
    ["SkillDesc_30040110"]="Genetic Flamel commands the cannon to unleash a powerful blast, dealing heavy area damage to Adventurers within range, and even damaging nearby newly spawned Homunculus.",
    ["SkillDesc_30090103"]="The Orc Disaster unleashes evil demons that track their prey and deal <color=#54478E>shadow </color><color=#0033ff>magic</color> damage.",
    ["SkillDesc_30090104"]="The Orc Disaster uses a wide range of chaotic magic, dealing <color=#54478E>Shadow</color> <color=#0033ff>magic</color> damage to targets hit.",
    ["SkillDesc_30090106"]="The Orc Disaster is powerful enough to devour anything in his path, and can devour Savage Warriors to heal himself and gain the stackable permanent Pigheaded buff.",
    ["SkillDesc_30090108"]="The Orc Disaster possesses powerful regeneration abilities. When he is close to death, he can stimulate his innate regeneration to significantly restore his health.",
    ["SkillDesc_30091103"]="Storm Dragon rotates in a circle and sprays his fiery breath and sets fire to the ground, dealing <color=#AB4050>Fire</color><color=#0033ff> magic </color>damage to affected targets.",
    ["SkillDesc_30091104"]="Storm Dragon summons a Black Dragon Vortex that knocks targets trapped within it into the air and deals <color=#5A7D29>Wind</color><color=#0033ff> magic damage</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_30091106"]="Storm Dragon selects multiple targets and plants a Storm Seed beneath them. After several seconds, the Storm Seed matures, creating a massive storm at its location. Targets closer to the storm take increased <color=#5A7D29>Wind</color><color=#0033ff> magic</color> damage.",
    ["SkillDesc_30091107"]="Storm Dragon soars into the air and focuses his power into a devastating blast. <color=#33ccff>Elemental Shields</color> can protect you from his deadly breath—step into them to recharge them. Failing to fully charge any single Elemental Shield will cause the other Elemental Shields to fail prematurely.",
    ["SkillDesc_30092101"]="Stop on the ground, dealing <color=#FF0000>damage</color> to humans within 5 meters, and increasing their <color=#800080>Terror</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_30092102"]="Charge forward, dealing <color=#FF0000>damage</color> to humans along the way and increasing their <color=#800080>Terror</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_30093102"]="Release a large amount of steam around you for <color=#FF0000>2 seconds</color>, dealing <color=#FF0000>damage</color> to humans within range and increasing their <color=#800080>Terror</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_30094102"]="Throw rocks into the distance, dealing <color=#FF0000>damage</color> to humans in range, and increasing their <color=#800080>Terror</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_30095101"]="Dash a certain distance after using it. Can be recharged up to <color=#800080>three times</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_30095102"]="Use this to <color=#FF0000>exterminate</color> a nearby Unsullied Titan. Ineffective against Self-aware Titans.",
    ["SkillDesc_30095103"]="Use this to <color=#FF0000>exterminate</color> a nearby Unsullied Titan, or inflict a brief <color=#0000FF>Stun</color> effect on Self-aware Titans.",
    ["SkillDesc_30095104"]="<color=#FF0000>Removes</color> Terror from humans, so they avoid being devoured by Titans.",
    ["SkillDesc_30095105"]="Hide yourself for a period of time so you're not easily discovered by Titans.",
    ["SkillDesc_30099102"]="Nian brandishes its claws and tail, dealing damage to nearby targets.",
    ["SkillDesc_30099103"]="Nian summons three flying ice blocks to surround itself, dealing damage to targets hit and <color=#7ACEFF>freezing</color> them.",
    ["SkillDesc_30099104"]="Nian continuously launches fireballs in the direction of targets marked with <color=#FF0000>Red Lotus</color>, dealing damage to them. All targets hit are inflicted with the <color=#FF0000>Holy Fire</color> effect, and a pillar of flame erupts at their location after a short delay, dealing damage. Holy Fire periodically ignites all targets around them.",
    ["SkillDesc_30181102"]="Garm fills the air with biting ice wind, dealing magic damage with water attribute and inflicting a freeze effect.",
    ["SkillDesc_30181103"]="Garm gathers ice and snow and smashes them onto the ground. Targets hit by the ice and snow will receive magic damage with the water attribute and enter the Blind state.",
    ["SkillDesc_30181105"]="Garm accelerates the movement of the ice storm, dealing damage with the wind attribute and slowing the target.",
    ["SkillDesc_30203102"]="Carnage Kabuto dashes forward, dealing multiple segments of <color=#6B5531>Earth attribute</color> <color=#ff3300>P.DMG</color> to the hit targets, dragging them along until he finishes his dash. He then follows up with an attack that deals significant True DMG to all surrounding units!",
    ["SkillDesc_30203112"]="Carnage Kabuto locks onto a target and charges toward them with unstoppable force while smashing the ground nearby to deal <color=#6B5531>Earth attribute</color> <color=#ff3300>P.DMG</color> that includes a Weapon Break effect.",
    ["SkillDesc_30204103"]="Mosquito Girl rapidly flaps her wings, aiming her stinger at the target and charging forward, dealing <color=#5A7D29>Wind attribute</color> <color=#ff3300>P.DMG</color> to all enemies in her path. Every time she bumps into a mosquito swarm during the charge, she restores <color=#44afee>10%</color> of her Max HP.",
    ["SkillDesc_30204113"]="Mosquito Girl calls forth all mosquito swarms to gather around her and releases them toward the front, continuously dealing <color=#5A7D29>Wind attribute</color> <color=#0033ff>M.DMG</color> to all units within the target range while inflicting them a <color=#ff9ca1>Bleed</color> effect.",
    ["SkillDesc_30205100"]="Awaken the power of the card and become the hero to unleash exclusive skills! While the effect is active, the character's previous cultivation will be disabled, and all hero skills share the same cooldown.",
    ["SkillDesc_30205101"]="Throw a normal punch, dealing <color=#44afee>400%%</color> Neutral attribute Adaptive DMG. The target dies instantly when it is a monster with a level lower than your Base Level (non-effective against MVP, MINI, and Boss).",
    ["SkillDesc_30205102"]="Throw normal punches continuously, dealing <color=#44afee>888%%</color> Neutral attribute Adaptive DMG to all enemies within range every second. The target dies instantly when it is a monster with a level lower than your Base Level (non-effective against MVP, MINI, and Boss). The skill lasts up to <color=#44afee>4</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_30205104"]="Start a serious training, increasing your P.ATK and M.ATK by <color=#44afee>10%%</color> per second for <color=#44afee>10</color> seconds. Stacks up to <color=#44afee>6</color> and lasts up to<color=#44afee>6</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_30205106"]="Throw a serious punch after a brief moment of charging, dealing <color=#44afee>1,575%%</color> Neutral attribute Adaptive DMG to all enemies within range. The target dies instantly when it is a monster with a level lower than your Base Level (non-effective against MVP, MINI, and Boss).",
    ["SkillDesc_30205107"]="Continuously throws punches forward, dealing ongoing <color=#0033ff>True</color> DMG to all enemies within range.",
    ["SkillDesc_30206100"]="Awaken the power of the card and become the hero to unleash exclusive skills! While the effect is active, the character's previous cultivation will be disabled, and all hero skills share the same cooldown.",
    ["SkillDesc_30206101"]="Lift your right hand and fire the incineration cannon, dealing <color=#44afee>320%%</color> Fire attribute Adaptive DMG to all enemies within a <color=#44afee>3</color>-meter radius upon hit.",
    ["SkillDesc_30206102"]="Leap forward and swing your firsts rapidly, dealing <color=#44afee>222%%</color> Fire attribute Adaptive DMG every <color=#44afee>0.5</color> seconds to all enemies within a <color=#44afee>3</color>-meter radius. The skill lasts up to <color=#44afee>4</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_30206104"]="Ejects flames from both arms to thrust forward for <color=#44afee>8</color> meters, dealing <color=#44afee>1,920%%</color> Fire attribute Adaptive DMG to all enemies in the path.",
    ["SkillDesc_30206106"]="After building up power, fires the massive incineration cannon, dealing <color=#44afee>1,183%%</color> Fire attribute Adaptive DMG to all enemies within a large area in front.",
    ["SkillDesc_30206107"]="Dashes toward a specified direction, <color=#0033ff>knocking back</color> enemies on the path.",
    ["SkillDesc_30207100"]="Awaken the power of the card and become the hero to unleash exclusive skills! While the effect is active, the character's previous cultivation will be disabled, and all hero skills share the same cooldown.",
    ["SkillDesc_30207101"]="Controls rocks using Ghost Power, dealing <color=#44afee>400%%</color> Ghost attribute Adaptive DMG to the target.",
    ["SkillDesc_30207102"]="Gathers rocks in the air above using Ghost Power, dealing <color=#44afee>1,375%%</color> Ghost attribute Adaptive DMG to all enemies within range.",
    ["SkillDesc_30207103"]="Envelope yourself with Ghost Power, briefly levitating all enemies within a <color=#44afee>5</color>-meter range and dealing <color=#44afee>880%%</color> Ghost attribute Adaptive DMG.",
    ["SkillDesc_30207104"]="Focus your power to lift the nearby boulder and hurl it forward, dealing <color=#44afee>1,575%%</color> Ghost attribute Adaptive DMG to all enemies within range.",
    ["SkillDesc_30207105"]="Inflicts the <color=#0033ff>Airborne</color> effect on enemies nearby.",
    ["SkillDesc_30208100"]="Awaken the power of the card and become the hero to unleash exclusive skills! While the effect is active, the character's previous cultivation will be disabled, and all hero skills share the same cooldown.",
    ["SkillDesc_30208101"]="Quickly throws out three Kunai, dealing <color=#44afee>3</color> segments of <color=#44afee>353%%</color> Shadow attribute Adaptive DMG to the target and all surrounding enemies within a <color=#44afee>3</color>-meter range.",
    ["SkillDesc_30208102"]="Dashes forward, dealing <color=#44afee>4</color> consecutive attacks equal to a total of <color=#44afee>2,750%%</color> Shadow attribute Adaptive DMG to all enemies within reach.",
    ["SkillDesc_30208103"]="After a brief pause, you enter the <color=#44afee>Hiding</color> state, increasing your MSPD by <color=#44afee>2</color> and Final Flee by <color=#44afee>50%</color> for <color=#44afee>7</color> seconds, all while leaving behind a series of afterimages.",
    ["SkillDesc_30208104"]="Spring up and vanish from enemy sight, nimbly moving around the target area while cloning yourself, then eventually throw out Shuriken to deal <color=#44afee>1,575%%</color> Shadow attribute Adaptive DMG to all enemies within the area.",
    ["SkillDesc_30208105"]="Grants temporary <color=#0033ff>Speedup</color> and <color=#0033ff>Enhanced Flee</color> effects.",
    ["SkillDesc_30209103"]="Yuda bursts forth with his hidden strength, exposing his pressure point weaknesses. He gains 50 ASPD, 3 MSPD, and 30% of Final DMG Bonus in a short while.",
    ["SkillDesc_30209105"]="Yuda employs a ranged attack from the Nanto Kokaku Ken, channeling his chi through the ground to the target, dealing Neutral attribute <color=#ff3300>P</color>.DMG when it hits the target.",
    ["SkillDesc_30209106"]="Yuda shapes his hands like crane beaks and performs a series of thrusting punches, delivering 3 consecutive hits of Neutral attribute <color=#ff3300>P</color>.DMG to everyone in front.",
    ["SkillDesc_30209108"]="Yuda preps a strategy before the fight, summoning a flood of mud to cover the battlefield, dealing damage while boosting himself, and reducing the MSPD of others.",
    ["SkillDesc_30210117"]="Tap to release a protective shield at your location. Adventurers within the shield are immune to Raoh's lethal skills!",
    ["SkillDesc_30212103"]="Within a 20-meter range, 5 random targets suffer mental contamination and bleed over time.",
    ["SkillDesc_30212107"]="With the Witch Factor, Sloth can channel souls into his fingers, enabling him to summon more Unseen Hands for area damage. When someone dies, their soul goes straight to Sloth.",
    ["SkillDesc_30212108"]="Forcibly possesses others using a one-way contract.",
    ["SkillDesc_30212110"]="The surrounding soil can be raised into dome-like barriers. These barriers are sturdy but can be shattered by strong attacks. Each time the barrier is broken, a follower of the Witch Cult will unleash a wide-area True DMG to protect Sloth.",
    ["SkillDesc_30213103"]="The White Whale sprays thick, normal white mist from its mouth, dealing damage in a fan-shaped area.",
    ["SkillDesc_30213104"]="The White Whale shoots out three wind blades clockwise around itself, dealing area damage over a fan-shaped area and summoning tornadoes that disperse mist.",
    ["SkillDesc_30213111"]="The White Whale's pelt can greatly reduce incoming damage.",
    ["SkillDesc_30213112"]="The White Whale's scream will make the targets within range hurt, faint, and become unhealable.",
    ["SkillDesc_30213117"]="After picking up the Purging Stone, you have 10 seconds to use it and activate a 12-second shield that makes all allies inside immune to the White Whale's Scream. Cooldown: 7 seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_30216106"]="Don't touch the fire rings! You'll get Burned and 1 stack of Fear. Reaching 10 stacks of Fear puts you into the Blind state!",
    ["SkillDesc_30216109"]="Watch out! If his white handkerchief hits you, you'll turn into a doll! Toss the doll into the Light of Revival fast, or it's going to become part of his collection!",
    ["SkillDesc_30216110"]="Piedmon wants to play a game! He turns this place into an ocean of colorful balls! Each time you touch something, your ball changes color. Place the matching-color balls into the basket for buffs, or get punished if you mess up...\n",
    ["SkillDesc_30216111"]="You only get one shot! Piedmon's made his move—it's your turn now! Work together to find the higher card. Remember—Teamwork's the key!",
    ["SkillDesc_30217107"]="Devimon summons a massive black gear, dealing damage to everyone within a 20-meter radius. Warning: Devimon gains a huge power-up when staying near the gear!",
    ["SkillDesc_30217108"]="Devimon randomly selects and teleports behind a target, briefly immobilizing and slashing the target with his claw.",
    ["SkillDesc_30217109"]="A dreadful shadow realm unfolds at Devimon's will—those caught within will have their defense reduced and slowed, with the Bleed effect stacking up every second!",
    ["SkillDesc_30218107"]="Watch out! Doakudar creates a growing barrier around himself that keeps releasing energy waves. When it reaches its limit, it explodes in a massive blast that devours everything! Adventurers, break the barrier before it explodes!",
    ["SkillDesc_30218110"]="Darkness is gathering around Doakudar! And the power will corrupt anyone who gets too close! When your negative energy maxes out, Doakudar will steal your soul! Remember, only the Power of Light can drive away the darkness!",
    ["SkillDesc_30218111"]="Doakudar creates a barrier around himself, dealing energy wave damage to nearby Adventurers. The barrier expands over time, so destroy it before it explodes, or everyone will be devoured.",
    ["SkillDesc_31001104"]="Toad's skin becomes poisonous, inflicting <color=#b4ceff>poison</color> on targets for the duration of the effect.",
    ["SkillDesc_31001105"]="Toad deals <color=#8438AD>Poison</color> <color=#ff3300>physical</color> damage to all targets in range. The larger the number of Poison stacks on the target, the more the damage taken.",
    ["SkillDesc_31002102"]="Mastering leaps into the air and slams back into the ground, knocking back nearby targets and dealing <color=#ff3300>physical</color> damage.",
    ["SkillDesc_31002103"]="Mastering brandishes a scepter, knocking back targets in front of it and dealing Neutral <color=#ff3300>physical</color> damage.",
    ["SkillDesc_31002106"]="Each time Mastering takes <color=#ff3300>physical</color> damage, there is a 1% chance it summons 5 Porings to escort it.",
    ["SkillDesc_31004104"]="Dragon Fly flashes to a random target location and summons Raging Thunder Bash, dealing a large amount of <color=#5A7D29>Wind</color> <color=#0033ff>magic</color> damage with a chance to <color=#7ACEFF>blind</color> the target.",
    ["SkillDesc_31005103"]="Vagabond Wolf leaps into the air and lands at the target location, dealing a large amount of <color=#6B5531>Earth</color> <color=#ff3300>physical</color> damage to the center of the target area. Targets below 50% HP will be instantly killed. After a slight delay, the surrounding sand is splashed, dealing <color=#ff3300>physical</color> damage and inflicting Blind.",
    ["SkillDesc_31005104"]="Vagabond Wolf lets out a horrifying wolf howl, summoning a large number of wolves to fight for it!",
    ["SkillDesc_31005105"]="Legend has it that Vagabond Wolf is enveloped by a mysterious power and becomes stronger at night.",
    ["SkillDesc_31008103"]="Ghostring leaps into the Dark Plane, hiding its tracks before knocking back nearby targets and dealing <color=#0033ff>magic</color> damage.",
    ["SkillDesc_31008104"]="Ghostring looks up and summons a holy bullet to attack a random target, dealing <color=#0033ff>magic</color> damage to an area around the target.",
    ["SkillDesc_31009102"]="King Dramoh stabs forward, knocking back its target and dealing <color=#ff3300>physical</color> damage while inflicting Stun.",
    ["SkillDesc_31009104"]="King Dramoh strengthens its shell, turning all damage taken for that duration into healing.",
    ["SkillDesc_31009105"]="King Dramoh shakes its tail, summoning a large number of Marine Spheres and Vadons to fight alongside it.",
    ["SkillDesc_31010102"]="Chimera thrusts its snake into the ground, dealing ranged <color=#0033ff>Magic</color> Damage in a circular pattern around it. It then hammers the ground in anger, dealing a fan of ranged<color=#ff3300>Physical</color> Damage on the right and left sides.",
    ["SkillDesc_31010103"]="Chimera awakens the Stalactic Golem to assist in the attack, and then deals a wide range of <color=#6B5531>Earth</color> <color=#0033ff>Magic</color> Damage.",
    ["SkillDesc_31010105"]="Chimera hits the ground to make three boulders fall from the sky, using Petrifying Gaze to inflict <color=#44afee>Petrify</color> with the target and deal <color=#6B5531>Earth</color> <color=#0033ff>Magic</color> Damage.",
    ["SkillDesc_31010107"]="Chimera summons a Gargoyle to shoot a booster at itself. The arrow deals <color=#FFFFF0>True</color> Damage to the surrounding area while in flight, and heals Chimera and inflicts it with Damage Reduction.",
    ["SkillDesc_31011102"]="Mysteltainn raises its sword body and sends sword rays shooting out in six directions, inflicting targets it hits with <color=#b9eb72>Broken Bone</color> and dealing <color=#ff3300>physical</color> damage.",
    ["SkillDesc_31011103"]="Mysteltainn flashes unexpectedly to a target at random and unleashes a fanning slash, dealing <color=#ff3300>Physical</color> damage.",
    ["SkillDesc_31011104"]="Mysteltainn spins around, stirring up a bloodstorm that deals massive <color=#FFFFF0>True damage</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_31011105"]="Mysteltainn slowly floats into the air before dropping countless swords of judgment to the ground around it, dealing area <color=#0033ff>magic</color> damage while inflicting <color=#b9eb72>Broken Bone</color>. The swords of judgment will aid Mysteltainn in battle upon landing.",
    ["SkillDesc_31012102"]="Ogretooth throws a fang missile, dealing Neutral <color=#ff3300>physical</color> damage to the target, as well as inflicting <color=#b9eb72>Tetanus</color> and marking them, causing spikes to keep appearing around them.",
    ["SkillDesc_31012104"]="Ogretooth leaps relentlessly at the target and slashes with its sharp body, dealing Neutral <color=#ff3300>physical</color> damage. The only way to stop it is to exterminate the Eye of Evil...",
    ["SkillDesc_31012105"]="Ogretooth charges forward and stirs up sharp gusts of wind, dealing <color=#FFFFF0>true</color> damage to enemies in the inner circle and <color=#ff3300>physical</color> damage to enemies on both sides, as well as inflicting <color=#b9eb72>Tetanus</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_31014102"]="The Necromancer has mastered <color=#6B5531>Earth</color>, <color=#44afee>Water</color>, <color=#5A7D29>Wind</color>, and <color=#AB4050>Fire</color> magic and harnesses powerful elemental forces to deal <color=#0033ff>magic</color> damage and spread <color=#b9eb72>viruses</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_31014103"]="The Necromancer unleashes dark energy, dealing high <color=#FFFFF0>true</color> damage to all living creatures around it. It is only protected from its harm with the help of its own equipment.",
    ["SkillDesc_31014105"]="The Necromancer creates a massive cursed whirlpool with its magic to attack enemies with the undead. Each strike deals <color=#7ACEFF>Undead</color> <color=#0033ff>magic</color> damage.",
    ["SkillDesc_31015104"]="Coelacanth devours the dying and the dead, pulling enemies towards it from the front and dealing <color=#7ACEFF>Undead</color> <color=#ff3300>physical</color> damage. If it hits the damp bone pile, it will <color=#FF4500>heal</color> itself.",
    ["SkillDesc_31015105"]="Coelacanth summons bone splinters every second, dealing <color=#7ACEFF>Undead</color> <color=#ff3300>physical</color> damage to enemies hit and <color=#b9eb72>slowing</color> them greatly.",
    ["SkillDesc_31015107"]="Coelacanth condenses bones into a shield. Deal <color=#FF4500>sufficient damage</color> to it during this time to prevent the formation of the shield.",
    ["SkillDesc_31016102"]="Naght Sieger charges forward while swinging dual blades, dealing <color=#AB4050>Fire</color> <color=#ff3300>physical</color> damage to enemies along the way and inflicting <color=#b9eb72>Blazing Flames</color>. It creates a battlefield of death flames at its destination, dealing <color=#7ACEFF>Undead</color> <color=#0033ff>magic</color> damage and inflicting <color=#b9eb72>Death Flames</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_31016106"]="Naght Sieger slashes the weak once with each of its dual blades, dealing <color=#AB4050>Fire</color>/<color=#7ACEFF>Undead</color> <color=#ff3300>physical</color> damage and inflicting <color=#b9eb72>Blazing Flames</color> / <color=#b9eb72>Death Flames</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_31016108"]="Naght Sieger channels punishment energy. The punished deal <color=#7ACEFF>Undead</color> <color=#0033ff>magic</color> damage to all nearby players after a brief delay.",
    ["SkillDesc_31017104"]="The Observation initiates a trial of modesty, using lines to connect up to 5 players, each of whom will lose HP continuously. However, <color=#b9eb72>these connecting lines can be blocked by other players</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_31017105"]="The Observation soothes you with scared power, summoning Hands of Kindliness to immobilize the players. If Hands of Kindliness are <color=#b9eb72>not completely eliminated</color>, the Observation will deal devastating damage to nearby players.",
    ["SkillDesc_31017108"]="The Observation gazes at every living creature on the continent, periodically announcing prophecies, saying that whoever disobeys shall take the punishment.",
    ["SkillDesc_31018102"]="Skeggiold uses its deformable body to shape-shift itself into different forms based on the Energy Surge stacks, dealing neutral attribute <color=#0033ff>M.DMG</color> to players.",
    ["SkillDesc_31018103"]="Skeggiold leaks out the overloaded energy, dealing Neutral attribute <color=#0033ff>M.DMG</color> to nearby players. If Skeggiold has the Energy Overloaded buff, it creates a leakage area. Players taking damage from the leakage area will receive the Energy Pulse buff, and the Energy Overloaded buff on Skeggiold will be <color=#b9eb72>removed</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_31018106"]="The elemental energy within Skeggiold becomes chaotic, making it periodically initiate a random detection sequence on its recently taken damage of <color=#44afee>Holy</color>, <color=#44afee>Fire</color>, and <color=#5A7D29>Wind</color> attributes. During this time, Skeggiold gains a stack of Energy Overloaded if it receives the damage with corresponding attributes <color=#b9eb72>lower</color> than 30% of its Max HP.",
    ["SkillDesc_31019105"]="Queen Scaraba ascends to the sky, gaining a certain amount of damage reduction while calling forth a sweeping sand storm that deals continuously <color=#D2691E>Earth attribute</color> <color=#0033ff>Magic</color> Damage to nearby players while inflicting debuffs. When the skill is over, if any player is <color=#44afee>petrified</color>, Queen Scaraba gains a special upgrade.",
    ["SkillDesc_31019107"]="Queen Scaraba channels her magic, dealing <color=#D2691E>Earth attribute</color> <color=#0033ff>Magic</color> Damage to nearby players while summoning two Boulder Puppets. These Boulder Puppets will unleash increasingly powerful area damage, so take them down quickly!",
    ["SkillDesc_31019108"]="Queen Scaraba dives into the quicksand, continuously charging at players to deal substantial <color=#D2691E>Earth attribute</color> <color=#0033ff>Physical</color> Damage Only the boulder left by dead Boulder Puppets can stop her.",
    ["SkillDesc_31020103"]="Faceworm Queen breathes out a puff of poison smoke at her feet, dealing continuous Poison attribute <color=#0033ff>Magic</color> Damage and <color=#44afee>poisoning</color> players who enter the area.",
    ["SkillDesc_31020106"]="With a powerful leap, Faceworm Queen uses her tail to strike the rectangular area before her heavily, dealing Poison attribute <color=#0033ff>Physical</color> Damage to players and leaving behind traps that can clear the <color=#44afee>poison</color> effect. Use them wisely!",
    ["SkillDesc_31020107"]="Faceworm Queen ignites her gems, unleashing Poison attribute energy in a larger area, dealing substantial True DMG based on the number of ignited gems (damage is doubled on <color=#44afee>poisoned</color> players).",
    ["SkillDesc_31021102"]="Ktullanux wraps itself in chilling air. When it takes a certain amount of damage, the unstable chilling air spreads, dealing <color=#316DA2>Water attribute</color> <color=#0033ff>M</color>.DMG to the surrounding and generating warm wind. Touching the warm wind grants the weapon a <color=#5A7D29>Wind attribute enchantment</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_31021105"]="Ktullanux slithers forward, dealing <color=#316DA2>Water attribute</color> <color=#ff3300>P</color>.DMG to Adventurers upon contact. Meanwhile, avalanches form on both sides, dealing <color=#316DA2>Water attribute</color> <color=#0033ff>M</color>.DMG.",
    ["SkillDesc_31021106"]="Ktullanux creates a sub-entity to assist in battle, shrinking in size but gaining enhanced attributes. If the sub-entity is not defeated within a set time, it sacrifices itself, granting Ktullanux significant damage reduction and massive healing. Defeating the sub-entity grants all nearby Adventurers a damage boost against the Ktullanux's main body.",
    ["SkillDesc_31022102"]="Shelter summons a <color= #EEDD82>Holy Field</color> and a <color= #191970>Shadow Field</color> on both sides. When the Shelter is standing in a field matching its armor attribute, it slowly regenerates HP. If in the opposite field, it gains increased damage output.",
    ["SkillDesc_31022103"]="Shelter alters its armor attribute and summons <color= #EEDD82>Holy Magic Circles</color> and <color= #191970>Shadow Magic Circles</color> everywhere, dealing <color=#ff3300>P</color>.DMG of the corresponding attribute to the Adventurer. Adventures affected by the magic circles receive a matching elemental blessing, changing their armor and weapon to that element. However, blessed Adventurers take increased damage from the other element.",
    ["SkillDesc_31022106"]="Shelter envelops itself in chaotic energy, entering a chaos state and dealing a mix of Holy and Shadow attributes <color=#0033ff>M</color>.DMG to nearby Adventurers. While in a chaotic state, Shelter deals increased damage to Adventurers of the opposite attribute.",
    ["SkillDesc_31023104"]="Sorcerer Celia gathers nearby elements to form an Elemental Field. The target's party members inside gain stacks of their own Elemental Mark while decreasing other Elemental Marks. When a mark reaches max stacks, it turns into Elemental Corrosion, dealing True DMG over time. Targets fully corrupted by all four elements die instantly.",
    ["SkillDesc_31023106"]="Sorcerer Celia summons Elemental Spirits to assist in battle. While alive, they shield their caster with high damage reduction. When entering the Elemental Field, the spirits trigger Elemental Resonance, dealing heavy True DMG to all enemies.",
    ["SkillDesc_31024104"]="Ranger Cecil fires a volley of arrows into the sky, creating an Arrow Shower that deals P.DMG and leaves behind an Elemental Arrow Array that inflicts Vulnerable.",
    ["SkillDesc_31024108"]="Ranger Cecil aims at the enemy carrying Wind Sign and fires a powerful sniping arrow. The enhanced arrow deals heavy P.DMG and instantly kills the target carrying Wind Sign, then shatters on impact.",
    ["SkillDesc_36000102"]="Sweep kick attack. Deals <color=#ff3300>P.DMG</color> to the enemies in a fan-shaped area in front of you.",
    ["SkillDesc_36000103"]="Deals continuous damage to the target in a fan-shaped area in front of you, inflicting multiple rounds of <color=#ff3300>P.DMG</color>, up to 4 rounds.",
    ["SkillDesc_36000104"]="Charges briefly and deals massive <color=#ff3300>P.DMG</color> to the enemies in a circular area in front of you.",
    ["SkillDesc_36000105"]="Transforms into the <color=#b9eb72>Power-Up State</color> when HP falls below a certain amount, which increases the Final DMG by <color=#b9eb72>20%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_36000106"]="Targets 5 random units from the surroundings and deploys a <color=#b9eb72>circular lightning-strike zone</color> with a 2-meter radius, dealing a certain amount of <color=#b9eb72>True DMG</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_36001103"]="Shoots 6 electrical spheres in a row at the current target, each sphere dealing <color=#0033ff>M.DMG</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_36001105"]="Jumps at a random target, dealing <color=#0033ff>M.DMG</color> every 0.5 seconds while <color=#44afee>healing</color> yourself.",
    ["SkillDesc_5000000"]="The pet's DEF increases by <color=#d14d75>%s</color>, and M.DEF increases by <color=#d14d75>%s</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_5000001"]="The pet's ATK increases by <color=#d14d75>%s</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_5000002"]="The pet's M.ATK increases by <color=#d14d75>%s</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_5000003"]="The pet's Max HP increases by <color=#d14d75>%s</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_5000004"]="The pet's Final Hit Rate increases by <color=#d14d75>%s%%</color>, and Final Dodge Rate increases by <color=#d14d75>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_5000005"]="The pet's Final Crit Rate increases by <color=#d14d75>%s%%</color>, and Final Anti-Crit Rate increases by <color=#d14d75>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_5000006"]="The pet's Crit Damage increases by <color=#d14d75>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_5000007"]="The pet's Final ASPD increases by <color=#d14d75>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_5000008"]="The pet's Final haste increases by <color=#d14d75>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_5000009"]="The pet's Reflect Damage increases by <color=#d14d75>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_5000010"]="The pet's Lifesteal increases by <color=#d14d75>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_5000011"]="The pet and its owner's STR increases by <color=#d14d75>%s</color> for <color=#d14d75>60</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_5000012"]="The pet and its owner's AGI increases by <color=#d14d75>%s</color> for <color=#d14d75>60</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_5000013"]="The pet and its owner's VIT increases by <color=#d14d75>%s</color> for <color=#d14d75>60</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_5000014"]="The pet and its owner's INT increases by <color=#d14d75>%s</color> for <color=#d14d75>60</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_5000015"]="The pet and its owner's DEX increases by <color=#d14d75>%s</color> for <color=#d14d75>60</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_5000016"]="The pet and its owner's LUK increases by <color=#d14d75>%s</color> for <color=#d14d75>60</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_5000017"]="Channeling skill. Heals <color=#d14d75>%s%%</color> of Max HP per second for <color=#d14d75>60</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_5000018"]="Forces other enemies within <color=#d14d75>4</color> meters to attack the pet for <color=#d14d75>%s</color> second(s).",
    ["SkillDesc_5000019"]="Removes the pet's and all nearby party members' Poison status.",
    ["SkillDesc_5000020"]="Heals the pet or its owner for <color=#d14d75>%s%%</color> of M.ATK.",
    ["SkillDesc_5000021"]="Heals all party members for <color=#d14d75>%s%%</color> of M.ATK per second for <color=#d14d75>5</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_5000022"]="Normal attacks have <color=#d14d75>%s%%</color> chance to poison the target for <color=#d14d75>5</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_5000023"]="Normal attacks ignore <color=#d14d75>%s%%</color> of target's DEF.",
    ["SkillDesc_5000024"]="Normal attacks have <color=#d14d75>100%%</color> chance to deal <color=#d14d75>%s%%</color> of ATK as Neutral physical splash damage to targets within a <color=#d14d75>3</color>-meter fan-shaped area.",
    ["SkillDesc_5000025"]="Normal attacks have <color=#d14d75>%s%%</color> chance to curse the target for <color=#d14d75>5</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_5000026"]="Normal attacks have <color=#d14d75>%s%%</color> chance to silence the target for <color=#d14d75>2</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_5000027"]="Normal attacks have<color=#d14d75>%s%%</color> chance to stun the target for <color=#d14d75>2</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_5000028"]="Reflects <color=#d14d75>%s%%</color> of melee physical damage for <color=#d14d75>5</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_5000029"]="Receives <color=#d14d75>%s%%</color> of the damage for its owner.",
    ["SkillDesc_5000200"]="Deals Earth damage equal to <color=#d14d75>%s%%</color> of ATK to the target.",
    ["SkillDesc_5000201"]="Grants <color=#d14d75>%s%%</color> Earth Attribute Enhancement to the pet and its owner for <color=#d14d75>60</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_5000202"]="The pet and its owner deal <color=#d14d75>%s%%</color> more damage to Earth attribute targets and receive <color=#d14d75>%s%%</color> less Earth damage for <color=#d14d75>60</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_5000203"]="Commands spikes to protrude from the ground, dealing Earth magic damage equal to <color=#d14d75>%s%%</color> of M.ATK to enemies within <color=#d14d75>3</color> meters of the specified location.",
    ["SkillDesc_5000300"]="Deals Fire damage equal to <color=#d14d75>%s%%</color> of ATK to the target.",
    ["SkillDesc_5000301"]="Grants <color=#d14d75>%s%%</color> Fire Attribute Enhancement to the pet and its owner for <color=#d14d75>60</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_5000302"]="The pet and its owner deal <color=#d14d75>%s%%</color> more damage to Fire attribute targets and receive <color=#d14d75>%s%%</color> less Fire damage for <color=#d14d75>60</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_5000303"]="Rains down firebolts upon the enemy, dealing Fire magic damage equal to <color=#d14d75>%s%%</color> of M.ATK.",
    ["SkillDesc_5000400"]="Deals Water damage equal to <color=#d14d75>%s%%</color> of ATK to the target.",
    ["SkillDesc_5000401"]="Grants <color=#d14d75>%s%%</color> Water Attribute Enhancement to the pet and its owner for <color=#d14d75>60</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_5000402"]="The pet and its owner deal <color=#d14d75>%s%%</color> more damage to Water attribute targets and receive <color=#d14d75>%s%%</color> less Water damage for <color=#d14d75>60</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_5000403"]="Rains down frostbolts from the sky and attack the enemies, dealing Water magic damage equal to <color=#d14d75>%s%%</color> of M.ATK.",
    ["SkillDesc_5000500"]="Deals Wind damage equal to <color=#d14d75>%s%%</color> of ATK to the target.",
    ["SkillDesc_5000501"]="Grants <color=#d14d75>%s%%</color> Wind Attribute Enhancement to the pet and its owner for <color=#d14d75>60</color> seconds.",
