    ["SkillDesc_5000703"]="Summons holy spirits to attack, dealing Ghost magic damage equal to <color=#d14d75>%s%%</color> of M.ATK to the enemy. Deals <color=#d14d75>%s%%</color> more damage to Undead enemies.",
