    ["SkillDesc_5000803"]="Deals Poison magic damage equal to <color=#d14d75>%s%%</color> of M.ATK to the target and has a <color=#d14d75>%s%%</color> chance to poison the enemy for <color=#d14d75>60</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_5000900"]="Deals Undead physical damage equal to <color=#d14d75>%s%%</color> of ATK to the target.",
