    ["SkillDesc_5001102"]="The pet and its owner deal <color=#d14d75>%s%%</color> more damage to Holy attribute targets and receive <color=#d14d75>%s%%</color> less Holy damage for <color=#d14d75>60</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_5001103"]="Smites the enemy with divine light, dealing Holy magic damage equal to <color=#d14d75>%s%%</color> of M.ATK and dispelling the Kyrie Eleison effect.",
    ["SkillDesc_5500101"]="Increases their master's Earth Enhancement by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> for <color=#44afee>6</color> seconds. Cooldown is <color=#44afee>15</color> seconds. This effect cannot stack.",
    ["SkillDesc_5500102"]="Increases their master's Fire Enhancement by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> for <color=#44afee>6</color> seconds. Cooldown is <color=#44afee>15</color> seconds. This effect cannot stack.",
    ["SkillDesc_5500103"]="Increases their master's Wind Enhancement by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> for <color=#44afee>6</color> seconds. Cooldown is <color=#44afee>15</color> seconds. This effect cannot stack.",
    ["SkillDesc_5500104"]="Increases their master's Water Enhancement by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> for <color=#44afee>6</color> seconds. Cooldown is <color=#44afee>15</color> seconds. This effect cannot stack.",
    ["SkillDesc_5500105"]="Decreases damage received by their master from Earth attribute monsters by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> for <color=#44afee>6</color> seconds. Cooldown is <color=#44afee>15</color> seconds. This effect cannot stack.",
    ["SkillDesc_5500106"]="Decreases damage received by their master from Fire attribute monsters by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> for <color=#44afee>6</color> seconds. Cooldown is <color=#44afee>15</color> seconds. This effect cannot stack.",
    ["SkillDesc_5500107"]="Decreases damage received by their master from Wind attribute monsters by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> for <color=#44afee>6</color> seconds. Cooldown is <color=#44afee>15</color> seconds. This effect cannot stack.",
    ["SkillDesc_5500108"]="Decreases damage received by their master from Water attribute monsters by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> for <color=#44afee>6</color> seconds. Cooldown is <color=#44afee>15</color> seconds. This effect cannot stack.",
    ["SkillDesc_5500109"]="Changes their master's weapon's attribute into Earth and increases their master's Earth Enhancement by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> for <color=#44afee>6</color> seconds. Cooldown is <color=#44afee>15</color> seconds. This effect cannot stack.",
    ["SkillDesc_5500110"]="Changes their master's weapon's attribute into Fire and increases their master's Fire Enhancement by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> for <color=#44afee>6</color> seconds. Cooldown is <color=#44afee>15</color> seconds. This effect cannot stack.",
    ["SkillDesc_5500111"]="Changes their master's weapon's attribute into Wind and increases their master's Wind Enhancement by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> for <color=#44afee>6</color> seconds. Cooldown is <color=#44afee>15</color> seconds. This effect cannot stack.",
    ["SkillDesc_5500112"]="Changes their master's weapon's attribute into Water and increases their master's Water Enhancement by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> for <color=#44afee>6</color> seconds. Cooldown is <color=#44afee>15</color> seconds. This effect cannot stack.",
    ["SkillDesc_5500113"]="Changes their master's armor's attribute into Earth and decreases damage received by their master from Earth attribute monsters by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> for <color=#44afee>6</color> seconds. Cooldown is <color=#44afee>15</color> seconds. This effect cannot stack.",
    ["SkillDesc_5500114"]="Changes their master's armor's attribute into Fire and decreases damage received by their master from Fire attribute monsters by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> for <color=#44afee>6</color> seconds. Cooldown is <color=#44afee>15</color> seconds. This effect cannot stack.",
    ["SkillDesc_5500115"]="Changes their master's armor's attribute into Wind and decreases damage received by their master from Wind attribute monsters by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> for <color=#44afee>6</color> seconds. Cooldown is <color=#44afee>15</color> seconds. This effect cannot stack.",
    ["SkillDesc_5500116"]="Changes their master's armor's attribute into Water and decreases damage received by their master from Water attribute monsters by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> for <color=#44afee>6</color> seconds. Cooldown is <color=#44afee>15</color> seconds. This effect cannot stack.",
    ["SkillDesc_5500117"]="Traps all enemies within 5 meters of their master in the mud, decreasing the target's Movement Speed by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> for <color=#44afee>6</color> seconds. Cooldown is <color=#44afee>15</color> seconds. This effect cannot stack.",
    ["SkillDesc_5500118"]="Applies the HP Burn state to an enemy, decreasing their HP by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of Max HP every <color=#44afee>3</color> seconds for <color=#44afee>15</color> seconds. Cooldown is <color=#44afee>60</color> seconds. This effect cannot stack. Not effective against Bosses, MVPs, and Minis.",
    ["SkillDesc_5500119"]="Grants their master a Frost Shield that has a <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> chance to freeze the target for <color=#44afee>1</color> second upon taking damage. The shield lasts for <color=#44afee>6</color> seconds. Cooldown is <color=#44afee>30</color> seconds. This effect cannot stack.",
    ["SkillDesc_5500120"]="Reduces the Final DMG Bonus (can be countered by Weapon Break) of a single enemy by <color=#FFA500>%s%%</color> for <color=#FFA500>6</color> seconds. Cooldown: <color=#FFA500>15</color> seconds. This effect cannot stack.",
    ["SkillDesc_5500121"]="Increases their master's Debuff Resistance and Debuff Duration Reduction by <color=#FFA500>%s</color> each for <color=#FFA500>6</color> seconds. Cooldown is <color=#FFA500>15</color> seconds. This effect cannot stack.",
    ["SkillDesc_5500122"]="Applies the SP Burn state to an enemy, decreasing their SP by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of Max SP every <color=#44afee>3</color> seconds for <color=#44afee>15</color> seconds. Cooldown is <color=#44afee>60</color> seconds. This effect cannot stack. Not effective against Bosses, MVPs, and Minis.",
    ["SkillDesc_5500123"]="Grants their master an Ice Shield that can block damage equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of Max HP for <color=#44afee>6</color> seconds. Cooldown is <color=#44afee>30</color> seconds. This effect cannot stack.",
    ["SkillDesc_5500124"]="Reduces the Final DMG Reduction (can be countered by Armor Break) of a single enemy by <color=#FFA500>%s%%</color> for <color=#FFA500>6</color> seconds. Cooldown: <color=#FFA500>15</color> seconds. This effect cannot stack.",
    ["SkillDesc_5500125"]="Causes earth spikes to suddenly erupt from the ground, dealing <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> Earth damage of a type that matches your own to enemies within 1.5 meters. Cooldown is <color=#44afee>6</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_5500126"]="Summons a fire bolt from the sky, dealing <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> Fire damage of a type that matches your own to an enemy. Cooldown is <color=#44afee>6</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_5500127"]="Summons an ice bolt from the sky, dealing <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> Water damage of a type that matches your own to an enemy. Cooldown is <color=#44afee>6</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_5500128"]="Summons a lightning bolt from the sky, dealing <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> Wind damage of a type that matches your own to an enemy. Cooldown is <color=#44afee>6</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_5500129"]="Commands spikes to protrude from the ground, dealing <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> Earth damage of a type that matches your own to an enemy. Cooldown is <color=#44afee>6</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_5500130"]="Summons a fireball from the sky, dealing <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> Fire damage of a type that matches your own to the target and enemies within 1.5 meters. Cooldown is <color=#44afee>6</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_5500131"]="Freezes mist, dealing <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> Water damage of a type that matches your own to enemies within 1.5 meters. Cooldown is <color=#44afee>6</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_5500132"]="Summons a ball of lightning, dealing <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> Wind damage of a type that matches your own to the target and enemies within 1.5 meters. Cooldown is <color=#44afee>6</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_5500133"]="Creates a mud puddle on the ground with a 4-meter range, dealing <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> Earth damage of a type that matches your own to enemies within range per second for <color=#44afee>3</color> seconds. Cooldown is <color=#44afee>12</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_5500134"]="Summons a fire pillar, dealing <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> Fire damage of a type that matches your own to within 4 meters every second for <color=#44afee>3</color> seconds. Cooldown is <color=#44afee>12</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_5500135"]="Summons a blizzard, dealing <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> Water damage of a type that matches your own to enemies within 4 meters every second for <color=#44afee>3</color> seconds. Cooldown is <color=#44afee>12</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_5500136"]="Unleashes a chain of lightning bolts that jump between enemies <color=#44afee>18</color> times, each bolt dealing <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> Wind damage of a type that matches your own to the target. When there are no enemies for the lightning bolt to jump to, the last enemy will take the remaining damage of up to 3 hits. Cooldown is <color=#44afee>18</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_5500137"]="Rapidly increases the force of gravity on the ground, dealing <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> Earth damage of a type that matches your own to enemies within 4 meters every second for <color=#44afee>6</color> seconds. Cooldown is <color=#44afee>18</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_5500138"]="Summons <color=#44afee>6</color> meteors, with each meteor dealing <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> Fire damage of a type that matches your own upon hitting an enemy. Cooldown is <color=#44afee>18</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_5500139"]="Freezes the surrounding air, dealing <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> Water damage of a type that matches your own to enemies within 4 meters. Cooldown is <color=#44afee>18</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_5500140"]="Forms a powerful lightning strike, dealing <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> Wind damage of a type that matches your own to enemies within 4 meters every second for <color=#44afee>3</color> seconds. Cooldown is <color=#44afee>12</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_5500141"]="Calls earth spikes to suddenly erupt from the ground, dealing <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> Earth damage of a type that matches your own to enemies within 2.5 meters. Adds an Earth Mark stack upon casting. Once <color=#44afee>4</color> stacks are accumulated, gain <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> Earth Enhancement for <color=#44afee>15</color> seconds. Mark stacks cannot be accumulated while this effect is active.",
    ["SkillDesc_5500142"]="Summons a rain of fire arrows from the sky, randomly hitting enemies 1-3 time(s) and dealing <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> Fire damage of a type that matches your own. Adds a Fire Mark stack upon casting. Once <color=#44afee>4</color> stacks are accumulated, gain <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> Fire Enhancement for <color=#44afee>15</color> seconds. Mark stacks cannot be accumulated while this effect is active.",
    ["SkillDesc_5500143"]="Summons a rain of ice arrows from the sky, randomly hitting enemies 1-3 time(s) and dealing <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> Water damage of a type that matches your own. Adds a Water Mark stack upon casting. Once <color=#44afee>4</color> stacks are accumulated, gain <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> Water Enhancement for <color=#44afee>15</color> seconds. Mark stacks cannot be accumulated while this effect is active.",
    ["SkillDesc_5500144"]="Summons a thunderbolt from the sky, randomly hitting enemies 1-3 time(s) and dealing <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> Wind damage of a type that matches your own. Adds a Wind Mark stack upon casting. Once <color=#44afee>4</color> stacks are accumulated, gain <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> Wind Enhancement for <color=#44afee>15</color> seconds. Mark stacks cannot be accumulated while this effect is active.",
    ["SkillDesc_5500145"]="Causes spikes to protrude from the ground, randomly hitting enemies 1-3 time(s) and dealing <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> Earth damage of a type that matches your own. Adds an Earth Mark stack upon casting. Once <color=#44afee>4</color> stacks are accumulated, gain <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> Earth Enhancement for <color=#44afee>15</color> seconds. Mark stacks cannot be accumulated while this effect is active.",
    ["SkillDesc_5500146"]="Summons a fireball from the sky, dealing <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> Fire damage of a type that matches your own to the target and enemies within 2.5 meters around them. Adds a Fire Mark stack to their master upon casting. Once <color=#44afee>4</color> stacks are accumulated, gain <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> Fire Enhancement for <color=#44afee>15</color> seconds. Mark stacks cannot be accumulated while this effect is active.",
    ["SkillDesc_5500147"]="Freezes mist, dealing <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> Water damage of a type that matches your own to enemies within 2.5 meters. Adds a Water Mark stack upon casting. Once <color=#44afee>4</color> stacks are accumulated, gain <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> Water Enhancement for <color=#44afee>15</color> seconds. Mark stacks cannot be accumulated while this effect is active.",
    ["SkillDesc_5500148"]="Summons a ball of lightning from the sky, dealing <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> Wind damage of a type that matches your own to the target and enemies within 2.5 meters around them. Adds a Wind Mark stack upon casting. Once <color=#44afee>4</color> stacks are accumulated, gain <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> Wind Enhancement for <color=#44afee>15</color> seconds. Mark stacks cannot be accumulated while this effect is active.",
    ["SkillDesc_5500149"]="Creates a mud puddle on the ground with a 4-meter range, dealing <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> Earth damage of a type that matches your own per second to enemies for <color=#44afee>3</color> seconds. Adds an Earth Mark stack upon casting. Once <color=#44afee>4</color> stacks are accumulated, gain <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> Earth Enhancement for <color=#44afee>15</color> seconds. Mark stacks cannot be accumulated while this effect is active.",
    ["SkillDesc_5500150"]="Summons a pillar of flames, dealing <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> Fire damage of a type that matches your own per second to enemies within 4 meters for <color=#44afee>3</color> seconds. Adds a Fire Mark stack upon casting. Once <color=#44afee>4</color> stacks are accumulated, gain <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> Fire Enhancement for <color=#44afee>15</color> seconds. Mark stacks cannot be accumulated while this effect is active.",
    ["SkillDesc_5500151"]="Summons a storm, dealing <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> Water damage of a type that matches your own per second to enemies within 4 meters for <color=#44afee>3</color>seconds. Adds a Water Mark stack upon casting. Once <color=#44afee>4</color> stacks are accumulated, gain <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> Water Enhancement for <color=#44afee>15</color> seconds. Mark stacks cannot be accumulated while this effect is active.",
    ["SkillDesc_5500152"]="Unleashes a bolt of lightning that jumps between enemies <color=#44afee>18</color> times, dealing <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> Wind damage of a type that matches your own to the target each time. When there are no enemies for the lightning bolt to jump to, the last enemy will take the remaining damage of up to 3 hits. Adds a Wind Mark stack upon casting. Once <color=#44afee>4</color> stacks are accumulated, gain <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> Wind Enhancement for <color=#44afee>15</color> seconds. Mark stacks cannot be accumulated while this effect is active.",
    ["SkillDesc_5500153"]="Rapidly increases the force of gravity, dealing <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> Earth damage of a type that matches your own per second to enemies within 4 meters for <color=#44afee>6</color> seconds. Adds an Earth Mark stack upon casting. Once <color=#44afee>4</color> stacks are accumulated, gain <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> Earth Enhancement for <color=#44afee>15</color> seconds. Mark stacks cannot be accumulated while this effect is active.",
    ["SkillDesc_5500154"]="Summons <color=#44afee>6</color> meteors from the sky, with each meteor dealing <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> Fire damage of a type that matches your own to the hit target. Adds a Fire Mark stack upon casting. Once <color=#44afee>4</color> stacks are accumulated, gain <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> Fire Enhancement for <color=#44afee>15</color> seconds. Mark stacks cannot be accumulated while this effect is active.",
    ["SkillDesc_5500155"]="Freezes the surrounding air, dealing <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> Water damage of a type that matches your own to enemies within 4 meters. Adds a Water Mark stack to their master upon casting. Once <color=#44afee>4</color> stacks are accumulated, gain <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> Water Enhancement for <color=#44afee>15</color> seconds. Mark stacks cannot be accumulated while this effect is active.",
    ["SkillDesc_5500156"]="Creates a powerful thunderbolt, dealing <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> Wind damage of a type that matches your own per second to enemies within 4 meters for <color=#44afee>3</color> seconds. Adds a Wind Mark stack to their master upon casting. Once <color=#44afee>4</color> stacks are accumulated, gain <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> Wind Enhancement for <color=#44afee>15</color> seconds. Mark stacks cannot be accumulated while this effect is active.",
    ["SkillDesc_5500157"]="Increases their master's Final Physical Defense and Final Physical Damage Reduction by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> each for <color=#44afee>6</color> seconds. Cooldown is <color=#44afee>15</color> seconds. This effect cannot stack.",
    ["SkillDesc_5500158"]="Increases their master's Final Magic Defense and Final Magic Damage Reduction by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> each for <color=#44afee>6</color> seconds. Cooldown is <color=#44afee>15</color> seconds. This effect cannot stack.",
    ["SkillDesc_5500159"]="Increases their master's Final Dodge and Final Anti-Crit by <color=#44afee>%s%% each</color> for <color=#44afee>6</color> seconds. Cooldown is <color=#44afee>15</color> seconds. This effect cannot stack.",
    ["SkillDesc_5500160"]="Increases their master's Bonus Heal Received and Bonus Heal by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> each for <color=#44afee>6</color> seconds. Cooldown is <color=#44afee>15</color> seconds. This effect cannot stack.",
    ["SkillDesc_5500161"]="Raises a barrier around their master, making all party members inside temporarily immune to physical damage. Blocks up to <color=#44afee>%s</color> attacks and lasts for <color=#44afee>6</color> seconds. Cooldown is <color=#44afee>15</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_5500162"]="Raises a barrier around their master, making all party members inside temporarily immune to magic damage. Blocks up to <color=#44afee>%s</color> attacks and lasts for <color=#44afee>6</color> seconds. Cooldown is <color=#44afee>15</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_5500163"]="Grants their master a buff that rapidly restores HP, healing <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> HP per second for <color=#44afee>6</color> seconds. Cooldown is <color=#44afee>60</color> seconds. This effect cannot stack, and it cannot stack with Ultimate Skill effects.",
    ["SkillDesc_5500164"]="Grants their master a shield and immediately dispels any debuffs their master is inflicted with. The shield can block damage equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of their master's max HP and lasts for <color=#44afee>6</color> seconds. Cooldown is <color=#44afee>120</color> seconds. This effect cannot stack, and it cannot stack with Ultimate Skill effects.",
    ["SkillDesc_5500165"]="Grants their master a buff that protects them from death. When they sustain a fatal blow, they will be immune to death and immediately recover <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> HP (affected by Heal Effectiveness). Lasts for <color=#44afee>6</color> seconds. Cooldown is <color=#44afee>120</color> seconds. This effect cannot stack, and it cannot stack with Ultimate Skill effects.",
    ["SkillDesc_5500166"]="When their master dies, they will be resurrected with <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> HP.",
    ["SkillDesc_5500167"]="Grants their master and their party members a buff that rapidly restores HP, healing <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> HP per second for <color=#44afee>6</color> seconds. Cooldown is <color=#44afee>60</color> seconds. This effect cannot stack, and it cannot stack with Mystic Skill effects.",
    ["SkillDesc_5500168"]="Grants their master and their party members a shield and immediately dispels any debuffs their master is inflicted with. The shield can block damage equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of their master's max HP and lasts for <color=#44afee>6</color> seconds. Cooldown is <color=#44afee>120</color> seconds. This effect cannot stack, and it cannot stack with Mystic Skill effects.",
    ["SkillDesc_5500169"]="Grants their master and their party members a buff that protects them from death. When they sustain a fatal blow, they will be immune to death and immediately recover <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> HP (affected by Heal Effectiveness). Lasts for <color=#44afee>6</color> seconds. Cooldown is <color=#44afee>120</color> seconds. This effect cannot stack, and it cannot stack with Mystic Skill effects.",
    ["SkillDesc_5500170"]="When their master or one of their party members dies, they will be resurrected with <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> HP.",
    ["SkillDesc_5500171"]="Decreases the target's Final Hit and Final Crit by <color=#FFA500>%s%%</color> each. Stacks up to <color=#FFA500>4</color> times and lasts for <color=#FFA500>15</color> seconds. Cooldown is <color=#FFA500>9</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_5500172"]="Decreases the target's Final Flee and Final Anti-Crit by <color=#FFA500>%s%%</color> each. Stacks up to <color=#FFA500>4</color> times and lasts for <color=#FFA500>15</color> seconds. Cooldown is <color=#FFA500>9</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_5500173"]="Decreases the target's Final Physical Defense and Final Magic Defense by <color=#FFA500>%s%%</color> each. Stacks up to <color=#FFA500>4</color> times and lasts for <color=#FFA500>15</color> seconds. Cooldown is <color=#FFA500>9</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_5500174"]="Decreases the target's Final Physical Penetration and Final Magic Penetration by <color=#FFA500>%s%%</color> each. Stacks up to <color=#FFA500>4</color> times and lasts for <color=#FFA500>15</color> seconds. Cooldown is <color=#FFA500>9</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_5500175"]="Decreases the target's Final P.DMG Bonus and Final M.DMG Bonus by <color=#FFA500>%s%%</color> each. Stacks up to <color=#FFA500>4</color> times and lasts for <color=#FFA500>15</color> seconds. Cooldown is <color=#FFA500>9</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_5500176"]="Decreases the target's Final P.DMG Reduction and Final M.DMG Reduction by <color=#FFA500>%s%%</color> each. Stacks up to <color=#FFA500>4</color> times and lasts for <color=#FFA500>15</color> seconds. Cooldown is <color=#FFA500>9</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_5500177"]="Decreases the target's P.ATK and M.ATK by <color=#FFA500>%s%%</color> each. Stacks up to <color=#FFA500>4</color> times and lasts for <color=#FFA500>15</color> seconds. Cooldown is <color=#FFA500>9</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_5500178"]="Decreases the target's Crit DMG Bonus and Crit DMG Reduction by <color=#FFA500>%s%%</color> each. Stacks up to <color=#FFA500>4</color> times and lasts for <color=#FFA500>15</color> seconds. Cooldown is <color=#FFA500>9</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_5500179"]="Decreases the target's Bonus Heal and Bonus Heal Received by <color=#FFA500>%s%%</color> each. Stacks up to <color=#FFA500>4</color> times and lasts for <color=#FFA500>15</color> seconds. Cooldown is <color=#FFA500>9</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_5500180"]="Decreases the target's Debuff Resistance and Debuff Duration Reduction by <color=#FFA500>%s</color> each. Stacks up to <color=#FFA500>4</color> times and lasts for <color=#FFA500>15</color> seconds. Cooldown is <color=#FFA500>9</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_5500181"]="Decreases the target's Final DMG Bonus and Final DMG Reduction by <color=#FFA500>%s%%</color> each. Stacks up to <color=#FFA500>4</color> times and lasts for <color=#FFA500>15</color> seconds. Cooldown is <color=#FFA500>9</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_5500182"]="Decreases the target's PVP Final P.DMG Bonus and PVP Final M.DMG Bonus by <color=#FFA500>%s%%</color> each. Stacks up to <color=#FFA500>4</color> times and lasts for <color=#FFA500>15</color> seconds. Cooldown is <color=#FFA500>9</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_5500183"]="Decreases the target's PVP Final P.DMG Reduction and PVP Final M.DMG Reduction by <color=#FFA500>%s%%</color> each. Stacks up to <color=#FFA500>4</color> times and lasts for <color=#FFA500>15</color> seconds. Cooldown is <color=#FFA500>9</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_5500184"]="Decreases the target's PVP Debuff Duration Reduction and PVP Debuff Resistance by <color=#FFA500>%s</color> each. Stacks up to <color=#FFA500>4</color> times and lasts for <color=#FFA500>15</color> seconds. Cooldown is <color=#FFA500>9</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_5500185"]="Has a <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> chance to inflict the target with Petrify for <color=#44afee>3</color> seconds. Cooldown is <color=#44afee>15</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_5500186"]="Has a <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> chance to inflict the target with Silence for <color=#44afee>3</color> seconds. Cooldown is <color=#44afee>15</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_5500187"]="Has a <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> chance to inflict the target with Blind for <color=#44afee>3</color> seconds. Cooldown is <color=#44afee>15</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_5500188"]="Has a <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> chance to inflict the target with Curse for <color=#44afee>3</color> seconds. Cooldown is <color=#44afee>15</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_5500189"]="Has a <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> chance to inflict the target with Bleed for <color=#44afee>3</color> seconds. Cooldown is <color=#44afee>15</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_5500190"]="Has a <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> chance to inflict the target with Poison for <color=#44afee>3</color> seconds. Cooldown is <color=#44afee>15</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_5500191"]="Has a <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> chance to inflict the target with Attack Speed Restriction, decreasing their Final Attack Speed by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> for <color=#44afee>3</color> seconds. Cooldown is <color=#44afee>15</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_5500192"]="Has a <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> chance to inflict the target with Haste Restriction, decreasing their Final Haste by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> for <color=#44afee>3</color> seconds. Cooldown is <color=#44afee>15</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_5500193"]="Has a <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> chance to inflict the target with HP Restriction, decreasing their HP Regen, HP Regen per 5 seconds, HP restored by potions, and Heal Effectiveness by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> each for <color=#44afee>3</color> seconds. Cooldown is <color=#44afee>15</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_5500194"]="Has a <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> chance to inflict the target with SP Restriction, decreasing their SP Regen, SP Regen per 5 seconds, and SP restored by potions by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> each for <color=#44afee>3</color> seconds. Cooldown is <color=#44afee>15</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_5500195"]="Has a <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> chance to inflict the target with Stun for <color=#44afee>3</color> seconds. Cooldown is <color=#44afee>15</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_5500196"]="Has a <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> chance to inflict the target with Freeze for <color=#44afee>3</color> seconds. Cooldown is <color=#44afee>15</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_5500197"]="Has a <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> chance to inflict the target with Immobilize for <color=#44afee>3</color> seconds. Cooldown is <color=#44afee>15</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_5500198"]="Charges at the target, dealing <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> Neutral damage of a type that matches their own. Has a <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> chance to make the target bleed for <color=#44afee>3</color> seconds. Cooldown is <color=#44afee>12</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_5500199"]="Summons a Lunatic General, charging at all enemies within 5 meters of their master and dealing <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> Neutral damage of a type that matches their own. Has a <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> chance to make the target bleed for <color=#44afee>6</color> seconds. Cooldown is <color=#44afee>24</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_5500200"]="Jumps up and slams the target, dealing <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> Neutral damage of a type that matches their own. Has a <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> chance to stun the target for <color=#44afee>1</color> second. Cooldown is <color=#44afee>12</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_5500201"]="Jumps up high and flies fiercely downward at the target, dealing <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> Neutral damage of a type that matches their own to enemies within 3 meters and stuns all enemies for <color=#44afee>2</color> seconds. Cooldown is <color=#44afee>24</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_5500202"]="Shoots a poisonous needle at the enemy, dealing Neutral damage of a type that matches their own equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of the target's Max HP. Cooldown is <color=#44afee>12</color> seconds. Not effective against Bosses, MVPs, and Minis.",
    ["SkillDesc_5500203"]="Shoots a poisonous needle at the enemy that has a <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> chance to directly kill the enemy. If the target is not killed, it instead deals Neutral damage of a type that matches their own equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of the target's Max HP. Cooldown is <color=#44afee>24</color> seconds. Not effective against Bosses, MVPs, and Minis.",
    ["SkillDesc_5500204"]="Devours the target. If the target is a monster, it will be killed immediately. If the target is a player, deals Neutral Damage which is equal to <color=#FFA500>%s%%</color> of the target’s Max HP on it and spits it out after 5 seconds. Cooldown is <color=#FFA500>24</color> seconds. Not effective against Bosses, MVPs, and Minis. Devouring-type skills cannot be cast on the same target for 24 seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_5500205"]="Rocker strums the guitar, emitting listless notes that have a <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> chance to confuse enemies within 3 meters of their master for <color=#44afee>6</color> seconds. Cooldown is <color=#44afee>18</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_5500206"]="Vocal strums the guitar, emitting angry notes that have a <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> chance to silence enemies within 3 meters of their master for <color=#44afee>6</color> seconds. Cooldown is <color=#44afee>18</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_5500207"]="Angrily howls at the enemy and intimidates them, decreasing the Final Physical Damage Reduction and Final Magic Damage Reduction of all enemies within 3 meters of their master by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> each for <color=#44afee>6</color> seconds. Cooldown is <color=#44afee>18</color> seconds. This effect cannot stack.",
    ["SkillDesc_5500208"]="Angrily howls at the enemy and intimidates them, decreasing the PVP Final Physical Damage Reduction and PVP Final Magic Damage Reduction of all enemies within 3 meters of their master by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> each for <color=#44afee>6</color> seconds. Cooldown is <color=#44afee>18</color> seconds. This effect cannot stack.",
    ["SkillDesc_5500209"]="Grants their master a Lifesteal buff, increasing their Physical Lifesteal and Magic Lifesteal by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> each for <color=#44afee>6</color> seconds. Cooldown is <color=#44afee>24</color> seconds. This effect cannot stack.",
    ["SkillDesc_5500210"]="Gives blood to their master, healing their master for <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> HP per second for <color=#44afee>6</color> seconds. Cooldown is <color=#44afee>24</color> seconds. This effect cannot stack.",
    ["SkillDesc_5500211"]="Throws a stone at the enemy. Has a <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> chance to stun the target for <color=#44afee>0.25</color> seconds. Cooldown is <color=#44afee>3</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_5500212"]="Speeds up mining efficiency by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_5500213"]="Awakens Muka's vengeful spirit. When they inflict enemies with debuffs, they ignore <color=#FFA500>%s%%</color> of their specified resistance and <color=#FFA500>%s</color> of their Debuff Resistance, Debuff Duration Reduction, PVP Debuff Resistance, and PVP Debuff Duration Reduction.",
    ["SkillDesc_5500214"]="Has a <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> chance to put the target to sleep for <color=#44afee>3</color> seconds. Cooldown is <color=#44afee>15</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_5500215"]="Devours the target. If the target is a monster, it will die at once. If the target is a player, the target will be spit out after 2 seconds. Restores <color=#FFA500>%s%%</color> Max HP of the owner, and removes owner’s debuffs and grants immunity to debuffs for the next <color=#FFA500>4</color> seconds (except for debuffs that cannot be removed). This skill is not effective against Bosses, MVPs and Minis. Cooldown is 24 seconds. Devouring-type skills cannot be cast on the same target for 24 seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_5500218"]="Moon Rabbit awakens Moon's Aura to increase <color=#FFA500>%s%%</color> Final Damage Bonus and Final Damage Reduction of their master and their party members for 12 seconds, stacking up to 5 times, with a 36-second cooldown.",
    ["SkillDesc_5500219"]="Every <color=#44afee>24</color>s, scorching steam is released into the surrounding area for <color=#44afee>6</color>s. Every<color=#44afee>0.5</color>s, the attack deals damage to all targets in range that is equal to the target's (Max HP (<color=#44afee>%s%%</color> + <color=#44afee>1%%</color>) + (<color=#44afee>%s%%</color> + <color=#44afee>15%%</color>)*Adaptive Attack Power) in <color=#44afee>Fire Stat Adaptive damage</color>. (Not effective on MVP, Mini, and bosses.) Targets that have taken damage <color=#44afee>4</color> consecutive times take fire damage that is increased by <color=#44afee>50%%</color> for <color=#44afee>10</color>s.",
    ["SkillDesc_5500220"]="Every second, restores <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> HP of all allied units within <color=#44afee>4</color> meters and deals <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> Adaptive Neutral Damage to enemies within range. Lasts for <color=#44afee>6</color> seconds. Cooldown: <color=#44afee>24</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_5500221"]="Puts the master into the <color=#7ACEFF>Carnage</color> Mode for <color=#7ACEFF>6</color> seconds. Cooldown: <color=#7ACEFF>36</color> seconds. Increases the master's size by <color=#7ACEFF>30%%</color>, and Final P.DEF and Final M.DEF by <color=#7ACEFF>30%%</color>. There is a <color=#7ACEFF>30%%</color> chance in each second to put enemies within a <color=#7ACEFF>4</color>-meter range into the Blind state for <color=#7ACEFF>3</color> seconds. This skill deals extra True DMG equal to <color=#7ACEFF>%s%%</color> of its previous damage to all targets within <color=#7ACEFF>3</color>-meter range.",
    ["SkillDesc_5500222"]="Once the master has taken damage over <color=#7ACEFF>10%%</color> of the Max HP, a swarm of mosquitoes will be summoned, dealing <color=#7ACEFF>%s%%</color> Shadow attribute Adaptive DMG to <color=#7ACEFF>2</color> random targets within a <color=#7ACEFF>4.5</color> meters every <color=#7ACEFF>0.5</color> seconds for <color=#7ACEFF>4</color> seconds. Cooldown: <color=#7ACEFF>20</color> seconds.\nFor targets with HP under <color=#7ACEFF>50%%</color>, each hit on <color=#7ACEFF>1</color> target triggers the following:\nIncrease the damage coefficient by <color=#7ACEFF>%s%%</color>.\nReduce the skill cooldown by <color=#7ACEFF>1</color> second and slow down the target by <color=#7ACEFF>75%%</color> for <color=#7ACEFF>2</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_5500223"]="After roaring, party members within <color=#44afee>20</color> meters receive <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> bonus damage against large monsters and <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> Water Attribute Enhancement for <color=#44afee>12</color> seconds. Stacks up to <color=#44afee>5</color> times. CD: <color=#7ACEFF>24</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_5500224"]="Devours the target. If the target is a monster, it will be killed immediately. If the target is a player, they will be spit out after <color=#FFA500>1</color> second. Cooldown is <color=#FFA500>%s</color> seconds. Not effective against Bosses, MVPs, and Minis. Devouring-type skills cannot be cast on the same target for 24 seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_5500226"]="Deals Adaptive Neutral DMG and Holy attribute DMG equal to <color=#FFA500>%s%%</color> of the target's Max HP within a <color=#FFA500>4</color>-meter radius (up to 2 hits of <color=#FFA500>1000%%</color> of your ATK; critical hits possible).\n If the target is MVP, BOSS, or MINI, it deals Adaptive Holy DMG and Neutral attribute DMG equal to <color=#FFA500>%s%%</color> (critical hits possible).\n Also grants a shield equal to <color=#FFA500>%s%%</color> of Max HP multiplied by the number of critical hits dealt during the precious attacks for 6 seconds (up to <color=#FFA500>4</color> times). Cooldown: 12 seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_5500227"]="Puck begins with <color=#FFA500>6</color> stamina in the fully energized state. It can cast 1 ice spike every <color=#FFA500>3</color> seconds, consuming <color=#FFA500>1</color> stamina per spike, dealing Adaptive Fire DMG equal to <color=#FFA500>%s%%</color> of Adaptive ATK in total within a <color=#FFA500>4</color>-meter radius. If there are <color=#FFA500>3</color> or fewer targets within range, the ice spike damage increases by <color=#FFA500>50%%</color>. Puck enters the fatigue state after casting 6 ice spikes in the fully energized state.\nIn the fatigue state, if the master is attacked, Puck has a <color=#FFA500>6.25%%</color> chance to apply Drowsiness to the attacker <color=#FFA500>3</color> seconds later, lasting for <color=#FFA500>3</color> seconds. Drowsy Enemies can't move or attack, waking up after taking damage equal to <color=#FFA500>30%%</color> of their Max HP in total. In the fatigue state, Puck no longer casts ice spikes and recovers 1 stamina every <color=#FFA500>2</color> seconds. Once its stamina is back to <color=#FFA500>6</color>, it re-enters the fully energized state and continues to cast ice spikes, dealing extra <color=#FFA500>20%%</color> damage to drowsy enemies affected by itself during its fatigue state.",
    ["SkillDesc_5500228"]="Sprinkles osmanthus flowers over a <color=#E79741>20</color>-meter area, granting all allies the dual blessings of <color=#E79741>Osmanthus</color> and <color=#E79741>Moonlight</color>. While the <color=#E79741>Osmanthus</color> effect is active, allies' Debuff Resistance is increased by <color=#E79741>%s</color>, and their MSPD is increased by <color=#E79741>2</color>. While the <color=#E79741>Moonlight</color> effect is active, the carrier gains a shield equal to <color=#E79741>%s%%</color> of the Max HP. <color=#E79741>Osmanthus</color> and <color=#E79741>Moonlight</color> effects last for <color=#44afee>5</color> seconds. Cooldown: <color=#E79741>16</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_5500233"]="The Fat Tiger ascends into the air before slamming into the ground, dealing <color=#FFA500>%s%%</color> Ghost or Neutral attribute DMG to targets within a 6-meter radius. This skill may trigger critical damage (based on the higher number of the master's Ghost or Neutral attributes, with damage shared by all targets within the area). It also boosts the master's Ghost and Neutral attributes by <color=#FFA500>%s%%</color> for <color=#FFA500>6</color> seconds. There's a <color=#FFA500>%s%%</color> chance to make the target bleeds for <color=#FFA500>6</color> seconds. Cooldown: 12 seconds. When Fat Tiger is casting <color=#FFA500>Divine: Ghost Enhancement</color>, if the master's Neutral Enhancement is greater than Ghost Enhancement, the effect will be changed to Neutral Enhancement.",
    ["SkillDesc_5500234"]="Summon ice spikes that strike the target <color=#44afee>3</color> times, each dealing <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> weapon attribute Adaptive DMG. Each hit absorbs energy around the target and grants the caster <color=#44afee>1-3</color> stacks of Magic Rose. Each stack of Magic Rose increases damage dealt to MVP and MINI units by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>. Lasts for 10 seconds. Cooldown: <color=#44afee>20</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_5500235"]="Strikes the targets within a 4-meter radius with Terra Force <color=#FFA500>3</color> times, each dealing Fire attribute P.DMG equal to <color=#FFA500>%s%%</color> of P.ATK. These hits can trigger critical damage. <color=#FFA500>Each</color> critical hit applies <color=#FFA500>1</color> stack of <color=#FFA500>Energy Erosion</color> to the target, up to <color=#FFA500>3</color> stacks. <color=#FFA500>Each</color> stack of <color=#FFA500>Energy Erosion</color> allows the pet and its master to ignore the target's Final DMG Reduction by <color=#FFA500>16%%</color> for <color=#FFA500>6</color> seconds. For <color=#FFA500>each</color> stack of Energy Erosion applied, subsequent damage from Terra Force increases by <color=#FFA500>%s%%</color>. If your Poison Enhancement is higher than Fire Enhancement, Terra Force inflicts Poison attribute P.DMG instead. Cooldown: <color=#FFA500>20</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_5500236"]="Each time Gaia Force lands a critical hit, you get <color=#FFA500>1</color> stack of Brave Shield, up to <color=#FFA500>3</color> stacks. Each Brave Shield grants the master a shield equal to <color=#FFA500>%s%%</color> of P.ATK, capping at <color=#FFA500>30%%</color> of the master's Max HP. Brave Shield lasts for <color=#FFA500>6</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_5500237"]="Smashes down with Heaven's Knuckle, dealing Holy attribute P.DMG equal to <color=#FFA500>%s%%</color> of P.ATK and ignoring <color=#FFA500>%s%%</color> of the target's P.DEF. If the target is an MVP/MINI/Boss unit, they'll get a <color=#FFA500>Divine Mark</color> effect, taking <color=#FFA500>%s%%</color> more damage from all party members for <color=#FFA500>6</color> seconds. If the skill hits a target already marked with <color=#FFA500>Divine Mark</color>, it ignores an additional <color=#FFA500>%s%%</color> P.DEF. If your Poison Enhancement is higher than Holy Enhancement, Heaven's Knuckle inflicts Poison attribute P.DMG instead. Cooldown: <color=#FFA500>24</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_5500238"]="Each a party member attacks, there's a <color=#FFA500>%s%%</color> chance to increase <color=#FFA500>Divine Mark</color>'s duration by <color=#FFA500>1</color> second, triggering up to <color=#FFA500>%s</color> time(s) (round down) while the <color=#FFA500>Divine Mark</color> is active. When triggered, it also applies <color=#FFA500>1</color> stack of Holy Light's purification effect to the target, with each stack reducing their Final P.DMG RED by <color=#FFA500>5%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_5500239"]="Unleashes a Celestial Arrow, dealing Holy attribute M.DMG equal to <color=#FFA500>%s%%</color> of M.ATK and applying a <color=#FFA500>Heaven's Punishment</color> to the target for <color=#FFA500>%s</color> second(s). When you or the master attack targets affected by <color=#FFA500>Heaven's Punishment</color>, you or the master ignore <color=#FFA500>40%%</color> of their Final M.DMG RED. If your Wind Enhancement is higher than Holy Enhancement, Celestial Arrow inflicts Wind M.DMG instead. Cooldown: <color=#FFA500>20</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_5500240"]="Activating Celestial Arrow also grants you the Heaven's Glow effect. While it's active, if your HP drops below <color=#FFA500>%s%%</color>, you instantly restore <color=#FFA500>%s%%</color> of your Max HP. When attacking a target affected by <color=#FFA500>Heaven's Punishment</color>, there's an <color=#FFA500>8%%</color> chance to reduce Celestial Arrow's cooldown by <color=#FFA500>1</color> second. This can only be triggered <color=#FFA500>once</color> per second.",
    ["SkillDesc_5500241"]="Shoots a Pepper Breath forward, dealing <color=#FFA500>%s%%</color> Fire attribute P.DMG to a single enemy. Cooldown: <color=#FFA500>8</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_5500242"]="Activates Medusa's Head, dealing Fire attribute P.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of P.ATK to the target. This skill may trigger critical damage. Also applies Chaotic Mark to the target for <color=#44afee>10</color> seconds. While the Chaotic Mark is active, reduces the target's Final Flee by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> and Debuff Resistance by <color=#44afee>%s</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_5500243"]="Deals Holy attribute P.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of P.ATK to enemies within <color=#44afee>6</color> meters and heals the master by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of their Max HP (the HP recovered cannot exceed <color=#44afee>12.5</color> times their ATK).",
    ["SkillDesc_5500260"]="Deals <color=#FFA500>2</color> hits of Adaptive P.DMG equal to <color=#FFA500>%s%%</color> of P.ATK to the target. Before each hit, inflicts <color=#FFA500>1</color> stack of <color=#FFA500>Shatter</color>, up to <color=#FFA500>2</color> stacks. At <color=#FFA500>1</color> stack of <color=#FFA500>Shatter</color>, reduces the target's Final Anti-Crit by <color=#FFA500>%s%%</color>. At <color=#FFA500>2</color> stacks of <color=#FFA500>Shatter</color>, additionally reduces the target's PVP Final P.DMG RED by <color=#FFA500>%s%%</color>. The <color=#FFA500>Shatter</color> effect lasts for <color=#FFA500>6</color> seconds. Each time you successfully apply <color=#FFA500>1</color> stack of <color=#FFA500>Shatter</color>, Fiery Bison Cross Slash's damage increases by <color=#FFA500>30%%</color>. Cooldown: <color=#FFA500>20</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_5500261"]="When entering battle, grants all party members a shield equal to <color=#FFA500>%s%%</color> of your ATK (up to <color=#FFA500>30%%</color> of the shielded target's Max HP). The shield lasts for <color=#FFA500>6</color> seconds. While active, it removes <color=#FFA500>1</color> random control-type debuff every <color=#FFA500>2</color> seconds. This shield triggers <color=#FFA500>once</color> every <color=#FFA500>20</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_5500262"]="Each time the master performs a normal attack or a skill, the master gains <color=#FFA500>1</color> or <color=#FFA500>3</color> stacks of energy, respectively. At <color=#FFA500>9</color> stacks, Jyakomaru consumes all energy stacks to unleash Tiger Beam, inflicting a <color=#FFA500>5</color>-second <color=#FFA500>Armor Break</color> and dealing Adaptive P.DMG equal to <color=#FFA500>%s%%</color> of P.ATK to the target. If the target dies while under <color=#FFA500>Armor Break</color>, the Tiger Beam cooldown is reduced by <color=#FFA500>%s</color> second(s). Cooldown: <color=#FFA500>20</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_5500263"]="When the master takes a single hit dealing more than <color=#FFA500>20%%</color> of Max HP as Final DMG, the Final DMG is reduced by <color=#FFA500>%s%%</color>, and the master gains <color=#FFA500>1</color> stack of <color=#FFA500>Swift</color>. The <color=#FFA500>Swift</color> effect lasts for <color=#FFA500>5</color> seconds. While <color=#FFA500>Swift</color> is active, any cooldown increase effects (both variable and fixed) received by you are temporarily disabled. Tiger Pauldrons trigger <color=#FFA500>once</color> every <color=#FFA500>20</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_5500264"]="Each time the master casts a skill or takes damage, there's a <color=#FFA500>10%%</color> and <color=#FFA500>20%%</color> chance respectively to gain <color=#FFA500>1</color> stack of <color=#FFA500>Dragon Soul Mark</color>, up to <color=#FFA500>5</color> stacks, lasting <color=#FFA500>8</color> seconds. While Ryujinmaru uses the Soaring Dragon Sword, all <color=#FFA500>Dragon Soul Marks</color> are consumed to deal Adaptive M.DMG equal to <color=#FFA500>%s%%</color> of M.ATK to the enemies within a <color=#FFA500>12x4</color> meter area. Enemies hit by the Soaring Dragon Sword are inflicted with <color=#FFA500>Soul Sever</color>, reducing their highest primary stat per <color=#FFA500>Dragon Soul Mark</color> consumed. <color=#FFA500>Each</color> stack of <color=#FFA500>Soul Sever</color> reduces their highest primary stat by <color=#FFA500>%s%%</color>. <color=#FFA500>Soul Sever</color> lasts for <color=#FFA500>6</color> seconds. Cooldown: <color=#FFA500>20</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_5500265"]="When the master's HP falls below <color=#FFA500>50%%</color>, Final DMG taken is reduced by <color=#FFA500>%s%%</color>. When the master's HP falls below <color=#FFA500>25%%</color>, Final DMG taken is reduced by <color=#FFA500>%s%%</color>. For every <color=#FFA500>25%%</color> HP lost, the chance to gain a <color=#FFA500>Dragon Soul Mark</color> increases by <color=#FFA500>10%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_5500266"]="Throws a massive Radiant Fang Shuriken at the target, dealing Neutral attribute P.DMG equal to <color=#FFA500>%s%%</color> of P.ATK to the target. <color=#FFA500>Each</color> stack of <color=#FFA500>Light Energy</color> increases the Shuriken damage by an extra <color=#FFA500>10%%</color>. Upon use, all <color=#FFA500>Light Energy</color> stacks are consumed, allowing the <color=#FFA500>Radiant Fang Shuriken</color> damage to ignore the target's Final P.DEF by <color=#FFA500>%s%%</color> and Final P.DMG RED by <color=#FFA500>%s%%</color>. When your Shadow Enhancement is higher than Neutral Enhancement, the attribute of the Radiant Fang Shuriken changes to Shadow. Cooldown: <color=#FFA500>20</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_5500267"]="Phantom Wings grants a surge of airflow, allowing the master to add <color=#FFA500>1</color> stack of <color=#FFA500>Light Energy</color> when casting a skill. The <color=#FFA500>Light Energy</color> lasts for <color=#FFA500>10</color> seconds, stacking up to <color=#FFA500>10</color> times. Each stack of <color=#FFA500>Light Energy</color> increases the master's Neutral Enhancement by <color=#FFA500>%s%%</color> and Final DMG Bonus by <color=#FFA500>%s%%</color>. When your Shadow Enhancement is higher than Neutral Enhancement, each stack of <color=#FFA500>Light Energy</color> provides <color=#FFA500>%s%%</color> Shadow Enhancement and <color=#FFA500>%s%%</color> Final DMG Bonus to the master instead.",
    ["SkillDesc_5500268"]="Baby Nian grants the <color=#FFA500>Unity Blessing</color> to the party member with the lowest remaining HP (below <color=#FFA500>50%%</color>). When a party member with <color=#FFA500>Unity Blessing</color> is attacked, the attacker is inflicted with <color=#FFA500>Fortune Corrosion</color> (only triggers if the attacker is within <color=#FFA500>15</color> meters), reducing the target's MSPD by <color=#FFA500>%s%%</color> and Final DMG dealt by <color=#FFA500>%s%%</color>. <color=#FFA500>Fortune Corrosion</color> lasts <color=#FFA500>6</color> seconds. After triggering <color=#FFA500>Fortune Corrosion</color>, <color=#FFA500>Unity Blessing</color> enters a cooldown of <color=#FFA500>18</color> seconds. <color=#FFA500>Fortune Corrosion</color> cannot be triggered on monsters.",
    ["SkillDesc_55004102"]="Eclipse's Summoned Monster casts <color=#40FF00>Coluceo Heal</color>, healing within a certain range",
    ["SkillDesc_5500600"]="Launches a water ball at the target, dealing Adaptive Undead Damage equal to <color=#FFA500>%s%%</color> of their Max HP and slowing them for <color=#FFA500>3</color> seconds. If the target is already slowed, the water ball has a <color=#FFA500>%s%%</color> chance to imprison them (does not apply to MVP, MINI, and Boss; party members can touch the water ball to remove the imprisonment), reducing the healing effects they receive by <color=#FFA500>100%%</color> and dealing True Damage equal to <color=#FFA500>12%%</color> of their Max HP every second for <color=#FFA500>10</color> seconds. This effect cannot stack. Cooldown: <color=#FFA500>30</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_5500601"]="Controls gravitational forces to drag all nearby enemies within a 5-meter radius toward the central area. After 1.5 seconds, the thunderstorm falls, dealing <color=#FFA500>%s%%</color> Adaptive Shadow DMG and increasing the hit targets' SP costs by <color=#FFA500>%s%%</color> for <color=#FFA500>8</color> seconds when they use skills. Cooldown: <color=#FFA500>24</color> seconds. This effect cannot stack.",
    ["SkillDesc_5500602"]="Deals <color=#FFA500>%s%%</color> Adaptive Undead Damage every second to enemies within 4 meters of the pet for <color=#FFA500>3</color> seconds. Cooldown: <color=#FFA500>12</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_5500603"]="Osiris touches the target, cursing them with a <color=#FFA500>%s%%</color> chance (every <color=#FFA500>%s</color> VIT of the target increases the chance by an additional 1%%, up to 80%%; does not apply to MVP, MINI, and Boss). Cursed targets will have their Max HP decreased by <color=#FFA500>60%%</color> for <color=#FFA500>12</color> seconds. This effect cannot stack. If the touch fails to inflict the curse, the target will suffer Adaptive Undead Damage equal to <color=#FFA500>%s%%</color> of their Max HP. (does not apply to MVP, MINI, and Boss.) Cooldown: <color=#FFA500>24</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_5500604"]="Randomly targets 3 enemy units and unleashes a 4-meter-radius Frost Mark at each of them. After a 1.5-second warning, deals <color=#FFA500>%s%%</color> Adaptive Water Damage respectively and freezes the targets for <color=#FFA500>3</color> seconds (does not apply to MVP, MINI, and Boss). Cooldown: <color=#FFA500>24</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_5500605"]="Bites the target, dealing <color=#FFA500>%s%%</color> Adaptive Fire Damage. Cooldown: <color=#FFA500>3</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_5500606"]="When damage taken by the master reaches 10%% of their Max HP, it converts the master's skin into barbed armor, turning their armor attribute into Fire for <color=#FFA500>6</color> seconds. Within this period, each time the master takes damage, the attacker suffers <color=#FFA500>%s%%</color> Adaptive Fire Damage. Cooldown: <color=#FFA500>24</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_5500607"]="The Vadon pinches the target with its claws, dealing <color=#FFA500>%s%%</color> Adaptive Water Damage. Cooldown: <color=#FFA500>3</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_5500608"]="Marks an enemy. After 5 seconds, deals <color=#FFA500>%s%%</color> Water attribute Adaptive Damage to the marked target and enemies within 5 meters of the marked target. Cooldown: <color=#FFA500>24</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_5500609"]="Sprays squid ink to surrounding targets within 3 meters. Has a <color=#FFA500>%s%%</color> chance to Blind them for <color=#FFA500>3</color> seconds. Cooldown: <color=#FFA500>12</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_5500610"]="Unleashes a pulsing beam from the eye, dealing <color=#FFA500>%s%%</color> Adaptive Water Damage every 0.5 seconds to all targets ahead.\nFor targets hit more than 3 times, each damage has a <color=#FFA500>%s%%</color> chance to inflict one of the following states on them:\nSilence, Freeze, Bleed, Confuse, Curse, and Sleep (these debuffs do not apply to MVP, MINI, and Boss)\nDuration: Debuffs last <color=#FFA500>3</color> seconds; the pulsing beam lasts <color=#FFA500>4</color> seconds. Cooldown: <color=#FFA500>24</color> seconds. This effect cannot stack.",
    ["SkillDesc_55006102"]="Dragon Fly's Summoned Monster casts <color=#7ACEFF>Steel Heart</color> decreasing damage received. Stacking Steel Heart increases DMG Reduction.",
    ["SkillDesc_5500611"]="Bites the target, dealing <color=#FFA500>%s%%</color> Adaptive Earth Damage. Cooldown: <color=#FFA500>3</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_5500612"]="When damage taken by the master reaches 10%% of their Max HP, adds a Guard buff to the master that lasts <color=#FFA500>12</color> seconds. Within this period, the master becomes immune to <color=#FFA500>%s</color> ranged attacks; each time the immunity is triggered, the attacker will have their Final DMG Bonus decreased by <color=#FFA500>%s%%</color> for <color=#FFA500>6</color> seconds, stacking up to 12 times. Cooldown: <color=#FFA500>24</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_5500613"]="Enables a <color=#FFA500>%s%%</color> chance to slow nearby enemies within 3 meters of it by <color=#FFA500>50%%</color> for <color=#FFA500>3</color> seconds. Cooldown: <color=#FFA500>12</color> seconds. This effect cannot stack.",
    ["SkillDesc_5500614"]="Adds an Auto Counter buff to the master, increasing their Final DMG Reduction by <color=#FFA500>%s%%</color> for 4 seconds. All damage taken by the master within the buff duration will be recorded. When the buff expires, deals True Damage equal to (<color=#FFA500>%s%%</color> x <color=#FFA500>recorded damage</color>) to all enemies within 5 meters of the master. Cooldown: <color=#FFA500>20</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_5500615"]="Conjures a ring of fire to obstruct enemies from advancing, dealing (<color=#FFA500>%s%%</color> of M.ATK) Adaptive Fire Damage to enemies that attempt to pass the fire wall. Lasts for <color=#FFA500>10</color> seconds. The ring of fire can obstruct enemies up to <color=#FFA500>%s</color> times and will persist for at least <color=#FFA500>3</color> seconds. Cooldown: <color=#FFA500>12</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_5500616"]="Reveals all stealth units within 8 meters of the master and marks them, increasing their damage received from the master by <color=#FFA500>%s%%</color> for <color=#FFA500>9</color> seconds. Cooldown: <color=#FFA500>18</color> seconds. This effect cannot stack.",
    ["SkillDesc_5500617"]="Enables the master's normal attacks to ignore <color=#FFA500>%s%%</color> of the target's defense. Lasts for <color=#FFA500>4</color> seconds. Cooldown: <color=#FFA500>12</color> seconds. This effect cannot stack.",
    ["SkillDesc_5500618"]="Attacks the target, dealing <color=#FFA500>%s%%</color> Adaptive Fire Damage. Cooldown: <color=#FFA500>6</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_5500619"]="Increases the master's body size by 20%%, granting each of their melee normal attacks an additional (<color=#FFA500>%s</color> x STR) Adaptive Undead Damage. This effect cannot stack. Increases their MSPD by <color=#FFA500>0.5</color>, stacking up to 4 times. The effect lasts for <color=#FFA500>9</color> seconds. Cooldown: <color=#FFA500>18</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_5500620"]="Conjures a Ring of the Dead under the master's feet, granting <color=#FFA500>%s%%</color> Final P.DMG Bonus and Final M.DMG Bonus, and <color=#FFA500>%s%%</color> Final P.DEF and Final M.DEF to the allied units within a 4-meter radius for <color=#FFA500>6</color> seconds. Cooldown: <color=#FFA500>12</color> seconds. This effect cannot stack.",
    ["SkillDesc_5500621"]="Attacks the target, dealing <color=#FFA500>%s%%</color> Adaptive Water Damage. Cooldown: <color=#FFA500>6</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_5500622"]="Increases the master's Final ASPD by <color=#FFA500>%s%%</color> and Crit DMG Bonus by <color=#FFA500>%s%%</color> for <color=#FFA500>6</color> seconds. Cooldown: <color=#FFA500>12</color> seconds. This effect cannot stack.",
    ["SkillDesc_5500623"]="Consumes 20%% of the master's Max HP (unusable when the master's HP is low) to curse the targets within 4 meters of the master, increasing all their skill cooldowns by <color=#FFA500>%s</color> seconds and cast time by <color=#FFA500>%s</color> seconds. This effect lasts for <color=#FFA500>8</color> seconds and does not apply to MVP, MINI, and Boss. Cooldown: <color=#FFA500>16</color> seconds. This effect cannot stack.",
    ["SkillDesc_5500624"]="Nine Tail charms the target, reducing their Final DMG Bonus by <color=#FFA500>%s%%</color> while granting the master <color=#FFA500>%s%%</color> increased damage against the target. This effect lasts for <color=#FFA500>6</color> seconds and does not apply to MVP, MINI, and Boss. Cooldown: <color=#FFA500>24</color> seconds. This effect cannot stack.",
    ["SkillDesc_5500625"]="Sends the target's mind to roam among multiple parallel universes, inflicting a Psychosis status on them. If the affected target is a player, they will suffer Adaptive Ghost Damage equal to <color=#FFA500>%s%%</color> of their Max HP each time they use a skill. If the affected target is a monster, however, it will take <color=#FFA500>%s%%</color> Adaptive Ghost Damage every 0.5 seconds over <color=#FFA500>4</color> seconds.\nCooldown: <color=#FFA500>20</color> seconds. This effect cannot stack.",
    ["SkillDesc_5500626"]="Prays for the full moon, generating a <color=#7ACEFF>6</color>-meter-radius Moonlight Area for <color=#7ACEFF>9</color> seconds at the caster's location. Enemies entering the Moonlight Area will have their P.DEF and M.DEF reduced by <color=#7ACEFF>%s%%</color> and Hiding state removed. Cooldown: <color=#7ACEFF>18</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_5510001"]="Increases their master’s Poison attribute enhancement by <color=#FFA500>%s%%</color> for <color=#FFA500>6</color>s. <color=#FFA500>15</color>-second cooldown. Cannot be stacked.",
    ["SkillDesc_5510002"]="Reduces damage dealt to their master by Poison attribute monsters by <color=#FFA500>%s%%</color> for <color=#FFA500>6</color>s. <color=#FFA500>15</color>-second cooldown. Cannot be stacked.",
    ["SkillDesc_5510003"]="Changes their master’s weapon’s attributes to Poison for <color=#FFA500>6</color>s and grants an additional <color=#FFA500>%s%%</color>%% Poison Enhancement. <color=#FFA500>15</color>-second cooldown. Cannot be stacked.",
    ["SkillDesc_5510004"]="Changes their master’s armor’s attribute to Poison for <color=#FFA500>6</color>s and grants a <color=#FFA500>%s%%</color>%% reduction in damage taken from Poison attribute monsters. <color=#FFA500>15</color>-second cooldown. Cannot be stacked.",
    ["SkillDesc_5510005"]="Detoxifies their master and grants Poison Immunity for <color=#FFA500>6</color>s. Recovers <color=#FFA500>%s%%</color> of master’s Max HP upon detoxification. <color=#FFA500>15</color>-second cooldown.",
    ["SkillDesc_5510006"]="Instantly detonates all virus carriers within a 6-meter radius, dealing Poison attribute Physical Damage equal to <color=#FFA500>%s%% x number of Poison stacks</color> x Physical Attack, while purifying all poison effects. <color=#FFA500>15</color>-second cooldown.",
    ["SkillDesc_5510007"]="Attacks an enemy with Venom Knife, dealing 2 stages of Poison attribute Physical Damage equal to <color=#FFA500>%s%%</color> Physical Attack. <color=#FFA500>6</color>-second cooldown.",
    ["SkillDesc_5510008"]="Casts Venom Dart, dealing Poison attribute Physical Damage equal to <color=#FFA500>%s%%</color> Physical Attack to a single enemy, and inflicting the target with Poison for <color=#FFA500>4</color>s. <color=#FFA500>12</color>-second cooldown.",
    ["SkillDesc_5510009"]="Casts Venom Mist in a 4-meter radius. Enemies who are enveloped by the mist suffer Poison attribute Physical Damage equal to <color=#FFA500>%s%%</color> of Physical Attack. The venom mist casts will disappear after <color=#FFA500>3</color>s. <color=#FFA500>12</color>-second cooldown.",
    ["SkillDesc_5510010"]="Inflicts Poison attribute Physical Damage equal to <color=#FFA500>%s%%</color> Physical Attack on enemies within a 3-meter radius. <color=#FFA500>18</color>-second countdown.",
    ["SkillDesc_5510011"]="Attacks an enemy with Venom Knife, dealing 2 instances of Poison attribute P.DMG equal to <color=#FFA500>%s%%</color> of P.ATK in total. If the target of the attack is already inflicted with Poison, they take an additional 50%% damage. Cooldown: <color=#FFA500>9</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_5510012"]="Casts Venom Dart, dealing Poison attribute Physical Damage equal to <color=#FFA500>%s%%</color> Physical Attack to a single enemy, inflicting the target with Poison for <color=#FFA500>4</color>s, and dealing an additional True Damage equal to <color=#FFA500>%s%%</color> max HP (does not apply to Boss monsters.) <color=#FFA500>15</color>-second cooldown.",
    ["SkillDesc_5510013"]="Casts Venom Mist in a 4-meter radius. Enemies who are enveloped by the mist suffer Poison attribute Physical Damage equal to <color=#FFA500>%s%%</color> of Physical Attack. At the same time, one stack of Poison will be inflicted per second, lasting <color=#FFA500>5</color>s. After <color=#FFA500>5</color>s, the Venom Mist cast will disappear. <color=#FFA500>15</color>-second cooldown.",
    ["SkillDesc_5510014"]="Inflicts Poison attribute Physical Damage equal to <color=#FFA500>%s%%</color> Physical Attack on enemies within a 3-meter radius and casts one stack of Poison on the target, which lasts for <color=#FFA500>5</color>s. <color=#FFA500>18</color>-second countdown.",
    ["SkillDesc_5510015"]="Increases their master’s Ghost attribute enhancement by <color=#FFA500>%s%%</color> for <color=#FFA500>6</color>s. <color=#FFA500>15</color>-second cooldown. Cannot be stacked.",
    ["SkillDesc_5510016"]="Reduces damage dealt to their master by Ghost attribute monsters by <color=#FFA500>%s%%</color> for <color=#FFA500>6</color>s, with a <color=#FFA500>15</color>-second cooldown. Cannot be stacked.",
    ["SkillDesc_5510017"]="Changes their master’s weapon’s attributes to Ghost attribute for <color=#FFA500>6</color>s and grants an additional <color=#FFA500>%s%%</color>%% Ghost attribute enhancement. <color=#FFA500>15</color>-second cooldown. Cannot be stacked.",
    ["SkillDesc_5510018"]="Changes their master’s armor’s attribute to Ghost attribute for <color=#FFA500>6</color>s and grants a <color=#FFA500>%s%%</color>%% reduction in damage taken from Ghost attribute monsters. <color=#FFA500>15</color>-second cooldown. Cannot be stacked.",
    ["SkillDesc_5510019"]="Grants their master a thin, transparent layer of napalm, which provides Damage Reduction equal to <color=#FFA500>%s%%</color> Final Damage Reduction for <color=#FFA500>6</color>s when taking any non-Ghost attribute damage. <color=#FFA500>15</color>-second cooldown. Cannot be stacked.",
    ["SkillDesc_5510020"]="Channels Ghost attribute magical power to achieve your optimal state and grants a <color=#FFA500>%s%%</color> chance of an immediate cooldown refresh after casting your pet’s skill.",
    ["SkillDesc_5510021"]="Inflicts an enemy with a thin, transparent layer of napalm, dealing Ghost attribute DMG equal to <color=#FFA500>%s%%</color> of Adaptive ATK. Cooldown: <color=#FFA500>6</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_5510022"]="Attacks an enemy at random with napalm 5 times, each dealing Ghost attribute DMG equal to <color=#FFA500>%s%%</color> of Adaptive ATK. Cooldown: <color=#FFA500>12</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_5510023"]="Summons a Soul Strike attack, dealing 5 stages of Ghost attribute DMG equal to <color=#FFA500>%s%%</color> of Adaptive ATK in total to a single enemy. Cooldown: <color=#FFA500>12</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_5510024"]="Unleashes a napalm attack, dealing Ghost attribute DMG equal to <color=#FFA500>%s%%</color> of Adaptive ATK to enemies within a 1.5-meter radius. Cooldown: <color=#FFA500>18</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_5510025"]="Inflicts a thin layer of napalm on a single enemy, dealing Ghost attribute DMG equal to <color=#FFA500>%s%%</color> of Adaptive ATK, with a <color=#FFA500>%s%%</color> chance of immobilization for <color=#FFA500>1</color> second (does not apply to Bosses). While immobilized, increases Ghost attribute DMG dealt by the pet or its master by 50%%. Cooldown: <color=#FFA500>9</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_5510026"]="Attacks an enemy at random with napalm 5 times, each dealing Ghost attribute DMG equal to <color=#FFA500>%s%%</color> of Adaptive ATK, with a <color=#FFA500>%s%%</color> chance of inflicting a Crit and cursing the target for <color=#FFA500>3</color> seconds. Cooldown: <color=#FFA500>15</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_5510027"]="Summons a Soul Strike, dealing 5 stages of Ghost attribute DMG equal to <color=#FFA500>%s%%</color> of Adaptive ATK in total to a single enemy, with a <color=#FFA500>%s%%</color> chance of dealing True DMG equal to 6%% of the Max HP (does not apply to Bosses). Cooldown: <color=#FFA500>15</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_5510028"]="Unleashes a napalm attack, dealing Ghost DMG equal to <color=#FFA500>%s%%</color> of Adaptive ATK to enemies within a 1.5-meter radius and reducing the target's HP Regen by <color=#FFA500>%s%%</color> (including HP Regen, HP Regen/5s, HP potion effects, and healing received) for <color=#FFA500>6</color> seconds. Cooldown: <color=#FFA500>24</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_5510029"]="Launches a strike against the target, dealing <color=#FFA500>%s%%</color> Wind attribute Adaptive Damage. <color=#FFA500>3</color>-second cooldown.",
    ["SkillDesc_5510030"]="Grants a <color=#FFA500>%s%%</color> chance of your pet inflicting either Silence, Freeze, Bleed, Sleep, or Curse on enemies within a 9-meter range, lasting for <color=#FFA500>3</color>s. <color=#FFA500>12</color>-second cooldown.",
    ["SkillDesc_5510031"]="Sticks out its forked tongue and sprays the target, dealing <color=#FFA500>%s%%</color> Water attribute Adaptive Damage. <color=#FFA500>3</color>-second cooldown.",
    ["SkillDesc_5510032"]="Toad grants Poison Skin to its master for 4s, and inflicts 1 stack of Poison on any attacker, lasting for <color=#FFA500>4</color>s. Can inflict up to 1 stack of Poison on the same target per second. <color=#FFA500>8</color>-second cooldown.",
    ["SkillDesc_5510033"]="Grants 1 stack of Phantom Flash to its master, increasing Final Dodge and Final Anti-Crit by <color=#FFA500>%s%%</color> for <color=#FFA500>4</color>s. <color=#FFA500>12</color>-second cooldown.",
    ["SkillDesc_5510034"]="Ghostring rises into the air before plunging down into the ground, inflicting Ghost attribute Magic Damage equal to <color=#FFA500>%s%%</color> Magic Attack on enemies within a 6-meter radius of its master and knocking back enemies by 3m. <color=#FFA500>12</color>-second cooldown.",
    ["SkillDesc_5510035"]="Tears savagely at the target, dealing <color=#FFA500>%s%%</color> Poison attribute Adaptive Damage. <color=#FFA500>3</color>-second cooldown.",
    ["SkillDesc_5510036"]="Tears savagely at the target, dealing <color=#FFA500>%s%%</color> Poison attribute Adaptive Damage and reducing the target’s HP Regen by <color=#FFA500>%s%%</color> (including HP Regen, HP Regen/5s, HP potion effects, and healing received) for <color=#FFA500>4</color>s. <color=#FFA500>12</color>-second cooldown.",
    ["SkillDesc_5510037"]="Emits a stench of putrefaction, with a <color=#FFA500>%s%%</color> chance of dealing Bleed to all enemies within a 3-meter range for <color=#FFA500>3</color>s. <color=#FFA500>12</color>-second cooldown.",
    ["SkillDesc_5510038"]="Ghoul transforms the surrounding 3-meter area into dead land, dealing True Damage equal to <color=#FFA500>%s%%</color> Max HP to enemies within range for <color=#FFA500>3</color>s (does not apply to Boss monsters). <color=#FFA500>12</color>-second cooldown.",
    ["SkillDesc_5510039"]="Clears all debuffs from its master, grants immunity to all debuffs for 3s (does not apply to certain Boss monster debuffs and debuffs that cannot be cleansed or are not affected by immunity), and recovers <color=#FFA500>%s%%</color> Max HP per second. <color=#FFA500>12</color>-second cooldown.",
    ["SkillDesc_5510040"]="Grants a <color=#FFA500>%s%%</color> chance of inflicting 1 stack of Poison on enemies within a 6-meter radius of the pet, lasting for <color=#FFA500>3</color>s. <color=#FFA500>12</color>-second cooldown.",
    ["SkillDesc_5510041"]="Grants an Ice Shield to its master for 5s, which inflicts 1 stack of Frost on each enemy attacker. Each stack of Frost reduces the target’s Final Attack Speed by <color=#FFA500>%s%%</color> and Final Haste by <color=#FFA500>%s%%</color> for<color=#FFA500>5</color>s. Can inflict up to 1 stack on the same target per second. <color=#FFA500>15</color>-second cooldown.",
    ["SkillDesc_5510042"]="Grants Petrification to its master, increasing PvP Final Physical Damage Reduction and PvP Final Magic Damage Reduction by <color=#FFA500>%s%%</color> for <color=#FFA500>6</color>s. <color=#FFA500>18</color>-second cooldown.",
    ["SkillDesc_5516001"]="Increases the master's Holy Enhancement by <color=#FFA500>%s%%</color> for <color=#FFA500>6</color> seconds. Cooldown: <color=#FFA500>15</color> seconds. This effect cannot stack.",
    ["SkillDesc_5516002"]="Reduces damage received by the master from Holy attribute monsters by <color=#FFA500>%s%%</color> for <color=#FFA500>6</color> seconds. Cooldown: <color=#FFA500>15</color> seconds. This effect cannot stack.",
    ["SkillDesc_5516003"]="Changes the master's weapon attribute into Holy and increases the master's Holy Enhancement by <color=#FFA500>%s%%</color> for <color=#FFA500>6</color> seconds. Cooldown: <color=#FFA500>15</color> seconds. This effect cannot stack.",
    ["SkillDesc_5516004"]="Changes the master armor attribute into Holy and reduces damage received by the master from Holy attribute monsters by <color=#FFA500>%s%%</color> for <color=#FFA500>6</color> seconds. Cooldown: <color=#FFA500>15</color> seconds. This effect cannot stack.",
    ["SkillDesc_5516005"]="Increases the master's damage dealt to Demon and Undead monsters by <color=#FFA500>%s%%</color> for <color=#FFA500>6</color> seconds. Cooldown: <color=#FFA500>15</color> seconds. This effect cannot stack.",
    ["SkillDesc_5516006"]="Removes the master's debuffs and grants immunity against all debuffs for <color=#FFA500>%s</color> seconds. Cooldown: <color=#FFA500>25</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_55176106"]="Spend 1 energy to grant 1 energy to the closest mechanical unit within a 5-meter radius.",
    ["SkillDesc_55176107"]="Increases your MSPD by 5 for 3 seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_55177101"]="Deals 100% Adaptive DMG to the current target.",
    ["SkillDesc_55177102"]="Deal damage equal to 30% of Max Hp to up to 8 enemies within a 3-meter radius (non-effective on bosses) (energy required).",
    ["SkillDesc_55177103"]="After a 3-second cast time, destroys and removes the boss' Mech Armor.",
    ["SkillDesc_5526001"]="Deals <color=#FFA500>%s%%</color> Adaptive Holy DMG to a single enemy target. Cooldown: <color=#FFA500>8</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_5526002"]="Deals <color=#FFA500>%s%%</color> Holy Attribute M.DMG to enemies within <color=#FFA500>4</color> meters of the master. Cooldown: <color=#FFA500>8</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_5526003"]="Summons two rays of divine light around the master and deals <color=#FFA500>%s%%</color> Adaptive Holy DMG to enemies within <color=#FFA500>3</color> meters every second for <color=#FFA500>12</color> seconds. Cooldown: <color=#FFA500>24</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_5526004"]="Summon a giant cross within a <color=#FFA500>4</color>-meter area around the target, inflicting <color=#FFA500>%s%%</color> Adaptive Holy DMG every second on all enemies within range for <color=#FFA500>9</color> seconds. Cooldown: <color=#FFA500>18</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_5536001"]="Deals <color=#FFA500>%s%%</color> Adaptive Holy DMG to a single enemy target and an extra <color=#FFA500>%s%%</color> to Undead and Demon monsters. Cooldown: <color=#FFA500>9</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_5536002"]="Deals <color=#FFA500>%s%%</color> Holy Attribute M.DMG to enemies within <color=#FFA500>4</color> meters of the master and increases Debuff Resistance by <color=#FFA500>%s</color>. Cooldown: <color=#FFA500>12</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_5536003"]="Summons two rays of divine light around the master and deals <color=#FFA500>%s%%</color> Adaptive Holy DMG to enemies within a <color=#FFA500>3</color>-meter range every second for <color=#FFA500>12</color> seconds. The damage dealt to the same enemy increases by <color=#FFA500>%s%%</color> each time. Cooldown: <color=#FFA500>24</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_5536004"]="Summons a giant cross within a <color=#FFA500>4</color>-meter area, inflicting <color=#FFA500>%s%%</color> Adaptive Holy DMG every second on all enemies within range and increases the damage to Undead and Demon enemies by <color=#FFA500>100%%</color> for <color=#FFA500>9</color> seconds. Reduces the Debuff Resistance of the enemies within range by <color=#FFA500>%s</color>. Cooldown: <color=#FFA500>18</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_6000001"]="Can be used to summon your partner to your side. You can only summon when you are in a normal location. When your partner is not online, dead or in a special location, such as in an instance, they will be unable to accept your summon.",
    ["SkillDesc_6000002"]="Can be used to teleport you to your partner. You can only teleport when both you and your partner are in a normal location. Cannot be used when in combat or when dead.",
    ["SkillDesc_6000003"]="When partners form a party and are within line of sight in the same location and dimension, increases Final Damage Reduction by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_6000004"]="When partners form a party and are within line of sight in the same location and dimension, increases EXP obtained from killing monsters by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_6000005"]="When partners form a party and are within line of sight in the same location and dimension, increases Zeny obtained from killing monsters by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_6000006"]="Can be used when in skill range of your partner. Consumes <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of your Max HP to heal your partner for <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of their Max HP. Cannot be used when your current HP is lower than the HP cost.",
    ["SkillDesc_6000007"]="Can be used when in skill range of your partner. Consumes <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of your Max SP to restore <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of your partner's Max SP. Cannot be used when your current SP is lower than the SP cost.",
    ["SkillDesc_6000008"]="Can be used when in skill range of your partner and your partner is dead. Consumes <color=#44afee>50%%</color> of your Max HP to resurrect and heal your partner for <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of their Max HP. Cannot be used when your current HP is lower than the HP cost.",
    ["SkillDesc_6010101"]="Increases the damage of <color=#44afee>Bash</color> by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_6010102"]="<color=#44afee>Bash</color> deals an additional weapon attribute P.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of P.ATK to the target and nearby enemies within <color=#44afee>3</color> meters of the target.",
    ["SkillDesc_6010103"]="Increases the Final Damage of <color=#44afee>Cart Revolution</color> by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_6010104"]="<color=#44afee>Cart Revolution</color> deals an additional weapon attribute P.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of P.ATK to the target and enemies within <color=#44afee>3</color> meters of the target.",
    ["SkillDesc_6010105"]="<color=#44afee>Bowling Bash</color> deals an additional weapon attribute P.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of P.ATK x (monster count - 1) to the targets hit.",
    ["SkillDesc_6010106"]="<color=#44afee>Bowling Bash</color> reduces the Final P.DEF of the targets hit by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> for <color=#44afee>4</color> seconds. Meanwhile, <color=#44afee>Bowling Bash</color> deals an additional weapon attribute P.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of P.ATK x (monster count - 1) to the targets hit.",
    ["SkillDesc_6010107"]="<color=#44afee>Mammonite</color> deals an additional weapon attribute P.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of P.ATK to the target and nearby enemies within <color=#44afee>3</color> meters of the target.",
    ["SkillDesc_6010108"]="When <color=#44afee>Mammonite</color> hits the target, for every <color=#44afee>1%%</color> loss of the target's Max HP, the P.ATK damage coefficient of <color=#44afee>Mammonite</color> is increased by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_6010109"]="Increases the damage of <color=#44afee>Shield Charge</color> by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_6010110"]="Increases the damage of <color=#44afee>Shield Charge</color> by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>. After being hit by <color=#44afee>Shield Charge</color>, the target will be marked for <color=#44afee>3</color> seconds, taking <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> increased damage from the caster's party members.",
    ["SkillDesc_6010111"]="Increases the damage of <color=#44afee>Shield Boomerang</color> by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_6010112"]="When <color=#44afee>Shield Boomerang</color> hits, reduces the Final P.DEF of the target by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> for <color=#44afee>3</color> seconds. Also has a <color=#44afee>10%%</color> chance of stunning the target for <color=#44afee>2</color> seconds. Increases the damage of <color=#44afee>Shield Boomerang</color> by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_6010113"]="Increases the damage of <color=#44afee>Back Stab</color> by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>. If the target is an <color=#44afee>MVP</color>, <color=#44afee>Mini</color>, or <color=#44afee>Instance Boss</color>, then the damage dealt is increased by an additional <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_6010114"]="Increases the damage of <color=#44afee>Holy Cross</color> by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>. <color=#44afee>Holy Cross</color> ignores <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of the target's Final P.DEF when dealing damage.",
    ["SkillDesc_6010115"]="Increases the damage of <color=#44afee>Snatcher</color> by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>. If the target is an <color=#44afee>MVP</color>, <color=#44afee>Mini</color>, or <color=#44afee>Instance Boss</color>, then the <color=#44afee>Snatcher</color> effect will now increase your highest stat by <color=#44afee>%s</color> points instead.",
    ["SkillDesc_6010116"]="Every time <color=#44afee>Grand Cross</color> deals damage, grants 1 stack of <color=#44afee>Judge</color> effect for <color=#44afee>2</color> seconds, up to 6 stacks. Each stack of <color=#44afee>Judge</color> increases your damage of <color=#44afee>Grand Cross</color> by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>. Upon reaching <color=#44afee>6</color> stacks, Grand Cross has a <color=#44afee>50%%</color> chance of dealing an additional weapon attribute P.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of P.ATK.",
    ["SkillDesc_6010301"]="Increases the damage of <color=#44afee>Soul Strike</color> by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_6010302"]="Increases the damage of <color=#44afee>Soul Strike</color> by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>. If the target is a Demon Monster, then the damage dealt is increased by an additional <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_6010303"]="Increases the damage of <color=#44afee>Cold Bolt</color>, <color=#44afee>Fire Bolt</color>, <color=#44afee>Lightning Bolt</color>, and <color=#44afee>Heaven's Drive</color> by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_6010304"]="Increases the damage of <color=#44afee>Cold Bolt</color>, <color=#44afee>Fire Bolt</color>, <color=#44afee>Lightning Bolt</color>, and <color=#44afee>Heaven's Drive</color> by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>. Meanwhile, these skills ignore <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of the target's Final M.DEF when dealing damage.",
    ["SkillDesc_6010305"]="Increases the healing effect and damage of <color=#44afee>Heal</color> by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_6010306"]="Increases the healing effect and damage of <color=#44afee>Heal</color> by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>. Meanwhile, if the target is an Undead or Demon Monster, then the damage dealt to them is increased by an additional <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_6010307"]="Increases the damage of <color=#44afee>Storm Gust</color> by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_6010308"]="Increases the damage of <color=#44afee>Storm Gust</color> by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>. While the target is under the frozen state in <color=#44afee>Storm Gust</color>, its damage received from you is increased by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_6010309"]="Increases the damage of <color=#44afee>Fire Wall</color> by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> and its blocking times by <color=#44afee>%s</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_6010310"]="Increases the damage of <color=#44afee>Fire Wall</color> by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> and its blocking times by <color=#44afee>%s</color>. While within the <color=#44afee>Fire Wall</color>, the caster's Final M.DMG Reduction is increased by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_6010311"]="Increases the damage coefficient of <color=#44afee>Lord of Vermilion</color> by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> x M.ATK.",
    ["SkillDesc_6010312"]="Increases the damage coefficient of <color=#44afee>Lord of Vermilion</color> by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> x M.ATK. Each time <color=#44afee>Lord of Vermilion</color> deals damage, you are granted a stack of <color=#44afee>Wrath of Thunder</color> (each AoE can only trigger this once). Each stack of <color=#44afee>Wrath of Thunder</color> increases your damage of <color=#44afee>Lord of Vermilion</color> by an additional <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> for <color=#44afee>3</color> seconds. Stacks up to <color=#44afee>5</color> times.",
    ["SkillDesc_6010313"]="Increases your <color=#44afee>Water, Fire, Earth, and Wind Attribute Enhancement</color> by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> after learning <color=#44afee>Recognized Spell</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_6010314"]="Increases the triggering chance of <color=#44afee>Double Casting</color> by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_6010315"]="Increases the damage of <color=#44afee>Meteor Storm</color> by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>. If a summoned meteor only hits one target, then its damage dealt is increased by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_6010316"]="Increases the damage of <color=#44afee>Chain Lightning</color> by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> and its bouncing times by <color=#44afee>%s</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_6010401"]="While under the effect of <color=#44afee>Increase Agility</color>, Increases the caster's ASPD by an additional <color=#44afee>%s</color> and Crit DMG Bonus by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_6010402"]="While under the effect of <color=#44afee>Gloria</color>, increases the caster's Final Crit by an additional <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_6010403"]="While under the effect of <color=#44afee>Gloria</color>, increases the caster's Final Crit by an additional <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> and Crit DMG Bonus by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_6010404"]="Increases the triggering chance of <color=#44afee>Expiatio</color> by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> and increases the damage coefficient of <color=#44afee>Expiatio</color> by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> x P.ATK.",
    ["SkillDesc_6010405"]="Increases the triggering chance of <color=#44afee>Expiatio</color> by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> and increases the damage coefficient of <color=#44afee>Expiatio</color> by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> x P.ATK. Also, the damage of <color=#44afee>Expiatio</color> can trigger crits now.",
    ["SkillDesc_6010406"]="While under the effect of <color=#44afee>Adrenaline Rush</color>, every 50 AGI of the caster increases their P.DMG Bonus by an additional <color=#44afee>%s</color> and their Final Crit by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_6010407"]="Increases the duration of <color=#44afee>Shadow Blade</color> by <color=#44afee>%s</color> seconds and its number of normal attacks by <color=#44afee>%s</color>. Increases your Crit DMG Bonus by an additional <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> and Final Hit by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> while under the effect of <color=#44afee>Shadow Blade</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_6010408"]="While under the effect of <color=#44afee>Aura Blade</color>, increases your Final Crit by an additional <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> and Crit DMG Bonus by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_6010409"]="Each time a crit is triggered by a normal attack, you are granted a stack of <color=#44afee>Focus</color> for <color=#44afee>3</color> seconds, up to <color=#44afee>5</color> stacks. Each stack of <color=#44afee>Focus</color> increases your Final Hit by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> and P.DMG Bonus by <color=#44afee>%s</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_6010410"]="After using <color=#44afee>Critical Explosion</color>, you will enter the <color=#44afee>Berserk</color> state for <color=#44afee>5</color> seconds. While in the <color=#44afee>Berserk</color> state, your normal attack damage is increased by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>. You will exit the state after dealing damage <color=#44afee>number of Spirit Spheres consumed on Critical Explosion x 3</color> times.",
    ["SkillDesc_6010501"]="Increases the damage of <color=#44afee>Magnum Break</color> by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_6010502"]="Increases the damage of <color=#44afee>Magnum Break</color> by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>. After casting <color=#44afee>Magnum Break</color>, normal attack damage is increased by an additional <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>, and its duration is increased by <color=#44afee>%s</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_6010503"]="While under the effect of <color=#44afee>Increase Agility</color>, increases the caster's ASPD by an additional <color=#44afee>%s</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_6010504"]="While under the effect of <color=#44afee>Increase Agility</color>, increases the caster's ASPD by an additional <color=#44afee>%s</color> and Final P.PEN by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_6010505"]="Increases the poison attribute damage inflicted by <color=#44afee>Enchant Poison</color> by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_6010506"]="Increases the poison attribute damage inflicted by <color=#44afee>Enchant Poison</color> by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>. Meanwhile, increases <color=#44afee>Enchant Poison</color>'s chance of poisoning the target by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_6010507"]="Increases <color=#44afee>Double Attack</color>'s trigger rate by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_6010508"]="Increases <color=#44afee>Double Attack</color>'s trigger rate by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>. Meanwhile, <color=#44afee>Double Attack</color> deals an additional weapon attribute P.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of P.ATK to the target and nearby enemies within <color=#44afee>3</color> meters of the target.",
    ["SkillDesc_6010509"]="While under the effect of <color=#44afee>Adrenaline Rush</color>, every 50 AGI of the caster increases their P.DMG Bonus by an additional <color=#44afee>%s</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_6010510"]="While under the effect of <color=#44afee>Adrenaline Rush</color>, every 50 AGI of the caster increases their P.DMG Bonus by an additional <color=#44afee>%s</color> and their Final Hit by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_6010511"]="Increases the duration of <color=#44afee>Shadow Blade</color> by <color=#44afee>%s</color> seconds and its number of normal attacks by <color=#44afee>%s</color>. Your ASPD will also be increased by an additional <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> during the effective period.",
    ["SkillDesc_6010512"]="Increases the duration of <color=#44afee>Shadow Blade</color> by <color=#44afee>%s</color> seconds and its number of normal attacks by <color=#44afee>%s</color>. Normal attack crits will not reduce the cooldown of <color=#44afee>Shadow Blade</color> anymore. Instead, the cooldown of <color=#44afee>Shadow Blade</color> will now be reduced by <color=#44afee>0.5</color> seconds every time a <color=#44afee>Double Attack</color> is triggered, and there is a <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> chance for this Double Attack to trigger a normal attack dealing <color=#44afee>eight times</color> the damage.",
    ["SkillDesc_6010513"]="While under the immune effect of <color=#44afee>Extraordinary</color>, increases your Final DMG Reduction by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> and MSPD by <color=#44afee>2</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_6010514"]="Extends the buff duration of <color=#44afee>Impositio Manus</color> by <color=#44afee>%s</color> second(s). Meanwhile, increases the caster's P.ATK by an additional <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> while under the effect of <color=#44afee>Impositio Manus</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_6010515"]="Each of your normal attacks has a <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> chance of detonating <color=#44afee>1</color> of your Spirit Spheres, dealing weapon attribute P.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of P.ATK to the target and nearby enemies within <color=#44afee>4</color> meters of the target. Consume 1 <color=#44afee>Spirit Sphere</color> when triggered.",
    ["SkillDesc_6010516"]="Each stack of <color=#44afee>Critical Explosion</color> increases the carrier's Final P.PEN by an additional <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> while its effect is active.",
    ["SkillDesc_6099801"]="Increases Mega Sonic Blow's damage coefficient by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> and its damage during critical hits by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_6099802"]="Spiral Stab deals <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> more damage to large targets.\nSpiral Stab deals <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> more damage to medium targets.\nSpiral Stab deals <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> more damage to small targets.",
    ["SkillDesc_6099803"]="Increases Napalm Vulcan Strike's damage coefficient by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>. While under the effect of Critical Explosion, <color=#44afee>%s</color> second(s) of fixed cooldown will be refunded if Napalm Vulcan Strike fails to refresh.",
    ["SkillDesc_6099804"]="If your elemental damage matches the enemy's armor attribute, ignore <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of the elemental resistance effect.",
    ["SkillDesc_6099805"]="Slows the attacker and reduces their PVP Final P.DMG RED and PVP Final M.DMG RED by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_6099807"]="When a debuff is added to you, there is a <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> chance to reduce the Final DMG Bonus of random target enemies within <color=#44afee>8</color> meters by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> for <color=#44afee>3</color> seconds. Can be triggered up to 1 time every 3 seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_6099808"]="When a debuff is added to you, there is a <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> chance to reduce the Final DMG Bonus of random target enemies within <color=#44afee>8</color> meters by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> for <color=#44afee>3</color> seconds. Can be triggered up to 1 time every 3 seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_6099901"]="While under the effect of <color=#44afee>Cart Boost</color>, increases your MSPD by <color=#44afee>%s</color> and Final Flee by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>. Also makes you immune to <color=#44afee>Slow</color> and <color=#44afee>Immobilize</color> states.",
    ["SkillDesc_6099902"]="Increases the blocking times of <color=#44afee>Pneuma</color> and <color=#44afee>Safety Wall</color> by <color=#44afee>%s</color>. Each successful block of <color=#44afee>Pneuma</color> and <color=#44afee>Safety Wall</color> grants the party members within the barrier a stack of <color=#44afee>Twilight Charge</color> for <color=#44afee>5</color> seconds, up to <color=#44afee>3</color> stacks. Each stack of <color=#44afee>Twilight Charge</color> increases its carrier's Adaptive Attack by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_6099903"]="Increases the triggering chance of <color=#44afee>Guard</color> by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> and the maximum damage blocking value by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> x Adaptive Attack.",
    ["SkillDesc_6099904"]="Reduces the damage received from other Adventurers' characters by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_6110101"]="When using normal attacks, there is a <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> chance to trigger Bash. When Bash is triggered through normal attacks, Fatal Blow will not be applied.",
    ["SkillDesc_6110102"]="Decreases the variable cooldown of Bowling Bash by <color=#44afee>%s</color> seconds and its fixed cooldown by <color=#44afee>%s</color> seconds. Restores <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of your Max HP.",
    ["SkillDesc_6110103"]="When using normal attacks, there is a <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> chance to trigger Bash. Also decreases the target's Final Physical Defense by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>. Stacks up to <color=#44afee>4</color> times. Lasts <color=#44afee>6</color> seconds. When Bash is triggered through normal attacks, Fatal Blow will not be applied.",
    ["SkillDesc_6110104"]="Decreases the variable cooldown of Bowling Bash by <color=#44afee>%s</color> seconds and its fixed cooldown by <color=#44afee>%s</color> seconds. Also deals Neutral attribute P.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of your Max HP.",
    ["SkillDesc_6110105"]="When Endure is active, Physical Reflect Damage is increased by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> and Magic Reflect Damage is increased by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>. This effect disappears when Endure is removed.",
    ["SkillDesc_6110106"]="Decreases the variable cooldown of Auto Counter by <color=#44afee>%s</color> seconds and increases its Shield Effect by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_6110107"]="When Endure is active, Physical Reflect Damage is increased by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> and Magic Reflect Damage is increased by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>. This effect disappears when Endure is removed. In addition, PVP Final Physical Damage Reduction is increased by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> and PVP Final Magic Damage Reduction is increased by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>. This effect disappears when Endure is removed.",
    ["SkillDesc_6110108"]="Decreases the variable cooldown of Auto Counter by <color=#44afee>%s</color> seconds, and increases its Shield Effect by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> and its Counter Effect by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_6110109"]="When Berserk is active, your Bonus Heal Received is increased by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_6110110"]="When Self-Ignite is active, Max HP is increased by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_6110111"]="When Berserk is active, your Bonus Heal Received is increased by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>, and your Physical Lifesteal is increased by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_6110112"]="When Self-Ignite takes effect, Max HP is increased by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>, PVP Debuff Duration Reduction is increased by <color=#44afee>%s</color>, and PVP Debuff Resistance is increased by <color=#44afee>%s</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_6110114"]="Increases the physical attack damage coefficient and Max HP damage coefficient of Impact Blade by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> and <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> respectively.",
    ["SkillDesc_6110116"]="Increases the Final Physical Defense and Final Magic Defense of each stack of Indestructible by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> each and extends its duration by <color=#44afee>%s</color> seconds. While the shield is active, increases your own Final PVP Physical Damage Reduction and Final PVP Magic Damage Reduction by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> each.",
    ["SkillDesc_6110151"]="When Guard is triggered, your HP recovers by <color=#FFA500>%s%%</color> of your Max HP.",
    ["SkillDesc_6110152"]="Increases Shield Charge of your Max HP Damage Coefficient by <color=#FFA500>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_6110153"]="When Guard is triggered, <color=#FFA500>%s%%</color> of your HP is recovered, and you deal <color=#FFA500>%s%%</color> of the effect recovery in damage to the attacker.",
    ["SkillDesc_6110154"]="Increases Shield Charge of your Max HP damage coefficient by <color=#FFA500>%s%%</color> and reduces the target's Stun Resistance by <color=#FFA500>%s%%</color> and PVP Debuff Resistance by <color=#FFA500>%s</color> for <color=#FFA500>3</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_6110155"]="Increases Shield Reflect's reflection coefficient by <color=#FFA500>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_6110156"]="Increases your Max HP Damage Coefficient of Shield Boomerang by <color=#FFA500>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_6110157"]="Increases the reflection coefficient of Shield Reflect by <color=#FFA500>%s%%</color> and reduces the attacker's PVP Debuff Duration Reduction by <color=#FFA500>%s</color> for <color=#FFA500>3</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_6110158"]="Increases your Max HP Damage Coefficient of Shield Boomerang by <color=#FFA500>%s%%</color>, and <color=#FFA500>%s</color> projectile number.",
    ["SkillDesc_6110159"]="When using Defending Aura, additionally reduces the ranged Physical Damage taken by party members by <color=#FFA500>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_6110160"]="After using Earth Drive, Final Physical Damage Bonus is increased by <color=#FFA500>%s%%</color> for <color=#FFA500>15</color>s.",
    ["SkillDesc_6110161"]="When using Defending Aura, additionally reduce <color=#FFA500>%s%%</color> of ranged Physical Damage taken by all party members, while <color=#FFA500>%s%%</color> of all damage taken by party members' is converted into healing you.",
    ["SkillDesc_6110162"]="After using Earth Drive, PVP Final Physical Damage Bonus is increased by <color=#FFA500>%s%%</color> for <color=#FFA500>15</color>s.",
    ["SkillDesc_6110163"]="Increases Shield Press of your Max HP Damage Coefficient by <color=#FFA500>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_6110164"]="Guardian Shield damage bonus effect is increased by <color=#FFA500>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_6110165"]="After using Devotion, while it is active, increases the Final Damage Reduction of all party members by <color=#FFA500>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_6110166"]="Increase the King's Grace shield value by <color=#FFA500>%s%%</color>, and while active, increases all party members' PVP Final Physical Damage Reduction by <color=#FFA500>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_6130101"]="After triggering Battle Will through a normal attack, Final Physical Damage Bonus is increased by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>. Stacks up to <color=#44afee>4</color> times. Lasts <color=#44afee>3</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_6130102"]="When Sword Speed Boost is active, Final ASPD is increased by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_6130103"]="After triggering Battle Will through a normal attack, PVP Final Physical Damage Bonus is additionally increased by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> and Movement Speed is increased by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>. Can be stacked up to <color=#44afee>4</color> times, lasting <color=#44afee>3</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_6130104"]="When Sword Speed Boost is active, Physical Lifesteal is increased by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>, and PVP Debuff Resistance is increased by <color=#44afee>%s</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_6130105"]="When Aura Blade is active, Final Crit is increased by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> and Final Hit is increased by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_6130106"]="When Weapon Blocking is active, trigger rate is increased by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_6130107"]="When Aura Blade is active, Final Crit is increased by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>, Crit Damage Bonus is increased by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>, and Final Hit is increased by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_6130108"]="When Weapon Blocking is active, trigger rate is increased by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>. Also extends the effect's duration for <color=#44afee>%s</color> seconds after blocking.",
    ["SkillDesc_6130109"]="Increases Double Blow's trigger rate by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_6130110"]="When Head Crush is active, Final Physical Damage Bonus is increased by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_6130111"]="Increases Double Blow's trigger rate by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> and its damage coefficient by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_6130112"]="When Head Crush is active, increase the PVP Final P.DMG Bonus and PVP Final P.DEF Reduction by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> and PVP Debuff Reduction by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_6130113"]="Increases the damage coefficient of Dragon Breath - Fire, Dragon Breath - Water, and Inverse Scale by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_6130114"]="Increases the damage coefficient of Wind Cutter's Crit Damage Bonus by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> and Bonus Physical Damage by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_6130115"]="Increases the shared damage coefficient of Death Bound by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_6130116"]="Increases the Final Hit and Final Crit increase coefficient inflicted by Dark Flame Sword to the target by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> and <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>, respectively. Increases the duration of the Dark Flame Sword effect on yourself by <color=#44afee>%s</color> seconds. Each stack of Dark Flame Sword increases the target's PVP Final P.DMG Bonus by an additional <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_6130151"]="After using Cyclone Strike, Final Physical Damage Bonus is increased by <color=#FFA500>%s%%</color>, for a max of <color=#FFA500>%s</color> stacks for <color=#FFA500>%s</color>s.",
    ["SkillDesc_6130152"]="When using increased Weapon Speed, Final Attack Speed is increased by <color=#FFA500>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_6130153"]="After using Cyclone Strike, the PVP Final Physical Damage Bonus is increased by <color=#FFA500>%s%%</color> for a max of <color=#FFA500>%s</color> stacks for <color=#FFA500>%s</color>s. Increases your PVP Final Physical Damage Reduction by <color=#FFA500>%s%%</color> for <color=#FFA500>3</color>s.",
    ["SkillDesc_6130154"]="When using increased Weapon Speed, Physical Lifesteal is increased by <color=#FFA500>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_6130155"]="When using Battle Intent, Final Crit is increased by <color=#FFA500>%s%%</color> and Final Hit is increased by <color=#FFA500>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_6130156"]="After using Sacrifice, your HP limit is increased by <color=#FFA500>%s%%</color> for 5s.",
    ["SkillDesc_6130157"]="When using Battle Intent, Crit Damage Bonus is increased by <color=#FFA500>%s%%</color> and Final Hit is increased by <color=#FFA500>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_6130158"]="After using Sacrifice, your Max HP is increased by <color=#FFA500>%s%%</color>, and your PVP Debuff Duration Reduction and PVP Debuff Resistance are increased by <color=#FFA500>%s</color> for <color=#FFA500>10</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_6130159"]="Increases your Max HP damage effect from <color=#FFA500>%s%%</color> Charge Up.",
    ["SkillDesc_6130160"]="When using Fearless Charge, Final Physical Damage Bonus is increased by <color=#FFA500>%s%%</color> for <color=#FFA500>15</color>s. Increases own Fearless Charge Max HP damage effect by <color=#FFA500>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_6130161"]="Increases your Max HP damage effect of <color=#FFA500>%s%%</color> Charge Up, dealing additional True Damage that is <color=#FFA500>%s%%</color> of the target's Max HP. (Additional effect is not effective on Mini, MVP, and bosses.)",
    ["SkillDesc_6130162"]="When using Fearless Charge, PVP Final Physical Damage Bonus is increased by <color=#FFA500>%s%%</color> for <color=#FFA500>15</color>s. Also increases own Fearless Charge Max HP damage effect by <color=#FFA500>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_6130163"]="After using Trample, your HP limit is increased by <color=#FFA500>%s%%</color> for <color=#FFA500>10</color>s.",
    ["SkillDesc_6130164"]="Increases your Holy attribute damage dealt to Earth, Fire, Water, and Wind attribute enemies by an additional <color=#FFA500>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_6130165"]="While Life Vow is active, it reduces the targets Final Physical Damage Reduction by <color=#FFA500>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_6130166"]="While Inspiration is active, every normal attach increases your PVP Final Physical Damage Reduction by <color=#FFA500>%s%%</color>, and can be stacked <color=#FFA500>%s</color> times for <color=#FFA500>5</color>s. Each time the target takes normal damage, there is an additional reduction of PVP Final Physical Damage Bonus that is <color=#FFA500>%s%%</color>, can be stacked <color=#FFA500>%s</color> times for <color=#FFA500>5</color>s.",
    ["SkillDesc_6130301"]="Decreases the fixed cooldown of Spear Stab by <color=#44afee>%s</color> seconds, and has a <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> chance to make the target bleed for <color=#44afee>6</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_6130302"]="Increases the damage coefficient of Pierce by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>, decreases the fixed cooldown of Pierce by <color=#44afee>%s</color> seconds, and decreases the target's Final P.DMG RED by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> for <color=#44afee>6</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_6130303"]="Decreases the fixed cooldown of Spear Stab by <color=#44afee>%s</color> seconds, and decreases the target's healing received by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> (including the Lifesteal effect) for <color=#44afee>6</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_6130304"]="Increases the damage coefficient of Pierce by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>, decreases the fixed cooldown of Pierce by <color=#44afee>%s</color> seconds, and decreases the target's PVP Final P.DMG RED by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> for <color=#44afee>6</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_6130305"]="When using Spear Boomerang, there is a <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> chance to inflict the same effect on enemies along its path.",
    ["SkillDesc_6130306"]="Decreases the fixed cooldown of Spiral Pierce by <color=#44afee>%s</color> seconds, and increases your Final Physical Damage Bonus by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>. Stacks up to <color=#44afee>4</color> times. Lasts <color=#44afee>12</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_6130307"]="When using Spear Boomerang, there is a <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> chance to inflict the same effect on enemies along its path. Also decreases the target's Final Physical Defense by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> for <color=#44afee>6</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_6130308"]="Decreases the fixed cooldown of Spiral Pierce by <color=#44afee>%s</color> seconds, and increases your PVP Final Physical Damage Bonus by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>. Stacks up to <color=#44afee>4</color> times. Lasts <color=#44afee>12</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_6130309"]="Decreases the fixed cooldown of Joint Beat by <color=#44afee>%s</color> seconds, and has a <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> chance to apply the Weapon Breakage and Armor Breakage states to the target for <color=#44afee>6</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_6130310"]="Decreases the fixed cooldown of Brandish Spear by <color=#44afee>%s</color> seconds, and has a <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> chance to inflict the same effect on enemies within <color=#44afee>3</color> meters of the target.",
    ["SkillDesc_6130311"]="Decreases the fixed cooldown of Joint Beat by <color=#44afee>%s</color> seconds, and deals true damage equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of the target's Max HP (not effective against Bosses, MVPs, and Minis).",
    ["SkillDesc_6130312"]="Decreases the fixed cooldown of Brandish Spear by <color=#44afee>%s</color>, and has a <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> chance to inflict the same effect on enemies within <color=#44afee>3</color> meters of the target, ignoring <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of their Stun Resistance and additionally stunning them for <color=#44afee>2</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_6130314"]="Increases the damage coefficient of Phantom Strike by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>. Once the skill hits the enemy, all your skill cooldowns will be reduced by <color=#44afee>1.5</color> seconds. This effect lasts <color=#44afee>3</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_6130316"]="Increases the damage coefficient of Hundred Spears by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>. Each sting causes the target to lose an additional <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of their Max HP (has no effect on Minis, MVPs, and bosses).",
    ["SkillDesc_6130351"]="When using Holy Cross to deal damage, there is a <color=#FFA500>%s%%</color> chance to inflict additional damage to the target that is <color=#FFA500>%s%%</color> of this damage.",
    ["SkillDesc_6130352"]="Increases the Damage Coefficient of Grand Cross by <color=#FFA500>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_6130353"]="When using Holy Cross to deal damage, there is a <color=#FFA500>%s%%</color> chance to add <color=#FFA500>%s%%</color> damage, and lower the target's Final Physical Penetration by <color=#FFA500>%s%%</color> for <color=#FFA500>6</color>s.",
    ["SkillDesc_6130354"]="Increases the effect of Judex by <color=#FFA500>%s%%</color>, while reducing the Movement Speed of targets in range of the skill by <color=#FFA500>%s%%</color> for <color=#FFA500>6</color>s.",
    ["SkillDesc_6130355"]="Pressure increases the target's Damage Coefficient from damage taken by you and your team by an additional <color=#FFA500>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_6130356"]="Increases Moon Slasher damage base bonus by <color=#FFA500>%s%%</color>, and <color=#FFA500>%s%%</color> of every unit's bonus multiplier.",
    ["SkillDesc_6130357"]="Pressure can be stacked an additional <color=#FFA500>%s</color> stack(s), and while active, reduces the target's Debuff Resistance by <color=#FFA500>%s</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_6130358"]="Increases the damage coefficient of Moon Slasher by <color=#FFA500>%s%%</color>, and <color=#FFA500>%s%%</color> of every unit's bonus skill effect, reducing the PVP Debuff Resistance of targets within range by <color=#FFA500>%s</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_6130359"]="Increases the Skill Coefficient of Punish by <color=#FFA500>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_6130360"]="When learning Pinpoint Attack, the player deals skill damage while also dealing damage that is <color=#FFA500>1%%</color> of Max HP to the target, triggering 1 time every <color=#FFA500>%s</color>s. (No effect on Mini, MVP, and bosses.)",
    ["SkillDesc_6130361"]="Increases the Skill Coefficient of Punish by <color=#FFA500>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_6130362"]="When learning Pinpoint Attack, the player deals skill damage while also dealing damage that is <color=#FFA500>2%%</color> of Max HP to the target, triggering 1 time every <color=#FFA500>%s</color>s. (No effect on Mini, MVP, and bosses.)",
    ["SkillDesc_6130363"]="After using Trample, deal <color=#FFA500>%s%%</color> of Max HP in True Damage to enemy targets within range. (No effect on Mini, MVP, and bosses.)",
    ["SkillDesc_6130365"]="Increases the charge damage coefficient and Bleed Damage Coefficient of Over Brand by <color=#FFA500>%s%%</color>, reducing <color=#FFA500>%s</color>s of fixed cooldown, while reducing target's Bleed resistance by <color=#FFA500>%s%%</color> for <color=#FFA500>5</color>s.",
    ["SkillDesc_6130366"]="Increases the Damage Coefficient of Ray of Genesis by <color=#FFA500>%s%%</color>, reducing cooldown by <color=#FFA500>%s</color>s.",
    ["SkillDesc_6199801"]="Increases the chance for normal attacks to consume energy sword by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>. Reduces energy sword's replenish time by <color=#44afee>%s</color> second(s) and its minimum replenish interval by <color=#44afee>%s</color> second(s).",
    ["SkillDesc_6199802"]="Adds <color=#44afee>2</color> extra piercing strikes. While charging, increases your chance to gain <color=#44afee>1</color> extra stack by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>. Unused attempts become charge stacks at the end of Charging Pierce.",
    ["SkillDesc_6199803"]="Allied Adventurers who are not mounted within <color=#44afee>6</color> meters of Vigor gain <color=#44afee>%s</color> MSPD and ignore enemies' ASPD and Haste reduction effects for <color=#44afee>5</color> seconds. This effect remains even after Vigor is absorbed.",
    ["SkillDesc_6199804"]="After casting Dragonic Aura, enter <color=#44afee>Awakened Dragon Soul</color> state for <color=#44afee>10</color> seconds. Attacking MVP, MINI, and Boss units deals corresponding attribute P.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of your Max HP, triggering up to <color=#44afee>5</color> times.",
    ["SkillDesc_6199805"]="Gaining a Rage stack increases your Sacrifice count by <color=#44afee>1</color>. Each Rage stack increases Final P.DMG Bonus by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>. For every <color=#44afee>2</color> Shadow Equipment skill levels increased, the max Rage stacks increase by <color=#44afee>1</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_6199806"]="Casting this skill applies Holy Mark to the target, reducing their Holy Resistance by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>. Holy Mark lasts for <color=#44afee>5</color> seconds. Attacking them with Holy DMG has a <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> chance to fully restore your Sacred Force. triggers up to <color=#44afee>2</color> times while Holy Mark is active.",
    ["SkillDesc_6199807"]="Reduces your Max HP consumption by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_6199808"]="For every <color=#44afee>2</color> Shadow Equipment skill levels increased, you gain <color=#44afee>1</color> extra Engage effect. When the Engage effect is triggered, all party members' Final P.DMG Bonus is increased by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_6199809"]="Increases Final Anti-Crit by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> and Crit DMG Reduction by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_6199810"]="Increases your Blind, Resistance, Bleed Resistance, and Poison Resistance by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_6199811"]="When equipping a two-handed sword, every <color=#44afee>%s</color> STR increases the damage coefficient of Storm Slash by <color=#44afee>1%%</color>, up to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_6199812"]="Enchant Blade ignores <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of the target's corresponding elemental resistance effect.",
    ["SkillDesc_6199813"]="Lord's Aura increases Final P.DMG Bonus by an additional <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_6199901"]="Party members gain Increase HP Recovery. When their HP is decreased to <color=#44afee>30%%</color> of Max HP, they restore HP equal to <color=#44afee>4%%</color> of Max HP per second for <color=#44afee>%s</color> seconds. This effect has a <color=#44afee>60</color>-second internal cooldown. Grants additional healing to self.",
    ["SkillDesc_6199902"]="After using Steel Heart, all party members gain this effect, increasing Physical Reflect Damage by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> and Magic Reflect Damage by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> while this effect is active.",
    ["SkillDesc_6199903"]="Can use Charge Attack a total of <color=#44afee>%s</color> times. After each time you use it, you gain <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> PVP Final Physical Damage Bonus. Stacks up to <color=#44afee>%s</color> times. Lasts <color=#44afee>18</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_6199904"]="After using Concentration, damage coefficient is increased by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>. Party members gain Control Immunity for the duration.",
    ["SkillDesc_6199951"]="When you are Party Leader, Prestige increases all party members Max HP by <color=#FFA500>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_6199952"]="Holy Cure increases party member targets' Final Dodge by <color=#FFA500>%s%%</color>, and Final Anti-Crit by <color=#FFA500>%s%%</color> for <color=#FFA500>5</color>s.",
    ["SkillDesc_6199953"]="Gospel odds increase by <color=#FFA500>%s%%</color>, and skill effects increase by <color=#FFA500>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_6199954"]="When you are Party Leader, Prestige increases all party members' normal attack damage by <color=#FFA500>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_6199955"]="When you are Party Leader, Prestige increases all party members' Final Physical Damage Reduction by <color=#FFA500>%s%%</color>.",
