    ["SkillDesc_6210311"]="Increases the damage coefficient of Judex by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>, and deals true damage equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of the target's Max Hp to a single target (not effective against Bosses, MVPs, and Minis).",
    ["SkillDesc_6210312"]="Increases the damage coefficient of Magnus Exorcismus by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>, and every instance of damage dealt has a <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> chance to immobilize the target for <color=#44afee>1</color> second.",
    ["SkillDesc_6210314"]="Increases the damage coefficient of Adoramus by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> and the healing to damage conversion coefficient by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_6210316"]="Increases the damage coefficient of the first phase of Light Shackle by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> and causes the target to lose an additional <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of their Max HP (has no effect on Minis, MVPs, and bosses).",
    ["SkillDesc_6210401"]="When Blessing is active, Final ASPD is additionally increased by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_6210402"]="Increases Expiatio's trigger rate by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> and its additional bonus effect by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_6210403"]="When Blessing is active, Final ASPD is additionally increased by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>, and Final Physical Damage Bonus is additionally increased by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_6210404"]="Increases Expiatio's trigger rate by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> and its additional bonus effect by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>. Also deals true damage equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of the target's Max HP (not effective against Bosses, MVPs, and Minis).",
    ["SkillDesc_6210405"]="When Gloria is active, Final Crit is additionally increased by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> and Final Hit is increased by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_6210406"]="Increases the normal attack damage enhancement effect of Holy Strike by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_6210407"]="When Gloria is active, Final Crit is additionally increased by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>, Crit Damage Bonus is increased by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>, and Final Hit is increased by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_6210408"]="Increases the normal attack damage enhancement effect of Holy Strike by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>, and increases the damage enhancement effect of Holy Marks by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_6210409"]="After learning Demon Bane, Final Physical Damage Bonus is additionally increased by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_6210410"]="Normal attacks have a <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> chance of triggering Sacred Hammer.",
    ["SkillDesc_6210411"]="After learning Demon Bane, PVP Final Physical Damage Bonus is additionally increased by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_6210412"]="Increases the damage coefficient of Sacred Hammer by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>. Normal attacks have a <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> chance of triggering Sacred Hammer.",
    ["SkillDesc_6210413"]="Increases the duration of Holy Spirit Protection by <color=#44afee>%s</color> seconds and increases the healing coefficient by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_6210414"]="Increases the damage coefficient of Ascalon by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_6210415"]="Increases the damage coefficient of Duple Light by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> and the incremental damage coefficient on the same target by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_6210416"]="Increases the Crit DMG Bonus and Final P.PEN of Holy Hammer by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> and its stack limit by <color=#44afee>%s</color>. Each stack also increases the PVP Final P.DMG Bonus by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_6210701"]="Decreases the fixed cooldown of Light Blessing by <color=#44afee>%s</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_6210702"]="Decreases the fixed cooldown of Magnificat by <color=#44afee>%s</color> seconds. While in effect, Final Magic Damage Bonus is increased by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_6210703"]="Decreases the fixed cooldown of Light Blessing by <color=#44afee>%s</color> seconds. While in effect, healing per second is increased by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> × M.ATK.",
    ["SkillDesc_6210704"]="Decreases the fixed cooldown of Magnificat by <color=#44afee>%s</color> seconds. While in effect, PVP Final Magic Damage Bonus is increased by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_6210705"]="Decreases the fixed cooldown of Angelus by <color=#44afee>%s</color> seconds. While in effect, Final Physical Defense is increased by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> and Final Magic Defense is increased by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_6210706"]="While under the effect of Suffragium, increases Final P.PEN by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> and Final M.PEN by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_6210707"]="Decreases the fixed cooldown of Angelus by <color=#44afee>%s</color> seconds. While in effect, PVP Final Physical Damage Reduction is increased by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> and PVP Final Magic Damage Reduction is increased by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_6210708"]="While under the effect of Suffragium, increases Final DMG Bonus by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> and Final DMG Reduction by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_6210709"]="Increases the healing coefficient of Sanctuary by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_6210710"]="Increases the healing coefficient of Coluceo Heal by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>, and increases Debuff Duration Reduction by <color=#44afee>%s</color> and Debuff Resistance by <color=#44afee>%s</color>. Lasts <color=#44afee>4</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_6210711"]="Increases the healing coefficient of Sanctuary by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>, and its damage coefficient by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_6210712"]="Increases the healing coefficient of Coluceo Heal by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>, and increases PVP Debuff Duration Reduction by <color=#44afee>%s</color> and PVP Debuff Resistance by <color=#44afee>%s</color>. Lasts <color=#44afee>4</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_6210714"]="Increases the duration of Oper Auditorium by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> and Bonus Heal by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_6210716"]="Increases HP recovery of Epiclesis by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>. While the Sigil of the Life Tree is active, increases Final PVP Physical Damage Reduction and Final PVP Magic Damage Reduction by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> each.",
    ["SkillDesc_6231151"]="Additional increase in the Damage Coefficient of the Investigate skill by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_6231152"]="Increase the skill Damage Coefficient of Spirit Wave by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_6231153"]="Increase the skill Damage Coefficient of Investigate by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>. Every <color=#44afee>1%%</color> of the Final Physical DEF of the target additionally increases the Investigate damage effect by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_6231154"]="Increases the skill Damage Coefficient of the Spirit Wave by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>, and each time you deal damage to a target, there is a <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> chance to obtain 1 Spirit Sphere.",
    ["SkillDesc_6231155"]="Finger Offensive has a <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> chance to deal an additional <color=#44afee>100%%</color> of this skill's damage.",
    ["SkillDesc_6231156"]="Increases the Bonus Damage effect of Power Velocity by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_6231157"]="Finger Offensive has a <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> chance to deal an additional <color=#44afee>100%%</color> of this skill's damage. Every 500 P.DEF or M.DEF (whichever is higher) of the target increases the current damage by an additional <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>. When the increased damage exceeds <color=#44afee>600%%</color>, this skill does not consume Spirit Spheres.",
    ["SkillDesc_6231158"]="Increases the extra damage effect of Power Velocity by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>, and increases the chance of gaining Spirit Spheres by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> when your skill deals damage to a target hit by Power Velocity.",
    ["SkillDesc_6231159"]="After learning Spirit Sphere Attack, your Final Physical Damage Bonus is increased by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_6231160"]="Increase the skill damage of Blade Stop by an additional <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>. Furthermore, every <color=#44afee>1%%</color> point of the target's Final P.DEF or M.DEF (whichever is greater) additionally increases Blade Stop's damage by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_6231161"]="After learning Spirit Sphere Attack, your PVP Final Physical Damage Bonus is increased by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_6231162"]="Additional increase in the skill damage effect of Blade Stop by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>. Every <color=#44afee>1%%</color> of the target's PVP final physical damage or magical damage (whichever greater) reduction increases every used Spirit Sphere damage effect by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_6231163"]="Increases the chance of Assimilate Power returning Spirit Spheres by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_6231164"]="The max stacks of Body Relocation is increased, and each time the skills hits gives a <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> chance to obtain <color=#44afee>1</color> Body Relocation stack (no Spirit Sphere) charging, for a max of <color=#44afee>3</color> stacks. Every time Body Relocation is used, your Final Physical Penetration is increased by an additional <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>, and can be stacked <color=#44afee>3</color> times. Lasts <color=#44afee>12</color>s.",
    ["SkillDesc_6231165"]="While Steel Body is active, there's a <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> chance to increase the current number and upper limit of Spirit Sphere by <color=#44afee>1</color> each time you are hit, increasing your damage dealt by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> for <color=#44afee>6</color> seconds. The Spirit Sphere's upper limit lasts <color=#44afee>3</color> seconds and refreshes each time it's increased.",
    ["SkillDesc_6231166"]="Tiger Cannon deals an additional <color=#44afee>50%%</color> true damage to targets below <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of their Max HP (only has a <color=#44afee>0.1%%</color> effect on MVP, Mini, and bosses), and has a <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> chance to cast the next Tiger Cannon without chanting.",
    ["SkillDesc_6231251"]="After using Triple Attack, Final Attack Speed is increased by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> for <color=#44afee>7</color>s, for a max of <color=#44afee>9</color> stacks.",
    ["SkillDesc_6231252"]="After learning Torrential Rain, Final Crit is increased by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_6231253"]="After using Triple Attack, Crit Damage Bonus percentage is increased by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>, and <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of Final Hit for <color=#44afee>7</color>s, for a max of <color=#44afee>9</color> stacks.",
    ["SkillDesc_6231254"]="While using Torrential Rain, Physical Lifesteal is increased by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_6231255"]="Skill Damage Coefficient of Combo Finish is increased by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_6231256"]="Skill Damage Coefficient of Tiger Knuckle Fist is increased by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>, and your Crit Damage Bonus percentage is increased by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> for <color=#44afee>7</color>s.",
    ["SkillDesc_6231257"]="Skill Damage Coefficient of Combo Finish is increased by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>, and your Final Physical Damage Bonus is increased by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> for <color=#44afee>7</color>s.",
    ["SkillDesc_6231258"]="Skill Damage Coefficient of Tiger Knuckle Fist is increased by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>, and your PVP Final Physical Damage Bonus is increased by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> for <color=#44afee>7</color>s.",
    ["SkillDesc_6231259"]="Damage increase effect of Crush is increased by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_6231260"]="Increased the damage dealt by Asura Strike by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>, and ignores <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of the target's Final Physical Damage Reduction.",
    ["SkillDesc_6231261"]="Improve damage boost effect of the crush state of<color=#44afee>%s%%</color>, the duration extend for another <color=#44afee>%s</color>seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_6231262"]="Increases damage dealt by Asura Strike by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>, and ignores <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of the target's PVP Final Physical Damage Reduction, while dealing additional true damage up to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of the target's Max HP. (This effect is immune to the bosses, MVP, and Mini percentage parameter.)",
    ["SkillDesc_6231263"]="Extends the duration of Cursed by <color=#44afee>%s</color> second(s) and reduces the target's PVP Debuff Resistance by <color=#44afee>%s</color> and Immobilization Resistance by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_6231264"]="The max stacks of Body Relocation is increased, and each Crit has a <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> chance to obtain 1 Body Relocation stack (no Spirit Sphere) charging, for a max of <color=#44afee>3</color> stacks. Every time Body Relocation is used, your Final Crit and Final Hit are increased by an additional <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>, and can be stacked <color=#44afee>3</color> times. Lasts <color=#44afee>12</color>s.",
    ["SkillDesc_6231265"]="While Steel Body is active, there's a <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> chance to increase the current number and upper limit of Spirit Sphere by <color=#44afee>1</color> each time you are hit, increasing the damage of the next normal attack or the first stage of the skill by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>. Triggering this effect does not consume SP, and it lasts <color=#44afee>6</color> seconds. The Spirit Sphere's upper limit lasts <color=#44afee>3</color> seconds and refreshes each time it's increased.",
    ["SkillDesc_6231266"]="Each attack that deals damage increases Gate of Hell damage by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>, and can be stacked up to <color=#44afee>30</color> times. Lasts <color=#44afee>5</color>s. Each attack deals <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of the target's Max HP in true damage. (This effect is immune to bosses, MVP, and Mini.)",
    ["SkillDesc_6299801"]="Party members whose highest primary stat is not VIT will also receive the Votum effect when healing. Every stack of Votum boosts your Max HP by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>. The Votum effect lasts for <color=#44afee>6</color> seconds, stacking up to <color=#44afee>%s</color> times.",
    ["SkillDesc_6299802"]="Effligo reduces the target's Final P.DMG RED by an additional <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>, dealing Holy attribute P.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of P.ATK that ignores defense to the target.",
    ["SkillDesc_6299803"]="Increases Pneumaticus Procella's damage dealt to MVP, MINI, and Boss units by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_6299804"]="In PVP, increases your PVP Debuff Resistance by <color=#44afee>%s</color> and PVP Debuff Duration Reduction by <color=#44afee>%s</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_6299805"]="Branding a monster ignores <color=#44afee>%s</color> of its Debuff Duration Reduction and Debuff Resistance. After Flame Bomb clears the Brand, you enter the <color=#44afee>Echo of Brand</color> state for <color=#44afee>5</color> seconds, making your next attack apply the same number of brand stacks to the target (triggers only once).",
    ["SkillDesc_6299806"]="Branding a monster ignores <color=#44afee>%s</color> of its Debuff Duration Reduction and Debuff Resistance. After Punish clears the Brand, you enter the <color=#44afee>Echo of Brand</color> state for <color=#44afee>5</color> seconds, making your next attack apply the same number of brand stacks to the target (triggers only once).",
    ["SkillDesc_6299807"]="Each stack of Brand recovers an additional <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> and <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of your Max HP and Max SP.",
    ["SkillDesc_6299808"]="When dealing damage to Adventurers, each stack of Brand ignores <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of their P.DMG Reflection and inflicts True DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of their Max HP to enemies under the Brand effect. Triggers up to <color=#44afee>1</color> time every <color=#44afee>1</color> second.",
    ["SkillDesc_6299809"]="Targets hit by Howling of Lion cannot enter Stealth within <color=#44afee>%s</color> second(s) and have their MSPD reduced by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_6299810"]="Oratio lasts <color=#44afee>%s</color> second(s) longer and grants <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> more Holy Enhancement.",
    ["SkillDesc_6299811"]="Exhort applied on Adventurers no longer reduces their Final P.DMG Bonus and Final M.DMG Bonus, but instead reduces their PVP Final P.DMG Bonus and PVP Final M.DMG Bonus by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_6299901"]="Increases the number of times Kyrie Eleison blocks damage by <color=#44afee>%s</color>, and its maximum damage blocked by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_6299902"]="Decreases the fixed cooldown of Decrease Agility by <color=#44afee>%s</color> seconds. While in effect, additionally decreases the target's Final ASPD by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> and Final haste by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_6299903"]="Decreases the fixed cooldown of Sacred Blessing by <color=#44afee>%s</color> seconds and increases its healing effect by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_6299904"]="Increases Pneuma and Safety Wall block damage by <color=#44afee>%s</color> times, and when these barriers disappear, increases the Final Damage Bonus of party members within the barrier by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>, and their Final Damage Reduction by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>. Lasts <color=#44afee>12</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_6299951"]="When a debuff is added to you, there is a <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> chance to reduce the Final Damage Bonus of random target enemies within <color=#44afee>8</color> meters by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> for <color=#44afee>3</color>s. Can be triggered a max of 1 time every 3s.",
    ["SkillDesc_6299952"]="Increase the SP effect of Spirits Recovery by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>, reducing the guided time and Fixed Cooldown Reduction by <color=#44afee>%s</color>s. While in Spirits Recovery, there is a <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> chance of not being interrupted.",
    ["SkillDesc_6299953"]="There is a <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> chance that Call Spirits can generate 4 additional Spirit Spheres.",
    ["SkillDesc_6299954"]="After using Rising Dragon, the max number of Spirit Sphere is increased by <color=#44afee>%s</color>, and duration is increased for <color=#44afee>%s</color>s.",
    ["SkillDesc_6310301"]="Increases the damage coefficient of Lightning Bolt by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_6310302"]="Increases the damage coefficient of Cold Bolt by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_6310303"]="Increases the damage coefficient of Lightning Bolt by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>, and decreases the target's Final Physical Defense by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> and Final Magic Defense by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> for <color=#44afee>6</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_6310304"]="Increases the damage coefficient of Cold Bolt by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>, and decreases the target's Final Physical Damage Bonus by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> and Final Magic Damage Bonus by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> for <color=#44afee>6</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_6310305"]="Increases the damage coefficient of Frost Diver by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>, and reduces the target’s Freeze Resistance by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> for <color=#44afee>10</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_6310306"]="Increases the damage coefficient of Jupitel Thunder by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>, and reduces the target’s Blind Resistance by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> for <color=#44afee>10</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_6310307"]="Increases the damage coefficient of Frost Nova by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>, and reduces the target’s Freeze Resistance by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> for <color=#44afee>10</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_6310308"]="Increases the damage coefficient of Lord of Vermilion by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>, and reduces the target’s Blind Resistance by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> for <color=#44afee>10</color> seconds each time it deals damage.",
    ["SkillDesc_6310309"]="Increases the damage coefficient of Chain Lightning by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_6310310"]="Increases the damage coefficient of Storm Gust by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_6310311"]="Increases the damage coefficient of Chain Lightning by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>, and increases its number of bounces by <color=#44afee>%s</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_6310312"]="Increases the damage coefficient of Storm Gust by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>, and increases its number of waves by <color=#44afee>%s</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_6310313"]="Increases the Slow coefficient of Frosty Misty by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> and its chance to Freeze by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_6310315"]="Increases the damage coefficient of Confusion Storm by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> and decreases the target's Final PVP Magic Damage Reduction by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> for <color=#44afee>6</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_6310701"]="Learning Advanced Book additionally increases your Final ASPD by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> and Final M.PEN by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_6310702"]="Spell Fist increases your M.ATK by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> while it is in effect. During this time, each normal attack has a chance of <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> to release fan-shaped shock waves that deal M.ATK x <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> melee magic damage of the corresponding attribute to all targets within range.",
    ["SkillDesc_6310703"]="Learning Advanced Book additionally increases your Final M.PEN by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> and PVP Final M.DMG Bonus by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_6310704"]="Spell Fist increases your Magic Lifesteal by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> while it is in effect. During this time, each normal attack has a chance of <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> to release fan-shaped shock waves that deal M.ATK x <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> melee magic damage of the corresponding attribute to all targets within range.",
    ["SkillDesc_6310705"]="When Magic Rod successfully fends off damage, it grants you a shield of <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> Max HP for <color=#44afee>5</color> seconds and restores <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> HP every second for <color=#44afee>5</color> seconds. These effects trigger <color=#44afee>1</color> time every <color=#44afee>5</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_6310707"]="Fire attribute normal attacks have a <color=#44afee>50%%</color> chance to inflict Kindle on targets, dealing M.ATK x <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> Fire magic damage every second to targets for <color=#44afee>3</color> seconds. Stacks up to <color=#44afee>4</color> times.",
    ["SkillDesc_6310708"]="While possessed by Earth Element, increases your Final DMG Reduction by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> and PVP Debuff Resistance by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>. While possessed by Earth Element, dealing damage to targets also reduces their Stun Resistance by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> and PVP Debuff Resistance by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> for <color=#44afee>3</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_6310709"]="Enemies who die while marked by the Sage's Elemental Mark will explode, dealing <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> melee magic damage of the Elemental Mark's attribute to all targets within <color=#44afee>4</color>m.",
    ["SkillDesc_6310710"]="Whenever Auto Spell casts Elemental Bolt, it increases Final M.PEN by the <color=#44afee>level of the Elemental Bolt cast</color> x <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> and Final M.DMG Bonus by the <color=#44afee>level of the Elemental Bolt cast</color> x <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> for <color=#44afee>3</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_6310711"]="While Earth Element exists, you gain Earth Shield, which increases your PVP Final P.DMG RED by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> and PVP Final M.DMG RED by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>. While Earth Shield is in effect, it reflects self M.ATK x <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> Earth ranged magic damage to the attacker after taking ranged damage, with a chance of <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> to stun them for <color=#44afee>1</color> second.",
    ["SkillDesc_6310712"]="While possessed by Fire Element, additionally increases your MSPD by <color=#44afee>2</color>. Every <color=#44afee>5</color> seconds, if you take damage exceeding <color=#44afee>30%%</color> of your Max HP, you immediately recover <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> HP. During this time, every normal attack deals an additional <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> Fire melee magic damage to targets.",
    ["SkillDesc_6310714"]="Increases your damage dealt to Wind monsters by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> and damage dealt to Earth monsters by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_6310715"]="Increases the magic bonus damage of Mind Drain by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_6310716"]="Increases your Fire Attribute Enhancement by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> and Earth Attribute Enhancement by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>, as well as your Wind Resistance by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> and Earth Resistance by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_6330601"]="Increases the damage coefficient of Fire Bolt by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_6330602"]="Increases the damage coefficient of Heaven's Drive by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_6330603"]="Increases the damage coefficient of Fire Bolt by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>, and decreases the target's Bonus Heal Received by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> for <color=#44afee>6</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_6330604"]="Increases the damage coefficient of Heaven's Drive by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>, and decreases the target's Final ASPD by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> and Final haste by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> for <color=#44afee>6</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_6330605"]="Increases the damage coefficient of Earth Spike by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_6330606"]="Increases the damage coefficient of Fire Ball by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_6330607"]="Increases the chance for Abyssal Swamp to change the target's armor attribute to Earth by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_6330608"]="Increases the damage coefficient of Fire Pillar's detonation by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_6330609"]="Increases the damage coefficient of Meteor Storm by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_6330610"]="Increases the damage coefficient of Gravitational Field by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_6330611"]="Increases the damage coefficient of Meteor Storm by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> and reduces the target's Stun Resistance by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> for <color=#44afee>3</color> seconds each time it deals damage. Can be stacked up to <color=#44afee>6</color> times, and increases its chance to stun targets by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_6330612"]="Increases the damage coefficient of Gravitational Field by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> and reduces the target's Stun Resistance by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> for <color=#44afee>3</color> seconds each time it deals damage. Can be stacked up to <color=#44afee>6</color> times, and increases its chance to stun targets by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_6330613"]="Ignores <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of the target's Immobilization Resistance when casting White Imprison and increases the chance of immobilizing the target by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>. The damage buff coefficient of the Ghost attribute also increases by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_6330614"]="Ignores <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of the target's Petrify Resistance when casting Earth Strain and increases the chance of petrifying the target by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>. The damage coefficient of the Earth Strain also increases by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_6330615"]="Increases the Attribute Enhancement of each elementally enhanced attribute orb by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> and the damage coefficient of Tetra Vortex by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_6330616"]="Increases the damage coefficient of Flame Shock by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> and its Burn damage coefficient by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_6330650"]="After casting Elemental Bolt, increases your Elemental Resistance to the corresponding attribute by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> for <color=#44afee>8</color> seconds. When casting Elemental Bolt in an elemental field, reduces the cast time of the Elemental Bolt of the corresponding attribute by <color=#44afee>%s</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_6330651"]="After casting Elemental Bolt, increases your Elemental Enhancement for the corresponding attribute by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> for <color=#44afee>8</color> seconds. Stacks up to <color=#44afee>3</color> times.",
    ["SkillDesc_6330652"]="After casting Elemental Bolt, increases your Elemental Resistance to the corresponding attribute by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> for <color=#44afee>8</color> seconds. When casting Elemental Bolt in an elemental field, reduces the cast time of the Elemental Bolt of the corresponding attribute by <color=#44afee>%s</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_6330653"]="After casting Elemental Bolt, increases your Elemental Enhancement for the corresponding attribute by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> and reduces the target's Elemental Resistance to the corresponding attribute by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> for <color=#44afee>8</color> seconds. Stacks up to <color=#44afee>5</color> times.",
    ["SkillDesc_6330654"]="When Magic Rod successfully fends off damage, additionally increases your Final M.PEN by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> for <color=#44afee>5</color> seconds and restores your HP by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of Max HP. These effects trigger <color=#44afee>1</color> time every <color=#44afee>5</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_6330655"]="Spell Breaker reduces the Silence Resistance of targets within range by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> for <color=#44afee>5</color> seconds. When it successfully interrupts the target's cast, it additionally deals Max SP x <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> ranged magic damage of your weapon's attribute to the target.",
    ["SkillDesc_6330656"]="For every normal attack, Ventus has a chance of <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> to increase the damage of its next Elemental Bolt by <color=#44afee>50%%</color> for <color=#44afee>30</color> seconds and restore Ventus' HP by <color=#44afee>10%%</color> of the caster's Max HP. This can be triggered <color=#44afee>1</color> time every <color=#44afee>3</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_6330657"]="While possessed by Aqua, you take <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> less damage from physical attacks, each Cold Bolt deals additional true damage equal to the target's Max HP x <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> to the target, and there is a chance of <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> to freeze the target for <color=#44afee>1</color> second. This damage effect does not apply to Boss, Mini, or MVP targets.",
    ["SkillDesc_6330658"]="Additionally increases the damage of same attribute Elemental Bolts cast under the effect of Habitual Casting by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_6330659"]="After using Enhanced Elemental Bolt, an elemental vortex of the corresponding attribute appears at the feet of a target killed by an Elemental Bolt of the corresponding attribute, dealing <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> damage of the corresponding attribute to all targets within range every <color=#44afee>2</color> seconds for <color=#44afee>6</color> seconds. A maximum of <color=#44afee>1</color> vortex can be generated every <color=#44afee>3</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_6330660"]="While Aqua exists, you gain Ice Armor, which increases your PVP Final P.DMG RED by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> and PVP Final M.DMG RED by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>. While Ice Armor is in effect, it reflects the attacker's M.ATK x <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> Water melee magic damage to the attacker after taking melee damage, with a chance of <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> to freeze them for <color=#44afee>1</color> second.",
    ["SkillDesc_6330661"]="While possessed by Wind Element, reduces your ranged damage taken by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> and the fixed cast time of all your spells by <color=#44afee>%s</color> second(s) and the fixed cooldown by <color=#44afee>%s</color> second(s).",
    ["SkillDesc_6330662"]="Dispell additionally removes <color=#44afee>%s</color> buffs from the target. For every <color=#44afee>1</color> buff removed, it reduces the target's PVP Final M.DMG RED by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> for <color=#44afee>5</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_6330663"]="Increases your damage dealt to Fire monsters by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> and damage dealt to Water monsters by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_6330665"]="Increases your Water Attribute Enhancement by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> and Wind Attribute Enhancement by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>, as well as your Water Resistance by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> and Fire Resistance by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_6399801"]="In battle, Intense Telekinesis will be removed, and <color=#44afee>2</color> stacks of Intense Telekinesis will be refunded. Soul Vulcan Strike ignores <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of the enemy's M.DEF while attacking them.",
    ["SkillDesc_6399802"]="While under the effect of Climax, Frozen Slash and Destructive Hurricane cost <color=#44afee>1</color> less energy orb; Rain of Crystal and Storm Cannon cost <color=#44afee>2</color> less energy orbs and have their damage coefficient increased by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> and <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>, respectively.",
    ["SkillDesc_6399803"]="While under the effect of Climax, Crimson Arrow and Rock Down cost <color=#44afee>1</color> less energy orb; Violent Quake and All Bloom cost <color=#44afee>2</color> less energy orbs and have their damage coefficient increased by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> and <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>, respectively.",
    ["SkillDesc_6399804"]="If your elemental damage matches the enemy's armor attribute, ignore <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of the elemental resistance effect.",
    ["SkillDesc_6399805"]="While Serpens exists, Cold Bolt and Fire Bolt become Poison attribute and benefit from all Bolt Enhancement effects, increasing your Debuff Penetration by <color=#44afee>%s</color>, Debuff Enhancement by <color=#44afee>%s</color>, and Poison Enhancement by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_6399806"]="Elemental Field now covers a <color=#44afee>12x12</color> square area, and its damage coefficient is increased by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_6399807"]="While Increasing Activity is active, summoning other Elemental Spirits refunds <color=#44afee>%s</color> of the skill cooldown.",
    ["SkillDesc_6399808"]="While Spell Enchanting is active, party members' PVP Final P.DMG Bonus and PVP M.DMG Bonus are increased by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>, PVP Final P.DMG Reduction and PVP Final M.DMG Reduction are increased by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_6399809"]="While White Barrier is active, your MSPD is increased by <color=#44afee>%s</color>, PVP Debuff Resistance and PVP Debuff Duration Reduction are increased by <color=#44afee>1.5 x Shadow Equipment Skill Level</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_6399810"]="While under any Climax state, your corresponding elemental damage taken is reduced by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_6399901"]="Extends the duration of Energy Coat by <color=#44afee>%s</color> seconds, and additionally increases PVP Final Physical Damage Reduction by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_6399902"]="While Amplify Magic Power is active, Magic Attack is increased by an additional <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>, and PVP Final Bonus Magic Damage by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_6399903"]="Increases the trigger rate of Intense Telekinesis by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>, and Ghost Attribute Enhancement by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_6399904"]="After learning Sightrasher, using Sight to knock targets back automatically triggers Fire Wall, forming a combo. Also increases Fire Attribute Enhancement by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> for <color=#44afee>12</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_6399951"]="When casting Warmer, applies the <color=#44afee>Breezy</color> state to friendly units in the field, and restores <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of Max HP per second for <color=#44afee>3</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_6399952"]="When casting Earth Grave, reduces the Slow Resistance of targets within range by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> for <color=#44afee>3</color> seconds and restores the cooldown of Earth Grave by <color=#44afee>5</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_6399953"]="When casting Diamond Dust, reduces the target's Freeze Resistance by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> for <color=#44afee>10</color> seconds. If the target is already frozen when taking damage from Diamond Dust, Diamond Dust inflicts <color=#44afee>Ice Crush</color> instead, which unfreezes the target, increases the damage dealt by Diamond Dust by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>, and restores the cooldown of Diamond Dust by <color=#44afee>7</color> seconds. This cooldown restoration effect can only be triggered once each time the skill is cast.",
    ["SkillDesc_6399954"]="Increases Varetyr Spear's damage by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> for every target within range. Varetyr Spear's cooldown is restored by <color=#44afee>1.5</color> seconds for every target it hits.",
    ["SkillDesc_6399955"]="When casting Warmer, inflicts <color=#44afee>Heat Wave</color> on all enemy targets within range, dealing true damage equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of their Max HP to them every second for 3 seconds. This does not apply to Boss, Mini, or MVP targets.",
    ["SkillDesc_6410501"]="After using Ambush or Brute Force, Final Physical Damage Bonus is increased by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>. Stacks up to <color=#44afee>4</color> times. Lasts <color=#44afee>12</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_6410502"]="After learning Left-Hand Mastery and Right-Hand Mastery, and when equipped with daggers, their respective Final ASPD stats are increased by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_6410503"]="After using Ambush or Brute Force, PVP Final Physical Damage Bonus is increased by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>. Stacks up to <color=#44afee>4</color> times. Lasts <color=#44afee>12</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_6410504"]="After learning Left-Hand Mastery and Right-Hand Mastery, and when equipped with daggers, their respective Final ASPD stats are increased by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>, and their Physical Lifesteal is increased by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_6410505"]="After using Venom Knife or Venom Dart, the target's Final Physical Damage Reduction is decreased by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>. Stacks up to <color=#44afee>4</color> times. Lasts <color=#44afee>12</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_6410506"]="Increases the chance to trigger Double Attack by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>. When triggered, increases your Final P.DMG Bonus by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> for <color=#44afee>3</color> seconds. Stacks up to <color=#44afee>5</color> times.",
    ["SkillDesc_6410507"]="After using Venom Knife or Venom Dart, the target's PVP Final Physical Damage Reduction is decreased by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>. Stacks up to <color=#44afee>4</color> times. Lasts <color=#44afee>12</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_6410508"]="Increases Double Attack's trigger rate by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>, and increases its damage by an additional <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_6410509"]="After using Slash, decreases the target's healing received by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>(including the lifesteal effect) for <color=#44afee>6</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_6410510"]="Increases the trigger rate of Twin Blade Piercing by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>. After triggering, decreases the target's Final Physical Defense by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>. Stacks up to <color=#44afee>4</color> times. Lasts <color=#44afee>12</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_6410511"]="After using Slash, decreases the target's healing received by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>(including the lifesteal effect) for <color=#44afee>6</color> seconds. Also has a <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> chance to make this skill usable again within the following <color=#44afee>10</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_6410512"]="Increases the trigger rate of Twin Blade Piercing by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>. After triggering, deals true damage equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of the target's Max HP (not effective against Bosses, MVPs, and Minis).",
    ["SkillDesc_6410514"]="Increases the damage coefficient of Dark Illusion by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> and the chance to immobilize by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_6410516"]="Causes the target to lose an additional <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of their Max HP when dealing damage to them (has no effect on Minis, MVPs, and bosses).",
    ["SkillDesc_6410551"]="Additionally improves the boost of Base EXP and Job EXP from <color=#44afee>Filch</color> by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_6410552"]="Additionally improves the boost of Base EXP and Job EXP from <color=#44afee>Filch</color> by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_6410553"]="Increases the damage of <color=#44afee>Ambush</color> by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>. After using <color=#44afee>Ambush</color>, the damage of <color=#44afee>Back Stab</color> is increased by an additional <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> for <color=#44afee>3</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_6410554"]="Increases the damage of <color=#44afee>Ambush</color> by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> and ignores <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of the target's Stun Resistance. After using <color=#44afee>Ambush</color>, the damage of <color=#44afee>Back Stab</color> is increased by an additional <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> for <color=#44afee>3</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_6410555"]="Increases the damage of <color=#44afee>Raid</color> by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_6410556"]="Increases the damage of <color=#44afee>Raid</color> by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>. Increases the odds of <color=#44afee>Raid</color> inflicting Blind on enemies by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>, while ignoring <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of the target's Blind RES.",
    ["SkillDesc_6410557"]="Reduces the duration of <color=#44afee>Close Confine</color> by <color=#44afee>3</color> seconds. Every <color=#44afee>0.5</color> seconds, additionally deals True Damage to the target equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of their Max HP. True Damage does not apply to MVP, MINI, and BOSS.",
    ["SkillDesc_6410558"]="Increases the target's DMG Taken by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> when <color=#44afee>Close Confine</color> is in effect. Reduces your DMG Taken by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_6410559"]="Increases the damage of <color=#44afee>Intimidate</color> by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> and the teleport probability by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>. When casting <color=#44afee>Intimidate</color> on monsters, it has the same probability as teleport to eliminate the monsters with one hit. The one-hit kill does not apply to MVP, MINI, and BOSS.",
    ["SkillDesc_6410560"]="Increases the damage of <color=#44afee>Intimidate</color> by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> and the teleport probability by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>. Upon dealing damage, there is a <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> chance to apply Blind on the target for <color=#44afee>3</color> seconds, while ignoring <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of the target's Blind RES.",
    ["SkillDesc_6410561"]="Increases the damage of <color=#44afee>Shadow Pierce</color> by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>. Reduces the skill cooldown of <color=#44afee>Shadow Pierce</color> by <color=#44afee>0.5</color> seconds per hit.",
    ["SkillDesc_6410562"]="Increases the damage of <color=#44afee>Shadow Pierce</color> by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>. If there is only one target in the path, the damage will be increased by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> for every <color=#44afee>1%%</color> HP the target loses.",
    ["SkillDesc_6410563"]="Increases the odds of <color=#44afee>Snatcher</color> stealing the stat by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>. Boosts the snatched stat by <color=#44afee>%s</color> points and extends its duration by <color=#44afee>%s</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_6410564"]="Extends the duration of <color=#44afee>Shadow Cage</color> by <color=#44afee>%s</color>seconds. Reduces your DMG Taken by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> in the <color=#44afee>Shadow Cage</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_6410565"]="<color=#44afee>Bloody Lust</color> reduces the target's healing received by <color=#44afee>50%%</color> when they are Bleeding. Based on the target's movement distance per second, additionally deals True Damage equal to (<color=#44afee>%s%%</color> + <color=#44afee>6%%</color> x distance difference per second) x P.ATK.",
    ["SkillDesc_6410566"]="Increases the REF DMG of <color=#44afee>Reject Sword</color> by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>, and grants <color=#44afee>%s</color> more chances to reflect damage. Each reflection will increase your damage on the target by <color=#44afee>1%%</color> for <color=#44afee>3</color> seconds. Stacks up to <color=#44afee>%s</color> times.",
    ["SkillDesc_6430401"]="When Shadow Blade is active, Final ASPD increases by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_6430402"]="When Enchant Poison is active, the chance of inflicting poison on the target is increased by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> and Final Hit is increased by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>. The effect will not be removed when you are killed.",
    ["SkillDesc_6430403"]="When Shadow Blade is active, Final ASPD is increased by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>, and ATK is increased by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_6430404"]="When Enchant Poison is active, the chance of inflicting poison on the target is increased by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>. At the same time, increases additional Poison Physical Damage dealt by your Normal Attack by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> and increases Final Hit by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>. The effect will not be removed when you are killed.",
    ["SkillDesc_6430405"]="Whenever you land a critical attack with your normal attacks, Sonic Blow's cooldown is decreased by an additional <color=#44afee>%s</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_6430406"]="Extends the duration for which Venom Dust's venom remains on the ground by <color=#44afee>%s</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_6430407"]="Whenever you land a critical attack with your normal attacks, Sonic Blow's cooldown is decreased by an additional <color=#44afee>%s</color> seconds. Also increases Supersonic Blow's damage bonus on Sonic Blow by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>. Ignores <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of the target's Stun Resistance when they are being stunned by the Sonic Blow.",
    ["SkillDesc_6430408"]="Extends the duration for which Venom Dust's venom remains on the ground by <color=#44afee>%s</color> seconds, and increases the Poison effect by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>. When enemies’ Movement Speed is decreased by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> when they are within the range of venom (not effective on MVPs, Minis, and Bosses).",
    ["SkillDesc_6430409"]="Each time you trigger a critical hit with a normal attack or skill, Final Physical Damage Bonus is increased by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>. Stacks up to <color=#44afee>8</color> times. Lasts <color=#44afee>6</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_6430410"]="Each time you trigger a critical hit with a normal attack, the cooldown of Mirror Image will complete <color=#44afee>%s</color> seconds earlier.",
    ["SkillDesc_6430411"]="Each time you trigger a critical hit with a normal attack or skill, PVP Final Physical Damage Bonus is increased by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>. Stacks up to <color=#44afee>8</color> times. Lasts <color=#44afee>6</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_6430412"]="Each time you trigger a critical hit with a normal attack, the cooldown of Mirror Image will complete <color=#44afee>%s</color> seconds earlier. Also instantly restores HP equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of Max HP.",
    ["SkillDesc_6430413"]="Increases the damage coefficient of Poison Mist by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> and its duration by <color=#44afee>%s</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_6430414"]="Increases the chance to inflict injury by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> and the Crit Damage increase coefficient by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_6430415"]="Increases the chance to parry by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> and the damage coefficient by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_6430416"]="Increases the damage coefficient of Spinning Blade by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>. Each stack of Spin Value also increases your Final PVP Physical Damage Bonus by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_6430551"]="Increases the Poison damage coefficient of <color=#44afee> Enchant Poison</color> by <color=#44afee>%s</color> time(s). Each stack of <color=#44afee>Dip</color> additionally boosts your Poison attribute by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_6430552"]="Increases the Poison damage coefficient of <color=#44afee> Enchant Poison</color> by <color=#44afee>%s</color> time(s). Each stack of <color=#44afee>Dip</color> additionally boosts your Poison attribute by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>. Normal attacks have a <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> chance to add <color=#44afee>Dip</color> effect to you.",
    ["SkillDesc_6430553"]="Increases the damage of <color=#44afee>Assault</color> by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_6430554"]="Increases the damage of <color=#44afee>Assault</color> by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>. Decreases the Hit of the targets under attack by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> for <color=#44afee>3</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_6430555"]="Increases the damage of <color=#44afee>Double Strafe</color> by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>. When Double Strafe is in use, increases your Final Crit by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>, lasting <color=#44afee>5</color>seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_6430556"]="Increases the damage of <color=#44afee>Double Strafe</color> by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>. When Double Strafe is in use, increases your Crit DMG Bonus by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>, lasting <color=#44afee>5</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_6430557"]="Increases the odds of triggering <color=#44afee>Repeated Shot</color> by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>. When triggered, increases your Final P.DMG Bonus by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>, lasting <color=#44afee>3</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_6430558"]="Increases the odds of triggering <color=#44afee>Repeated Shot</color> by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>. When triggered, increases your PVP Final P.DMG Bonus by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>, lasting <color=#44afee>3</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_6430559"]="For every <color=#44afee>1%%</color> of the target's HP lost, the damage of <color=#44afee>Triangle Slot</color> is additionally increased by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>. When Triangle Slot is released, increases your Final Crit by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> for <color=#44afee>5</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_6430560"]="For every <color=#44afee>1%%</color> of the target's HP lost, the damage of <color=#44afee>Triangle Slot</color> is additionally increased by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>. When Triangle Slot is released, increases your Crit DMG Bonus by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> for <color=#44afee>5</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_6430561"]="Increases the damage of <color=#44afee>Bone Rotting Arrow</color> by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>. The contamination effect of <color=#44afee>Bone Rotting Arrow</color> lasts <color=#44afee>4</color> seconds on the ground, dealing Poison attribute P.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of P.ATK to enemies within the contaminated area. This skill may trigger critical damage.",
    ["SkillDesc_6430562"]="Increases the damage of <color=#44afee>Bone Rotting Arrow</color> by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>. The contamination effect of <color=#44afee>Bone Rotting Arrow</color> lasts <color=#44afee>5</color> seconds on the ground, dealing Poison attribute P.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of P.ATK to enemies within the contaminated area and reducing their healing received by <color=#44afee>50%%</color>. This skill may trigger critical damage.",
    ["SkillDesc_6430563"]="While <color=#44afee>Shadow Spell</color> is in effect: When landing Critical Hits with <color=#44afee>arrow normal attacks</color> under Shadow Spell, there is a <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> chance to extend the duration of <color=#44afee>Shadow Spell</color> by <color=#44afee>1</color> second. When landing Critical Hits with <color=#44afee>Double Strafe</color>, <color=#44afee>Double Strafe triggered by Repeated Shot</color>, and <color=#44afee>Triangle Slot</color> under <color=#44afee>Shadow Spell</color>, there is a <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> chance to extend the duration of <color=#44afee>Shadow Spell</color> by <color=#44afee>1</color> second. The skill duration of <color=#44afee>Shadow Spell</color> can be extended by up to <color=#44afee>6</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_6430564"]="Increases the cap of your <color=#44afee>Dip</color> stacks by <color=#44afee>%s</color>times, extending the <color=#44afee>Dip</color> duration by <color=#44afee>%s</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_6430565"]="When <color=#44afee>Hiding</color>, adds <color=#44afee>%s</color> extra stacks of <color=#44afee>Ghost Power </color> and increases all Ghost attribute damage dealt during the period by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>, and Final Hit by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>. Once the <color=#44afee>Hiding</color> ends, increases MSPD by <color=#44afee>2</color> and Final DMG Reduction by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> for <color=#44afee>3</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_6430566"]="Additionally increases the damage of <color=#44afee>Ranged Toxic Attack</color> by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>; depending on the number of <color=#44afee>Dip</color> stacks you consume, it increases the Slow effect by (<color=#44afee>20%%</color> + <color=#44afee>Dip</color> stacks consumed x <color=#44afee>5%%</color>) on the target and the enemies within <color=#44afee>4</color> meters of the target. It also increases the <color=#44afee>Poison</color> effect based on the corresponding number of stacks, lasting <color=#44afee>4</color> seconds (up to 5 Poison stacks).",
    ["SkillDesc_6499801"]="Increases the chance of summoning a Phantom by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> and reduces Shadow Exceed's trigger interval by <color=#44afee>%s</color> second(s).",
    ["SkillDesc_6499802"]="When only one target is within Shadow Claw's range, deals an additional weapon attribute P.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of P.ATK.",
    ["SkillDesc_6499803"]="While Hallucination Walk is active, reduces <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of damage over time from ground effects. (Excludes ground effects cast by MVP, MINI, and Boss units.)",
    ["SkillDesc_6499804"]="When Hallucination Walk is removed, increases your Final Flee by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> for <color=#44afee>3</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_6499805"]="Increase the chance of consuming Abyssal Orb by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> and its damage coefficient by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_6499806"]="Reduces Deft Stab's fixed cooldown by <color=#44afee>%s</color> second(s). Each stack of buff increases the DEX bonus effect by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>, and the stack limit increases to <color=#44afee>3</color>. When hitting a target without any of the <color=#44afee>Curse, Blind, Confuse, Fear, or Slow</color> effects, <color=#44afee>1</color> random debuff will be applied on the target, granting you <color=#44afee>2</color> stacks of the DEX bonus effect if successful.",
    ["SkillDesc_6499807"]="Increases Chain Reaction Shot's damage coefficient by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> and its trap effect duration by <color=#44afee>%s</color> second(s).",
    ["SkillDesc_6499808"]="Increases Abyss Square and Omega Abyss Strike's casting range by <color=#44afee>%s</color> meter(s) (up to 4 meters). While possessing Abyssal Orbs, the skill cooldown is reduced by an additional <color=#44afee>2 x (Shadow Equipment Skill Level -5)</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_6499809"]="Increases the chance to trigger abyssal zone by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>, which deals weapon attribute P.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of P.ATK to enemies within the zone (may trigger critical hits).",
    ["SkillDesc_6499810"]="Increases the success rate of stripping off Weapons, Armor, Accessories, and Shadow Equipment by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_6499811"]="Dashes to the target and deals weapon attribute P.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of P.ATK. If the target has no Assassination mark from you, apply one for <color=#44afee>%s</color> second(s). If the target is already marked, extend the mark by <color=#44afee>%s</color> second(s).",
    ["SkillDesc_6499901"]="When the Hiding effect of Assassination Halo ends, your buffs last for an additional <color=#44afee>%s</color> seconds. If your Final Crit is higher than your Final Penetration, you receive an extra <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of Final Crit. If your Final P.PEN is greater than your Final Crit, you get an extra <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of Final P.PEN.",
    ["SkillDesc_6499902"]="When using Venom Splasher, additionally deals Poison physical damage equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> × Poison Stacks × ATK that ignores DEF.",
    ["SkillDesc_6499903"]="When casting Grimtooth or Meteor Assault while in the Hiding mode, there is a <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> chance to immediately reset this skill's cooldown.",
    ["SkillDesc_6499904"]="Can use Soul Destroyer a total of <color=#44afee>%s</color> times. After each time you use it, you gain <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> PVP Final Physical Damage Bonus. Stacks up to <color=#44afee>%s</color> times. Lasts <color=#44afee>18</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_6499951"]="Increases damage dealt to the targets on whom you have inflicted Stun, Slow, Blind, Bleed, or Poison by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_6499952"]="When using <color=#44afee>Strip Weapon</color>, <color=#44afee>Strip Armor</color>, or <color=#44afee>Strip Accessory</color>, if the stripping fails, there is a <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> chance to activate the same kind of stripping once more.",
    ["SkillDesc_6499953"]="If you activate any of <color=#44afee>Strip Weapon</color>, <color=#44afee>Strip Armor</color>, and <color=#44afee>Strip Accessory</color>, you are considered to have activated <color=#44afee>Strip All</color>. When <color=#44afee>Strip All</color> is activated, there is a chance to inflict the effect of <color=#44afee>Strip Weapon</color>, <color=#44afee>Strip Armor</color>, and <color=#44afee>Strip Accessory</color> on the target at the same time with a basic probability of <color=#44afee>2%%</color>. Based on the <color=#44afee>DEX</color> difference between you and the target, the chance of triggering this skill will be increased by <color=#44afee>(0.5%% + ((your Dex - target's Dex) / 5000) x 0.5%%) x %s</color>. If there is any stripping skill you have not learned, Strip All will not be able to activate the corresponding effect.",
    ["SkillDesc_6499954"]="Targets in the <color=#44afee>Man Hole</color> take True Damage equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of Max Hp each second.",
    ["SkillDesc_6530501"]="Normal attacks have a <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> chance of triggering Double Strafe.",
    ["SkillDesc_6530502"]="When Improve Concentration is active, Final ASPD is increased by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_6530503"]="When using normal attacks, there is a <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> chance to trigger Double Strafe. Also decreases the target's Final Physical Defense by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>. Stacks up to <color=#44afee>4</color> times. Lasts <color=#44afee>6</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_6530504"]="When Improve Concentration is active, Physical Lifesteal is increased by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_6530505"]="Normal attacks have a <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> chance of triggering Focused Shot.",
    ["SkillDesc_6530506"]="Increases the chance to trigger Falconry Mastery by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> and its Neutral attribute Sacred P.DMG by (INT + DEX) x <color=#44afee>%s</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_6530507"]="Normal attacks have a <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> chance of triggering Focused Shot. Also decreases the target's healing received by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> (including the Lifesteal effect) for <color=#44afee>6</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_6530508"]="Increases the chance to trigger Falconry Mastery by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> and its P.DMG by (INT + DEX) x <color=#44afee>%s</color>. Each time the falcon attacks, there is a <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> chance to stun the target for <color=#44afee>1</color> second.",
    ["SkillDesc_6530509"]="Extends the effective time of True Sight by <color=#44afee>%s</color> and increases Final Physical Damage Bonus by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_6530510"]="Increases damage dealt by Falcon attacks by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_6530511"]="Extends the effective time of True Sight by <color=#44afee>%s</color> and increases PVP Final Physical Damage Bonus by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_6530512"]="Increases damage dealt by Falcon attacks by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>. Also deals true damage equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of the target's Max HP (not effective against Bosses, MVPs, and Minis).",
    ["SkillDesc_6530513"]="Increases the trigger rate of Prowling Wolf by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_6530514"]="Increases the damage coefficient of Aimed Bolt by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_6530515"]="Decreases the fixed cooldown of Elemental Trap by <color=#44afee>%s</color> seconds and increases the trap limit by <color=#44afee>%s</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_6530516"]="Increases the damage coefficient of No Limits by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> and the Reduced Healing Received coefficient by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_6530701"]="Decreases the fixed cooldown of Arrow Shower by <color=#44afee>%s</color> seconds, and has a <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> chance to make the target bleed for <color=#44afee>6</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_6530702"]="Decreases the fixed cooldown of Charge Arrow by <color=#44afee>%s</color> seconds, and decreases the target's Final Physical Damage Reduction by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> for <color=#44afee>6</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_6530703"]="Decreases the fixed cooldown of Arrow Shower by <color=#44afee>%s</color> seconds, and decreases the target's healing received by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> (including the Lifesteal effect) for <color=#44afee>6</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_6530704"]="Decreases the fixed cooldown of Charge Arrow by <color=#44afee>%s</color> seconds, and decreases the target's PVP Final Physical Damage Reduction by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> for <color=#44afee>6</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_6530705"]="Decreases the fixed cooldown of Trap by <color=#44afee>%s</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_6530706"]="Decreases the fixed cooldown of Blitz Beat by <color=#44afee>%s</color> seconds, and decreases the fixed cooldown of Falcon Assault by <color=#44afee>%s</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_6530707"]="Decreases the fixed cooldown of Trap by <color=#44afee>%s</color> seconds, and increases the maximum number of traps that can be set by <color=#44afee>%s</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_6530708"]="Decreases the fixed cooldown of Blitz Beat by <color=#44afee>%s</color> seconds, and decreases the fixed cooldown of Falcon Assault by <color=#44afee>%s</color> seconds. Also increases bonus damage enhancement by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_6530709"]="Decreases the fixed cooldown of Sharp Shooting by <color=#44afee>%s</color> seconds, and has a <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> chance apply the Weapon Breakage and Armor Breakage states to the target for <color=#44afee>6</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_6530710"]="Decreases the fixed cooldown of Multi Firing by <color=#44afee>%s</color> seconds. After each time you use it, your Final Physical Damage Bonus is increased by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>. Stacks up to <color=#44afee>4</color> times. Lasts <color=#44afee>12</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_6530711"]="Decreases the fixed cooldown of Sharp Shooting by <color=#44afee>%s</color> seconds, and deals true damage equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of the target's Max HP (not effective against Bosses, MVPs, and Minis).",
    ["SkillDesc_6530712"]="Decreases the fixed cooldown of Multi Firing by <color=#44afee>%s</color> seconds. After each time you use it, your PVP Final Physical Damage Bonus is increased by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>. Stacks up to <color=#44afee>4</color> times. Lasts <color=#44afee>12</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_6530713"]="Increases the trigger rate of Warg Bite's Bleed by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_6530714"]="Increases the splash damage coefficient of Splitting Arrows by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> and the number of splash targets by <color=#44afee>%s</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_6530716"]="While under the effect of Precision Shot, increases your Final PVP P.DMG Bonus by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>, PVP Debuff Resistance by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>, and reduces the damage taken by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_6531001"]="Defeat monsters by using <color=#44afee>Dissonance</color> to receive an additional <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> Zeny.",
    ["SkillDesc_6531002"]="Reduces normal attack damage on the players who are under the effect of <color=#44afee>A Whistle</color> by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>. Reduces the Final Damage dealt to normal monsters who are under the effect of <color=#44afee>A Whistle</color> by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> (not effective against Bosses, MVPs, and Minis). Effects of the same songs do not stack when their performance ranges overlap.",
    ["SkillDesc_6531003"]="Increases <color=#44afee>Energy Beat</color> damage by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_6531004"]="<color=#44afee>The Apple of Idun</color> grants all party members a stack of Shield equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> Max HP of the caster every <color=#44afee>3</color> seconds. Stacks up to <color=#44afee>4</color> times. Effects of the same songs do not stack when their performance ranges overlap.",
    ["SkillDesc_6531005"]="<color=#44afee>Musical Strike</color> increases Final P.PEN by an additional <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> for <color=#44afee>5</color> seconds. Stacks up to <color=#44afee>6</color> times.",
    ["SkillDesc_6531006"]="<color=#44afee>Assassin Cross of Sunset</color> has a <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> chance of doubling the damage of party members' normal attacks. Effects of the same songs do not stack when their performance ranges overlap.",
    ["SkillDesc_6531007"]="<color=#44afee>Musical Strike</color> increases PVP Final P.DMG Bonus by an additional <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> for <color=#44afee>5</color> seconds. Stacks up to <color=#44afee>6</color> times.",
    ["SkillDesc_6531008"]="<color=#44afee>A Drum on the Battlefield</color> has a <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> x (Sum of both Ensemble members' skill level / <color=#44afee>20</color>) chance of doubling the damage of party members' normal attacks. Effects of the same songs do not stack when their performance ranges overlap.",
    ["SkillDesc_6531009"]="<color=#44afee>Eternal Chaos</color> increases the Final M.DMG Bonus of party members by an additional <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> x Sum of both Ensemble members' skill level / <color=#44afee>20</color>. Effects of the same songs do not stack when their performance ranges overlap.",
    ["SkillDesc_6531010"]="Increases the damage of <color=#44afee>Arrow Vulcan</color> by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>, and each hit reduces the Max SP of the hit target by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> x your Intelligence / <color=#44afee>500</color>. Stacks up to <color=#44afee>4</color> times and lasts for <color=#44afee>20</color> seconds. (Not effective against Bosses, MVPs, and Minis.)",
    ["SkillDesc_6531011"]="After the <color=#44afee>Invulnerable Siegfried</color> starts playing, all party members in the range will gain an <color=#44afee>immortality</color> effect. The unit under the <color=#44afee>immortality</color> effect will be immune to fatal damage once and restore (<color=#44afee>10%%</color> + additional <color=#44afee>1%%</color> for every <color=#44afee>100</color> Intelligence) HP, and <color=#44afee>10%%</color> SP. During the performance, the immortality effect will be refreshed every <color=#44afee>%s</color> second(s). Effects of the same songs do not stack when their performance ranges overlap.",
    ["SkillDesc_6531012"]="<color=#44afee>A Poem of Bragi</color> additionally reduces the variable cast time of the party members by <color=#44afee>%s</color> seconds. All party members in the performance range will gain Debuff Immunity for <color=#44afee>%s</color> seconds when taking damage, which can only be triggered once every <color=#44afee>%s</color> seconds. Effects of the same songs do not stack when their performance ranges overlap.",
    ["SkillDesc_6531013"]="Increases the damage of <color=#44afee>Dominion Impulse</color> by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>. Every time the target within range receives damage, <color=#44afee>Dominion Impulse</color> has a <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> chance to <color=#44afee>Blind</color> the target for <color=#44afee>1</color> second.",
    ["SkillDesc_6531014"]="Inflicts Silence to the targets hit by <color=#44afee>Great Echo</color> for <color=#44afee>%s</color> second(s). Reduces Great Echo's cooldown by <color=#44afee>%s</color> second(s) for every target hit.",
    ["SkillDesc_6531015"]="Increases the damage of <color=#44afee>Severe Rainstorm</color> by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> and deals true damage equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of the target's Max HP on each hit (not effective against Bosses, MVPs, and Minis).",
    ["SkillDesc_6531016"]="When party members within the performance range of <color=#44afee>Circle of Nature's Sound</color> deal damage with normal attacks, restores <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of Max HP. Can be triggered a max of <color=#44afee>3</color> times every second.",
    ["SkillDesc_6531101"]="Defeat monsters by using <color=#44afee>Ugly Dance</color> to receive an additional <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> Zeny.",
    ["SkillDesc_6531102"]="Reduces skill damage on the players who are under the effect of <color=#44afee>Please Don't Forget Me</color> by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>. Reduces the Final Damage dealt to normal monsters who are under the effect of <color=#44afee>Please Don't Forget Me</color> by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> (not effective against Bosses, MVPs, and Minis). Effects of the same songs do not stack when their performance ranges overlap.",
    ["SkillDesc_6531104"]="<color=#44afee>Moonlit Serenade</color> can now increase the effect of PVP Final P.DMG Bonus and PVP Final M.DMG Bonus by an additional <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>. Effects of the same songs do not stack when their performance ranges overlap.",
    ["SkillDesc_6531105"]="<color=#44afee>Throw Arrow</color> increases PVP Final P.PEN by an additional <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> for <color=#44afee>5</color> seconds. Stacks up to <color=#44afee>6</color> times.",
    ["SkillDesc_6531106"]="<color=#44afee>Humming</color> increases all skill damage of party members by an additional <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>. Effects of the same songs do not stack when their performance ranges overlap.",
    ["SkillDesc_6531107"]="<color=#44afee>Throw Arrow</color> increases PVP Final P.DMG Bonus by an additional <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> for <color=#44afee>5</color> seconds. Stacks up to <color=#44afee>6</color> times.",
    ["SkillDesc_6531108"]="<color=#44afee>A Drum on the Battlefield</color> increases all skill damage of party members by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> x (Sum of both Ensemble members' skill level / <color=#44afee>20</color>). Effects of the same songs do not stack when their performance ranges overlap.",
    ["SkillDesc_6531109"]="<color=#44afee>Eternal Chaos</color> increases the Final P.DMG Bonus of party members by an additional <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> x Sum of both Ensemble members' skill level / <color=#44afee>20</color>. Effects of the same songs do not stack when their performance ranges overlap.",
    ["SkillDesc_6531110"]="Increases the damage of <color=#44afee>Arrow Vulcan</color> by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>, and each hit reduces the target's Vitality by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> x your Agility / <color=#44afee>50</color>. Stacks up to <color=#44afee>4</color> times and lasts for <color=#44afee>20</color> seconds. (Not effective against Bosses, MVPs, and Minis.)",
    ["SkillDesc_6531111"]="After the <color=#44afee>Invulnerable Siegfried</color> starts playing, all party members in the range will gain an <color=#44afee>immortality</color> effect. The unit under the <color=#44afee>immortality</color> effect will be immune to fatal damage once and restore <color=#44afee>10%%</color> HP, and (<color=#44afee>10%%</color> + additional <color=#44afee>1%%</color> for every <color=#44afee>100</color> Agility) SP. During the performance, the immortality effect will be refreshed every <color=#44afee>%s</color> second(s). Effects of the same songs do not stack when their performance ranges overlap.",
    ["SkillDesc_6531112"]="<color=#44afee>Fortune's Kiss</color> deals additional true damage equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of the current damage to the targets when they receive Crit Damage from party members. Effects of the same songs do not stack when their performance ranges overlap.",
    ["SkillDesc_6531113"]="Increases the damage of <color=#44afee>Dominion Impulse</color> by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>. Every time the target within range receives damage, <color=#44afee>Dominion Impulse</color> has a <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> chance to <color=#44afee>Stun</color> the target for <color=#44afee>1</color> second.",
    ["SkillDesc_6531116"]="When party members within the performance range of <color=#44afee>Circle of Nature's Sound</color> deal damage with Skills, restores <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of Max HP. Can be triggered a max of <color=#44afee>3</color> times every second.",
    ["SkillDesc_6599801"]="Reduces Hawk Rush's fixed cooldown by <color=#44afee>%s</color> second(s) and increases MSPD by <color=#44afee>%s</color> and shield value by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> during flight.",
    ["SkillDesc_6599802"]="Leaving the sniper zone refunds <color=#44afee>%s</color> second(s) of Crescive Bolt's cooldown for every <color=#44afee>1</color> unused sniper attempt.",
    ["SkillDesc_6599803"]="Reduces Nature Friendly's trigger interval by <color=#44afee>%s</color> second(s) and increases its trigger chance by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_6599804"]="Increases Wind Sign's trigger chance by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> and reduces its trigger interval by <color=#44afee>%s</color> second(s). While Wind Sign is active, ignores <color=#44afee>%s</color> of the target's Debuff Resistance and Debuff Duration Reduction and increases Calamity Gale's MSPD by <color=#44afee>%s</color> and its damage dealt by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_6599805"]="Skills cast by the partner who is outside of the ensemble range have a <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> chance to trigger Musical Interlude, delaying your return by <color=#44afee>2</color> seconds each time. Triggers <color=#44afee>once</color> every <color=#44afee>2</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_6599806"]="Performing solo ensemble triggers Mystic Symphony (Lv.1 x Shadow Equipment Skill Level).",
    ["SkillDesc_6599807"]="In PVP, increases party members' PVP Debuff Resistance and PVP Debuff Duration Reduction by <color=#44afee>%s</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_6599808"]="In PVP, increases party members' PVP Final P.DMG Bonus and PVP M.DMG Bonus by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_6599809"]="Increases Calamity Gale's damage coefficient by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>, and there's a <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> chance to reduce the enemy's MSPD by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> for <color=#44afee>3</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_6599810"]="While Elemental Arrow Array is active, stuns all enemies within the array for <color=#44afee>%s</color> second(s) and ignores <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of their Stun Resistance while doing so.",
    ["SkillDesc_6599811"]="While possessing any music note, Rhythm Shooting's damage coefficient is increased by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>. When you have no music note, Rhythm Shooting has a <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> chance to inflict Dance on the target for <color=#44afee>1</color> second.",
    ["SkillDesc_6599901"]="After using Electric Shock, increases your Wind Attribute Enhancement by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> for <color=#44afee>15</color> seconds.\nAfter using Claymore Trap, increases your Fire Attribute Enhancement by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> for <color=#44afee>15</color> seconds.\nAfter using Freezing Trap, increases your Water Attribute Enhancement by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> for <color=#44afee>15</color> seconds.\nAfter using Land Mine, increases your Earth Attribute Enhancement by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> for <color=#44afee>15</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_6599902"]="Increases ATK Bonus from beast attacks by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>, and increases this effect's maximum number of stacks by <color=#44afee>%s</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_6599903"]="After your traps detonate, your ATK Bonus increases by (<color=#44afee>%s%%</color> × Number of Traps Detonated) and Physical Lifesteal percentage increases by (<color=#44afee>%s%%</color> × Number of Traps Detonated). Lasts <color=#44afee>12</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_6599904"]="After using Detect, applies Falcon Marks to all targets in range, decreasing their Final Physical Defense by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> and Final Physical Damage Reduction by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>. Lasts for <color=#44afee>10</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_6599951"]="<color=#44afee>Marionette Control</color> gains a new effect: Inflicts <color=#44afee>Blind</color> to targets within range while appearing at the location of the marionette, lasting 3 seconds. Ignores <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of the target's Blind Resistance when triggered. Reduces its cooldown by <color=#44afee>%s</color> seconds for each enemy that takes damage from Marionette Control.",
    ["SkillDesc_6599952"]="<color=#44afee>Lerad's Dew</color> grants party members the following effect: Increases the PVP Final P.DMG RED by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> for each damage received. Stacks up to <color=#44afee>6</color> times and lasts for <color=#44afee>5</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_6599953"]="Under the <color=#44afee>Exhaustion</color> effect of <color=#44afee>Dance With Warg</color>, increases Max HP Loss per second by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> and increases Healing Received Reduction by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_6599954"]="<color=#44afee>Lullaby</color> ignores <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of the target's Sleep Resistance when inflicting Sleep. <color=#44afee>Sleeping</color> enemies have a <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> chance of not reducing Sleep stacks when taking damage.",
    ["SkillDesc_6599955"]="<color=#44afee>Marionette Control</color> gains a new effect: Inflicts <color=#44afee>Stun</color> to targets within range while appearing at the location of the marionette, lasting 3 seconds. Ignores <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of the target's Stun Resistance when triggered. Reduces its cooldown by <color=#44afee>%s</color> seconds for each enemy that takes damage from Marionette Control.",
    ["SkillDesc_6599956"]="<color=#44afee>Lerad's Dew</color> grants party members the following effect: Increases the PVP Final M.DMG RED by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> for each damage received. Stacks up to <color=#44afee>6</color> times and lasts for <color=#44afee>5</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_6610201"]="Increases the damage coefficient of Mammonite by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_6610202"]="Increases the damage coefficient of Hammer Fall by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_6610203"]="Increases the damage coefficient of Mammonite by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>, and has a <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> chance to make the target bleed for <color=#44afee>6</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_6610204"]="Increases the damage coefficient of Hammer Fall by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>, and increases its chance to stun targets by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_6610205"]="Increases the damage coefficient of Midas Touch by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_6610206"]="Increases the damage coefficient of Savage Slash by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_6610207"]="Increases the damage coefficient of Midas Touch by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>, and increases Zeny obtained with the Bounty effect by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_6610208"]="Increases the damage coefficient of Savage Slash by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>, and decreases the target's Final Physical Defense by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> and Final Physical Damage Reduction by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> for <color=#44afee>6</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_6610209"]="Increases the damage coefficient of Zeny Storm by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_6610210"]="Increases the damage coefficient of Melt Down by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_6610211"]="Increases the damage coefficient of Zeny Storm by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>, and decreases the target's healing received by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> (including the Lifesteal effect) for <color=#44afee>6</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_6610212"]="Increases the damage coefficient of Melt Down by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>, and deals true damage equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of the target's Max HP (not effective against Bosses, MVPs, and Minis).",
    ["SkillDesc_6610213"]="Increases the damage coefficient of Knuckle Boost by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_6610214"]="Increases the damage coefficient of Zenypult by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> and the number of throws by <color=#44afee>%s</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_6610215"]="Increases Neutral Barrier's damage dealt and damage taken conversion rate by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> and its max storage limit by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>. Also increases shield duration by <color=#44afee>%s</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_6610216"]="Increases the damage coefficient of Axe Boomerang by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>. When dealing damage, decreases the target's Final PVP Physical Damage Reduction by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> for <color=#44afee>6</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_6610251"]="<color=#44afee>Cart Revolution</color> deals additional Neutral P.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of P.ATK  on enemies within a <color=#44afee>4</color>-meter radius.",
    ["SkillDesc_6610252"]="Increases the damage of <color=#44afee>Cart Revolution</color> by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_6610253"]="Increases the explosion damage of <color=#44afee>Sphere Mine</color> by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_6610254"]="Increases the explosion damage of <color=#44afee>Sphere Mine</color> by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>. The Marine Spheres will parasitize the enemies who enter their range and tag along with them.",
    ["SkillDesc_6610255"]="Increases the damage of Plant monsters summoned by <color=#44afee>Bio Cannibalize</color> by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_6610256"]="Increases the damage of Plant monsters summoned by <color=#44afee>Bio Cannibalize</color> by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>. There is a <color=#44afee>30%%</color> chance of reducing the target's MSPD by <color=#44afee>60%%</color>. Lasts for <color=#44afee>3</color>s.",
    ["SkillDesc_6610257"]="Each attack of <color=#44afee>Cart Tornado</color> deals additional True Physical Damage equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of Max HP to enemies (except MVP, MINI, and Boss monsters). Increases your MSPD by <color=#44afee>%s</color> while casting.",
    ["SkillDesc_6610258"]="The Stun effect of <color=#44afee>Cart Tornado</color> ignores <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of the target's Stun RES and pulls enemies within <color=#44afee>3</color> meters towards yourself instead of knocking them back.",
    ["SkillDesc_6610259"]="Increases the damage of Plant monsters summoned by <color=#44afee>Hell's Plant</color> by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_6610260"]="Increases the damage of Plant monsters summoned by <color=#44afee>Hell's Plant</color> by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>. Ignores <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of the target's Stun RES when stunning them.",
    ["SkillDesc_6610261"]="Increases the skill damage of <color=#44afee>Heavy Cannon</color> by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_6610262"]="Increases the skill damage of <color=#44afee>Heavy Cannon</color> by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>. There is a <color=#44afee>50%%</color> chance of increasing the stun duration by <color=#44afee>2</color>s.",
    ["SkillDesc_6610263"]="Increases the maximum loading capacity of <color=#44afee>Cart Cannon</color> by <color=#44afee>%s</color> and the maximum loading capacity of <color=#44afee>Heavy Cannon</color> by <color=#44afee>%s</color> (rounded down).",
    ["SkillDesc_6610264"]="When a Plant summoned by <color=#44afee>Bio Cannibalize</color> and <color=#44afee>Hell's Plant</color> attacks a target, reduce the target's Final P.DMG RED by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>. Stacks up to <color=#44afee>3</color> times and lasts for up to <color=#44afee>5</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_6610265"]="<color=#44afee>Heavy Cannon</color> deals an additional <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> Fire P.DMG to targets within <color=#44afee>4</color> meters of the target.",
    ["SkillDesc_6610266"]="The Plants summoned by <color=#44afee>Bio Cannibalize</color> and <color=#44afee>Hell's Plant</color> grow larger and their attack range increases to <color=#44afee>2</color> meters. When attacking, they deal additional Neutral P.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of the caster's P.ATK to enemies within <color=#44afee>4</color> meters of the target (additional damage is not affected by other bonuses from Bio Cannibalize I, Bio Cannibalize II, Hell's Plant I, and Hell's Plant II).",
    ["SkillDesc_6610401"]="After triggering Battle Will through a normal attack, Final Physical Damage Bonus is increased by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>. Stacks up to <color=#44afee>4</color> times. Lasts <color=#44afee>3</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_6610402"]="Increases the damage coefficient of Mammonite by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>, and when using normal attacks, there is a <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> chance to trigger Mammonite. Cannot be triggered when you don't have enough Zeny.",
    ["SkillDesc_6610403"]="After triggering Battle Will through a normal attack, PVP Final Physical Damage Bonus is increased by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>. Stacks up to <color=#44afee>4</color> times. Lasts <color=#44afee>3</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_6610404"]="Increases the damage coefficient of Mammonite by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>. Normal attacks have a <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> chance to trigger Mammonite, and a <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> chance to make the target bleed for <color=#44afee>6</color> seconds. Cannot be triggered when you don't have enough Zeny.",
    ["SkillDesc_6610405"]="When Adrenaline Rush is active, increases party members’ Final ASPD increases by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> and Final Hit by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_6610406"]="Increases the damage coefficient of Midas Touch by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>, and normal attacks have a <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> chance to trigger Midas Touch.",
    ["SkillDesc_6610407"]="When Adrenaline Rush is active, increases party members’ Final ASPD by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> and Final Hit by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>, and increases damage dealt to large and medium-sized monsters by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_6610408"]="Increases the damage coefficient of Midas Touch by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>, and normal attacks have a <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> chance to trigger Midas Touch. Also increases Zeny obtained with the Bounty effect by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_6610409"]="Extends the duration of Maximum Over Thrust by <color=#44afee>%s</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_6610410"]="When using normal attacks, there is a <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> chance to trigger Zeny Storm. Cannot be triggered when you don't have enough Zeny.",
    ["SkillDesc_6610411"]="Extends the duration of Maximum Over Thrust by <color=#44afee>%s</color> seconds, and increases its Physical Lifesteal percentage by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_6610412"]="Normal attacks have a <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> chance of triggering Zeny Storm. Also decreases the target's healing received by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> (including the Lifesteal effect) for <color=#44afee>6</color> seconds. Cannot be triggered when you don't have enough Zeny.",
    ["SkillDesc_6610414"]="Increases the trigger rate of Magma Eruption by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>, its Crit bonus trigger rate by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>, and its damage coefficient by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_6610416"]="Increases the damage coefficient of Zenypult by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> and the number of throws by <color=#44afee>%s</color>. Each throw causes the target to lose an additional <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of their Max HP (has no effect on Minis, MVPs, and bosses).",
    ["SkillDesc_6610481"]="After triggering <color=#44afee>Battle Will</color> through a normal attack, Final P. DMG Bonus is increased by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>. Stacks up to <color=#44afee>3</color> times. Lasts <color=#44afee>5</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_6610482"]="After triggering <color=#44afee>Battle Will</color> through a normal attack, PVP Final P.DMG Bonus is increased by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>. Stacks up to <color=#44afee>3</color> times. Lasts <color=#44afee>5</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_6610483"]="Increases the trigger rate for <color=#44afee>Impulsive Slash</color> by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>. If there is only one enemy within range, the skill damage will be increased by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_6610484"]="Increases the trigger rate for <color=#44afee>Impulsive Slash</color> by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>. For every additional enemy within range, the skill damage will be increased by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_6610485"]="Increases your Final P.DMG RED by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_6610486"]="Increases your PVP Final P.DMG RED by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_6610487"]="Increases the Lifesteal granted to you by <color=#44afee>Blood Sucker</color> by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>. The Lifesteal bonus can stack up to <color=#44afee>%s</color> times.",
    ["SkillDesc_6610488"]="Increases the Lifesteal granted to you by <color=#44afee>Blood Sucker</color> by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>. The Lifesteal bonus can stack up to <color=#44afee>%s</color> times.\nThe amount of unconverted healing from Lifesteal will be converted into <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> Neutral True Damage and dealt to the target.",
    ["SkillDesc_6610489"]="Increases the damage per second caused by the <color=#44afee>Illusion Doping</color> to the surroundings by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_6610490"]="Increases the damage per second caused by the <color=#44afee>Illusion Doping</color> to the surroundings by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>. The <color=#44afee>Illusion</color> caused by <color=#44afee>Illusion Doping</color> can be stacked up to <color=#44afee>4</color> stacks.",
    ["SkillDesc_6610491"]="While under the effect of <color=#44afee>Demonic Potion</color>, your heal effectiveness is increased by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>, Debuff Reduction is increased by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>, and Debuff Resistance is increased by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_6610492"]="While under the effect of <color=#44afee>Demonic Potion</color>, your heal effectiveness is increased by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>, PVP Debuff Reduction is increased by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>, and PVP Debuff Resistance is increased by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_6610493"]="When the damage you receive from a single attack (including True Damage) exceeds <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of your Max HP, <color=#44afee>50%%</color> of the damage will be negated. This effect triggers once every <color=#44afee>3</color>s.",
    ["SkillDesc_6610494"]="Grants yourself 1 stack of <color=#44afee>Painkiller</color> whenever you lose HP equal to <color=#44afee>10%%</color> of your Max HP. While under this effect, every stack grants <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> PVP Final P.DMG RED and PVP Final M.DMG RED.\nThis effect is removed when exiting combat.",
    ["SkillDesc_6610495"]="After taking Physical Damage from an attack, inflicts <color=#44afee>Wounded</color> on the attacker for <color=#44afee>%s</color> second(s), which reduces their healing received by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> (does not take effect on Boss, MVP, and MINI units).",
    ["SkillDesc_6610496"]="When the normal attack or <color=#44afee>Impulsive Slash</color> triggers <color=#44afee>Gene Upgrade</color>, inflicts the target with <color=#44afee>1</color> stack of <color=#44afee>Bleed</color>. Stacks up to <color=#44afee>8</color> times and lasts for <color=#44afee>6</color> seconds. Each stack of Bleed deals weapon attribute P.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of P.ATK + INT x <color=#44afee>%s</color> every second.",
    ["SkillDesc_6630201"]="Decreases the fixed cooldown of Hammer Fall by <color=#44afee>%s</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_6630202"]="Decreases the fixed cooldown of Cart Revolution by <color=#44afee>%s</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_6630203"]="Decreases the fixed cooldown of Hammer Fall by <color=#44afee>%s</color> seconds, and increases its chance to stun the target by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_6630204"]="Decreases the fixed cooldown of Cart Revolution by <color=#44afee>%s</color> seconds, and increases its damage coefficient by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_6630205"]="Decreases the fixed cooldown of Savage Slash by <color=#44afee>%s</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_6630206"]="Decreases the fixed cooldown of Cart Hurl by <color=#44afee>%s</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_6630207"]="Decreases the fixed cooldown of Savage Slash by <color=#44afee>%s</color> seconds, and decreases the target's Final Physical Defense by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> and Final Physical Damage Reduction by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> for <color=#44afee>6</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_6630208"]="Decreases the fixed cooldown of Cart Hurl by <color=#44afee>%s</color> seconds, and increases its damage coefficient by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_6630209"]="Decreases the fixed cooldown of Melt Down by <color=#44afee>%s</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_6630210"]="Decreases the fixed cooldown of Cart Termination by <color=#44afee>%s</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_6630211"]="Decreases the fixed cooldown of Melt Down by <color=#44afee>%s</color> seconds, and deals true damage equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of the target's Max HP (not effective against Bosses, MVPs, and Minis).",
    ["SkillDesc_6630212"]="Decreases the fixed cooldown of Cart Termination by <color=#44afee>%s</color> seconds, and increases its damage coefficient by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_6630214"]="Increases the damage coefficient of Axe Boomerang by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>. When dealing damage, decreases the target's Movement Speed by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> for <color=#44afee>2</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_6630216"]="The damage coefficient of the Vulcan Arm is increased by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of P.ATK. Each hit has a <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> chance to increase the Fire/Neutral damage taken by the targets within range by an additional <color=#44afee>8%%</color>. Stacks up to <color=#44afee>6</color> times and lasts for <color=#44afee>3</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_6630251"]="Increases the skill effects of <color=#44afee>Midas Touch</color> by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_6630252"]="Increases the skill effects of <color=#44afee>Midas Touch</color> by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> and the Zeny obtained with the Bounty effect by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_6630253"]="Increases the skill damage of the <color=#44afee>Demonstration</color> by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_6630254"]="Increases the skill damage of <color=#44afee>Demonstration</color> by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>. There is a <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> chance of inflicting <color=#44afee>Weapon Break</color> on the hit enemies for <color=#44afee>10</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_6630255"]="Increases the Bleed effect caused by <color=#44afee>Acid Terror</color> by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_6630256"]="Increases the Bleed effect caused by <color=#44afee>Acid Terror</color> by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>. There is a <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> chance of inflicting <color=#44afee>Armor Damage</color> on enemies hit by Acid Bottle for <color=#44afee>10</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_6630257"]="<color=#44afee>Acid Demonstration</color> deals additional True DMG to the target equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of their Max HP. (Does not apply to MVP, Mini, and Boss units.)",
    ["SkillDesc_6630258"]="<color=#44afee>Acid Demonstration</color> deals additional Fire P.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of P.ATK + <color=#44afee>INT x %s</color> to other enemies within <color=#44afee>4</color> meters of the target.",
    ["SkillDesc_6630259"]="Increases the Spore Explosion damage to the implanted target by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_6630260"]="Increases the Spore Explosion damage to the implanted target by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> and the explosion range by <color=#44afee>2</color> meters.",
    ["SkillDesc_6630261"]="When a fire attack releases a target from the <color=#44afee>Thorn Trap</color>'s <color=#44afee>trap</color> state, it creates an on-fire area that deals Fire P.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of P.ATK + INT x %s every second to all enemies within <color=#44afee>4</color> meters for 12 seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_6630262"]="When a fire attack releases a target from the <color=#44afee>Thorn Trap</color>'s <color=#44afee>trap</color> state, it will continue burning the target, causing the target to receive Fire P.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of P.ATK per second and reducing the target's Bonus Heal Received by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> for <color=#44afee>12</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_6630263"]="Gain 1 stack of <color=#44afee>Fire Upgrade</color> whenever you deal Fire Damage. Each stack of <color=#44afee>Fire Upgrade</color> increases your Fire Attribute Enhancement by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>. Stacks up to <color=#44afee>10</color> times and lasts for <color=#44afee>10</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_6630264"]="Extends the duration of the <color=#44afee>Armor Breakage</color> and <color=#44afee>Weapon Breakage</color> effect on the target by <color=#44afee>%s</color> second(s). Inflicts <color=#44afee>Corrosion</color> at the same time, which reduces the target's healing received by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> and increases the damage the target receives from the caster's party by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>. <color=#44afee>Corrosion</color> lasts for <color=#44afee>10</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_6630265"]="Whenever you deal Fire Damage to the target, there is a <color=#44afee>100%%</color> chance to inflict the target with <color=#44afee>Kindle</color> for <color=#44afee>12</color>s. Targets that have <color=#44afee>Kindle</color> take Fire P.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of P.ATK + INT x %s every second. This effect stacks up to <color=#44afee>10</color> times. <color=#44afee>Kindle</color> can't be triggered repeatedly.",
    ["SkillDesc_6630266"]="When using <color=#44afee>Acid Terror</color> or <color=#44afee>Acid Demonstration</color>, there is a <color=#44afee>50%%</color> chance to inflict the target with <color=#44afee>Acidic Fog</color> for <color=#44afee>6</color> seconds. <color=#44afee>Acidic Fog</color> deals weapon attribute P.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of P.ATK every second to all enemies within <color=#44afee>5</color> meters of the target.",
    ["SkillDesc_6699801"]="Increases Armor Swap's trigger chance by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> and reduces its trigger interval by <color=#44afee>%s</color>. While riding Magic Gear, increases PVP Final P.DMG RED and PVP Final M.DMG RED by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_6699802"]="Attack Machine can now attack <color=#44afee>2</color> more targets. For every <color=#44afee>1</color> fewer target exists in range, its damage coefficient increases by an additional <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_6699803"]="Enemies within the zone have their Final ASPD, Final Haste, and MSPD reduced by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>, <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>, and <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>, respectively.",
    ["SkillDesc_6699804"]="While Emergency Armor is active, you have a <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> chance to resist control-type debuffs, triggering once every <color=#44afee>2</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_6699805"]="When attacking Adventurers with normal attacks and skills, reduces their PVP Debuff Resistance and PVP Debuff Duration Reduction by <color=#44afee>%s</color>. The trigger interval is reduced by <color=#44afee>%s</color> second(s).",
    ["SkillDesc_6699806"]="Automated Cannon has a (<color=#44afee>INT/%s x 1%%</color>) chance to fire one additional shot.",
    ["SkillDesc_6699807"]="While using Demonic Potion, your M.DMG taken is reduced by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> and you recover <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of your Max HP every second. Demonic Potion's duration extends to <color=#44afee>5</color> seconds. While under the effect of Demonic Potion, the damage of Impulsive Slash and Charged Blitz is increased by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_6699808"]="When attacking targets carrying shields, increases the damage coefficient of Acid Terror, Acid Demonstration, and Acidified Zone by an additional <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>. There's a <color=#44afee>15%%</color> chance to reduce the hit target's P.DEF and M.DEF by <color=#44afee>20%%</color> for <color=#44afee>3</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_6699809"]="All summon monsters and Homunculus deal <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> more damage, with a <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> chance to not consume skill items.",
    ["SkillDesc_6699901"]="When Crazy Uproar is active, Final Damage Bonus is additionally increased by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> and Final Damage Reduction is additionally increased by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_6699902"]="Decreases the Zeny costs of the Mammonite, Hurl Zeny, and Zeny Storm skills by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_6699903"]="When Cart Blitz hits the target, it has a <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> chance to knock them back <color=#44afee>3</color> meters. Also stuns them for <color=#44afee>1</color> second. This skill's knockback effect and Cart Assault's knockback effect do not stack.",
    ["SkillDesc_6699904"]="Increases the damage of Mammonite, Hurl Zeny, Zeny Storm, and Zenypult by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_6699951"]="Homunculi mark enemies for <color=#44afee>6</color> seconds when dealing damage to them. When the caster attacks a marked enemy, they deal an additional weapon attribute P.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of the caster's P.ATK. This can be triggered once every <color=#44afee>2</color> seconds (the Homunculus must be summoned again for this to take effect).",
    ["SkillDesc_6699952"]="<color=#44afee>Cart Boost</color> increases the party's MSPD by <color=#44afee>%s</color> and P.ATK by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>. You gain an additional <color=#44afee>1%%</color> MSPD for every <color=#44afee>1%%</color> HP you have lost.",
    ["SkillDesc_6699953"]="When a Homunculus is on the field, <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of the damage dealt to you will be dealt to the Homunculus instead (the Homunculus must be summoned again for this to take effect).",
    ["SkillDesc_6699954"]="When <color=#44afee>Armor Protection</color>, <color=#44afee>Accessory Protection</color>, and <color=#44afee>Weapon Protection</color> are all active at the same time, <color=#44afee>Strip Armor</color>, <color=#44afee>Strip Accessory</color>, and <color=#44afee>Strip Weapon</color> will be removed from the target, and the target will be immune to <color=#44afee>Strip Armor</color>, <color=#44afee>Strip Accessory</color>, and <color=#44afee>Strip Armor</color> for <color=#44afee>%s</color> second(s).",
    ["SkillDesc_6710801"]="Increase the damage of the Elegant Shot by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>. Every time the target takes damage, their Final P.DMG Reduction will be reduced by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>. This effect stacks up to <color=#44afee>20</color> times and lasts <color=#44afee>3</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_6710802"]="Increase the damage of Fire Dance by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>. Each additional target that exists in the skill range increases the damage of Fire Dance by an additional <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_6710803"]="Increase the damage of Hammer of God by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> and ignore <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of the target's Stun Resistance.",
    ["SkillDesc_6710804"]="Increase the damage of Madness Canceller by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>. Each additional target that exists in the skill range increases the damage of the Madness Canceller by an additional <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_6710901"]="Increase Tracking's damage by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> and your P.ATK by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> for <color=#44afee>6</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_6710902"]="Increase Dust's damage by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> and your Final P.DMG Bonus by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> for <color=#44afee>6</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_6710903"]="Increase Piercing Shot's damage by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> and your PVP Final P.DMG Bonus by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> for <color=#44afee>6</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_6710904"]="Increase Deatheye Missile's damage by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> and shorten its cooldown by <color=#44afee>1</color> second for each target it hits.",
    ["SkillDesc_6710905"]="During Magical Bullet's effective period, your P.ATK percentage is increased by an additional <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> for <color=#44afee>8</color> seconds every time you cause damage.",
    ["SkillDesc_6710906"]="Platinum Alter's control effect will ignore <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of the target's Stun Resistance.",
    ["SkillDesc_6710907"]="When you Flip the Coin, if the front side is facing up, your Physical Lifesteal is increased by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>; if the back side is facing up, your Neutral attribute enhancement and Neutral attribute resistance are increased by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>. Last for <color=#44afee>12</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_6710908"]="Increase Desperado's damage by an additional <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>. Each enemy target that exists within the skill range decreases the effect by <color=#44afee>24%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_6710909"]="After Fallen Angel is cast, your Final P.DMG Bonus is increased by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> for <color=#44afee>10</color> seconds. This effect stacks up to <color=#44afee>3</color> times.",
    ["SkillDesc_6710910"]="The chance of triggering extra bullets in Chain Action is increased by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_6710911"]="After casting Concentration Realm, receive <color=#44afee>3</color> stacks of Concentration Defense. Each stack of Concentration Defense can negate one ranged physical attack. Staying in the Concentration Realm every <color=#44afee>%s</color> seconds grants <color=#44afee>2</color> additional stacks of Concentration Defense.",
    ["SkillDesc_6710912"]="Increase Mass Spiral's damage by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> and your PVP Final P.DMG Bonus by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> x Cast Time when firing a penetrating bullet. This effect lasts for <color=#44afee>20</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_6710913"]="Targets hit by the Gatling will now take an additional <color=#44afee>0.5%%</color> damage from the shooter and their party members. This skill effect lasts for <color=#44afee>3</color> seconds and stacks up to <color=#44afee>%s</color> times.",
    ["SkillDesc_6710914"]="Increases the damage of Slug Shot by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_6710915"]="After entering the Duel state, your P.DEF is decreased by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>, and your P.DMG is increased by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_6710916"]="Increase the damage of Anti-Material Blast by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>. The target will receive extra True DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of their Max HP from each hit. (Does not apply to MVP, MINI, Boss)",
    ["SkillDesc_6799801"]="When used on Adventurers, Basic Grenade deals splash damage to enemies within <color=#44afee>4</color> meters, which is equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of the Basic Grenade's damage.",
    ["SkillDesc_6799802"]="Reduces Spiral Shooting's cooldown by <color=#44afee>2</color> seconds. After casting Spiral Shooting, your skill damage against monsters is increased by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> for <color=#44afee>5</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_6799803"]="Increases the grenade range by <color=#44afee>2</color> meters and reduces the MSPD of hit enemies by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> for <color=#44afee>3</color> seconds, ignoring their Slow Resistance by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_6799804"]="If you have <color=#44afee>3</color> stacks of Focus, casting Wild Fire on monsters also deals <color=#44afee>6</color> rounds of weapon attribute P.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of P.ATK to other monsters within <color=#44afee>6</color> meters. If there are no other monsters within <color=#44afee>6</color> meters, <color=#44afee>2</color> additional Focus stacks will be consumed, dealing weapon attribute P.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of P.ATK to the target.",
    ["SkillDesc_6799805"]="While Vigilante is active, your PVP Final P.DEF and PVP Final M.DEF are increased by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_6799806"]="Leaving the Concentration Realm extends the duration of Concentration Realm's buff by <color=#44afee>3</color> seconds and grants you <color=#44afee>%s</color> additional MSPD for <color=#44afee>%s</color> second(s).",
    ["SkillDesc_6799901"]="Using Camouflage to enter Stealth state grants you a shield equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of your Max HP for <color=#44afee>3</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_6799902"]="After learning <color=#44afee>Banishing Buster</color>, normal attacks have a <color=#44afee>50%%</color> chance to deal additional True DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of P.ATK while under the <color=#44afee>Magical Bullet</color> state.",
    ["SkillDesc_6799903"]="Attacking a target with Crimson Marker grants you an additional <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of PVP Final P.DMG Bonus for 3 seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_6799904"]="Grants a <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> chance to receive <color=#44afee>1</color> extra stack of <color=#44afee>Heat</color> effect when reloading.",
    ["SkillDesc_6831201"]="After releasing <color=#44afee>Suiton - Wave</color>, gain a shield equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of your Max HP x the level of <color=#44afee>Suiton - Wave</color> for <color=#44afee>12</color> seconds. You now carry a Water attribute armor during the shielded period.",
    ["SkillDesc_6831202"]="Reduce the M.DEF percentage of all targets within the <color=#44afee>vortex</color> by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>. Stacks up to <color=#44afee>3</color> and lasting <color=#44afee>8</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_6831203"]="After releasing <color=#44afee>Suiton - Wave</color>, gain a shield equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of your Max HP x the level of <color=#44afee>Suiton - Wave</color> for <color=#44afee>12</color> seconds. You now obtain <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> Freeze RES and carry a Water attribute armor during the shielded period.",
    ["SkillDesc_6831204"]="Reduce the M.DEF percentage of all targets within the <color=#44afee>vortex</color> by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>. Stacks up to <color=#44afee>3</color> and lasting <color=#44afee>8</color> seconds. After reaching <color=#44afee>3</color> stacks, the target will be frozen for <color=#44afee>5</color> seconds. While frozen, the targets' Armor attribute will become <color=#44afee>Water</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_6831205"]="After releasing <color=#44afee>Katon - Fire Breath</color>, your M.DMG Reflection is increased by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> for <color=#44afee>8</color> seconds, stacking up to <color=#44afee>10</color>. While the effect is active, you will receive 1 stack of buff for <color=#44afee>8</color> seconds whenever you take damage.",
    ["SkillDesc_6831206"]="The explosion effect also ignites up to <color=#44afee>5</color> other targets within range, dealing Fire attribute M.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of the M.ATK every second to the target and surrounding targets within <color=#44afee>4</color> meters. Lasts <color=#44afee>5</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_6831207"]="After releasing <color=#44afee>Katon - Fire Breath</color>, you gain 1 stack of <color=#44afee>Backfire</color> for <color=#44afee>8</color> seconds, stacking up to <color=#44afee>10</color>. Each time an enemy deals damage to you, the enemy receives Fire attribute M.DMG equal to (<color=#44afee>%s%%</color> x the stacks of <color=#44afee>Backfire</color>) of the M.ATK. While the effect is active, you will receive 1 stack of buff for <color=#44afee>8</color> seconds whenever you take damage.",
    ["SkillDesc_6831208"]="The explosion effect also ignites up to <color=#44afee>5</color> other targets within range, dealing Fire attribute M.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of the M.ATK every second to the target and surrounding targets within <color=#44afee>4</color> meters. Lasts <color=#44afee>5</color> seconds. If there's only <color=#44afee>1</color> target within range, the target receives extra Fire attribute M.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of the M.ATK.",
    ["SkillDesc_6831209"]="Every <color=#44afee>1.5</color> seconds, it deals Wind attribute M.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of the M.ATK x the level of thundercloud to an extra random target. Targets within 3 meters take an extra <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> damage.",
    ["SkillDesc_6831210"]="Inflicts Blind on hit targets. When targets are already under the Blind state, they receive an extra <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of Wind DMG and have their Final Haste reduced by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> for <color=#44afee>5</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_6831211"]="Every <color=#44afee>1.5</color> seconds, it deals Wind attribute M.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of the M.ATK x the level of thundercloud to an extra random target. If there is only 1 target within range, the target takes extra <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> damage.",
    ["SkillDesc_6831212"]="Inflicts Blind on hit targets. When targets are already under the Blind state, they receive an extra <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of Wind DMG and have their fixed cooldown of all skills increased by <color=#44afee>%s</color> second(s) for <color=#44afee>5</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_6831213"]="When successfully defeating a target using Kagutsuchi, it can be used again within <color=#44afee>3</color> seconds (with or without Fire Mark), with its damage increased by <color=#44afee>100%%</color>. This effect can only be triggered once every <color=#44afee>%s</color> second(s).",
    ["SkillDesc_6831214"]="Increases the Slow effect of the <color=#44afee>Suijinton - Mitsuha</color> by an extra <color=#44afee>%s</color>. After releasing the skill, it reduces the Slow Resistance of the enemies in the water area by an extra <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_6831215"]="For each enemy within the attack range of Takemikazuchi, its damage coefficient increases by an additional <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> x M.ATK. Up to <color=#44afee>5</color> enemies will be counted toward the increase.",
    ["SkillDesc_6831216"]="The Vortex Shuriken, Gusty Shuriken, and Explosive Shuriken triggered by Huuma Trinity ignore the target's Water, Fire, and Wind attribute reduction by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>. Whenever the Shuriken hits a target in the air, there's a <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> chance to reduce Huuma Trinity's cooldown by <color=#44afee>3</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_6831301"]="After throwing Shuriken, increase your Final P.DMG Bonus by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> for <color=#44afee>7</color> seconds. Stacks up to <color=#44afee>3</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_6831302"]="The <color=#44afee>Shadow Jump</color> gains an extra effect: Before and after the jump, it deals Shadow attribute P.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of the P.ATK to all enemies within 4 meters.",
    ["SkillDesc_6831303"]="When Shuriken hits the target, it inflicts Bleed on the target, dealing Neutral DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of the P.ATK for <color=#44afee>7</color> seconds. Stacks up to <color=#44afee>3</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_6831304"]="After using Mist Slash, it removes all debuffs and grants you immunity for debuffs for <color=#44afee>5</color> seconds. Your MSPD is increased by <color=#44afee>%s</color> for <color=#44afee>10</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_6831305"]="Each time North Wind hits a target, it further increases your Shadow and Neutral attributes by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>. Stacks up to <color=#44afee>5</color> and lasts <color=#44afee>4</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_6831306"]="Each time <color=#44afee>Chaotic Dance</color> hits an enemy, there's a <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> chance to grant you 2 stacks of effects that block off <color=#44afee>1</color> instance of P.DMG. Lasts 6 seconds. Stacks up to <color=#44afee>20</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_6831307"]="When <color=#44afee>Shadow Slash</color> deals damage, if the target is under <color=#44afee>Slow, Freeze, Stun, Immobilize, Petrify, or Bleed</color> state, it deals extra Shadow attribute P.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of the P.ATK to the target. If the target receiving damage is within <color=#44afee>3</color> meters of you, <color=#44afee>Shadow Slash</color>'s cooldown is reduced by <color=#44afee>1</color> second.",
    ["SkillDesc_6831308"]="Within <color=#44afee>5</color> seconds after releasing <color=#44afee>Final Strike</color>, if your skills or normal attacks deal damage, they now carry an additional weapon attribute P.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of P.ATK that ignores the target's defense. This damage is increased by <color=#44afee>100%%</color> to targets in the Bleed state. Triggers up to <color=#44afee>20</color> times.",
    ["SkillDesc_6831309"]="After learning <color=#44afee>Kagemusha</color>, if you are under the <color=#44afee>Hiding</color> state, your SP cost is reduced by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> and you restore <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of your Max HP every second.",
    ["SkillDesc_6831310"]="When <color=#44afee>Soul</color> is activated, there's a <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> chance to receive 1 additional stack of <color=#44afee>Soul</color> whenever you receive the <color=#44afee>Soul</color> effect.",
    ["SkillDesc_6831311"]="Every time Swirling Shuriken deals damage, your Physical Lifesteal is increased by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> for 10 seconds. Stacks up to <color=#44afee>20</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_6831312"]="Increases the chance of creating a shadow clone by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> and the damage coefficient by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_6831313"]="Every time <color=#44afee>Chaotic Dance</color> hits an enemy, it reduces the enemy's Max HP by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> for 10 seconds. Stacks up to <color=#44afee>10</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_6831314"]="When <color=#44afee>Shadow Mist</color>'s Hiding effect is activated, your fixed cooldown is additionally reduced by <color=#44afee>%s</color> for <color=#44afee>5</color> seconds. Cooldown: <color=#44afee>25</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_6831315"]="Restores <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of your Max HP every second when you are within the shadow area.",
    ["SkillDesc_6831316"]="Increases Iaijutsu Strike's slashing damage by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>, and Sword Aura's damage by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>. After releasing Sword Aura, your HP is restored by <color=#44afee>100%%</color> x the damage taken during the Iaijutsu period.",
    ["SkillDesc_6899801"]="If you have 10 or more stacks of Soul while casting Final Strike, the cooldown of Soul will end <color=#44afee>%s</color> second(s) early.",
    ["SkillDesc_6899802"]="Reduces the HP loss per second by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> after activating Soul.",
    ["SkillDesc_6899803"]="Reduces the damage taken by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> while under Enton.\nGetting hit under Muton will not remove your Stealth stage.\nIncreases your MSPD by <color=#44afee>%s</color> while under Ranton.",
    ["SkillDesc_6899804"]="If a marked target takes damage of the same element again, the mark activates, dealing M.DMG (same attribute of the mark) equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of the caster's M.ATK for <color=#44afee>3</color> seconds. Triggers <color=#44afee>once</color> every <color=#44afee>5</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_6899805"]="Increases Mist Slash's damage coefficient by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>. There's a <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> chance to inflict Blind on the target.",
    ["SkillDesc_6899806"]="Whether the target is moving or not, a shadow area will be generated once every <color=#44afee>%s</color> second(s). The maximum number of shadow areas that can exist at a time is increased to (Shadow Equipment Skill Level/5, rounded down).",
    ["SkillDesc_6899807"]="After casting Shadow Jump, your MSPD is increased by <color=#44afee>2</color> for <color=#44afee>%s</color> second(s).",
    ["SkillDesc_6899808"]="Max stack limit of Ninjutsu Enhancement is increased by <color=#44afee>%s</color>. Each stack of Ninjutsu Enhancement increases your Fire, Water, and Wind attributes by an additional <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_6899901"]="When an Escape Technique hits more than 1 target, each additional target hit reduces the cooldown of Izayoi by <color=#44afee>%s</color> second(s). Triggers up to once every 4 seconds. Cooldown reduction is capped when hitting 4 additional targets.",
    ["SkillDesc_6899902"]="The cooldown of Cast-off Ciceda Shell is reduced by <color=#44afee>%s</color> second(s).",
    ["SkillDesc_6899903"]="Every 2 seconds during the effective period of Meikyo Shisui, it increases your PVP Final M.DMG Bonus by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> for 40 seconds. Stacks up to 10.",
    ["SkillDesc_6899904"]="For each enemy within the effective range of Reaper, Jyusatsu's cooldown is reduced by <color=#44afee>%s</color> second(s). This effect triggers once every <color=#44afee>2</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_6899905"]="<color=#44afee>Soul</color>'s stacking limit is increased by <color=#44afee>%s</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_6899906"]="Every 2 seconds during the effective period of Meikyo Shisui, it increases your PVP Final P.DMG Bonus by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> for 40 seconds. Stacks up to 10.",
    ["SkillDesc_6910301"]="Warm Wind increases the corresponding elemental enhancement by an extra <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_6910302"]="Warm Wind increases the corresponding elemental resistance by an extra <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_6910303"]="After Espa deals damage, changes the elemental attribute based on Warm Wind, and reduces the target's corresponding elemental resistance by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> for <color=#44afee>5</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_6910304"]="After Espa deals damage, increases your PVP Final M.DMG Bonus by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> for <color=#44afee>5</color> seconds, stacking up to <color=#44afee>3</color> times.",
    ["SkillDesc_6910305"]="For every <color=#44afee>60</color> LUK, Espa, Esha, Eswhoo, and Eske ignore <color=#44afee>1%%</color> of the monster's Final M.DEF when dealing damage to them, up to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_6910306"]="For every <color=#44afee>35</color> LUK, Espa, Esha, Eswhoo, and Eske ignore <color=#44afee>1%%</color> of the Adventurer's Final M.DEF when dealing damage to them, up to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_6910307"]="When Eswhoo defeats a monster, there's a <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> chance to reduce cooldown by <color=#44afee>0.5</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_6910308"]="Eswhoo deals extra Neutral attribute True DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of Max HP to Adventurers.",
    ["SkillDesc_6910309"]="Eske's infection chance increases by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>. If the infected target is a monster, the damage coefficient is increased by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of M.ATK.",
    ["SkillDesc_6910310"]="Eske's infection chance increases by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>. If the infected target is an Adventurer, the target's PVP Final P.DMG RED and PVP Final M.DMG RED are reduced by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> and <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_6910311"]="Party members with Falcon's Soul, Shadow's Soul, or Fairy's Soul gain <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> Final P.DMG Bonus and <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> Final M.DMG Bonus. Party members with Golem's Soul gain <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> Final P.DMG RED and <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> Final M.DMG RED.",
    ["SkillDesc_6910312"]="Party members with Falcon's Soul, Shadow's Soul, or Fairy's Soul gain <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> PVP Final P.DMG Bonus and <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> PVP Final M.DMG Bonus. Party members with Golem's Soul gain <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> PVP Final P.DMG RED and <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> PVP Final M.DMG RED.",
    ["SkillDesc_6910313"]="Soul Gathering's trigger chance increases by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>, and each stack of Soul Gathering grants party members an extra <color=#44afee>%s</color> PVP Debuff Resistance and PVP Debuff Duration Reduction.",
    ["SkillDesc_6910314"]="Soul Gathering's trigger chance increases by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>, and each stack of Soul Gathering increases your HP by an extra <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_6910315"]="Estun's control effects ignore the target's corresponding resistance by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_6910316"]="While Soul Fatigue is active, the target's VIT bonus is reduced by an extra <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_6910317"]="While <color=#44afee>Warm Wind</color> is active, party members gain an extra <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> resistance of the corresponding element.",
    ["SkillDesc_6910318"]="Increases Espa's Slow effect by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> and extends MSPD buffs by <color=#44afee>%s</color> second(s). Esha's Armor Break effect is increased by <color=#44afee>%s</color> second(s).",
    ["SkillDesc_6910319"]="When Divine Resonance reaches <color=#44afee>6</color> stacks, <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of its effect is shared among all party members.",
    ["SkillDesc_6910320"]="Each stack of Divine Resonance reduces the fixed cooldown of Protective Talisman, Samurai Talisman, Mage Talisman, and Five Elements Talisman by <color=#44afee>%s</color> second(s).",
    ["SkillDesc_6910321"]="While <color=#44afee>Lost Soul</color> is active, the target's Physical Lifesteal and Magic Lifesteal are reduced by an extra <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>, and their recovery effects are also reduced by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_6910322"]="While <color=#44afee>Lost Soul</color> is active, reduces the target's PVP Final P.DEF and PVP Final M.DEF by an extra <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> and <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>, and natural recovery is disabled.",
    ["SkillDesc_6910323"]="Within the Shrine of the Underworld, increases party members' HP by <color=#44afee>%s</color>, Final P.DEF / Final M.DEF by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>, and Final P.DMG RED / Final M.DMG RED by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_6910324"]="Within the Shrine of the Underworld, party members recover <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> Max HP and <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> Max SP per second.",
    ["SkillDesc_6930601"]="Grants additional <color=#44afee>%s</color> Soul Essence(s) when entering battle, and the chance to obtain Soul Essences upon dealing damage increases by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_6930602"]="Increases the maximum Soul Essences gained per second from Soul Collect by <color=#44afee>%s</color>, and the chance to obtain Soul Essences upon dealing damage increases by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_6930603"]="Soul Explosion has a <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> chance to deal double damage to the target.",
    ["SkillDesc_6930604"]="While Soul Explosion is active, for every <color=#44afee>%s</color> INT, further increases damage coefficient by <color=#44afee>1%%</color>, and further increases the maximum damage coefficient by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_6930605"]="When dealing damage with a Two-Handed Rod, there's a <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> chance to gain <color=#44afee>1</color> extra stack of <color=#44afee>Soul Insight</color>. When taking damage, there's also a <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> chance to gain <color=#44afee>1</color> extra stack of <color=#44afee>Soul Insight</color>",
    ["SkillDesc_6930606"]="When Soul Insight reaches <color=#44afee>5</color> stacks, automatically gains<color=#44afee>1</color> Soul Essence every <color=#44afee>%s</color> second(s).",
    ["SkillDesc_6930607"]="Each stack of Soul Essence increases your Final DMG Bonus by an extra <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>. While <color=#44afee>Soul Unity</color> is active, the damage of <color=#44afee>Soul Explosion</color>, <color=#44afee>Soul Harvest</color>, and <color=#44afee>Curse Explosion</color> are increased by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_6930608"]="Each stack of Soul Essence increases your Final DMG Bonus by an extra <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> and reduces the trigger interval of <color=#44afee>Soul Unity</color> by <color=#44afee>%s</color> second(s).",
    ["SkillDesc_6930609"]="The damage coefficient of returning Soul Fragments increases by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> and increases your Max HP by an extra <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> upon returning.",
    ["SkillDesc_6930610"]="The damage coefficient of returning Soul Fragments increases by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> and increases your MSPD by an extra <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> for <color=#44afee>2</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_6930611"]="While Soul Division is active, auto-attacks have a <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> chance to spawn an extra soul dealing equal damage to the enemy.",
    ["SkillDesc_6930612"]="While Soul Division is active, reduces all your damage taken by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_6930613"]="Curse Explosion's damage coefficient increases by an extra <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> and ignores an extra <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of the target's Final M.DMG RED.",
    ["SkillDesc_6930614"]="Curse Explosion's damage coefficient increases by an extra <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> and ignores <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> an extra of the target's PVP Final M.DMG RED.",
    ["SkillDesc_6930615"]="When a movement-restricting effect is removed, gain an extra <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> MSPD bonus for <color=#44afee>3</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_6930616"]="Kaina's trigger interval is reduced by <color=#44afee>%s</color> second(s).",
    ["SkillDesc_6930617"]="Extends the duration of Spirit Form to <color=#44afee>3</color> seconds. When the effect ends, increases HP by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_6930618"]="Targets marked by Soul Gaze now remain revealed longer for <color=#44afee>%s</color> second(s), and their Final DMG taken during the period increases to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_6930619"]="Soul Taint's area damage gains an extra <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of ATK.",
    ["SkillDesc_6930620"]="After Soul Taint hits an Adventurer, it applies <color=#44afee>Infection</color>, reducing their damage by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> for <color=#44afee>3</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_6930621"]="Each stack of Four Guardians Blessing further increases your damage dealt to monsters by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_6930622"]="Each stack of Four Guardians Blessing recovers an additional <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of your Max HP.",
    ["SkillDesc_6930623"]="Monsters inside the Elemental Four Guardians Field take extra <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> weapon attribute M.DMG, and also receive <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> more damage from party members.",
    ["SkillDesc_6930624"]="Party members standing on a field node have an extra <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> chance to reduce control duration by an extra <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>. Enemies entering a node are immediately silenced.",
    ["SkillDesc_6931401"]="Increases the damage of <color=#44afee>Rising Kick</color> by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>. After casting this skill, increases Final P.DMG Bonus by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> for <color=#44afee>6</color> seconds. Stacks up to <color=#44afee>3</color> times.",
    ["SkillDesc_6931402"]="Increases the damage of <color=#44afee>Round Kick</color> by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.\n After learning <color=#44afee>Feeling of the Stars</color>, restores ((1~2) x <color=#44afee>%s</color>) Energy based on the number of targets hit each time the skill deals damage.",
    ["SkillDesc_6931403"]="Increases the damage of <color=#44afee>Shattering Kick</color> by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>. Each stack of weakness additionally decreases the target's P.DEF by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_6931404"]="Taekwon sacrifices the vision and enters a state of eternal <color=#44afee>Blindness</color> (cannot be dispelled), and increases Final DMG Bonus by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_6931405"]="Increases the damage of <color=#44afee>Axe Kick</color> by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>. After casting this skill, increases PVP Final P.DMG Bonus by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> for <color=#44afee>6</color> seconds. Stacks up to <color=#44afee>3</color> times.",
    ["SkillDesc_6931406"]="Increases the damage of <color=#44afee>Whirlwind Kick</color> by [<color=#44afee>%s%%</color> x (3-current stars)].",
    ["SkillDesc_6931407"]="Increases the damage of <color=#44afee>Ignition Kick</color> by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>. Dealing damage to the target with this skill has a <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> chance to restore (<color=#44afee>12</color> x <color=#44afee>weakness</color> stacks) Energy.",
    ["SkillDesc_6931408"]="When within range of the Sun Realm, recover <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> Max HP and Max SP every 5 seconds, and deal Fire attribute physical damage equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of P.ATK to the attacker after taking physical damage.",
    ["SkillDesc_6931409"]="Increases the damage of <color=#44afee>Blast Kick</color> by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>. Dealing damage with this skill reduces the target's Stun RES by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> for <color=#44afee>3</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_6931410"]="Increases the damage of <color=#44afee>Cyclone Kick</color> by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.\n After learning <color=#44afee>Feeling of the Stars</color>, restores ((1 - 2) x <color=#44afee>%s</color>) Energy based on the number of targets hit each time the skill deals damage.",
    ["SkillDesc_6931411"]="Increases the damage of <color=#44afee>Atomic Kick</color> by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> and increases its True DMG coefficient by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.\n After dealing damage with <color=#44afee>Atomic Kick</color>, instantly kills targets with HP below (Max Hp x <color=#44afee>weakness</color> stacks x 2%%) (ineffective against MVP, MINI, and Boss) and restores <color=#44afee>%s</color> Energy.",
    ["SkillDesc_6931412"]="When within range of the Sun or Moon Realms, for every enemy target defeated within <color=#44afee>4</color> meters, receives one of the following effects based on the current mode:\nPVP: Each enemy player defeated restores <color=#44afee>%s</color> Energy, up to <color=#44afee>400</color> every 10 seconds.\nPVE: Each monster defeated restores <color=#44afee>%s</color> Energy, up to <color=#44afee>200</color> every 10 seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_6931413"]="When within range of the <color=#44afee>Sun Realm</color>, increases Fire Attribute Enhancement and Fire Attribute Resistance by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> for all party members within the realm's range.",
    ["SkillDesc_6931414"]="After dealing damage with <color=#44afee>Sun Explosion</color>, ignites the ground around the target for <color=#44afee>6</color> seconds, which ignites enemies that enter the area, dealing Fire attribute physical damage equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of P.ATK every 2 seconds for 6 seconds. Each instance of this damage on each target (up to 3 targets) has a <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> chance to restore <color=#44afee>6</color> Energy.",
    ["SkillDesc_6931415"]="When within range of the <color=#44afee>Moon Realm</color>, increases Adaptive Weapon Attribute Enhancement by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> for all party members within the realm's range.",
    ["SkillDesc_6931416"]="Enter the Hiding state after casting <color=#44afee>Union of the Moon</color>. This effect cannot be dispelled by taking damage (up to <color=#44afee>7</color> instances of damage). Increases the damage of the next Ultimate by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> for <color=#44afee>15</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_6999801"]="At Noon, increases the flame area by <color=#44afee>1</color> meter and its damage coefficient by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>. At Sunset, increases your damage dealt to monsters with <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> or less HP by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_6999802"]="At Moonrise, you gain <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> extra shield. At Moonset, increases your damage dealt to Adventurers with <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> or less HP by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_6999803"]="Boosts MSPD even without moving in one direction. There's <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> chance to remove <color=#44afee>1</color> debuff from you every <color=#44afee>1</color> second during running.",
    ["SkillDesc_6999804"]="Increases instant HP regen by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> and reduces your Final DMG taken by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> during the <color=#44afee>5</color>-second HP regen period.",
    ["SkillDesc_6999901"]="When party members within <color=#44afee>30</color> meters of Taekwon cast skills or perform normal attacks <color=#44afee>50</color> times, the entire party receives a blessing, increasing their Final P.DMG Bonus by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> for <color=#44afee>3</color> seconds, stacking up to <color=#44afee>3</color> times.",
    ["SkillDesc_6999902"]="After casting <color=#44afee>Full Moon Kick</color>, each enemy it deals damage to (up to 3) grants 1 stack of shield equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of P.ATK for <color=#44afee>6</color> seconds. (The shield is affected by Max HP percentage bonuses.)",
    ["SkillDesc_6999903"]="<color=#44afee>Anger of the Stars</color> increases Final DMG Bonus by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> in PVP.",
    ["SkillDesc_6999904"]="When party members within <color=#44afee>30</color> meters of Taekwon cast skills or perform normal attacks <color=#44afee>50</color> times, Taekwon receives a blessing, increasing Taekwon's Final P.DMG Bonus by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> for <color=#44afee>3</color> seconds, stacking up to <color=#44afee>3</color> times.",
    ["SkillDesc_74012101"]="Deals weapon attribute P.DMG equal to (<color=#44afee>90%%</color> of P.ATK + caster's INT x <color=#44afee>20</color>) to the target.\nAfter evolving over 1 time, normal attacks will have a <color=#44afee>50%%</color> chance to slow the target by <color=#44afee>50%%</color> over <color=#44afee>3</color> seconds and dispelling 1 buff from the target (dispel effect only works on characters). This evolved effect can only be triggered once per <color=#44afee>3</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_74012102"]="Restore HP equal to <color=#44afee>560%%</color> of P.ATK + caster's INT x <color=#44afee>240</color> to a random allied unit within <color=#44afee>8</color> meters of Lif.",
    ["SkillDesc_74012103"]="When the caster is immobilized, slowed, confused, or frozen, they become immune to such effects for <color=#44afee>3</color> seconds. This can be triggered once every <color=#44afee>12</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_74012104"]="Lif restores the HP of allied units within <color=#44afee>4</color> meters, recovering HP equal to <color=#44afee>97%%</color> P.ATK + caster's INT x <color=#44afee>45</color> to each target every second for <color=#44afee>6</color> seconds. When there are more than <color=#44afee>3</color> targets within range, the healing amount decreases by <color=#44afee>25%%</color> for every additional target, down to the default healing amount of <color=#44afee>25%%</color>. This is only cast when Lif or the caster's HP is lower than <color=#44afee>65%%</color>, and each target can only be affected by 1 <color=#44afee>Brain Surgery</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_74013101"]="Uses the pointy horns to attack the target, dealing caster's weapon attribute P.DMG equal to (<color=#44afee>100%%</color> of P.ATK + caster's INT x <color=#44afee>25</color>). Damage dealt by normal attacks generates a large number of Threats.\nAfter evolving over 1 time, normal attacks can deal an additional <color=#44afee>35%%</color> of damage to the enemies within a <color=#44afee>3</color>-meter nearby area. Damage dealt by this skill generates a large number of Threats.",
    ["SkillDesc_74013102"]="Enhances the P.DEF and M.DEF of Amistr and all allied units within <color=#44afee>4</color> meters of Amistr by <color=#44afee>50%%</color> for <color=#44afee>6</color> seconds. Cooldown: <color=#44afee>12</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_74013103"]="When Amistr's HP is reduced to <color=#44afee>50%%</color>, Amistr and the caster gain a shield equal to <color=#44afee>40%%</color> of caster's Max HP that lasts for <color=#44afee>8</color> seconds. This shield can be triggered once every <color=#44afee>24</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_74013104"]="Amistr charges at the target, dealing weapon attribute P.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>300%%</color> of P.ATK + caster's INT x <color=#44afee>150</color> to the target and enemies within <color=#44afee>4</color> meters of the target. At the same time, Amistr gathers together the targets within range and taunts them for <color=#44afee>3</color> seconds, as well as stunning the target for <color=#44afee>3</color> seconds. Cooldown: <color=#44afee>12</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_74014101"]="Deals caster's weapon attribute P.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>100%%</color> P.ATK to the target. After evolving over 1 time, Vanilmirth's normal attacks now have a <color=#44afee>35%%</color> chance to spread unstable matters in a <color=#44afee>5</color>-meter area nearby (trigger interval: 2s), exploding after <color=#44afee>3</color> seconds and dealing caster's weapon attribute P.DMG equal to (<color=#44afee>200%%</color> of P.ATK + caster's INT x <color=#44afee>90</color> (up to <color=#44afee>110%%</color> of caster's P.ATK)) to the enemies within <color=#44afee>2</color> meters.",
    ["SkillDesc_74014102"]="Shoots an Elemental Arrow of a random level (Lv.1–Lv.10) at a random target within <color=#44afee>6</color> meters, dealing P.DMG of the Elemental Arrow's attribute equal to <color=#44afee>360%%</color> x Elemental Arrow Level x P.ATK + caster's INT x <color=#44afee>90</color> (up to <color=#44afee>110%%</color> of caster's P.ATK) x Elemental Arrow Level. Cooldown: <color=#44afee>3</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_74014103"]="Every <color=#44afee>6</color> seconds, Vanilmirth automatically casts Heal of a random level (Lv.1 to Lv.10) on a random target within <color=#44afee>6</color> meters (the caster or Homunculus itself), restoring HP equal to (<color=#44afee>100%%</color> of P.ATK + INT x <color=#44afee>75</color> (up to <color=#44afee>90%%</color> of caster's P.ATK) x Heal Level).",
    ["SkillDesc_74014105"]="Vanilmirth triggers a massive explosion, dealing caster's weapon attribute P.DMG equal to (<color=#44afee>1000%%</color> of P.ATK + caster's INT x <color=#44afee>200</color> (up to <color=#44afee>250%%</color> of caster's P.ATK) + <color=#44afee>12%%</color> of caster's Max HP) to the enemies within <color=#44afee>4</color> meters. Damage converted from the caster's Max HP is capped at <color=#44afee>72</color> times the caster's P.ATK. Cooldown: <color=#44afee>24</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_74015101"]="Deals a total of caster's weapon attribute P.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>100%%</color> of P.ATK + caster's INT x <color=#44afee>50</color> (up to <color=#44afee>60%%</color> of caster's P.ATK) in <color=#44afee>3 times</color> to the target. This damage can be critical.\nAfter evolving over 1 time, Filir's normal attacks now have a <color=#44afee>35%%</color> chance of marking the target. The marked target receives higher damage based on the current HP lost when they get hit by Filir, increasing <color=#44afee>4%%</color> of their damage received for each <color=#44afee>1%%</color> HP lost. The marks last for <color=#44afee>6</color> seconds and can only be triggered once every <color=#44afee>24</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_74015102"]="Attacks the target <color=#44afee>8</color> times in a short time, dealing caster's weapon attribute P.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>100%%</color> of P.ATK + caster's INT x <color=#44afee>15</color> (up to <color=#44afee>20%%</color> of caster's P.ATK) each time. This damage can be critical. When <color=#44afee>Moonlight</color> triggers a critical hit, there's a <color=#44afee>30%%</color> chance to reduce its cooldown by <color=#44afee>1</color> second.",
    ["SkillDesc_74015103"]="Gain 1 stack of <color=#44afee>Fleet Move</color> after each successful normal attack or critical hit triggered by <color=#44afee>Moonlight</color>. Filir's P.ATK, Final Crit, and Final Hit are increased by <color=#44afee>2%%</color>, and Crit DMG Bonus is increased by <color=#44afee>4%%</color> during this time. Stacks up to <color=#44afee>5</color> times and lasts for <color=#44afee>15</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_74015105"]="After flying into the sky and becoming untargetable, Filir lands randomly and deals weapon attribute P.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>100%%</color> of P.ATK + caster's INT x <color=#44afee>30</color> (up to <color=#44afee>40%%</color> of caster's P.ATK) <color=#44afee>12</color> times to the target and all enemies within <color=#44afee>3</color> meters of the target. This damage can be critical and can only be cast on marked targets. Cooldown: <color=#44afee>6</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_80100001"]="Deals true damage equal to 5%% Max HP to all targets within a 6-meter radius of yourself once every 30 seconds in combat, and knocks them back 6 meters. When the target’s HP is lower than 50%% after taking the damage, then there is a 35%% chance that the target will be stunned for 2 seconds. This skill does not apply to Boss, Mini, or MVP targets.",
    ["SkillDesc_80100002"]="When you are in combat and your HP is below 35%%, 5 Swords of Judgement will fall at random locations within a 6-meter radius of yourself. The Sword of Judgement will immobilize enemies within 3 meters for 3 seconds, dealing true damage which is equal to 3%% Max HP, and converting the damage dealt into a healing effect on yourself. The skill takes effect every 30 seconds, and a target can only be affected by a Sword of Judgement at the same time. This skill does not apply to Boss, Mini, or MVP targets.",
    ["SkillDesc_80110001"]="For each Normal Attack hit or active skill activation, increases Final Damage Bonus and Final Damage Reduction by %s for 3 seconds. Stacks up to 12 times.",
    ["SkillDesc_80110002"]="After entering battle, and every 90 seconds in battle, increases Final Damage Bonus and Final Damage Reduction of self and up to 2 teammates within 5 meters by %s for 30 seconds. Leaving the battle does not reset cooldown.",
    ["SkillDesc_80600100"]="Dealing damage each time increases your Final P.DMG Bonus by <color=#44afee>%s</color> for <color=#44afee>3</color> seconds. Stack up to <color=#44afee>5</color> times.",
    ["SkillDesc_80600200"]="Dealing damage each time grants 1 stack of <color=#44afee>Courage</color> effect for <color=#44afee>1.5</color> seconds. Up to 1 stack can be triggered every second. Reaching 3 stacks of <color=#44afee>Courage</color> increases your Final P.DMG Bonus and Physical Lifesteal by <color=#44afee>%s</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_80600300"]="Each normal attack grants your party members that are within <color=#44afee>5</color> meters of your position a stack of <color=#44afee>Array</color>. Each stack of <color=#44afee>Array</color> increases their Final P.DMG Bonus by <color=#44afee>%s</color> for <color=#44afee>3</color> seconds. Stack up to <color=#44afee>5</color> times.",
    ["SkillDesc_80600400"]="Increase your normal attack damage by <color=#44afee>%s</color> after casting any skill. Stack up to <color=#44afee>5</color> times and last for <color=#44afee>5</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_80600500"]="Mist Slash reduces the target's P.DEF by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> x (the number of Trauma stacks when Mist Slash becomes effective +1) for 8 seconds. When Mist Slash hits an enemy with Cross Trauma, it grants all allied party members a <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> chance to ignore 100%% of the enemy's P.DEF when dealing P.DMG to them, lasting 8 seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_80600600"]="After dealing Water attribute DMG, reduces the target's MSPD by 75%% for 1 second and deals Water attribute M.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of the M.ATK to the target and enemies within a 4-meter radius. This skill can be triggered once every 5 seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_80600700"]="<color=#44afee>%s</color> chance to ignore the target's P.DEF when casting skills or performing normal attacks.",
    ["SkillDesc_80800100"]="Each crit has a <color=#44afee>20%%</color> chance to receive 1 stack of effect that can negate physical attacks. Stack up to 5 times. Consuming 1 stack increases your P.DMG by <color=#44afee>%s</color> for <color=#44afee>5</color> seconds. Stack up to <color=#44afee>3</color> times.",
    ["SkillDesc_80800200"]="Every <color=#44afee>10%%</color> HP loss will increase your Final DMG Bonus and Final DMG Reduction by <color=#44afee>%s</color> for <color=#44afee>10</color> seconds. Stack up to <color=#44afee>5</color> times.",
    ["SkillDesc_80800300"]="Each normal attack that hits grants all allies within <color=#44afee>5</color> meters a stack of <color=#44afee>Matrix Shield</color>. Each stack of <color=#44afee>Matrix Shield</color> reduces the shield carrier's damage taken by <color=#44afee>%s</color> for <color=#44afee>3</color> seconds. Stack up to <color=#44afee>4</color> times. Each time the carrier of <color=#44afee>Matrix Shield</color> takes damage, 1 stack of <color=#44afee>Matrix Shield</color> will be consumed, dealing Adaptive damage equal to <color=#44afee>%s</color> of the carrier's Adaptive ATK to enemies within a <color=#44afee>4</color> meter range. This damage can trigger crit.",
    ["SkillDesc_80800400"]="When taking damage from an attacker within <color=#44afee>4</color> meters of your position, reduce their Final DMG Bonus by <color=#44afee>%s</color> and increase your Final DMG Bonus by <color=#44afee>%s</color> for <color=#44afee>3</color> seconds. Can only be triggered once every <color=#44afee>6</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_80800500"]="Whenever skill damage is dealt, there is a <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> chance to deal True DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of the current damage to a maximum of 3 targets within a 2-meter range of the current target.",
    ["SkillDesc_80800600"]="After entering the battle, every 2 seconds, there is a 50%% chance to remove up to 2 debuffs. Each successfully removed debuff increases your INT and VIT by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> for 10 seconds. Stacks up to 5.",
    ["SkillDesc_80800700"]="Increases Neutral DMG by <color=#44afee>%s</color> after casting any skill. Lasts for <color=#44afee>5</color> seconds and stacks up to <color=#44afee>20</color> times.",
    ["SkillDesc_80900100"]="Increase your Ghost attribute enhancement by <color=#44afee>%s</color> and reduce the <color=#44afee>Bleeding</color> target's Final Anti-Crit by <color=#44afee>%s</color> when dealing damage to them, while increasing their fixed cast time by <color=#44afee>0.6</color> seconds and fixed cooldown by <color=#44afee>3</color> seconds for <color=#44afee>3</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_80900200"]="Increase your Fire attribute enhancement by <color=#44afee>%s</color>. If the target is Kindled, each of your normal attacks can deal an additional Fire attribute P.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s</color> of P.ATK. This damage can trigger crit.",
    ["SkillDesc_80900300"]="Increase your Neutral attribute enhancement by <color=#44afee>%s</color>. If the target is Bleeding, each of your normal attacks can deal an additional True DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s</color> of the target's Max HP. (When facing <color=#44afee>MVP, MINI, or Boss</color>, it deals Neutral attribute P.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s</color> of P.ATK instead. This damage can trigger crit.)",
    ["SkillDesc_80900400"]="Increase your Fire attribute enhancement by <color=#44afee>%s</color>. Normal attacks now have a splash effect when attacking Kindled targets, dealing an extra <color=#44afee>%s</color> Fire attribute P.DMG to all enemies within <color=#44afee>4</color> meters of the target (including the target).",
    ["SkillDesc_80900500"]="Whenever Shadow Slash deals damage, if the target is an Adventurer, then it deals extra Neutral attribute True DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of the target's Max HP; if the target is a monster, then it deals extra Shadow attribute P.DMG equal <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of your P.ATK.\nWhenever Shadow Slash deals damage, if the target has one of the following debuffs (Bleed, Blind, Immobilize, Slow), there's a 50%% chance (evaluated separately for each debuff) to gain an extra damage effect (up to 5 extra damage effects per Shadow Slash).",
    ["SkillDesc_80900600"]="After dealing Wind attribute DMG, deal Wind attribute M.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of the M.ATK to the target and enemies within a 3-meter radius. This skill can be triggered once every 3 seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_80900700"]="In PVP, when the skill hits an enemy target below <color=#44afee>50%%</color> of Max HP, deals additional True DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s</color> of Max HP once. Can be triggered once per <color=#44afee>4</color> seconds for each target.",
    ["SkillDesc_8100001"]="Increases Final Haste by 5% per level when the refinement level of equipment is increased to +5 or above.",
    ["SkillDesc_8100002"]="Reduces Final Haste by 0.625% and increases Final P.PEN by 5% per level when the refinement level of equipment is increased to +5 or above.",
    ["SkillDesc_8100004"]="Increases Final ASPD by 50% per level when the refinement level of equipment is increased to +5 or above.",
    ["SkillDesc_8100005"]="Reduces Final ASPD by 12.5% and increases Final Hit by 10% and Crit DMG Bonus by 5% per level when the refinement level of equipment is increased to +5 or above.",
    ["SkillDesc_8100006"]="Reduces Final Haste by 1.25% and increases Final P.PEN by 10% per level when the refinement level of equipment is increased to +5 or above.",
    ["SkillDesc_8100007"]="Reduces Final Haste by 1.25% and increases Final M.PEN by 10% per level when the refinement level of equipment is increased to +5 or above.",
    ["SkillDesc_8100008"]="Increases Final Haste by 2.5% and Final ASPD by 25% per level when the refinement level of equipment is increased to +5 or above.",
    ["SkillDesc_8100009"]="Reduces Final ASPD by 12.5% and increases Final Hit by 10% and Crit DMG Bonus by 5% per level when the refinement level of equipment is increased to +8 or above.",
    ["SkillDesc_8100010"]="Reduces Final Haste by 1.25% and increases Final M.PEN by 10% per level when the refinement level of equipment is increased to +8 or above.",
    ["SkillDesc_81000100"]="After entering the battle, receive 1 stack of <color=#44afee>Shadowing</color> every second. Stack up to <color=#44afee>30</color> times. Each stack of <color=#44afee>Shadowing</color> increases your MSPD by <color=#44afee>0.05</color> and damage by <color=#44afee>%s</color>. Taking damage removes 1 stack of <color=#44afee>Shadowing</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_81000200"]="Hitting an enemy within <color=#44afee>2</color> meters with normal attacks grants you the <color=#44afee>Phantom</color> effect, increasing your MSPD by <color=#44afee>2</color> and making you immune to Slow for <color=#44afee>3</color> seconds. Can only be triggered once every <color=#44afee>6</color> seconds. Within <color=#44afee>6</color> seconds after <color=#44afee>Phantom</color> ends, the damage of the next normal attack will be increased by <color=#44afee>%s</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_81000300"]="Normal attacks have a <color=#44afee>%s</color> chance to ignore the target's defense. After entering the battle, remove 1 Debuff every <color=#44afee>3</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_81000400"]="If your position remains unchanged for <color=#44afee>3</color> seconds after entering the battle, you receive <color=#44afee>Diving</color> effect, increasing your Final P.DMG Bonus by <color=#44afee>%s</color>. Once your position changes, you will lose the <color=#44afee>Diving</color> effect, increasing your MSPD by <color=#44afee>2</color> for <color=#44afee>3</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_81000500"]="After dealing damage, reduces the Max HP of the target (group damage skills can only select 1 target) by 10%%. Stacks up to 3 and lasts 10 seconds (ineffective against MVP, MINI, and Boss). It also deals Shadow attribute P.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of the P.ATK. The above effect triggers once every 3 seconds. Continuous debuff effects can be countered by Curse Resistance, but they won't stack with general curse effects. At refinement level +4, for each extra refinement level, ignores 10%% of the target's Curse Resistance.",
    ["SkillDesc_81000600"]="When the weapon is refined to +8 or every subsequent level of refinement, reduces your Final Haste by 1.25%% and increases your bonus damage dealt to Angel and Demon Monsters by 15%%.",
    ["SkillDesc_81010000"]="For every unit killed, Final Damage Bonus is increased by %s%% for 30 seconds. Stacks up to 5 times.",
    ["SkillDesc_81010001"]="For every 20%% of HP lost, deals Neutral adaptive damage equal to %s of the damage taken to all enemies in a 4-meter range. Also decreases their P.ATK and M.ATK by %s for 5 seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_81010002"]="Deals an additional %s damage to Minis, MVPs, and Bosses.",
    ["SkillDesc_81010003"]="In PVP, upon entering battle, you gain 1 stack of Gift. Subsequently, 1 additional stack of Gift is granted every <color=#44afee>1.5</color> seconds. Stacks up to 5 times. Each stack increases your PVP Final P.DMG Bonus and PVP Final M.DMG Bonus by <color=#44afee>%s</color>. When dealing damage, ignores <color=#44afee>%s</color> of the target's reflection, stacking up to 5 times and lasting 8 seconds. Upon taking fatal damage, all remaining stacks are consumed, inflicting Farewell Gift to the Adventurer taking the last hit and reducing their Max HP bonus by <color=#44afee>%s</color> x number of Gift stacks (for instant kill, it counts as max stacks), lasting for 5 seconds. Unstackable and cannot be dispelled. Farewell Gift triggers once every 30 seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_81020000"]="Obtain %s Physical Damage Reflection and Magic Damage Reflection.",
    ["SkillDesc_81100100"]="When dealing damage with Revolver normal attacks, if only 1 target exists within <color=#44afee>7</color> meters of your position and that target proves to be an enemy, your damage will be increased by <color=#44afee>%s</color>, and your Revolver bullet will be replenished to the max capacity. Can only be triggered once every <color=#44afee>3</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_81100101"]="Whenever taking damage, has 10%% chance to increase Physical Reflect Damage and Magic Reflect Damage by %s for 10 seconds. Stacks up to 8 times.",
    ["SkillDesc_81100102"]="In PVP, when actively dealing damage to the enemy player, increases PVP Final Physical Damage Reduction and PVP Final Magic Damage Reduction by %s for 3 seconds. Every 6 seconds, when actively dealing damage to the enemy player, decreases Stun RES by %s and stuns the target for 3 seconds. (Applies to only 1 enemy when dealing AoE damage.)",
    ["SkillDesc_81100103"]="In PVP, for every enemy player defeated immediately or within 8 seconds of dealing damage, increases PVP Final Magic Damage Bonus by %s, and PVP Final Magic Damage Reduction by %s for 30 seconds. Stacks up to 8 times.",
    ["SkillDesc_81100104"]="In PVP, when actively dealing damage to the enemy player, increases PVP Final Physical Damage Reduction and PVP Final Magic Damage Reduction by %s for 6 seconds. Every 12 seconds, when actively dealing damage to the enemy player, decreases Silence RES by %s and silences the target for 6 seconds. (Applies to only 1 enemy when dealing AoE damage.)",
    ["SkillDesc_81100105"]="In PVP, when actively dealing damage to an enemy player, increases your PVP Final P.DMG RED and PVP Final M.DMG RED by %s for 6 seconds. Every 60 seconds, when actively dealing damage to an enemy player, decreases their Curse Resistance by %s and inflicts Slumber Curse for 30 seconds (the duration is affected by Curse Resistance). The target, if dead while Slumber Curse is in effect, cannot be resurrected (applies to only 1 enemy when dealing AoE damage).",
    ["SkillDesc_81100106"]="Each Normal Attack hit increases Final Damage Reduction by %s, and decreases the target's Final Physical Damage Reduction by %s. Both effects last for 3 seconds, stacking up to 12 times.",
    ["SkillDesc_81100107"]="In PVP, for every enemy player defeated immediately or within 8 seconds of dealing damage, increases PVP Final Physical Damage Bonus by %s, and Physical Lifesteal by %s for 30 seconds. Stacks up to 8 times.",
    ["SkillDesc_81100108"]="In PVP, for every enemy player defeated immediately or within 8 seconds of dealing damage, increases PVP Final Physical Damage Bonus by %s, and Final Damage Reduction by %s for 30 seconds. Stacks up to 8 times.",
    ["SkillDesc_81100109"]="In PVP, when actively dealing damage to the enemy player, increases PVP Final Physical Damage Bonus by %s, and decreases the target's Bleed RES by %s, both for 3 seconds and stack up to 6 times. Every 6 seconds, when actively dealing damage to the enemy player, inflicts Bleeding for 3 seconds (affected by Bleed RES Reduction), and neutralizes all healing effects while Bleeding is in effect. (Applies to only 1 enemy when dealing AoE damage.)",
    ["SkillDesc_81100110"]="In PVP, when actively dealing damage to the enemy player, decreases Final DMG Reduction for self and the target by 25%%, and increases self PVP Final P.DMG Bonus by %s and Physical Lifesteal by %s for 6 seconds. Cooldown: 12 seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_81100111"]="In PVP, when actively dealing damage to the enemy player, increases PVP Final P.DMG RED, PVP Final M.DMG RED, and PVP Final P.DMG Bonus by %s for 3 seconds. Stacks up to 6 times.",
    ["SkillDesc_81100112"]="In PVP, when actively dealing damage to the enemy player, increases PVP Final P.DMG RED, PVP Final M.DMG RED, and PVP Final M.DMG Bonus by %s for 3 seconds. Stacks up to 6 times.",
    ["SkillDesc_81100113"]="When dealing Ghost damage to the enemy player, increases Final Magic Damage Bonus by %s for 6 seconds. Stacks up to 20 times.",
    ["SkillDesc_81100114"]="In PVP, after entering battle, and every 180 seconds in battle, decreases Final Attack Speed by 100%%. Also, increases PVP Final Physical Damage Bonus by %s, and PVP Final Physical Damage Reduction and PVP Final Magic Damage Reduction by %s for 30 seconds for the ally with the highest Physical Attack within 30 meters. Leaving the battle does not reset cooldown.",
    ["SkillDesc_81100115"]="In PVP, after entering battle, and every 180 seconds in battle, decreases Final Haste by 10%%. Also, increases PVP Final Magic Damage Bonus by %s, and PVP Final Physical Damage Reduction and PVP Final Magic Damage Reduction by %s for 30 seconds for the ally with the highest Magic Attack within 30 meters. Leaving the battle does not reset cooldown.",
    ["SkillDesc_81100200"]="After killing a target, your next normal attack deals an additional weapon attribute P.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s</color> of P.ATK and consumes no bullets. It can trigger critical damage. Last up to <color=#44afee>3</color> seconds and can only be triggered once per second.",
    ["SkillDesc_81100300"]="Critical normal attack has a <color=#44afee>%s</color> chance to auto-reload 1 bullet and increase the next bullet's damage by <color=#44afee>%s</color>. Last up to <color=#44afee>5</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_81100400"]="Successful skill hit has a <color=#44afee>(0.1%% x LUK)</color> chance to increase its bullet count 1 and allow the next normal attack of the Sniper Rifle to ignore <color=#44afee>%s</color> of the target's Final P.DMG Reduction and Final Anti-Crit for <color=#44afee>3</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_81100500"]="Your Shadow Enhancement is increased by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.\nFor every 4 skills released, your skill damage is increased by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> for 4 seconds. Triggers one every 12 seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_81100600"]="When dealing damage using an escape technique, it increases your Final M.DMG Bonus by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> for 6 seconds. Stacks up to 20 times.",
    ["SkillDesc_81100700"]="In PVP, when dealing damage to the enemy player, decreases Final DMG Reduction for self and the target by <color=#44afee>25%%</color>, and increases self PVP Final P.DMG Bonus by <color=#44afee>%s</color> and self Physical Lifesteal by <color=#44afee>%s</color> for <color=#44afee>6</color> seconds. Can be triggered once per <color=#44afee>12</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_81140000"]="For every damage taken equal to 10%% of max HP, increases Final DMG Bonus by %s for 6s, up to 5 stacks. (The level cap of the set is 5)",
    ["SkillDesc_81170000"]="For every damage taken equal to 10%% of Max HP, increases Final DMG Reduction by %s for 10 seconds, up to 5 stacks. (Capped at Set Ascension Level 5.)",
    ["SkillDesc_81200001"]="Increases your Fire DMG by %s after casting any skill. Lasts for 5 seconds and stacks up to 20 times.",
    ["SkillDesc_81200002"]="Increases Neutral DMG by %s after casting any skill. Lasts for 5 seconds and stacks up to 20 times.",
    ["SkillDesc_81200003"]="Increases Wind DMG by %s after casting any skill. Lasts for 5 seconds and stacks up to 20 times.",
    ["SkillDesc_81200004"]="Increases your Poison DMG by %s after casting any skill. Lasts for 5 seconds and stacks up to 20 times.",
    ["SkillDesc_81200005"]="Increases your Holy DMG by %s after casting any skill. Lasts for 5 seconds and stacks up to 20 times.",
    ["SkillDesc_81200006"]="Increases your Earth DMG by %s after casting any skill. Lasts for 5 seconds and stacks up to 20 times.",
    ["SkillDesc_81200007"]="Increases your Water DMG by %s after casting any skill. Lasts for 5 seconds and stacks up to 20 times.",
    ["SkillDesc_81200008"]="Increases your Fire DMG by %s after casting any skill. Lasts for 5 seconds and stacks up to 20 times.",
    ["SkillDesc_81200009"]="In PVP, each time you deal skill damage, reduces the target’s Max HP percentage bonus by %s(does not stack with similar effects), and reduces PVP Final P.DMG Reduction by %s. These effects can be triggered up to once every 4 seconds, stacking up to 3 times for 12 seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_81200010"]="In PVP, every time you deal damage with normal attacks, you reduce the target's LUK and VIT by %s (up to 8 stacks) and gain a blocking effect to nullify the damage for once. These effects can only be triggered once every 2 seconds and last for 12 seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_81200011"]="In PVP, each time you deal skill damage, reduces the target’s Max HP percentage bonus by %s(does not stack with similar effects), and reduces PVP Final M.DMG Reduction by %s. These effects can be triggered up to once every 4 seconds, stacking up to 3 times for 12 seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_81200012"]="In PVP, every time you deal damage with normal attacks, you reduce the target's highest attribute by %s (up to 8 stacks) and gain a blocking effect to nullify the damage for once. These effects can only be triggered once every 2 seconds and last for 12 seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_81200013"]="In PVP, every time you deal damage with normal attacks, you reduce the target's AGI and STR by %s (up to 8 stacks) and gain a blocking effect to nullify the damage for once. These effects can only be triggered once every 2 seconds and last for 12 seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_81200014"]="Increases all your party member's Final M.DMG Bonus by %s when your HP is higher than 80%% for 6 seconds. This effect can only be triggered once every 12 seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_81200015"]="Increases all your party member's Final P.DMG Bonus by %s when your HP is higher than 80%% for 6 seconds. This effect can only be triggered once every 12 seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_81200100"]="Each critical normal attack grants 1 stack of <color=#44afee>Cowboy</color> for <color=#44afee>3</color> seconds. Stack up to <color=#44afee>10</color> times. Each stack of <color=#44afee>Cowboy</color> increases the skill damage by <color=#44afee>%s</color>. All stacks of <color=#44afee>Cowboy</color> will be removed after reloading.",
    ["SkillDesc_81200200"]="Increase your damage to the target that is less than <color=#44afee>2</color> meters away from you by <color=#44afee>%s</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_81200300"]="Within 6 seconds of actively switching the firearm, the first normal attack will create a ricochet effect that bounces up to <color=#44afee>7</color> times among the enemies, dealing Ghost attribute P.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s</color> of P.ATK with each bounce. The damage can trigger crit, but no more than <color=#44afee>once</color> every <color=#44afee>6</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_81200400"]="Increase your damage to the target that is over <color=#44afee>8</color> meters away from you by <color=#44afee>%s</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_81200500"]="After entering the battle, you receive 1 stack of effects that can negate P.DMG every 2 seconds. Lasts 6 seconds and stacks up to 5. Consuming 1 stack of the effect randomly triggers the following effects:\n1. Deal weapon attribute DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of the P.ATK.\n2. Restore your HP by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_81200600"]="When dealing Fire attribute DMG, the target is set ablaze and enters the Kindle state (group damage skills can only select 1 target), receiving Fire attribute DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of the M.ATK for 4 seconds. The target's Max HP is reduced by 30%% during the Kindle state (non-effective against MVP, MINI, and Boss). This effect triggers once every 8 seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_81200700"]="In PVP, each time when the skill hits an enemy target, reduces the target's Max HP percentage bonus by <color=#44afee>%s</color> (does not stack with similar effects), and reduces PVP Final P.DMG Reduction by <color=#44afee>%s</color>. These effects can be triggered up to once every <color=#44afee>4</color> seconds, stacking up to <color=#44afee>3</color> times for <color=#44afee>12</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_81240100"]="Regenerates <color=#44afee>30%%</color> of the Max HP when the HP drops below <color=#44afee>20%%</color> of the Max HP, and regenerates <color=#44afee>5%%</color> of the Max HP per second for <color=#44afee>10</color> seconds. Triggers up to once every <color=#44afee>90</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_81240200"]="Reduces the P.DMG taken by <color=#44afee>30%%</color> when the HP drops below <color=#44afee>40%%</color> of the Max HP. Lasts <color=#44afee>5</color> seconds. Triggers up to once every <color=#44afee>30</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_81240300"]="Has a <color=#44afee>8%%</color> chance to gain a blocking effect to nullify the M.DMG for <color=#44afee>once</color> when taking P.DMG. Lasts <color=#44afee>8</color> seconds. Stacks up to <color=#44afee>5</color> times. Triggers up to once every <color=#44afee>2</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_81240400"]="Removes all debuffs after taking damage more than <color=#44afee>10%%</color> of the Max HP. Triggers up to once every <color=#44afee>40</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_81240500"]="Upon entering Hiding, gains a blocking effect to nullify the P.DMG for <color=#44afee>10</color> times, and regenerates <color=#44afee>4%%</color> of the Max HP per second for <color=#44afee>6</color> seconds. Triggers up to once every <color=#44afee>90</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_81240600"]="Gains a blocking effect to nullify damage for <color=#44afee>5</color> times when the HP drops below <color=#44afee>20%%</color> of the Max HP, and a shield equal to <color=#44afee>50%%</color> of the Max HP for <color=#44afee>6</color> seconds. Triggers up to once every <color=#44afee>90</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_81300100"]="After entering the battle, inflicts a <color=#44afee>3</color>-second Bleed effect to <color=#44afee>2</color> random enemies within a <color=#44afee>4</color>-meter range every <color=#44afee>3</color> seconds, dealing Neutral attribute P.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s</color> of the caster's Max HP every second.\nIf the refinement level reaches <color=#44afee>+5</color> or above, ignores <color=#44afee>10%%</color> of the target's Bleed Resistance for every <color=#44afee>1</color> level increased in refinement when inflicting Bleed effects.",
    ["SkillDesc_81300200"]="After entering the battle, inflicts a <color=#44afee>3</color>-second Curse effect to <color=#44afee>2</color> random enemies within a <color=#44afee>4</color>-meter range every <color=#44afee>3</color> seconds. If the target is cursed, they will immediately take weapon attribute P.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s</color> of the caster's P.ATK.\nIf the refinement level reaches <color=#44afee>+5</color> or above, ignores <color=#44afee>10%%</color> of the target's Curse Resistance for every <color=#44afee>1</color> level increased in refinement when inflicting Curses.",
    ["SkillDesc_81300300"]="When your skill hits the enemy, deals Wind attribute M.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s</color> of the caster's M.ATK to 1 random enemy within a <color=#44afee>4</color>-meter range, and has a <color=#44afee>30%%</color> chance of inflicting a <color=#44afee>3</color>-second Blind effect on the target <color=#44afee>3</color> times in total. This effect triggers once every <color=#44afee>6</color> seconds.\nIf the refinement level reaches <color=#44afee>+5</color> or above, ignores <color=#44afee>10%%</color> of the target's Blind Res for every <color=#44afee>1</color> level increased in refinement when inflicting Blind effects.",
    ["SkillDesc_81300400"]="When your skill hits the enemy, deals Poison attribute P.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s</color> of the caster's P.ATK to the target. If the target is already poisoned, the damage will be doubled. This effect triggers once every <color=#44afee>3</color> seconds.\nWhen the refinement level reaches <color=#44afee>+5</color> or above, ignores <color=#44afee>10%%</color> of the target's Poison Resistance for every <color=#44afee>1</color> level increased in refinement when inflicting Poison effects.",
    ["SkillDesc_81300500"]="When your skill hits the enemy, deals Poison attribute P.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of the caster's P.ATK to the target. If the target is already poisoned, the damage will be doubled. This effect triggers once every <color=#44afee>3</color> seconds.\nWhen the refinement level reaches <color=#44afee>+5</color> or above, ignores <color=#44afee>10%%</color> of the target's Poison Resistance for every <color=#44afee>1</color> level increased in refinement when inflicting Poison effects.",
    ["SkillDesc_81300600"]="Your successful normal attack deals weapon attribute P.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s</color> of the caster's P.ATK to the target if they are Stunned or Bleeding. This damage can trigger crit, and the effect triggers once every <color=#44afee>2</color> seconds.\nWhen the refinement level reaches <color=#44afee>+5</color> or above, ignores <color=#44afee>10%%</color> of the target's Bleed Resistance for every 1 level increased in refinement when inflicting Bleed effects.",
    ["SkillDesc_81300700"]="Increases the Final M.DMG Bonus by <color=#44afee>%s</color> and Final M.DMG Reduction by <color=#44afee>%s</color> for your party members within a <color=#44afee>5</color>-meter range.",
    ["SkillDesc_81300800"]="Increases the Final P.DMG Bonus by <color=#44afee>%s</color> and Final P.DMG Reduction by <color=#44afee>%s</color> for your party members within a <color=#44afee>5</color>-meter range.",
    ["SkillDesc_81300900"]="Your successful normal attack deals Poison attribute P.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s</color> of the caster's P.ATK to the target if they are Poisoned. This damage can trigger crit, and the effect triggers once every <color=#44afee>2</color> seconds.\nWhen the refinement level reaches <color=#44afee>+5</color> or above, ignores <color=#44afee>10%%</color> of the target's Poison Resistance for every <color=#44afee>1</color> level increased in refinement when inflicting Poison effects.",
    ["SkillDesc_81301000"]="Your successful normal attack deals Fire attribute P.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s</color> of the caster's P.ATK to the target if they are Kindled or Bleeding. This damage can trigger crit, and the effect triggers once every <color=#44afee>2</color> seconds.\nWhen the refinement level reaches <color=#44afee>+5</color> or above, ignores <color=#44afee>10%%</color> of the target's Bleed Resistance for every <color=#44afee>1</color> level increased in refinement when inflicting Bleed effects.",
    ["SkillDesc_81301100"]="When your skill hits an enemy, deals weapon attribute P.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s</color> of the caster's P.ATK to the target if they are Stunned or Bleeding. This effect triggers once every <color=#44afee>3</color> seconds.\nWhen the refinement level reaches <color=#44afee>+5</color> or above, ignores <color=#44afee>10%%</color> of the target's Bleed Resistance for every <color=#44afee>1</color> level increased in refinement when inflicting Bleed effects.",
    ["SkillDesc_81301200"]="After entering the battle, inflicts a <color=#44afee>3</color>-second Bleed effect to <color=#44afee>2</color> random enemies within a <color=#44afee>4</color>-meter range every <color=#44afee>3</color> seconds, dealing weapon attribute P.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s</color> of the caster's P.ATK every second.\nWhen the refinement level reaches <color=#44afee>+5</color> or above, ignores <color=#44afee>10%%</color> of the target's Bleed Resistance for every <color=#44afee>1</color> level increased in refinement when inflicting Bleed effects.",
    ["SkillDesc_81301300"]="Your successful normal attack has a <color=#44afee>50%%</color> chance of inflicting a <color=#44afee>8</color>-second <color=#44afee>Kindle</color> effect on the target, dealing Fire attribute M.DMG equal to (target's Max SP x <color=#44afee>%s</color> + caster's M.ATK x <color=#44afee>%s</color>) while reducing target's SP by (target's Max SP x <color=#44afee>%s</color>) every second.",
    ["SkillDesc_81301400"]="Your damage against Kindled targets increases by <color=#44afee>%s</color>.\nWhen the refinement level reaches <color=#44afee>+5</color> or above, your PVE Debuff Penetration is increased by <color=#44afee>10</color> for every <color=#44afee>1</color> level increased in refinement.",
    ["SkillDesc_81301500"]="Dealing damage to Cursed or Bleeding targets increases your Physical Lifesteal by <color=#44afee>%s</color> and Neutral Enhancement by <color=#44afee>%s</color> for <color=#44afee>3</color> seconds. Stacks up to <color=#44afee>5</color> times.",
    ["SkillDesc_81301600"]="Dealing damage to Cursed or Kindled targets increases your Physical Lifesteal by <color=#44afee>%s</color> and Neutral Attribute Enhancement by <color=#44afee>%s</color> for <color=#44afee>3</color> seconds. Stacks up to <color=#44afee>5</color> times.",
    ["SkillDesc_81301700"]="When your skill hits the enemy, deals Neutral attribute P.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s</color> of the caster's P.ATK to the target if they are Blinded, Poisoned, or Bleeding. This damage can trigger crit, and the effect triggers once every <color=#44afee>3</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_81301800"]="When your normal attack hits, deals Neutral attribute P.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s</color> of the caster's P.ATK to the target if they are Blinded, Poisoned, or Bleeding. This damage can trigger crit, and the effect triggers once every <color=#44afee>2</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_81301900"]="Each time the damage you take equals <color=#44afee>10%%</color> of your Max HP, applies <color=#44afee>1</color> stack of Truce effect to all party members within a <color=#44afee>30</color>-meter range, increasing their Final M.DMG Reduction by <color=#44afee>%s</color> and M.ATK by <color=#44afee>%s</color>. Stacks up to <color=#44afee>3</color> times and lasts for <color=#44afee>10</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_81302000"]="Each time the damage you take equals <color=#44afee>10%%</color> of your Max HP, applies <color=#44afee>1</color> stack of Triumph effect to all party members within a <color=#44afee>30</color>-meter range, increasing their Final P.DMG Reduction by <color=#44afee>%s</color> and P.ATK by <color=#44afee>%s</color>. Stacks up to <color=#44afee>3</color> times and lasts for <color=#44afee>10</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_81302001"]="After entering the battle, puts on the Manteau of Darkness to self every 20 seconds, lasting for 8 seconds. Each ascension level reduces the cooldown by 1 second. Manteau of Darkness Effect: Decreases P.DEF/M.DEF by %s; increases Blind/Freeze/Slow Resistance by %s; increases Final DMG Reduction by %s; increases Final DMG Bonus by %s.",
    ["SkillDesc_81302002"]="When using skills or normal attacks, there's a (24%%|12%%) chance to gain 1 stack of Vesper Mark, with each stack providing the following bonus effect for 6 seconds, stacking up to 5 times.\nEach stack reduces the increase in Max HP percentage by %s.\nEach stack increases P.ATK and M.ATK by %s.\nEach stack increases Debuff Penetration by %s.\nEach stack increases Final DMG Bonus by %s.",
    ["SkillDesc_81302003"]="Combine Vesper Core 01 x2 with Memory of Lovers to unlock Core's Memory I.\nIncreases INT percentage by <color=#44afee>%s</color> and Max SP percentage by <color=#44afee>%s</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_81302004"]="Combine Vesper Core 02 x2 with Memory of Lovers to unlock Core's Memory II.\nIncreases STR percentage by <color=#44afee>%s</color> and M.DEF by <color=#44afee>%s</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_81302005"]="Combine Vesper Core 03 x2 with Memory of Lovers to unlock Core's Memory III.\nIncreases AGI percentage by <color=#44afee>%s</color> and M.DEF by <color=#44afee>%s</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_81302006"]="Combine Vesper Core 04 x2 with Memory of Lovers to unlock Core's Memory IV.\nIncreases DEX percentage by <color=#44afee>%s</color> and Final Flee by <color=#44afee>%s</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_81302100"]="When the skill damage other Adventurers deal to you exceeds <color=#44afee>40%%</color> of your Max HP, you are immune to the incoming attack. This effect triggers once every <color=#44afee>%s</color> seconds (can be triggered with other damage immunity effects).\nIncreases your Max HP by <color=#44afee>%s</color>, Final P.DMG Bonus by <color=#44afee>%s</color>, and Final M.DMG Bonus by <color=#44afee>%s</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_81302200"]="When attacked, there is a <color=#44afee>30%%</color> chance to cast a lightning bolt that can jump up to <color=#44afee>6</color> times to an attacker within a <color=#44afee>6</color>-meter range, each time dealing Wind attribute P.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s</color> of your P.ATK and reducing the hit target's Debuff Resistance by <color=#44afee>%s</color> for <color=#44afee>3</color> seconds. This effect triggers once every <color=#44afee>3</color> seconds.\nIncreases your Final P.DMG Reduction by <color=#44afee>%s</color>, Final M.DMG Reduction by <color=#44afee>%s</color>, Final P.DMG Bonus by <color=#44afee>%s</color>, and Final M.DMG Bonus by <color=#44afee>%s</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_81302300"]="Normal attacks now deal extra <color=#44afee>%s</color> Neutral attribute damage. This damage can trigger crit and has a <color=#44afee>5%%</color> chance to make the target Bleed, dealing Neutral attribute P.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s</color> of P.ATK every second for <color=#44afee>6</color> seconds. When the refinement level reaches <color=#44afee>+5</color>, each additional refinement level allows you to ignore an extra <color=#44afee>10%%</color> of the target's Bleed Resistance.",
    ["SkillDesc_81302400"]="Normal attacks now deal extra Fire attribute P.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s</color> of P.ATK. This damage can trigger crit and has a <color=#44afee>5%%</color> chance Kindle the target, dealing Fire attribute P.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s</color> of P.ATK every second for 6 seconds. When the refinement level reaches <color=#44afee>+5</color>, each additional refinement level increases your Debuff Penetration by an extra <color=#44afee>5</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_81302500"]="Normal attacks deal an additional Ghost attribute P.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s</color> of P.ATK. The damage can trigger crit and inflict the target with a <color=#44afee>Bleed</color> effect named <color=#44afee>Soul Piercing</color>, dealing Ghost attribute P.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s</color> of P.ATK for 3 seconds. This effect can only be triggered once every 6 seconds. When the refinement level reaches <color=#44afee>+5</color>, each additional refinement level allows you to ignore an extra <color=#44afee>10%%</color> of the target's Bleed Resistance.",
    ["SkillDesc_81302600"]="Skill damage will inflict the target with the <color=#44afee>Kindle</color> effect for <color=#44afee>6</color> seconds, dealing Fire attribute P.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s</color> of P.ATK every second, with a chance to trigger critical damage. Can be only triggered once every <color=#44afee>12</color> seconds. After the refinement level reaches +5, each additional level increases your Debuff Penetration by <color=#44afee>5</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_81302700"]="Whenever you lose a total of 10%% of your Max HP, both you and a random party member undergo the following check. Can be triggered once every 10 seconds:\n1. There's a 20%% chance to gain <color=#44afee>%s</color> stack(s) of effect that can block off P.DMG once. Lasts 5 seconds.\n2. There's a 20%% chance to regenerate <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of your Max HP (calculated in PvP). Lasts 5 seconds.\n3. There's a 20%% chance to increase your Final DMG Bonus by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>. Lasts 5 seconds.\n4. There's a 20%% chance to increase your MSPD by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>. Lasts 5 seconds.\n5. There's a 20%% chance to increase your Final P.DMG Bonus by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>. Lasts 5 seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_81302800"]="After casting a skill, place targets within <color=#44afee>5</color> meters into the Dizzy state, reducing their Hit by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> for <color=#44afee>3</color> seconds. Triggers <color=#44afee>once</color> every <color=#44afee>9</color> seconds. Each time an enemy enters the Dizzy state, it increases your PVP Final M.DMG Bonus by <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> for <color=#44afee>20</color> seconds while reducing the skill cooldown by <color=#44afee>2</color> seconds. Stacks up to <color=#44afee>20</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_81302900"]="When an enemy is hit by skills, deals Shadow attribute P.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s</color> of P.ATK to the target if they are Stunned or Slowed. This effect triggers once every <color=#44afee>3</color> seconds.\nWhen the refinement level reaches <color=#44afee>+5</color> or above, ignores <color=#44afee>5%%</color> of the target's Stun Resistance for every 1 level increased in refinement when inflicting Stun.",
    ["SkillDesc_81400100"]="<color=#44afee>Odd Ascension Level</color>: Increases Neutral attribute by <color=#44afee>%s</color>.\n<color=#44afee>Even Ascension Level</color>: When dealing any type of damage, there's a <color=#44afee>20%%</color> chance to instantly unleash <color=#44afee>Inverse Scale</color>, dealing Neutral attribute P.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s</color> of your Max HP to nearby enemy units. Cooldown: <color=#44afee>6</color> seconds. (Reflect damage and damage from this skill won't be triggered.)\nAt <color=#44afee>Refinement Lv.8-Lv.11</color> during PVP, using <color=#44afee>Inverse Scale</color> grants a <color=#44afee>50%%</color> chance to reduce the Final HP of nearby enemy units by <color=#44afee>25%%</color> for 6 seconds. Cooldown: <color=#44afee>6</color> seconds.\nWhen <color=#44afee>Refinement exceeds Lv.12</color> during PVP, using <color=#44afee>Inverse Scale</color> grants you a <color=#44afee>50%%</color> chance to reduce the Final HP of nearby enemy units by <color=#44afee>50%%</color> for 6 seconds. Cooldown: <color=#44afee>6</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_81400200"]="<color=#44afee>Odd Ascension Level</color>: Increases Neutral attribute by <color=#44afee>%s</color>.\n<color=#44afee>Even Ascension Level</color>: When dealing any type of damage, there's a <color=#44afee>20%%</color> chance to instantly unleash <color=#44afee>Hammer Fall</color>, dealing Neutral attribute P.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s</color> of P.ATK to nearby enemy units. Cooldown: <color=#44afee>6</color> seconds. (Reflect damage and damage from this skill won't be triggered.)\nAt <color=#44afee>Refinement Lv.8-Lv.11</color>, using <color=#44afee>Hammer Fall</color> grants a <color=#44afee>25%%</color> chance to <color=#44afee>stun</color> nearby enemy units by for <color=#44afee>2</color> seconds. Cooldown: <color=#44afee>3</color> seconds.\nWhen <color=#44afee>Refinement exceeds Lv.12</color>, using <color=#44afee>Hammer Fall</color> grants you a <color=#44afee>50%%</color> chance to <color=#44afee>stun</color> nearby enemy units by for <color=#44afee>2</color> seconds. Cooldown: <color=#44afee>3</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_81400300"]="<color=#44afee>Odd Ascension Level</color>: Increases M.ATK by <color=#44afee>%s</color>.\n<color=#44afee>Even Ascension Level</color>: When dealing damage, there's a <color=#44afee>20%%</color> chance to instantly unleash <color=#44afee>Judge</color>, dealing Holy M.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s</color> of M.ATK that ignores the target's DEF and inflicts half of the same amount damage to all nearby enemies again. Cooldown: <color=#44afee>6</color> seconds.\nAt <color=#44afee>Refinement Lv.8-Lv.11</color>, using <color=#44afee>Judge</color> allows you to deal extra True DMG equal to <color=#44afee>3%%</color> of the target's Max HP. Cooldown: <color=#44afee>6</color> seconds. (Not effective against Boss, MVP, and MINI.)\nWhen <color=#44afee>Refinement exceeds Lv.12</color>, using <color=#44afee>Judge</color> allows you to deal extra True DMG equal to <color=#44afee>6%%</color> of the target's Max HP. Cooldown: <color=#44afee>6</color> seconds. (Not effective against Boss, MVP, and MINI.)",
    ["SkillDesc_81400400"]="<color=#44afee>Odd Ascension Level</color>: Increases P.ATK by <color=#44afee>%s</color>.\n<color=#44afee>Even Ascension Level</color>: When dealing damage under the effect of <color=#44afee>Hiding</color>, you can unleash <color=#44afee>Blind Mark</color> to the target, increasing all damage taken by the current target by <color=#44afee>%s</color> for 6 seconds. Cooldown: <color=#44afee>12</color> seconds. If the target dies within the effective period of the mark, the cooldown will be reset. (Damage boost only applies to the caster during PVE.)\nAt <color=#44afee>Refinement Lv.8-Lv.11</color>, <color=#44afee>Blind Mark</color> comes with a Silence effect.\nWhen <color=#44afee>Refinement exceeds Lv.12</color>, <color=#44afee>Blind Mark</color> comes with a Silence effect. When the mark disappears, the target affected by Blind Mark takes an additional True DMG equal to <color=#44afee>35%%</color> of all damage taken during the effective period of the mark. (Only damage dealt by the caster will be counted during PVE.)",
    ["SkillDesc_81400500"]="<color=#44afee>Odd Ascension Level</color>: Increases P.ATK by <color=#44afee>%s</color>.\n<color=#44afee>Even Ascension Level</color>: Following a single-target skill or normal attack, there's a <color=#44afee>40%%</color> chance to unleash <color=#44afee>Hurl Zeny</color> at the target when casting any skill, dealing weapon attribute P.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s</color> of P.ATK, with a chance to trigger critical damage. Cooldown: <color=#44afee>2</color> seconds.\nAt <color=#44afee>Refinement Lv.8-Lv.11</color>, all damage against medium monsters is increased by <color=#44afee>15%%</color>.\nWhen <color=#44afee>Refinement exceeds Lv.12</color>, all damage against medium monsters is increased by <color=#44afee>30%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_81400600"]="<color=#44afee>Odd Ascension Level</color>: Increases Neutral attribute by <color=#44afee>%s</color>.\n<color=#44afee>Even Ascension Level</color>: After using normal attacks or single unit skills, casting any skill has a <color=#44afee>40%%</color> chance to cast <color=#44afee>Musical Strike</color>, dealing weapon attribute P.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s</color> of P.ATK in total over 3 attacks. Cooldown: <color=#44afee>3</color> seconds.\n<color=#44afee>At Refinement Lv.8-Lv.11</color>, Debuff Penetration is increased by <color=#44afee>20</color>.\n<color=#44afee>When Refinement exceeds Lv.12</color>, Debuff Penetration is increased by <color=#44afee>20</color> and PVP Debuff Penetration is increased by <color=#44afee>20</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_81400700"]="<color=#44afee>Odd Ascension Level</color>: Increases Neutral attribute by <color=#44afee>%s</color>.\n<color=#44afee>Even Ascension Level</color>: After using normal attacks or single unit skills, casting any skill has a <color=#44afee>40%%</color> chance to cast <color=#44afee>Throw Arrow</color>, dealing weapon attribute P.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s</color> of P.ATK in total over 3 attacks. Cooldown: <color=#44afee>3</color> seconds.\n<color=#44afee>At Refinement Lv.8-Lv.11</color>, Debuff Penetration is increased by <color=#44afee>20</color>.\n<color=#44afee>When Refinement exceeds Lv.12</color>, Debuff Penetration is increased by <color=#44afee>20</color> and PVP Debuff Penetration is increased by <color=#44afee>20</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_81400800"]="<color=#44afee>Odd Ascension Level</color>: Increases P.ATK by <color=#44afee>%s</color>.\n<color=#44afee>Even Ascension Level</color>: When dealing damage under the effect of <color=#44afee>Hiding</color>, you can unleash <color=#44afee>Blind Mark</color> to the target, increasing all damage taken by the current target by <color=#44afee>%s</color> for 6 seconds. Cooldown: <color=#44afee>12</color> seconds. If the target dies within the effective period of the mark, the cooldown will be reset. (Damage boost only applies to the caster during PVE.)\nAt <color=#44afee>Refinement Lv.8-Lv.11</color>, <color=#44afee>Blind Mark</color> comes with a Silence effect.\nWhen <color=#44afee>Refinement exceeds Lv.12</color>, <color=#44afee>Blind Mark</color> comes with a Silence effect. When the mark disappears, the target effected by Blind Mark takes an additional True DMG equal to <color=#44afee>70%%</color> of all damage taken during the effective period of the mark. (Only damage dealt by the caster will be counted during PVE.)",
    ["SkillDesc_81400900"]="<color=#44afee>Odd Ascension Level</color>: Increases Neutral attribute by <color=#44afee>%s</color>.\n<color=#44afee>Even Ascension Level</color>: After using normal attacks or single unit skills, casting any skill has a <color=#44afee>40%%</color> chance to cast <color=#44afee>Double Strafe</color>, dealing weapon attribute P.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s</color> of P.ATK in total over 2 attacks. Cooldown: <color=#44afee>4</color> seconds.\n<color=#44afee>At Refinement Lv.8-Lv.11</color>, using <color=#44afee>Double Strafe</color> allows you to deal extra True DMG equal to <color=#44afee>2%%</color> of the target's Max HP. Cooldown: <color=#44afee>4</color> seconds. (Not effective against Boss, MVP, and MINI.)\n<color=#44afee>When Refinement exceeds Lv.12</color>, using <color=#44afee>Double Strafe</color> allows you to deal extra True DMG equal to <color=#44afee>4%%</color> of the target's Max HP. Cooldown: <color=#44afee>4</color> seconds. (Not effective against Boss, MVP, and MINI.)",
    ["SkillDesc_81401000"]="<color=#44afee>Odd Ascension Level</color>: Increases Neutral Enhancement by <color=#44afee>%s</color>.\n<color=#44afee>Even Ascension Level</color>: When casting a normal attack, there's an <color=#44afee>8%%</color> chance to instantly unleash <color=#44afee>Double Strafe</color> at the target, dealing weapon attribute P.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s</color> of P.ATK in total over 2 attacks. If your Final Crit is higher than Final P.PEN, this skill may trigger critical damage. Cooldown: <color=#44afee>4</color> seconds.\nAt <color=#44afee>Refinement Lv.8-Lv.11</color>, <color=#44afee>Double Strafe</color> slows down the target by an additional <color=#44afee>10%%</color> for <color=#44afee>2</color> seconds.\nWhen <color=#44afee>Refinement exceeds Lv.12</color>, <color=#44afee>Double Strafe</color> slows down the target by an additional <color=#44afee>20%%</color> for <color=#44afee>2</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_81401100"]="\n\n<color=#44afee>Odd Ascension Level</color>: Increases P.ATK by <color=#44afee>%s</color>.\n<color=#44afee>Even Ascension Level</color>: When a normal attack lands a critical hit, instantly unleashes <color=#44afee>Dragon Breath - Fire</color>, dealing Fire attribute ranged P.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s</color> of P.ATK to all enemies within range, and there's a <color=#44afee>60%%</color> chance to make the hit enemy enter <color=#44afee>Burn</color> state. Units under the <color=#44afee>Burn</color> effect take True DMG equal to <color=#44afee>1%%</color> of their Max HP every second for <color=#44afee>3</color> seconds. Cooldown: <color=#44afee>6</color> seconds. (This damage effect is not effective against Boss, MVP, and MINI.)\nAt <color=#44afee>Refinement Lv.8-Lv.11</color>, targets under the Burn effect will have their MSPD reduced by <color=#44afee>50%%</color>.\nWhen <color=#44afee>Refinement exceeds Lv.12</color>, targets under the Burn effect will have their MSPD reduced by <color=#44afee>50%%</color> and lose <color=#44afee>2</color> buffs per second. (This damage effect is not effective against Boss, MVP, and MINI.)\n\n",
    ["SkillDesc_81401200"]="<color=#44afee>Odd Ascension Level</color>: Increases P.ATK by <color=#44afee>%s</color>.\n<color=#44afee>Even Ascension Level</color>: When it deals damage, instantly unleashes <color=#44afee>Dragon Breath - Water</color>, dealing weapon attribute ranged P.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s</color> of P.ATK to all enemies within range and reducing the MSPD of hit enemies by <color=#44afee>40%%</color> for <color=#44afee>3</color> seconds. Cooldown: <color=#44afee>6</color> seconds.\nAt <color=#44afee>Refinement Lv.8-Lv.11</color>, when casting a skill on the slowed target, there's a <color=#44afee>8%%</color> chance to reset 1 active skill's cooldown.\nWhen <color=#44afee>Refinement exceeds Lv.12</color>, when casting a skill on the slowed target, there's a <color=#44afee>16%%</color> chance to reset 1 active skill's cooldown.",
    ["SkillDesc_81401300"]="<color=#44afee>Odd Ascension Level</color>: Increases P.ATK by <color=#44afee>%s</color>.\n<color=#44afee>Even Ascension Level</color>: When it deals damage, instantly unleashes <color=#44afee>Zeny Storm</color> to blast the target area with Zeny a total of <color=#44afee>6</color> times, each dealing weapon attribute P.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s</color> of P.ATK and reducing their MSPD by <color=#44afee>50%%</color> for <color=#44afee>3</color> seconds. Cooldown: <color=#44afee>9</color> seconds.\nAt <color=#44afee>Refinement Lv.8-Lv.11</color>, when casting a skill on the slowed target, there's a <color=#44afee>8%%</color> chance to reset 1 active skill's cooldown.\nWhen <color=#44afee>Refinement exceeds Lv.12</color>, when casting a skill on the slowed target, there's a <color=#44afee>16%%</color> chance to reset 1 active skill's cooldown.",
    ["SkillDesc_81401400"]="\n\n<color=#44afee>Odd Ascension Level</color>: Increases M.ATK by <color=#44afee>%s</color>.\n<color=#44afee>Even Ascension Level</color>: When casting a normal attack or skill, there's a <color=#44afee>20%%</color>/<color=#44afee>60%%</color> chance to instantly unleash <color=#44afee>Fire Bolt</color>, dealing Fire attribute M.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s</color> of M.ATK to the target. Cooldown: <color=#44afee>3</color> seconds.\nAt <color=#44afee>Refinement Lv.8-Lv.11</color> and when skills of this equipment deal damage, it reduces all HP Regen effects of the target by <color=#44afee>40%%</color> for <color=#44afee>3</color> seconds.\nWhen <color=#44afee>Refinement exceeds Lv.12</color> and when skills of this equipment deal damage, it reduces all HP Regen effects of the target by <color=#44afee>80%%</color> for <color=#44afee>3</color> seconds.\n\n",
    ["SkillDesc_81401500"]="<color=#44afee>Odd Ascension Level</color>: Increases M.ATK by <color=#44afee>%s</color>.\n<color=#44afee>Even Ascension Level</color>: When it deals damage, there's a <color=#44afee>40%%</color> chance to instantly unleash <color=#44afee>Fire Bolt</color>, dealing Fire attribute M.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s</color> of M.ATK to the target. Cooldown: <color=#44afee>3</color> seconds.\nAt <color=#44afee>Refinement Lv.8-Lv.11</color>, <color=#44afee>Fire Bolt</color>'s <color=#44afee>Double Casting</color> trigger chance is increased by <color=#44afee>10%%</color> after casting <color=#44afee>Fire Bolt</color>.\nWhen <color=#44afee>Refinement exceeds Lv.12</color>, <color=#44afee>Fire Bolt</color>'s <color=#44afee>Double Casting</color> trigger chance is increased by <color=#44afee>20%%</color> after casting <color=#44afee>Fire Bolt</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_81401600"]="<color=#44afee>Odd Ascension Level</color>: Increases Neutral attribute by <color=#44afee>%s</color>.\n<color=#44afee>Even Ascension Level</color>: When a normal attack lands a critical hit, instantly unleashes <color=#44afee>Dragon Breath - Fire</color>, dealing Fire attribute ranged P.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s</color> of P.ATK to all enemies within range, and there's a <color=#44afee>60%%</color> chance to make the hit enemy enter <color=#44afee>Burn</color> state. Units under the <color=#44afee>Burn</color> effect take True DMG equal to <color=#44afee>1%%</color> of their Max HP every second for <color=#44afee>3</color> seconds. Cooldown: <color=#44afee>6</color> seconds. (This damage effect is not effective against Boss, MVP, and MINI.)\nAt <color=#44afee>Refinement Lv.8-Lv.11</color>, targets under the Burn effect will have their MSPD reduced by <color=#44afee>50%%</color>.\nWhen <color=#44afee>Refinement exceeds Lv.12</color>, targets under the Burn effect will have their MSPD reduced by <color=#44afee>50%%</color> and lose <color=#44afee>2</color> buffs per second. (This damage effect is not effective against Boss, MVP, and MINI.)",
    ["SkillDesc_81401700"]="<color=#44afee>Odd Ascension Level</color>: Increases Neutral Enhancement by <color=#44afee>%s</color>.\n<color=#44afee>Even Ascension Level</color>: When it deals damage, instantly unleashes <color=#44afee>Ki Wave</color> to blast the target and nearby enemies a total of 3 times, dealing weapon attribute P.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s</color> of P.ATK in total. Cooldown: <color=#44afee>6</color> seconds.\nAt <color=#44afee>Refinement Lv.8-Lv.11</color>, when casting a skill on the slowed target, there's a <color=#44afee>8%%</color> chance to reset 1 active skill's cooldown.\nWhen <color=#44afee>Refinement exceeds Lv.12</color>, when casting a skill on the slowed target, there's a <color=#44afee>16%%</color> chance to reset 1 active skill's cooldown.",
    ["SkillDesc_81401800"]="<color=#44afee>Odd Ascension Level</color>: Increases Neutral attribute by <color=#44afee>%s</color>.\n<color=#44afee>Even Ascension Level</color>: When a normal attack lands a critical hit, instantly unleashes <color=#44afee>Deatheye Missile</color>, dealing Neutral attribute P.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s</color> of P.ATK to the target (crit possible) while reducing their MSPD by <color=#44afee>15%%</color> for <color=#44afee>1.5</color> seconds. Cooldown: <color=#44afee>3</color> seconds.\nAt <color=#44afee>Refinement Lv.8-Lv.11</color>, you deal <color=#44afee>15%%</color> more damage to slowed targets.\nWhen <color=#44afee>Refinement exceeds Lv.12</color>, you deal <color=#44afee>30%%</color> more damage to slowed targets.",
    ["SkillDesc_81401900"]="<color=#44afee>Odd Ascension Level</color>: Increases Ghost attribute by <color=#44afee>%s</color>.\n<color=#44afee>Even Ascension Level</color>: When a normal attack lands a critical hit, instantly unleashes <color=#44afee>White Imprison</color>, granting a <color=#44afee>50%%</color> chance to <color=#44afee>Immobilize</color> to the target for <color=#44afee>1</color> second. If it fails, then it deals Ghost attribute P.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s</color> of P.ATK (crit possible). Cooldown: <color=#44afee>6</color> seconds.\nAt <color=#44afee>Refinement Lv.8-Lv.11</color>, you deal <color=#44afee>15%%</color> more damage to immobilized targets.\nWhen <color=#44afee>Refinement exceeds Lv.12</color>, you deal <color=#44afee>30%%</color> more damage to immobilized targets.",
    ["SkillDesc_81402000"]="<color=#44afee>Odd Ascension Level</color>: Increases Ghost attribute by <color=#44afee>%s</color>.\n<color=#44afee>Even Ascension Level</color>: When a normal attack lands a critical hit, instantly unleashes <color=#44afee>Banishing Buster</color> to remove 1 buff from the target. When successfully removed, it deals Ghost attribute P.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s</color> of P.ATK to the target (crit possible). Cooldown: <color=#44afee>6</color> seconds.\nAt <color=#44afee>Refinement Lv.8-Lv.11</color>, each buff removed increases your Final P.DMG Bonus by <color=#44afee>8%%</color> for <color=#44afee>12</color> seconds. Stacks up to <color=#44afee>3</color> times.\nWhen <color=#44afee>Refinement exceeds Lv.12</color>, each buff removed increases your Final P.DMG Bonus by <color=#44afee>16%%</color> for <color=#44afee>12</color> seconds. Stacks up to <color=#44afee>3</color> times.",
    ["SkillDesc_81402100"]="<color=#44afee>Odd Ascension Level</color>: Increases Neutral attribute by <color=#44afee>%s</color>.\n<color=#44afee>Even Ascension Level</color>: When it deals damage, instantly unleashes <color=#44afee>Slug Shot</color> to generate a blackhole beneath the target and pull in nearby enemies for <color=#44afee>3</color> seconds. After it explodes, it deals Neutral attribute P.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s</color> of P.ATK to nearby enemies (crit possible). Cooldown: <color=#44afee>12</color> seconds.\nAt <color=#44afee>Refinement Lv.8-Lv.11</color>, each target present in the area when the blackhole explodes reduces this skill's cooldown by <color=#44afee>0.5</color> seconds.\nWhen <color=#44afee>Refinement exceeds Lv.12</color>, each target present in the area when the blackhole explodes reduces this skill's cooldown by <color=#44afee>1</color> second.",
    ["SkillDesc_81402200"]="<color=#44afee>Odd Ascension Level</color>: Increases M.ATK by <color=#44afee>%s</color>.\n<color=#44afee>Even Ascension Level</color>: After using normal attacks or single unit skills, casting any skill will unleash <color=#44afee>Throw Shuriken</color> to throw a shuriken at the target, dealing Escape Mark's attribute M.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s</color> in a total of 3 hits. Cooldown: <color=#44afee>3</color> seconds.\n<color=#44afee>At Refinement Lv.8-Lv.11</color>, you deal <color=#44afee>15%%</color> more damage to slowed targets.\n<color=#44afee>When Refinement exceeds Lv.12</color>, you deal <color=#44afee>30%%</color> more damage to slowed targets.",
    ["SkillDesc_81402300"]="<color=#44afee>Odd Ascension Level</color>: Increases Shadow Enhancement by <color=#44afee>%s</color>.\n<color=#44afee>Even Ascension Level</color>: After using a normal attack or a single-target skill, casting any skill unleashes <color=#44afee>Throw Shuriken</color> to throw a shuriken at the current target, dealing Shadow attribute P.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s</color> of P.ATK in a total of 3 hits. Cooldown: <color=#44afee>3</color> seconds.\nAt <color=#44afee>Refinement Lv.8-Lv.11</color>, you deal <color=#44afee>15%%</color> more damage to bleeding targets.\nWhen <color=#44afee>Refinement exceeds Lv.12</color>, you deal <color=#44afee>30%%</color> more damage to bleeding targets.",
    ["SkillDesc_81402400"]="<color=#44afee>Odd Ascension Level</color>: Increases Final ASPD by <color=#44afee>%s</color>.\n<color=#44afee>Even Ascension Level</color>: When taking damage, it applies a <color=#44afee>%s</color> reduction (1 stack) in Final Crit and Final P.DMG Reduction to the source of the attack for <color=#44afee>5</color> seconds. Each target receives up to 1 stack of this effect per second, stacking up to <color=#44afee>15</color> times.\nAt <color=#44afee>Refinement Lv.8-Lv.11</color>, you take <color=#44afee>15%%</color> less damage when your HP falls below <color=#44afee>30%%</color> of your Max HP.\nWhen <color=#44afee>Refinement exceeds Lv.12</color>, you take <color=#44afee>30%%</color> less damage when your HP falls below <color=#44afee>30%%</color> of your Max HP.",
    ["SkillDesc_81402500"]="<color=#44afee>Odd Ascension Level</color>: Increases Final Haste by <color=#44afee>%s</color>.\n<color=#44afee>Even Ascension Level</color>: When taking damage, it applies a <color=#44afee>%s</color> reduction (1 stack) in Final Haste and Final M.DMG Reduction to the source of the attack for <color=#44afee>5</color> seconds. Each target receives up to 1 stack of this effect per second, stacking up to <color=#44afee>15</color> times.\nAt <color=#44afee>Refinement Lv.8-Lv.11</color>, you take <color=#44afee>15%%</color> less damage when your HP falls below <color=#44afee>30%%</color> of your Max HP.\nWhen <color=#44afee>Refinement exceeds Lv.12</color>, you take <color=#44afee>30%%</color> less damage when your HP falls below <color=#44afee>30%%</color> of your Max HP.",
    ["SkillDesc_81402600"]="For each monster defeated, gain <color=#44afee>1</color> stack of the effect that increases your Final DMG Bonus by <color=#44afee>1%%</color>. For each Adventurer defeated, gain <color=#44afee>3</color> stacks of that effect. Stacks up to <color=#44afee>%s</color> times and lasts <color=#44afee>20</color> seconds.\nEach level upgrade of the set effect grants an additional <color=#44afee>40</color> VIT, <color=#44afee>40</color> STR, <color=#44afee>40</color> AGI, and <color=#44afee>10%%</color> Final P.DMG and M.DMG Bonus.",
    ["SkillDesc_81402700"]="If your HP falls below <color=#44afee>20%%</color> of your Max HP, you will enter a state of <color=#44afee>Frozen</color> and <color=#44afee>Invincibility</color> (this state is unbreakable but can be dispelled). This effect disappears after <color=#44afee>3</color> seconds, dealing Adaptive DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s</color> of P.ATK to nearby targets. Cooldown: <color=#44afee>30</color> seconds.\nEach level upgrade of the set effect grants an additional <color=#44afee>40</color> VIT, <color=#44afee>40</color> STR, <color=#44afee>40</color> AGI, and <color=#44afee>10%%</color> Final P.DMG and M.DMG Bonus.",
    ["SkillDesc_81402800"]="<color=#44afee>Odd Ascension Level</color>: Increases Fire attribute by <color=#44afee>%s</color>.\n<color=#44afee>Even Ascension Level</color>: After casting the skill, launches a <color=#44afee>Fire Bolt</color>, dealing Fire attribute physical damage equal to <color=#44afee>%s</color> of P.ATK to the target. Cooldown: <color=#44afee>3</color> seconds.\nAt <color=#44afee>Refinement Lv.8-Lv.11</color>, this equipment skill deals <color=#44afee>15%%</color> more damage to stunned targets.\nWhen <color=#44afee>Refinement exceeds Lv.12</color>, this equipment skill deals <color=#44afee>30%%</color> more damage to stunned targets.",
    ["SkillDesc_81500100"]="Each time you deal skill damage (group damage skills can only select 1 target), the target takes extra <color=#44afee>%s</color> P.DMG from you. Stacks up to 5 times and lasts 12 seconds. Cooldown: 2 seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_81500200"]="Dealing damage to monsters each time grants 1 stack of mark, while defeating an Adventurer grants 5 stacks, increasing your Fire Enhancement by <color=#44afee>%s</color>. Stacks up to 20 times and lasts 20 seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_81500300"]="Each time you deal skill damage, the target takes an extra <color=#44afee>%s</color> M.DMG from you and you take <color=#44afee>%s</color> less M.DMG from the target. Stacks up to 5 times and lasts 12 seconds. Cooldown: 2 seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_81500400"]="Attacking a target deals extra Poison attribute DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s</color> of P.ATK and has a <color=#44afee>6%%</color> chance to <color=#44afee>silence</color> the target for 3 seconds. Cooldown: 6 seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_81500600"]="When attacking a target with less than <color=#44afee>30%%</color> HP, deals <color=#44afee>%s</color> more damage and has a <color=#44afee>%s</color> chance to execute the target instantly (Execution is not effective against MVP, MINI, and Boss units and PVP mode).",
    ["SkillDesc_81500700"]="Casting a skill boosts the damage output of nearby allies (within 6 meters) by <color=#44afee>%s</color> and reduces the damage they take by <color=#44afee>%s</color>. Stacks up to 10 times and lasts 10 seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_81500800"]="Casting a skill boosts the damage output of nearby allies (within 6 meters) by <color=#44afee>%s</color> and reduces the damage they take by <color=#44afee>%s</color>. Stacks up to 10 times and lasts 10 seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_81500900"]="When it's nighttime or indoor environment, your damage dealt is increased by <color=#44afee>%s</color>, your Hiding duration lasts <color=#44afee>%s</color> second(s) longer, and you can spot hidden targets.",
    ["SkillDesc_81501000"]="After using normal attacks or single unit skills, casting any skill has a <color=#44afee>10%%</color> chance to automatically cast Charge Arrow, dealing weapon attribute P.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s</color> of P.ATK and stunning the target for 2 seconds. Triggers once every 6 seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_81501100"]="Dealing damage to monsters each time grants 1 stack of mark, while defeating an Adventurer grants 5 stacks, increasing your Neutral Enhancement by <color=#44afee>%s</color>. Stacks up to 30 times and lasts 20 seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_81501200"]="Dealing damage to monsters each time grants 1 stack of mark, while defeating an Adventurer grants 5 stacks, increasing your Fire Enhancement by <color=#44afee>%s</color>. Stacks up to 30 times and lasts 20 seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_81501500"]="When dealing skill damage, there is a <color=#44afee>%s</color> chance to remove 1 buff from the target; damage against Demon and Undead monsters is increased by <color=#44afee>%s</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_81501600"]="When casting a skill, there is a <color=#44afee>15%%</color> chance to gain a shield equal to M.ATK x <color=#44afee>%s</color> (scales with HP percentage) for 10 seconds; while the shield is active, casting a skill also deals weapon attribute M.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s</color> of M.ATK.",
    ["SkillDesc_81501700"]="Increases your Fire Enhancement by <color=#44afee>%s</color> after casting a kicking skill for <color=#44afee>5</color> seconds, stacking up to <color=#44afee>10</color> times.",
    ["SkillDesc_81501800"]="Every <color=#44afee>40</color> normal attacks, your next move (skill or normal attack) within 5 seconds deals extra weapon attribute DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s</color> of P.ATK and stuns the target for 2 seconds. If your Final Crit is higher than Final P.PEN, this skill may trigger critical damage. Triggers once every 6 seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_81501900"]="There's a <color=#44afee>6%%</color> chance to trigger a combo when dealing damage, dealing weapon attribute P.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s</color> of P.ATK to the target. Triggers once every 3 seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_81502000"]="When the current weapon's ammo count is below <color=#44afee>30%%</color>, all skill damage is increased by <color=#44afee>%s</color> for 10 seconds or until reloading. Cooldown: 20 seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_81502100"]="When attacking a target who has less than <color=#44afee>30%%</color> HP, you deal <color=#44afee>%s</color> more damage and have a <color=#44afee>10%%</color> chance to confuse them for 3 seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_81502200"]="Deals increased damage to targets beyond 3 meters. Each meter increases damage by <color=#44afee>%s</color>, up to a maximum of <color=#44afee>%s</color> x9.",
    ["SkillDesc_81502300"]="After casting a skill, increases the Final DMG Bonus of all teammates by <color=#44afee>%s</color> and MSPD by 3%% for 5 seconds, stacking up to 3 times.",
    ["SkillDesc_81502400"]="After casting a skill, there is a <color=#44afee>30%%</color> chance to automatically cast Chain Lightning, dealing Wind attribute M.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s</color> of M.ATK to random targets within 12 meters, bouncing up to 5 times. Cooldown: 4 seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_81502500"]="When it's nighttime or indoor environment, your damage dealt is increased by <color=#44afee>%s</color>, your Hiding duration lasts <color=#44afee>%s</color> second(s) longer, and you can spot hidden targets.",
    ["SkillDesc_81502600"]="When taking P.DMG, there is a <color=#44afee>8%%</color> chance to become immune and reflect <color=#44afee>%s</color> of the damage to the attacker as True DMG.",
    ["SkillDesc_81502700"]="When taking M.DMG, there is a <color=#44afee>8%%</color> chance to become immune and reflect <color=#44afee>%s</color> of the damage to the attacker as True DMG.",
    ["SkillDesc_81502800"]="When hit by Earth/Water/Fire/Wind DMG, gain <color=#44afee>%s</color> resistance to that element for 5 seconds, stacking up to 5 times.\n(Can only gain one elemental resistance at a time.)",
    ["SkillDesc_81502900"]="When the user's HP falls below 30%%, gain a shield equal to <color=#44afee>%s</color> of Max HP for 5 seconds. Cooldown: 20 seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_81503000"]="After landing a critical hit, there is a <color=#44afee>5%%</color> chance to increase your Final DMG Bonus by <color=#44afee>%s</color> for 5 seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_81503100"]="After entering battle, every 10 seconds, there is a <color=#44afee>24%%</color> chance to gain the following buff: Each time you cast a skill, it deals an additional Neutral attribute DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s</color> of P.ATK to the current target within 12 meters for 10 seconds.\n(Cannot be triggered again while active.)",
    ["SkillDesc_81503200"]="When the user's HP falls below <color=#44afee>50%%</color>, they gain Lv.10 Kyrie Eleison, blocking up to <color=#44afee>10</color> attacks or absorbing damage equal to <color=#44afee>30%%</color> of Max HP, while increasing their Final M.DMG Bonus by <color=#44afee>%s</color> for 10 seconds. Cooldown: 10 seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_81503300"]="Each time you damage a target afflicted by Kindle, Freeze, Blind, or Slow, your Final DMG Bonus increases by <color=#44afee>%s</color>. Stacks up to 10 times and lasts 12 seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_81503400"]="Each time you damage a target afflicted by Bleed, Stun, Poison, or Silence, your Final DMG Bonus increases by <color=#44afee>%s</color>. Stacks up to 10 times and lasts 12 seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_81503500"]="When the user's HP falls below <color=#44afee>50%%</color>, they gain Lv.10 Kyrie Eleison, blocking up to <color=#44afee>10</color> attacks or absorbing damage equal to <color=#44afee>30%%</color> of Max HP, while increasing their Final P.DMG Bonus by <color=#44afee>%s</color> for 10 seconds. Cooldown: 10 seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_81503600"]="Casting a skill or normal attack grants a (<color=#44afee>12%%|8%%</color>) chance to inflict Armor Break on a single enemy target for <color=#44afee>8</color> seconds. Performs divination simultaneously, yielding one of four possible results: <color=#44afee>Sun</color>, <color=#44afee>Moon</color>, <color=#44afee>Stars</color>, or <color=#44afee>Earth</color>. After the initial divination, there is a <color=#44afee>%s</color> chance (up to 100%%) to perform another <color=#44afee>%s</color> time(s) in a row (up to 3) without repeated results. Triggers once every <color=#44afee>16</color> seconds.\n <color=#44afee>Sun</color>: Reduces a single enemy target's P.DMG Reflection and M.DMG Reflection by <color=#44afee>%s</color> for <color=#44afee>8</color> seconds.\n <color=#44afee>Moon</color>: Increases your Physical Lifesteal and Magic Lifesteal by <color=#44afee>%s</color> for <color=#44afee>8</color> seconds.\n <color=#44afee>Stars</color>: Reduces a single enemy target's highest main attribute by <color=#44afee>%s</color> for <color=#44afee>8</color> seconds.\n <color=#44afee>Earth</color>: Reduces a single enemy target's Max HP Regen percentage per 5s by <color=#44afee>%s</color> for <color=#44afee>8</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_81600100"]="After dealing damage using a skill, increases Neutral Enhancement by <color=#44afee>%s</color> for <color=#44afee>5</color> seconds, stacking up to <color=#44afee>20</color> times.",
    ["SkillDesc_81600101"]="After dealing damage using a skill, increases Fire Enhancement by <color=#44afee>%s</color> for <color=#44afee>5</color> seconds, stacking up to <color=#44afee>20</color> times.",
    ["SkillDesc_81600102"]="After dealing damage using a skill, increases Final P.DMG Bonus by <color=#44afee>%s</color> for <color=#44afee>6</color> seconds, stacking up to <color=#44afee>20</color> times.",
    ["SkillDesc_81600103"]="After dealing damage using a skill, increases Final M.DMG Bonus by <color=#44afee>%s</color> for <color=#44afee>6</color> seconds, stacking up to <color=#44afee>20</color> times.",
    ["SkillDesc_81600104"]="Then the highest primary stat is VIT, increases Final DMG Bonus effect against monsters by <color=#44afee>%s</color> for <color=#44afee>10</color> seconds. Triggers <color=#44afee>once</color> every <color=#44afee>20</color> seconds.\nWhen the highest primary stat is not VIT, increases Final DMG Bonus effect by <color=#44afee>%s</color> and Debuff Penetration by <color=#44afee>%s</color> against monsters for <color=#44afee>16</color> seconds. Triggers <color=#44afee>once</color> every <color=#44afee>20</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_81600105"]="After dealing damage using a skill, increases Poison Enhancement by <color=#44afee>%s</color> for <color=#44afee>5</color> seconds, stacking up to <color=#44afee>20</color> times.",
    ["SkillDesc_81600106"]="After dealing damage using a skill, increases Poison Enhancement by <color=#44afee>%s</color> for <color=#44afee>5</color> seconds, stacking up to <color=#44afee>20</color> times.",
    ["SkillDesc_81600107"]="When the weapon reaches refinement level +8, <color=#44afee>each</color> additional refinement level reduces your Final ASPD by <color=#44afee>%s</color> and increases your bonus damage dealt to Angel and Demon Monsters by <color=#44afee>%s</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_81600108"]="After dealing damage using a skill, increases Ghost Enhancement by <color=#44afee>%s</color> for <color=#44afee>5</color> seconds, stacking up to <color=#44afee>20</color> times.",
    ["SkillDesc_81600109"]="After dealing damage using a skill, increases Wind Enhancement by <color=#44afee>%s</color> for <color=#44afee>5</color> seconds, stacking up to <color=#44afee>20</color> times.",
    ["SkillDesc_81600110"]="After dealing damage using a skill, increases Final P.DMG Bonus by <color=#44afee>%s</color> for <color=#44afee>5</color> seconds, stacking up to <color=#44afee>20</color> times.",
    ["SkillDesc_81600111"]="After dealing damage using a skill, increases Final P.DMG Bonus by <color=#44afee>%s</color> for <color=#44afee>5</color> seconds, stacking up to <color=#44afee>20</color> times.",
    ["SkillDesc_81600112"]="After dealing damage using a skill, increases Final P.DMG Bonus by <color=#44afee>%s</color> for <color=#44afee>5</color> seconds, stacking up to <color=#44afee>20</color> times.",
    ["SkillDesc_81600113"]="Then the highest primary stat is VIT, increases Final DMG Bonus effect against monsters by <color=#44afee>%s</color> for <color=#44afee>10</color> seconds. Triggers <color=#44afee>once</color> every <color=#44afee>20</color> seconds.\nWhen the highest primary stat is not VIT, increases Final DMG Bonus effect by <color=#44afee>%s</color> and Debuff Penetration by <color=#44afee>%s</color> against monsters for <color=#44afee>16</color> seconds. Triggers <color=#44afee>once</color> every <color=#44afee>20</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_81600114"]="Then the highest primary stat is VIT, increases Final DMG Bonus effect against monsters by <color=#44afee>%s</color> for <color=#44afee>10</color> seconds. Triggers <color=#44afee>once</color> every <color=#44afee>20</color> seconds.\nWhen the highest primary stat is not VIT, increases Final DMG Bonus effect by <color=#44afee>%s</color> and Debuff Penetration by <color=#44afee>%s</color> against monsters for <color=#44afee>16</color> seconds. Triggers <color=#44afee>once</color> every <color=#44afee>20</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_81600115"]="When exiting Stealth, reduces Final DMG taken by <color=#44afee>%s</color> for <color=#44afee>5</color> seconds, and increases Final DMG Bonus by <color=#44afee>%s</color> during this period. Triggers <color=#44afee>once</color> every <color=#44afee>10</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_81600116"]="After dealing damage using a skill, increases Fire Enhancement by <color=#44afee>%s</color> for <color=#44afee>5</color> seconds, stacking up to <color=#44afee>20</color> times.",
    ["SkillDesc_81600117"]="After dealing damage using a skill, increases Holy Enhancement by <color=#44afee>%s</color> for <color=#44afee>5</color> seconds, stacking up to <color=#44afee>20</color> times.",
    ["SkillDesc_81600118"]="After dealing Shadow DMG, increases Final M.DMG Bonus by <color=#44afee>%s</color> for <color=#44afee>6</color> seconds, stacking up to <color=#44afee>20</color> times.",
    ["SkillDesc_81600119"]="After dealing damage using a skill, increases Final P.DMG Bonus by <color=#44afee>%s</color> for <color=#44afee>6</color> seconds, stacking up to <color=#44afee>20</color> times.",
    ["SkillDesc_81600120"]="After dealing damage using a skill, increases Final P.DMG Bonus by <color=#44afee>%s</color> for <color=#44afee>6</color> seconds, stacking up to <color=#44afee>20</color> times.",
    ["SkillDesc_81600121"]="After dealing damage using a skill, increases Ghost Enhancement by <color=#44afee>%s</color> for <color=#44afee>5</color> seconds, stacking up to <color=#44afee>20</color> times.",
    ["SkillDesc_81600123"]="After dealing damage using a skill, increases Final P.DMG Bonus by <color=#44afee>%s</color> for <color=#44afee>6</color> seconds, stacking up to <color=#44afee>20</color> times.",
    ["SkillDesc_81600124"]="After dealing damage using a skill, increases Final P.DMG Bonus by <color=#44afee>%s</color> for <color=#44afee>6</color> seconds, stacking up to <color=#44afee>20</color> times.",
    ["SkillDesc_81600125"]="After dealing damage using a skill, increases Final P.DMG Bonus by <color=#44afee>%s</color> for <color=#44afee>6</color> seconds, stacking up to <color=#44afee>20</color> times.",
    ["SkillDesc_81600126"]="Increases damage dealt to buildings by an extra <color=#44afee>%s</color>. Unstackable.",
    ["SkillDesc_81600127"]="Increases the highest primary stat by <color=#44afee>%s</color> and the second-highest primary stat by <color=#44afee>%s</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_81600128"]="DMG Against Wind Attribute Monsters +<color=#44afee>%s</color>\nDMG Reduction from Wind Attribute Monsters +<color=#44afee>%s</color>",
    ["SkillDesc_81600129"]="DMG Against Wind Attribute Monsters +<color=#44afee>%s</color>\nDMG Reduction from Wind Attribute Monsters +<color=#44afee>%s</color>",
    ["SkillDesc_81600130"]="Increases damage dealt to buildings by an extra <color=#44afee>%s</color>. Unstackable.",
    ["SkillDesc_81600131"]="Increases the highest primary stat by <color=#44afee>%s</color> and the second-highest primary stat by <color=#44afee>%s</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_81600132"]="DMG Against Undead Attribute Monsters +<color=#44afee>%s</color>\nDMG Reduction from Undead Attribute Monsters +<color=#44afee>%s</color>",
    ["SkillDesc_81600133"]="DMG Against Undead Attribute Monsters +<color=#44afee>%s</color>\nDMG Reduction from Undead Attribute Monsters +<color=#44afee>%s</color>",
    ["SkillDesc_81600134"]="When the weapon reaches refinement level +8, <color=#44afee>each</color> additional refinement level reduces your Final ASPD by <color=#44afee>%s</color> and increases your bonus damage dealt to Angel and Demon Monsters by <color=#44afee>%s</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_82020000"]="When the target's HP is lower than %s, damage dealt (not including physical or magic damage bonuses) is increased by %s.",
    ["SkillDesc_82060000"]="During battle, Dracula's Blood Summon is triggered every 5 seconds, summoning %s Familiar(s) that self-destruct on random nearby targets. Each Familiar deals %s Neutral damage of a type that matches your own (physical or magic) to targets within 2 meters and inflicts them with the Vulnerable status. Damage taken by Vulnerable targets is increased by %s for 5 seconds. Stacks up to 5 times.",
    ["SkillDesc_82070000"]="Each time you receive damage equal to %s of Max HP, summons a Dark Lord's black matter orb, with each orb increasing PVP Final P.DMG Bonus and PVP Final M.DMG Bonus by %s. A maximum of %s orbs can be summoned. Each orb lasts for 12 seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_82080000"]="Obtain three cards at random from Jacks, Queens, and Kings every 6 seconds during combat. Your Final DMG Bonus will be increased by %s for 18 seconds when getting 3 Jacks, which can be stacked. Your Final DMG Reduction will be increased by %s for 18 seconds when getting 3 Queens, which can be stacked. Your Debuff Duration Reduction and Debuff Resistance will be increased by %s for 18 seconds when getting 3 Kings, which can be stacked. If you obtain a Jack, Queen, and King in order, you will get a shield equal to %s Max HP for 18 seconds, which can be stacked.",
    ["SkillDesc_82090000"]="Each time when activating the class active skill, obtains a 60%% chance to gain Sharp, which increases Final Damage Bonus and Bonus Heal by %s for 15 seconds, stacking up to 3 times. After obtaining 3 stacks of Sharp, consumes all the stacks to increase the damage or healing produced by the next active attack within 3 seconds by %s. The effect is triggered up to 1 time every 5 seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_82100001"]="After dealing damage with normal attacks, generates Underworld's Mist in a 3-meter area on the targeted floor that lasts for 6 seconds. Afterwards, generates 1 Underworld's Mist every 6 seconds, granting the caster one stack of Haze of the Underworld every 2 seconds. Each stack of Haze of the Underworld increases normal attack damage by %s and Final Hit by %s for 3 seconds, up to 10 stacks.",
    ["SkillDesc_82100002"]="In PVP, upon entering battle, for every <color=#44afee>10%%</color> of Max HP lost, you gain 1 stack of Auto Counter lasting 8 seconds, stacking up to 5 times. Each stack increases your PVP Final P.DMG Bonus and PVP Final M.DMG Bonus by <color=#44afee>%s</color>. The effect ends immediately when the character is defeated or exits combat.",
    ["SkillDesc_83020000"]="After entering battle, poison up to 5 targets (not including Mini, MVP, or bosses) within a 4-meter radius of yourself once every 10 seconds, causing the target(s) to lose %s of their Max HP per second for 4 seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_84020000"]="When attacked, there is a %s chance to cast a lightning bolt that can jump up to 5 times to an attacker within a 6-meter range, dealing %s Wind damage of a type that matches your own (physical or magic) every time it jumps. Can be triggered once every 5 seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_85020000"]="Removes self debuffs every 6 seconds and becomes immune to debuffs for %s seconds, during this duration regen %s MAX HP every second. (In addition to some debuffs from BOSS and debuffs or resistances that can't be removed)",
    ["SkillDesc_86000000"]="When taking fatal damage, you are saved from death, immediately recovering to %s of Max HP (not affected by healing effect modifiers), and MSPD is increased by %s for 10 seconds. Can take effect once every %s second(s). (Capped at Set Ascension Level 5.)",
    ["SkillDesc_86001000"]="When casting a skill or attacking normally, you'll have a %s chance of ignoring the target's physical defense",
    ["SkillDesc_86002000"]="After casting this skill, there's a %s chance to reset the cooldown of a random active skill of the current class",
    ["SkillDesc_86003000"]="During the battle, every 30s, enter Berserk state and increase Crit Damage Bonus by %s for 10s",
    ["SkillDesc_86004000"]="For every damage taken equal to 10%% of max HP, increase Final Damage Bonus by %s for 10s, up to 6 stacks",
    ["SkillDesc_86005000"]="When HP is below 50%%, gain a Shield that lasts 6 seconds and can block damage equal to %s of max HP; the Shield takes effect once every 20 seconds",
    ["SkillDesc_86006000"]="When casting a skill or launching normal attacks, you have a %s chance of ignoring the target's Magic Defense",
    ["SkillDesc_88001000"]="Every time you cast a skill of your current class, gain a mark that lasts 10s; once you have 5 marks, damage of your active skills increase by %s for 4s; this takes effect once every 12s",
    ["SkillDesc_88003000"]="Every time your normal attack hits the target, there's a %s chance to deal True DMG equal to %s of this damage to up to 3 enemies within 2 meters from the target.",
    ["SkillDesc_88004000"]="When HP is below %s, increase Final DMG Reduction by %s for 10s; this takes effect once every 30s",
    ["SkillDesc_88005000"]="Physical Reflect Damage and Magic Reflect Damage increase by %s",
    ["SkillDesc_89001000"]="In PVP, when the enemy player's HP drops below <color=#44afee>50%%</color>, upon inflicting damage to them with skills, deals additional True DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s</color> of the target's Max HP. Takes effect once every <color=#44afee>4</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_89002000"]="In PVP, when the enemy player's HP drops below <color=#44afee>50%%</color>, upon inflicting damage to them with skills, deals additional True DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s</color> of the target's Max HP. Takes effect once every <color=#44afee>4</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_89003000"]="In PVP, each normal attack that hits the enemy player will lower the target's PVP Final Physical Damage Reduction by %s for 3 seconds. Can stack up to 12 times.",
    ["SkillDesc_89004000"]="Every 12 seconds in battle, removes all party members' debuffs and grants immunity to debuff statuses for 3 seconds. (This does not include debuffs inflicted by Boss monsters.) During this period, increases PVP Final Physical Damage Reduction and PVP Final Magic Damage Reduction by %s.",
    ["SkillDesc_89005000"]="In PVP, each skill cast increases your PVP Final Physical Damage Bonus and PVP Final Magic Damage Bonus by %s. Stacks up to 4 times and lasts for 6 seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_89006000"]="In PVP, upon dealing a total of 6 critical hits to the enemy player within 3 seconds, deals additional true damage equal to %s of the target's Max HP. Takes effect once every 6 seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_89007000"]="Immune to Devouring Shadow skill during the battle with Necromancer.",
    ["SkillDesc_90000101"]="Strikes the targets within a 4-meter radius with Terra Force <color=#FFA500>3</color> times, each dealing Fire attribute P.DMG equal to <color=#FFA500>650%</color> of P.ATK. These hits can trigger critical damage. <color=#FFA500>Each</color> critical hit applies <color=#FFA500>1</color> stack of <color=#FFA500>Energy Erosion</color> to the target, up to <color=#FFA500>3</color> stacks. <color=#FFA500>Each</color> stack of <color=#FFA500>Energy Erosion</color> allows the pet and its master to ignore the target's Final DMG Reduction by <color=#FFA500>16%</color> for <color=#FFA500>6</color> seconds. For <color=#FFA500>each</color> stack of Energy Erosion applied, subsequent damage from Terra Force increases by <color=#FFA500>30%</color>. If your Poison Enhancement is higher than Fire Enhancement, Terra Force inflicts Poison attribute P.DMG instead.",
    ["SkillDesc_90001101"]="Smashes down with Heaven's Knuckle, dealing Holy attribute P.DMG equal to <color=#FFA500>2,000%</color> of P.ATK and ignoring <color=#FFA500>20%</color> of the target's P.DEF. If the target is an MVP/MINI/Boss unit, they'll get a <color=#FFA500>Divine Mark</color> effect, taking <color=#FFA500>15%</color> more damage from all party members for <color=#FFA500>6</color> seconds. If the skill hits a target already marked with <color=#FFA500>Divine Mark</color>, it ignores an additional <color=#FFA500>20%</color> P.DEF. If your Poison Enhancement is higher than Holy Enhancement, Heaven's Knuckle inflicts Poison attribute P.DMG instead. Cooldown: <color=#FFA500>24</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_90002101"]="Unleashes a Celestial Arrow, dealing Holy attribute M.DMG equal to <color=#FFA500>2,200%</color> of M.ATK and applying a <color=#FFA500>Heaven's Punishment</color> to the target for <color=#FFA500>10</color> seconds. When you or the master attack targets affected by <color=#FFA500>Heaven's Punishment</color>, you or the master ignore <color=#FFA500>40%</color> of their Final M.DMG Bonus. If your Wind Enhancement is higher than Holy Enhancement, Celestial Arrow inflicts Wind M.DMG instead. Cooldown: <color=#FFA500>20</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_9012004"]="Use the strength of the holy cross to attack the enemy, dealing holy attribute P.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of P.ATK to a single enemy target.",
    ["SkillDesc_9013004"]="Deals weapon attribute P.DMG equal to (<color=#44afee>%s%%</color> of P.ATK + DEX x <color=#44afee>%s</color>) to a single enemy target. When <color=#44afee>behind</color> the target, increases the damage dealt by <color=#44afee>100%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_9122004"]="Charge the target <color=#44afee>4</color> times to make a crossed spear formation, with each charge dealing weapon attribute P.DMG equal to P.ATK x <color=#44afee>%s%%</color>, inflicting a stack of Bleed. Each Bleed stack causes the target to lose HP equal to P.ATK x <color=#44afee>%s%%</color> per second for <color=#44afee>3</color> seconds. For every <color=#44afee>2%%</color> of the target's HP reduced, the charge damage increases by <color=#44afee>1%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_9601101"]="Puts the whole party into Assault state, instantly boosting MSPD to <color=#44afee>12</color> for <color=#44afee>4</color> seconds. When the Assault state ends, the carrier gains the Starfire effect, reducing party members' damage received from ground-based DoT by <color=#44afee>50%%</color> for <color=#44afee>6</color> seconds and granting 1 stack of Starpower every <color=#44afee>0.5</color> seconds. On the next attack, party members consume all Starpower stacks to deal True DMG equal to (<color=#44afee>1.25%%</color> of Max HP x Starpower stacks). If attacking monsters, then they receive weapon attribute Adaptive DMG equal to (<color=#44afee>200%%</color> of the caster's Adaptive ATK x Starpower stacks). Starpower stacks up to <color=#44afee>6</color> times. When any party member casts Dragon Nova - Assault, all other members enter an Overloaded state (excluding PVE scenes), preventing them from using Dragon Nova - Assault for the next 50 seconds. If your Final Crit is higher than Final P.PEN or Final M.PEN, Dragon Nova - Assault can trigger critical damage when attacking monsters.",
    ["SkillDesc_9602101"]="Creates a 6-meter Ghostly Zone where enemies have a <color=#44afee>30%%</color> chance per second to be Feared for 1 second. If attacking monsters, then they receive weapon attribute Adaptive DMG equal to <color=#44afee>2,000%%</color> of Adaptive ATK. Ghostly Zone lasts <color=#44afee>6</color> seconds. In PVE scenes, using a skill puts you in Elegy state, increasing your damage dealt to monsters by <color=#44afee>40%%</color> for <color=#44afee>12</color> seconds. In PVP scenes, each time an enemy dies within the zone, it triggers a Soul Shock, dealing True DMG equal to <color=#44afee>30%%</color> of Max HP to all enemies within range (non-effective against MVP, MINI, and Boss units). When any party member casts Soulbound Nightfall - Elegy, all other members enter an Overloaded state (excluding PVE scenes), preventing them from using Soulbound Nightfall - Elegy for the next 50 seconds. If your Final Crit is higher than Final P.PEN or Final M.PEN, Soulbound Nightfall - Elegy can trigger critical damage when attacking monsters.",
    ["SkillDesc_9603101"]="Locks on to a single target, dealing corresponding attribute damage equal to <color=#44afee>3,200%%</color> of Adaptive ATK. Afterward, applies Starpiercer - Hunt to the target, increasing their damage taken by <color=#44afee>25%%</color> for <color=#44afee>6</color> seconds. If the target inflicted with Starpiercer - Hunt dies during the effective period, all your party members gain Hunt Lock for 45 seconds, which prevents them from using Flashbeak - Starpiercer. If your Final Crit is higher than Final P.PEN or Final M.PEN, Flashbeak - Starpiercer may trigger critical damage.",
    ["SkillDesc_9604101"]="Clears all debuffs instantly and activates Armor Leecher for <color=#44afee>6</color> seconds. While active, gains Endure effect and converts <color=#44afee>12%%</color> of damage taken to a shield (blocks True DMG and is effective during controlled state) that lasts 6 seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_9605101"]="Fires a Decay Spore at the target, releasing Fungal Adhesive to the target and putting them into Fungal Adhesive state, which nullifies the target's MSPD bonus for <color=#44afee>4</color> seconds. If attacking monsters, Fungal Adhesive deals an additional corresponding attribute damage equal to <color=#44afee>450%%</color> of Adaptive ATK. While the target is affected by Fungal Adhesive, every <color=#44afee>5</color> hits causes the spore to absorb energy and grow even larger (excluding Fungal Adhesive's periodic damage). After growing <color=#44afee>4</color> times, the target's Fungal Adhesive is removed and replaced with Suffocating Cocoon, stopping them from moving and casting normal attacks and skills for <color=#44afee>3</color> seconds. If the target dies while having Suffocating Cocoon, all members in your party gain Withered Bloom for <color=#44afee>45</color> seconds. While Withered Bloom is active, Fungal Adhesive - Cocoon cannot be cast. If your Final Crit is higher than Final P.PEN or Final M.PEN, Fungal Adhesive's periodic damage can trigger critical damage.",
    ["SkillDesc_9606101"]="Casts Heartlink Shield to yourself and all party members for <color=#44afee>5</color> seconds. While active, if any party member takes a hit that the final damage exceeds their Max HP by <color=#44afee>10%</color>, the damage received gets split evenly among other party members who have at least <color=#44afee>40%</color> HP and are under the Heartlink Shield effect. (Each party member receives <color=#44afee>10%</color> of the damage, up to 4 members for a total of <color=#44afee>40%</color>.) Whenever damage is shared, <color=#44afee>15%</color> of the damage each member takes turns into a shield for <color=#44afee>1</color> second. This can trigger <color=#44afee>once</color> every <color=#44afee>2</color> seconds. While under the effect of Heartlink Shield, if a protected party member's HP drops below <color=#44afee>50%</color>, they will fire the Arrow of Fate at the attacker if they take damage again. If the attacker is an Adventurer, inflicts <color=#44afee>Punish</color> instead, reducing their damage dealt to the Arrow of Fate caster by <color=#44afee>30%</color> for <color=#44afee>2.5</color> seconds. If the target is a monster, it takes corresponding attribute damage equal to <color=#44afee>4,000%</color> of Adaptive ATK and gets the <color=#44afee>Divine Punishment</color> effect, increasing the damage received from the Arrow of Fate caster by <color=#44afee>15%</color> for <color=#44afee>4</color> seconds. While Heartlink Shield is active, each party member can fire <color=#44afee>1</color> Arrow of Fate, and the arrow can trigger critical damage if the caster's Final Crit is higher than their Final P.PEN or Final M.PEN. In PVP, once a party member uses Heartlink Shield - Punish, the whole party enters Overloaded for <color=#44afee>50</color> seconds, rendering Heartlink Shield - Punish unavailable. Overloaded will not be triggered in PVE.",
    ["SkillDesc_9607101"]="All party members carrying Kazla gain <color=#44afee>1</color> stack of <color=#44afee>Crystal Edge</color> whenever Dual Blades - Cleaver cooldown completes, up to <color=#44afee>2</color> stacks. When any party member uses <color=#44afee>Dual Blades - Cleaver</color>, all party members with <color=#44afee>Crystal Edge</color> lose <color=#44afee>1</color> stack of <color=#44afee>Crystal Edge</color> effect and the caster gains the <color=#44afee>Cleaver</color> effect, granting the caster a <color=#44afee>12%%</color> chance for normal attacks and <color=#44afee>36%%</color> chance for skills to deal <color=#44afee>6</color> extra hits of corresponding attribute damage equal to <color=#44afee>500%%</color> of Adaptive ATK or <color=#44afee>0.8%%</color> of Max HP, respectively. Triggers once every <color=#44afee>3</color> seconds. The <color=#44afee>Cleaver</color> effect lasts for <color=#44afee>20</color> seconds. Dual Blades - Cleaver lasts for <color=#44afee>50</color> seconds. If the target is an Adventurer, the damage coefficient of each hit changes to <color=#44afee>250%%</color> of Adaptive ATK or <color=#44afee>0.4%%</color> of Max HP. When the caster's Final Crit is higher than Final P.PEN or Final M.PEN, Cleaver will crit. In PVE, <color=#44afee>Cleaver</color> increases Final DMG Bonus by <color=#44afee>20%%</color>. In PVP, there's a <color=#44afee>30%%</color> chance to remove <color=#44afee>1</color> buff from the target when <color=#44afee>Cleaver</color> is triggered each time (not applicable on targets immune to debuffs).",
    ["SkillDesc_9608101"]="Creates a <color=#44afee>6</color>-meter radius Strangling Zone at the target location. Enemies inside are pulled toward the center and inflicted with <color=#44afee>Soul Snare</color>, taking Neutral attribute True DMG equal to <color=#44afee>6%%</color> of Max HP every <color=#44afee>0.5</color> seconds. If the target is a monster, it takes corresponding attribute damage equal to <color=#44afee>1,650%%</color> of Adaptive ATK. The zone lasts <color=#44afee>3</color> seconds. When the caster's Final Crit is higher than Final P.PEN or Final M.PEN, <color=#44afee>Soul Snare</color>'s damage to monsters can trigger critical damage. In PVP, when any party member releases <color=#44afee>Strangling Mask</color>, all party members enter <color=#44afee>Overloaded</color> state, preventing them from casting <color=#44afee>Strangling Mask</color> for the next <color=#44afee>50</color> seconds. Overloaded will not be triggered in PVE.",
    ["SkillDesc_9609101"]="Instantly channels freezing undercurrents, wrapping yourself in a hard shell and entering <color=#44afee>Iron Wall</color>, becoming immune to damage for <color=#44afee>3</color> seconds (excluding from MVP, MINI, BOSS, or other execution effects). Can be used while controlled, but you can't move, attack, or cast skills during it. <color=#44afee>Iron Wall</color> is a buff and can be dispelled. Releasing this skill under the <color=#44afee>Iron Wall</color> state removes it instantly.",
    ["SkillDesc_9610101"]="Casts Blossom Mirage at a target location within 6 meters, removing all buffs from enemies inside and applying Mistbind for 6 seconds. Enemies affected by Mistbind have blurred vision and take corresponding attribute damage equal to <color=#44afee>2,000%%</color> of Adaptive ATK or <color=#44afee>1.5%%</color> of Max HP every second. If the Adventurer's Final Crit is higher than Final P.PEN or Final M.PEN, this skill may trigger critical damage. Mistbind also applies a <color=#44afee>15%%</color> miss chance on their normal attacks and a <color=#44afee>40%%</color> chance for their AoE skills to deviate from the targeted location. When any party member casts Blossom Mirage - Mistbind in a PVP scene, all other members enter an Overloaded state (excluding PVE scenes), preventing them from using Blossom Mirage - Mistbind for the next 50 seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_9611101"]="After casting the skill, you gain <color=#44afee>Whispering Corridor</color>. While active, increases PVP MSPD by <color=#44afee>2</color> and PVP Final P.DMG RED / PVP Final M.DMG RED by <color=#44afee>60%%</color>. <color=#44afee>Whispering Corridor</color> lasts for <color=#44afee>8</color> seconds.\nWhile <color=#44afee>Whispering Corridor</color> is active, the Demon emits a Demonic Whisper every <color=#44afee>1</color> second to all enemies within <color=#44afee>6</color> meters, applying <color=#44afee>Heart Erosion</color> on them. <color=#44afee>Heart Erosion</color> stacks up to <color=#44afee>4</color> times and lasts <color=#44afee>8</color> seconds.\nTargets affected by <color=#44afee>Heart Erosion</color> take True DMG equal to <color=#44afee>4%%</color> of Max HP. (For MVP, MINI, BOSS units, it deals corresponding attribute damage equal to <color=#44afee>1050%%</color> of Adaptive ATK or <color=#44afee>1.2%%</color> of Max HP.) When <color=#44afee>Whispering Corridor</color> ends, all applied <color=#44afee>Heart Erosion</color> effects are recalculated again, with each stack of <color=#44afee>Heart Erosion</color> dealing corresponding attribute damage equal to <color=#44afee>900%%</color>of Adaptive ATK or <color=#44afee>1%%</color> of Max HP. When the caster's Final Crit is higher than Final P.PEN or Final M.PEN, <color=#44afee>Heart Erosion</color> can trigger critical damage.\nIn PVP, when any party member releases <color=#44afee>Whispering Corridor - Heart Erosion</color>, all party members enter <color=#44afee>Overloaded</color> state, preventing them from casting <color=#44afee>Whispering Corridor - Heart Erosion</color> for the next <color=#44afee>50</color> seconds. Overloaded will not be triggered in PVE.",
    ["SkillDesc_9999001"]="Punishes a single target with holy light, dealing damage equal to <color=#44afee>850%%</color> of Adaptive ATK. The damage attribute corresponds to your highest elemental attribute enhancement.",
    ["SkillDesc_9999002"]="Creates a sacred domain at a target location, dealing damage equal to <color=#44afee>350%%</color> of Adaptive ATK every <color=#44afee>0.5</color> seconds to all targets within a <color=#44afee>6</color>-meter radius for <color=#44afee>4</color> seconds. The damage attribute corresponds to your highest elemental attribute enhancement.",
    ["SkillDesc_9999003"]="Oracle grants you immense power. When your Final Penetration is higher than Final Crit, <color=#44afee>Goddess' Retribution</color>, <color=#44afee>Goddess' Domain</color>, <color=#44afee>Goddess' Verdict</color>, and <color=#44afee>Goddess' Wrath</color> will ignore <color=#44afee>50%%</color> of the enemy's defense.",
    ["SkillDesc_9999004"]="Unleashes light of judgment, dealing damage equal to <color=#44afee>1,600%%</color> of Adaptive ATK to all targets within a <color=#44afee>4x12</color> straight line area. The damage attribute corresponds to your highest elemental attribute enhancement.",
    ["SkillDesc_9999005"]="Brings down the wrath of heaven, dealing damage equal to <color=#44afee>1,600%%</color> of Adaptive ATK to all targets within a <color=#44afee>6</color>-meter radius. The damage attribute corresponds to your highest elemental attribute enhancement.",
    ["SkillDesc_9999006"]="Light of insight grants you immense strength. When your Final Crit is higher than Final Penetration, the damage of <color=#44afee>Goddess' Retribution</color>, <color=#44afee>Goddess' Domain</color>, <color=#44afee>Goddess' Verdict</color>, and <color=#44afee>Goddess' Wrath</color> can trigger critical hit, reducing their cooldown by <color=#44afee>1</color> second. Once the cooldown is reduced to the fixed cooldown minimum, crits will no longer reduce the cooldown.",
    ["SkillDesc_9999007"]="The power of blessing empowers you, increasing your elemental enhancement by <color=#44afee>5%%</color> and damage dealt to all monster types by <color=#44afee>5%%</color>.",
    ["SkillDesc_9999008"]="The holy radiance awakens the power of revival. If you take damage over <color=#44afee>25%%</color> of your Max HP within <color=#44afee>5</color> seconds, you will recover <color=#44afee>10%%</color> of your Max HP. This effect can be triggered once every <color=#44afee>12</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillDesc_9999009"]="The holy radiance protects you, reducing damage taken from normal monsters by <color=#44afee>20%%</color>, MVP/MINI/Boss units by <color=#44afee>10%%</color>, and characters by <color=#44afee>5%%</color>.",
