    ["SkillRelease_LackBuffPlies"]="This skill must reach <color=#ec8a5a>{1}</color> stacks of <color=#ec8a5a>{0}</color> before cast.",
    ["SkillSet1"]="There are active skills which take effect after a certain cast time. Their Variable Cooldown and Variable Cast Time <color=#CA2E0AFF>increase with the skill level</color>. When the character's current stats are lower than the value required by the skill, the skill cast time and CD will take longer.",
    ["SkillSet2"]="It is recommended to refer to the character's stats and consider factors like the Variable Cooldown, Variable Cast Time, and MP consumption when configuring skills. <color=#CA2E0AFF>Appropriately lowering the skill level </color>will benefit your adventure performance even more.",
    ["SkillSet3"]="You can choose an optimal plan through the Recommended Stat Points button on the screen. You can also choose different playstyles according to your needs and allocate the stat points based on the character's stats.",
    ["SkillSet4"]="If you are not satisfied with the current Stat Points Allocation load-out, you can use items to reset it.",
