    ["SkillSketch5500203"]="Has a chance to directly kill the enemy. If this fails, it will deal damage equal to a percentage of Max HP.",
    ["SkillSketch5500204"]="Devoured monsters will be directly killed. Devoured players will take a large amount of damage and be spit out after 5 seconds.",
    ["SkillSketch5500205"]="Has a chance to confuse enemies within 3 meters of their master.",
    ["SkillSketch5500206"]="Has a chance to silence enemies within 3 meters of their master.",
    ["SkillSketch5500207"]="Decreases the Final Physical Damage Reduction and Final Magic Damage Reduction of enemies within 3 meters of their master.",
    ["SkillSketch5500208"]="Decreases the PVP Final Physical Damage Reduction and PVP Final Magic Damage Reduction of enemies within 3 meters of their master.",
    ["SkillSketch5500209"]="Increases their master's Physical Lifesteal and Magic Lifesteal.",
    ["SkillSketch5500210"]="Restores their master's HP once per second.",
    ["SkillSketch5500211"]="Throws a stone. Has a chance to stun the enemy.",
    ["SkillSketch5500212"]="Increases their master's Mining Speed.",
    ["SkillSketch5500213"]="Ignores some resistances and reductions when inflicting enemies with debuffs.",
    ["SkillSketch5500214"]="Has a chance to inflict the enemy with sleep.",
    ["SkillSketch5500215"]="Devours target, restores owner's health and immune to debuff",
    ["SkillSketch5500218"]="Increases Final Damage Bonus and Final Damage Reduction of their master and their party members",
    ["SkillSketch5500219"]="Deals Fire Attribute damage to enemy groups within 3 meters",
    ["SkillSketch5500220"]="Continuously restores HP for allied units within 4 meters and deals Neutral damage to enemy groups within 4 meters.",
    ["SkillSketch5500221"]="Increase your size, enhance your P.DEF and M.DEF, and put nearby enemies into the Blind state.",
    ["SkillSketch5500223"]="After roaring, increases party members' bonus damage against large monsters and Water Attribute Enhancement.",
    ["SkillSketch5500224"]="Devoured monsters will be directly killed. Devoured players will be spit out after 1 second.",
    ["SkillSketch5500225"]="Devoured monsters will be directly killed. Devoured players will be spit out after 1 second.",
    ["SkillSketch5500226"]="Deals area damage that can trigger critical hits and grants a shield to the master.",
    ["SkillSketch5500227"]="Max Level: Puck begins with <color=#FFA500>6</color> stamina in the fully energized state. It can cast 1 ice spike every <color=#FFA500>3</color> seconds, consuming <color=#FFA500>1</color> stamina per spike, dealing Adaptive Fire DMG equal to <color=#FFA500>336%</color> of Adaptive ATK in total within a <color=#FFA500>4</color>-meter radius. If there are <color=#FFA500>3</color> or fewer targets within range, the ice spike damage increases by <color=#FFA500>50%</color>. Puck enters the fatigue state after casting 6 ice spikes in the fully energized state.\nIn the fatigue state, if the master is attacked, Puck has a <color=#FFA500>6.25%</color> chance to apply Drowsiness to the attacker <color=#FFA500>3</color> seconds later, lasting for <color=#FFA500>3</color> seconds. Drowsy Enemies can't move or attack, waking up after taking damage equal to <color=#FFA500>30%</color> of their Max HP in total. In the fatigue state, Puck no longer casts ice spikes and recovers 1 stamina every <color=#FFA500>2</color> seconds. Once its stamina is back to <color=#FFA500>6</color>, it re-enters the fully energized state and continues to cast ice spikes, dealing extra <color=#FFA500>20%</color> damage to drowsy enemies affected by itself during its fatigue state.",
    ["SkillSketch5500228"]="Increases allied unit's Debuff Resistance and MSPD while providing a shield.",
    ["SkillSketch5500233"]="The Fat Tiger ascends into the air before slamming into the ground, dealing <color=#FFA500>2,460%</color> Ghost or Neutral attribute DMG to targets within a 6-meter radius. This skill may trigger critical damage (based on the higher number of the master's Ghost or Neutral attributes, with damage shared by all targets within the area). It also boosts the master's Ghost and Neutral attributes by <color=#FFA500>30%</color> for <color=#FFA500>6</color> seconds. There's a <color=#FFA500>55%</color> chance to make the target bleeds for <color=#FFA500>6</color> seconds. Cooldown: 12 seconds. When Fat Tiger is casting <color=#FFA500>Divine: Ghost Enhancement</color>, if the master's Neutral Enhancement is greater than Ghost Enhancement, the effect will be changed to Neutral Enhancement.",
    ["SkillSketch5500234"]="Summon ice spikes that strike the target <color=#44afee>3</color> times, each dealing <color=#44afee>465%</color> weapon attribute Adaptive DMG. Each hit absorbs energy around the target and grants the caster <color=#44afee>1-3</color> stacks of Magic Rose. Each stack of Magic Rose increases damage dealt to MVP and MINI units by <color=#44afee>2%</color>. Lasts for 10 seconds. Cooldown: <color=#44afee>20</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillSketch5500235"]="Strikes the targets within a 4-meter radius with Terra Force <color=#FFA500>3</color> times, each dealing Fire attribute P.DMG equal to <color=#FFA500>650%</color> of P.ATK. These hits can trigger critical damage. <color=#FFA500>Each</color> critical hit applies <color=#FFA500>1</color> stack of <color=#FFA500>Energy Erosion</color> to the target, up to <color=#FFA500>3</color> stacks. <color=#FFA500>Each</color> stack of <color=#FFA500>Energy Erosion</color> allows the pet and its master to ignore the target's Final DMG Reduction by <color=#FFA500>16%</color> for <color=#FFA500>6</color> seconds. For <color=#FFA500>each</color> stack of Energy Erosion applied, subsequent damage from Terra Force increases by <color=#FFA500>30%</color>. If your Poison Enhancement is higher than Fire Enhancement, Terra Force inflicts Poison attribute P.DMG instead. Cooldown: <color=#FFA500>20</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillSketch5500236"]="Each time Terra Force lands a critical hit, you get <color=#FFA500>1</color> stack of Brave Shield, up to <color=#FFA500>3</color> stacks. Each Brave Shield grants the master a shield equal to <color=#FFA500>180%</color> of P.ATK, capping at <color=#FFA500>30%</color> of the master's Max HP. Brave Shield lasts for <color=#FFA500>6</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillSketch5500237"]="Smashes down with Heaven's Knuckle, dealing Holy attribute P.DMG equal to <color=#FFA500>2,000%</color> of P.ATK and ignoring <color=#FFA500>20%</color> of the target's P.DEF. If the target is an MVP/MINI/Boss unit, they'll get a <color=#FFA500>Divine Mark</color> effect, taking <color=#FFA500>15%</color> more damage from all party members for <color=#FFA500>6</color> seconds. If the skill hits a target already marked with <color=#FFA500>Divine Mark</color>, it ignores an additional <color=#FFA500>20%</color> P.DEF. If your Poison Enhancement is higher than Holy Enhancement, Heaven's Knuckle inflicts Poison attribute P.DMG instead. Cooldown: <color=#FFA500>24</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillSketch5500238"]="Each a party member attacks, there's a <color=#FFA500>10%</color> chance to increase <color=#FFA500>Divine Mark</color>'s duration by <color=#FFA500>1</color> second, triggering up to <color=#FFA500>6</color> times (round down) while the <color=#FFA500>Divine Mark</color> is active. When triggered, it also applies <color=#FFA500>1</color> stack of Holy Light's purification effect to the target, with each stack reducing their Final P.DMG RED by <color=#FFA500>5%</color>.",
    ["SkillSketch5500239"]="Unleashes a Celestial Arrow, dealing Holy attribute M.DMG equal to <color=#FFA500>2,200%</color> of M.ATK and applying a <color=#FFA500>Heaven's Punishment</color> to the target for <color=#FFA500>10</color> seconds. When you or the master attack targets affected by <color=#FFA500>Heaven's Punishment</color>, you or the master ignore <color=#FFA500>40%</color> of their Final M.DMG RED. If your Wind Enhancement is higher than Holy Enhancement, Celestial Arrow inflicts Wind M.DMG instead. Cooldown: <color=#FFA500>20</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillSketch5500240"]="Activating Celestial Arrow also grants you the Heaven's Glow effect. While it's active, if your HP drops below <color=#FFA500>70%</color>, you instantly restore <color=#FFA500>30%</color> of your Max HP. When attacking a target affected by <color=#FFA500>Heaven's Punishment</color>, there's an <color=#FFA500>8%%</color> chance to reduce Celestial Arrow's cooldown by <color=#FFA500>1</color> second. This can only be triggered <color=#FFA500>once</color> per second.",
    ["SkillSketch5500241"]="Shoots a Pepper Breath forward, dealing <color=#FFA500>1,520%</color> Fire attribute P.DMG to a single enemy. Cooldown: <color=#FFA500>8</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillSketch5500242"]="Activates Medusa's Head, dealing Fire attribute P.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>2,000%</color> of P.ATK to the target. This skill may trigger critical damage. Also applies Chaotic Mark to the target for <color=#44afee>10</color> seconds. While the Chaotic Mark is active, reduces the target's Final Flee by <color=#44afee>24%</color> and Debuff Resistance by <color=#44afee>22</color>.",
    ["SkillSketch5500243"]="Deals Holy attribute P.DMG equal to <color=#44afee>2,000%</color> of P.ATK to enemies within <color=#44afee>6</color> meters and heals the master by <color=#44afee>25%</color> of their Max HP (the HP recovered cannot exceed <color=#44afee>12.5</color> times their ATK).",
    ["SkillSketch5500260"]="Deals <color=#FFA500>2</color> hits of Adaptive P.DMG equal to <color=#FFA500>900%</color> of P.ATK to the target. Before each hit, applies <color=#FFA500>1</color> stack of <color=#FFA500>Shatter</color>, up to <color=#FFA500>2</color> stacks. At <color=#FFA500>1</color> stack of <color=#FFA500>Shatter</color>, reduces the target's Final Anti-Crit by <color=#FFA500>45%</color>. At <color=#FFA500>2</color> stacks of <color=#FFA500>Shatter</color>, additionally reduces the target's PVP Final P.DMG RED by <color=#FFA500>30%</color>. The <color=#FFA500>Shatter</color> effect lasts for <color=#FFA500>6</color> seconds. Each time you successfully apply <color=#FFA500>1</color> stack of <color=#FFA500>Shatter</color>, Fiery Bison Cross Slash's damage increases by <color=#FFA500>30%</color>. Cooldown: <color=#FFA500>20</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillSketch5500261"]="When entering battle, grants all party members a shield equal to <color=#FFA500>500%</color> of your ATK (up to <color=#FFA500>30%</color> of the shielded target's Max HP). The shield lasts for <color=#FFA500>6</color> seconds. While active, it removes <color=#FFA500>1</color> random control-type debuff every <color=#FFA500>2</color> seconds. This shield triggers <color=#FFA500>once</color> every <color=#FFA500>20</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillSketch5500262"]="Each time the master performs a normal attack or a skill, the master gains <color=#FFA500>1</color> or <color=#FFA500>3</color> stacks of energy, respectively. At <color=#FFA500>9</color> stacks, Jyakomaru consumes all energy stacks to unleash Tiger Beam, inflicting a <color=#FFA500>5</color>-second <color=#FFA500>Armor Break</color> and dealing Adaptive P.DMG equal to <color=#FFA500>2,100%</color> of P.ATK to the target. If the target dies while under <color=#FFA500>Armor Break</color>, the Tiger Beam cooldown is reduced by <color=#FFA500>5</color> seconds. Cooldown: <color=#FFA500>20</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillSketch5500263"]="When the master takes a single hit dealing more than <color=#FFA500>20%</color> of Max HP as Final DMG, the Final DMG is reduced by <color=#FFA500>30%</color>, and the master gains <color=#FFA500>1</color> stack of <color=#FFA500>Swift</color>. The <color=#FFA500>Swift</color> effect lasts for <color=#FFA500>5</color> seconds. While <color=#FFA500>Swift</color> is active, any cooldown increase effects (both variable and fixed) received by you are temporarily disabled. Tiger Pauldrons trigger <color=#FFA500>once</color> every <color=#FFA500>20</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillSketch5500264"]="Each time the master casts a skill or takes damage, there's a <color=#FFA500>10%</color> and <color=#FFA500>20%</color> chance respectively to gain <color=#FFA500>1</color> stack of <color=#FFA500>Dragon Soul Mark</color>, up to <color=#FFA500>5</color> stacks, lasting <color=#FFA500>8</color> seconds. While Ryujinmaru uses the Soaring Dragon Sword, all <color=#FFA500>Dragon Soul Marks</color> are consumed to deal Adaptive M.DMG equal to <color=#FFA500>2,000%</color> of M.ATK to the enemies within a <color=#FFA500>12x4</color> meter area. Enemies hit by the Soaring Dragon Sword are inflicted with <color=#FFA500>Soul Sever</color>, reducing their highest primary stat per <color=#FFA500>Dragon Soul Mark</color> consumed. <color=#FFA500>Each</color> stack of <color=#FFA500>Soul Sever</color> reduces their highest primary stat by <color=#FFA500>6.6%</color>. <color=#FFA500>Soul Sever</color> lasts for <color=#FFA500>6</color> seconds. Cooldown: <color=#FFA500>20</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillSketch5500265"]="When the master's HP falls below <color=#FFA500>50%</color>, Final DMG taken is reduced by <color=#FFA500>20%</color>. When the master's HP falls below <color=#FFA500>25%%</color>, Final DMG taken is reduced by <color=#FFA500>35%</color>. For every <color=#FFA500>25%</color> HP lost, the chance to gain a <color=#FFA500>Dragon Soul Mark</color> increases by <color=#FFA500>10%</color>.",
    ["SkillSketch5500266"]="Throws a massive Radiant Fang Shuriken at the target, dealing Neutral attribute P.DMG equal to <color=#FFA500>1,300%</color> of P.ATK to the target. <color=#FFA500>Each</color> stack of <color=#FFA500>Light Energy</color> increases the Shuriken damage by an extra <color=#FFA500>10%</color>. Upon use, all <color=#FFA500>Light Energy</color> stacks are consumed, allowing the <color=#FFA500>Radiant Fang Shuriken</color> damage to ignore the target's Final P.DEF by <color=#FFA500>5%</color> and Final P.DMG RED by <color=#FFA500>5%</color>. When your Shadow Enhancement is higher than Neutral Enhancement, the attribute of the Radiant Fang Shuriken changes to Shadow. Cooldown: <color=#FFA500>20</color> seconds.",
    ["SkillSketch5500267"]="Phantom Wings grants a surge of airflow, allowing the master to add <color=#FFA500>1</color> stack of <color=#FFA500>Light Energy</color> when casting a skill. The <color=#FFA500>Light Energy</color> lasts for <color=#FFA500>10</color> seconds, stacking up to <color=#FFA500>10</color> times. Each stack of <color=#FFA500>Light Energy</color> increases the master's Neutral Enhancement by <color=#FFA500>4%</color> and Final DMG Bonus by <color=#FFA500>1.5%</color>. When your Shadow Enhancement is higher than Neutral Enhancement, each stack of <color=#FFA500>Light Energy</color> provides <color=#FFA500>4%</color> Shadow Enhancement and <color=#FFA500>1.5%</color> Final DMG Bonus to the master instead.",
    ["SkillSketch5500268"]="Baby Nian grants the <color=#FFA500>Unity Blessing</color> to the party member with the lowest remaining HP (below <color=#FFA500>50%</color>). When a party member with <color=#FFA500>Unity Blessing</color> is attacked, the attacker is inflicted with <color=#FFA500>Fortune Corrosion</color> (only triggers if the attacker is within <color=#FFA500>15</color> meters), reducing the target's MSPD by <color=#FFA500>55%</color> and Final DMG dealt by <color=#FFA500>27.5%</color>. <color=#FFA500>Fortune Corrosion</color> lasts <color=#FFA500>6</color> seconds. After triggering <color=#FFA500>Fortune Corrosion</color>, <color=#FFA500>Unity Blessing</color> enters a cooldown of <color=#FFA500>18</color> seconds. <color=#FFA500>Fortune Corrosion</color> cannot be triggered on monsters.",
    ["SkillSketch5500600"]="Damages and slows the enemy. Has a chance to imprison the target if they're already slowed.",
    ["SkillSketch5500601"]="Damages enemies within 5 meters and increases their skills' SP costs.",
    ["SkillSketch5500602"]="Deals damage to enemies within 4 meters continuously.",
    ["SkillSketch5500603"]="Has a chance to curse the enemy. Deals Max HP-based damage if the curse fails to land.",
    ["SkillSketch5500604"]="Randomly targets enemies, dealing area damage and freezing them.",
    ["SkillSketch5500605"]="Deals Adaptive Fire Damage to a single enemy target.",
    ["SkillSketch5500606"]="Changes the master's armor attribute and grants damage reflection.",
    ["SkillSketch5500607"]="Deals Adaptive Water Damage to a single enemy target.",
    ["SkillSketch5500608"]="Deals Adaptive Water Damage to enemy targets in an area.",
    ["SkillSketch5500609"]="Has a chance to Blind nearby enemies within 3 meters.",
    ["SkillSketch5500610"]="Deals continuous damage to enemies in a linear direction and has a chance to inflict Debuffs on them.",
    ["SkillSketch5500611"]="Deals Adaptive Earth Damage to a single enemy target.",
    ["SkillSketch5500612"]="Grants the master immunity to subsequent ranged attacks and lowers the attacker's Final DMG Bonus.",
    ["SkillSketch5500613"]="Has a chance to slow nearby enemies within 3 meters.",
    ["SkillSketch5500614"]="Increases the master's Final DMG Reduction for a period and counters the attackers with a proportion of damage taken after the reduction expires.",
    ["SkillSketch5500615"]="Erects a fire wall to block enemies.",
    ["SkillSketch5500616"]="Reveals and marks the enemies around the master.",
    ["SkillSketch5500617"]="Enables the master's normal attacks to ignore a proportion of the target's defense.",
    ["SkillSketch5500618"]="Deals Adaptive Fire Damage to a single enemy target.",
    ["SkillSketch5500619"]="Enhances the master's melee normal attacks and grants an MSPD boost to itself.",
    ["SkillSketch5500620"]="Conjures a magic circle, granting increased Final P.DMG Bonus, Final M.DMG Bonus, Final P.DEF, and Final M.DEF to the allies within.",
    ["SkillSketch5500621"]="Deals Adaptive Water Damage to a single enemy target.",
    ["SkillSketch5500622"]="Increases the master's Final ASPD and Crit DMG Bonus.",
    ["SkillSketch5500623"]="Consumes the master's HP to curse the targets around the master, increasing all their skill cooldowns and cast time.",
    ["SkillSketch5500624"]="Charms an enemy target and lowers their Final DMG Bonus.",
    ["SkillSketch5500625"]="Curses an enemy target, dealing damage over time.",
    ["SkillSketch5500626"]="Reduces P.DEF and M.DEF of the enemies in range and removes their Hiding state.",
    ["SkillSketch5500628"]="Deals Shadow DMG to enemies within range.",
    ["SkillSketch5500629"]="Deals True DMG to enemies within range and increases the Final P.DEF and Final M.DEF.",
    ["SkillSketch5510001"]="Increases their master's Poison Enhancement.",
    ["SkillSketch5510002"]="Increases their master's Poison Resistance and decreases damage received from Poison attribute monsters.",
    ["SkillSketch5510003"]="Changes their master's weapon's attribute to Poison and increases their master's Poison Enhancement.",
    ["SkillSketch5510004"]="Changes their master's armor's attribute to Poison and decreases damage received from Poison attribute monsters.",
    ["SkillSketch5510005"]="Detoxifies their master and recovers additional HP if successful.",
    ["SkillSketch5510006"]="Deals damage to poisoned enemies within a 6-meter radius and cleanses all Poison debuffs.",
    ["SkillSketch5510007"]="Deals Poison attribute Physical Damage to a single enemy.",
    ["SkillSketch5510008"]="Deals Poison attribute Physical Damage to a single enemy and inflicts Poison.",
    ["SkillSketch5510009"]="Casts Venom Mist, dealing Poison attribute Physical Damage to enemies within range a 4-meter range.",
    ["SkillSketch5510010"]="Deals Poison attribute Physical Damage to enemies within a 3-meter range.",
    ["SkillSketch5510011"]="Deals Poison attribute Physical Damage to a single enemy. Increases damage dealt if the target is poisoned.",
    ["SkillSketch5510012"]="Deals Poison attribute Physical Damage and True Damage to a single enemy and inflicts Poison.",
    ["SkillSketch5510013"]="Casts Venom Mist, dealing Poison attribute Physical Damage to enemies within range a 4-meter range and inflicting Poison.",
    ["SkillSketch5510014"]="Deals Poison attribute Physical Damage to enemies within a 3-meter range and inflicts Poison.",
    ["SkillSketch5510015"]="Increases their master's Ghost attribute enhancement.",
    ["SkillSketch5510016"]="Increases their master's Ghost attribute resistance and decreases damage received from Ghost attribute monsters.",
    ["SkillSketch5510017"]="Changes their master's weapon's attribute to Ghost and increases their master's Ghost attribute enhancement.",
    ["SkillSketch5510018"]="Changes their master's armor's attribute to Ghost and decreases damage received from Ghost attribute monsters.",
    ["SkillSketch5510019"]="Reduces all damage taken by their master, excluding Ghost attribute damage.",
    ["SkillSketch5510020"]="Grants a chance to refresh the pet’s skill upon casting it.",
    ["SkillSketch5510021"]="Deals Ghost attribute DMG to a single enemy.",
    ["SkillSketch5510022"]="Randomly attacks a target 5 times, dealing Ghost attribute DMG.",
    ["SkillSketch5510023"]="Summons a Soul Strike, dealing Ghost attribute DMG to a single enemy.",
    ["SkillSketch5510024"]="Deals Ghost attribute DMG to enemies within a 1.5-meter radius.",
    ["SkillSketch5510025"]="Deals damage, with a chance of inflicting Immobilization. Once immobilized, both the pet and its master’s damage is increased.",
    ["SkillSketch5510026"]="Randomly attacks a target 5 times, dealing Ghost attribute DMG with a chance of inflicting critical hits and curses.",
    ["SkillSketch5510027"]="Deals Ghost attribute DMG to a single enemy with a chance of inflicting True DMG.",
    ["SkillSketch5510028"]="Deals Ghost attribute DMG to enemies within a 1.5-meter radius, reducing their HP Regen.",
    ["SkillSketch5510029"]="Deals Wind attribute Adaptive Damage to a single enemy.",
    ["SkillSketch5510030"]="Grants a chance of randomly inflicting a debuff on enemies within 9 meters.",
    ["SkillSketch5510031"]="Deals Water attribute Adaptive Damage to a single enemy.",
    ["SkillSketch5510032"]="Inflicts Poison on enemy attackers.",
    ["SkillSketch5510033"]="Increases their master's Final Dodge and Final Anti-Crit.",
    ["SkillSketch5510034"]="Deals Ghost attribute Magic Damage to enemies within a 6-meter range and knocks them back.",
    ["SkillSketch5510035"]="Deals Poison attribute Adaptive Damage to a single enemy.",
    ["SkillSketch5510036"]="Deals Poison attribute Adaptive Damage to a single enemy and reduces their HP Regen.",
    ["SkillSketch5510037"]="Grants a chance to inflict Bleed on enemies within a 3-meter range.",
    ["SkillSketch5510038"]="Deals True Damage per second to enemies within 3 meters.",
    ["SkillSketch5510039"]="Cleanses their master of any debuffs, grants immunity, and regenerates HP.",
    ["SkillSketch5510040"]="Grants a chance to inflict Poison on enemies within a 6-meter range.",
    ["SkillSketch5510041"]="Reduces the enemy's Final Attack Speed and Final Haste when attacked.",
    ["SkillSketch5510042"]="Increases their master's PVP Final Physical Damage Reduction and PVP Final Magic Damage Reduction.",
    ["SkillSketch5516001"]="Increases the master's Holy Enhancement.",
    ["SkillSketch5516002"]="Increases the master's Holy Resistance and reduces damage received from Holy attribute monsters.",
    ["SkillSketch5516003"]="Changes the master's weapon attribute to Holy and increases the master's Holy Enhancement.",
    ["SkillSketch5516004"]="Changes the master's armor attribute to Holy and reduces the damage received from Holy attribute monsters.",
    ["SkillSketch5516005"]="Increases the master damage dealt to Demon and Undead monsters.",
    ["SkillSketch5516006"]="Removes the master's debuffs and grants debuff immunity.",
    ["SkillSketch5526001"]="Deals Holy DMG to a single enemy.",
    ["SkillSketch5526002"]="Deals Holy DMG once to enemies around the master.",
    ["SkillSketch5526003"]="Deals continuous Holy DMG to enemies around the master.",
    ["SkillSketch5526004"]="Deals continuous Holy DMG to enemies within the designated area.",
    ["SkillSketch5536001"]="Deals Holy DMG to a single enemy and increases the damage dealt to Undead and Demon monsters.",
    ["SkillSketch5536002"]="Deals Holy DMG once to enemies around the master and increases the master's Debuff Resistance.",
    ["SkillSketch5536003"]="Continuously increases the master's Holy DMG dealt to nearby enemies.",
    ["SkillSketch5536004"]="Deals continuous Holy DMG to enemies within the designated area, reduces the enemies' Debuff Resistance, and increases the damage dealt to Undead and Demon monsters.",
