    ["Skill_UIInfo_010"]="m",
    ["Skill_UIInfo_011"]="You have no available Skill Points!",
    ["Skill_UIInfo_012"]="You have yet to equip any skills on the next page!",
    ["Skill_UIInfo_013"]="<color=#74717b>Cannot co-exist with %s</color>",
    ["SkillsCanChangeLevels"]="You can adjust the cast level once this skill is equipped.",
    ["SlimeEvent_GuiRen_R1_1"]="Rejected Shion's food-tasting request without hurting her feelings and threw Gobta under the bus instead.",
    ["SlimeEvent_GuiRen_R1_10"]="Souei wished to interrogate the enemy's leader with me, but I rejected him. Because he would turn it into a homicide.",
    ["SlimeEvent_GuiRen_R1_2"]="Somehow bumped into Shion and Shuna in the middle of a \"friendly\" conversation about secretarial work. Managed to sneak off before things got weird.",
    ["SlimeEvent_GuiRen_R1_3"]="Invited by Hakurou to co-mentor a Goblin's special training that lasts for a week. Turned down the invite with the reason—\"Your mentorship is trustworthy.\"",
    ["SlimeEvent_GuiRen_R1_4"]="Passed by Hakurou's place, and he insisted on giving me the new species of flowers he had cultivated lately. Rejected the flowers because I am not good at tending flowers.",
    ["SlimeEvent_GuiRen_R1_5"]="Benimaru wanted to name the new elite team \"Team Rimuru\" but I was too embarrassed to say this out loud. Rejected him without hesitation.",
    ["SlimeEvent_GuiRen_R1_6"]="From afar, seeing Benimaru downing the drinks with other cadres using a super large mug, I fled from the scene before getting dragged into it.",
    ["SlimeEvent_GuiRen_R1_7"]="Shuna made me a pink hat, but I still have my old one. So I rejected her kindness most tenderly.",
    ["SlimeEvent_GuiRen_R1_8"]="Shuna wanted me to pick a Miko costume for her festival, but I didn't have any relevant experience from my past life. So I declined her.",
    ["SlimeEvent_GuiRen_R1_9"]="Souei said I should increase the number of guards around me, and I rejected him with the reason—\"I will leave my back to you.\"",
    ["SlimeEvent_GuiRen_R2_1"]="To reward Shion for her secretarial work, I ate her Cuisine of Love with my finger crossed. And I survived!",
    ["SlimeEvent_GuiRen_R2_2"]="In response to Hakurou's request, I watered the flowers with lots of magical energy and successfully cultivated a big carnivorous plant that could devour Gobta in one go!",
    ["SlimeEvent_GuiRen_R2_3"]="Fought alongside the team led by Benimaru and won the battle without any causalities. And the loot was loaded!",
    ["SlimeEvent_GuiRen_R2_4"]="Invited by Shuna to join the Kijin festival. Those Kijin kids were adorable, and their food was amazing, too!",
    ["SlimeEvent_GuiRen_R2_5"]="Spent a whole day going through the secret intel Souei had submitted, learning tons of information about human higher-ups.",
    ["SlimeEvent_GuiRen_R3_1"]="Had a dream about Shion leaving again and thus felt upset. Received the promise \"I will never leave you\" after being found out.",
    ["SlimeEvent_GuiRen_R3_2"]="Helped to name Kijin youths during the Kijin festival and established an even stronger bond with everyone!",
    ["SlimeEvent_GuiRen_R3_3"]="Visited Treyni, Manager of the Great Jura Forest with the Kijin tribe, and received blessings from the Dryads after being recognized!",
    ["SlimeEvent_TY1"]="Reinforced the wooden bridge in the forest. Now more people can pass through it at the same time.",
    ["SlimeEvent_TY10"]="Pink sakura petals were coming from far away. Felt a lot better after taking a whiff of the floral scent.",
    ["SlimeEvent_TY11"]="Fed those cute little birds on the roadside and gently stroked their fur.",
    ["SlimeEvent_TY12"]="Discovered that there was a battered cabin inside the forest. Maybe it's a good place to hold a test of courage.",
    ["SlimeEvent_TY13"]="Clear streams coursed through the mountain. Had a good time with everyone in the water.",
    ["SlimeEvent_TY14"]="Ate an unknown fruit out of curiosity. Thank god it wasn't poisonous.",
    ["SlimeEvent_TY15"]="Met a friendly traveler and spent an unforgettable time together.",
    ["SlimeEvent_TY16"]="Reached the top of the Mjolnir Mountains. Saw the beautiful sunrise before passing out.",
    ["SlimeEvent_TY17"]="Bumped into Great Sage Kroneika, who lives in seclusion. Stayed a night at Sage Hut.",
    ["SlimeEvent_TY18"]="Bumped into the friendly Giearths when mining. Tasted their hard liquor.",
    ["SlimeEvent_TY19"]="Bumped into wandering Whispers. Defeated them and vaguely heard them saying, \"Thank you.\"",
    ["SlimeEvent_TY2"]="Bumped into a bard. Heard many legends about Veldora, the Storm Dragon.",
    ["SlimeEvent_TY20"]="Randomly saw Jarod, who was skipping his work in Rose Red Tavern. Escorted him back to his workplace.",
    ["SlimeEvent_TY21"]="Updated the adventure save point at W's place. The world exploration progress had been increased!",
    ["SlimeEvent_TY22"]="Listened to Arielle's new album. Almost as if it healed the heart and soul!",
    ["SlimeEvent_TY23"]="Sent a letter on behalf of a sick Parrot. Experienced the pain of being a courier after running around all day.",
    ["SlimeEvent_TY24"]="Saw a new kind of Poring in Payon — Poporing! Somehow it was green!",
    ["SlimeEvent_TY25"]="Dug out some fresh bamboo shoots in Payon's bamboo forest. Made them into a delicious soup with meat.",
    ["SlimeEvent_TY26"]="Heard a bard tell an ancient legend about pyramids. Gained more travel knowledge!",
    ["SlimeEvent_TY27"]="Discovered the oasis hidden deep in the desert. Carried on the adventure after replenishing the supplies!",
    ["SlimeEvent_TY28"]="Joined the local fireworks festival in Geffen. It turned out even a wand could shoot out fireworks...",
    ["SlimeEvent_TY29"]="Caught the vampire who snuck into the Geffen Tower. Someone said that it would become an experimental subject for those Magicians...",
    ["SlimeEvent_TY3"]="Bumped into Milim, who was craving honey. Gave her all the sweets in the backpack.",
    ["SlimeEvent_TY30"]="Unintentionally triggered the mechanism in Geffen Library. Somehow I was teleported to the bottom of the tower!",
    ["SlimeEvent_TY31"]="Started sneezing after getting doused by the Central Fountain. Luckily I didn't catch a cold.",
    ["SlimeEvent_TY32"]="Didn't find the book I wanted in Prontera Library. Decided to try my luck at Geffen Library.",
    ["SlimeEvent_TY33"]="Got lost in Labyrinth Forest. Spent a whole day trying to find the way out.",
    ["SlimeEvent_TY34"]="Found out the storeowner took a day off when purchasing equipment there. Decided to have fun in Alberta for a week.",
    ["SlimeEvent_TY35"]="Went on mining in Mjolnir Mine but broke my pickaxe halfway. There was nothing I could do but return.",
    ["SlimeEvent_TY36"]="The sea was rough when I was out there. Lucky for me that the ship didn't flip.",
    ["SlimeEvent_TY37"]="Inhaled too much of Spore's Numb-Numb Powder. It took me a good while to lie on the ground before recovering.",
    ["SlimeEvent_TY38"]="Fell off into a Munak hole. Had to disguise myself as one of them to escape there.",
    ["SlimeEvent_TY39"]="Adventured in Morroc's desert. As a result, my skin got tanned.",
    ["SlimeEvent_TY4"]="Fell asleep on Ranga's back, then spent the whole day lying around. Cozy!",
    ["SlimeEvent_TY40"]="Ran into Hassan, the master of the Assassins Guild. Somehow he seemed more intimidating after concealing his murderous intention.",
    ["SlimeEvent_TY41"]="Completed the special mission on the Mission Board and got commended by the Kingdom Defense Force.",
    ["SlimeEvent_TY42"]="Spent all day playing with those adorable Lunatics. Maybe I can try to adopt one as a pet...",
    ["SlimeEvent_TY43"]="Randomly ran into the alchemy professor Lawrence. Successfully stopped him from turning me into an experimental subject.",
    ["SlimeEvent_TY44"]="Helped Mr. Gray harvest his wheat at Green Cotton Farm. Spent a productive day on the farm.",
    ["SlimeEvent_TY45"]="Made a wish under the Wishing Tree. Hopefully, my dream will come true one day.",
    ["SlimeEvent_TY46"]="Received a front-row concert ticket from Morts and found out my story was sung in a song.",
    ["SlimeEvent_TY47"]="Passed by Poring ruins and encountered the mythical Angeling and King Poring!",
    ["SlimeEvent_TY48"]="Witnessed the vanishing of a Dimensional Gap and picked up a precious item on the ground.",
    ["SlimeEvent_TY49"]="Walked past the malfunctioning Magic Furnace and choked on the smoke coming out of it.",
    ["SlimeEvent_TY5"]="Bumped into a craftsman from the Dwarf Tribe, finding out the liquor from the Monster Federation is popular among them.",
    ["SlimeEvent_TY50"]="Got drunk in Rose Red Tavern. Thank Odin, nothing embarrassing had happened.",
    ["SlimeEvent_TY51"]="The fishing line was broken by a gigantic fish. I swear I will get it next time!",
    ["SlimeEvent_TY52"]="Went on a treasure hunt in the Underwater Cave. Didn't get anything, but I saw those beautiful Obeaunes.",
    ["SlimeEvent_TY53"]="Bought the thing I wanted in Exchange Center, and there seemed not even a dime left in my wallet.",
    ["SlimeEvent_TY54"]="Ran into a Magician who was selling Transgender Potions. Declined their offer.",
    ["SlimeEvent_TY55"]="Took the Geffen specialty, Intelligence Potion. Felt like I got scammed...",
    ["SlimeEvent_TY56"]="Encountered a black cat at a corner in Geffen. And it turned out to be a human!",
    ["SlimeEvent_TY57"]="Played an arm wrestling game with the kids in Orc Village. It was a narrow victory.",
    ["SlimeEvent_TY58"]="Spoke to the Orc Lord with my head up for a long time. My neck was sore afterward.",
    ["SlimeEvent_TY59"]="Helped Miss Lindra sort out the storage racks and received the latest information about new products in advance.",
    ["SlimeEvent_TY6"]="Bumped into Treyni, who was eating chips, and witnessed a mega bag of chips vanish into zilch.",
    ["SlimeEvent_TY60"]="Received the book 100 Ways To Build Your Muscles from Hollgrehenn. Just the thing I needed to level off my table.",
    ["SlimeEvent_TY61"]="Encountered Tanders the Knight at Windmill Tower and heard lots of adventure stories from him.",
    ["SlimeEvent_TY62"]="Helped Mr. Taksch tame pets and scheduled a trip for the next time.",
    ["SlimeEvent_TY63"]="Won the DrinkUp event in the Sapphire Blue Tavern and received rich rewards!",
    ["SlimeEvent_TY64"]="Became the 10,000th guest of the Amusement Park at Prontera South Gate. Spent a whole day in there for free.",
    ["SlimeEvent_TY65"]="Encountered the Eden Group members who were exploring Prontera. Learned a lot of history about the Rune Kingdom from them.",
    ["SlimeEvent_TY66"]="Visited Dean Mainz at Criatura Academy and dined with the mentors in the academy.",
    ["SlimeEvent_TY67"]="Hit by a Poring that fell out from the sky. Spent a dizzy day afterward.",
    ["SlimeEvent_TY68"]="Had a nightmare after passing by the Ghastly Graveyard. Decided to pray under Odin's Statue the next day.",
    ["SlimeEvent_TY69"]="Witnessed the full course of Hollgrehenn the Blacksmith getting beat up by his customer. Luckily I wasn't involved.",
    ["SlimeEvent_TY7"]="Bumped into a treasure-hunting team. They ran off after knowing this was the Monster Federation.",
    ["SlimeEvent_TY70"]="Heard the battle song of the Orcs. Didn't know the meaning, but felt encouraged!",
    ["SlimeEvent_TY71"]="Walked into the territory of Kobolds and paid them a jerky as a toll.",
    ["SlimeEvent_TY72"]="Waited for the meteor in Kordt Forest's Lake Pavilion. But somehow fell asleep.",
    ["SlimeEvent_TY73"]="Saw the divine dog totem of Kobold. It's a shame that humans are not allowed to touch it.",
    ["SlimeEvent_TY74"]="Asked about the appraisal knowledge from Mr. Vali, but he suggested that I learn how to reduce the waste of appraising potions before anything...",
    ["SlimeEvent_TY75"]="Boarded an airship. But somehow got airsick on the way to the next stop...",
    ["SlimeEvent_TY76"]="Bumped into a Phreeoni while taking shelter from the rain in a cave. Lucky for me that it had eaten something else already...",
    ["SlimeEvent_TY77"]="Observed Royal Chivalry's daily training. Got inspired and came up with some new combat techniques.",
    ["SlimeEvent_TY78"]="Listened to the preaching addressed by Wolmas the Archbishop, making me admire Odin even more.",
    ["SlimeEvent_TY79"]="Received a greeting from Kafra Corporation that they wanted me to rate their teleport service.",
    ["SlimeEvent_TY8"]="Waiting for Great Sage to update the Wonderland intel. Stayed here for a while and set off again.",
    ["SlimeEvent_TY80"]="Poked the honeycomb on the tree. No bees! Only sweet, sweet honey!",
    ["SlimeEvent_TY81"]="Assisted the Kingdom Defense Force in clearing monsters in the sewer. Formed a special bond of comradeship!",
    ["SlimeEvent_TY82"]="Invited to the palace banquet by Princess Katherine. Ate a lot of delicious food!",
    ["SlimeEvent_TY83"]="Enjoyed an outdoor concert of Vocals by chance. There are great musicians, even among monsters.",
    ["SlimeEvent_TY84"]="Took a ride in the Poring Hot Air Balloon across the sky of Prontera. The scenery was breathtaking.",
    ["SlimeEvent_TY9"]="Bumped into workers who were transporting Magic Ores. Helped them pick up the ones falling on the ground and left.",
    ["SlimeEvent_XiRen_R1_1"]="Bumped into Gabiru, who was getting beaten up by Milim. After a moment's thought, I left the scene without looking back.",
    ["SlimeEvent_XiRen_R1_10"]="Received an ode with Gabiru's name signed. Decided not to open it for now...",
    ["SlimeEvent_XiRen_R1_2"]="Saw Gabiru was smashed into the air by someone. Believing he could spread his wings and make it to the land, I left in relief.",
    ["SlimeEvent_XiRen_R1_3"]="Bumped into Gabiru, who was doing special combat training with Hakurou. Put down the healing medicine and left.",
    ["SlimeEvent_XiRen_R1_4"]="The Lizardmen Chieftain wanted me to convince Souka to find herself a partner soon. Thinking of Souei, I declined his request.",
    ["SlimeEvent_XiRen_R1_5"]="Gabiru bitterly told me that Souka isn't as clingy as she used to be. Couldn't empathize with him, so I ended the conversation.",
    ["SlimeEvent_XiRen_R1_6"]="Saw Gabiru teaching the Goblin kids how to sing. I expressed my expectation for the result and then left.",
    ["SlimeEvent_XiRen_R1_7"]="Heard the Lizard Trio yelling, \"Gabiru is the best.\" Didn't know how to respond, so I left.",
    ["SlimeEvent_XiRen_R1_8"]="Saw the Lizardmen dancing in the paddy fields. Reminded them not to step on the seedlings and left.",
    ["SlimeEvent_XiRen_R1_9"]="Saw Souka and Souei carrying out a quest together. Told them to \"keep up the good work\" and left.",
    ["SlimeEvent_XiRen_R2_1"]="Received a batch of newly cultivated herbs from the Lizardman tribe. These herbs could be used to craft more effective healing medicine!",
    ["SlimeEvent_XiRen_R2_2"]="Watched the dance performed by Gabiru and the Lizard Trio. The festive atmosphere was getting heated up!",
    ["SlimeEvent_XiRen_R2_3"]="Gabiru and the Lizard Trio both got \"Lucky\" fortune-telling sticks from the new-year drawing divination. The upcoming year is going to be smooth!",
    ["SlimeEvent_XiRen_R2_4"]="Visited the paddy fields of the Lizardman tribe. The harvests are bound to be good as long as they have enough water supplies!",
    ["SlimeEvent_XiRen_R2_5"]="Attempted to ride Lizardmen's mount and had a unique experience!",
    ["SlimeEvent_XiRen_R3_1"]="Listened to the tale of \"Dragon's Last Descendent\" told by the Lizardmen Chieftain and learned some ancient knowledge.",
    ["SlimeEvent_XiRen_R3_2"]="After the temperature drop, Gabiru seemed quite weary. Does this mean the amphibians in this world also hibernate...?",
    ["SlimeEvent_XiRen_R3_3"]="Ask Shuna to prepare a summer swimsuit for Souka so they can have fun on the beach once the summer arrives!",
    ["SlimeEvent_ZhuTou_R1_1"]="Saw Gerudo was playing with little Goblins. Didn't want to ruin the party and snuck away.",
    ["SlimeEvent_ZhuTou_R1_10"]="Heard the love confession of a female Orc made to Gerudo. I left, pretending nothing had happened.",
    ["SlimeEvent_ZhuTou_R1_2"]="Recognized by an Orc whose name was given by me. Having no recall at all, I could only reply with a smile.",
    ["SlimeEvent_ZhuTou_R1_3"]="Worked with everyone in the Orc tribe until the end of the day and fell asleep unintentionally due to exhaustion.",
    ["SlimeEvent_ZhuTou_R1_4"]="Passed by Orc's new settlement. Declined the dinner invite because something else needed to be taken care of.",
    ["SlimeEvent_ZhuTou_R1_5"]="Named a newborn Orc and left at once for being nervous with enthusiastic kids.",
    ["SlimeEvent_ZhuTou_R1_6"]="Gerudo came to ask me about farming skills. Got him an agricultural book from the human kingdom and turned away.",
    ["SlimeEvent_ZhuTou_R1_7"]="The braid of the Goblin little girl looked very cute. Chuckled and left there after knowing it was plaited by Gerudo.",
    ["SlimeEvent_ZhuTou_R1_8"]="Bumped into Gerudo, who was learning fighting skills from Hakurou. Told him to \"keep it up\" and left.",
    ["SlimeEvent_ZhuTou_R1_9"]="Bumped into Gerudo when shopping, who was carrying a big bag of kid snacks. I refused to carry the bag for him and left.",
    ["SlimeEvent_ZhuTou_R2_1"]="Bumped into Gerudo at the mochi-pounding event. Had some delicious Orc-shaped mochi with Goblins!",
    ["SlimeEvent_ZhuTou_R2_2"]="Bumped into a wandering Orc. By giving him a name, the population of the Monster Federation increased again!",
    ["SlimeEvent_ZhuTou_R2_3"]="Bumped into Gerudo, who dressed like a Demon Lord at the temple fair. Didn't defeat him but received a prize!",
    ["SlimeEvent_ZhuTou_R2_4"]="Received a gift from an Orc: a wooden sculpture in the shape of Slime!",
    ["SlimeEvent_ZhuTou_R2_5"]="Received the Orc-proposed Outline of Agricultural Development at the Monster Federal Conference. It will be put into action next month!",
    ["SlimeEvent_ZhuTou_R3_1"]="Worshiped the Orc deceased with Gerudo. There wouldn't be starvation if they were still alive...",
    ["SlimeEvent_ZhuTou_R3_2"]="Reinforced the bird-repelling devices on the Orc's farm. The harvests are sure to be good this year!",
    ["SlimeEvent_ZhuTou_R3_3"]="Prepared some winter clothes for Gerudo. Gotta put something on regardless you feel the cold or not!",
