    ["SlotStrengthenConsumption"]="Upgrading Cost",
    ["SlotStrengthenConsumptionExplainTips1"]="When the Upgrading Lv. is low, the upgrading cost of weapon/armor/accessory is the same.",
    ["SlotStrengthenConsumptionExplainTips2"]="When the Upgrading Level reaches a certain level, the upgrading cost of weapons/armors/accessories will be different.",
    ["SlotStrengthenConsumptionExplainTips3"]="The upgrading cost is only dependent on the piece of equipment you are upgrading; the amount of materials required and stat(s) increased are the same. The upgrading cost of Daggers/One-Handed Weapons/Two-Handed Weapons is 1.5/2/3 times that of Shields, respectively, and the upgrading cost of Talismans is 2 times that of Accessories.",
    ["SlotStrengthenGrade"]="Upgrading Lv.",
    ["SlotStrengthenGradeExplainTips1"]="Max Weapon/Armor/Accessory Upgrade Level cannot exceed 2x/1x/0.5x of the max Base Level of the current version or 2x/1x/0.5x of the character's current Base Level.",
    ["SlotStrengthenInherit"]="Upgrading Transfer",
    ["SlotStrengthenInheritExplainTips1"]="Pieces of equipment of the same type can transfer their stat bonus interchangeably.",
    ["SlotStrengthenInheritExplainTips2"]="Transferring stat bonus requires a certain amount of Zeny.",
    ["SlotStrengthenInheritExplainTips3"]="Both pieces of equipment involved in the transfer occupy the same amount of slots.",
    ["SlotStrengthenInheritExplainTips4"]="A certain amount of diamonds will be consumed for advanced transferring stat bonus.",
    ["SlotStrengthenProp"]="Stat Bonus",
    ["SlotStrengthenPropExplainTips1"]="Each Upgrading level increases stats by a fixed amount.",
    ["SlotStrengthenPropExplainTips2"]="Upon Upgrading all equipped items to a certain level, the Resonance stat will be activated (Can be found in the Resonance system).",
    ["SmallmapTips1"]="You do not have a Fly Wing. Unable to use this function.",
