    ["SnowFestivalTips_034"]="Submit All",
    ["SnowFestivalTips_035"]="Unlock the Snowland Pass to access exclusive privilege rewards.",
    ["SnowFestivalTips_036"]="1. Join the Snowland Envoy gameplay daily to receive extra rewards. (Missing rewards will be reissued and sent by mail after unlocking the pass.)\n2. Unlock the exclusive Individual Reward in Sleigh Repair.\n3. Unlock the Pass Reward in Snowland Quest.",
    ["SnowFestivalTips_037"]="%s Unlocked",
    ["SnowFestivalTips_038"]="1,280% Rebate",
    ["SnowFestivalTips_039"]="Unlock to obtain",
    ["SnowFestivalTips_040"]="Go",
    ["SnowFestivalTips_041"]="Search for the hidden clown in Lutie [Channel 1] every day and talk to him for rewards.",
    ["SnowFestivalTips_042"]="Daily Reward",
    ["SnowFestivalTips_043"]="Pass Reward",
    ["SnowFestivalTips_044"]="Garm will invade Lutie [Channel 1], spawning at random locations. Defeat Garm to receive rare rewards.",
    ["SnowFestivalTips_045"]="Rare Reward",
    ["SnowFestivalTips_046"]="Daily Quest",
    ["SnowFestivalTips_047"]="Cumulative Quest",
    ["SnowFestivalTips_048"]="Quest Reward",
    ["SnowFestivalTips_049"]="Pass Reward",
    ["SnowFestivalTips_050"]="Go",
    ["SnowFestivalTips_051"]="Claim",
    ["SnowFestivalTips_052"]="Completed",
    ["SnowFestivalTips_053"]="Reward Retrieval",
    ["SnowFestivalTips_054"]="Reward Retrieval",
    ["SnowFestivalTips_055"]="Unclaimed quest rewards before purchasing the pass.",
    ["SnowFestivalTips_056"]="Retrieve Reward",
    ["SnowFestivalTips_057"]="Winter Fortune\n1. Repair the sleigh to obtain <color=#ec8a5a>Blue Bell Wish Box</color>, which offers a chance to draw the <color=#ec8a5a>Grand Prize</color>.\n2. Spend <color=#ec8a5a>2,000 Diamonds</color> to open the Blue Bell Wish Box directly and draw from the <color=#ec8a5a>Grand Prize</color> or <color=#ec8a5a>Shared Prize Pool</color>.\n3. Each box opened adds more to the prize pool. The pool starts at <color=#ec8a5a>700,000 Diamonds</color>.\n4. The larger the prize pool, the higher the chance to trigger <color=#ec8a5a>Grand Prize</color>. Different boxes have different probabilities.\n5. Trigger the Grand Prize grants a huge number of <color=#ec8a5a>Diamonds</color>. Everyone else shares the remaining pool based on how many boxes they opened (the more they opened, the better the prize).\n6. Participants may obtain either the <color=#ec8a5a>Grand Prize</color> or the <color=#ec8a5a>Shared Reward</color>, not both.\n7. Contribution amounts per box type: Blue Bell: <color=#ec8a5a>100</color> / Amethyst: <color=#ec8a5a>200</color> / Luminous: <color=#ec8a5a>300</color>.\n8. When the Grand Prize is triggered, <color=#ec8a5a>30%</color> of the current prize pool becomes the payout of this round. The winner gets <color=#ec8a5a>55%</color>, and the rest is distributed based on contribution weight.\n\nSnowland News\n1. Purchase the <color=#ec8a5a>Snowland Pass</color> to unlock the exclusive rewards.\n2. Activating the pass unlocks the following: <color=#ec8a5a>Sleigh Repair Rewards</color> and <color=#ec8a5a>Snowland Quest Rewards</color>.\n3. During the event, <color=#ec8a5a>Garm</color> will spawn in Lutie. Defeat Gram to obtain rare rewards (does not consume MVP/MINI attempts).\n\nRepair the Sleigh\nSubmit <color=#ec8a5a>repair materials</color> to increase both personal progress and server progress. <color=#ec8a5a>Corresponding rewards</color> are granted upon reaching specific milestones.\n\nSnowland Quest\nComplete <color=#ec8a5a>Daily Quests</color> and <color=#ec8a5a>Cumulative Quests</color> to obtain rewards. Daily Quests reset at 05:00.\n\nSnowland Envoy\nVisit Lutie every day to locate the <color=#ec8a5a>Secret NPC - Christmas Clown</color> and talk to him for 15 Snowland Gingerbread Men and 2 Emerald Repair Panels. Activating the pass unlocks <color=#ec8a5a>Exclusive Envoy Rewards</color>. Get an extra 10 Snowland Gingerbread Men and 2 Emerald Repair Panels every day.\n\nAFK Drops\nGoing AFK in the wild using Odin's Blessings grants <color=#ec8a5a>Snowland Gingerbread Man</color> (up to 15 per day).\nSmall: 1.500%\nMedium: 3.000%\nLarge: 4.500%\n",
    ["SnowFestivalTips_058"]="Purchase Snowland Pass?\n<color=#da696f>Tips: Items that take effect immediately are not eligible for cancellation.</color>",
    ["SnowFestivalTips_059"]="<color=#fd7360>%s</color>/%s",
    ["SnowFestivalTips_060"]="<color=#5e5d63>%s</color>/%s",
    ["SnowFestivalTips_062"]="The Snowland Pass hasn't been activated. Activate now?",
    ["SnowFestivalTips_063"]="No Available Data",
    ["SnowFestivalTips_064"]="Obtain %s Blue Bell Wish Boxes",
    ["SnowFestivalTips_Time_hy01"]="Exchange Deadline (UTC+7):",
    ["SnowFestivalTips_big01"]="Good news! Congratulations to our lucky winner %s for scoring a huge prize in the Winter Fortune: <color=#ec8a5a>%s x%s</color>. With the blessings of ice crystals, your luck is totally overflowing!",
    ["SnowFestival_info"]="About Snow Festival Events:\n\n·Event Time\nFishing Showdown & Daily Quest & Snowflake Source & Exchange Gifts\n%s\nShop Exchange & Snowflake Wish\n%s\n\n·Rules\n1. During the event, two sessions of Fishing Showdown will be held every day. You can find <color=#ff5d5d>Magic Gingerbread</color> in Lutie and <color=#ff5d5d>Join Fishing Showdown</color> button to enter the contest location.\n2. Corresponding fishing rods and fishing baits are required for Ice Fishing. Completing an Ice Fishing earns you Base EXP, Job EXP, and Zeny based on your current level, up to 20 times per day.\nDifferent baits affect the chances of catching fish of different sizes:\nFruit Bait\nSmall Fish: 80%%\nMedium Fish: 15%%\nLarge Fish: 4%%\nGrand Fish: 1%%\nLive Worm Bait\nMedium Fish: 75%%\nLarge Fish: 20%%\nGrand Fish: 5%%\nRed Shrimp Bait\nLarge Fish: 80%%\nGrand Fish: 20%%\n3. The Fishing Showdown includes Daily Ranking and Overall Ranking. Participants with a fish exceeding 80cm will enter the Daily Rankings. The Overall Ranking is determined by adding the lengths of the 10 longest fish caught by each participant during the event.\nDaily Ranking Rewards:\n1st: Glorious Ancient Divinity Box x2, Fishing King Coin x30\n2nd-5th: Fishing King Coin x20\n6th-10th: Fishing King Coin x10\n11th to 50th: Fishing King Coin x5\nOverall Ranking Rewards:\n1st: Bear Buddy x1, Glorious Ancient Divinity Box x8, Crystal x200,000\n2nd-5th: Bear Buddy x1, Glorious Ancient Divinity Box x6, Crystal x50,000\n6th-10th: Glorious Ancient Divinity Box x5, Crystal x50,000\n11th to 50th: Glorious Ancient Divinity Box x3\n4. The Daily Quest consists of Regular Quest and Event Quest. The Regular Quest will be refreshed daily at 05:00, and the Event Quest will be accumulated throughout the event.\n5. Spend Fluffy Snowflakes and make wishes at <color=#ff5d5d>Magic Gingerbread</color> to obtain different items, with each wish consuming one snowflake. You can choose to make 1 wish or 10 wishes at a time. For the detailed item list and probabilities of receiving them, please tap the <color=#ff5d5d>View Probabilities</color> on the Snowflake Wish event page.\n6. During the event, consume Odin's Blessings when defeating monsters for a chance to get Fluffy Snowflakes. Up to 5 Fluffy Snowflakes can be obtained by defeating monsters every day.\nSnowflakes drop rate from large monsters: 1.5%%\nSnowflakes drop rate from medium monsters: 1%%\nSnowflakes drop rate from small monsters: 0.5%%",
    ["SnowGuardUnlock"]="Use the item Snowward Defender to unlock.",
