    ["StarRankTargetName_006"]="Selling items in Diamond Exchange Center",
    ["StarRankTargetName_007"]="Buying items in Diamond Exchange Center",
    ["StarRankTargetName_008"]="Obtain votes from other Adventurers",
    ["StarRankTest_001"]="Event Time: %s–%s\nSupport Phase: %s–%s\n\nStars Ranking\n- Increase the points gained during the event by increasing your level, participating in the Exchange Center gameplay, and receiving support from other Adventurers. The higher the points, the higher the ranking. If two Adventurers have the same points, the ranking will be determined based on the time they achieved the said points.\n- Adventurers can obtain Spot Light Cards by completing Carnival Quests or spending currency on the event page. Use Spot Light Cards to vote for your favorite Adventurers.\n\nSupport Rewards\n- Adventurers can purchase various Support Reward Plans, which can be used to attract other Adventurers' support. When the number of Spot Light Cards you receive from other Adventurers reaches the requirement of this plan, a corresponding reward can be claimed.\n- Only one purchase of the Support Reward Plan with the same number of support votes can be made at a time. Before other Adventurers finish claiming the support reward, it's not possible to purchase another Support Reward Plan with the same support requirements. Please select wisely.\n- The number of Spot Light Cards required by a Support Reward Plan from the same Adventurer will be cumulatively tallied, and it's not possible to claim the same support rewards from an Adventurer twice.\n\nRanking Rewards\n- When the support period is over, Adventurers will receive rewards based on their current ranking. Besides the rewards, Adventurers with higher rankings can give out a special title to the supporters who have contributed over 100 votes on them.",
    ["StarRankTest_002"]="There are no more Adventurers up there.",
    ["StarRankTest_003"]="There are no more Adventurers down there.",
    ["StarRankTest_004"]="Require 1 Support Vote to follow the new Adventurer.",
    ["StarRankTest_005"]="Each day, the 1st–3rd Spot Light Card purchase will cost Zeny; the 4th–10th Spot Light Card purchase will cost Crystals; any Spot Light Card purchase after that will cost Diamonds. Resets at 05:00 daily.",
    ["StarRankTest_006"]="There can only be one reward plan with the same number of votes existing at a time.",
