    ["SummerHomeworkTask045"]="Take part in and complete the Cross-server Ultimate Showdown %s/%s times.",
    ["SummerHomeworkTips001"]="1. Daily Practice: When quests are completed, new quests will be refreshed automatically at 05:00 (UTC+0) the next day. Please claim your reward in time, as it's impossible to claim unclaimed rewards the next day.\n2. Score Summary: During the event, completed quests will be accumulated, and all of them come with multiple follow-up quests. Please claim your rewards in time after completing the quest.\n3. Be sure to claim the rewards of completed quests as soon as possible!\n4. Exchange items will be removed at the end of the event, and you will receive a portion of Zeny based on the number of items removed.",
