    ["TaskDescription110432101"]="With your help the <color=#CA2E0AFF>Magic Furnace</color> has obtained a new power, and once again is in the hands of its master Swick. It seems it can help you increase the refining success rate or reduce the consumption of refining materials of <color=#CA2E0AFF>blue quality Armor</color>. However, it seems you'll first need to help the furnace collect some materials to exert this new power.",
    ["TaskDescription110433101"]="With your help the <color=#CA2E0AFF>Magic Furnace</color> has obtained a new power, and once again is in the hands of its master Swick. It seems it can help you increase the refining success rate or reduce the consumption of refining materials of <color=#CA2E0AFF>blue quality Cloaks</color>. However, it seems you'll first need to help the furnace collect some materials to exert this new power.",
