    ["TaskDescription25046"]="True soulmates never back down from a battle! These <color=#CA2E0AFF>Sky Petites</color> don't stand a chance against you!",
    ["TaskDescription25047"]="True soulmates never back down from a battle! These <color=#CA2E0AFF>Baphomet Jrs.</color> don't stand a chance against you!",
    ["TaskDescription25501"]="Only gourmets with the most refined palettes can appreciate the subtle nuances of fine cuisine, and this <color=#CA2E0AFF>Aquatic Salad I</color>, made by a certain cooking couple, is as fine as it gets!",
    ["TaskDescription25502"]="Only gourmets with the most refined palettes can appreciate the subtle nuances of fine cuisine, and this <color=#CA2E0AFF>Mandragora Prawns I</color>, made by a certain cooking couple, is a prime example!",
    ["TaskDescription25503"]="Only gourmets with the most refined palettes can appreciate the subtle nuances of fine cuisine, and this <color=#CA2E0AFF>Nutritious Frog Meat I</color>, made by a certain cooking couple, is as fine as it gets!",
    ["TaskDescription25504"]="Only gourmets with the most refined palettes can appreciate the subtle nuances of fine cuisine, and this <color=#CA2E0AFF>Fruity Squid I</color>, made by a certain cooking couple, is as fine as it gets!",
    ["TaskDescription25505"]="Only gourmets with the most refined palettes can appreciate the subtle nuances of fine cuisine, and this <color=#CA2E0AFF>Mixed Congee I</color>, made by a certain cooking couple, is as fine as it gets!",
    ["TaskDescription25506"]="Only gourmets with the most refined palettes can appreciate the subtle nuances of fine cuisine, and this <color=#CA2E0AFF>Fish Fillet I</color>, made by a certain cooking couple, is as fine as it gets!",
    ["TaskDescription25507"]="Only gourmets with the most refined palettes can appreciate the subtle nuances of fine cuisine, and this <color=#CA2E0AFF>Rat-on-a-Stick I</color>, made by a certain cooking couple, is as fine as it gets!",
    ["TaskDescription25508"]="Only gourmets with the most refined palettes can appreciate the subtle nuances of fine cuisine, and this <color=#CA2E0AFF>Prawn-on-a-Stick I</color>, made by a certain cooking couple, is as fine as it gets!",
    ["TaskDescription25509"]="Only gourmets with the most refined palettes can appreciate the subtle nuances of fine cuisine, and this <color=#CA2E0AFF>Crispy Fish I</color>, made by a certain cooking couple, is as fine as it gets!",
    ["TaskDescription25510"]="Only gourmets with the most refined palettes can appreciate the subtle nuances of fine cuisine, and this <color=#CA2E0AFF>Smooth Clam Flesh I</color>, made by a certain cooking couple, is as fine as it gets!",
    ["TaskDescription25511"]="Only gourmets with the most refined palettes can appreciate the subtle nuances of fine cuisine, and this <color=#CA2E0AFF>Cold Jellyfish with Sauce I</color>, made by a certain cooking couple, is as fine as it gets!",
    ["TaskDescription25512"]="Only gourmets with the most refined palettes can appreciate the subtle nuances of fine cuisine, and this <color=#CA2E0AFF>Fish n' Crab I</color>, made by a certain cooking couple, is as fine as it gets!",
    ["TaskDescription25513"]="Only gourmets with the most refined palettes can appreciate the subtle nuances of fine cuisine, and this <color=#CA2E0AFF>Grilled Steak I</color>, made by a certain cooking couple, is as fine as it gets!",
    ["TaskDescription25514"]="Only gourmets with the most refined palettes can appreciate the subtle nuances of fine cuisine, and this <color=#CA2E0AFF>Fried Eggs with Squid I</color>, made by a certain cooking couple, is as fine as it gets!",
    ["TaskDescription25515"]="Only gourmets with the most refined palettes can appreciate the subtle nuances of fine cuisine, and this <color=#CA2E0AFF>Fish Stew I</color>, made by a certain cooking couple, is as fine as it gets!",
    ["TaskDescription25601"]="They say that lovers share one mind... So, are the two of you thinking the same thing? Form a party and kill that <color=#CA2E0AFF>Mistress</color>!",
    ["TaskDescription25602"]="They say that lovers share one mind... So, are the two of you thinking the same thing? Form a party and kill that <color=#CA2E0AFF>Phreeoni</color>!",
    ["TaskDescription25603"]="They say that lovers share one mind... So, are the two of you thinking the same thing? Form a party and kill that <color=#CA2E0AFF>Kraken</color>!",
    ["TaskDescription25604"]="They say that lovers share one mind... So, are the two of you thinking the same thing? Form a party and kill that <color=#CA2E0AFF>Eddga</color>!",
    ["TaskDescription25605"]="They say that lovers share one mind... So, are the two of you thinking the same thing? Form a party and kill that <color=#CA2E0AFF>Maya</color>!",
    ["TaskDescription25606"]="They say that lovers share one mind... So, are the two of you thinking the same thing? Form a party and kill that <color=#CA2E0AFF>Orc Hero</color>!",
    ["TaskDescription25607"]="They say that lovers share one mind... So, are the two of you thinking the same thing? Form a party and kill that <color=#CA2E0AFF>Pharaoh</color>!",
    ["TaskDescription25608"]="They say that lovers share one mind... So, are the two of you thinking the same thing? Form a party and kill that <color=#CA2E0AFF>Orc Lord</color>!",
    ["TaskDescription25651"]="Getting hitched is no excuse to let your fighting skills go to waste! For the glory of the Kingdom Defense Force, let's go clear <color=#CA2E0AFF>Corsair's Cabin (Normal)</color>!",
    ["TaskDescription25652"]="Getting hitched is no excuse to let your fighting skills go to waste! For the glory of the Kingdom Defense Force, let's go clear <color=#CA2E0AFF>Corsair's Cabin (Hard)</color>!",
    ["TaskDescription25653"]="Getting hitched is no excuse to let your fighting skills go to waste! For the glory of the Kingdom Defense Force, let's go clear <color=#CA2E0AFF>Ancient Pyramid (Normal)</color>!",
    ["TaskDescription25654"]="Getting hitched is no excuse to let your fighting skills go to waste! For the glory of the Kingdom Defense Force, let's go clear <color=#CA2E0AFF>Ancient Pyramid (Hard)</color>!",
    ["TaskDescription25655"]="Getting hitched is no excuse to let your fighting skills go to waste! For the glory of the Kingdom Defense Force, let's go clear <color=#CA2E0AFF>Lost Temple (Normal)</color>!",
    ["TaskDescription25656"]="Getting hitched is no excuse to let your fighting skills go to waste! For the glory of the Kingdom Defense Force, let's go clear <color=#CA2E0AFF>Lost Temple (Hard)</color>!",
    ["TaskDescription25657"]="Getting hitched is no excuse to let your fighting skills go to waste! For the glory of the Kingdom Defense Force, let's go clear <color=#CA2E0AFF>Moonlit Cave (Normal)</color>!",
    ["TaskDescription25658"]="Getting hitched is no excuse to let your fighting skills go to waste! For the glory of the Kingdom Defense Force, let's go clear <color=#CA2E0AFF>Moonlit Cave (Hard)</color>!",
    ["TaskDescription25701"]="Let love and loyalty unleash the supreme power of faith! Use love to break through the monsters' defense on the <color=#CA2E0AFF>4th floor</color> of the tower!",
    ["TaskDescription25702"]="Let love and loyalty unleash the supreme power of faith! Use love to break through the monsters' defense on the <color=#CA2E0AFF>8th floor</color> of the tower!",
    ["TaskDescription25751"]="You can never give enough gifts to the one you love... but at least <color=#CA2E0AFF>2</color> should be enough, right?",
    ["TaskDescription25752"]="You can never give enough gifts to the one you love... but at least <color=#CA2E0AFF>4</color> should be enough, right?",
    ["TaskDescription25801"]="We'll be relying on your sweet photos to promote this season's hottest wedding trend!",
    ["TaskDescription25802"]="This season's hottest wedding trend? Let's take a look at your sweet photos and see!",
    ["TaskDescription25803"]="This season's hottest wedding trend? Let's take a look at your sweet photos and see!",
    ["TaskDescription25804"]="This season's hottest wedding trend? Let's take a look at your sweet photos and see!",
    ["TaskDescription26001"]="We should try to reduce the number of monsters affected by the Orc Disaster before we confront him head-on.",
    ["TaskDescription26002"]="Challenger, please accept the old man's mission to temper your skills against low-level monsters.",
    ["TaskDescription26003"]="The rat infestation in the sewers has begun to interfere with the Shadow Squad's duties. Please eliminate them, quickly!",
    ["TaskDescription26004"]="Scouts have reported that Steel Chonchons populate the only path of attack leading to the Orc Disaster. It's up to you to reduce their numbers!",
    ["TaskDescription26005"]="Now that the demand for rations has grown, the threat posed by Thief Bugs has also increased. Please protect the food I prepared for Lord Rimuru!",
    ["TaskDescription26006"]="Please, go get rid of those Poison Spores before Shion brings them back for dinner!",
    ["TaskDescription26007"]="I'm Rigurd, loyal servant of Lord Rimuru. I'm trying to build a temporary residence here, but we don't have building materials!",
    ["TaskDescription26008"]="In addition to normal meals, we also need some portable rations for our operations...",
    ["TaskDescription26009"]="To be honest, as long as I can swallow them, I can learn a demon's abilities and absorb their knowledge!",
    ["TaskDescription26010"]="The Shadow Squad wishes to use the sewer as a military route. Please help clear out the monsters down there.",
    ["TaskDescription26011"]="Negotiations with the people inside the wreckage have failed. It seems we'll have to resort to force.",
    ["TaskDescription26012"]="Although we have no grievances with them, the sound they produce will affect our battle against the Orc Disaster. Please silence them.",
    ["TaskDescription26013"]="Challenger, please accept this old man's mission to eliminate the evil aboard the ship and hone your skills.",
    ["TaskDescription26014"]="Ranga can't use his electrical abilities in wet places. Please come and help to clear the hostiles!",
    ["TaskDescription26015"]="Those vermin dare to defy the Storm Dragon?! They don't even deserve to die by my hands!",
    ["TaskDescription26016"]="We intend to obtain a large quantity of high-quality fur to make advanced weapons. Potential transporters, please seek out Lord Rimuru for details.",
    ["TaskDescription26017"]="Good, I'm beginning to find out everything there is to know about this world. I must continue analyzing it!",
    ["TaskDescription26018"]="Whoa! What is a thing like this doing in the desert?! If you're not paying attention, its exploding spikes could be the end of you!",
    ["TaskDescription26019"]="The surviving Savages seem to have gained greater magical abilities. We must continue to cull the threat.",
    ["TaskDescription26020"]="Young Champion, please accept this old man's mission and hone your skills against those sword-wielding monsters.",
    ["TaskDescription26021"]="Perhaps there has been some kind of cultural misunderstanding here... Why is it that the more you drive them away, the noisier they become?",
    ["TaskDescription26022"]="I wonder what those egg-like monsters taste like... *gulp*",
    ["TaskDescription26023"]="Don't you think it's an awful waste leaving perfectly good stones lying around out there?",
    ["TaskDescription26024"]="We heard that a high-quality rocky material can be found naturally in the world. I hope the rumors are true!",
    ["TaskDescription26025"]="The King of Tempest's powers have essentially returned to normal, but I demand more!",
    ["TaskDescription26026"]="No matter how meddlesome they are, they're just ants! I'd crush them myself, but they're not even worth the energy!",
    ["TaskDescription26027"]="Young Valiant, please accept this old man's mission and hone your skills against those lordly-looking monsters.",
    ["TaskDescription26028"]="Although I am confident in my work, I should really make sure it stands up to equipment on this continent.",
    ["TaskDescription26029"]="I never imagined that even the ants in this world would be so bold as to steal from the strong! Let's take out their transportation team!",
    ["TaskDescription26030"]="Up for a little contest? Which weapon can slay monsters faster—one made by Kaijin, or one from this world?",
    ["TaskDescription26031"]="Why do I always run into enemies near water! Aroo!",
    ["TaskDescription26032"]="In that case, I'll just go ahead and learn all the skills this world has to offer!",
    ["TaskDescription26033"]="We failed to gain the aid of the Requiems in the cavern ruins. They seem to lack sentience...",
    ["TaskDescription26034"]="These tomb robbers didn't listen to Ramiris' advice, and now they seem to have become Pasana!",
    ["TaskDescription26035"]="It seems that not only the Savages have been affected by Starved—it's also taken hold of the Wolves! Please reduce their numbers.",
    ["TaskDescription26036"]="Young Fighter, please accept this old man's mission and hone your skills against those boneless things.",
    ["TaskDescription26037"]="Construction of the stronghold has been impeded by Arclouzes. Please get rid of them, quickly.",
    ["TaskDescription26038"]="The Shadow Squad has sent word that filth has appeared in Payon's labyrinth.",
    ["TaskDescription26039"]="I hear that the essence of this world's monsters is considered to be quite a sumptuous cooking ingredient. Please bring me some!",
    ["TaskDescription26040"]="I have basically learned all there is to know about the monsters here. Now, I still have some items to analyze, such as this world's precious metals.",
    ["TaskDescription26041"]="I don't know why, but as soon as we entered this area, monsters started coming at us from all directions...",
    ["TaskDescription26042"]="Buying live Deviaces for high prices! Please come work with us!",
    ["TaskDescription26043"]="Although there is no hostility between us, the Elder Willows are in our way and need to be driven off.",
    ["TaskDescription26044"]="Young Aspirant, please accept this old man's mission and hone your skills against those hard-as-stone things.",
    ["TaskDescription26045"]="Reincarnation in this world seems quite interesting. The core principle seems to revolve around a spell...?",
    ["TaskDescription26046"]="After learning all there is to know about the metals here, the next step is to identify the various types of leather in this world!",
    ["TaskDescription26047"]="Magical energy seems to be affecting the souls of the ancient heroes here. Please release them from their torment.",
    ["TaskDescription26048"]="Although this whole misunderstanding was actually caused by Gobta, it looks like they have no intention of letting us go...",
    ["TaskDescription26049"]="Young Adept, please accept this old man's mission and hone your skills against those ethereal things.",
    ["TaskDescription26050"]="Why are those pumpkin-headed things chasing Ramiris?!",
    ["TaskDescription26051"]="The ancient weapons of this world have been preserved to the present day. This is indeed worth studying.",
    ["TaskDescription26052"]="Indeed, it seems that the crafting technology of other races is also very much worth researching!",
    ["TaskDescription26053"]="I'm going to recruit the Petites here! The first thing we need to do is give them a good thrashing!",
    ["TaskDescription26054"]="What?! This place is crawling with Demon King spawn! When are we gonna get a break?!",
    ["TaskDescription26055"]="I, Rigurd, swear that I will teach Gobta a lesson for this!",
    ["TaskDescription26056"]="Young Virtuoso, please accept this old man's mission and hone your skills against those things so infinitely linked to humans.",
    ["TaskDescription26057"]="Ranga has entrusted me to recruit warriors to eliminate our evil cousins and bring back their fur...",
    ["TaskDescription26058"]="Our camp has been looted by bandits... We need to get our stuff back!",
    ["TaskDescription26059"]="In that case, I might as well learn the skills of this world's dragons!",
    ["TaskDescription26060"]="The little monsters here are really getting in the way of construction. Make sure you keep them away from here while we're working!",
    ["TaskDescription26061"]="We've received word that the scouting party was attacked by a species of wild bears. Please go and quell the threat.",
    ["TaskDescription26062"]="If the Side Winders around our temporary residence are allowed to roam free, they could prove to be a significant safety hazard.",
    ["TaskDescription26063"]="Anyone can see that a body without a mind cannot engage in communication.",
    ["TaskDescription26064"]="The animals buried in the tombs have also awakened. Please cleanse the area of their presence.",
    ["TaskDescription26065"]="The influx of magical energy has resurrected the dead here. Although it is truly a tragedy, I ask that you allow them to return to the grave...",
    ["TaskDescription26066"]="Why have even these powerful monsters been affected by Starved! This is so bizarre!",
    ["TaskDescription26067"]="We need some brightly colored flowers to dye the things we've spun. Please bring me some!",
    ["TaskDescription26068"]="Looks like the dispute between us can't be resolved, and this is how the world works...",
    ["TaskDescription26069"]="It surprises me that there is quite a lot of undead who practice kendo. This is awesome!",
    ["TaskDescription26070"]="Even those lowlife degenerate demons can walk around here, and no one cares about it. This is getting up my nose.",
    ["TaskDescription26071"]="How many knights did I absorb? I lost count of it...",
    ["TaskDescription26072"]="The dispute with Goblins has been turned into full-scale technological warfare from a skirmish...",
    ["TaskDescription26073"]="The prolonged time that the Orc Disaster stayed here seemed to strengthen the Starved skill...",
    ["TaskDescription26074"]="A bug that possesses a scholar-like face. Maybe we can gain knowledge by eating them!",
    ["TaskDescription26075"]="So, these Goblins were just trying to show off their warfare tech since the beginning?",
    ["TaskDescription26076"]="The unsupervised prisoner ends up looking like this. It will be an absolute disaster for everybody if he gets away.",
    ["TaskDescription26077"]="Wraiths with giant mouths in their stomachs start to appear. Whether they are under the affection of Starved still remains unclear.",
    ["TaskDescription26078"]="The magical energy seems to be the cause of the Scavengers starting to attack living creatures. Please extinguish the danger.",
    ["TaskDescription26079"]="To show appreciation for staying in this world, we plan to terminate the creator of the evil ritual.",
    ["TaskDescription26080"]="The evil Bathory seems to be fond of the petite Goblins. Spare no mercy.",
    ["TaskDescription26081"]="The vanguard legion from the abyss makes a server impact on the magical energy environment. Please assist us in defeating them.",
    ["TaskDescription26082"]="It may or may not be intended, but souls remaining in the existing world is a safety threat.",
    ["TaskDescription26083"]="Changing all the cards into jokers may be a trivial trick for the monster. Sucks for me to get a deck of useless cards!",
    ["TaskDescription26084"]="Shadow Squad reports demon hiding in the mirror started acting up. Please dispel them.",
    ["TaskDescription26085"]="The way of Kendo is a path that can be pursued even in the afterlife. Let's put an end to this.",
    ["TaskDescription26086"]="The free-roaming Clock disrupted the order of time. Please eliminate the negative impact.",
    ["TaskDescription26087"]="The modified Phendark attacks nearby target indiscriminately and pose an extremely serious threat.",
    ["TaskDescription26088"]="Evil power lies within the heart. It seems like intel can be retrieved by reading the mind labyrinth.",
    ["TaskDescription26089"]="We attempt to refine the current smelting tech to save up even more raw materials!",
    ["TaskDescription26090"]="Maybe we can mentally encourage Shion by comparing her stuff with something even worst, if there is any...",
    ["TaskDescription26091"]="Maybe surpassing metal, there is something even sharper in the world...",
    ["TaskDescription26092"]="Even if the sentence is ambiguous and hard to interpret, I can gain magic skills as long as I decipher the magic noted in the book.",
    ["TaskDescription26093"]="To assist Kaijin in upgrading his smelting skills, we need high-efficiency fuel to boost fire power.",
    ["TaskDescription27001"]="Complete the class trial to prove your strength.",
    ["TaskDescription28001"]="It looks like Payon's firecrackers aren't enough scare away those naughty Baby Nians. The villagers need your help!",
    ["TaskDescription28002"]="Today’s Maya seems to be well-dressed, even the movements that deal damage are as elegant as if she were dancing…",
    ["TaskDescription28003"]="Celebrating holidays is not the privilege of humans. Even Phreeoni wants to eat some good food on this day.",
    ["TaskDescription28004"]="As a false friend of Maya, how can I just be watching her seek the limelight in such a grand festival alone?!",
    ["TaskDescription28005"]="The undead fierce beast strikes again, and at this moment… You are the hero with the spear of graphite in your hand!",
    ["TaskDescription28006"]="I heard that Eclipse, who is always mistaken for a cute pet, wants to take this opportunity to restore its power…",
    ["TaskDescription28007"]="It is already tiring to deal with the Nian. How can there be someone who takes advantage of it?",
    ["TaskDescription28008"]="Super fast speed can be used not only to assassinate someone, but also to… steal food.",
    ["TaskDescription28009"]="Become stronger, is a persistent thing!",
    ["TaskDescription28010"]="Don’t hit too hard, they will cry.",
    ["TaskDescription28011"]="It’s time to meet some old friends.",
    ["TaskDescription28012"]="Persistence, is the secret of invincibility!",
    ["TaskDescription28013"]="Don't hit me! Hit me again and I’ll ignore you!",
    ["TaskDescription28014"]="To cherish every time we get together, because the parting will always come.",
    ["TaskDescription28015"]="It is said that in the far eastern lands, eating fish on New Year's Eve is a very important custom…",
    ["TaskDescription28016"]="Do your best to hold off 30 waves of the monster invasion. There is a chance of dropping unbound Collab Gacha Coins and Collab Tokens from each monster.",
    ["TaskDescription29001"]="The Training Course situated at the southeast corner of Prontera is officially open to all adventurers. We sincerely invite you to join us.",
    ["TaskDescription29002"]="The Carousel is a new business at the Prontera South Gate, set up by the Eden Group. It has become a hot spot for ladies to take photos!",
    ["TaskDescription29003"]="The bards sing of the Endless Tower, of how it awaits the brave to unveil it.",
    ["TaskDescription29004"]="Tavern Owner: \"This isn't just a place for drinking. There are also games with great prizes!\"",
    ["TaskDescription29050"]="The Golden Thief Bug was affected by the Fragment of Ymir's Heart and has become stronger!",
    ["TaskDescription29051"]="The Corsair was affected by the Fragment of Ymir's Heart and has become stronger!",
    ["TaskDescription29052"]="Osiris was affected by the Fragment of Ymir's Heart and has become stronger!",
    ["TaskDescription29053"]="Strouf was affected by the Fragment of Ymir's Heart and has become stronger!",
    ["TaskDescription29054"]="Moonlight Flower was affected by the Fragment of Ymir's Heart and has become stronger!",
    ["TaskDescription29055"]="Dracula was affected by the Fragment of Ymir's Heart and has become stronger!",
    ["TaskDescription29056"]="Dark Lord was affected by the Fragment of Ymir's Heart and has become stronger!",
    ["TaskDescription29057"]="Owl Duke was affected by the Fragment of Ymir's Heart and has become stronger!",
    ["TaskDescription29100"]="All fair prices and good services here! You can count on the Lindra Trading Company!",
    ["TaskDescription29200"]="All fair prices and good services here! You can count on the Lindra Trading Company!",
