    ["TaskQuestion450001"]="Questioning the first intention of martial arts",
    ["TaskQuestion460001"]="Help Jude figure things out",
    ["TaskQuestion470001"]="Talk to the voice within",
    ["TaskQuestionTitle3100011"]="Will you never regret the decision you are making at this moment?",
    ["TaskQuestionTitle3100012"]="Are you willing to wield your weapon at any time to defend the people of this land?",
    ["TaskQuestionTitle3100013"]="Even when facing a tortuous trial by fire, will you be able to march forward?",
    ["TaskQuestionTitle3100021"]="Do you always stand strong when faced with a great threat?",
    ["TaskQuestionTitle3100022"]="Do you only use force and not your intellect?",
    ["TaskQuestionTitle3100023"]="Will you lend your hand to your companions instead of abandoning them?",
    ["TaskQuestionTitle3100031"]="The royal election lasts for seven days, and there is a total of seven candidates.",
    ["TaskQuestionTitle3100032"]="A new king will be elected by voting. The vote consists of two categories, public votes, and aristocratic committee votes.",
    ["TaskQuestionTitle3100033"]="The elector's vote will account for 20% of the total votes at the royal election.",
    ["TaskQuestionTitle3200011"]="In the face of danger, are you willing to protect your allies at all cost?",
    ["TaskQuestionTitle3200012"]="Faced with treasure, will you step in front of others and reap your team's rewards for yourself?",
    ["TaskQuestionTitle3200013"]="Will you treat animals as your companions, cherishing and protecting them?",
    ["TaskQuestionTitle3200021"]="Elemental magic is colorful and stunning. It's a very stylish and easy-to-perform discipline. What do you think?",
    ["TaskQuestionTitle3200022"]="The best way to use elemental magic is to maximize your casting rate and destructive power. What do you think?",
    ["TaskQuestionTitle3200023"]="If you focus on one attribute of magic, you will be able to deal with all danger. As the saying goes, one strength beats ten abilities. What do you think?",
    ["TaskQuestionTitle3200031"]="By Odin, you shall abhor evil as you do an enemy and send all undead to the Goddess of Death. Are you ready?",
    ["TaskQuestionTitle3200032"]="By Odin, you shall have mercy in your heart. With the blessings of the holy light of Odin, you will inspire your allies to fight courageously in battle. Are you ready?",
    ["TaskQuestionTitle3200033"]="By Odin, are you ready to dedicate the remainder your life to faith in Odin?",
    ["TaskQuestionTitle3200041"]="You will be surrounded by applause and flowers as the most prominent person amongst the masses. Do you look forward to such an adventurous life?",
    ["TaskQuestionTitle3200042"]="Sharp arrows and hidden traps will make you the reaper of death on the battlefield, are you looking forward to such an adventurous life?",
    ["TaskQuestionTitle3200043"]="On the battlefield, your falcon will always have your back and fight alongside you. You will never be alone. Are you looking forward to such an adventurous life?",
    ["TaskQuestionTitle3200051"]="Will you uphold a spirit of righteousness and honesty?",
    ["TaskQuestionTitle3200052"]="Are you prepared to walk in the shadows, always ready to strike a deadly blow?",
    ["TaskQuestionTitle3200053"]="Can you set aside the doubts and vilification of others and be committed to your own sense of justice?",
    ["TaskQuestionTitle3200061"]="Strong muscles, body, and mind are one's first valuable assets on the path to wealth! What do you think?",
    ["TaskQuestionTitle3200062"]="The push cart is our tool, our weapon, and our companion! What do you think?",
    ["TaskQuestionTitle3200063"]="Whoooo!!! Let's show off our toned flesh, sweat it out, and be one with fire!!!",
    ["TaskQuestionTitle3200071"]="Is Kafra's headquarters situated in Alberta?",
    ["TaskQuestionTitle3200072"]="Does Kafra Corporation's services include selling pushcarts?",
    ["TaskQuestionTitle3200073"]="Is Kafra Corporation your favorite logistics company?",
    ["TaskQuestionTitle3200081"]="Will you maintain your faith in Odin, no matter what?",
    ["TaskQuestionTitle3200082"]="Do you rank glory and honor above all else?",
    ["TaskQuestionTitle3200083"]="Would you be willing to sacrifice anything for your teammates?",
    ["TaskQuestionTitle3200101"]="Do you wish to become a devotee of the Way and a survivor of such suffering as to rend flesh from bone?",
    ["TaskQuestionTitle3200102"]="Do you wish to become an advanced practitioner of our art with the power to endure ten years of suffering in one day, and one day of joy in ten years?",
    ["TaskQuestionTitle3200103"]="And when you reach the pinnacle of our craft, would you still be willing to have compassion upon the multitude and all living things?",
    ["TaskQuestionTitle3200111"]="Did you discover your talent while learning to cast spells?",
    ["TaskQuestionTitle3200112"]="Knowledge is akin to an endless ocean. When you tread from a Magician into the unfamiliar domain of a Sage, will you have the courage to start over?",
    ["TaskQuestionTitle3200113"]="When you become a Sage, will you remain sincere and true to the title?",
    ["TaskQuestionTitle3200121"]="From this moment forth, are you willing to be unbiased, graceful, and unpretentious to all audience?",
    ["TaskQuestionTitle3200122"]="From this moment forth, are you willing to be patient and passionate in the pursuit of excellence?",
    ["TaskQuestionTitle3200123"]="When your battle skills and results have reached the pinnacle, are you willing to teach others without holding back as I did today?",
    ["TaskQuestionTitle3300011"]="The earliest \"Sweet Dumplings\" were also known as \"Floating Balls\".",
    ["TaskQuestionTitle33000110"]="\"White sugar plum is truly rare indeed, without a pit and without skin\" refers to Sweet Dumplings.",
    ["TaskQuestionTitle3300012"]="\"New Year's Eve\" is another name for the Lantern Festival.",
    ["TaskQuestionTitle3300013"]="Enjoying lanterns, guessing riddles, and eating rice dumplings are all Lantern Festival customs.",
    ["TaskQuestionTitle3300014"]="\"Tangyuan\" and \"Sweet Dumplings\" are different kinds of food.",
    ["TaskQuestionTitle3300015"]="The lantern tradition began in the Qin Dynasty and flourished in the Tang Dynasty.",
    ["TaskQuestionTitle3300016"]="Releasing lanterns also symbolizes \"having a baby\".",
    ["TaskQuestionTitle3300017"]="The three elements of a lantern riddle are the riddle's description, the riddle's mystery, and riddle's answer.",
    ["TaskQuestionTitle3300018"]="The next sentence of \"Fire Trees and Silver Flowers\" is \"The Bright Moon Begins Chase\".",
    ["TaskQuestionTitle3300019"]="The first person to make a lantern couplet was Jia Sidao.",
    ["TaskQuestionTitle3400011"]="Becoming a Master signifies that your education has almost reached its apex, and that you can ease your pursuit of knowledge somewhat.",
    ["TaskQuestionTitle3400012"]="Tough love is the only teaching method suitable for students who dare question their Master.",
    ["TaskQuestionTitle3400013"]="If a student's achievements exceed those of their Master, the Master should feel pride, not envy.",
    ["TaskQuestionTitle3400014"]="Each student has their own strengths and failings, thus each must be taught according to their aptitude.",
    ["TaskQuestionTitle3400015"]="Every Master must endure to lead their students to do good, and punish the Masters of those who do evil.",
    ["TaskQuestionTitle3500011"]="Have you ever hurt someone to satisfy your desires?",
    ["TaskQuestionTitle3500012"]="Are you willing to lend a hand to someone who is suffering?",
    ["TaskQuestionTitle3500013"]="Are you committed to justice in your heart, even if it comes with a cost?",
    ["TaskQuestionTitle3600011"]="Do you possess the manner of being a Rouge?",
    ["TaskQuestionTitle3600012"]="Do you possess the decency of being a Rouge?",
    ["TaskQuestionTitle3600013"]="Do you possess the attitude of being a Rouge?",
    ["TaskQuestionTitle3700011"]="Do you have reverence and respect for lives?",
    ["TaskQuestionTitle3700012"]="Can you stand firm against taboos and temptations?",
    ["TaskQuestionTitle3700013"]="Are you willing to wholeheartedly pass on Alchemy's knowledge and legacy to our successors?",
    ["TaskQuestionTitle3800011"]="在演员的整体素质中，先天的因素起着决定性的作用。",
    ["TaskQuestionTitle3800012"]="表演的信念与真实感是不可分离的。",
    ["TaskQuestionTitle3800013"]="演员只需按照导演要求直译式扮演角色。",
    ["TaskQuestionTitle3900011"]="Orfeo is a mentor to Trinity.",
    ["TaskQuestionTitle3900012"]="Between the two, Orfeo was the one who confessed first.",
    ["TaskQuestionTitle3900013"]="Orfeo and Trinity used to live in seclusion on Comodo.",
    ["TaskQuestionTitle4000011"]="Will you never regret the decision you are making at this moment?",
    ["TaskQuestionTitle4000012"]="Are you willing to take up arms at any time to defend the people of this land?",
    ["TaskQuestionTitle4000013"]="Even when facing a tortuous trial by fire, will you be able to march forward?",
    ["TaskQuestionTitle4100011"]="We swear our character shall forever remain noble.",
    ["TaskQuestionTitle4100012"]="We vow our blood shall ceaselessly boil with fervor.",
    ["TaskQuestionTitle4100013"]="We pledge our justice shall endure eternally!",
    ["TaskQuestionTitle4200011"]="Question 1: Keep silent, as this is the Ninja's truest form of speech.",
    ["TaskQuestionTitle4200012"]="Question 2: Keep apart, as this is the measure for life's preservation.",
    ["TaskQuestionTitle4200013"]="Question 3: Keep awake, as this is the beacon in the endless night.",
    ["TaskQuestionTitle4300011"]="The sky is blue.",
    ["TaskQuestionTitle4300012"]="Puppies can meow.",
    ["TaskQuestionTitle4300013"]="All animals with wings can fly.",
    ["TaskQuestionTitle4300014"]="Got two apples, eat one, then there's one left.",
    ["TaskQuestionTitle4300015"]="If you see someone mess up, the nicest thing to do is laugh out loud.",
    ["TaskQuestionTitle4400031"]="In a future where you succeed in your class advancement, can you stay true to your heart, protect the weak, and never bow to evil?",
    ["TaskQuestionTitle4400041"]="In a future where your class advancement fails, can you persevere, cut through all obstacles, and forever walk the path of light?",
    ["TaskQuestionTitle4400051"]="Items held past the storage period will incur a late fee. Are you aware of this?",
    ["TaskQuestionTitle4400052"]="The cause of this air disaster has been officially ruled as accidental. By claiming the belongings, you acknowledge and accept this ruling. Are you aware of this?",
    ["TaskQuestionTitle4400053"]="You are currently within the compensation claim period for the incident. If you miss the deadline, it will be considered a waiver of your claim. Are you aware of this?",
    ["TaskQuestionTitle4500011"]="I will exhaust all efforts in the pursuit of martial arts, no matter the struggle!",
    ["TaskQuestionTitle4500012"]="I will hold on to the heart of justice, steering clear of the path of evil!",
    ["TaskQuestionTitle4500013"]="I will always remember my teacher's kindness, never forsaking loyalty and honor!",
    ["TaskQuestionTitle4600011"]="Through everything—have you truly held firm to your faith and principles without ever straying?",
    ["TaskQuestionTitle4600012"]="If someone dear to you stands against your faith, would you be able to agree to disagree... and live with that difference?",
    ["TaskQuestionTitle4600013"]="If one day you were caught in a painful dilemma, would you hurt someone you love just to stay true to your faith?",
    ["TaskQuestionTitle4700011"]="I will gaze upon all that walks or lingers in this world, be they the living or the souls beyond death.",
    ["TaskQuestionTitle4700012"]="I will delve into the laws of nature and lead all creation into the embrace of spiritual art.",
    ["TaskQuestionTitle4700013"]="I will bow before the Four Celestial Sovereigns, serving as Heaven's hand to judge and purge all sin.",
