    ["TaskUI_Title1"]="Novice Registration",
    ["TaskUI_Title2"]="1st Class Certificate",
    ["TaskUI_comment1"]="Your courage rivals your perseverance. Point your sword to the east, where the sun rises!",
    ["TaskUI_comment10"]="Stay humble and stay patient on the unending path of martial arts!",
    ["TaskUI_comment2"]="Magic knows no bounds, just like your talents.",
    ["TaskUI_comment3"]="You look beautiful, but a more beautiful soul is hidden beneath the surface. Keep shining bright.",
    ["TaskUI_comment4"]="You possess all the qualities of a great Thief, but do not let pride blind you. Be subtle and you can blend into the shadows.",
    ["TaskUI_comment5"]="If the thoughts of an Archer are conveyed through their arrows, then you must be swift as thought.",
    ["TaskUI_comment6"]="There are some things money cannot buy, such as goodwill and your honesty.",
    ["TaskUI_comment7"]="Your heart is the beginning and the end of everything. Only a torch is needed in the darkness to light up the night.",
    ["TaskUI_comment8"]="Bullets hold no bias; it is your choice where they find their mark.",
    ["TaskUI_comment9"]="Ninjutsu and weapons are the truest allies you'll ever have.",
