    ["TeamBattleAddStars"]="The Star Upgrade Card is activated; receive 1 extra star.",
    ["TeamBattleBeginLimit01"]="Party member's level is insufficient.",
    ["TeamBattleBraveCoin"]="Warrior Coin Acquisition This Week:",
    ["TeamBattleExit"]="Exiting now will result in a <color=#ff5d5d>loss</color>, and you will not be able to enter <color=#ff5d5d>Infinite Showdown Ranked Match</color> in the next <color=#ff5d5d>%s</color>. Exit still?",
    ["TeamBattleFlag01"]="Blue Party's Flag Count +1",
    ["TeamBattleFlag02"]="Red Party's Flag Count +1",
    ["TeamBattleFlag03"]="The central flag has respawned. Capture it now!",
    ["TeamBattleFlag04"]="The flag holder has left the scene. The flag has been returned to the spawn point.",
    ["TeamBattleFlag05"]="Welcome to the Double Poring! Let's see who gets the most little Porings!",
    ["TeamBattleFlag06"]="You've lost all little Porings!",
    ["TeamBattleFlag07"]="All little Porings have been released! Go for it!",
    ["TeamBattleFlag08"]="Resource points have appeared in the center and on both sides of the map! Let's go!",
    ["TeamBattleFlag09"]="The Blue Party has captured 1 resource point, allowing them to gain resources continuously.",
    ["TeamBattleFlag10"]="The Red Party has captured 1 resource point, allowing them to gain resources continuously.",
    ["TeamBattleFlag11"]="Your party has outnumbered the other side and gained a bonus effect.",
    ["TeamBattleFlag12"]="Brave souls, charge forth and fight for glory!",
