    ["TendencyName_5"]="Assassin",
    ["TendencyName_6"]="Marksman",
    ["ThePartProhibitConvert"]="Unable to transfer this part.",
    ["TimeConditionTips"]="Cannot use during this time period. You can use it from %s to %s.",
    ["TimeLimitedFarmActivity_1"]="World Drop ends in %s.",
    ["TimeLimitedFarmActivity_1_Coda"]="Rune-Midgarts Kingdom Defense Force",
    ["TimeLimitedFarmActivity_1_Content"]="Due to a reason that can't be shared at this time, the Rune-Midgarts Kingdom Defense Force is currently gathering all outstanding adventurers for a secret mission!\n\nWe hope you can come to the kingdom's aid. If you are interested in the contents of this letter, go to the <color=#ff6f76>Prontera South Gate</color> and ask <color=#ff6f76>Hershey</color>, Staff Officer, 2nd Regiment of the Defense Force for more information!",
    ["TimeLimitedFarmActivity_1_Title"]="To all esteemed adventurers,",
    ["TimeLimitedFarmActivity_2"]="Exchange ends in %s.",
    ["TimeLimitedFarmActivity_2_Content"]="Greetings, as staunch researchers of Glast Heim, we have dedicated ourselves to discovering the truth behind why the bustling city of Glast Heim was destroyed overnight. We hope to one day unveil this sealed history to the public as well. However, due to lack of personnel, our research has once again been put to the wayside. We at the Eden Group believe only a heroic and responsible Adventurer such as yourself can help us weather this obstacle. If you're willing to help us, please go to <color=#ff6f76>Glast Heim</color> and look for the Eden Group member <color=#ff6f76>Sarence</color>. We'll be waiting.\n\n                                                                                                               Yours sincerely, Eden Group",
    ["TimeLimitedFarmActivity_2_Title"]="To all esteemed adventurers,",
    ["TimeLimitedFarmActivity_3"]="Remain: %s",
    ["TimeLimitedFarmActivity_4"]="<color=#8ebd4a>%s</color>/%s",
    ["TimeLimitedFarmActivity_5"]="<color=#ff6f76>%s</color>/%s",
    ["TimeLimitedFarmActivity_6"]="World Drop phase has ended. You can still redeem rewards.",
    ["TimeLimitedFarmActivity_7"]="Number of participation attempts exceeds limit.",
    ["TimeLimitedFarmActivity_Coda"]="                                                                                                                 Yours sincerely, Rekenber Institute",
    ["TimeLimitedFarmActivity_Content"]="Due to some circumstances that cannot be disclosed, Rekenber Institute requires your assistance! News of your heroic deeds throughout Rune-Midgarts are known far and wide. I humbly beg that you will be gracious to use your great powers to help us overcome this crisis. For more information, please speak with our <color=#ff6f76>research team</color> temporarily stationed at <color=#ff6f76>Prontera South Gate</color> (Disclaimer: We are NOT a MLM organization).\n",
    ["TimeLimitedFarmActivity_Intro"]="- During the event period, killing specific monsters while using Odin's Blessing will drop several different war preparation resource items. Please refer to the Handbook for drop details.\n- You can use these war preparation resource items to exchange for great rewards from Freida at Prontera South Gate.\n- After the drop phase ends, the exchange NPC will remain for 7 days, and you can still exchange for items during this period. After the event ends, you can sell the remaining items to general merchants.",
    ["TimeLimitedFarmActivity_Title"]="To all esteemed adventurers,",
    ["TimeLimitedFashionText_001"]="<color=#CA2E0AFF>%s</color> appearance expired",
    ["TimeLimitedFashionText_002"]="Limited-time costumes can’t be stored in the Warehouse",
