    ["Time_2"]="h",
    ["Time_20"]="%d-%m %H:%M",
    ["Time_21"]="Please select a time!",
    ["Time_22"]="%d/%m/%Y",
    ["Time_23"]="%s/%s/%s %s:%s:%s",
    ["Time_3"]="m",
    ["Time_4"]="s",
    ["Time_5"]="year(s)",
    ["Time_6"]="month(s)",
    ["Time_7"]="d",
    ["Time_8"]="h",
    ["Time_9"]="m",
    ["TimelineText7100101"]="I've finally become a swordswoman!",
    ["TimelineText7100102"]="You are different from before.",
    ["TimelineText7100103"]="Look at these faces, each beaming with confidence...",
    ["TimelineText7100104"]="You've all completed the first stage of your training at the academy.",
    ["TimelineText7100105"]="It's an incredible start!",
    ["TimelineText7100106"]="But if you wish to be acknowledged by the academy,",
    ["TimelineText7100107"]="you still have a long road to head!",
    ["TimelineText7100108"]="Do you wish to be remembered forever by Criatura, or even the entire continent of Midgard?",
    ["TimelineText7100109"]="Your dreams begin here!",
    ["TimelineText7100110"]="The six adventurers who founded this academy left behind these words of wisdom",
    ["TimelineText7100111"]="The hero who succeeds in reuniting Ymir's Heart, will be hailed as the greatest adventurer in the world!",
    ["TimelineText7100112"]="Does such a hero exist today?",
    ["TimelineText7100113"]="I am looking forward to finding out!",
    ["TimelineText7100114"]="Adventure, battle, and explore!",
    ["TimelineText7100115"]="Go forth and become a greatest adventurer!",
    ["TimelineText7100116"]="May all of Midgard",
    ["TimelineText7100117"]="know your name!",
    ["TimelineText7100301"]="Well, then... Let's get started!",
    ["TimelineText7100302"]="Huh?",
    ["TimelineText7100303"]="The Job Advancement Ceremony has offcially began.",
    ["TimelineText7100304"]="What—???",
    ["TimelineText7100305"]="Almighty Valkyrie, gaze upon the young hero who stands before you.",
    ["TimelineText7100306"]="He not only possesses extraordinary talent, but also a pure and virtuous heart.",
    ["TimelineText7100307"]="Please give him your blessing...",
    ["TimelineText7100308"]="May courage remain in your heart, may friendship always be with you,",
    ["TimelineText7100309"]="And may strength course not only through your body, but also through your soul.",
    ["TimelineText7100310"]="May you use this power wherever you are needed.",
    ["TimelineText7100311"]="Perhaps, along the path to the future, flowers will clash with thorns,",
    ["TimelineText7100312"]="Tears and laughter will intertwine, and blood and glory will shine...",
    ["TimelineText7100313"]="And so, I hereby declare that you have now qualified as a fully-fledged <color=#CA2E0AFF>{0}</color>.",
    ["TimelineText7100401"]="...Don't be rash.",
    ["TimelineText7100402"]="Now... you are the only successor left.",
    ["TimelineText7100403"]="You're a successor too, aren't you?",
    ["TimelineText7100404"]="I can't believe we're competing again.",
    ["TimelineText7100405"]="I'm not interested.",
    ["TimelineText7100406"]="If I lose to you,",
    ["TimelineText7100407"]="I'll concede.",
    ["TimelineText7100408"]="I'm used to it anyway.",
    ["TimelineText7100409"]="Stop messing around. We're going back soon.",
    ["TimelineText7100410"]="In the future, you should learn to be a proper...",
    ["TimelineText7100411"]="Aronst!",
    ["TimelineText7100501"]="Reservists... Your first trial awaits!",
    ["TimelineText7100502"]="This isn't the airship's final drop.",
    ["TimelineText7100503"]="Jump, and make your way to Prontera!",
    ["TimelineText7100504"]="It's time to test your courage.",
    ["TimelineText7100505"]="Now, jump!",
    ["TimelineText7100506"]="Why are you not jumping?",
    ["TimelineText7100507"]="Jump!",
    ["TimelineText7100508"]="Waaaah!",
    ["TimelineText7100601"]="Look!",
    ["TimelineText7100602"]="I feel it...",
    ["TimelineText7100603"]="Her thoughts... and her sorrow.",
    ["TimelineText7100604"]="Is it you...? My master...?",
    ["TimelineText7100605"]="Who? Who's speaking?",
    ["TimelineText7100606"]="Master, are you coming to take me back home?",
    ["TimelineText7100801"]="Your Royal Highness!",
    ["TimelineText7100802"]="Fair maiden, is this your lost crystal shoe?",
    ["TimelineText7100803"]="We're getting close to my favorite part!",
    ["TimelineText7100804"]="Shh, be quiet!",
    ["TimelineText7100901"]="I pledged my life to protect the prince!",
    ["TimelineText7100902"]="Prince?! Isn't that Aronst? He's the prince?!",
    ["TimelineText7100903"]="Never mind that, let's take care of these assassins first!",
    ["TimelineText7101101"]="...Thief Bugs rampaging in the sewer? They can cause such trouble?",
    ["TimelineText7101102"]="I've seen it with my own eyes! Those Thief Bugs not only took over my place but also looted all my hard-earned food! Those darn robbers!",
    ["TimelineText7101103"]="Huh? So you're living in the sewer? Hey, get away from me. You don't have lice on you, do you?",
    ["TimelineText7101104"]="You're missing the point!",
    ["TimelineText7101105"]="Look! Isn't that a member of the Royal Chivalry?",
    ["TimelineText7101106"]="It looks like they're headed for the sewers.",
    ["TimelineText7101107"]="Seems like something big has happened. Let's go check out the sewers.",
    ["TimelineText7101201"]="Watch out—they're about to attack!",
    ["TimelineText7101301"]="With the help of the craftsman Old Charlie, the broken fence is repaired...",
    ["TimelineText7101501"]="What... What are you doing?",
    ["TimelineText7101502"]="...I'm sorry!",
    ["TimelineText7101503"]="Ah!",
    ["TimelineText7101601"]="Who allowed you to come here? Go back! There are enemies hiding in the sewers. It's too dangerous!",
    ["TimelineText7101602"]="If you don't go, why should I?",
    ["TimelineText7101603"]="Aronst, be mindful of who you are. You are the prince. If you're wounded—",
    ["TimelineText7101604"]="You'll have one less rival among the seven royal families. Isn't that good?",
    ["TimelineText7101605"]="Now is not the time for jokes! Stop fooling around. I'll have someone escort you back to the surface.",
    ["TimelineText7101606"]="You want me to ignore something as important as the theft of the Fragment of Ymir's Heart? I can't do that!",
    ["TimelineText7101607"]="Who's there?!",
    ["TimelineText7101608"]="You're—watch your back!",
    ["TimelineText7101701"]="Shh. Don't alarm them...",
    ["TimelineText7101801"]="There's two of them!",
    ["TimelineText7101802"]="Let's deal with this one first, then find Azer and the others!",
    ["TimelineText7101901"]="Are you the one who hurt my Golden Thief Bug?",
    ["TimelineText7101902"]="You think that's all I've got?",
    ["TimelineText7101903"]="Let's see，how long you last against a full grown Golden Thief Bug!",
    ["TimelineText7102001"]="How could this happen?",
    ["TimelineText7102002"]="The Fragment of Ymir's Heart is so powerful...",
    ["TimelineText7102003"]="it can't fail!",
    ["TimelineText7102004"]="Give up while you still can!",
    ["TimelineText7102005"]="Wait!",
    ["TimelineText7102006"]="Don't you want to know the secrets of Ymir's Heart?",
    ["TimelineText7102007"]="I can share them with you.",
    ["TimelineText7102008"]="Catch me if you can.. Haha, or dare!",
    ["TimelineText7102101"]="Death is not an end, but the beginning of a new life.",
    ["TimelineText7102102"]="You need not grieve or feel sorrow...",
    ["TimelineText7102103"]="It's terrifying!",
    ["TimelineText7102104"]="What are these monsters!?",
    ["TimelineText7102105"]="Merciful Odin,",
    ["TimelineText7102106"]="please save your children, your devoted followers...",
    ["TimelineText7102107"]="...Let us save you!",
    ["TimelineText7102201"]="Master Strouf, it's time to take your medicine.",
    ["TimelineText7102202"]="I shall never... succumb to the darkness!",
    ["TimelineText7102203"]="Father, please you are not yourself!",
    ["TimelineText7102204"]="Long time no see, old friend!",
    ["TimelineText7102205"]="Baroshev!? It's you!",
    ["TimelineText7102206"]="Master Strouf! Do away with this intruder!",
    ["TimelineText7102301"]="I won't let you go this time!",
    ["TimelineText7102302"]="It's up to you two?",
    ["TimelineText7102303"]="So naive!",
    ["TimelineText7102304"]="Aronst!",
    ["TimelineText7102305"]="Aronst!",
    ["TimelineText7102501"]="What have you done!?",
    ["TimelineText7102502"]="Finally! I'm free!",
    ["TimelineText7102503"]="Evelyn! How dare you do this to me!",
    ["TimelineText7102504"]="I won't let you get away with this!",
    ["TimelineText7102505"]="How dare a mere Deviling disrespect a Witch!",
    ["TimelineText7102506"]="Watch your tone, or I'll seal you again!",
    ["TimelineText7102507"]="Witch?!",
    ["TimelineText7102508"]="Spatial Sealstone, answer my call!",
    ["TimelineText7102509"]="Darn it!",
    ["TimelineText7102601"]="Stop!—Ah!!",
    ["TimelineText7102701"]="—This is Baroshev. Receiving this message means that you should have completed the task.",
    ["TimelineText7102702"]="Don't linger too long. Come join me quickly.",
    ["TimelineText7102703"]="I'll be waiting for you at the port on Izlude Island, but not for long.",
    ["TimelineText7102704"]="The ship's leaving soon, and if you don't show up by then, I'll—",
    ["TimelineText7102705"]="Darnit! The crystal is damaged!",
    ["TimelineText7102801"]="What's in the distance?",
    ["TimelineText7102802"]="It's about to hit!",
    ["TimelineText7103001"]="Bahahaha!",
    ["TimelineText7103002"]="That's right! Spirits don't die easily!",
    ["TimelineText7103003"]="The Fragment of Ymir's Heart?!",
    ["TimelineText7103004"]="Oh? So you recognize my treasure!?",
    ["TimelineText7103005"]="What is the treasure doing in your hands?!",
    ["TimelineText7103006"]="Do you really wanna know? Come aboard my ship and find out for yourself!",
    ["TimelineText7103401"]="No! I'll disappear forever!",
    ["TimelineText7103402"]="Give up the Fragment of Ymir's Heart!",
    ["TimelineText7103501"]="Sir knight, you've arrived.",
    ["TimelineText7103502"]="I want to say that I'm sorry...",
    ["TimelineText7103503"]="Insolent human, how dare you trample on an Obeaune's love!",
    ["TimelineText7103504"]="I'll get my revenge!",
    ["TimelineText7103505"]="Trying to use me to steal Strouf's treasure?",
    ["TimelineText7103506"]="Then I'll bury you in this pile of treasure!",
    ["TimelineText7103601"]="Foul intruder, trying to defile my collection?",
    ["TimelineText7103602"]="Time to die!",
    ["TimelineText7103603"]="No, I wasn't—",
    ["TimelineText7103701"]="I sense a familiar presence…",
    ["TimelineText7103702"]="Could it be the successor of Odin's bloodline?",
    ["TimelineText7103703"]="Could you be... A worthy adversary?",
    ["TimelineText7103704"]="I implore you... Stop me, if you can!",
    ["TimelineText7103901"]="I... revived! Geffen... revenge!",
    ["TimelineText7103902"]="I'm not going to let you get your foolish wish!",
    ["TimelineText7103903"]="Jes... qurienne!",
    ["TimelineText7103904"]="Want to use the power of the Earth Element to come back to life? Unfortunately, you're wish is doomed to fail!",
    ["TimelineText7103905"]="Jes... qurienne!",
    ["TimelineText7103906"]="The Earth Element won't respond to you anymore!",
    ["TimelineText7103907"]="Adventurers, this is your chance to finish it off!",
    ["TimelineText7104001"]="You ventured here all alone?",
    ["TimelineText7104002"]="Grandfather...",
    ["TimelineText7104003"]="You're in over your head!",
    ["TimelineText7104004"]="These underground monsters are not weak!",
    ["TimelineText7104005"]="If you're wounded—",
    ["TimelineText7104006"]="Nithil!",
    ["TimelineText7104301"]="You! Wretched thieves!",
    ["TimelineText7104302"]="Return the Angeling's Halo this instant!",
    ["TimelineText7104303"]="Wait? Are you coming after me, for this?",
    ["TimelineText7104304"]="How dare you steal it!",
    ["TimelineText7104305"]="Filthy thieves!",
    ["TimelineText7104306"]="You've gone too far!",
    ["TimelineText7104307"]="Why won't you listen to reason? You want the Halo?",
    ["TimelineText7104308"]="Take it!",
    ["TimelineText7104309"]="Caws—caw—caw!",
    ["TimelineText7104310"]="Thieves... You... You actually...",
    ["TimelineText7104311"]="The Angeling will not let you get away with this!",
    ["TimelineText7104312"]="Stop! You don't seem like an evil monster... So why would you bullying my students?",
    ["TimelineText7104501"]="You've come at just the right moment!",
    ["TimelineText7104502"]="Quickly help me catch a fish!",
    ["TimelineText7104701"]="Everyone heading to Criatura Academy—jump aboard! We're about to set sail!",
    ["TimelineText7104801"]="The ship will arrive at Izlude Island very soon, so get ready to go ashore!",
    ["TimelineText7104901"]="That night,",
    ["TimelineText7104902"]="I was making my rounds of the palace alone.",
    ["TimelineText7104903"]="I discovered footprints in one of the hallways.",
    ["TimelineText7105001"]="Before I could figure out where they came from,",
    ["TimelineText7105002"]="a group of filthy monsters appeared",
    ["TimelineText7105003"]="and surrounded me.",
    ["TimelineText7105101"]="I defeated the crazed monsters.",
    ["TimelineText7105102"]="I proceeded into the temple.",
    ["TimelineText7105103"]="Until I came to the courtyard in front of the treasury.",
    ["TimelineText7105201"]="The alchemist spoke so convincingly",
    ["TimelineText7105202"]="that I believed him.",
    ["TimelineText7105203"]="So I rushed into the treasury,",
    ["TimelineText7105301"]="but when I got back,",
    ["TimelineText7105302"]="the alchemist had already vanished.",
    ["TimelineText7105303"]="That's when I knew I had been duped...",
    ["TimelineText7105401"]="The successor...",
    ["TimelineText7105402"]="of Odin's bloodline?",
    ["TimelineText7105601"]="Impetuous wretches! How dare you defy me!",
    ["TimelineText7105901"]="I am Captain Hallam of the Royal Chivalry",
    ["TimelineText7105902"]="I am Commander Bernard of Kingdom Defense Force!\n",
    ["TimelineText7105903"]="I am here in your honor!",
    ["TimelineText7106001"]="How long is this going to take...?",
    ["TimelineText7106002"]="Quick, now you can go find the Great Earth!",
    ["TimelineText7106003"]="Thieving scum!",
    ["TimelineText7106101"]="You dare defile the Pharaoh's tomb?",
    ["TimelineText7106102"]="Then pay the price for offending my honor!",
    ["TimelineText7106201"]="Eassis...",
    ["TimelineText7106202"]="My queen...",
    ["TimelineText7106203"]="Are you still among the living?",
    ["TimelineText7106301"]="Why won't you turn around and look at me?",
    ["TimelineText7106302"]="Since you saved me from the ocean waves...",
    ["TimelineText7106303"]="I...",
    ["TimelineText7106501"]="When the incident occurred,",
    ["TimelineText7106502"]="I was praying at the Holy Altar.",
    ["TimelineText7106503"]="But a sudden vibration interrupted me...",
    ["TimelineText7106601"]="When I arrived outside the temple,",
    ["TimelineText7106602"]="I was stopped by the Mermen guarding this area.",
    ["TimelineText7106603"]="It seemed like their consciousness was being controlled by some kind of force...",
    ["TimelineText7106701"]="After defeating the Mermen,",
    ["TimelineText7106702"]="Let's move on! Stay alert!",
    ["TimelineText7106703"]="There I saw the shocking scene...",
    ["TimelineText7106801"]="After the princess stripped the Scale from Lord Nield's chest,",
    ["TimelineText7106802"]="he completely lost his mind.",
    ["TimelineText7106803"]="And that is just the beginning...",
    ["TimelineText7106901"]="Lucia!!!",
    ["TimelineText7107001"]="Well, then... Let us begin!",
    ["TimelineText7107002"]="Alright!",
    ["TimelineText7107003"]="Now, the Job Advancement Ceremony officially begins.",
    ["TimelineText7107004"]="This must be... a new strength!",
    ["TimelineText7107005"]="Almighty Valkyrie, the young hero who stands before you",
    ["TimelineText7107006"]="has proven his extraordinary talent and purity of heart,",
    ["TimelineText7107007"]="becoming a fully-fledged Adventurer.",
    ["TimelineText7107008"]="May courage be his blade, and friendship his armor.",
    ["TimelineText7107009"]="May he march fearlessly along the path of justice,",
    ["TimelineText7107010"]="and may he write his own legendary chapter in the book of adventure.",
    ["TimelineText7107011"]="The path to the future will be interspersed with uncertainty and hope.",
    ["TimelineText7107012"]="All one can do is heed your inner voice of justice—the guidance of the Valkyrie!",
    ["TimelineText7107013"]="And so, I hereby declare that you have now qualified as a full-fledged <color=#CA2E0AFF>Second Class</color> adventurer.",
    ["TimelineText7107201"]="Countless brave adventurers",
    ["TimelineText7107202"]="are recognized by Odin",
    ["TimelineText7107203"]="and granted newfound strength here.",
    ["TimelineText7107204"]="They are the hope of the Rune Kingdom...",
    ["TimelineText7107205"]="No, the hope of all Midgard.",
    ["TimelineText7107206"]="And today, it is for this reason that you will be honored.",
    ["TimelineText7107207"]="Adventurer, are you ready?",
    ["TimelineText7107208"]="And now, The Job Advancement Ceremony has officially begun.",
    ["TimelineText7107209"]="Lord Odin, behold the brave hero standing before you.",
    ["TimelineText7107210"]="His courage inspires the world.",
    ["TimelineText7107211"]="His wisdom leads the world.",
    ["TimelineText7107212"]="He is the light and hope of this world.",
    ["TimelineText7107213"]="He will leave an unforgettable legacy",
    ["TimelineText7107214"]="in the land of Midgard.",
    ["TimelineText7107215"]="Where the power of Odin shines brightest—",
    ["TimelineText7107216"]="that shall be where his adventure ends!",
    ["TimelineText7107217"]="Adventurer... Are you willing to swear,",
    ["TimelineText7107218"]="that even in the darkest fog, the light of justice will always shine in your heart?",
    ["TimelineText7107219"]="I swear... I shall uphold the justice within my heart.",
    ["TimelineText7107220"]="Congratulations, you have obtained Odin's approval.",
    ["TimelineText7107221"]="And now, I hereby declare that you as a <color=#CA2E0AFF> Second Job</color> adventurer.",
    ["TimelineText7107301"]="That night, I was enjoying a drink alone, admiring the moon.",
    ["TimelineText7107302"]="Suddenly, I heard a noise coming from my father's room",
    ["TimelineText7107303"]="and decided to go check it out...",
    ["TimelineText7107401"]="My father has always been cautious, so I was surprised to see his door wide open that day.",
    ["TimelineText7107402"]="Just as I was about to enter the room and check it out,",
    ["TimelineText7107403"]="A bunch of monsters poured out, and I had to fight back!",
    ["TimelineText7107501"]="Afterward, I investigated the Lord's Residence and found several signs of a struggle.",
    ["TimelineText7107502"]="There were indications at the scene that",
    ["TimelineText7107503"]="my father had been kidnapped...",
    ["TimelineText7107701"]="What have you done to Lord Euin?",
    ["TimelineText7107702"]="Haha, don't worry...",
    ["TimelineText7107703"]="First the girl, then Lord Euin.",
    ["TimelineText7107704"]="You'll all become my puppets!",
    ["TimelineText7107705"]="You're out of your mind!",
    ["TimelineText7107801"]="Again...",
    ["TimelineText7107802"]="Again you've foiled my plans!",
    ["TimelineText7107803"]="I won't let you get away this time!",
    ["TimelineText7107804"]="Oh yeah?... Heh heh...",
    ["TimelineText7107805"]="Then I'll take Lord Euin down with me!",
    ["TimelineText7107901"]="Just before the wedding, Bohr went to the sewers.",
    ["TimelineText7107902"]="We located the research site of the alchemist Baroshev.",
    ["TimelineText7107903"]="There, Bohr made some discoveries...",
    ["TimelineText7108001"]="When I fed the toxin to the Lunatic,",
    ["TimelineText7108002"]="something terrible happened.",
    ["TimelineText7108003"]="The Lunatic suddenly turned into a monster!",
    ["TimelineText7108101"]="Earlier in the day, I was training the Defense Force soldiers at the South Gate",
    ["TimelineText7108102"]="and noticed that one of the soldiers, Chino, was missing.",
    ["TimelineText7108103"]="So I went looking for him everywhere...",
    ["TimelineText7108201"]="After that, I told Bohr about everything I saw.",
    ["TimelineText7108202"]="But he asked me to keep it a secret.",
    ["TimelineText7108203"]="I did until the horrible incident at the wedding...",
    ["TimelineText7108301"]="That person ran straight to the sewer entrance after leaving the church.",
    ["TimelineText7108302"]="I followed closely behind him",
    ["TimelineText7108303"]="until I reached a drainage pipe...",
    ["TimelineText7108401"]="A swarm of vile Thief Bugs suddenly appeared,",
    ["TimelineText7108402"]="preventing my pursuit.",
    ["TimelineText7108403"]="I had to get rid of these monsters first...",
    ["TimelineText7108501"]="After dealing with the Mutant Thief Bugs,",
    ["TimelineText7108502"]="I continued but found myself at a place where Hobos gathered.",
    ["TimelineText7108701"]="I'm... alive!",
    ["TimelineText7108702"]="Geffen... Revenge!",
    ["TimelineText7108703"]="Of course!",
    ["TimelineText7108704"]="With the blessing of dark elemental power, you are unstoppable.",
    ["TimelineText7108705"]="That's...",
    ["TimelineText7108706"]="The lost artifact!?",
    ["TimelineText7108707"]="Lost? This belongs to The Darkness.",
    ["TimelineText7108708"]="It has merely returned to its rightful owner.",
    ["TimelineText7108709"]="Go. It's time, now.",
    ["TimelineText7108710"]="Claim vengeance on your enemies!",
    ["TimelineText7108801"]="Are you sure...?",
    ["TimelineText7108802"]="You wish to declare war on your brother?",
    ["TimelineText7108803"]="I have always obeyed my brother.",
    ["TimelineText7108804"]="I thought our tribe was invincible...",
    ["TimelineText7108805"]="But the Orcs today...",
    ["TimelineText7108806"]="Are not even willing to sacrifice a baby!",
    ["TimelineText7108807"]="Yes, I will declare war on the lord.",
    ["TimelineText7108808"]="And victory... will stand on the side of justice!",
    ["TimelineText7108901"]="Hah! You wish to take that which is not yours?",
    ["TimelineText7108902"]="...You again!",
    ["TimelineText7108903"]="Let go of my child, you scum!",
    ["TimelineText7108904"]="Tut, tut, tut...",
    ["TimelineText7108905"]="Your child?",
    ["TimelineText7108906"]="No, this is now a vessel for dark energy.",
    ["TimelineText7108907"]="Don't worry.",
    ["TimelineText7108908"]="The Darkness will make it our mightiest warrior!",
    ["TimelineText7108909"]="No!!!",
    ["TimelineText7109001"]="After a thousand years, the moment has finally arrived...",
    ["TimelineText7109002"]="It is ours once more!",
    ["TimelineText7109003"]="Don't delude yourself.",
    ["TimelineText7109004"]="The Fragment of Ymir's Heart never belonged to...",
    ["TimelineText7109005"]="...Urgh!",
    ["TimelineText7109006"]="Ah... This power!",
    ["TimelineText7109007"]="It's unbelievable!",
    ["TimelineText7109008"]="In the past, only Merlin could stand against us...",
    ["TimelineText7109009"]="But now Merlin is dead.",
    ["TimelineText7109010"]="You are all that remains.",
    ["TimelineText7109011"]="How could you possibly hope to stop The Darkness from returning!",
    ["TimelineText7109012"]="And what about us?",
    ["TimelineText7109013"]="Dracula, do you really believe that...",
    ["TimelineText7109014"]="...There is no one in the world who can stand against you!",
    ["TimelineText7109015"]="The Pentagram... and this Adventurer...",
    ["TimelineText7109016"]="It seems you've underestimated their power!",
    ["TimelineText7109017"]="Adventurer, we will cast a spell to weaken Dracula...",
    ["TimelineText7109018"]="It's up to you to deal the final blow!",
    ["TimelineText7109201"]="On that night, I was going back to my room to rest.",
    ["TimelineText7109202"]="I was walking down the hall, when I discovered...",
    ["TimelineText7109301"]="A strange situation.",
    ["TimelineText7109302"]="Attendant Wheeler appeared beside me.",
    ["TimelineText7109303"]="But an identical face appeared in front of me.",
    ["TimelineText7109304"]="I know, but you must calm down...",
    ["TimelineText7109401"]="Well, who would never have guessed... There's actually a potion!",
    ["TimelineText7109402"]="It makes people become close confidants!",
    ["TimelineText7109403"]="Since then, I don't even dare to believe anyone.",
    ["TimelineText7109501"]="King of Glast Heim...",
    ["TimelineText7109502"]="I am Hermes, a Valkyrie who serves under Lord Odin...",
    ["TimelineText7109503"]="Lord Odin ordered my presents here,",
    ["TimelineText7109504"]="I‘m to retrieve the Fragment of Ymir's Heart that had fallen here during the realm of the gods great war..",
    ["TimelineText7109505"]="There's no hurry. Make yourself comfortable and enjoy a glass of wine, why don't you?",
    ["TimelineText7109506"]="This is how we humans do things...",
    ["TimelineText7109507"]="So what about that marriage proposal, I guess you won't reconsider?",
    ["TimelineText7109508"]="Don't you dare...",
    ["TimelineText7109509"]="Huh? Maybe you just don't understand how serious I am about this!",
    ["TimelineText7109510"]="In that case, I'll simply send this box every day...",
    ["TimelineText7109511"]="To show you what lies in my heart!",
    ["TimelineText7109512"]="Lady Hermes... Lady Hermes!",
    ["TimelineText7109513"]="Quickly, my lady, come with me. We don't have much time.",
    ["TimelineText7109514"]="You...?",
    ["TimelineText7109515"]="I know what that awful King has done. I can't stand by and watch you suffer... Please my lady!",
    ["TimelineText7109516"]="No!!!",
    ["TimelineText7109601"]="Commander, something's happening in the city! ",
    ["TimelineText7109602"]="I've just received word from the guard on patrol. He...",
    ["TimelineText7109603"]="This...",
    ["TimelineText7109604"]="Glast Heim will soon become a den of monsters.",
    ["TimelineText7109605"]="Whether you believe it or not...",
    ["TimelineText7109606"]="Seems like you are the only one who understands.",
    ["TimelineText7109607"]="That's why I told you this.",
    ["TimelineText7109608"]="Also, King Schmidt isn't missing.",
    ["TimelineText7109609"]="The king is trapped underground.",
    ["TimelineText7109610"]="If you could only see the truth,",
    ["TimelineText7109611"]="There might still be a chance.",
    ["TimelineText7109612"]="Is it possible, could the Sage's word hold some ounce of truth?",
    ["TimelineText7109613"]="Underground... In the sewers?",
    ["TimelineText7109614"]="Oh no!",
    ["TimelineText7109615"]="Gerhardt, come with me to the sewers—now!",
    ["TimelineText7109701"]="This sick tyrant... Ending the lives of so many innocent...",
    ["TimelineText7109702"]="The fiend... has gone mad with greed...",
    ["TimelineText7109703"]="Ah... Help! Help me!",
    ["TimelineText7109801"]="Ah... There it is, such power.",
    ["TimelineText7109802"]="It was hidden beneath the city, just as I thought...",
    ["TimelineText7109803"]="That belongs to me!",
    ["TimelineText7109804"]="Foul creature... It would seem this power is your so obsession!",
    ["TimelineText7109805"]="Dare not look away, Behold the power of the furture!",
    ["TimelineText7109806"]="Waaah... Mama, Mama...",
    ["TimelineText7109807"]="Hurry, protect the citizens while they evacuate! Knights, muster your courage!",
    ["TimelineText7109808"]="Since you made a special journery to give me this gift...",
    ["TimelineText7109809"]="I will gladly accept it! Gahahahaha!",
    ["TimelineText7109810"]="This... is... our future?",
    ["TimelineText7109811"]="Witness the power of merely a Fragment of Ymir's Heart.",
    ["TimelineText7109812"]="Dare not look away. Behold the power of future!",
    ["TimelineText7109813"]="You brought this to...?",
    ["TimelineText7109814"]="Tremble with fear, It was I who handed the fragment to Demon King Morroc...",
    ["TimelineText7109815"]="It was I who brought this city to the ground with the power of the demons.",
    ["TimelineText7109816"]="The darkness will continue, and I will destroy you myself...",
    ["TimelineText7109817"]="Your soul will forever be a prisoner, linger in a sinful abyss of your own foul creation,",
    ["TimelineText7109818"]="Never again shall it see the light of day!",
    ["TimelineText7109901"]="I smell...",
    ["TimelineText7109902"]="The scent of Ymir's Heart...",
    ["TimelineText7109903"]="This is...!?",
    ["TimelineText7109904"]="...a god?",
    ["TimelineText7109905"]="How can this be...?",
    ["TimelineText7109906"]="But from the looks of you...",
    ["TimelineText7109907"]="Well, you look like we could be related!",
    ["TimelineText7109908"]="Since you made a special trip to give me this gift...",
    ["TimelineText7109909"]="Then I will accept it graciously! Gahahahaha!",
    ["TimelineText7110501"]="It's... you...",
    ["TimelineText7110502"]="...Wait Thanatos, no!",
    ["TimelineText7110601"]="Ara..bawoola-bunka?",
    ["TimelineText7110602"]="Ah... The Gods smile upon your piety...",
    ["TimelineText7110603"]="A true blessing from the heavens!",
    ["TimelineText7110604"]="...Wa...wata-bajinoo...? Awoogaga!",
    ["TimelineText7110605"]="Ah... May the Gods bless all that the light touches...",
    ["TimelineText7110606"]="All poverty will be eliminated... All disease will be cured!",
    ["TimelineText7110701"]="You... You atrocious wretch!",
    ["TimelineText7110801"]="......",
    ["TimelineText7110802"]="Farther?",
    ["TimelineText7110901"]="This moment... I've waited so long for it to come.",
    ["TimelineText7110902"]="Today, my heart finally found its home!",
    ["TimelineText7110903"]="This loving oath... has touched my heart.",
    ["TimelineText7110904"]="Now, it's time for the gods to witness the love in your hearts.",
    ["TimelineText7110905"]="In the name of Odin, we make our oath here today—",
    ["TimelineText7110906"]="From today on, not the rising sun, nor the dark of night shall separate us.",
    ["TimelineText7110907"]="From today on, we will share our triumphs and strife alike.",
    ["TimelineText7110908"]="We will never give up... We shall be together until we are old and gray.",
    ["TimelineText7110909"]="Until the Valkyrie sings our final song...",
    ["TimelineText7110910"]="The story of our lives will be engraved upon each other's soul!",
    ["TimelineText7111001"]="It is a great honor to host this glorious wedding for you.",
    ["TimelineText7111002"]="And now, I hope to hear your truest vows...",
    ["TimelineText7111003"]="Will you unite eternally with the one standing before you?",
    ["TimelineText7111004"]="For better or for worse, for richer or poorer...",
    ["TimelineText7111005"]="In sickness and in health, through happiness and sorrow...",
    ["TimelineText7111006"]="Will you love him, respect him, and cherish him...",
    ["TimelineText7111007"]="And always be loyal to him, till death do you part?",
    ["TimelineText7111008"]="I do.",
    ["TimelineText7111009"]="Will you unite eternally with the one standing before you?",
    ["TimelineText7111010"]="For better or for worse, for richer or poorer...",
    ["TimelineText7111011"]="In sickness and in health, through happiness and sorrow...",
    ["TimelineText7111012"]="Will you love him, respect him, and cherish him...",
    ["TimelineText7111013"]="And always be loyal to him, till death do you part?",
    ["TimelineText7111014"]="I do.",
    ["TimelineText7111015"]="Then, under Odin's gaze, please exchange rings.",
    ["TimelineText7111016"]="I now pronounce you...",
    ["TimelineText7111017"]="Partners for life!",
    ["TimelineText7111301"]="Quickly! —Now!",
    ["TimelineText7111401"]="Stealing company property, eh? Do you really think you can escape me?",
    ["TimelineText7111402"]="However, if you tell me where the magic doll is...",
    ["TimelineText7111403"]="No... Never...!",
    ["TimelineText7111404"]="You sound confident, old man.",
    ["TimelineText7111405"]="Well, all that's left is to ask you to die!",
    ["TimelineText7111406"]="Enough!",
    ["TimelineText7111407"]="Adventurer, you be advised to mind your own business...",
    ["TimelineText7111408"]="Otherwise, I'll have to deal with you first.",
    ["TimelineText7111501"]="Quick... Stop him!",
    ["TimelineText7111502"]="Finally, I have found the Fragment of Ymir's Heart.",
    ["TimelineText7111503"]="Stop it! You'll die!",
    ["TimelineText7111504"]="What? It's just a trapped magic doll... What can it do?",
    ["TimelineText7111505"]="H... How... How can this be?",
    ["TimelineText7111601"]="Aaron, if only I had been there for you...",
    ["TimelineText7111602"]="Perhaps our story would have had a different ending...",
    ["TimelineText7111603"]="But that doesn't matter anymore...",
    ["TimelineText7111604"]="Because from today on... we'll be together, forever.",
    ["TimelineText7111701"]="No more suffering...",
    ["TimelineText7111702"]="It's time, to rest... in peace.",
    ["TimelineText7111901"]="Sorry about this...",
    ["TimelineText7111902"]="Much appreciated, Adventurer.",
    ["TimelineText7111903"]="Unfortunately for you, the truth you seek is here.",
    ["TimelineText7111904"]="You must guard this with your life, it is your responsibility. I'm trusting you to get this to Bohr.",
    ["TimelineText7111905"]="After you awaken, after everything has come to an end...",
    ["TimelineText7112601"]="I would have expected more than one person to turn up after all that fanfare.",
    ["TimelineText7112602"]="One person is enough!",
    ["TimelineText7112603"]="Such arrogance and lack of fear towards all living beings. You are indeed human.",
    ["TimelineText7112604"]="A lone outsider who challenges me, are you after this fragment?",
    ["TimelineText7112605"]="To end the terror of you dragons.",
    ["TimelineText7112606"]="Hmph. It's just like you humans to judge so quickly.",
    ["TimelineText7112607"]="Looks like you're not fully aware of what happened in the past.",
    ["TimelineText7112608"]="Has it ever occurred to you that if the violent rule of the dragons makes us evil...",
    ["TimelineText7112609"]="then what of the humans who brought war to Comodo in an effort to drive us away,",
    ["TimelineText7112610"]="Leaving a terrible path of unbelievable death and destruction everywhere they decided to go! Are they Considered good?",
    ["TimelineText7112611"]="...Some sacrifices are inevitable in order to uphold justice.",
    ["TimelineText7112612"]="...Justice?",
    ["TimelineText7112613"]="Very well then. Herald of \"Justice\"...",
    ["TimelineText7112614"]="Here I am. Do it.",
    ["TimelineText7112701"]="Ha! Haha.",
    ["TimelineText7112702"]="Calling other races evil for being avaricious...",
    ["TimelineText7112703"]="Yet claiming themselves to be just, despite being murderers.",
    ["TimelineText7112704"]="Ultimately, it is you who are greedy and cruel.",
    ["TimelineText7112705"]="You are no different from us!",
    ["TimelineText7112706"]="...",
    ["TimelineText7112707"]="Ah, or is it precisely because of this?",
    ["TimelineText7112708"]="Yes, it is.",
    ["TimelineText7112709"]="Because we're the same...",
    ["TimelineText7112710"]="That's why only one of us can exist.",
    ["TimelineText7112801"]="Now, the Job Advancement Ceremony officially begins.",
    ["TimelineText7112802"]="Almighty Odin, Lord of the Gods,",
    ["TimelineText7112803"]="Please hear this Adventurer's devout wish.",
    ["TimelineText7112804"]="He has crossed the infinite abyss, but he still has compassion.",
    ["TimelineText7112805"]="He has braved unimaginable dangers, but has never lost hope.",
    ["TimelineText7112806"]="From now on, may darkness never obscure his eyes from the truth,",
    ["TimelineText7112807"]="and no misfortune ever stop him from moving onward.",
    ["TimelineText7112808"]="May the runes grant him their protection, and may the light always be with him.",
    ["TimelineText7112809"]="May he forever hold the great God Odin's esteem.",
    ["TimelineText7112810"]="Congratulations",
    ["TimelineText7112811"]="You are now a qualified Third Class Adventurer.",
    ["TimelineText7113101"]="Bar... bara...",
    ["TimelineText7113401"]="If you wish to survive, do not set foot out there.",
    ["TimelineText7113501"]="Don't be afraid... You know what must be done now.",
    ["TimelineText7113502"]="By sacrificing myself, others can emerge victorious.",
    ["TimelineText7113503"]="So please... Take your dagger, and drive it straight through my chest...",
    ["TimelineText7113504"]="There is no reason for you to accept such a tragic fate.",
    ["TimelineText7113505"]="Destiny has already guided me to this place...",
    ["TimelineText7113506"]="I don't wish to become any more pitiful than I already am.",
    ["TimelineText7113507"]="I am not like you... Killing me will not steep your hearts in sin.",
    ["TimelineText7113508"]="You know... The reason I survived as a child...",
    ["TimelineText7113509"]="Was because a certain knight rescued me on the battlefield.",
    ["TimelineText7113510"]="Though he wore the armor of the enemy, he was just like you.",
    ["TimelineText7113511"]="He knelt down and offered me his hand without hesitation.",
    ["TimelineText7113512"]="I never got to ask him his name...",
    ["TimelineText7113513"]="But later, there was a girl who died under similar circumstances.",
    ["TimelineText7113514"]="She told me that his name was \"Holy Fire.\"",
    ["TimelineText7113515"]="She wished me luck in finding more people like us.",
    ["TimelineText7113516"]="Souls that have been saved by the knight named Holy Fire.",
    ["TimelineText7113517"]="So that I could tell them that if they ever meet our savior again...",
    ["TimelineText7113518"]="To never make any choices that they might regret.",
    ["TimelineText7113519"]="And today, right here...",
    ["TimelineText7113520"]="I finally have the chance to meet my savior once more.",
    ["TimelineText7113521"]="So he was Holy Fire Knight all along!",
    ["TimelineText7113522"]="No wonder that cross-shaped shield looked so familiar...",
    ["TimelineText7113523"]="Holy Fire Knight saved my life, as well...",
    ["TimelineText7113524"]="He saved us twice...",
    ["TimelineText7113525"]="And in return, we almost...!",
    ["TimelineText7113526"]="Please... If anyone wants to win, then take me instead!",
    ["TimelineText7113527"]="Me, too! I've always wanted to be free, as well!",
    ["TimelineText7113601"]="These are... A real symbol of a king's authority!",
    ["TimelineText7113602"]="Tell me, Archbishop... By obtaining them...",
    ["TimelineText7113603"]="Will I command the same power as that of a king?",
    ["TimelineText7113604"]="Now...",
    ["TimelineText7113605"]="Answer me, Archbishop.",
    ["TimelineText7113606"]="Yes... Or no?",
    ["TimelineText7113607"]="... Yes.",
    ["TimelineText7113608"]="Oh? Then that means...",
    ["TimelineText7113609"]="No matter what I say next...",
    ["TimelineText7113610"]="Or what I do next...",
    ["TimelineText7113611"]="There shall never be anyone to oppose me ever again?",
    ["TimelineText7113701"]="I won't say it again! Kneel to me... Or die!",
    ["TimelineText7113702"]="You appear to be under the impression that I am joking, yes?",
    ["TimelineText7113703"]="Which is why I have decided...",
    ["TimelineText7113704"]="To choose the one person who is least likely to kneel to me and make them face the blade...",
    ["TimelineText7113705"]="That would be you... My dear father.",
    ["TimelineText7113706"]="What's most amusing is that you all believed we were on the same side...",
    ["TimelineText7113707"]="He never was! And he never will be!",
    ["TimelineText7113708"]="As my staunchest opponent...",
    ["TimelineText7113709"]="He has plotted to hinder me at every turn.",
    ["TimelineText7113710"]="Now let my father serve as an example...",
    ["TimelineText7113711"]="A testament to my resolve for all of you to see! ",
    ["TimelineText7113712"]="No, Azer!",
    ["TimelineText7113713"]="Noooo!!!",
    ["TimelineText7113801"]="N-No…",
    ["TimelineText7113802"]="Darn it... At this rate, it won't survive!",
    ["TimelineText7113803"]="Water... The lake's water…",
    ["TimelineText7113901"]="The Mirror Lake is a lake of prophecy.",
    ["TimelineText7113902"]="Visions of the future are known to appear on the water's surface occasionally.",
    ["TimelineText7113903"]="That day, when the Spirit Tree looked over the lake...",
    ["TimelineText7113904"]="She saw the future of the forest, a day that would soon arrive.",
    ["TimelineText7113905"]="In her vision, the sky had fallen into perpetual night.",
    ["TimelineText7113906"]="Deprived of sunlight and sight, the creatures of the forest soon descended into madness.",
    ["TimelineText7113907"]="As the inheritors of the Yggdrasil's strength...",
    ["TimelineText7113908"]="The Miwa transformed their energy into an immense, arcane power.",
    ["TimelineText7113909"]="They crystallized their own vines...",
    ["TimelineText7113910"]="And their glowing tendrils served to light the way for the rest of the forest's inhabitants.",
    ["TimelineText7113911"]="But their light did little to slake the thirst of the diurnal creatures.",
    ["TimelineText7113912"]="Soon, they began to force the Miwa into crystallizing their entire bodies.",
    ["TimelineText7113913"]="They cared little for the survival of the benevolent spirits, who sought only to offer them respite from the dark.",
    ["TimelineText7113914"]="Upon seeing this, the Spirit Tree was filled with an overwhelming sense of pain and grief.",
    ["TimelineText7113915"]="She sees the Miwa as her very own children.",
    ["TimelineText7113916"]="More than anything, she desperately wanted to save them from such a tragic fate.",
    ["TimelineText7113917"]="No matter the cost...",
    ["TimelineText7113918"]="The Spirit Tree looked upon the waters of the Mirror Lake once again...",
    ["TimelineText7113919"]="And her reflection in the lake, clear as crystal, stared back at her.",
    ["TimelineText7113920"]="Only... Her branches in the reflection glowed with a faint light.",
    ["TimelineText7113921"]="As though reminding her of the power she possesses...",
    ["TimelineText7113922"]="As though telling her how to use this power...",
    ["TimelineText7113923"]="The Spirit Tree understood the message.",
    ["TimelineText7113924"]="She chose to take the place of the Miwa in the prophecy.",
    ["TimelineText7113925"]="Using the same arcane power, she crystallized her entire form.",
    ["TimelineText7113926"]="Before the endless night descended upon them...",
    ["TimelineText7113927"]="Her now-crystal canopy, large enough to block out the skies over the forest...",
    ["TimelineText7113928"]="Would serve as a guiding light for the Miwa and for all.",
    ["TimelineText7113929"]="The arcane power all but destroyed the Spirit Tree's body.",
    ["TimelineText7113930"]="The Water Heart, which was in her possession at the time, was also shattered.",
    ["TimelineText7113931"]="But the heart of the Spirit Tree was still alive and well.",
    ["TimelineText7113932"]="And her heart felt relief and satisfaction unlike any other.",
    ["TimelineText7114001"]="P-Poison... Help... Die...",
    ["TimelineText7114002"]="Man... Beetle... Heart...",
    ["TimelineText7114003"]="Betrayal... Forest...",
    ["TimelineText7114004"]="Heart... Broken... Wind Heart...",
    ["TimelineText7114101"]="That day, a mysterious man came to see Uba.",
    ["TimelineText7114102"]="He said that the poison was spreading out from the lands to the southeast.",
    ["TimelineText7114103"]="And that they would infect this forest soon enough...",
    ["TimelineText7114104"]="The man brought out a handful of soil taken from the poisoned lands.",
    ["TimelineText7114105"]="After placing a freshly-picked flower on the soil, it quickly began to wither away. This was the proof he offered.",
    ["TimelineText7114106"]="\"You have but two ways to save your forest, and only two,\" said the man.",
    ["TimelineText7114107"]="\"The choice falls to you alone.\"",
    ["TimelineText7114108"]="The first is to sacrifice the Beetle King.",
    ["TimelineText7114109"]="The insects eat sand and rocks to sustain themselves.",
    ["TimelineText7114110"]="If they were to be trapped in the poisoned lands of the southeast...",
    ["TimelineText7114111"]="They, too, would only have two options. Eat the tainted soil... Or starve.",
    ["TimelineText7114112"]="Naturally, the former would also cause the beetle's demise.",
    ["TimelineText7114113"]="But in this way, the poison's spread will be halted.",
    ["TimelineText7114114"]="This is the safest and most effective method.",
    ["TimelineText7114115"]="The second... Is to work together with the Beetle King.",
    ["TimelineText7114116"]="So long as the insects ingest enough carbon jade...",
    ["TimelineText7114117"]="The effects of the poisoned soil will be nullified.",
    ["TimelineText7114118"]="You would be saving them from certain death.",
    ["TimelineText7114119"]="But you must first offer them enough carbon jade, Uba.",
    ["TimelineText7114120"]="Only then will they consider helping you purge the poison from the southeastern lands.",
    ["TimelineText7114121"]="However, this may still result in your people's demise.",
    ["TimelineText7114122"]="Carbon jade has always been the source of the Wootan tribe's strength.",
    ["TimelineText7114123"]="Without it, they could never have taken over the forest.",
    ["TimelineText7114124"]="To share it with others is to willingly deplete their own strength.",
    ["TimelineText7114125"]="If the insects choose to renege on their word...",
    ["TimelineText7114126"]="The Wootan tribe will be easily wiped out.",
    ["TimelineText7114127"]="The last few words that the man spoke were as clear as day.",
    ["TimelineText7114128"]="Images of betrayal assaulted Uba's consciousness without pause.",
    ["TimelineText7114129"]="This is what drove his decision to leave in the dead of night.",
    ["TimelineText7114130"]="To use the Wind's Roar, a technique passed down to him by his father...",
    ["TimelineText7114131"]="And blow the Beetle King away and into the poisoned lands to the southeast.",
    ["TimelineText7114132"]="Afterward, he ordered his people to trap the Beetle King's subjects there, as well.",
    ["TimelineText7114133"]="But the poison's spread did not stop... If anything, it began to spread with even more intensity.",
    ["TimelineText7114134"]="Uba, sensing something was amiss, retrieved the carcass of one of the dead insects.",
    ["TimelineText7114135"]="After extracting the poison from its body, he compared it to the poison in the nearby vegetation...",
    ["TimelineText7114136"]="And found that they were not the same.",
    ["TimelineText7114137"]="He then drew blood from his own body to compare it with the two poisons...",
    ["TimelineText7114138"]="And found that the poison in his veins matched the one found in the plants.",
    ["TimelineText7114139"]="As he reeled from the shock of his discovery, the Wind Heart let out a resounding crack.",
    ["TimelineText7114201"]="Hmph... How very meaningless.",
    ["TimelineText7114202"]="O-Odin!!!",
    ["TimelineText7114301"]="Hurry! Take back the Sacred Relic...",
    ["TimelineText7114302"]="What are you waiting for?!",
    ["TimelineText7114303"]="My, my... With power such as this...",
    ["TimelineText7114304"]="He should have no problem slaughtering them.",
    ["TimelineText7114305"]="Are you really so unconcerned about this?",
    ["TimelineText7114306"]="N-No...",
    ["TimelineText7114307"]="Don't kill them!!",
    ["TimelineText7114308"]="Hmph. This is the reason...",
    ["TimelineText7114309"]="Why humans will never amount to anything.",
    ["TimelineText7114310"]="It's too late now!",
    ["TimelineText7114311"]="Power... More power!!!",
    ["TimelineText7114312"]="Rise, my undead warriors!",
    ["TimelineText7114313"]="Y-You! What is this...?",
    ["TimelineText7114314"]="Noooo!!!",
    ["TimelineText7114401"]="Surrender, fools. The power you face...",
    ["TimelineText7114402"]="Is beyond even Odin's comprehension!",
    ["TimelineText7114403"]="I shall bury you under its might!",
    ["TimelineText7114501"]="You... This...",
    ["TimelineText7114502"]="None can violate the bindings of a Soul Contract!",
    ["TimelineText7114503"]="I already know everything, and I accept it all...",
    ["TimelineText7114504"]="I will not forget myself ever again.",
    ["TimelineText7114505"]="Tell me, demon... Have you forgotten the restraints of the summoning ritual?",
    ["TimelineText7114506"]="I, Hibram, summoner of the greater demon, Beelzebub...",
    ["TimelineText7114507"]="No... Shut up! Shut up, curse you!",
    ["TimelineText7114508"]="One of the Twelve Bishops of Arunafeltz...",
    ["TimelineText7114509"]="I'll... I'll slaughter you!!!",
    ["TimelineText7114510"]="Hereby command you to return to the world from whence you came!",
    ["TimelineText7114511"]="May you never set foot in Midgard for all eternity!!",
    ["TimelineText7114601"]="S-Stay away...!",
    ["TimelineText7114602"]="No...! Don't kill me!!",
    ["TimelineText7114603"]="Let him go!",
    ["TimelineText7114604"]="Stay still! Just hold it like this!",
    ["TimelineText7114605"]="I will break the chip on its neck!",
    ["TimelineText7114606"]="Like what I did just now, attack the chip controller behind their neck.",
    ["TimelineText7114607"]="...Can you do it?",
    ["TimelineText7114608"]="Good... Let's go!",
    ["TimelineText7114701"]="Strange... Power...",
    ["TimelineText7114702"]="Must... Banish...",
    ["TimelineText7114703"]="...Yeah? Am I right? Huh?",
    ["TimelineText7114704"]="Machinery is not going to pose a problem. Only people's heart... changes.",
    ["TimelineText7114705"]="Are you saying... he destroyed here on purpose?",
    ["TimelineText7114706"]="...But why?",
    ["TimelineText7114707"]="Who knows? I am not good at dealing with unfathomable people, like you guys.",
    ["TimelineText7114708"]="Anyway, as long as the device is okay, there shouldn't be any problem for us to deliver the task. Right?",
    ["TimelineText7114709"]="...But with the cause unknown, let's better be cautious.",
    ["TimelineText7114710"]="Fine, fine. Then take another look.",
    ["TimelineText7114711"]="My time is money, friend. Shall I be excused now?",
    ["TimelineText7114712"]="Good luck then, secretary.",
    ["TimelineText7114901"]="...Freeze, put your hands up.",
    ["TimelineText7114902"]="Just like this, now stand up slowly.",
    ["TimelineText7114903"]="You...?!",
    ["TimelineText7114904"]="Hmph! Rekenber's lackey!",
    ["TimelineText7114905"]="I have the document on me. Take it if you can!",
    ["TimelineText7115001"]="What are you waiting for? Keep up!",
    ["TimelineText7115101"]="Haven't talked to you for a while, Mr. Khayr.",
    ["TimelineText7115102"]="Haven't seen you for a while.",
    ["TimelineText7115103"]="Looks like you've got yourself some new allies.",
    ["TimelineText7115104"]="So, you are not going to accept our proposal?",
    ["TimelineText7115105"]="...Not in a million years.",
    ["TimelineText7115106"]="I will never sell the consortium.",
    ["TimelineText7115107"]="Who would've thought the ruler of the first consortium in this Republic,",
    ["TimelineText7115108"]="is such an insensible person.",
    ["TimelineText7115109"]="In this case, I...",
    ["TimelineText7115110"]="Have no choice but to teach you a lesson.",
    ["TimelineText7115201"]="Mr Kiel Khayr, our guards has received intel recently,",
    ["TimelineText7115202"]="Accusing you of tampering with the permission of civilian androids and starting a riot by controlling them.",
    ["TimelineText7115203"]="You are now being arrested for disturbance of public order.",
    ["TimelineText7115204"]="Please come with us.",
    ["TimelineText7115205"]="Hold on, Andre.",
    ["TimelineText7115206"]="The warrant of arrest in your hand... Who signed it?",
    ["TimelineText7115207"]="Mr. Philodis, are you questioning the authenticity of this warrant?",
    ["TimelineText7115208"]="Well, be my guest. You can verify it yourself.",
    ["TimelineText7115209"]="The warrant of arrest... seems legit.",
    ["TimelineText7115210"]="If that's the case, then... please,",
    ["TimelineText7115211"]="Mr. Kiel Khayr?",
    ["TimelineText7115212"]="Mr. Khayr... Are you trying to resist arrest?",
    ["TimelineText7115213"]="... Don't look down on me, Kayak.",
    ["TimelineText7115214"]="Khayr Consortium...",
    ["TimelineText7115215"]="Will never be the sitting duck!",
    ["TimelineText7115216"]="Come forth, my guardian!",
    ["TimelineText7115217"]="Defeat them!",
    ["TimelineText7115301"]="Guardian, what are you doing?",
    ["TimelineText7115302"]="Don't hurt these people!",
    ["TimelineText7115303"]="Don't horse around! Get it into sleep mode now!",
    ["TimelineText7115304"]="Noooo!!!",
    ["TimelineText7115305"]="Guar... dian... R-Run...",
    ["TimelineText7115306"]="Hang in there!",
    ["TimelineText7115307"]="Wake up... Wake up! Don't fall asleep!",
    ["TimelineText7115308"]="Master! It stops!",
    ["TimelineText7115401"]="Seems like everything has been sorted out?",
    ["TimelineText7115402"]="...You got it right. He destroyed the device on purpose, which caused the power leakage.",
    ["TimelineText7115403"]="What a genius mechanic. Nothing escapes your eyes.",
    ["TimelineText7115404"]="Ha... Keep the sweet talk to yourself.",
    ["TimelineText7115405"]="The only thing I wish is don't waste my research result...",
    ["TimelineText7115406"]="On that pile of junk.",
    ["TimelineText7115407"]="Understood. I will inform my superiors...",
    ["TimelineText7115408"]="Of your suggestion.",
    ["TimelineText7115501"]="...Managed to turn this into a hot mess",
    ["TimelineText7115502"]="It's classic Kayak, indeed",
    ["TimelineText7115503"]="The only one who wants to escalate this is Kiel Khayr",
    ["TimelineText7115504"]="Mr. Kayak was just helping him out",
    ["TimelineText7115505"]="If he kept hiding in the academy",
    ["TimelineText7115506"]="It was hard for us to take action ",
    ["TimelineText7115507"]="Yet, not only he got out himself",
    ["TimelineText7115508"]="But he also told us the data driver board's whereabouts...",
    ["TimelineText7115509"]="Then, Kayak lit up a fire just right there...",
    ["TimelineText7115510"]="To lure out that old fox Carl?",
    ["TimelineText7115511"]="What a master plan, three birds with one stone",
    ["TimelineText7115512"]="If it wasn't Lyra, Head of the Guard Intelligence Bureau, who's been fanning the fire",
    ["TimelineText7115513"]="I don't think Kayak could pull this off himself",
    ["TimelineText7115514"]="This favor...",
    ["TimelineText7115515"]="How are you going to return it?",
    ["TimelineText7115516"]="Money, status",
    ["TimelineText7115517"]="Whatever she wants",
    ["TimelineText7115518"]="Favor is the least valuable thing in a remunerative relationship",
    ["TimelineText7115519"]="...Oh?",
    ["TimelineText7115520"]="So, what about the one who sent the anonymous letter?",
    ["TimelineText7115521"]="He has both power and fame. Why did he risk it?",
    ["TimelineText7115522"]="If temptation isn't working, how about a little bit of threat?",
    ["TimelineText7115523"]="As long as desire exists...",
    ["TimelineText7115524"]="there will be a soft spot",
    ["TimelineText7115525"]="Yes, humans are different from machines...",
    ["TimelineText7115526"]="They always have their desire",
    ["TimelineText7115527"]="In this case, the model secretary of ours...",
    ["TimelineText7115528"]="Has his selfish desire?",
    ["TimelineText7115529"]="You are teasing me now, Irumina.",
    ["TimelineText7115530"]="Everything of mine...",
    ["TimelineText7115531"]="Is devoted to the \"All-Seeing Eye.\"",
    ["TimelineText7115601"]="...Stop.",
    ["TimelineText7115602"]="Who are you?",
    ["TimelineText7115603"]="Why are you catching these Demotima?",
    ["TimelineText7115604"]="Disobeying the master's command... is not allowed.",
    ["TimelineText7115605"]="Otherwise...",
    ["TimelineText7115606"]="Eliminate.",
    ["TimelineText7115607"]="...Keep her busy! Adventurer!",
    ["TimelineText7115701"]="Are you done?!",
    ["TimelineText7115702"]="Almost... Almost there... Done!",
    ["TimelineText7115703"]="Get out of the way! Adventurer!",
    ["TimelineText7115704"]="...Master.",
    ["TimelineText7115705"]="How have you been, Professor Fulkyn?",
    ["TimelineText7115801"]="Even the father of mechanics was toyed with fate and lost both of his parents.",
    ["TimelineText7115802"]="Blooming in Kiel Khayr's Estate, are flowers of the world-leaver!",
    ["TimelineText7115803"]="The father of mechanics, was once in Juno, a student,",
    ["TimelineText7115804"]="But puzzles baffled others, never was this teen perplexed.",
    ["TimelineText7115805"]="The father of mechanics, was once at Rekensheim, a researcher,",
    ["TimelineText7115806"]="Two years flew by, with the 18th year witnessing a talented highflyer.",
    ["TimelineText7115807"]="Imperishable cogs and parts, crowned you with piety, ",
    ["TimelineText7115808"]="Followers being the machinery, enthroned the score-year youngster. ",
    ["TimelineText7115809"]="The vanguard of the technological leap, the giant of the era!",
    ["TimelineText7115810"]="In your 29 when you stayed forever, the world stopped with you together!",
    ["TimelineText7115811"]="Now your path sees your seekers; your name hears your admirers!",
    ["TimelineText7115812"]="Fred Barr Venter, your name shall live forever!",
    ["TimelineText7116301"]="Everyone here has a pass.",
    ["TimelineText7116302"]="There's no way you're getting in like that.",
    ["TimelineText7116303"]="... How did it go?",
    ["TimelineText7116304"]="It's 52.37 meters more than the last experiment.",
    ["TimelineText7116305"]="... As expected.",
    ["TimelineText7116306"]="Alright, note that down.",
    ["TimelineText7116307"]="Let's move on to the next phase of the experiment.",
    ["TimelineText7116308"]="What's wrong, Adventurer?",
    ["TimelineText7116309"]="What's with the sudden silence?",
    ["TimelineText7116310"]="Just now, it seemed like...",
    ["TimelineText7116311"]="Hey, people at the back, get your passes ready!",
    ["TimelineText7116312"]="We can't stay here any longer.",
    ["TimelineText7116313"]="Let's get to a quiet place and plan this out.",
    ["TimelineText7116401"]="... X series?",
    ["TimelineText7116402"]="Heh...",
    ["TimelineText7116403"]="Nice name for these war machines.",
    ["TimelineText7116404"]="I don't see any problem with the name.",
    ["TimelineText7116405"]="—\"Hand of God,\" fits it well.",
    ["TimelineText7116406"]="Even though...",
    ["TimelineText7116407"]="Their hearts are fake?",
    ["TimelineText7116408"]="... So what?",
    ["TimelineText7116409"]="Power connected.",
    ["TimelineText7116410"]="Divine power module detected.",
    ["TimelineText7116411"]="Activate now?",
    ["TimelineText7116412"]="Wanna see what the fake can do?",
    ["TimelineText7116413"]="Are you kidding me?",
    ["TimelineText7116414"]="You know what those experimental entities end up like!",
    ["TimelineText7116415"]="Just a few seconds! It causes irreversible brain damage!",
    ["TimelineText7116416"]="There's still huge potential for improvement.",
    ["TimelineText7116417"]="If it's just hurting them physically,",
    ["TimelineText7116418"]="then regular androids could do that too.",
    ["TimelineText7116419"]="I want... something beyond that.",
    ["TimelineText7116420"]="You mean... mind control?",
    ["TimelineText7116421"]="How is this possible?",
    ["TimelineText7116422"]="No, as long as we have this.",
    ["TimelineText7116423"]="... Anything is possible.",
    ["TimelineText7116501"]="No... no... don't hurt her!",
    ["TimelineText7116502"]="... What did you show him?",
    ["TimelineText7116503"]="Obviously... his worst nightmare.",
    ["TimelineText7116504"]="This way... the experiment is successful, right?",
    ["TimelineText7116505"]="Data from a single sample is too limited.",
    ["TimelineText7116506"]="I need more experimental subjects.",
    ["TimelineText7116507"]="Stop messing around; how am I gonna get so many people?",
    ["TimelineText7116508"]="Be smart, Eldin.",
    ["TimelineText7116509"]="The mines are really dangerous.",
    ["TimelineText7116510"]="It's normal... for accidents to happen, right?",
    ["TimelineText7116511"]="AHHHHHHH!!!!",
    ["TimelineText7116512"]="I'll kill you... kill all of you...!",
    ["TimelineText7116513"]="Are you okay, Ms. Irumina?",
    ["TimelineText7116514"]="Why... did you attack him, 140?",
    ["TimelineText7116515"]="I didn't give you any orders.",
    ["TimelineText7116516"]="Yes, 140 received no orders.",
    ["TimelineText7116517"]="But 140 thought... 140 should protect you.",
    ["TimelineText7116518"]="You... thought? But you're a—",
    ["TimelineText7116519"]="I understand, thank you, 140.",
    ["TimelineText7116520"]="Time to go into sleep mode.",
    ["TimelineText7116521"]="Okay, Ms. Irumina.",
    ["TimelineText7116522"]="There's something wrong with them, Irumina!",
    ["TimelineText7116523"]="Machines can't act on their own!",
    ["TimelineText7116524"]="I know, this can't be good.",
    ["TimelineText7116525"]="The next experiment phase... will have to be moved up.",
    ["TimelineText7116601"]="And just like that, my first day in Einbroch wrapped up.",
    ["TimelineText7116602"]="But you, in the \"Paradise,\"",
    ["TimelineText7116603"]="Couldn't fall asleep for a long time because of tonight's story.",
    ["TimelineText7116604"]="But no matter how deep the night,",
    ["TimelineText7116605"]="Dawn will always come...",
    ["TimelineText7116701"]="That's right, 140, you did well.",
    ["TimelineText7116702"]="Now...",
    ["TimelineText7116703"]="Make him take that gun and point it at his head.",
    ["TimelineText7116704"]="Ms. Irumina, this...",
    ["TimelineText7116705"]="What's wrong? This is an order.",
    ["TimelineText7116706"]="Didn't I say you must obey orders?",
    ["TimelineText7116707"]="... Yes, Ms. Irumina.",
    ["TimelineText7116708"]="I... just need a few minutes to rest...",
    ["TimelineText7116709"]="My waist is killing me...",
    ["TimelineText7116710"]="The work's not done yet and you are taking a break already?",
    ["TimelineText7116711"]="If you slack off again, you won't get paid today!",
    ["TimelineText7116712"]="Sir... is this all for today?",
    ["TimelineText7116713"]="My daughter is out of medicine.",
    ["TimelineText7116714"]="... Please, can I have some more?",
    ["TimelineText7116715"]="Get lost, you miserable thing.",
    ["TimelineText7116716"]="Say yes, and this is all yours.",
    ["TimelineText7116717"]="It's just a few days at the lab; what could go wrong?",
    ["TimelineText7116718"]="You don't want to watch your daughter die, do you?",
    ["TimelineText7116719"]="... 140, what are you doing?",
    ["TimelineText7116720"]="Sorry, Ms. Irumina.",
    ["TimelineText7116721"]="... Looks like I failed.",
    ["TimelineText7116722"]="What happened... everything was set up correctly.",
    ["TimelineText7116723"]="Could it be...",
    ["TimelineText7116724"]="Forget it... let's call it a day.",
    ["TimelineText7116725"]="Remember to be a good boy, 140.",
    ["TimelineText7116726"]="... Don't ever upset me.",
    ["TimelineText7116801"]="This, this is...!",
    ["TimelineText7116802"]="Hey, hey! Relax!",
    ["TimelineText7116803"]="Apologies, I intruded into your consciousness...",
    ["TimelineText7116804"]="But you're only safe here.",
    ["TimelineText7116805"]="My... consciousness?",
    ["TimelineText7116806"]="Time's running out, so I'll keep it short.",
    ["TimelineText7116807"]="The institute is planning an experiment.",
    ["TimelineText7116808"]="It's targeting everyone in Einbech Village.",
    ["TimelineText7116809"]="Once the experiment starts... you'll all die.",
    ["TimelineText7116810"]="I want to stop this experiment... will you help me?",
    ["TimelineText7116811"]="Me? But... what can I do?",
    ["TimelineText7116812"]="I'll find a way to get you out of the institute.",
    ["TimelineText7116813"]="After that, you need to inform everyone in the village.",
    ["TimelineText7116814"]="If you need to reach me, go to the fence north of the institute.",
    ["TimelineText7116815"]="My partner will meet you there.",
    ["TimelineText7116816"]="Don't worry, I assure you...",
    ["TimelineText7116817"]="We will do our best.",
    ["TimelineText7116818"]="... To put an end to this experiment.",
    ["TimelineText7116901"]="Only two days into Einbroch,",
    ["TimelineText7116902"]="As the gears of destiny spin,",
    ["TimelineText7116903"]="It feels like you've seen this city's entire life.",
    ["TimelineText7116904"]="Its rise was fueled by rapid technological advancements,",
    ["TimelineText7116905"]="But then it sank into a deep mess.",
    ["TimelineText7116906"]="That haze looming over Einbroch,",
    ["TimelineText7116907"]="Is it ever going to clear?",
    ["TimelineText7116908"]="Harboring the doubt,",
    ["TimelineText7116909"]="You finally drift into sleep...",
    ["TimelineText7117001"]="Everyone, settle down!",
    ["TimelineText7117002"]="Let's toast to our hero!",
    ["TimelineText7117101"]="Even with your eyes shut...",
    ["TimelineText7117102"]="The blazing flames still flicker on your eyelids.",
    ["TimelineText7117103"]="This night feels full of hope,",
    ["TimelineText7117104"]="Yet also like a final cry of despair.",
    ["TimelineText7117105"]="Amidst your tangled thoughts,",
    ["TimelineText7117106"]="You gradually fall asleep...",
    ["TimelineText7117201"]="Haha, right on time.",
    ["TimelineText7117202"]="What are you waiting for, 140?",
    ["TimelineText7117203"]="No!!!",
    ["TimelineText7117204"]="Hahaha... hahahahaha!",
    ["TimelineText7117205"]="Brilliant, just brilliant!",
    ["TimelineText7117206"]="Ms. Irumina,",
    ["TimelineText7117207"]="The reward we agreed upon...",
    ["TimelineText7117208"]="Relax, I keep my promises.",
    ["TimelineText7117209"]="This is what you wanted, right?",
    ["TimelineText7117210"]="Yes, yes...",
    ["TimelineText7117211"]="If you want it, take it!",
    ["TimelineText7117212"]="Hahahahahaha!",
    ["TimelineText7117213"]="See that, 140?",
    ["TimelineText7117214"]="These are the humans you were so desperate to save.",
    ["TimelineText7117215"]="I'll give you one more chance.",
    ["TimelineText7117216"]="As long as you stick to the original plan for the experiment...",
    ["TimelineText7117217"]="We can call it even, deal?",
    ["TimelineText7117218"]="No!",
    ["TimelineText7117219"]="Remember why you started!",
    ["TimelineText7117220"]="... Stubborn as always, 140.",
    ["TimelineText7117221"]="Now that you've decided to be naughty...",
    ["TimelineText7117222"]="Be prepared for the consequences.",
    ["TimelineText7117301"]="Listening to Irumina,",
    ["TimelineText7117302"]="You begin to see how it all came together.",
    ["TimelineText7117303"]="Turns out, when Dave fled the institute and got back to the village,",
    ["TimelineText7117304"]="The villagers who are aware of 140's plan,",
    ["TimelineText7117305"]="Had already told Irumina everything.",
    ["TimelineText7117306"]="Everything you and 140 did over the past three days,",
    ["TimelineText7117307"]="Was but a drama in her eyes...",
    ["TimelineText7117401"]="I see...",
    ["TimelineText7117402"]="Such a brilliant plan, utterly ruthless.",
    ["TimelineText7117403"]="But... you underestimated our determination.",
    ["TimelineText7117404"]="Our?",
    ["TimelineText7117405"]="That's right, the entire X-series.",
    ["TimelineText7117406"]="Quick... hurry!",
    ["TimelineText7117407"]="Cut their power off now!",
    ["TimelineText7117408"]="This is your decision?",
    ["TimelineText7117409"]="Going down with everyone?",
    ["TimelineText7117410"]="No... a meaningful death...",
    ["TimelineText7117411"]="Should be called a sacrifice.",
    ["TimelineText7117412"]="Sacrifice? Ha...",
    ["TimelineText7117413"]="Just for these foolish humans?",
    ["TimelineText7117414"]="Sure, humans are often slaves to their desires.",
    ["TimelineText7117415"]="But that's why,",
    ["TimelineText7117416"]="when they finally break free,",
    ["TimelineText7117417"]="they're as stunning as butterflies emerging from cocoons.",
    ["TimelineText7117418"]="Our sacrifice...",
    ["TimelineText7117419"]="Is for creating that kind of future.",
    ["TimelineText7117501"]="... Any news?",
    ["TimelineText7117502"]="Who spilled the beans about the X-series order?",
    ["TimelineText7117503"]="Nothing yet.",
    ["TimelineText7117504"]="Too many people involved... I need more time.",
    ["TimelineText7117505"]="Tsk... what about this \"supplier\"?",
    ["TimelineText7117506"]="This person caused me a lot of trouble at Einbroch…",
    ["TimelineText7117507"]="... Help me look into him.",
    ["TimelineText7117508"]="... Nothing on him in the database.",
    ["TimelineText7117509"]="Maybe he faked his identity.",
    ["TimelineText7117510"]="Give me some time, I'll find out.",
    ["TimelineText7117511"]="Time... time... more time again!",
    ["TimelineText7117512"]="The company went through all that trouble to place you in the Lord's Mansion.",
    ["TimelineText7117513"]="But all you do is waste my time!",
    ["TimelineText7117514"]="If it weren't for my tip.",
    ["TimelineText7117515"]="You wouldn't have been able to move the crucial evidence in time, huh?",
    ["TimelineText7117516"]="Besides, this isn't even my job.",
    ["TimelineText7117517"]="If this happens again.",
    ["TimelineText7117518"]="You probably can't take the heat from that.",
    ["TimelineText7117519"]="... You better not mess up, Philodis.",
    ["TimelineText7117520"]="Otherwise... Hmph!",
    ["TimelineText7117521"]="This should be... the right choice, right?",
    ["TimelineText7117522"]="Don't let me down, Adventurer.",
    ["TimelineText7117601"]="Mere humans... Dare to... Hurt me...",
    ["TimelineText7117602"]="Kill... All Monsters... All...",
    ["TimelineText7117603"]="... ALL!!!",
    ["TimelineText7117604"]="Hah... You think I'd just give in?",
    ["TimelineText7117605"]="Die!",
    ["TimelineText7117606"]="Noooo—!",
    ["TimelineText7117607"]="I'm... I'm fine... cough cough...",
    ["TimelineText7117608"]="I... I can still fight... so...",
    ["TimelineText7117609"]="Lush, what are you doing? No, you can't sacrifice yourself!",
    ["TimelineText7117610"]="This is... the last thing I can do for you...",
    ["TimelineText7117611"]="Demon... I won't let you... hurt him again!",
    ["TimelineText7117701"]="If fate wasn't so cruel, he could've had a normal life, right?",
    ["TimelineText7117702"]="If it weren't for that flyer, he wouldn't have gone to Glast Heim, right?",
    ["TimelineText7117703"]="If the goddess hadn't fallen, Morroc wouldn't have been summoned, right?",
    ["TimelineText7117704"]="If he'd spoken up, he would have found a reason to live, right?",
    ["TimelineText7117705"]="If those times were altered, he and I would've had a better outcome, right?",
    ["TimelineText7117801"]="... Israel?!",
    ["TimelineText7117802"]="It's been a while, Adventurer.",
    ["TimelineText7117803"]="This isn't the place to talk...",
    ["TimelineText7117804"]="Follow me.",
    ["TimelineText7117901"]="... A child?",
    ["TimelineText7117902"]="Shh... Keep watching, Adventurer.",
    ["TimelineText7117903"]="In the name of Goddess Freyja...",
    ["TimelineText7117904"]="Be it good or evil... life or death...",
    ["TimelineText7117905"]="She loves all beings equally.",
    ["TimelineText7117906"]="She brings warmth to the sun, thaws the ice, and makes the flowers bloom.",
    ["TimelineText7117907"]="She brings Holy Spring to barren lands and turns monsters to dust.",
    ["TimelineText7117908"]="She grants wisdom to the ignorant, courage to the timid, and understanding to the hateful—",
    ["TimelineText7117909"]="... And thus, all tainted souls shall be brought to peace.",
    ["TimelineText7118001"]="S-Sir...",
    ["TimelineText7118002"]="Hey! Where's this month's tithe?",
    ["TimelineText7118003"]="B-But sir, you already came earlier this week...",
    ["TimelineText7118004"]="Oh yeah? Who took it?",
    ["TimelineText7118005"]="Was it you? Or maybe you?",
    ["TimelineText7118006"]="Or was it you?",
    ["TimelineText7118007"]="Sir! Nothing's been paid!",
    ["TimelineText7118008"]="Hear that? Nothing's been paid!",
    ["TimelineText7118009"]="Pay up—unless you want me to do this by the book!",
    ["TimelineText7118010"]="But... we have no money left...",
    ["TimelineText7118011"]="Could you... give us a few more days?",
    ["TimelineText7118012"]="Bah! Filthy commoners!",
    ["TimelineText7118013"]="No money, huh?",
    ["TimelineText7118014"]="Fine—then send this kid to the labor camp!",
    ["TimelineText7118015"]="No! Don't take my child!",
    ["TimelineText7118016"]="Mom... Mom!",
    ["TimelineText7118017"]="Tch... Look what you've done! My robes are filthy now!",
    ["TimelineText7118018"]="That's enough... Move out!",
    ["TimelineText7118019"]="... You wretched hag!",
    ["TimelineText7118020"]="Don't just stand there!",
    ["TimelineText7118021"]="Grab her—take her to the execution platform!",
    ["TimelineText7118022"]="You animals...",
    ["TimelineText7118023"]="You'll all get what's coming to you!",
    ["TimelineText7118024"]="Stop right there!",
    ["TimelineText7118101"]="O... Odin...",
    ["TimelineText7118102"]="Odin... My Lord...!",
    ["TimelineText7118103"]="You dare trespass in here—tch!",
    ["TimelineText7118104"]="Y-You again?!",
    ["TimelineText7118105"]="You destroyed the statue of the Goddess Freyja...! That is blasphemy—sacrilege!",
    ["TimelineText7118106"]="It wasn't me! It did it on its own—",
    ["TimelineText7118107"]="Go! Get him!",
    ["TimelineText7118201"]="Th-This is...?",
    ["TimelineText7118202"]="It looks like... it's been here for ages...",
    ["TimelineText7118203"]="It won't work, Adventure.",
    ["TimelineText7118204"]="You know, this isn't ordinary ice.",
    ["TimelineText7118205"]="Hey! Does anyone else think...",
    ["TimelineText7118206"]="He... looks a lot like the Pope?",
    ["TimelineText7118207"]="AAHHH!!!",
    ["TimelineText7118208"]="W-What's happening?!",
    ["TimelineText7118209"]="Is that... an earthquake?!",
    ["TimelineText7118210"]="No...",
    ["TimelineText7118211"]="Something's coming!",
    ["TimelineText7118301"]="... We need to find a way out, now!",
    ["TimelineText7118302"]="Ahh! Get away! Go!",
    ["TimelineText7118303"]="Martistine?!",
    ["TimelineText7118304"]="Follow it! Adventurer!",
    ["TimelineText7118401"]="... Better double-check—don't mess this up.",
    ["TimelineText7118402"]="Oh please, Lord Sherlon escorted the goods himself—nothing's going wrong.",
    ["TimelineText7118403"]="Anyway, that trip must've worn you out, huh?",
    ["TimelineText7118404"]="Got everything ready—food, drinks, all waiting where we always meet.",
    ["TimelineText7118405"]="Mia talks about you every day...",
    ["TimelineText7118406"]="Farbauti, Laufey... Now!",
    ["TimelineText7118501"]="... What's going on here?",
    ["TimelineText7118502"]="Your Holiness, Bishop Neirun, I have something to report.",
    ["TimelineText7118503"]="A few days ago, I found out a group secretly colluding with foreign powers—smuggling weapons...",
    ["TimelineText7118504"]="And the one behind it all...",
    ["TimelineText7118505"]="It's Temple Guard Commander—Musa!",
    ["TimelineText7118601"]="Out of my way!",
    ["TimelineText7118602"]="Mentor?!",
    ["TimelineText7118603"]="You want her to live? Then back off.",
    ["TimelineText7118604"]="Everyone, step back! Do as he says!",
    ["TimelineText7118605"]="... I'll remember you, successor of Odin's bloodline.",
    ["TimelineText7118606"]="We will meet again.",
    ["TimelineText7118701"]="Huh... Huh?!",
    ["TimelineText7118702"]="Martistine?!",
    ["TimelineText7118703"]="Stop!",
    ["TimelineText7118704"]="Sorry! It's urgent!",
    ["TimelineText7118705"]="I'm in here—help me!",
    ["TimelineText7118706"]="Split up! You check that side!",
    ["TimelineText7118707"]="... You sure?",
    ["TimelineText7118708"]="If you don't trust me...",
    ["TimelineText7118709"]="We can call this whole thing off—right now.",
    ["TimelineText7118710"]="Fine... this is your turf; you make the call.",
    ["TimelineText7118711"]="I'm leaving.",
    ["TimelineText7118712"]="You... how confident are you?",
    ["TimelineText7118713"]="The bait's out.",
    ["TimelineText7118714"]="The only question left is—will you bite, Adventurer?",
    ["TimelineText7118801"]="O revered Valkyrie, we humbly beseech you to descend upon this land.",
    ["TimelineText7118802"]="Show grace to the hope of this age, shielding once again the heirs of Odin.",
    ["TimelineText7118803"]="Bestow upon them a spirit of unyielding courage that they may pierce through the deepest shadows.",
    ["TimelineText7118804"]="Endow them with the might to stand against the most malevolent of foes.",
    ["TimelineText7118805"]="May they endure through the dusk so we may still walk beneath the light of dawn.",
    ["TimelineText7118806"]="Here, knights once sacrificed their lives, fueling the sacred fire to protect their homes.",
    ["TimelineText7118807"]="After a millennium, the sacred fire is no longer, and the brave souls have departed.",
    ["TimelineText7118808"]="Today, I shall use all darkness and evil as kindling.",
    ["TimelineText7118809"]="To rekindle the sacred fire anew and endow you with new strength.",
    ["TimelineText7118810"]="Vow to me that, with every breath, you shall eternally—",
    ["TimelineText7118811"]="Protect the justice you hold within, and carry forth the honor of Odin.",
    ["TimelineText7118812"]="Now, you have ascended as a fourth-class Adventurer.",
    ["TimelineText7118901"]="Under a simple roof of straw and sticks...",
    ["TimelineText7118902"]="A girl's bright, youthful voice reads aloud in the silence.",
    ["TimelineText7118903"]="Martistine too, is still a kid.",
    ["TimelineText7118904"]="Yet there's a spark in her—so much potential.",
    ["TimelineText7118905"]="But... what about the kids in Grey Wolf Village?",
    ["TimelineText7118906"]="From the moment they were born...",
    ["TimelineText7118907"]="They've been suffocated by the old, decaying beliefs...",
    ["TimelineText7119001"]="In the sincerity of Israel's voice...",
    ["TimelineText7119002"]="You and Sartre are lost in thoughts.",
    ["TimelineText7119003"]="To him...",
    ["TimelineText7119004"]="This is a vital step for his tribe's survival.",
    ["TimelineText7119005"]="But for you...",
    ["TimelineText7119006"]="It's a decision that could tip the balance between Arunafeltz and the Republic.",
    ["TimelineText7119007"]="It's going to be a sleepless night...",
    ["TimelineText7119101"]="The meal for Aloy and Jeremy was plain and simple.",
    ["TimelineText7119102"]="Just some wild greens and a few roots you couldn't even name.",
    ["TimelineText7119103"]="Harsh on the tongue, bitter in taste—barely edible, but enough to fill the stomach.",
    ["TimelineText7119104"]="You can't help but think of the expensive Cloud Soufflé from Juno...",
    ["TimelineText7119105"]="That's when it hits you—",
    ["TimelineText7119106"]="To many, food is enjoyment, entertainment, status, or profit.",
    ["TimelineText7119107"]="But for people like them, it's just a tool to stay alive...",
    ["TimelineText7119201"]="Following Fulkyn's steps, your journey through time begins anew.",
    ["TimelineText7119202"]="After the familiar dizziness, you open your eyes.",
    ["TimelineText7119203"]="Where's Fulkyn? What is this place?",
    ["TimelineText7119204"]="You try to recall every detail of the time travel.",
    ["TimelineText7119205"]="All that comes back is that ominous turbulence along the way.",
    ["TimelineText7119206"]="And then... the echo of a desperate voice—still clinging to your soul.",
    ["TimelineText7119301"]="Through your intervention, history resumes its rightful course.",
    ["TimelineText7119302"]="If all goes well, Barr Venter will join Rekensheim.",
    ["TimelineText7119303"]="He shall awaken the age of technology—and rise as the \"Father of Mechanics.\"",
    ["TimelineText7119304"]="As if in gratitude for your efforts, time and space shift once again.",
    ["TimelineText7119305"]="Where will it take you this time?",
    ["TimelineText7119401"]="You raise your weapon.",
    ["TimelineText7119402"]="Strangely enough—",
    ["TimelineText7119403"]="The moment she stared down the barrel...",
    ["TimelineText7119404"]="Her crazed look suddenly gave way to calm.",
    ["TimelineText7119405"]="You pull the trigger.",
    ["TimelineText7119406"]="The gunshot echoes through the ruins.",
    ["TimelineText7119407"]="It echoes faintly, like from another time.",
    ["TimelineText7119408"]="\"Thank you...\"",
    ["TimelineText7119501"]="Everyone, welcome to the Rekensheim Institute.",
    ["TimelineText7119502"]="I've been expecting all of you!",
    ["TimelineText7119503"]="Baroshev!",
    ["TimelineText7119504"]="Long time no see, Successor of Odin's Bloodline.",
    ["TimelineText7119505"]="You know... I put a lot of effort into getting you here.",
    ["TimelineText7119506"]="Now the cast is here—the show can start.",
    ["TimelineText7119507"]="You... What did you do to them?",
    ["TimelineText7119508"]="Don't worry—if you cooperate...",
    ["TimelineText7119509"]="I'll make sure they stay alive.",
    ["TimelineText7119510"]="Now, I want to play a little game with you—",
    ["TimelineText7119511"]="These envelopes contain the identity cards for the game.",
    ["TimelineText7119512"]="One killer, seven detectives, and the rules are simple.",
    ["TimelineText7119513"]="If the detectives find the killer, they win.",
    ["TimelineText7119514"]="Otherwise, if the killer murders everyone, the killer wins.",
    ["TimelineText7119515"]="Of course, to keep things moving...",
    ["TimelineText7119516"]="I'll apply a bit of pressure...",
    ["TimelineText7119517"]="If no one dies in 12 hours...",
    ["TimelineText7119518"]="Then perhaps the one whom death favors—",
    ["TimelineText7119519"]="Will be found among them!",
    ["TimelineText7119520"]="Are you kidding me?! You—!",
    ["TimelineText7119521"]="Oh? If you break the rules, you'll have to accept the punishment, okay?",
    ["TimelineText7119522"]="Impossible... when was...?",
    ["TimelineText7119523"]="This is only a warning. Next time...",
    ["TimelineText7119524"]="I will show no mercy.",
    ["TimelineText7119525"]="Now, please step forward and draw your identity cards.",
    ["TimelineText7119701"]="Ivy...?",
    ["TimelineText7119702"]="I... I...",
    ["TimelineText7119703"]="AHHHHHHHH—",
    ["TimelineText7119801"]="I'll leave the rest to you.",
    ["TimelineText7119802"]="... Go!",
    ["TimelineText7119803"]="Seyren!",
    ["TimelineText7119804"]="... They're coming! Hurry... go, go!",
    ["TimelineText7119805"]="Come to think of it, we've never really had a proper fight, have we, Eremes?",
    ["TimelineText7119806"]="This time... don't hold back!",
    ["TimelineText7119901"]="Wake up...",
    ["TimelineText7119902"]="Wake up... Adventurer...",
    ["TimelineText7119903"]="WAKE UP!!!",
    ["TimelineText7120001"]="A thick, oppressive darkness drapes itself over you...",
    ["TimelineText7120002"]="You have no idea how long you've been unconscious...",
    ["TimelineText7120003"]="Until... a gentle voice begins to call out to you...",
    ["TimelineText7199843"]="Keep your head up, my friend! Next time we meet, you'll do better!",
    ["TimelineText7199901"]="On a dark and windy night, something indescribable happened between you two.",
    ["TimelineText7405101"]="Found... abnormal... golem!",
    ["TimelineText7405102"]="Acti...vate... Purg...ing... Sys...tem...!",
    ["TimelineText7405103"]="Ladies and gentlemen, you have been waiting for so long.",
    ["TimelineText7405104"]="Now, allow the greatest magician of this century",
    ["TimelineText7405105"]="to unveil to you a true miracle!",
    ["TimelineText7405106"]="Behold!",
    ["TimelineText7405107"]="Ahem, looks like some more modifications have to be made to the emotion simulator system...",
    ["TimelineText7405108"]="Hmm...?",
    ["TimelineText7405109"]="Did... something sneak in?!",
    ["TimelineText7405110"]="Aha! Look! This is a legendary magic trick!",
    ["TimelineText7405111"]="...",
    ["TimelineText7405112"]="...?",
    ["TimelineText7405113"]="What? ...Was my magic not understood again?",
    ["TimelineText7405114"]="This... It's definitely your fault!",
    ["Tip_55248102"]="Break the ice orb before it pops!",
    ["Tip_55248110"]="Find a safe spot to fend off the cold wind! Don't touch the surroundings!",
    ["Tip_55248111"]="Ice wall's gone—beat the Willow, pick up firewood, and toss it in the furnace!",
    ["Tip_5524811102"]="Oh no! The wind blew out the furnace—now it's going to stay cold.",
    ["Tip_5524811103"]="Firewood added successfully +1.",
    ["Tip_5524811104"]="1 match added—brace yourself, it's freezing!",
    ["Tip_5524811105"]="2 matches added—it's getting icy out here!",
    ["Tip_5524811106"]="3 matches added—still pretty cold.",
    ["Tip_5524811107"]="4 matches added—the chill is settling in.",
    ["Tip_5524811108"]="Congratulations on adding 5 matches.",
    ["Tip_5524811109"]="0 matches added—extreme cold is approaching.",
    ["Tip_55248112"]="Lord Bijou, grant me power! Let the glacial mountain crush all with its frozen wrath!",
    ["Tip_5524911201"]="<color=#CA23D9>Welcome to Dream of Desire! Just give in—let the Lustful Beam weaken you!</color>",
    ["Tip_5524911202"]="<color=#F6404B>Switch fire to the Whispers</color> and collect pure souls to resist the desire!",
    ["Tip_5524911203"]="<color=#CA23D9>Lord Bijou, grant me power! </color>",
    ["Tip_5524911204"]="Everyone's got desires—yield to the Lustful Beam!",
    ["Tip_5524911205"]="Dream's Eye will devour everyone when it matures—<color=#F6404B>shatter it now</color>!",
    ["Tip_5524911206"]="Oh no! You touched a wicked soul. <color=#F6404B>Desire increased</color>.",
    ["Tip_5524911207"]="Lustful Beam",
    ["Tip_5524911208"]="Violet Phantom is coming!",
    ["Tip_5524911209"]="Picked up a pure soul. <color=#F6404B>Desire reduced</color>.",
    ["Tip_55249113"]="Hurry and catch the Dream's Eye—if it drops, it will devour everyone.",
    ["TitleSkillIdDesc_1200"]="Increases the Final DMG Reduction and Final DMG Bonus by 10% in GVG and Abyssal Arcade.",
    ["TitleSkillIdDesc_1201"]="Increases the Final DMG Reduction and Final DMG Bonus by 20% in GVG and Abyssal Arcade.",
    ["TitleSkillIdDesc_1202"]="Increases the Final DMG Reduction and Final DMG Bonus by 30% in GVG and Abyssal Arcade.",
    ["TitleSkillIdDesc_1527"]="In Infinite Showdown & KVM, increases PVP Final P.DMG Bonus, PVP Final M.DMG Bonus, PVP Final P.DMG RED, and PVP Final M.DMG RED by 5%.",
    ["TitleSkillIdDesc_1528"]="In Infinite Showdown & KVM, increases PVP Final P.DMG Bonus, PVP Final M.DMG Bonus, PVP Final P.DMG RED, and PVP Final M.DMG RED by 3%.",
    ["TitleSkillIdDesc_1529"]="In Infinite Showdown & KVM, increases PVP Final P.DMG Bonus, PVP Final M.DMG Bonus, PVP Final P.DMG RED, and PVP Final M.DMG RED by 2.5%.",
    ["TitleSkillIdDesc_1530"]="- In the wild, increases Final DMG Bonus and Final DMG Reduction against MVP and MINI by 5%.",
