    ["TitleSkillIdDesc_1599"]="Increases PVP Final P.DMG Bonus / PVP Final M.DMG Bonus by 20% and PVP Final P.DMG RED / PVP Final M.DMG RED by 10% in GVG and Abyssal Arcade.",
    ["TitleSkillIdDesc_1600"]="Increases PVP Final P.DMG Bonus / PVP Final M.DMG Bonus by 15% and PVP Final P.DMG RED / PVP Final M.DMG RED by 10% in GVG and Abyssal Arcade.",
