    ["TradePknote_05"]="(Check to close)",
    ["TradePknote_06"]="Activate Kafra's VIP card to send gifts.",
    ["TradePknote_07"]="You have not selected a target to send gifts.",
    ["TradePknote_08"]="You cannot gift anymore.",
    ["TradePknote_09"]="A gift for you! %s %s sends %s %s a(n) <color=#ff6f76>%s</color>!",
    ["TradePknote_10"]="No bids yet. Will select random player at the end to strike a deal. ",
    ["TradeRecordRemainingTips"]="Nothing set to expire",
    ["Tradecontract_01"]="Exchange Center Description",
    ["Tradecontract_02"]="The Central Exchange Center is an official organization established directly by the royal family with the intent of providing a fair market for the citizens of the kingdom. The Central Exchange Center holds absolute authority and influence over the price of products.\n\"We support free trade, but freedom must be tempered by rules!\"\n- Exchange Center Director Lionel",
    ["Tradecontract_03"]="Exchange Center Rules",
    ["Tradecontract_04"]="1. The Exchange Center protects the rights of all merchants and individuals engaging in normal trading activities according to fair principles.\n2. Serving as the official trade platform of the kingdom, the Exchange Center collects a certain amount of tax per transaction.\n3. The Exchange Center takes serious actions against speculation and profiteering activities. Once we have identified such activities, severe sanctions will be imposed.",
    ["Tradecontract_05"]="Exchange Center Agreement",
    ["Tradecontract_06"]="1. By signing this agreement, you agree to the\nExchange Center's regulations, and all relevant rules will apply to you.\n2. By signing this agreement, you can trade freely in the Exchange Center.\n3. The Exchange Center encourages you to perform mining, fishing, and gathering activities.\n4. The Exchange Center will appraise you based on the contributions you have made through daily activities,\nand issue contract dividends every week.",
    ["Tradecontract_07"]="<color=#F076FF>Exchange Center stock increases %s x %s.</color>",
    ["Tradecontract_08"]="Stock Trader",
    ["Tradecontract_09"]="Next",
    ["Tradecrystalnote_1"]="Current price range permitted: %s - %s crystals",
    ["Tradecrystalnote_2"]="Today's Diamond purchase limit: %s\nThis month's Diamond purchase limit: %s",
    ["Tradecrystalnote_3"]="Please do not tap too frequently.",
    ["Tradecrystalnote_4"]="Not on sale",
    ["Tradecrystalnote_5"]="There is no listing for this item currently. You must sell it for more than the standard price.",
    ["Tradecrystalnote_6"]="Pre-order amount must be at least 1.\nMaximum pre-order amount per single item: %s Crystals",
    ["Tradecrystalnote_7"]="About Follow Lowest Price:\nIf this option is checked, as the price of the item changes, this mechanic will be triggered if the bid becomes the lowest price of the current standard price, and your bid will be synchronized with the item's most recent lowest price. This mechanic makes the prices of your items follow the market trend.",
    ["Tradecrystalnote_tips1"]="Unit Price:",
