    ["TreviFount_Ui_15"]="Remaining: %s",
    ["TreviFount_Ui_16"]="Spend %s Diamonds to purchase Wish Coin x%s?",
    ["TreviFount_Ui_17"]="Don't show again for this login",
    ["TreviFount_Ui_18"]="Congratulations! You've obtained all the wish items!",
    ["TreviFount_Ui_19"]="Claim",
    ["TreviFount_Ui_20"]="Not Achieved",
    ["TreviFount_Ui_21"]="Claimed",
    ["TreviFount_Ui_22"]="Adventurer Rankings",
    ["TreviFount_Ui_23"]="How to Get Blessing Points",
    ["TreviFount_Ui_24"]="1. Complete Gratitude of Wishes\n2. Submit any Blue/White Card",
    ["TreviFount_Ui_25"]="Submit Card",
    ["TreviFount_Ui_26"]="Earn 200 Blessing Points to get",
    ["TreviFount_Ui_27"]="During the event, rewards will be settled once every 3 days at 05:00 and sent through mail.",
    ["TreviFount_Ui_28"]="Blessing Points: [s s=40.0 url=%s]%s",
    ["TreviFount_Ui_29"]="Total Blessing Points Obtainable: [s s=40.0 url=%s]%s",
    ["TreviFount_Ui_30"]="Select All",
    ["TreviFount_Ui_31"]="Select Wish Items",
    ["TreviFount_Ui_32"]="Please reach the selection limit for all wish items before confirming.",
    ["TreviFount_Ui_33"]="You haven't selected a card.",
    ["TreviFount_Ui_34"]="Submitting cards will convert them into Blessing Points. Confirm?",
    ["TreviFount_Ui_35"]="Please select your wish items before making a wish.",
    ["TreviFount_Ui_36"]="No cards available to submit.",
    ["TreviFount_Ui_37"]="Any blessings made outside the ranking period will not be counted toward leaderboard points!",
    ["TreviFount_Ui_38"]="Round %s",
    ["TreviFount_Ui_39"]="Prize Pool Reset",
    ["TreviFount_Ui_40"]="Free Reset",
    ["TreviFount_Ui_41"]="<color=#b26134>Ranking</color>",
    ["TreviFount_Ui_42"]="<color=#b26134>Name</color>",
    ["TreviFount_Ui_43"]="<color=#b26134>Blessing Points</color>",
    ["TreviFount_Ui_44"]="<color=#b26134>Rewards</color>",
    ["TreviFount_Ui_45"]="<color=#b26134>Rules</color>",
    ["TreviFount_Ui_46"]="<color=#b3794d>1. Leaderboard Blessing Points earned by participating in the Good Tidings event: </color><color=#dc753b>(converts to Blessing Points based on actual draw consumption)</color>\n<color=#b3794d>2. Unclaimed event progress rewards will be sent by mail after the current round ends.\n3. The leaderboard consists of 4 rounds, with scores resetting at the start of each round.\nLeaderboard Rules\n1. Each round is divided into two phases:</color>\n<color=#dc753b>Phase 1: Leaderboard Competition\nPhase 2: Round Settlement</color>\n<color=#b3794d>2. Only actions performed during Phase 1 will contribute to leaderboard points.\n3. In the event of a tie, rankings will be determined by time (the earlier one receives the higher ranking).\n4. All rewards will be sent through the mail within 5 minutes after each round's settlement.</color>",
    ["TreviFount_Ui_47"]="This round has not started yet.",
    ["TreviFount_Ui_48"]="Current Blessing Points:",
    ["TreviFount_Ui_49"]="Ended",
    ["TreviFount_Ui_50"]="Daily",
    ["TreviFount_Ui_51"]="Completed",
    ["TreviFount_Ui_52"]="No Adventurers on the leaderboard yet.",
    ["TreviFount_Ui_53"]="Spend Diamond x%s to reset the prize pool?",
    ["TreviFount_Ui_54"]="Event Time:\n%s",
    ["TreviFount_Ui_Help_01"]="Rules\n1. Event rewards are in self-selection mode; Adventurers must select their desired items manually.\n2. The prize pool is divided into <color=#dc753b>Supreme Wish Items</color> and Collector's Wish Items.\n3. Each time you make a wish, the items you've received will be removed from the pool until all rewards are obtained.\n4. The number of Wish Coins required increases with each draw:\n1st Draw: 1\n2nd Draw: 2\n3rd Draw: 3\n4th Draw: 4\n5th Draw: 6\n6th Draw: 8\n7th Draw: 10\n8th Draw: 15\n9th Draw: 20\n10th Draw: 25\nOdds Announcement: \nThe chance to draw from the <color=#dc753b>Supreme Wish Items</color> is 8%.\nThe chance to draw from the Collector's Wish Items is 92%.\nAll rewards within each pool have an equal drop rate.",
    ["TurntableBox_001"]="Blue Bell Wish Box",
    ["TurntableBox_002"]="Amethyst Wish Box",
    ["TurntableBox_003"]="Luminous Wish Box",
    ["TurntableBox_005"]="The lucky draw screen will close in %ss.",
    ["TurntableBox_006"]="Open x%s",
    ["Turntable_Tips_006"]="Spend %s x<color=#CA2E0AFF>%s</color> to purchase Blue Bell Wish Box x%s and open them immediately?",
    ["TypeDesc_1"]="Upgrade Resonance",
    ["TypeDesc_2"]="Enchant Resonance",
    ["TypeDesc_3"]="Refine Resonance",
    ["TypeDesc_4"]="Strength (STR)",
    ["TypeDesc_5"]="Agility (AGI)",
    ["TypeDesc_6"]="Vitality (VIT)",
    ["TypeDesc_7"]="Intelligence (INT)",
    ["TypeDesc_8"]="Dexterity (DEX)",
    ["TypeDesc_9"]="Luck (LUK)",
    ["UIOnePunchManTips_02"]="◆Serious Point\nObtained through the Superpower Request gameplay during the event period.\nObtained by purchasing Limited-Time Gift Packs during the event period.\n◆Event Rules:\n1. There are 4 levels for the disasters: Wicked/Tiger/Demon/Dragon.\n2. Upon meeting the required Serious Points, tap Hero's Entrance to summon heroes to exterminate the disaster.\n3. The event map is made up of Prontera/Morroc/Payon, and each city includes 3 disaster areas.\n4. Exterminating all disasters within any city or all disasters of the same level on the map grants you corresponding rewards.\n5. After exterminating every disaster, the limited-edition costume, Terrible Tornado (Cute) Backpack, can be obtained.",
    ["UIOnePunchManTips_03"]="◆Pass:\n1. Spend <color=#ec8a5a>4,888</color> Diamonds to unlock <color=#ec8a5a>Association Hero</color>.\n2. Upgrade the Pass to receive exclusive collaboration titles.\n3. The max level of the Pass is <color=#ec8a5a>Lv.80</color>.\n◆Quests:\n1. 4 daily quests will be refreshed each day, and they are reset daily.\n2. Obtain <color=#ec8a5a>Positive Ratings</color> by completing daily quests.\n3. Challenge quests can be attempted throughout the event period.\n",
    ["UIOnePunchManTips_05"]="Watchdog Man Photo-Taking Tips",
    ["UIOnePunchManTips_06"]="Rules:\n 1. The event refreshes at 05:00 daily. Receive up to 3 requests every day.\n 2. The materials required for requests all come from Life or can be purchased in the Exchange Center.\n 3. When submitting a request, there's a chance to obtain <color=#ec8a5a>One-Punch Collab Chest</color>\n 4. Increase the One-Punch Pass rating to increase the chance of getting <color=#ec8a5a>One-Punch Collab Chest</color> and the chest level!",
    ["UIOnePunchManTips_101"]="Cleared",
    ["UIOnePunchManTips_102"]="Villains spotted! Summon heroes to exterminate the disaster.",
    ["UIOnePunchManTips_103"]="LEVEL: <size=26>%s</size>",
    ["UIOnePunchManTips_104"]="Positive Ratings: %s/%s",
    ["UIOnePunchManTips_105"]="LEVEL: %s",
    ["UIOnePunchManTips_106"]="Standby Hero",
    ["UIOnePunchManTips_107"]="Association Hero",
    ["UIOnePunchManTips_108"]="Available at Character Rating: Lv.%s",
    ["UIOnePunchManTips_109"]="\"With the beast-like combat instinct, they excel in both speed and strength. Known for protecting their own territory, they can safeguard the entire city single-handedly. However, once a villain exits their sphere of influence, they will cease the chase.\"",
    ["UIOnePunchManTips_110"]="Take a photo",
    ["UIOnePunchManTips_111"]="For the gift box from Watchdog Man",
    ["UIOnePunchManTips_116"]="Event Rules:",
    ["UIOnePunchManTips_117"]="Base Lv.25 or higher. Daily at 12:00–14:00, 19:00–22:00",
    ["UIOnePunchManTips_118"]="Daily Participation Limit: Unlimited. 32 participants for each round;",
    ["UIOnePunchManTips_119"]="Available to go Solo, Party, or any mode.",
    ["UIOnePunchManTips_120"]="All players enter the instance as Novices with a fixed basic speed of 5-speed.",
    ["UIOnePunchManTips_121"]="After entering the instance, you can only use the corresponding skills inside the instance that have been unlocked in the Pass.",
    ["UIOnePunchManTips_122"]="You can bring up to 5 types of items, with a maximum of 2 for each type. Items brought in cannot be taken out of the instance.",
    ["UIOnePunchManTips_123"]="Round Introduction:",
    ["UIOnePunchManTips_124"]="Round 1: Speed Race. Dodge obstacles and skills in the scene and reach the safety area as fast as possible. The top 16 can enter Round 2.",
    ["UIOnePunchManTips_125"]="Round 2: Speed Race. Dodge obstacles and skills in the scene and reach the safety area as fast as possible. The top 8 can enter Round 3.",
    ["UIOnePunchManTips_126"]="Round 3: Survival Race. Dodge obstacles and skills in the scene and become the last survivor to win.",
    ["UIOnePunchManTips_127"]="Reward Preview",
    ["UIOnePunchManTips_128"]="Rewards across all 4 tiers can be obtained once per day by reaching the corresponding tier.",
    ["UIOnePunchManTips_129"]="Reach the corresponding tier to claim rewards of the tier and rewards from all lower tiers.",
    ["UIOnePunchManTips_130"]="Battle Recap matchmaking",
