    ["UI_ShadowInherit_013"]="Activated",
    ["UI_SuperNINJA_001"]="Participate in the event to receive rewards, such as Ninja's job advancement materials. Shadow Equipment can be activated without completing the quest during the event!",
    ["UltReward_1"]="Activate the Glory Super Pack and instantly reach Lv.30.\nInstantly obtain Student Uniform.",
    ["UltReward_2"]="Activate the Glory Super Pack and instantly reach Lv.30.\nInstantly obtain School Uniform.",
    ["UltraManGachaTips001"]="Spend %s Diamond(s) to refresh the prize pool?",
    ["UltraManGachaTips002"]="Reward Rules",
    ["UltraManGachaTips003"]="1. Use Odin to defeat monsters in the event location for a chance to receive event currency A.\n2. Each section of Golden Fortress's HP bar is worth a certain number of event currency A. When a section is cleared, Adventurers will receive event currency A based on the amount of damage dealt to that particular section.\n3. Killing MVP/Mini earns you event currency B. (Consume participation rewards)\n4. Adventurers who deal damage to Golden Fortress' shield will receive event currency B.\n5. After the event is over, event currency A & B will be issued based on the Power of Light Ranking on the server.",
    ["UltraManGachaTips004"]="Alien Adacic has brought many rare treasures. Go take a look and see if there is anything you like! Defeating Golden Fortress will trigger the special Surprise Assault rewards!",
    ["UltraManGachaTips005"]="Draw Rules",
    ["UltraManGachaTips006"]="◆Reward of Light Rules\n1. Adventurers can use <color=#ec8a5a>Tickets of Light</color> to draw prizes. 1-Draw costs 1 ticket, and 10-Draw costs 9 tickets.\n2. The first prize pool will be generated randomly when the event begins. Adventurers can spend Diamonds to refresh the pool until they are satisfied with the prize content.\n3. A random item will be drawn whenever Adventurers draw from the prize pool, and the number of items of the corresponding tier will be one-less. In other words, Adventurers are guaranteed to receive all items in the collection if they draw the entire set.\n4. Whenever an item is drawn from the pool, it increases the probability of getting the rest. There is a chance of getting a random SP reward on each draw, but drawing an SP reward won't decrease the number of items from other tiers.\n5. Once Adventurers have drawn all current tier S, A, and B rewards, Adventurers can refresh the prize pool for free without costing any Diamonds.\n◆Surprise Assault Mode:\n1. Surprise Assault mode can be activated when a certain number of Golden Fortresses have been taken down in the Monster Invasion mode on the server.\n2. Surprise Assault mode lasts for 30 minutes, and the SP reward will turn into a fixed rare item under this mode. <color=#ec8a5a>Ultraman Taro Armor (Flame)</color> and <color=#ec8a5a>Space Dragon Nurse</color> will become available during two specific time frames with limited quantity on a first-come, first-served basis. Please refer to the Reward Preview page for the detailed available time.\n3. The number of SP rewards available under the Surprise Assault mode is shared across the server. When the Surprise Assault mode is over, or all SP rewards are withdrawn, it will go back to normal mode.",
    ["UltraManGachaTips007"]="Ichiban Surprise Assault",
    ["UltraManGachaTips008"]="1. Ichiban Reward is related to Fortress Assault in some sense. When the Power of Light of the entire server is accumulated to a certain amount, Ichiban Surprise Assault will become available.\n2. Ichiban Surprise Assault lasts for 4 hours, during which the chance of getting the SP reward will be increased, and the SP reward will become a certain costume. There are a total of 10 SP rewards in the entire server. When all of them are drawn or when the Ichiban Surprise Assault is over, the mode will go back to the normal Ichiban Reward mode.\n3. Ichiban Surprise Assault consumes the same draw tickets as the normal mode, and the progress of A–D prize pool will remain the same as well.\n4. The current SP reward costume cannot be refreshed using Diamonds. Only the A–D prize pool can be refreshed.",
    ["UltraManGachaTips009"]="Reward Preview",
    ["UltraManGachaTips010"]="The Surprise Assault SP Reward of each specific time frame:\nLocal time January 31, 2023, 05:00–February 14, 2023, 05:00. <color=#ec8a5a>Ultraman Taro Suit (Flame)</color>.\nLocal time February 14, 2023, 05:00–February 28, 2023, 23:59. <color=#ec8a5a>Space Dragon Nurse</color>.",
    ["UltraManGachaTips011"]="SP Reward, initial chance: 0.01%, possible rewards are as follows:",
    ["UltraManGachaTips012"]="A Reward, initial chance: 0.02%, possible rewards are as follows:",
    ["UltraManGachaTips013"]="B Reward, initial chance: 1.09%, possible rewards are as follows:",
    ["UltraManGachaTips014"]="C Reward, initial chance: 14.7%, possible rewards are as follows:",
    ["UltraManGachaTips015"]="D Reward, initial chance: 84%, possible rewards are as follows:",
