    ["UltraManTips_001"]="Obtained by participating in Ultraman Monster Invasion, or through Treasury of Light and Energy Gift Pack.",
    ["UltraManTips_002"]="Remaining: %s",
    ["UltraManTips_003"]="Surprise Assault Points",
    ["UltraManTips_004"]="Obtained by defeating Golden Fortress",
    ["UltraManTips_005"]="Spend <color=#da696f>%s</color> Diamonds to refresh the prize pool? The prize pool will be reset with random new rewards after being refreshed.",
    ["UltraManTips_006"]="Rewards from the B prize pool and above have all been drawn. The current refresh is free. The prize pool will be reset with random new rewards after being refreshed.",
    ["UltraManTips_007"]="The number of prizes in the pool is less than 10. Please use 1-Draw.",
    ["UltraManTips_008"]="Surprise Assault has begun",
    ["UltraManTips_009"]="Surprise Assault",
    ["UltraManTips_010"]="Normal",
    ["UltraManTips_011"]="Investigated today",
    ["UltraManTips_012"]="Answer again",
    ["UltraManTips_1"]="Ultra Badge refreshes in: %s",
    ["UltraManTips_10"]="My Best Damage Record",
    ["UltraManTips_11"]="Best Damage Record",
    ["UltraManTips_12"]="Only the top-%s players are recorded",
    ["UltraManTips_13"]="<color=#ffe788>The <color=#528fff>Ultra Badge</color> has arrived! Go search for it! Transform into Ultraman Taro and become the hero that takes down Golden Fortress!</color>",
    ["UltraManTips_14"]="<color=#ffe788>The <color=#ff5252>Golden Fortress</color> has started its invasion! Rise up, Adventurers who carry the power of Taro, the battle of crusading against Golden Fortress has now begun! Go search for <color=#ff5252>Golden Fortress</color> now!</color>",
    ["UltraManTips_15"]="Points required for the chest in the next phase: %s",
    ["UltraManTips_16"]="Today's chests can all be claimed now",
    ["UltraManTips_17"]="Ultra Badge distance: %s meter(s)",
    ["UltraManTips_18"]="About Monster Invasion\n1. Event Time: Monster Invasion will become available with the Ultraman collaboration event, and the instance entrance will be refreshed at the Prontera West Gate at 12:00–22:00 on the hour. Adventurers can enter the instance when it's 5 minutes past the hour, and each instance lasts 30 minutes. The instance will end early if the Golden Fortress is defeated.\n2. Rules and Rewards:\nAdventurers can obtain Power of Light points in the instance to unlock daily point rewards. The points reset at 05:00 daily, and unclaimed rewards will be sent via mail.\n3. Source of Power of Light Points:\n· 10 points for each small monster\n· 20 points for each medium monster\n· 30 points for each large monster\n· Adventurers gain 100 points for every 1% HP Golden Fortress loses.\n· Adventurers gain 100 points for each normal monster killed which is summoned by Golden Fortress every time Adventurers disarm its shield. Gain 1,000 points each for killing the elites Alien Pedant and Alien Adacic.\n· Each successfully disarmed shield will earn all Adventurers in the instance 5,000 points, and the Adventurer who is responsible for disarming the shield will receive an extra 5,000 points.\n· Once the Golden Fortress is defeated, the points of all Adventurers in the instance will be doubled!\nGo look for Ultra Badge and transform yourself into Ultraman Taro to defeat Golden Fortress!\nWhen the total number of defeated Golden Fortresses on the server reaches a certain number, the Surprise Assault mode of Reward of Light will be unlocked, and limited rewards will become available!",
    ["UltraManTips_19"]="Take down Golden Fortress and transmuted monsters to get <color=#528fff>Power of Light</color>. The more Power of Light you have, the better the rewards will be. Successfully taking down Golden Fortress will <color=#528fff>double</color> the amount of Power of Light you receive.\nWhen the battle progresses to a certain phase, Golden Fortress will enable the Absolute Shield, and the only way to disarm it is to <color=#528fff>find the Ultra Badge</color> and transform yourself into Ultraman Taro!",
    ["UltraManTips_2"]="Ultra Badge refreshed",
    ["UltraManTips_20"]="Monster Invasion is not yet available. Begins in: %smin %ssec",
    ["UltraManTips_21"]="Not available",
    ["UltraManTips_22"]="This event is not available yet",
    ["UltraManTips_23"]="Available daily at 12:00–22:00 on the hour",
    ["UltraManTips_24"]="Go Now",
    ["UltraManTips_25"]="The entrance will appear at Prontera West Gate",
    ["UltraManTips_26"]="Wait for Ultra Badge to be refreshed",
    ["UltraManTips_27"]="◆Odin's Blessing:\n1. Defeating monsters within 6 levels of your base level while Odin's Blessing is activated has a chance to grant you <color=#ec8a5a>Energy of Light</color>, which can be used as EXP for the Treasury of Light. There are also chances of dropping <color=#ec8a5a>Ultraman Coins</color> and <color=#ec8a5a>Taro Coins</color>.\n2. Up to 360 <color=#ec8a5a>Energy of Light</color>, 60 <color=#ec8a5a>Ultraman Coins</color>, and 30 <color=#ec8a5a>Taro Coins</color> can be obtained daily. Resets daily at local time 05:00.\n◆Treasury Quest:\n1. 4 daily quests will be refreshed each day, and they are reset daily.\n2. Obtain Treasury EXP by completing daily quests, which can be completed throughout the event period.\n◆Other Obtainable:\n1. During the Ultraman event, obtain 150 <color=#ec8a5a>Energy of Light</color> when completing Anomaly Warning in the World Quest each time.",
    ["UltraManTips_3"]="Ultraman transformation ends in: %s",
    ["UltraManTips_4"]="The first to reach %s points can receive the Ultra Badge.",
    ["UltraManTips_5"]="The entrance of the Monster Invasion instance has appeared on Prontera West Gate. Please get there as soon as possible. The Monster Invasion officially begins in 5 minutes!",
    ["UltraManTips_6"]="The <color=#ffe788>Golden Fortress enabled the <color=#ff5252>Absolute Shield</color>! Only Ultraman Taro can disarm it! Wait for <color=#528fff>Ultra Badge's</color> arrival now!</color>",
    ["UltraManTips_7"]="<color=#ffe788>Golden Fortress's shield has been successfully disarmed! Hurry up, everyone! Stop the Golden Fortress!</color>",
    ["UltraManTips_8"]="<color=#ffe788>Golden Fortress's shield has exhausted all energy! Hurry up, everyone! Stop the Golden Fortress!</color>",
    ["UltraManTips_9"]="Ranking",
    ["UnderageTips"]="The Recharge feature is not yet available in the Lite version. Please go to the store and download the client to experience all available features.",
    ["UnlockAfterTransfer"]="Unlocks after you complete 2nd Job Advancement.",
    ["UnlockAfterTransfer1"]="Feature available after reaching 3rd Class",
