    ["UnlockCondition_9"]="Reach Lv.25",
    ["UnlockDescribe_1"]="<color=#FF751CFF>Mount</color> unlocked! \nComplete <color=#FF751CFF>Lv.12</color> Side Quest: <color=#FF751CFF>Tour Izlude Island</color> to obtain a mount!",
    ["UnlockDescribe_10"]="Equipment <color=#FF751CFF>Enchantment</color> unlocked!\nLil' Kitty's magical powers will be at your service!",
    ["UnlockDescribe_11"]="Equipment <color=#FF751CFF>Refinement</color> unlocked!\nImprove your stats to make yourself stronger!",
    ["UnlockDescribe_12"]="<color=#FF751CFF>Battlefield</color> unlocked!\nBring along your friends for an exciting PVP match!",
    ["UnlockDescribe_13"]="<color=#FF751CFF>Endless Tower</color> unlocked!\nFind your own objective and challenge your limits.",
    ["UnlockDescribe_14"]="<color=#FF751CFF>Crafting</color> unlocked! \nCreate your own powerful weapons!",
    ["UnlockDescribe_2"]="<color=#FF751CFF>Headgear Gift Pack</color> is in your Backpack now!\nOpen it and see what cute headgears you got!",
    ["UnlockDescribe_3"]="Congratulations! <color=#FF751CFF>Job Advancement</color> completed!\nOut with the old, in with the new!",
    ["UnlockDescribe_4"]="<color=#FF751CFF>Academy</color> unlocked!\nGo out and explore Midgard!",
    ["UnlockDescribe_5"]="You obtained a new <color=#FF751CFF>Card </color>!\nSlot them into an equipment and its effect will activate!",
    ["UnlockDescribe_6"]="You can go to the <color=#FF751CFF>Mission Board</color> and accept quests!\nRemember to come daily for massive EXP!",
    ["UnlockDescribe_7"]="<color=#FF751CFF>Guild</color> unlocked!\nJoin a guild to meet some kindred spirits!",
    ["UnlockDescribe_8"]="<color=#FF751CFF>Instance</color> unlocked!\nMore instances will be unlocked at later levels, there will always be new challenges!",
    ["UnlockDescribe_9"]="<color=#FF751CFF>MVP</color> unlocked!\nNo pain, no gain. Challenge MVPs that appear suddenly in the wild!",
    ["UnlockSkill200004"]="Unlock conditions: Obtain [Water Cannon]",
