    ["VIPBuyDes_1"]="When there are more than 30 days left on a card with a lower tier, you can trade it for a premium card by making up for the price.",
    ["VIPBuyDes_2"]="The remaining days on the cards with a lower tier will be deducted and added to the new one you purchased by making up the price or the one you purchased directly.",
    ["VIPBuyDes_3"]="When purchasing cards of the same level, the validity is extended by 30 days each time by default.",
    ["VIPBuyTitle"]="Purchasing Rules",
    ["VIPCardOnSetDes_1"]="Once purchased, the card becomes active based on its tier. Do not forget to set your privileges.",
    ["VIPCardOnSetDes_2"]="There can only be one card that takes effect at a time. When you own multiple cards, the card with the highest tier takes effect first by default, and the card with a lower tier will be paused until the current effective card expires.",
    ["VIPCardOnSetTitle"]="Card Rules",
    ["VIPCardPrivilege_1"]="Obtain the title <color=#86a42aff>\"{1}\"</color> when activated. <color=#86a42aff>{2}</color>",
    ["VIPCardPrivilege_10"]="Quest rewards for the return event +<color=#86a42aff>{0}%</color>. <color=#86a42aff>{1}</color>",
    ["VIPCardPrivilege_11"]="Consuming <color=#86a42aff>{1}</color> can receive probability bonuses when upgrading a Shadow Equipment. <color=#86a42aff>{2}</color>",
    ["VIPCardPrivilege_12"]="Obtain <color=#86a42a>{0}</color> Odin's Blessings every Monday. <color=#86a42aff>{1}</color>",
    ["VIPCardPrivilege_13"]="Obtain <color=#86a42a>{0}</color> Stamina every day. <color=#86a42aff>{1}</color>",
    ["VIPCardPrivilege_14"]="Reduces the final Diamond cost by <color=#86a42a>{0}</color>% when commencing the advanced transfer of the equipment. <color=#86a42aff>{1}</color>",
    ["VIPCardPrivilege_15"]="You can send gifts to bidding Adventurers during the Bidding War in the Exchange Center. <color=#86a42aff>{1}</color>",
    ["VIPCardPrivilege_16"]="Reduces the Zeny cost by <color=#86a42a>{0}</color>% when commencing the ordinary transfer of the equipment. <color=#86a42aff>{1}</color>",
    ["VIPCardPrivilege_17"]="Receive <color=#86a42a>{0}</color> chance(s) of patting a pet every day. <color=#86a42aff>{1}</color>",
    ["VIPCardPrivilege_18"]="You can select the reward chance consumption multiplier upon a single completion of the Heart Pedestal instance, either in Normal or Hard difficulty.",
    ["VIPCardPrivilege_19"]="Claim <color=#86a42aff>{1}</color> x<color=#86a42a>{0}</color> daily",
    ["VIPCardPrivilege_2"]="You can be resurrected in place <color=#86a42aff>{0}</color> time(s) daily if you die in the wild. <color=#86a42aff>{1}</color>",
    ["VIPCardPrivilege_3"]="In the OX Quiz, you can <color=#86a42aff>know the correct answers in advance.</color> <color=#86a42aff>{1}</color>",
    ["VIPCardPrivilege_4"]="You can buy {1} x<color=#86a42aff>{0}</color> in the Crystal Shop each day. <color=#86a42aff>{2}</color>",
    ["VIPCardPrivilege_5"]="Satiety cap +<color=#86a42aff>{0}</color>. <color=#86a42aff>{1}</color>",
    ["VIPCardPrivilege_6"]="Unlocks extra <color=#86a42aff>{0}</color> slot(s) for <color=#86a42aff>Combo Skills</color>  <color=#86a42aff>{1}</color>",
    ["VIPCardPrivilege_7"]="In KVM, you can offset points deduction when defeated for <color=#86a42aff>{0}</color> time(s) each day. <color=#86a42aff>{1}</color>",
    ["VIPCardPrivilege_8"]="Participating in the Ultimate Showdown for the first <color=#86a42aff>{0}</color> time(s) in each phase will earn you an additional <color=#86a42aff>{1}</color> point(s). <color=#86a42aff>{2}</color>",
    ["VIPCardPrivilege_9"]="Choose any <color=#86a42aff>{0}</color> tier(s) to top up each month and enjoy First Top-up Gifts. <color=#86a42aff>{1}</color>",
    ["VIPCardResetDes"]="Some privileges require a CD reset, which can only be deselected after equipping them for the entire 30-day effective period once activated.",
    ["VIPCard_Hints1"]="Select <color=#e7bb22>%s</color> Privileges to activate",
    ["VIPCard_Hints10"]="Spend <color=#86a42aff>%s</color> to extend the validity for <color=#86a42aff>30 days</color>.",
    ["VIPCard_Hints11"]="Spend <color=#86a42aff>%s</color> to extend the validity for <color=#86a42aff>7 days</color>.",
    ["VIPCard_Hints12"]="Default Privileges cannot be canceled",
    ["VIPCard_Hints13"]="You've reached the max number of selected Privileges",
    ["VIPCard_Hints14"]="Save Privilege Settings",
    ["VIPCard_Hints15"]="After purchase, extend the validity for <color=#86a42aff>30 days</color>.",
    ["VIPCard_Hints16"]="Selected privileges remain unchanged. No need to save.",
    ["VIPCard_Hints17"]="Only reward privileges will be in effect by default when privileges are not set. Are you sure you want to skip the settings?",
    ["VIPCard_Hints18"]="The privilege is currently in the CD reset period, and you may deselect it once it is over.",
    ["VIPCard_Hints2"]="Privileges are set",
    ["VIPCard_Hints3"]="Added %s duration",
