    ["VIPCard_Tips6"]="%s day(s) remaining",
    ["VIPCard_Tips7"]="Active",
    ["VIPDesTitle"]="VIP Card Explanation",
    ["VIPItemDes_1"]="With Maid's Bell, you can summon a Maid in the wild, allowing you to sell items, access a Sundries Store, and use remote Warehouse services. The Premium Maid's services are also available to your party members in addition to the teleport service.",
    ["VIPItemDes_2"]="The timer of the First Top Up Gift privilege will be timed in cycles once activated. It will be reset every 30 days, and it won't be affected by the card's level. When activating an expired card, it will start a new cycle based on the activation time. Relevant information can be viewed on the Top Up page.",
    ["VIPItemTitle"]="Privileges",
    ["VIPListOnSetDes_1"]="By default, each time a card is reactivated, you will have a chance to set the privileges as needed.",
    ["VIPListOnSetDes_2"]="Every 30 days, the privileges of the VIP Card can be reset once, but unused chances cannot be carried over.",
    ["VIPListOnSetDes_3"]="When setting privileges, the required number of privileges selected for the current card must be reached before the privilege settings can be saved.",
    ["VIPListOnSetDes_4"]="The privilege consists of three categories: Reward Privileges, privileges that require a CD reset, and Selectable Privileges.",
    ["VIPListOnSetDes_5"]="Reward privileges take effect by default when a card is activated. These bonus privileges are not counted in the number of privileges available for selections.",
    ["VIPListOnSetDes_6"]="Once the privilege that requires a CD reset is activated, it must fulfill a 30-day effective period before it can be canceled. Suppose the card expires before this privilege fulfills the 30-day effective period. In that case, this privilege will be selected by default after a new card is activated. Until reaching 30 days of the effective period, it can be deselected.",
    ["VIPListOnSetDes_7"]="Higher card levels bring more available options to the privilege list and more privileges that can be activated.",
    ["VIPListOnSetTitle"]="Privilege Rules",
    ["VIPPrivilegeReset_1"]="Require a CD reset",
    ["VIPPrivilegeReset_2"]="Can be reset in %s day(s)",
    ["VIPinheritShow"]="Cost -%s",
    ["ValentineDayFestivaText_101"]="Infused <color=#ff6eaf>%s</color> Energy in total, Lucky Draw attempts increased by <color=#ff6eaf>%s</color>.",
    ["ValentineDayFestivaText_102"]="Odds: %s",
    ["ValentineDayFestivaText_103"]="Insufficient Lucky Draw attempts",
    ["ValentineDayFestivaText_104"]="%s obtained <color=#ffe38f>%s</color> from the Lucky Draw.",
    ["ValentineDayFestivaText_105"]="%s infused <color=#ffe38f>%s</color> Energy.",
    ["ValentineDayFestivaText_106"]="%s Lucky Draw attempts remaining",
    ["ValentineDayFestivaText_107"]="Insufficient remaining attempts",
    ["ValentineDayFestivaText_108"]="【活动说明】\n1、活动时间：%s\n2、兑换时间：%s\n3、活动条件：好友结对后才能参与活动，契约达成后不可取消，赶紧去寻找心仪的Ta吧~\n4、活动玩法-以爱之名：任务计数共享，双方完成数量可累加，获取更多积分去解锁各种奖励吧~\n5、活动玩法-星语星愿：消耗活动道具进行抽奖充能，结对的两个人共享充能进度，进度满了后两人可以各获得1次抽奖机会，随着抽奖次数的增加每次抽奖需要的能量会增加，快来和好友一起看看是谁的运气最好吧~\n6、活动玩法-甜蜜兑换：凑齐活动道具后，可在此处兑换心怡的礼物哦~\n7、活动玩法-奥丁祝福：结对后消耗奥丁击杀怪物才有几率掉落活动兑换道具~\n8、活动玩法-爱的赠礼：玩家每日都可为心仪的Ta赠送10个活动道具，卡普拉会员尊享更多次数哦~",
    ["ValentineDayFestivaText_109"]="Event Description\n1. Event Duration: %s\n2. Exchange Duration: %s\n3. Event Conditions: Friends can only participate in the event after pairing, and the pairing contract can not be canceled after it is reached. Hurry to find your partner of affection!\n4. Guardian's Pact: Quest count can be shared, and completions (by both parties) will accumulate. Get more points, and unlock those awesome rewards!\n5. Game of Fate: Use event items to recharge Lucky Draw attempts. Paired-up players will share the recharge progress. Once the progress is fully recharged, each player will receive one Lucky Draw attempt. If the grand prize, <color=#ff6eaf>Apocalypse Blitz</color>, is not drawn <color=#ff6eaf>within 300 attempts</color>, it will be guaranteed on the 300th. The Energy required for each draw attempt will increase as the draw progresses. The details are as follows:\n1st–40th draw: 60 Energy per draw\n41st–80th draw: 80 Energy per draw\n81st–120th draw: 100 Energy per draw\n121st–160th draw: 120 Energy per draw\n161st–200th draw: 150 Energy per draw\n201st–250th draw: 200 Energy per draw\n251st–300th draw: 250 Energy per draw\n301st and after: 300 Energy per draw\n6. Triumph Vault: Players can exchange gifts here after collecting enough event items!\n7. Endgame Clash: After successful pairing, players can get Event Exchange Items by consuming Odin’s Blessings to kill the monsters!\n8. Gift of Love: Players can give 10 event items to their partner of affection every day. Kafra VIPs enjoy more gifting chances!",
    ["ValentineDayFestivaText_110"]="Owned: %s",
    ["ValentineDayFestivaText_111"]="Today's Remaining Infusion: %s",
    ["ValentineDayFestivaText_112"]="Today's limit reached",
    ["ValentineText_101"]="Insufficient currency",
    ["ValentineText_102"]="Insufficient items",
    ["ValentinesDayText_001"]="Daily wish limit reached. Please come back tomorrow!",
    ["ValentinesDayText_002"]="Please pair up first before participating in this event!",
    ["ValentinesDayText_003"]="The event has ended. Exchange for rewards now!",
    ["ValentinesDayText_004"]="[Event Rules]\n1. Event Duration: %s\n2. Exchange Duration: %s\n3. Event Conditions: Friends can only participate in the event after the pairing, and the contract can not be cancelled after it is reached. Hurry to find the partner of your affection!\n4. Event Description - In the Name of Love: Quest count can be shared, and completions (by both parties) will accumulate. Get more points, and unlock those awesome rewards!\n5. Event Description - Wish Upon a Star: Make a wish to get the Event Exchange Items. Players can make 9 wishes per day, with the 1st to 2nd time consuming Zeny, the 3rd to 5th time consuming crystals, and the 6th to 9th time consuming diamonds. Please pay attention to this!\n6. Event Description - Sweet Exchange: Players can exchange gifts here after collecting enough event items!\n7. Event Description - Odin’s Blessings: After successful pairing, players can get Event Exchange Items by consuming Odin’s Blessings to kill the monsters!\n8. Event Description - Point Gift Pack: After completing the quest A Heaven-made Match, both sides will get points and can claim gift packs once their accumulated points reach the conditions!\n9. Event Description - Gift of Love: Players can give 10 event items to the partner of their affection every day, and Kafra VIPs enjoy more gifting chances!",
    ["ValentinesDayText_005"]="\nEvent Rules \n1. Event Time: %s \n2. Exchange Duration: %s \n3. Event Conditions: Friends can only participate in the event after the pairing, and the contract can not be canceled after it is reached. Hurry up and find your partner of affection! \n4. Event Description - Shining Stars: The number of quests will be shared between the players who are successfully paired, and the number of quests completed by both sides can be added up, so get more points and unlock all the rewards. \n5. Event Description - Starlit Wishes: Make a wish to get the event exchange items. Players can make 9 wishes per day, with the 1st to 5th times consuming Zeny, the 6th to 10th times consuming Crystals, and the 11th to 15th times consuming Diamonds. Please pay attention to this! \n6. Event Description - Starlit Shop: Players can exchange gifts here after collecting enough event items! \n7. Event Description - Starlit Battle Song: After successful pairing, there are chances of dropping event exchange items when players kill the monsters by consuming Odin's Blessings. \n8. Event Description - Points Gift Pack: After completing Shining Stars quests, both sides will get points and can claim gift packs once their accumulated points meet the requirement! \n9. Event Description - Starry Surprises: Players can give 10 event items to the partner of their affection every day, and Kafra's VIPs enjoy more gifting chances!",
