    ["VoteList_Help01_01"]="Voting Rules:\n1. Vote for retro Costumes. The top-ranked retro Costume from voting will appear in the Costume Shop the next week.\n2. The Costume that has appeared in the current week's Costume Shop cannot be voted on.\n3. You can claim voting rewards after casting your vote",
