    ["VowTips001"]="Invite the party who you wish to spend your life with to establish a contract.",
    ["VowTips002"]="Gain 9999 Favor with the party you wish to establish the contract with.",
    ["VowTips003"]="Conditions of the contract have been fulfilled. Please start Couple Challenge Quest.",
    ["VowTips004"]="Accept a series of vow outfit quests?\n(This quest can only be accepted by the party leader and both parties who wish to establish their relationship need to be near the Archbishop.)",
    ["VowTips005"]="Complete this with the party you wish to establish the contract with.",
    ["VowTips006"]="Please go near the Archbishop.",
    ["VowTips007"]="All members must be in the same dimension.",
    ["VowTips008"]="Only the party leader can make the selection.",
    ["VowTips010"]="Do you want to give up the contract challenge?\n(This will end the relationship between the parties of the contract and reset all vow challenge quests progress. Please select carefully.)",
    ["VowTips011"]="Accept the witness quest?\n(This quest can only be accepted by the party leader and both parties who wish to establish their relationship need to be near the Archbishop.)",
    ["VowTips012"]="Do you want to carry out the vow ceremony?\n(The vow ceremony will require both parties who wish to establish their relationship to be near the Archbishop.\nYou will not be able to end the relationship for a short period of time after taking the vow. Please consider carefully.)",
