    ["WeddingDiologue1000101"]="Dear guests, unfortunately due to the absence of %s %s, the wedding will not be able to proceed as planned. We are sorry for taking up your time and we thank you for your participation.",
    ["WeddingDiologue1000102"]="The wedding is about to begin. Bride and groom, please change your outfit.",
    ["WeddingDiologue1000103"]="Love, laughter, and showers of blessings. May your happiness know no bounds from here on.",
    ["WeddingDiologue1000104"]="You are now free to give out Red Envelopes. May everyone be blessed with good fortune! May the newlyweds have a wonderful marriage and may their love last forever!",
    ["WeddingDiologue1000105"]="Dear guests, please ready your cameras and record this moment of happiness.",
    ["WeddingDiologue1000106"]="May your love last till the end of time.",
    ["WeddingDiologue1000107"]="Cheers and applause. The air is filled with intoxicating sweetness.",
    ["WeddingDiologue1000108"]="I honored to be able to witness this moment of happiness with everyone.",
    ["WeddingDiologue1000109"]="Hmm... This is the most beautiful wedding I've ever seen.",
    ["WeddingDiologue1000110"]="Everyone, let's give the newlyweds our most sincere blessings.",
