    ["WeddingListDes10002"]="Experience a unique and romantic dream wedding amongst falling cherry blossom petals.",
    ["WeddingListDes10003"]="I want to give you a wedding that's filled with sweetness. Surrounded by snow that seems to glow and lights like shining stars, even the gingerbread man on the platter seems to be giving us his blessings.",
    ["WeddingListDes10004"]="The light of dawn illuminates the foam on the sea and ripples embrace the sand. The song of the little Obeaune resonates among the waves and this time, the prince reaches out to her.",
    ["WeddingListDes20001"]="Each party will receive Family and Friends Invitation <color=#ba7d7d>x1</color> + Guest Invitation <color=#ba7d7d>x10</color>.",
