    ["WeddingListDes40004"]="Reserve 8 carriages.",
    ["WeddingMailContent001"]="Dear %s,\nWe would like to congratulate you on finding your one true love in Midgard. You have successfully made a reservation for %s in %s for a %s styled wedding party. The Heart of Freyja Wedding Planners will be here to serve you. Please claim the necessary wedding items in the mail.\nAlso, invitations for your family, friends and guests are attached in this mail. Hurry, invite all your family and friends to witness this wonderful moment of your love!\nOnce your guests RSVP to your invite, they will receive the items in your Wedding Set and we will also convey their response to you immediately!\nHave a wonderful wedding and may you and your partner's love last till the end of time!\n Heart of Freyja Wedding Planners",
    ["WeddingMailContent002"]="Dear %s,\nYour friend, %s, cordially invites you to their wedding as a member of their Family and Friends group. For more details on their wedding, kindly check out the invitation and please do remember to respond as soon as you can!\nOur company will ensure that your response reaches your friend immediately. Have a good day ahead!\n Heart of Freyja Wedding Planners",
    ["WeddingMailContent003"]="Dear %s,\nYou have accepted your friend, %s's wedding invitation. You will be attending their wedding as a member of their Family and Friends group. Thank you very much for your response!\nKindly wear the outfit attached in this mail for the wedding. And do make use of the romantic wedding items during the wedding to spice up the ceremony for your friend!\nMay you have an enjoyable time at the wedding!\n Heart of Freyja Wedding Planners",
    ["WeddingMailContent004"]="Dear %s,\nYour friend, %s, has accepted your wedding invitation. They will be attending your wedding as a member of your Family and Friends group! The wedding items that you have ordered from our company have also been delivered to your friend. All that's left is to wait for the arrival of your big day!\nMay you have a wonderful wedding and may your love last forever!\n Heart of Freyja Wedding Planners",
    ["WeddingMailContent005"]="Dear %s,\nYou have declined your friend, %s's invitation to attend their wedding as part of their Family and Friends group. It is regretful that you won't be able to witness their moment of love, but we would still like to thank you for your response. We will ensure that your response reaches your friend immediately.\nHave a good day ahead and safe travels on your adventures!\n Heart of Freyja Wedding Planners",
    ["WeddingMailContent006"]="Dear %s,\nWe regret to inform you that your friend, %s, has declined your wedding invitation. We will now return the wedding invitation to you. Please send the invitation to another friend to invite them to join you as a member of your Family and Friends group!\nMay you have a wonderful wedding and may your love last forever!\n Heart of Freyja Wedding Planners",
    ["WeddingMailContent007"]="Dear %s,\nYour friend, %s, cordially invites you to their wedding as a member of their Guests group. For more details on their wedding, kindly check out the invitation and please do remember to respond as soon as you can!\nOur company will ensure that your response reaches your friend immediately. Have a good day ahead!\nHeart of Freyja Wedding Planners",
    ["WeddingMailContent008"]="Dear %s,\nYou have accepted your friend, %s's wedding invitation. You will be attending their wedding as a member of their Guests group. Thank you very much for your response!\nKindly attend the wedding on the date and place stated in the invitation. Be sure to use the romantic wedding items in this mail during the wedding to help spice up the ceremony!\nMay you have an enjoyable time at the wedding!\nHeart of Freyja Wedding Planners",
    ["WeddingMailContent009"]="Dear %s,\nYour friend, %s, has accepted your wedding invitation. They will be attending your wedding as a member of your Guests group!\nThe interactive items that you have ordered from our company have also been delivered to your friend. All that's left is to wait for the arrival of your big day!\nMay you have a wonderful wedding and may your love last forever!\n \nMay you have an enjoyable time at the wedding!\n Heart of Freyja Wedding Planners",
    ["WeddingMailContent010"]="Dear %s,\nYou have declined your friend, %s's invitation to attend their wedding as part of their Guests group. It is regretful that you won't be able to witness their moment of love, but we would still like to thank you for your response. We will ensure that your response reaches your friend immediately.\nHave a good day ahead and safe travels on your adventures!\n Heart of Freyja Wedding Planners",
    ["WeddingMailContent011"]="Dear %s,\nWe regret to inform you that your friend, %s, has declined your wedding invitation. We will now return the wedding invitation to you. Please send the invitation to another friend to invite them to join you as a member of your Guests group!\nMay you have a wonderful wedding and may your love last forever!\n Heart of Freyja Wedding Planners",
    ["WeddingMailContent012"]="Dear %s,\nWe would like to congratulate you on finding your one true love, %s, in Midgard.\nHeart of Freyja Wedding Planners is here to serve you. Our company provides the most exquisite and glamorous wedding customization service in the whole continent.\nWe strongly believe that everyone has their own unique requests for their wedding and we are here to fulfill them all. We will be waiting for you at Prontera.\nHave a wonderful wedding and may you and your partner's love last till the end of time!\n Heart of Freyja Wedding Planners",
    ["WeddingMailContent013"]="Dear %s,\nThanks to you and your partner's hard work, your Couple Level has risen to %s. The corresponding rewards for this level is sent as follows. Please remember to claim them.",
    ["WeddingMailContent014"]="Dear %s,\nThe reservation that you had made in %s for your %s styled wedding has been canceled due to extenuating circumstance. Here is the refund of your deposit of %s Crystals. We are sorry for the inconvenience. Kindly remember to claim your deposit.",
    ["WeddingMailContent015"]="Dear %s,\nWelcome to our custom wedding service. We've received your wedding appointment and the related funds. We'll try our best to give you the perfect wedding ceremony.\nTo repay your trust in us, we'd like to offer you %s. This coupon can be used in any of our booked wedding services. We hope to hear from you again should you wish to experience different wedding styles.\nWe hope you have a wonderful wedding and everlasting love!\n Freyja's Wedding Planners",
