    ["WonderWorldTips003"]="Remote Control Dice cannot be auto-rolled!",
    ["WonderWorldTips004"]="Character is currently moving forward. Please try again later.",
    ["WonderWorldTips005"]="You don't have enough of the selected dice!",
    ["WonderWorldTips006"]="You cannot switch dice in auto mode. Please cancel auto mode and try again.",
    ["WonderWorldTips007"]="You don't have enough of the selected dice to commence auto mode.",
    ["WonderWorldTips008"]="Remaining Purchases: %s",
