    ["activityOnGoing"]="In Progress",
    ["adventuretips"]="\n<color=#e7bb22>Adventurer's Journey Level:</color>\n\nLarge amounts of <color=#66ccff>Crystals</color> can be obtained by increasing your Adventurer's Journey level.\nYou will need to pass <color=#66ccff>Adventure Level Tests</color> at Lv.2, 4, 6, 8, and 10 to claim them.\n\nAdventure Lv.2: 4,000 Crystals (requires Base Lv.30)\nAdventure Lv.3: 6,000 Crystals (requires Base Lv.40)\nAdventure Lv.4: 8,000 Crystals (requires Base Lv.50)\nAdventure Lv.5: 10,000 Crystals (requires Base Lv.60)\nAdventure Lv.6: 14,000 Crystals (requires Base Lv.70)\nAdventure Lv.7: 20,000 Crystals (requires Base Lv.80)\nAdventure Lv.8: 30,000 Crystals (requires Base Lv.90)\nAdventure Lv.9: 40,000 Crystals (requires Base Lv.100)\nAdventure Lv.10: 60,000 Crystals (requires Base Lv.110)\nAdventure Lv.11: 80,000 Crystals (requires Base Lv.120)\nAdventure Lv.12: 100,000 Crystals (requires Base Lv.130)\nAdventure Lv.13: 120,000 (requires Base Lv.140)\nAdventure Lv.14: 140,000 (requires Base Lv.150)\nAdventure Lv.15: 160,000 (requires Base Lv.160)\n<color=#e7bb22>Road to Adventure EXP:</color>\n\nAdventure EXP is used to raise your Adventurer's Journey Level.\nAdventure EXP can be obtained by completing Adventure Quests, obtaining Cards, taking photos of Attractions, unlocking the Monster Encyclopedia, or taking photos of Monsters.",
