    ["aside11000101"]="Hey, hey! Stop looking around! Yes, I'm talking to you!",
    ["aside11000102"]="You must be a reporting Novice too, right? Come here!",
    ["aside11000201"]="That person in front of the stage is Jarod?!",
    ["aside11000202"]="In any case, let's go check it out first.",
    ["aside11000301"]="It looks like Jarod won't listen to me unless I fulfill his request.",
    ["aside11000401"]="How's it going? Has the baby found any friends yet?",
    ["aside11000501"]="Let's go now. The door to the tavern is just there!",
    ["aside11000502"]="Oh, beautiful Isabella, I will be back during the next recruitment!",
    ["aside11000601"]="You guys took so long!",
    ["aside11000701"]="Follow this road and you'll reach the Prontera South Gate.",
    ["aside11000702"]="Let's hurry!",
    ["aside11000801"]="That girl is Ygnizem. I think she's in trouble!",
    ["aside11000802"]="Let's go help her!",
    ["aside11000901"]="Careful! These Porings seem to be going crazy!",
    ["aside11001001"]="Aha! It's time for the instructor to show you how it's done!",
    ["aside11001002"]="Novice, pick up your knife now!",
    ["aside11001101"]="These Porings are relentless.",
    ["aside11001102"]="Don't back down! Hit them hard!",
    ["aside11001201"]="Hang on, here comes another big one! It's never-ending.",
    ["aside11001301"]="Novice, you've got to evade the King Poring's skill!",
    ["aside11001302"]="This one's way stronger than a normal Poring!",
    ["aside11001401"]="Novice, you did your best.",
    ["aside11001402"]="Let me teach you how to retreat!",
    ["aside11001501"]="Use this skill to recover your stamina!",
    ["aside11001601"]="Let's split up!",
    ["aside11001602"]="Let's first investigate the area where the halo was lost!",
    ["aside11001701"]="I should search ahead; there might be...",
    ["aside11001801"]="There's another feather ahead!",
    ["aside11001901"]="Let me check out the edge of the cliff!",
    ["aside11002001"]="Maybe... I can try climbing up the vines?",
    ["aside11002101"]="The crow's nest really is up there!",
    ["aside11002201"]="Found it! Time to bring it back to Ygnizem!",
    ["aside11002301"]="This mount can bring you back! Por!",
    ["aside11002401"]="You finally caught up!",
    ["aside11002501"]="Here, it's done. Try it on!",
    ["aside11002601"]="We've reached the port. Look! Isn't that Ygnizem?",
    ["aside11002701"]="Go greet <color=#CA2E0AFF>Captain Carew</color>! We're depending on him for the voyage!",
    ["aside11002801"]="The ship is docked!",
    ["aside11002901"]="Haha! So long, kiddos!",
    ["aside11003001"]="This is the Champagne Blue Market, the place where merchants gather on Izlude Island.",
    ["aside11003002"]="You can buy weapons, armor, and supplies here!",
    ["aside11003101"]="Up ahead is Esplanade Garden. Academy students love to have picnics there during their free time.",
    ["aside11003102"]="You look at the flowers or go fishing. It's very relaxing!",
    ["aside11003201"]="Behind this door is Criatura Academy!",
    ["aside11003202"]="Mainz is expecting you in the Great Hall of Job Advancement. Go see him now!",
    ["aside11003301"]="Close your eyes and relax. You can tell me your choice after the trial.",
    ["aside11003401"]="You have finally arrived. Come before me.",
    ["aside11003501"]="Hang on! You haven't collected your <color=#CA2E0AFF>1st Class Certificate</color>!",
    ["aside11003601"]="If you want to know more about Ymir's Heart, try dropping by the library.",
    ["aside11003602"]="Eason, the librarian, will help you out.",
    ["aside11003701"]="What are you doing here? I've been looking all over for you!",
    ["aside11003801"]="Everyone's gathered at the square. Let's hurry over!",
    ["aside11003901"]="Good, let's go!",
    ["aside11004001"]="That's right! That's the way it's done!",
    ["aside11004301"]="Warning! Once you've spoken to a Class Instructor, you won't be able to change your class! Choose wisely!",
    ["aside11004302"]="Complete the <color=#CA2E0AFF>1st Class Quest</color> to continue with the main storyline.",
    ["aside11010101"]="Below the airship platform? Let's take a look!",
    ["aside11010201"]="Great! My next order is to tell the <color=#CA2E0AFF>pilot</color> over there that—",
    ["aside11010202"]="if he doesn't take off, I'm going to kick his butt!",
    ["aside11010301"]="I almost forgot; I need to meet up with Captain Fitz. I'll go take a look near the Central Fountain.",
    ["aside11010401"]="You're finally here, Reservist!",
    ["aside11010501"]="You still have to pay Blacksmith Hollgrehenn a visit before the start of the training.",
    ["aside11010502"]="He'll unleash the true power of these upgrading stones.",
    ["aside11010601"]="Done! Your equipment should be stronger than before!",
    ["aside11010602"]="If you bring enough upgrading stones, I can make it even stronger! Haha!",
    ["aside11010701"]="I should report to Captain Fitz now. Wait, where's that call of distress coming from?",
    ["aside11010801"]="This is...? I should show it to Captain Fitz!",
    ["aside11010901"]="Found it. I'll bring it back too!",
    ["aside11011001"]="Who?!",
    ["aside11011101"]="What is this letter on the floor?",
    ["aside11011201"]="I'm counting on you!",
    ["aside11011301"]="Those two look suspicious. I'll just listen in on what they're saying.",
    ["aside11011401"]="...How should I get the information from them?",
    ["aside11011402"]="Hi! The adventurer over there. Could you come over for a bit?",
    ["aside11011501"]="He's drunk. I'll take this opportunity to get some information out of him!",
    ["aside11011601"]="Wow! Are you here to hunt for treasure too?",
    ["aside11011701"]="Commander Bernard, you came at the right time!",
    ["aside11011801"]="This is...?!",
    ["aside11011901"]="Why are there monsters in the treasury?!",
    ["aside11012001"]="Oh no, where is the <color=#CA2E0AFF>Fragment of Ymir's Heart</color>?!",
    ["aside11012002"]="Wait, could it be that <color=#CA2E0AFF>Alchemist</color>...",
    ["aside11012101"]="There's a set of <color=#CA2E0AFF>knight armor</color> here. I could put it on and disguise myself as a knight!",
    ["aside11012201"]="What? Fragment of Ymir's Heart? Keep your voice down. Do you mean the one that recently went missing from the palace?",
    ["aside11012202"]="Rumor has it that Bernard from the Defense Force stole it in cahoots with an alchemist. This is no longer a secret, but Captain Hallam seems to think Bernard is innocent.",
    ["aside11012301"]="I heard that the expedition squad found a strange device in the sewers.",
    ["aside11012401"]="Don't you know that men from the Defense Force tried to force their way into the sewers not too long ago? How can there be anything good in the sewers? It all sounds very suspicious.",
    ["aside11012501"]="Stop! This place has been sealed off by the Royal Chivalry!",
    ["aside11012601"]="Members of the chivalry should be nearby. Try looking for them.",
    ["aside11012701"]="I'm trapped. You need to get rid of these <color=#CA2E0AFF>Thief Bug Eggs</color> first!",
    ["aside11012801"]="...Hallam?!",
    ["aside11012802"]="Commander Bernard, I can explain.",
    ["aside11012901"]="We meet again, my friend!",
    ["aside11013001"]="There seem to be traces of humans having lived here before.",
    ["aside11013101"]="This... this is...?!",
    ["aside11013201"]="That must be the archbishop. I should ask him for help.",
    ["aside11013301"]="Stand beneath the statue and pray. Odin will answer through his divine power.",
    ["aside11013401"]="Captain Hallam and Commander Bernard are waiting for you beneath Odin's statue!",
    ["aside11013402"]="Hurry over now!",
    ["aside11013501"]="The star of the award ceremony is here! Let's give a cheer for this amazing adventurer!",
    ["aside11013502"]="Did you hear? This adventurer managed to quell the frenzy caused by monsters in the capital!",
    ["aside11013503"]="Not only that, he even brought back the Fragment of Ymir's Heart.",
    ["aside11013504"]="Because of this hero, peace was restored to our farm.",
    ["aside11013601"]="Adventurer, are you ready? Make your statement in front of Odin's statue.",
    ["aside11013701"]="...Are you the successor of Odin's bloodline...?",
    ["aside11013702"]="Who's speaking?",
    ["aside11013801"]="Successor of Odin's bloodline, this is just the beginning.",
    ["aside11013901"]="Successor of Odin's bloodline, you are strong, but not strong enough.",
    ["aside11014001"]="Good... Come before me.",
    ["aside11014101"]="The goddess... disappeared?",
    ["aside11019901"]="Baroshev escaped? Wait, that's...",
    ["aside11019902"]="The Fragment of Ymir's Heart?!",
    ["aside11020101"]="You want to go out to sea? But now isn't a good time for that.",
    ["aside11020201"]="Bahahaha! This island is going to become a pirate kingdom!",
    ["aside11020202"]="Who's speaking?",
    ["aside11020301"]="Why are monsters suddenly appearing? What's happening?!",
    ["aside11020302"]="So it was you!",
    ["aside11020401"]="I'll leave everything to you.",
    ["aside11020501"]="Huh? Why are you here?",
    ["aside11020601"]="Finally, a living person! Quick, come help! ...Why aren't you coming?!",
    ["aside11020701"]="Hey! What are you looking at? I'm here!",
    ["aside11020801"]="Good job, everybody! You're the ones who defended Izlude Island!",
    ["aside11020901"]="The Great Sage... Kroneika? Let's go find out!",
    ["aside11021001"]="Adventurer, can you help me, please?",
    ["aside11021101"]="That's right, this is the place. Thank you very much!",
    ["aside11021201"]="Go away, you disgusting Chonchons! Stay away from me!",
    ["aside11021301"]="There really is a river here. I'll check out what's over the bridge!",
    ["aside11021401"]="Footprints... Could they have been left by the Great Sage?",
    ["aside11021501"]="Why is it you again?!",
    ["aside11021601"]="I... will... return to life again...",
    ["aside11021701"]="Come on. This teleporter will take us back to the Sage Hut.",
    ["aside11021801"]="Give me some time.",
    ["aside11021901"]="Are you the adventurer that Dad was talking about?",
    ["aside11022001"]="Right on time. Let's go.",
    ["aside11022101"]="Young adventurer, you're finally back!",
    ["aside11022201"]="H-help! Can anyone hear me?",
    ["aside11022301"]="Is that...?",
    ["aside11022401"]="...I told you, you've got the wrong person!",
    ["aside11022402"]="Is that... Alice's voice?",
    ["aside11022501"]="Great job. I'll go get ready in the prayer room first!",
    ["aside11022601"]="My ship... Why are there monsters all over my ship?!",
    ["aside11022701"]="I should have bought enough time now.",
    ["aside11022801"]="Hang on, this tentacle...",
    ["aside11022901"]="Please... help me...",
    ["aside11023001"]="Adventurer, I knew you would come.",
    ["aside11023101"]="Careful... Here they come!",
    ["aside11023201"]="The markings end here. The Corsair must be behind this door!",
    ["aside11023202"]="Finally caught up to you!",
    ["aside11023301"]="...Successor of Odin's bloodline, you are back.",
    ["aside11023401"]="Found the Kraken's eyes!",
    ["aside11023501"]="...Successor of Odin's bloodline, you are back.",
    ["aside11023601"]="The third fragment... is somewhere in Morroc... Be very careful.",
    ["aside11023602"]="The fragment's fire element has been activated. This is going to be a dangerous journey.",
    ["aside11030101"]="Strange... How did anyone find their way here?",
    ["aside11030201"]="There's a strange force field up ahead.",
    ["aside11030301"]="It's here... Tsk! The sand swallowed it up again.",
    ["aside11030401"]="It's done. Scoop the medicine out while it's still hot!",
    ["aside11030501"]="...Careful!",
    ["aside11030601"]="Oh no! The ground is collapsing!",
    ["aside11030701"]="There's a terrifying hole ahead. Could Trisse have fallen into it?",
    ["aside11030801"]="It's hard. Why is it so hard for me? Waka...",
    ["aside11030901"]="A willful and barbaric woman? Could it be Trisse? Let's check it out.",
    ["aside11031001"]="It's hard. Why is it so hard for me? Waka...",
    ["aside11031101"]="A sudden lover? It seems to be Trisse. Let's check it out.",
    ["aside11031201"]="It's hard. Why is it so hard for me? Waka...",
    ["aside11031301"]="Waaaaaaaa! I've been found!",
    ["aside11031401"]="Sweetheart, you're finally back! Waka!",
    ["aside11031501"]="Come, put the Great Earth onto the Wind Force Field.",
    ["aside11031601"]="Careful... In front of you!",
    ["aside11031701"]="Urgh... Better take these monster corpses back to the black market merchant.",
    ["aside11031801"]="Ew, these things are absolutely disgusting... By Odin, the stench...",
    ["aside11031901"]="All in the name of love... Urgh... I'm about to suffocate...",
    ["aside11032001"]="I hope Heflee will like them... Bleurgh!",
    ["aside11032101"]="Who's there? How dare you insult Osiris' honor!",
    ["aside11032201"]="That should be all of them. I'll take them back to Eassis.",
    ["aside11032301"]="Oh no, this is bad. It's covered in Matyr saliva.",
    ["aside11032401"]="Oh, thanks! Look, the finger is still moving slightly!",
    ["aside11032501"]="A red, beating heart! It belongs to Osiris!",
    ["aside11032601"]="The shape of your forehead is so elegant!",
    ["aside11032701"]="Well then, it's time for us to return to our eternal slumber. Adventurer, goodbye and I hope to never see you again.",
    ["aside11032801"]="...Successor of Odin's bloodline, you are back.",
    ["aside11040101"]="This is as far as I can go. Good luck!",
    ["aside11040201"]="...Adventurer, wait a moment.",
    ["aside11040301"]="Help! Somebody help me!",
    ["aside11040401"]="We're saved. Thank you so much!",
    ["aside11040501"]="Let's go.",
    ["aside11040601"]="Alright, the medicine is ready.",
    ["aside11040602"]="Bring it to me now!",
    ["aside11040701"]="If my guess is correct, this is the skeleton with gold teeth!",
    ["aside11040801"]="These footprints... They must belong to Yorkshire!",
    ["aside11040901"]="Oh! He must be just up ahead!",
    ["aside11041001"]="He seems to be talking to someone? Let's move closer...",
    ["aside11041101"]="The vibrations... They seem to be coming from the ground!",
    ["aside11041102"]="—You're the one who helped the princess escape?",
    ["aside11041201"]="This, this is...?!",
    ["aside11041202"]="High Priestess Leona! Bad news!",
    ["aside11041301"]="This... Nield?!",
    ["aside11041302"]="Ahhhhhh! Who's there?! I'm going to kill you!",
    ["aside11041303"]="Oh no! Nield is on a rampage!",
    ["aside11041401"]="Gail once said that he wanted to take Lucia to admire the scenery of the desert.",
    ["aside11041402"]="I'll have to try my luck in the desert if I want to locate Princess Lucia!",
    ["aside11041501"]="What a coincidence! We meet again!",
    ["aside11041601"]="It's done. Scoop the medicine out while it's still hot!",
    ["aside11041701"]="...Help... Help! Bloop!",
    ["aside11041702"]="I'm saved. Thank you! Bloop!",
    ["aside11041901"]="*Cries*",
    ["aside11041902"]="This sound... It seems to be coming from the west!",
    ["aside11042001"]="Boohoo... Daddy, where are you... Bloop...",
    ["aside11042002"]="Found it!",
    ["aside11042101"]="Oh no, the entrance is blocked!",
    ["aside11042201"]="Everyone under the sea has become so distant. Did Father also...",
    ["aside11042301"]="That's— We have to help him!",
    ["aside11042401"]="Looks like it's all over.",
    ["aside11042501"]="...Successor of Odin's bloodline, well done.",
    ["aside11050101"]="Stop!",
    ["aside11050201"]="We're here! This is the place!",
    ["aside11050301"]="This is the Munak Cave that Uncle mentioned.",
    ["aside11050302"]="Careful, Euin! They're coming again!",
    ["aside11050401"]="The Munaks are getting more aggressive. What should we do?",
    ["aside11050402"]="Sigh. Let's go back and speak to my uncle.",
    ["aside11050501"]="Hey, hey! This way, adventurer.",
    ["aside11050601"]="Oh gosh, what now, what now, what now?",
    ["aside11050701"]="There seems to be some Ice Soul Grass beneath that tree.",
    ["aside11050801"]="*Squeaks*",
    ["aside11050802"]="Oh no, it looks mad!",
    ["aside11050901"]="Meat Pie Mushrooms seem to be growing by the grass there.",
    ["aside11051001"]="*Wails*",
    ["aside11051002"]="Oh no, it looks mad!",
    ["aside11051101"]="I'm back!",
    ["aside11051201"]="Strange, why is it so quiet...? Careful!",
    ["aside11051301"]="These Munaks... Could it be?",
    ["aside11051401"]="The old woman in front of the house seems to be the chief. Let's talk to her to find out what happened!",
    ["aside11051501"]="Looks like we'll have to ask the survivors to get a clearer idea of what happened.",
    ["aside11051601"]="A doctor who passed by the well...?",
    ["aside11051602"]="This is really strange. Let's investigate the well!",
    ["aside11051701"]="This must be the well that the chief was talking about. Hurry, let's investigate!",
    ["aside11051801"]="I'm back!",
    ["aside11051901"]="It transformed!",
    ["aside11052001"]="Who are you people?",
    ["aside11052101"]="What's the outcome of the investigation?",
    ["aside11052201"]="There are monsters everywhere. I have to eliminate them or I won't be able to proceed.",
    ["aside11052301"]="I'm refreshed! Time to move on ahead!",
    ["aside11052401"]="Wait up, what are those things on the ground?",
    ["aside11052501"]="Ah... Who's that unconscious person?",
    ["aside11052601"]="This power... seems familiar...",
    ["aside11052602"]="Who's speaking?",
    ["aside11052701"]="These monsters... It seems that they were attracted by the runes too!",
    ["aside11052801"]="Good, now the runes can be dug up.",
    ["aside11052901"]="These two pieces don't make a whole. Looks like I need to search elsewhere.",
    ["aside11053001"]="Monsters again... Did they all come for the runes?",
    ["aside11053101"]="Good, now the runes can be dug up.",
    ["aside11053201"]="It's finally completed. Let's bring it back to the Horong!",
    ["aside11053301"]="Ah, that's right. This is the power...",
    ["aside11053401"]="Found it!",
    ["aside11053501"]="...Where... is this place?",
    ["aside11053601"]="General!",
    ["aside11053701"]="What are you doing here?",
    ["aside11053801"]="That old man is him, right?",
    ["aside11053901"]="Stop! How dare you trespass in the Euin Family's burial ground!",
    ["aside11054001"]="...Enough.",
    ["aside11054101"]="Time to go back and see General Qi Euin.",
    ["aside11054201"]="Monsters, this is no place for your nonsense!",
    ["aside11054301"]="Careful, they're attacking again!",
    ["aside11054401"]="There's no end to this!",
    ["aside11054501"]="Everyone, please wait.",
    ["aside11054601"]="This place...?!",
    ["aside11054701"]="...What's happening?!",
    ["aside11054801"]="I finally found the reason behind the Munaks' appearance!",
    ["aside11054901"]="Oh no! Are you alright?",
    ["aside11055001"]="Uncle, be careful!",
    ["aside11055101"]="...Successor of Odin's bloodline, well done.",
    ["aside11060101"]="This, this is...?!",
    ["aside11060102"]="Sigh, you're back?",
    ["aside11060201"]="Umm... Which room is Jesqurienne in? I should ask someone.",
    ["aside11060301"]="Look, the Artifact should be on this table!",
    ["aside11060401"]="This aura...",
    ["aside11060402"]="Huh? Can you feel it, too?",
    ["aside11060501"]="Up ahead!",
    ["aside11060502"]="Damn! It was you who stole it?",
    ["aside11060601"]="You... you're pretty strong.",
    ["aside11060701"]="Watch out! They're coming right at us!",
    ["aside11060801"]="Don't let your guard down. It isn't over yet.",
    ["aside11060901"]="Wait, there seems to be some movement not far away.",
    ["aside11061001"]="Good. It's safe for now.",
    ["aside11061101"]="Hmm... I should tell Bairde and the others!",
    ["aside11061201"]="These are the nuts. Try putting it in front of the Goblin camp!",
    ["aside11061301"]="Gob! Lovely smelling fruit, tasty fruit!",
    ["aside11061302"]="He took the bait! I'll put some more down.",
    ["aside11061401"]="Gob! There's more! There's more!",
    ["aside11061402"]="It's following the trail. Now try drawing it toward the magic barrier.",
    ["aside11061501"]="Gob! All for me, all for Shorty!",
    ["aside11061502"]="Well done, adventurer. Hurry and catch it!",
    ["aside11061601"]="Stop hitting me! Stop hitting me! I, I surrender, gob!",
    ["aside11061701"]="Damn, the Blood Clan member got away. I should tell Jesqurienne what happened.",
    ["aside11061801"]="So did you find the Artifact?",
    ["aside11061901"]="Adventurer, there's something you need to know.",
    ["aside11062001"]="This is the book the master was talking about.",
    ["aside11062101"]="...I knew you'd come.",
    ["aside11062201"]="That older orc should be the shaman.",
    ["aside11062301"]="Oh no! We've been found!",
    ["aside11062401"]="Stop! Don't try to run!",
    ["aside11062501"]="What was just said... I have to tell Murloma as soon as possible!",
    ["aside11062601"]="Come on, let's have a fair and open duel!",
    ["aside11062701"]="Since this fight must take place... there's no need to hold back!",
    ["aside11062801"]="Look out! They're going for a special attack!",
    ["aside11062901"]="The winner is already clear.",
    ["aside11063001"]="Okay, it's about time to meet with Joao in front of the chief's hut.",
    ["aside11063101"]="Out with it! Where the hell did my brother go?",
    ["aside11063201"]="Take a look up ahead!",
    ["aside11063301"]="Done! Let's take them to Joao!",
    ["aside11063401"]="Stop! No one's allowed in here!",
    ["aside11063501"]="Urgh! Argh!",
    ["aside11063502"]="That voice... It's my son, Jofar!",
    ["aside11063601"]="Haha, it's too late. It's too late...",
    ["aside11063701"]="I know it's too late to apologize now.",
    ["aside11063801"]="You're finally back.",
    ["aside11063901"]="There must be something going on. Follow the trail of paw prints and see what you can find.",
    ["aside11064001"]="I understand where you're coming from, but right now we have to focus on the investigation.",
    ["aside11064101"]="Looks like the answer is in the camp!",
    ["aside11064201"]="On the ground! It's...!",
    ["aside11064301"]="I should search ahead; there might be a clue.",
    ["aside11064401"]="Hold on, there's a guard up ahead.",
    ["aside11064501"]="The Gutripper guards are all dead. I'd better go back and tell the chieftain.",
    ["aside11064601"]="Did you locate the guards?",
    ["aside11064701"]="Done! Let's push on!",
    ["aside11064801"]="It actually worked! Let's place some more.",
    ["aside11064901"]="The Skullsplitter camp is just ahead. I have to move carefully!",
    ["aside11065001"]="If you have something to say, just say it. What's with the violence?!",
    ["aside11065101"]="We meet again, adventurer.",
    ["aside11065201"]="Adventurer, you're back safe!",
    ["aside11065301"]="What... what's going on?!",
    ["aside11065401"]="Ahead, just ahead. Go down the ramp and you will find what you are looking for.",
    ["aside11065402"]="...This voice?",
    ["aside11065501"]="Yes, it is here. Just keep going and it will appear.",
    ["aside11065502"]="...Who's speaking?",
    ["aside11065601"]="Why is there a dimensional gap here? Wait, I think something's happening.",
    ["aside11065701"]="Beware. The gap is transporting an endless stream of monsters.",
    ["aside11065801"]="Do not let your guard down. Here they come again.",
    ["aside11065802"]="Who are you?",
    ["aside11065901"]="Good, you've done well. If you want to find me, come to the tombstone.",
    ["aside11066001"]="We meet at last, young adventurer.",
    ["aside11066101"]="I can clear the vines now!",
    ["aside11066201"]="We meet at last, young adventurer.",
    ["aside11066301"]="Hmm...",
    ["aside11066401"]="All right, hurry and give it to Katrina!",
    ["aside11066501"]="Thank you so much.",
    ["aside11066601"]="We meet at last, young adventurer.",
    ["aside11066701"]="...Successor of Odin's bloodline, well done.",
    ["aside11070101"]="The most grandiose building... This should be it!",
    ["aside11070102"]="Hurry, show it to that young lady!",
    ["aside11070201"]="Fuchsia herbs growing near the palace... Could it be those herbs up ahead?",
    ["aside11070301"]="Light blue flowers growing in a corner of the southwest of the city... These should be it!",
    ["aside11070401"]="Roar—",
    ["aside11070402"]="Oh no! The monsters nearby have discovered me!",
    ["aside11070501"]="All that is left is the fountain water from Quiet Garden.",
    ["aside11070601"]="Alright, let's leave it to that servant!",
    ["aside11070701"]="The soil beneath this flower cluster seems a little loose...",
    ["aside11070801"]="If my guess is correct, this is it!",
    ["aside11070901"]="Be careful... The aura of the monsters have gotten stronger!",
    ["aside11071001"]="Yes, this is the place.",
    ["aside11071101"]="This place... I remember it...",
    ["aside11071201"]="...Why did it turn out this way?",
    ["aside11071301"]="Wait, don't kill him!",
    ["aside11071401"]="These shelves look like a good place to hide papers...",
    ["aside11071501"]="Put it down... Put it down—!",
    ["aside11071502"]="Oh no! It's being guarded by monsters!",
    ["aside11071601"]="Let's search elsewhere.",
    ["aside11071701"]="...This is?!",
    ["aside11071801"]="There's something suspicious about these papers that are sandwiched between the pages of the book...",
    ["aside11071901"]="How lucky! Let's continue searching around the area!",
    ["aside11072001"]="...There seems to be something dropped on the ground?",
    ["aside11072101"]="This should be all. Hurry and show them to Cassius!",
    ["aside11072201"]="Let's look elsewhere.",
    ["aside11072301"]="Alright, let's take it back to Cassius.",
    ["aside11072401"]="Oh Odin... What wrongdoings have we committed...!",
    ["aside11072501"]="Alright, try placing these in front of the Knight Statue.",
    ["aside11072601"]="This is the armory. The item that best represents a knight's honor is...",
    ["aside11072701"]="Alright, try placing this in front of the Knight Statue.",
    ["aside11072801"]="Did we succeed...? Let's return and check it out!",
    ["aside11072901"]="If my guess is correct, this is it!",
    ["aside11073001"]="Almost there. Get some fresh blood and offer it to this knight!",
    ["aside11073101"]="Alright, try reading the opening verse to the Knight Statue!",
    ["aside11073201"]="...Unbelievable. Completely unbelievable!",
    ["aside11073301"]="Wait, what's that up ahead?",
    ["aside11073401"]="...Hey, you. Come here.",
    ["aside11073501"]="Alright, there's still another set nearby...",
    ["aside11073601"]="Let's take a look elsewhere.",
    ["aside11073701"]="Done! Let's report back!",
    ["aside11073801"]="Alright, this much should be enough.",
    ["aside11073901"]="...My food has been snatched away again...?",
    ["aside11074001"]="What a scumbag! He deserved to die!",
    ["aside11074101"]="Well then, I'm counting on you!",
    ["aside11074201"]="This is strange. I don't think we got the steps wrong...",
    ["aside11074202"]="In any case, let's inform Darens of the situation first!",
    ["aside11074301"]="Another boiler... This should be the one?",
    ["aside11074401"]="Who's there? How dare you steal from me! Are you tired of living?!",
    ["aside11074402"]="Oh no!",
    ["aside11074501"]="Alright, let's inform Darens of the situation first!",
    ["aside11074601"]="What's going on...?",
    ["aside11074701"]="...Wait, why is King Schmidt missing?!",
    ["aside11074801"]="Help... Help me!! I'm trapped! Hurry, find me!",
    ["aside11074901"]="There seems to be noises coming from behind this wooden door...?",
    ["aside11075001"]="Ah, I'm finally free... I want revenge!",
    ["aside11075101"]="This is not King Schmidt... Where is he?",
    ["aside11075201"]="Help... Help me!! I'm trapped! Hurry, find me!",
    ["aside11075301"]="Ah, I'm finally free... I want revenge!",
    ["aside11075401"]="This is not King Schmidt... Where is he?",
    ["aside11075501"]="Help... Help me!! I'm trapped! Hurry, find me!",
    ["aside11075601"]="Ah, I'm finally free... I want revenge!",
    ["aside11075701"]="This is not King Schmidt... Where is he?",
    ["aside11075801"]="Help... Help me!! I'm trapped! Hurry, find me!",
    ["aside11075901"]="Q-quick, take me away from here... I don't want to stay here for even a second longer!",
    ["aside11076001"]="...This strange feeling... What's happening?",
    ["aside11076101"]="What's that up ahead... An afterimage of the goddess?",
    ["aside11076201"]="The goddess disappeared? Let's look elsewhere.",
    ["aside11076301"]="The goddess disappeared again... Let's search around the area.",
    ["aside11076401"]="This should do it. Let's return to King Schmidt!",
    ["aside11076501"]="That... What's that up ahead?!",
    ["aside11076601"]="This is... We've returned to our reality?",
    ["aside11076602"]="Go inform Eden Group Instructor Rockley of your investigation results.",
    ["aside11076701"]="Hurry, protect the citizens while they evacuate! Knights, muster your courage!",
    ["aside11076702"]="...It's someone from the Chivalry!",
    ["aside11076801"]="Wait, there's another one beside it...",
    ["aside11076901"]="Alright, go find the weary citizens!",
    ["aside11077001"]="Well fought, Adventurer!",
    ["aside11077101"]="This is... We've returned to the Glast Heim of the current time?",
    ["aside11077102"]="In any case, hurry and return the Sands of Time to Fulkyn.",
    ["aside11077201"]="...Successor of Odin's bloodline, well done.",
    ["aside11077301"]="These should be King Schmidt's footprints. Let's follow them!",
    ["aside11077401"]="King Schmidt seems flustered. We need to find him quick!",
    ["aside11077501"]="This... Could he have escaped to the level below?",
    ["aside11080101"]="What’s this.... an entry pass?",
    ["aside11080102"]="It could be the lost property of the traveler who left just a moment ago...",
    ["aside11080201"]="This is where the incident between the caravan and the bandits took place. Go ahead and have a look!",
    ["aside11080301"]="It looks like someone is transporting a heavy load... could it be the bandits?",
    ["aside11080401"]="G.W......G.W.?! Could it be Goldie’s gang?!",
    ["aside11080501"]="This... this body... what happened?",
    ["aside11080601"]="Oh no, its going to.... (vomiting noise...)",
    ["aside11080701"]="Strange, I haven't seen any doctors around here.",
    ["aside11080702"]="This is a familiar feeling....",
    ["aside11080801"]="....This is?",
    ["aside11080901"]="Northwest Desert.... Go and take a look!",
    ["aside110810001"]="......",
    ["aside11081001"]="As expected, the body can behave.",
    ["aside110810101"]="-- Stop! What are you up to?",
    ["aside110810201"]="(Brother’s name) -- Get out of the line immediately!",
    ["aside110810301"]="Pick up a weapon and show me what you’re made of!",
    ["aside110810401"]="Very good, but it is far from over.",
    ["aside110810501"]="You’ve got some skills, what could possibly come next?",
    ["aside110810601"]="Prepare yourself to accept the final Trial!",
    ["aside110810701"]="Hmm. It seems you shouldn’t judge a man by his appearance....",
    ["aside110810801"]="Alright! Now stand in the middle of the arena and prepare for your Combat Ability Test ",
    ["aside110810901"]="Err... where is this power coming from?! ",
    ["aside110810902"]="Hm. Things are going according to initial predictions. Proceed to the next test!",
    ["aside110811001"]="How can this be....? My powers are oozing out of me! I go from strength to strength!",
    ["aside110811002"]="Yes, you’re right.... It seem that medium intensity is not as hard as i thought....",
    ["aside11081101"]="Alright, give this to Wallace!",
    ["aside110811101"]="...Ahh! My head.... it hurts! Can we pause for a moment? ",
    ["aside110811102"]="Oh? Is this test okay? It’s possible that I have found the perfect match....",
    ["aside110811201"]="Very good, you passed the experiment. Now then (Name of the team captain), can you help me out with this?",
    ["aside110811301"]="--Adventurer, get back!",
    ["aside110811401"]="Hmm... Hmm...",
    ["aside110811501"]="...Successor of Odin's bloodline, you have done well....",
    ["aside11081201"]="Seize the moment and show them your power!",
    ["aside11081301"]="What? What do you want to do?",
    ["aside11081401"]="Bah, I can smell something suspicious.",
    ["aside11081501"]="Pass confirmed -- Welcome to Aldebaran",
    ["aside11081601"]="Okay, this is not the time to relax.",
    ["aside11081602"]="Go to the place mentioned in the letter!",
    ["aside11081701"]="This is the place. Wait, what’s that...?!",
    ["aside11081801"]="There are 3 monsters on guard, you must be careful.",
    ["aside11081901"]="-- Oh damn it! I've been found!",
    ["aside11082001"]="That is strange... There is a Monster patrolling but we cannot see it.",
    ["aside11082002"]="-- This is not a good Cargo Box!",
    ["aside11082101"]="Damn it, there is no way we are going to figure this one out.....",
    ["aside11082201"]="Motor oil... Could it have been set on fire by the Mechanical Monster who just escaped?",
    ["aside11082202"]="OK, now I've got it -- Wait until I have dealt with you!",
    ["aside11082301"]="What happened.... The machine is catching on fire?!",
    ["aside11082401"]="Ah... Thank you so much for your help....",
    ["aside11082501"]="What's going on...?",
    ["aside11082601"]="--!!!",
    ["aside11082701"]="Huh? What on earth is this thing?",
    ["aside11082801"]="Okay, bring it to the Alchemist Guild, they will take a look at it!",
    ["aside11082901"]="The fire originated in this spot.",
    ["aside11083001"]="The contents of this wreckage has already been ransacked, it would be better to look elsewhere.",
    ["aside11083101"]="Done! Lets go to the next fire site.",
    ["aside11083201"]="How lucky, look at the wreckage next to it.",
    ["aside11083301"]="... Gahh, Geez --!",
    ["aside11083401"]="Surprisingly there are still a few of them that haven't been completely destroyed.....",
    ["aside11083402"]="Go and take a look at the others.",
    ["aside11083501"]="The wreckage of the last Monster’s remains, go and take a look!",
    ["aside11083601"]="... Gahh, Geez --!",
    ["aside11083701"]="Alright, take the chip to the guild member quickly!",
    ["aside11083801"]="Member No.: RX-786D--",
    ["aside11083802"]="Received message from the Alchemist Guild xxx·xxx .",
    ["aside11083901"]="Halt! No traffic allowed through here!",
    ["aside11084001"]="From now on, we must pay closer attention.....",
    ["aside11084101"]="Good. Now please follow my steps.",
    ["aside11084201"]="We are directly underneath the Clock tower. We just need to go south....",
    ["aside11084301"]="The road ahead is blocked by Monsters, we must clean it up. ",
    ["aside11084401"]="Good. Please keep following me.",
    ["aside11084501"]="Gee, these Monsters are really bothering me....",
    ["aside11084601"]="Great. We are almost there.",
    ["aside11084701"]="Damn it, there is another Mechanical Monster left!",
    ["aside11084801"]="Enough! You can’t kill it yet.",
    ["aside11084901"]="It looks like there is an open book over there.",
    ["aside11085001"]="xxx·xxxx?! Its him!!",
    ["aside11085101"]="Errr..... How can you eat the rotten flesh of these Monsters? ",
    ["aside11085102"]="Can’t the company find a better cemetery?",
    ["aside11085201"]="Finally some peace and quiet. I must find it before sunset.....",
    ["aside11085301"]="No, it’s not this.....",
    ["aside11085401"]="Not this either. We must hurry up.",
    ["aside11085501"]=".... Damn! Where is it?",
    ["aside11085601"]="Finally... This is the place.",
    ["aside11085701"]="Hiss!!",
    ["aside11085801"]="No, Monsters are appearing more and more frequently, we must hurry!",
    ["aside11085901"]="Ah -- The first step is to draw an Alchemist Sign on the bottle.....",
    ["aside11086001"]="The second step is to put the Fragment of Ymir's Heart into the bottle.....",
    ["aside11086101"]="The final step is to put the mouth of the bottle into the mouth of the body.....",
    ["aside11086201"]="(Brother’s name), I hope that you will forgive my brother.....",
    ["aside11086202"]="I..... I have to take your soul.",
    ["aside11086301"]="Well, the Alchemy Sign has been painted on these machines...",
    ["aside11086302"]="Next, just put the Fragment of Ymir's Heart into it.",
    ["aside11086401"]="... Gahh, Geez --!",
    ["aside11086501"]="... Alas, failed again.",
    ["aside11086502"]="Experiment No. 84, it's all up to you.",
    ["aside11086601"]="... Gahh, Geez --!",
    ["aside11086701"]="...What should I say? That I don’t care about it one bit?",
    ["aside11086801"]="Yeee -- Chaaa!!",
    ["aside11086901"]="Damn it, how am I going to fuse the soul to the machine?",
    ["aside11086902"]="Wait, maybe that book....!",
    ["aside11087001"]="Yes, that’s it! Something to love.....",
    ["aside11087002"]="(brother’s name) was there anything that he was particularly attached to when he was alive?",
    ["aside11087101"]="Something meaningful.... Perhaps he was protecting it....",
    ["aside11087102"]="Maybe its that Mechanical Owl Doll. What about that?",
    ["aside11087201"]="Where the heck did he go at night? We mus get to the bottom of it.",
    ["aside11087301"]="Here it is, follow along the paw prints.",
    ["aside11087401"]="... what's that up ahead?",
    ["aside11087501"]="Wha... What’s going on? Where did all of these dead people coming from?",
    ["aside11087601"]="Their cause of death.... It can’t be....",
    ["aside11087701"]="Uhh, bro...... Brother.....",
    ["aside11087801"]="Oh, let that guy escape....",
    ["aside11087901"]="No mistake, he can’t be too far!",
    ["aside11088001"]="It is done, quickly take it to Guild Member A!",
    ["aside11088101"]="Eh? Where are Guild Member A and Doctor B?",
    ["aside11088201"]="... What! What happened?",
    ["aside11088301"]="Wait! Don’t kill him yet!",
    ["aside11088401"]="It is dangerous here, follow me and stay close....",
    ["aside11088501"]="*Roaring--*",
    ["aside11088502"]="-- Wha.... what’s that?!",
    ["aside11088601"]="....What’s that on the ground?",
    ["aside11088701"]="I found it, the second remnant page!",
    ["aside11088801"]="Gaa----- Shi ----- !",
    ["aside11088901"]="Doctor said that it was Alarm who attacked him",
    ["aside11088902"]="Maybe the third remnant is on the Alarm’s body?",
    ["aside11089001"]="All together now, take this to the doctor!",
    ["aside11089101"]="How... How is this possible!?",
    ["aside11089201"]="An engraved wooden box.... Could this be it?",
    ["aside11089301"]="Hmm.... I’ve saved a lot of money, surely this is enough......",
    ["aside11089401"]="~Oooh. There is only one last thing remaining....",
    ["aside11089501"]=".... eh? What’s that over there?",
    ["aside11089601"]="You worry far too much brother.... explain it when we get there.",
    ["aside11089701"]="Well, next is the picture of home....",
    ["aside11089801"]="Okay! Give this to brother. I don’t know how long he can stay for this time....",
    ["aside11089901"]="Wait! Brother is over there! And... who is he with?",
    ["aside11090101"]="This is the place.",
    ["aside11090201"]="Look, there seems to be a marking on the ground.",
    ["aside11090301"]="...What's that shiny object over there?",
    ["aside11090401"]="...It looks very suspicious.",
    ["aside11090501"]="Strange... These flames?",
    ["aside11090601"]="?",
    ["aside11090701"]="Why... Why don't they work?",
    ["aside11090801"]="!!!",
    ["aside11090802"]="...Stop, Adventurer.",
    ["aside11090901"]="Uhh... Flame... Endless flame...",
    ["aside11091001"]="Ohh... Red wings... Blocking out the sky...",
    ["aside11091101"]="...How's it going?",
    ["aside11091201"]="...What are those on the ground?",
    ["aside11091301"]="Found it, and these too!",
    ["aside11091401"]="That is pretty lucky...",
    ["aside11091501"]="Gah!",
    ["aside11091601"]="Done! Time to get it back to Hardy!",
    ["aside11091701"]="Next, the Frozen Fleet...",
    ["aside11091801"]="All right, give the picture to Bronte!",
    ["aside11091901"]="Now, report back to Alexia!",
    ["aside11092001"]="May I speak to you, Adventurer?",
    ["aside11092101"]="First, we start here.",
    ["aside11092201"]="Finally... at last! I thought I was dead for sure this time...",
    ["aside11092301"]="...All quiet now.",
    ["aside11092401"]="There's a trail here, but it's too small for a dragon to pass.",
    ["aside11092501"]="The pond seems bottomless and probably not an access to the underground cave.",
    ["aside11092601"]="Here... Wait, what's this I'm sensing?",
    ["aside11092701"]="Look, something's down there!",
    ["aside11092801"]="Wh-What is this place...?!",
    ["aside11092901"]="Check out those dragon eggs!",
    ["aside11093001"]="What the...!!",
    ["aside11093101"]="(Howling)",
    ["aside11093102"]="Oh no, monster is awakened!",
    ["aside11093201"]="Bad news, Lady Alexia!",
    ["aside11093301"]="Comodo's fate rests in our hands, everyone!",
    ["aside11093401"]="Watch out, they're coming right at us!",
    ["aside11093501"]="Again? Is it ever going to end...?",
    ["aside11093601"]="Hold it, something's out there...",
    ["aside11093701"]="Thank you, Adventurer, it should be safe for a while.",
    ["aside11093801"]="I'll leave everything to you.",
    ["aside11093901"]="(Howling)",
    ["aside11094001"]="Help...! Can anyone hear me?",
    ["aside11094101"]="It's done. Time to report back to Cecilia!",
    ["aside11094201"]="Umm... Hmm...",
    ["aside11094301"]="Halt! What is your intent?",
    ["aside11094401"]="...Wait, what did you just say?",
    ["aside11094501"]="Come here, Adventurer.",
    ["aside11094601"]="Hey, we meet again!",
    ["aside11094701"]="You've finally showed, Grantham!",
    ["aside11094801"]="A life for a life, scoundrel.",
    ["aside11094901"]="Hehe! Found you!",
    ["aside11095001"]="Whoa! What are you doing?",
    ["aside11095101"]="Little one, there's nowhere else for you to hide...",
    ["aside11095201"]="Hehe, you're simply... amazing!",
    ["aside11095301"]="You're finally here, Adventurer.",
    ["aside11095401"]="It's done! Hurry, bring it to Vendra!",
    ["aside11095501"]="Well, then. Everyone, may the God of War, Tyr, bless us!",
    ["aside11095601"]="Ha! Familiar location, different mood!",
    ["aside11095701"]="Okay, now to the subject.",
    ["aside11095801"]="Click... click...",
    ["aside11095901"]="... (A big sigh).",
    ["aside11096001"]="Halt, Adventurer!",
    ["aside11096101"]="Rrrrr... Gah!",
    ["aside11096102"]="Watch out, here they come!",
    ["aside11096201"]="Now, put the leftover fish here!",
    ["aside11096301"]="Rrrrr... Gah!",
    ["aside11096401"]="No matter how many times, I still can't get used to these guys.",
    ["aside11096501"]="Click... click...",
    ["aside11096601"]="Over here, Adventurer!",
    ["aside11096701"]="(Howling)",
    ["aside11096702"]="Listen, it fell for the trap!",
    ["aside11096801"]="Ugh... Cough, cough...",
    ["aside11096901"]="Can't be seen before making it to the other end of the bridge...",
    ["aside11097001"]="...It's over. Time to report back to Alexia.",
    ["aside11097101"]="Successor of Odin's Bloodline, you have done well...",
    ["aside11141001"]="So... where can we find the wizard?",
    ["aside11141101"]="I forgot to ask where the wizard is... and this forest is huge!",
    ["aside11141201"]="Wait, what's that over there?!",
    ["aside11141301"]="Stop!!!",
    ["aside11141401"]="Please, please...",
    ["aside11141501"]="These crystals... could it be...",
    ["aside11141601"]="Please, you have to help us!",
    ["aside11141701"]="*Sniffle* Ouch...",
    ["aside11141801"]="Ahhh! Stay back, murderer! Heeeelp!!!",
    ["aside11141901"]="What's this...?!",
    ["aside11142001"]="Done. And there's Refreshing Dew left.",
    ["aside11142101"]="Take these to the wizard now!",
    ["aside11142201"]="I have made my decision, so please... Leave this place.",
    ["aside11142301"]="This time, I shall be the one to protect you, Mother Tree...",
    ["aside11142401"]="Oh no, I'm late again!",
    ["aside11142501"]="Chief, what happened?!",
    ["aside11142601"]="You! Could it be...?",
    ["aside11142701"]="We'll need to tell Tatanka about this!",
    ["aside11142801"]="You... What have you done to me?!",
    ["aside11142901"]="Let's start the verification. First, put the Phosphorescent Bulb into the lake water.",
    ["aside11143001"]="That's not right. Try adding a drip of Choco Blood.",
    ["aside11143101"]="I see. Okay, let me try.",
    ["aside11143201"]="This is...?!",
    ["aside11143301"]="This is the place.",
    ["aside11143401"]="!!!",
    ["aside11143501"]="That's unusual, right?",
    ["aside11143601"]="This must be the Kalala Swamp. So next...",
    ["aside11143701"]="Humans? Er, thanks very much...",
    ["aside11143801"]="...!!!",
    ["aside11143901"]="Hey... Things aren't as simple as you think!",
    ["aside11144001"]="What are these!!!",
    ["aside11144101"]="Cl... ick...",
    ["aside11144201"]="(Howling—)",
    ["aside11144301"]="Done. Take it to the wizard.",
    ["aside11144401"]="C-Cut it out! You're the intruders, not me!",
    ["aside11144501"]="This is Chief's Cave... Wait, look at these marks.",
    ["aside11144601"]="These scratches weren't made by any ordinary-sized monster...",
    ["aside11144701"]="Could any kind of beast have made these marks?",
    ["aside11144801"]="Aaaargh—!",
    ["aside11144901"]="Look out, Adventurer!!!",
    ["aside11145001"]="This is...?!",
    ["aside11145101"]="What? This can't be...",
    ["aside11145201"]="Darn it... Retreat!!!",
    ["aside11145301"]="What happened?",
    ["aside11145401"]="A quarantine zone... what's going on?!",
    ["aside11145501"]="Thank you... I thought I was dead for sure!",
    ["aside11145601"]="Darn! Tatanka is in danger!",
    ["aside11145701"]="What happened here?!",
    ["aside11145801"]="There's something out there...",
    ["aside11145901"]="Wait, it's not over yet...",
    ["aside11146001"]="What's the roaring sound?!",
    ["aside11146101"]="Found it! Come quickly!",
    ["aside11146201"]="Hmm...",
    ["aside11146301"]="Hisss...",
    ["aside11146401"]="Done. Take it to the wizard.",
    ["aside11146501"]="Adventurer, come and look at this container...",
    ["aside11146601"]="Finally, I know what this really is.",
    ["aside11146701"]="Tatanka, you're here!",
    ["aside11146801"]="Okay, take these to the wizard!",
    ["aside11146901"]="You guys...",
    ["aside11147001"]="Now, listen to me.",
    ["aside11147101"]="What, it's just one of my own men!",
    ["aside11147201"]="There, that's the guy. Grab him!",
    ["aside11147301"]="Enough, enough!",
    ["aside11147401"]="Come here, Adventurer.",
    ["aside11147501"]="Phew... That was close.",
    ["aside11147601"]="That must be them.",
    ["aside11147701"]="Hel's servants... I'll need to find them.",
    ["aside11147801"]="Those two over there... That's them.",
    ["aside11147901"]="... Okay, I understand now.",
    ["aside11148001"]="... Weird.",
    ["aside11148101"]="Heheheh... Welcome, dear guests. I've been expecting you.",
    ["aside11148201"]="You dare to invade my kingdom with such meager strength?",
    ["aside11148301"]="Welcome to the party! Try not to disappoint me.",
    ["aside11148401"]="Oh wow, you can't even deal with a minion?",
    ["aside11148501"]="Darn. I can't use my strength...",
    ["aside11148601"]="I don't think you're strong enough to last much longer.",
    ["aside11148701"]="This isn't good. I'm getting weaker...",
    ["aside11148801"]="It appears the time has come to settle this!",
    ["aside11148901"]="Stop. Who told you to attack?!",
    ["aside11149001"]="Come look at this.",
    ["aside11149101"]="The holder of the Sacred Relic is up ahead. Follow me.",
    ["aside11149201"]="... Hel?!",
    ["aside11149301"]="You will not succeed!",
    ["aside11149401"]="Hey... the fight's got easier?",
    ["aside11149501"]="Wait. My strength... it's returned?!",
    ["aside11149601"]="Could it be the Potent Pill of Undeath...",
    ["aside11149701"]="What are you still dawdling about?!",
    ["aside11149801"]="Why the rush? The fun has just begun!",
    ["aside11149901"]="What is this place...?!",
    ["aside11150001"]="Inside Hibram's brain...",
    ["aside11150101"]="This labyrinth is crawling with guards... Looks like you'll have to deal with them yourself!",
    ["aside11150201"]="This is the entrance to the memory.",
    ["aside11150301"]="Israel...",
    ["aside11150401"]="Is that... Hibram?!",
    ["aside11150501"]="... Your voice has reached me.",
    ["aside11150601"]="Eh... Ah...",
    ["aside11150701"]="Look out, master!",
    ["aside11150801"]="Ugh... How upsetting.",
    ["aside11150901"]="... Master, is this really okay?",
    ["aside11151001"]="... Huh. I didn't expect you'd be unable to handle even this.",
    ["aside11151101"]="What's that up ahead? Is it Hel?!",
    ["aside11151201"]="Haha! Fresh power!",
    ["aside11151301"]="...",
    ["aside11151401"]="Take care of these guards.",
    ["aside11151501"]="The deeper we go into the labyrinth, the stronger the guards become...",
    ["aside11151601"]="This looks like the entrance to Hibram's second memory!",
    ["aside11151701"]="Why...?",
    ["aside11151801"]="Okay, take it and feed Lareia!",
    ["aside11151901"]="Tell me... Tell me why?!",
    ["aside11152001"]="Surely it's not really too late...",
    ["aside11152101"]="I beg of you... I have nowhere else to turn!",
    ["aside11152201"]="Humph...",
    ["aside11152301"]="... Begone!!!",
    ["aside11152401"]="...",
    ["aside11152501"]="These guards are something else... We must be getting closer to the truth!",
    ["aside11152601"]="Let's take a look at Hibram's third memory!",
    ["aside11152701"]="Please listen to me...",
    ["aside11152801"]="Monsters are blocking the way. Leave it to me...",
    ["aside11152901"]="This way. Please follow.",
    ["aside11153001"]="Relax. I can handle these monsters.",
    ["aside11153101"]="Hel's temple should not be far now.",
    ["aside11153201"]="Oh? And who might you be...?",
    ["aside11153301"]="These shackles are beautiful, aren't they?",
    ["aside11153401"]="...!",
    ["aside11153501"]="Finally...",
    ["aside11153601"]="Master sent back the letter I mailed him... Could it be...?",
    ["aside11153701"]="Master...",
    ["aside11153801"]="Darn. These monsters are blocking my view...",
    ["aside11153901"]="I can now see clearly. It's that one...",
    ["aside11154001"]="Such leisurely existences...",
    ["aside11154101"]="...",
    ["aside11154201"]="Is this... the labyrinth seems to have changed?!",
    ["aside11154301"]="That must be the manifestation of Hibram's consciousness.",
    ["aside11154401"]="That key should unlock these chains...",
    ["aside11154501"]="Master...",
    ["aside11154601"]="At long last... It's over.",
    ["aside11154701"]="Israel... What is this?!",
    ["aside11154801"]="Wizard, what's wrong...?",
    ["aside11154901"]="Successor of Odin's bloodline, you have done well...",
    ["aside11155001"]="Oh, it... But I also...",
    ["aside11155101"]="This strength... Could it be Odin's bloodline...",
    ["aside11160101"]="...That person is...?",
    ["aside11160201"]="Minister Philodis?!",
    ["aside11160301"]="How can this be...?",
    ["aside11160401"]="Welcome to Juno, Adventurer!",
    ["aside11160501"]="So that person is Andre?",
    ["aside11160601"]="...I see. I got it now.",
    ["aside11160701"]="These should be enough, right?",
    ["aside11160801"]="Thanks for your patronage!",
    ["aside11160901"]="Done!",
    ["aside11161001"]="T-Thank you... I feel much better now.",
    ["aside11161101"]="You... Just now... Are you...?!",
    ["aside11161201"]="Cough... Thank you, Adventurer.",
    ["aside11161301"]="Thank you, Adventurer! You're a great help!",
    ["aside11161401"]="Ouch Ouch Ouch Ouch!",
    ["aside11161501"]="Hurry up! They can't wait any longer!",
    ["aside11161601"]="Easy... My good old waist...",
    ["aside11161701"]="Here, here!",
    ["aside11161801"]="Boo... Boohoo...",
    ["aside11161901"]="Good, this should be the last one!",
    ["aside11162001"]="Great job, Adventurer!",
    ["aside11162101"]="...You are indeed worth it.",
    ["aside11162102"]="Andre?!",
    ["aside11162201"]="S-Stop, Stop! Stop hitting it!!!",
    ["aside11162301"]="Yes, this is it!",
    ["aside11162401"]="Halt! Don't go any further!",
    ["aside11162501"]="Who's there?!",
    ["aside11162601"]="...What's going on? Is it a person?",
    ["aside11162701"]="Seems all cleared here, more or less.",
    ["aside11162801"]="Alright! Then next...",
    ["aside11162901"]="T-Thank you... That was a close call.",
    ["aside11163001"]="This... What...?!",
    ["aside11163101"]="So strong... How could it be...?",
    ["aside11163201"]="I knew you would never let me down.",
    ["aside11163301"]="Good... Let's go!",
    ["aside11163401"]="Looks like we can enter from here...?",
    ["aside11163501"]="What's this...?!",
    ["aside11163601"]="...Ahem...",
    ["aside11163701"]="This model...?!",
    ["aside11163801"]="Then... I will meet you later, Adventurer.",
    ["aside11163901"]="You're back!",
    ["aside11164001"]="...Thank you for keeping your promise, Adventurer.",
    ["aside11164101"]="Could it be...?!",
    ["aside11164201"]="Thanks for helping, Adventurer!",
    ["aside11164301"]="Hehe!",
    ["aside11164302"]="This voice...",
    ["aside11164401"]="This should be all of them, right?",
    ["aside11164501"]="Inventory checked! Thank you very much.",
    ["aside11164601"]="Woah! Isn't this Minister Philodis?",
    ["aside11164701"]="Then, come with me, Adventurer!",
    ["aside11164801"]="...Ahhh! This is not a good sign.",
    ["aside11164901"]="Finally fixed it.",
    ["aside11165001"]="Please... Just hang in there for a second!",
    ["aside11165101"]="Keep it up! It's almost there!",
    ["aside11165201"]="This feeling... Again?!",
    ["aside11165202"]="Hey! Get out of the way!",
    ["aside11165301"]="I'm here, Adventurer!",
    ["aside11165401"]="What's going on with everybody?",
    ["aside11165501"]="You guys are finally back!",
    ["aside11165601"]="Yes... This is it.",
    ["aside11165701"]="Great. All the preparation work has been finished!",
    ["aside11165801"]="A bunch of rubbish!",
    ["aside11165901"]="...Nonsense!",
    ["aside11166001"]="...Ha, grasping at straws.",
    ["aside11166101"]="I suggest you stop resisting, Mr. Kiel Khayr.",
    ["aside11166201"]="...W-What's the matter, Guardian?!",
    ["aside11166301"]="Am I right?",
    ["aside11166401"]="...Time to go, Adventurer.",
    ["aside11166501"]="Stop right there!",
    ["aside11166601"]="...Finally meet you, the successor of Odin's bloodline.",
    ["aside11166701"]="...This doesn't look like an ordinary monster attack.",
    ["aside11166801"]="These people... What are they doing?",
    ["aside11166901"]="This kind of text... I've seen it somewhere before.",
    ["aside11167001"]="I've never given them any permission to manufacture androids of this model!",
    ["aside11167101"]="How can this be...?!",
    ["aside11167201"]="What in the world is this...",
    ["aside11167301"]="...Is this the secret weapon to fight against Rekenber Corp?",
    ["aside11167401"]="...Adventurer? Adventurer!",
    ["aside11167402"]="...What happened to you?",
    ["aside11167501"]="Hold on! Something's up!",
    ["aside11167601"]="...OK! Now let's proceed!",
    ["aside11167701"]="Watch out! A group of Guardians of the Ruins is blocking the way!",
    ["aside11167801"]="Phew... That was close.",
    ["aside11170101"]="S-1028L... This batch number...?",
    ["aside11170201"]="Someone as clever as you must have noticed something, right?",
    ["aside11170301"]="Right... That's it.",
    ["aside11170401"]="This should do it, right?",
    ["aside11170501"]="... Huh? What a surprise running into you here, Adventurer...",
    ["aside11170601"]="H-How are you feeling? Any better, Adventurer?",
    ["aside11170701"]="... What a strange name.",
    ["aside11170801"]="... It's TL33019-SG! SG!",
    ["aside11170901"]="That's...?",
    ["aside11171001"]="Aaaargh—! What's that?!",
    ["aside11171002"]="Hello? Hey! Adventurer? What happened?!",
    ["aside11171101"]="Oh dear, this is... a very creative piece of graffiti!",
    ["aside11171201"]="Man! That was a close call!",
    ["aside11171301"]="... Adventurer? Adventurer? Come in, do you copy?!",
    ["aside11171401"]="… I guess we'll have to try something else.",
    ["aside11171501"]="Welcome to my \"Paradise,\" successor of Odin's bloodline!",
    ["aside11171601"]="... Adventurer? Can you hear me—",
    ["aside11171602"]="Yay! This comm channel is now under my control!",
    ["aside11171701"]="You, you're such a meddler!",
    ["aside11171801"]="Look over here, Adventurer.",
    ["aside11171901"]="... Good thing you're okay.",
    ["aside11172001"]="From here on, let's split up.",
    ["aside11172101"]="This won't do, Adventurer.",
    ["aside11172201"]="Now, it looks much better.",
    ["aside11172301"]="... Leave the rest to the professionals.",
    ["aside11172401"]="... Right on time, Adventurer.",
    ["aside11172501"]="Hey-hey-hey! What are you doing?!",
    ["aside11172601"]="Why are you still following me?",
    ["aside11172701"]="This is...?",
    ["aside11172801"]="... Reboot... Complete...",
    ["aside11172901"]="It's getting dark soon, Adventurer.",
    ["aside11173001"]="Welcome back, Adventurer.",
    ["aside11173101"]="Okay, come a bit closer, Adventurer.",
    ["aside11173102"]="Check out what they're talking about.",
    ["aside11173201"]="This is... what they're planning.",
    ["aside11173301"]="Eh? Is that...?",
    ["aside11173401"]="Hold on, Adventurer. Look over there—",
    ["aside11173402"]="Let's go. Find out what they're talking about.",
    ["aside11173501"]="What are you doing?!",
    ["aside11173601"]="Run! Now!",
    ["aside11173701"]="... I think we're safe here now.",
    ["aside11173801"]="Enough!",
    ["aside11173901"]="Here is good enough.",
    ["aside11174001"]="... Who's there?",
    ["aside11174101"]="Enough, Adventurer. Just knock them out.",
    ["aside11174201"]="Good. One more chip to go.",
    ["aside11174301"]="... You again?",
    ["aside11174401"]="Good. That's everything.",
    ["aside11174501"]="Right on time, Adventurer.",
    ["aside11174601"]="... I'm here.",
    ["aside11174701"]="Over here, Adventurer.",
    ["aside11174801"]="That's good enough, youngster.",
    ["aside11174901"]="Be careful... the methane is thick here.",
    ["aside11175001"]="Okay, okay... it'll be wrecked if you hit it again.",
    ["aside11175101"]="... There, do you see it?",
    ["aside11175201"]="Cough... Hurry up, my back is hurting...",
    ["aside11175301"]="Finally made it...",
    ["aside11175401"]="Good, this is the last one.",
    ["aside11175501"]="Right on time, Adventurer.",
    ["aside11175601"]="Weird... why aren't they back yet...?",
    ["aside11175701"]="Melanie...",
    ["aside11175801"]="Boss! The research train has arrived!",
    ["aside11175802"]="Okay, get ready to unload!",
    ["aside11175901"]="... Alright, now to find the General Merchant.",
    ["aside11176001"]="Thanks for your patronage!",
    ["aside11176101"]="Did you get the stuff, Adventurer?",
    ["aside11176201"]="... Great job, Adventurer.",
    ["aside11176301"]="What now...",
    ["aside11176401"]="Okay, see you later, Adventurer!",
    ["aside11176501"]="W-we're saved...",
    ["aside11176601"]="Stop, stop, stop... Right here!",
    ["aside11176701"]="So... our quest's done.",
    ["aside11176801"]="No, no way... I can't walk anymore!",
    ["aside11176901"]="So... just walk to the end of this tunnel.",
    ["aside11177001"]="Adventurer... I've got a bad feeling.",
    ["aside11177101"]="It's not here... a bit further, Adventurer.",
    ["aside11177201"]="... We're very close.",
    ["aside11177301"]="Adventurer, look over there!",
    ["aside11177401"]="Hurry up! The monsters are gathering!",
    ["aside11177501"]="Hmph, piece of cake!",
    ["aside11177601"]="Huh? More monsters are coming?",
    ["aside11177701"]="All set, Adventurer!",
    ["aside11177801"]="Alright, next one!",
    ["aside11177901"]="That should do it, right?",
    ["aside11178001"]="We must believe dawn will eventually come, right?",
    ["aside11178101"]="... No matter what, I've done my best.",
    ["aside11178201"]="Drink up... might as well get hammered.",
    ["aside11178301"]="The commotion's died down... You probably want to talk alone, right?",
    ["aside11178401"]="Hmm... Are they already off to the abandoned warehouse?",
    ["aside11178501"]="What's up with them?",
    ["aside11178601"]="This paper is...?",
    ["aside11178701"]="Crap! We've got to rush to Nogg Cave!",
    ["aside11178801"]="... Intruder, detected.",
    ["aside11178901"]="Keep going...",
    ["aside11178902"]="...?",
    ["aside11179001"]="... Identity not detected.",
    ["aside11179002"]="... Intercept protocol, activated.",
    ["aside11179101"]="Thank you, Adventurer.",
    ["aside11179201"]="Even if the path leads to a bottomless abyss...",
    ["aside11179202"]="... Will you still forge ahead?",
    ["aside11179301"]="We entrust our will... to you.",
    ["aside11179401"]="... Hmph, grasping at straws.",
    ["aside11179501"]="Stop your futile resistance.",
    ["aside11179601"]="You can't win.",
    ["aside11179701"]="I don't need to go over the rest, right?",
    ["aside11179801"]="Ms. Irumina?!",
    ["aside11179901"]="... Don't be afraid, it's safe here.",
    ["aside11180001"]="Th-This place...?!",
    ["aside11180101"]="What did you say?!",
    ["aside11180102"]="This voice...?",
    ["aside11180201"]="Is it here...?",
    ["aside11180301"]="… It looks like there's another letter?",
    ["aside11180401"]="Your dream... I'll fulfill it.",
    ["aside11180501"]="What's wrong, Adventurer?!",
    ["aside11180601"]="What on earth are you doing?!",
    ["aside11180701"]="… I'm happy you're back in one piece.",
    ["aside11180801"]="... Clack, clack... data analysis...",
    ["aside11180901"]="I know he's here!",
    ["aside11181001"]="... What exactly are you up to?",
    ["aside11181101"]="Over here, Adventurer.",
    ["aside11190101"]="Enjoy your meal!",
    ["aside11190201"]="Uh, excuse me... Would you mind letting me have that one?",
    ["aside11190301"]="... It's the same familiar taste.",
    ["aside11190401"]="Eh? So early today?",
    ["aside11190501"]="Kafra's got you covered, anytime, anywhere!",
    ["aside11190601"]="Over here, Adventurer.",
    ["aside11190701"]="This should be far enough, right?",
    ["aside11190801"]="... Don't ask anything right now, Adventurer.",
    ["aside11190901"]="Okay, we should be safe here.",
    ["aside11191001"]="Hi there! Need some help?",
    ["aside11191101"]="Follow me, Adventurer.",
    ["aside11191201"]="... You've got some nerve!",
    ["aside11191301"]="Sorry, we don't need help from outsiders.",
    ["aside11191401"]="Hmph... fine, do whatever you want then!",
    ["aside11191501"]="Mom, are you still in pain...?",
    ["aside11191601"]="Th-Thank you... I'm feeling a lot better.",
    ["aside11191701"]="Chop-chop, everyone!",
    ["aside11191801"]="Ugh... the sun is blazing today...",
    ["aside11191901"]="... Found it!",
    ["aside11192001"]="Ugh... It's so hot...",
    ["aside11192101"]="This is it!",
    ["aside11192201"]="Almost...",
    ["aside11192301"]="Took forever... my eyes hurt...",
    ["aside11192401"]="Let's go, Adventurer.",
    ["aside11192501"]="Mom! Look who's back—it's the Adventurer!",
    ["aside11192601"]="Huh...?",
    ["aside11192701"]="... What's the matter, Adventurer?",
    ["aside11192801"]="... This should be enough, right?",
    ["aside11192901"]="Ugh... books are no fun.",
    ["aside11193001"]="... Another book about alchemy?",
    ["aside11193101"]="... I've already read all of these.",
    ["aside11193201"]="Are they all handed out already?",
    ["aside11193301"]="... What's going on?",
    ["aside11193401"]="Looks like you made quite the haul.",
    ["aside11193501"]="Nice! Something new to read!",
    ["aside11193601"]="Hmm... what does this word mean?",
    ["aside11193701"]="Um... could you read it out loud for me?",
    ["aside11193801"]="... You're injured! You shouldn't be doing this...",
    ["aside11193901"]="... Hurry up and get over here.",
    ["aside11194001"]="Hey! What are you all wandering around for?",
    ["aside11194101"]="Place your bet!",
    ["aside11194201"]="Alright then! Best of luck to you both!",
    ["aside11194301"]="Welcome, everyone! We're honored to have you here!",
    ["aside11194302"]="Sit back and enjoy today's show!",
    ["aside11194401"]="What the...?! So powerful?!",
    ["aside11194501"]="... What are these things?!",
    ["aside11194601"]="—And today's winner's here!",
    ["aside11194602"]="Let's give it up for both contestants!",
    ["aside11194701"]="Now that was something else!",
    ["aside11194801"]="... Check it—are we good?",
    ["aside11194901"]="Okay, we should be safe here.",
    ["aside11195001"]="We meet again, Adventurer.",
    ["aside11195002"]="Malam?!",
    ["aside11195101"]="What took you so long?",
    ["aside11195201"]="How do you feel, Adventurer?",
    ["aside11195301"]="Leaving now?",
    ["aside11195401"]="Taken care of everything, Adventurer?",
    ["aside11195501"]="The Pope has been expecting you, Adventurer.",
    ["aside11195601"]="Ahem... Well, Lord Carl certainly thought this through.",
    ["aside11195701"]="Gremlin...",
    ["aside11195801"]="Could it be this?",
    ["aside11195901"]="Good...",
    ["aside11196001"]="Hazy Herb...",
    ["aside11196101"]="... This?",
    ["aside11196201"]="Truly... Odin's chosen...",
    ["aside11196301"]="Are you looking for me, Adventurer?",
    ["aside11196401"]="Is this... Gremlin Tear?",
    ["aside11196501"]="... Hah, interesting.",
    ["aside11196601"]="Could it be...?",
    ["aside11196701"]="This is where... all six hundred years of Arunafeltz's knowledge came to be.",
    ["aside11196801"]="... Hey! Over here! Come on!",
    ["aside11196901"]="Weird... Why are there monsters in the Temple?",
    ["aside11197001"]="Look! There's a door!",
    ["aside11197101"]="... Useless! A bunch of rubbish!",
    ["aside11197201"]="Argh! You're done! I'm gonna deal with you now—",
    ["aside11197301"]="What are you doing?",
    ["aside11197401"]="Well, it looks like we're stuck on this together now.",
    ["aside11197501"]="Wait, Adventurer... something feels off here.",
    ["aside11197601"]="Hmm. Are those deep marks from the blades?",
    ["aside11197701"]="This...?!",
    ["aside11197801"]="The trail... just ends here?",
    ["aside11197901"]="It looks like some kind of personal accessory.",
    ["aside11198001"]="...!!!",
    ["aside11198101"]="That is...?!",
    ["aside11198201"]="Mother...",
    ["aside11198301"]="Look! There's a camp!",
    ["aside11198401"]="Looks like someone's been digging here.",
    ["aside11198501"]="I think there's something ahead...",
    ["aside11198601"]="This is... horrible...",
    ["aside11198701"]="Look over there!",
    ["aside11198801"]="That monster... doesn't seem to be following us.",
    ["aside11198901"]="Wait—what?! It's gone?!",
    ["aside11199001"]="This is... the Temple?!",
    ["aside11199101"]="Raaah—!",
    ["aside11199102"]="Aah! There are monsters everywhere here!",
    ["aside11199201"]="These monsters... look just like the ones in the Ice Cave.",
    ["aside11199301"]="Hmm... is this a cellar?",
    ["aside11199401"]="... Get away! Go!",
    ["aside11199402"]="Martistine! Watch out!",
    ["aside11199501"]="... I see.",
    ["aside11199601"]="Let's go check somewhere else.",
    ["aside11199701"]="What... is this machine?",
    ["aside11199801"]="Kill... Kill...",
    ["aside11199802"]="?!",
    ["aside11199901"]="Kill... KILL ME...",
    ["aside11200001"]="Ah... AHHH...",
    ["aside11200002"]="?!",
    ["aside11200101"]="It hurts... It really hurts...",
    ["aside11200201"]="Just as I thought...",
    ["aside11200202"]="Mentor?!",
    ["aside11200301"]="Huh...?",
    ["aside11200302"]="Apologies, Your Holiness, I have something to report.",
    ["aside11200401"]="... What an honored guest.",
    ["aside11200501"]="...!!!",
    ["aside11200601"]="Let's hear my plan!",
    ["aside11200701"]="... Exactly what I suspected.",
    ["aside11200801"]="Now that I think about it, how did the Pope find out...?",
    ["aside11200901"]="Everything is ready!",
    ["aside11201001"]="... This should be good enough, right?",
    ["aside11201101"]="Tch... so it's all just weapons...",
    ["aside11201201"]="Hmph! Let's snap a nice group photo of you all!",
    ["aside11201301"]="Alright! This should be enough!",
    ["aside11201401"]="So? Everything going okay?",
    ["aside11201501"]="Settle down—tell me everything!",
    ["aside11201601"]="How... how did this happen?",
    ["aside11201602"]="Maybe... this was the Goddess's will.",
    ["aside11201701"]="Weird... did something happen?",
    ["aside11201801"]="Was someone here?",
    ["aside11201901"]="Lord Odin...",
    ["aside11201902"]="?!",
    ["aside11202001"]="Lord Odin... I've finally found you...",
    ["aside11202002"]="... Who are you?",
    ["aside11202101"]="Knew something was off about this place.",
    ["aside11202201"]="... When your insatiable desire is cast aside...",
    ["aside11202301"]="... When the weight of power is yielded to its rightful bearer...",
    ["aside11202401"]="... When the chains of obsession no longer hold you...",
    ["aside11202501"]="... When you bare your soul in true remorse for sins of thy past...",
    ["aside11202601"]="... Only then will god forgive your sins...",
    ["aside11202701"]="... So begins the path that leads you home.",
    ["aside11202801"]="Adventurer! Look!",
    ["aside11202901"]="!!!",
    ["aside11202902"]="Adventurer?!",
    ["aside11203001"]="I've been waiting for you, Adventurer.",
    ["aside11203101"]="Adventurer? Adventurer?! Wake up!",
    ["aside11203201"]="How's it going? Making any progress?",
    ["aside11203301"]="Uh... brother...?",
    ["aside11203401"]="Phew...",
    ["aside11203501"]="This...?!",
    ["aside11203601"]="Impossible...!",
    ["aside11203701"]="Nonsense! You're slandering me!",
    ["aside11203801"]="Musa...?",
    ["aside11203901"]="Damn it! Where'd they go?!",
    ["aside11204001"]="... Guess we'll have to head back to the Temple for now.",
    ["aside11204101"]="... Looks like you didn't catch them either.",
    ["aside11204201"]="You all have returned.",
    ["aside11204301"]="Lighthalzen again?!",
    ["aside11204401"]="Adventurer, how did it go?",
    ["aside11204501"]="... You're back already, Adventurer?",
    ["aside11204601"]="This presence...?",
    ["aside11204701"]="Hey! The Adventurer is right there!",
    ["aside11210101"]="Hello! I'm the courier from Gilded Rose Trading Company!",
    ["aside11210201"]="It is confirmed! Thank you for your cooperation!",
    ["aside11210301"]="If everything's fine, please sign here!",
    ["aside11210401"]="Since the delivery's complete, I'll be on my way!",
    ["aside11210501"]="I've been expecting you, Adventurer.",
    ["aside11210601"]="I've been waiting for you for a long time, Adventurer.",
    ["aside11210602"]="... Dave?!",
    ["aside11210701"]="Over here, Adventurer.",
    ["aside11210801"]="S-Stay away...!",
    ["aside11210901"]="Whew... that was close! Good thing you showed up.",
    ["aside11211001"]="Hang in there, Adventurer.",
    ["aside11211101"]="... It's just up ahead.",
    ["aside11211201"]="Here it is, Adventurer.",
    ["aside11211301"]="This is... Rekensheim Institute.",
    ["aside11211302"]="... Let's check things out first.",
    ["aside11211401"]="Stop! Who the heck are you?!",
    ["aside11211402"]="That voice... sounds familiar?",
    ["aside11211501"]="Seyren?!",
    ["aside11211601"]="What's this...?!",
    ["aside11211602"]="Adventurer, go see what's happened to them!",
    ["aside11211701"]="Everyone, listen to me.",
    ["aside11211801"]="Calm down, everyone—this isn't the time to argue.",
    ["aside11211901"]="Looks like... a library?",
    ["aside11211902"]="Let's look around, Adventurer.",
    ["aside11212001"]="What's with this place...?",
    ["aside11212101"]="No... it just keeps coming...",
    ["aside11212201"]="What's... this...?",
    ["aside11212301"]="For some reason... I'm getting sleepy.",
    ["aside11212401"]="Who's calling me?!",
    ["aside11212402"]="It's me, Adventurer.",
    ["aside11212501"]="Everyone, please gather at the main hall right now.",
    ["aside11212502"]="I've got some good news for you all.",
    ["aside11212601"]="Good, looks like everyone's here.",
    ["aside11212701"]="Anyway, let's do a quick check around, okay?",
    ["aside11212801"]="There's a strange smell in the air.",
    ["aside11212901"]="... Ivy?!",
    ["aside11213001"]="... These are the ones, right?",
    ["aside11213101"]="Vegetable oil... where is it?",
    ["aside11213201"]="Hurry up, don't drag your feet!",
    ["aside11213301"]="Hmm... not bad.",
    ["aside11213401"]="You're finally back, Adventurer.",
    ["aside11213501"]="Adventurer, are you awake?",
    ["aside11213601"]="Oh my... looks like the killer scores another point.",
    ["aside11213602"]="Everyone—please gather at the main hall.",
    ["aside11213701"]="...?! That's...",
    ["aside11213801"]="Adventurer! Thank goodness... I thought it was you.",
    ["aside11213901"]="Congrats, everyone—we took down the killer!",
    ["aside11214001"]="Ivy... Why?",
    ["aside11214002"]="... Go! Let's get out of here!",
    ["aside11214101"]="Time's short, so I'll keep it brief.",
    ["aside11214201"]="Hang in there! Adventurer!",
    ["aside11214301"]="There's more of them coming...",
    ["aside11214401"]="Now! Adventurer!",
    ["aside11214501"]="This is...?!",
    ["aside11214601"]="... Handle it with care, Adventurer.",
    ["aside11214701"]="... Great, the lock's corroded.",
    ["aside11214801"]="Finally! We are out!",
    ["aside11214901"]="... This is the place, right?",
    ["aside11215001"]="Warning—power anomaly detected—",
    ["aside11215002"]="All personnel—evacuate immediately—",
    ["aside11215101"]="Trinity...",
    ["aside11215201"]="Sky Euin...",
    ["aside11215301"]="I...",
    ["aside11215401"]="I won't lose... the next time...",
    ["aside11215501"]="Zenlur...",
    ["aside11215601"]="Master...",
    ["aside11215701"]="... If it's you...",
    ["aside11215801"]="Seyren...?",
    ["aside11215901"]="My sister... she's right here!",
    ["aside11216001"]="... Anyway, let's clean up first.",
    ["aside11216101"]="Okay... now's the time!",
    ["aside11216201"]="... Is it here?",
    ["aside11216301"]="Found it!",
    ["aside11216401"]="... Anyway, let's clean up first.",
    ["aside112164011"]="Is it here...",
    ["aside11216501"]="Okay... now's the time!",
    ["aside11216601"]="Now... there's just one last thing to do.",
    ["aside11216701"]="... Wait a moment, Adventurer.",
    ["aside11216801"]="Farbauti! Laufey!",
    ["aside11216901"]="... Adventurer?!",
    ["aside11217001"]="Well... that sure was unexpected.",
    ["aside12000101"]="Woah! What a touching scene!",
    ["aside12000201"]="The bottom half of the poem has been torn off?! What... what should I do now?",
    ["aside12000301"]="Sigh, I feel so sorry for Parni.",
    ["aside12000401"]="She should be Parni. I'll go ask her!",
    ["aside12000501"]="Are these the tombstones of the three princes from the Gaebolg family?",
    ["aside12000502"]="Isn't it strange that all three princes died on the same day?",
    ["aside12000503"]="In any case, I'll head back and ask Parni first!",
    ["aside12000601"]="Where's Parni? What's that on the ground?",
    ["aside12000701"]="You have arrived. I have been waiting for you.",
    ["aside12000801"]="We're here.",
    ["aside12000901"]="Who are you?! How dare you barge into the royal tomb!",
    ["aside12001001"]="...Quick, follow her quietly!",
    ["aside12001101"]="You are...?!",
    ["aside12001201"]="Adventurer, he is free to see you now.",
    ["aside12001301"]="We're here. Don't keep Walter waiting.",
    ["aside12001401"]="Adventurer, come over.",
    ["aside12001501"]="...What are you doing?!",
    ["aside12001601"]="Urgh... Adventurer...",
    ["aside12001701"]="Hmm? They seem to be saying something. Let's get closer!",
    ["aside12001801"]="He-help... HELP ME! G-G-GHOST!",
    ["aside12001901"]="Ah... Another visit from the living...?",
    ["aside12001902"]="D-did you hear that?! What was it?",
    ["aside12002001"]="Who's that in the photos? Her photos are everywhere. I should take a photo and show it to Colorful!",
    ["aside12002101"]="The words on the insignia... Nerius Guards?!",
    ["aside12002102"]="Colorful is a member of the Nerius royal family?!",
    ["aside12002201"]="The cover reads \"Captain: Colorful Nerius\"... No wonder!",
    ["aside12002202"]="Some of the content is better left unsaid.",
    ["aside12002301"]="I found it! There's a whole bunch near the altar! Follow me!",
    ["aside12002401"]="Don't be afraid, Sherry. Look, these Planktons like you.",
    ["aside12002402"]="Is there really no problem with these monsters of the deep?",
    ["aside12002403"]="No problem at all! Come, try touching them!",
    ["aside12002501"]="Huh, wait a minute, aren't you a little too enthusiastic? Sherry?! Sherry?!",
    ["aside12002502"]="Adventurer, something's not right! Hurry, save us!",
    ["aside12002601"]="Hahaha, I've always been so focused on training that I tend to forget some important things.",
    ["aside12002701"]="Hmm... Dinza doesn't look too bad, huh?",
    ["aside12002702"]="Hehe, I gotta learn to pay more attention to things other than training!",
    ["aside12002801"]="This Obeaune's bark is worse than her bite. She didn't kill him.",
    ["aside12002802"]="I think there's a need to investigate further. It might have something to do with the God of the Sea.",
    ["aside12002901"]="Can't find it... Did Elliott manage to escape? Or...?",
    ["aside12003001"]="Did we hurt Ygnizem?",
    ["aside12003101"]="I'm sorry... for... causing so much trouble...",
    ["aside12003102"]="Let's go.",
    ["aside12003201"]="Will this trap really work? Will the Goblin really fall into it?",
    ["aside12003301"]="Um... let's just pretend it will work.",
    ["aside12003401"]="They're here! It's them!",
    ["aside12003501"]="No! Stay away!",
    ["aside12003502"]="Huh? Is someone calling for help?",
    ["aside12003503"]="This voice... Is it Morts?!",
    ["aside12003601"]="Let's leave them alone to let them calm down.",
    ["aside12003701"]="Since when did I become Dinza's assistant?",
    ["aside12003801"]="This seems a little... cruel.",
    ["aside12003901"]="Ah! Found it! I better go comfort her!",
    ["aside12004001"]="Let me see... Hmm, go north first!",
    ["aside12004101"]="This is a straight road! Following it can't go wrong!",
    ["aside12004201"]="Hmm... Follow the river, then go west!",
    ["aside12004301"]="This feels just like a normal stone surface.",
    ["aside12004401"]="They're not here yet? We'll wait a little longer then.",
    ["aside12004501"]="Something doesn't feel right...",
    ["aside12004601"]="This is getting a lot of positive feedback! Awesome!",
    ["aside12004701"]="Do all craftsmen care about \"perfection\"?",
    ["aside12004801"]="There are new footprints on the ground? Whose are they?",
    ["aside12004901"]="The footprints are headed in there!",
    ["aside12005001"]="Such a cute picture!",
    ["aside12005101"]="I'm going to sing everyone a brand-new song! It hasn't even been debuted yet!",
    ["aside12005102"]="Let's get out of here first.",
    ["aside12005201"]="Is Eclipse Skin so dangerous?",
    ["aside12005301"]="Hahaha, another person fooled!",
    ["aside12005302"]="There really are so many fools!",
    ["aside12005303"]="Fooled? Me? Damn, I'm going to teach him a lesson!",
    ["aside12005401"]="Will the bard really be inspired by something like this?",
    ["aside12005501"]="Help! Help!",
    ["aside12005502"]="Ah, so that's it!",
    ["aside12005601"]="Is he alright?",
    ["aside12005701"]="Why would the Tarou want to grab the backpack? What's inside?",
    ["aside12005801"]="This isn't a calming potion! It's definitely a berserk potion!",
    ["aside12005901"]="He almost killed me! I have to go back and settle the score with him!",
    ["aside12006001"]="How disgusting.",
    ["aside12006101"]="What's with these Thief Bug Eggs?",
    ["aside12006102"]="I want to keep the Thief Bugs that hatched as pets!",
    ["aside12006103"]="Ridiculous! Thief Bugs are monsters! How could you bring them to the city!",
    ["aside12006104"]="Seeing that this is your first offense, you shall not be held responsible for the destruction of these Thief Bug Eggs!",
    ["aside12006201"]="Is Frank finally going to give up?",
    ["aside12006301"]="It appeared! How effective!",
    ["aside12006401"]="I don't really know how to face Chef Dobbin now. How else can I help him?",
    ["aside12006501"]="The way that the monsters were being eliminated seems a little twisted.",
    ["aside12006601"]="It... It can't be real, right?",
    ["aside12006701"]="This is the taste of love.",
    ["aside12006801"]="Will putting these ingredients together really make medicine?",
    ["aside12006901"]="I don't know whose pot this is... but I'm sorry!",
    ["aside12007001"]="Open wide and let me take a look!",
    ["aside12007002"]="Can... can I still be saved?",
    ["aside12007003"]="Ah? What are you saying?",
    ["aside12007004"]="If I have to become a vampire, then please let me...",
    ["aside12007005"]="Who said anything about you becoming a vampire? It's just the flu!",
    ["aside12007006"]="Really?",
    ["aside12007007"]="Why would I lie? I'll give you some medicine, then you just need to go home and rest.",
    ["aside12007008"]="What a relief. Looks like it was all just a misunderstanding.",
    ["aside12007101"]="Such a worrying child.",
    ["aside12007201"]="Punk Mira? I'll take note of it.",
    ["aside12007301"]="This scent... It's quite subtle.",
    ["aside12007401"]="Do these two used to know each other?",
    ["aside12007501"]="Looks like his first quest was a success.",
    ["aside12007601"]="I think Morts doesn't seem as bad as he looks. I hope everything goes well for them.",
    ["aside12007701"]="Let's look around! I'll ask you to stop when I find an unmarked area.",
    ["aside12007801"]="This is the place! Move to the center of the area; I want to record it!",
    ["aside12007901"]="He really can't feel the presence of the witch beside him? Hold up, Punk.",
    ["aside12008001"]="Awoo... Wolf guards! Let's drive out the ones who disturbed our peace!",
    ["aside12008101"]="A witch... I can't believe they actually exist.",
    ["aside12008201"]="I seem to have seen Arlene's hidden side.",
    ["aside12008301"]="A group of seagulls... I think I remember seeing them when I first arrived on Izlude Island.",
    ["aside12008401"]="A captain's uniform with antlers? Why does it look so familiar?",
    ["aside12008501"]="I'll look for Lacus later. I'll tell Caslisse the story first!",
    ["aside12008601"]="I'll have to go take a photo of Captain Kahn's spirit as evidence for Lacus.",
    ["aside12008701"]="I'm sorry, Lacus! No matter how cruel, I have to tell you the truth!",
    ["aside12008801"]="Where can I buy medicine? I should ask a general merchant!",
    ["aside12008901"]="There's no time to lose, let's get going!",
    ["aside12009001"]="Adventurer, why did you bring her to such a dangerous place?!",
    ["aside12009002"]="I didn't want to part ways with those last words, so I insisted to be brought here.",
    ["aside12009003"]="Lacus, I... I... I can't even hug you now...",
    ["aside12009004"]="I'm sorry, for saying you don't care about me and that you're unable to provide for our family.",
    ["aside12009005"]="If I hadn't have said those things, you wouldn't have risked going out to sea.",
    ["aside12009006"]="Even if I could decide all over again, I'd still choose to go, for the sake of our future.",
    ["aside12009007"]="As I was setting sail, I told myself that after I come back from this voyage, I'll stay with you for the rest of our lives.",
    ["aside12009008"]="But now, the gods are punishing me for my recklessness.",
    ["aside12009009"]="I want to say that I'm sorry, and that... I love you.",
    ["aside12009101"]="The ghost princess? I'd really like to meet her.",
    ["aside12009201"]="You're hiding. Why come here if you're afraid of ghosts?",
    ["aside12009301"]="Ah, could that be...",
    ["aside12009401"]="Is this a joke? The living afraid of a ghost, and a ghost afraid of the living?!",
    ["aside12009501"]="I can finally meet the ghost princess now that I've sent Arlene away!",
    ["aside12009601"]="Is there a captain's study here? Could it be upstairs?",
    ["aside12009701"]="Royal guards? Looks like there's more to Colorful's identity.",
    ["aside12009801"]="Judging from Colorful's reaction, choosing to withhold certain information from her was the right call.",
    ["aside12009901"]="This hair accessory was already broken.",
    ["aside12010001"]="Ygnizem seems really upset. Ah, I have an idea!",
    ["aside12010101"]="Thank you, I'll still need some silver ore and gold ore.",
    ["aside12010201"]="Great, I'm just short of some gold ore now.",
    ["aside12010301"]="I think this is enough!",
    ["aside12010401"]="With Halmod around, those monsters are going to pay!",
    ["aside12010501"]="Haha! They're no match for me!",
    ["aside12010601"]="You came. Looks like I put my faith in the right person!",
    ["aside12010701"]="You're really slow, my friend!",
    ["aside12010801"]="Ouch!",
    ["aside12010901"]="Darn it! Stupid kidnapper!",
    ["aside12011001"]="Agnes? Wait a second, what's that on the ground?",
    ["aside12011101"]="...Let's take a break here.",
    ["aside12011201"]="Let's hide over there. I want to see who the kidnapper is!",
    ["aside12011301"]="Here he comes!",
    ["aside12011401"]="Stop! This must be a misunderstanding!",
    ["aside12011501"]="Let's use the signal flare here.",
    ["aside12011601"]="Be careful of those ants!",
    ["aside12011701"]="Let's move on! Stay alert!",
    ["aside12011801"]="Oh no, Wulf is in trouble! Let's help him!",
    ["aside12011901"]="That's right, this is the herb!",
    ["aside12012001"]="Morts is, in a sense, just a simple musician.",
    ["aside12012002"]="It was great to be able to help him out at the South Gate that time.",
    ["aside12013901"]="I think the Swordsman Guild is to the west? Let's go take a look.",
    ["aside12014001"]="The central marketplace seems really lively. Let's go check it out!",
    ["aside12014101"]="I heard that the Training Course is a great place to hone combat abilities! Let's check it out since I've advanced my job!",
    ["aside12020101"]="Weird... Where did the invitation go?",
    ["aside12020201"]="This guard has the invitation!",
    ["aside12020301"]="Alright, alright, I admit defeat!",
    ["aside12020401"]="That beautiful lady must be Veronica. I'll give the present to her!",
    ["aside12020501"]="...Oh no, oh no, she's going to be so upset!",
    ["aside12020601"]="It's this nest again.",
    ["aside12020701"]="Great! Veronica Flowers are here!",
    ["aside12020702"]="Gah!",
    ["aside12020801"]="Phew, now I can pick Veronica Flowers in peace.",
    ["aside12020901"]="...You! What did you do?!",
    ["aside12021001"]="No— Bohr!",
    ["aside12021101"]="Firstly, place the Earth Magic Core on Master Bohr's right side.",
    ["aside12021201"]="Next, place the Water Magic Core on Master Bohr's left side.",
    ["aside12021301"]="Lastly, place the Undead Magic Core by Master Bohr's feet.",
    ["aside12021401"]="Great, now I'm going to cast the spell.",
    ["aside12021501"]="All done, Master Bohr you should be completely fine now.",
    ["aside12021601"]="That's enough. Now try feeding this toxin to the Lunatic I brought over.",
    ["aside12021701"]="Just as expected. Quick, examine the Lunatic's corpse.",
    ["aside12021801"]="Oh no! We've been found!",
    ["aside12021901"]="Stop!",
    ["aside12022001"]="I have to get back to the Training Course and find Master Bohr!",
    ["aside12022101"]="Akand, we have news of Chino's whereabouts!",
    ["aside12030101"]="These flowers should suffice.",
    ["aside12030201"]="There's a girl there. Could it be her?",
    ["aside12030301"]="That's...",
    ["aside12030401"]="Too slow! Too slow!",
    ["aside12030501"]="This is the place!",
    ["aside12030601"]="Kaitlyn, you'll love these!",
    ["aside12030701"]="It must be Jurgen!",
    ["aside12030801"]="What are you trying to do?!",
    ["aside12030901"]="Found it!",
    ["aside12031001"]="Incalculable delicacies hold no value and sobriety is worthless; drunken stupor should prevail! Burp!",
    ["aside12031101"]="Found it!",
    ["aside12040101"]="Those marks up ahead?",
    ["aside12040201"]="I should search ahead; there might be...",
    ["aside12040301"]="These bloodstains. Could they belong to him?!",
    ["aside12040401"]="Go check under the tree!",
    ["aside12040501"]="Halt!",
    ["aside12040601"]="Who are those thieves?",
    ["aside12040701"]="Leave the stuff!",
    ["aside12040801"]="That's strange. How did they know I have Merlin's Manuscript?",
    ["aside12040901"]="Hmph, don't even think about going over there!",
    ["aside12041001"]="They just keep coming. I'll have to be extra careful!",
    ["aside12041101"]="Ahem, you're just in time!",
    ["aside12041201"]="Nithil said not to trust anyone. I need to be extra cautious!",
    ["aside12041301"]="I'd better hurry to the Sage Hut!",
    ["aside12041401"]="Do you know the details of what it looks like? Why not take a photo?",
    ["aside12041501"]="Now, let's see what he has on him.",
    ["aside12041601"]="...What's this? Let's show it to Kroneika!",
    ["aside12041701"]="M-Master Nithil, here you are!",
    ["aside12041801"]="...No more fighting! No more fighting!",
    ["aside12041901"]="Remember, don't let your guard down.",
    ["aside12042001"]="Let's look around ahead, but tread carefully.",
    ["aside12042101"]="He's heading for the bucket. Hurry and put the Truth Potion in!",
    ["aside12042201"]="Done. Now try asking him!",
    ["aside12042301"]="(Growling.)",
    ["aside12042302"]="Looks like we can't move on until we get rid of these guys.",
    ["aside12042401"]="How did the person orchestrating all this get into such a dangerous place?",
    ["aside12042501"]="Up ahead! Is that...?!",
    ["aside12042601"]="Wait, there seems to be something by the river.",
    ["aside12042701"]="Who could be here?",
    ["aside12042702"]="You really do like showing up uninvited, don't you?",
    ["aside12042801"]="You're back, adventurer.",
    ["aside12050101"]="Oh no! Those two people are in danger!",
    ["aside12050201"]="Alright, hurry and return to Pooler Garden!",
    ["aside12050301"]="...Wait, this is?!",
    ["aside12050401"]="This is...!",
    ["aside12050501"]="...As expected.",
    ["aside12050601"]="Those assassins were injured in battle. These blood stains should be theirs...",
    ["aside12050701"]="I should continue my search ahead. There might be...",
    ["aside12050801"]="These tracks are...?! Hurry, tell Azer and the others!",
    ["aside12050901"]="Check the other cargo boxes as well...",
    ["aside12051001"]="There are some cargo boxes there as well...",
    ["aside12051101"]="...Darn it, I've been found! Gob!",
    ["aside12051201"]="Pain—I'm in pain ahhhhhh—",
    ["aside12051301"]="Alright, hurry and tell Azer the results of the investigation!",
    ["aside12051401"]="Is this... enough?",
    ["aside12051501"]="Adventurer, come...",
    ["aside12051601"]="Alright, hurry and tell Azer what you've just heard.",
    ["aside12060101"]="As expected, the Corps have already left. Let’s have a look around and see if they have left any clues.",
    ["aside12060201"]="These are of no use at all.... wait! What is that?",
    ["aside12060301"]=".....Who left this manuscript?",
    ["aside12060302"]="First, go to the place mentioned in the note.",
    ["aside12060401"]="First, go to the place mentioned in the note.",
    ["aside12060501"]="Giant mummy? Maybe the archaeologists will be able to tell us something.",
    ["aside12060601"]="Okay, we will have to try and tame it.",
    ["aside12060701"]="Done! Now we wait for night to come....",
    ["aside12060801"]="Well done, now quietly spray the poison over their bodies!",
    ["aside12060901"]="Next, feed the magic thorn to the Mummy.",
    ["aside12061001"]="That is strange, there is still no sign of the king... Lets keep looking!",
    ["aside12061101"]="What? What’s that.....?",
    ["aside12061201"]="What the hell is this -- Ouch!!!",
    ["aside12061202"]="...Y-you're back again!?",
    ["aside12061301"]="What the heck! Who threw this stone?",
    ["aside12061401"]="Oh no! The Corps have returned! Get out of here!",
    ["aside12061501"]="Yes, on the recently found note.....",
    ["aside12061502"]="First, go to the place mentioned in the note.",
    ["aside12061601"]=".....Who the heck could have left these tips?",
    ["aside12061602"]="First, go to the place mentioned in the note.",
    ["aside12061701"]="Goodness, the security guard guarding the supplies is not letting us through! So how are we going to....",
    ["aside12061702"]="--Oh, Over here, adventurer! What luck!",
    ["aside12061801"]="Let go of me -- let go.....",
    ["aside12061901"]="Hey hey-- Those are my minerals! Damn Giearth!",
    ["aside12062001"]="It's all up to you now, adventurer!",
    ["aside12062002"]="...This voice?",
    ["aside12062101"]="*Crying*",
    ["aside12062201"]="Ouch!",
    ["aside12062301"]="There are Golum’s all around us, Lets clean them up first!",
    ["aside12062401"]="Done. Now put the fresh meat on.....",
    ["aside12062501"]="How.... Why haven’t we got the King’s clue yet?",
    ["aside12062601"]="What... what's going on?!",
    ["aside12062701"]="There is only one container left, it couldn’t be.....?!",
    ["aside12062801"]="The person who left the not will turn up eventually.",
    ["aside12062901"]="Alright. Lets have another think, what did that blonde kid say...?",
    ["aside12063001"]="...I knew you'd come.",
    ["aside12063002"]="Well, what else has he been saying?",
    ["aside12063101"]="Alright, the first thing that he asked for has already been completed. ",
    ["aside12063102"]="Well, what else has he been saying?",
    ["aside12063201"]="Now, the second thing has also been completed.",
    ["aside12063301"]="We meet again, Adventurer.",
    ["aside12070101"]="Can you come over for a bit, Adventurer?",
    ["aside12070201"]="You again...? How?",
    ["aside12070301"]="Then you better keep up with me!",
    ["aside12070401"]="Darn it, monsters block the passage again!",
    ["aside12070501"]="Excellent. But the Sword of Valiant is probably deeper in the cave.",
    ["aside12070601"]="...This place is as problematic as in the rumors.",
    ["aside12070701"]="I think we're close to that dragon's lair!",
    ["aside12070801"]="What's this...?!",
    ["aside12070901"]="Argh! Go away, go away!",
    ["aside12071001"]="Nope, there's no end to this! Fall back!",
    ["aside12071101"]="What the heck is it...?",
    ["aside12071201"]="Attention, attention! Barbara's show starts in five minutes!",
    ["aside12071202"]="Hey, that name...?!",
    ["aside12071301"]="Hey, don't scramble! There's enough for everyone!",
    ["aside12071401"]="Now is the time to meet this beauty!",
    ["aside12071501"]="...Hmph, only fools would believe that.",
    ["aside12071601"]="Command a monster to steal the handkerchief... First, lock onto the target!",
    ["aside12071701"]="All right! Next is the fine beer for bribery...",
    ["aside12071801"]="Now we can go find the Galapago that Speeka mentioned!",
    ["aside12071901"]="...Coo?",
    ["aside12072001"]="Coo... Coo, coo!",
    ["aside12072101"]="It's done. Time to see Speeka!",
    ["aside12072201"]="Gaw, gaw!",
    ["aside12072301"]="As expected...",
    ["aside12072401"]="Roar!!!",
    ["aside12072501"]="...!!!",
    ["aside12072601"]="Now, we need a new approach.",
    ["aside12072701"]="It's done. Time to speak with Elena!",
    ["aside12072801"]="Culture can offer you \"get-rich-quick\" opportunities, so recite these poems well, little ones!",
    ["aside12072901"]="Thanks! That was a close call.",
    ["aside12073001"]="I think there are enough clues now.",
    ["aside12073101"]="This is...?!",
    ["aside12073201"]="Wh-What do you really want?!",
    ["aside12073301"]="Please... don't press me anymore!",
    ["aside12073401"]="...",
    ["aside12080101"]="That's it ahead. We need to deal with these monsters first...",
    ["aside12080201"]="Okay, sneak up and see what they're saying.",
    ["aside12080301"]="Darn. This place is crawling with monsters too...",
    ["aside12080401"]="The cemetery... could that be what it means?",
    ["aside12080501"]="Halt! Who's there?!",
    ["aside12080601"]="Hold on, hold on! It's Adventurer!",
    ["aside12080701"]="(Caw—)",
    ["aside12080801"]="Then, after praying, drink the water from the Central Fountain...",
    ["aside12080901"]="Then gather branches of ash and elm...",
    ["aside12081001"]="Got it. Report to the Archbishop!",
    ["aside12081101"]="What a joke—it's ridiculous! Haha!",
    ["aside12081201"]="... What are you doing?!",
    ["aside12081301"]="Oh, so even you...!",
    ["aside12081401"]="Attention, everyone.",
    ["aside12081501"]="B-But...",
    ["aside12081601"]="Darn. There are so many of them...",
    ["aside12081701"]="Surely they can't all be...!",
    ["aside12081801"]="So, has that jogged your memory?",
    ["aside12081901"]="You... How could...",
    ["aside12082001"]="Azer, don't do anything stupid!",
    ["aside12082101"]="Oh, how could this happen...",
    ["aside12082201"]="The guards have got the hall surrounded...",
    ["aside12082301"]="What's going on? Where have the banquet servants gone?",
    ["aside12082401"]="... You can stop looking.",
    ["aside12090101"]="Now you're gonna listen huh?",
    ["aside12090201"]="...What's going on here?",
    ["aside12090301"]="...That was close.",
    ["aside12090401"]="Congratulations on completing the quest, Adventurer.",
    ["aside12090501"]="This is...!?",
    ["aside12090601"]="How can these things not be killed?!",
    ["aside12090701"]="Warning, warning. Danger, danger...",
    ["aside12090801"]="Now! Let's move on!",
    ["aside12090901"]="Warning, warning. Danger, danger...",
    ["aside12091001"]="They are getting increasingly stronger...",
    ["aside12091002"]="...Watch out, the intruder must be up ahead.",
    ["aside12091101"]="Hang in there! Adventurer!",
    ["aside12091201"]="Over here, Adventurer!",
    ["aside12091301"]="Chirp-chirp, choo-choo... o(*////▽////*)",
    ["aside12091302"]="Tsk... So damn fast!",
    ["aside12091401"]="Chug-chug-chug Σ(⊙▽⊙",
    ["aside12091402"]="Ha——ha... Geez, what in the world powers it...",
    ["aside12091501"]="Gotcha!",
    ["aside12091601"]="Now you're gonna listen huh?",
    ["aside12091701"]="Could it be...?",
    ["aside12091801"]="This should be enough.",
    ["aside12091901"]="Gah! Ahahahaha! Gah! Gah! Gah! What's up? Long time no see!",
    ["aside12091902"]="Ar... gota...",
    ["aside12092001"]="Is this... a repeated scene?",
    ["aside12092101"]="It's over. But Lush, how did you know there was a monster inside Uncle Gamow?",
    ["aside12092102"]="I don't know... Strange, I wonder why.",
    ["aside12092201"]="I think I should catch up with you. Adventurer, the Mysterious Device has recreated the altered timeline.",
    ["aside12092202"]="Watch out; the shadow of the third person appears in that timeline for the first time.",
    ["aside12092301"]="Lush and... Barr Venter?",
    ["aside12092401"]="The demon lord is dying, and the sage is upon us; oh lover, before dawn, listen to my heart!",
    ["aside12092402"]="Nightfall never ends with the looming cloud over your soul; spare me your feelings, and trust only yourself!",
    ["aside12092403"]="What's that noise?!!",
    ["aside12092501"]="Cough, heh... such a broken soul. Thanatos, are you planning revenge?",
    ["aside12092502"]="But are you really entitled to revenge?",
    ["aside12092503"]="Thanks to you, this woman's flashing memories are so fascinating; I just can't keep them to myself.",
    ["aside12092601"]="It turns out that before the sacrifice, her soul was already filled with nothing but regrets and sorrow.",
    ["aside12092602"]="Speaking of revenge, you'd be on that list too, wouldn't you?",
    ["aside12092603"]="So, I'll take revenge for you, making sure he never forgets his mistakes...",
    ["aside12092604"]="No——!",
    ["aside12092701"]="Click... Click... The recreation is completed. Transfer now?",
    ["aside12092702"]="Cancel transfer. Returning to the original timeline.",
    ["aside12092801"]="Nice, this is the model I need.",
    ["aside12092901"]="Calculating... ERROR!!!",
    ["aside12093001"]="Soul, experiment, mechanical Lush.",
    ["aside12093002"]="Calculating...",
    ["aside12093003"]="Calculating...",
    ["aside12093004"]="Time Node: AW706, Location: Rekensheim R&D Dept Sector One.",
    ["aside12093101"]="Good... Let's see the level of distortion of this land.",
    ["aside12093201"]="Thank you! Thanks to all of you... Cough, cough...",
    ["aside12093401"]="Good... Let's see the level of distortion of this land.",
    ["aside12093601"]="Stay back!!!",
    ["aside12093701"]="Po? Popo! Poring! Poring!",
    ["aside12093801"]="(Chewing) Po? Po!!!",
    ["aside12093901"]="What do you want? Let my android go; you can have all the Zeny!",
    ["aside12093902"]="Let go of Zenlur! We'll talk alone!",
    ["aside12093903"]="Fine, you, you let him go first...",
    ["aside12094001"]="Why are you here? What did you do to Dr. Milian?",
    ["aside12094002"]="I'll tell you on the way, just come with me!",
    ["aside12094101"]="Adventurer! Look at what I just finished... Oh, Zenlur...",
    ["aside12094102"]="He's all yours!",
    ["aside12094201"]="Ivy! Get out here!!!",
    ["aside12094202"]="Command executing—Eliminate—Intruders—",
    ["aside12094301"]="Stop fighting, go check on Zenlur!",
    ["aside12094401"]="How... how did this happen?",
    ["aside12094501"]="Add the materials to the crucible and give it to Zenlur when it's done.",
    ["aside12094601"]="Adventurer, over here!",
    ["aside12094701"]="Zenlur, didn't you want to fight? Get over here.",
    ["aside12094702"]="W-What? ... AHHH!!!",
    ["aside12094801"]="Hi! Adventurer!",
    ["aside12094901"]="Back off! No one is allowed here!",
    ["aside12095001"]="Adventurer?",
    ["aside12095101"]="Bzz—Humans who are poking around our secrets—Bzz",
    ["aside12095201"]="Wait!",
    ["aside12095301"]="Shh... Adventurer, over here.",
    ["aside12095401"]="Adventurer? Are you looking for my father?",
    ["aside12095501"]="So that's how it is...",
    ["aside12095601"]="This is——the North Stars!",
    ["aside12095701"]="Malam's trading company? Let's check with him.",
    ["aside12095801"]="Midgard? Maybe Wolmas the Archbishop knows something...",
    ["aside12095901"]="Could it be Orfeo's performance? Go ask Malam.",
    ["aside12096001"]="Greetings! You've arrived at Rachel's signature inn—we are honored to have you!",
    ["aside12096101"]="Stop shouting! Who's the real boss here, huh?!",
    ["aside12096201"]="Aisha... Aishaaaa...",
    ["aside12096301"]="Hey! That's Celia's! Get back here!",
    ["aside12096401"]="You're finally back!",
    ["aside12096501"]="Ahem, excuse me, Adventurer...",
    ["aside12096601"]="Step back! No entry beyond this point!",
    ["aside12096701"]="Adventurer?",
    ["aside12096801"]="Ugh, the usual junk. I'll take it, but tell him to bring something better next time!",
    ["aside12096901"]="Ouch! That hurt!",
    ["aside12097001"]="White hair... heterochromatic eyes... she's the Pope?",
    ["aside12097101"]="Isumia... Isumia...",
    ["aside12097102"]="You heard it too, right? He's currently in Glast Heim St. Abbey.",
    ["aside12097201"]="What have you done!?",
    ["aside12097301"]="Is it all over?",
    ["aside12097401"]="A shift from the top down... Let's check out the Grey Wolf Village outside the city first.",
    ["aside12097501"]="Cough, cough... Who's here?",
    ["aside12097601"]="For raw stone... maybe we should ask Malam...",
    ["aside12097701"]="Over here, Adventurer.",
    ["aside12097801"]="Everyone, allow me to report.",
    ["aside12097901"]="They've left. You can come out now.",
    ["aside12098001"]="This should be enough.",
    ["aside12098101"]="Please! Help me out!",
    ["aside12098201"]="Look! That's the one!",
    ["aside12098301"]="Now! Adventurer!",
    ["aside12098401"]="Grr... blblblbl...",
    ["aside12098501"]="Seriously? Out again?!",
    ["aside12098601"]="... That's more like it.",
    ["aside12098701"]="This... How is this possible!?",
    ["aside12098801"]="Cell wall... there's no cell wall?",
    ["aside12098901"]="... Grandpa...",
    ["aside12099001"]="Then we shall regroup later, Adventurer!",
    ["aside12099101"]="This should be enough!",
    ["aside12099201"]="Alright, it's time to return to Grey Wolf Village!",
    ["aside12099301"]="With this, our success is now assured.",
    ["aside12099401"]="Now's our chance!",
    ["aside12099501"]="Who's there?!",
    ["aside12099601"]="Stop right there!",
    ["aside12099701"]="(Rachel swears) You are fast!",
    ["aside12099801"]="Got you now!",
    ["aside12099901"]="Sorry! Lights out for you!",
    ["aside12100001"]="From all things, I was born...",
    ["aside12100101"]="And in death, I shall return to all things.",
    ["aside12100201"]="The eagles shall claim my eyes...",
    ["aside12100301"]="And wolves shall feast on my heart...",
    ["aside12100401"]="Fruit shall bloom from my flesh and blood...",
    ["aside12100501"]="Vines shall flourish entwined with my bones—",
    ["aside12100601"]="... So long as my heart endures, my soul shall never fade.",
    ["aside12101001"]="Successor of Odin's Bloodline... I can sense the hunger for power that stirs within you.",
    ["aside12101002"]="Stand before me once more; may you still recall the path that led you here.",
    ["aside12101101"]="Hmm... I sense the presence of an enemy.",
    ["aside12101201"]="This armor was crafted by the finest blacksmith of Glast Heim in their day...",
    ["aside12101301"]="This shield has protected us countless times...",
    ["aside12101401"]="This is a crossbow that could pierce even the hardest steel...",
    ["aside12101501"]="Are you here to seek answers about the Rune Slab?",
    ["aside12101502"]="Step forward—you have earned the right to these answers.",
    ["aside12101601"]="Who dares to trespass into the lair of dragons?!",
    ["aside12101701"]="Ah, the hero who completed the trial has returned...",
    ["aside12101801"]="This is...?",
    ["aside12101901"]="... What is this place?",
    ["aside12101902"]="Brother... wait for me.",
    ["aside12102001"]="That's the Hell Poodle... the gatekeeper of the Realm of the Dead.",
    ["aside12102101"]="... Nothing will keep me from going on.",
    ["aside12102201"]="Don't meet her gaze... or you'll be petrified.",
    ["aside12102301"]="The Temple... we're almost there.",
    ["aside12102401"]="... Stop right there.",
    ["aside12102501"]="... Such a melody... You may proceed.",
    ["aside12102601"]="Mortal, I know what it is you seek.",
    ["aside12102701"]="Hmm...",
    ["aside12102702"]="I think... I heard something?",
    ["aside12102801"]="It hurts...",
    ["aside12102802"]="No... almost there.",
    ["aside12102901"]="Alsa... my sister...",
    ["aside12102902"]="... Brother!",
    ["aside12103001"]="Don't look back!!",
    ["aside12103002"]="Huh? This is... the bedroom?",
    ["aside12103101"]="Something up, Adventurer?",
    ["aside12103201"]="Just a moment, Adventurer!",
    ["aside12103301"]="You are... Rossin's...?!",
    ["aside12103401"]="Mmm... Looks sweet.",
    ["aside12103501"]="Is it that one?",
    ["aside12103601"]="... You think she'll find out?",
    ["aside12103701"]="... You're here to persuade me as well, Malam?",
    ["aside12103801"]="This is... my sister's favorite flower.",
    ["aside12103901"]="And... Rossin's favorite wine.",
    ["aside12104001"]="Has she agreed?",
    ["aside12104101"]="(Bzzzt—) Welcome to Alpha Manor.",
    ["aside12104201"]="Tamaureen... Hic! Where's... my wine?",
    ["aside12104301"]="Please... help... (Bzzt—) Young master...?",
    ["aside12104401"]="Hello, how may I assist you?",
    ["aside12104501"]="Please wait.",
    ["aside12104601"]="Item received, confirmed.",
    ["aside12104701"]="Please (Bzzt—) wait...",
    ["aside12104801"]="This is...?",
    ["aside12104901"]="Tsk, what did you see?",
    ["aside12105001"]="Alright, alright, I'll look... hic!",
    ["aside12105101"]="Could this be... the battlefield of Thanatos and Morroc?",
    ["aside12105201"]="Hey, that's not bad! Good enough for now!",
    ["aside12105301"]="Uh, hey—do you know Barr Venter, by any chance?",
    ["aside12105401"]="A-Adventurer?!",
    ["aside12105501"]="What's this...? Wait, I can go back?!",
    ["aside12105601"]="It's been a while, Adventurer.",
    ["aside12105701"]="Adventurer, where did you go?",
    ["aside12105801"]="Morts... Come on...",
    ["aside12105901"]="I live for the drink!",
    ["aside12106001"]="Long time no see, Adventurer.",
    ["aside12106101"]="Adventurer?",
    ["aside12106201"]="How do I approach that cat...",
    ["aside12106301"]="You are back!",
    ["aside12106401"]="That's the one!",
    ["aside12106501"]="The traveler from another world... That must be him.",
    ["aside13000101"]="Where can I find Mana Crystals in such a huge mine?",
    ["aside13000102"]="Hmm, isn't this the Giearth stronghold?",
    ["aside13000103"]="They'd know where to find Mana Crystals!",
    ["aside13000201"]="Hmm, let's get this Giearth to carry some fragments.",
    ["aside13000301"]="Undead creatures don't deserve sympathy.",
    ["aside13000302"]="When you say that, it makes me feel sorry for them.",
    ["aside13000401"]="Woooo! Vile Whisper!",
    ["aside13000402"]="Who's that? Sounds like he needs help. It seems to have come from another level.",
    ["aside13000403"]="Let's have a look!",
    ["aside13000501"]="This priest is a spirit that hasn't been exorcised, right?",
    ["aside13000502"]="He remembers his duty to pray to Odin, even in death.",
    ["aside13000503"]="He's a kind spirit and should not be destroyed.",
    ["aside13000504"]="I still want to help him, even if it means going against the archbishop's instructions.",
    ["aside13000601"]="This is it! It's old and damaged. It seems history has taken its toll.",
    ["aside13000701"]="Ew... Even good wine can't withstand the trial of time.",
    ["aside13000702"]="I never want to smell this again.",
    ["aside13000801"]="He disappeared. I think he must have returned to Odin's side.",
    ["aside13000901"]="Hmm? Has somebody else arrived before me?",
    ["aside13001001"]="Go look for a bard's instrument? What's happening?",
    ["aside13001002"]="I don't understand. I'll talk to him first.",
    ["aside13001101"]="This is his instrument? Should it be handed over to the Misha Guild?",
    ["aside13001102"]="This is very important to Caslisse! It should be returned to her!",
    ["aside13001103"]="I will not turn my back on justice just to pass the trial!",
    ["aside13001104"]="Yup, this is what I shall do!",
    ["aside13001201"]="If this is the case, what will become of that person's trial?",
    ["aside13001202"]="Should I help him?",
    ["aside13001301"]="(Looks like I've helped the right person. This adventurer doesn't seem like a bad person.)",
    ["aside13001401"]="Huff, huff... Is it done yet? My hands are about to break.",
    ["aside13001402"]="No, no, no. There's still a long way for you to go.",
    ["aside13001403"]="Who... who's that?",
    ["aside13001501"]="He ran away. How strange.",
    ["aside13001502"]="Speaking of which, it's so hot. This thing isn't poisonous, is it?",
    ["aside13001601"]="This ore does look kind of different.",
    ["aside13001701"]="The Temple of Dawn—the place where my adventure began.",
    ["aside13001801"]="I can feel an abundance of magic inside!",
    ["aside13001901"]="It's so intriguing that a piece of cloth like this will become a priest's robe after it's been cleansed.",
    ["aside13002001"]="Payon can even enhance a pelt like this? His workmanship is really amazing.",
    ["aside13002101"]="This bone feels creepy. I makes me uncomfortable.",
    ["aside13002201"]="The ground is shaking! Is it an earthquake?!",
    ["aside13002202"]="The seal in the Mjolnir Mine is getting very dangerous.",
    ["aside13002203"]="There's no time to lose, let's get going!",
    ["aside13002301"]="Mumu Be will not give up, even if there's only one Giearth left!",
    ["aside13002302"]="This sound... Is it a Giearth?!",
    ["aside13002401"]="Mysts? Something's wrong!",
    ["aside13002402"]="Careful! They're super strong now!",
    ["aside13002501"]="We're here! This is the first Mana Crystal mine!",
    ["aside13002601"]="Both the crystal and the gap disappeared! Adventurer, you're amazing!",
    ["aside13002602"]="The crystal won't materialize even when there's no danger in the gap?",
    ["aside13002603"]="Let's look for the other crystals!",
    ["aside13002701"]="These monsters intend to destroy the crystals! They must be stopped!",
    ["aside13002801"]="The second one! There are two more— Ahhhhh! Earthquake!",
    ["aside13002802"]="That one was even worse. What's happening?",
    ["aside13002901"]="Damn. The crystal... Are we too late?",
    ["aside13003001"]="It's beyond repair.",
    ["aside13003002"]="Let's hurry to the next crystal!",
    ["aside13003003"]="Be careful! Judging from how strong the earthquake was just now...",
    ["aside13003004"]="We might meet a strong foe.",
    ["aside13003101"]="Hey! This is a joke, right?!",
    ["aside13003201"]="Made it!",
    ["aside13003202"]="Awesome! Mumu Be and the adventurer saved the world!",
    ["aside13003203"]="But one of the seals was destroyed...",
    ["aside13003204"]="Mumu Be doesn't know magic,",
    ["aside13003205"]="but since all the crystals and gaps have disappeared, everything should be alright now, right?",
    ["aside13003206"]="Hopefully...",
    ["aside13003301"]="Here's comes another human to hinder the resurrection of the great Pharaoh!",
    ["aside13003302"]="Stop that adventurer!",
    ["aside13003303"]="Resurrection of the Pharaoh? Let's force some information out of them!",
    ["aside13003401"]="Stop, stop! We'll confess, we'll confess!",
    ["aside13003501"]="(The human he referred to should be that adventurer, right?)",
    ["aside13003502"]="Hey! Stop running! Stand still!",
    ["aside13003503"]="A girl's voice? Let's go check it out.",
    ["aside13003601"]="Who is that! How dare you interfere with the Pharaoh's great resurrection plan!",
    ["aside13003602"]="You have all been used by the devil! Its real motive is...",
    ["aside13003603"]="Atrocious! How dare you insult the great Seti's faithful allies!",
    ["aside13003604"]="Unforgivable! Guards, kill them! Now!",
    ["aside13003605"]="There's no choice. Let them rest in peace.",
    ["aside13003701"]="Wha... what's with this shaking?!",
    ["aside13003702"]="(It feels just like that time in the mine! Could it be...?)",
    ["aside13003801"]="This air feels familiar.",
    ["aside13003802"]="Egypt, no... Midgard, your king is back!",
    ["aside13003803"]="Long live King Seti! Long live the Egyptian empire!",
    ["aside13003804"]="Why are these guys so relentless?!",
    ["aside13003805"]="Ignore the guards! Defeat the Pharaoh to end this!",
    ["aside13003901"]="Okay, let's take a look at the first clue.",
    ["aside13003902"]="Southern meadow knows no hate; a grave as home to winter shrubs... South, grave...",
    ["aside13003903"]="Ah! Grave in the south! Let's go find out if there's a place like that!",
    ["aside13004001"]="Ah! These spots are responding to Odin's bloodline!",
    ["aside13004002"]="I knew it! This is the place!",
    ["aside13004101"]="There, the first seal is done. Huh...?",
    ["aside13004102"]="I feel like I'm being watched.",
    ["aside13004201"]="It disappeared! Is it Baphomet? No, I think it's just an illusion.",
    ["aside13004202"]="Whatever, I've got to hurry to the next area! The next clue is...",
    ["aside13004203"]="West spring meets a sandy land; rippling willow, pavilion front.",
    ["aside13004204"]="According to how the previous clue worked, this should be referring to a pavilion in the west that's under a willow tree!",
    ["aside13004301"]="Haha! No sweat! Let me just imbue it with some power...",
    ["aside13004401"]="Done! But doesn't this seem like suspiciously smooth-sailing?",
    ["aside13004402"]="There haven't been any interruptions... Ah! The Baphomet Jr. is here again!",
    ["aside13004501"]="And it's gone again... Why doesn't it attack me? What does it want?",
    ["aside13004502"]="Forget it, there's still one last clue. Let me complete it!",
    ["aside13004503"]="Journey to the clear eastern skies; harvest falls with western rains.",
    ["aside13004504"]="Haha. I don't really understand it, but I'm sure it has something to do with places in the east that have water!",
    ["aside13004601"]="So the water in the clue was a waterfall! Great! Time to get to work!",
    ["aside13004701"]="It feels really odd that I haven't been attacked yet.",
    ["aside13004702"]="When I see that Baphomet Jr. again, I'll... Ah! It's appeared!",
    ["aside13004801"]="I keep getting the feeling that something bad is about to happen.",
    ["aside13004901"]="My judgment was... I'm sorry, Sage Kroneika.",
    ["aside13004902"]="I can't just leave Payon to fend for himself. I'll come back as soon as I can!",
    ["aside13004903"]="I hope this won't turn into an irreversible situation.",
    ["aside13005001"]="I get the feeling that something bad is about to happen.",
    ["aside13005002"]="All three seals have been reinforced. Time to head back to Instructor Sky Euin.",
    ["aside13005101"]="A Pecopeco has appeared! Approach it quietly.",
    ["aside13005201"]="Yes! Got its feather!",
    ["aside13005301"]="This looks a scene from hell...",
    ["aside13005302"]="Is everybody okay? I need to get to Central Square!",
    ["aside13005401"]="Adventurer! Here!",
    ["aside13005402"]="It's Captain Fitz!",
    ["aside13005501"]="Ran away? Something dangerous seems to be happening up ahead?",
    ["aside13005502"]="A group of Wraiths are attacking the people! Captain Fitz is protecting them!",
    ["aside13005601"]="Everyone, follow closely! Don't fall behind!",
    ["aside13005602"]="The Defense Force will make sure everyone reaches the palace safely! Don't panic!",
    ["aside13005901"]="Everyone, follow closely! Don't fall behind!",
    ["aside13005902"]="The Defense Force will make sure everyone reaches the palace safely! Don't panic!",
    ["aside13006001"]="Muahahaha! Midgard, may your fears manifest!",
    ["aside13006002"]="Ba-Baphomet?! Such a mighty foe...",
    ["aside13006003"]="Don't panic! This is just an illusion of Baphomet's powers!",
    ["aside13006004"]="Hmph, my illusion alone is enough to deal with insects like you!",
    ["aside13006005"]="Warriors! Do not back down! This is the enemy's final struggle!",
    ["aside13006006"]="Persevere and victory will be ours!",
    ["aside13006101"]="No! Impossible! This is cannot be!",
    ["aside13006102"]="You are mere humans! Mere humans!",
    ["aside13006103"]="Don't belittle humans! Go back to your dimensional gap, Baphomet!",
    ["aside13006104"]="He has fallen.",
    ["aside13006105"]="Everyone, we have won!",
    ["aside13006106"]="We have protected Prontera from Baphomet's Night of Calamity!",
    ["aside13006107"]="Your bravery and fearlessness will go down in history!",
    ["aside13006108"]="Wooooooo!",
    ["aside13010101"]="Found it. This must be Drubby!",
    ["aside13010201"]="Ahhh! Help!",
    ["aside13010301"]="Ah, found it. This backpack should be...",
    ["aside13010401"]="By Odin, why are these rabbits going crazy?",
    ["aside13020101"]="Those Hornets are back! I'm going to teach them a lesson!",
    ["aside13020201"]="Hurry, go! I'll cover you!",
    ["aside13020301"]="Urgh, why are they so relentless?",
    ["aside13020401"]="It's too scary in here! Let's get out!",
    ["aside13020501"]="Phew, here at last. Wait, what? They're still at it?!",
    ["aside13020601"]="Tanders, you really are a walking nuisance!",
    ["aside13020701"]="Buzz!",
    ["aside13020801"]="Glug! Glug!",
    ["aside13020802"]="Help... Erm, I meant to say, come join this sacred battle!",
    ["aside13020901"]="Aha! I knew victory would be ours!",
    ["aside13021001"]="Hurry, tail that Hornet!",
    ["aside13021101"]="Buzz!",
    ["aside13021102"]="This place seems safe enough.",
    ["aside13021201"]="Hang on, let me take a closer look. Something doesn't feel right.",
    ["aside13021301"]="Great, let me light it up!",
    ["aside13021401"]="Creamy is here for the pupa. We have to protect it!",
    ["aside13021501"]="Is it just me or did the pupa get bigger?",
    ["aside13021502"]="Buzz!",
    ["aside13021601"]="Phew, it looks much better now.",
    ["aside13030101"]="Remove your unclean hand, blasphemer!",
    ["aside13030201"]="Please step back. Do not soil such a precious relic.",
    ["aside13030301"]="This is... We have to help Osiris!",
    ["aside13030401"]="Who killed the envoy from the underworld?",
    ["aside13030501"]="Blah, blah, blah! How annoying!",
    ["aside13030601"]="Hurry, the coronation is starting soon!",
    ["aside13030602"]="Coronation? Could it be...?",
    ["aside13030701"]="Hey! There's a fee for viewing the murals!",
    ["aside13030801"]="I acknowledge you. I hereby grant you this power.",
    ["aside13030901"]="You've arrived.",
    ["aside13040101"]="Huh? Why did Rosie suddenly disappear?",
    ["aside13040102"]="Weird, why do I feel a little dizzy?",
    ["aside13040201"]="Rosie isn't here either? Strange...",
    ["aside13040202"]="You still have some vanilla on you, right? Light it up!",
    ["aside13040301"]="No! Why? Why has it been released?",
    ["aside13040302"]="Foolish humans! Hahahahaha!",
    ["aside13040401"]="Look carefully! Who is this person in front of you!",
    ["aside13040402"]="You are...? Why am I so dizzy...?",
    ["aside13040501"]="So Phillas is here!",
    ["aside13040601"]="My powers have returned! Hahahaha!",
    ["aside13040701"]="A hallucination? It disappeared again?",
    ["aside13050101"]="The flowers have bloomed!",
    ["aside13050102"]="I've got to pick some for the God of the Sea.",
    ["aside13060101"]="Mr. Alson is right there!",
    ["aside13060201"]="Help! Someone please chase those Pirate Skeletons away!",
    ["aside13060301"]="Thank you so much!",
    ["aside13060401"]="Get back! Stay away, you awful Hydras!",
    ["aside13060501"]="Hmph, peace at last.",
    ["aside13060601"]="Ahhh! Help! Why are there spirits everywhere?!",
    ["aside13060701"]="Thank you ever so much!",
    ["aside13060801"]="You are...?",
    ["aside13060901"]="Ah, the strange gap is there!",
    ["aside13070101"]="The shiny spot on the ground should be the Sands of Time. Go take a look!",
    ["aside13070201"]="Ah! Found it!",
    ["aside13070301"]="I'd better go back to that boy!",
    ["aside13070401"]="Wh-what is this?!",
    ["aside13070501"]="What exactly happened?",
    ["aside13070502"]="Sigh, I'll take the Sands of Time to Fulkyn first.",
    ["aside13070601"]="The shiny spot on the ground should be the Sands of Time. Go take a look!",
    ["aside13070701"]="The power that is fluctuating... Could it be...?!",
    ["aside13070801"]="...Sigh, I'll take the Sands of Time to Fulkyn first.",
    ["aside13070901"]="Huh? You are—",
    ["aside13071001"]="Th-this is...?!",
    ["aside13071101"]="...Oh right, the Sands of Time!",
    ["aside13080101"]="Gaaaaaooohhhh!",
    ["aside13080102"]="Wow, it looks like it's going insane!",
    ["aside13080201"]="Ouch... My head hurts...",
    ["aside13080301"]="Ah, someone else got here first.",
    ["aside13080401"]="Oh, please accept this hair accessory as well.",
    ["aside13080501"]="Woshishishi—!",
    ["aside13080502"]="It looks like it's in pain!",
    ["aside13080601"]="Ouch... My head hurts...",
    ["aside13080701"]="Siii! Pika, Siii—!",
    ["aside13080702"]="It looks pretty anxious!",
    ["aside13080801"]="Ouch... My head hurts...",
    ["aside13090101"]="Huff, huff—",
    ["aside13090102"]="Hmm, did it find something?",
    ["aside13090201"]="Huff, huff—",
    ["aside13090202"]="What's that up ahead?!",
    ["aside13090301"]="Well done!",
    ["aside13090401"]="You're walking too slowly.",
    ["aside13090501"]="(Ah—)",
    ["aside13090601"]="My mistress will not let you off!",
    ["aside13090701"]="What did you do?",
    ["aside13090801"]="(*Wails*)",
    ["aside13090802"]="What's that sound?",
    ["aside13090901"]="How dare you harm my servant?! Die!",
    ["aside13091001"]="This is... my grave...",
    ["aside13100101"]="Master, there you are!",
    ["aside13100201"]="Please follow me. The item is just ahead.",
    ["aside13100301"]="What's that on the ground?!",
    ["aside13100401"]="...Master, watch out!",
    ["aside13100501"]="Come with me please!",
    ["aside13100601"]="This mage's aura!",
    ["aside13100701"]="Hey... Hey! You %^@#$*&?!",
    ["aside13100801"]="Aha, I smell an ancient relic!",
    ["aside13100901"]="Ugh, I can't move it at all.",
    ["aside13101001"]="That should be enough. I should get them to Wyatt!",
    ["aside13101101"]="I should search ahead; there might be a clue.",
    ["aside13101201"]="These mages... Could the same person have done this to them?",
    ["aside13101301"]="Damn, he got away!",
    ["aside13101401"]="Aha, I smell an ancient relic!",
    ["aside13101501"]="This gap?",
    ["aside13101601"]="Wait a minute, there seems to be something on the ground.",
    ["aside13101701"]="Ugh, my head. I'm so dizzy.",
    ["aside13101702"]="Come... come to the great and noble Dracula.",
    ["aside13101703"]="Just give me the Fragment of Ymir's Heart.",
    ["aside13101704"]="Then you'll gain endless magical power, and eternal life.",
    ["aside13101801"]="Kill him, kill him. He doesn't deserve sympathy.",
    ["aside13101901"]="...This... this body?",
    ["aside13102001"]="Kill him, kill him. They are jealous of your power.",
    ["aside13102101"]="Ahhh...! Why did they become human?",
    ["aside13102201"]="Kill her, kill her. She wants to bewitch you.",
    ["aside13102301"]="What the...?! Wh-who did I kill?!",
    ["aside13102401"]="Hehehe, welcome, blood-soaked human!",
    ["aside13102501"]="Wait, over there?",
    ["aside13102502"]="Ahhhh!",
    ["aside13102601"]="...I... This is...",
    ["aside13110101"]="This must be where De'qeen lives. I wonder if he's home??",
    ["aside13110201"]="...Maybe he didn't hear? Why don't I go look around nearby.",
    ["aside13110301"]="Wait, something just fell out!",
    ["aside13110401"]="What's going on? I should tell Katrina about this.",
    ["aside13110501"]="Ah, this is unbelievable!",
    ["aside13110601"]="These should be the mistletoe.",
    ["aside13110701"]="Rotten humans aren't allowed to touch anything in the forest, gob!",
    ["aside13110801"]="Wait, I think I hear someone up ahead.",
    ["aside13110802"]="Could it be the possessed Amber? Quick, throw a flash grenade!",
    ["aside13110901"]="Is that alchemist De'qeen? Try using a flash grenade!",
    ["aside13111001"]="Woah, someone actually still has it.",
    ["aside13111101"]="Hmm, that's surprising.",
    ["aside13111201"]="Huh, wait. This feeling?!",
    ["aside13111301"]="Now let's report back to Jesqurienne about what happened.",
    ["aside13120101"]="...Huh? Where did everybody go?",
    ["aside13120201"]="Hey, wait a minute... Let's talk about this!",
    ["aside13120301"]="Look, that must be the caravan carrying the precious medicinal materials up ahead!",
    ["aside13120401"]="...Huh? It's you?!",
    ["aside13120402"]="Ah... What am I supposed to do now?!",
    ["aside13120501"]="Is this the warehouse the caravan leader mentioned?",
    ["aside13120602"]="Come on! Let's go and find out!",
    ["aside13120701"]="These goods... Don't you think there's something strange about them?",
    ["aside13120801"]="Ouch! Enough, stop it already!",
    ["aside13120901"]="Wait, those guys up ahead are...?!",
    ["aside13121001"]="These should be the herbs. Did the mobsters escape into Ant Cavern?",
    ["aside13121101"]="Look, there seems to be something scattered on the ground.",
    ["aside13121201"]="Maybe there'll be more ahead. Go and have a look!",
    ["aside13121301"]="Wait... Just over there... Is that a barrel of herbs?!",
    ["aside13121401"]="Young adventurer, you need to see the situation clearly.",
    ["aside13121501"]="Hmph! What a bother. Come on, let's take her back to the Assassins Guild!",
    ["aside13121601"]="G-Goldie?!",
    ["aside13121701"]="That's... Goldie? Goldie's back!",
    ["aside13121801"]="I'll never... let you take this child...",
    ["aside13121901"]="Wah! It's Goldie!",
    ["aside13122001"]="Sniff... Sniff... You bullies...",
    ["aside13122101"]="Oh no... H-help—!",
    ["aside13122201"]="Blanche, Jean... Are both of you alright?!",
    ["aside13122301"]="This should have been left behind by that monster. Let's move ahead and check it out!",
    ["aside13122401"]="It escaped that way. Let's continue to search.",
    ["aside13122501"]="Great, the owner of these claw marks should be nearby!",
    ["aside13122601"]="Darn it, it got away again. Let's give chase!",
    ["aside13122701"]="T-that is...?!",
    ["aside13122801"]="Oh no, it didn't just grow in size, it got stronger too...",
    ["aside13122901"]="We can't win like this. Let's retreat and think of another way!",
    ["aside13123001"]="Something is fishy. Let's report the situation to Lanister first.",
    ["aside13123101"]="Alright, now we need to bring the photo to Norten!",
    ["aside13123201"]="Those monster corpses ahead have been gnawed on by the Chimera...",
    ["aside13123301"]="There should be remnants of its saliva.",
    ["aside13123401"]="Done! Hurry and bring it to Norten!",
    ["aside13123501"]="This dust... Try and see if you can clean it off!",
    ["aside13123601"]="The person who activated the curse... Is it referring to Hylas?",
    ["aside13123701"]="Hurry and tell him about the situation.",
    ["aside13123801"]="...The curse disappeared? Hurry and find the Chimera!",
    ["aside13140101"]="Wait a moment, what's that over there?",
    ["aside13140201"]="Hm, this situation...",
    ["aside13140301"]="...No reaction. Let's try again somewhere else!",
    ["aside13140401"]="...Oh? What about the other side?",
    ["aside13140501"]="So this is how it is. I understand now.",
    ["aside13140601"]="We're still short of Soft Water Weeds. We should be able to get some by the river!",
    ["aside13140701"]="Alright, let's bring them to Seyren!",
    ["aside13140801"]="...Weird, Seyren hasn't returned?",
    ["aside13140901"]="There is no sign of him around. What's this...",
    ["aside13140902"]="—You're right on time.",
    ["aside13141001"]="A brick in the wall seems to be a little loose...",
    ["aside13141101"]="This is... The mechanism has been activated? Let's go back and take a look!",
    ["aside13141201"]="...It hurts...!",
    ["aside13141301"]="...This, this leaf?!",
    ["aside13141401"]="There's even a Directional Leaf here... Looks like we're on the right track!",
    ["aside13141501"]="I can feel it. Seyren is nearby!",
    ["aside13141601"]="Oh no! Seyren is in danger!",
    ["aside13141701"]="...Adventurer, enough!",
    ["aside13150101"]="A dazzling spirit... Could it be that floating orb of light?",
    ["aside13150201"]="Alright, hurry and give it to Fulkyn!",
    ["aside13150301"]="This... place...?!",
    ["aside13150401"]="This strange feeling...",
    ["aside13150402"]="...Adventurer, be careful!",
    ["aside13150501"]="Has it begun...?",
    ["aside13150601"]="Wait, there's noise coming from somewhere near here...",
    ["aside13150701"]="Oh no! Thanatos is in danger!",
    ["aside13150801"]="So, do you still think I'm a lunatic?",
    ["aside13150901"]="These hairs... Let's carry onward and investigate!",
    ["aside13151001"]="Could the owner of the claw marks have gone into the abbey? Let's go and check it out!",
    ["aside13151101"]="Thana... tos...",
    ["aside13151201"]="...I have underestimated you.",
    ["aside13151301"]="This is...!?",
    ["aside13151302"]="This ends here.",
    ["aside13151401"]="Please wait a second...",
    ["aside13151501"]="Long time no see, Fulkyn...",
    ["aside13160101"]="Okay, get this to Archbishop Wolmas immediately.",
    ["aside13160201"]="Please try again with foul slime.",
    ["aside13160301"]="..... As expected, OK.",
    ["aside13160401"]="-- Wha.... what’s this?!",
    ["aside13160501"]="I'm counting on you!",
    ["aside13160601"]="Th-this is....?!",
    ["aside13160701"]="Okay, we will have to try and tame it.",
    ["aside13160801"]="Adventurer, what have you found?",
    ["aside13160901"]="—Hey! Stop!",
    ["aside13161001"]="These people’s clothes, they’re really not the style of clothes that you normally see in the Kingdom...",
    ["aside13161101"]="1, 2, 3... 11 Cargo Boxes in total?",
    ["aside13161102"]="So much material to exchange for such a small mission.",
    ["aside13161201"]="—W-Wait! Don’t touch those boxes!",
    ["aside13161301"]="Did these two guys just... mention the King?!",
    ["aside13161401"]="Did they say what I think they said? We must go and have a look!",
    ["aside13161501"]="Ah jeez, there are Monsters up ahead...",
    ["aside13161601"]="What the heck are these?! This must be reported to Commander Bohr immediately.",
    ["aside13161701"]="Done, take the picture to Vera.",
    ["aside13161801"]="All right, take the clothing material to Vera.",
    ["aside13161901"]="The corps’ base is up ahead. Put your robes on now so they can recognize us.",
    ["aside13162001"]="There is no one around! Quick, take a look inside the cargo box.",
    ["aside13162101"]="Nothing wrong with the contents of these boxes... Check the others!",
    ["aside13162201"]="Ch—rp!",
    ["aside13162202"]="—Oh no!",
    ["aside13162301"]="What was that noise?",
    ["aside13170101"]="--Hey! Stop!",
    ["aside13170201"]="These people’s clothes, they’re really not the style of clothes that you normally see in the Kingdom...",
    ["aside13170301"]="1, 2, 3.... In total 11 Cargo Boxes?",
    ["aside13170302"]="So much material to exchange for such a small mission.",
    ["aside13170401"]="-- Wait.... Wait! Don’t touch those boxes!",
    ["aside13170501"]="Did these two guys just..... mention the King?",
    ["aside13170601"]="Did they say what I think they said...... we must go and have a look!",
    ["aside13170701"]="Ah jeez, there are Monsters up ahead......",
    ["aside13170801"]="What the heck are these?! This must be reported to Commander Bohr immediately.",
    ["aside13170901"]="Done, take the picture to Vera. ",
    ["aside13171001"]="All right, take the clothing material to Vera.",
    ["aside13171101"]="The corps’ base is up ahead. Put your robes on now so they can recognize us!.",
    ["aside13171201"]="There is no one around! Quickly, take a look inside the cargo box.",
    ["aside13171301"]="Nothing wrong with the contents of these boxes... Check the others!",
    ["aside13171401"]="Wha.....What-!",
    ["aside13171402"]="Oh Jeez!!!",
    ["aside13171501"]=".... What was that noise?",
    ["aside13180301"]="Hey, take a look at this---",
    ["aside13180401"]="Ah... Once again....",
    ["aside13180601"]="--Hey! No one is allowed to touch the Oracle’s message!",
    ["aside13180602"]="That just about does it. Report to your captain right away!",
    ["aside13180901"]="That was a close call.",
    ["aside13181001"]="-- I really didn’t expect it to be you!",
    ["aside13190101"]="Footprints... Let's follow.",
    ["aside13190201"]="We must act swiftly...",
    ["aside13190301"]="Gaaaah!",
    ["aside13190401"]="Gaaaah!",
    ["aside13190402"]="...",
    ["aside13190501"]="How's the situation, Adventurer?",
    ["aside13190601"]="...Weird.",
    ["aside13190602"]="Watch out!",
    ["aside13190701"]="How can it be...",
    ["aside13190702"]="Thieves! You stole the Spore!",
    ["aside13190801"]="Phew, finally all done. The weeds sure are tough...",
    ["aside13190901"]="This way, please.",
    ["aside13190902"]="Here we are.",
    ["aside13191001"]="...S-Stop!",
    ["aside13191101"]="...",
    ["aside13191201"]="...Weird.",
    ["aside13191301"]="Watch out!",
    ["aside13191401"]="How can it be...",
    ["aside13191501"]="Thieves! You stole the Spore!",
    ["aside13191601"]="This way, please.",
    ["aside13191701"]="Here we are.",
    ["aside13191801"]="...S-Stop!",
    ["aside13191901"]="Is this Lutie? I remember the guy who was going pick me up is supposed to be...",
    ["aside13192001"]="not far from here.",
    ["aside13192101"]="Oh no, it's the Garm Baby!",
    ["aside13192201"]="Whew! Nailed it. Now report to the Christmas Envoy!",
    ["aside13200101"]="This should be where the pirates claimed they had been ambushed.",
    ["aside13200102"]="What's that over there?",
    ["aside13200103"]="This mark... Show it to Captain Drake!",
    ["aside13200201"]="What's that over there?",
    ["aside13200301"]="Is this...?!",
    ["aside13200302"]="...H-Help!",
    ["aside13200401"]="This mark... Show it to Captain Drake!",
    ["aside13200501"]="Stop!!",
    ["aside13200502"]="Hmph. Give up, you can't defeat me.",
    ["aside13200601"]="...How can it be?",
    ["aside13200602"]="Heh, this turned out to be interesting.",
    ["aside13200603"]="...Oh! Quick, block...",
    ["aside13200701"]="Bastard! How dare you take Obeaune's food!",
    ["aside13200702"]="All right, take these to Spencer now!",
    ["aside13200801"]="Is this...?!",
    ["aside13200901"]="...H-Help!",
    ["aside13201001"]="Wait!",
    ["aside1320101"]="Hmph, this world will be ours sooner or later! I'll be back!",
    ["aside13201101"]="Stop!!",
    ["aside13201201"]="Hmph. Give up, you can't defeat me.",
    ["aside13201301"]="...How can it be?",
    ["aside13201401"]="Heh, this turned out to be interesting.",
    ["aside13201501"]="...Oh! Quick, block...",
    ["aside13201601"]="Bastard! How dare you take Obeaune's food!",
    ["aside13201701"]="All right, take these to Spencer now!",
    ["aside13210101"]="See, this is it.",
    ["aside13210201"]="...See these here!",
    ["aside13210301"]="This is the most unusual discovery.",
    ["aside13210401"]="All right, give it to Walsh.",
    ["aside13210501"]="These will do.",
    ["aside13210502"]="Please make good use of this bone fragment, then!",
    ["aside13210601"]="These will do.",
    ["aside13210701"]="...Don't think it's this one.",
    ["aside13210702"]="This diary didn't hold clues relevant to Comodo, either.",
    ["aside13210703"]="Margaret?! There's a need to ask the Nerius family for assistance now.",
    ["aside13210801"]="...Are you sure you want to do that?",
    ["aside13210802"]="There's more to this. Let's report what we found so far to Eden Group first!",
    ["aside13210901"]="You're finally here!",
    ["aside13210902"]="It's done. Time to see Salisbury!",
    ["aside13210903"]="You're back just in time.",
    ["aside13211001"]="...Wh-What's this?!",
    ["aside13211101"]="Please make good use of this bone fragment, then!",
    ["aside13211201"]="...Don't think it's this one.",
    ["aside13211301"]="This diary didn't hold clues relevant to Comodo, either.",
    ["aside13211401"]="Margaret?! There's a need to ask the Nerius family for assistance now.",
    ["aside13211501"]="...Are you sure you want to do that?",
    ["aside13211601"]="There's more to this. Let's report what we found so far to Eden Group first!",
    ["aside13211701"]="You're finally here!",
    ["aside13211801"]="It's done. Time to see Salisbury!",
    ["aside13211901"]="You're back just in time.",
    ["aside13212001"]="Wh-What's this?!",
    ["aside13220101"]="Hey... I know that voice...",
    ["aside13220201"]="Ah, Adventurer, you—ah?!",
    ["aside13220301"]="... You'll never catch me!",
    ["aside13220401"]="Haha! Seems like today is not my lucky day...",
    ["aside13220501"]="Miss Parni, let me get to the point.",
    ["aside13220601"]="She... could it be?!",
    ["aside13220701"]="... Adventurer?!",
    ["aside13220801"]="Alright, take it to Seyren!",
    ["aside13230101"]="Hmm... That's more like it.",
    ["aside13230201"]="Is that Bidal? Go and talk with him.",
    ["aside13230301"]="Are you... Moffit?",
    ["aside13230401"]="This is where it happened, Adventurer...",
    ["aside13230501"]="What's that liquid...",
    ["aside13230601"]="Officer Bohr, you're here.",
    ["aside13230701"]="You go check on Aronst first. I'll take care of things here.",
    ["aside13230801"]="Okay, take it to Lawrence!",
    ["aside13230901"]="Please read this black leather-bound book on my left.",
    ["aside13231001"]="!!!",
    ["aside13231101"]="Now we can have a chat.",
    ["aside13240101"]="What are you doing here, sir?",
    ["aside13240201"]="Ah... Who could have done this?",
    ["aside13240301"]="Hang on. It looks like they've got something in their pockets.",
    ["aside13240401"]="It must be them. Go take a look!",
    ["aside13240501"]="Okay, take it to the servants!",
    ["aside13240601"]="Awesome! Okay, let's recount...",
    ["aside13240701"]="Okay, take it to the servants!",
    ["aside13240801"]="Awesome! Okay, let's compare them again...",
    ["aside13240901"]="... Adventurer! Over here.",
    ["aside13241001"]="This is...?!",
    ["aside13241101"]="Have you seen those knights? Don't let them see you...",
    ["aside13241201"]="Come with me. There's a bunch of knights over there.",
    ["aside13241301"]="This is super odd. We'll need to learn more...",
    ["aside13241401"]="Lord Bohr? What are you doing here?",
    ["aside13250101"]="Hey! Pull yourself together! There should be another way...",
    ["aside13250201"]="Are there any other questions?",
    ["aside13250301"]="Looks like you are not a student.",
    ["aside13250401"]="If that's the case, I'm willing to share some knowledge with you.",
    ["aside13250501"]="Waaaaaaa! Don't suddenly show up behind my back!",
    ["aside13250601"]="Good lord, you have taken a photo of something incredible...",
    ["aside13250701"]="This is only the first location. Follow me!",
    ["aside13250801"]="The next one... Hey, keep up!",
    ["aside13250901"]="Whew... You can... Stop it now...",
    ["aside13251001"]="How dare you hit my handsome face?",
    ["aside13251101"]="Everyone, this is not a place built for dispute.",
    ["aside13251201"]="Your Excellency, your guest is waiting outside the door.",
    ["aside13251301"]="Please come in, Adventurer from afar.",
    ["aside13251302"]="Adventurer, you may enter now.",
    ["aside13251401"]="Do you like the red color, Adventurer?",
    ["aside13251501"]="The clock in Lord's Mansion needs to be corrected by hand, always.",
    ["aside13251601"]="Shh... Looks like it has its own secret.",
    ["aside13260101"]="Expired stuff again? Tsk!",
    ["aside13260200"]="Tree root? Doesn't look edible to me...",
    ["aside13260300"]="...Does cooking require engine oil?",
    ["aside13260400"]="Hmm... What's the use of these?",
    ["aside13260500"]="Ta-da! It's ready to be served!",
    ["aside13260600"]="Mind your own business!",
    ["aside13260700"]="I give up... I concede!",
    ["aside13260800"]="I will look at it... I swear I will!",
    ["aside13270101"]="There seem to be some traces over there...",
    ["aside13270201"]="W-What are you going to do?",
    ["aside13270301"]="This is it!",
    ["aside13270401"]="Okay! Let's find Auntie Cook to make some nice dishes!",
    ["aside13270501"]="...Your cooking skill is not bad.",
    ["aside13270601"]="You... Did you bring the food I wanted?",
    ["aside13270701"]="You idiot! I got you! HAHAHAHA!",
    ["aside13270702"]="Boo...",
    ["aside13270801"]="Is that all you got?",
    ["aside13270901"]="It's children's playing house, after all.",
    ["aside13271001"]="I know where you are hiding. Show yourself!",
    ["aside13271002"]="In your dreams! You'll never catch me!",
    ["aside13271101"]="None... None of your business!",
    ["aside13271201"]="...Farbauti, stop it.",
    ["aside13271202"]="What are you doing? Get out of my way!",
    ["aside13271301"]="You... Cut the act!",
    ["aside13271401"]="...What are you trying to tell me?",
    ["aside13300101"]="How did the last one get stuck in the tree?!",
    ["aside13300201"]="Sigh... anyway, let's head back first.",
    ["aside13300301"]="Huh? What's that?",
    ["aside13300401"]="This isn't good...",
    ["aside13300501"]="What do you mean?",
    ["aside13300601"]="Not bad! Time to meet up with Parni.",
    ["aside13300701"]="Wow, that's beautiful! You've got great taste, Adventurer!",
    ["aside13300801"]="Alright... three more quests to go today.",
    ["aside13300901"]="Hurry up—pick the prettiest one!",
    ["aside13301001"]="Whew, easy peasy!",
    ["aside13301101"]="Nice! The fields are still intact!",
    ["aside13301201"]="Uh, why is there such a huge Dustiness here?",
    ["aside13301301"]="Good thing I came. Seyren couldn't handle this right now.",
    ["aside13301401"]="...",
    ["aside13301501"]="Here! Oh, come on, don't be shy, Margaret!",
    ["aside13301601"]="Sorry... I...",
    ["aside13301701"]="I get it. Leave it to me.",
    ["aside13301801"]="Let the stars watch over me...",
    ["aside13301901"]="I won't stop moving forward...",
    ["aside16000101"]="Select a pet and tap the Tame Pet skill.",
    ["aside16000102"]="It's successful when the slots show a row of the same icon.",
    ["aside16000201"]="Whose sacrificial stone is this? In any case, better pay respect to it first.",
    ["aside16000301"]="There seems to be something shiny next to the tombstone.",
    ["aside16000401"]="This should be it. Let's take it to Hollgrehenn!",
    ["aside16000501"]="The Emperium is protected by a holy shield and only takes 1 point of damage from attacks.",
    ["aside16000601"]="Respawning after dying on a GVG battlefield will return you to your initial entrance.",
    ["aside16000701"]="Individual strength is limited. The united strength of a guild can lead to better results on a GVG battlefield!",
    ["aside16000801"]="Guild leaders can communicate tactical information to guild members via the tactical command feature of the mini map.",
    ["aside16000901"]="Information on each base can be obtained through the GVG event panel.",
    ["aside16001001"]="You can configure the maximum number of people shown on the battlefield via the GVG Battle Report Settings.",
    ["aside16001101"]="Watch out for assassins using the Hiding skill for sneak attacks.",
    ["aside16001201"]="Guilds are hostile to each other within the GVG battlefield.",
    ["aside16001301"]="Deliver the Mysterious Cargo or Abyssal Treasure to me to exchange for rewards such as Abyssal Essence!\nCome see me if you need to leave Abyssal Arcade!",
    ["aside16001401"]="This should be the place.",
    ["aside16001501"]="Hurry! This is the place!",
    ["aside16001601"]="Why are you still here? The wedding is about to begin.",
    ["aside16001701"]="Why are they not back yet?",
    ["aside16001801"]="It seems like something has happened...",
    ["aside16001901"]="There seems to be footprints up front.",
    ["aside16002001"]="Thankfully there are still footprints ahead. This means that Jimmy is still safe.",
    ["aside16002101"]="*Cries* Grandpa...",
    ["aside16002201"]="This is...",
    ["aside16002301"]="Hm, everything is ready now.",
    ["aside16002401"]="It's finally opened! I knew we found the right person!",
    ["aside16002501"]="Here, Adventurer... Here...",
    ["aside16002502"]="<size=24><color=#CA2E0AFF>Purgatory instance unlocked!</color></size>",
    ["aside16002601"]="That, that's what I want, Adventurer!",
    ["aside16002801"]="Be careful not to hurt yourself with the slingshot.",
    ["aside16002901"]="That person under the tree is Taksch?!",
    ["aside16002902"]="In any case, let's go talk to him...",
    ["aside16003001"]="I won't let you catch me!",
    ["aside16003002"]="I hadn't even finished speaking...",
    ["aside16003101"]="Hmm, consulting an encyclopedia is truly a skill that requires patience...",
    ["aside16003201"]="The Orc Disaster... Maybe we'll find some clues among the Savages.",
    ["aside16003301"]="Why are the Savages here so hysterical? Something is wrong...",
    ["aside16004401"]="Well... You've been staring at me just now. What's the problem?",
    ["aside16004501"]="Real estate in a prime location with convenient transportation is now on sale!",
    ["aside16004601"]="Dried fish... dried fish...",
    ["aside16004701"]="Adventurer! You're back!",
    ["aside16004801"]="Now, I need you to use the Exploration Flame to explore and locate the ore veins inside the mine.",
    ["aside16004901"]="The mineral resources you gathered will be stored in the minecart, but it has a capacity limit, so don't forget to collect what's yours from time to time!",
    ["aside16005001"]="It's time to upgrade your Home to Lv.3.",
    ["aside16005101"]="Release a certain number of fingerlings to the Pond first.",
    ["aside16005201"]="Don't forget to feed the fingerlings to speed up their growth after releasing them.",
    ["aside16005301"]="Don't forget to harvest them when they grow up.",
    ["aside16005401"]="You can start upgrading your Home after assigning a pet.",
    ["aside16005501"]="First, sow the seeds in your Farmland.",
    ["aside16005601"]="Make sure you water them after sowing; otherwise, the crop will wither.",
    ["aside16005701"]="Don't forget to harvest the crops when they are ripened. Letting them rot in the farmland is a waste of food.",
    ["aside16005801"]="Don't only focus on the Farmland; you need to upgrade every aspect of the estate.",
    ["aside16005901"]="Have you decided which pet you want to assign?",
    ["aside16006001"]="Everything is ready. You may now explore the Ore Vein.",
    ["aside16006101"]="Don't forget to claim the minerals stored in the minecart.",
    ["aside16006201"]="Come with me, Adventurer!",
    ["aside16006301"]="Next, let us take a look at the Pond.",
    ["aside16006401"]="Let's take a look at the farmland.",
    ["aside16006501"]="Now, try to upgrade your Home to Lv.2!",
    ["aside16006601"]="Adventurer, over here!",
    ["aside16006701"]="Come with me, Adventurer!",
    ["aside16006801"]="Adventurer, try to expand the Craftsman Workshop!",
    ["aside16010101"]="There you are!",
    ["aside16010201"]="That sounds awesome!",
    ["aside16010301"]="Next, we need to find Morts.",
    ["aside16020101"]="Who's there? Meow!",
    ["aside16020201"]="I always keep my word. Just wait for me at the <color=#CA2E0AFF>Poring Ruins</color>!",
    ["aside16020301"]="What is this place?!",
    ["aside16020401"]="Where are my tools...? Oh, here they are!",
    ["aside16020501"]="Step 1: Carefully rub it with sandpaper. Please be gentle.",
    ["aside16020601"]="Step 2: Apply the melted wax to the wood.",
    ["aside16020701"]="Step 3: Allow the wax to dry before polishing.",
    ["aside16020801"]="Impressive!",
    ["aside16020901"]="It's Criatura Academy!",
    ["aside16021001"]="Now to roast them! Yum!",
    ["aside16021101"]="Stop! Take them out!",
    ["aside16021201"]="What a view.",
    ["aside16021301"]="Today's new item is Desert Tomato!",
    ["aside16021401"]="The sandstorm has stopped. Come with me!",
    ["aside16021501"]="It's the Sphinx!",
    ["aside16021601"]="How terrifying! Help me!",
    ["aside16021701"]="Done. Now give the photo to Master Jesqurienne!",
    ["aside16021801"]="Beep! Place of Sages! The parrot was born in the last century!",
    ["aside16021901"]="Beep! The Library! A fine of 1000 Zeny for overdue books!",
    ["aside16022001"]="Beep! Danger! Cherish your life and stay away!",
    ["aside16022101"]="Beep! End of the tour! Don't forget to give me a 5-star review!",
    ["aside16022201"]="O almighty but silent Goddess, when will you wake up?",
    ["aside16022301"]="... Adventurer, see you at Rose Red Tavern.",
    ["aside16022401"]="Drink, sing, and be merry!",
    ["aside16022501"]="Another round of wine, please! Put it on the adventurer's tab!",
    ["aside16022601"]="The prophecy mentioned needing a controller of events to open the way.",
    ["aside16022701"]="Maybe we should ask her...",
    ["aside16022801"]="Let's try that book over there first.",
    ["aside16030101"]="Hey there, little Adventurer! What are you doing?",
    ["aside16030201"]="I heard footsteps!",
    ["aside16030301"]="It's been a long while but I haven't seen anyone... Aaaah! Hello, Dean!",
    ["aside16030401"]="That look on your face... are you holding back a laugh?",
    ["aside16040101"]="Wanna go back with me?",
    ["aside16050101"]="Desert, oasis, and cactus. Hope Heflee will love it!",
    ["aside16050201"]="When the venue is completed, it's time for a showdown!",
    ["aside16060101"]="Where's mom... I want mom...",
    ["aside16070101"]="These should be enough...",
    ["aside16080101"]="These are all that could be shot...",
    ["aside16080201"]="I think it's much better than nothing...",
    ["aside16090101"]="Desert, oasis, and palm trees. Hope Heflee will love it!",
    ["aside16090201"]="Now go back and give the photo to Heflee!",
    ["aside16100101"]="What's taking you so long? Hmph!",
    ["aside16100201"]="Open your eyes... to the feats of my research!",
    ["aside16100301"]="Bring the collection device with you, and come back in one piece!",
    ["aside16100401"]="You must have succeeded... right?",
    ["aside16110101"]="Successor of Odin's bloodline... Please step forward...",
    ["aside16110201"]="The facial feature and strange dressing style... Could this be him?",
    ["aside16120101"]="The key holder... Please talk to me at the illusion entrance...",
    ["aside16130101"]="Oh, my supreme King of the Gods, your sun has wandered astray...",
    ["aside16130201"]="My wheat... My farm...",
    ["aside16130202"]="Put out the fire!",
    ["aside16130301"]="Luckily no one was injured...",
    ["aside16130401"]="It's been a hundred years... Sol, my good friend...",
    ["aside16130501"]="Nield, have you also fallen into a deep slumber...?",
    ["aside16130601"]="God's Descendant, you have done well.",
    ["aside16140101"]="Successor of Odin's bloodline... Please, come forward...",
    ["aside16140201"]="Sol, my dear friend...",
    ["aside16160101"]="Commander Bernard, this is...?",
    ["aside16160201"]="...",
    ["aside16160301"]="Is this your companion for rebellion, Kenshiro?",
    ["aside16160401"]="Lord Raoh is invincible... Urgh!!!",
    ["aside16160501"]="Lead their souls to the gate of Valhalla...",
    ["aside16160601"]="Finally... time to go back?",
    ["aside16170101"]="This presence...",
    ["aside16999801"]="Isabella's Likeability toward you is maxed. Unlocked exclusive storyline.",
    ["aside16999901"]="Isabella's Likeability toward you increased by 1.",
    ["aside17000001"]="I'm Mentor Poring! In this version, I'll be the one giving you tips! Por!",
    ["aside17000002"]="You can access the <color=#f6723e>Academy</color> anytime from the menu on the main screen! Por!",
    ["aside17000101"]="Here comes the <color=#f6723e>Monster Diary</color>! Por! Access the Academy, find the <color=#f6723e>Monster Diary</color> and open it! Por!",
    ["aside17000201"]="Feel like reading stories? Access the Academy and locate <color=#f6723e>Character Stories</color>! Por!",
    ["aside17000301"]="See that Pecopeco button next to your skills? Tap it and you'll be able to ride your <color=#f6723e>mount</color>! Por!",
    ["aside17000401"]="When you talk to Smile Assistance, you'll find the option to craft headgear! Por!",
    ["aside17000501"]="The <color=#f6723e>Mission Board</color> has been fixed! Thank you, helpful adventurer! I'll be going home now!",
    ["aside17000601"]="When you talk to Hollgrehenn, you'll find the option to <color=#f6723e>Upgrade equipment</color>! Por!",
    ["aside17000701"]="These are cards! Por! Tap Weapon and you'll find the <color=#f6723e>Insert</color> button! Por!",
    ["aside17000801"]="What is this place? Por! I see Captain Carew! Por! Let's go ask him!",
    ["aside17000901"]="Tap on the Events button in the menu on the main screen and it will teach you how to become stronger!",
    ["aside17001001"]="Successor of Odin's bloodline, Prontera Square will grant you <color=#f6723e>Odin's Blessing</color>.",
    ["aside17001002"]="Is this the voice of the War Goddess? She said something about <color=#f6723e>Odin's Blessing</color>... Let's go check it out!",
    ["aside17001101"]="Accumulate Odin's Blessing and you'll get more <color=#f6723e>Adventure EXP</color> while adventuring!",
    ["aside17001102"]="So, this is Odin's Blessing? I should come back more often to accumulate it!",
    ["aside17001201"]="<color=#f6723e>Equipment crafting</color> is provided by the <color=#f6723e>Equipment Crafting Merchant</color>! Don't go the wrong way! Por!",
    ["aside17001301"]="Adventurer! Over here! I found something interesting!",
    ["aside17001401"]="I've learned Falconry Mastery! It's time for me to hunt for a falcon to be my partner!",
    ["aside17001501"]="Your moves aren't bad, but your equipment leaves a lot to be desired!",
    ["aside17001502"]="Take this and go to Hollgrehenn to upgrade your equipment!",
    ["aside17001601"]="The materials are sufficient but I'll need some time to make the repairs.",
    ["aside17001602"]="You can go browse around while you wait!",
    ["aside17010101"]="Hmm..... Where is that strange Horong?",
    ["aside17010201"]="Inheritor of Odin’s bloodline, if you must see my true face.....",
    ["aside17010202"]="If you are to prove your allegiance, you must endure three trials",
    ["aside17010203"]="Horong..... turned into light?",
    ["aside17010301"]="Hmmm..... Do you need me to worship this Goddess Statue?",
    ["aside17010401"]="Your respect is undeniable, we shall start the next trail immediately.....",
    ["aside17010501"]="Courage? Your courage will be proven when you defeat the Monster.",
    ["aside17010601"]="Your courage has been proven, the next trail shall start immediately.....",
    ["aside17010701"]="Blinded..... Banish darkness....? The light!",
    ["aside17010801"]="A Stone Slab....? Is that it?",
    ["aside17010901"]="Is this.... Glast Heim?!",
    ["aside17010902"]="Be gone, return and seek out Rockley!",
    ["aside17011001"]="You’re back!",
    ["aside17011101"]="Hmm.... I am feeling a powerful force.....",
    ["aside17011201"]="-- Wha.... what’s this?!",
    ["aside17020101"]="Hmm... This should be the place.",
    ["aside17020201"]="Are you ready? I am going to turn the mechanism on now!",
    ["aside17020301"]="Well well well.... Not bad at all.....",
    ["aside17020401"]="No..... It is not enough.....",
    ["aside17020501"]="Stop.... Stop! Quickly, pick up that red thing!",
    ["aside17020601"]="Oh, wow, that smell is....",
    ["aside17020701"]="I knew you wouldn’t let Odin down!",
    ["aside17030101"]="Oh.... How awful.",
    ["aside17030201"]="Alright....! Halfway there!",
    ["aside17030301"]="Done! Return to Alice right away!",
    ["aside17030401"]="This is...",
    ["aside17040101"]="Over here, Adventurer",
    ["aside17040201"]="Wait.... There are dragons here?",
    ["aside17040202"]="Don’t forget what I have told you, Adventurer!",
    ["aside17040301"]="Truly a perfect battle",
    ["aside17040401"]="...And?!",
    ["aside17040402"]="Focus on the battle that lies ahead, don’t get distracted!",
    ["aside17040501"]="Good.... Not too far ahead.",
    ["aside17040601"]="A beautiful blow, Adventurer!",
    ["aside17040701"]="Oh, wow, that smell is....",
    ["aside17040801"]="I knew you wouldn’t let Odin down!",
    ["aside17050101"]="Over here, Adventurer.",
    ["aside17050201"]="You seem to be becoming more natural when working with magic!",
    ["aside17050301"]="... yeah, but I still have a lot to work on!",
    ["aside17050401"]="I feel the energy of the elements flow through me......",
    ["aside17050501"]="I become one with the elements......",
    ["aside17050801"]="We have been waiting a long time for you, Adventurer.",
    ["aside17060101"]="Here...... Come forward and let me take a look at you.",
    ["aside17060201"]="Shhh..... quietly now......",
    ["aside17060301"]="They seem to be sleeping soundly....... Don’t worry about them~",
    ["aside17060401"]="Okay! Go and find the Moxie Master!",
    ["aside17060501"]="No chance you can let me down, ha ha~",
    ["aside17060601"]="Quietly, deal your deadly blow and be done with it!",
    ["aside17060602"]="Ouch! Ouch! -- Who’s doing that?!",
    ["aside17060701"]="No chance you can let me down, ha ha~",
    ["aside17060801"]="Oh, wow, that smell is....",
    ["aside17060901"]="I knew you wouldn’t let Odin down!",
    ["aside17070101"]="Ughh..... It's still as gloomy as ever......",
    ["aside17070201"]="The first step~Completed!",
    ["aside17070301"]="Done! There is only one left!",
    ["aside17070401"]="Alright, you must meet with Melbrun as soon as possible.",
    ["aside17070501"]="Haha! We meet again, Adventurer!",
    ["aside17070502"]="General Qi Euin?!",
    ["aside17070601"]="--How brilliant!",
    ["aside17070701"]="What fell off the Butsudan?",
    ["aside17070702"]="Is this...... A whistle?",
    ["aside17070801"]="Oh, wow, that smell is....",
    ["aside17070901"]="I knew you wouldn’t let Odin down!",
    ["aside17080101"]="Over here, Adventurer.",
    ["aside17080201"]="Oh. Doesn't feel too heavy after all?",
    ["aside17080301"]="(Panting) I should be able to add a bit more...",
    ["aside17080401"]="You can... do it!",
    ["aside17080501"]="(Phew) The last stretch.",
    ["aside17080601"]="Hisss...",
    ["aside17080602"]="A monster?!",
    ["aside17080701"]="Oh no! The supplies are falling off!",
    ["aside17080801"]="Heh. It looks like you're coming back empty-handed!",
    ["aside17080901"]="Right. This is all I have.",
    ["aside17081001"]="Good luck, Adventurer!",
    ["aside17081101"]="Then it's settled! Head for Glast Heim now.",
    ["aside17081201"]="We meet again, Adventurer!",
    ["aside17081301"]="I swear to be the shield I seek and never take a step in retreat...",
    ["aside17081401"]="My sword may break, my shield my fall, but our glory enjoys forever...",
    ["aside17081501"]="I-Invaders—wipe them out!",
    ["aside17081601"]="My king.... please forgive me...",
    ["aside17081602"]="Halt, Adventurer.",
    ["aside17081701"]="Oh, wow, that's the smell of....",
    ["aside17081801"]="I knew you wouldn't let Odin down!",
    ["aside17090101"]="So many precious memories.",
    ["aside17100101"]="Who awoke first from the great dream of life, of which I have learned all meanings? I have slept long enough within these halls of grass to see the sun outside.",
    ["aside17100201"]="Indeed. These are the ones.",
    ["aside17100301"]="The Lotus Seed has changed color!",
    ["aside17100401"]="We shall continue today's discussion once you reach Job level 50.",
    ["aside17110101"]="It looks like our guest has arrived.",
    ["aside17110201"]="Give it to Master Peerless Jin and Master Alice to evaluate!",
    ["aside17110301"]="Is this a... Holy Bead?",
    ["aside17110401"]="Are we to consider this the will of fate...?",
    ["aside17110501"]="Who exactly is this Earth Guardian?",
    ["aside17120101"]="The sea breeze assembling and dispersing... It's a conch!",
    ["aside17120201"]="Hey, I spotted it first!",
    ["aside17120301"]="Brother!",
    ["aside17120401"]="It's my costume...",
    ["aside17120501"]="It's obsidian formed from cooled volcano lava...",
    ["aside17120601"]="Give them to Callahan now!",
    ["aside17120701"]="Nicely done!",
    ["aside17130101"]="A rather heavy, hot lunch box. I wonder how much he ordered?",
    ["aside17130201"]="Block not my light, Adventurer!",
    ["aside17130301"]="It's generally better for people to write their essays themselves.",
    ["aside17130401"]="They've got to be mailed to Master Sage Kroneika right away!",
    ["aside17130501"]="A letter for you, Adventurer!",
    ["aside17130601"]="Time to upgrade your class level. Prepare for Disputation Ceremony!",
    ["aside17140101"]="This is...!?",
    ["aside17140201"]="What is that thing in the circle?",
    ["aside17140301"]="The Contract has changed!",
    ["aside17140401"]="The Contract is really hot!",
    ["aside17140501"]="Quick! Open up the Contract and take a look!",
    ["aside17140601"]="What's the next stop?",
    ["aside17140701"]="Something's... changed...",
    ["aside17150101"]="So many precious memories.",
    ["aside17160101"]="So many precious memories!",
    ["aside17170101"]="What a beautiful tune!",
    ["aside17170201"]="The pearl sank...",
    ["aside17170301"]="This is...?!",
    ["aside17170401"]="Nice work!",
    ["aside17180101"]="Boss! What are we eating today?",
    ["aside17180201"]="Boss! What are we beating today... Ahem!",
    ["aside17180301"]="Huh? A letter from that woman?",
    ["aside17180401"]="All of you... are nothing but trash!",
    ["aside17180501"]="Seeing someone bleed on their first day isn't a good mojo for the new blood. Wait outside for us.",
    ["aside17180601"]="Come on in.",
    ["aside17180701"]="The sandstorm in Morroc... Has it stopped?",
    ["aside17190101"]="So many precious memories!",
    ["aside17200101"]="Very good, very good.",
    ["aside17200201"]="Interesting... Very interesting...",
    ["aside17200301"]="Now! Drop the Soul Fixer!",
    ["aside17200401"]="The soul has changed color!",
    ["aside17200501"]="The Guild Leader is waiting for me. I have to get back to Al De Baran now!",
    ["aside17200601"]="A dazzling, golden shine. This is how an Alchemy Potion should look.",
    ["aside17210101"]="This is absolutely... Ugh!",
    ["aside17210201"]="Here he comes!",
    ["aside17210301"]="Right now!",
    ["aside17210401"]="May justice be engraved on our hearts. May depravities never taint us...",
    ["aside17220101"]="So many precious memories!",
    ["aside17230101"]="With my blood... You shall be born...",
    ["aside17230102"]="This is...?",
    ["aside17240101"]="Who's talking? What do you want?",
    ["aside17240201"]="Oh no, it's the monster!",
    ["aside17250101"]="You're the trialist for today?",
    ["aside17250201"]="Okay, okay... None of the four portals is real...",
    ["aside17250202"]="Your passage lies ahead...",
    ["aside17250301"]="Anthony, my dear Anthony...",
    ["aside17250401"]="Ahem... Ahem, ahem!",
    ["aside17250501"]="You're back, Adventurer... Anthony?!",
    ["aside17250601"]="Ole exhausted examinee, you got a new mission!",
    ["aside17260101"]="So many precious memories!",
    ["aside17260201"]="Over here, Adventurer.",
    ["aside17260301"]="Tsk... Are you here to see that old knight?",
    ["aside17260401"]="Why aren't you saying a word? You wanna die in silence?",
    ["aside17260501"]="Too bad you're too late...",
    ["aside17260601"]="Then be a sacrifice too!",
    ["aside17260701"]="But the ritual is complete. It's all too late, all too late!!!",
    ["aside17260801"]="Who... dare disturb my slumber?",
    ["aside17260901"]="Impossible! How did you...?! Ugh!",
    ["aside17270101"]="Attention! Gather before me.",
    ["aside17270201"]="Mama...",
    ["aside17270301"]="It's all over...",
    ["aside17270401"]="Please forgive me...",
    ["aside17270501"]="Here you are.",
    ["aside17280101"]="So many precious memories!",
    ["aside17290101"]="It's been a while, Adventurer.",
    ["aside17290201"]="Why are there so many Rybios here?",
    ["aside17290301"]="What's that up ahead?",
    ["aside17300101"]="Adventurer, wait!",
    ["aside17300201"]="Ready? We're setting off!",
    ["aside17300301"]="Over here! Quick!",
    ["aside17300401"]="How does it feel to be protected?",
    ["aside17300501"]="Ha——ha......",
    ["aside17300601"]="Now we can talk.",
    ["aside17310101"]="Here you are.",
    ["aside17310201"]="Adventurer...",
    ["aside17310301"]="This is it.",
    ["aside17310401"]="Oh... ka...",
    ["aside17310501"]="Afterall... I failed everyone...",
    ["aside17320101"]="Ha——ha...",
    ["aside17320201"]="So this is the power of \"speed\"...",
    ["aside17320301"]="Here you are.",
    ["aside17320401"]="Human, did you manage to find a hero who can defeat me?",
    ["aside17320402"]="Yes, my student is here.",
    ["aside17320501"]="Huff... huff... I'm alive...",
    ["aside17330101"]="Slay them, and you shall become the master of knowledge.",
    ["aside17330201"]="Something... has invaded my mind...!",
    ["aside17330301"]="AHHHHHHH!!!!",
    ["aside17330401"]="What... are these things???",
    ["aside17330501"]="Ah, the hero who completed the trial has returned...",
    ["aside17340101"]="Hmm... this should be the place.",
    ["aside17340102"]="Clank... hiss... crack!!!",
    ["aside17350101"]="Hmm, this should be the place.",
    ["aside17350201"]="Human... you've butchered my kind, and you think you can walk away unscathed?!",
    ["aside17350301"]="What a raw and repulsive evil presence...",
    ["aside17360101"]="Hmm, this should be the place.",
    ["aside17360201"]="Ready the bow and steady the aim... they're coming...!",
    ["aside17360301"]="Falcon and bow, please guide my sight...",
    ["aside17360401"]="With this arrow—I'll pierce the unseen!",
    ["aside17360501"]="I... I did it...",
    ["aside17370101"]="Look who it is—our next rising star in the Royal Chivalry!",
    ["aside17370201"]="Looks like our challenger is ready!",
    ["aside17370202"]="I've been waiting for you. Draw your sword, Adventurer!",
    ["aside17370301"]="Your sword... it's steady.",
    ["aside17370401"]="A beautiful display, Adventurer!",
    ["aside17370501"]="... Your resolve is clear and sincere.",
    ["aside17380101"]="Hmm... time really flies, huh?",
    ["aside17380201"]="Well, well, here comes the protagonist!",
    ["aside17380301"]="So the creator is... a Bard?",
    ["aside17380401"]="This tree...?",
    ["aside17380501"]="That's weird... Why is Megalith here?",
    ["aside17380502"]="Never bows... Ha! I got it! It can't really bow!",
    ["aside17380601"]="... Huh? What's it spitting out?",
    ["aside17380701"]="It's... Serpens!",
    ["aside17380801"]="Who's... there?",
    ["aside17380901"]="Has it really been... this long?",
    ["aside17381001"]="Heh, a contract with me? Let's see if you've got what it takes!",
    ["aside17381101"]="With that kind of power... you're not exactly embarrassing the Great Sage.",
    ["aside17381102"]="... So be it. I'm yours to command.",
    ["aside17381201"]="I knew you'd pull it off.",
    ["aside17390101"]="... Hurry up! Stop wasting time.",
    ["aside17390201"]="... Oh? Got something fresh coming in?",
    ["aside17390301"]="... Quick! Let me take a look!",
    ["aside17390401"]="... If you've made up your mind, go ahead and sign.",
    ["aside17390501"]="Good... that's some courage right there.",
    ["aside17390601"]="Wraith Forge... this is the place!",
    ["aside17390701"]="Your contract... has been accepted.",
    ["aside17390702"]="... Who?",
    ["aside17390801"]="... Looks like you made it.",
    ["aside17400101"]="Hmm... I think I hear some beautiful melody. Hohoho!",
    ["aside17400202"]="A lovely tune, but wouldn't it be even better with a dance? What do you think, Uncle Callahan?",
    ["aside17410101"]="... This is the final resting place of Lady Margaret.",
    ["aside17410201"]="Guess I'll have to make a trip to Umbala!",
    ["aside17410301"]="Piece of cake!",
    ["aside17410401"]="Hmph! A walk in the park!",
    ["aside17410501"]="All set! I should report back to Nicolas!",
    ["aside17410601"]="... Here, Adventurer.",
    ["aside17410801"]="Well, well... Look who's here!",
    ["aside17420101"]="It was in this very place that I saw the legendary battle...",
    ["aside17420201"]="Indeed... those who return from the path of sin have been forged anew by fire.",
    ["aside17420301"]="... What does that mean?",
    ["aside17420401"]="... Is it the Broken Butsudan?",
    ["aside17420501"]="Wandering souls... aren't those Horong?",
    ["aside17420601"]="Next, take these back to the Butsudan.",
    ["aside17420701"]="Very well... then the Flame of Exorcism is now yours to bear...",
    ["aside17420702"]="Those are...?",
    ["aside17420801"]="It seems like... a new power!",
    ["aside17430101"]="This is where Azer and I... spoke for the final time...",
    ["aside17440101"]="... Huh? Isn't that Adventurer?",
    ["aside17450101"]="Well, well... Seems like our best student has figured it out!",
    ["aside17450201"]="Hohoho! I'm looking forward to it.",
    ["aside17460101"]="... This is...?!",
    ["aside17460201"]="Em-Empty...?!",
    ["aside17470101"]="W-What do we do now?!",
    ["aside17470201"]="Adventurer! Look!",
    ["aside17470301"]="... Shh! Adventurer, Listen!",
    ["aside17470401"]="Your kindness shouldn't get washed away in hardship! I can give you a cozy home—and fancy clothes too!",
    ["aside17470501"]="That kind of courage deserves a reward! How about a massive amount of Zeny, huh?",
    ["aside17470601"]="Why...?",
    ["aside17480101"]="... Here you are.",
    ["aside17480201"]="This is...?!",
    ["aside17480301"]="Good. You didn't let me down.",
    ["aside17480401"]="So this is... how it ends for me?",
    ["aside17490101"]="Huh... Where is he?",
    ["aside17490201"]="Adventurer, I'm here!",
    ["aside17490301"]="This is your first trial.",
    ["aside17490401"]="Huh... I feel tougher.",
    ["aside17490501"]="Ah, my friend! I'm so glad you didn't leave!",
    ["aside17490601"]="Overcoming strength with weakness... using gentleness to overcome rigidity?",
    ["aside17500101"]="Hmph, you're so slow! Get over here already!",
    ["aside17500201"]="What is that?!",
    ["aside17500301"]="Just kill me... please...",
    ["aside17500401"]="Just... like we promised...",
    ["aside17500501"]="Thank you...",
    ["aside17500601"]="It looks like you made it?",
    ["aside17510101"]="Hello.",
    ["aside17510201"]="What a strange feeling...",
    ["aside17510301"]="Something's... gone?",
    ["aside17510302"]="Mentor, did you...? Mentor?",
    ["aside17520101"]="Ah, you're here.",
    ["aside17520201"]="Mentor... Gone again...?",
    ["aside17520202"]="Aah!! H-help, somebody help me!!!",
    ["aside17520301"]="What an overwhelming presence of evil!",
    ["aside17530101"]="Mentor's still not here.. huh?",
    ["aside17530201"]="Ugh... ahh...",
    ["aside17530202"]="Who?!",
    ["aside17530301"]="Ugh... can you feel it? There's a monster here...",
    ["aside17530302"]="Yes—Yes—that's it. Raise your weapon—kill him.",
    ["aside17530401"]="I can feel it... that presence...",
    ["aside17530501"]="It's close—right there!",
    ["aside17530601"]="Ugh—!",
    ["aside17530701"]="A strange notebook...?",
    ["aside17530801"]="... You've done well, get a good sleep.",
    ["aside18020101"]="What's that sheet on the ground?",
    ["aside18020201"]="Found it. This must be the second log page!",
    ["aside18020301"]="Awesome! That's the third log page!",
    ["aside18050101"]="Halt, no entry!",
    ["aside18060101"]="Look, Phreeoni is here!",
    ["aside18060102"]="It's been weakened by the poison in the food. Take this opportunity to eliminate it!",
    ["aside18070101"]="Ah, that huge Marse is...?!",
    ["aside18070201"]="Done! Time to return to Dobbin!",
    ["aside18080101"]="Ah, it appeared!",
    ["aside18080201"]="Done! Time to return to Perini!",
    ["aside18110101"]="Hmph, I'm going to teach you a lesson!",
    ["aside18120101"]="This is the place.",
    ["aside18120102"]="A hundred pieces of Willow Bark isn't a small amount. Let's get moving!",
    ["aside18120201"]="Ygnizem, Adventurer, this way please.",
    ["aside18120301"]="Done! Let's give them to Kavaski!",
    ["aside18130101"]="Oh no! That person's in danger!",
    ["aside18130201"]="Hmph, today will become the anniversary of your death!",
    ["aside18130301"]="Strange... Why isn't that kid here yet?",
    ["aside18140101"]="This is bad... The pack of hungry wolves thinks she's food!",
    ["aside18140201"]="Oh no, their target is Sarah!",
    ["aside18140301"]="\"Cries\"... Mama, Mama...",
    ["aside18150101"]="One down. The next destination would be Yin-Yang Taiji.",
    ["aside18150201"]="If I remember correctly, I'll need to take a photo in front of the Soul Devouring Tree.",
    ["aside18150301"]="Now to visit the Butsudan.",
    ["aside18150401"]="All done! Time to head back to Bowya!",
    ["aside18150501"]="Done! Time to head back to Bowya!",
    ["aside18160101"]="There seem to be some messy footprints on the ground.",
    ["aside18160201"]="I should search ahead; there might be...",
    ["aside18160301"]="The footprints turn left here. Let's follow them!",
    ["aside18160401"]="*Squeaks*",
    ["aside18160501"]="Ha! It's your turn now!",
    ["aside18160601"]="*Squeaks*",
    ["aside18160701"]="Erm, I'll take it back to Juke first!",
    ["aside18170101"]="This place... It's just like heaven!",
    ["aside18170201"]="Ah... You managed to bring so much!",
    ["aside18170301"]="I really hope luck is on our side.",
    ["aside18170401"]="Wow... It actually appeared!",
    ["aside18170501"]="Oh no! Look out!",
    ["aside18180101"]="Phew! Thank you so much!",
    ["aside18180201"]="Alright, let's give them to that mage!",
    ["aside18180301"]="...Hmph! S-stupid, meow...",
    ["aside18180401"]="Thank you. Now, let's take a look...",
    ["aside18190101"]="It's done. Take the weapon and let Howard take a look!",
    ["aside18190201"]="It's done. Take the weapon and let Howard take a look!",
    ["aside18190301"]="Give up now. You can't beat me.",
    ["aside18200101"]="Okay, let's go to the next location!",
    ["aside18200201"]="We still need some Axe-wielding Goblin blood. Let's take a look up ahead.",
    ["aside18200301"]="We've finally got them all. Let's give them to the Anti-Goblin Association.",
    ["aside18200401"]="Hey, over here! I'm here!",
    ["aside18200501"]="This is the place. Hmm, I really don't want to see this place again.",
    ["aside18210101"]="Hmm... Why aren't they listening to me?",
    ["aside18210201"]="Hah! This is perfect!",
    ["aside18210301"]="So, I'm counting on you to take the photo!",
    ["aside18210401"]="Hah! This is perfect!",
    ["aside18210501"]="Hah! This is perfect!",
    ["aside18220101"]="Adventurer, can you come over for a moment?",
    ["aside18220201"]="The sound that is coming from this Goddess Statue is pretty creepy...",
    ["aside18220202"]="Better check the area out!",
    ["aside18220301"]="How can there be monster footprints in the city center? Let's follow them!",
    ["aside18220401"]="The claw marks are pointing toward that field? What does it mean...",
    ["aside18220501"]="W-what, what was that sound?!",
    ["aside18220601"]="Ahem! Hey, hey—! Adventurer!",
    ["aside18220701"]="*Wails* What... is this smell!!",
    ["aside18220801"]="Stop! I surrender!",
    ["aside18230101"]="This color...",
    ["aside18230201"]="If we look at the distance between the strides, these seem to be the footprints of a grown man...?",
    ["aside18230301"]="Strange, if even Dinza can move those goods, then why...",
    ["aside18230401"]="Oh? The clues led us here?",
    ["aside18230501"]="Look here.",
    ["aside18230601"]="Oh? It's here too? Could it have entered the abbey...",
    ["aside18240101"]="This, this is...?",
    ["aside18240102"]="This is very strange. Let's sneak over and investigate!",
    ["aside18240201"]="There seems to be something under the ashes...",
    ["aside18240301"]="This talisman... Hurry and show it to Hylas.",
    ["aside18240401"]="Adventurer, come over.",
    ["aside18240501"]="I'm so mad. I'm so, so mad!!",
    ["aside18240601"]="Haha, what's going on?",
    ["aside18250101"]="What's that up ahead?!",
    ["aside18250201"]="It ran away. Hurry, follow it!",
    ["aside18250301"]="...I can't go near that spirit at all. Let's report the situation to Lanister first.",
    ["aside18250401"]="Wait up, there seems to be something on the ground!",
    ["aside18250501"]="...Could that girl's father be trapped in the sewer?",
    ["aside18250502"]="Try searching for other clues!",
    ["aside18250601"]="This bell was given to the girl by her father...",
    ["aside18250602"]="If his spirit still roams this world, he will definitely recognize its sound!",
    ["aside18250701"]="No reaction? Let's try again somewhere else!",
    ["aside18250801"]="Maybe he isn't around here...",
    ["aside18250901"]="Could this be?! Let's bring him back to Rey and try again!",
    ["aside18251001"]="Aooohhhhh!",
    ["aside18251101"]="Oh no, the Sageworm has lost its mind! Try ringing the bell!",
    ["aside18251201"]="Aaaaaooohhhhh!",
    ["aside18251301"]="Almost there! Try ringing the bell again!",
    ["aside18251401"]="It has come to an end. Let's report the situation to Lanister first.",
    ["aside18260101"]="Oh no, there are monsters everywhere!",
    ["aside18260201"]="Those corpses on the ground were from the caravan that was attacked by monsters, right?",
    ["aside18260202"]="Hurry, check if the jewelry box is on them.",
    ["aside18260301"]="A dagger? Weren't they attacked by monsters?",
    ["aside18260401"]="Strange, something doesn't add up.",
    ["aside18260501"]="Help... Help me...",
    ["aside18260601"]="Where's that sound coming from?",
    ["aside18260701"]="Urgh...",
    ["aside18260801"]="Hmph, he asked for it.",
    ["aside18270101"]="Strange, how have we not seen the inspector? Let’s have a look around shall we.",
    ["aside18270201"]="What the heck happened....? Wait, What’s that?",
    ["aside18270301"]="--Don’t move! Put your hands up!!",
    ["aside18270401"]="What's that piece of paper on the ground?",
    ["aside18270501"]="I found it, the second investigation record!",
    ["aside18270601"]="I didn’t expect the third one to be here!",
    ["aside18270701"]="I found it, the fourth investigation record!",
    ["aside18270801"]="We must go and ask the uniformed youth A about the contents of this.",
    ["aside18270901"]="There is something fishy going on here....",
    ["aside18270902"]="We must investigate the place mentioned in the document!",
    ["aside18271001"]="--Wha.... Whats that?!!",
    ["aside18271101"]="Show the document to the guard officer!",
    ["aside18280101"]="Alright! Here, take your photo!",
    ["aside18280201"]="Okay, its done, you can have you staff back!",
    ["aside18280301"]="It should be this book!",
    ["aside18290101"]="Oh-hoho, looks as if you’re pretty good at this~",
    ["aside18290201"]="Good, however the punch was no where near good enough.",
    ["aside18290301"]="Fantastic! You can go straight out!",
    ["aside18290401"]="Done! I have acquired even more useful and strange knowledge than I thought I would!",
    ["aside18290501"]="--No! Please, I beg you, don’t hurt him!",
    ["aside18300101"]="Ahh Hah, what a glorious battle!",
    ["aside18300201"]="Enough.... That should be enough!",
    ["aside18310101"]="How strange, there are no flowers here.... No people either!",
    ["aside18310201"]="Did someone run off with all of the xx flowers?",
    ["aside18310301"]="There are footprints..... lets follow up ahead and have a look!",
    ["aside18310401"]="Alright, now is not the time to be merciful to a Monster! ",
    ["aside18310501"]="—!!!",
    ["aside18310601"]="What the heck is going on...? Wait, what happened?",
    ["aside18320101"]="Hey, are... are you all right?",
    ["aside18320201"]="...Remember, follow along the west side!",
    ["aside18320301"]="These monsters are easy to deal with, indeed.",
    ["aside18320401"]="The Obeaune is right. Good thing we listened to him.",
    ["aside18320501"]="Why... Why are there spiders here?",
    ["aside18320601"]="Treasure, my treasure!",
    ["aside18320701"]="How can it be...",
    ["aside18320801"]="What's this...?!",
    ["aside18320901"]="Ugh... What happened to me...?",
    ["aside18330101"]="A big ship showed up on that sunny day...",
    ["aside18330201"]="Okay, fledgling Raggler is next...",
    ["aside18330301"]="Let's clear all the wandering Ragglers out first.",
    ["aside18330401"]="Done. Just the picture of the ice cave and glacier left to go...",
    ["aside18330501"]="Take these to Lindsey now!",
    ["aside18330601"]="A big ship showed up on that sunny day...",
    ["aside18340101"]="All right, take it to Jack.",
    ["aside18340201"]="Hey, you're pretty impressive! Here, it's yours now!",
    ["aside18340301"]="All right, what is it that you really want to know?",
    ["aside18340401"]="These barefoot prints... Let's follow them!",
    ["aside18340501"]="...What's that book over there?",
    ["aside18340601"]="...Arunafeltz? Guess more clues are needed!",
    ["aside18340701"]="... (Weird foreign language)",
    ["aside18340801"]="Is this...?!",
    ["aside18340901"]="Waah! Ouch, ouch...",
    ["aside18350101"]="...What's that book over there?",
    ["aside18350201"]="...Looks like we'll have to scour it for clues.",
    ["aside18350301"]="Done. The desert is next...",
    ["aside18350401"]="All right, give it to the girls!",
    ["aside18350501"]="Weird, no one's here.",
    ["aside18350601"]="Aha, got you!",
    ["aside18350701"]="...Wait! That's not the right bastard...",
    ["aside18350801"]="Ah, the air feels a lot better.",
    ["aside18360101"]="Late night, beer, beach... Those are the keys!",
    ["aside18360201"]="Counting on you to catch the culprit, then.",
    ["aside18360301"]="All right. First, wait until sundown...",
    ["aside18360401"]="Now, chug some beer...",
    ["aside18360501"]="Lastly, pretend you're drunk and raise hell on the beach...",
    ["aside18360601"]="Burp... Come, another round!!!",
    ["aside18360701"]="Whoopee, I'm a bird flying free! Burp!",
    ["aside18360801"]="Burp... Wh-Who else?",
    ["aside18360802"]="Beer-bobo... Beer!",
    ["aside18400101"]="Okay, let's cook the vegetable stew.",
    ["aside18400201"]="I'm sorry, Aronst...",
    ["aside18410101"]="Sorry, I... ",
    ["aside18410201"]="Thanks. Let's continue...  ",
    ["aside18410301"]="No—No—!!!",
    ["aside18410401"]="...",
    ["aside18410501"]="B-Brother...",
    ["aside18420101"]="... I don't want to be undead. Let the ground open up and swallow me!",
    ["aside18420201"]="Oh, what should I do...",
    ["aside18420301"]="—Please stand, unknown spirit.",
    ["aside18420401"]="Get back. It's very dangerous here!",
    ["aside18420501"]="You... Careful, they're attacking again!",
    ["aside18420601"]="... Thanks.",
    ["aside18420701"]="Everyone, now listen to me.",
    ["aside18420801"]="Okay. Go and report to those two soldiers.",
    ["aside18430101"]="Those are the Lord of the Dead's footprints. Let's follow!",
    ["aside18430201"]="Darn, monsters are blocking the road.",
    ["aside18430301"]="... Could it be that the Lord of the Dead has been tortured?",
    ["aside18430401"]="This is weird. Get pictures of where the trail of clues ended!",
    ["aside18430501"]="Heh-heh.",
    ["aside18430601"]="Is that... the Lord of the Dead? But the soldiers said...",
    ["aside18430701"]="Wait, what's that on the ground?!",
    ["aside18430801"]="Those glowing footprints... Could it be her?!",
    ["aside18440101"]="Cough cough...",
    ["aside18440201"]="No. But if that's true...",
    ["aside18440301"]="I suggest you do not act rashly.",
    ["aside18440401"]="Why... Why don't you just go and die?!",
    ["aside18450101"]="Yo! Wanna fight?!",
    ["aside18450201"]="I expect nothing less from Zenlur!",
    ["aside18450301"]="Hi... Class... mate...",
    ["aside18450401"]="Ho-ho-ho... Want to take a look?",
    ["aside18450501"]="H-Hello...",
    ["aside18450502"]="(Robotic Sound) H-Hello...",
    ["aside18460101"]="Is everyone here? The rehearsal is about to begin!",
    ["aside18460201"]="Go home and wait for it. Ain't my style to lie to my customers.",
    ["aside18460301"]="It's Orfeo and Trinity!",
    ["aside18470101"]="What is this place?",
    ["aside18470201"]="Let me out!",
    ["aside18470301"]="Look! Adventurer is awake!",
    ["aside18470401"]="Adventurer, has anyone ever told you that you are perfect to be a courier?",
    ["aside18470402"]="Put the materials on the Alchemy Platform. Then you can take a break.",
    ["aside18470501"]="Now, the secrets of these old bones are nowhere to hide...",
    ["aside18470601"]="New text appears!",
    ["aside18470701"]="...Impossible! What kind of a secret is this?",
    ["aside18480101"]="Why... How come it's them?",
    ["aside18480201"]="It's over? You could take a few more!",
    ["aside18490101"]="Give me a full face! Come on!",
    ["aside18490201"]="Side-view! Side-view! Watch your focus!",
    ["aside18490301"]="Don't... Push... Ouch!",
    ["aside18490302"]="Careful!",
    ["aside18490401"]="Command confirmed... Detected incoming tester... Verifying identity... Identity verification completed.",
    ["aside18490402"]="Identity verification completed. Adventurer, wish you a wonderful day.",
    ["aside18490501"]="Shhh... We will meet again...",
    ["aside18500101"]="Why's it so noisy here...?",
    ["aside18500102"]="... Come on, everyone! Cheer up!",
    ["aside18500201"]="Alright then, I'm leaving this to you!",
    ["aside18500301"]="Not convinced? Then all of you, come at me together!",
    ["aside18500401"]="I-I... I can't keep this up...",
    ["aside18500501"]="Don't panic! Stay in formation!",
    ["aside18500601"]="Alright... that should be enough!",
    ["aside18500701"]="Useless! Move—let me handle it!",
    ["aside18500702"]="Darn it... How's she even stronger than Goldie?!",
    ["aside18500801"]="Thanks, little Ebel! I wouldn't know what to do without you!",
    ["aside18500802"]="No problem, no problem! Call me anytime!",
    ["aside18500901"]="Darn it... How's she even stronger than Goldie?!",
    ["aside18510101"]="Cecil... Is she really...?",
    ["aside18510201"]="So this is... your hometown?",
    ["aside18510301"]="... Maybe I should find somewhere quieter.",
    ["aside18510401"]="... Let's keep looking.",
    ["aside18510501"]="You'll like it here.",
    ["aside18510601"]="Wait—what's going on?!",
    ["aside18510602"]="... I told you, you're not ready yet.",
    ["aside18510701"]="... Captain, can't you be a little nicer to her?",
    ["aside18510801"]="Useless bunch of idiots!",
    ["aside18510802"]="I'm sorry! I was wrong! Stop hitting me!",
    ["aside18510901"]="... Again?!",
    ["aside18511001"]="... Alright, then let's...",
    ["aside18511002"]="... Hold on, Adventurer.",
    ["aside19130101"]="Now everything is ready. I'm going to take the performance outfit to Schumann.",
    ["aside19200101"]="Now everything is ready. I'm going to take the performance outfit to Schumann.",
    ["aside19300101"]="There are just a few spooky places...",
    ["aside19300201"]="The first is Munak Cave...",
    ["aside19300301"]="Will she pick the Pyramid?",
    ["aside19300401"]="Done!",
    ["aside19300501"]="This place sure is creepy...",
    ["aside19300601"]="AAHHH!!!",
    ["aside19300602"]="...!",
    ["aside19300701"]="What? It's just a statue!",
    ["aside19310101"]="I'll have to rescue it first!",
    ["aside19310201"]="Woof... Woof!",
    ["aside19310301"]="Someone's put up a poster! \"Missing cat and dog. If you find a cat or a dog with a number 9 on its tag, please return it to Kao in Payon...\"",
    ["aside19310302"]="That must be their owner! Go return the pets.",
    ["aside19310401"]="My goodness! There you are!",
    ["aside19320101"]="Use Radiance Flowers and Forest Essence to make a wreath not commonly seen in Morroc.",
    ["aside19320201"]="Now for Forest Essence. Find a Wormtail.",
    ["aside19320301"]="Bring these to Heflee.",
    ["aside19320401"]="I just sent her away. Hurry up!",
    ["aside19320501"]="Fantastic! Let me see...",
    ["aside19320601"]="Look! She's back!",
    ["aside19320701"]="This...",
    ["aside19330101"]="Just trying to draw people's attention. See?",
    ["aside19330201"]="Wow...",
    ["aside19330301"]="In that case, just take a photo and show it to Heflee.",
    ["aside19340101"]="I'm counting on you. Thanks!",
    ["aside19340201"]="Go! Go!",
    ["aside19340301"]="This place looks just like a game...",
    ["aside19340401"]="This place's history is recorded in books. Standing here feels so strange...",
    ["aside19340402"]="There's still one more place. Let's go!",
    ["aside19340501"]="I know this place like the back of my hand—even better than Prontera!",
    ["aside19340502"]="Let's take a photo to remember this!",
    ["aside19340601"]="How was it? Did you have fun?",
    ["aside19350101"]="A pen pal... Then the postmaster must know.",
    ["aside19350201"]="What was that just now?",
    ["aside19350202"]="From over in the forest?",
    ["aside19350301"]="Oh no, we need to save him!",
    ["aside19350401"]="I'll leave it to you. Thank you!",
    ["aside19350501"]="And this is...?",
    ["aside19360101"]="You... You are not on my teleport list...",
    ["aside19360201"]="Eh...",
    ["aside19360301"]="Oh no...",
    ["aside19360401"]="Now, try to shut down the Dimensional Gap!",
    ["aside19360501"]="So, it really disappears!",
    ["aside19360601"]="Let's return and see Wolmas the Arch Bishop!",
    ["aside19360701"]="Are you guys okay?",
    ["aside19370101"]="What is this place...?",
    ["aside19370201"]="We're here! This is the place!",
    ["aside19370301"]="Ouch! Ouch, ouch...",
    ["aside19370401"]="Find a place to sit down.",
    ["aside19370501"]="F-Finally, make it in time!",
    ["aside19380101"]="There you are!",
    ["aside19380201"]="Here and there. Don't slack off. Huh? Adventurer?",
    ["aside19380301"]="Don't forget to mop the floor.",
    ["aside19380401"]="So, I will fulfill my promise.",
    ["aside19380501"]="Don't worry. It's gonna be fine.",
    ["aside19380601"]="Ahem. Let me show you all my beautiful voice.",
    ["aside19380701"]="You guys! The show is about to start!",
    ["aside19390101"]="Adventurer! Here!",
    ["aside19390201"]="Leave... Intruder...",
    ["aside19390301"]="Greetings, guest from the Parallel World.",
    ["aside19390401"]="Now, let the guest recall the item's look as much as he can...",
    ["aside19390501"]="We did it!",
    ["aside19400101"]="Dried fish... I want dried fish!",
    ["aside19400201"]="I'm about to have all the dried fish in the world!",
    ["aside19400301"]="Oh? New friends?",
    ["aside19410101"]="Leo...",
    ["aside19410201"]="The claw mark's depth is the same, without bloodstains...",
    ["aside19410301"]="It's Nasir's color!",
    ["aside19410401"]="The footprints' interval is huge... this direction is...",
    ["aside19410501"]="Adventurer!",
    ["aside19410601"]="My dear friends! I'm back!",
    ["aside19410701"]="That's great...",
    ["aside19410801"]="Ahem... I wish Odin is answering our call...",
    ["aside19410901"]="Complicated emotions come from the statue...",
    ["aside19411001"]="All the purchased goods disappeared!",
    ["aside19420101"]="Really... Is it not available for borrowing anymore?",
    ["aside19420201"]="(Whisper) You are...?",
    ["aside19420301"]="Huh? This is...?",
    ["aside19420401"]="Master! Why are you here?",
    ["aside19420501"]="Thank you! Thanks to all of you...",
    ["aside19430101"]="It's been a while, Adventurer!",
    ["aside19430201"]="No problem! I'll take care of it!",
    ["aside19430301"]="Quality is always guaranteed at Green Cotton Farm!",
    ["aside19430401"]="Premium beef and the freshest seafood are all here.",
    ["aside19430501"]="Let's invite our friends together!",
    ["aside19430601"]="Parrot loves delicious food!",
    ["aside2510001"]="The age of mankind's rule has long passed. This world shall belong to Lord <color=#A020F0>Baphomet</color>!",
    ["aside2510002"]="Oh no! The fires of <color=#ff5252>Flame Demon Tower</color> are blocking the city gates!\nIf we're going to put out the fire, then we need to get rid of the <color=#ff5252>Flame Baphomet</color> tower spirit!",
    ["aside2510003"]="This is a <color=#A020F0>demonic barrier</color> that Baphomet placed here. There are records of it in ancient books. Please, give me some time to crack the code!",
    ["aside2510004"]="Damn! The <color=#ff5252>Demon Tower</color> keeps creating <color=#ff5252>Demon Sacrifices</color> to strengthen <color=#A020F0>Baphomet's Afterimage</color>!",
    ["aside2510005"]="See that <color=#528fff>magic circle</color> nearby? If <color=#528fff>five people</color> gather inside, it will dispel the impenetrable barrier protecting the corresponding color of Demon Tower and its Sacrifices!",
    ["aside2510006"]="The <color=#528fff>water spheres</color> that the Water Lizards drop can extinguish the <color=#ff5252>Flame Demon Tower</color>!",
    ["aside2510007"]="The road up ahead is blocked by <color=#A020F0>demonic barriers</color> set by Baphomet. I've already asked the <color=#528fff>Ancient Mages</color> to go ahead and dispel them.\nWhen that time comes, the <color=#ff5252>Sacrifices</color> of Baphomet's Afterimage will continuously rush to the barrier and provide the Afterimage with energy. You must stop them!",
    ["aside2510008"]="I recommend that you <color=#528fff>send three teams of equal strength to take the three lanes</color>. That way, we'll have at least a slim chance of survival!\nThe fate of Prontera is in your hands, warriors!",
    ["aside2610101"]="Successfully submitted 1 Totem",
    ["aside2610102"]="Successfully submitted 1 Totem",
    ["aside2610103"]="Successfully submitted 1 Totem",
    ["aside2610104"]="Successfully submitted 1 Totem",
    ["aside2610105"]="Foolish intruders, meet your ends here! You are not worthy to be slain by my blade.",
    ["aside2610106"]="Bah, those Asgardian Gods! A bunch of Odin's lackeys. No wonder they failed to escape the fate of Ragnarok.",
    ["aside2610107"]="Do you truly believe that old mage won't offer you to me after he reaches the top?",
    ["aside2610108"]="I heard it, the darkest urges beckoning from the bottom of your heart, waiting to dominate your sanity...",
    ["aside2610109"]="Morroc didn't kill Lush; Thanatos' folly did.",
    ["aside2610110"]="Midgard has been immersed in peace for too long. Allow me to be a herald, bringing them war and bloodbath...",
    ["aside2610111"]="Hatred, despair, sorrow, agony... Ah, wondrous plagues—bred by human's heart...",
    ["aside2610112"]="With three heirs gone and seven candidates contending for the throne, the Rune Kingdom, a realm you're used to calling home, will inevitably start to fall apart...",
    ["aside2610113"]="Carry on your journey, even though your fate was sealed long ago...",
    ["aside2610114"]="Watch out, Thanatos released Emotional Poison Gas! My magic can only protect the central area!",
    ["aside2610115"]="A totem was wrongly submitted! Upon three wrong submissions, Thanatos will unleash his ultimate skill, and we will all die here!",
    ["aside2610116"]="Two totems were wrongly submitted! Upon three wrong submissions, Thanatos will unleash his ultimate skill, and we will all die here!",
    ["aside2610117"]="Adventurer, don't be deluded by the Phantom of Thanatos in the center! Our targets are materialized emotion monsters located at the four corners. Defeat them, take their sealing totems, and submit them at the correct location!",
    ["aside261011801"]="What a marvelous moment! Enjoy these captivating emotions with me!",
    ["aside261011802"]="Adventurer, it's the moment of truth! Go to the rooms on both sides, search for totems, and then dispel the Emotional Poison Gas!",
    ["aside2610119"]="Well done, Adventurers! Now go on to attack Thanatos!",
    ["aside27000117"]="Human! Don't you think this is it for the Class Advancement!",
    ["aside27000118"]="Demon, this is no place for your nonsense!",
    ["aside27000119"]="Hmph! Grumpy old people. Take your time and play with these Deviruchi here.",
    ["aside27000120"]="Baphomet has left. Now finish your trial.",
    ["aside27000121"]="<color=#ffe788>This is</color> <color=#ff5252>Baphomet's</color><color=#ffe788>mind illusion</color>. Try out the <color=#ff5252>Class Skills</color><color=#ffe788> to defeat monsters or quit the instance early.</color>",
    ["aside27000124"]="Adventurer! Defeat the demon!",
    ["aside2840101"]="Let's have some fun! My dear Geirrod!",
    ["aside2840102"]="You're a bit too fired up—time to cool you down with some ice!",
    ["aside2840103"]="Come on out, my minions!",
    ["aside2840104"]="Taste the power of ice!",
    ["aside2840105"]="Time for a divine judgment!",
    ["aside2840106"]="Stars of the heavens, gather to my side—strike down these faithless souls!",
    ["aside2840107"]="Behold, mortals—tremble before the might of a god!",
    ["aside2840108"]="Foolish humans! You have no idea what you're up against!",
    ["aside2840109"]="Hmph! That fragile hope you cling to is nothing more than your grasp of the last straw!",
    ["aside30004101"]="Damn Krakens! I'll turn you all into my undead slaves!",
    ["aside390101"]="Uh-huh. I'm the tour guide for the first stop, Rama VIII Bridge!",
    ["aside390201"]="Yo! This Chinese food in Chinatown ain't bad at all!",
    ["aside390301"]="You better put on long pants when you enter the palace.",
    ["aside390401"]="I wonder what it feels like to sing on the 77th floor.",
    ["aside390501"]="Wish you a moment of peacefulness when you stop here...",
    ["aside390601"]="The ultimate victory belongs to righteous people!",
    ["aside390701"]="I want to get on the Ferris wheel with my loved one the next time.",
    ["aside40004101"]="Ghost ship! Attack!",
    ["aside40004102"]="You’re the star of the Year of the Tiger!",
    ["aside40004103"]="Good guess! Don’t do this next time!",
    ["aside40004104"]="You’re the one who’s quick with your hands and sharp-sighted!",
    ["aside50000201"]="Adventurer, you're here! Follow me! I am Hulse, a member of Pentagram.",
    ["aside50000202"]="The demon army has already entered the city. We have to reinforce the Defense Force right away!",
    ["aside50000301"]="Look! The Defense Force ahead is fighting fiercely against the army of monsters! Help them destroy these terrible demons!",
    ["aside50000302"]="Hahaha! You think you can defeat me? Stop dreaming and submit to your fate. Worms deserve only to be exterminated!",
    ["aside50000303"]="You won't get away with this! We will take back Prontera! The sons of Odin will not be slaves!",
    ["aside50000401"]="We won! Let's keep moving!",
    ["aside50000402"]="Thank you all. I'll stay here to take care of the wounded. Please make sure you defeat that demon.",
    ["aside50000501"]="We are now separated from the other two squads by Baphomet's ward. We have to break through in order to assemble.",
    ["aside50000502"]="The symbols on this door are the keys to breaking Baphomet's ward. The 3 symbols that light up the ward at the same time will unlock it.",
    ["aside50000601"]="The ward is unlocked! Let's keep going!",
    ["aside50000701"]="Be careful, here comes another wave of monsters!",
    ["aside50000801"]="Adventurer, I need to stay here to seal the remaining evil power of Baphomet.",
    ["aside50000802"]="Maintain the momentum and keep advancing. Guard Commander Fergus is just ahead.",
    ["aside50000901"]="Wretched monsters, go back to your world!",
    ["aside50000902"]="Maggot, your resistance is futile! Crush them, my servants!",
    ["aside50001001"]="Our brothers have arrived to reinforce us! Finally, we can counterattack!",
    ["aside50001101"]="Thanks for the rescue! On behalf of the kingdom, I would like to express my highest respect for you!",
    ["aside50001102"]="Baphomet should be just a short distance away. There's no time to lose, let's get going!",
    ["aside50001201"]="I can't believe it's just his doppelganger. Darn it!",
    ["aside50001202"]="We proceed into the temple!",
    ["aside50001301"]="It's finally time for the showdown. You'll pay for your desecration of this land!",
    ["aside50001302"]="Maggots being maggots, blathering so much even when they're about to die! It's time to be cut down by my scythe!",
    ["aside50001303"]="For Midgard!",
    ["aside57010101"]="There are a lot of Cookies rushing into the square! Hide!",
    ["aside57010201"]="There are a lot of Christmas Cookies rushing in! Hide!",
    ["aside57010301"]="Myst Cases are running at you with their mouth wide open! Hide between them!",
    ["aside57010401"]="The Cruiser Salute won't hurt the fairy tale creatures! Disguise!",
    ["aside57010501"]="Garm is about to initiate the Fairy Tale Protection! Let's use the transmog and enter the fairy tale world with Garm!",
    ["aside571001"]="<color=#ffe788>You're the star of the Year of the Rabbit!!</color>",
    ["aside571002"]="<color=#ff5252>Good job! You will get better next time!</color>",
    ["aside571003"]="<color=#ffe788>Yo! What a move!</color>",
    ["aside600006011"]="<color=#528fff>Charging has reached the first stage! Release your fighting skills to defeat Traitor A!</color>",
    ["aside600006012"]="<color=#528fff>Charging has reached the first stage! Release your fighting skills to defeat Traitor B!</color>",
    ["aside600006013"]="<color=#528fff>Charging has reached the first stage! Release your fighting skills to defeat Traitor C!</color>",
    ["aside600006014"]="<color=#ff5252>Eliminate… the… Intruders…!</color>",
    ["aside600006015"]="Puny humans! Have you come to die again~",
    ["aside600006016"]="<color=#ff5252>Ryder</color>, initiate the disposal system.",
    ["aside600006017"]="Brue is already nothing more than scrap metal. Don't waste your energy!",
    ["aside600006018"]="Aaaaargh! My <color=#ff5252>Ryder</color>! You'll pay for this!",
    ["aside600006019"]="Today, I'll turn you all into spare parts! Spare Parts! Ahaha!",
    ["aside600006020"]="Hm, today's magic show will be very exciting...",
    ["aside600006021"]="Who's causing trouble? Don't you know the show is about to start?!",
    ["aside600006022"]="Acti...vate! Process the Monster’s program!",
    ["aside600006023"]="Minions! Crush them into pieces!",
    ["aside600006024"]="Feeble humans. Let me make you as tough as steel!",
    ["aside600006025"]="<color=#ff5252>Turn… you… all… into… dust…!</color>",
    ["aside600006026"]="T minus<color=#ffe788> 15 seconds</color>!\nLaunch <color=#ff5252>Iron Fist</color>!",
    ["aside600006027"]="T minus<color=#ffe788> 30 seconds</color>!\nLaunch <color=#ff5252>Explosive Punch</color>!",
    ["aside600006028"]="<color=#ff5252>Blast… the… humans… away…!</color>",
    ["aside600006029"]="<color=#528fff>Humans…\nBe… careful… on… the… road…</color>",
    ["aside600006030"]="<color=#ff5252>Stupid… losers…!</color>",
    ["aside600006031"]="<color=#ff5252>Destruction Mode!</color>",
    ["aside600006032"]="Charging has reached peak! Initiating <color=#528fff>destruction of Ryder!</color>",
    ["aside600006033"]="Let me make you as tough as mechs!",
    ["aside66030101"]="Um, are you here because you've heard about the legend of the Moonlight Flower? You have to think of a way to solve the mystery of the statue.",
    ["aside66030102"]="An illusion which guards the Moonlight Flower will appear. Be careful not to let it turn against you!",
    ["aside66030201"]="Another one unafraid of death is trespassing in the tower! I'll cast a special <color=#f6723e>curse</color> on them!",
    ["aside66030202"]="Whoever trespassing into the tower shall walk in my <color=#f6723e>blazing Burn effect</color>.",
    ["aside66030301"]="The party has officially started! MVPs and Minis with candy will appear in 1 minute. Get ready!",
    ["aside66030302"]="Hmph! These good-for-nothing monsters! Wait for me to bring more MVPs and Minis.",
    ["aside66030303"]="The party is heating up! More candy! More monsters! Are you ready?",
    ["attrTypeDes_10"]="Grants a permanent Endure status.",
    ["attrTypeDes_12"]="The skill level of activated %s of all pets +%s. (This effect will not stack if the same card is equipped. The adjusted skill level will not exceed the level cap of that skill.)",
    ["attrTypeDes_13"]="The skill level of activated %s of Shadow Equipment +%s. (This effect will not stack if the same card is equipped. The adjusted skill level will not exceed the level cap of that skill.)",
    ["attrTypeDes_14"]="Increase all Pet Attribute (calculated as aptitude +%s). (This effect will not stack if the same card is equipped. The adjusted aptitude cannot exceed the aptitude limit.)",
    ["attrTypeDes_3"]="Deals 100% damage to Large, Medium, and Small monsters. (When this card is equipped, other size-based damage enhancement effects will become invalid.)",
    ["attrTypeDes_8"]="When casting a skill that consumes %s, you have a %s chance to cast it without consuming any. (This effect cannot be stacked.)",
    ["attrpool_1"]="Increase the damage of Magnus Exorcismus by 20%",
    ["attrpool_2101013_1"]="Damage taken from Medium Monsters is reduced by 10%",
    ["attrpool_2102019_1"]="Physical Damage taken from Demi-Human monsters is reduced by 10%",
    ["awaken_001"]="Awakening",
    ["awaken_002"]="Upgrade Awakening",
    ["awaken_003"]="Enchant Awakening",
    ["awaken_004"]="Refine Awakening",
    ["awaken_005"]="Card Awakening",
    ["awaken_006"]="Pet Awakening",
    ["awaken_007"]="Weapon Awakening",
    ["battlePlanTips_01"]="Go to Class Conversion to unlock a new class?\n<color=#FF6F76>Requires 2nd Class Advancement and Job Lv. 30.</color>",
    ["battlePlanTips_02"]="Would you like to switch the load-out to <color=#F2AD18>%s</color>? Switching now requires <color=#F2AD18>%s</color> Gender Conversion Vouchers, and this feature will enter a 1-minute cooldown, during which you cannot switch classes.",
    ["battlePlanTips_03"]="Must first complete the \"New Master\" series quests.",
    ["battlePlanTips_04"]="You cannot switch classes while in combat or in a team.",
    ["battlepass_tips_001"]="Grand Prize",
    ["battlepass_tips_002"]="Reset ",
    ["battlepass_tips_003"]="Validity: %s",
    ["battlepass_tips_004"]="%s",
    ["battlepass_tips_005"]="Purchase to activate Glory Pass",
    ["battlepass_tips_006"]="Level is increased by <size=40>%s</size>",
    ["battlepass_tips_007"]="Level is increased to <size=40>%s</size>",
    ["battlepass_tips_008"]="%s Gift",
    ["battlepass_tips_009"]="Gift to",
    ["battlepass_tips_010"]="Gift",
    ["battlepass_tips_011"]="Gift History",
    ["battlepass_tips_012"]="1. The pass from the gift becomes an item card and can only be used in the backpack. The pass can only be sent to friends that have been added more than 3 days.",
    ["battlepass_tips_013"]="Activate Glory Pass",
    ["battlepass_tips_014"]="At Lv.120 and above, the whole party can obtain a Material Pack after clearing an instance.",
    ["battlepass_tips_015"]="%s has gifted you a Glory Pass. Please check it in the mail.",
    ["battlepass_tips_016"]="You've gifted a Glory Pass to %s.",
    ["battlepass_tips_017"]="Gift Attempts: <color=#ffa8e1>%s</color>",
    ["battlepass_tips_018"]="2. For every 20,000 Diamonds topped up, receive 1 gift attempt.",
    ["battlepass_tips_019"]="Glory Pass Lv.%s Claim",
    ["battlepass_tips_020"]="<color=#FFFFFF><size=18>Level</size></color>\n%s",
    ["battlepass_tips_021"]="Lv.<size=30>%s</size> \nClaim",
    ["battlepass_tips_022"]="Level up the pass to (current Lv.%s)",
    ["battlepass_tips_023"]="The maximum level for the purchase each time is Lv.120",
    ["battlepass_tips_024"]="Your game client is outdated. Please update it.",
    ["battlepass_tips_025"]="Send a Glory Pass to your friend as a gift? It's non-refundable once it has been sent.",
    ["battlepass_tips_026"]="Insufficient gift attempts.",
    ["battlepass_tips_027"]="The system is locked.",
    ["battlepass_tips_028"]="You have purchased the Glory Bonus Pack successfully. Your Pass level is increased by Lv.%s.",
    ["battlepass_tips_029"]="You have purchased the Glory Bonus Pack successfully. Your Pass level is increased by Lv.%s.",
    ["battlepass_tips_030"]="No selected Costume for preview. Unable to reset.",
    ["battlepass_tips_031"]="1. Pass resets when it ends this time.\n2. Upon reaching Lv.120, rewards for the pass will be given in cycles.\n3. Pass Glory Gift Pack: Only one of the following can be purchased each phase: Glory Activation Card, Glory Bonus Pack, or Glory Booster Pack.\n4. The maximum number of levels that can be purchased each time is 120.\n5. The Pass Challenge Quest consists of two phases, which reset every phase. New quests at different levels of difficulty will be available upon refresh based on the World Level at that moment.\n6. The Pass Weekly Quest refreshes every Monday. If the first or last week of the month has less than 7 days, the number of quests during the given week will be reduced accordingly.\n7. The Weekly Sign-in Chest EXP is 50 before you activate the Glory Pass.\n8. Upon reaching Lv. 120, the next Glory Pass will come at a 20% discount.\n9. The Glory Booster Pack price changes based on the current pass price.\n10. Reaching Pass Lv.120 earns your whole party a material pack upon completing an instance.\n11. The price of the Glory Booster Pack and the Season Pass-exclusive Lv.120 Booster Pack will vary according to your current pass level. Please choose your purchase as needed.",
    ["battlepass_tips_032"]="Lv %s",
    ["battlepass_tips_033"]="No rewards for the current level",
    ["battlepass_tips_034"]="No gift history",
    ["battlepass_tips_035"]="Successfully activated the Glory Pass for the current phase.",
    ["battlepass_tips_036"]="You have purchased the Glory Booster Pack successfully. As your Pass level is over 80, only the Glory Pass will be activated.",
    ["battlepass_tips_038"]="Spend %s Diamonds to purchase %s? You can only purchase 1 gift pack out of the 3 tiers available each phase.",
    ["battlepass_tips_039"]="Spend %s Diamonds to purchase Glory Pass? You can only purchase 1 gift pack out of the 3 tiers available each phase.",
    ["battlepass_tips_040"]="Spend %s Diamonds to purchase Glory Bonus Pack? You can only purchase 1 gift pack out of the 3 tiers available each phase.",
    ["battlepass_tips_041"]="Spend %s Diamonds to purchase Glory Booster Pack? You can only purchase 1 gift pack out of the 3 tiers available each phase.",
    ["battlepass_tips_042"]="Purchase Pass Levels.",
    ["battlepass_tips_043"]="Glory Activation Card",
    ["battlepass_tips_044"]="Glory Bonus Pack",
    ["battlepass_tips_045"]="Glory Booster Pack",
    ["cameraNoFreeMode"]="You cannot use Free Mode in the current state.",
    ["cardskill_10101141"]="The chance for triggering Auto Spell: Lv.5 Frost Diver (instantaneous) is 3.5% when launching melee normal attacks, and 2% when launching ranged normal attacks. Not stackable.",
    ["cardskill_10101175"]="When using normal attacks/skills, there is a 10% chance that the next damage comes with a Lv.6 Ice Arrow Auto Spell, dealing 600% Water attribute Adaptive DMG. Cooldown: 2 seconds. (Unique skill effect.)",
    ["cardskill_10102050"]="The chance for triggering Auto Spell: Lv.5 Frost Diver (instantaneous) is 3.5% when taking melee P.DMG, and 2% when taking ranged P.DMG. Not stackable.",
    ["cardskill_10102051"]="When dealing ranged normal attacks, there is a 1.5% chance of inflicting Bleed on the target. Lasts 10 seconds.",
    ["cardskill_10102063"]="When using normal attacks/skills, there is a 10% chance that the next damage comes with a Lv.8 Magic Crasher Auto Spell, dealing 220% Neutral attribute Adaptive DMG. Cooldown: 2 seconds. (Unique skill effect.)",
    ["cardskill_10104010"]="Max HP -25%",
    ["cardskill_10104011"]="MSPD +25%",
    ["cardskill_10105014"]="Skill SP Cost -30%",
    ["cardskill_10105069"]="When dealing melee normal attacks, there is a 0.2% chance of triggering Auto Spell: Lv.10 Strip Weapon, and the probability of stripping weapons is 15%. Lasts 12 seconds.",
    ["cardskill_10105089"]="After releasing any skill, the party member with the highest P.ATK receives a 15% increase in P.ATK percentage for 6 seconds. Cooldown: 18 seconds. (Unique skill effect)",
    ["cardskill_10105090"]="After releasing any skill, the party member with the highest M.ATK receives a 15% increase in M.ATK percentage for 6 seconds. Cooldown: 18 seconds. (Unique skill effect)",
    ["cardskill_10105104"]="When a target deals more than 40% of your Max HP as damage within 3 seconds, immediately cast Serpent Bind on the source of the damage. The bound enemy's damage against you is reduced by 50%, and their MSPD is reduced by 20% for 4 seconds. Cooldown: 20 seconds. Unique effect. Cannot be stacked.",
    ["cardskill_10105105"]="There's a 6% chance for normal attacks and a 12% chance for skills to trigger Serpent Dance, increasing your damage dealt to Angel, Insect, Demi-Human, and Brute monsters by 16% for 10 seconds. Triggers once every 20 seconds. Unique effect. Cannot be stacked.",
    ["cardskill_10106026"]="Revives on the spot after dying, recovering all HP and SP. (300-second cooldown. This effect does not stack.)",
    ["cardskill_10106028"]="Can Use Lv.1 Heal. SP cost of all skills is increased by 25%. (This effect doesn't stack.)",
    ["cardskill_10106067"]="Each Normal Attack hit has a 3% chance to trigger Lv.10 Fire Ball instantly.",
    ["cardskill_10107015"]="40% chance to be immune to magic skills. Skill SP cost is increased by 50%. (This effect cannot stack and cannot be used in PVP mode.)",
    ["cardskill_10107022"]="Equip the Orc Disaster [Day], [Night], and [Void] Cards at the same time to awaken the Orc Disaster: When receiving lethal damage, triggers Self-Regeneration, instantly recovers 30% HP, and heals 2% Max HP per second for 10 seconds (Built-in Cooldown: 60 seconds. This effect does not stack.)",
    ["cardskill_10107023"]="Equip the Storm Dragon's [Day], [Night], and [Void] Cards at the same time to awaken the Storm Dragon: After entering combat, summon 6 black cyclones every 30 seconds that move outwards for 6 seconds, dealing True damage equal to 1% Max HP to targets they touch. (This effect is ineffective against Bosses, Minis, and MVPs.)",
    ["cardskill_10107026"]="Effect of equipping Armored Titan Card [Day], [Night], and [Void] at the same time:\nChance to increase your Final P.DEF by 60% for 6 seconds when being hit, which has a 12-second cooldown.",
    ["cardskill_10107027"]="Effect of equipping Colossal Titan Card [Day], [Night], and [Void] at the same time:\nChance to gain a shield equal to 20% of your Max HP for 6 seconds when being hit, which has a 12-second cooldown.",
    ["cardskill_10107028"]="Effect of equipping Beast Titan Card [Day], [Night], and [Void] at the same time:\nGiant's Bane: Increases Final DMG Bonus when attacking <color=#44afee>Adventurers</color> with more HP than yourself. Increases Final DMG Bonus by 1% for every 10% extra HP, up to 30% (non-effective against monsters).",
    ["cardskill_10107029"]="Effect of equipping Armored Titan Card [Day], [Night], and [Void] at the same time:\nThere is a 15% chance to increase your Final P.DEF by 72% for 6 seconds when being hit, which has a 12-second cooldown.",
    ["cardskill_10107030"]="Effect of equipping Colossal Titan Card [Day], [Night], and [Void] at the same time:\nThere is a 15% chance to gain a shield equal to 24% of your Max HP for 6 seconds when being hit, which has a 12-second cooldown.",
    ["cardskill_10107031"]="Effect of equipping Beast Titan Card [Day], [Night], and [Void] at the same time:\nGiant's Bane: Increases your damage against <color=#44afee>Adventurers</color> with higher Max HP than you. Increases damage by 1% for every 20% of extra HP, up to 20% (non-effective against monsters).",
    ["cardskill_10107032"]="The effect when equipping First Ultraman Card, Ultraman Taro Card, Alien Pedant Card, and Alien Adacic Card at the same time:\nThere is a 3% chance of getting a buff when using normal attacks or dealing skill damage, increasing the damage dealt against all MVPs, Minis, and Bosses by 20%. Lasts 10 seconds with a 20-second cooldown.",
    ["cardskill_10107033"]="The effect when equipping Ultraman Zoffy Card, Ultraman Seven Card, Ultraman Jack Card, and Ultraman Ace Card at the same time:\nThere is a 3% chance of getting a buff when using normal attacks or dealing skill damage, increasing the damage dealt against normal monsters by 20%. Lasts 10 seconds with a 20-second cooldown.",
    ["cardskill_10107034"]="When equipped with both Garm Card and Garm Baby Card: the probability of triggering the effect of the two cards is increased by 50% (equivalent to base probability x (1 + increased probability)).",
    ["cardskill_10107035"]="Effect of equipping Watcher Card [Day], [Night], and [Void] at the same time:\nWhen damage received exceeds 10% of your Max HP, become immune to this damage and receive Endure and the Damage Blocking for the next 2 seconds (can be triggered with other damage immunity effects). This effect triggers once every 10 seconds.\n(Unique set effect. Cannot be stacked, and is ineffective in PVE.)",
    ["cardskill_10107036"]="Effect of equipping Skeggiold Card [Day], [Night], and [Void] at the same time:\nNormal attack has a 20% chance to trigger Divine Blessing, converting your armor into Holy attribute for 3 seconds.\nAdditionally, increases your Holy & Neutral attribute damage by 2% and Holy & Neutral attribute resistance by 2% for 3 seconds. Stacks up to 10 times.",
    ["cardskill_10107037"]="Effect of equipping Gioia Card [Day], [Night], and [Void] at the same time:\nYour Wind & Ghost attribute M.DMG has a 30% chance to deal an additional 100% damage.\nAll damage taken is increased by 40%.\n(Unique set effect. Cannot be stacked.)",
    ["cardskill_10107038"]="Effect of equipping Arc Angeling Card [Day], [Night], and [Void] at the same time:\nWhen party members receive P.DMG within 30 meters of you, their damage taken is reduced by 20% (excludes True Damage). Instead, you will suffer HP loss equal to 10% of the original damage taken (ineffective when you have less than 25% HP).\nYour HP/SP regen per 5 seconds will be increased by 5%.\nWhen your Luck is above 777, HP/SP regen per 5 seconds will be increased by an additional 15%.\n(Unique set effect. Cannot be stacked.)",
    ["cardskill_10107039"]="Equipping Memory of Thanatos Card [Day] and [Night] at the same time:\nApplies the Investigate effect to the weapon: For every 50 points of P.DEF that the target has, increases your damage dealt by 1% (up to 30%).\nConsumes an additional 20 SP when attacking every time (normal attacks/skills).\nP.DEF/M.DEF Percentage -30%, Final Flee Percentage -30%.",
    ["cardskill_10107040"]="Effect of equipping Bane Dragon Card [Day], [Night], and [Void] at the same time:\nIncreases your Final DMG Reduction by 45% for 6 seconds when total damage taken exceeds 20% of your Max HP. Triggers once every 18 seconds.",
    ["cardskill_10107041"]="Effect of equipping Orc Disaster II Card [Day], [Night], and [Void] at the same time:\nAuto-cast Magic Crasher on the target when using normal attacks or dealing skill damage: Deals 1,250% adaptive Ghost attribute damage and reduces the target's Final DMG Bonus by 30% for 6 seconds. Cooldown: 18 seconds.",
    ["cardskill_10109005"]="Effect of equipping RSX-0806 Card [Day], [Night], and [Void] at the same time (Unique set effect. Cannot be stacked.):\nWhen dealing skill damage on the target, Fatal Missile will be automatically cast, dealing Adaptive Neutral DMG equal to 360% of Adaptive ATK to the target. Cooldown: 3 seconds.\nIf the target is immobilized, Fatal Missile deals an additional Adaptive Neutral DMG equal to 1.5% of the target's Max HP.\nWhen the average refinement level reaches Lv.6 or every subsequent level, the damage coefficient of Fatal Missile is increased by an additional 60% up to 10 levels.",
    ["cardskill_10109006"]="Effect of equipping Nidhoggr's Shadow Card [Day], [Night], and [Void] at the same time (Unique set effect. Cannot be stacked.):\nIncrease Fire Bolt and Cold Bolt's damage coefficient by 40% of M.ATK per skill level. (Skills triggered by equipment do not count.) Every 100 INT increases Fire Bolt and Cold Bolt's damage coefficient by 1% of M.ATK per skill level (up to 80% per skill level).\nWhen equipped by Warlock, Sorcerer, or Elevated Novice, the fixed cast time is reduced by 0.5 seconds.",
    ["cardskill_10109007"]="Effect of equipping Queen Scaraba Card [Day], [Night], and [Void] at the same time (Unique set effect. Cannot be stacked.):\nIncreases the damage against Insect monsters by 10%.\n After entering the battle, a Porcellio (with inherited character attributes and two skills) will be summoned automatically to assist the battle. (Only one Porcellio can exist at a time and will disappear after exiting the battle.)\nPorcellio Skill:\nEarth Attack: Deals 397% melee Adaptive Earth DMG to a single target within 3 meters. Cooldown: 3 seconds.\nPneuma: Applies a Lv.10 Pneuma to the master (same effect as Priest). Cooldown: 40 seconds.\nWhen the average refinement level reaches Lv.6 or every subsequent level, the damage against Insect monsters is increased by 3%, and the damage of Porcellio is increased by 25%.",
    ["cardskill_10109008"]="Effect of equipping Faceworm Queen Card [Day], [Night], and [Void] at the same time (Unique set effect. Cannot be stacked.):\nReduces Max HP by 25% and increases Final Crit by 25%.\nWhen dealing Neutral attribute Crit DMG, it inflicts one hit that deals an additional 10% damage to the target (an additional 60% damage if the target is poisoned).\nDepending on the average refinement level of the weapon, for each level above Lv.5, the bonus damage coefficient of this card is increased by 2.2% up to 10 levels.",
    ["cardskill_10109009"]="Effect of equipping Garm Card (2023) and Garm Baby Card (2023) at the same time:\nThe damage of the Magic Crasher and Ice Arrow triggered by Garm Card (2023) and Garm Baby Card (2023) is increased by 100% against Bleeding targets. (Unique skill effect.)",
    ["cardskill_10109010"]="Effect of equipping Vesper Card [Day], and [Night] at the same time (exclusive effect):\nIncreases Earth/Water/Fire/Wind elemental reduction by 30% and Final P.DMG/M.DMG Bonus and by 35%.",
    ["cardskill_10109011"]="Effect of equipping Legendary Savior Card [Day] and [Night] at the same time:\nWhen casting normal attacks or skills, there's a 10% chance to summon Kenshiro to release Hokuto Hyakuretsu Ken, dealing 1,800% weapon attribute P.DMG. Cooldown: 20 seconds. (Attack range: 125-degree fan-shaped area x5m)\nAfter triggering, it increases P.ATK by 50% and Final P.PEN by 25% for 10 seconds.",
    ["cardskill_10109012"]="Effect of equipping Terrifying Ken-Oh Card [Day] and [Night] at the same time:\nWhen casting normal attacks or skills, there's a 10% chance to summon Raoh to release Tensho Honretsu, dealing 2,400% weapon attribute P.DMG. Cooldown: 20 seconds. (Attack range: straight line, 12m long and 3m wide)\nAfter triggering, it increases P.ATK by 50% and Crit DMG Bonus by 50% for 10 seconds.",
    ["cardskill_10109013"]="Effect of equipping Hokuto Shinken Successor Card [Day] and [Night] at the same time:\nWhen casting normal attacks or skills, there's a 10% chance to summon Kenshiro to release Hokuto Hyakuretsu Ken, dealing 1,800% weapon attribute M.DMG. Cooldown: 20 seconds. (Attack range: 125-degree fan-shaped area x5m)\nAfter triggering, it increases M.ATK by 50% and Final M.PEN by 25% for 10 seconds.",
    ["cardskill_10109014"]="Effect of equipping Conqueror Card [Day] and [Night] at the same time:\nWhen casting normal attacks or skills, there's a 10% chance to summon Raoh to release Tensho Honretsu, dealing 2,400% weapon attribute Adaptive DMG. Cooldown: 20 seconds. (Attack range: straight line, 12m long and 3m wide)\nAfter triggering, it increases the damage against MVP and MINI by 20% for 10 seconds.",
    ["cardskill_10109017"]="Equipping Gloom Under Night Card [Void]/[Day]/[Night] grants you the following effects:\nEach time a skill hits a target, there's a 10% chance to auto-cast Doom Shadow, dealing Adaptive Ghost DMG equal to 1,200% of Adaptive ATK to a single target. This also inflicts a Severe Damage effect on the target, reducing their Final Max HP by 10% for 6 seconds (a unique effect that cannot be stacked; ineffective against MVP, MINI, or Boss units).\nDoom Shadow triggers up to once every 12 seconds. When the weapon average refinement level reaches Lv.+6 or above, each additional refinement level reduces the target's Final Max HP by an additional 5%. The effect caps at Lv.+10.",
    ["cardskill_10109018"]="Equipping Retribution Card [Void]/[Day]/[Night] grants you the following effects:\nWhen dealing skill damage on the target, there's a 10% chance of casting Fatal Missile automatically, dealing Adaptive Shadow DMG equal to 2,000% of Adaptive ATK to the target. For every 10% Max HP lost by the target, the trigger rate increases by 8%, up to 40%.\nWhen the weapon average refinement level reaches Lv.+6 or above, each additional refinement level deals an additional Adaptive Shadow DMG equal to 500% of Adaptive ATK. The effect caps at Lv.+10. Fatal Missile triggers up to once every 20 seconds.",
    ["cardskill_10109019"]="Equipping Shelter Card [Void]/[Day]/[Night] grants you the following effects:\nWhen your Holy Enhancement is higher than the Shadow Enhancement, attacking has a 9% chance of summoning a Holy Magic Circle. This grants you a Holy Armor and causes your normal attacks to deal an extra 100% of your Adaptive Holy Damage, while your skills deal an additional 300% of your Adaptive ATK as Adaptive Holy Damage. (The extra damage triggers once every 0.2s and 0.6s for normal attacks and skills, respectively.)\nWhen your Shadow Enhancement is higher than the Holy Enhancement, attacking has a 9% chance of summoning a Shadow Magic Circle. This grants you Shadow Armor and causes your normal attacks and skills to deal an additional 100% and 300% Adaptive ATK as Adaptive Shadow DMG, respectively. (The extra damage has a trigger interval of 0.2s for normal attacks and 0.6s for skills.)\nThe Magic Circle effect triggers once every 10 seconds, lasting 20 seconds. If the Holy Enhancement and Shadow Enhancement are equal, the Magic Circle will be triggered randomly in either attribute. When your Final Crit is higher than Final Penetration, this bonus damage may trigger critical damage.",
    ["cardskill_10109020"]="Equipping Ktullanux Card [Void]/[Day]/[Night] grants you the following effects:\nNormal attacks and skills have a 10% and 30% to summon a 6-meter Storm Gust around yourself, dealing Adaptive Water DMG equal to 180% of Adaptive ATK every 0.5 seconds and inflicting a Slow effect to all enemies within range.\nTargets under the effect of Slow will have their MSPD reduced by 50%, fixed cooldown increased by 10 seconds, fixed cast time increased by 2 seconds, and Final ASPD reduced by 50%. This effect lasts for 5 seconds.\nStorm Gust lasts for 5 seconds and triggers once every 20 seconds. When your Final Crit is higher than Final Penetration, Storm Gust's damage may trigger critical damage.",
    ["cardskill_10109021"]="Equipping Subaru Natsuki Card [Day]/[Night] at the same time grants you the following effects:\nGains the forbidden power that defies the Source of Life. Upon death, you will be revived on the spot in 2 seconds, with both your HP and SP restored to what they were 5 seconds ago. Can only be triggered once every 180 seconds.",
    ["cardskill_10109022"]="Equipping Rem Card [Day]/[Night] at the same time grants you the following effects:\nEnhances your combat abilities significantly. When attacked, there's an 11% chance to enter Demon Form, boosting your Final P.DMG and M.DMG Bonus by 60% while turning your armor into Undead attribute, making you immune to debuffs for 6 seconds (excluding special debuffs from MVP, MINI, and Instance Boss). Can only be triggered once every 20 seconds.",
    ["cardskill_10109023"]="Equipping Emilia Card [Day]/[Night] grants you the following effects:\nGrants you the power to incorporate Ice into Fire. In battle, your attacks and hits taken have an 11% chance to cast an ice hammer and a 6% chance to deal 280% Adaptive Fire DMG 2 times to all enemies within 8 meters, with a 4% chance to freeze them for 3 seconds (not effective against MVP, MINI, and Boss units). Frozen enemies are unable to move, cast normal attacks or skills, and will remain frozen even when attacked. Frozen can be countered with Freeze Resistance. Can only be triggered once every 3 seconds.",
    ["cardskill_10109024"]="Equipping Ram Card [Day]/[Night] at the same time grants you the following effects:\nAllows Ram to use her Clairvoyance to detect your target's weakness when you attack, making your next attack deal an additional weapon attribute Adaptive DMG equal to 1,500% of Adaptive ATK. The target's weakness can only be triggered by you or party members, and it will be removed afterward. Can only be triggered once every 5 seconds. When targeting the same enemy, multiple Clairvoyance effects in the party can be triggered in turns.",
    ["cardskill_10109025"]="Equipping Downhill Fat Tiger [Day]/[Night] grants you the following effects:\nA starving Fat Tiger comes down the mountain to hunt for juicy prey. Applies a Tender mark to targets upon dealing damage, with a 20-second cooldown. If the target is an Adventurer, they gain 1 stack of Tender for every 400 VIT they process (minimum 1, maximum 30 stacks). If the target is not an Adventurer, they gain 25 stacks of Tender for 10 seconds. Each stack of Tender increases the caster's Crit DMG Bonus by 8%. The mark can be dispelled.",
    ["cardskill_10109026"]="Equipping Skyward Fat Dragon [Day]/[Night] grants you the following effects:\nA full-bellied Fat Dragon ascends into the sky. Enters the Well-Fed state when your HP is over 90%. While active, your HP is locked at 80% or above of your Max HP for 6 seconds under the Fat Dragon's protection. This protection ends early after 20 hits or if damage exceeds 35% of your Max HP. Once the protection ends, the Well-Fed state cannot be triggered again for 20 seconds. The Well-Fed state is unremovable, but the protection can be dispelled.",
    ["cardskill_10109027"]="Equipping Bijou Card [Day]/[Night] grants you the following effects:\nWhen dealing skill damage, there's a 10% chance of summoning a meteor shower over a 6-meter radius around the target for 10 seconds. Enemies in the area are kindled, taking Fire attribute M.DMG equal to 320% of M.ATK every second. Meteors strike the target area, and deal weapon attribute M.DMG equal to 3,000% of M.ATK. Targets hit by meteor ash will have their armor attribute changed to Earth for 7 seconds (ineffective against MVP, MINI, and Boss units). A fiery zone remains, dealing with the Fire attribute M.DMG equal to 400% M.ATK every 0.5 seconds for 6 seconds to all targets within range. Triggers once every 20 seconds.",
    ["cardskill_10109028"]="Equipping Angel Capoo Card [Day]/[Night] grants you the following effects: Angel Capoo is always on the lookout for the enemy's Malice. Normal attacks and skills each have a 5%|10% chance to reveal Malice on a single target. Each stack of Malice reduces the target's PVP Final P.DMG RED and PVP Final M.DMG RED by 1%, lasting 8 seconds and stacking up to 6 times. All party members with this skill can stack Malice together, increasing the number of stackable Malice by 1 for each member with the skill. When attacking a target affected by Malice, all party members deal an additional weapon attribute Adaptive DMG equal to (150% +20% x Malice stacks) of their ATK. Triggers once every 2 seconds. The trigger interval is reduced by 12.5% for each party member with this skill.",
    ["cardskill_10109029"]="Equipping Wealth Capoo Card [Day]/[Night] grants you the following effects: With Wealthy Capoo's favor, fortune comes your way. You can consume Golden Favor to ward off debuffs. When dealing damage, there's a 40% chance to apply 8 stacks of Golden Favor that lasts for 8 seconds on yourself. You can consume 1 stack of Golden Favor to be immune to the effect when getting hit (from another Adventurer) by Freeze, Petrify, Immobilize, or Stun. Cooldown: 16 seconds.",
    ["cardskill_10109030"]="Effect of equipping Angemon Card [Day] and [Night] at the same time:\nWhen using normal attacks|skills, there's a 6%|18% chance to unleash God Typhoon, dealing 2,100% weapon attribute P.DMG to all enemies within a 12x3 meter area. God Typhoon reduces affected enemies' P.DEF significantly, reducing their Final P.DEF by 20%. If the targets are Adventurers, the effect becomes a 12% reduction in PVP Final P.DMG RED instead for 6 seconds. Cooldown: 20 seconds. While the skill is active, it increases your P.ATK by 40% and Final P.DMG Bonus by 35% for 10 seconds.",
    ["cardskill_10109031"]="Effect of equipping Angewomon Card [Day] and [Night] at the same time:\nWhen using normal attacks|skills, there's a 6%|18% chance to unleash Heaven's Charm, dealing 2,100% weapon attribute M.DMG to all enemies within a 12x3 meter area. Heaven's Charm reduces affected enemies' M.DEF significantly, reducing their Final M.DEF by 20%. If the targets are Adventurers, the effect becomes a 13% reduction in PVP Final M.DMG RED instead for 6 seconds. Cooldown: 20 seconds. While the skill is active, it increases your M.ATK by 40% and Final M.DMG Bonus by 35% for 10 seconds.",
    ["cardskill_10109032"]="Effect of equipping Thanatos' Expedition [Day] and [Night] at the same time: Deals 30% more DMG to buildings (cannot be stacked).",
    ["cardskill_10109033"]="Effect of equipping Morroc's Creation [Day] and [Night] at the same time: Deals 30% more DMG to buildings (cannot be stacked).",
    ["cardskill_10109034"]="Effect of equipping Senoumaru [Day] and [Night] at the same time:\nWhen using normal attacks|skills, there's a 6%|18% chance to unleash Crescent Tear, dealing 2,100% weapon attribute P.DMG (crit possible) to all enemies within a 12x3 meter area. Crescent Tear reduces affected enemies' DEF significantly, reducing their Final Anti-Crit by 20%. If the targets are Adventurers, the effect becomes a 13% reduction in PVP Final P.DMG RED instead for 6 seconds. Cooldown: 20 seconds. While the skill is active, it increases your Crit DMG Bonus by 80% and Final P.DMG Bonus by 30% for 10 seconds.",
    ["cardskill_10109035"]="Effect of equipping Ryuoumaru Card [Day] and [Night] at the same time:\nWhen using normal attacks|skills, there's a 6%|18% chance to unleash Phoenix Dragon Sword, dealing 2,100% weapon attribute P.DMG (crit possible) to all enemies within a 12x3 meter area. Phoenix Dragon Sword reduces affected enemies' DEF significantly, reducing their Final P.DMG RED by 20%. If the targets are Adventurers, the effect becomes a 75% reduction in Fire and Ghost Resistance instead for 6 seconds. Cooldown: 20 seconds. While the skill is active, it increases your Crit DMG Bonus by 80% and P.ATK by 35% for 10 seconds.",
    ["cardskill_10109036"]="Effect of equipping Jyakomaru Card [Day] and [Night] at the same time:\nWhen using normal attacks|skills, there's a 6%|18% chance to unleash Tiger Sword, dealing 2,100% weapon attribute M.DMG to all enemies within a 12x3 meter area. Tiger Sword reduces affected enemies' M.DEF significantly, reducing their Final M.DMG RED by 20%. If the targets are Adventurers, the effect becomes a 75% reduction in Wind and Water Resistance instead for 6 seconds. Cooldown: 20 seconds. While the skill is active, it increases your Final M.PEN by 40% and M.ATK by 35% for 10 seconds.",
    ["cardskill_10109037"]="Equipping Shadow Chaser Gertie [Day]/[Night]/[Void] grants you the following effects:\nWhen dealing Poison or Ghost P.DMG, there's a 5% chance to trigger Shadow Venom. While Shadow Venom is active, your Poison/Ghost P.DMG against monsters is increased by an extra 30%, or 17% if the target is an Adventurer. Shadow Venom lasts for 12 seconds. Can trigger once every 20 seconds. The damage boost provided by this effect also applies to critical hits.",
    ["cardskill_10109038"]="Equipping Genetic Flamel [Day]/[Night]/[Void] grants you the following effects:\nWhen dealing Fire/Earth P.DMG, there's a 5% chance to trigger Berserk Reagent. While Berserk Reagent is active, your Fire/Earth P.DMG is increased by an extra 30%, or 17% if the target is an Adventurer. Berserk Reagent lasts for 12 seconds. Can trigger once every 20 seconds. The damage boost provided by this effect also applies to critical hits.",
    ["cardskill_10109039"]="Equipping Sorcerer Celia [Day]/[Night]/[Void] grants you the following effects:\nWhen dealing Shadow/Holy M.DMG, there's a 5% chance to trigger Elemental Resonance. While Elemental Resonance is active, your Shadow/Holy M.DMG of the corresponding attribute is increased by an extra 30%, or 17% if the target is an Adventurer. Elemental Resonance lasts for 12 seconds. Can trigger once every 20 seconds. The damage boost provided by this effect does not apply to critical hits.",
    ["cardskill_10109040"]="Equipping Ranger Cecil [Day]/[Night]/[Void] grants you the following effects:\nWhen dealing Neutral/Wind P.DMG, there's a 5% chance to trigger Hunting Pulse. While Hunting Pulse is active, your Neutral/Wind P.DMG is increased by an extra 30%, or 17% if the target is an Adventurer. Hunting Pulse lasts for 12 seconds. Can trigger once every 20 seconds. The damage boost provided by this effect does not apply to critical hits.",
    ["cardskill_10109041"]="Effects of equipping Garm Card (2025) [Day] and [Night] at the same time:\nGarm's Conviction: After entering battle, using normal attacks|skills has a 6%|18% chance to gain <color=#44afee>Conviction</color>. Each stack of <color=#44afee>Conviction</color> increases your PVP Final P.DMG Bonus by <color=#44afee>8%</color>, up to <color=#44afee>5</color> stacks. <color=#44afee>Conviction</color> lasts <color=#44afee>10</color> seconds. If you receive fatal damage, all your <color=#44afee>Conviction</color> stacks convert into the same number of <color=#44afee>Grudge</color> stacks, applying them to the Adventurer who dealt the killing blow. Each stack of <color=#44afee>Grudge</color> reduces Final DMG by <color=#44afee>1%</color>. <color=#44afee>Grudge</color> lasts <color=#44afee>30</color> seconds, stacking up to <color=#44afee>20</color> times (any Adventurer who deals the killing blow to you will trigger <color=#44afee>Grudge</color> stacking). After <color=#44afee>Grudge</color> is applied, <color=#44afee>Garm's Conviction</color> enters a <color=#44afee>60</color>-second cooldown. (<color=#44afee>Grudge</color> and <color=#44afee>Conviction</color> cannot be dispelled and disappear immediately when the carrier is defeated.)",
    ["cardskill_10109042"]="Effects of equipping Garm Baby Card (2025) [Day] and [Night] at the same time:\nGarm Baby's Courage: After entering battle, using normal attacks|skills has a 6%|18% chance to gain <color=#44afee>Courage</color>. Each stack of <color=#44afee>Courage</color> increases your PVP Final M.DMG Bonus by <color=#44afee>8%</color>, up to <color=#44afee>5</color> stacks. <color=#44afee>Courage</color> lasts <color=#44afee>10</color> seconds. If you receive fatal damage, all your <color=#44afee>Courage</color> stacks convert into the same number of <color=#44afee>Grudge</color> stacks, applying them to the Adventurer who dealt the killing blow. Each stack of <color=#44afee>Grudge</color> reduces Final DMG by <color=#44afee>1%</color>. <color=#44afee>Grudge</color> lasts <color=#44afee>30</color> seconds, stacking up to <color=#44afee>20</color> times (any Adventurer who deals the killing blow to you will trigger <color=#44afee>Grudge</color> stacking). After <color=#44afee>Grudge</color> is applied, <color=#44afee>Garm Baby's Courage</color> enters a <color=#44afee>60</color>-second cooldown. (<color=#44afee>Grudge</color> and <color=#44afee>Courage</color> cannot be dispelled and disappear immediately when the carrier is defeated.)",
    ["cardskill_10109043"]="Equipping Year of the Horse Nian Card [Day], with any 1 of the 3 cards (Year of the Horse Nian Shiny Card [Night]|Year of the Horse Nian Blessing Card [Night]|Year of the Horse Nian Protection Card [Night]) to receive the following effects:\nWhen using normal attacks|skills, there's a <color=#44afee>6%</color>|<color=#44afee>18%</color> chance to deal <color=#44afee>1</color> instance of <color=#44afee>2600%</color> weapon attribute Adaptive DMG (can crit) to enemies within a <color=#44afee>6</color>-meter radius centered on the target. Grants <color=#44afee>Overloaded</color> after a successful trigger. <color=#44afee>Overloaded</color>: When the highest primary stat is VIT, increases Final P.DMG Bonus and Final M.DMG Bonus by <color=#44afee>80%</color>. <color=#44afee>Overloaded</color> lasts <color=#44afee>12</color> seconds. When the highest primary stat is not VIT, the effect of <color=#44afee>Overloaded</color> is halved, but you gain <color=#44afee>Buffer</color> instead. While <color=#44afee>Buffer</color> is active, increases Final P.DMG RED and Final M.DMG RED by <color=#44afee>20%</color>. <color=#44afee>Buffer</color> lasts <color=#44afee>12</color> seconds. Cooldown: <color=#44afee>25</color> seconds.",
    ["cardskill_30106100"]="Each normal attack has a 2% chance, and each actively-used skill has a 6% chance to summon <color=#CA2E0AFF>Tanjiro Kamado</color> to aid you in battle. <color=#CA2E0AFF>Tanjiro Kamado</color> will disappear after 30 seconds. Cooldown: 300 seconds.\nOnly one supporting character can aid you in battle at any time.",
    ["cardskill_30107100"]="Each normal attack has a 2% chance, and each actively-used skill has a 6% chance to summon <color=#CA2E0AFF>Zenitsu Agatsuma</color> to aid you in battle. <color=#CA2E0AFF>Zenitsu Agatsuma</color> will disappear after 30 seconds. Cooldown: 300 seconds.",
    ["cardskill_30108100"]="Each normal attack has a 2% chance, and each actively-used skill has a 6% chance to summon <color=#CA2E0AFF>Inosuke Hashibira</color> to aid you in battle. <color=#CA2E0AFF>Inosuke Hashibira</color> will disappear after 30 seconds. Cooldown: 300 seconds.\nOnly one supporting character can aid you in battle at any time.",
    ["cardskill_30109100"]="Each normal attack has a 2% chance, and each actively-used skill has a 6% chance to summon <color=#CA2E0AFF>Hinokami Tanjiro Kamado</color> to aid you in battle. <color=#CA2E0AFF>Hinokami Tanjiro Kamado</color> will disappear after 30 seconds. Cooldown: 300 seconds.\nOnly one supporting character can aid you in battle at any time.",
    ["cardskill_30205100"]="Effect of equipping Saitama (Soul) Card [Day] and [Night] at the same time: Stun Resistance +100%. Gain the Entertainment Skill: Saitama (Soul) Transformation to transform into Saitama for 1 minute. Cooldown: 3 minutes.\nIn Saitama (Soul) form, you can defeat a monster with a single blow! Engaging in MVP/MINI/Boss/PvP battles will forcibly terminate the transformation.",
    ["cardskill_30206100"]="Effect of equipping Genos (Soul) Card [Day] and [Night] at the same time: Freeze Resistance +100%. Gain the Entertainment Skill: Genos (Soul) Transformation to transform into Genos for 1 minute. Cooldown: 3 minutes.",
    ["cardskill_30207100"]="Effect of equipping Terrible Tornado (Soul) Card [Day] and [Night] at the same time: Gain the infinite Endure effect and the Entertainment Skill: Terrible Tornado (Soul) Transformation to transform into Terrible Tornado for 1 minute. Cooldown: 3 minutes.",
    ["cardskill_30207106"]="Effect of equipping Terrible Tornado (Soul) Card [Day] and [Night] at the same time: Gain the infinite Endure effect.",
    ["cardskill_30208100"]="Effect of equipping Speed-o'-Sound Sonic (Soul) Card [Day] and [Night] at the same time: Immobilize Resistance +100%. Gain the Entertainment Skill: Speed-o'-Sound Sonic (Soul) Transformation to transform into Speed-o'-Sound Sonic for 1 minute. Cooldown: 3 minutes.",
