    ["energyicon"]="<color=#97BCF8FF>Stamina:</color>\n\nPlayers use up a certain amount of Stamina when performing life activities.\n\nLife activities include:\nFishing: Fish in designated areas to get materials needed for life.\nMining: Mine in designated areas to get materials needed for life.\nGardening: Garden in designated areas to get materials needed for life.\nCatching pets: Players can use corresponding items on monsters to catch them.\nCooking: Players can cook various foods that grant buffs.\nCrafting: Merchants can craft items needed by different classes.\nSmelting: Players can make materials that are used to upgrade or ascend equipment.\n\nGet 1 Stamina for every 1 point of Odin's Blessing consumed.\n\n",
