    ["exploretips0"]="Time moves onward, and a new day brings new hope.",
    ["exploretips1"]="The breeze caresses my face, soothing my heart. Whenever you're in a good mood, good luck will not be far behind.",
    ["exploretips10"]="The sun is high and a warm wind blows. It's the perfect time to go exploring in the wilderness.",
    ["exploretips11"]="The sun is high and a warm wind blows. It's the perfect time to go exploring in the wilderness.",
    ["exploretips12"]="When the sky is blue, the fish can't help but rise to the surface.",
    ["exploretips13"]="When the sky is blue, the fish can't help but rise to the surface.",
    ["exploretips14"]="When the sun shines brightly, dungeons may hold unexpected surprises for you.",
    ["exploretips15"]="When the sun shines brightly, dungeons may hold unexpected surprises for you.",
    ["exploretips16"]="The breeze rises, but it is tainted with an ill wind, like a subtle warning hanging in the air.",
    ["exploretips17"]="Sand dances in the air... Is the wind carrying it away, or is the sand seeking to avoid some terrible creature?",
    ["exploretips18"]="As the clouds begin to gather, dangers emerge in the wilderness. Of course, the benefits of adventuring will increase as a result.",
    ["exploretips19"]="The sound of thunder and lightning echoes down from the sky, as the fish cheer its arrival.",
    ["exploretips2"]="The breeze disperses the clouds, but wisps of fog insist on gathering, as if to herald the arrival of some unknown creature.",
    ["exploretips20"]="Heading home after a thunderstorm is a wise choice, as no one knows what kind of terrible creatures may appear in the wild.",
    ["exploretips21"]="As a mysterious creature arrives, the thunder and lightning rise to new heights of intensity.",
    ["exploretips22"]="After the rain, the plants in the wilderness exude their true luxuriance.",
    ["exploretips23"]="After some terrifying creature leaves, the fish begin to reemerge.",
    ["exploretips3"]="Thick fog gathers, concealing the form of some mysterious creature.",
    ["exploretips4"]="As the fog becomes thicker, footsteps can be heard approaching. What could it be?",
    ["exploretips5"]="The light fog disperses, and the wilderness becomes a landscape of mystery and beauty, beckoning adventurers to explore it.",
    ["exploretips6"]="The light fog disperses, and the wilderness becomes a landscape of mystery and beauty, beckoning adventurers to explore it.",
    ["exploretips7"]="The breeze disperses the fog, soothing my heart. Whenever you're in a good mood, good luck will not be far behind.",
    ["exploretips8"]="The breeze disperses the fog, soothing my heart. Whenever you're in a good mood, good luck will not be far behind.",
    ["exploretips9"]="The sun is high and a warm wind blows. It's the perfect time to go exploring in the wilderness.",
    ["fb_tag_001"]="Ragnarok X: Next Generation testing with server wipe and in-app purchases now available! The music of our memories, the unchanged scenes, and the friends of old. We have gathered at the Prontera South Gate, and are waiting for you to set off!",
    ["fb_tag_002"]="Ragnarok X: Next Generation testing with server wipe and in-app purchases now available! Rallying event at the Prontera South Gate now ongoing. Let's relive the memories!",
    ["fb_tag_003"]="Ragnarok X: Next Generation testing with server wipe and in-app purchases now available! The music of our memories, the unchanged scenes, and the friends of old. We have gathered at the Prontera South Gate, and are waiting for you to set off!",
    ["fb_tag_004"]="Ragnarok X: Next Generation testing with server wipe and in-app purchases now available! Eighteen years of waiting to have a better reunion. With a new generation, new friends, and new game modes, let's embark on a brand new adventure together!",
    ["fb_tag_005"]="Ragnarok X: Next Generation testing with server wipe and in-app purchases now available! It's the Ragnarok you're familiar with. New chapters available. Let's create memories that only belong to us!",
    ["fb_tag_006"]="After eighteen years of waiting, Ragnarok X: Next Generation testing with server wipe and in-app purchases is now available! With new friends and new game modes, let the glory be reborn!",
    ["fb_tag_007"]="# RO X # Ragnarok X: Next Generation",
