    ["homesteadFurniture_desc_22060104"]="A thorny plant that grows in Sograt Desert.",
    ["homesteadFurniture_desc_22060105"]="A vase filled with a bouquet of fresh flowers.",
    ["homesteadFurniture_desc_23010101"]="A giant window that offers an unobstructed view of the outdoor scenery.",
    ["homesteadFurniture_desc_23010102"]="A small yet exquisite painting.",
    ["homesteadFurniture_desc_23010103"]="A wall-hanging landscape painting.",
    ["homesteadFurniture_desc_23010104"]="An oil painting created by a famous artist.",
    ["homesteadFurniture_desc_23010105"]="A compact window with an intricate design.",
    ["homesteadFurniture_desc_23020101"]="Once used to rally troops in war, this horn is now a cherished decorative piece.",
    ["homesteadFurniture_desc_23020102"]="A wall-hanging candlestand.",
    ["homesteadFurniture_desc_50001"]="The most common type of household flooring.",
    ["homesteadFurniture_desc_50030301"]="A participation medal of the War of the Chosen: Heimdall Season. May every chosen one hear the brave sound of Gjalarhorn.",
    ["homesteadFurniture_desc_50030302"]="A trophy to commemorate the excellent performance of the 3rd Place in the War of the Chosen: Heimdall Season.",
    ["homesteadFurniture_desc_50030303"]="A trophy to commemorate the outstanding performance of the 2nd Place in the War of the Chosen: Heimdall Season.",
    ["homesteadFurniture_desc_50030304"]="A trophy to commemorate the top performance of the Champion in the War of the Chosen: Heimdall Season.",
    ["homesteadFurniture_desc_50030305"]="A trophy made of mysterious material. Given in recognition of Adventurers with good performance in ROXIC.",
    ["homesteadFurniture_desc_50030306"]="A trophy made of mysterious material. Given in recognition of Adventurers with outstanding performance in ROXIC.",
    ["homesteadFurniture_desc_50030307"]="A trophy made of mysterious material. Given in recognition of Adventurers with the best performance in ROXIC.",
    ["homesteadFurniture_desc_50101"]="The most common type of household wallpaper.",
    ["homesteadFurniture_desc_50110301"]="A wooden dining table that can accommodate many people.",
    ["homesteadFurniture_desc_50110401"]="A wooden dining chair with a simple yet practical design.",
    ["homesteadFurniture_desc_50110501"]="An upright storage cabinet with a simple design.",
    ["homesteadFurniture_desc_50110502"]="A floor-standing storage cabinet with a simple design.",
    ["homesteadFurniture_desc_50110503"]="A large extendable kitchen island.",
    ["homesteadFurniture_desc_50110504"]="A small extendable kitchen island.",
    ["homesteadFurniture_desc_50110505"]="An all-in-one stove offering features like igniting, steaming, and so on.",
    ["homesteadFurniture_desc_50110506"]="A prep station that comes with a sink.",
    ["homesteadFurniture_desc_50110507"]="A freezer powered by ice magic that freezes food within a short period.",
    ["homesteadFurniture_desc_50110508"]="A handy tool for moving large amounts of food during banquets.",
    ["homesteadFurniture_desc_50130001"]="A food heating device marked with a fire magic circle inside.",
    ["homesteadFurniture_desc_50130002"]="An express coffee maker, perfect for delightful afternoon coffee breaks.",
    ["homesteadFurniture_desc_50130003"]="A bread-toasting machine makes delicious breakfasts easily achievable.",
    ["homesteadFurniture_desc_50130004"]="A bottle of lilies with a faint fragrance.",
    ["homesteadFurniture_desc_50130005"]="A stack of porcelain dinner plates.",
    ["homesteadFurniture_desc_50130006"]="Seasonings are essential for making delicious dishes.",
    ["homesteadFurniture_desc_50130007"]="Snacking on fruits during meal prep is kind of nice.",
    ["homesteadFurniture_desc_50130008"]="While drinks are enjoyable, it's best not to overdo it!",
    ["homesteadFurniture_desc_50130009"]="The combination of bitter coffee beans and creamy milk is ideal for coffee making.",
    ["homesteadFurniture_desc_50130010"]="A well-organized dinnerware set.",
    ["homesteadFurniture_desc_50140001"]="An exhaust hood engraved with a wind magic circle, capable of venting all cooking fumes.",
    ["homesteadFurniture_desc_50140002"]="A wooden rack for storing spices and assorted goods, fully utilizing home space.",
    ["homesteadFurniture_desc_50140003"]="A wall-mounted wooden storage cabinet, fully utilizing home space.",
    ["homesteadFurniture_desc_50140005"]="A rack for hanging mugs, fully utilizing home space.",
    ["homesteadFurniture_desc_50150001"]="Ceramic tiles featuring cartoon patterns.",
    ["homesteadFurniture_desc_50150101"]="Wallpaper featuring cartoon patterns.",
    ["homesteadFurniture_desc_51010001"]="A single bed adorned with elk antlers and topped with Christmas stockings, setting the stage for Christmas Eve's anticipated fortune.",
    ["homesteadFurniture_desc_51010002"]="A Christmas-style twin bed, where dreams are fulfilled on Christmas Eve.",
    ["homesteadFurniture_desc_51010201"]="In this chilly winter, you absolutely need a cozy snow velvet sofa!",
    ["homesteadFurniture_desc_51010202"]="Enjoy a delightful Christmas Eve by gathering with loved ones on the sofa for some heartwarming chats.",
    ["homesteadFurniture_desc_51010301"]="A round table decorated for welcoming Christmas.",
    ["homesteadFurniture_desc_51010401"]="A chair with candy decorations. Hey, don't eat them!",
    ["homesteadFurniture_desc_51010501"]="A small Christmas tree that can be placed anywhere you want.",
    ["homesteadFurniture_desc_51010502"]="No Christmas is completed without a Christmas tree.",
    ["homesteadFurniture_desc_51010503"]="Who would say no to a Christmas tree piled with gifts?",
    ["homesteadFurniture_desc_51010504"]="A fireplace decorated for welcoming Christmas.",
    ["homesteadFurniture_desc_51010505"]="Gingerbread Man doll—an ideal Christmas gift for kids.",
    ["homesteadFurniture_desc_51010506"]="Santa's sleigh, of course, must be packed with tons of gifts!",
    ["homesteadFurniture_desc_51010507"]="One of the most anticipated parts of Christmas has to be exchanging gifts, right?",
    ["homesteadFurniture_desc_51010508"]="This candy cane lamp is all Christmas—watch out, it's gonna melt!",
    ["homesteadFurniture_desc_51020001"]="A round carpet with Christmas-style decorations.",
    ["homesteadFurniture_desc_51020002"]="A square carpet with Christmas-style decorations.",
    ["homesteadFurniture_desc_51030001"]="Sometimes, a Christmas-style flowerpot is all you need for a nice decoration!",
    ["homesteadFurniture_desc_51030101"]="Use the gift box to package a special present for your loved ones!",
    ["homesteadFurniture_desc_51030102"]="Could a little crystal ball contain a whole small world within?",
    ["homesteadFurniture_desc_51030201"]="How could we celebrate the festival without a delicious cake?",
    ["homesteadFurniture_desc_51030202"]="An amazing turkey feast, with a mix of meat and vegetables for balanced nutrition.",
    ["homesteadFurniture_desc_51040001"]="Large wooden window decorated for Christmas.",
    ["homesteadFurniture_desc_51040002"]="Small wooden window decorated with Christmas stockings.",
    ["homesteadFurniture_desc_51040101"]="A decorative reindeer head with a rich Christmas design.",
    ["homesteadFurniture_desc_51040102"]="Christmas stockings.",
    ["homesteadFurniture_desc_51040103"]="Bells from a Christmas reindeer to bestow Santa's gifts upon anyone who hears them on Christmas Eve.",
    ["homesteadFurniture_desc_51040104"]="Red Santa Hat Ornament.",
    ["homesteadFurniture_desc_51040105"]="Green Santa Hat Ornament.",
    ["homesteadFurniture_desc_51050001"]="Grey flooring featuring snowflake patterns.",
    ["homesteadFurniture_desc_51050002"]="Flooring that carries the mysterious designs of the Utan tribe.",
    ["homesteadFurniture_desc_51050101"]="Wallpaper with white snowflakes for Christmas celebration.",
    ["homesteadFurniture_desc_51050102"]="Green wallpaper with gingerbread men for Christmas celebration.",
    ["homesteadFurniture_desc_51110201"]="The classic Arhat Bed. It's pretty much the ancient version of a modern soda, packed with ancient wisdom.",
    ["homesteadFurniture_desc_51110301"]="For the new year, you gotta have the whole family and friends gathering around a big table.",
    ["homesteadFurniture_desc_51110401"]="The classic Chinese-style armchair. Great for a quick relaxation or catching up with friends.",
    ["homesteadFurniture_desc_51110501"]="Golden ginkgo trees really bring a different kind of joy to the spring festival.",
    ["homesteadFurniture_desc_51110502"]="The classic Chinese-style tea table. Great for a quick relaxation or catching up with friends.",
    ["homesteadFurniture_desc_51110503"]="Fancy gold prints for decorating screens, which really make the old-school designs pop.",
    ["homesteadFurniture_desc_51110504"]="The big floor-standing porcelain vase with golden persimmons really brings a year of good luck and fortune to your house.",
    ["homesteadFurniture_desc_51110505"]="This celadon incense burner in green color fills the air with zen and calms your nerves.",
    ["homesteadFurniture_desc_51110506"]="The red plum blossom on this Chinese-style floor-standing lantern becomes increasingly vibrant with the help of the yellow light.",
    ["homesteadFurniture_desc_51120001"]="Red carpet with golden Chinese patterns. The perfect choice for ringing out the old and ringing in the new.",
    ["homesteadFurniture_desc_51140001"]="Classic wooden window with traditional Chinese carving—a timeless vintage piece.",
    ["homesteadFurniture_desc_51140002"]="Firecrackers are essential for the spring festival!",
    ["homesteadFurniture_desc_51140003"]="Festive banners in Chinese style. Let's say goodbye to the old and hello to the new.",
    ["homesteadFurniture_desc_51140004"]="This traditional upside-down sticker is a cool way to ring in the \"Luck\" right up to your door.",
    ["homesteadFurniture_desc_51140005"]="A special dragon paper cut for the window to welcome the Jiachen Year of the Dragon.",
    ["homesteadFurniture_desc_51150001"]="Classic Chinese wooden flooring—a timeless vintage piece.",
    ["homesteadFurniture_desc_51150101"]="Fancy wallpaper with traditional Chinese carvings—like a throwback to ancient China.",
