    ["homesteadLevel_btn_upgrade"]="Upgrade",
    ["homesteadLevel_exp_help"]="About Home:\n 1. Upgrading your Home requires two conditions to be met simultaneously: Home EXP maxed out; all upgrade quests completed.\n 2. Home EXP can be obtained through <color=#3acfef>Daily Activities</color>.\n Activities such as sowing seeds, harvesting crops, releasing/harvesting fingerlings, and exploring/mining ore veins all grant Home EXP.\n 3. During upgrades, the buildings will be under construction status. Tap <color=#3acfef>Upgrade Complete</color> when the construction is done to complete the upgrade.\n 4. Tap <color=#3acfef>Upgrade Preview</color> to check unlockable features of the next level.",
