    ["itemDes_10202212"]="Use to increase Odin offline EXP 3 times, lasting 3 hours.",
    ["itemDes_10202213"]="Use to increase Odin offline EXP 5 times, lasting 3 hours",
    ["itemDes_10219481"]="Open to obtain the following items:\nOdin’s Resplendent Reliquary x1\nGuild Contribution x5\nBrilliant Light Coin x5",
    ["itemDes_10219482"]="Open to obtain the following items:\n3× EXP Card (3 hours) x1\nGuild Contribution x10\nBrilliant Light Coin x20",
    ["itemDes_10219483"]="Open to obtain the following items:\n5× EXP Card (3 hours) x1\nGuild Contribution x45\nBrilliant Light Coin x50",
    ["itemDes_10219484"]="Open to select one of the following:\n Inscription I x12\n Pioneer I x6\n Bound I x3\n Engraved I x2\n Validation I x1",
    ["itemName_10202212"]="3× EXP Card (3 hours)",
    ["itemName_10202213"]="5× EXP Card (3 hours)",
    ["itemName_10219481"]="Growth Boost Gift Pack I",
    ["itemName_10219482"]="Growth Boost Gift Pack II",
    ["itemName_10219483"]="Growth Boost Gift Pack III",
    ["itemName_10219484"]="Shadow Equipment Material Selection Pack III",
    ["itle_Desc_1583"]="Valid Until: January 24, 2026",
    ["jobDescription1012"]="The all-around Novice has mastered skills of other jobs. Their unrestrained skill combination can easily handle every situation.",
    ["jobDescription1111"]="Clad in the strongest armor, these knights defend peace on the continent with their unparalleled defensive capabilities and can always be found fighting on the vanguard of any battle.",
    ["jobDescription1121"]="They swore an oath to Odin to remain fearless and dedicated. Use their bodies as a shield to carry out the way of faith.",
    ["jobDescription1211"]="With the sincerest faith, these pious heroes bless all peace-loving people of the world. The holy light within them not only heals the wounded, but also banishes all undead creatures.",
    ["jobDescription1221"]="A Monk must have a heart the size of a mountain and the reflexes of a bolt of lightning. They are not only fierce and courageous fighting experts, but also righteous masters with the world in mind.",
    ["jobDescription1311"]="Masters of the world's most profound arcane arts. Nature's creatures cannot help but submit to the power of these magical scholars.",
    ["jobDescription1321"]="An Envoy of Elemental Spirits wields the full fury of the Spirits-Beyond against enemies.",
    ["jobDescription1411"]="Hiding in the darkness like silent shadows, these assassins launch lethal attacks in the blink of an eye and view only deadly weapons and crippling poisons as their most trustworthy allies.",
    ["jobDescription1421"]="Delivers a fatal blow to a single enemy target while hiding in the shadows. Their powerful damage-dealing ability on a single target enables them to win easily in duels.",
    ["jobDescription1511"]="There is no creature alive capable of escaping their eagle eyes, and every pull of their bowstrings is imbued with the greatest respect for their prey.",
    ["jobDescription1521"]="No melody is too challenging for the Master of Music, a true miracle-worker alongside fellow troupe dancers.",
    ["jobDescription1531"]="No dance is too challenging for the Master of Dance, a true miracle-worker alongside the Minstrel.",
    ["jobDescription1611"]="All they need in this world is their carts and Zeny. In addition to the battlefield, their stalls are where their talents can best be witnessed in all their glory.",
    ["jobDescription1621"]="An Alchemist who can summon Homunculi to fight alongside them in battles and use miraculous items.",
    ["jobDescription1711"]="This war machine, possessing a large arsenal of firearms, never hesitates to unleash devastating firepower, destroying anything standing in its way.",
    ["jobDescription1811"]="An assassin skilled in the use of ninja swords and ninjutsu, excelling in taking out their targets through all sorts of tactics.",
    ["jobDescription1821"]="An assassin skilled in the use of ninja swords and ninjutsu, excelling in taking out their targets through all sorts of tactics.",
    ["jobDescription1911"]="Possessing an array of lethal kicking moves, dominating the battlefield by dishing out all sorts of kicking combos.",
    ["jobDescription1921"]="A nimble spellcaster who channels souls as a medium, combining elemental magic and support techniques to buff allies and shift between offense and defense soul states.",
    ["jobInstanceTips1"]="You must complete a Mentor's <color=#CA2E0AFF>Battle Trial</color> before you can select a job for the first time!",
    ["jobInstanceTips10"]="Passive Skill",
