    ["npctdes_17"]="There is a chance of refunding the upgrade costs. The specific chances are listed below:\nWeapon (Lv.0-220: 10%), (Lv.221-260: 15%), (Lv.261-300: 20%)\nArmor (Lv.0-110: 10%), (Lv.111-130: 15%), (Lv.131-150: 20%)\nAccessory (Lv.0-55: 10%), (Lv.56-65: 15%), (Lv.66-75: 20%)",
