    ["qualitypoint"]="<color=#97BCF8FF>Introduction to the six stats</color>\n\n\nStrength (STR): Increases Physical Attack and Weight Limit.\n\nAgility (AGI): Increases Attack Speed and Dodge.\n\nVitality (VIT): Increases Max HP and Physical Defense.\n\nIntelligence (INT): Increases Max SP, Magic Attack, and Magic Defense.\n\nDexterity (DEX): Increases Physical Attack, Haste, and Hit.\n\nLuck (LUK): Increases Physical Attack, Crit, and Anti-Crit.\n\n<color=#CCFF66>Thanks to the power awakened by Odin, every 100-point increase of your base stats will additionally increase their secondary stats bonus (after the primary stats exceed 3,000 points, the additional bonus to secondary stats will no longer increase).</color>",
    ["rechange_talk_1"]="Dear Adventurer, the first time you top up in each tier gives you a First Top Up Gift.",
    ["rechange_talk_2"]="Diamonds can be used to purchase passes and crystals, as well as to bid in the Diamond Exchange Center.",
    ["rechange_talk_3"]="The Kafra Corporation does provide diamond services...*Wink Wink*",
    ["rechange_talk_4"]="You'll enjoy a top up gift every 30 days after activating the VIP Card!",
