    ["ui_AceHunterRules_025"]="Use Zeny to make a bribe.",
    ["ui_AceHunterRules_026"]="Confirm Bribe Result",
    ["ui_AceHunterRules_027"]="Pre-Showdown Rules",
    ["ui_AceHunterRules_028"]="Contestants must enter the Showdown arena before the showdown starts.",
    ["ui_AceHunterRules_029"]="Contestants will automatically leave any parties they are in after they enter the location.",
    ["ui_AceHunterRules_030"]="Contestants who fail to enter the arena before the start countdown ends will be unable to enter the arena and will be deemed to have forfeited their right to compete.",
    ["ui_AceHunterRules_031"]="Preparation Room Rules",
    ["ui_AceHunterRules_032"]="30 arenas will be set up during the registration period, and each arena can have 30 contestants.",
    ["ui_AceHunterRules_033"]="During the preparation period, players can exit their current arena at will.",
    ["ui_AceHunterRules_034"]="Contest Rules",
    ["ui_AceHunterRules_035"]="Contestants can leave arenas after the showdown starts, but they will be disqualified once they leave.",
    ["ui_AceHunterRules_036"]="If any contestants go offline during the showdown, their image will be retained and the amount of HP lost due to attacks and the amount of damage dealt by their attacks will be recorded for this time.",
    ["ui_AceHunterRules_037"]="Contestants are disqualified after they are defeated.",
    ["ui_AceHunterRules_038"]="Contestants will spectate as spectators.",
    ["ui_AceHunterRules_039"]="Contestants will leave their arena once they are defeated, but they can re-enter arenas as spectators.",
    ["ui_AceHunterRules_040"]="Spectator Rules",
    ["ui_AceHunterRules_041"]="After the showdown starts, adventurers can enter arenas to spectate as spectators.",
    ["ui_AceHunterRules_042"]="Spectators randomly enter arenas in which battles are taking place.",
    ["ui_AceHunterRules_043"]="Spectators are invisible and cannot be seen by the contestants.",
    ["ui_AceHunterRules_044"]="Contestants will automatically become spectators once they are defeated.",
    ["ui_AceHunterRules_045"]="Contestants cannot enter arenas as spectators.",
    ["ui_AceHunterRules_046"]="Qualifiers End Rules",
    ["ui_AceHunterRules_047"]="The qualifier match of a room ends when there is only 1 adventurer remaining.",
    ["ui_AceHunterRules_048"]="The winner will be teleported to the finals room 15 seconds after the qualifier match ends.",
    ["ui_AceHunterRules_049"]="Spectators will not be teleported to the finals room.",
    ["ui_AceHunterRules_050"]="Arenas will be removed 30 seconds after the matches end.",
    ["ui_AceHunterRules_051"]="Contestants who complete the qualifiers and survive will be teleported to the finals room.",
    ["ui_AceHunterRules_052"]="Contestants who make it to the finals can leave the room at any time, and can return to the room by talking to the NPC.",
    ["ui_AceHunterRules_053"]="Finals Rules",
    ["ui_AceHunterRules_054"]="The finals will officially start 2 minutes after all the qualifier matches end.",
    ["ui_AceHunterRules_055"]="The finals arena will open after all the qualifier matches are completed, and the contestants will be teleported directly to the finals arena.",
    ["ui_AceHunterRules_056"]="Qualifiers can leave the room before the finals start. The preparation time is 2 minutes.",
    ["ui_AceHunterRules_057"]="Any contestants who fail to return to the finals arena before the preparation time ends will be deemed to have forfeited.",
    ["ui_AceHunterRules_058"]="Qualifiers who leave the arena can return to the arena by talking to Tony Chir or by tapping Participate in the Arena Panel.",
    ["ui_AceHunterRules_059"]="Finals End Rules",
    ["ui_AceHunterRules_060"]="The event ends when there is only 1 contestant left in the arena or when time runs out.",
    ["ui_AceHunterRules_061"]="This surviving contestant will be marked as the Ultimate Fighter and be given the ultimate prize.",
    ["ui_AceHunterRules_062"]="The room will be removed 30 seconds after the matches end.",
    ["ui_AceHunterRules_063"]="Claiming Rewards",
    ["ui_AceHunterRules_064"]="The results screen will appear after players are defeated.",
    ["ui_AceHunterRules_065"]="Ranking Display Rules: The ranking of contestants will be displayed in descending order. Player's rankings won't be displayed until they are dead.",
    ["ui_AceHunterRules_066"]="Rewards will be issued directly to players, and the rewards that will be issued to players for the current match will be displayed on the results screen.",
    ["ui_AceHunterRules_067"]="Qualifiers",
