    ["ui_AceHunterRules_091"]="Invitation",
    ["ui_AceHunterRules_092"]="Ultimate Showdown Invitation Letters will be issued to the most proactive adventurers with the best performance when hunting MVP and Mini in the wild.",
    ["ui_AceHunterRules_093"]="Only adventurers who have invitations are qualified to register for the Ultimate Showdown, but there are rumors that Tony Chir secretly keeps a few invitations to himself every time.",
    ["ui_AceHunterRules_094"]="Invitation Issuance Rules",
    ["ui_AceHunterRules_095"]="There are a total of 890 invitations that are issued in the following priority:",
    ["ui_AceHunterRules_096"]="All members of a party that hunted for MVP and Mini and came in first place.",
    ["ui_AceHunterRules_097"]="Adventurers who hunted for MVP and Mini and received settlement rewards.",
    ["ui_AceHunterRules_098"]="When more than 890 adventurers satisfy the above conditions, invitations are issued in descending order according to adventurers' level.",
    ["ui_AceHunterRules_099"]="When fewer than 890 adventurers satisfy the above conditions, invitations are issued in descending order according to adventurers' level to adventurers who did not hunt for MVP and Mini to make up for the numbers.",
    ["ui_AceHunterRules_100"]="Method of Issuing Invitations",
    ["ui_AceHunterRules_101"]="Tony Chir will issue invitations to all eligible adventurers via in-game mail.",
