    ["ui_AnniCeremony_001"]="Please enter your birthday greetings. There is a chance for it to be displayed at the Anniversary Concert!",
    ["ui_AnniCeremony_003"]="Tap to enter (Max 30 characters)",
    ["ui_AnniCeremony_004"]="The Anniversary Concert will be held on October 15 at 20:00.",
    ["ui_AnniCeremony_005"]="The top 3 Adventurers who receive the highest votes will be granted the chance to join the Anniversary Music Festival in person for prize-giving. Due to the risk of force majeure in offline events, Ragnarok X: Next Generation reserves all the rights to the final interpretation of the event.",
    ["ui_AnniCeremony_006"]="Be Rich!\nBe Wealthy!",
