    ["ui_AnniCeremony_020"]="Please claim the warrior exclusive anniversary gift.",
    ["ui_AnniCeremony_021"]="Claim All",
    ["ui_AnniCeremony_022"]="Anniversary Wish",
    ["ui_AnniCeremony_023"]="Make Your Wish",
    ["ui_AnniCeremony_024"]="You can claim gift packs in the <size=20>2022</size> Anniversary Celebration to make your dream come true!",
    ["ui_AnniCeremony_025"]="Pick one wish out of three",
    ["ui_AnniCeremony_026"]="Shop",
    ["ui_AnniCeremony_027"]="Rare Item",
    ["ui_AnniCeremony_028"]="Growth Item",
    ["ui_AnniCeremony_029"]="Celebration Point",
    ["ui_AnniCeremony_030"]="Welcome!",
    ["ui_AnniCeremony_031"]="Out of Stock",
    ["ui_AnniCeremony_032"]="Commencing Traceback",
    ["ui_AnniCeremony_033"]="1. Statistics of the player since they first started the game will be added up during the Bass Echo for completing the Traceback Quests.\n\n2. It's possible for the statistics required for different quests to keep increasing during the event period.\n\n3. The player's Diamond recharge history will be tallied in the Diamond Hunter quest series. Historical Diamond recharges and Diamond recharges during the event will be converted into Diamond Points for completing the quest in a 10:1 and 1:1 ratio, respectively.\n\n4. Player's historical Crystal transactions before tax will be tallied in the Business Tycoon quest series, excluding buying and selling Diamonds and bidding on rare items.",
    ["ui_AnniCeremony_034"]="Statistics of the player during the event period will be added up during the Note Challenge for completing the quests.",
    ["ui_AnniCeremony_035"]="Unable to change once selected",
    ["ui_AnniCeremony_036"]="Hurry and vote for your favorite costumes! \nThe list will be updated later.",
    ["ui_AnniCeremony_037"]="You can only vote once each time, and claim rewards after voting.",
    ["ui_AnniCeremony_038"]="Voted",
