    ["ui_BattleAchievement_013"]="The current phase has been completed. The next phase of Quest Chain has been opened.",
    ["ui_BattleAchievement_014"]="Submit Materials",
    ["ui_BattleAchievement_015"]="Submit",
    ["ui_BattleAchievement_016"]="Materials Required:",
    ["ui_BattleAchievement_017"]="Medal Display",
    ["ui_BattleAchievement_018"]="Objective",
    ["ui_BattleAchievement_019"]="Select an Instance",
    ["ui_BattleAchievement_020"]="Medal Attribute",
    ["ui_BattleAchievement_021"]="No medal with relevant attributes found, please enter the correct attribute.\n",
    ["ui_BattleAchievement_022"]="Congrats! You've completed all phases of the quest chain!",
    ["ui_BattleAchievement_023"]="Battle Achievement Rules",
    ["ui_BattleAchievement_024"]="Quest Chain",
    ["ui_BattleAchievement_025"]="1. Quests in the Battle Achievements will be counted when <color=#CA2E0AFF>the feature is activated</color>, and the quests completed previously will <color=#CA2E0AFF>not be recorded</color>.",
    ["ui_BattleAchievement_026"]="2. There are <color=#CA2E0AFF>different stages</color> in the quest chain, and the difficulty of quests will gradually; the high stage quest chain will only be unlocked after completing its predecessor quests.",
    ["ui_BattleAchievement_027"]="3. Quests in the same stage of the quest chain <color=#CA2E0AFF>can be completed at the same time</color>, but players still need to complete the predecessor node to unlock the next one.",
    ["ui_BattleAchievement_028"]="4. To unlock each node, players need to complete <color=#CA2E0AFF>all the predecessor nodes</color> connected to it.",
    ["ui_BattleAchievement_029"]="5. Players need to complete <color=#CA2E0AFF>all quests within the node</color> to unlock the next one.",
    ["ui_BattleAchievement_030"]="6. The quests in the unlocked stage of the quest chain cannot be counted nor can they be completed.",
    ["ui_BattleAchievement_031"]="7. <color=#CA2E0AFF>Total Quests</color> in the unlocked stage of the quest chain will be counted <color=#CA2E0AFF>from 0</color> when that quest chain is unlocked.",
    ["ui_BattleAchievement_032"]="Medals",
    ["ui_BattleAchievement_033"]="1. Medals can only be claimed after completing <color=#CA2E0AFF>all nodes</color> in the current quest chain.",
    ["ui_BattleAchievement_034"]="2. Medals have different qualities. Low quality medals will be <color=#CA2E0AFF>automatically upgraded</color> after players obtain higher quality medals.",
    ["ui_BattleAchievement_035"]="3. Medals are divided into different types according to their attributes and can only be equipped in the corresponding type of slot.",
    ["ui_BattleAchievement_036"]="Number of materials for the week updated each Monday at 6AM",
    ["ui_BattleAchievement_037"]="8. <color=#CA2E0AFF>Confirm Material</color>: The amount of each material required in the node will be adjusted <color=#CA2E0AFF>every Monday at 6AM</color> according to <color=#CA2E0AFF>the real-time standard price of the item</color> in the Exchange Center.",
    ["ui_BattleAchievement_038"]="9. Progression for some PvP quests will be counted <color=#CA2E0AFF>during settlement</color>, while <color=#CA2E0AFF>Party Kills</color> will be counted from the time the player joins the party. (Will remain after leaving the party, and continue to be counted after rejoining the party).",
    ["ui_BattleAchievement_039"]="10. Total kills/resurrection quests are determined as completed based on the <color=#CA2E0AFF>max</color> number of kills or resurrections required.",
    ["ui_BattleAchievement_040"]="Obtain Now",
    ["ui_BattleAchievement_041"]="You can use items to unlock it directly!",
    ["ui_BattlePassErji_001"]="Purchase Lv. <size=20><color=#FD7C66FF>%s</color></size>",
    ["ui_BattlePassErji_002"]="rewards unlocked immediately.",
    ["ui_BattlePassErji_003"]="When the Pass of a player in the instance party reaches the max level, each member will receive 1 Max-level Pass Reward.",
    ["ui_BattlePassErji_004"]="Immediately unlock the following rewards.",
    ["ui_BattlePassErji_005"]="When your Pass reaches Lv. 80, you will enjoy a 20% discount when purchasing the Honor Special Pack next month.",
    ["ui_BattlePassErji_006"]="Pass Level Boost",
