    ["ui_CapooTips_001"]="You're out of dice. Go to the Exchange Center to buy more?",
    ["ui_CapooTips_002"]="You're out of draw tickets. Go to the Gift Pack page to buy more?",
    ["ui_Capoo_001"]="Maze Treasure Hunt",
    ["ui_Capoo_002"]="Adventure Quest",
    ["ui_Capoo_003"]="Capoo Lucky Box",
    ["ui_Capoo_004"]="Tavern Exchange",
    ["ui_Capoo_005"]="1. You need to consume Treasure Dice to play the Maze Treasure Hunt. Roll the dice and move 1 to 6 steps at random.\n2. Skipping the animation will instantly move you to the final destination and grant you the corresponding reward.\n3. You can't stop at the starting point. When you pass it, you'll automatically move one extra step forward.\n4. After claiming all the fixed rewards, completing a new cycle every time grants you cycle rewards.",
    ["ui_Capoo_006"]="1. Spend Lucky Box Tickets to draw. You're guaranteed a Capoo Headgear every 80 draws.\n2. Secret Capoo Headgear can only be exchanged from the shop and is not available in the prize pool.\n3. Duplicated Capoo Headgear can be exchanged at the Tavern Store for Whimsy Box Headgear Token.",
    ["ui_Capoo_007"]="Daily Quests",
    ["ui_Capoo_008"]="Total Quests",
    ["ui_Capoo_009"]="The headgear is equipped or in the wardrobe. Please unequip it before exchanging.",
    ["ui_Capoo_010"]="The headgear is in a load-out. Please remove it from the load-out before exchanging.",
    ["ui_Capoo_011"]="The headgear has a card inserted. Please remove the card before exchanging.",
    ["ui_Capoo_012"]="Remaining: <color=#ea7474>%s</color>",
    ["ui_Capoo_013"]="Guaranteed to get a random Capoo Headgear.",
    ["ui_Capoo_014"]="Collect all styles below to exchange for a hidden version in the tavern.",
    ["ui_Capoo_015"]="Bonus DMG to Formless",
    ["ui_Capoo_016"]="Bonus DMG to Undead",
    ["ui_Capoo_017"]="Bonus DMG to Insect",
    ["ui_Capoo_018"]="Bonus DMG to Fish",
    ["ui_Capoo_019"]="Bonus DMG to Brute",
    ["ui_Capoo_020"]="Bonus DMG to Dragon",
    ["ui_Capoo_021"]="1. Earn collaboration rewards by completing daily adventure quests.\n2. The Adventure Overview shows all the quests that have been completed during the event period.",
