    ["ui_ChildRen001"]="Minors can play: %s",
    ["ui_ChildrenDay_001"]="Candy Battle",
    ["ui_ChildrenDay_002"]="Children's Day Event",
    ["ui_ChildrenDay_003"]="Children's Day",
    ["ui_ChildrenDay_004"]=" Go to the Eden Shop in the Eden Group to purchase.\nRequired Holiday-exclusive Item: <color=#ff7430><size=18>Candy Slingshot</size></color> ",
    ["ui_ChildrenDay_005"]=" <color=#ff7430><size=18>Use Odin's Blessing</size></color> to get candy projectiles.\nThe higher the quality of the projectiles, the greater their power.",
    ["ui_ChildrenDay_006"]=" Use the Candy Slingshot or approach the fort to activate the ranged attack view, then aim at the <color=#ff7430><size=18>Honeybee</size></color>\nand make a decisive shot. Shoot it down to get a Children's Day accessory. The larger the Honeybee, the higher the quality of the accessory.",
    ["ui_ChildrenDay_007"]="The Eden Group is recruiting adventurers to defeat mischievous Honeybees.",
    ["ui_ChildrenDay_008"]="Defeat Honeybees to get exquisite Children's Day gifts!",
    ["ui_ChildrenDay_009"]="Tip: In addition to the main drop, defeated Gold Queen Bees have a small chance to drop other gifts, too!",
    ["ui_ChildrenDay_010"]="Defeat to Obtain",
    ["ui_ChildrenDay_011"]="Exchange medals for the Honeybee Set and Honeybee Mount.",
    ["ui_ChildrenDay_012"]="Bear Medal",
    ["ui_ChildrenDay_013"]="Mini Rocket Medal",
    ["ui_ChildrenDay_014"]="Bifrost Medal",
    ["ui_ChildrenDay_015"]="Honeybee Set",
    ["ui_ChildrenDay_016"]="Mount: Buzzing Honeypot",
    ["ui_ChildrenDay_017"]="Candy Battle",
    ["ui_ChildrenDay_018"]="Skyrocket to the Blue",
    ["ui_ChildrenDay_019"]="Rainbow Gifts",
    ["ui_ChildrenDay_020"]="All quests are refreshed at <color=#fffbdd>5:00</color> every day.",
    ["ui_ChildrenDay_021"]="Skyrocket to the Blue Ranking",
    ["ui_ChildrenDay_022"]="All-Time Fastest",
    ["ui_ChildrenDay_023"]="Tickets are used to enter the race.\nThey can be purchased from <color=#fed83c>Altyna</color> or obtained from <color=#fed83c>Rainbow Gifts</color>.",
    ["ui_ChildrenDay_024"]="Adventurers will need to complete a <color=#fed83c>2-lap race</color> around the Amusement Park on their own mounts according to the specified route and direction. During the race, there will be mysterious skill pots that can be picked up and <color=#fed83c>Evil Honeybees</color> who will hinder you.",
    ["ui_ChildrenDay_025"]="Adventurers who participate in the event will receive medals. The Adventurer who finishes in <color=#fed83c>first place</color> will get additional medals and have a chance to enter the <color=#fed83c>ranking</color> to get the ultimate prize. Medals can be submitted to <color=#fed83c>Altyna</color> to redeem Children's Day costumes, mounts, and other rewards.",
    ["ui_ChildrenDay_026"]="Current Ranking",
    ["ui_ChildrenDay_027"]="Matchmaking...",
    ["ui_ChildrenDay_028"]="Participate to Get",
    ["ui_ChildrenDay_029"]="Exchange to Get",
    ["ui_ChildrenDay_030"]="Consume Odin and kill the MVP in the wild for chances to get <color=#F7B947>Music Box Medals</color> and <color=#F7B947>Honeybee Medals</color>.",
    ["ui_ChildrenDay_031"]="Go to Eden Group at Prontera South Gate to participate in the Skyrocket to the Blue event. Remember to bring your fastest mount!",
    ["ui_ChildrenDay_032"]="Champion Prize Pool",
    ["ui_ChildrenDay_033"]="Reward List",
    ["ui_ChildrenDay_034"]="Claim for free for going there the first time every day",
    ["ui_ChildrenDay_035"]="The top-3 Adventurers will receive the following rewards when the event is over",
