    ["ui_Christmas2022_001"]="Christmas Hide and Seek",
    ["ui_Christmas2022_002"]="Defend Toy Factory",
    ["ui_Christmas2022_003"]="Repair the Sleigh",
    ["ui_Christmas2022_004"]="Claimed\nToday",
    ["ui_Christmas2022_005"]="Repair Progress",
    ["ui_Christmas2022_006"]="Garm destroys Santa Claus' sleigh! Help repair it!",
    ["ui_Christmas2022_007"]="\u{3000}\u{3000}Every day, the <color=#b3f56d>Cookie Manager</color> will ask Adventurers to resolve the <color=#a0edfe>invasion issue</color> caused by Garm Baby. Get rich rewards by completing the quest!",
    ["ui_Christmas2022_008"]="Gameplay Description:",
    ["ui_Christmas2022_009"]="\u{3000}\u{3000}<color=#b3f56d>Garm</color> keeps invading the factory lately! Someone said that only <color=#a0edfe>transforming</color> yourself could nullify its magic. Protect the factory together!",
    ["ui_Christmas2022_010"]="Individual Progress",
    ["ui_Christmas2022_011"]="Possible to get",
    ["ui_Christmas2022_012"]="Required Materials",
    ["ui_Christmas2022_013"]="Go to the Christmas scene and look for the hiding Clown. He will reward you if you catch him!",
    ["ui_ChristmasActivity_001"]="Furniture boxes can only be used after <color=#fffaaf>unlocking Home feature</color>!",
    ["ui_ChristmasActivity_002"]="Not Participated Today",
