    ["ui_ChristmasMagic_030"]="Christmas Mount - Head",
    ["ui_ChristmasMagic_031"]="Tip: In addition to the main drop, popped balloons have a small chance to drop other Christmas gifts, too!",
    ["ui_ChristmasMagic_032"]="Reward List",
    ["ui_ChristmasMagic_033"]="Go to the Christmas Shop in Geffen.\nPurchase the required item.",
    ["ui_ChristmasMagic_034"]="Obtained by consuming Odin's Blessings, participating in MVP or Heart Pedestal challenges, via Activity Chest, or from Christmas Shop.",
    ["ui_ChristmasMagic_035"]="The higher the quality of the projectiles, the greater their power would become.",
    ["ui_ChristmasMagic_036"]="Use the Elk Slingshot to activate the ranged attack view.\nAim at the balloons and fire away.\nPop a balloon to receive",
    ["ui_ChristmasMagic_037"]="The larger the balloon, the greater the reward!",
