    ["ui_CoCoActivity_001"]="CoCo Milk Tea Stand",
    ["ui_CoCoActivity_002"]="Great Fun in RO",
    ["ui_CoCoActivity_003"]="Drink CoCo",
    ["ui_CoCoActivity_004"]="This event has ended.\nExchange for rewards now!",
    ["ui_CoCoActivity_005"]=" A mysterious power from another world has arrived at Midgard.\nAdventurers, collect the\nCoCo Star Force that is scattered all over the\nworld!",
    ["ui_CoCoActivity_006"]="Exchange CoCo Star Force for surprise gifts, as well as the chance to get drink vouchers\nthat can be used at CoCo's physical\nstores.",
    ["ui_CoCoActivity_007"]="This item can only be used in the Taiwan region. Exchange for this reward?",
    ["ui_CoCoActivity_008"]="Confirm",
    ["ui_CoCoActivity_009"]="Cancel",
    ["ui_CoCoActivity_010"]="Amount Remaining on the Server: ",
    ["ui_CoCoActivity_011"]="My Exchanges: ",
    ["ui_CoCoActivity_012"]="Exchange",
    ["ui_CoCoActivity_013"]="1. From 5:00:00 on 4/30/2021 to 5:00:00 on 5/10/2021, complete daily quests to get CoCo Star Force.\n2. Quests and rewards are reset at 5:00 every morning. Unclaimed rewards will be cleared when the event refreshes. CoCo Star Force can be exchanged until 5:00:00 on 5/14/2021.\n3. Up to 9,500 CoCo drink vouchers will be given out during the event. Exchanges are made on a first-come, first-serve basis, and no more exchanges can be made once all the vouchers have been given out.\n4. The drink vouchers can be used at CoCo's stores in Taiwan to redeem drinks before 21:00 on 5/25/2021, and cannot be redeemed after they expire (the cut-off time is subject to the opening hours of the store on that day).\n5. During the event, present the CoCo drink voucher to a staff at the store to get a Starry Grape drink worth NT$75 for free. The drink cannot be exchanged for any other drink, and extra toppings cannot be added.\n6. Some CoCo stores may not be participating in this event. Please confirm with the staff at the store before using CoCo drink vouchers. Compensation will not be given if a voucher is used without confirming in advance.\n7. CoCo Star Force will be automatically removed after the event ends. Please exchange for rewards in time to avoid any unnecessary losses.\n8. Ragnarok X: Next Generation and CoCo reserve the rights to amend the contents of the free drink event.",
