    ["ui_CrossRegionKVM_044"]="Candidates of the Chosen",
    ["ui_CrossRegionKVM_045"]="War of the Chosen",
    ["ui_CrossRegionKVM_046"]="It is an unquestionable consensus that the gods watch the Midgard Continent permanently and continuously. And in the human world, there is such a group of top warriors who show the heavenly power with their mortal bodies that Asgard cannot ignore.\nThe Father of the Gods praises mankind’s quest for power and has decided that the gods of Asgard will take turns hosting the War of the Chosen. In this grand event for both gods and humans, heroes will form parties to test their combat skills, wisdom, and collaboration.\nRemember, only the mightiest will be chosen by the gods to bear the great name of the gods of heaven!",
    ["ui_CrossRegionKVM_047"]="During this event, players who participate in KVM and rank the top 100 in terms of accumulated personal points will receive a Party Creation Voucher for the War of the Chosen. After the War of the Chosen officially begins, players can consume the vouchers to form a party of up to 8 players to participate in the contest. Players without vouchers can also join the parties that have already been created.\nAt the end of this event, varying amounts of voting items will be issued to players according to their personal points. Voting items can be used by players to support their favorite parties during the voting phase of the War of the Chosen to get rewards.",
    ["ui_CrossRegionKVM_048"]="Step <size=30>1</size> - Pre-battle Preparation",
    ["ui_CrossRegionKVM_049"]="Step <size=30>2</size> - Preparation Parties",
    ["ui_CrossRegionKVM_050"]="Step <size=30>3</size> - Vote for Qualifications",
    ["ui_CrossRegionKVM_051"]="Step <size=30>4</size> - Qualify for the War for Honor",
    ["ui_CrossRegionKVM_052"]="Step <size=30>5</size> - All-Servers Battles",
    ["ui_CrossRegionKVM_053"]="Participate in KVM to earn <color=#FDE165FF>Party Creation Vouchers</color> and get <color=#FDE165FF>voting items</color>.",
    ["ui_CrossRegionKVM_054"]="Create a party by using the Party Creation Voucher or join a party to gain access to the contest.",
    ["ui_CrossRegionKVM_055"]="Promote the party to win votes, or cast votes to rank high and qualify the party for a spot in the qualifying round.",
    ["ui_CrossRegionKVM_056"]="The qualifying parties will be matched for KVM battles. The winner will advance to the next round, and the loser will be eliminated. <color=#FDE165FF>The champion party</color> will represent its server to participate in the War for Honor.",
    ["ui_CrossRegionKVM_057"]="All qualified parties will be matched randomly for KVM battles until <color=#FDE165FF>the final champion party</color> is decided.",
    ["ui_CrossRegionKVM_058"]="Total Points",
