    ["ui_DemonSlayer_006"]="Overall Server Progress",
    ["ui_DemonSlayer_007"]="Kill Demons",
    ["ui_DemonSlayer_008"]="Get rewards from your first share each day.",
    ["ui_DemonSlayer_009"]="Shared",
    ["ui_DemonSlayer_010"]="Monsters",
    ["ui_DemonSlayer_011"]="Demon Slayer Chest",
    ["ui_DemonSlayer_012"]="Target Monster",
    ["ui_DemonSlayer_013"]="Current Objective",
    ["ui_DemonSlayer_014"]="Other Monsters",
    ["ui_DemonSlayer_015"]="Reaching 100% in Overall Server Progress unlocks <color=#da696f>mysterious events</color>!",
    ["ui_DemonSlayer_016"]="Not Achieved",
    ["ui_DemonSlayer_017"]="Head to the Mission Board.",
    ["ui_DemonSlayer_018"]="Open 1",
    ["ui_DemonSlayer_019"]="Open 10",
    ["ui_DemonSlayer_020"]="Daily Supply",
    ["ui_DemonSlayer_021"]="Gain EXP",
    ["ui_DemonSlayer_022"]="1. You will encounter 30 waves of monsters after entering the stage. Defeat all monsters in a wave to unlock the next wave",
    ["ui_DemonSlayer_023"]="2. Every 3 waves, the Demon in the Temple appears with a shield of different attributes",
    ["ui_DemonSlayer_024"]="3. Only Collaboration Characters with counter attributes can defeat the Demon in the Temple",
    ["ui_DemonSlayer_025"]="4. Try your best to defeat all 30 waves of monsters to stop their invasion",
    ["ui_DemonSlayer_026"]="5. Corresponding challenge rewards will be distributed according to the number waves you have survived",
    ["ui_DemonSlayer_027"]="Reward Drops",
    ["ui_DemonSlayer_028"]="Insufficient investigation attempts.",
    ["ui_DepositTips_001"]="First Top Up Gift",
    ["ui_DepositTips_002"]="Current VIP Card Validity: <color=#FF9000FF>%s</color>",
    ["ui_DepositTips_003"]="Select one of the following tiers to enjoy a VIP Card top up gift.",
    ["ui_Deposit_001"]="VIP Card users can claim one first top up gift each month from the spending tier met.",
    ["ui_Deposit_002"]="First Top Up Gift",
    ["ui_Deposit_003"]="Dear Adventurer, your <size=18><color=#ff9638>first top up</color></size> in each tier gets you <size=18><color=#ff9638>double</color></size> the Diamonds.",
    ["ui_Deposit_004"]="First Top Up Gift",
    ["ui_Deposit_005"]="Cashback Rules",
    ["ui_Deposit_006"]="The VIP Card's first top-up privilege for the current event cycle has been used. Resets in %s.",
    ["ui_DiagnoseNetwork_001"]="Check Network",
    ["ui_DiagnoseNetwork_002"]="Network Type",
    ["ui_DiagnoseNetwork_003"]="VPN Status",
    ["ui_DiagnoseNetwork_004"]="Start Checking",
    ["ui_DiagnoseNetwork_005"]="Smooth",
    ["ui_DiagnoseNetwork_006"]="Weak",
    ["ui_DiagnoseNetwork_007"]="Poor",
    ["ui_Digimon_001"]="Digital Monster",
    ["ui_Digimon_002"]="Take Photo & Check In",
    ["ui_Digimon_003"]="Witness Taichi Kamiya's Courage Dignity",
    ["ui_Digimon_004"]="Refreshes daily at <color=#FFF101>5:00</color>",
    ["ui_Digimon_005"]="Snap a photo with Taichi and Agumon at Prontera's Central Fountain!\nThough the adventure ends at some point, a smile frozen in time transforms a fleeting encounter into eternity.\n\"The gate to the Digital World is open—DigiDestined—let's go!\"",
    ["ui_Digimon_006"]="Event Time: %s",
    ["ui_Digimon_007"]="Exchange Period: %s",
    ["ui_Digimon_008"]="Possible rewards are as follows:",
    ["ui_Digimon_009"]="Initial Chance",
    ["ui_Digimon_010"]="Level Up The Pass",
    ["ui_Digimon_011"]="View Prize Pool",
    ["ui_Digimon_012"]="SP Reward",
    ["ui_Digimon_013"]="A Reward",
    ["ui_Digimon_014"]="B Reward",
    ["ui_Digimon_015"]="C Reward",
    ["ui_Digimon_016"]="Refresh ",
    ["ui_Digimon_017"]="Digimon Vault Description:\n1. Each draw consumes Digital Chips, and the cost increases with each successive draw.\n2. Costs from draw 1 to 10 are as follows: 3, 6, 9, 12, 16, 32, 64, 128, 256, and 512 chips.\n3. Rewards obtained from the prize pool will not be replenished. You are guaranteed to receive all available prizes in the current pool within a maximum of 10 draws.\n4. You can use Diamonds to refresh the prize pool (first time's free), and your draw count resets after doing so.\n5. Every time you refresh, new rewards are randomly selected from the prize library and placed into the pool.",
    ["ui_Digimon_018"]="Quests Reset Countdown: %s",
    ["ui_Digimon_019"]="Darkness Purge Description:\n1. This gameplay is available daily from 12:00 to 22:00. A new instance portal opens every hour sharp and remains open for 30 minutes.\n2. Each instance opens for 30 minutes. During this time, you can earn Courage Points by defeating minions and bosses and picking up buffs.\n3. In this mode, you can get the collaboration SP pets to assist in battles. Defeat monsters to accumulate energy to trigger pet skills.\n4. Rewards will be granted once the Courage Points reach a certain threshold. You can enter the mode multiple times a day, with points adding up each time.\n5. Devimon shows up on the battlefield once every 5 minutes. Participate in defeating Devimon to get a lot of points.",
    ["ui_Digimon_020"]="Demon Invasion Description:\n1. Progress can be accumulated by defeating monsters of a similar level each day.\n2. Defeating collaboration MVPs or MINIs can greatly increase your progress.\n3. Reaching the corresponding tier grants rewards. Rewards are refreshed daily.",
    ["ui_Digimon_021"]="The event is currently unavailable.",
    ["ui_Digimon_022"]="Current Objective: Darkness Purge",
    ["ui_Digimon_023"]="Unavailable in team mode. Please form a party or enter solo.",
    ["ui_Digimon_024"]="Ultimate Challenge Description:\n1. Withstand Piedmon's relentless assault for 5 minutes and try to deal as much damage as possible within the time limit (death will affect the clearance rating).\n2. Only with an Invitation of Darkness can you get the clearance rewards. Without an Invitation of Darkness, you can still refresh your leaderboard ranking (leaving the instance early won't be counted).\n3. Different clearance ratings correspond to different reward tiers, with D being the lowest and SSS the highest. The rating is shared across the party.\n4. Adventurers can join the Ultimate Challenge by forming a party or using matchmaking. At least 2 participants are required to start.\n5. The rankings during the gameplay period will be based on the clearance ratings of all Adventurers on the server, with rewards given to those on the leaderboard within 24 hours after the gameplay is over.",
    ["ui_Digimon_025"]="Today's Progress: <size=20>%s</size>",
    ["ui_Digimon_026"]="Only the leader can start.",
    ["ui_Digimon_027"]="Please enter as a party.",
    ["ui_Digimon_028"]="Require at least 2 participants.",
    ["ui_Digimon_029"]="Participate in the Ultimate Challenge once to claim. (Quitting early will not be counted.)",
    ["ui_Digimon_030"]="No rankings.",
    ["ui_Digimon_031"]="Today's Total Points: %s",
    ["ui_Digimon_032"]="The challenge is starting soon.",
    ["ui_Digimon_033"]="End of Battle",
    ["ui_Digimon_034"]="Remaining battle time: %s",
    ["ui_Digimon_035"]="Tallying %s and distributing rewards.",
    ["ui_Digimon_036"]="Daily points are maxed out.",
    ["ui_Digimon_037"]="This event has not started yet.",
    ["ui_Digimon_038"]="Waiting for the next boss to respawn.",
    ["ui_Digimon_039"]="The boss has respawned. Tap the mini-map to check its location.",
    ["ui_Digimon_040"]="%s minute(s)",
    ["ui_Digimon_041"]="Ultimate Challenge matchmaking",
    ["ui_Digimon_042"]="Current Objective: Ultimate Challenge",
    ["ui_Digimon_043"]="Budding Journey",
    ["ui_Digimon_044"]="Path of Brilliance",
    ["ui_Digimon_045"]="Darkness Purge",
    ["ui_Digimon_046"]="Demon Invasion",
    ["ui_Digimon_047"]="Ultimate Challenge",
    ["ui_Digimon_048"]="Target Points ",
    ["ui_Digimon_049"]="Reward Details",
    ["ui_Digimon_050"]="Matchmaking is in progress. Tap to cancel. ",
    ["ui_Digimon_051"]="Phase 1 - Darkness Purge",
    ["ui_Digimon_052"]="Phase 2 - Demon's Arrival",
    ["ui_Digimon_053"]=" Phase 3 - Ultimate Challenge ",
    ["ui_Digimon_054"]="The above event guarantees a certain number of MetalGarurumon Limited Boxes, which contain MetalGarurumon trial vouchers or a permanent mount.",
    ["ui_Digimon_055"]="Today's Trial Pet",
    ["ui_Digimon_056"]="Available Daily from 09:00 to 23:00 ",
    ["ui_Digimon_057"]="Today's Progress ",
    ["ui_Digimon_058"]="Purchase <color=#FFE901>%s</color> Level(s)",
    ["ui_Digimon_059"]="Reward ",
    ["ui_Digimon_060"]="No Adventurers are currently ranked",
    ["ui_Digimon_061"]=" Tap anywhere to close ",
    ["ui_Digimon_062"]="Obtained Points ",
    ["ui_Digimon_063"]="Finish Time",
    ["ui_Digimon_064"]="No rewards are granted without the Invitation of Darkness. Only the leaderboard results will be recorded.",
    ["ui_Digimon_065"]="Shadows are pouring out of the Dimensional Gap, and the black gears are spinning like crazy—driving the monsters wild! And behind it all? Devimon from the Digital World. Adventurers, grab your weapons—it's up to you to protect the peace of Prontera!",
    ["ui_Digimon_066"]="Digimons will assist you in the instance!\nDefeat monsters and pick up buffs in the instance to use pet skills!",
    ["ui_Digimon_067"]="Available Daily from 12:00 to 22:00",
    ["ui_Digimon_068"]="Target Monster",
    ["ui_Digimon_069"]="Today's Progress",
    ["ui_Digimon_070"]="Thanks to all of you, Devimon's first wave got totally shut down! But don't let your guard down yet—the threat is far from over. That creepy black-and-white mask is grinning in the shadows again...",
    ["ui_Digimon_071"]="A mountain shrouded in black mist has risen from the earth—a challenge from Piedmon. A master of illusions and mind games, this monarch of darkness loves messing with people's minds. Only by standing united can Adventurers hope to claim victory.",
    ["ui_Digimon_072"]="Free Tickets",
    ["ui_Digimon_073"]="Login Daily",
    ["ui_Digimon_074"]="Tap the blank space to return ",
    ["ui_Digimon_075"]="Rewards from the B prize pool and above have all been drawn. The current refresh is <color=#da696f>free</color>. The prize pool will be reset with random new rewards after being refreshed.",
    ["ui_Digimon_076"]="Spend <color=#da696f>%s</color> Diamonds to refresh the prize pool? The prize pool will be reset with random new rewards after being refreshed.\n<color=#da696f>Tips: Items that take effect immediately are not eligible for cancelation or cash refund.</color>",
    ["ui_Digimon_077"]="The first refresh is <color=#da696f>free</color>. The prize pool will be reset with random new rewards.",
    ["ui_Digimon_078"]="1. The leaderboard is a solo leaderboard. During the event period, rankings are determined by the clearance ratings.\n2. If multiple parties achieve the same score, their rankings are randomly ordered, and Adventurers will receive rewards according to the highest ranking for that score.\n3. Players without the Invitation of Darkness can still enter the instance to challenge. They won't receive any rewards but can update their leaderboard rankings.\n4. Rewards will be distributed via mail at the end of the event.",
    ["ui_Digimon_079"]="After purchase, you can activate the Path of Brilliance and boost the level by 20.",
    ["ui_Digimon_080"]="After purchase, you can claim the Path of Brilliance rewards.",
    ["ui_Digimon_081"]="Spend <color=#ec8a5a>8,888</color> Diamonds to activate the Path of Brilliance?\n<color=#da696f>Tips: Items that take effect immediately are not eligible for cancellation.</color>",
    ["ui_Digimon_082"]="Spend <color=#ec8a5a>34,088</color> Diamonds to purchase the Path of Brilliance Box?\n<color=#da696f>Tips: Items that take effect immediately are not eligible for cancellation.</color>",
    ["ui_Digimon_083"]="You have successfully purchased the <color=#e7bb22>Path of Brilliance</color>.",
    ["ui_Digimon_084"]="You have successfully purchased the <color=#e7bb22>Path of Brilliance Box</color> and increased %s levels.",
    ["ui_Digimon_085"]="Your <color=#e7bb22>Path of Brilliance</color> is already at the maximum level. There is no need to purchase any more.",
    ["ui_DoritosActivity_001"]="Enjoy Doritos",
    ["ui_DoritosActivity_002"]="Infinite Fun in RO",
    ["ui_DoritosActivity_003"]="Mysterious power from the parallel world has arrived at Midgard. Adventurers, collect the Doritos Brave Hearts that are scattered all over the world!",
