    ["ui_FNS_020"]="0 questions answered correctly",
    ["ui_FOFTArmy_101"]="The intel from the vanguard legion has been fully analyzed, and the horns of war are about to sound. Will the defense line formed by valiant Adventures withstand the vicious monster horde?",
    ["ui_FOFTDuel_001"]="Participate in the Raoh Battle once to claim. (Quitting early will not be counted.)",
    ["ui_FOFTDuel_002"]="Raoh Battle matchmaking is in progress.",
    ["ui_FOFTDuel_003"]="Current goal: Raoh Battle",
    ["ui_FOFTDuel_004"]="Only Lv.25 or higher can join.",
    ["ui_FOFTDuel_005"]="Require at least 2 participants.",
    ["ui_FOFTDuel_006"]="Please enter as a party.",
    ["ui_FOFTDuel_007"]="Only the leader can start.",
    ["ui_FOFTDuel_008"]="Tallying %s and distributing rewards.",
    ["ui_FOFTDuel_009"]="No rankings.",
    ["ui_FOFTDuel_010"]="Not available yet.",
    ["ui_FOFTDuel_011"]="Remaining battle time: %s",
    ["ui_FOFTDuel_012"]="No rewards are granted without the Proof of Courage. Only the leaderboard results will be recorded.",
    ["ui_FOFTDuel_013"]="End of Battle",
    ["ui_FOFTDuel_014"]="A setback has no impact on Raoh's ambition. With overwhelming strength, winning and losing are no more than a flicker on the scale. To reach peace, you must step on the stage of Ken-Oh's challenge...",
    ["ui_FOFTDuel_015"]="Adventurers can trigger card skill effects temporarily in the instance.",
    ["ui_FOFTDuel_016"]="Accumulate energy by defeating monsters in the instance, and card skills will be automatically triggered when fully charged.",
    ["ui_FOFTDuel_017"]="1. The leaderboard is a solo leaderboard. During the event period, rankings are determined by the clearance ratings.\n2. If multiple parties achieve the same score, their rankings are randomly ordered, and Adventurers will receive rewards according to the highest ranking for that score.\n3. Players without the Proof of Courage can still enter the instance to challenge. They won't receive any rewards but can update their leaderboard rankings.\n4. Rewards will be distributed via mail at the end of the event.",
    ["ui_FOFTPioneer_001"]="Available in %s hours.",
    ["ui_FOFTPioneer_002"]="This event has not started yet.",
    ["ui_FOFTPioneer_003"]="The event is currently unavailable.",
    ["ui_FOFTPioneer_004"]="Unavailable in team mode. Please form a party or enter solo.",
    ["ui_FOFTPioneer_005"]="Daily points are maxed out.",
    ["ui_FOFTPioneer_101"]="%s minutes",
    ["ui_FOFTPioneer_102"]="Current Individual Points: %s/%s",
    ["ui_FOFTPioneer_103"]="Points required for the chest in the next phase: %s",
    ["ui_FOFTPioneer_104"]="Current Chi: %s",
    ["ui_FOFTPioneer_105"]="Current Objective: Vanguard Assault",
    ["ui_FOFTPioneer_106"]="Refresh in %s minutes",
    ["ui_FOFTPioneer_107"]="Monsters whose pressure points were struck are now under the command of Raoh, forming a vanguard legion to invade Midgard. The one leading them is Yuda, as known as \"Yosei\"...",
    ["ui_FOFTPioneer_108"]="1. Participate in the instance multiple times every day to accumulate points.\n2. Rewards refresh daily. Reach the corresponding tier to claim rewards.",
    ["ui_FOFTPioneer_109"]="Defeat the monsters on the map to gain energy. Reach 1 stack or above to trigger North Star skills.",
    ["ui_FOFTPioneer_110"]="Waiting for the next boss to respawn",
    ["ui_FOFTPioneer_111"]="The boss has respawned. Tap the mini-map to check its location.",
    ["ui_FOFTPioneer_112"]="The entrance of the Vanguard Assault instance has appeared on Prontera West Gate. Please get there as soon as possible. Yuda will invade with his legion in 5 minutes!",
    ["ui_FOFT_001"]="Vanguard Assault Description:\n1. This gameplay is available daily from 12:00 to 22:00. A new instance portal opens every hour sharp and remains open for 30 minutes.\n2. Each instance opens for 30 minutes. During this time, you can earn Defender Points by defeating minions and bosses and picking up buffs.\n3. In this mode, you can get temporary card skill effects. Defeat monsters to accumulate energy to trigger the skills.\n4. Rewards will be granted once the Defender Points reach a certain threshold. You can enter the mode multiple times a day, with points adding up each time.\n5. Yuda shows up on the battlefield once every 5 minutes. Participate in defeating Yuda to get a lot of points.",
    ["ui_FOFT_002"]="Legion Invasion Description:\n1. Progress can be accumulated by defeating monsters of a similar level each day.\n2. Defeating MVPs can greatly increase your progress.\n3. Reaching the corresponding tier grants rewards. Rewards are refreshed daily.",
    ["ui_FOFT_003"]="Raoh Battle Description:\n1. Withstand Raoh's relentless assault for 5 minutes and try to deal as much damage as possible within the time limit (death will affect the clearance rating).\n2. Only with a Proof of Courage can you get the clearance rewards. Without a Proof of Courage, you can still refresh your leaderboard ranking (leaving the instance early won't be counted).\n3. Different clearance ratings correspond to different reward tiers, with D being the lowest and SSS the highest. The rating is shared across the party.\n4. Adventurers can join Raoh Battle by forming a party or using matchmaking. At least 2 participants are required to start.\n5. The rankings during the gameplay period will be based on the clearance ratings of all Adventurers on the server, with rewards given to those on the leaderboard.",
    ["ui_FOFT_004"]="Today's Total Points: %s",
    ["ui_FOFT_005"]="Defend Prontera",
    ["ui_FOFT_006"]="MVP Monster Hunting Points Event",
    ["ui_FOFT_007"]="Party up to challenge Raoh Instance",
    ["ui_FOFT_008"]="Available Daily from 12:00 to 22:00",
    ["ui_FOFT_009"]="Available Daily from 09:00 to 22:00",
    ["ui_FOFT_010"]="Today's Progress: <size=20>%s</size>",
