    ["ui_FatTiger_004"]="Wheel Prize Pool",
    ["ui_FatTiger_005"]="1. Use 1 Wheel Chip per draw, randomly receiving a reward from the prize pool based on its odds.\n2. The prize pool is accumulated across the entire server. Each draw contributes to the total pool amount. If someone hits the jackpot, they'll share the bonus based on the current pool amount.",
    ["ui_FatTiger_006"]="1. Complete Leisure Quests to accumulate EXP and upgrade the level of your Leisure Rewards.\n2. The daily quests in the Leisure Journey reset every day, but the quests on the journey list accumulate throughout the event.",
    ["ui_FatTiger_007"]="1. Complete Leisure Quests to upgrade the level of your Leisure Rewards, allowing you to claim Leisure Rewards after reaching corresponding levels.",
