    ["ui_FullMonthActivity_002"]="One Month Anniversary",
    ["ui_FullMonthActivity_003"]="One Month Anniversary Promo Pack",
    ["ui_GVE_001"]="Difficulty",
    ["ui_GVGNewRules_1"]="●Throne Wars Participation Rules:\n\u{3000}\u{3000}Eligible Guilds can enter Throne Wars via the Throne Wars Flag portal. There will be up to 3 Guilds of equal strength in each battle to compete against you, and the parties from the same Guild are independent of each other. Up to 70 people from the same Guild can participate in the Throne Wars, and the portal will appear 15 minutes before the battle, during which the participants may enter and prepare for the upcoming battle. The entire battle lasts 45 minutes.\n●Throne Wars Winning Conditions:\n\u{3000}\u{3000}Adventurers need to shatter as many metals on the battlefield as possible, including the Emperium that belongs to other Guilds, seize them, and convert them into their own energy. The bigger the metal, the higher the energy you may gain, which earns you more points per unit time. When the battle is over, the ranking will be tallied from high to low based on the number of points earned by each party. If two parties have the same score, the result will be determined based on the time they acquire it.\n\u{3000}\u{3000}The Guild that first reaches 3,000 points will automatically win the match, and the result will be tallied at that time.\n\u{3000}\u{3000}If a participant has too many deaths in a row on the battlefield, they may receive a GVG penalty.\n●Metal Information:\n\u{3000}\u{3000}Emperium: Energy 1 / HP 2,000\n\u{3000}\u{3000}Ultirium: Energy 2 / HP 4,000\n\u{3000}\u{3000}Glarium: Energy 3 / HP 6,000\n\u{3000}\u{3000}Miragerium: Energy 5 / HP 10,000\nFight for the glory of the Guild until the very end and determine the true king among Guilds!",
    ["ui_GVGRules_001"]="GVG Event Guide",
    ["ui_GVGRules_002"]="Event Summary",
    ["ui_GVGRules_003"]="Participation Rules",
    ["ui_GVGRules_004"]="Available Time: Guild War will be available <color=#338dc3>%s</color> every Saturday.",
    ["ui_GVGRules_005"]="Eligibility: Adventurers with a Base Level of ≥<color=#338dc3>Lv.35</color> and who are in a guild can participate.",
    ["ui_GVGRules_006"]="Event Entrance",
    ["ui_GVGRules_007"]="Adventurer guilds can compete for <color=#338dc3>8</color> bases during this event.",
    ["ui_GVGRules_008"]="Adventurers can use the Navigation feature of the GVG Battle Report to conveniently access the battlefield entrance.",
    ["ui_GVGRules_009"]="You can't participate in GVG battles within 7 days of leaving a guild.",
    ["ui_GVGRules_010"]="Gameplay Description",
    ["ui_GVGRules_011"]="Adventurers of Midgard, the Emperiums glow radiantly—the time to prove yourselves has come! Take up arms, seize the crystals, and occupy the bases! Fight for glory alongside your guildmates!",
    ["ui_GVGRules_012"]="The first guild to destroy the Emperium located within a base will become <color=#338dc3>defender</color> of that base.",
    ["ui_GVGRules_013"]="When the battle ends, the guild last <color=#338dc3>defending</color> the base will be declared <color=#338dc3>victorious</color> and earn <color=#338dc3>ownership</color> of the corresponding base.",
    ["ui_GVGRules_014"]="Battlefield Mode Introduction",
    ["ui_GVGRules_015"]="<color=#338dc3>Siege War Mode</color>",
    ["ui_GVGRules_016"]="When the GVG event first starts, bases will be in a neutral state and occupied by monsters.",
    ["ui_GVGRules_017"]="The first guild to break through the monsters' defense and destroy the Emperium located within a base will gain that base's <color=#338dc3>defense right</color>, and <color=#338dc3>Clash of Champions</color> mode will begin.",
    ["ui_GVGRules_018"]="<color=#338dc3>Clash of Champions Mode</color>",
    ["ui_GVGRules_019"]="This mode lasts for <color=#338dc3>30</color> minutes. Adventurers will be divided into Attackers and Defenders.",
    ["ui_GVGRules_020"]="The guild that has a base's <color=#338dc3>defense right</color> will be the defender, and the remaining guilds will be the attackers.",
    ["ui_GVGRules_021"]="Attackers: The Guild that destroys the Emperium within <color=#338dc3>30</color> minutes will become <color=#338dc3>Defenders</color> of that base, and the Clash of Champions <color=#338dc3>timer will be reset</color>.",
    ["ui_GVGRules_022"]="Defenders: If the Emperium is defended for <color=#338dc3>30</color> minutes and not destroyed, they will become the <color=#338dc3>winner</color> and occupy the base. The base's entrance will then be closed off.",
    ["ui_GVGRules_023"]="<color=#338dc3>Defensive War Mode</color>",
    ["ui_GVGRules_024"]="When the next GVG event begins, the guilds who occupied bases will be the defenders.",
    ["ui_GVGRules_025"]="This mode lasts for <color=#338dc3>45</color> minutes. Players will be divided into attackers and defenders.",
    ["ui_GVGRules_026"]="Attackers: A guild that destroys the Emperium located within a base within <color=#338dc3>45</color> minutes will become <color=#338dc3>defender</color> of that base, and the Clash of Champions mode <color=#338dc3>time will reset</color>.",
    ["ui_GVGRules_027"]="Defenders: If the Emperium is defended for <color=#338dc3>45</color> minutes and not destroyed, they will be declared the <color=#338dc3>victor</color> and occupy the base, and that base's entrance will be closed off.",
    ["ui_GVGRules_028"]="Victory Determination",
    ["ui_GVGRules_029"]="The ownership of the city is determined by the battlefield mode when the event ends.",
    ["ui_GVGRules_030"]="Occupied Mode: The occupier of the city gains ownership of the city.",
    ["ui_GVGRules_031"]="Clash of Champions Mode: The guild defending the city gains ownership of the city.",
    ["ui_GVGRules_032"]="Defensive War Mode: The guild defending the city gains ownership of the city.",
    ["ui_GVGRules_033"]="Siege War Mode: The city remains neutral.",
    ["ui_GVGRules_034"]="Event Restrictions",
    ["ui_GVGRules_035"]="Fly Wings and Butterfly Wings cannot be used on the battlefield.",
    ["ui_GVGRules_036"]="Yggdrasil Berry, Seed of Yggdrasil, and PVE potions cannot be used on the battlefield.",
    ["ui_GVGRules_037"]="Adventurers who die twice within 60 seconds on the battlefield will be penalized by resurrecting in a weakened state.",
    ["ui_GVGRules_038"]="Can control other bases from different areas. No. of bases allowed to be controlled in the same area: <color=#338dc3>1</color> base",
    ["ui_GVGRules_039"]="Event Reward",
    ["ui_GVGRules_040"]="Merit Reward",
    ["ui_GVGRules_041"]="Obtain Merit by completing the specified incidents on the battlefield.",
    ["ui_GVGRules_042"]="Incident Type",
    ["ui_GVGRules_043"]="Kill players.",
    ["ui_GVGRules_044"]="Resurrect friendly players.",
    ["ui_GVGRules_045"]="Deal 2,500,000 damage to Emperium.",
    ["ui_GVGRules_046"]="Restore 2,500,000 HP to Emperium.",
    ["ui_GVGRules_047"]="Destroy the Emperium.",
    ["ui_GVGRules_048"]="Battle Time",
    ["ui_GVGRules_049"]="Rewarded Merit",
