    ["ui_GashaponReward_001"]="Tap to continue",
    ["ui_GashaponRule_001"]="Legendary",
    ["ui_GashaponRule_002"]="Epic",
    ["ui_GashaponRule_003"]="Rare",
    ["ui_GashaponRule_004"]="Normal",
    ["ui_GashaponRule_005"]="Gacha Reward List",
    ["ui_GashaponRule_006"]="All Possible Prizes",
    ["ui_GashaponRule_007"]="Increased Chance of Spawning",
    ["ui_GashaponRule_008"]="This is a potentially winnable item. Making a purchase or participating in the event does not guarantee you will obtain certain items.",
    ["ui_GashaponTips_001"]="Past Review",
    ["ui_GashaponTips_002"]="Draw Rules:\n1. Adventurers get 1 point for every 1 Gacha Coin used. Points are automatically used to participate in the prize draw that is available at the Vending Machine at this time. Points are removed after the draw ends and will not carry over to the next draw.\n2. A reward is drawn immediately whenever there are enough points to draw a prize in each round of the draw. The chance of winning a prize increases with the number of individual points. After they are drawn, prizes are distributed to the winners via mail. Adventurers, please remember to claim them.\n3. There is an upper limit to how many points can be obtained from a single Vending Machine each day (resets at 05:00 in-game time). Exceeding points will not be counted.\n4. There is an upper limit to how many points can be obtained from a single Vending Machine drawing each round. Exceeding points will not be counted.\n5. Rewards can be drawn and given away from the prize pool of a single Vending Machine up to 2 times per day. The exceeding attempts will be carried over to the following day (resets at 05:00 in-game time).",
    ["ui_GashaponTips_003"]=" 1. Adventurers get 1 point for every 1 Gacha Coin used.\nPoints are automatically used to participate in prize draw that is available at the vending machine\nat this time. Points are removed after the draw ends\nand will not count towards the next draw.",
    ["ui_GashaponTips_004"]=" 2. A reward is drawn immediately whenever there are enough points to draw a prize in each round of the draw.\nThe chance of winning a prize increases with the number of individual points. After they are drawn,\nprizes are distributed to the winners via mail.\nAdventurers, please remember to claim them.",
    ["ui_GashaponTips_005"]="Current Reward",
    ["ui_GashaponTips_006"]="Next Round's Reward",
    ["ui_GashaponTips_007"]="Points: %s",
    ["ui_GashaponTips_008"]="Time: %s",
    ["ui_GashaponTips_009"]="Lv.%s",
    ["ui_GashaponTips_010"]="3. There is an upper limit to how many points can be obtained from a single Vending machine each day (resets at 5:00 am in-game time). The exceeding points will not be counted.",
    ["ui_GashaponTips_011"]="4. There is an upper limit to how many points can be obtained from a single Vending machine drawing each round. Exceeding points will not be counted.",
    ["ui_GashaponTips_012"]="5. Rewards can be drawn and given away from the prize pool of a single Vending Machine up to 2 times per day. The exceeding attempts will be carried over to the following day (resets at 5:00 in-game time).",
    ["ui_GashaponTips_013"]="Daily Limit: %s",
    ["ui_GashaponTips_014"]="Round Limit: %s",
