    ["ui_Gyotaku_004"]="Third Type of Fish",
    ["ui_Gyotaku_005"]="<color=#FFFFFFFF>Longest Fish Print Obtained: </color>",
    ["ui_Gyotaku_006"]="Ranking",
    ["ui_Gyotaku_007"]="Angler's Name",
    ["ui_Gyotaku_008"]="Fish Print Length",
    ["ui_Gyotaku_009"]="Ranking refreshes once every 5 minutes. Final data to be taken at 05:00!",
    ["ui_Gyotaku_010"]="No data available yet. Keep up the hard work!",
    ["ui_Gyotaku_011"]="Craft Fish Print",
    ["ui_Gyotaku_012"]="You've caught a -long .",
    ["ui_Gyotaku_013"]="Use the power of the Magic Bait to craft it into a Fish Print?",
    ["ui_Gyotaku_014"]="Xavier's Ranking selects three types of fish at random each day to record fish print data.\nEach day, use Magic Bait at the Izlude Fishing Ground to craft and record the data of one Fish Print.\nRankings are calculated once daily. The top 50 adventurers can all get rewards.\nThe rankings for the three types of fish have no difference in priority. Ranking rewards are the same.",
    ["ui_Gyotaku_015"]="Event Description",
    ["ui_Gyotaku_016"]="Ranking Reward",
    ["ui_Gyotaku_017"]="Fishing Contest",
    ["ui_Hairdressing_001"]="Wig",
    ["ui_Hairdressing_002"]="Hide Headgear",
    ["ui_Hairdressing_003"]="Contacts",
    ["ui_HalfAnniversary_001"]="Six-month Celebration",
    ["ui_HalfAnniversary_002"]="Six-month Celebration Gift Pack",
    ["ui_HalfAnniversary_003"]="Daily Limited Purchase Refresh Time: 5:00",
    ["ui_HalfAnniversary_004"]="Today's Limited Purchase ",
    ["ui_HalfAnniversary_005"]="Tap items to view a detailed introduction",
    ["ui_HalfAnniversary_006"]="Purchase",
    ["ui_HalfAnniversary_007"]="Limited Purchase Amount",
    ["ui_HalfAnniversary_008"]="Six-month Special",
    ["ui_HalfYearCelebration_001"]="Official Bottle",
    ["ui_HalfYearCelebration_002"]="Claim and Throw",
    ["ui_HalfYearCelebration_003"]="Throw",
    ["ui_HalfYearCelebration_004"]="Tap the screen according to the rhythm to increase your score.",
    ["ui_HalfYearCelebration_005"]="Select Track",
    ["ui_HalfYearCelebration_006"]="New Year Wishes",
    ["ui_HalfYearCelebration_007"]="Mega Raffle",
    ["ui_HalfYearCelebration_008"]="<size=24> 2022</size><color=#FFFFFFFF> players so far! The more tickets, the higher the chance!</color>",
    ["ui_HalfYearCelebration_009"]="Target Points",
    ["ui_HalloweenActivity_001"]="Halloween Event",
    ["ui_HalloweenActivity_002"]="Revelry Party",
    ["ui_HalloweenActivity_003"]="Spooky Code",
    ["ui_HalloweenActivity_004"]="Go to Party",
    ["ui_HalloweenActivity_005"]="Go to Shop",
    ["ui_HalloweenActivity_006"]="Exchange Deadline",
    ["ui_HalloweenActivity_007"]="Starting at <color=#72DB8B>18:00</color> every day, Adventurers can get ciphered clues and exclusive keys from the <color=#72DB8B>Banquet Messenger</color>.\nSend your <color=#72DB8B>Deciphered Code</color> to the World Channel! If correct, you'll receive <color=#FDC130>a reward via mail</color>!\nThere's a chance to receive a <color=#FDC130>permanent rare mount</color>!",
    ["ui_HalloweenActivity_008"]="Event Points: ",
    ["ui_HalloweenCode_001"]="Shadow Trail",
    ["ui_HalloweenCode_002"]="Start deciphering",
    ["ui_HalloweenCode_003"]="The Shadow Organization, which resides in the darkness but yearns for the light has launched a decryption challenge to all ghost hunters!",
    ["ui_HalloweenCode_004"]="Tap the avatar to start tracking",
    ["ui_HalloweenCode_005"]="Messenger List (Plaintext)",
    ["ui_HalloweenCode_006"]="List of Key Messengers",
    ["ui_HalloweenCode_007"]="Perform specific social actions on <color=#40E9CF>Plaintext Messengers</color> to get <color=#40E9CF>cipher clues!</color>\nThe order of ciphers is consistent with the order of the plaintext messengers in the interface! <color=#40E9CF>From left to right</color>!",
    ["ui_HalloweenCode_008"]="Perform specific social actions on <color=#40E9CF>Key Messengers</color> to get a 3-digit <color=#40E9CF>Exclusive Key!</color>\nThe order of the Exclusive Key is consistent with the order of the Exclusive Messengers in the interface! <color=#40E9CF>From left to right</color>!\n(Each Adventurer's Exclusive Key may differ!)",
    ["ui_HalloweenCode_009"]="<color=#CAE0EE>Starting at <color=#40E9CF>18:00</color> every day, Adventurers can get ciphered intel and exclusive keys from the <color=#40E9CF>Faerie Messenger</color>.\nSend your <color=#40E9CF>Deciphered Code</color> to the World Channel! If correct, you'll receive <color=#EF9A67>a reward via mail</color>! \n<color=#40E9CF>The first</color> Adventurer to send the correct code will receive <color=#EF9A67>extra rare rewards!</color></color>",
    ["ui_HalloweenCode_010"]="Shadow Trail",
    ["ui_HalloweenCode_011"]="Guide",
    ["ui_HalloweenCode_012"]="Open the event page to get the list of the 9 Shadow Messengers of the day.",
    ["ui_HalloweenCode_013"]="Talk to Jakk to get hints about the mystery of the day (cipher type, decryption method, and number of letters)",
    ["ui_HalloweenCode_014"]="Perform specific social actions on Shadow Messengers to get decryption clues!\n· 6 Plaintext Messengers: Provide the plaintext required to decrypt the cipher\n· 3 Key Messengers: Provide 3-digit exclusive keys\n<color=#ffc1f6>(P.S. Each Shadow Messenger has their own preferences. Note their favorite social actions!)</color>",
    ["ui_HalloweenCode_015"]="<color=#85f8ff>Send your cracked passwords to the World Channel! If it is correct, you'll receive your reward by mail!</color>\n<color=#ffc1f6>Format: Code - Exclusive Key (For example: CODE-888)</color>",
    ["ui_HalloweenCode_016"]="The first Adventurer to post the correct code + exclusive key in the World Channel on each server will get the permanent rare mount <color=#ffc1f6>Yamata no Orochi</color>!",
    ["ui_HalloweenCode_017"]="At the <color=#40E9CF>8/23/35/47</color> minute mark while Hyakki Yagyō is available, <color=#40E9CF>MVP, Mini, and Boss units</color> will appear in 12 areas!",
    ["ui_HalloweenCode_018"]="Daily",
    ["ui_HalloweenCode_019"]="Format:\nCode - Exclusive Key\n(For example: CODE - 888)",
    ["ui_HalloweenCode_020"]="Hyakki Yagyō Countdown",
    ["ui_HalloweenCode_021"]="Fairy Tale Points",
    ["ui_HalloweenCode_022"]="October 25 18:00 - November 9 23:59",
    ["ui_HalloweenCode_023"]="10/25~11/08",
    ["ui_HalloweenCode_024"]="19:00~20:00",
    ["ui_HalloweenItem1115"]="Face (M) - Bugaku",
    ["ui_HalloweenItem1214"]="Face (F) - Bugaku",
    ["ui_HalloweenItem2131"]="Hairstyle (M) - Bugaku",
    ["ui_HalloweenItem2230"]="Hairstyle (F) - Bugaku",
    ["ui_HalloweenItem80114"]="Change - Dark Gold",
    ["ui_HalloweenParty_001"]="Hyakki Yagyō",
    ["ui_HalloweenParty_002"]="Event Time",
    ["ui_HalloweenParty_003"]="Go to Challenge",
    ["ui_HalloweenParty_004"]="The gate to the underworld has opened, granting access to the night parade of one hundred demons. Can you be sure if the friend next to you is a human, ghost, or demon? Jakk said that you can drive away ghosts by scattering beans. There are lots of treasures to be found in places where ghosts frequent. Our guests from the underworld will eventually return to the underworld!",
    ["ui_HalloweenParty_005"]="Event Time",
    ["ui_HalloweenParty_006"]="Go to Challenge",
    ["ui_HalloweenParty_007"]="Cowboys,\nFill your cups with the crimson brew, and join the Twilight Banquet!\nLast for 1 hour daily from 19:00 to 20:00.\nDefeat monsters to earn event exchange materials!\nPlus, you have a chance to get the Inferno Golem mount!",
    ["ui_HalloweenParty_008"]="The Hyakki Yagyō will appear for <color=#40E9CF>1</color> hour from <color=#40E9CF>19:00-20:00</color> every day.\nAdventurers with Base Lv.<color=#40E9CF> ≥ 31</color> can go to Jakk at Odin's Statue in Prontera to participate in the Hyakki Yagyō exorcism event.",
    ["ui_HalloweenParty_009"]="Defeat monsters to get lots of EXP, Hyakki Yagyō exclusive <color=#40E9CF>exchange materials</color> and <color=#40E9CF>souls</color>, as well as Beans that can be eaten for some unexpected changes!",
    ["ui_HalloweenParty_010"]="At the <color=#40E9CF>8/23/35/47</color> mark while Hyakki Yagyō is available, lots of <color=#40E9CF>MVP, Mini, and Boss units</color> will appear in the stage!\nDefeat them to get lots of <color=#40E9CF>exchange materials that can be exchanged for costumes and a chance to get the super rare <color=#40E9CF>Yamata no Orochi</color>!\nThe naughty <color=#40E9CF>Nekomata</color> will also appear. Attack and defeat it to get great rewards!",
    ["ui_HalloweenParty_011"]="Jakk will rank all Adventurers based on the number of <color=#40E9CF>Souls</color> they have when the event ends every day and will give additional <color=#40E9CF>chests</color> to those who perform well!\nDuring the event, Jakk will also set up an <color=#40E9CF>Exchange Shop</color> outside Odin's Statue in Prontera. Adventurers can exchange the exchange materials there for various Halloween exclusive rewards! Jakk's Exchange Shop will be open for 7 more days after the event ends, so remember to exchange items before it closes!",
    ["ui_HalloweenParty_012"]="Every day, Jakk will send 9 special <color=#ADFDF8FF>Secret Messengers</color> to Prontera. By performing <color=#ADFDF8FF>social actions</color> on the Secret Messengers, you can get password clues!",
    ["ui_HalloweenParty_013"]="However, it is not enough to just know the correct password!\nAdventurers also need to find their own <color=#ADFDF8FF>Exclusive Messengers</color> for each day and get a 3-digit <color=#ADFDF8FF>Exclusive Code</color>!",
    ["ui_HalloweenParty_014"]="Perform specific social actions on <color=#56E795FF>Plaintext Secret Messengers</color> to get <color=#56E795FF>code clues!</color>\nThe order of the letters in the code is consistent with the order of the Plaintext Secret Messengers in the interface!\n(If you have trouble decrypting the code, why not try asking Secret Messengers who are not on the list)",
    ["ui_HalloweenParty_015"]="Perform specific social actions on <color=#56E795FF>Exclusive Messengers</color> to get a 3-digit <color=#56E795FF>Exclusive Key!</color>\nThe order of the Exclusive Key is consistent with the order of the Exclusive Messengers in the interface!\n(Each Adventurer's Exclusive Key may differ!)",
    ["ui_HalloweenParty_016"]="Each day when the event starts, Adventurers can get clues and start cracking codes!\nSend your <color=#56E795FF>cracked password</color> to the <color=#56E795FF>World Channel</color>. Format: Code - Exclusive Key (For example: CODE-888)\nIf it’s correct, you’ll receive your reward by mail! <color=#56E795FF>The first</color> Adventurer to send the correct password will win an amazing prize!",
    ["ui_HalloweenParty_017"]="Event Time: <color=#56E795FF>Every day at 18:00</color>",
    ["ui_HalloweenParty_097"]="The unusual illusion will appear for <color=#40E9CF>1</color> hour from <color=#40E9CF>19:00-20:00</color> every day.\nAdventurers with Base Lv.<color=#40E9CF> ≥ 31</color> can go to Jakk at Odin's Statue in Prontera to enter the Twilight Banquet Illusion.\nEliminate the monsters inside to earn exclusive Twilight Banquet <color=#40E9CF>exchange materials</color>, and event <color=#40E9CF>points</color>! Plus, there are Beans that can be eaten for some unexpected changes!\nAt the <color=#40E9CF>10/20/35/50</color>-minute mark while Twilight Banquet is available, lots of <color=#40E9CF>MVP, Mini, and Boss units</color> will appear in the stage!\nDefeat them to get lots of <color=#40E9CF>exchange materials</color>that can be exchanged for costumes and a chance to get the super rare <color=#40E9CF>Inferno Golem</color>!\n The insane <color=#40E9CF>Crazy Hat</color> will also appear. Attack and defeat it to get great rewards!\nJakk will rank all Adventurers based on the number of <color=#40E9CF>points</color> they have when the event ends every day and will give additional <color=#40E9CF>materials</color> to those who perform well!\nThere's a <color=#40E9CF>daily limit</color> on the number of exchange materials an Adventurer can obtain by defeating monsters. <color=#40E9CF>Normal Monster: 20 times, Mini: 4 times, MVP: 4 times, Boss: 2 times, Crazy Hat: 2 times.</color>\nDuring the event, Jakk will also set up an <color=#40E9CF>Exchange Shop</color> at Odin's Statue in Prontera. Adventurers can use the materials there to exchange for various Halloween-exclusive rewards! Jakk's Exchange Shop will remain open for 3 more days after the event ends, so remember to exchange items before it closes!",
    ["ui_HalloweenParty_098"]="Event Time",
    ["ui_HalloweenParty_099"]="Hyakki Yagyō",
    ["ui_HalloweenReward_001"]="Halloween Exchange",
    ["ui_Halloween_001"]="Twilight Banquet",
    ["ui_Halloween_002"]="Faerie's Whisper",
    ["ui_Halloween_003"]="The bell tolls, and the blood banquet is starting soon. Can you solve the secrets buried within?",
