    ["ui_Jobber144"]="Tax Rate",
    ["ui_Jobber145"]="All Records",
    ["ui_Jobber146"]="Expiring Soon",
    ["ui_Jobber147"]="Transaction record limit reached, please claim some and view again",
    ["ui_Jobber148"]="You've reached the end",
    ["ui_Jobber149"]="Pet",
    ["ui_Jobber150"]="Quick Select",
    ["ui_Jobber151"]="Select to Claim:",
    ["ui_Jobber152"]="Exchange Center transaction history can now be filtered into \"All\", \"Purchases\" and \"Sales\".\nPlayers can select transactions from the list, or choose the auto-select function, which will automatically select 30 transactions at once.\nCombined transactions will not be counted separately, therefore the number of transactions selected will appear as below the withdrawal limit.",
    ["ui_Jobber153"]="Reach the goals on all <size=18>7</size> days to get event rewards (Refreshes at 0:00 each day)",
    ["ui_Jobber154"]="Rules:\n\n① This event is limited to the <color=#56E795FF>Crystal Exchange Center</color>; purchases with Diamonds and auctions of rare goods are not counted in this event.\n② Sales only include transactions <color=#56E795FF>made and claimed during the event time</color>.\n③ There is a purchase rebate and sale tax rebate <color=#56E795FF>limit</color>.\n<color=#56E795FF>No rebates will be given</color> after the purchase amount reaches <color=#56E795FF>5 million</color>, and <color=#56E795FF>no tax refunds will be given</color> after the sale amount reaches <color=#56E795FF>3 million</color>.\n④ <color=#56E795FF>Kafra Plus Card users</color> can enjoy an <color=#56E795FF>8%</color> rebate on all successful purchases made within their validity period.\nOnce expired, the rebate returns to <color=#56E795FF>4%</color>.\n⑤ The Thanksgiving tax rate is the actual tax rate after removing the sales tax rebate, and the tax on sales orders during the event is still deducted according to the normal tax rate.\n(To enjoy the Thanksgiving VIP card tax rate, Adventurers need to select the <color=#56E795FF>Exchange Center low tax quota increased</color> privilege in the VIP card)\n⑥ Only purchases and sales claimed <color=#56E795FF>during the event </color>will be counted for the event quests.\n\nThe total tax rebate can be claimed after the event ends.\n",
    ["ui_Jobber155"]="Event Time: %s (Rewards Claim Deadline: %s)",
    ["ui_Jobber156"]="Rebate Limit Reached",
    ["ui_Jobber157"]="Max Tax Refund Reached",
    ["ui_Jobber158"]="钻石说明：",
    ["ui_Jobber159"]="Only Unbound Diamonds can be sold in the Exchange Center.\nUnbound Diamonds will be used first when purchasing rare equipment, headgear, cards, or other rare items.\nDiamonds circulated in the Exchange Center can only be obtained in the form of Bound Diamonds.",
