    ["ui_Kingdom_008"]="Successfully liked. Congratulations on obtaining the reward.",
    ["ui_Kingdom_009"]="Reward Preview",
    ["ui_Kingdom_010"]="Quiz Season",
    ["ui_Kingdom_011"]="The Child of Fortune",
    ["ui_Kingdom_012"]="Lucky Number",
    ["ui_Kingdom_013"]="Quiz Time",
    ["ui_Kingdom_014"]="Session's Winning Numbers:",
    ["ui_Kingdom_015"]="Please enter number.",
    ["ui_Kingdom_016"]="Incident Quiz",
    ["ui_Kingdom_017"]="Claim Reward",
    ["ui_Kingdom_018"]="Did not win",
    ["ui_Kingdom_019"]="Lucky Number Draw",
    ["ui_Kingdom_020"]="The kingdom's chronicler will record incidents happening in the kingdom <color=#338dc3>this week</color> based on reports from the relevant staff.",
    ["ui_Kingdom_021"]="Data and statistics gathering for incidents <color=#338dc3>stop on Saturday</color>. Incidents happening on Sunday will not be recorded.",
    ["ui_Kingdom_022"]="<color=#338dc3>Every Sunday at 12:00 PM</color>, the kingdom's chronicler will <color=#338dc3>randomly draw in turn</color> lucky numbers from the <color=#338dc3>different types</color> of incidents happening in the kingdom this week.",
    ["ui_Kingdom_023"]="For the Super Prize, in the event that several adventurers selected the same numbers, based on the <color=#338dc3>betting order</color>, there will be a maximum of <color=#338dc3>5</color> winners.",
    ["ui_Kingdom_024"]="The number of Lucky Prizes is generated randomly each time and is proportional to the <color=#338dc3>total quantity</color> of numbers participating in the Lucky Draw.",
    ["ui_Kingdom_025"]="Players with numbers the same as the lucky numbers but beyond the quota of the Lucky Prizes still receive the <color=#338dc3>Quiz reward</color>. However, they will not be able to accept additional quests from the kingdom's chronicler.",
    ["ui_Kingdom_026"]="The Child of Fortune Display",
    ["ui_Kingdom_027"]="If many Child of Fortune exist for a Quiz session, based on the <color=#338dc3>betting order</color>, the first will be selected as the winning Child of Fortune.",
    ["ui_Kingdom_028"]="<color=#338dc3>Hobnob with the lucky once</color> daily and get a King of Luck Gift Pack.",
    ["ui_Kingdom_029"]="Apparently, hobnobing with the lucky everyday can increase your own <color=#338dc3>luck</color>!",
    ["ui_Kingdom_030"]="Participate in Incident Quiz",
    ["ui_Kingdom_031"]="(Guessed %s numbers correctly)",
    ["ui_Kingdom_032"]="Grand Prize",
    ["ui_Kingdom_033"]="First Prize",
    ["ui_Kingdom_034"]="Second Prize",
    ["ui_Kingdom_035"]="Third Prize",
    ["ui_Kingdom_036"]="Fourth Prize",
    ["ui_Kingdom_037"]="Fifth Prize",
    ["ui_Kingdom_038"]="Please enter number.",
    ["ui_Kingdom_039"]="(1st place got %s correct)",
    ["ui_KvmLimitGift_001"]="Leaping Support",
    ["ui_KvmLimitGift_002"]="Ascension Gift Pack",
    ["ui_LanternFestival_001"]="Lantern Festival Event",
    ["ui_LanternFestival_002"]="Lantern Festival Garden Party",
    ["ui_LanternFestival_003"]="During the Lantern Festival, a lively garden party will be held at Prontera South Gate Amusement Park. The Lantern Festival emissary invites all adventurers to come and have fun!",
    ["ui_LanternFestival_004"]="Garden Party Quest 1:",
    ["ui_LanternFestival_005"]="Garden Party Quest 2:",
    ["ui_LanternFestival_006"]="Garden Party Quest 3:",
    ["ui_LanternFestival_007"]="Solve the Lantern Emissary's lantern riddles, find the right rocking chair, and sit on it first to win!",
    ["ui_LanternFestival_008"]="Which Carousel can lead you to victory? The answer is hidden in the Lantern Emissary's sweet dreamland!",
    ["ui_LanternFestival_009"]="Invite your sweetheart to take the Mini Train and enjoy a happy Lantern Festival!\nYou can get Odin's Reliquary, the special food Golden Rabbit Sweet Dumplings, or Silver Rabbit Sweet Dumplings after completing Lantern Festival Garden Party daily quests!",
    ["ui_LanternFestival_010"]="Enjoy special Lantern Festival foods to obtain blessings.\nIt's said that the golden rabbit and silver rabbit will come together to raise lanterns of blessings.",
    ["ui_LanternFestival_011"]="Kafra's VIP Reward",
