    ["ui_MidAutumnFestival2023_026"]="1. During the event, the chance of taming <color=#ff992b>S/A</color>-quality pets is increased by <color=#4b90ee>50%</color>.\n2. During the event, the success rate of evolving pets to <color=#ff992b>S/A</color> quality is increased by <color=#4b90ee>50%</color>.",
