    ["ui_MiniBattlePass_003"]="Activate the Glory Pass and instantly\nlevel up your pass by 25 levels.",
    ["ui_MiniBattlePass_004"]="Activate the Glory Pass.\nAt maximum level, the whole party can obtain a Cooking Pack after clearing an instance.",
