    ["ui_MoneyDeficit_001"]="Excess from buying on behalf will be automatically returned!",
    ["ui_MonthCard_001"]="The VIP Card is Kafra Corporation's way of providing adventurers with even more rewards!\nThe VIP Card is valid for 30 days, you can enjoy a VIP Card exclusive top up gift and reset privileges every 30 days.\nThe Trial Card is valid for 7 days, you can reset privileges every 7 days.",
    ["ui_MonthCard_002"]="Dear Adventurer, the Kafra Corporation\nprovides these VIP privileges.\nYou can choose 7 when you activate your VIP Card.\n(You must to select the privilege to increase free make-up sign-ins.)",
