    ["ui_OdinBlessing_001"]="Go to Odin's Statue",
    ["ui_OdinBlessing_002"]="Blessing limit reached",
    ["ui_OdinBlessing_003"]="The difference between the monster's and the player's level and the number of party members affect the final amount of EXP obtained.",
    ["ui_OdinBlessing_004"]="Recommended Training Points",
    ["ui_OdinBlessing_005"]="Odin's Blessing",
    ["ui_OdinBlessing_006"]="Use Odin's Blessing when killing monsters to obtain the following effects.",
    ["ui_OdinBlessing_007"]="5× Zeny",
    ["ui_OdinBlessing_008"]="5× EXP",
    ["ui_OdinBlessing_009"]="5× Drop Rate",
    ["ui_OdinBlessing_010"]="Activate Odin's Blessing when killing monsters to obtain a lot of additional rewards.\nKilling monsters automatically consumes Odin's Blessing: 1 for Small monsters, 2 for Medium monsters and 3 for Large monsters.\nOdin's Blessing will only be consumed when killing monsters within 6 levels of difference from the character's level. Please take note of the monster's level.\nOdin blesses adventurers. You can obtain Stamina by consuming Odin's Blessing.",
    ["ui_OdinBlessing_011"]="The difference between the monster's and the player's level and the number of party members affect the final amount of EXP obtained.",
    ["ui_OdinBlessing_012"]="Obtain Blessing",
    ["ui_OdinBlessing_013"]="Daily Mission",
    ["ui_OdinBlessing_014"]="Prontera",
    ["ui_OdinBlessing_015"]="Complete daily missions to obtain lots of Odin's Blessings!",
    ["ui_OdinBlessing_016"]="Complete daily missions first to greatly increase monster-killing efficiency!",
    ["ui_OdinBlessing_017"]="Go to Mission Board",
    ["ui_OdinBlessing_018"]="When in Prontera, get {1} Odin's Blessings every {0} seconds.",
    ["ui_OdinBlessing_019"]="Be in Prontera at <color=#f6723e>12:00 (noon)</color> and <color=#f6723e>20:00</color> daily to obtain lots of Blessings!",
    ["ui_OdinBlessing_020"]="Go to Main City",
    ["ui_OdinBlessing_021"]="Progress:",
    ["ui_OdinBlessing_022"]="Turned On",
    ["ui_OdinBlessing_023"]="Turned Off",
    ["ui_OdinBlessing_024"]="Turns off when Stamina is full",
    ["ui_OdinBlessing_025"]="Killing monsters automatically consumes Odin's Blessing: <color=#d48b5f>1</color> for Small monsters, <color=#d48b5f>2</color> for Medium monsters, and <color=#d48b5f>3</color> for Large monsters.",
    ["ui_OdinBlessing_026"]="Odin's Blessing will only be consumed when killing monsters within <color=#d48b5f>6</color> levels of difference from the character's level. Please take note of the monster's level.",
    ["ui_OdinBlessing_027"]="Obtain 1:1 Stamina",
