    ["ui_OdinRevisionInstruction_005"]="Odin's Blessing Effect Interval",
    ["ui_OdinRevisionInstruction_006"]="Bonus Coefficient",
    ["ui_OdinRevisionInstruction_007"]="Odin's Blessing also makes it so drops of monster items to not be affected by level decrease restrictions.\nWhile, monster item drops are affected by level decrease restrictions in normal state.",
    ["ui_OdinRevisionInstruction_008"]="EXP Modifier",
    ["ui_OdinRevisionInstruction_009"]="Class Amount",
    ["ui_OfferToBuyPanel_001"]="The item takes effect immediately after purchase, and you cannot cancel or get a refund. \n(Paid Diamonds will be consumed first.)",
