    ["ui_OfferToBuyPanel_003"]="Commodity Price",
    ["ui_OnePunchManPuzzle_001"]="The continent is teeming with villains. Summon heroes to exterminate the disasters now.",
    ["ui_OnePunchManPuzzle_002"]="\"With the beast-like combat instinct, they excel in both speed and strength. Known for protecting their own territory, they can safeguard the entire city single-handedly. However, once a villain exits their sphere of influence, they will cease the chase.\"",
    ["ui_OnePunchManPuzzle_003"]="Take a photo and check in",
    ["ui_OnePunchManPuzzle_004"]="To receive the gift box prepared by Watchdog Man.",
    ["ui_OnePunchManPuzzle_005"]="Refresh daily at 05:00",
    ["ui_OnePunchManPuzzle_006"]="Check-In Point",
    ["ui_OnePunchManPuzzle_007"]="12:00 - 22:00",
    ["ui_OnePunchManPuzzle_008"]="Escape to the safe zone from the lab in Party/Solo mode. Dodge the dangers and be the last survivor!",
    ["ui_OnePunchManPuzzle_009"]="Carry the maximum number of items by default",
