    ["ui_PVP_003"]="2V2",
    ["ui_PVP_004"]="3V3",
    ["ui_PVP_005"]="6V6",
    ["ui_PVP_006"]="Room Request",
    ["ui_PVP_007"]="Tap to select the mode you want to ban. This will reduce the probability of this mode being randomly matched. The more people ban the mode, the lower the probability will be randomly matched.",
    ["ui_PVP_008"]="Room",
    ["ui_PVP_009"]="Exit Room",
    ["ui_PVP_010"]="Unavailable",
    ["ui_PVP_011"]="Battle Time",
    ["ui_PVP_012"]="My Party",
    ["ui_PVP_013"]="Enemy's Party",
    ["ui_PVP_014"]="The more people banning the mode, the lower the probability it will be matched.",
    ["ui_PVP_015"]="Ban Rules",
    ["ui_PVP_016"]="Waiting for a mode to be banned",
    ["ui_PVP_017"]="Resource Crisis",
    ["ui_PVP_018"]="Flag-Capturing Heroes",
    ["ui_PVP_019"]="Double Poring",
    ["ui_PVP_020"]="Last Stand",
    ["ui_PVP_021"]="Occupy the resource station to obtain resources",
    ["ui_PVP_022"]="Capture the flag and deliver it to your party's flag drop-off point",
    ["ui_PVP_023"]="Hurry and pick up the little Porings",
    ["ui_PVP_024"]="Defeat your opponent",
    ["ui_PVP_025"]="Battle\u{0020}\u{0020} \u{0020}\u{0020}Mode\u{0020}\u{0020}",
    ["ui_PVP_026"]="Infinite Showdown In Progress",
    ["ui_PVP_027"]="Event Intro",
    ["ui_PVP_028"]="Gameplay Intro",
    ["ui_PVP_029"]="Map Intro",
    ["ui_PVP_030"]="Infinite Showdown Rules",
    ["ui_PVP_031"]="Availability: All Day",
    ["ui_PVP_032"]="Level: Base Level>=40",
    ["ui_PVP_033"]="Mode: Solo/Party matchmaking, custom rooms",
    ["ui_PVP_034"]="Daily Participation Limit: Unlimited",
    ["ui_PVP_035"]="1. Solo or Party participation is allowed.",
    ["ui_PVP_036"]="2. Both the game mode and the map are randomized.",
    ["ui_PVP_037"]="3. Upon a successful matching, you can ban a mode. Banned mode will have a reduced chance of being selected.",
    ["ui_PVP_038"]="4. Each map comes with its own set of unique mechanisms.",
    ["ui_PVP_039"]="5. Fulfill the winning conditions of each mode to secure a victory.",
    ["ui_PVP_040"]="Time: Ranked match is available from 20:00 to 21:00 on Monday, Wednesday, and Friday during the season; Infinite Showdown is available all day.",
    ["ui_PVP_041"]="Enter Room",
    ["ui_PVP_042"]="1. Capture the flag located at the middle of the scene.",
    ["ui_PVP_043"]="2. Successfully delivering the captured flag to your party's flag drop-off point counts as one flag submission.",
    ["ui_PVP_044"]="3. Your party's flag drop-off point is located in the opponent's base.",
    ["ui_PVP_045"]="4. The first party to submit the flag 3 times wins the match.",
    ["ui_PVP_046"]="1. Defeat members of the opposing party to earn points.",
    ["ui_PVP_047"]="2. The party that first reaches the target score wins the match.",
    ["ui_PVP_048"]="1. Watch out for the chilling floating ice in the scene.",
    ["ui_PVP_049"]="1. Watch out for the laser traps scattered around the scene.",
    ["ui_PVP_050"]="1. Watch out for the blood orbs unleashed by the vampire in the castle.",
    ["ui_PVP_051"]="Sorry, no empty rooms were found.",
    ["ui_PVP_052"]="To",
    ["ui_PVP_053"]="Select Mode",
    ["ui_PVP_054"]="Ranked Match",
    ["ui_PVP_055"]="Infinite Showdown",
    ["ui_PVP_056"]="ALL DAY",
    ["ui_PVP_057"]="7. It's recommended not to engage in events in a party of 6 other than Infinite Showdown. For other events, relevant effects won't be applied to the 6th member.",
    ["ui_PVP_058"]="Friends Ranking",
    ["ui_PVP_059"]="Cross-Server Ranking",
    ["ui_PVP_060"]="Tier",
    ["ui_PVP_061"]="Still Require",
    ["ui_PVP_062"]="Tier Requirement:",
    ["ui_PVP_063"]="Tap anywhere to continue",
    ["ui_PVP_064"]="Your tier of the previous season has been successfully inherited.",
    ["ui_PVP_065"]="Tier Reward Preview",
    ["ui_PVP_066"]="Season Reward Preview",
    ["ui_PVP_067"]="Ranked Match Rules",
    ["ui_PVP_068"]="1. Matchmaking for ranked matches is only available during each season's event period and is unavailable during the offseason settlement period.",
    ["ui_PVP_069"]="2. Season Cycle: Each season runs on a monthly cycle, beginning at 05:00 on the first and ending with settlement on the last day, which is excluded from the schedule.",
    ["ui_PVP_070"]="3. Multiplayer Mode: 6V6",
    ["ui_PVP_071"]="4. Matchmaking rules: Adventurers are matched across servers based on their strengths. The more matches they play, the closer the strengths of the matched Adventurers.",
    ["ui_PVP_072"]="5. Ban & Pick Modes: Upon a successful matching, each Adventurer can ban a mode from all available ones. Banned modes will have a reduced chance of being selected.",
    ["ui_PVP_073"]="6. Phases: Each mode includes a preparation phase, a battle phase, and an exit phase. Meeting the winning conditions will end the match earlier. Please refer to the Gameplay Intro for more details.",
    ["ui_PVP_074"]="7. Settlement rules:\nBelow Warlord Tier: Each victory grants Gold Star x1, while each loss deducts Gold Star x1 (except when certain rank-protection or special items are in effect).\nWarlord Tier: No longer gaining/deducting Gold Stars. Instead, a certain number of Blue Stars are granted or deducted for each win or loss.",
    ["ui_PVP_075"]="8. Major Tiers in the season: Accumulate Gold Stars to promote the rank, ranging from Elite, Ultimate, Champion, Epic, Legendary, King, and Warlord. Those who achieve the Warlord Tier get placed in the regional rankings based on the number of their Blue Stars.",
    ["ui_PVP_076"]="9. Match Abandonment Penalty and Surrender Rules:\nPlayers who are matched but not ready will be penalized with a 5-minute game suspension.\nPlayers who enter the match but leave before it's settled will be considered defeated and suspended for 5 minutes.\nAfter 3 minutes into a match, players can start a surrender vote. If 5 out of 6 players agree, the surrender is confirmed. Surrendering does not count as abandoning a match and will not incur penalties for leaving.",
    ["ui_PVP_077"]="Infinite Showdown Rules",
    ["ui_PVP_078"]="1. Infinite Showdown is not restricted by the season, but its gameplay/scenes are identical to the ranked match.",
    ["ui_PVP_079"]="2. The settlement of matches in Infinite Showdown will not affect the results of the ranked match.",
    ["ui_PVP_080"]="1. There are three resource points in the scene.",
    ["ui_PVP_081"]="2. Occupy resource points to continuously obtain resources.",
    ["ui_PVP_082"]="3. Occupied resource points can still be seized and reclaimed by other parties.",
    ["ui_PVP_083"]="4. The party that first collects a specified amount of resources wins the match.",
    ["ui_PVP_084"]="1. The Mastering will randomly summon Little Porings in the scene.",
    ["ui_PVP_085"]="2. Get close to Little Porings to pick them up.",
    ["ui_PVP_086"]="3. Collecting a certain number of Little Porings for a certain period to win the match.",
    ["ui_PVP_087"]="1. The edges of the scene and the magma in the scene are very dangerous.",
    ["ui_PVP_088"]="10. Please refer to Reward Preview on the ranked match's main page for reward details. Tier rewards will be distributed via mail when that tier is reached; season rewards will be distributed via mail when the season is settled.",
    ["ui_PVP_089"]="11. Tier Carryover Rules:\nWhen a season ends, Adventurer's current tier will be settled and carried over to the next season based on specific rules.",
    ["ui_PVP_090"]="3. Adventurers can create custom rooms in Infinite Showdown and recruit party members on their local server to battle against each other.\nHappy gaming!",
    ["ui_PVP_091"]="Note: Not available in the 2V2 mode.",
    ["ui_PVP_092"]="(Non-Local-Server Player)",
    ["ui_PVP_093"]="Party Data",
    ["ui_PVP_094"]="Daily 1st Win",
    ["ui_PVP_095"]="Tap anywhere to close the page",
    ["ui_PVP_096"]="1. 1st Win Rewards: Participate in the Infinite Showdown ranked match and secure your first win of the day to get rewards.",
    ["ui_PVP_097"]="2. EXP Rewards: Participate in any Infinite Showdown mode to earn EXP rewards; there's a daily cap.",
    ["ui_PVP_098"]="3. Warrior Coins:\nParticipate in the Infinite Showdown ranked match to earn Warrior Coins; there's a daily cap.\nUse Warrior Coins to exchange items in the Warrior Shop (exchange limits reset each season).",
    ["ui_PVP_099"]="4. Tier Achievement Rewards: Corresponding rewards will be granted when achieving the specified tier for the first time in the season.",
    ["ui_PVP_100"]="5. Season Rewards: Corresponding rewards will be granted based on the tier achieved at the end of the season.",
    ["ui_PVP_101"]="Stars",
    ["ui_PVP_107"]="Mech Clash",
    ["ui_PVP_108"]="Multiple mechanical devices are scattered across the area, and a few will activate every so often for Adventurers to compete over. (Activating a device temporarily disables the Endure and Debuff Immunity effect while greatly reducing the Debuff Resistance down by 1,000%.)",
    ["ui_PVP_109"]="You can earn points by capturing or taking down enemies. When the battle ends, the side with more points wins. If it's a tie, the side with the higher total damage dealt wins.",
    ["ui_PVP_110"]="Jungle Base",
    ["ui_PVP_111"]="There's one base in the area. If only your faction is in the area, your capture progress goes up. First to fill the progress bar wins. If both sides are on it, the one with more damage dealt wins.",
    ["ui_PVP_112"]="Powerful battle fruits randomly spawn around the map—they might just turn the tide!",
    ["ui_Pay_failure"]="Sorry, the order didn't go through.",
    ["ui_Personalized_001"]="Personalization Settings",
    ["ui_Personalized_002"]="Avatar Frame",
    ["ui_Personalized_003"]="Chat Frame",
    ["ui_Personalized_004"]="Side Bar",
