    ["ui_Re0_066"]="Beatrice's Rare Treasure",
    ["ui_Re0_067"]="Unlocks after accepting",
    ["ui_Re0_068"]="Please Start Challenge",
    ["ui_Re0_069"]="Rewards will be issued at 05:00 every Monday, and the rewards for the final week of the event will be settled on the last day.",
    ["ui_Re0_070"]="Floor",
    ["ui_Re0_071"]="Get rewards for the highest floor cleared as the clearance rewards.",
    ["ui_Re0_072"]="Relic Display",
    ["ui_Re0_Dungeon_Des001"]="Rules:\n1. Gain 1 reward chance every 48 hours (next available in: %s).\n2. No more chances will be added when the limit is reached, so use them promptly.\n3. Soul of Rebirth can be used to refresh the current option, with a limit of 10 times per round.",
    ["ui_Re0_Dungeon_tips004"]="Rules:\n1. After entering, you can choose the class, cards, and pets for the best combination to clear the stages.\n2. There are 10 waves of monsters in total. Try to last as long as possible before dying.\n3. In the end, rewards will be given according to the highest level you have cleared.",
    ["ui_Re0_Dungeon_tips005"]="This Week's Available Classes",
    ["ui_Re0_Dungeon_tips006"]="Reward Preview",
    ["ui_Re0_Dungeon_tips007"]="Enter",
    ["ui_Re0_Dungeon_tips008"]="Tip",
    ["ui_Re0_Dungeon_tips009"]="No reward chances remain, and no rewards will be given for completing this level. Enter anyway?",
