    ["ui_Re0_Dungeon_tips044"]="Daily Refresh Limit: %s/%s",
    ["ui_Re0_Dungeon_tips066"]="Congratulations to %s on obtaining <size=18><color=#F85F83>%s</color></size> from the selected gate! Come share the luck!",
    ["ui_Re0_Dungeon_tips095"]="Spend <color=#f59710>20,000</color> Zeny to refresh the quest?",
    ["ui_Re0_Dungeon_tips096"]="<size=26><color=#FFFD58>%s</color></size>/5",
    ["ui_Re0_Dungeon_tips097"]="Purchase Level +%s",
    ["ui_Re0_Dungeon_tips098"]="Draw Rules:\n1. Every five levels unlock a Relic Door with rich rewards.\n2. Only by drawing a special reward in the Treasure Door can you enter the next level (guaranteed after opening all Beatrice's Doors).\n3. Draw any reward in the Relic Door to enter the next level.\n4. The Relic Door allows you to select a Pet or Mount as your reward.\n5. Relic Door rewards have a chance to trigger crit.",
    ["ui_Re0_Dungeon_tips099"]="The pass level has been maxed out. No purchases are required.",
