    ["ui_Redeem_003"]="Buyback",
    ["ui_Redeem_004"]="Quick Buyback",
    ["ui_Redeem_005"]="Consume Soul Contract",
    ["ui_Redeem_006"]="The Soul lost when dying will reduce your attributes in Nightmare Mode.\n Spend a certain amount of Zeny to quickly buy back your lost Soul.\n Level up the Soul Buyback feature to have a chance to not lose any Soul.",
    ["ui_Redeem_007"]="Equipment that is taken from you will permanently lose effect in Nightmare Mode.\n It takes a lot of time to gradually buy back equipment that has been taken from you.\n Level up the Soul Buyback feature to have a chance to not lose your equipment.",
