    ["ui_ReturnActivity_001"]="Return Event",
    ["ui_ReturnActivity_002"]="Total Logins",
    ["ui_ReturnActivity_003"]="Challenge Quest",
    ["ui_ReturnActivity_004"]="Day %s",
    ["ui_ReturnActivity_005"]="Total Activity",
    ["ui_ReturnActivity_006"]="First Return to the Kingdom",
    ["ui_ReturnActivity_007"]="Gradual Improvement",
    ["ui_ReturnActivity_008"]="Arm for Glory",
    ["ui_ReturnActivity_009"]="Testing One's Power",
    ["ui_ReturnActivity_010"]="Kingdom Warrior",
    ["ui_ReturnActivity_011"]="Dear Adventurer, welcome back:",
    ["ui_ReturnActivity_012"]="It's been some time since you last visited Midgard...\nThe story continues to unfold here every day,\nand every touching moment here is related to you.\nFortunately, you haven't gotten very far away yet!\nWith great sincerity, we've prepared the Return Challenge gameplay and a welcome back gift for you.",
    ["ui_ReturnActivity_013"]="Welcome back, Adventurer!",
    ["ui_ReturnActivity_014"]="—Next Generation Project Team",
    ["ui_ReturnActivity_015"]="Enable Return Challenge",
    ["ui_ReturnActivity_016"]="Cornerstone of Protection",
    ["ui_ReturnActivity_017"]="Evil Nemesis",
    ["ui_ReturnActivity_018"]="Return Pass",
    ["ui_ReturnActivity_019"]="Standard Tier",
    ["ui_ReturnActivity_020"]="Advanced Tier",
    ["ui_Reward_001"]="Tap to continue",
    ["ui_RichMan_001"]="Automatic",
    ["ui_RichMan_002"]="Confirm Reward",
    ["ui_RichMan_003"]="Claim Directly",
    ["ui_RichMan_004"]="Challenge Again",
    ["ui_RichMan_005"]="Full-Star Clearance",
    ["ui_RichMan_006"]="Select Points",
    ["ui_RichMan_007"]="Select Your Points",
    ["ui_RichMan_008"]="Exchange Shop",
    ["ui_RichMan_009"]="Start Challenge",
    ["ui_RichMan_010"]="Memory Bomber",
    ["ui_RichMan_011"]="Bomber's Delight",
    ["ui_RichMan_012"]="Bomb Bump",
    ["ui_RichMan_013"]="Shizue",
    ["ui_RichMan_014"]="Ramiris",
    ["ui_RichMan_015"]="Rimuru",
    ["ui_RichMan_016"]="Milim",
    ["ui_RichMan_017"]="Shuna",
    ["ui_RichMan_018"]="Shion",
    ["ui_RichMan_019"]="Ranking",
    ["ui_RichMan_020"]="Adventurer's Name",
    ["ui_RichMan_021"]="Wonderland Cycles Completed",
    ["ui_RichMan_022"]="Total Purchases",
    ["ui_RichMan_023"]="Final Price",
    ["ui_RichMan_024"]="The more people buy, the lower the gift's price will fall!\nIf your purchase price is higher than the final price, the extra amount you paid will be returned after the event!",
    ["ui_RichMan_025"]="Claimable",
    ["ui_RichMan_026"]="Milim Nava",
    ["ui_RichMan_027"]="    Due to the violent fluctuation in magic elements, a Wonderland has appeared in Midgard! In the Wonderland you can act according to certain rules! If you step on a special space, unexpected things might happen. People who enter the Wonderland from the outside can also directly affect the things within, and complete minigames to get rewards! Together with Rimuru’s projection, explore the Wonderland, face danger, and collect rich rewards!",
    ["ui_RichMan_028"]="<size=20>20%</size> Discount for Kafra VIPs!",
    ["ui_RichMan_029"]="Slime-san Mission",
    ["ui_RichMan_030"]="Price:",
    ["ui_RichMan_031"]="<color=#ff4855FF>%s</color>",
    ["ui_RichMan_032"]="<color=#FFFFFF>%s</color>",
    ["ui_RichMan_033"]="Current Points: %s/%s",
    ["ui_RichMan_034"]="· After the game begins, you'll need to quickly try to remember the patterns on each card.\n· If you flip two identical cards in a row, you'll remove them from the board and earn points.\n· If you flip the wrong cards, you'll only waste precious time.",
    ["ui_RichMan_035"]="- After the game begins, tap the Porings to drive them away as quickly as you can!\n- Prioritize taking down the Deviling first!\n- Make sure you don't drive off the Angeling and King Poring!\n- You'll receive a penalty if you drive off the Slimes!",
    ["ui_RichMan_036"]="· After the game begins, you must quickly quickly tap the question marks to reveal stars~\n· Only one of the five mysterious question marks in each round hides a star behind it~\n· If you're not feeling too lucky, you can refresh the game and directly enter the next round~\n· You can flip for up to 10 rounds, with 3 tries each round~\n· Add 1 Gold Coin to the final reward for each star you find~",
    ["ui_RichMan_037"]="Pass the test to win Wonderland action items!",
    ["ui_RichMan_038"]="Aim at the Deviling and its minions to earn bonus points for %s seconds!\nMake sure you don't hit the wrong target!",
    ["ui_RichMan_039"]="The hammer sticks for %s seconds.",
    ["ui_RichMan_040"]="Reset View",
    ["ui_RichMan_041"]="Excellent students can get a crossover <color=#4099ff>Exclusive Title</color>~",
    ["ui_RichMan_042"]="(Purchase limit refreshes at 5:00 daily)",
    ["ui_RichMan_055"]="Normal Dice",
    ["ui_RichMan_056"]="Remote Control Dice",
    ["ui_RichMan_057"]="Nothing obtained...",
    ["ui_RichMan_059"]="Confirm to enable automatic Minigame?",
    ["ui_RichMan_060"]="After selecting the Skip Minigame option, triggered minigames will be completed automatically, granting you the rewards corresponding to a 1-star rating.",
