    ["ui_SongkranFestival_001"]="Songkran Festival",
    ["ui_SongkranFestival_002"]="Island Tour",
    ["ui_SongkranFestival_003"]="Water Gun Battle",
    ["ui_SongkranFestival_004"]="King of Revelry",
    ["ui_SongkranFestival_005"]="Strouf's Blessing",
    ["ui_SongkranFestival_006"]="Vacation Shop",
    ["ui_SongkranFestival_007"]="Final Rewards",
    ["ui_SongkranFestival_008"]="Travel Progress",
    ["ui_SongkranFestival_009"]="Forward",
    ["ui_SongkranFestival_010"]="Start",
    ["ui_SongkranFestival_011"]="Kick out from party",
    ["ui_SongkranFestival_012"]="Daily 1st Win grants Clear Water.",
    ["ui_SongkranFestival_013"]="Ranking Rewards",
    ["ui_SongkranFestival_014"]="Rewards can be obtained based on your ranking when the event is over.\n<color=#CA2E0AFF>Outstanding Adventurers can get an exquisite mount!</color>",
    ["ui_SongkranFestival_015"]="My Rewards",
    ["ui_SongkranFestival_016"]="Reminder",
    ["ui_SongkranFestival_017"]="During the event, Adventurers can receive additional XXX Odin's Blessings. Consuming Odin's Blessings to kill monsters earns you a chance to get event exchange materials!",
    ["ui_SongkranFestival_018"]="Claim Odin's Blessings",
    ["ui_SongkranFestival_019"]="Rama VIII Bridge",
    ["ui_SongkranFestival_020"]="Chinatown",
    ["ui_SongkranFestival_021"]="Grand Palace",
    ["ui_SongkranFestival_022"]="MahaNakhon",
    ["ui_SongkranFestival_023"]="Temple of Dawn",
    ["ui_SongkranFestival_024"]="Victory Monument",
    ["ui_SongkranFestival_025"]="Eye of Bangkok",
    ["ui_SongkranFestival_026"]="Again",
    ["ui_SongkranFestival_027"]="Matchmaking:",
    ["ui_SongkranFestival_028"]="Cancel",
    ["ui_SongkranFestival_029"]="Get Fuel",
    ["ui_SpringFestivalActivity2023_021"]="Fireworks",
    ["ui_SpringFestivalActivity2023_022"]="Firecrackers",
    ["ui_SpringFestivalActivity2023_042"]="During the Spring Festival, the more the monsters defeated in the wild, the easier the hidden Nian Babies to show up.\nUpon the arrival of Nian in Payon, many Nian Babies will be summoned in concurrence.",
    ["ui_SpringFestivalActivity2023_043"]="Eclipse has come to Payon. Adventurers can accept the MVP/Mini Knockback quests on the Mission Board to help Eclipse guard the forest, earn Forest Companion Badges, and exchange exclusive rewards at Eclipse's Badge Store!",
    ["ui_SpringFestivalActivity2023_044"]="Fireworks work amazingly effectively against Nian.\nWhen the armor of Nian gets destroyed, it drops tons of rewards, and it makes the firecrackers work even better.\nNian will flee to other areas when it feels threatened.",
    ["ui_SpringFestivalActivity2023_045"]="With the special Eclipse exclusive item Eclipse's Carrot, Adventurers can summon Eclipse to ignore Nian's shield and deal huge damage to it!",
    ["ui_SpringFestivalActivity2023_046"]="Quest 1: Help Eclipse to kill the restless monsters!",
    ["ui_SpringFestivalActivity2023_047"]="Quest 2: The Nian becomes stronger!",
    ["ui_SpringFestivalActivity2023_048"]="Participate after ≥Lv.30",
    ["ui_SpringFestivalActivity2023_049"]="Treasure Tiger",
    ["ui_SpringFestivalActivity2023_050"]="Full Set of Year of the Tiger Accessories",
    ["ui_SpringFestivalActivity2023_051"]="During the event, Adventurers can enter a specific sentence \"<size=20><color=#ffe86a>Happy Lunar New Year 2023!</color></size>\" in the world channel\nto get New Year's Eve Pack x1.",
    ["ui_SpringFestivalActivity2023_052"]="Open to randomly receive a <color=#FFE3A7FF>guaranteed</color> part of New Year Return Accessories and a large number of Crystals. There is even a chance to get the precious mount: <color=#FFE3A7FF>Treasure Tiger</color> or a random Spring Festival-exclusive Class Mount Accessory.",
    ["ui_SpringFestivalActivity2023_053"]="Year of the Rabbit Acc. Card can be exchanged for <size=20><color=#FFE3A7FF>Year of the Rabbit Exclusive Headgear</color></size> at Eclipse's Badge Store!",
    ["ui_SpringFestivalActivity2023_054"]="New Year rewards! Log into the game every day, talk to Eclipse, and win the game of transporting carrots to get the daily rewards!",
    ["ui_SpringFestivalActivity2023_055"]="Day X",
    ["ui_SpringFestivalActivity2023_056"]="Lucky Rabbit Welcomes the New Year",
    ["ui_SpringFestivalActivity2023_057"]="Spring Festival Gifts",
    ["ui_SpringFestivalActivity2023_058"]="New Year's Eve Celebration",
    ["ui_SpringFestivalActivity2023_059"]="Year of the Rabbit Exclusive Mount Accessories",
    ["ui_SpringFestivalActivity2023_060"]="Special Quests from Mission Board",
    ["ui_SpringFestivalActivity2023_061"]="Eclipse's Down Fur",
    ["ui_SpringFestivalActivity2023_062"]="New Year Gift Box",
    ["ui_SpringFestivalActivity2023_063"]="Year of the Rabbit Mount",
    ["ui_SpringFestivalActivity2023_064"]="Year of the Rabbit Backpack",
    ["ui_SpringFestivalActivity2023_065"]="Year of the Rabbit Costume",
    ["ui_SpringFestivalActivity2023_066"]="Year of the Rabbit Tail",
    ["ui_SpringFestivalActivity2023_067"]="New Year Items",
    ["ui_SpringFestivalActivity2023_068"]="Participate in defeating the Nian",
    ["ui_SpringFestivalActivity2023_069"]="Guard Certificate",
    ["ui_SpringFestivalActivity2023_070"]="Lots of Forest Companion Badges",
    ["ui_SpringFestivalActivity2023_071"]="Eclipse's Carrot",
    ["ui_SpringFestivalActivity2023_072"]="Tap to claim",
    ["ui_SpringFestivalActivity2023_073"]="* Break Nian's armor/Consume Odin's Blessing for a chance to get Forest Companion Badges and Eclipse's Carrot.",
    ["ui_SpringFestivalActivity2023_074"]="There is a chance of dropping the rare Year of the Rabbit Mount when defeating the Nian!",
    ["ui_SpringFestivalActivity2023_075"]="Tap to enter",
    ["ui_SpringFestivalActivity2023_076"]="Go to the Minigame and Eclipse Badge Store by tapping here",
    ["ui_SpringFestivalActivity2023_099"]="Happy Lunar New Year 2023!",
    ["ui_SpringFestivalActivity2023_100"]="Password copied. You can paste it anytime!",
    ["ui_SpringFestivalActivity2024_001"]="Painted Spring",
    ["ui_SpringFestivalActivity2024_002"]="Nian Siege",
    ["ui_SpringFestivalActivity2024_003"]="Nian Invasion",
    ["ui_SpringFestivalActivity2024_004"]="Spring Rewards",
    ["ui_SpringFestivalActivity2024_005"]="Spring Furniture",
    ["ui_SpringFestivalActivity2024_006"]="Gift Received",
    ["ui_SpringFestivalActivity2024_007"]="Login Rewards",
    ["ui_SpringFestivalActivity2024_008"]="Exclusive Face",
    ["ui_SpringFestivalActivity2024_009"]="Total Contribution",
    ["ui_SpringFestivalActivity2024_010"]="Server-Wide Participation",
    ["ui_SpringFestivalActivity2024_011"]="Upgraded Mechanics",
    ["ui_SpringFestivalActivity2024_012"]="More Rewards",
    ["ui_SpringFestivalActivity2024_013"]="Unlock Gift Box",
    ["ui_SpringFestivalActivity2024_014"]="Quest Level-Up",
    ["ui_SpringFestivalActivity2024_015"]="Double Surprise",
    ["ui_SpringFestivalActivity2024_016"]="Special Mission",
    ["ui_SpringFestivalActivity2024_017"]="Exclusive Appearance",
    ["ui_SpringFestivalActivity2024_018"]="Exclusive Discount",
    ["ui_SpringFestivalActivity2024_019"]="Copy",
    ["ui_SpringFestivalActivity2024_020"]="As New Year's Eve is approaching, the recon team has discovered numerous Baby Nian near different main cities, including Phantom Nian, of various elements, causing significant fear in the residents of these cities!",
    ["ui_SpringFestivalActivity2024_021"]="<color=#B75219>From 10:00 to 24:00 daily</color>, every 2 hours, this event will appear randomly in one of the main cities, lasting 1 hour (with the first at 10:00 and the last at 24:00).",
    ["ui_SpringFestivalActivity2024_022"]="Contribution Points",
    ["ui_SpringFestivalActivity2024_023"]="This Round's Elimination Progress",
    ["ui_SpringFestivalActivity2024_024"]="Return of the Nian",
    ["ui_SpringFestivalActivity2024_025"]="<color=#6F4B36>Once again, the Nian returns with full force, assaulting Payon!</color>",
    ["ui_SpringFestivalActivity2024_026"]="Consume Odin's Blessings to get items.",
    ["ui_SpringFestivalActivity2024_027"]="Consume Odin's Blessings to get <color=#FFE0AF>Amber x1</color>. Can be obtained up to <color=#FFE0AF>15 times</color> per day.",
    ["ui_SpringFestivalActivity2024_028"]="Recharge to Get Diamond Red Envelopes",
    ["ui_SpringFestivalActivity2024_029"]="During the event, <color=#FFE0AF>1/2/5 Year of the Horse Diamond Red Envelopes</color> will be granted when topping up <color=#FFE0AF>15,000/26,000/51,000 Diamonds</color> in-game in a single purchase (not obtainable through the official shop).",
    ["ui_SpringFestivalActivity2024_030"]="The Double Event becomes available for a limited time.",
    ["ui_SpringFestivalActivity2024_031"]="<color=#FFE0AF>Double Zeny/EXP</color> available daily\n12:00–14:00, 19:00–21:00 (UTC+7)",
    ["ui_SpringFestivalActivity2024_032"]="Special Mission refreshes daily",
    ["ui_SpringFestivalActivity2024_033"]="Get the Special Mission from the Mission Board every day (must be completed on the same day).",
    ["ui_SpringFestivalActivity2024_034"]="During the event, send the specific sentence \"<color=#FDD4A3>Happy Lunar New Year 2024!</color>\" to the world channel.",
    ["ui_SpringFestivalActivity2024_035"]="Current Tier",
    ["ui_SpringFestivalActivity2024_036"]="Current Points",
    ["ui_SpringFestivalActivity2024_037"]="New Year rewards! Log in daily to claim rewards!",
    ["ui_SpringFestivalActivity2024_038"]="Log in for 7 days to get the <color=#FCF497>Year of the Snake Exclusive Face</color>!",
    ["ui_SpringFestivalActivity2024_039"]="Happy Lunar New Year 2024!",
    ["ui_SpringFestivalActivity2024_040"]="View the Showroom",
    ["ui_SpringFestivalActivity2024_041"]="Tap the button below to go to the corresponding scene and eliminate Baby Nian and Phantom Nian.",
    ["ui_SpringFestivalActivity2024_042"]="Phantom Nian possesses many different attributes and is highly resistant to non-counter attributes. However, they are more vulnerable to counter-attributes.",
    ["ui_SpringFestivalActivity2024_043"]="Earn <color=#FFF4A6>30</color> Contribution Points by participating in the elimination of Baby Nian and <color=#FFF4A6>300</color> Contribution Points by participating in the elimination of Phantom Nian. Doing this with a party earns you even more points!",
    ["ui_SpringFestivalActivity2024_044"]="Firecrackers can directly eliminate Baby Nian and shatter the shield triggered by Phantom Nian when it's at 50% HP, causing them to be stunned temporarily and lose their attribute resistance.",
    ["ui_SpringFestivalActivity2024_045"]="Daily rewards of various tiers are available depending on the Contribution Points obtained.",
    ["ui_SpringFestivalActivity2024_046"]="When the elimination progress reaches 100% in each round, you can claim the special dish <color=#B75219>Richer and Richer</color>! Consuming it will boost the damage you deal to Nian-series monsters!",
    ["ui_SpringFestivalActivity2024_047"]="The recon team reports that the Nian changes its attribute and emits lights of varying colors every thirty seconds—attack with countering attributes!",
    ["ui_SpringFestivalActivity2024_048"]="Additionally, the Nian has become resistant to Firecrackers. It's recommended to use <color=#B75219>Fireworks</color>[s s=40.0 url=Icons/Item/10202163] and the new item <color=#B75219>Kylin Scale</color>[s s=40.0 url=Icons/Item/10202552]!",
    ["ui_SpringFestivalActivity2024_049"]="Fireworks can effectively shatter the Nian's shield while the Serpent Fang inflicts substantial damage upon the shield shattering!",
    ["ui_SpringFestivalActivity2024_050"]="As the difficulty increases, the rewards from the Nian get even better! During the event, the first time a Nian is defeated, it is guaranteed to drop <color=#CA7D30>rare equipment</color> or a <color=#CA7D30>Nian Card</color>!",
    ["ui_SpringFestivalActivity2024_051"]="Activate Quest and Gift Box",
    ["ui_SpringFestivalActivity2024_052"]="Earn Points to Upgrade Gift Box",
    ["ui_SpringFestivalActivity2024_053"]="Consume Odin's Blessings to get Flawless Serpent Scale x1. Can be obtained once per day.",
    ["ui_SpringFestivalActivity2024_054"]="Adventurers can claim Bound Diamonds daily from the Year of the Horse Diamond Red Envelopes, <color=#FFE0AF>with any excess converting into Crystals</color>.",
    ["ui_SpringFestivalActivity2024_055"]="All <color=#FFE0AF>Double Rewards</color> become available on <color=#FFE0AF>Spring Festival</color>\n00:00–24:00 (UTC+7)",
    ["ui_SpringFestivalActivity2024_056"]="Complete the Special Mission to obtain event items such as Flawless Serpent Scale, Serpent Fang, etc.",
    ["ui_SpringFestivalActivity2025_001"]="Lv. ≥ <color=#FDF7C9>30</color>",
    ["ui_SpringFestivalActivity2025_002"]="During the event, send the specific sentence to the world channel",
    ["ui_SpringFestivalActivity2025_003"]="Happy Lunar New Year 2026!",
    ["ui_SpringFestivalActivity2025_004"]="Once the gift box is available for claiming, you can no longer complete quests to earn points.",
    ["ui_SpringFestivalActivity2025_005"]="Serpent Mark Drop Rate (including Odin's Blessing's 5x multiplier):\nSmall monsters: 1.0000%, medium monsters: 2.0000%, large monsters: 3.0000%\nDrops 5 each time, limited to 5 times per day.\n\nFlawless Serpent Scale Drop Rate (including Odin's Blessing's 5x multiplier):\nSmall monsters: 0.1000%, medium monsters: 0.2000%, large monsters: 0.3000%\nDrops 1 each time, limited to 1 time per day.",
    ["ui_SpringFestivalActivity2026_001"]="Enter the password in World Channel to unlock sign-in rewards.",
    ["ui_SpringFestivalActivity2026_002"]="Happy Lunar New Year 2026!",
    ["ui_SpringFestivalActivity2026_003"]="Claimable after %s",
    ["ui_SpringFestivalActivity2026_004"]="Exchange the tokens you've collected for your favorite materials! Time to head out and hunt!",
    ["ui_SpringFestivalActivity2026_005"]="Exchange Deadline (UTC+7):",
    ["ui_SpringFestivalActivity2026_006"]="Enter <color=#B75219>\"Happy Lunar New Year 2026!\"</color> in the public channel to claim the password reward",
    ["ui_SpringFestivalActivity2026_007"]="Coming Soon",
    ["ui_SpringFestivalActivity2026_010"]="<color=#B75219>You have claimed the password reward!</color>",
    ["ui_SpringFestivalActivity2026_011"]="Herald of Spring\n1. Sign in daily to claim rewards. Send the designated password in the world channel to get extra rewards.\nGolden Steed Blessings\n1. During the event, use the Fortune Hammer to smash Golden Eggs.\n2. A Gold Card is guaranteed within 300 smashes (the count does not reset before the guarantee is triggered).\n3. Each Golden Egg smash grants 1 point. Points earned will automatically count toward your entry in the ongoing Lucky Draw. Points will be cleared after the draw ends and will not carry over.\n4. Point rewards will be drawn immediately once the point goal is reached. Higher personal points increase your chance of winning. Rewards will be sent via in-game mail—please check your inbox.\nNian Siege\n1. Large numbers of Baby Nian and Phantom Nian will appear near major cities at scheduled times. Defeating a Baby Nian grants 30 Contribution Points and has a chance to drop a Common New Year Pack, while defeating a Phantom Nian grants 300 Contribution Points and guarantees a Common New Year Pack.\n2. Earn a certain number of Contribution Points each day to claim corresponding rewards. See the event page for details.\nNian Invasion\n1. After 12:00 on New Year's Day (UTC+7), Nian will appear as an MVP in Payon. The first Adventurer to defeat Nian is guaranteed to receive either rare equipment or a Nian Card.\n2. See the event page for details.\nSpring Gratitude\n1. Complete Spring Gratitude daily quests or cumulative quests to earn points. Reach the required points to claim the corresponding New Year's Eve Pack.\n2. Each pack can only be claimed once during the event. If you have enough points, you can claim all three different packs.\n",
    ["ui_SpringFestivalActivity2026_012"]="<size=18>First Kill</size> <size=26>Untaken</size>",
    ["ui_SpringFestivalActivity2026_013"]="<size=18>First Kill</size> <size=26>Taken</size>",
    ["ui_SpringFestivalActivity_001"]="Spring Festival Event",
    ["ui_SpringFestivalActivity_002"]="Cat Hand Services Gift Pack",
    ["ui_SpringFestivalActivity_003"]="New Year Greetings Gift Pack",
    ["ui_SpringFestivalActivity_004"]="MVP Nian Has Arrived!",
    ["ui_SpringFestivalActivity_005"]="Dear Adventurer, at the end of every year, the Nian comes and attacks the villages of Payon. The villages chosen by the Nian and its offspring will be ravaged unsparingly…",
    ["ui_SpringFestivalActivity_006"]="Quest 1: Stop the Baby Nian!",
    ["ui_SpringFestivalActivity_007"]="Information 1: During the event, there is a chance that a Baby Nian will appear after players defeat monsters Lv.40 or higher in the wild.",
    ["ui_SpringFestivalActivity_008"]="Information 2: When the giant Nian appears in Payon, it will summon several Baby Nians to its side.",
    ["ui_SpringFestivalActivity_009"]="Defeat these Baby Nians to obtain the Spring Festival Gift Box. Open the gift box to get up to 888,888 Zeny, red envelopes, Spring Festival Cooking, and other generous rewards!",
    ["ui_SpringFestivalActivity_010"]="After completing all of the daily Mission Board quests, a special bounty for exterminating the Baby Nian will appear. Complete it to get Spring Festival Lucky Bags, Firecrackers, Fireworks, and more!",
    ["ui_SpringFestivalActivity_011"]="Quest 2: Exterminate MVP Nian!",
    ["ui_SpringFestivalActivity_012"]="Information 1: Nian will appear in Payon. He has immense defensive capabilities, but fireworks seem to be effective at breaking through his armor.",
    ["ui_SpringFestivalActivity_013"]="Information 2: When Nian’s armor breaks, he will drop a bunch of rewards. Players can also use firecrackers at this moment to inflict huge damage on him.",
    ["ui_SpringFestivalActivity_014"]="Information 3: When Nian feels threatened, he will cunningly escape to another area of the village.",
    ["ui_SpringFestivalActivity_015"]="When Nian is finally defeated, there is a chance he will drop the Spring Festival-exclusive Mount, Nian Cards, Lucky Bags, and other generous rewards.",
    ["ui_SpringFestivalActivity_016"]="Main Drops",
    ["ui_SpringFestivalActivity_017"]="Baby Nian",
    ["ui_SpringFestivalActivity_018"]="Spring Festival Gift Box",
    ["ui_SpringFestivalActivity_019"]="Gift Box Reward",
    ["ui_SpringFestivalActivity_020"]="Lucky Bag",
    ["ui_SpringFestivalActivity_021"]="Fireworks",
