    ["ui_SpringFestivalActivity_023"]="Spring Festival Dumplings",
    ["ui_SpringFestivalActivity_024"]="Spring Festival Rice Cakes",
    ["ui_SpringFestivalActivity_025"]="Tons of Zeny",
    ["ui_SpringFestivalActivity_026"]="Nian",
    ["ui_SpringFestivalActivity_027"]="Break the Armor",
    ["ui_SpringFestivalActivity_028"]="Tons of Lucky Bags",
    ["ui_SpringFestivalActivity_029"]="(Can obtain up to 10 times per day)",
    ["ui_SpringFestivalActivity_030"]="Additional Rare Reward",
    ["ui_SpringFestivalActivity_031"]="Panda Eiffel",
    ["ui_SpringFestivalActivity_032"]="Lion's Head Fireworks",
    ["ui_SpringFestivalActivity_033"]="Vending Machine",
    ["ui_SpringFestivalActivity_034"]="Extra Rewards",
    ["ui_SpringFestivalActivity_035"]="Nian Costume Series",
    ["ui_SpringFestivalActivity_036"]="New Year Mount Accessory",
    ["ui_SpringFestivalActivity_037"]="Equipment Upgrade Material",
    ["ui_SpringFestivalActivity_038"]="Reward List",
    ["ui_SpringFestivalActivity_039"]="Kill Drops",
    ["ui_SpringFestivalActivity_040"]="Exchange Reward",
    ["ui_SpringFestivalActivity_041"]="Adventurers with a Base Lv.30 or above can exchange in Prontera until March 1st at 05:00.",
    ["ui_SpringFestivalActivity_042"]="With the gradual awakening of Nian, the monsters on the continent become more restless!",
    ["ui_SpringFestivalActivity_043"]="Eddga has come to Payon. Adventurers can accept the MVP/Mini Knockback quests on the Mission Board to help Eddga guard the forest, earn Forest Companion Badges, and exchange exclusive rewards at Eddga’s Badge Store!",
    ["ui_SpringFestivalActivity_044"]="The Nian will become even more powerful after a year of rejuvenation!",
    ["ui_SpringFestivalActivity_045"]="With the special Eddga exclusive item Eddga’s Knuckle, players can summon Eddga to ignore Nian’s shield and deal huge damage to it!",
    ["ui_SpringFestivalActivity_046"]="Quest 1: Help Eddga to kill the restless monsters!",
    ["ui_SpringFestivalActivity_047"]="Quest 2: The Nian becomes stronger!",
    ["ui_SpringFestivalActivity_048"]="Participating players must be Lv.30 or above",
    ["ui_SpringFestivalActivity_049"]="Treasure Tiger",
    ["ui_SpringFestivalActivity_050"]="Full Set of Nian Accessories",
    ["ui_SpringFestivalActivity_051"]="During the event, Adventurers can enter a specific sentence \"<size=20><color=#ffe86a>Happy Lunar New Year 2022!</color></size>\" in the world channel to get New Year’s Eve Pack x1.",
    ["ui_SpringFestivalActivity_052"]="Open to <color=#FFE3A7FF>get</color> a random part of Nian Accessories, a large number of Crystals, and even have a chance to get precious mounts such as <color=#FFE3A7FF>Panda Eiffel</color>, <color=#FFE3A7FF>Lion's Head Fireworks</color>, or a random Spring Festival-exclusive Mount Accessory.",
    ["ui_SpringFestivalActivity_053"]="Year of the Tiger Accessory Card can be exchanged for <size=20><color=#FFE3A7FF>Year of the Tiger exclusive Headgear</color></size> at Eddga’s Badge Store!",
    ["ui_SpringFestivalActivity_054"]="New Year benefits! Log into the game every day, talk to Eddga, and play a game of Guess the Hat to get the daily rewards!",
    ["ui_SpringFestivalActivity_055"]="Day",
    ["ui_SpringFestivalActivity_056"]="Lucky Tiger Welcomes the New Year",
    ["ui_SpringFestivalActivity_057"]="Spring Festival Sign-in",
    ["ui_SpringFestivalActivity_058"]="Spring Gratitude",
