    ["ui_SpringFestivalActivity_070"]="Lots of Forest Companion Badges",
    ["ui_SpringFestivalActivity_071"]="Eddga’s Knuckle",
    ["ui_SpringFestivalActivity_072"]="Tap to claim",
    ["ui_SpringFestivalActivity_073"]="* Break Nian’s armor/Consume Odin’s Blessing for a chance to get Forest Companion Badges and Eddga’s Knuckle.",
    ["ui_SpringFestivalActivity_074"]="Players who defeat the Nian will have a chance to get a rare mount of the Year of the Tiger!",
    ["ui_SpringFestivalTime_2025"]="Event Time: %s/%s <color=#FDF7C9>%s:%s</color> to %s/%s <color=#FDF7C9>%s:%s</color> (UTC+7)",
