    ["ui_SuperIgnitionReflow_003"]="Hyper Challenge",
    ["ui_SuperIgnitionReflow_004"]="Hyper Pass",
    ["ui_SuperIgnitionReflow_005"]="Ultra Boost",
    ["ui_SuperIgnitionReflow_006"]="Ultra Power",
    ["ui_SuperIgnitionReflow_007"]="Hyper Journey",
    ["ui_SuperIgnitionReflow_008"]="Supercharged Buff",
    ["ui_SuperIgnitionReflow_009"]="Claim Item",
    ["ui_SuperIgnitionReflow_010"]="Level Boost",
    ["ui_SuperIgnitionReflow_011"]="Stress-Free",
    ["ui_SuperIgnitionReflow_012"]="Choice of Equipment",
    ["ui_SuperIgnitionReflow_013"]="Growth Support",
    ["ui_SuperIgnitionReflow_014"]="Ultra Power",
    ["ui_SuperIgnitionReflow_015"]="Friends Reunion",
    ["ui_SuperIgnitionReflow_016"]="New Acquaintance",
    ["ui_SuperIgnitionReflow_017"]="Hyper Companionship",
    ["ui_SuperIgnitionReflow_018"]="Power Up",
    ["ui_SuperIgnitionReflow_019"]="Hyper Boost",
    ["ui_SuperIgnitionReflow_020"]="Hyper Battle",
    ["ui_SuperIgnitionReflow_021"]="Guide Quest",
    ["ui_SuperIgnitionReflow_022"]="Friends Reunion, New Acquaintance",
    ["ui_SuperIgnitionReflow_023"]="1. When a Hyper Player joins a guild and completes a guild order, the guild will receive Novice Coins in the warehouse. The distribution quota of the previous week can be assigned at 5:00AM every Monday.\n2. When a Hyper Player becomes an apprentice and completes the master/apprentice daily quest, the master will receive Novice Coins.\n3. Adventurers who are not Hyper Players will have their own exclusive quests available during the event period.\n4. Defeating monsters with Odin's Blessings, defeating MVP/MINI, or completing instances with Adventurers who are 30 levels lower than the World Level grants you A Travel Companion Pack.",
    ["ui_SuperIgnitionReflow_024"]="Daily Quest",
    ["ui_SuperIgnitionReflow_025"]="Cumulative Quests",
    ["ui_SuperIgnitionReflow_026"]="Obtained during the Hyper Event.",
    ["ui_SuperIgnitionReflow_027"]="Hyper Return Exclusive Rewards",
    ["ui_SuperIgnitionReflow_028"]="Today's Limit:",
    ["ui_SuperIgnitionReflow_029"]="You are currently a Hyper Player, and your master will receive extra rewards when you complete quests.",
    ["ui_SuperIgnitionReflow_030"]="Standard Edition",
    ["ui_SuperIgnitionReflow_031"]="Collector Edition",
    ["ui_SuperIgnitionReflow_032"]="Personal Protection",
    ["ui_SuperIgnitionReflow_033"]="Party Member Protection",
    ["ui_SuperIgnitionReflow_034"]="When consuming Odin's Blessings, each normal attack/skill deals extra True DMG equal to <color=#b584ea>20%/60%</color> of the monster's Max HP to them (ineffective against MVP, MINI, and Boss).",
    ["ui_SuperIgnitionReflow_035"]="After partying up with Adventurers with Hyper Power, the damage against all monsters is increased by <color=#44afee>15%</color> for party members within the <color=#44afee>same scene</color>; when out of combat, MSPD is increased by <color=#44afee>10%</color>.\nNote: The protection becomes ineffective when the Hyper Player leaves the party, the buff carrier enters a PVP scene, or the Hyper Event is over.\nGains corresponding Life EXP and extra rewards (5% chance to receive 1 extra Stamina Potion) when conducting life-related activities.\nLevels 1-3 in Life Skills grant an additional 1 EXP.\nLevels 4-5 in Life Skills grant an additional 2 EXP.\nLevels 6-8 in Life Skills grant an additional 4 EXP.\nLevels 9-13 in Life Skills grant an additional 5, 6, 7, 8, and 9 EXP, respectively.\nLevels 14-15 in Life Skills grant an additional 10 EXP.\nDaily EXP Limit: 300",
    ["ui_SuperIgnitionReflow_036"]="Hyper Power",
    ["ui_SuperIgnitionReflow_037"]="Grand Prize Showcase",
    ["ui_SuperIgnitionReflow_038"]="Power of Companionship",
    ["ui_SuperNoviceActivity_001"]="Daily Login",
    ["ui_SuperNoviceActivity_002"]="Season Quest",
    ["ui_SuperNoviceActivity_003"]="Hit the Season Rankings",
    ["ui_SuperNoviceActivity_004"]="Go for Job Advancement",
    ["ui_SuperSniper_001"]="Challenge Quest",
    ["ui_SuperSniper_002"]="Participate in the event to receive rewards, such as Gunslinger's job advancement materials.",
    ["ui_SuperSniper_003"]="Complete quests to receive free job advancement rewards.",
    ["ui_SuperSniper_004"]="Log in every day to claim job advancement rewards.",
    ["ui_SwitchingLines_001"]="The law of the kingdom requires all merchants to run their shop in Channel 1 of their respective region.",
    ["ui_TaekwondoActivity_001"]="Participate in the event to receive rewards, such as Taekwon's job advancement materials. Shadow Equipment can be activated without completing the quest during the event!",
    ["ui_TanabataFestival_001"]="Perfect Match",
    ["ui_TanabataFestival_002"]="Wish Upon a Star",
    ["ui_TanabataFestival_003"]="Sweet Exchange",
    ["ui_TanabataFestival_004"]="Magpie Bridge Blessing",
    ["ui_TanabataFestival_005"]="Wish History",
    ["ui_TanabataFestival_006"]="Get Rewards",
    ["ui_TanabataFestival_007"]="Wish",
    ["ui_TanabataFestival_008"]="During the event, <color=#FFED00FF>pair up with other Adventurers</color> and kill the specified monster by consuming Odin’s blessing to get rewards",
    ["ui_TanabataFestival_009"]="Gift of Love",
    ["ui_TanabataFestival_010"]="Kafra's VIPs can send gifts for <color=#DB79F0>10</color> more times!",
    ["ui_TanabataFestival_011"]="Processing...",
    ["ui_TanabataFestival_012"]="Invite Friends",
