    ["ui_UltraMan_001"]="According to the S.S.S.P. intel, Alien Pedant has left the Power of Darkness somewhere in Midgard. We request every Adventurer to investigate this matter and guard the peace of the world together!",
    ["ui_UltraMan_002"]="Intel Number: ROX-UltraMan\nIntel Content: Unknown changes have occurred throughout Midgard, and there were unknown energy waves left on the scene.\nSuggestion: <color=#da696f>Priority SSS, Risk Level UNKNOWN</color>. Investigate ASAP!",
    ["ui_UltraMan_003"]="Urgent Intel from Kotaro Higashi",
    ["ui_UltraMan_004"]="The Golden Fortress has invaded! Rise up, Adventurers who carry the power of Taro and guard the Midgard together!",
    ["ui_UltraMan_005"]="Dear Adventurers",
    ["ui_UltraMan_006"]="Reward of Light",
    ["ui_UltraMan_007"]="Energy Replenish",
    ["ui_UltraMan_008"]="Alien Adacic has brought many rare treasures. Go take a look and see if there is anything you like! Seems like there are some hidden treasures too!",
