    ["ui_thanksgivingnpc_4"]="Event Time: %s-%s (Round %s)",
    ["ui_thanksgivingnpc_5"]="Seat Preview",
    ["ui_thanksgivingnpc_6"]="Voting Seat",
    ["ui_thanksgivingnpc_7"]="Buff\nPreview",
    ["ui_thanksgivingnpc_8"]="Support Vote",
    ["ui_thanksgivingnpc_9"]="(Countdown %s)",
    ["ui_thanksgivingnpc_mainui"]="Thanksgiving Support",
    ["ui_thanksgivingnpc_tips"]="Gameplay Rules:\nStage 1: Star of the Spotlight\nParticipants may vote for their preferred rising star from the candidate pool.\nDaily votes are limited and cannot be modified once cast.\nAt the end, the candidate with the highest votes will advance as the \"Popular Star.\"\nStage 2: Grand Reveal\nAt the scheduled time in this stage, two categories of rising stars will be revealed.\nPopular Star: Chosen by Stage 1 votes.\nLucky Star: Randomly selected by the system.\nStage 3: Thanksgiving Surprise Delivery\nSend support gifts to the revealed rising stars and earn \"Support Points.\"\nSupport Points accumulate based on gift value, unlocking exclusive rewards at each phase.\nSubmitting their preferred items grants an extra 20% support bonus!\nNear the end of the stage (last day on stage 3), the support passage will close, so don't miss your chance!\nNote: There are 2 rounds in total; rising stars appearing in the previous round won't appear again.\nYou can get voting items from the Carnival!",
