    ["worldKVM2_rule_061"]="During the Chosen event, participate in the following activities to obtain Chosen Badges.",
    ["worldKVM2_rule_062"]="1. During the competition <color=#ff646f>(up to the end of the Finals)</color>, each point of consumed Odin's Blessing earns you a 33% (including the Odin's Blessing drop rate bonus) chance of getting 1 Chosen's Medal. Up to 333 medals can be obtained every day. The limit resets daily at 05:00.\n2. Participate in Contest Prediction to win medals.",
    ["worldKVM2_rule_063"]="2. When your daily Carnival Activity reaches 100, you receive 70 Chosen Badges as a reward.",
    ["worldKVM2_rule_064"]="3. Participate in the KVM mode and be rewarded with the corresponding number of Chosen Badges if the weekly points reach the specified number.",
