    ["worldkvm_newtips1"]="Up to <color=#ec8a5a>1 character</color> can be selected on the <color=#ec8a5a>same account</color> to participate in the competition. Registered characters cannot be alternated later. Please confirm: do you want to use this character to register for the competition?",
